            ['start_time'=>56.36,'end_time'=>60.18,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s walk down this ramp and let\'s go explore the city a little bit.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita jalan turun melalui tanjakan ni dan teroka kota ni sikit.','order'=>25],
