            ['start_time'=>82.76,'end_time'=>89.18,'target_text'=>'And two, it\'s also hot because it\'s July 22nd right now in Beijing, and this is very warm.','source_text'=>'Dan keduanya, cuaca juga panas sebab hari ini 22 Julai di Beijing, dan pakaian ni sangat panas.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>89.28,'end_time'=>96.98,'target_text'=>'So, I might get heatstroke, so let\'s low-key film this video for you guys, explore the Forbidden City, and learn some English.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya mungkin kena strok haba, jadi jom kita rakam video ni secara santai untuk korang, teroka Kota Larangan, dan belajar sikit Bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>97.08,'end_time'=>102.42,'target_text'=>'One thing I really, really like a lot is the red walls and red buildings.','source_text'=>'Satu perkara yang saya sangat-sangat suka ialah dinding merah dan bangunan-bangunan merahnya.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>102.52,'end_time'=>104.6,'target_text'=>'What do you think?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat awak?','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>104.88,'end_time'=>105.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they\'re really nice.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, memang cantik sangat.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>106,'end_time'=>108.58,'target_text'=>'I like red in traditional architecture.','source_text'=>'Saya suka warna merah dalam seni bina tradisional.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>108.68,'end_time'=>114.14,'target_text'=>'It always turns out >> And like the gold roofs, I\'m pretty sure that\'s what they\'re going for, gold, are really beautiful,','source_text'=>'Ia sentiasa nampak cantik >> Dan bumbung emas tu, saya rasa memang itu yang mereka cuba tonjolkan, warna emas, memang sangat indah,','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>114.24,'end_time'=>114.78,'target_text'=>'too.','source_text'=>'juga.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>114.88,'end_time'=>117.46,'target_text'=>'This is quite similar to Korea.','source_text'=>'Ini agak serupa dengan Korea.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>117.56,'end_time'=>119.82,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s that palace called in Korea?','source_text'=>'>> Apa nama istana di Korea tu?','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>119.92,'end_time'=>123.3,'target_text'=>'>> In Korea, the palace we visited was Gyeongbokgung Palace.','source_text'=>'>> Di Korea, istana yang kita lawati ialah Istana Gyeongbokgung.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>123.4,'end_time'=>126.62,'target_text'=>'Make sure to check out that video, but that palace was really, really beautiful.','source_text'=>'Pastikan korang tengok video tu, istana tu memang sangat-sangat indah.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>126.72,'end_time'=>132.87,'target_text'=>'And funny thing is, right before we started recording, there was like almost 20 kids that came and asked for photos.','source_text'=>'Dan lucunya, betul-betul sebelum kita mula merakam, ada hampir 20 orang kanak-kanak datang dan minta bergambar.','order'=>43],
