            ['start_time'=>146.8,'end_time'=>154.06,'target_text'=>'Obviously, I won\'t be able to hear your answer, but instead I will hear Leon\'s answer and that\'s how we\'ll have a conversation.','source_text'=>'Mestilah saya tak dapat dengar jawapan korang, tapi sebaliknya saya akan dengar jawapan Leon dan begitulah cara kita berbual.','order'=>63],
