            ['start_time'=>1148.08,'end_time'=>1151.9,'target_text'=>'>> It sounds normal because in Canada, that\'s what you would pay at the Fairmont.','source_text'=>'Kecuali jika mereka mengadakan promosi jualan murah.','order'=>511],
