            ['start_time'=>1259.36,'end_time'=>1263.66,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ll be posting my shadowing stories on my second channel, Vulca.','source_text'=>'>> Saya akan muat naik kisah-kisah shadowing di saluran kedua saya, Vulca.','order'=>566],
            ['start_time'=>1263.76,'end_time'=>1267.18,'target_text'=>'And I\'ve also started posting these videos as podcasts.','source_text'=>'Dan saya juga dah mula muat naik video-video ini sebagai podcast.','order'=>567],
            ['start_time'=>1267.28,'end_time'=>1270.54,'target_text'=>'Do you understand English but feel nervous when you speak?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda faham Bahasa Inggeris tetapi berasa gementar apabila ingin bertutur?','order'=>568],
            ['start_time'=>1270.64,'end_time'=>1275.26,'target_text'=>'Join my Patreon for my speaking, pronunciation, and shadowing course.','source_text'=>'Sertai Patreon saya untuk kursus pertuturan, sebutan, dan latihan teknik shadowing.','order'=>569],
            ['start_time'=>1275.36,'end_time'=>1283.34,'target_text'=>'With over 90 video lessons, you\'ll practice pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking.','source_text'=>'Bersama lebih 90 video pembelajaran, anda akan melatih sebutan, loghat, ritma, dan pertuturan semula jadi.','order'=>570],
            ['start_time'=>1283.44,'end_time'=>1288.38,'target_text'=>'With stepbystep video lessons, plus new lessons every week.','source_text'=>'Dengan panduan video langkah demi langkah, disertakan pembelajaran baharu pada setiap minggu.','order'=>571],
