            ['start_time'=>174.08,'end_time'=>182.22,'target_text'=>'Actually, when I was in university, I would drink a lot of Coke Zero cuz I would go to Costco and get like a 48 pack of Coke','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya, masa di universiti dulu, saya banyak minum Coke Zero sebab saya pergi ke Costco dan beli pek 48 tin Coke','order'=>63],
