            ['start_time'=>377.92,'end_time'=>379.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it is from Beijing.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ia memang dari Beijing.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>379.28,'end_time'=>385.1,'target_text'=>'But they do a lot of good roasted meats and >> Oh yeah, I\'m excited to try the >> I\'ve never been to China before, not even','source_text'=>'Tapi mereka memang banyak hidangan daging panggang sedap dan >> Ya betul, saya teruja nak cuba >> Saya tak pernah ke China sebelum ini, tak pernah langsung','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>385.2,'end_time'=>389.18,'target_text'=>'like nearby in Hong Kong or >> I\'ve been to Hong Kong, >> Macau.','source_text'=>'walaupun dekat-dekat seperti di Hong Kong atau >> Saya pernah ke Hong Kong, >> Macau.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>389.28,'end_time'=>397.74,'target_text'=>'So I\'m really looking forward to go to China and explore and just see the scale cuz the cities there do not compare to the','source_text'=>'Jadi saya sangat tak sabar untuk ke China dan meneroka serta melihat sendiri saiznya kerana bandar-bandar di sana langsung tak boleh dibandingkan dengan','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>397.84,'end_time'=>399.1,'target_text'=>'any city I\'ve been before.','source_text'=>'mana-mana bandar yang pernah saya pergi sebelum ini.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>399.2,'end_time'=>400.78,'target_text'=>'Like they\'re just massive.','source_text'=>'Bandar mereka memang teramat besar.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>400.88,'end_time'=>402.94,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m definitely looking forward to that.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya memang sangat menantikannya.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>403.04,'end_time'=>409.02,'target_text'=>'>> And I\'m also like a big fan of like a lot of Chinese technology like DJI and Huawei.','source_text'=>'>> Dan saya juga peminat tegar teknologi dari China seperti DJI dan Huawei.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>409.12,'end_time'=>413.9,'target_text'=>'So, I want to see what they have to offer there and uh maybe do some shopping as well.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya nak tengok apa yang ada di sana dan mungkin membeli-belah sedikit juga.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>414,'end_time'=>414.78,'target_text'=>'>> How\'s your food?','source_text'=>'>> Macam mana makanan kau?','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>414.88,'end_time'=>415.28,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s good.','source_text'=>'>> Sedap.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>415.36,'end_time'=>416.7,'target_text'=>'We just had some of it.','source_text'=>'Kami baru sahaja makan sebahagiannya.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>416.8,'end_time'=>418.94,'target_text'=>'So far, the food is quite amazing.','source_text'=>'Setakat ini, makanannya memang cukup sedap.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>419.04,'end_time'=>421.5,'target_text'=>'But I want to ask you a question on the topic we just talked about.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya nak tanya kau satu soalan tentang topik yang kita bualkan tadi.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>421.6,'end_time'=>423.9,'target_text'=>'What is something you want to buy in China?','source_text'=>'Apa satu benda yang kau teringin nak beli di China?','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>424,'end_time'=>425.34,'target_text'=>'>> Something I want to buy?','source_text'=>'>> Benda yang aku nak beli?','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>425.44,'end_time'=>425.84,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>425.92,'end_time'=>428.86,'target_text'=>'Like you really want cuz I know what I really want.','source_text'=>'Benda yang kau betul-betul teringin, sebab aku tahu apa yang aku teringin.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>428.96,'end_time'=>429.58,'target_text'=>'Two things.','source_text'=>'Dua benda.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>429.68,'end_time'=>431.5,'target_text'=>'Well, I I do know one thing.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya, saya tahu satu benda.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>431.6,'end_time'=>440.78,'target_text'=>'So, uh DJI is coming out with a brand new mic, a new mic [snorts] mini version, and it\'s coming out in the middle of July.','source_text'=>'DJI akan keluarkan mikrofon serba baharu, versi mic mini yang baharu, dan ia akan keluar pada pertengahan bulan Julai.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>440.88,'end_time'=>444.3,'target_text'=>'So, by the time we get to China, it\'ll already be released.','source_text'=>'Jadi, bila kami tiba di China nanti, ia pasti sudah mula dijual.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>444.4,'end_time'=>446.3,'target_text'=>'It might already be released there, actually.','source_text'=>'Malah ia mungkin sudah pun mula dijual di sana, sebenarnya.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>446.4,'end_time'=>452.3,'target_text'=>'And I want to buy that when we get there because I definitely know that China is going to have the best prices because DJI','source_text'=>'Dan saya nak beli mikrofon itu bila kami sampai di sana kerana saya pasti harga di China paling berbaloi memandangkan DJI','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>452.4,'end_time'=>453.9,'target_text'=>'is based in China.','source_text'=>'berpangkalan di China.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>454,'end_time'=>456.06,'target_text'=>'So, I want to buy those when I get there.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya nak beli barang itu bila tiba di sana.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>456.16,'end_time'=>459.26,'target_text'=>'Yeah, DJI is really one of my favorite like companies.','source_text'=>'Ya, DJI memang salah satu syarikat kegemaran saya.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>459.36,'end_time'=>460.22,'target_text'=>'Yeah, like in general.','source_text'=>'Secara keseluruhannya.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>460.32,'end_time'=>462.38,'target_text'=>'I really like I think their products are really good.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat suka, saya rasa produk mereka memang sangat berkualiti.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>462.48,'end_time'=>465.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they should sponsor us too because >> Yeah, shout out DJI.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, mereka patut taja kita juga sebab >> Ya, sokongan untuk DJI.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>465.44,'end_time'=>467.02,'target_text'=>'>> We do use all their stuff.','source_text'=>'>> Kita memang guna semua peralatan mereka.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>467.12,'end_time'=>475.26,'target_text'=>'>> But one thing I want to buy is also a DJI product, but it\'s this new camera DJI is coming out with DJI uh Osmo Pocket 4','source_text'=>'>> Tapi satu benda yang saya nak beli juga produk DJI, iaitu kamera baharu DJI Osmo Pocket 4','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>475.36,'end_time'=>475.76,'target_text'=>'Pro.','source_text'=>'Pro.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>475.84,'end_time'=>480.22,'target_text'=>'I had the Osmo Pocket 3 and I actually filmed a lot of my first videos on that camera.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah guna Osmo Pocket 3 dan saya sebenarnya rakam banyak video terawal saya dengan kamera itu.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>480.32,'end_time'=>483.26,'target_text'=>'I think the first video ever on my channel was filmed with that camera.','source_text'=>'Rasanya video paling pertama di saluran saya dirakam menggunakan kamera itu.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>483.36,'end_time'=>486.38,'target_text'=>'But yeah, then I was robbed so that that got stolen.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, kemudian saya dirompak jadi kamera itu telah dicuri.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>486.48,'end_time'=>487.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>487.44,'end_time'=>491.5,'target_text'=>'>> But now I use this camera and my phone depending on what type of video I\'m filming.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi sekarang saya gunakan kamera ini dan telefon saya bergantung pada jenis video yang saya rakam.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>491.6,'end_time'=>494.14,'target_text'=>'But it would be nice to have that camera.','source_text'=>'Tapi seronok juga kalau dapat kamera itu semula.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>494.24,'end_time'=>495.9,'target_text'=>'But that\'s what one thing I want to buy.','source_text'=>'Tapi itulah satu benda yang saya teringin nak beli.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>496,'end_time'=>503.34,'target_text'=>'And the second thing is I heard Huawei has a really good like fitness smartwatch kind of like the Whoop or the the Apple Fitbit.','source_text'=>'Dan perkara kedua ialah saya dengar Huawei ada jam pintar kecergasan yang bagus macam Whoop atau Fitbit.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>503.44,'end_time'=>505.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, >> Huawei also has one.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, >> Huawei pun ada satu.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>505.44,'end_time'=>509.1,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s called the Fit Huawei Fit Watch or Watch Fit.','source_text'=>'>> Namanya Huawei Fit Watch atau Watch Fit.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>509.2,'end_time'=>511.66,'target_text'=>'And they just came out with a new version, the number five.','source_text'=>'Dan mereka baru sahaja keluarkan versi baharu, iaitu versi kelima.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>511.76,'end_time'=>513.98,'target_text'=>'So >> you had the three, I remember.','source_text'=>'Jadi >> kau pernah ada versi ketiga, aku ingat lagi.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>514.08,'end_time'=>515.58,'target_text'=>'Or we both had the number three.','source_text'=>'Atau kita berdua pernah pakai yang versi ketiga.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>515.68,'end_time'=>517.5,'target_text'=>'>> Just the one that\'s just a band though.','source_text'=>'>> Cuma yang gelang kecergasan sahaja.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>517.6,'end_time'=>518.3,'target_text'=>'No watch.','source_text'=>'Bukan jam penuh.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>518.4,'end_time'=>520.94,'target_text'=>'Like no watch display, just a band like >> Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Tiada paparan jam besar, cuma gelang getah seperti >> Oh, ya.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>521.04,'end_time'=>521.28,'target_text'=>'Okay.','source_text'=>'Okey.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>521.28,'end_time'=>522.06,'target_text'=>'I know that one too.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu yang itu juga.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>522.16,'end_time'=>523.42,'target_text'=>'I think that one\'s called the band.','source_text'=>'Rasanya yang itu dipanggil \'Band\'.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>523.52,'end_time'=>524.7,'target_text'=>'The watch fit band.','source_text'=>'Watch Fit Band.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>524.8,'end_time'=>525.74,'target_text'=>'>> Who would have guessed?','source_text'=>'>> Siapa sangka, kan?','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>525.84,'end_time'=>529.9,'target_text'=>'>> But they did come out with a new like cuz you remember your one, the three, the watch.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi mereka ada keluarkan yang baru macam yang kau pakai dulu, versi ketiga, yang jam.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>530,'end_time'=>530.54,'target_text'=>'>> I didn\'t really like it.','source_text'=>'>> Aku tak berapa suka sebenarnya.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>530.64,'end_time'=>533.82,'target_text'=>'If I want to get a watch, I\'ll just get an Apple Watch so I can use it with my phone.','source_text'=>'Kalau saya nak pakai jam, saya beli Apple Watch saja supaya boleh guna terus dengan telefon.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>533.92,'end_time'=>537.98,'target_text'=>'But if it\'s just going to be like a fitness tracker, like a band with no display, then I\'ll get whatever one.','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau sekadar penjejak kecergasan seperti gelang tanpa skrin, saya beli mana-mana saja.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>538.08,'end_time'=>540.06,'target_text'=>'Well, then why don\'t you get like a Whoop or not?','source_text'=>'Kalau begitu, kenapa kau tak ambil Whoop atau seumpamanya?','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>540.16,'end_time'=>544.06,'target_text'=>'Not not the Whoop, but Google makes one that looks like a Whoop.','source_text'=>'Bukan Whoop, tapi Google ada buat satu yang bentuknya macam Whoop.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>544.16,'end_time'=>546.14,'target_text'=>'And [snorts] also a different brand.','source_text'=>'Dan ada juga jenama lain.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>546.24,'end_time'=>550.94,'target_text'=>'I can\'t remember exactly what it was called, but I did try it when I was in Canada.','source_text'=>'Saya tak ingat tepat apa namanya, tapi saya pernah cuba masa saya di Kanada.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>551.04,'end_time'=>554.22,'target_text'=>'>> And uh I didn\'t really like it because it was a little bit bulky.','source_text'=>'>> Dan saya tak berapa suka sebab ia agak tebal dan besar sikit.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>554.32,'end_time'=>555.1,'target_text'=>'But >> that\'s one thing.','source_text'=>'Tapi >> itulah satu hal.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>555.2,'end_time'=>559.74,'target_text'=>'I don\'t like wearing stuff on my wrists that much, just like like a hair tie and bracelet.','source_text'=>'Saya tak suka sangat pakai barang di pergelangan tangan, setakat getah rambut dan gelang biasa saja.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>559.84,'end_time'=>561.26,'target_text'=>'But I don\'t really like wearing watches.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya tak berapa gemar pakai jam tangan.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>561.36,'end_time'=>563.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of just like annoying to me.','source_text'=>'Ia rasa agak rimas bagi saya.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>563.12,'end_time'=>565.58,'target_text'=>'And I always like sweat so much and it just becomes so annoying.','source_text'=>'Dan saya selalu berpeluh banyak jadi ia rasa sangat rimas.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>565.68,'end_time'=>568.06,'target_text'=>'So, I don\'t like wearing like anything on my wrists.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya tak suka pakai apa-apa di pergelangan tangan.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>568.16,'end_time'=>573.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, but if you don\'t like that but you do wear rings, you can get the smart ring like the Aura ring.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tapi kalau kau tak suka itu tapi kau pakai cincin, kau boleh beli cincin pintar macam cincin Oura.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>573.2,'end_time'=>575.34,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, those things are like massive, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Bro, benda tu tebal sangat, bro.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>575.44,'end_time'=>576.62,'target_text'=>'>> They just came out with a new one.','source_text'=>'>> Mereka baru keluarkan versi baharu.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>576.72,'end_time'=>578.14,'target_text'=>'It\'s like the same size as that.','source_text'=>'Saiznya sama macam cincin biasa itu.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>578.24,'end_time'=>579.66,'target_text'=>'They\'re super slim.','source_text'=>'Ia sangat nipis.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>579.76,'end_time'=>582.78,'target_text'=>'>> This size >> like you cannot Well, like a regular ring, right?','source_text'=>'>> Saiz macam ini >> macam kau takkan... ya, macam cincin biasa, kan?','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>582.88,'end_time'=>583.74,'target_text'=>'>> But is it accurate?','source_text'=>'>> Tapi adakah ia tepat?','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>583.84,'end_time'=>584.62,'target_text'=>'>> Completely accurate.','source_text'=>'>> Sangat tepat.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>584.72,'end_time'=>585.74,'target_text'=>'They\'re actually really nice.','source_text'=>'Ia sebenarnya sangat bagus.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>585.84,'end_time'=>588.06,'target_text'=>'Like, but they are a little more expensive.','source_text'=>'Cuma harganya agak mahal sedikit.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>588.16,'end_time'=>590.46,'target_text'=>'They\'re I don\'t know $400ish dollars.','source_text'=>'Dalam lingkungan sekitar 400 dolar.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>590.56,'end_time'=>590.88,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'>> Entahlah.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>590.88,'end_time'=>593.82,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if that\'s like a necessity to be honest.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada itu satu keperluan sejujurnya.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>593.92,'end_time'=>596.54,'target_text'=>'I kind of just want to know like how well my sleep is.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma nak tahu kualiti tidur saya bagaimana.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>596.64,'end_time'=>600.46,'target_text'=>'That\'s kind of the only thing I really want to know, like my sleep score, like if I\'m being honest.','source_text'=>'Itu sahaja satu-satunya perkara yang saya betul-betul nak tahu, skor tidur saya, sejujurnya.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>600.56,'end_time'=>605.1,'target_text'=>'Cuz if I want to track a workout, my AirPods can track my heartbeat and they\'re pretty accurate.','source_text'=>'Sebab kalau saya nak pantau senaman, AirPods saya boleh jejak degupan jantung dan agak tepat.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>605.2,'end_time'=>610.22,'target_text'=>'So, I can track a workout or a run or a walk and track my calories, how many calories I burned with that.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya boleh pantau senaman, larian atau jalan kaki serta berapa banyak kalori yang saya bakar.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>610.32,'end_time'=>614.38,'target_text'=>'So, I kind of just want something to like see what my sleep was, like the quality of sleep.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya cuma perlukan sesuatu untuk tengok tidur saya, seperti kualiti tidur.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>614.48,'end_time'=>620.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I would just get one of those like Whoop alternatives then >> in China cuz they do make a lot of them.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kalau begitu ambil saja alternatif Whoop di China >> sebab mereka banyak hasilkan peranti macam tu.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>620.16,'end_time'=>621.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I should do some more research.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya patut buat kajian lebih sikit.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>621.68,'end_time'=>627.9,'target_text'=>'If you guys have any suggestions on like Chinese tech products or like a camera or something, I do want to get like a nice','source_text'=>'Kalau korang ada sebarang cadangan tentang produk teknologi China atau kamera, saya memang teringin nak dapatkan yang bagus','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>628,'end_time'=>633.74,'target_text'=>'I think film or like a point and shoot digital camera like something that has like a nice built-in like film grade already','source_text'=>'mungkin kamera filem atau kamera digital kompak yang sudah ada tona warna filem yang cantik di dalamnya','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>633.84,'end_time'=>636.46,'target_text'=>'like a Fujif film or something but like a Chinese version.','source_text'=>'seperti Fujifilm tapi versi buatan China.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>636.56,'end_time'=>642.06,'target_text'=>'Let me know cuz since we\'re going to China, I know they have a lot of like super good products and I\'m just not very aware','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya sebab alang-alang kami ke China, saya tahu mereka ada banyak produk hebat dan saya cuma kurang tahu','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>642.16,'end_time'=>647.9,'target_text'=>'of their products since >> I\'m not from China and we don\'t get like any Chinese advertisements and I\'m not on Chinese social','source_text'=>'tentang produk mereka memandangkan >> saya bukan orang China dan kami tak dapat iklan produk China serta saya tak guna media sosial','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>648,'end_time'=>648.4,'target_text'=>'media.','source_text'=>'mereka.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>648.4,'end_time'=>651.1,'target_text'=>'>> Well, you can\'t forget about Chinese fashion too, right?','source_text'=>'>> Jangan lupa tentang fesyen China juga, kan?','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>651.2,'end_time'=>654.46,'target_text'=>'because they have >> crazy crazy clothing as well.','source_text'=>'sebab mereka ada >> pakaian yang sangat bergaya dan unik juga.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>654.56,'end_time'=>658.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it sucks that I can\'t have like do yin so I could see like Chinese social media.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sayangnya saya tak ada aplikasi Douyin untuk tengok media sosial China.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>658.96,'end_time'=>665.02,'target_text'=>'But if you guys have recommendations for like uh clothing stores or brands and stuff in Beijing specifically, let me know','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau korang ada cadangan kedai pakaian atau jenama menarik di Beijing khususnya, beritahu saya','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>665.12,'end_time'=>668.22,'target_text'=>'as well cuz I\'ll definitely stop by those stores and see see what they have.','source_text'=>'juga sebab saya pasti akan singgah ke kedai-kedai itu untuk tengok apa yang ada.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>668.32,'end_time'=>674.22,'target_text'=>'I\'ll also search on like probably Tik Tok and stuff or Google and see like what people recommend and where they recommend','source_text'=>'Saya juga akan cari di TikTok atau Google untuk tengok apa yang orang cadangkan dan ke mana tempat','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>674.32,'end_time'=>680.38,'target_text'=>'to go and also where they recommend to eat food, tech, fashion, and also sites, historical sites.','source_text'=>'yang dicadangkan untuk pergi, tempat makan sedap, gajet, fesyen, serta tempat bersejarah.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>680.48,'end_time'=>683.18,'target_text'=>'Wait, is the Great Wall of China close to Beijing?','source_text'=>'Kejap, Tembok Besar China dekat ke dengan Beijing?','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>683.28,'end_time'=>683.82,'target_text'=>'>> I think it is.','source_text'=>'>> Rasanya dekat.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>683.92,'end_time'=>686.38,'target_text'=>'Yeah, >> it\'s not far.','source_text'=>'Ya, >> tak jauh pun.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>686.48,'end_time'=>688.31,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s go to the Great Wall of China.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita pergi ke Tembok Besar China.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>688.41,'end_time'=>690.46,'target_text'=>'[laughter] Low key, that\'s actually cool.','source_text'=>'[ketawa] Sejujurnya, memang gempak kalau dapat pergi.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>690.56,'end_time'=>692.3,'target_text'=>'That is one thing I I really want to see.','source_text'=>'Itulah satu benda yang saya teringin sangat nak tengok.','order'=>224],
