            ['start_time'=>698.08,'end_time'=>698.54,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Hebat.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>698.64,'end_time'=>699.26,'target_text'=>'Damn.','source_text'=>'Memang mantap.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>699.36,'end_time'=>702.62,'target_text'=>'Low key, I should learn I should learn some Mandarin, but it\'s so hard.','source_text'=>'Secara jujurnya, saya patut belajar sikit bahasa Mandarin, tapi susah sangat.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>702.72,'end_time'=>703.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s so difficult.','source_text'=>'Sangat sukar.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>703.44,'end_time'=>707.9,'target_text'=>'I tried to learn Korean cuz I mean, I lived in Korea for a year.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah cuba belajar bahasa Korea sebab saya pernah tinggal di Korea selama setahun.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>708,'end_time'=>708.62,'target_text'=>'Difficult, dude.','source_text'=>'Susah, bro.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>708.72,'end_time'=>709.12,'target_text'=>'Difficult.','source_text'=>'Memang sukar.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>709.2,'end_time'=>709.82,'target_text'=>'Very difficult.','source_text'=>'Sangat sukar.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>709.92,'end_time'=>713.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s not easy to learn a language with a different alphabet.','source_text'=>'Bukan mudah untuk belajar bahasa yang mempunyai sistem tulisan berbeza.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>713.52,'end_time'=>713.76,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>713.76,'end_time'=>721.66,'target_text'=>'That\'s why anyone that\'s like from Asia, doesn\'t use the Roman alphabet, like Japanese people, Koreans, Chinese people, like','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah sesiapa yang dari Asia yang tidak menggunakan abjad Rumi, seperti orang Jepun, Korea, Cina,','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>721.76,'end_time'=>724.86,'target_text'=>'anyone that doesn\'t use uh the Roman alphabet, bro.','source_text'=>'sesiapa sahaja yang tidak menggunakan abjad Rumi, kawan.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>724.96,'end_time'=>730.62,'target_text'=>'Good on you for learning English cuz I know it\'s difficult cuz I\'ve tried to learn Korean, very difficult.','source_text'=>'Syabas kepada anda kerana belajar bahasa Inggeris kerana saya tahu ia sangat susah, saya pernah cuba belajar bahasa Korea, amat sukar.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>730.72,'end_time'=>733.74,'target_text'=>'And vice versa, if you\'re Korean, you try to learn English, it\'s difficult.','source_text'=>'Dan begitu juga sebaliknya, jika anda orang Korea cuba belajar bahasa Inggeris, ia mencabar.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>733.84,'end_time'=>734.86,'target_text'=>'But yeah, it\'s good.','source_text'=>'Tetapi ya, usaha yang bagus.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>734.96,'end_time'=>736.46,'target_text'=>'If you guys are learning, keep trying.','source_text'=>'Jika anda sedang belajar, teruskan berusaha.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>736.56,'end_time'=>737.18,'target_text'=>'Keep studying.','source_text'=>'Teruskan belajar.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>737.28,'end_time'=>737.98,'target_text'=>'Keep practicing.','source_text'=>'Teruskan berlatih.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>738.08,'end_time'=>739.9,'target_text'=>'Keep watching comprehensible info videos.','source_text'=>'Teruskan menonton video input yang mudah difahami.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>740,'end_time'=>744.14,'target_text'=>'Keep shadowing to practice your pronunciation and accent and you guys will become fluent.','source_text'=>'Teruskan teknik shadowing untuk melatih sebutan dan aksen anda, dan anda pasti akan fasih.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>744.24,'end_time'=>744.94,'target_text'=>'Just keep trying.','source_text'=>'Teruskan sahaja mencuba.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>745.04,'end_time'=>746.7,'target_text'=>'Low key, I should set a goal for myself.','source_text'=>'Secara jujurnya, saya patut tetapkan matlamat untuk diri sendiri.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>746.8,'end_time'=>747.98,'target_text'=>'Learn Chinese.','source_text'=>'Belajar bahasa Cina.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>748.08,'end_time'=>750.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, >> that\'s a big goal though.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, >> tapi itu matlamat yang besar.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>750.48,'end_time'=>752.94,'target_text'=>'>> Did you hear that construction noise in the morning?','source_text'=>'>> Kau ada dengar bunyi pembinaan pagi tadi tak?','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>753.04,'end_time'=>754.86,'target_text'=>'>> Like around like just before 9.','source_text'=>'>> Masa sekitar sebelum pukul 9 pagi tadi.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>754.96,'end_time'=>756.46,'target_text'=>'>> Every morning they start working here.','source_text'=>'>> Setiap pagi mereka mula bekerja dekat sini.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>756.56,'end_time'=>758.14,'target_text'=>'>> No, but did you hear how loud it was?','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, tapi kau dengar tak betapa kuatnya bunyi tu?','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>758.24,'end_time'=>761.18,'target_text'=>'>> Not that loud for me, but I could hear it through my window.','source_text'=>'>> Bagi aku taklah bising sangat, tapi aku boleh dengar dari tingkap.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>761.28,'end_time'=>763.74,'target_text'=>'So it has to like around the building for me to hear.','source_text'=>'Jadi bunyinya kena lalu keliling bangunan baru sampai ke bilik aku.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>763.84,'end_time'=>766.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, for me it\'s right outside my window.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, bagi saya ia betul-betul di luar tingkap saya.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>766.24,'end_time'=>768.78,'target_text'=>'It was so loud, dude.','source_text'=>'Bising gila, bro.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>768.88,'end_time'=>771.5,'target_text'=>'I couldn\'t even like I couldn\'t even hear anything.','source_text'=>'Saya langsung tak boleh nak dengar apa-apa.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>771.6,'end_time'=>772.3,'target_text'=>'It was so loud.','source_text'=>'Bunyinya teramat kuat.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>772.4,'end_time'=>775.98,'target_text'=>'And it\'s like my balcony door doesn\'t like block any sound.','source_text'=>'Dan pintu balkoni saya langsung tak kedap bunyi.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>776.08,'end_time'=>781.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s like they\'re wide open because the sound just like goes right through it and like shakes my whole head.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam pintu tu ternganga luas sebab bunyi tu tembus terus dan bergegar dalam kepala saya.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>781.68,'end_time'=>783.74,'target_text'=>'Dude, it\'s so so loud.','source_text'=>'Bro, bising sungguh.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>783.84,'end_time'=>784.46,'target_text'=>'So annoying.','source_text'=>'Sangat menjengkelkan.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>784.56,'end_time'=>786.14,'target_text'=>'But it was like I was already awake.','source_text'=>'Tapi nasib baiklah masa tu saya memang dah bangun.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>786.24,'end_time'=>788.46,'target_text'=>'It was like at 8:40','source_text'=>'Masa tu sekitar pukul 8:40','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>788.56,'end_time'=>788.88,'target_text'=>'a.m.','source_text'=>'pagi.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>788.88,'end_time'=>789.58,'target_text'=>'So it was fine.','source_text'=>'Jadi okeylah.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>789.68,'end_time'=>791.58,'target_text'=>'I usually wake up at 8, so it wasn\'t that bad.','source_text'=>'Saya biasanya bangun pukul 8, jadi tak adalah teruk sangat.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>791.68,'end_time'=>795.58,'target_text'=>'But if it was like before 8, dude, I would lowkey not be impressed.','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau bunyi tu mula sebelum pukul 8, memang saya akan bengang juga.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>795.68,'end_time'=>796.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of annoying.','source_text'=>'Agak menyakitkan hati.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>796.96,'end_time'=>798.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, aku pun tak tahu.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>798.16,'end_time'=>800.38,'target_text'=>'Everybody\'s doing construction now for some reason.','source_text'=>'Sekarang semua orang sibuk buat kerja pembinaan atas sebab tertentu.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>800.48,'end_time'=>806.62,'target_text'=>'I guess this is the best time for them because it\'s not fully rainy season yet, so it\'s not raining like all day long, but','source_text'=>'Rasanya sekarang masa paling sesuai untuk mereka sebab belum musim hujan sepenuhnya, jadi tak hujan sepanjang hari, tapi','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>806.72,'end_time'=>810.3,'target_text'=>'it\'s also not like the middle of summer, so it\'s not really really hot out.','source_text'=>'ia juga bukan kemuncak musim panas, jadi cuaca luar tak terlalu terik.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>810.4,'end_time'=>811.9,'target_text'=>'So they get some cloudy weather.','source_text'=>'Jadi mereka dapat cuaca redup dan berawan.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>812,'end_time'=>814.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s maybe 30ish degrees.','source_text'=>'Suhu sekitar 30 darjah Celsius.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>814.56,'end_time'=>816.78,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, cuz they\'re they\'re demolishing that [clears throat] building.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sebab mereka sedang merobohkan bangunan [berdehem] itu.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>816.88,'end_time'=>820.7,'target_text'=>'And then beside us, a little bit down, they\'re building another building.','source_text'=>'Dan di sebelah kita, ke bawah sikit, mereka sedang bina bangunan lain.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>820.8,'end_time'=>824.14,'target_text'=>'And then they\'re redoing that whole pickle ball court down the street.','source_text'=>'Dan mereka juga baiki semula gelanggang pickleball di hujung jalan sana.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>824.24,'end_time'=>824.48,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>824.48,'end_time'=>826.06,'target_text'=>'So, everybody\'s working right now.','source_text'=>'Jadi, semua orang tengah buat kerja sekarang.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>826.16,'end_time'=>830.62,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, and on the way to the pickle ball court, they\'re building another like apartment building, too.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, dan dalam perjalanan ke gelanggang pickleball itu, mereka tengah bina satu lagi bangunan pangsapuri juga.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>830.72,'end_time'=>831.18,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, wah.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>831.28,'end_time'=>833.66,'target_text'=>'Even on this building, they\'re doing renovations.','source_text'=>'Di bangunan kita ini pun mereka tengah buat pengubahsuaian.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>833.76,'end_time'=>834,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>834,'end_time'=>834.62,'target_text'=>'On the roof.','source_text'=>'Di bahagian bumbung.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>834.72,'end_time'=>837.74,'target_text'=>'Don\'t just watch this lesson and forget it.','source_text'=>'Jangan sekadar menonton pelajaran ini dan melupakannya.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>837.84,'end_time'=>845.1,'target_text'=>'Get the workbook for this video on my website and practice everything from the lesson more deeply.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku latihan untuk video ini di laman web saya dan latih semua isi pelajaran dengan lebih mendalam.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>845.2,'end_time'=>854.86,'target_text'=>'Inside, you\'ll review the grammar, vocabulary, tenses, sentence patterns, comprehension questions, and real English from this','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya, anda akan mengulang kaji tatabahasa, kosa kata, kala tenses, pola ayat, soalan kefahaman, dan bahasa Inggeris sebenar daripada','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>854.96,'end_time'=>859.34,'target_text'=>'video with clear explanations and exercises.','source_text'=>'video ini dengan penerangan dan latihan yang jelas.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>859.44,'end_time'=>864.46,'target_text'=>'Watching helps you understand, but practicing helps you remember.','source_text'=>'Menonton membantu anda faham, tetapi membuat latihan membantu anda mengingati.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>864.56,'end_time'=>869.82,'target_text'=>'And when you buy five or more workbooks, you automatically get 30% off at checkout.','source_text'=>'Dan apabila anda membeli lima atau lebih buku latihan, anda secara automatik mendapat diskaun 30% semasa pembayaran.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>869.92,'end_time'=>873.58,'target_text'=>'The link is in the description or at vulca.com.','source_text'=>'Pautan ada di bahagian penerangan atau di vulca.com.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>873.68,'end_time'=>877.34,'target_text'=>'Then you want to go to pickle ball tonight, >> Saturday.','source_text'=>'Jadi kau nak pergi main pickleball malam ini ke, >> hari Sabtu.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>877.44,'end_time'=>878.7,'target_text'=>'>> You don\'t want to go anywhere.','source_text'=>'>> Kau sebenarnya tak nak keluar pergi mana-mana pun.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>878.8,'end_time'=>883.66,'target_text'=>'>> I only like doing stuff in the morning cuz once it\'s not once it\'s past noon, I don\'t want to leave my house, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Saya cuma suka buat aktiviti waktu pagi, sebab bila dah lepas tengah hari, saya malas nak keluar rumah, bro.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>883.76,'end_time'=>884.46,'target_text'=>'I don\'t.','source_text'=>'Saya memang malas.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>884.56,'end_time'=>885.18,'target_text'=>'>> We can.','source_text'=>'>> Kita boleh pergi.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>885.28,'end_time'=>891.42,'target_text'=>'The only reason I said tonight is cuz they had like a open house kind of night where people get matched up with random people.','source_text'=>'Satu-satunya sebab aku kata malam ini sebab ada sesi terbuka di mana pemain dipadankan secara rawak.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>891.52,'end_time'=>893.9,'target_text'=>'So if you go by yourself, tonight\'s a good night to go.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau kau pergi seorang diri, malam ini waktu yang sesuai.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>894,'end_time'=>896.62,'target_text'=>'But you can go any other time and just play against >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Tapi kau boleh pergi bila-bila masa lain dan main lawan >> Ya.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>896.72,'end_time'=>897.58,'target_text'=>'We just play together.','source_text'=>'Kita boleh main bersama.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>897.68,'end_time'=>898.7,'target_text'=>'So >> singles.','source_text'=>'Jadi main perseorangan.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>898.8,'end_time'=>899.12,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>899.12,'end_time'=>902.22,'target_text'=>'So tonight was just good if you went by yourself.','source_text'=>'Jadi malam ini hanya sesuai kalau kau pergi seorang diri.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>902.32,'end_time'=>903.9,'target_text'=>'But they\'re open any day.','source_text'=>'Tapi gelanggang itu buka setiap hari.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>904,'end_time'=>905.98,'target_text'=>'Like they\'re open all day, every day of the week.','source_text'=>'Mereka buka sepanjang hari, setiap hari dalam seminggu.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>906.08,'end_time'=>908.94,'target_text'=>'So >> I think it\'s better to go in the morning cuz one, it\'s way cheaper.','source_text'=>'Jadi >> rasanya lebih baik pergi waktu pagi sebab pertamanya, jauh lebih murah.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>909.04,'end_time'=>911.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s like half the price if you go before 4.','source_text'=>'Harganya separuh lebih murah kalau pergi sebelum pukul 4 petang.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>911.28,'end_time'=>912.78,'target_text'=>'And two, it\'s less busy.','source_text'=>'Dan keduanya, tak berapa ramai orang.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>912.88,'end_time'=>914.3,'target_text'=>'So you could just like play and stuff.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita boleh santai main.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>914.4,'end_time'=>915.5,'target_text'=>'They have paddles you can rent.','source_text'=>'Mereka ada raket yang boleh disewa.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>915.6,'end_time'=>918.46,'target_text'=>'I checked online on they have paddles and >> the one that\'s right here.','source_text'=>'Saya dah semak dalam talian mereka ada sediakan raket dan >> di gelanggang yang dekat sini.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>918.56,'end_time'=>920.14,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I saw they had paddles, too.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya nampak mereka ada raket juga.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>920.24,'end_time'=>925.02,'target_text'=>'>> If it\'s really fun and we like pickle ball, obviously I\'ll just buy a paddle, but I don\'t know if I like it yet or not.','source_text'=>'>> Kalau betul-betul seronok dan kita suka pickleball, sudah tentu saya akan beli raket sendiri, tapi saya belum tahu lagi suka ke tak.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>925.12,'end_time'=>927.74,'target_text'=>'So >> it\'s just like slow tennis, right?','source_text'=>'Jadi >> ia macam tenis versi santai, kan?','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>927.84,'end_time'=>928.86,'target_text'=>'That\'s pretty much what it is.','source_text'=>'Memang itulah sebenarnya.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>928.96,'end_time'=>930.06,'target_text'=>'>> No, but people love it, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, tapi orang memang gilakan permainan ini, bro.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>930.16,'end_time'=>931.26,'target_text'=>'People love >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ramai orang suka >> Ya.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>931.36,'end_time'=>932.62,'target_text'=>'I love pickle ball.','source_text'=>'Saya suka pickleball.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>932.72,'end_time'=>935.98,'target_text'=>'>> I met this guy in Thailand in Shiang Mai.','source_text'=>'>> Saya pernah jumpa seorang lelaki ini di Thailand di Chiang Mai.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>936.08,'end_time'=>939.82,'target_text'=>'He was a Spanish guy that was [snorts] living there and he was obsessed with pickle ball.','source_text'=>'Dia orang Sepanyol yang tinggal di sana dan dia sangat fanatik dengan pickleball.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>939.92,'end_time'=>943.18,'target_text'=>'He talked about it like every day and he played it every day as well.','source_text'=>'Dia asyik cerita fasal pickleball setiap hari dan dia main setiap hari juga.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>943.28,'end_time'=>947.42,'target_text'=>'And I was like before that I didn\'t even know like what pickle ball really was.','source_text'=>'Dan sebelum itu saya langsung tak tahu pickleball itu sebenarnya apa.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>947.52,'end_time'=>951.18,'target_text'=>'Like I I knew the name but even now I don\'t even know exactly how to play it.','source_text'=>'Saya sekadar tahu nama tapi sampai sekarang pun saya tak tahu cara tepat nak main.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>951.28,'end_time'=>957.66,'target_text'=>'I just know they have like >> it\'s like table tennis mixed with tennis and they put it together cuz the paddle is like a big','source_text'=>'Saya cuma tahu ia seperti gabungan pingpong dengan tenis, sebab raketnya macam raket pingpong','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>957.76,'end_time'=>961.74,'target_text'=>'table tennis paddle and then the ball is like I think it has holes in it.','source_text'=>'yang besar dan bolanya pula ada lubang-lubang padanya.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>961.84,'end_time'=>965.1,'target_text'=>'So then it if you hit it doesn\'t go super far so it\'s easy to play.','source_text'=>'Jadi bila dipukul ia tak terbang terlalu jauh dan mudah untuk dimainkan.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>965.2,'end_time'=>965.98,'target_text'=>'I think I would like it.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya akan suka permainan ini.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>966.08,'end_time'=>971.98,'target_text'=>'I think it would be fun and it\'s like so easily accessible so no matter where you go there\'s going to be a table tennis court.','source_text'=>'Ia nampak seronok dan sangat mudah diakses, ke mana sahaja kita pergi pasti ada gelanggang pickleball.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>972.08,'end_time'=>975.66,'target_text'=>'When I was in Malaysia I stayed in that apartment we stayed at.','source_text'=>'Masa saya di Malaysia, di pangsapuri yang pernah kita menginap itu.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>975.76,'end_time'=>978.54,'target_text'=>'They had a pickle ball court right at the bottom of the apartment.','source_text'=>'Mereka ada gelanggang pickleball betul-betul di bahagian bawah pangsapuri.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>978.64,'end_time'=>979.58,'target_text'=>'Big pickle ball court.','source_text'=>'Gelanggang pickleball yang besar.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>979.68,'end_time'=>980.7,'target_text'=>'>> There\'s courts everywhere like >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Gelanggang ada di mana-mana saja >> Ya.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>980.8,'end_time'=>986.54,'target_text'=>'And then the second place I stayed when I went back to Malaysia, they had a pickle ball court that was like pretty much part','source_text'=>'Dan tempat kedua yang saya menginap masa saya kembali ke Malaysia, mereka ada gelanggang pickleball yang sebahagian daripada','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>986.64,'end_time'=>987.66,'target_text'=>'of the building.','source_text'=>'kemudahan bangunan itu.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>987.76,'end_time'=>993.26,'target_text'=>'Like I feel like most apartments or at least the ones I went to had like pickle ball courts very close or like pretty much','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kebanyakan pangsapuri atau sekurang-kurangnya tempat yang saya pergi ada gelanggang berdekatan atau terus','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>993.36,'end_time'=>996.86,'target_text'=>'attached to the apartments cuz I guess people just love pickle ball.','source_text'=>'melekat dengan bangunan kediaman itu kerana nampaknya orang ramai memang gemar pickleball.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>996.96,'end_time'=>1002.62,'target_text'=>'I wonder for how how many years it\'s been around like being this popular cuz I feel like it\'s probably always been around','source_text'=>'Saya tertanya-tanya sudah berapa tahun sukan ini mula popular begini, sebab saya rasa sukan ini dah lama wujud','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>1002.72,'end_time'=>1004.22,'target_text'=>'but not like this popular.','source_text'=>'cuma taklah sepopular sekarang ini.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>1004.32,'end_time'=>1007.02,'target_text'=>'>> Well, I think in Asia it\'s always been popular.','source_text'=>'>> Rasanya di Asia sukan ini sentiasa popular.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>1007.12,'end_time'=>1007.52,'target_text'=>'Really?','source_text'=>'Biar betul?','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>1007.6,'end_time'=>1008,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>1008,'end_time'=>1012.7,'target_text'=>'The first time I\'ve noticed like pickle ball actually being popular was in Asia.','source_text'=>'Kali pertama saya perasan pickleball mula popular adalah di Asia.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>1012.8,'end_time'=>1018.94,'target_text'=>'Like in Canada, I\'ve heard about it and I seen that I could go play it sometimes, but people don\'t really talk about it there.','source_text'=>'Di Kanada, saya pernah dengar dan nampak boleh main sekali-sekala, tapi orang jarang bualkan tentangnya di sana.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>1019.04,'end_time'=>1023.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s not something you\'ll see on social media or walking down the street.','source_text'=>'Bukanlah sesuatu yang biasa nampak di media sosial atau di tepi jalan.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>1023.6,'end_time'=>1024.46,'target_text'=>'>> But now it is.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi sekarang dah mula popular.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>1024.56,'end_time'=>1030.86,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, here in like a 20 minute walk from we [snorts] are there\'s probably like 6 to 10 courts >> literally, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Di sini dalam jarak 20 minit berjalan kaki ada dalam 6 hingga 10 gelanggang >> memang betul-betul banyak, bro.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>1030.96,'end_time'=>1032.38,'target_text'=>'Like >> that you can go to.','source_text'=>'Yang boleh kita pergi.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>1032.48,'end_time'=>1039.1,'target_text'=>'Maybe it\'s just cuz the area we live in is like mostly residential, but there are so so many pickle ball courts like all around','source_text'=>'Mungkin sebab kawasan yang kita tinggal ini kawasan perumahan, tapi memang teramat banyak gelanggang pickleball di sekitar','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>1039.2,'end_time'=>1039.52,'target_text'=>'us.','source_text'=>'kita.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>1039.52,'end_time'=>1041.58,'target_text'=>'Like I was like so surprised when I first came here.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat terkejut masa mula-mula sampai ke sini.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>1041.68,'end_time'=>1043.9,'target_text'=>'I was like, why is there so many pickle ball courts?','source_text'=>'Saya tertanya-tanya, kenapa banyak sangat gelanggang pickleball dekat sini?','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>1044,'end_time'=>1044.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s crazy.','source_text'=>'Memang luar biasa.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>1044.8,'end_time'=>1045.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>1045.44,'end_time'=>1047.66,'target_text'=>'>> But hey, if it\'s fun, it\'s fun.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi apa pun, kalau seronok, seronoklah.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>1047.76,'end_time'=>1048.54,'target_text'=>'That\'s what I want to try.','source_text'=>'Itu yang saya nak cuba.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>1048.64,'end_time'=>1050.06,'target_text'=>'But I also want to do boxing.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya juga nak cuba sukan tinju.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>1050.16,'end_time'=>1052.3,'target_text'=>'But I asked Leon what he wanted for his birthday.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya tanya Leon apa yang dia mahukan sempena hari jadinya.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>1052.4,'end_time'=>1053.42,'target_text'=>'His birthday just passed.','source_text'=>'Hari jadinya baru sahaja lepas.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>1053.52,'end_time'=>1058.38,'target_text'=>'If he wanted a pickle ball membership or like a membership to boxing.','source_text'=>'Sama ada dia nak keahlian gelanggang pickleball atau keahlian kelas tinju.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>1058.48,'end_time'=>1059.42,'target_text'=>'He chose pickle ball.','source_text'=>'Dia pilih pickleball.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>1059.52,'end_time'=>1065.34,'target_text'=>'So, I guess next month will be like a boxing gym because I want to start boxing cuz I\'ve already been going to the gym or','source_text'=>'Jadi, rasanya bulan depan kami akan ke gim tinju sebab saya nak mula bertinju memandangkan saya dah selalu ke gim biasa','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>1065.44,'end_time'=>1070.54,'target_text'=>'we\'ve already been going to the gym like weightlifting for probably a month and a half now.','source_text'=>'kami berdua dah pergi ke gim angkat berat selama kira-kira sebulan setengah sekarang.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>1070.64,'end_time'=>1072.22,'target_text'=>'But, uh, now we\'ll start something new.','source_text'=>'Tapi, sekarang kami akan cuba sesuatu yang baharu.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>1072.32,'end_time'=>1074.46,'target_text'=>'So, so this month will be pickle ball.','source_text'=>'Jadi, bulan ini kami main pickleball.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>1074.56,'end_time'=>1078.06,'target_text'=>'Next month will be boxing, but we\'ll keep doing the other things as well.','source_text'=>'Bulan depan pula sukan tinju, di samping meneruskan aktiviti lain juga.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>1078.16,'end_time'=>1078.56,'target_text'=>'So, yeah.','source_text'=>'Begitulah.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>1078.56,'end_time'=>1080.14,'target_text'=>'Now, we\'re going to just wipe the table.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, kami cuma nak lap meja ini.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>1080.24,'end_time'=>1083.18,'target_text'=>'But, I am super excited for China.','source_text'=>'Tapi, saya sangat teruja nak pergi ke China.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>1083.28,'end_time'=>1085.66,'target_text'=>'I think China will be so >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa lawatan ke China nanti pasti sangat >> Ya.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>1085.76,'end_time'=>1086.54,'target_text'=>'>> So amazing.','source_text'=>'>> Sangat mengagumkan.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>1086.64,'end_time'=>1087.82,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m looking forward to it.','source_text'=>'>> Saya memang sangat menantikannya.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>1087.92,'end_time'=>1092.14,'target_text'=>'Honestly, I\'m probably looking forward to it more than any country I\'ve been to so far.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, ini negara yang paling saya nantikan berbanding mana-mana negara yang pernah saya lawati setakat ini.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>1092.24,'end_time'=>1095.5,'target_text'=>'>> Honestly, two countries I want to go to like the most.','source_text'=>'>> Sejujurnya, dua negara yang paling aku teringin nak pergi.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>1095.6,'end_time'=>1097.98,'target_text'=>'The two countries I want to go to the most the most.','source_text'=>'Dua negara yang tersangat-sangat aku nak lawati.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>1098.08,'end_time'=>1099.26,'target_text'=>'Like I\'ve already traveled a lot.','source_text'=>'Aku dah banyak mengembara sebelum ini.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>1099.36,'end_time'=>1100.14,'target_text'=>'I\'ve seen a lot of countries.','source_text'=>'Aku dah melawat banyak negara.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>1100.24,'end_time'=>1107.98,'target_text'=>'So going to like a new place isn\'t like super exciting for me, but two countries that I am excited to go to are um China and','source_text'=>'Jadi pergi ke tempat baharu bukanlah terlalu mengujakan bagi aku, tapi dua negara yang buat aku rasa teruja ialah China dan','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>1108.08,'end_time'=>1108.54,'target_text'=>'India.','source_text'=>'India.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>1108.64,'end_time'=>1110.7,'target_text'=>'Those two countries, >> India is going to be crazy.','source_text'=>'Dua negara itu, >> India pasti akan jadi pengalaman luar biasa.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>1110.8,'end_time'=>1111.66,'target_text'=>'>> China and India.','source_text'=>'>> China dan India.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>1111.76,'end_time'=>1113.58,'target_text'=>'>> But I I want to go experience it.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi aku nak pergi dan rasai sendiri pengalamannya.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>1113.68,'end_time'=>1115.58,'target_text'=>'Obviously, you see what you see online.','source_text'=>'Tentulah kita tengok pelbagai perkara dalam talian.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>1115.68,'end_time'=>1117.1,'target_text'=>'There\'s a lot >> of those crackers.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak >> biskut kraker itu.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>1117.2,'end_time'=>1120.62,'target_text'=>'There\'s a lot of different opinions online about any country you go to.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak pendapat berbeza dalam talian tentang mana-mana negara yang kita nak pergi.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>1120.72,'end_time'=>1123.18,'target_text'=>'I want to go see and experience it for myself.','source_text'=>'Saya nak pergi tengok dan alami sendiri suasananya.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>1123.28,'end_time'=>1125.26,'target_text'=>'It was like with Brunai for me.','source_text'=>'Sama macam pengalaman saya dengan Brunei dulu.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>1125.36,'end_time'=>1127.34,'target_text'=>'Like I heard a lot of things with Brunai.','source_text'=>'Saya banyak dengar cerita tentang Brunei.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>1127.44,'end_time'=>1132.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a they have like Sharia law there and stuff and I wanted to go experience it for myself.','source_text'=>'Seperti pelaksanaan undang-undang Syariah di sana dan saya teringin nak merasai sendiri suasananya.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>1132.4,'end_time'=>1133.9,'target_text'=>'And when I went there, it was nice.','source_text'=>'Dan bila saya sampai di sana, keadaannya sangat menyenangkan.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>1134,'end_time'=>1135.18,'target_text'=>'I really enjoyed it.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat menikmatinya.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>1135.28,'end_time'=>1136.06,'target_text'=>'No, I\'m good.','source_text'=>'Tak apa, saya okey.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>1136.16,'end_time'=>1142.38,'target_text'=>'I was there like during Ramadan, so it was very festive and a really enjoyable country to go to.','source_text'=>'Saya berada di sana semasa bulan Ramadan, jadi suasananya sangat meriah dan sebuah negara yang seronok dikunjungi.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>1142.48,'end_time'=>1144.78,'target_text'=>'Although I did spend way too long there.','source_text'=>'Walaupun saya tinggal di sana agak terlalu lama.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>1144.88,'end_time'=>1146.78,'target_text'=>'I was there for a week and >> too long.','source_text'=>'Saya berada di sana selama seminggu dan >> terlalu lama.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>1146.88,'end_time'=>1149.02,'target_text'=>'>> Too long cuz the country is so tiny.','source_text'=>'>> Terlalu lama sebab negaranya sangat kecil.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>1149.12,'end_time'=>1151.82,'target_text'=>'Like you could see everything in 2 3 days.','source_text'=>'Dalam 2 atau 3 hari dah boleh pusing tengok semua tempat.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>1151.92,'end_time'=>1157.82,'target_text'=>'So one week was a little bit too long especially during Ramadan because a lot of things were closed during the day.','source_text'=>'Jadi seminggu agak terlalu lama terutamanya semasa bulan Ramadan sebab banyak kedai tutup pada waktu siang.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>1157.92,'end_time'=>1159.42,'target_text'=>'But it was still really enjoyable.','source_text'=>'Tapi percutian itu tetap sangat menyeronokkan.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>1159.52,'end_time'=>1164.22,'target_text'=>'And I would go back there because they do have some of the nicest like nature preserves.','source_text'=>'Dan saya sudi ke sana lagi kerana mereka mempunyai antara kawasan pemuliharaan alam semula jadi yang paling indah.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>1164.32,'end_time'=>1164.78,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, really?','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ya ke?','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1164.88,'end_time'=>1165.2,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1165.2,'end_time'=>1166.38,'target_text'=>'On the island of Borneo.','source_text'=>'Di kepulauan Borneo.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>1166.48,'end_time'=>1171.82,'target_text'=>'So I\'d like to go see the animals they have there like orangutans and crocodiles and stuff.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya teringin nak tengok hidupan liar di sana seperti orang utan, buaya dan pelbagai lagi.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>1171.92,'end_time'=>1175.98,'target_text'=>'So, but yeah, you have to go experience places for yourself, right?','source_text'=>'Jadi, itulah, kita kena pergi alami sendiri tempat itu, kan?','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>1176.08,'end_time'=>1180.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, honestly, everything I\'ve seen online about India just makes me want to go more.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sejujurnya semua yang saya lihat dalam talian tentang India membuatkan saya makin teringin nak ke sana.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>1180.24,'end_time'=>1181.18,'target_text'=>'It just seems really interesting.','source_text'=>'Ia nampak sangat menarik.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>1181.28,'end_time'=>1182.3,'target_text'=>'And same thing with China.','source_text'=>'Dan hal yang sama juga dengan China.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>1182.4,'end_time'=>1185.58,'target_text'=>'Those two countries make me like really want to go like explore it.','source_text'=>'Dua negara itu buat saya betul-betul teringin nak pergi meneroka.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>1185.68,'end_time'=>1186.94,'target_text'=>'And those two countries are huge.','source_text'=>'Dan kedua-dua negara itu tersangat besar.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>1187.04,'end_time'=>1191.18,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ll definitely go back probably more than once cuz I know China\'s huge, India\'s huge.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya pasti akan kembali lebih daripada sekali sebab saya tahu China sangat luas, India pun sangat luas.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1191.28,'end_time'=>1193.42,'target_text'=>'And I love Indian food and I love Chinese food.','source_text'=>'Dan saya sangat suka makanan India dan makanan Cina.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>1193.52,'end_time'=>1194.46,'target_text'=>'So, the food is amazing.','source_text'=>'Jadi, makanannya memang luar biasa.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>1194.56,'end_time'=>1197.66,'target_text'=>'The countries are like like mysterious, kind of like something like I want to explore.','source_text'=>'Negara-negara ini ada tarikan misteri yang membuatkan saya teringin nak teroka.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>1197.76,'end_time'=>1199.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of like an adventure, you know?','source_text'=>'Ia rasa seperti satu pengembaraan, faham tak?','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>1199.2,'end_time'=>1200.86,'target_text'=>'It kind of feels like the first time I ever traveled.','source_text'=>'Perasaannya seolah-olah macam kali pertama saya mula mengembara dulu.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>1200.96,'end_time'=>1202.7,'target_text'=>'feel like I have that feeling with those two countries.','source_text'=>'Rasa teruja itu hadir kembali untuk dua negara ini.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>1202.8,'end_time'=>1207.66,'target_text'=>'So I do want to explore those two countries, meet the people, travel around and do everything like that.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya memang mahu menjelajah kedua-dua negara itu, berjumpa masyarakat setempat, berjalan-jalan dan buat segala aktiviti.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>1207.76,'end_time'=>1211.48,'target_text'=>'So I think that will be really exciting.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa ia pasti sangat menyeronokkan.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>1212.32,'end_time'=>1215.26,'target_text'=>'Okay, so what are we doing right now?','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jadi apa yang kita tengah buat sekarang ini?','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>1215.36,'end_time'=>1220.7,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so Foc was complaining that his computer had issues with Wi-Fi connection.','source_text'=>'>> Okey, tadi Foc mengadu komputernya ada masalah sambungan Wi-Fi.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>1220.8,'end_time'=>1223.98,'target_text'=>'So I wanted to go see and if I could troubleshoot it.','source_text'=>'Jadi aku nak pergi tengok kalau-kalau aku boleh bantu selesaikan masalah itu.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>1224.08,'end_time'=>1227.98,'target_text'=>'And the first thing I did was update his OS.','source_text'=>'Dan perkara pertama yang aku buat ialah kemas kini sistem operasinya.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>1228.08,'end_time'=>1232.78,'target_text'=>'Yeah, low key >> to the newest OS because he was still on the previous generation.','source_text'=>'Ya, secara jujurnya >> ke sistem operasi terkini sebab dia masih pakai versi generasi sebelumnya.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>1232.88,'end_time'=>1235.58,'target_text'=>'So, he\'s now fully updated.','source_text'=>'Jadi, sekarang ia sudah dikemas kini sepenuhnya.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>1235.68,'end_time'=>1241.98,'target_text'=>'And I mean, I don\'t know if if you have like slowdown issues, but having so many things run in the background is like not','source_text'=>'Dan maksud aku, aku tak tahu kalau kau ada isu komputer perlahan, tapi banyak aplikasi berjalan di latar belakang memang tak','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>1242.08,'end_time'=>1242.48,'target_text'=>'good.','source_text'=>'elok.','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>1242.48,'end_time'=>1242.94,'target_text'=>'>> Delete it.','source_text'=>'>> Padamkan saja.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>1243.04,'end_time'=>1248.54,'target_text'=>'Yeah, that\'s one thing I guess I never updated for a long time because I always saw like, oh, update update.','source_text'=>'Ya, itulah satu hal, saya dah lama tak kemas kini sebab bila ada notifikasi kemas kini keluar,','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>1248.64,'end_time'=>1251.18,'target_text'=>'I\'m like, no, no.','source_text'=>'saya selalu kata, nanti dulu.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>1251.28,'end_time'=>1253.58,'target_text'=>'Cuz one, every time I\'m on my computer, I\'m working.','source_text'=>'Sebab pertamanya, setiap kali saya buka komputer, saya sedang bekerja.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>1253.68,'end_time'=>1258.38,'target_text'=>'So, I don\'t really have time to just let it up up upgrade or update, sorry, because it takes like a long time.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya tak ada masa nak biarkan ia kemas kini sebab ia memakan masa yang agak lama.','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>1258.48,'end_time'=>1260.38,'target_text'=>'And uh two, I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Dan yang kedua, entahlah.','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>1260.48,'end_time'=>1266.46,'target_text'=>'I guess I just think if I upgrade it, Apple\'s going to make my computer worse cuz they were sued for that in the past and','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kalau kemas kini, Apple akan buat komputer saya makin perlahan sebab mereka pernah disaman kerana isu itu dulu dan','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>1266.56,'end_time'=>1267.42,'target_text'=>'it was a thing they were doing.','source_text'=>'mereka memang ada buat begitu sebelum ini.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>1267.52,'end_time'=>1271.98,'target_text'=>'They were slowing down like their Apple products, but I guess they don\'t do it anymore cuz they were sued for that.','source_text'=>'Mereka sengaja perlahankan produk Apple lama, tapi rasanya sekarang mereka dah tak buat lagi sebab dah disaman.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>1272.08,'end_time'=>1273.9,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s That\'s Yeah, they don\'t do it anymore.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, mereka dah tak buat lagi benda tu.','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>1274,'end_time'=>1275.82,'target_text'=>'But >> yeah, but they did do it in the past.','source_text'=>'Tapi >> ya, mereka memang pernah buat dulu.','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>1275.92,'end_time'=>1277.34,'target_text'=>'I honestly I should have updated it.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya saya patut dah kemas kini dari awal.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1277.44,'end_time'=>1280.46,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know why I didn\'t update it, but it cuz it looks a lot better now.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kenapa saya tangguh, tapi sekarang paparannya nampak jauh lebih cantik.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1280.56,'end_time'=>1282.38,'target_text'=>'Now they have the liquid glass display.','source_text'=>'Sekarang ada paparan efek kaca cecair yang kemas.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1282.48,'end_time'=>1283.82,'target_text'=>'It looks a lot better.','source_text'=>'Ia nampak jauh lebih menarik.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1283.92,'end_time'=>1284.16,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1284.16,'end_time'=>1288.46,'target_text'=>'Anyway, he also has an issue with everything turning on when he turns on his computer.','source_text'=>'Apa pun, dia juga ada masalah di mana semua aplikasi terus terbuka secara automatik bila dia hidupkan komputer.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1288.56,'end_time'=>1290.7,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m going to show him how to turn that all off.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya akan tunjukkan pada dia cara untuk matikan semua tetapan itu.','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1290.8,'end_time'=>1295.5,'target_text'=>'Uh >> yeah, like all my all my apps or tabs or everything I have opens every time.','source_text'=>'Ya, macam semua aplikasi atau tab yang saya guna sentiasa terbuka setiap kali komputer dihidupkan.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1295.6,'end_time'=>1298.14,'target_text'=>'And I also like never shut down my computer.','source_text'=>'Dan saya juga jenis yang hampir tak pernah matikan komputer saya.','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1298.24,'end_time'=>1300.78,'target_text'=>'Sometimes if it\'s like really slow, I\'ll restart it.','source_text'=>'Kadang-kadang kalau dah rasa sangat perlahan, barulah saya hidupkan semula.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1300.88,'end_time'=>1305.18,'target_text'=>'But yeah, so yeah, we\'re just going to sort this out, clear up the stuff on my computer.','source_text'=>'Tapi itulah, kami nak bersihkan dan kemas semula komputer saya ini.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1305.28,'end_time'=>1309.66,'target_text'=>'Hopefully that makes it faster because my Wi-Fi connection has been like really bad.','source_text'=>'Harap-harap ia akan jadi lebih laju sebab sambungan Wi-Fi saya sebelum ini memang sangat teruk.','order'=>456],
