            ['start_time'=>1313.36,'end_time'=>1317.9,'target_text'=>'But it\'s really bad for my room and everything is like super slow, which is like just really annoying.','source_text'=>'Tapi dari dalam bilik saya isyaratnya lemah dan semuanya jadi teramat perlahan, memang buat geram.','order'=>458],
