            ['start_time'=>148.32,'end_time'=>152.06,'target_text'=>'But it\'s like a cool slang way to say it, like Gen Z.','source_text'=>'Tetapi ia seperti cara slanga yang bergaya untuk diucapkan, seperti Gen Z.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>152.16,'end_time'=>153.66,'target_text'=>'Let\'s bounce.','source_text'=>'Jom kita cabut.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>153.76,'end_time'=>157.9,'target_text'=>'Now I\'m in the elevator and I pressed this button, B.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya berada di dalam lif dan saya telah menekan butang B ini.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>158,'end_time'=>159.9,'target_text'=>'I pressed it to go down.','source_text'=>'Saya menekannya untuk turun ke bawah.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>160,'end_time'=>164.74,'target_text'=>'This button closes the doors and this button opens the doors.','source_text'=>'Butang ini menutup pintu dan butang ini membuka pintu.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>164.84,'end_time'=>169.66,'target_text'=>'But now I\'m heading to the basement to get on my Grab bike.','source_text'=>'Tetapi sekarang saya sedang menuju ke tingkat bawah tanah untuk menaiki motosikal Grab saya.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>169.76,'end_time'=>171.72,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom pergi.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>175.16,'end_time'=>181.98,'target_text'=>'Okay, so Leon has just arrived on the back of his Grab bike and now we\'re going to go over there to the dock to get on our','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi Leon baru sahaja sampai membonceng motosikal Grab miliknya dan sekarang kami akan pergi ke jeti di sana untuk menaiki','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>182.08,'end_time'=>182.86,'target_text'=>'ferry.','source_text'=>'feri kami.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>182.96,'end_time'=>183.58,'target_text'=>'Lego.','source_text'=>'Jom gerak.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>183.68,'end_time'=>187.7,'target_text'=>'So now we are sitting on this bench waiting for our ferry.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang kami sedang duduk di atas bangku ini menunggu feri kami.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>187.8,'end_time'=>191.38,'target_text'=>'It\'s going to come in about 10 minutes.','source_text'=>'Ia akan sampai dalam masa lebih kurang 10 minit.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>191.48,'end_time'=>192.42,'target_text'=>'10 minutes.','source_text'=>'10 minit.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>192.52,'end_time'=>195.34,'target_text'=>'So we\'re waiting for the ferry and something happened to Leon.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami sedang menunggu feri dan sesuatu telah berlaku kepada Leon.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>195.44,'end_time'=>197.06,'target_text'=>'So let\'s listen to Leon\'s story here.','source_text'=>'Jadi mari kita dengarkan cerita Leon di sini.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>197.16,'end_time'=>198.06,'target_text'=>'Tell us your story.','source_text'=>'Ceritakan kisah kamu.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>198.16,'end_time'=>199.58,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, what happened just now?','source_text'=>'>> Oh, apa yang berlaku tadi?','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>199.68,'end_time'=>200.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>200.28,'end_time'=>206.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so I booked my Grab bike and I went to go meet him and I noticed he [laughter] tried to call me but I was in the','source_text'=>'>> Ya, jadi saya tempah Grab bike dan pergi menunggunya, dan saya perasan dia cuba telefon saya tapi saya berada di dalam','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>206.12,'end_time'=>207.92,'target_text'=>'elevator.','source_text'=>'lif.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>209.36,'end_time'=>210.54,'target_text'=>'All right, so >> Anyway.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jadi... >> Apa-apa pun.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>210.64,'end_time'=>214.44,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so he tried to call me but I was in the elevator.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, jadi dia cuba hubungi saya tetapi saya berada di dalam lif.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>215.08,'end_time'=>221.3,'target_text'=>'Okay, anyway, he tried to call me but I was in the elevator and there\'s no reception in the elevator, so obviously I didn\'t','source_text'=>'Okey, apa-apa pun, dia cuba hubungi saya tetapi saya di dalam lif dan tiada liputan telefon di dalam lif, jadi memang saya tidak','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>221.4,'end_time'=>222.22,'target_text'=>'try to pick up.','source_text'=>'dapat mengangkatnya.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>222.32,'end_time'=>227.56,'target_text'=>'So I go out and I open the gate and I see him standing there.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya keluar dan buka pagar, lalu saya lihat dia sedang berdiri di situ.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>228.04,'end_time'=>232.54,'target_text'=>'So I was going outside the gate and then I saw the driver, so I walked up to him.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya berjalan keluar pagar dan nampak pemandu itu, lalu saya berjalan ke arahnya.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>232.64,'end_time'=>234.62,'target_text'=>'I said hello, and he looked at me.','source_text'=>'Saya menyapa \'hello\', dan dia memandang saya.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>234.72,'end_time'=>236.78,'target_text'=>'I looked at his phone and I didn\'t see my name there.','source_text'=>'Saya lihat telefonnya dan saya tidak nampak nama saya di situ.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>236.88,'end_time'=>237.7,'target_text'=>'So I was like, oh, what the heck?','source_text'=>'Jadi saya macam terpinga-pinga, eh biar betul?','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>237.8,'end_time'=>238.82,'target_text'=>'Maybe this is not my driver.','source_text'=>'Mungkin ini bukan pemandu saya.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>238.92,'end_time'=>242.48,'target_text'=>'Then I pull out my phone and it said, your driver','source_text'=>'Kemudian saya keluarkan telefon saya dan ia tertulis, pemandu anda...','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>243.2,'end_time'=>245.18,'target_text'=>'When I saw that he arrived there.','source_text'=>'Bila saya lihat dia sudah tiba di sana.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>245.28,'end_time'=>249.14,'target_text'=>'So I\'m like, this guy canceled right in front of me and then he just drove away.','source_text'=>'Saya macam terkejut, orang ini batalkan tempahan betul-betul di depan saya dan terus menunggang pergi begitu saja.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>249.24,'end_time'=>250.38,'target_text'=>'I was like, what the heck?','source_text'=>'Saya pun rasa pelik sangat.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>250.48,'end_time'=>254.9,'target_text'=>'And it said something like suspicious issue or something like his reasoning for it.','source_text'=>'Dan aplikasi itu menyatakan sebab seperti \'isu mencurigakan\' sebagai alasannya.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>255,'end_time'=>259.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s probably cuz I didn\'t pick up the phone, but I can\'t answer the phone anyway on the elevator, so.','source_text'=>'Mungkin sebab saya tidak angkat telefon tadi, tapi saya memang tak boleh jawab telefon dalam lif.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>259.72,'end_time'=>260.54,'target_text'=>'We didn\'t even have to wait.','source_text'=>'Kami langsung tak perlu tunggu lama.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>260.64,'end_time'=>263.5,'target_text'=>'He waited like maybe 30 seconds.','source_text'=>'Dia cuma tunggu sekitar 30 saat sahaja.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>263.6,'end_time'=>265.82,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re going to board the boat here.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami akan menaiki bot di sini.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>265.92,'end_time'=>267.82,'target_text'=>'We\'re following the security guy.','source_text'=>'Kami sedang mengikut abang keselamatan ini.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>267.92,'end_time'=>269.98,'target_text'=>'Did I ever tell you about these plants?','source_text'=>'Pernahkah saya beritahu kamu tentang tumbuhan ini?','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>270.08,'end_time'=>270.66,'target_text'=>'Yep.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>270.76,'end_time'=>273.34,'target_text'=>'They\'re like one of the fastest growing plants in the world.','source_text'=>'Ia antara tumbuhan yang paling cepat membesar di dunia.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>273.44,'end_time'=>276.5,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I think you told me about that in a previous video.','source_text'=>'Ya, rasanya kamu pernah beritahu saya tentang itu dalam video sebelum ini.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>276.6,'end_time'=>278.1,'target_text'=>'But they grow really fast.','source_text'=>'Tetapi ia memang tumbuh sangat pantas.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>278.2,'end_time'=>283.18,'target_text'=>'We\'re walking on this artificial grass, this nice green artificial grass.','source_text'=>'Kami sedang berjalan di atas rumput tiruan ini, rumput tiruan hijau yang cantik.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>283.28,'end_time'=>285.02,'target_text'=>'And the river is very brown.','source_text'=>'Dan air sungainya kelihatan sangat keruh kecoklatan.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>285.12,'end_time'=>289.76,'target_text'=>'This right here is the dock where the boat comes and docks.','source_text'=>'Inilah jeti tempat bot tiba dan berlabuh.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>290.12,'end_time'=>296.78,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we\'ve just got on the water bus or the water boat or the water ferry or the boat, whatever you want to call it.','source_text'=>'Okey, kami baru sahaja naik bas air atau bot air atau feri air, apa-apa sahaja yang anda mahu panggil.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>296.88,'end_time'=>299.74,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re on the river.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami berada di atas sungai.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>299.84,'end_time'=>303.7,'target_text'=>'Right now we are passing underneath this bridge.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami sedang lalu di bawah jambatan ini.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>303.8,'end_time'=>306.22,'target_text'=>'Underneath this bridge.','source_text'=>'Di bawah jambatan ini.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>306.32,'end_time'=>309.56,'target_text'=>'Now you can see the boat is rocking.','source_text'=>'Sekarang anda boleh nampak bot ini berayun-ayun.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>309.76,'end_time'=>312.14,'target_text'=>'The boat is rocking.','source_text'=>'Bot ini sedang terumbang-ambing.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>312.24,'end_time'=>315.46,'target_text'=>'There are probably waves on the river','source_text'=>'Mungkin ada ombak di atas sungai','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>315.56,'end_time'=>318.23,'target_text'=>'causing the boat to rock.','source_text'=>'yang menyebabkan bot ini bergoyang.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>318.33,'end_time'=>320.13,'target_text'=>'>> [music]','source_text'=>'>> [muzik]','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>322.48,'end_time'=>324.22,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, we just got off the water bus.','source_text'=>'>> Okey, kami baru sahaja turun dari bas air.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>324.32,'end_time'=>328.62,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re walking on this dock to Lindong Station.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami sedang berjalan di atas jeti ini menuju ke Stesen Linh Dong.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>328.72,'end_time'=>332.62,'target_text'=>'This on the side here is railing to keep us from falling into the river.','source_text'=>'Di tepi ini adalah pagar penghadang untuk mengelakkan kami daripada terjatuh ke dalam sungai.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>332.72,'end_time'=>336.06,'target_text'=>'And the railing looks freshly painted and it\'s white.','source_text'=>'Dan pagar ini kelihatan seperti baru dicat dan berwarna putih.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>336.16,'end_time'=>340.26,'target_text'=>'The floor we are walking on is made out of metal and it is also painted.','source_text'=>'Lantai yang kami pijak ini diperbuat daripada logam dan ia juga dicat.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>340.36,'end_time'=>341.3,'target_text'=>'This right here is the gate.','source_text'=>'Inilah pintunya.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>341.4,'end_time'=>343.42,'target_text'=>'They close this so no one goes in.','source_text'=>'Mereka menutup ini supaya tiada sesiapa yang boleh masuk.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>343.52,'end_time'=>345.02,'target_text'=>'And now we\'re at the last station.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang kami berada di stesen terakhir.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>345.12,'end_time'=>347.74,'target_text'=>'Area is a lot busier than the other station.','source_text'=>'Kawasannya jauh lebih sibuk berbanding stesen yang satu lagi.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>347.84,'end_time'=>348.24,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>348.28,'end_time'=>350.58,'target_text'=>'>> They have a cafe here and it\'s a lot busier.','source_text'=>'>> Mereka ada kafe di sini dan suasananya jauh lebih meriah.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>350.68,'end_time'=>354.64,'target_text'=>'A lot of people are enjoying, I guess, the river view.','source_text'=>'Ramai orang sedang menikmati, rasanya, pemandangan sungai.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>357.6,'end_time'=>360.34,'target_text'=>'This is an outdoor cafe.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah kafe terbuka di luar.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>360.44,'end_time'=>363.58,'target_text'=>'Many people are sitting on chairs and relaxing.','source_text'=>'Ramai orang sedang duduk di atas kerusi sambil berehat santai.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>363.68,'end_time'=>367.34,'target_text'=>'Some people are drinking, talking, and looking around.','source_text'=>'Ada yang sedang minum, bersembang, dan melihat sekeliling.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>367.44,'end_time'=>371.66,'target_text'=>'There are trees, tables, chairs, and a small cafe counter.','source_text'=>'Ada pokok-pokok, meja, kerusi, dan kaunter kafe yang kecil.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>371.76,'end_time'=>374.9,'target_text'=>'A woman is holding a child on the right side.','source_text'=>'Seorang wanita sedang memangku seorang kanak-kanak di sebelah kanan.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>375,'end_time'=>376.94,'target_text'=>'The weather looks sunny and warm.','source_text'=>'Cuaca kelihatan cerah dan panas.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>377.04,'end_time'=>381.06,'target_text'=>'The cafe is under a roof, so people can sit in the shade.','source_text'=>'Kafe ini berbumbung, jadi pengunjung boleh duduk di tempat teduh.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>381.16,'end_time'=>384.54,'target_text'=>'This outdoor cafe looks busy, but comfortable.','source_text'=>'Kafe terbuka ini nampak sibuk tetapi tetap selesa.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>384.64,'end_time'=>388.82,'target_text'=>'Some people are sitting with friends, while others are walking through the area.','source_text'=>'Sesetengah orang duduk bersama rakan-rakan, manakala yang lain berjalan melintasi kawasan itu.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>388.92,'end_time'=>393.5,'target_text'=>'The chairs are low and the tables are small, so the place feels casual.','source_text'=>'Kerusinya rendah dan mejanya kecil, membuatkan tempat ini terasa santai.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>393.6,'end_time'=>398.62,'target_text'=>'There are many trees around the cafe, which makes the area feel fresh and peaceful.','source_text'=>'Terdapat banyak pokok di sekitar kafe, menjadikan kawasan ini terasa nyaman dan tenang.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>398.72,'end_time'=>403.34,'target_text'=>'A mother is carrying her child and a man in a green hoodie is walking nearby.','source_text'=>'Seorang ibu sedang mengendong anaknya dan seorang lelaki berhud hijau sedang berjalan berhampiran.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>403.44,'end_time'=>406.82,'target_text'=>'People are enjoying their drinks and spending time together.','source_text'=>'Orang ramai sedang menikmati minuman dan meluangkan masa bersama.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>406.92,'end_time'=>413.46,'target_text'=>'This scene shows a relaxed outdoor seating area at a cafe or small food court.','source_text'=>'Pemandangan ini menunjukkan kawasan tempat duduk santai di luar sebuah kafe atau medan selera kecil.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>413.56,'end_time'=>421.34,'target_text'=>'Many customers are sitting under the shade, drinking cold drinks, chatting with friends, or resting in the afternoon.','source_text'=>'Ramai pelanggan sedang duduk berteduh, menikmati minuman sejuk, berbual dengan rakan, atau berehat pada waktu petang.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>421.44,'end_time'=>427.9,'target_text'=>'The open space, trees, and covered roof make the place feel comfortable even on a sunny day.','source_text'=>'Ruang terbuka, rimbunan pokok, dan bumbung teduhan menjadikan tempat ini selesa walaupun pada hari panas.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>428,'end_time'=>432.58,'target_text'=>'Some people are standing near the counter, while others are walking between the tables.','source_text'=>'Ada yang berdiri berhampiran kaunter, manakala yang lain berjalan di celah-celah meja.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>432.68,'end_time'=>433.74,'target_text'=>'Want more practice?','source_text'=>'Mahu lebih banyak latihan?','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>433.84,'end_time'=>441.22,'target_text'=>'Get the workbook for this lesson on my website and review the vocabulary, grammar, and real English from this video.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku kerja untuk pelajaran ini di laman web saya dan ulangkaji kosa kata, tatabahasa, serta bahasa Inggeris sebenar daripada video ini.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>441.32,'end_time'=>446.54,'target_text'=>'>> Over there in the distance, [music] you can see many cranes and also shipping containers.','source_text'=>'>> Di kejauhan sana, anda boleh lihat banyak kren dan juga kontena perkapalan.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>446.64,'end_time'=>449.1,'target_text'=>'That looks to be like a port.','source_text'=>'Itu kelihatan seperti kawasan pelabuhan.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>449.2,'end_time'=>452.34,'target_text'=>'And behind the port, it looks like there is an apartment building.','source_text'=>'Dan di belakang pelabuhan itu, nampaknya ada sebuah bangunan pangsapuri.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>452.44,'end_time'=>458.82,'target_text'=>'There are also many boats on the water, and you can see these barges are transporting cranes.','source_text'=>'Terdapat juga banyak bot di atas air, dan anda boleh lihat tongkang-tongkang ini sedang mengangkut kren.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>458.92,'end_time'=>462.26,'target_text'=>'That is the ferry we were just on, that ferry right there.','source_text'=>'Itulah feri yang baru sahaja kami naiki tadi, feri di sana itu.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>462.36,'end_time'=>465.58,'target_text'=>'And down there, you can see another ferry.','source_text'=>'Dan di bawah sana, anda boleh nampak sebuah lagi feri.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>465.68,'end_time'=>469.34,'target_text'=>'I believe that one just takes you from one side of the river to the other.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa feri yang itu cuma membawa penumpang menyeberang dari satu tebing sungai ke tebing yang bertentangan.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>469.44,'end_time'=>474.94,'target_text'=>'You can see people are getting off the ferry, and I believe it\'s probably just for motorcycles.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak orang ramai turun dari feri, dan saya rasa ia mungkin dikhaskan untuk motosikal sahaja.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>475.04,'end_time'=>480.38,'target_text'=>'They probably came from that side over to this side, and the easiest way to cross is with a ferry.','source_text'=>'Mereka kemungkinan datang dari seberang sana ke sini, dan cara paling mudah untuk menyeberang adalah menaiki feri.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>480.48,'end_time'=>482.22,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we\'re now heading back.','source_text'=>'Okey, sekarang kami sedang dalam perjalanan pulang.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>482.32,'end_time'=>484.42,'target_text'=>'They just scanned our tickets here.','source_text'=>'Mereka baru sahaja mengimbas tiket kami di sini.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>484.52,'end_time'=>485.46,'target_text'=>'Pass the ticket, please.','source_text'=>'Tolong hulurkan tiketnya.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>485.56,'end_time'=>488.02,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, they just scanned the QR code here.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya, mereka baru sahaja imbas kod QR di sini.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>488.12,'end_time'=>491.62,'target_text'=>'Two tickets, and now we\'re heading back to our area.','source_text'=>'Dua keping tiket, dan sekarang kami menuju kembali ke kawasan tempat tinggal kami.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>491.72,'end_time'=>496.7,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to head back, probably get something to eat, go to the gym, and do some more stuff at home.','source_text'=>'Kami akan balik, mungkin cari makanan, pergi ke gim, dan buat beberapa kerja di rumah.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>496.8,'end_time'=>498.26,'target_text'=>'So, we\'ll start heading back now.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami akan mula bertolak pulang sekarang.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>498.36,'end_time'=>500.02,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we just got back.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi kami baru sahaja sampai balik.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>500.12,'end_time'=>501.3,'target_text'=>'We got off the boat.','source_text'=>'Kami sudah turun dari bot.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>501.4,'end_time'=>505.34,'target_text'=>'Now, we\'re going to go back to the apartment and probably order some lunch to eat.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami akan balik ke pangsapuri dan mungkin memesan makanan tengah hari.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>505.44,'end_time'=>508.02,'target_text'=>'And I also need to have a shower and do some other things.','source_text'=>'Dan saya juga perlu mandi serta selesaikan beberapa urusan lain.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>508.12,'end_time'=>510.34,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ll see you guys at the apartment.','source_text'=>'Jadi jumpa anda semua di apartmen nanti.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>510.44,'end_time'=>514.14,'target_text'=>'And as always, guys, there will be a shadowing segment at the very end of the video.','source_text'=>'Dan seperti biasa, akan ada segmen teknik peniruan (shadowing) di penghujung video.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>514.24,'end_time'=>516.26,'target_text'=>'So, make sure you watch till the end.','source_text'=>'Jadi pastikan anda menonton sehingga selesai.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>516.36,'end_time'=>517.82,'target_text'=>'Let\'s head back home now.','source_text'=>'Mari kita pulang sekarang.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>517.92,'end_time'=>520.26,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys, I just got back from the gym.','source_text'=>'Okey kawan-kawan, saya baru sahaja balik dari gim.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>520.36,'end_time'=>525.02,'target_text'=>'I went to the gym, and Leon went to the grocery store, right?','source_text'=>'Saya pergi ke gim, dan Leon pergi ke kedai runcit, betul tak?','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>525.12,'end_time'=>526.46,'target_text'=>'Yeah, he went to the grocery store.','source_text'=>'Ya, dia pergi ke kedai runcit.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>526.56,'end_time'=>527.78,'target_text'=>'Not really sure what he bought.','source_text'=>'Tak pasti sangat apa yang dia beli.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>527.88,'end_time'=>529.06,'target_text'=>'What did you buy?','source_text'=>'Apa yang kau beli?','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>529.16,'end_time'=>530.46,'target_text'=>'>> Just something to drink.','source_text'=>'>> Cuma beli air minuman sahaja.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>530.56,'end_time'=>533.06,'target_text'=>'>> So, he said he bought just some stuff to drink.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi dia kata dia cuma beli minuman.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>533.16,'end_time'=>533.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>533.68,'end_time'=>536.04,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s see what he bought.','source_text'=>'>> Mari kita tengok apa yang dia beli.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>538.04,'end_time'=>539.42,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh ya.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>539.52,'end_time'=>542.9,'target_text'=>'I can see he bought a pack of six-pack of Coke Zero.','source_text'=>'Saya nampak dia beli satu pek enam tin Coke Zero.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>543,'end_time'=>544.7,'target_text'=>'Low-key, I like Coke Zero.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, saya memang suka Coke Zero.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>544.8,'end_time'=>547.26,'target_text'=>'Tastes good and zero calories.','source_text'=>'Rasanya sedap dan sifir kalori.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>547.36,'end_time'=>548.9,'target_text'=>'But yeah, I just got back from the gym.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, saya baru balik dari gim.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>549,'end_time'=>557.94,'target_text'=>'I\'m like pretty sweaty right now, but the apartment is nice and cool because we have AC in here and also a fan right there.','source_text'=>'Saya agak berpeluh sekarang, tetapi apartmen ini sejuk dan nyaman kerana ada penyaman udara dan juga kipas di situ.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>558.04,'end_time'=>560.14,'target_text'=>'So, the apartment is nice and cool.','source_text'=>'Jadi apartmen ini terasa nyaman dan sejuk.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>560.24,'end_time'=>561.62,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s not hot.','source_text'=>'Jadi tidaklah panas.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>561.72,'end_time'=>564.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s cool, but uh I\'m going to go have a shower now.','source_text'=>'Rasanya nyaman, tetapi saya akan pergi mandi sekarang.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>564.72,'end_time'=>573.34,'target_text'=>'I shaved yesterday, so I\'m not going to shave today, but um I will go have a shower, and then probably eat something.','source_text'=>'Saya sudah bercukur semalam, jadi tak perlu cukur hari ini, tetapi saya akan mandi dan kemudian makan sesuatu.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>573.44,'end_time'=>575.1,'target_text'=>'I think I\'ll have a smoothie or something.','source_text'=>'Rasanya saya nak minum smoothie atau sesuatu yang menyegarkan.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>575.2,'end_time'=>581.38,'target_text'=>'I stopped at a restaurant on the way back, and I got broken rice, which is like one of my favorite meals to get here.','source_text'=>'Saya singgah di sebuah restoran semasa perjalanan balik dan beli \'broken rice\' (nasi hancur Vietnam), iaitu salah satu makanan kegemaran saya di sini.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>581.48,'end_time'=>584.34,'target_text'=>'But, um yeah, now I\'m going to go have a shower.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, sekarang saya nak pergi mandi.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>584.44,'end_time'=>587.06,'target_text'=>'I\'ll see you guys after my shower.','source_text'=>'Jumpa anda semua selepas saya selesai mandi.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>587.16,'end_time'=>587.7,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys.','source_text'=>'Okey semua.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>587.8,'end_time'=>594.5,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m back home now, and low-key, I forgot to show you guys what I had for lunch.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya sudah berada di rumah sekarang, dan sebenarnya saya terlupa nak tunjuk apa yang saya makan tengah hari tadi.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>594.6,'end_time'=>595.86,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ll just tell you instead.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya ceritakan sahaja kepada anda.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>595.96,'end_time'=>598.38,'target_text'=>'I had um Filipino food.','source_text'=>'Saya makan masakan Filipina.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>598.48,'end_time'=>605.1,'target_text'=>'It was barbecue chicken with rice and some vegetables, and I think some like soy sauce or something.','source_text'=>'Ia adalah ayam barbeku bersama nasi dan sedikit sayur-sayuran, serta rasanya ada kicap soya.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>605.2,'end_time'=>606.78,'target_text'=>'But, this is all that\'s left.','source_text'=>'Tetapi ini sahaja yang tinggal.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>606.88,'end_time'=>608.38,'target_text'=>'This is the one thing I didn\'t throw out.','source_text'=>'Inilah satu-satunya benda yang belum saya buang.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>608.48,'end_time'=>609.46,'target_text'=>'But, it was very good.','source_text'=>'Tetapi rasanya sangat sedap.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>609.56,'end_time'=>613.7,'target_text'=>'My brother recommended it to me, and I ordered it, and it is very good.','source_text'=>'Abang saya cadangkan makanan itu kepada saya, jadi saya pesan, dan rasanya memang sangat enak.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>613.8,'end_time'=>614.9,'target_text'=>'I like Filipino food.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka makanan Filipina.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>615,'end_time'=>617.58,'target_text'=>'It really like matches my taste buds a lot.','source_text'=>'Ia memang sangat kena dengan selera tekak saya.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>617.68,'end_time'=>621.9,'target_text'=>'But, now I\'m going to open the bathroom door and take my laundry out.','source_text'=>'Tetapi sekarang saya akan buka pintu bilik air dan keluarkan baju basuhan saya.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>622,'end_time'=>623.3,'target_text'=>'My laundry.','source_text'=>'Pakaian basuhan saya.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>623.4,'end_time'=>625.78,'target_text'=>'So, I washed all my whites here.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya basuh semua baju putih saya di sini.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>625.88,'end_time'=>628.94,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to bring it to my bed and fold it.','source_text'=>'Saya akan bawa ia ke atas katil dan melipatnya.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>629.04,'end_time'=>631.62,'target_text'=>'So, now I\'m going to grab all my laundry here.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya akan angkat semua pakaian basuhan ini.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>631.72,'end_time'=>633.62,'target_text'=>'I also washed my towels.','source_text'=>'Saya juga basuh tuala-tuala saya.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>633.72,'end_time'=>638.78,'target_text'=>'And yeah, it\'s mostly my socks, boxers, and towels.','source_text'=>'Dan ya, kebanyakannya adalah stoking, seluar boxer, dan tuala saya.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>638.88,'end_time'=>641.18,'target_text'=>'But, yeah, let\'s fold this laundry now.','source_text'=>'Mari kita lipat pakaian basuhan ini sekarang.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>641.28,'end_time'=>647.9,'target_text'=>'So, now I\'m going to put my socks right side out, and uh then fold them.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang saya akan kalihkan stoking ke sebelah luar yang betul, kemudian melipatnya.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>648,'end_time'=>651.3,'target_text'=>'And you can see this is my bath towel and my boxers as well.','source_text'=>'Dan anda boleh nampak ini tuala mandi serta seluar boxer saya juga.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>651.4,'end_time'=>653.22,'target_text'=>'So, let me fold all of this stuff.','source_text'=>'Jadi biar saya lipat semua barang ini.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>653.32,'end_time'=>656.14,'target_text'=>'Now, I\'m not sure what Leon wants to eat for dinner.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya tidak pasti apa yang Leon nak makan untuk makan malam.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>656.24,'end_time'=>663.48,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go ask him because I didn\'t show you guys what I had for lunch, so I should show you what I have for dinner.','source_text'=>'Mari pergi tanya dia sebab tadi saya tak sempat tunjuk apa yang saya makan tengah hari, jadi saya patut tunjuk apa yang kami makan malam.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>663.76,'end_time'=>665.06,'target_text'=>'Yo.','source_text'=>'Yo.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>665.16,'end_time'=>666.94,'target_text'=>'What do you want for dinner?','source_text'=>'Kau nak makan apa untuk malam ini?','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>667.04,'end_time'=>667.98,'target_text'=>'>> Dinner?','source_text'=>'>> Makan malam?','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>668.08,'end_time'=>669.7,'target_text'=>'>> Or did you already eat?','source_text'=>'>> Atau kau dah makan?','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>669.8,'end_time'=>673.94,'target_text'=>'>> I had lunch around 11:00, so >> Wait, what did you have for lunch?','source_text'=>'>> Aku makan tengah hari sekitar pukul 11 tadi, jadi... >> Kejap, kau makan apa tengah hari tadi?','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>674.04,'end_time'=>676.02,'target_text'=>'>> I got some stuff at the grocery store.','source_text'=>'>> Aku ada beli barang di kedai runcit.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>676.12,'end_time'=>676.82,'target_text'=>'>> You want pizza?','source_text'=>'>> Kau nak piza?','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>676.92,'end_time'=>677.5,'target_text'=>'>> Pizza?','source_text'=>'>> Piza?','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>677.6,'end_time'=>678.62,'target_text'=>'>> Do they have two for one?','source_text'=>'>> Ada promosi beli satu percuma satu ke?','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>678.72,'end_time'=>679.46,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe.','source_text'=>'>> Mungkin ada.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>679.56,'end_time'=>681.74,'target_text'=>'>> He says he lost 50 lbs.','source_text'=>'>> Dia kata berat badan dia turun 50 paun.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>681.84,'end_time'=>684.38,'target_text'=>'Yo, write in the comments if you believe that.','source_text'=>'Tulis di ruangan komen kalau korang percaya.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>684.48,'end_time'=>686.66,'target_text'=>'>> [laughter] >> Yo, what are you working on?','source_text'=>'>> [ketawa] >> Hei, kau tengah buat apa tu?','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>686.76,'end_time'=>688.7,'target_text'=>'Yo, I\'m working on my channel right now.','source_text'=>'Aku tengah uruskan saluran YouTube aku sekarang.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>688.8,'end_time'=>689.42,'target_text'=>'I just started.','source_text'=>'Aku baru sahaja bermula.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>689.52,'end_time'=>691.74,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to be posting once a week if you guys want to check it out.','source_text'=>'Aku akan muat naik seminggu sekali kalau korang berminat nak tonton.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>691.84,'end_time'=>696.18,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ll be posting my shadowing stories on my second channel, Volka.','source_text'=>'>> Saya akan muat naik cerita peniruan sebutan (shadowing) di saluran kedua saya, Volka.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>696.28,'end_time'=>699.58,'target_text'=>'And I\'ve also started posting these videos as podcasts.','source_text'=>'Dan saya juga telah mula menyiarkan video-video ini dalam format podcast.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>699.68,'end_time'=>704.5,'target_text'=>'We\'re deciding on what we should get for dinner, so let me let me give Leon a mic.','source_text'=>'Kami sedang membuat keputusan tentang makan malam, jadi biar saya pasangkan mikrofon pada Leon.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>704.6,'end_time'=>705.62,'target_text'=>'So you guys can hear him.','source_text'=>'Supaya anda semua boleh dengar suaranya.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>705.72,'end_time'=>707.22,'target_text'=>'I have the mic here.','source_text'=>'Saya ada mikrofon di sini.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>707.32,'end_time'=>708.82,'target_text'=>'Okay, what did you want to have for dinner?','source_text'=>'Okey, kau nak makan apa untuk makan malam?','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>708.92,'end_time'=>711.94,'target_text'=>'>> Um what\'s that Korean chicken you had that one time?','source_text'=>'>> Apa nama ayam Korea yang kau pernah makan dulu tu?','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>712.04,'end_time'=>712.9,'target_text'=>'That was pretty good.','source_text'=>'Rasanya agak sedap.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>713,'end_time'=>713.98,'target_text'=>'>> Korean fried chicken?','source_text'=>'>> Ayam goreng Korea?','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>714.08,'end_time'=>714.98,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>715.08,'end_time'=>716.26,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m not against that.','source_text'=>'>> Aku tak kisah, boleh sangat.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>716.36,'end_time'=>717.98,'target_text'=>'Korean fried chicken, that is really good.','source_text'=>'Ayam goreng Korea memang sangat sedap.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>718.08,'end_time'=>719.1,'target_text'=>'One of my favorites, honestly.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya antara makanan kegemaran saya.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>719.2,'end_time'=>721.54,'target_text'=>'I love Korean fried chicken.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat menggemari ayam goreng Korea.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>721.64,'end_time'=>725.66,'target_text'=>'My favorite is the red sauce one, which is like the original flavor.','source_text'=>'Pilihan kegemaran saya adalah yang bersos merah, iaitu seperti perisa asalnya.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>725.76,'end_time'=>728.1,'target_text'=>'Not plain, but the original red sauce one.','source_text'=>'Bukan yang biasa tanpa sos, tapi yang sos merah asli.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>728.2,'end_time'=>729.3,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know what it\'s called.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu apa namanya.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>729.4,'end_time'=>730.54,'target_text'=>'>> Gochujang sauce.','source_text'=>'>> Sos gochujang.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>730.64,'end_time'=>732.22,'target_text'=>'>> No, it\'s not called that.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, bukan itu namanya.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>732.32,'end_time'=>733.94,'target_text'=>'>> Isn\'t that one of the flavors, though?','source_text'=>'>> Tapi bukankah itu salah satu perisanya?','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>734.04,'end_time'=>736.7,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, gochujang chicken, but I don\'t think that\'s what it\'s called.','source_text'=>'>> Ya ayam gochujang, tapi rasanya itu bukan nama khususnya.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>736.8,'end_time'=>741.26,'target_text'=>'I think you get I think they put gochujang in the sauce to make it, but I don\'t think that\'s the name of it.','source_text'=>'Rasanya mereka letak pes gochujang dalam sos untuk membuatnya, tetapi rasanya bukan itu nama menu tersebut.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>741.36,'end_time'=>742.26,'target_text'=>'I could be wrong, though.','source_text'=>'Mungkin saya tersilap juga.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>742.36,'end_time'=>743.98,'target_text'=>'You guys know, let me know in the comments.','source_text'=>'Kalau anda tahu, beritahu saya di ruangan komen.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>744.08,'end_time'=>746.06,'target_text'=>'>> Why do you like Korean fried chicken, though?','source_text'=>'>> Tapi kenapa kau suka sangat ayam goreng Korea?','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>746.16,'end_time'=>750.62,'target_text'=>'>> I like Korean fried chicken because they have a lot of different sauces and good flavors.','source_text'=>'>> Saya suka ayam goreng Korea sebab mereka ada banyak pilihan sos dan rasa yang menyelerakan.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>750.72,'end_time'=>757.46,'target_text'=>'I tried a BHC chicken in Korea, and it was like a spicy soy sauce sweet flavor or something.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah cuba ayam BHC di Korea, rasanya seperti gabungan manis sos soya pedas.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>757.56,'end_time'=>761.98,'target_text'=>'Man, that was good cuz I love spicy food and like sweet together.','source_text'=>'Memang mantap sebab saya suka makanan pedas bercampur manis bersama-sama.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>762.08,'end_time'=>762.78,'target_text'=>'It was really good.','source_text'=>'Ia benar-benar sedap.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>762.88,'end_time'=>763.5,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'>> Wah.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>763.6,'end_time'=>766.82,'target_text'=>'>> But yeah, so I guess we\'ll have that for dinner, and that\'s what we\'ll show you guys.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi ya, jadi rasanya kami akan makan itu untuk malam ini dan itulah yang akan kami tunjukkan kepada anda.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>766.92,'end_time'=>770.46,'target_text'=>'And remember, at the end of the video we\'ll have another shadowing practice.','source_text'=>'Dan ingat, di penghujung video nanti kita akan ada satu lagi latihan teknik shadowing.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>770.56,'end_time'=>772.3,'target_text'=>'So stick around till the end.','source_text'=>'Jadi teruskan menonton hingga ke penamat.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>772.4,'end_time'=>773.98,'target_text'=>'I\'ll see you guys then.','source_text'=>'Jumpa anda sebentar lagi.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>774.08,'end_time'=>777.42,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys, as promised, I will show you what we got for dinner.','source_text'=>'Okey semua, seperti yang dijanjikan, saya akan tunjukkan apa yang kami beli untuk makan malam.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>777.52,'end_time'=>778.34,'target_text'=>'Open it up.','source_text'=>'Buka bungkusannya.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>778.44,'end_time'=>779.78,'target_text'=>'>> This thing was heavy.','source_text'=>'>> Berat betul bungkusan ini.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>779.88,'end_time'=>781.22,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh ya.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>781.32,'end_time'=>783.22,'target_text'=>'>> This is just like a full portion.','source_text'=>'>> Ini memang satu hidangan lengkap yang besar.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>783.32,'end_time'=>785.94,'target_text'=>'There\'s two sides, but this is really good.','source_text'=>'Ada dua hidangan sampingan, tetapi ini memang nampak sangat sedap.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>786.04,'end_time'=>791.98,'target_text'=>'This is sweet and spicy, and this is soy garlic with rice cakes.','source_text'=>'Ini perisa manis pedas, dan ini perisa bawang putih soya bersama kek beras (tteokbokki).','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>792.08,'end_time'=>793.86,'target_text'=>'Yep, but it\'s not it\'s not spicy.','source_text'=>'Ya, tapi yang ini tidak pedas.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>793.96,'end_time'=>795.82,'target_text'=>'But this is what we\'ve got for dinner.','source_text'=>'Inilah menu makan malam kami.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>795.92,'end_time'=>802.34,'target_text'=>'And then on the side here, we also have some radish, a Coke, and then one other thing, which I\'m not sure exactly what it','source_text'=>'Dan di samping itu, kami juga ada lobak putih jeruk, sebotol Coke, serta satu lagi benda yang saya tak pasti apa','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>802.44,'end_time'=>802.84,'target_text'=>'is.','source_text'=>'bendanya.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>802.92,'end_time'=>804.58,'target_text'=>'But we are having dinner together.','source_text'=>'Tetapi malam ini kami makan malam bersama.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>804.68,'end_time'=>810.22,'target_text'=>'We don\'t have dinner together every night because we eat different things at different times, but I would say a couple of','source_text'=>'Kami tidak makan malam bersama setiap hari kerana waktu makan dan selera kami berbeza, tetapi saya rasa dalam seminggu','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>810.32,'end_time'=>811.46,'target_text'=>'times out of the week we do.','source_text'=>'ada beberapa kali juga kami makan bersama.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>811.56,'end_time'=>812.02,'target_text'=>'You can have that.','source_text'=>'Kau boleh ambil yang itu.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>812.12,'end_time'=>814.02,'target_text'=>'I have my other one in the fridge.','source_text'=>'Aku ada satu lagi di dalam peti sejuk.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>814.12,'end_time'=>819.1,'target_text'=>'Leon\'s putting the Coke in the fridge to Oh, I guess I\'ll drink this then since I already drank all my Coke.','source_text'=>'Leon meletakkan Coke ke dalam peti sejuk untuk... Oh nampaknya saya minum yang ini sahajalah kerana saya sudah habiskan Coke saya.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>819.2,'end_time'=>820.82,'target_text'=>'I low-key need to buy more.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya saya memang kena beli stok baharu lagi.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>820.92,'end_time'=>826.1,'target_text'=>'Anyway, we\'re going to have our final shadowing segment of the day as promised here.','source_text'=>'Apa pun, kita akan teruskan dengan segmen latihan shadowing terakhir untuk hari ini seperti yang dijanjikan.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>826.2,'end_time'=>830.64,'target_text'=>'So, take a look at the scene and let\'s get started.','source_text'=>'Jadi perhatikan suasana ini dan mari kita mulakan.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>832.36,'end_time'=>835.46,'target_text'=>'This is a table with food and drinks.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah meja makan yang dipenuhi dengan makanan dan minuman.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>835.56,'end_time'=>838.78,'target_text'=>'There is a box of chicken in the middle of the table.','source_text'=>'Terdapat sebuah kotak ayam goreng di tengah-tengah meja.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>838.88,'end_time'=>846.1,'target_text'=>'There are also cups, sauce, a bottle of soda, fruit, glasses, and plastic bags.','source_text'=>'Terdapat juga cawan, bekas sos, sebotol minuman berkarbonat, buah-buahan, cermin mata, dan beg plastik.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>846.2,'end_time'=>848.58,'target_text'=>'The table is black and shiny.','source_text'=>'Meja ini berwarna hitam dan berkilat.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>848.68,'end_time'=>851.5,'target_text'=>'The food looks hot and sweet.','source_text'=>'Makanannya kelihatan panas dan berselera manis.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>851.6,'end_time'=>854.3,'target_text'=>'Someone is going to eat the chicken soon.','source_text'=>'Seseorang akan menikmati ayam ini sebentar lagi.','order'=>280],
