            ['start_time'=>231.4,'end_time'=>236.06,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys, so now we are at KLCC Park, KLCC Park.','source_text'=>'Baiklah kawan-kawan, sekarang kami berada di Taman KLCC, Taman KLCC.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>236.16,'end_time'=>239.38,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to start talking about our daily routine and habits.','source_text'=>'Kita akan mula bercerita tentang rutin harian dan tabiat kita.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>239.48,'end_time'=>245.78,'target_text'=>'So, you can divide that into three categories: your morning routine, your afternoon routine, and your evening routine.','source_text'=>'Jadi, anda boleh membahagikannya kepada tiga kategori: rutin pagi, rutin tengah hari, dan rutin malam.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>245.88,'end_time'=>252.26,'target_text'=>'So, those are the three parts of the day and you can divide them all into separate routines when you talk about your daily','source_text'=>'Itulah tiga bahagian dalam sehari dan anda boleh membahagikan semuanya kepada rutin berasingan apabila bercerita tentang','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>252.36,'end_time'=>254.54,'target_text'=>'routine and habits.','source_text'=>'rutin harian dan tabiat anda.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>254.64,'end_time'=>259.82,'target_text'=>'Okay, so here are four useful words you can use when talking about your daily routine.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, ini empat perkataan berguna yang boleh anda gunakan apabila bercerita tentang rutin harian anda.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>259.92,'end_time'=>265.94,'target_text'=>'I always, I usually, I sometimes, and I never.','source_text'=>'I always (saya sentiasa), I usually (saya biasanya), I sometimes (saya kadang-kadang), dan I never (saya tidak pernah).','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>266.04,'end_time'=>269.3,'target_text'=>'I always means every day.','source_text'=>'\'I always\' bermaksud setiap hari.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>269.4,'end_time'=>272.46,'target_text'=>'I usually means most days.','source_text'=>'\'I usually\' bermaksud kebanyakan hari.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>272.56,'end_time'=>275.94,'target_text'=>'I sometimes means not every day.','source_text'=>'\'I sometimes\' bermaksud bukan setiap hari.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>276.04,'end_time'=>278.62,'target_text'=>'And I never means','source_text'=>'Dan \'I never\' bermaksud','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>278.72,'end_time'=>280.82,'target_text'=>'zero days, so you never do it.','source_text'=>'sifar hari, maknanya anda langsung tidak melakukannya.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>280.92,'end_time'=>284.38,'target_text'=>'So, out of all the days of the week, you never do this activity.','source_text'=>'Jadi, daripada semua hari dalam seminggu, anda langsung tidak pernah melakukan aktiviti ini.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>284.48,'end_time'=>289.58,'target_text'=>'Those are four important words you can use when talking about your daily routine and habits.','source_text'=>'Itulah empat perkataan penting yang boleh anda gunakan apabila bercerita tentang rutin harian dan tabiat anda.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>289.68,'end_time'=>292.62,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s make a couple sentences using those four words.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, mari kita bina beberapa ayat menggunakan empat perkataan tersebut.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>292.72,'end_time'=>295.46,'target_text'=>'I always have a shower in the morning.','source_text'=>'I always have a shower in the morning (Saya sentiasa mandi pada waktu pagi).','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>295.56,'end_time'=>300.02,'target_text'=>'I usually eat lunch in the afternoon, but not always.','source_text'=>'I usually eat lunch in the afternoon, but not always (Saya biasanya makan tengah hari, tetapi bukan selalu).','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>300.12,'end_time'=>305.18,'target_text'=>'And in the evening, I sometimes go out to a restaurant to eat.','source_text'=>'And in the evening, I sometimes go out to a restaurant to eat (Dan pada waktu malam, saya kadang-kadang keluar makan di restoran).','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>305.28,'end_time'=>311.02,'target_text'=>'And something I never do at all throughout the whole day is I never eat breakfast.','source_text'=>'Dan perkara yang saya langsung tidak buat sepanjang hari ialah saya tidak pernah bersarapan.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>311.12,'end_time'=>313.66,'target_text'=>'I never eat breakfast, ever.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pernah bersarapan, langsung tak pernah.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>313.76,'end_time'=>314.98,'target_text'=>'Now, it\'s your turn.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, giliran anda pula.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>315.08,'end_time'=>318.02,'target_text'=>'Make me a sentence using each of those words.','source_text'=>'Bina satu ayat untuk saya menggunakan setiap perkataan tersebut.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>318.12,'end_time'=>322.58,'target_text'=>'I always, I usually, I sometimes, I never.','source_text'=>'I always, I usually, I sometimes, I never.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>322.68,'end_time'=>329.58,'target_text'=>'Make a sentence now, and if you want to practice even more, take a video of yourself saying these sentences out loud.','source_text'=>'Bina ayat sekarang, dan jika anda mahu berlatih lebih lagi, rakam video diri anda menyebut ayat-ayat ini dengan kuat.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>329.68,'end_time'=>336.38,'target_text'=>'You can also write your answers in the comments, and I\'ll tell you if your sentence is right or if it needs improvement.','source_text'=>'Anda juga boleh tulis jawapan anda di ruangan komen, dan saya akan beritahu jika ayat anda betul atau perlu diperbaiki.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>336.48,'end_time'=>337.9,'target_text'=>'Okay, this park is pretty nice.','source_text'=>'Taman ini agak menarik.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>338,'end_time'=>339.5,'target_text'=>'What do you think of it so far?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat awak setakat ini?','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>339.6,'end_time'=>341.78,'target_text'=>'>> So far, this park looks really well-maintained.','source_text'=>'>> Setakat ini, taman ini nampak sangat terjaga dengan rapi.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>341.88,'end_time'=>344.62,'target_text'=>'I don\'t see any garbage or anything that shouldn\'t be there.','source_text'=>'Saya langsung tak nampak sampah atau apa-apa yang tidak sepatutnya berada di sini.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>344.72,'end_time'=>346.5,'target_text'=>'It does seem fairly popular.','source_text'=>'Ia kelihatan agak popular.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>346.6,'end_time'=>350.3,'target_text'=>'It is the middle of the day and there are quite a few people out.','source_text'=>'Sekarang waktu tengah hari dan ada agak ramai orang beriadah di luar.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>350.4,'end_time'=>356.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, one thing I would add to that is that it it seems kind of small or does it go like a lot further that way?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, satu perkara yang saya ingin tambah ialah ia nampak agak kecil atau adakah ia meluas lebih jauh ke arah sana?','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>356.24,'end_time'=>359.34,'target_text'=>'From what I\'m seeing it\'s like it\'s kind of small in my opinion.','source_text'=>'Daripada apa yang saya lihat, pada pendapat saya ia agak kecil.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>359.44,'end_time'=>360.1,'target_text'=>'>> super huge.','source_text'=>'>> sangat luas.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>360.2,'end_time'=>362.14,'target_text'=>'We are in the center of the city right now.','source_text'=>'Kita kini berada di pusat bandar raya.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>362.24,'end_time'=>362.64,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>362.72,'end_time'=>367.94,'target_text'=>'>> But it does go that way and then over there is a aquarium.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi ia memang menuju ke arah sana dan di sebelah sana ada akuarium.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>368.04,'end_time'=>368.9,'target_text'=>'>> Over there?','source_text'=>'>> Di sebelah sana?','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>369,'end_time'=>371.06,'target_text'=>'>> To that yeah, to that side.','source_text'=>'>> Ke arah ya, ke arah bahagian sana.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>371.16,'end_time'=>372.54,'target_text'=>'There\'s a large aquarium.','source_text'=>'Ada sebuah akuarium yang besar.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>372.64,'end_time'=>377.46,'target_text'=>'>> Central Park is probably an arguably the most famous park out of all the parks.','source_text'=>'>> Central Park boleh dikatakan taman yang paling terkenal daripada semua taman.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>377.56,'end_time'=>381.06,'target_text'=>'When you think of a park inside a city usually you think of Central Park, right?','source_text'=>'Bila anda terfikir tentang taman di dalam bandar raya, biasanya anda akan teringat Central Park, kan?','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>381.16,'end_time'=>384.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that\'s I think I\'d argue it\'s the most famous park in the world.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya rasa ia sememangnya taman paling terkenal di dunia.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>384.4,'end_time'=>389.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, like usually when I think of a park in a city I think of Central Park and that park is huge.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, biasanya bila saya teringat taman di dalam bandar raya, saya fikirkan Central Park dan taman itu sangat besar.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>389.4,'end_time'=>393.66,'target_text'=>'And there are so many movies that feature Central Park like one off the top of my head is Elf.','source_text'=>'Dan terdapat begitu banyak filem yang memaparkan Central Park, contohnya yang terlintas di fikiran saya ialah Elf.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>393.76,'end_time'=>400.86,'target_text'=>'Elf is like a very popular Christmas movie and it features a lot of scenes in Central Park during the winter.','source_text'=>'Elf ialah sebuah filem Krismas yang sangat popular dan menampilkan banyak babak di Central Park semasa musim sejuk.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>400.96,'end_time'=>402.98,'target_text'=>'But yeah, this park is quite nice.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, taman ini agak cantik.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>403.08,'end_time'=>405.54,'target_text'=>'See on the ground here, are those ants or what?','source_text'=>'Tengok di atas tanah ini, adakah itu semut atau apa?','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>405.64,'end_time'=>406.58,'target_text'=>'Like what are these?','source_text'=>'Apakah benda-benda ini?','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>406.68,'end_time'=>408.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they look like really small ants.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, mereka nampak seperti semut yang sangat halus.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>408.72,'end_time'=>411.5,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m not sure if you could see it on camera but they\'re so small.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tidak pasti sama ada anda boleh nampak dalam kamera, tetapi ia sangat kecil.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>411.6,'end_time'=>416.58,'target_text'=>'They kind of look like fruit flies to me but I\'m pretty sure they\'re ants.','source_text'=>'Ia nampak macam lalat buah bagi saya tetapi saya agak yakin ia adalah semut.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>416.68,'end_time'=>417.14,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'>> Wah.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>417.24,'end_time'=>420.68,'target_text'=>'>> How would you guys describe these ants?','source_text'=>'>> Bagaimana anda menggambarkan semut-semut ini?','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>421.04,'end_time'=>426.38,'target_text'=>'To me these ants are very tiny, almost microscopic you could say.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya semut-semut ini sangat halus, boleh dikatakan hampir mikroskopik.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>426.48,'end_time'=>430.34,'target_text'=>'And that\'s obviously an exaggeration but that just shows you how small they are.','source_text'=>'Dan itu jelas satu hiperbola, tetapi ia menunjukkan betapa kecilnya saiz mereka.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>430.44,'end_time'=>432.06,'target_text'=>'They are extremely small.','source_text'=>'Mereka tersangatlah kecil.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>432.16,'end_time'=>435.22,'target_text'=>'They don\'t even look like ants, they look like tiny fruit flies to me.','source_text'=>'Mereka langsung tidak nampak macam semut, nampak macam lalat buah kecil bagi saya.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>435.32,'end_time'=>436.42,'target_text'=>'That\'s how small they are.','source_text'=>'Begitulah betapa kecilnya mereka.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>436.52,'end_time'=>437.66,'target_text'=>'And they\'re also quite fast.','source_text'=>'Dan mereka juga bergerak agak pantas.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>437.76,'end_time'=>440.18,'target_text'=>'What other words would you use to describe those ants?','source_text'=>'Apakah perkataan lain yang anda akan gunakan untuk menggambarkan semut-semut itu?','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>440.28,'end_time'=>442.58,'target_text'=>'>> I\'d say their movements are erratic.','source_text'=>'>> Saya akan kata pergerakan mereka tidak menentu (erratic).','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>442.68,'end_time'=>445.74,'target_text'=>'They\'re not moving in a straight line or following a path.','source_text'=>'Mereka tidak bergerak dalam garisan lurus atau mengikut laluan tertentu.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>445.84,'end_time'=>447.66,'target_text'=>'They\'re kind of jerking around, yeah.','source_text'=>'Mereka bergerak secara tersentak-sentak ke sana ke mari, ya.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>447.76,'end_time'=>449.26,'target_text'=>'>> They\'re all over the place.','source_text'=>'>> Mereka bertempiaran di merata-rata tempat.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>449.36,'end_time'=>455.46,'target_text'=>'I\'m sure they have orders from the queen from the queen ant but I don\'t know what those orders are but they\'re just like all','source_text'=>'Saya yakin mereka mendapat arahan daripada ratu semut, tetapi saya tak tahu apa arahannya sebab mereka cuma bertempiaran','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>455.56,'end_time'=>457.06,'target_text'=>'over the place.','source_text'=>'ke merata tempat.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>457.16,'end_time'=>459.06,'target_text'=>'Do you guys see this right here?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda nampak benda ini di sini?','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>459.16,'end_time'=>460.82,'target_text'=>'Come a little closer to show them.','source_text'=>'Datang dekat sikit untuk tunjukkan kepada mereka.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>460.92,'end_time'=>462.14,'target_text'=>'Do you know what this is?','source_text'=>'Anda tahu apa ini?','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>462.24,'end_time'=>463.06,'target_text'=>'What is this called?','source_text'=>'Apakah nama benda ini?','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>463.16,'end_time'=>464.94,'target_text'=>'>> That looks like a light to me.','source_text'=>'>> Itu nampak seperti lampu bagi saya.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>465.04,'end_time'=>468.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so this is an LED light by the looks of it.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ini nampaknya seperti sebuah lampu LED.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>468.2,'end_time'=>472.62,'target_text'=>'It looks like an LED light and this just turns on at night to light up these trees.','source_text'=>'Ia kelihatan seperti lampu LED dan ini menyala pada waktu malam untuk menerangi pokok-pokok ini.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>472.72,'end_time'=>479.86,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m sure this park at night is very beautiful and also right across this park is the Petronas Twin Towers which are beautiful','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya yakin taman ini pada waktu malam sangat cantik dan bertentangan dengan taman ini ialah Menara Berkembar Petronas yang indah','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>479.96,'end_time'=>480.5,'target_text'=>'at night.','source_text'=>'pada waktu malam.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>480.6,'end_time'=>487.42,'target_text'=>'The tower lights up at night and there are many different colors such as red, purple, green, blue, black, white.','source_text'=>'Menara itu menyala pada waktu malam dan terdapat pelbagai warna seperti merah, ungu, hijau, biru, hitam, putih.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>487.52,'end_time'=>489.9,'target_text'=>'>> And we can see it from our apartment, right?','source_text'=>'>> Dan kita boleh melihatnya dari apartmen kita, kan?','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>490,'end_time'=>491.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, we can see this tower from our apartment.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kita boleh nampak menara ini dari apartmen kita.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>491.92,'end_time'=>492.78,'target_text'=>'That\'s how big it is.','source_text'=>'Begitulah betapa besarnya menara itu.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>492.88,'end_time'=>495.1,'target_text'=>'Tell me guys, what is your favorite color?','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya kawan-kawan, apakah warna kegemaran anda?','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>495.2,'end_time'=>495.78,'target_text'=>'Let me know.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>495.88,'end_time'=>496.98,'target_text'=>'Want more practice?','source_text'=>'Mahu lebih banyak latihan?','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>497.08,'end_time'=>504.26,'target_text'=>'Get the workbook for this lesson on my website and review the vocabulary, grammar, and real English from this video.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku latihan untuk pelajaran ini di laman web saya dan ulangkaji kosa kata, tatabahasa, serta bahasa Inggeris sebenar daripada video ini.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>504.36,'end_time'=>512.62,'target_text'=>'So, some linking words you can use to sound more fluent when talking about your daily routine are then, after that, later,','source_text'=>'Jadi, beberapa kata hubung yang boleh anda gunakan untuk kedengaran lebih fasih semasa bercerita tentang rutin harian ialah \'then\', \'after that\', \'later\',','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>512.72,'end_time'=>514.14,'target_text'=>'and finally.','source_text'=>'dan \'finally\'.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>514.24,'end_time'=>517.9,'target_text'=>'So, if I had to talk about my daily routine, this is what I usually do.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jika saya perlu bercerita tentang rutin harian saya, inilah apa yang biasanya saya lakukan.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>518,'end_time'=>521.34,'target_text'=>'Every morning, I always have a shower in the morning.','source_text'=>'Setiap pagi, saya sentiasa mandi pada waktu pagi.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>521.44,'end_time'=>523.3,'target_text'=>'After that, I brush my teeth.','source_text'=>'Selepas itu (After that), saya menggosok gigi.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>523.4,'end_time'=>525.1,'target_text'=>'Then, I get dressed.','source_text'=>'Kemudian (Then), saya memakai pakaian.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>525.2,'end_time'=>534.18,'target_text'=>'Later, I go to work and finally, at the end of the day, I just kick back, relax, and watch some TV or just scroll through','source_text'=>'Kemudian nanti (Later), saya pergi bekerja dan akhirnya (finally), pada penghujung hari, saya berehat santai sambil menonton TV atau melihat','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>534.28,'end_time'=>534.98,'target_text'=>'my phone.','source_text'=>'telefon saya.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>535.08,'end_time'=>538.06,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s usually what I do in my day.','source_text'=>'Jadi, itulah apa yang biasanya saya lakukan seharian.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>538.16,'end_time'=>545.18,'target_text'=>'In the morning, I just get up, in the afternoon, I work, and in the evening, I relax, maybe do a little bit more work, and','source_text'=>'Pada waktu pagi saya bangun tidur, pada waktu tengah hari saya bekerja, dan pada waktu malam saya berehat, mungkin bekerja sedikit lagi, dan','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>545.28,'end_time'=>546.34,'target_text'=>'then I go to bed.','source_text'=>'kemudian saya masuk tidur.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>546.44,'end_time'=>548.38,'target_text'=>'And I have the same schedule every day.','source_text'=>'Dan jadual saya adalah sama setiap hari.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>548.48,'end_time'=>551.46,'target_text'=>'Every morning, I wake up at 8:00 a.m.','source_text'=>'Setiap pagi, saya bangun pada pukul 8:00 pagi.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>551.56,'end_time'=>555.26,'target_text'=>'and every night, I go to bed at midnight, at 12:00 a.m.','source_text'=>'dan setiap malam, saya tidur pada tengah malam, pukul 12:00 tengah malam.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>555.36,'end_time'=>560.46,'target_text'=>'This way, I sleep for 8 hours and then my body wakes up naturally without needing an alarm.','source_text'=>'Dengan cara ini, saya tidur selama 8 jam dan badan saya bangun secara semula jadi tanpa memerlukan jam loceng.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>560.56,'end_time'=>561.7,'target_text'=>'Now, it\'s your turn.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, giliran anda pula.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>561.8,'end_time'=>564.26,'target_text'=>'What do you usually do in the morning?','source_text'=>'Apa yang anda biasanya lakukan pada waktu pagi?','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>564.36,'end_time'=>570.22,'target_text'=>'>> In the morning, I do the same thing as you and I sometimes drink coffee in the mornings.','source_text'=>'>> Pada waktu pagi, saya buat perkara yang sama macam awak dan kadang-kadang saya minum kopi pada waktu pagi.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>570.32,'end_time'=>571.5,'target_text'=>'>> Why not every morning?','source_text'=>'>> Kenapa bukan setiap pagi?','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>571.6,'end_time'=>577.26,'target_text'=>'>> I only drink it when I feel tired or if I will need a lot of energy throughout the day.','source_text'=>'>> Saya hanya meminumnya bila berasa penat atau jika saya memerlukan banyak tenaga sepanjang hari.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>577.36,'end_time'=>583.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I honestly never drink coffee because I don\'t need it and I hate the taste of coffee.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sejujurnya saya langsung tidak pernah minum kopi kerana saya tidak memerlukannya dan saya tidak suka rasa kopi.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>583.32,'end_time'=>584.58,'target_text'=>'What do you do in the afternoon?','source_text'=>'Apa yang awak buat pada waktu tengah hari?','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>584.68,'end_time'=>587.82,'target_text'=>'>> In the afternoon, I always eat lunch.','source_text'=>'>> Pada waktu tengah hari, saya sentiasa makan tengah hari.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>587.92,'end_time'=>589.22,'target_text'=>'>> You never skip it?','source_text'=>'>> Awak tak pernah tinggal makan tengah hari?','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>589.32,'end_time'=>593.34,'target_text'=>'>> Usually never skip lunch or I\'ll have a later lunch.','source_text'=>'>> Biasanya hampir tak pernah tinggal makan tengah hari, atau saya makan lewat sedikit.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>593.44,'end_time'=>600.5,'target_text'=>'If anything, I\'ll skip breakfast and maybe dinner depending on how late I eat lunch.','source_text'=>'Kalau ada pun, saya akan tinggalkan sarapan dan mungkin makan malam bergantung pada betapa lewatnya saya makan tengah hari.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>600.6,'end_time'=>604.98,'target_text'=>'>> Are there some situations where you can\'t avoid it and you end up skipping lunch?','source_text'=>'>> Ada tak situasi tertentu di mana awak tak dapat elak dan akhirnya terpaksa tinggal makan tengah hari?','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>605.08,'end_time'=>612.86,'target_text'=>'>> There have been a few situations I\'m very busy or I\'m traveling or even I\'m flying and I don\'t eat anything during lunch','source_text'=>'>> Pernah ada beberapa situasi di mana saya terlalu sibuk atau mengembara atau sedang menaiki penerbangan dan tak makan apa-apa pada waktu','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>612.96,'end_time'=>614.46,'target_text'=>'time, then I would skip it.','source_text'=>'tengah hari, ketika itu saya akan tinggalkannya.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>614.56,'end_time'=>617.5,'target_text'=>'I usually I have a meal a day, at least one.','source_text'=>'Biasanya saya makan sekali sehari, sekurang-kurangnya sekali.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>617.6,'end_time'=>618.38,'target_text'=>'>> At least one.','source_text'=>'>> Sekurang-kurangnya sekali.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>618.48,'end_time'=>621.34,'target_text'=>'I mean, I think you need to have at least one meal a day.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, saya rasa memang perlu makan sekurang-kurangnya sekali sehari.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>621.44,'end_time'=>623.74,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I would say me and Leo have a similar routine.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya boleh katakan saya dan Leo mempunyai rutin yang hampir sama.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>623.84,'end_time'=>625.94,'target_text'=>'We both almost never eat breakfast.','source_text'=>'Kami berdua hampir tidak pernah bersarapan.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>626.04,'end_time'=>632.1,'target_text'=>'I never eat breakfast and we always have lunch, usually a late lunch like around 2:00 p.m.','source_text'=>'Saya langsung tidak bersarapan dan kami sentiasa makan tengah hari, biasanya makan tengah hari lewat sekitar pukul 2:00 petang.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>632.2,'end_time'=>635.5,'target_text'=>'and then we have dinner around 6:00 to 8:00 p.m.','source_text'=>'dan kemudian kami makan malam sekitar pukul 6:00 hingga 8:00 malam.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>635.6,'end_time'=>642.22,'target_text'=>'So, our lunch and dinner isn\'t too far apart and that way we don\'t eat as much, which is good because we\'re trying to lose','source_text'=>'Jadi jarak waktu makan tengah hari dan makan malam tidak terlalu jauh, dengan cara itu kami tidak makan terlalu banyak, bagus kerana kami cuba menurunkan','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>642.32,'end_time'=>642.74,'target_text'=>'weight.','source_text'=>'berat badan.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>642.84,'end_time'=>645.54,'target_text'=>'And finally, what do you do in the evening?','source_text'=>'Dan akhirnya, apa yang awak lakukan pada waktu malam?','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>645.64,'end_time'=>651.66,'target_text'=>'>> In the evening, I always take a little bit of time to relax, especially if I had a busy day.','source_text'=>'>> Pada waktu malam, saya sentiasa luangkan sedikit masa untuk berehat, terutamanya jika hari saya agak sibuk.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>651.76,'end_time'=>656.78,'target_text'=>'I always brush my teeth before I go to bed or just after my last meal.','source_text'=>'Saya sentiasa menggosok gigi sebelum masuk tidur atau sejurus selepas hidangan terakhir saya.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>656.88,'end_time'=>664.42,'target_text'=>'>> Do you ever call your mom in the evening or >> Yes, that\'s the best time to call my family because of the time change.','source_text'=>'>> Awak pernah telefon ibu awak pada waktu malam atau >> Ya, itu waktu terbaik untuk hubungi keluarga saya kerana perbezaan zon masa.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>664.52,'end_time'=>671.38,'target_text'=>'So, in the evenings, I sometimes call my family, my mom, my dad, at least once a week.','source_text'=>'Jadi, pada waktu malam, saya kadang-kadang menelefon keluarga, ibu dan bapa saya, sekurang-kurangnya sekali seminggu.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>671.48,'end_time'=>673.06,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so yeah, you sometimes do.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah, jadi ya, awak kadang-kadang buat begitu.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>673.16,'end_time'=>674.5,'target_text'=>'Me too, I sometimes do.','source_text'=>'Saya juga begitu, saya kadang-kadang buat.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>674.6,'end_time'=>679.3,'target_text'=>'Now, you guys answer, what do you do in the morning, in the afternoon and in the evening?','source_text'=>'Sekarang, giliran anda pula jawab, apakah yang anda lakukan pada waktu pagi, tengah hari, dan malam?','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>679.4,'end_time'=>687.02,'target_text'=>'Okay, you guys, now we\'re walking kind of off the beaten path, so the trail or the path is over there and you can see the','source_text'=>'Baiklah kawan-kawan, sekarang kami berjalan di luar laluan biasa, denai atau lorong pejalan kaki ada di sebelah sana dan anda boleh nampak','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>687.12,'end_time'=>695.42,'target_text'=>'path is very nice, but we are on top of this small little hill and there are a lot of roots sticking out, so you can trip','source_text'=>'lorongnya sangat elok, tetapi kami berada di atas bukit kecil ini dan terdapat banyak akar pokok yang tersembul, jadi anda boleh tersadung','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>695.52,'end_time'=>697.42,'target_text'=>'on these and sprain your ankle.','source_text'=>'pada akar ini dan menyebabkan buku lali anda terseliuh.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>697.52,'end_time'=>705.34,'target_text'=>'There are a lot of roots, but it\'s not really a big deal since I have the Burks, and these things are 4x4, waterproof, trail-proof,','source_text'=>'Banyak akar di sini, tetapi ia bukan masalah besar kerana saya memakai sandal Birkenstock, dan kasut ini tahan lasak 4x4, kalis air, kalis denai,','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>705.44,'end_time'=>707.42,'target_text'=>'rain-proof, wind-proof, sun-proof.','source_text'=>'kalis hujan, kalis angin, kalis matahari.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>707.52,'end_time'=>708.54,'target_text'=>'>> Are they step-proof?','source_text'=>'>> Adakah ia kalis pijak?','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>708.64,'end_time'=>710.44,'target_text'=>'>> Everything-proof.','source_text'=>'>> Kalis segala-galanya.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>710.56,'end_time'=>716.42,'target_text'=>'Okay, so on the right-hand side of this path, there is a great a great, and this is just for water.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, di sebelah kanan laluan ini, terdapat jeriji longkang (grate), dan ini adalah untuk laluan air.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>716.52,'end_time'=>718.62,'target_text'=>'This is actually very deep.','source_text'=>'Ia sebenarnya sangat dalam.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>718.72,'end_time'=>720.06,'target_text'=>'I did not think it was that deep.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak sangka ia begitu dalam.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>720.16,'end_time'=>721.62,'target_text'=>'So, you do not want to fall in there.','source_text'=>'Jadi, anda tentu tidak mahu terjatuh ke dalamnya.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>721.72,'end_time'=>727.7,'target_text'=>'But yeah, this great is just to keep you from falling in here, and it\'s on the right-hand side of this path.','source_text'=>'Tetapi ya, jeriji ini adalah untuk menghalang anda daripada terjatuh ke sini, dan ia berada di sebelah kanan laluan ini.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>727.8,'end_time'=>730.94,'target_text'=>'But if I\'m walking that way, it\'s on my left-hand side.','source_text'=>'Tetapi jika saya berjalan ke arah sana, ia berada di sebelah kiri saya.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>731.04,'end_time'=>734.66,'target_text'=>'Both ways you can say right-hand side, left-hand side.','source_text'=>'Kedua-dua cara anda boleh gunakan: \'right-hand side\' (sebelah kanan), \'left-hand side\' (sebelah kiri).','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>734.76,'end_time'=>742.1,'target_text'=>'And we just say left-hand side and right-hand side just to be more exact when we\'re saying what side it\'s on because right','source_text'=>'Dan kita sebut \'left-hand side\' dan \'right-hand side\' supaya lebih tepat apabila menyatakan di sebelah mana kedudukannya kerana \'right\'','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>742.2,'end_time'=>744.06,'target_text'=>'has more than one meaning in English.','source_text'=>'mempunyai lebih daripada satu maksud dalam bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>744.16,'end_time'=>749.82,'target_text'=>'Right could be like yes, you\'re right, but it could also be your right side or your right hand.','source_text'=>'\'Right\' boleh bermaksud betul (yes, you\'re right), tetapi ia juga boleh bermaksud sebelah kanan atau tangan kanan anda.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>749.92,'end_time'=>752.3,'target_text'=>'>> Or it could be like writing on a paper.','source_text'=>'>> Atau ia boleh berbunyi seperti menulis di atas kertas (write).','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>752.4,'end_time'=>755.9,'target_text'=>'>> Or it could be writing right right on your paper.','source_text'=>'>> Atau boleh jadi menulis perkataan \'right\' di atas kertas anda.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>756,'end_time'=>760.82,'target_text'=>'So, it is spelled differently, but uh it\'s pronounced the same.','source_text'=>'Ejaannya berbeza, tetapi sebutannya adalah sama.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>760.92,'end_time'=>761.94,'target_text'=>'Right.','source_text'=>'\'Right\'.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>762.04,'end_time'=>768.78,'target_text'=>'Now, I\'m going to ask you guys three questions, and I want you to answer and then check the comments for the correct answer.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, saya akan tanya anda tiga soalan, dan saya mahu anda jawab kemudian semak ruangan komen untuk jawapan yang betul.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>768.88,'end_time'=>773.92,'target_text'=>'Which one of these means 0% of the time?','source_text'=>'Yang manakah antara ini bermaksud 0% daripada keseluruhan masa?','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>774.48,'end_time'=>777.54,'target_text'=>'Answer and then check the comments for the correct answer.','source_text'=>'Jawab dan kemudian periksa ruangan komen untuk melihat jawapan yang betul.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>777.64,'end_time'=>782.96,'target_text'=>'Choose the best sentence out of all these sentences.','source_text'=>'Pilih ayat yang terbaik daripada kesemua ayat ini.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>790.6,'end_time'=>795.48,'target_text'=>'I\'ll be posting my shadowing stories second channel.','source_text'=>'Saya akan memuat naik cerita teknik shadowing di saluran kedua saya.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>798.52,'end_time'=>802.46,'target_text'=>'Has your daily routine changed at all since you started traveling?','source_text'=>'Adakah rutin harian awak berubah sama sekali sejak mula mengembara?','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>802.56,'end_time'=>803.42,'target_text'=>'>> I think so.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa ya.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>803.52,'end_time'=>807.34,'target_text'=>'I wake up earlier while I\'m traveling, which is surprising, I guess.','source_text'=>'Saya bangun lebih awal semasa mengembara, sesuatu yang mengejutkan juga.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>807.44,'end_time'=>808.34,'target_text'=>'>> What time do you wake up?','source_text'=>'>> Pukul berapa awak bangun?','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>808.44,'end_time'=>809.66,'target_text'=>'>> Usually around 5:00 a.m.','source_text'=>'>> Biasanya sekitar pukul 5:00 pagi.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>809.76,'end_time'=>810.34,'target_text'=>'I\'m up.','source_text'=>'Saya sudah bangun.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>810.44,'end_time'=>811.34,'target_text'=>'>> Around 5:00?','source_text'=>'>> Sekitar pukul 5:00?','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>811.44,'end_time'=>813.1,'target_text'=>'Bro, who are you lying to?','source_text'=>'Kawan, awak nak tipu siapa ni?','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>813.2,'end_time'=>816.3,'target_text'=>'>> No, it\'s usually 7:30 to 8:00 I wake up.','source_text'=>'>> Taklah, biasanya 7:30 hingga 8:00 pagi saya bangun.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>816.4,'end_time'=>819.94,'target_text'=>'And then we started going to the gym now at around 8:00.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang kami mula pergi ke gim sekitar pukul 8:00 pagi.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>820.04,'end_time'=>826.38,'target_text'=>'So, definitely going to the gym more often because it\'s so close compared to back home in Canada.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami pasti lebih kerap ke gim kerana lokasinya sangat dekat berbanding di kampung halaman di Kanada.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>826.48,'end_time'=>827.38,'target_text'=>'>> We had to drive to it.','source_text'=>'>> Di sana kita kena memandu ke gim.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>827.48,'end_time'=>831.86,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s in our building, so we can just literally go up the elevator and then we\'re at the gym.','source_text'=>'>> Di sini gim berada di bangunan kami, jadi kami hanya perlu menaiki lif dan terus sampai ke gim.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>831.96,'end_time'=>837.9,'target_text'=>'Whereas in Canada, we have to drive 20 minutes to get to the town where the gym is.','source_text'=>'Manakala di Kanada, kami terpaksa memandu selama 20 minit untuk sampai ke pekan di mana gim itu berada.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>838,'end_time'=>843.7,'target_text'=>'So, it is really nice and really convenient to be able to just walk to the gym or just take the elevator.','source_text'=>'Jadi sangat seronok dan mudah apabila boleh sekadar berjalan kaki ke gim atau naik lif sahaja.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>843.8,'end_time'=>845.54,'target_text'=>'It\'s honestly so convenient.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya ia sangat memudahkan.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>845.64,'end_time'=>847.7,'target_text'=>'I\'ll definitely miss that convenience.','source_text'=>'Saya pasti akan merindui kemudahan seperti ini.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>847.8,'end_time'=>849.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s worth it, in my opinion.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya ia sangat berbaloi.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>849.84,'end_time'=>850.58,'target_text'=>'>> 100%.','source_text'=>'>> 100% setuju.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>850.68,'end_time'=>853.38,'target_text'=>'>> Anything else that\'s changed in your daily routine?','source_text'=>'>> Ada perkara lain yang berubah dalam rutin harian awak?','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>853.48,'end_time'=>854.98,'target_text'=>'>> Uh >> Or your daily habits?','source_text'=>'>> Um >> Atau tabiat harian awak?','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>855.08,'end_time'=>856.26,'target_text'=>'>> My daily habits?','source_text'=>'>> Tabiat harian saya?','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>856.36,'end_time'=>858.42,'target_text'=>'>> Now you don\'t really cook as much, do you?','source_text'=>'>> Sekarang awak dah jarang memasak, kan?','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>858.52,'end_time'=>863.14,'target_text'=>'>> No, cooking is not really a thing anymore because uh well, we still can.','source_text'=>'>> Tidak, memasak bukan lagi satu kebiasaan kerana kami masih boleh melakukannya jika mahu.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>863.24,'end_time'=>868.18,'target_text'=>'There\'s the option to cook, but >> Eating out is a lot more affordable than it is in Canada.','source_text'=>'Memang ada pilihan untuk memasak, tapi >> Makan di luar jauh lebih berpatutan harganya berbanding di Kanada.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>868.28,'end_time'=>872.82,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s easier for us to just order some lunch in and order some dinner in.','source_text'=>'Jadi lebih mudah untuk kami pesan makanan tengah hari dan makan malam secara penghantaran.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>872.92,'end_time'=>878.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, and usually we\'re out and about filming something, so we always grab a bite to eat while we\'re filming and then usually','source_text'=>'>> Ya, dan biasanya kami berada di luar merakam video, jadi kami sentiasa singgah makan semasa merakam dan biasanya','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>878.92,'end_time'=>881.74,'target_text'=>'film the food to show you guys and uh also eat.','source_text'=>'merakam makanan tersebut untuk ditunjukkan kepada anda dan menikmatinya.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>881.84,'end_time'=>885.9,'target_text'=>'So, it just makes more sense to go out and buy food than to cook.','source_text'=>'Oleh itu, lebih munasabah untuk keluar membeli makanan daripada memasak sendiri.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>886,'end_time'=>887.7,'target_text'=>'But if we did want to cook, we could.','source_text'=>'Tetapi jika kami mahu memasak, kami masih boleh.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>887.8,'end_time'=>892.98,'target_text'=>'But then it\'s like we need to buy all the ingredients that we might not use after that, like oil.','source_text'=>'Tetapi masalahnya kami perlu membeli semua bahan yang mungkin tidak digunakan lagi selepas itu, seperti minyak masak.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>893.08,'end_time'=>893.36,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>893.36,'end_time'=>895.46,'target_text'=>'>> You need to buy oil, salt, pepper, all your spices.','source_text'=>'>> Perlu beli minyak, garam, lada hitam, semua rempah-ratus.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>895.56,'end_time'=>900.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s like once you think of it, like you need to buy a whole bunch of stuff and then you\'re only going to stay there for like','source_text'=>'Bila difikirkan semula, kita kena beli banyak barang sedangkan kita hanya tinggal di situ untuk sekitar','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>900.16,'end_time'=>901.14,'target_text'=>'a month max.','source_text'=>'sebulan paling lama.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>901.24,'end_time'=>906.1,'target_text'=>'And some of the places we\'ve stayed don\'t even have kitchens, so can\'t really cook there.','source_text'=>'Dan beberapa tempat penginapan kami sebelum ini langsung tiada dapur, jadi memang tak boleh memasak di situ.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>906.2,'end_time'=>906.86,'target_text'=>'>> No, exactly.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tepat sekali.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>906.96,'end_time'=>911.02,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s not really worth it at the end of the day to buy all that extra stuff.','source_text'=>'Jadi pada akhirnya memang tidak berbaloi untuk membeli semua barang tambahan itu.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>911.12,'end_time'=>911.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>911.72,'end_time'=>916.5,'target_text'=>'>> Although like small things like pre-made meals or something, they\'re also >> That\'s not cooking, though.','source_text'=>'>> Walaupun makanan sedia untuk dimakan atau seumpamanya juga >> Tapi itu bukan memasak.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>916.6,'end_time'=>917.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, but they\'re also pretty affordable.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tetapi harganya juga agak berpatutan.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>917.96,'end_time'=>921.02,'target_text'=>'Yeah, so cooking is basically not a thing we do anymore.','source_text'=>'Jadi memasak pada dasarnya bukan lagi perkara yang kami lakukan.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>921.12,'end_time'=>925.3,'target_text'=>'Although in Canada, we did still cook we did cook almost every day.','source_text'=>'Walaupun semasa di Kanada dahulu, kami memang memasak hampir setiap hari.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>925.4,'end_time'=>929.26,'target_text'=>'We didn\'t eat out that much so I guess it balances out now.','source_text'=>'Kami tidak kerap makan di luar ketika itu, jadi saya rasa sekarang keadaannya seimbang.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>929.36,'end_time'=>930.62,'target_text'=>'>> Well, I guess you cooked, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa awak yang memasak, ya.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>930.72,'end_time'=>933.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, well, I\'m when I say we I mean like my family.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, bila saya kata kami, maksud saya keluarga saya.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>933.76,'end_time'=>938.98,'target_text'=>'Shout out to my mom, she\'s the best cook I know and cooks uh every meal except for breakfast.','source_text'=>'Pujian untuk ibu saya, dia tukang masak terbaik yang saya kenal dan memasak setiap hidangan kecuali sarapan pagi.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>939.08,'end_time'=>942.42,'target_text'=>'We don\'t really eat breakfast but lunch and dinner, W.','source_text'=>'Kami jarang bersarapan, tetapi makan tengah hari dan malamnya memang hebat.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>942.52,'end_time'=>947.82,'target_text'=>'>> One thing that has changed in my daily routine is uh seeing my dogs.','source_text'=>'>> Satu perkara yang berubah dalam rutin harian saya ialah melihat anjing-anjing peliharaan saya.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>947.92,'end_time'=>953.86,'target_text'=>'Usually I always saw my dogs throughout the whole day, but now obviously I don\'t see them because they\'re in Canada and I\'m','source_text'=>'Biasanya saya sentiasa melihat anjing saya sepanjang hari, tetapi sekarang sudah tentu tidak kerana mereka berada di Kanada dan saya','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>953.96,'end_time'=>960.5,'target_text'=>'not so I don\'t see my dogs at all anymore, but uh besides that my routine is pretty similar.','source_text'=>'pula berada di sini, jadi saya langsung tidak berjumpa dengan mereka lagi, namun selain itu rutin saya hampir sama.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>960.6,'end_time'=>967.82,'target_text'=>'I usually get up in the morning at 8:00 a.m., go to the gym, and then I work for the whole day, and then in the evening I','source_text'=>'Saya biasanya bangun pada pukul 8:00 pagi, pergi ke gim, kemudian saya bekerja sepanjang hari, dan pada waktu malam saya','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>967.92,'end_time'=>969.78,'target_text'=>'relax and then I do it again.','source_text'=>'berehat dan kemudian mengulanginya lagi keesokan harinya.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>969.88,'end_time'=>971.42,'target_text'=>'And uh yeah.','source_text'=>'Dan ya begitulah.','order'=>289],
