            ['start_time'=>170.88,'end_time'=>178.42,'target_text'=>'You can see the vines coming from this tree are almost touching the surface of the water.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak akar-akar jalar daripada pokok ini hampir menyentuh permukaan air.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>178.52,'end_time'=>182.14,'target_text'=>'This tree has a lot of vines.','source_text'=>'Pokok ini mempunyai banyak akar jalar.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>182.24,'end_time'=>183.58,'target_text'=>'Leon\'s dead.','source_text'=>'Leon dah tak larat (mati penat).','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>183.68,'end_time'=>185.34,'target_text'=>'We just have a little bit more to go.','source_text'=>'Tinggal sedikit sahaja lagi perjalanan kita.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>185.44,'end_time'=>187.76,'target_text'=>'Our mom is right there.','source_text'=>'Ibu kami ada di sebelah sana.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>188.76,'end_time'=>190.14,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m on top.','source_text'=>'>> Saya dah sampai atas.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>190.24,'end_time'=>191.18,'target_text'=>'>> She\'s just right there.','source_text'=>'>> Dia ada di atas sana sahaja.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>191.28,'end_time'=>191.68,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I know.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya tahu.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>191.72,'end_time'=>193.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s not that far.','source_text'=>'Tak adalah jauh sangat.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>193.4,'end_time'=>194.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s just hot and humid.','source_text'=>'Cuma cuacanya panas dan lembap.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>194.76,'end_time'=>196.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s just humid.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, udaranya memang sangat lembap.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>196.36,'end_time'=>197.5,'target_text'=>'>> Do you want some water?','source_text'=>'>> Awak nak air?','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>197.6,'end_time'=>198.06,'target_text'=>'>> Give it to Leon.','source_text'=>'>> Berikan kepada Leon.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>198.16,'end_time'=>199.5,'target_text'=>'He\'s dying.','source_text'=>'Dia dah nyawa-nyawa ikan tu.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>199.6,'end_time'=>200.9,'target_text'=>'But we\'re almost at the top here.','source_text'=>'Tapi kita sudah hampir sampai ke puncak.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>201,'end_time'=>203.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s just just up there.','source_text'=>'Cuma tinggal sedikit di atas sana.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>203.36,'end_time'=>206.5,'target_text'=>'Now it\'s getting really busy cuz I guess it\'s almost sunset.','source_text'=>'Sekarang keadaan semakin sesak sebab rasanya dah hampir waktu matahari terbenam.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>206.6,'end_time'=>211.46,'target_text'=>'Refuel, recharge, and then we\'ll make it the rest of the way.','source_text'=>'Minum air, kumpul tenaga semula, dan kemudian kita habiskan baki pendakian.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>211.56,'end_time'=>212.58,'target_text'=>'How are you feeling, Mom?','source_text'=>'Macam mana perasaan mak?','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>212.68,'end_time'=>215.18,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m feeling better than our cameraman that we lost.','source_text'=>'>> Mak rasa lebih cergas berbanding jurukamera kita yang tertinggal di belakang.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>215.28,'end_time'=>217.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, we lost him.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kita tertinggal dia di belakang.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>217.28,'end_time'=>220.14,'target_text'=>'Unfortunately, Leon was not able to make it this high.','source_text'=>'Malangnya, Leon tidak mampu mendaki setinggi ini.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>220.24,'end_time'=>224.5,'target_text'=>'I think he\'s coming up maybe after, but he\'s having crapping issues.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa dia mungkin naik selepas ini, tetapi dia mengalami kekejangan otot (cramping).','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>224.6,'end_time'=>226.38,'target_text'=>'So, we are just up here.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kami kini berada di atas sini.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>226.48,'end_time'=>228.54,'target_text'=>'You can see how beautiful this view is.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh lihat betapa indahnya pemandangan ini.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>228.64,'end_time'=>229.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s stunning.','source_text'=>'Ia sungguh menakjubkan.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>229.76,'end_time'=>231.7,'target_text'=>'This honestly looks like Avatar.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya suasana ini kelihatan seperti dalam filem Avatar.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>231.8,'end_time'=>232.66,'target_text'=>'This is a nice view.','source_text'=>'Ini pemandangan yang sangat cantik.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>232.76,'end_time'=>233.26,'target_text'=>'>> Very good.','source_text'=>'>> Sangat bagus.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>233.36,'end_time'=>235.54,'target_text'=>'>> It really does remind me of Avatar.','source_text'=>'>> Ia betul-betul mengingatkan saya kepada filem Avatar.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>235.64,'end_time'=>237.26,'target_text'=>'Like the mountains, doesn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Seperti pergunungannya, kan?','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>237.36,'end_time'=>238.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, absolutely.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tepat sekali.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>238.6,'end_time'=>240.66,'target_text'=>'>> And you can see people on boats there.','source_text'=>'>> Dan anda boleh nampak orang di atas bot di sana.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>240.76,'end_time'=>242.02,'target_text'=>'You know, they go underneath the mountain there.','source_text'=>'Awak tahu, mereka melalui bahagian bawah pergunungan di situ.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>242.12,'end_time'=>243.34,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, no.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ya ke.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>243.44,'end_time'=>244.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s pretty cool.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ia memang sangat menarik.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>244.96,'end_time'=>245.66,'target_text'=>'>> So, where\'s the town?','source_text'=>'>> Jadi, di mana pekannya?','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>245.76,'end_time'=>246.22,'target_text'=>'That way?','source_text'=>'Arah sana ke?','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>246.32,'end_time'=>248.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, the town is downstream.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, pekannya berada di sebelah hilir sungai.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>248.44,'end_time'=>250.58,'target_text'=>'At the top here, it was a little difficult to get up here.','source_text'=>'Di bahagian puncak ini, agak sukar sedikit untuk naik ke sini.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>250.68,'end_time'=>253.9,'target_text'=>'I had to go through there, but uh yeah, now I\'m up here.','source_text'=>'Saya terpaksa melalui celah batu di situ, tetapi ya, sekarang saya sudah sampai di atas.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>254,'end_time'=>256.02,'target_text'=>'And the view here is really nice.','source_text'=>'Dan pemandangan di sini amat menakjubkan.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>256.12,'end_time'=>259.18,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re walking down now, but the rocks are very slippery.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami sedang menuruni tangga sekarang, tetapi batu-batunya sangat licin.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>259.28,'end_time'=>260.86,'target_text'=>'You can see they\'re like polished.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak permukaannya seperti telah digilap.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>260.96,'end_time'=>267.7,'target_text'=>'So, we have to step on the cement only, cuz so many people step on the rocks that they just are so smooth now.','source_text'=>'Oleh itu kita hanya boleh memijak bahagian simen, kerana terlalu ramai orang memijak batu itu sehingga ia menjadi sangat licin sekarang.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>267.8,'end_time'=>271.42,'target_text'=>'So, we kind of have to walk like sideways and just on the cement part.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami terpaksa berjalan mengiring sedikit dan hanya memijak bahagian bersimen.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>271.52,'end_time'=>274.94,'target_text'=>'And Leon didn\'t make it up, so we\'ll see if we find him on the way down.','source_text'=>'Dan Leon tidak sempat sampai ke atas, jadi kita tengok sama ada kita akan jumpa dia dalam perjalanan turun.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>275.04,'end_time'=>277.42,'target_text'=>'So, Leon is now flying his drone.','source_text'=>'Leon kini sedang menerbangkan dronnya.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>277.52,'end_time'=>278.62,'target_text'=>'You can see.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh lihat.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>278.72,'end_time'=>280.02,'target_text'=>'He\'s flying his drone.','source_text'=>'Dia sedang menerbangkan dron.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>280.12,'end_time'=>282.42,'target_text'=>'So, why are you sweating so much, dude?','source_text'=>'Kenapa awak berpeluh teruk sangat ni, kawan?','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>282.52,'end_time'=>283.74,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, look at I just kept sweating.','source_text'=>'>> Kawan, tengoklah peluh saya tak berhenti-henti keluar.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>283.84,'end_time'=>284.46,'target_text'=>'I just couldn\'t stop.','source_text'=>'Saya langsung tak dapat hentikannya.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>284.56,'end_time'=>285.54,'target_text'=>'I thought I was going to lose consciousness.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa macam nak pengsan tadi.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>285.64,'end_time'=>286.42,'target_text'=>'>> Once you got to the top?','source_text'=>'>> Bila awak sampai ke bahagian atas?','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>286.52,'end_time'=>287.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I was just so thirsty.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya berasa teramat dahaga.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>287.84,'end_time'=>290.9,'target_text'=>'And then somebody dropped their water on the ground, and I was like, man, I got to drink this water.','source_text'=>'Dan kemudian ada seseorang terjatuhkan botol air mereka di atas tanah, dan saya rasa macam nak minum saja air tu.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>291,'end_time'=>291.62,'target_text'=>'>> So, you drank it?','source_text'=>'>> Jadi, awak minum ke?','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>291.72,'end_time'=>292.22,'target_text'=>'>> No, I didn\'t.','source_text'=>'>> Tak, saya tak minum.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>292.32,'end_time'=>294.5,'target_text'=>'I sat there for a good 25 minutes just breathing.','source_text'=>'Saya duduk di situ selama 25 minit hanya untuk bernafas dan pulihkan tenaga.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>294.6,'end_time'=>295.7,'target_text'=>'>> Oh my goodness.','source_text'=>'>> Ya ampun.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>295.8,'end_time'=>297.7,'target_text'=>'>> Bro, we went to the top, and I went to the very top.','source_text'=>'>> Kawan, kami panjat sampai ke atas, dan saya naik ke puncak yang paling tinggi.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>297.8,'end_time'=>299.34,'target_text'=>'I was on the everything.','source_text'=>'Saya naik ke tempat paling atas sekali.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>299.44,'end_time'=>302.18,'target_text'=>'>> looked >> No, on the dragon head, like the dragon part.','source_text'=>'>> pandangan >> Bukan, di atas kepala naga, bahagian ukiran naga itu.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>302.28,'end_time'=>303.5,'target_text'=>'>> from there is a way nicer.','source_text'=>'>> pemandangan dari situ jauh lebih cantik.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>303.6,'end_time'=>306.5,'target_text'=>'>> No, cuz there you can see it the full like panoramic 360.','source_text'=>'>> Dari situ anda boleh nampak pemandangan panorama 360 darjah sepenuhnya.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>306.6,'end_time'=>308.02,'target_text'=>'So, I got some footage of that.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya sempat merakam beberapa video di situ.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>308.12,'end_time'=>310.98,'target_text'=>'But you have the drone, so I haven\'t even drank any water yet.','source_text'=>'Tetapi awak ada dron, dan saya sendiri pun belum minum setitik air lagi.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>311.08,'end_time'=>312.38,'target_text'=>'I\'m just built different, okay?','source_text'=>'Ketahanan saya memang berbeza, faham?','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>312.48,'end_time'=>312.98,'target_text'=>'Let\'s bounce.','source_text'=>'Jom kita beredar.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>313.08,'end_time'=>317.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s going to get dark soon, so >> Yeah, let\'s go through the paddy field there.','source_text'=>'Hari akan gelap sebentar lagi, jadi >> Ya, mari kita lalu kawasan sawah padi di sebelah sana.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>317.84,'end_time'=>321.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so Leon is landing the drone now.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, jadi Leon sedang mendaratkan dronnya sekarang.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>321.92,'end_time'=>324.44,'target_text'=>'He\'s landing the drone.','source_text'=>'Dia sedang mendaratkan dron.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>326.16,'end_time'=>328.46,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys, now we\'re going to have a shadowing practice.','source_text'=>'Baiklah kawan-kawan, sekarang kita akan buat latihan teknik shadowing.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>328.56,'end_time'=>333.6,'target_text'=>'So, read along and really focus on your accent and pronunciation.','source_text'=>'Jadi, baca bersama-sama dan beri tumpuan sepenuhnya pada aksen dan sebutan anda.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>333.92,'end_time'=>340.1,'target_text'=>'This is a huge rocky mountain with steep cliffs, narrow paths, and dramatic views.','source_text'=>'Ini sebuah gunung berbatu yang besar dengan tebing yang curam, laluan yang sempit, dan pemandangan yang dramatik.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>340.2,'end_time'=>346.18,'target_text'=>'Dark gray rocks cover most of the mountain, and small green plants are growing between the cracks.','source_text'=>'Batuan kelabu gelap meliputi sebahagian besar gunung ini, dan tumbuhan hijau kecil tumbuh di celah-celah rekahan.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>346.28,'end_time'=>352.42,'target_text'=>'Many people are climbing up and down the stone stairs while carefully walking along the edge of the mountain.','source_text'=>'Ramai orang mendaki naik dan turun anak tangga batu sambil berhati-hati berjalan di sepanjang pinggir gunung.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>352.52,'end_time'=>357.38,'target_text'=>'Near the top, there is a tall pagoda standing on the highest point of the rocks.','source_text'=>'Berhampiran puncaknya, terdapat sebuah pagoda tinggi yang berdiri di titik tertinggi batuan.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>357.48,'end_time'=>363.14,'target_text'=>'The pagoda looks small from far away, but it stands out clearly against the bright sky.','source_text'=>'Pagoda itu kelihatan kecil dari kejauhan, tetapi ia terserlah jelas dilatari langit yang cerah.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>363.24,'end_time'=>367.78,'target_text'=>'Long lines of visitors are slowly moving toward the summit to enjoy the view.','source_text'=>'Barisan panjang para pelawat bergerak perlahan-lahan menuju ke puncak untuk menikmati pemandangan.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>367.88,'end_time'=>374.1,'target_text'=>'In the foreground, there is a tiny building with a red roof built directly into the rocky landscape.','source_text'=>'Di bahagian latar depan, terdapat sebuah binaan kecil berbumbung merah yang dibina terus ke landskap berbatu.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>374.2,'end_time'=>378.1,'target_text'=>'The rocks look rough, sharp, uneven, and natural.','source_text'=>'Batu-batu itu kelihatan kasar, tajam, tidak sekata, dan semula jadi.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>378.2,'end_time'=>384.94,'target_text'=>'In the distance, you can see green fields, small buildings, and flat land spreading across the horizon.','source_text'=>'Di kejauhan, anda boleh melihat padang hijau, bangunan-bangunan kecil, dan tanah rata terbentang merentasi ufuk.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>385.04,'end_time'=>389.9,'target_text'=>'The sky is wide and cloudy with soft light covering the entire scene.','source_text'=>'Langit terbentang luas dan berawan dengan cahaya lembut menyinari seluruh pemandangan.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>390,'end_time'=>398.22,'target_text'=>'The atmosphere feels adventurous, exciting, and slightly intense because of the height and narrow paths.','source_text'=>'Suasananya terasa mencabar, mengujakan, dan agak mendebarkan disebabkan ketinggian serta laluannya yang sempit.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>398.32,'end_time'=>399.38,'target_text'=>'Want more practice?','source_text'=>'Mahu lebih banyak latihan?','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>399.48,'end_time'=>406.58,'target_text'=>'Get the workbook for this lesson on my website and review the vocabulary, grammar, and real English from this video.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku latihan untuk pelajaran ini di laman web saya dan ulangkaji kosa kata, tatabahasa, serta bahasa Inggeris sebenar daripada video ini.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>406.68,'end_time'=>408.62,'target_text'=>'>> We\'ve come a long way and now we\'re at the bottom.','source_text'=>'>> Perjalanan kita sangat jauh dan kini kita sudah tiba di bahagian bawah.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>408.72,'end_time'=>411.3,'target_text'=>'Let\'s walk through this uh field a little bit.','source_text'=>'Mari kita berjalan melalui kawasan ini sebentar.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>411.4,'end_time'=>412.26,'target_text'=>'>> Lotus.','source_text'=>'>> Teratai.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>412.36,'end_time'=>413.82,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, these are lotus?','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ini bunga teratai ke?','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>413.92,'end_time'=>415.54,'target_text'=>'>> I believe this is a lotus field.','source_text'=>'>> Saya percaya ini ialah kawasan tanaman teratai.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>415.64,'end_time'=>416.78,'target_text'=>'Those ones there.','source_text'=>'Yang di sebelah sana itu.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>416.88,'end_time'=>418.74,'target_text'=>'>> Wait, do lotus grow in water like this?','source_text'=>'>> Kejap, adakah teratai tumbuh di dalam air seperti ini?','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>418.84,'end_time'=>419.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>419.72,'end_time'=>427.38,'target_text'=>'And I believe that they are not in bloom at the moment, as you can see, but that pink one over there is Yeah, is a lotus.','source_text'=>'Dan saya percaya bunga-bunga ini belum mekar buat masa sekarang seperti yang anda lihat, tetapi yang berwarna merah jambu di sana itu ya, adalah bunga teratai.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>427.48,'end_time'=>429.66,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, and they cook with that, right?','source_text'=>'>> Oh, dan mereka gunakan teratai dalam masakan, kan?','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>429.76,'end_time'=>430.04,'target_text'=>'>> Huh?','source_text'=>'>> Apa dia?','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>430.04,'end_time'=>432.26,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if they cook with it, but I know they use the seed.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pasti sama ada mereka memasak dengannya, tetapi saya tahu mereka menggunakan bijinya.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>432.36,'end_time'=>434.06,'target_text'=>'I have eaten some of the seeds.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah makan biji teratai.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>434.16,'end_time'=>435.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually really yummy.','source_text'=>'Rasanya memang sedap.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>435.6,'end_time'=>439.74,'target_text'=>'>> There are a lot of photo spots throughout this uh field.','source_text'=>'>> Terdapat banyak sudut bergambar di seluruh kawasan ini.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>439.84,'end_time'=>443.02,'target_text'=>'And here you can see this path is extremely narrow.','source_text'=>'Dan di sini anda boleh nampak laluan ini tersangatlah sempit.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>443.12,'end_time'=>444.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s very narrow.','source_text'=>'Ia sangat sempit.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>444.12,'end_time'=>444.98,'target_text'=>'Don\'t fall in.','source_text'=>'Jangan terjatuh ke dalam.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>445.08,'end_time'=>448.7,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, I\'m a little bit off balance because >> [laughter] >> I\'m tired.','source_text'=>'>> Alamak, saya hilang keseimbangan badan sedikit sebab >> [ketawa] >> Saya penat.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>448.8,'end_time'=>449.38,'target_text'=>'>> Your legs hurt?','source_text'=>'>> Kaki awak sakit ke?','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>449.48,'end_time'=>451.7,'target_text'=>'Dude, my legs are aching.','source_text'=>'Kawan, kaki saya rasa sangat sengal dan lenguh.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>451.8,'end_time'=>453.38,'target_text'=>'My legs are aching right now.','source_text'=>'Kaki saya terasa lenguh sekarang.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>453.48,'end_time'=>455.82,'target_text'=>'You can see up there some people are taking photos.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak di atas sana ada orang sedang bergambar.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>455.92,'end_time'=>459.26,'target_text'=>'Or maybe we should go this way cuz I think those people want to come up.','source_text'=>'Atau mungkin kita patut ikut jalan ini kerana saya rasa orang-orang itu mahu naik ke atas.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>459.36,'end_time'=>462.46,'target_text'=>'So, that is what the lotus flowers look like when they bloom.','source_text'=>'Jadi, begitulah rupanya bunga teratai apabila ia mekar.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>462.56,'end_time'=>463.26,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>463.36,'end_time'=>466.62,'target_text'=>'>> So, that\'s what this whole field would look like if it bloomed.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi begitulah pemandangan seluruh kawasan ini jika semua teratainya mekar.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>466.72,'end_time'=>468.38,'target_text'=>'Unfortunately, it\'s not in bloom.','source_text'=>'Malangnya, sekarang ia belum mekar sepenuhnya.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>468.48,'end_time'=>470.58,'target_text'=>'Although, there are a few flowers.','source_text'=>'Walaupun begitu, ada beberapa kuntum bunga yang kelihatan.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>470.68,'end_time'=>479.98,'target_text'=>'Here, there is a sign that says, \"Do not pick the flowers.\" I think this would be very beautiful in full bloom when all the','source_text'=>'Di sini ada papan tanda tertulis, \'Jangan petik bunga\'. Saya rasa pemandangannya amat memukau apabila semua','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>480.08,'end_time'=>482.14,'target_text'=>'flowers are in full bloom.','source_text'=>'bunganya mekar sepenuhnya.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>482.24,'end_time'=>485.02,'target_text'=>'Unfortunately, that is not right now.','source_text'=>'Malangnya, bukan pada waktu sekarang.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>485.12,'end_time'=>489.82,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure if you can hear that creaking, but that bench is creaking a lot.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pasti jika anda boleh mendengar bunyi berkeriut itu, tetapi bangku itu berkeriut kuat.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>489.92,'end_time'=>490.9,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s swing.','source_text'=>'>> Itu buaian.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>491,'end_time'=>493.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, this swing, this bench swing.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, buaian ini, bangku buaian ini.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>493.92,'end_time'=>494.9,'target_text'=>'This is quite nice.','source_text'=>'Ini agak menarik.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>495,'end_time'=>495.74,'target_text'=>'I\'m pretty tired though.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya agak penat.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>495.84,'end_time'=>497.9,'target_text'=>'I think we should go back.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kita patut pulang.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>498,'end_time'=>500.1,'target_text'=>'Definitely have a shower after our long day.','source_text'=>'Pastinya kita perlu mandi selepas hari yang panjang ini.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>500.2,'end_time'=>502.9,'target_text'=>'>> Goodness, and then go and find some food.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul, dan kemudian pergi cari makanan.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>503,'end_time'=>504.7,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, we definitely need to have a shower.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kita memang perlu mandi.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>504.8,'end_time'=>507.66,'target_text'=>'Like, we\'ve been sweating all day and we are just tired.','source_text'=>'Kita berpeluh sepanjang hari dan kita berasa sangat penat.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>507.76,'end_time'=>510.38,'target_text'=>'Especially that last hike or this last hike we did, man.','source_text'=>'Terutamanya pendakian terakhir yang baru sahaja kita lakukan tadi.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>510.48,'end_time'=>512.22,'target_text'=>'Holy >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Fuh >> Ya.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>512.32,'end_time'=>513.18,'target_text'=>'>> Tired, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Penat sungguh, kawan.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>513.28,'end_time'=>517.38,'target_text'=>'>> High five to me for for being your your partner in crime today.','source_text'=>'>> Tepuk tangan untuk saya kerana menjadi teman setia awak hari ini.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>517.48,'end_time'=>518.22,'target_text'=>'>> could not do it, dude.','source_text'=>'>> tak mampu buat tadi, kawan.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>518.32,'end_time'=>520.1,'target_text'=>'He I didn\'t know he was that out of shape.','source_text'=>'Saya tak sangka stamina dia seteruk itu.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>520.2,'end_time'=>521.98,'target_text'=>'He needs to get in the gym again.','source_text'=>'Dia kena mula pergi ke gim semula.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>522.08,'end_time'=>522.98,'target_text'=>'For real.','source_text'=>'Serius betul.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>523.08,'end_time'=>524.42,'target_text'=>'>> That was like leg day.','source_text'=>'>> Pendakian tadi macam latihan senaman kaki (leg day).','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>524.52,'end_time'=>525.42,'target_text'=>'>> It wasn\'t even that high.','source_text'=>'>> Bukannya tinggi sangat pun.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>525.52,'end_time'=>526.34,'target_text'=>'500 steps.','source_text'=>'Cuma 500 anak tangga.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>526.44,'end_time'=>526.94,'target_text'=>'>> No, it\'s not.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, memang tak tinggi.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>527.04,'end_time'=>528.14,'target_text'=>'But, it\'s the humidity.','source_text'=>'Tetapi tahap kelembapannya yang tinggi.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>528.24,'end_time'=>529.54,'target_text'=>'It just gets to you.','source_text'=>'Ia cepat menghabiskan tenaga anda.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>529.64,'end_time'=>531.58,'target_text'=>'>> These lanterns do look very nice.','source_text'=>'>> Tanglung-tanglung ini nampak sangat cantik.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>531.68,'end_time'=>534.38,'target_text'=>'Like, once it gets darker, it\'ll look even better.','source_text'=>'Bila hari semakin gelap nanti, ia pasti nampak jauh lebih cantik.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>534.48,'end_time'=>536.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it looks really pretty.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ia kelihatan sangat indah.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>536.12,'end_time'=>541.5,'target_text'=>'They seem to hang them all around the lakes and and areas where tourists seems to gather.','source_text'=>'Mereka menggantungnya di sekeliling tasik dan di kawasan tumpuan para pelancong.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>541.6,'end_time'=>543.18,'target_text'=>'But, looks very nice.','source_text'=>'Tetapi memang nampak sangat cantik.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>543.28,'end_time'=>543.68,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, no.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>543.72,'end_time'=>546.48,'target_text'=>'It is really nice.','source_text'=>'Ia memang sangat cantik.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>546.84,'end_time'=>547.24,'target_text'=>'Okay, Mom.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, Mak.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>547.28,'end_time'=>548.66,'target_text'=>'What do you have in your hand there?','source_text'=>'Apa yang mak pegang dalam tangan tu?','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>548.76,'end_time'=>551.34,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, I have my backpack and my life jacket.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, mak ada beg galas dan jaket keselamatan.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>551.44,'end_time'=>557.26,'target_text'=>'And now, I am going to put on my hat because it is super sunny.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang mak nak pakai topi sebab cuaca sangat panas terik.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>557.36,'end_time'=>558.1,'target_text'=>'>> Facts.','source_text'=>'>> Betul sangat.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>558.2,'end_time'=>560.18,'target_text'=>'So, Leon\'s also grabbing a life jacket.','source_text'=>'Leon pun sedang mengambil jaket keselamatan.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>560.28,'end_time'=>561.18,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>561.28,'end_time'=>562.38,'target_text'=>'Oh, these are clean.','source_text'=>'Oh, yang ini bersih.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>562.48,'end_time'=>564.46,'target_text'=>'So, Leon just handed me my life jacket.','source_text'=>'Leon baru sahaja hulurkan jaket keselamatan saya.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>564.56,'end_time'=>567.02,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m about to put this life jacket on.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya mahu memakai jaket keselamatan ini.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>567.12,'end_time'=>568.18,'target_text'=>'I need both hands.','source_text'=>'Saya perlukan kedua-dua belah tangan.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>568.28,'end_time'=>569.46,'target_text'=>'Leon\'s putting his on.','source_text'=>'Leon sedang memakai jaketnya.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>569.56,'end_time'=>572.22,'target_text'=>'Leon has a blue and green life jacket.','source_text'=>'Leon memakai jaket keselamatan berwarna biru dan hijau.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>572.32,'end_time'=>575.4,'target_text'=>'>> Because he\'s the camera guy.','source_text'=>'>> Sebab dia jurukamera.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>577.92,'end_time'=>580.1,'target_text'=>'This camera wasn\'t in there.','source_text'=>'Kamera ini tiada di dalam beg.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>580.2,'end_time'=>582.98,'target_text'=>'>> He just dropped the bag with all the important stuff.','source_text'=>'>> Dia baru sahaja menjatuhkan beg yang mengandungi semua barang penting.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>583.08,'end_time'=>584.22,'target_text'=>'>> You think that battery thing has a case?','source_text'=>'>> Awak rasa bateri tu ada bekas pelindung tak?','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>584.32,'end_time'=>586.66,'target_text'=>'>> Bro, that buckle is not going to hold, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Kawan, klip tali itu takkan muat menahan badan awak tu.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>586.76,'end_time'=>587.66,'target_text'=>'>> Why is it so tight?','source_text'=>'>> Kenapa ketat sangat ni?','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>587.76,'end_time'=>588.78,'target_text'=>'>> Why is it so tight, dude?','source_text'=>'>> Kenapa ketat sangat, kawan?','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>588.88,'end_time'=>589.5,'target_text'=>'>> I loosen it?','source_text'=>'>> Nak longgarkannya ke?','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>589.6,'end_time'=>590.42,'target_text'=>'How do I loosen it?','source_text'=>'Macam mana saya nak longgarkan benda ni?','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>590.52,'end_time'=>591.18,'target_text'=>'>> Do this normally.','source_text'=>'>> Buat macam biasa.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>591.28,'end_time'=>592.34,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, these don\'t loosen.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, yang ini tak boleh dilonggarkan.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>592.44,'end_time'=>593.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s like side sideways.','source_text'=>'Ia dari arah tepi.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>593.92,'end_time'=>595.42,'target_text'=>'>> The sides here at the back.','source_text'=>'>> Bahagian tepi di bahagian belakang ini.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>595.52,'end_time'=>598.06,'target_text'=>'>> Bro, why don\'t you just get a bigger life jacket, bro?','source_text'=>'>> Kawan, kenapa awak tak ambil jaket keselamatan yang lebih besar saja?','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>598.16,'end_time'=>599.94,'target_text'=>'Bro is like the Michelin Man.','source_text'=>'Rupa dia dah macam maskot Michelin Man.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>600.04,'end_time'=>602.42,'target_text'=>'>> it You got it on the camera though, huh?','source_text'=>'>> Awak sempat rakam dengan kamera kan?','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>602.52,'end_time'=>602.98,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>603.08,'end_time'=>604.86,'target_text'=>'Now I\'m going to put my life jacket on.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya akan memakai jaket keselamatan saya.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>604.96,'end_time'=>606.7,'target_text'=>'Let me buckle up my life jacket.','source_text'=>'Biar saya pasangkan klip jaket keselamatan saya.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>606.8,'end_time'=>609.34,'target_text'=>'Dude, I am bright in this.','source_text'=>'Kawan, terang sungguh warna jaket saya ni.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>609.44,'end_time'=>611.58,'target_text'=>'Feel like you can see me from a mile away.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam orang boleh nampak saya dari jarak satu batu.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>611.68,'end_time'=>614.82,'target_text'=>'Yeah, now we\'re ready to go on the boat here.','source_text'=>'Ya, sekarang kami sudah bersedia untuk menaiki bot di sini.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>614.92,'end_time'=>615.74,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>615.84,'end_time'=>617.64,'target_text'=>'Dude.','source_text'=>'Kawan.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>618.04,'end_time'=>622.82,'target_text'=>'So, I just went through here and now the rest of them are also going through.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya baru sahaja melepasi pintu ini dan sekarang yang lain pun turut melaluinya.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>622.92,'end_time'=>628.14,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we\'re going to wait up here until we get a boat and then we\'ll go on the boat.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jadi sekarang kami akan menunggu di atas ini sehingga kami mendapat bot dan barulah kami menaikinya.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>628.24,'end_time'=>632.66,'target_text'=>'And also, I do think it\'s like customary to tip them 50,000 at the end.','source_text'=>'Dan juga, saya rasa menjadi kebiasaan untuk memberi mereka tip sebanyak 50,000 dong di hujung perjalanan.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>632.76,'end_time'=>633.3,'target_text'=>'>> Oh.','source_text'=>'>> Oh.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>633.4,'end_time'=>634.3,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s what I\'ve been told.','source_text'=>'>> Itu apa yang diberitahu kepada saya.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>634.4,'end_time'=>634.82,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>634.92,'end_time'=>636.66,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s how it was last time I was here.','source_text'=>'>> Begitulah keadaannya kali terakhir saya berada di sini.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>636.76,'end_time'=>638.14,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, we could just tip the boat driver.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, kita boleh beri tip kepada pendayung bot.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>638.24,'end_time'=>643.1,'target_text'=>'>> said, \"Yeah, you usually tip the boat driver.\" I\'m like, \"If a guy\'s going to row me for 2 hours in this heat, I\'ll give','source_text'=>'>> orang kata, \'Ya, biasanya pelancong beri tip kepada pendayung bot.\' Saya rasa, \'Jika seseorang mendayung untuk saya selama 2 jam dalam panas ini, saya pasti bagi','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>643.2,'end_time'=>645.74,'target_text'=>'him a tip.\" >> row our heavy boat.','source_text'=>'dia tip.\' >> mendayung bot berat kita ini.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>645.84,'end_time'=>646.86,'target_text'=>'Yes, definitely.','source_text'=>'Ya, sudah tentu.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>646.96,'end_time'=>651.38,'target_text'=>'He or she cuz there is a lot of ladies >> Yeah, there are, yeah.','source_text'=>'Sama ada lelaki atau wanita kerana terdapat ramai wanita yang mendayung >> Ya, memang ada, ya.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>651.48,'end_time'=>653.86,'target_text'=>'Okay, now we\'re getting on our boat here.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang kami sedang menaiki bot kami di sini.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>653.96,'end_time'=>656.18,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, shoot.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, alamak.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>656.28,'end_time'=>657.54,'target_text'=>'Got it.','source_text'=>'Dapat pun.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>657.64,'end_time'=>659.7,'target_text'=>'>> Get on camera, boy.','source_text'=>'>> Masuk dalam kamera, kawan.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>659.8,'end_time'=>663.5,'target_text'=>'Yeah, for now we\'re on the on the river.','source_text'=>'Ya, buat masa ini kami sudah berada di atas sungai.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>663.6,'end_time'=>665.34,'target_text'=>'Now I\'m going to put on sunscreen.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya akan memakai krim pelindung matahari (sunscreen).','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>665.44,'end_time'=>666.42,'target_text'=>'Korean sunscreen.','source_text'=>'Krim pelindung matahari buatan Korea.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>666.52,'end_time'=>668.42,'target_text'=>'>> And I can say what I\'m going to do.','source_text'=>'>> Dan saya boleh beritahu apa yang saya akan buat.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>668.52,'end_time'=>670.82,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to clean my sunglasses.','source_text'=>'Saya akan membersihkan cermin mata hitam saya.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>670.92,'end_time'=>676.02,'target_text'=>'>> So, I\'m putting sunscreen on my face because I don\'t have a hat and it is just really sunny out right now.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi saya menyapu krim pelindung matahari pada muka saya kerana saya tidak memakai topi dan cuaca di luar sangat panas terik sekarang.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>676.12,'end_time'=>681.02,'target_text'=>'Like oh, the sun just came out from behind the clouds and I could just feel myself about to burn.','source_text'=>'Matahari baru sahaja keluar dari balik awan dan saya dapat rasa kulit saya seperti mahu terbakar.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>681.12,'end_time'=>684.34,'target_text'=>'So, let me apply the sunscreen without a mirror.','source_text'=>'Jadi biar saya sapukan krim pelindung matahari ini tanpa cermin.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>684.44,'end_time'=>686.3,'target_text'=>'>> make sunscreen for scalps?','source_text'=>'>> ada ke krim pelindung matahari untuk kulit kepala?','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>686.4,'end_time'=>686.8,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>686.84,'end_time'=>687.16,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'>> Tak ada.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>687.16,'end_time'=>688.34,'target_text'=>'>> You can just put on normal sunscreen.','source_text'=>'>> Awak boleh sapukan pelindung matahari biasa sahaja.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>688.44,'end_time'=>689.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s skin.','source_text'=>'Kulit kepala pun kulit juga.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>689.28,'end_time'=>690.02,'target_text'=>'No?','source_text'=>'Bukan ke?','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>690.12,'end_time'=>691.5,'target_text'=>'Or is that flawed logic?','source_text'=>'Atau adakah logik saya salah?','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>691.6,'end_time'=>693.94,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, have you ever burned your scalp before?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, pernah tak kulit kepala awak terbakar matahari sebelum ini?','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>694.04,'end_time'=>695.7,'target_text'=>'>> Uh no, I have not.','source_text'=>'>> Tidak, saya belum pernah mengalaminya.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>695.8,'end_time'=>697.18,'target_text'=>'>> Have you heard of that though?','source_text'=>'>> Tapi pernah dengar tak tentang hal itu?','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>697.28,'end_time'=>701.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'ve heard of people burning their scalps, but I don\'t think I\'ve ever burned my scalp.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya pernah dengar tentang orang yang kulit kepalanya terbakar matahari, tetapi saya rasa kulit kepala saya belum pernah terbakar.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>701.28,'end_time'=>706.78,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I think it\'s probably one of the most painful places to get burnt because that part of your body usually never gets','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya rasa ia mungkin antara bahagian paling menyakitkan bila terbakar kerana bahagian badan itu biasanya tidak pernah terkena','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>706.88,'end_time'=>707.86,'target_text'=>'any sun on it.','source_text'=>'cahaya matahari langsung.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>707.96,'end_time'=>710.62,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s just pale and has no sun resistance.','source_text'=>'Jadi warnanya pucat dan tidak mempunyai daya tahan terhadap matahari.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>710.72,'end_time'=>713.06,'target_text'=>'So, if you burn your scalp, it\'s just brutal.','source_text'=>'Oleh itu, jika kulit kepala terbakar, ia amat menyiksakan.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>713.16,'end_time'=>717.58,'target_text'=>'If you like burn enough that you peel, it\'s like you have the worst dandruff getting that out.','source_text'=>'Kalau terbakar teruk sampai mengelupas, ia kelihatan seperti kelemumur yang paling teruk bila anda mengikisnya keluar.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>717.68,'end_time'=>723.9,'target_text'=>'>> Isn\'t it like like how can you go like most of your life don\'t burn your scalp and then all of a sudden you burn your scalp?','source_text'=>'>> Bukankan pelik, macam mana sepanjang hidup kita tak pernah terbakar kulit kepala dan tiba-tiba saja ia terbakar?','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>724,'end_time'=>730.02,'target_text'=>'Is it just cuz like you were in the sun for so long or >> I think if you start start losing hair or if you change your hairstyle','source_text'=>'Adakah hanya kerana berada di bawah matahari terlalu lama atau >> Saya rasa jika rambut mula gugur atau jika menukar gaya rambut','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>730.12,'end_time'=>734.58,'target_text'=>'that exposes your scalp, then you could burn your scalp, but most people have not burnt their scalp.','source_text'=>'yang mendedahkan kulit kepala, maka ia boleh terbakar, namun kebanyakan orang tidak pernah mengalaminya.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>734.68,'end_time'=>736.98,'target_text'=>'So, >> Yeah, I\'ve never I\'ve never burnt my scalp.','source_text'=>'Jadi, >> Ya, saya tak pernah kulit kepala saya terbakar.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>737.08,'end_time'=>741.86,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m not really sure the pain, but I have burnt my body and that pain is no joke.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya tidak begitu pasti tahap kesakitannya, tetapi badan saya pernah terbakar matahari dan rasa sakitnya bukan main-main.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>741.96,'end_time'=>743.58,'target_text'=>'That\'s serious stuff.','source_text'=>'Ia perkara yang serius.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>743.68,'end_time'=>744.18,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>744.28,'end_time'=>745.38,'target_text'=>'>> I think I burnt yesterday too.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa kulit saya terbakar semalam juga.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>745.48,'end_time'=>749.02,'target_text'=>'You could see the tan line from my sunglasses in between my nose.','source_text'=>'Boleh nampak kesan belang gelap daripada cermin mata hitam di bahagian hidung saya.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>749.12,'end_time'=>749.74,'target_text'=>'>> I didn\'t burn.','source_text'=>'>> Kulit saya tak terbakar.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>749.84,'end_time'=>750.66,'target_text'=>'I never burnt.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah terbakar matahari.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>750.76,'end_time'=>753.5,'target_text'=>'But yeah, now we\'re on the It\'s like a river.','source_text'=>'Tetapi ya, sekarang kami berada di... ia seperti sebatang sungai.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>753.6,'end_time'=>756.74,'target_text'=>'Like it just like flows so gently.','source_text'=>'Airnya mengalir dengan begitu tenang.','order'=>293],
