            ['start_time'=>260.88,'end_time'=>266.62,'target_text'=>'These doors all open yeah, you see these lights flash to tell you what side the doors open on so it opens on this side and','source_text'=>'Pintu-pintu ini semuanya dibuka... ya, lampu ini berkelip untuk memberitahu di sebelah mana pintu akan dibuka, jadi ia dibuka di sebelah sini','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>266.72,'end_time'=>267.82,'target_text'=>'not on that side.','source_text'=>'dan bukan di sebelah sana.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>267.92,'end_time'=>271.76,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we\'re getting out the doors all open.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita keluar, semua pintu telah terbuka.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>274.04,'end_time'=>278.54,'target_text'=>'Yeah, so now we\'re at the station and we\'re going out here this exit.','source_text'=>'Ya, sekarang kita berada di stesen dan kita akan keluar melalui pintu keluar ini.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>278.64,'end_time'=>280.02,'target_text'=>'We just got off of this train.','source_text'=>'Kami baru sahaja turun dari kereta api ini.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>280.12,'end_time'=>282.14,'target_text'=>'This was our train that we just took.','source_text'=>'Inilah kereta api yang baru kami naiki tadi.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>282.24,'end_time'=>284.74,'target_text'=>'We just got off and now it\'s going so we\'ll say bye.','source_text'=>'Kami baru turun dan sekarang ia sedang berlepas, jadi kita ucapkan selamat tinggal.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>284.84,'end_time'=>286.58,'target_text'=>'These right here are all the exits.','source_text'=>'Di sini terletaknya semua laluan keluar.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>286.68,'end_time'=>288.3,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to walk up the stairs to the exit.','source_text'=>'Kita akan menaiki tangga menuju ke pintu keluar.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>288.4,'end_time'=>289.46,'target_text'=>'Oh, it\'s very dark.','source_text'=>'Oh, di sini sangat gelap.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>289.56,'end_time'=>292.98,'target_text'=>'Yeah, we\'re leaving the station we\'re going to go to the lake.','source_text'=>'Ya, kita sedang meninggalkan stesen dan kita akan pergi ke tasik.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>293.08,'end_time'=>297.14,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know how to pronounce it feel feel.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pasti cara menyebutnya, Seokchon.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>297.24,'end_time'=>302.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s a lake and there\'s also a castle at the lake so we\'ll go see the castle and the lake.','source_text'=>'Ia sebuah tasik dan terdapat juga istana di tasik tersebut, jadi kita akan pergi melihat istana dan tasik itu.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>302.4,'end_time'=>303.66,'target_text'=>'Right now I need my card.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya perlukan kad saya.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>303.76,'end_time'=>305.98,'target_text'=>'So I\'ll tap.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya akan sentuh kad.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>306.08,'end_time'=>310.04,'target_text'=>'That\'s how much money I have left and I\'ll go.','source_text'=>'Itu baki wang yang tinggal pada kad saya dan saya boleh lalu.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>310.76,'end_time'=>317.54,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re heading to exit number two and this area is just somewhere where you can leave your luggage and stuff so I think','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita menuju ke pintu keluar nombor dua dan kawasan ini adalah tempat di mana anda boleh tinggalkan bagasi anda, jadi saya rasa','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>317.64,'end_time'=>319.98,'target_text'=>'you have to pay for it somewhere here and then you get a pin.','source_text'=>'anda perlu membayarnya di sini dan kemudian anda akan mendapat nombor pin.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>320.08,'end_time'=>321.5,'target_text'=>'Yeah, here are the steps.','source_text'=>'Ya, ini langkah-langkahnya.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>321.6,'end_time'=>327.1,'target_text'=>'So you select a location then you check out and pay pay extra fee.','source_text'=>'Mula-mula pilih lokasi kemudian daftar keluar dan bayar bayaran tambahan.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>327.2,'end_time'=>328.02,'target_text'=>'You get a one-time code.','source_text'=>'Anda akan dapat kata laluan sekali guna.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>328.12,'end_time'=>329.1,'target_text'=>'>> This is the take it out.','source_text'=>'>> Ini untuk mengambil barang keluar.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>329.2,'end_time'=>330.22,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, this is the store it.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ini untuk menyimpannya.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>330.32,'end_time'=>330.9,'target_text'=>'Okay.','source_text'=>'Baiklah.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>331,'end_time'=>337.98,'target_text'=>'So it\'s similar scan QR code select a locker and pay you check the one-time password and then you enter it and then the locker','source_text'=>'Caranya serupa: imbas kod QR, pilih loker dan buat pembayaran, semak kata laluan sekali guna kemudian masukkannya dan loker','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>338.08,'end_time'=>339.9,'target_text'=>'opens up and you can store your luggage here.','source_text'=>'akan terbuka supaya anda boleh menyimpan bagasi anda di sini.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>340,'end_time'=>341.38,'target_text'=>'>> And then you can charge your phone right here.','source_text'=>'>> Dan anda boleh mengecas telefon anda tepat di sini.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>341.48,'end_time'=>342.02,'target_text'=>'>> For real?','source_text'=>'>> Biar betul?','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>342.12,'end_time'=>343.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, USB-C.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ada slot USB-C.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>343.28,'end_time'=>344.22,'target_text'=>'>> Can you actually?','source_text'=>'>> Boleh cas betul-betul ke?','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>344.32,'end_time'=>345.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yep.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>345.12,'end_time'=>348.1,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know if that\'s true but Leon says you can charge your phone right here.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tak pasti sama ada itu benar tetapi Leon kata kita boleh cas telefon di sini.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>348.2,'end_time'=>350.38,'target_text'=>'Like we said, we\'re heading to exit number two.','source_text'=>'Seperti yang kami katakan tadi, kami sedang menuju ke pintu keluar nombor dua.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>350.48,'end_time'=>352.94,'target_text'=>'That\'s going to get us close to the lake.','source_text'=>'Itu akan membawa kita dekat dengan tasik.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>353.04,'end_time'=>353.54,'target_text'=>'We\'ll show you guys.','source_text'=>'Kami akan tunjukkan kepada anda semua.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>353.64,'end_time'=>356.54,'target_text'=>'But this is a big big passageway.','source_text'=>'Tetapi ini lorong laluan yang sangat luas.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>356.64,'end_time'=>361.06,'target_text'=>'And that\'s like a nice like green tile wall.','source_text'=>'Dan itu dinding jubin hijau yang sangat cantik.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>361.16,'end_time'=>361.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>362,'end_time'=>364.02,'target_text'=>'And here are some advertisements.','source_text'=>'Dan di sini terdapat beberapa papan iklan.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>364.12,'end_time'=>367.06,'target_text'=>'This is an information area, so it gives you information.','source_text'=>'Ini kawasan maklumat, jadi ia menyediakan pelbagai maklumat.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>367.16,'end_time'=>369.06,'target_text'=>'You see it I for information.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh lihat simbol \'i\' untuk maklumat (information).','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>369.16,'end_time'=>370.9,'target_text'=>'Tells us we\'re right here.','source_text'=>'Ia menunjukkan kita berada di sini sekarang.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>371,'end_time'=>371.5,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>371.6,'end_time'=>372.94,'target_text'=>'Oh, it\'s touchscreen.','source_text'=>'Oh, ia menggunakan skrin sentuh.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>373.04,'end_time'=>373.36,'target_text'=>'>> I see.','source_text'=>'>> Saya faham.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>373.36,'end_time'=>375.06,'target_text'=>'Is that the lake we\'re going >> Oh, that\'s cool.','source_text'=>'Adakah itu tasik yang kita mahu pergi... >> Oh, menariknya.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>375.16,'end_time'=>376.34,'target_text'=>'Oh, this is touchscreen.','source_text'=>'Oh, ini skrin sentuh.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>376.44,'end_time'=>378.18,'target_text'=>'So I\'m going to select English.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya akan memilih bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>378.28,'end_time'=>379.3,'target_text'=>'>> Nice to meet you.','source_text'=>'>> Selamat berkenalan.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>379.4,'end_time'=>382.82,'target_text'=>'This is Julia, the digital map for this >> Nice to meet you, too.','source_text'=>'Ini Julia, peta digital untuk kawasan ini... >> Selamat berkenalan juga.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>382.92,'end_time'=>386.06,'target_text'=>'So yeah, we\'re heading right here to this lake.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya, kita sedang menuju ke tasik ini di sini.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>386.16,'end_time'=>391.26,'target_text'=>'And then right here, we could also head to this lake because right here there is a castle.','source_text'=>'Dan kemudian tepat di sini, kita juga boleh menuju ke tasik ini kerana di sini terdapat sebuah istana.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>391.36,'end_time'=>396.02,'target_text'=>'And then right here, I believe is the fifth biggest building in the world.','source_text'=>'Dan di sini saya percaya ialah bangunan kelima terbesar di dunia.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>396.12,'end_time'=>398.06,'target_text'=>'>> And right here, that\'s Olympic Park.','source_text'=>'>> Dan di sebelah sini, itu Taman Olimpik.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>398.16,'end_time'=>400.62,'target_text'=>'>> And yeah, and then we\'re going right here to Olympic Park.','source_text'=>'>> Dan ya, kemudian kita akan ke Taman Olimpik di sini.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>400.72,'end_time'=>402.58,'target_text'=>'So these are the exits.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah senarai pintu keluar.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>402.68,'end_time'=>404.92,'target_text'=>'And our exit','source_text'=>'Dan pintu keluar kita','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>406,'end_time'=>408.22,'target_text'=>'Our exit is number two, but yeah, let\'s keep going.','source_text'=>'Pintu keluar kita ialah nombor dua, tapi jom kita teruskan perjalanan.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>408.32,'end_time'=>409.42,'target_text'=>'What do you think about that?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat awak tentang itu?','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>409.52,'end_time'=>412.02,'target_text'=>'>> I think it\'s confusing.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa ia mengelirukan.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>412.12,'end_time'=>412.98,'target_text'=>'Actually, it\'s not confusing.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya tidaklah mengelirukan sangat.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>413.08,'end_time'=>417.78,'target_text'=>'There\'s a lot of signs, but there\'s just so many places you can go in the subway.','source_text'=>'Papan tanda memang banyak, cuma terdapat terlalu banyak laluan yang boleh dituju di stesen bawah tanah ini.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>417.88,'end_time'=>419.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, this subway is pretty big.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, stesen bawah tanah ini sangat besar.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>419.24,'end_time'=>421.14,'target_text'=>'There are a lot of exits.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak pintu keluar.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>421.24,'end_time'=>422.34,'target_text'=>'But we\'re going Oh, look.','source_text'=>'Tapi kita mahu... Oh, tengok.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>422.44,'end_time'=>423.38,'target_text'=>'>> the sign for the lake.','source_text'=>'>> papan tanda untuk ke tasik.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>423.48,'end_time'=>425.46,'target_text'=>'>> Seokchon Lake, exit two.','source_text'=>'>> Tasik Seokchon, pintu keluar dua.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>425.56,'end_time'=>428.14,'target_text'=>'So this is the Lotte World Mall.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah Pusat Beli-Belah Lotte World.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>428.24,'end_time'=>431.9,'target_text'=>'We\'re not going to go there this video, but we will be going there another video.','source_text'=>'Kita tidak akan pergi ke situ dalam video kali ini, tetapi kita akan ke sana dalam video yang lain.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>432,'end_time'=>435.86,'target_text'=>'So if you guys want to see Lotte World Mall, which is huge, it\'s huge.','source_text'=>'Jadi jika anda mahu melihat Lotte World Mall yang sangat besar, saiznya memang gergasi.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>435.96,'end_time'=>439.74,'target_text'=>'But right now we\'re leaving the station and we\'re going to go see the lake.','source_text'=>'Tetapi sekarang kita sedang keluar dari stesen dan kita akan pergi melihat tasik.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>439.84,'end_time'=>440.9,'target_text'=>'Want more practice?','source_text'=>'Mahu lebih banyak latihan?','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>441,'end_time'=>448.06,'target_text'=>'Get the workbook for this lesson on my website and review the vocabulary, grammar, and real English from this video.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku latihan untuk pelajaran ini di laman web saya dan ulangkaji kosa kata, tatabahasa, serta bahasa Inggeris sebenar daripada video ini.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>448.16,'end_time'=>450.22,'target_text'=>'>> Wait, do I look fire, though?','source_text'=>'>> Kejap, gaya saya nampak mantap tak?','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>450.32,'end_time'=>452.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so there\'s Leon posing.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, itu dia Leon sedang bergaya.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>452.36,'end_time'=>455.06,'target_text'=>'That\'s a department store there, a department store.','source_text'=>'Di sebelah sana ada gedung serbaneka, gedung serbaneka.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>455.16,'end_time'=>456.5,'target_text'=>'And then this is Leon right here.','source_text'=>'Dan ini Leon di sebelah sini.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>456.6,'end_time'=>458.76,'target_text'=>'Yo, do a pose.','source_text'=>'Kawan, buatlah satu gaya.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>460.24,'end_time'=>464.82,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure if you guys can see this, but this building is absolutely massive.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pasti jika anda boleh nampak dalam kamera, tetapi bangunan ini sangat besar secara luar biasa.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>464.92,'end_time'=>471.14,'target_text'=>'It is the fifth tallest building in the world from what I can remember, but it is also the tallest building in Korea.','source_text'=>'Ia adalah bangunan kelima tertinggi di dunia mengikut apa yang saya ingat, dan ia juga merupakan bangunan tertinggi di Korea.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>471.24,'end_time'=>473.02,'target_text'=>'Like just looking at it hurts my neck.','source_text'=>'Melihatnya sahaja membuatkan leher saya berasa sakit.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>473.12,'end_time'=>474.86,'target_text'=>'Yo, look at it.','source_text'=>'Kawan, tengoklah ke atas.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>474.96,'end_time'=>475.54,'target_text'=>'Break your neck.','source_text'=>'Patah leher tengok benda tu.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>475.64,'end_time'=>476.04,'target_text'=>'>> Oh.','source_text'=>'>> Oh.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>476.04,'end_time'=>477.94,'target_text'=>'>> Just looking at it so massive.','source_text'=>'>> Melihatnya sahaja, ia terlalu gergasi.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>478.04,'end_time'=>478.58,'target_text'=>'>> Look at his neck.','source_text'=>'>> Tengok leher dia tu.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>478.68,'end_time'=>481.66,'target_text'=>'That\'s like a 90° angle just to take a look at that.','source_text'=>'Kena mendongak sampai 90 darjah hanya untuk melihat puncaknya.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>481.76,'end_time'=>484.5,'target_text'=>'>> Do you know how many floors are in that tower?','source_text'=>'>> Awak tahu berapa banyak tingkat yang ada dalam menara itu?','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>484.6,'end_time'=>489.42,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know the exact number, but if I had a guess, I would say probably 300 floors.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tak tahu angka yang tepat, tetapi jika saya terpaksa teka, saya rasa mungkin ada 300 tingkat.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>489.52,'end_time'=>490.46,'target_text'=>'>> 300?','source_text'=>'>> 300 tingkat?','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>490.56,'end_time'=>490.96,'target_text'=>'>> Yep.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>491.04,'end_time'=>497.18,'target_text'=>'>> If I had a guess, I would say 1 2 3 4 5 6 How many floors does the Burj Khalifa have?','source_text'=>'>> Kalau saya nak teka, saya kata 1 2 3 4 5 6 Berapa tingkat yang Burj Khalifa ada?','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>497.28,'end_time'=>498.02,'target_text'=>'>> 1,000.','source_text'=>'>> 1,000 tingkat.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>498.12,'end_time'=>498.82,'target_text'=>'>> 1,000?','source_text'=>'>> 1,000 tingkat?','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>498.92,'end_time'=>499.74,'target_text'=>'>> No, I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'>> Taklah, saya tak tahu.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>499.84,'end_time'=>506.18,'target_text'=>'>> If I had a guess, you guessed 300, I will guess It\'s like should I go over or under because that really determines if I','source_text'=>'>> Kalau saya kena teka, awak teka 300, saya akan teka... patutkah saya teka lebih atau kurang sebab itu menentukan sama ada saya','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>506.28,'end_time'=>506.82,'target_text'=>'win.','source_text'=>'menang.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>506.92,'end_time'=>510.12,'target_text'=>'I\'ll guess 275.','source_text'=>'Saya teka 275 tingkat.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>511.12,'end_time'=>511.52,'target_text'=>'>> All right.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>511.6,'end_time'=>511.88,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>511.88,'end_time'=>512.7,'target_text'=>'Now, let me search it.','source_text'=>'Sekarang biar saya buat carian di internet.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>512.8,'end_time'=>517.48,'target_text'=>'How many floors are in the Lotte World Tower?','source_text'=>'Berapa banyak tingkat yang ada di Menara Lotte World?','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>517.96,'end_time'=>518.42,'target_text'=>'>> How many?','source_text'=>'>> Berapa banyak?','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>518.52,'end_time'=>519.66,'target_text'=>'>> 123.','source_text'=>'>> 123 tingkat.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>519.76,'end_time'=>520.04,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>520.04,'end_time'=>520.58,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s not even a lot.','source_text'=>'>> Tak banyak mana pun rupa-rupanya.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>520.68,'end_time'=>528.78,'target_text'=>'Okay, so the Lotte World Tower has 123 floors above ground, six floors below ground, totaling 129','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jadi Menara Lotte World mempunyai 123 tingkat di atas tanah dan enam tingkat di bawah tanah, menjadikannya 129','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>528.88,'end_time'=>534.22,'target_text'=>'stories, making it the tallest building in South Korea, and a major landmark in Seoul.','source_text'=>'tingkat secara keseluruhan, menjadikannya bangunan tertinggi di Korea Selatan dan mercu tanda utama di Seoul.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>534.32,'end_time'=>539.66,'target_text'=>'Wow, so it is 555 m tall or 1,821','source_text'=>'Wah, ketinggiannya mencecah 555 meter atau 1,821','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>539.76,'end_time'=>540.58,'target_text'=>'ft.','source_text'=>'kaki.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>540.68,'end_time'=>543.26,'target_text'=>'How many floors does the Burj Khalifa have?','source_text'=>'Berapa tingkat pula yang Burj Khalifa ada?','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>543.36,'end_time'=>544.94,'target_text'=>'>> Is it the highest building in Seoul though?','source_text'=>'>> Tapi adakah ia bangunan tertinggi di Seoul?','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>545.04,'end_time'=>545.32,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>545.32,'end_time'=>546.38,'target_text'=>'>> Higher than Namsan Tower?','source_text'=>'>> Lebih tinggi daripada Menara Namsan ke?','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>546.48,'end_time'=>549.1,'target_text'=>'>> The Burj Khalifa only has 163.','source_text'=>'>> Burj Khalifa hanya mempunyai 163 tingkat.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>549.2,'end_time'=>549.82,'target_text'=>'>> I didn\'t know that.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tak tahu tentang perkara itu.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>549.92,'end_time'=>555.54,'target_text'=>'>> So, 163 for the Burj Khalifa, total height of 828 m.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi 163 tingkat untuk Burj Khalifa dengan jumlah ketinggian 828 meter.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>555.64,'end_time'=>560.82,'target_text'=>'So, this one has 123, Burj Khalifa, tallest building in the world, 163.','source_text'=>'Menara ini mempunyai 123 tingkat, manakala Burj Khalifa selaku bangunan tertinggi di dunia mempunyai 163 tingkat.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>560.92,'end_time'=>562.14,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s go to the lake.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, mari kita pergi ke tasik.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>562.24,'end_time'=>563.5,'target_text'=>'Let me pull up the map.','source_text'=>'Biar saya buka aplikasi peta.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>563.6,'end_time'=>569.06,'target_text'=>'I need to navigate for us because I don\'t know where the lake is, so I\'ll just navigate.','source_text'=>'Saya kena tunjukkan arah perjalanan kerana saya tidak tahu kedudukan tasik itu, jadi saya akan pandu arah.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>569.16,'end_time'=>570.74,'target_text'=>'No, it\'s on this side of the road.','source_text'=>'Bukan, ia berada di sebelah jalan yang ini.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>570.84,'end_time'=>571.58,'target_text'=>'>> Bro, here\'s a map.','source_text'=>'>> Kawan, di sini ada peta.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>571.68,'end_time'=>572.98,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah, there is a map.','source_text'=>'>> Oh ya, memang ada peta di sini.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>573.08,'end_time'=>576.54,'target_text'=>'So, there\'s a map there, but I also have the Naver Maps on my phone.','source_text'=>'Ada peta di situ, tetapi saya juga ada aplikasi Naver Maps di dalam telefon saya.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>576.64,'end_time'=>577.86,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s just a 5-minute walk.','source_text'=>'Jaraknya hanya kira-kira 5 minit berjalan kaki.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>577.96,'end_time'=>584.1,'target_text'=>'We just have to walk down a bit and then there\'ll be the start of the lake, Seokchon','source_text'=>'Kita cuma perlu berjalan ke bawah sedikit dan di situ bermulanya Tasik Seokchon,','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>584.2,'end_time'=>584.62,'target_text'=>'Lake.','source_text'=>'Tasik Seokchon.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>584.72,'end_time'=>585.82,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Mari kita gerak.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>585.92,'end_time'=>589.86,'target_text'=>'Okay, so Leon\'s just opening up his bag to grab the gloves.','source_text'=>'Leon sedang membuka begnya untuk mengambil sarung tangan.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>589.96,'end_time'=>590.74,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m going to wear the gloves.','source_text'=>'Saya akan memakai sarung tangan ini.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>590.84,'end_time'=>592.46,'target_text'=>'So, he\'s just opening up his bag.','source_text'=>'Dia sedang membuka begnya.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>592.56,'end_time'=>593.14,'target_text'=>'>> The gloves.','source_text'=>'>> Sarung tangan itu.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>593.24,'end_time'=>595.3,'target_text'=>'These You make it sound like they\'re communal gloves.','source_text'=>'Awak cakap macam sarung tangan itu kepunyaan bersama.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>595.4,'end_time'=>597.06,'target_text'=>'>> My gloves.','source_text'=>'>> Sarung tangan saya.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>597.16,'end_time'=>602.3,'target_text'=>'I\'ll be posting my shadowing stories on my second channel, Volca.','source_text'=>'Saya akan muat naik cerita teknik shadowing di saluran kedua saya, Volka.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>602.4,'end_time'=>604.9,'target_text'=>'The link to my channel will be in the description.','source_text'=>'Pautan ke saluran saya ada di bahagian penerangan.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>605,'end_time'=>607.94,'target_text'=>'So, make sure to subscribe and watch videos there.','source_text'=>'Pastikan anda melanggan dan menonton video di sana.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>608.04,'end_time'=>609.42,'target_text'=>'So, I mentioned this in another video.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah sebutkan perkara ini dalam video lain.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>609.52,'end_time'=>611.5,'target_text'=>'These are both mittens and gloves.','source_text'=>'Ini berfungsi sebagai sarung tangan tanpa jari (mittens) dan sarung tangan biasa (gloves).','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>611.6,'end_time'=>613.02,'target_text'=>'So, mittens, gloves.','source_text'=>'Jadi ada bahagian \'mittens\' dan \'gloves\'.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>613.12,'end_time'=>615.6,'target_text'=>'So, they\'re two in one.','source_text'=>'Ia dua dalam satu.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>616.28,'end_time'=>618.86,'target_text'=>'Did that Was that scooter guy just driving on the sidewalk?','source_text'=>'Penunggang skuter tadi memandu di atas laluan pejalan kaki ke?','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>618.96,'end_time'=>619.66,'target_text'=>'>> it on here.','source_text'=>'>> lalu di atas sini.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>619.76,'end_time'=>620.16,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kawan.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>620.16,'end_time'=>621.7,'target_text'=>'Scooter drivers are crazy here.','source_text'=>'Penunggang skuter di sini sangat berbahaya.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>621.8,'end_time'=>626.9,'target_text'=>'You have to be careful cuz that guy was just driving on the sidewalk when I\'m pretty sure you\'re not supposed to do that.','source_text'=>'Kena berhati-hati sebab orang itu tadi selamba menunggang di atas laluan pejalan kaki sedangkan saya pasti ia tidak dibenarkan.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>627,'end_time'=>628.26,'target_text'=>'Let me just tuck these in.','source_text'=>'Biar saya selitkan sarung tangan ini ke dalam poket.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>628.36,'end_time'=>629.66,'target_text'=>'All right, so now let\'s go to the lake.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang mari kita pergi ke tasik.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>629.76,'end_time'=>631.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s just a 5-minute walk down this way.','source_text'=>'Jaraknya hanya 5 minit berjalan kaki ke arah sini.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>631.56,'end_time'=>638.26,'target_text'=>'I have the gloves on to keep my hands warm cuz although my body is warm enough, my hands are a little cold.','source_text'=>'Saya memakai sarung tangan untuk memanaskan tangan kerana walaupun badan saya sudah cukup hangat, tangan saya berasa agak sejuk.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>638.36,'end_time'=>642.02,'target_text'=>'And I guess yeah, that\'s a hotel over there and that\'s a department store.','source_text'=>'Dan di sebelah sana itu sebuah hotel dan di situ pula sebuah gedung serbaneka.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>642.12,'end_time'=>644.78,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we are crossing the crosswalk.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita sedang melintas di lintasan pejalan kaki.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>644.88,'end_time'=>647.58,'target_text'=>'Like I mentioned before, this is a zebra crosswalk.','source_text'=>'Seperti yang saya sebutkan sebelum ini, ini adalah lintasan belang (zebra crosswalk).','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>647.68,'end_time'=>650.62,'target_text'=>'We\'re just crossing it to get to the other side.','source_text'=>'Kita melintasinya untuk ke seberang jalan.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>650.72,'end_time'=>653.66,'target_text'=>'That\'s what the speed limit signs in Korea look like.','source_text'=>'Beginilah rupa papan tanda had laju di Korea.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>653.76,'end_time'=>655.42,'target_text'=>'But yeah, now we\'re in the park.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita sudah berada di dalam taman.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>655.52,'end_time'=>658.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a small park and I think we can get in from there.','source_text'=>'Ia seperti sebuah taman kecil dan saya rasa kita boleh masuk dari sebelah sana.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>658.92,'end_time'=>659.62,'target_text'=>'Like right there.','source_text'=>'Tepat di sebelah situ.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>659.72,'end_time'=>660.74,'target_text'=>'There\'s a small trail.','source_text'=>'Terdapat laluan denai kecil.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>660.84,'end_time'=>664.58,'target_text'=>'So, right here, this is just a little small wall.','source_text'=>'Di sini hanya terdapat tembok kecil.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>664.68,'end_time'=>666.3,'target_text'=>'These are some directions.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah beberapa papan tanda arah.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>666.4,'end_time'=>669.5,'target_text'=>'I believe the lake is right there, so we\'ll just go straight.','source_text'=>'Saya percaya tasik itu berada di hadapan sana, jadi kita teruskan sahaja perjalanan ke hadapan.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>669.6,'end_time'=>675.06,'target_text'=>'It looks like there was an exit right here that we could have entered, but we did not know.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya ada pintu keluar di sini yang boleh kita gunakan untuk masuk tadi, tetapi kita tidak tahu.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>675.16,'end_time'=>677.86,'target_text'=>'But now Now you can see the lake here.','source_text'=>'Sekarang anda boleh melihat tasik di sini.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>677.96,'end_time'=>679.54,'target_text'=>'These are just some lights.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah lampu hiasan.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>679.64,'end_time'=>680.82,'target_text'=>'Some lights.','source_text'=>'Lampu-lampu hiasan.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>680.92,'end_time'=>684.18,'target_text'=>'This is a nice stone pathway.','source_text'=>'Ini laluan pejalan kaki berbatu yang sangat cantik.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>684.28,'end_time'=>685.26,'target_text'=>'That is a nice rock.','source_text'=>'Batu itu sangat menarik.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>685.36,'end_time'=>687.34,'target_text'=>'It looks like that was a river rock, right?','source_text'=>'Ia nampak seperti batu sungai, kan?','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>687.44,'end_time'=>688.9,'target_text'=>'Cuz it\'s so smooth.','source_text'=>'Kerana permukaannya sangat licin.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>689,'end_time'=>689.9,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s eroded.','source_text'=>'>> Ia telah terhakis.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>690,'end_time'=>693.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s been eroded by the river and by water.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ia telah terhakis oleh arus sungai dan air.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>693.56,'end_time'=>695.38,'target_text'=>'And you can see it\'s very smooth.','source_text'=>'Dan anda boleh lihat ia sangat licin.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>695.48,'end_time'=>697.42,'target_text'=>'Okay, I was I was wondering what I tripped on.','source_text'=>'Tadi saya tertanya-tanya apa yang saya tersadung.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>697.52,'end_time'=>699.54,'target_text'=>'There\'s a small Where is it?','source_text'=>'Ada dahan kecil... di mana ia?','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>699.64,'end_time'=>700.14,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>700.24,'end_time'=>703.54,'target_text'=>'Oh, there\'s a small little twig there and I tripped on it.','source_text'=>'Oh, ada ranting kayu kecil di situ dan saya tersadung padanya.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>703.64,'end_time'=>705.3,'target_text'=>'This is a photo spot.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah sudut bergambar.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>705.4,'end_time'=>707.7,'target_text'=>'This looks like a nice photo spot at night time.','source_text'=>'Tempat ini nampak sangat cantik untuk mengambil gambar pada waktu malam.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>707.8,'end_time'=>713.26,'target_text'=>'So, at night these hearts light up and then you can take a nice photo there, I assume.','source_text'=>'Pada waktu malam, lampu berbentuk hati ini akan menyala dan anda boleh mengambil gambar yang cantik di situ, saya rasa.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>713.36,'end_time'=>717.9,'target_text'=>'But yeah, you can actually see there\'s a track that goes all the way around.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh lihat terdapat trek larian yang mengelilingi seluruh tasik ini.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>718,'end_time'=>720.06,'target_text'=>'So, some people are running like this guy.','source_text'=>'Ada orang yang sedang berjoging seperti lelaki ini.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>720.16,'end_time'=>721.34,'target_text'=>'Most people are walking.','source_text'=>'Kebanyakan orang hanya berjalan santai.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>721.44,'end_time'=>723.66,'target_text'=>'But yeah, overall it\'s very calm here.','source_text'=>'Secara keseluruhannya suasana di sini sangat tenang.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>723.76,'end_time'=>731.06,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure if you guys can hear that, but these speakers are playing like a nice calm music [music] and also it doubles','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pasti jika anda boleh mendengarnya, tetapi pembesar suara ini memainkan muzik yang sangat mendamaikan dan ia juga berfungsi','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>731.16,'end_time'=>732.3,'target_text'=>'as a lamp post.','source_text'=>'sebagai tiang lampu.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>732.4,'end_time'=>733.94,'target_text'=>'Speakers and a lamp post.','source_text'=>'Pembesar suara dan juga tiang lampu.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>734.04,'end_time'=>737.1,'target_text'=>'And then there are benches all along the side here.','source_text'=>'Terdapat deretan bangku di sepanjang laluan tepi ini.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>737.2,'end_time'=>740.22,'target_text'=>'Really long benches to sit down on.','source_text'=>'Bangku yang sangat panjang untuk diduduki.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>740.32,'end_time'=>741.26,'target_text'=>'Yeah, thoughts?','source_text'=>'Ya, apa pandangan awak?','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>741.36,'end_time'=>742.3,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s so blue.','source_text'=>'>> Airnya nampak sangat biru.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>742.4,'end_time'=>747.78,'target_text'=>'They\'ve got to be using that I\'ve seen videos where they like pour like a blue like dye into the into the lakes to make it','source_text'=>'Mereka pasti guna pewarna... saya pernah tengok video di mana mereka menuang pewarna biru ke dalam tasik untuk menjadikannya','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>747.88,'end_time'=>749.26,'target_text'=>'look like super nice and blue.','source_text'=>'kelihatan sangat cantik dan membiru.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>749.36,'end_time'=>750.18,'target_text'=>'>> Here in Korea?','source_text'=>'>> Di Korea ini ke?','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>750.28,'end_time'=>751.66,'target_text'=>'>> No, like anywhere in the world.','source_text'=>'>> Tak, di mana-mana sahaja di dunia.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>751.76,'end_time'=>753.82,'target_text'=>'I can almost guarantee that\'s what they\'re using for this.','source_text'=>'Saya berani jamin itulah yang mereka gunakan untuk tasik ini.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>753.92,'end_time'=>756.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, cuz this is quite blue.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kerana air ini memang sangat biru.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>756.2,'end_time'=>759.34,'target_text'=>'Usually I would imagine this type of water to be like brown.','source_text'=>'Biasanya air tasik bandar seperti ini berwarna agak kecoklatan.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>759.44,'end_time'=>760.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>760.2,'end_time'=>762.86,'target_text'=>'>> But this is like it and it\'s like a deep blue.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi yang ini berwarna biru pekat.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>762.96,'end_time'=>763.36,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>763.36,'end_time'=>764.94,'target_text'=>'>> A really deep blue.','source_text'=>'>> Warna biru yang sangat pekat.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>765.04,'end_time'=>769.22,'target_text'=>'I think these apartments along here would be quite expensive.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa apartmen di sepanjang tepi tasik ini harganya pasti sangat mahal.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>769.32,'end_time'=>775.98,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure the exact price, but I would assume that those apartments are expensive since they overlook this lake.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak tahu harga tepatnya, tetapi saya menganggap apartmen itu mahal kerana ia menghadap tasik ini.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>776.08,'end_time'=>778.14,'target_text'=>'But yeah, it\'s pretty nice overall.','source_text'=>'Tetapi secara keseluruhannya ia memang sangat cantik.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>778.24,'end_time'=>784.18,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m not sure if you can see in the lake here, but a little bit further you can see a lot of bubbles coming out from the','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pasti jika anda boleh nampak di dalam tasik ini, tetapi sedikit jauh ke hadapan terdapat banyak buih udara yang keluar dari dalam','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>784.28,'end_time'=>784.78,'target_text'=>'lake.','source_text'=>'tasik.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>784.88,'end_time'=>791.54,'target_text'=>'That is called aeration and that is just when they pump oxygen into the lake from underneath to make sure that the fish and','source_text'=>'Proses itu dipanggil pengudaraan (aeration) di mana oksigen dipam ke dalam tasik dari bahagian bawah untuk memastikan ikan dan','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>791.64,'end_time'=>798.94,'target_text'=>'other organisms living inside this lake don\'t die because I\'m not exactly sure, but more more than likely this lake is not','source_text'=>'hidupan lain di dalam tasik ini tidak mati, kerana kemungkinan besar tasik ini bukan','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>799.04,'end_time'=>800.62,'target_text'=>'a naturally formed lake.','source_text'=>'tasik yang terbentuk secara semula jadi.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>800.72,'end_time'=>802.54,'target_text'=>'Maybe I\'ll also fact check myself.','source_text'=>'Mungkin saya patut semak fakta ini.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>802.64,'end_time'=>803.62,'target_text'=>'Fact check.','source_text'=>'Semak fakta (fact check).','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>803.72,'end_time'=>808.46,'target_text'=>'That means I\'ll check if I\'m telling the truth or not or I\'ll check if I\'m correct or not.','source_text'=>'Itu bermaksud saya menyemak sama ada apa yang saya katakan itu benar atau tidak, betul atau salah.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>808.56,'end_time'=>813.38,'target_text'=>'Is Seokchon Lake in Seoul a natural lake?','source_text'=>'Adakah Tasik Seokchon di Seoul sebuah tasik semula jadi?','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>813.48,'end_time'=>815.5,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we have the facts here.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, faktanya ada di sini.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>815.6,'end_time'=>821.62,'target_text'=>'Seokchon Lake, often called Seokchon in Seoul, is an artificial lake.','source_text'=>'Tasik Seokchon di Seoul adalah sebuah tasik buatan manusia (artificial lake).','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>821.72,'end_time'=>824.38,'target_text'=>'Artificial, that means this lake is not natural.','source_text'=>'Buatan manusia, bermakna tasik ini bukan semula jadi.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>824.48,'end_time'=>826.74,'target_text'=>'This lake was man-made, it\'s artificial.','source_text'=>'Tasik ini dibina oleh manusia, ia adalah buatan.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>826.84,'end_time'=>832.18,'target_text'=>'So that makes sense now why they\'re pumping oxygen throughout the lake here, because it\'s not natural, it\'s artificial.','source_text'=>'Jadi memang masuk akal kenapa mereka mengepam oksigen ke seluruh tasik ini, kerana ia adalah tasik buatan.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>832.28,'end_time'=>834.74,'target_text'=>'So the lake was made in 1971.','source_text'=>'Tasik ini dibina pada tahun 1971.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>834.84,'end_time'=>836.3,'target_text'=>'But yeah, that makes sense, artificial lake.','source_text'=>'Memang berasas, tasik buatan manusia.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>836.4,'end_time'=>839.34,'target_text'=>'I wonder if the other side we\'re going to go see is also an artificial lake.','source_text'=>'Saya tertanya-tanya sama ada bahagian sebelah sana yang akan kita lawati juga tasik buatan.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>839.44,'end_time'=>843.58,'target_text'=>'I would assume so, because yeah, as you mentioned when we got here, this water is very blue.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa begitu juga, kerana seperti yang awak katakan tadi, air ini terlalu biru.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>843.68,'end_time'=>850.34,'target_text'=>'But yeah, you can see on the surface of the water the reflections of those apartment buildings and also the branches of trees','source_text'=>'Anda boleh melihat pada permukaan air pantulan bangunan apartmen serta dahan-dahan pokok','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>850.44,'end_time'=>851.14,'target_text'=>'and stuff.','source_text'=>'dan sebagainya.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>851.24,'end_time'=>853.46,'target_text'=>'So yeah, that\'s the full lake right there.','source_text'=>'Itulah gambaran penuh tasik ini.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>853.56,'end_time'=>856.78,'target_text'=>'There\'s, you know, the walking path all the way around the lake.','source_text'=>'Terdapat laluan pejalan kaki di sekeliling tasik.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>856.88,'end_time'=>862.02,'target_text'=>'There are people walking around the lake, a nice view of the tower, and then a big mall over there.','source_text'=>'Ada ramai orang bersiar-siar di sekitar tasik, pemandangan menara yang indah, dan pusat beli-belah besar di sana.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>862.12,'end_time'=>864.54,'target_text'=>'We will be visiting that one day.','source_text'=>'Kita akan melawatnya pada suatu hari nanti.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>864.64,'end_time'=>866.22,'target_text'=>'But now we\'re back up top here.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita berada di bahagian atas semula.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>866.32,'end_time'=>867.82,'target_text'=>'Now you can see the castle better.','source_text'=>'Kini anda boleh melihat istana itu dengan lebih jelas.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>867.92,'end_time'=>872.82,'target_text'=>'That over there is Lotte World Amusement Park, and we are heading that way right now.','source_text'=>'Di sebelah sana itu adalah Taman Tema Lotte World, dan kita sedang menuju ke arah itu sekarang.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>872.92,'end_time'=>879.1,'target_text'=>'Let\'s walk down the sidewalk till we get to the crosswalk, and then we\'ll go right, look at the lake on that side.','source_text'=>'Mari kita berjalan di laluan pejalan kaki sehingga sampai ke lintasan jalan, kemudian kita belok ke kanan melihat tasik di sebelah sana.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>879.2,'end_time'=>885.94,'target_text'=>'And that is actually one of the most popular places to see the cherry blossoms from, because you have the nice because you','source_text'=>'Kawasan ini sebenarnya antara tempat paling popular untuk melihat bunga sakura (cherry blossoms), kerana anda mempunyai latar belakang','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>886.04,'end_time'=>889.5,'target_text'=>'have the nice castle in the background and then cherry blossoms and then the lake.','source_text'=>'istana yang cantik bersama bunga sakura dan tasik.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>889.6,'end_time'=>893.1,'target_text'=>'So this is a really nice area to see the cherry blossoms from.','source_text'=>'Jadi ini kawasan yang sangat indah untuk melihat pemandangan bunga sakura.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>893.2,'end_time'=>895.46,'target_text'=>'Yeah, this is a very busy street, eh?','source_text'=>'Jalan raya ini sangat sibuk, kan?','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>895.56,'end_time'=>895.96,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>896,'end_time'=>897.74,'target_text'=>'>> There is a lot of traffic.','source_text'=>'>> Trafiknya sangat padat.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>897.84,'end_time'=>899.26,'target_text'=>'How many lanes are there?','source_text'=>'Berapa banyak lorong yang ada?','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>899.36,'end_time'=>904.18,'target_text'=>'There are like 1 2 3 4 5 6 lanes.','source_text'=>'Ada sekitar 1 2 3 4 5 6 lorong.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>904.28,'end_time'=>907.7,'target_text'=>'There are 6 lanes on each side, that\'s huge.','source_text'=>'Terdapat 6 lorong pada setiap arah, sangat luas.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>907.8,'end_time'=>911.66,'target_text'=>'And it just goes right down, all the way down through Seoul.','source_text'=>'Jalan ini merentasi terus ke seluruh bandar raya Seoul.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>911.76,'end_time'=>912.34,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Hebat sungguh.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>912.44,'end_time'=>915.3,'target_text'=>'And right there, that is a place where you can rent bikes.','source_text'=>'Tepat di sebelah sana itu adalah tempat sewa basikal.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>915.4,'end_time'=>921.74,'target_text'=>'So those bikes are called Seoul City Bikes, and I\'ve also started posting these videos as podcasts.','source_text'=>'Basikal itu dipanggil Seoul City Bikes, dan saya juga mula memuat naik video ini sebagai podcast.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>921.84,'end_time'=>924.62,'target_text'=>'You can find them here or in the description.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh mencarinya di sini atau di bahagian penerangan.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>924.72,'end_time'=>925.98,'target_text'=>'Wolka English.','source_text'=>'Wolka English.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>926.08,'end_time'=>926.48,'target_text'=>'>> Here we go.','source_text'=>'>> Mari kita lintas.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>926.48,'end_time'=>927.42,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re crossing.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita sedang melintas.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>927.52,'end_time'=>931.14,'target_text'=>'So, you see traffic is going that way now and we are crossing this way.','source_text'=>'Kenderaan bergerak ke arah sana sekarang dan kita melintas ke arah sini.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>931.24,'end_time'=>938.66,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m not sure if you guys have seen that big like dome, that\'s circular building in Las Vegas, but this is similar to that,','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pasti jika anda pernah melihat bangunan berbentuk kubah bulat gergasi di Las Vegas, tetapi ini menyerupai reka bentuk itu,','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>938.76,'end_time'=>939.54,'target_text'=>'just very small.','source_text'=>'cuma dalam saiz yang jauh lebih kecil.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>939.64,'end_time'=>941.82,'target_text'=>'But this one just tells you the time and the weather.','source_text'=>'Skrin ini hanya memaparkan waktu dan cuaca.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>941.92,'end_time'=>947.06,'target_text'=>'So, right now it\'s cloudy, 7°, it\'s 12:35 p.m.','source_text'=>'Sekarang cuaca mendung, suhu 7 darjah, waktu menunjukkan 12:35 tengah hari.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>947.16,'end_time'=>951.22,'target_text'=>'And today is the 10th of December 2025.','source_text'=>'Dan hari ini ialah 10 Disember 2025.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>951.32,'end_time'=>953.62,'target_text'=>'Let me know in the comments what day it is.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya di ruangan komen tarikh hari ini semasa anda menonton.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>953.72,'end_time'=>956.66,'target_text'=>'Is it March 2026?','source_text'=>'Adakah sekarang Mac 2026?','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>956.76,'end_time'=>958.94,'target_text'=>'March 3rd, 2026 perhaps?','source_text'=>'Mungkin 3 Mac 2026?','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>959.04,'end_time'=>961.86,'target_text'=>'Or is it July 1st, 2027?','source_text'=>'Atau adakah 1 Julai 2027?','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>961.96,'end_time'=>963.66,'target_text'=>'Anyways, now we\'re on the other side.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, sekarang kita sudah berada di seberang sana.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>963.76,'end_time'=>964.7,'target_text'=>'This is a bench.','source_text'=>'Ini sebuah bangku.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>964.8,'end_time'=>966.02,'target_text'=>'This right here is a tree.','source_text'=>'Ini pula sebatang pokok.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>966.12,'end_time'=>969.34,'target_text'=>'The tree has branches and no leaves.','source_text'=>'Pokok ini mempunyai dahan tanpa sehelai daun pun.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>969.44,'end_time'=>972.74,'target_text'=>'This tree has no leaves, but this tree does have leaves.','source_text'=>'Pokok ini tiada daun, tetapi pokok di sebelah sana itu masih ada daun.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>972.84,'end_time'=>975.34,'target_text'=>'>> Looks like it\'s under construction, Lotte World.','source_text'=>'>> Nampaknya Lotte World sedang dalam pembinaan.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>975.44,'end_time'=>976.54,'target_text'=>'>> Under construction?','source_text'=>'>> Sedang dalam pembinaan?','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>976.64,'end_time'=>980.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, there\'s some Well, there\'s a crane right there and they got stuff under tarps.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ada kren di situ dan barang-barang ditutup dengan kain terpal (tarpaulin).','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>980.84,'end_time'=>985.42,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe that\'s just a Christmas special that they\'re making because I know that they\'re going to have like some Christmas','source_text'=>'>> Mungkin itu hiasan khas sempena Krismas yang sedang mereka siapkan kerana saya tahu mereka akan mengadakan acara bertemakan Krismas','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>985.52,'end_time'=>990.9,'target_text'=>'themed stuff here and I really doubt that they would be closed during one of the busiest holidays.','source_text'=>'di sini dan saya amat meragui mereka akan ditutup semasa musim cuti paling sibuk.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>991,'end_time'=>991.9,'target_text'=>'>> Well, there\'s people in there.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi ada orang di dalam sana.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>992,'end_time'=>992.24,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I know.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya tahu.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>992.24,'end_time'=>995.9,'target_text'=>'I saw some of the rides going like Yeah, there are people in there going on rides.','source_text'=>'Saya nampak beberapa permainan sedang beroperasi... ya, ada pengunjung sedang menaiki permainan di dalam.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>996,'end_time'=>1000.22,'target_text'=>'I think that might be something they\'re constructing, a new construction.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa mungkin ada bahagian baharu yang sedang dibina.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>1000.32,'end_time'=>1003.18,'target_text'=>'This is the outer part of Have you been to Lotte World?','source_text'=>'Ini adalah bahagian luar... awak pernah masuk ke Lotte World?','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>1003.28,'end_time'=>1004.1,'target_text'=>'>> No, I haven\'t.','source_text'=>'>> Belum, saya belum pernah masuk.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>1004.2,'end_time'=>1005.06,'target_text'=>'>> No?','source_text'=>'>> Belum?','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>1005.16,'end_time'=>1008.06,'target_text'=>'Yeah, there\'s an outer part, which is what you\'re seeing right now.','source_text'=>'Taman tema ini ada bahagian luar seperti yang anda lihat sekarang.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>1008.16,'end_time'=>1013.5,'target_text'=>'That\'s the outside, but also that building right there that says Lotte World on it is the indoor part of it.','source_text'=>'Itu bahagian luarnya, tetapi bangunan di sebelah sana yang bertulis Lotte World adalah bahagian dalamannya.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>1013.6,'end_time'=>1020.62,'target_text'=>'So, so there\'s an amusement park outside and there\'s one inside because it gets really, really cold in Korea, so they can\'t','source_text'=>'Terdapat taman tema di luar dan di dalam bangunan kerana musim sejuk di Korea sangat mencengkam, jadi pengunjung tidak boleh','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>1020.72,'end_time'=>1021.7,'target_text'=>'really be outside.','source_text'=>'berada di luar terlalu lama.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>1021.8,'end_time'=>1024.5,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s why they have one for the inside as well.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah mereka turut menyediakan taman tema tertutup di bahagian dalam.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>1024.6,'end_time'=>1030.5,'target_text'=>'And you can see right there some people are in paddle boats going through the lake, but they look motorized because they\'re','source_text'=>'Anda boleh lihat di sana ada orang menaiki bot kayuh merentasi tasik, tetapi ia kelihatan bermotor kerana mereka','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>1030.6,'end_time'=>1031.58,'target_text'=>'not actually paddling.','source_text'=>'tidak mengayuhnya secara manual.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>1031.68,'end_time'=>1033.9,'target_text'=>'So, I do believe they are motorized.','source_text'=>'Saya percaya bot itu menggunakan motor.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>1034,'end_time'=>1035.34,'target_text'=>'But it that\'s pretty romantic.','source_text'=>'Suasananya sangat romantik.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>1035.44,'end_time'=>1037.98,'target_text'=>'You can go with your girlfriend or your wife.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh pergi bersama teman wanita atau isteri anda.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>1038.08,'end_time'=>1038.9,'target_text'=>'>> What about boyfriend?','source_text'=>'>> Bagaimana pula dengan teman lelaki?','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>1039,'end_time'=>1039.98,'target_text'=>'>> Boyfriend, too.','source_text'=>'>> Bersama teman lelaki pun boleh.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>1040.08,'end_time'=>1041.14,'target_text'=>'On the paddle boats.','source_text'=>'Menaiki bot kayuh.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>1041.24,'end_time'=>1042.82,'target_text'=>'>> What about mistress?','source_text'=>'>> Bagaimana pula dengan orang ketiga?','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>1042.92,'end_time'=>1047.54,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so we\'ve just come across an absolutely amazing discovery.','source_text'=>'>> Kami baru sahaja menjumpai satu penemuan yang amat menakjubkan.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>1047.64,'end_time'=>1048.86,'target_text'=>'Hey, what do you think?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat awak?','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>1048.96,'end_time'=>1050.02,'target_text'=>'>> I think it\'s pretty good.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa ia sangat bagus.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>1050.12,'end_time'=>1052.22,'target_text'=>'>> I think it\'s more than pretty good.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa ia lebih daripada sekadar bagus.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>1052.32,'end_time'=>1055.94,'target_text'=>'We have just realized that this seat is heated.','source_text'=>'Kami baru menyedari bahawa bangku ini mempunyai pemanas.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>1056.04,'end_time'=>1057.1,'target_text'=>'This is a heated seat.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah kerusi berpemanas (heated seat).','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>1057.2,'end_time'=>1059.18,'target_text'=>'So, that means it\'s just warmed up from the bottom.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya ia dipanaskan dari bahagian bawah.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>1059.28,'end_time'=>1062.94,'target_text'=>'So, I guess yeah, right here it it kind of looks like there\'s some electrical stuff.','source_text'=>'Di sebelah sini kelihatan seperti ada komponen elektrik.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>1063.04,'end_time'=>1070.9,'target_text'=>'On that other side there is a cable going into the ground and that\'s most likely where the power comes to heat up this bench.','source_text'=>'Di sebelah sana terdapat kabel yang bersambung ke dalam tanah dan kemungkinan besar dari situlah bekalan elektrik untuk memanaskan bangku ini.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>1071,'end_time'=>1072.14,'target_text'=>'So, this is a heated bench.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah bangku berpemanas.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>1072.24,'end_time'=>1079.78,'target_text'=>'My fingers are like really cold, so I\'m putting them in between my leg and the heated seat, the heated bench so that it warms','source_text'=>'Jari-jari saya berasa sangat sejuk, jadi saya meletakkannya di antara peha dan bangku berpemanas ini supaya tangan saya kembali','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>1079.88,'end_time'=>1080.38,'target_text'=>'me up.','source_text'=>'hangat.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>1080.48,'end_time'=>1081.38,'target_text'=>'Oh, that is very nice.','source_text'=>'Oh, sangat selesa.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>1081.48,'end_time'=>1082.86,'target_text'=>'But, right now we\'re at the bus stop.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami berada di perhentian bas.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>1082.96,'end_time'=>1087.62,'target_text'=>'We\'re at this bus stop uh Michelin Posco Apartment.','source_text'=>'Kami berada di hentian bas Apartmen Michelin Posco.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>1087.72,'end_time'=>1090.14,'target_text'=>'We\'re waiting for bus number 333.','source_text'=>'Kami sedang menunggu bas nombor 333.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>1090.24,'end_time'=>1096.42,'target_text'=>'It should be here in about 8 minutes and then that will take us to Seoul Olympic Park.','source_text'=>'Ia sepatutnya tiba dalam masa kira-kira 8 minit dan akan membawa kita ke Taman Olimpik Seoul.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>1096.52,'end_time'=>1102.46,'target_text'=>'And then at Seoul Olympic Park we\'re going to talk about goals, like how to talk about your goals, like maybe for New Year\'s','source_text'=>'Di Taman Olimpik Seoul nanti kita akan berbincang tentang matlamat, cara bercakap tentang azam anda, mungkin sempena Tahun Baharu','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>1102.56,'end_time'=>1105.86,'target_text'=>'you could come up with a New Year\'s resolution after watching this video.','source_text'=>'anda boleh menetapkan azam Tahun Baharu selepas menonton video ini.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>1105.96,'end_time'=>1112.34,'target_text'=>'So, talking about your goals, maybe writing your goals if you want because Olympians are people that are like viewed as people','source_text'=>'Bercerita tentang matlamat anda, mungkin menulisnya jika anda mahu kerana atlet Olimpik dipandang sebagai individu','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>1112.44,'end_time'=>1117.06,'target_text'=>'who have worked very very very very hard their whole life to achieve their goals.','source_text'=>'yang telah bekerja keras sepanjang hidup mereka untuk mencapai impian mereka.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>1117.16,'end_time'=>1122.7,'target_text'=>'And especially like the gold place winners, they have really reached the pinnacle and have achieved their goals.','source_text'=>'Terutamanya pemenang pingat emas yang telah mencapai puncak kejayaan dalam bidang mereka.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>1122.8,'end_time'=>1129.1,'target_text'=>'So, we\'ll talk about goals over there and uh yeah, maybe I\'ll talk about my goals as an example for you guys.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita akan bercerita tentang matlamat di sana dan saya akan kongsikan matlamat saya sebagai contoh untuk anda semua.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>1129.2,'end_time'=>1131.06,'target_text'=>'But yeah, we\'re just waiting at the bus stop.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita hanya perlu menunggu di perhentian bas.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>1131.16,'end_time'=>1138.26,'target_text'=>'Bus should be here soon and then we\'ll head to Seoul Olympic Park and yeah, stick around, guys.','source_text'=>'Bas sepatutnya sampai sebentar lagi dan kita akan terus menuju ke Taman Olimpik Seoul, teruskan menonton ya.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>1138.36,'end_time'=>1139.66,'target_text'=>'Okay, where are we?','source_text'=>'Sekarang di mana kita berada?','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>1139.76,'end_time'=>1141.82,'target_text'=>'>> Right now, we\'re in Olympic Park.','source_text'=>'>> Sekarang kita berada di Taman Olimpik.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>1141.92,'end_time'=>1142.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s just over there.','source_text'=>'Ia berada di sebelah sana.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>1142.76,'end_time'=>1147.86,'target_text'=>'>> So, yeah, Olympic Park is just right there, but we\'re going to stop and grab a quick bite to eat for lunch first here.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, Taman Olimpik berada di situ, tetapi kita akan singgah makan tengah hari sebentar di sini.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>1147.96,'end_time'=>1149.06,'target_text'=>'>> Cuz it\'s already 1:00.','source_text'=>'>> Sebab jam sudah menunjukkan pukul 1:00 petang.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>1149.16,'end_time'=>1150.26,'target_text'=>'>> At Lotteria.','source_text'=>'>> Di restoran Lotteria.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>1150.36,'end_time'=>1151.38,'target_text'=>'So, this is what we\'re going to order.','source_text'=>'Jadi inilah apa yang kami akan pesan.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>1151.48,'end_time'=>1153.1,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to order a storm meal.','source_text'=>'Kami akan memesan hidangan set.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>1153.2,'end_time'=>1155.62,'target_text'=>'Usually, it\'s just called kiosk.','source_text'=>'Biasanya ia dipanggil kiosk pesanan.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>1155.72,'end_time'=>1158.06,'target_text'=>'This right here is just a kiosk where you can order food from.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah kiosk di mana anda boleh membuat pesanan makanan.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>1158.16,'end_time'=>1159.66,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ll order food.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya akan memesan makanan.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>1159.76,'end_time'=>1163.06,'target_text'=>'I think I want just a crispy chicken burger, and it\'s on a discount.','source_text'=>'Saya mahu burger ayam rangup, dan ia ada potongan harga.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>1163.16,'end_time'=>1167.18,'target_text'=>'Oh, dude, I\'m going to get the this one, the chicken burger discounted price.','source_text'=>'Saya akan ambil burger ayam dengan harga promosi ini.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>1167.28,'end_time'=>1168.98,'target_text'=>'Uh no change.','source_text'=>'Tiada perubahan pilihan.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1169.08,'end_time'=>1171.06,'target_text'=>'And then, I\'m just going to go with regular fries.','source_text'=>'Dan saya akan ambil kentang goreng biasa.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1171.16,'end_time'=>1173.86,'target_text'=>'Here, they just say potato, but those are fries.','source_text'=>'Di sini mereka menamakannya \'potato\', tetapi itu adalah kentang goreng (fries).','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>1173.96,'end_time'=>1176.7,'target_text'=>'And I\'ll go with a zero sugar cola.','source_text'=>'Dan saya pilih air kola tanpa gula.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>1176.8,'end_time'=>1179.94,'target_text'=>'Topping selection, do I want to add additional items?','source_text'=>'Pilihan bahan tambahan, adakah saya mahu menambah makanan sampingan?','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>1180.04,'end_time'=>1181.1,'target_text'=>'No, I don\'t.','source_text'=>'Tidak, saya tidak mahu.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>1181.2,'end_time'=>1182.7,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ll say add to cart.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya tekan \'masukkan ke dalam troli\' (add to cart).','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>1182.8,'end_time'=>1184.38,'target_text'=>'>> Have you ever had a shrimp burger here?','source_text'=>'>> Awak pernah makan burger udang di sini?','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>1184.48,'end_time'=>1184.88,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'>> Belum pernah.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>1184.96,'end_time'=>1187.58,'target_text'=>'There\'s There\'s two chicken burgers, but I guess they\'re the same.','source_text'=>'Ada dua pilihan burger ayam, tetapi saya rasa rasanya sama sahaja.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>1187.68,'end_time'=>1189.7,'target_text'=>'Now, I\'m going to go down here to payment.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya beralih ke bahagian pembayaran.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1189.8,'end_time'=>1191.3,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to press the button.','source_text'=>'Saya tekan butang ini.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>1191.4,'end_time'=>1193.26,'target_text'=>'>> Please check the order details.','source_text'=>'>> Sila semak butiran pesanan anda.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>1193.36,'end_time'=>1194.42,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m checking the order details.','source_text'=>'>> Saya sedang menyemak butiran pesanan.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>1194.52,'end_time'=>1195.62,'target_text'=>'Everything looks good.','source_text'=>'Semuanya nampak tepat.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>1195.72,'end_time'=>1197.26,'target_text'=>'Pay on credit card.','source_text'=>'Bayar menggunakan kad kredit.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>1197.36,'end_time'=>1201.62,'target_text'=>'>> Please put your card in the card >> going to take out my card and pay.','source_text'=>'>> Sila masukkan kad anda ke dalam slot >> saya keluarkan kad saya dan buat bayaran.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>1201.72,'end_time'=>1203.1,'target_text'=>'>> Payment has been completed.','source_text'=>'>> Pembayaran telah selesai.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>1203.2,'end_time'=>1204.02,'target_text'=>'>> Payment has been completed.','source_text'=>'>> Pembayaran telah berjaya.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>1204.12,'end_time'=>1205.26,'target_text'=>'Would you like to print a receipt?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda mahu mencetak resit?','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>1205.36,'end_time'=>1206.54,'target_text'=>'>> Receipt.','source_text'=>'>> Resit.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>1206.64,'end_time'=>1209.98,'target_text'=>'Here\'s my number, waiting 191 or 191.','source_text'=>'Ini nombor giliran saya, nombor menunggu 191.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>1210.08,'end_time'=>1212.42,'target_text'=>'So, when my number is called, then I can pick up my food.','source_text'=>'Bila nombor saya dipanggil, saya boleh mengambil makanan saya.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>1212.52,'end_time'=>1213.74,'target_text'=>'But now, Leon\'s going to order.','source_text'=>'Sekarang giliran Leon pula membuat pesanan.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>1213.84,'end_time'=>1215.62,'target_text'=>'Leon\'s going to order same as me.','source_text'=>'Leon akan memesan hidangan yang sama seperti saya.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>1215.72,'end_time'=>1218.22,'target_text'=>'He\'s going to use the kiosk to order his food.','source_text'=>'Dia menggunakan kiosk untuk memesan makanannya.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>1218.32,'end_time'=>1219.46,'target_text'=>'I just got the food.','source_text'=>'Saya baru sahaja mengambil makanan saya.','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>1219.56,'end_time'=>1221.14,'target_text'=>'This is a tray, a red tray.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah dulang, dulang berwarna merah.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>1221.24,'end_time'=>1223.72,'target_text'=>'These right here are my fries,','source_text'=>'Ini adalah kentang goreng saya,','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>1224.08,'end_time'=>1227.62,'target_text'=>'my chicken burger, a packet of ketchup, and napkins.','source_text'=>'burger ayam saya, sepaket sos tomato, dan tisu.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>1227.72,'end_time'=>1230.86,'target_text'=>'And this right here is my my drink.','source_text'=>'Dan ini adalah minuman saya.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>1230.96,'end_time'=>1233.74,'target_text'=>'There is a lot of ice in here, a lot of ice.','source_text'=>'Banyak ais dalam cawan ini, ais yang sangat banyak.','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>1233.84,'end_time'=>1237.44,'target_text'=>'But this is my drink, Pepsi Zero.','source_text'=>'Tetapi ini minuman saya, Pepsi Zero.','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>1237.76,'end_time'=>1239.1,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it doesn\'t taste that good.','source_text'=>'Rasanya tidak berapa sedap.','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>1239.2,'end_time'=>1240.38,'target_text'=>'Usually, lime lime is fine.','source_text'=>'Biasanya perisa limau nipis okay sahaja.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>1240.48,'end_time'=>1241.62,'target_text'=>'Like, I don\'t mind lime.','source_text'=>'Saya tak kisah dengan perisa limau.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>1241.72,'end_time'=>1244.34,'target_text'=>'Just tastes a little bit Like, you can really taste the healthiness in it.','source_text'=>'Rasanya seperti... anda boleh rasa ia minuman diet yang tawar.','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>1244.44,'end_time'=>1249.66,'target_text'=>'The Pepsi tastes a little bit off, but it might just be me cuz I got zero sugar, but I don\'t really drink Pepsi that much,','source_text'=>'Rasa Pepsi ini agak pelik sedikit, tapi mungkin kerana saya pilih versi tanpa gula dan saya jarang minum Pepsi,','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>1249.76,'end_time'=>1252.94,'target_text'=>'so I don\'t really know what it normally tastes like, but I\'ll still drink it, obviously.','source_text'=>'jadi saya tidak berapa ingat rasa asalnya, tapi saya tetap akan minumnya.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1253.04,'end_time'=>1257.94,'target_text'=>'But yeah, we\'re going to finish eating this, and then we\'re going to go see the Olympic Park across the street.','source_text'=>'Kami akan habiskan makanan ini, dan kemudian kami akan pergi melawat Taman Olimpik di seberang jalan.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1258.04,'end_time'=>1260.42,'target_text'=>'This is my my burger, the chicken burger.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah burger saya, burger ayam.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1260.52,'end_time'=>1261.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually quite good.','source_text'=>'Rasanya sangat sedap sebenarnya.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1261.76,'end_time'=>1267.1,'target_text'=>'I think Lotteria redeemed themselves cuz last time I had a beef burger here, and it was really not good.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa Lotteria berjaya menebus rasa kecewa saya kerana kali terakhir saya makan burger daging di sini, rasanya kurang memuaskan.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1267.2,'end_time'=>1270.24,'target_text'=>'But, this chicken burger is really good.','source_text'=>'Tetapi burger ayam kali ini memang sangat sedap.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1270.88,'end_time'=>1271.86,'target_text'=>'This is busting.','source_text'=>'Memang padu rasanya.','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1271.96,'end_time'=>1273.7,'target_text'=>'And it was really cheap, so double win.','source_text'=>'Harganya pun sangat murah, untung berganda.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1273.8,'end_time'=>1276.82,'target_text'=>'Now, I\'m going to throw my garbage and stuff.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya akan membuang sampah dan sisa makanan saya.','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1276.92,'end_time'=>1281.22,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to put my ice in a separate area, and put the tray also in a separate area.','source_text'=>'Saya akan buang ais di tempat khas dan letakkan dulang di tempat berasingan.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1281.32,'end_time'=>1281.98,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Mari kita kemas.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1282.08,'end_time'=>1283.94,'target_text'=>'This is where you throw your stuff out here.','source_text'=>'Di sinilah tempat membuang sisa makanan.','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>1284.04,'end_time'=>1285.78,'target_text'=>'This is made just for ice.','source_text'=>'Salur ini dikhaskan untuk membuang baki ais.','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>1285.88,'end_time'=>1289.5,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never seen this in any other country, but in Korea, yes.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pernah melihat sistem ini di negara lain, tetapi di Korea ia disediakan.','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>1289.6,'end_time'=>1291.46,'target_text'=>'And then you put the cup on the side there.','source_text'=>'Kemudian letakkan cawan di bahagian tepi sana.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>1291.56,'end_time'=>1293.8,'target_text'=>'Then you put the waste','source_text'=>'Kemudian masukkan sisa sampah','order'=>460],
            ['start_time'=>1293.96,'end_time'=>1296,'target_text'=>'right in there.','source_text'=>'tepat ke dalam tong ini.','order'=>461],
            ['start_time'=>1296.16,'end_time'=>1299.1,'target_text'=>'Just like that, and then the tray goes on top.','source_text'=>'Begitu caranya, dan kemudian dulang diletakkan di bahagian atas.','order'=>462],
            ['start_time'=>1299.2,'end_time'=>1302.9,'target_text'=>'Use some napkins to clean my hands, and now I\'m going to go to the washroom and wash my hands.','source_text'=>'Gunakan tisu untuk mengelap tangan saya, dan sekarang saya akan ke tandas untuk mencuci tangan.','order'=>463],
            ['start_time'=>1303,'end_time'=>1305.1,'target_text'=>'But, we\'ll see you guys at the Olympic Park.','source_text'=>'Kita jumpa sebentar lagi di Taman Olimpik.','order'=>464],
            ['start_time'=>1305.2,'end_time'=>1307.3,'target_text'=>'We are in like','source_text'=>'Kita kini berada di...','order'=>465],
            ['start_time'=>1307.4,'end_time'=>1309.66,'target_text'=>'>> [laughter] >> We\'re in like the center of Seoul right now.','source_text'=>'>> [ketawa] >> Kita berada tepat di pusat bandar Seoul sekarang.','order'=>466],
            ['start_time'=>1309.76,'end_time'=>1312.3,'target_text'=>'Huge high-rise buildings all around us.','source_text'=>'Bangunan pencakar langit yang tinggi mengelilingi kita di merata tempat.','order'=>467],
            ['start_time'=>1312.4,'end_time'=>1317.78,'target_text'=>'And dude, these roads, these aren\'t even highways, they\'re just regular roads, but they\'re like six lanes.','source_text'=>'Kawan, jalan raya ini bukan lebuh raya, ia cuma jalan biasa tetapi mempunyai enam lorong.','order'=>468],
            ['start_time'=>1317.88,'end_time'=>1319.54,'target_text'=>'I saw 12 lanes total.','source_text'=>'Saya nampak 12 lorong secara keseluruhan.','order'=>469],
            ['start_time'=>1319.64,'end_time'=>1320.1,'target_text'=>'Just huge.','source_text'=>'Sangat luas. Di mana gerejanya?','order'=>470],
            ['start_time'=>1320.2,'end_time'=>1320.94,'target_text'=>'Where\'s the church?','source_text'=>'>> Nampak palang salib di atas sana?','order'=>471],
            ['start_time'=>1321.04,'end_time'=>1322.18,'target_text'=>'>> See the cross up there?','source_text'=>'>> Oh ya, di sebelah sana.','order'=>472],
            ['start_time'=>1322.28,'end_time'=>1323.18,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah, over there.','source_text'=>'>> Seluruh bangunan itu adalah gereja.','order'=>473],
            ['start_time'=>1323.28,'end_time'=>1324.34,'target_text'=>'>> That whole building is a church.','source_text'=>'Yang ada banyak struktur runcing itu ke?','order'=>474],
            ['start_time'=>1324.44,'end_time'=>1325.66,'target_text'=>'Like with all the pointy stuff?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya nampak.','order'=>475],
            ['start_time'=>1325.76,'end_time'=>1326.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I see it.','source_text'=>'>> Keseluruhan bangunan kaca itu adalah sebuah gereja.','order'=>476],
            ['start_time'=>1326.6,'end_time'=>1327.7,'target_text'=>'>> That whole glass building is a church.','source_text'=>'>> gereja kaca.','order'=>477],
            ['start_time'=>1327.8,'end_time'=>1328.86,'target_text'=>'>> glass church.','source_text'=>'Hebat sungguh.','order'=>478],
            ['start_time'=>1328.96,'end_time'=>1329.58,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Tepat di hadapan kita ini adalah Taman Olimpik Seoul.','order'=>479],
            ['start_time'=>1329.68,'end_time'=>1332.58,'target_text'=>'But, yeah, this right in front of us is Seoul Olympic Park.','source_text'=>'Baiklah kawan-kawan, seperti yang anda lihat, ada penghadang dinding yang menghalang kita daripada masuk terus ke Taman Olimpik.','order'=>480],
            ['start_time'=>1332.68,'end_time'=>1339.66,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys, so as you can see, there is this wall blocking us from going through to the Olympic Park.','source_text'=>'Struktur ini berada tepat di hadapan kita, tetapi saya rasa mereka akan memasang laluan air di tepi, jadi kawasan tepat','order'=>481],
            ['start_time'=>1339.76,'end_time'=>1345.3,'target_text'=>'So, this is right in front of us, this thing, but I guess they\'re going to be putting water on the side, so the area right','source_text'=>'di belakang dinding ini sedang dalam pembinaan.','order'=>482],
            ['start_time'=>1345.4,'end_time'=>1347.5,'target_text'=>'behind this wall is under construction right now.','source_text'=>'Beginilah rupanya apabila ia siap kelak.','order'=>483],
            ['start_time'=>1347.6,'end_time'=>1349.66,'target_text'=>'But, yeah, this is what it\'ll look like when it\'s done.','source_text'=>'Buat masa ini kita berada di sini.','order'=>484],
            ['start_time'=>1349.76,'end_time'=>1351.54,'target_text'=>'But, yeah, right now we\'re right here.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa hanya kawasan ini yang terlibat dengan pembinaan, jadi kita tidak boleh lalu di situ tetapi kita akan pusing mengikut jalan lain.','order'=>485],
            ['start_time'=>1351.64,'end_time'=>1356.1,'target_text'=>'I think just this area is under construction, so we can\'t go there, but we\'ll go around it now.','source_text'=>'>> Apa maksud papan tanda ini?','order'=>486],
            ['start_time'=>1356.2,'end_time'=>1357.06,'target_text'=>'>> What does this sign say?','source_text'=>'Sekarang Leon mengeluarkan telefonnya dan menggunakan Google Translate untuk mengambil gambar papan tanda ini dan menterjemahkannya.','order'=>487],
            ['start_time'=>1357.16,'end_time'=>1363.1,'target_text'=>'So, now Leon\'s taking out his phone and using Google Translate to take a picture of this sign and translate it.','source_text'=>'Stesen ke arah sana.','order'=>488],
            ['start_time'=>1363.2,'end_time'=>1364.46,'target_text'=>'The station\'s that way.','source_text'=>'Oh, stesen kereta api.','order'=>489],
            ['start_time'=>1364.56,'end_time'=>1365.5,'target_text'=>'Oh, the station.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ia tertulis, \'Kami memohon maaf atas kesulitan.','order'=>490],
            ['start_time'=>1365.6,'end_time'=>1367.98,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it says, \"We apologize for the inconvenience.','source_text'=>'Stesen Hansung Baekje ke arah sana.\' >> Baiklah, jadi stesen berada di sebelah bawah sana.','order'=>491],
            ['start_time'=>1368.08,'end_time'=>1371.7,'target_text'=>'The Honk-so station\'s that way.\" >> Okay, so the station\'s down over here.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita sudah berada di dalam Taman Olimpik, kita berjaya masuk.','order'=>492],
            ['start_time'=>1371.8,'end_time'=>1374.1,'target_text'=>'We\'re in the Olympic Park right now, so we got in.','source_text'=>'Taman ini memang bersaiz gergasi.','order'=>493],
            ['start_time'=>1374.2,'end_time'=>1376.02,'target_text'=>'The park is It really is massive.','source_text'=>'Pintu masuknya sangat cantik.','order'=>494],
            ['start_time'=>1376.12,'end_time'=>1377.18,'target_text'=>'The entrance was really nice.','source_text'=>'Malangnya kita tidak dapat lalu di pintu masuk utama tadi.','order'=>495],
            ['start_time'=>1377.28,'end_time'=>1378.82,'target_text'=>'Unfortunately, we could not go in.','source_text'=>'Ini sebuah arca yang menarik.','order'=>496],
            ['start_time'=>1378.92,'end_time'=>1380.42,'target_text'=>'This is a nice sculpture.','source_text'=>'Kawasan ini berada di laluan menurun (decline).','order'=>497],
            ['start_time'=>1380.52,'end_time'=>1384.18,'target_text'=>'This right here is on a decline.','source_text'=>'Laluan ini menurun ke bawah.','order'=>498],
            ['start_time'=>1384.28,'end_time'=>1385.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s on a decline.','source_text'=>'Laluan landai ini condong ke bawah.','order'=>499],
            ['start_time'=>1385.12,'end_time'=>1388.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s slanted downwards.','source_text'=>'Laluan landai ini.','order'=>500],
            ['start_time'=>1388.16,'end_time'=>1389.22,'target_text'=>'This ramp.','source_text'=>'Oh, nampak seperti buah epal di sana.','order'=>501],
            ['start_time'=>1389.32,'end_time'=>1392.3,'target_text'=>'Oh, it looks like those are apples and those are apples.','source_text'=>'>> Buah pisang kaki (persimmons)?','order'=>502],
            ['start_time'=>1392.4,'end_time'=>1393.02,'target_text'=>'>> Persimmons?','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>503],
            ['start_time'=>1393.12,'end_time'=>1393.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yep.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi buah-buah itu kelihatan seperti sudah busuk dan mereput.','order'=>504],
            ['start_time'=>1393.64,'end_time'=>1396.18,'target_text'=>'>> But they\'re kind of like a rotten, decomposing.','source_text'=>'Buah pisang kaki itu sedang mereput.','order'=>505],
            ['start_time'=>1396.28,'end_time'=>1398.58,'target_text'=>'Those persimmons are decomposing.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya rasa ini sebuah karya seni.','order'=>506],
            ['start_time'=>1398.68,'end_time'=>1399.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I think this is an art piece.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, jadi mereka ada pelbagai jenis karya seni di serata tempat.','order'=>507],
            ['start_time'=>1399.92,'end_time'=>1402.82,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, so they have like different type of art pieces everywhere.','source_text'=>'Menarik sekali.','order'=>508],
            ['start_time'=>1402.92,'end_time'=>1404.66,'target_text'=>'Hmm, interesting.','source_text'=>'Taman ini sangat luas dan saya sebenarnya belum pernah datang ke sini.','order'=>509],
            ['start_time'=>1404.76,'end_time'=>1408.18,'target_text'=>'This park is huge and I\'ve actually never been here.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh lihat ada kafe di dalam taman ini dan sejujurnya saya rasa ada lebih daripada sebuah kafe di sini.','order'=>510],
            ['start_time'=>1408.28,'end_time'=>1413.22,'target_text'=>'But you can see there\'s a cafe inside this park and there\'s probably more than one if I\'m being honest.','source_text'=>'Arca ini merupakan replika buah pisang kaki.','order'=>511],
            ['start_time'=>1413.32,'end_time'=>1417.46,'target_text'=>'But yeah, this one is uh imitation of a persimmon.','source_text'=>'Itulah nama bagi arca ini.','order'=>512],
            ['start_time'=>1417.56,'end_time'=>1419.78,'target_text'=>'That\'s what this is called.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh lihat terdapat sebiji buah pisang kaki di atas huruf S ini.','order'=>513],
            ['start_time'=>1419.88,'end_time'=>1423.66,'target_text'=>'And you can see there\'s a persimmon on top of this S.','source_text'=>'Fakta menarik, saya sebenarnya belum pernah makan buah pisang kaki seumur hidup saya.','order'=>514],
            ['start_time'=>1423.76,'end_time'=>1428.38,'target_text'=>'And fun fact, I\'ve actually never had a persimmon before.','source_text'=>'Saya belum pernah merasainya.','order'=>515],
            ['start_time'=>1428.48,'end_time'=>1429.5,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never had one.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya tidak tahu rasanya bagaimana, sama ada ia rangup, lembut, manis, atau masam.','order'=>516],
            ['start_time'=>1429.6,'end_time'=>1437.22,'target_text'=>'So I don\'t even know what it tastes like and I don\'t know if it\'s crunchy or if it\'s soft or if it\'s sweet, if it\'s sour.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pasti.','order'=>517],
            ['start_time'=>1437.32,'end_time'=>1437.78,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Saya menganggap rasanya manis berdasarkan apa yang saya lihat dalam rancangan memasak.','order'=>518],
            ['start_time'=>1437.88,'end_time'=>1441.1,'target_text'=>'I assume it\'s sweet though based on what I\'ve seen in cooking shows.','source_text'=>'Kawasan di sebelah sini ialah taman arca (sculpture park).','order'=>519],
            ['start_time'=>1441.2,'end_time'=>1444.58,'target_text'=>'So this right here is the sculpture park.','source_text'=>'Taman arca.','order'=>520],
            ['start_time'=>1444.68,'end_time'=>1445.66,'target_text'=>'The sculpture park.','source_text'=>'Kita akan berjalan melintasi arca-arca ini dan terdapat banyak arca di sepanjang taman ini.','order'=>521],
            ['start_time'=>1445.76,'end_time'=>1450.66,'target_text'=>'So you can see we\'ll walk past these ones but there are sculptures all along this park here.','source_text'=>'Yang ini saya kurang faham apa maksudnya.','order'=>522],
            ['start_time'=>1450.76,'end_time'=>1452.14,'target_text'=>'This one I\'m not really sure what that means.','source_text'=>'Mungkin ia seperti mangga kunci yang turun dan mengunci.','order'=>523],
            ['start_time'=>1452.24,'end_time'=>1456.5,'target_text'=>'Oh, maybe it\'s like like a lock like it comes down and locks on.','source_text'=>'>> Macam zip?','order'=>524],
            ['start_time'=>1456.6,'end_time'=>1457.3,'target_text'=>'>> A zipper?','source_text'=>'>> Ya mungkin.','order'=>525],
            ['start_time'=>1457.4,'end_time'=>1457.8,'target_text'=>'>> Yep.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tak nampak macam zip pun, tapi terpulanglah pada pandangan awak.','order'=>526],
            ['start_time'=>1457.84,'end_time'=>1459.66,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t see that but if you say so.','source_text'=>'Ada satu lagi arca di sebelah sana.','order'=>527],
            ['start_time'=>1459.76,'end_time'=>1461.7,'target_text'=>'There\'s another sculpture there.','source_text'=>'Dua orang tanpa mata dan kepala.','order'=>528],
            ['start_time'=>1461.8,'end_time'=>1466.46,'target_text'=>'Two people with their eyes and head','source_text'=>'hilang.','order'=>529],
            ['start_time'=>1466.56,'end_time'=>1467.1,'target_text'=>'gone.','source_text'=>'Arca-arca ini tidak melambangkan sesuatu secara harfiah, ia bergantung pada tafsiran anda sendiri dan itulah tujuan seni.','order'=>530],
            ['start_time'=>1467.2,'end_time'=>1472.7,'target_text'=>'They\'re not sculptures of anything literal but maybe it\'s just your interpretation of how you see it and that\'s the point','source_text'=>'Kecuali yang ini, arca ini sangat jelas kelihatan seperti struktur tulang kaki tetapi dalam bentuk yang berbeza.','order'=>531],
            ['start_time'=>1472.8,'end_time'=>1473.34,'target_text'=>'of it.','source_text'=>'>> Macam penari gelek.','order'=>532],
            ['start_time'=>1473.44,'end_time'=>1479.62,'target_text'=>'Except for this one, this one\'s pretty obviously the bones of your feet but they\'re kind of shaped differently.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, cara kedudukan kakinya nampak tidak semula jadi.','order'=>533],
            ['start_time'=>1479.72,'end_time'=>1480.78,'target_text'=>'>> They\'re like belly dancers.','source_text'=>'Walaupun jika seseorang berdiri menjengket dengan hujung jari kaki.','order'=>534],
            ['start_time'=>1480.88,'end_time'=>1484.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it looks like someone It doesn\'t look natural the way they\'re standing.','source_text'=>'Bagi diri saya secara peribadi, saya bukanlah peminat tegar seni abstrak atau seni interpretatif...','order'=>535],
            ['start_time'=>1484.96,'end_time'=>1486.82,'target_text'=>'Even if they\'re standing on their tippy-toes.','source_text'=>'apakah istilah yang betul untuk menggambarkan seni yang tidak mewakili objek nyata?','order'=>536],
            ['start_time'=>1486.92,'end_time'=>1494.38,'target_text'=>'Me personally, like I\'m not a huge fan of interpretive art or like uh how would What\'s the proper way to describe art that','source_text'=>'>> Seni moden.','order'=>537],
            ['start_time'=>1494.48,'end_time'=>1496.5,'target_text'=>'isn\'t like a specific like thing?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, seni moden.','order'=>538],
            ['start_time'=>1496.6,'end_time'=>1497.3,'target_text'=>'>> Modern.','source_text'=>'Saya kurang meminati seni moden kerana maknanya bergantung kepada tafsiran masing-masing.','order'=>539],
            ['start_time'=>1497.4,'end_time'=>1498.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I guess like modern art.','source_text'=>'Saya lebih menyukai seni klasik, seperti seni era Renaissance dengan lukisan manusia yang indah di mana','order'=>540],
            ['start_time'=>1498.64,'end_time'=>1503.14,'target_text'=>'I\'m not really a huge fan of modern art since like it\'s up to your interpretation of what you see.','source_text'=>'anda tahu dengan jelas apa yang digambarkan.','order'=>541],
            ['start_time'=>1503.24,'end_time'=>1511.58,'target_text'=>'I prefer uh like older art, like Renaissance art where it\'s like beautiful paintings of people and like different things where','source_text'=>'Bagi saya karya seperti itu sangat indah.','order'=>542],
            ['start_time'=>1511.68,'end_time'=>1513.62,'target_text'=>'you clearly know what it is.','source_text'=>'Arca ini ada keindahannya yang tersendiri, cuma ia bukan kegemaran saya (not my cup of tea).','order'=>543],
            ['start_time'=>1513.72,'end_time'=>1515.02,'target_text'=>'That I think is really beautiful.','source_text'=>'Ia bukan citarasa saya.','order'=>544],
            ['start_time'=>1515.12,'end_time'=>1520.66,'target_text'=>'This is beautiful in its own way, but it\'s just not my cup of tea.','source_text'=>'Bukan minat saya.','order'=>545],
            ['start_time'=>1520.76,'end_time'=>1521.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s not my cup of tea.','source_text'=>'Ia bukan sesuatu yang benar-benar menarik minat atau perhatian saya.','order'=>546],
            ['start_time'=>1521.6,'end_time'=>1522.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s not my thing.','source_text'=>'Kita akan pergi melihat papan peta ini, tetapi saya perasan ada sarang burung di atas pokok.','order'=>547],
            ['start_time'=>1522.68,'end_time'=>1526.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s not something that really interests me or gets my attention.','source_text'=>'Satu kelebihan bila daun-daun berguguran ialah anda boleh melihat sarang burung dengan jelas pada dahan pokok.','order'=>548],
            ['start_time'=>1526.68,'end_time'=>1531.1,'target_text'=>'Okay, we\'re going to go check out this map, but I noticed there\'s a bird nest in the tree.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah peta penuh Taman Olimpik.','order'=>549],
            ['start_time'=>1531.2,'end_time'=>1536.06,'target_text'=>'That\'s one thing about uh when all the leaves fall, you can see all the birds nests in the trees.','source_text'=>'Di sinilah tempat kita bermula tadi.','order'=>550],
            ['start_time'=>1536.16,'end_time'=>1540.34,'target_text'=>'Anyways, if you come here, this is the map of the Olympic Park.','source_text'=>'Ingat tak, laluan tadi ditutup dengan dinding sementara untuk kerja pembinaan.','order'=>551],
            ['start_time'=>1540.44,'end_time'=>1541.98,'target_text'=>'This is where we started.','source_text'=>'Saya sebenarnya teringin sangat lalu di situ.','order'=>552],
            ['start_time'=>1542.08,'end_time'=>1547.3,'target_text'=>'Remember, it was closed off with that wall, the temporary wall for construction.','source_text'=>'Malangnya kita tidak dapat melaluinya.','order'=>553],
            ['start_time'=>1547.4,'end_time'=>1548.62,'target_text'=>'I really wanted to walk through here.','source_text'=>'Namun begitu, taman ini sangat besar.','order'=>554],
            ['start_time'=>1548.72,'end_time'=>1550.66,'target_text'=>'Unfortunately, we could not.','source_text'=>'Saya percaya hanya kawasan pintu masuk itu sahaja yang ditutup dengan bendera dan penghadang.','order'=>555],
            ['start_time'=>1550.76,'end_time'=>1552.54,'target_text'=>'However, the park is very big.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita berada di sini.','order'=>556],
            ['start_time'=>1552.64,'end_time'=>1557.86,'target_text'=>'I believe it was just this area that was blocked off with the flags and everything.','source_text'=>'Kita masuk melalui sini dan kini berada di sini, dan kita akan terus berjalan ke arah ini kemudian','order'=>557],
            ['start_time'=>1557.96,'end_time'=>1560.1,'target_text'=>'But now we are right here, I believe.','source_text'=>'berjalan melalui laluan tengah.','order'=>558],
            ['start_time'=>1560.2,'end_time'=>1566.58,'target_text'=>'So, we enter through here, and now we\'re right here, and we\'re going to keep on walking down here until we get here, and then','source_text'=>'Bila kita sampai di kawasan bangunan-bangunan ini, kita akan bercerita tentang matlamat.','order'=>559],
            ['start_time'=>1566.68,'end_time'=>1567.82,'target_text'=>'walk down the middle.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan berjalan buat masa ini.','order'=>560],
            ['start_time'=>1567.92,'end_time'=>1572.74,'target_text'=>'Yeah, once we get around here, maybe where these buildings are, we\'ll talk about goals.','source_text'=>'Seperti yang anda tahu, Sukan Olimpik telah diadakan di Taman Olimpik Seoul ini pada tahun 1988, Sukan Olimpik Musim Panas 1988.','order'=>561],
            ['start_time'=>1572.84,'end_time'=>1574.3,'target_text'=>'Let\'s keep on walking for now though.','source_text'=>'Dan ini adalah salah satu arena sukan tersebut.','order'=>562],
            ['start_time'=>1574.4,'end_time'=>1583.58,'target_text'=>'So, as you guys know, the Olympics were held here in Seoul in the Seoul Olympic Park in 1988, the Summer Olympics here, 1988.','source_text'=>'Inilah salah satu arena yang digunakan semasa temasya Olimpik dahulu.','order'=>563],
            ['start_time'=>1583.68,'end_time'=>1585.34,'target_text'=>'And this is one of the arenas.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pasti acara sukan apa yang berlangsung di sini, tetapi ia berbentuk arena bulat, dan kita akan melihat banyak lagi arena lain sebentar lagi.','order'=>564],
            ['start_time'=>1585.44,'end_time'=>1588.46,'target_text'=>'This is one of the arenas that were used during the Olympics.','source_text'=>'Sangat menarik.','order'=>565],
            ['start_time'=>1588.56,'end_time'=>1594.46,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure what sport this was in here or what sports, but it looks like a circular arena, but we\'re about to see a bunch','source_text'=>'Saya sangka Sukan Olimpik di sini dianjurkan baru-baru ini sekitar tahun 2000-an, tetapi ia diadakan pada tahun 1988,','order'=>566],
            ['start_time'=>1594.56,'end_time'=>1596.62,'target_text'=>'more arenas, but uh yeah, super nice.','source_text'=>'namun semua bangunannya masih kelihatan sangat elok.','order'=>567],
            ['start_time'=>1596.72,'end_time'=>1603.66,'target_text'=>'And I thought the Olympics were more recent, like in the 2000s here at least, but uh the Olympics were here in 1988, but all','source_text'=>'Ia tidak nampak terlalu usang, dan tamannya terjaga dengan sangat rapi.','order'=>568],
            ['start_time'=>1603.76,'end_time'=>1606.1,'target_text'=>'the buildings and stuff look quite nice still.','source_text'=>'Mari kita teruskan perjalanan.','order'=>569],
            ['start_time'=>1606.2,'end_time'=>1608.86,'target_text'=>'They don\'t look too old, and the park looks well maintained.','source_text'=>'Di sini anda boleh melihat dua lagi arena sukan.','order'=>570],
            ['start_time'=>1608.96,'end_time'=>1609.58,'target_text'=>'Let\'s continue.','source_text'=>'Arena yang itu bersaiz tersangat besar.','order'=>571],
            ['start_time'=>1609.68,'end_time'=>1612.62,'target_text'=>'Here, you can see two more arenas.','source_text'=>'KSPO Dome.','order'=>572],
            ['start_time'=>1612.72,'end_time'=>1614.78,'target_text'=>'That arena is really, really big.','source_text'=>'Dan arena yang ini pula lebih kecil sedikit.','order'=>573],
            ['start_time'=>1614.88,'end_time'=>1616.74,'target_text'=>'The KSPO Dome.','source_text'=>'Berjalan di sini sambil membayangkan betapa ramainya orang yang memenuhi kawasan ini pada tahun 1988','order'=>574],
            ['start_time'=>1616.84,'end_time'=>1618.54,'target_text'=>'And this arena is a little bit smaller.','source_text'=>'sungguh mengujakan.','order'=>575],
            ['start_time'=>1618.64,'end_time'=>1625.34,'target_text'=>'But the This is actually really cool walking through here and just imagining how many people would have been here in 1988','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ia pasti tempat yang amat meriah untuk menyaksikan Sukan Olimpik, terutamanya temasya Olimpik Musim Panas.','order'=>576],
            ['start_time'=>1625.44,'end_time'=>1626.06,'target_text'=>'just packed.','source_text'=>'Arena di sebelah sini dahulunya digunakan untuk acara lawan pedang (fencing) dan bola baling (handball) Olimpik.','order'=>577],
            ['start_time'=>1626.16,'end_time'=>1632.58,'target_text'=>'I think it would be a really nice place to come and see the Olympics, especially during the summer, the summer Olympics.','source_text'=>'Dan bangunan ini dahulunya sebuah gimnasium.','order'=>578],
            ['start_time'=>1632.68,'end_time'=>1636.7,'target_text'=>'So, this arena right here was used for Olympic fencing and Olympic handball.','source_text'=>'Dan arena besar di sebelah sana itu, KSPO Dome.','order'=>579],
            ['start_time'=>1636.8,'end_time'=>1638.78,'target_text'=>'And this was a gymnasium.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah arena terbesar di seluruh Taman Olimpik ini.','order'=>580],
            ['start_time'=>1638.88,'end_time'=>1641.22,'target_text'=>'And that arena, the big boy, the KSP.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah arena yang paling besar.','order'=>581],
            ['start_time'=>1641.32,'end_time'=>1643.94,'target_text'=>'This is the biggest arena in the Olympic Park.','source_text'=>'Dan arena ini dahulunya digunakan untuk acara gimnastik Olimpik.','order'=>582],
            ['start_time'=>1644.04,'end_time'=>1645.02,'target_text'=>'This is the biggest arena.','source_text'=>'Seluruh arena ini dikhaskan untuk gimnastik Olimpik.','order'=>583],
            ['start_time'=>1645.12,'end_time'=>1649.5,'target_text'=>'And this is now used or this was used for Olympic gymnastics.','source_text'=>'Dan kini ia digunakan terutamanya untuk konsert berskala besar, acara mega, konsert K-pop, dan persembahan antarabangsa.','order'=>584],
            ['start_time'=>1649.6,'end_time'=>1652.5,'target_text'=>'So, this whole arena was just Olympic gymnastics.','source_text'=>'Itulah fungsi utama arena ini sekarang.','order'=>585],
            ['start_time'=>1652.6,'end_time'=>1661.02,'target_text'=>'And now it\'s mainly used for large concerts, large-scale events, K-pop concerts, and international pop-up shows.','source_text'=>'Tetapi dahulunya ia adalah gelanggang gimnastik Olimpik.','order'=>586],
            ['start_time'=>1661.12,'end_time'=>1663.5,'target_text'=>'That\'s what this arena right here is mainly used for.','source_text'=>'Sangat menarik sejarahnya.','order'=>587],
            ['start_time'=>1663.6,'end_time'=>1666.54,'target_text'=>'But before, it was just Olympic gymnastics.','source_text'=>'Mari kita teruskan berjalan.','order'=>588],
            ['start_time'=>1666.64,'end_time'=>1668.22,'target_text'=>'That is quite interesting.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kawan-kawan, saya akan paparkan gambar 10 sukan Olimpik musim panas terbesar satu demi satu di skrin.','order'=>589],
            ['start_time'=>1668.32,'end_time'=>1670.06,'target_text'=>'Let\'s Let\'s keep going.','source_text'=>'Khusus untuk sukan musim panas sahaja.','order'=>590],
            ['start_time'=>1670.16,'end_time'=>1675.9,'target_text'=>'So, now guys, I\'m going to put an image on screen of the 10 biggest Olympic sports one by one.','source_text'=>'Dan saya mahu anda semua meneka nama sukan tersebut.','order'=>591],
            ['start_time'=>1676,'end_time'=>1677.82,'target_text'=>'Obviously, just the summer ones.','source_text'=>'Ini untuk melatih bahasa Inggeris anda bagi melihat sama ada anda tahu nama sukan-sukan ini dalam bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>592],
            ['start_time'=>1677.92,'end_time'=>1681.22,'target_text'=>'And I want you guys to guess the name of the sport.','source_text'=>'Yang pertama.','order'=>593],
            ['start_time'=>1681.32,'end_time'=>1686.62,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s to practice your English to see if you know what these sports are called, okay?','source_text'=>'Ini adalah olahraga (track and field).','order'=>594],
            ['start_time'=>1686.72,'end_time'=>1688.84,'target_text'=>'First one.','source_text'=>'Olahraga merangkumi acara lari pecut, lari jarak jauh, lari berpagar, lompat jauh, lompat tinggi, lompat bergalah, dan merejam lembing.','order'=>595],
            ['start_time'=>1688.96,'end_time'=>1690.18,'target_text'=>'This is track and field.','source_text'=>'Merejam lembing sangat menyeronokkan.','order'=>596],
            ['start_time'=>1690.28,'end_time'=>1699.38,'target_text'=>'Track and field consists of sprints, you know, distance races, hurdles, long jump, high jump, pole vaulting, javelin.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah menyertai acara merejam lembing semasa di sekolah menengah dan banyak acara lain juga.','order'=>597],
            ['start_time'=>1699.48,'end_time'=>1700.42,'target_text'=>'Javelin was a fun one.','source_text'=>'Itulah yang terkandung dalam sukan olahraga.','order'=>598],
            ['start_time'=>1700.52,'end_time'=>1704.22,'target_text'=>'I used to do javelin javelin in high school and many other ones as well.','source_text'=>'Dan fakta menarik, sukan olahraga sebenarnya sangat popular.','order'=>599],
            ['start_time'=>1704.32,'end_time'=>1706.5,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s what track and field is.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pasti di luar Amerika Utara, tetapi setiap sekolah menengah di Kanada dan Amerika Syarikat mempunyai pasukan olahraga.','order'=>600],
            ['start_time'=>1706.6,'end_time'=>1710.06,'target_text'=>'And also, fun fact, track and field is actually really popular.','source_text'=>'Dan fakta menarik, sukan olahraga sebenarnya sangat popular.','order'=>601],
            ['start_time'=>1710.16,'end_time'=>1715.58,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure about outside of North America, but every high school in North America, Canada, and America, they all have a','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pasti tentang kawasan di luar Amerika Utara, tetapi setiap sekolah menengah di Amerika Utara, Kanada dan Amerika, semuanya mempunyai','order'=>602],
            ['start_time'=>1715.68,'end_time'=>1716.62,'target_text'=>'track and field team.','source_text'=>'pasukan olahraga.','order'=>603],
            ['start_time'=>1716.72,'end_time'=>1721.66,'target_text'=>'And we all do like track and field competitions at least once a year, depending on how good you are.','source_text'=>'Dan kami semua menyertai pertandingan olahraga sekurang-kurangnya sekali setahun, bergantung kepada tahap kebolehan anda.','order'=>604],
            ['start_time'=>1721.76,'end_time'=>1726.3,'target_text'=>'Maybe if you\'re better, you\'ll do more track and field competitions, but it is really popular.','source_text'=>'Mungkin jika anda lebih handal, anda akan menyertai lebih banyak kejohanan olahraga, tetapi ia sememangnya amat popular.','order'=>605],
            ['start_time'=>1726.4,'end_time'=>1727.58,'target_text'=>'Next one.','source_text'=>'Gambar seterusnya.','order'=>606],
            ['start_time'=>1727.68,'end_time'=>1730.18,'target_text'=>'So, the second most popular sport is swimming.','source_text'=>'Sukan kedua paling popular ialah renang (swimming).','order'=>607],
            ['start_time'=>1730.28,'end_time'=>1734.3,'target_text'=>'Me personally, swimming is not really my favorite.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya secara peribadi, renang bukanlah sukan kegemaran saya.','order'=>608],
            ['start_time'=>1734.4,'end_time'=>1738.54,'target_text'=>'I did do swimming for like 5 6 years when I was in school.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah menyertai kelas renang selama kira-kira 5 hingga 6 tahun semasa bersekolah dahulu.','order'=>609],
            ['start_time'=>1738.64,'end_time'=>1741.78,'target_text'=>'So, I do know how to swim pretty well, but I just didn\'t really like swimming.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya tahu berenang dengan agak baik, cuma saya tidak begitu meminatinya.','order'=>610],
            ['start_time'=>1741.88,'end_time'=>1745.26,'target_text'=>'I prefer like a sport in the water like water polo or something.','source_text'=>'Saya lebih suka sukan berpasukan di dalam air seperti polo air (water polo).','order'=>611],
            ['start_time'=>1745.36,'end_time'=>1746.66,'target_text'=>'Water polo is a lot of fun.','source_text'=>'Polo air sangat menyeronokkan.','order'=>612],
            ['start_time'=>1746.76,'end_time'=>1748.74,'target_text'=>'Next image.','source_text'=>'Gambar seterusnya.','order'=>613],
            ['start_time'=>1748.84,'end_time'=>1750.38,'target_text'=>'So, this is football.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah bola sepak (football).','order'=>614],
            ['start_time'=>1750.48,'end_time'=>1754.18,'target_text'=>'People call it football, but in North America we call this soccer.','source_text'=>'Orang ramai memanggilnya \'football\', tetapi di Amerika Utara kami menamakannya \'soccer\'.','order'=>615],
            ['start_time'=>1754.28,'end_time'=>1756.5,'target_text'=>'But, outside of North America people call it football.','source_text'=>'Namun di luar Amerika Utara orang memanggilnya \'football\'.','order'=>616],
            ['start_time'=>1756.6,'end_time'=>1759.46,'target_text'=>'Me personally, not a huge fan of soccer either.','source_text'=>'Saya secara peribadi juga bukanlah peminat tegar bola sepak.','order'=>617],
            ['start_time'=>1759.56,'end_time'=>1760.58,'target_text'=>'I prefer hockey.','source_text'=>'Saya lebih meminati hoki ais.','order'=>618],
            ['start_time'=>1760.68,'end_time'=>1764.28,'target_text'=>'Since I\'m Canadian, hockey number one all day.','source_text'=>'Sebagai orang Kanada, hoki ais sentiasa nombor satu.','order'=>619],
            ['start_time'=>1765.04,'end_time'=>1767.11,'target_text'=>'I like how people walk right beside me.','source_text'=>'Saya suka cara orang berjalan betul-betul di sebelah saya.','order'=>620],
            ['start_time'=>1767.21,'end_time'=>1768.5,'target_text'=>'>> [laughter] >> He was about to hit you.','source_text'=>'>> [ketawa] >> Dia hampir melanggar awak tadi.','order'=>621],
            ['start_time'=>1768.6,'end_time'=>1771.1,'target_text'=>'He had to change course.','source_text'=>'Dia terpaksa menukar laluannya.','order'=>622],
            ['start_time'=>1771.2,'end_time'=>1772.18,'target_text'=>'>> Was he watching?','source_text'=>'>> Dia pandang ke mana tadi?','order'=>623],
            ['start_time'=>1772.28,'end_time'=>1774.42,'target_text'=>'>> No, he was just walking straight.','source_text'=>'>> Tak, dia cuma berjalan lurus sahaja.','order'=>624],
            ['start_time'=>1774.52,'end_time'=>1775.1,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah.','order'=>625],
            ['start_time'=>1775.2,'end_time'=>1777.32,'target_text'=>'Next image.','source_text'=>'Gambar seterusnya.','order'=>626],
            ['start_time'=>1777.72,'end_time'=>1779.42,'target_text'=>'I\'m sure a lot of you guys like this sport.','source_text'=>'Saya pasti ramai antara anda meminati sukan ini.','order'=>627],
            ['start_time'=>1779.52,'end_time'=>1782.22,'target_text'=>'I know this sport is really popular in China as well.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu sukan ini sangat popular di China juga.','order'=>628],
            ['start_time'=>1782.32,'end_time'=>1782.78,'target_text'=>'Basketball.','source_text'=>'Bola keranjang (basketball).','order'=>629],
            ['start_time'=>1782.88,'end_time'=>1783.62,'target_text'=>'I like this sport too.','source_text'=>'Saya juga menyukai sukan ini.','order'=>630],
            ['start_time'=>1783.72,'end_time'=>1784.78,'target_text'=>'It is a lot of fun.','source_text'=>'Ia sangat menyeronokkan.','order'=>631],
            ['start_time'=>1784.88,'end_time'=>1790.34,'target_text'=>'Especially playing a game of pick-up basketball with your friends, maybe a 3 V 3 or or a 2 V 2.','source_text'=>'Terutamanya bermain perlawanan santai bersama kawan-kawan, mungkin perlawanan 3 lawan 3 atau 2 lawan 2.','order'=>632],
            ['start_time'=>1790.44,'end_time'=>1791.82,'target_text'=>'Basketball is a lot of fun.','source_text'=>'Bola keranjang memang seronok.','order'=>633],
            ['start_time'=>1791.92,'end_time'=>1794,'target_text'=>'Next image.','source_text'=>'Gambar seterusnya.','order'=>634],
            ['start_time'=>1794.36,'end_time'=>1796.38,'target_text'=>'This is gymnastics.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah gimnastik (gymnastics).','order'=>635],
            ['start_time'=>1796.48,'end_time'=>1797.18,'target_text'=>'Gymnastics.','source_text'=>'Gimnastik.','order'=>636],
            ['start_time'=>1797.28,'end_time'=>1799.7,'target_text'=>'This is also really really popular.','source_text'=>'Sukan ini juga sangat-sangat popular.','order'=>637],
            ['start_time'=>1799.8,'end_time'=>1802.06,'target_text'=>'I personally have never done gymnastics.','source_text'=>'Secara peribadi saya tidak pernah melakukan gimnastik.','order'=>638],
            ['start_time'=>1802.16,'end_time'=>1807.18,'target_text'=>'I did it a little bit in school when I was in school, but I\'m not that flexible.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah mencubanya sedikit semasa di sekolah dahulu, tetapi badan saya tidak begitu lentur.','order'=>639],
            ['start_time'=>1807.28,'end_time'=>1809.98,'target_text'=>'I think it looks really cool when people are good at gymnastics.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya aksi gimnastik nampak sangat hebat apabila seseorang itu mahir melakukannya.','order'=>640],
            ['start_time'=>1810.08,'end_time'=>1812.28,'target_text'=>'Next one here.','source_text'=>'Sukan yang seterusnya.','order'=>641],
            ['start_time'=>1812.44,'end_time'=>1813.02,'target_text'=>'Tennis.','source_text'=>'Tenis (tennis).','order'=>642],
            ['start_time'=>1813.12,'end_time'=>1816.22,'target_text'=>'I prefer playing table tennis, but tennis is also fun.','source_text'=>'Saya lebih suka bermain pingpong (table tennis), tetapi tenis juga menyeronokkan.','order'=>643],
            ['start_time'=>1816.32,'end_time'=>1818.46,'target_text'=>'Next sport here.','source_text'=>'Sukan seterusnya di sini.','order'=>644],
            ['start_time'=>1818.56,'end_time'=>1819.3,'target_text'=>'Volleyball.','source_text'=>'Bola tampar (volleyball).','order'=>645],
            ['start_time'=>1819.4,'end_time'=>1820.06,'target_text'=>'This is volleyball.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah bola tampar.','order'=>646],
            ['start_time'=>1820.16,'end_time'=>1822.94,'target_text'=>'I played this in high school as well for 3 years.','source_text'=>'Saya juga pernah bermain sukan ini di sekolah menengah selama 3 tahun.','order'=>647],
            ['start_time'=>1823.04,'end_time'=>1823.9,'target_text'=>'Volleyball is fun.','source_text'=>'Bola tampar sangat menyeronokkan.','order'=>648],
            ['start_time'=>1824,'end_time'=>1825.1,'target_text'=>'I like playing volleyball.','source_text'=>'Saya suka bermain bola tampar.','order'=>649],
            ['start_time'=>1825.2,'end_time'=>1827.26,'target_text'=>'Next one.','source_text'=>'Sukan seterusnya.','order'=>650],
            ['start_time'=>1827.36,'end_time'=>1830.86,'target_text'=>'This is similar to volleyball, but this is beach volleyball.','source_text'=>'Ini serupa dengan bola tampar, tetapi ini adalah bola tampar pantai (beach volleyball).','order'=>651],
            ['start_time'=>1830.96,'end_time'=>1833.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s the same, but you\'re just you just play in sand.','source_text'=>'Permainannya sama, cuma anda bermain di atas pasir pantai.','order'=>652],
            ['start_time'=>1833.56,'end_time'=>1835.46,'target_text'=>'Next sport.','source_text'=>'Sukan seterusnya.','order'=>653],
            ['start_time'=>1835.56,'end_time'=>1837.74,'target_text'=>'Can you guys guess this one?','source_text'=>'Boleh anda teka sukan ini?','order'=>654],
            ['start_time'=>1837.84,'end_time'=>1838.66,'target_text'=>'Boxing.','source_text'=>'Tinju (boxing).','order'=>655],
            ['start_time'=>1838.76,'end_time'=>1839.66,'target_text'=>'This is boxing.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah sukan tinju.','order'=>656],
