            ['start_time'=>1900.08,'end_time'=>1907.42,'target_text'=>'So, a good way to structure your goal is to say where you are now, what your goal is, why you want to go there, and how you\'re','source_text'=>'Cara yang baik untuk menyusun matlamat anda ialah menyatakan tahap anda sekarang, apa matlamat anda, mengapa anda mahu mencapainya, dan bagaimana cara','order'=>674],
