            ['start_time'=>179.36,'end_time'=>180.06,'target_text'=>'So, this is a seat.','source_text'=>'Ini tempat duduknya.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>180.16,'end_time'=>181.62,'target_text'=>'They have their own armrest.','source_text'=>'Setiap tempat duduk ada penyandar tangan sendiri.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>181.72,'end_time'=>185.02,'target_text'=>'They also have a hand grip right here to hold on to.','source_text'=>'Ada juga pemegang tangan di sini untuk berpaut.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>185.12,'end_time'=>189.26,'target_text'=>'They have a little pouch here you can store maybe your phone or something there.','source_text'=>'Ada poket kecil di sini untuk letak telefon atau barang lain.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>189.36,'end_time'=>190.58,'target_text'=>'And there\'s more legroom.','source_text'=>'Dan ruang kakinya lebih luas.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>190.68,'end_time'=>193.9,'target_text'=>'And also usually everyone gets a seat in a coach bus.','source_text'=>'Biasanya semua orang dijamin dapat tempat duduk dalam bas persiaran ini.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>194,'end_time'=>200.82,'target_text'=>'In a normal standing bus like you see throughout the city that we\'ve been in, those do not have their own seats for everyone.','source_text'=>'Dalam bas bandar biasa yang selalu kita naik di sekitar bandar, bas itu tiada tempat duduk untuk semua orang.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>200.92,'end_time'=>202.38,'target_text'=>'So, you usually have to stand and stuff.','source_text'=>'Jadi biasanya anda terpaksa berdiri dan sebagainya.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>202.48,'end_time'=>203.14,'target_text'=>'But, yeah.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>203.24,'end_time'=>204.1,'target_text'=>'This is what a coach bus is.','source_text'=>'Inilah dia rupa bas persiaran.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>204.2,'end_time'=>207.14,'target_text'=>'And you also can have air air flow and lights.','source_text'=>'Ada juga corong pendingin hawa dan lampu individu.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>207.24,'end_time'=>207.7,'target_text'=>'But, yeah.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>207.8,'end_time'=>209.46,'target_text'=>'That\'s what a coach bus looks like.','source_text'=>'Begitulah keadaannya di dalam bas ini.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>209.56,'end_time'=>212.16,'target_text'=>'And we\'ll see you guys in Paju.','source_text'=>'Dan jumpa anda nanti di Paju.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>215.44,'end_time'=>217.22,'target_text'=>'Yo, what are you working [music] on?','source_text'=>'Yo, kau tengah buat apa tu?','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>217.32,'end_time'=>220.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, I\'m working on my channel right now.','source_text'=>'>> Yo, aku tengah uruskan saluran YouTube aku sekarang.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>220.36,'end_time'=>221.1,'target_text'=>'I just started.','source_text'=>'Aku baru saja mula.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>221.2,'end_time'=>223.82,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to be posting once [music] a week if you guys want to check it out.','source_text'=>'Aku akan muat naik video seminggu sekali kalau korang nak tengok.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>223.92,'end_time'=>230.14,'target_text'=>'>> So, if you guys want to follow Leon on YouTube, he\'s posting comprehensible input vlogs here No Matter Pedia.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi kalau korang nak ikuti Leon di YouTube, dia ada muat naik vlog input mudah faham di sini, No Matter Pedia.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>230.24,'end_time'=>231.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s in the description.','source_text'=>'Pautannya ada di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>231.68,'end_time'=>236.18,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we\'ve just arrived at a Lotte Premium Outlet here in Paju.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, kami baru saja tiba di Lotte Premium Outlet di Paju.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>236.28,'end_time'=>237.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s like huge.','source_text'=>'Kawasannya sangat luas.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>237.32,'end_time'=>239.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a huge shopping complex.','source_text'=>'Ia sebuah kompleks beli-belah yang tersangat besar.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>239.56,'end_time'=>240.74,'target_text'=>'>> Is it all indoors or outdoors?','source_text'=>'>> Semua kedai dalam bangunan ke atau di luar?','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>240.84,'end_time'=>242.46,'target_text'=>'>> No, no, it\'s indoors and outdoors.','source_text'=>'>> Tak, ada bahagian dalam dan ada bahagian luar.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>242.56,'end_time'=>245.74,'target_text'=>'So, when we walk in there, this whole thing is and it\'s like two separate buildings.','source_text'=>'Bila kita masuk ke sana, keseluruhan kawasan ini terdiri daripada dua bangunan berasingan.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>245.84,'end_time'=>247.1,'target_text'=>'I think there\'s a street in between.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ada jalan raya di bahagian tengahnya.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>247.2,'end_time'=>252.7,'target_text'=>'But, it\'s like imagine a complex like all around shopping and then in the middle it\'s like a grassy area and stuff.','source_text'=>'Bayangkan kompleks beli-belah di sekeliling, dan di bahagian tengahnya ada kawasan padang rumput.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>252.8,'end_time'=>256.94,'target_text'=>'Everything you see from here on out is part of the Lotte Outlet Mall.','source_text'=>'Semua yang anda nampak bermula dari sini ialah sebahagian daripada Lotte Outlet Mall.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>257.04,'end_time'=>257.78,'target_text'=>'So, everything.','source_text'=>'Semuanya sekali.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>257.88,'end_time'=>258.9,'target_text'=>'There are different malls.','source_text'=>'Ada beberapa zon beli-belah berbeza.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>259,'end_time'=>261.42,'target_text'=>'Honestly, we could go to Uniqlo first since it\'s right here.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya kita boleh singgah ke Uniqlo dulu sebab kedainya betul-betul di sini.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>261.52,'end_time'=>262.22,'target_text'=>'Might as well.','source_text'=>'Alang-alang dah sampai.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>262.32,'end_time'=>266.54,'target_text'=>'But, some people park their bikes here on the bike rack.','source_text'=>'Ada orang parkir basikal mereka di rak basikal ini.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>266.64,'end_time'=>268.22,'target_text'=>'>> Kind of cool, actually.','source_text'=>'>> Menarik juga sebenarnya.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>268.32,'end_time'=>270.62,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s like just a lot a lot of shopping.','source_text'=>'>> Memang ada banyak sangat pilihan beli-belah.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>270.72,'end_time'=>273.94,'target_text'=>'I don\'t even know where everything is, but the sports village is over there.','source_text'=>'Saya pun tak tahu kedudukan semua kedai, tapi zon sukan ada di sebelah sana.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>274.04,'end_time'=>275.22,'target_text'=>'So, we\'ll probably end up over there.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita mungkin akan berakhir di sana nanti.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>275.32,'end_time'=>279.22,'target_text'=>'But, let\'s start inside and then we could go through the buildings in a warm area.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom kita mula dari dalam dulu supaya dapat berjalan melalui bangunan yang lebih hangat.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>279.32,'end_time'=>281.94,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s go in here.','source_text'=>'Jom kita masuk ke sini.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>282.04,'end_time'=>284.74,'target_text'=>'And it\'s Monday, so hopefully it\'s not too busy to do some shopping.','source_text'=>'Hari ini hari Isnin, jadi harapnya tak terlalu sesak untuk membeli-belah.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>284.84,'end_time'=>286.74,'target_text'=>'But, everything here should be on a discount.','source_text'=>'Tapi semua barang di sini sepatutnya ada potongan harga.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>286.84,'end_time'=>292.18,'target_text'=>'That\'s like why people come to outlet malls and stuff because outlet malls are like an hour outside of Seoul.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah orang datang ke pusat beli-belah outlet, walaupun lokasinya sejam perjalanan dari luar Seoul.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>292.28,'end_time'=>298.58,'target_text'=>'But, the only reason people come is because stuff is heavily discounted because it\'s like last year\'s stock or they just have','source_text'=>'Satu-satunya sebab orang datang ke sini adalah kerana diskaun yang besar untuk stok tahun lepas atau','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>298.68,'end_time'=>299.74,'target_text'=>'more discounts here.','source_text'=>'promosi diskaun yang lebih banyak.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>299.84,'end_time'=>301.3,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, this is a nice scarf, actually.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, selendang ini cantik juga sebenarnya.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>301.4,'end_time'=>304.62,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s the COS the COS one with the XX.','source_text'=>'Aku rasa ini jenama COS yang ada corak XX tu.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>304.72,'end_time'=>305.66,'target_text'=>'40,000, yeah.','source_text'=>'40,000 Won, ya.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>305.76,'end_time'=>307.06,'target_text'=>'>> COS Oh, right here.','source_text'=>'>> Jenama COS? Oh, di sini.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>307.16,'end_time'=>308.26,'target_text'=>'COS What\'s COS?','source_text'=>'COS? Apa itu COS?','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>308.36,'end_time'=>309.54,'target_text'=>'>> Just a brand.','source_text'=>'>> Cuma satu jenama pakaian.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>309.64,'end_time'=>313.34,'target_text'=>'>> This person I\'ve seen that, but I didn\'t know it was a clothing brand.','source_text'=>'>> Corak orang ni aku pernah nampak, tapi tak tahu pula ia jenama pakaian.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>313.44,'end_time'=>316.34,'target_text'=>'>> No, I think it\'s like a character.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, aku rasa itu macam watak kartun.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>316.44,'end_time'=>318.9,'target_text'=>'Actually, I want to check if they have they have sweatshirts.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya saya nak tengok kalau-kalau mereka ada baju panas (*sweatshirts*).','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>319,'end_time'=>321.94,'target_text'=>'>> What about the quarters at >> I thought it would be warmer in here.','source_text'=>'>> Macam mana dengan baju zip suku tu? >> Saya ingat dalam ni lebih hangat.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>322.04,'end_time'=>323.3,'target_text'=>'I\'m being honest.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>323.4,'end_time'=>325.02,'target_text'=>'So, today we have a couple goals.','source_text'=>'Jadi hari ini kita ada beberapa matlamat.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>325.12,'end_time'=>326.66,'target_text'=>'I want to buy a rain jacket.','source_text'=>'Saya nak beli jaket kalis hujan.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>326.76,'end_time'=>327.58,'target_text'=>'That\'s one thing.','source_text'=>'Itu benda pertama.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>327.68,'end_time'=>329.46,'target_text'=>'I also want to see what kind of shoes they have.','source_text'=>'Saya juga nak tengok jenis kasut yang mereka ada.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>329.56,'end_time'=>331.98,'target_text'=>'Perhaps I\'ll buy a pair of shoes.','source_text'=>'Mungkin saya akan beli sepasang kasut.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>332.08,'end_time'=>332.94,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure yet.','source_text'=>'Saya belum pasti lagi.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>333.04,'end_time'=>336.38,'target_text'=>'A scarf, maybe I want to buy a scarf depending on the price.','source_text'=>'Selendang, mungkin saya nak beli selendang bergantung pada harganya.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>336.48,'end_time'=>339.26,'target_text'=>'If they are discounted, I\'m interested in buying a scarf.','source_text'=>'Kalau ada diskaun, saya berminat nak beli selendang.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>339.36,'end_time'=>341.06,'target_text'=>'On top of that, >> Wait, did you say shoes?','source_text'=>'Selain daripada itu, >> Kejap, kau kata nak beli kasut?','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>341.16,'end_time'=>341.56,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, shoes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kasut.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>341.64,'end_time'=>343.02,'target_text'=>'My shoes are busted.','source_text'=>'Kasut aku dah rosak teruk.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>343.12,'end_time'=>344.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they\'re doesn\'t match with the fit.','source_text'=>'>> Ya lah, kasut tu dah tak padan langsung dengan pakaian kau.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>344.84,'end_time'=>349.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, the fourth thing I\'m interested in is uh a sweatshirt.','source_text'=>'>> Benda keempat yang saya cari ialah baju panas (*sweatshirt*).','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>349.44,'end_time'=>351.46,'target_text'=>'Yeah, but like a nice burgundy sweatshirt.','source_text'=>'Baju panas warna merah \'burgundy\' yang cantik.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>351.56,'end_time'=>356.3,'target_text'=>'And then the last thing, the fifth item, is a gray zip-up sweater.','source_text'=>'Dan benda kelima yang terakhir ialah baju sejuk kelabu berzip.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>356.4,'end_time'=>357.46,'target_text'=>'Gray zip-up sweater.','source_text'=>'Baju sejuk kelabu berzip.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>357.56,'end_time'=>360.02,'target_text'=>'And this is kind of like the sweatshirt I\'m interested in.','source_text'=>'Dan ini seakan-akan baju panas yang saya cari.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>360.12,'end_time'=>361.34,'target_text'=>'Like a nice burgundy.','source_text'=>'Warna merah burgundy yang menarik.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>361.44,'end_time'=>362.86,'target_text'=>'I wonder where this one came from.','source_text'=>'Entah dari mana datangnya baju ini.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>362.96,'end_time'=>364.78,'target_text'=>'Oh yeah, there\'s discounts here.','source_text'=>'Oh ya, ada diskaun di sini.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>364.88,'end_time'=>366.02,'target_text'=>'Oh, that\'s the sweater you want.','source_text'=>'Oh, itu baju sejuk yang kau nak.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>366.12,'end_time'=>368.46,'target_text'=>'No, not the same color.','source_text'=>'Bukan, warnanya tak sama.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>368.56,'end_time'=>371.02,'target_text'=>'This is kind of like similar to a sweatshirt.','source_text'=>'Yang ini agak serupa dengan baju panas.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>371.12,'end_time'=>376.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s more like a long sleeve long sleeve shirt, but this is kind of like what I wanted in this color.','source_text'=>'Lebih kepada baju kemeja lengan panjang, tapi jenis inilah yang saya nak dalam warna ini.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>376.92,'end_time'=>380.22,'target_text'=>'This size is extra large, so maybe that\'s a little bit too big.','source_text'=>'Saiz ini ekstra besar (XL), jadi mungkin agak longgar.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>380.32,'end_time'=>382.7,'target_text'=>'They call this a crew neck sweater.','source_text'=>'Mereka panggil ini baju sejuk leher bulat (*crew neck*).','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>382.8,'end_time'=>383.54,'target_text'=>'I guess so.','source_text'=>'Bolehlah dikatakan begitu.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>383.64,'end_time'=>384.62,'target_text'=>'Crew neck sweater.','source_text'=>'Baju sejuk leher bulat.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>384.72,'end_time'=>387.46,'target_text'=>'But maybe maybe large is more of my size.','source_text'=>'Tapi mungkin saiz L lebih padan dengan badan saya.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>387.56,'end_time'=>388.82,'target_text'=>'And it\'s merino wool.','source_text'=>'Dan bahannya daripada bulu biri-biri merino.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>388.92,'end_time'=>390.82,'target_text'=>'The material is merino wool.','source_text'=>'Bahan kainnya ialah bulu merino.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>390.92,'end_time'=>392.18,'target_text'=>'And it\'s made in Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Dan dibuat di Vietnam.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>392.28,'end_time'=>393.3,'target_text'=>'What if I could try it on?','source_text'=>'Boleh ke kalau saya cuba pakai dulu?','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>393.4,'end_time'=>395.14,'target_text'=>'Does merino wool shrink when you wash it?','source_text'=>'Bulu merino mengecut ke bila dibasuh?','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>395.24,'end_time'=>395.86,'target_text'=>'Oh yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh ya.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>395.96,'end_time'=>397.78,'target_text'=>'It says machine washable.','source_text'=>'Ada tertulis boleh dibasuh dengan mesin.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>397.88,'end_time'=>399.54,'target_text'=>'Oh, then maybe it\'s pre-washed.','source_text'=>'Oh, kalau macam tu mungkin ia sudah siap dicuci awal.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>399.64,'end_time'=>400.62,'target_text'=>'Says machine washable.','source_text'=>'Tertulis boleh dibasuh mesin.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>400.72,'end_time'=>402.94,'target_text'=>'Or do you think it\'s best to get extra large then?','source_text'=>'Atau kau rasa lebih baik aku ambil saiz XL terus?','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>403.04,'end_time'=>404.94,'target_text'=>'Cuz a medium fits me perfect.','source_text'=>'Sebab saiz M memang muat padan dengan aku.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>405.04,'end_time'=>408.34,'target_text'=>'So then I size it up to large for the machine washer.','source_text'=>'Jadi aku besarkan satu saiz ke L untuk persediaan cucian mesin.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>408.44,'end_time'=>411.14,'target_text'=>'Well, I don\'t think it\'s going to shrink that much as long as you don\'t dry it.','source_text'=>'Aku rasa ia tak mengecut banyak sangat selagi kau tak guna mesin pengering.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>411.24,'end_time'=>412.94,'target_text'=>'I usually dry the life out of it.','source_text'=>'Masalahnya aku memang selalu keringkan sampai betul-betul kering.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>413.04,'end_time'=>413.82,'target_text'=>'Let me try both.','source_text'=>'Biar aku cuba kedua-dua saiz.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>413.92,'end_time'=>415.74,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to go see if I can try these on.','source_text'=>'Saya nak pergi tengok kalau boleh cuba baju-baju ini.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>415.84,'end_time'=>416.82,'target_text'=>'Cuz merino wool\'s nice.','source_text'=>'Sebab kain bulu merino ini memang berkualiti.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>416.92,'end_time'=>418.74,'target_text'=>'This makes you like not smell, right?','source_text'=>'Kain jenis ini buat badan tak berbau, kan?','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>418.84,'end_time'=>419.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>419.36,'end_time'=>420.94,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s like a antibacterial.','source_text'=>'>> Ia bersifat antibakteria.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>421.04,'end_time'=>421.86,'target_text'=>'And what does that mean?','source_text'=>'Dan apa maksudnya tu?','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>421.96,'end_time'=>425.98,'target_text'=>'>> Just means that it doesn\'t hold like odors or dirt easily.','source_text'=>'>> Maksudnya ia tak mudah serap bau busuk atau kotoran.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>426.08,'end_time'=>428.98,'target_text'=>'>> So you don\'t like smell dirty and it stays cleaner for longer?','source_text'=>'>> Jadi baju tak berbau busuk dan kekal bersih lebih lama?','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>429.08,'end_time'=>429.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>430,'end_time'=>431.14,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, good to know.','source_text'=>'>> Baguslah kalau macam tu.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>431.24,'end_time'=>432.14,'target_text'=>'Let me see if I can try these on.','source_text'=>'Biar saya cuba pakai baju-baju ini dulu.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>432.24,'end_time'=>432.94,'target_text'=>'Fitting room?','source_text'=>'Bilik persalinan?','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>433.04,'end_time'=>433.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>433.6,'end_time'=>434.18,'target_text'=>'>> Down here.','source_text'=>'>> Di sebelah bawah sini.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>434.28,'end_time'=>435.86,'target_text'=>'And I do have like so many layers.','source_text'=>'Badan saya ada banyak sangat lapisan baju sekarang.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>435.96,'end_time'=>441.26,'target_text'=>'I have this coat, this sweatshirt, and then I have another sweatshirt, and then I have the Heattech underneath.','source_text'=>'Saya pakai kot ini, baju panas ini, sehelai lagi baju panas, dan lapisan Heattech di bahagian dalam.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>441.36,'end_time'=>443.9,'target_text'=>'So I have like one, two, three, four layers.','source_text'=>'Jadi ada dalam satu, dua, tiga, empat lapisan baju.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>444,'end_time'=>446.18,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to go try it on and I\'ll be back out.','source_text'=>'Saya masuk cuba baju dulu dan nanti keluar semula.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>446.28,'end_time'=>447.34,'target_text'=>'>> Want more practice?','source_text'=>'>> Nak lebih banyak latihan?','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>447.44,'end_time'=>454.54,'target_text'=>'Get the workbook for this lesson on my website and review the vocabulary, grammar, and real English from this video.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku kerja pelajaran ini di laman web saya dan ulangkaji kosa kata, tatabahasa, dan bahasa Inggeris harian.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>454.64,'end_time'=>458.38,'target_text'=>'So now I\'m walking through the passageway.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya sedang berjalan melalui laluan jejantas.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>458.48,'end_time'=>459.58,'target_text'=>'Passageway.','source_text'=>'Laluan pejalan kaki berhubung (*passageway*).','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>459.68,'end_time'=>461.38,'target_text'=>'This just connects the two buildings.','source_text'=>'Laluan ini menghubungkan dua buah bangunan.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>461.48,'end_time'=>467.1,'target_text'=>'So as you can see out here, there are from what I can see like six different buildings.','source_text'=>'Dari apa yang saya nampak di luar sini, ada kira-kira enam buah bangunan berbeza.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>467.2,'end_time'=>467.6,'target_text'=>'Come over here.','source_text'=>'Jom ke sini.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>467.68,'end_time'=>469.42,'target_text'=>'There are six different buildings.','source_text'=>'Ada enam buah bangunan berasingan.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>469.52,'end_time'=>471.06,'target_text'=>'Right, we just hit the first one.','source_text'=>'Kita baru saja selesai di bangunan pertama.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>471.16,'end_time'=>474.98,'target_text'=>'There\'s another one right across, but then there\'s four more down there.','source_text'=>'Ada sebuah lagi betul-betul di seberang, dan ada empat lagi di sebelah bawah sana.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>475.08,'end_time'=>477.46,'target_text'=>'Each with a passageway connecting them.','source_text'=>'Setiap satunya dihubungkan dengan laluan jejantas.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>477.56,'end_time'=>481.54,'target_text'=>'So, you see that green part in between over the road?','source_text'=>'Nampak tak binaan hijau di atas jalan raya itu?','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>481.64,'end_time'=>483.74,'target_text'=>'That\'s a passageway connecting the buildings.','source_text'=>'Itulah jejantas yang menghubungkan bangunan-bangunan ini.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>483.84,'end_time'=>486.1,'target_text'=>'And right now we\'re going to enter the Fashionville.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita akan masuk ke Fashionville (Zon Fesyen).','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>486.2,'end_time'=>490.1,'target_text'=>'Over there is Luxuryville and over there is Sports ville.','source_text'=>'Di sebelah sana Luxuryville dan di sana pula Sportsville.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>490.2,'end_time'=>493.26,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re going to hit all of them and see what they have.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita akan lawati semuanya dan tengok apa barang yang ada.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>493.36,'end_time'=>496.62,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s continue to Fashionville down this way.','source_text'=>'Jom teruskan perjalanan ke Fashionville ikut laluan ini.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>496.72,'end_time'=>504.06,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys, we have been into a couple stores like Columbia, Black Yak and stuff to look for a rain jacket, but I haven\'t','source_text'=>'Kami dah masuk ke beberapa kedai seperti Columbia, Black Yak dan lain-lain untuk cari jaket kalis hujan, tapi saya belum','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>504.16,'end_time'=>505.1,'target_text'=>'found a rain jacket.','source_text'=>'jumpa jaket kalis hujan yang sesuai.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>505.2,'end_time'=>507.94,'target_text'=>'They\'re all like very expensive, not really on discount.','source_text'=>'Semuanya sangat mahal dan tiada diskaun menarik.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>508.04,'end_time'=>513.86,'target_text'=>'So, I think the last store we\'ll go check out is Patagonia, but I don\'t think I\'ll be able to get the rain jacket today.','source_text'=>'Kedai terakhir yang kami akan periksa ialah Patagonia, tapi saya rasa macam tak dapat beli jaket hujan hari ini.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>513.96,'end_time'=>520.74,'target_text'=>'Not sure unless Patagonia has a deal on their 3L torrent shell specifically black in large, then I\'ll get that one, but if','source_text'=>'Kecuali kalau Patagonia ada tawaran untuk jaket 3L Torrentshell warna hitam saiz L, barulah saya beli, tapi kalau','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>520.84,'end_time'=>521.62,'target_text'=>'they don\'t, I\'m not sure.','source_text'=>'tiada tawaran itu, saya tak pasti.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>521.72,'end_time'=>527.84,'target_text'=>'Dude, it\'s cold We\'re in the mall right now, but it\'s not heated, so it\'s cold like it\'s chilly.','source_text'=>'Sejuknya. Kita dalam pusat beli-belah sekarang tapi tiada pemanas, jadi cuacanya memang menggigil.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>527.96,'end_time'=>528.62,'target_text'=>'You can see my breath.','source_text'=>'Nampak wap asap nafas saya.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>528.72,'end_time'=>529.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s cold.','source_text'=>'Memang sejuk.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>529.32,'end_time'=>531.3,'target_text'=>'Anyways, go to Patagonia.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, jom ke Patagonia.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>531.4,'end_time'=>533.06,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys, we\'re in New Balance right now.','source_text'=>'Baiklah semua, sekarang kita berada di dalam kedai New Balance.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>533.16,'end_time'=>536.1,'target_text'=>'We\'re looking at shoes and these things are heavily discounted.','source_text'=>'Kami tengah tengok kasut dan kasut di sini ada potongan harga yang sangat besar.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>536.2,'end_time'=>537.18,'target_text'=>'50% off.','source_text'=>'Diskaun 50%.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>537.28,'end_time'=>537.98,'target_text'=>'That\'s a good deal.','source_text'=>'Tawaran yang sangat berbaloi.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>538.08,'end_time'=>542.1,'target_text'=>'But New Balance sells shoes and also other clothing items, but mainly shoes.','source_text'=>'New Balance menjual kasut dan juga pakaian lain, tapi utamanya ialah kasut.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>542.2,'end_time'=>543.94,'target_text'=>'They\'re really popular for their shoes.','source_text'=>'Mereka sangat terkenal dengan kasut-kasut mereka.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>544.04,'end_time'=>544.62,'target_text'=>'Oh, look at these.','source_text'=>'Oh, tengok yang ini.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>544.72,'end_time'=>545.78,'target_text'=>'These things look kind of cool.','source_text'=>'Kasut ini nampak bergaya.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>545.88,'end_time'=>547.9,'target_text'=>'They\'re really popular because they\'re comfortable, right?','source_text'=>'Kasut ini sangat popular sebab selesa, kan?','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>548,'end_time'=>548.4,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>548.4,'end_time'=>550.02,'target_text'=>'They\'re the most comfortable shoes I\'ve owned.','source_text'=>'Ia kasut paling selesa yang pernah aku miliki.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>550.12,'end_time'=>552.18,'target_text'=>'You haven\'t owned any ASICS?','source_text'=>'Kau tak pernah ada kasut ASICS ke?','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>552.28,'end_time'=>552.68,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Pernah.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>552.68,'end_time'=>554.06,'target_text'=>'ASICS gel, very comfortable.','source_text'=>'ASICS Gel memang sangat selesa.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>554.16,'end_time'=>554.66,'target_text'=>'That\'s what I\'ve heard.','source_text'=>'Itulah yang aku dengar.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>554.76,'end_time'=>560.1,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never owned any either, but I would like to own them, but I don\'t see any of their popular styles here.','source_text'=>'Aku pun tak pernah ada, tapi teringin nak beli sepasang, cuma aku tak nampak model popular mereka di sini.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>560.2,'end_time'=>562.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, those 550s are pretty popular.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, model 550 tu agak popular.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>562.48,'end_time'=>563.02,'target_text'=>'>> Where?','source_text'=>'>> Di mana?','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>563.12,'end_time'=>563.86,'target_text'=>'>> On that first row.','source_text'=>'>> Pada baris yang pertama tu.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>563.96,'end_time'=>565.26,'target_text'=>'And here are some 2002s.','source_text'=>'Dan di sini ada model 2002R.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>565.36,'end_time'=>566.34,'target_text'=>'Those are super popular.','source_text'=>'Model tu tersangat popular.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>566.44,'end_time'=>567.14,'target_text'=>'That\'s what I wear.','source_text'=>'Itu model yang aku pakai sekarang.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>567.24,'end_time'=>567.78,'target_text'=>'>> That?','source_text'=>'>> Yang itu?','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>567.88,'end_time'=>568.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that style.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, gaya macam tu.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>568.92,'end_time'=>570.1,'target_text'=>'>> Those things are dad shoes.','source_text'=>'>> Reka bentuk tu macam kasut bapa-bapa (*dad shoes*).','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>570.2,'end_time'=>570.98,'target_text'=>'Is that a good deal?','source_text'=>'Tawaran tu berbaloi ke?','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>571.08,'end_time'=>574.46,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s a good I paid like 240 US dollars for these ones.','source_text'=>'>> Berbaloi sangat, aku dulu bayar kira-kira $240 dolar US untuk kasut ni.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>574.56,'end_time'=>575.26,'target_text'=>'And that\'s a good deal.','source_text'=>'Dan harga di sini memang murah.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>575.36,'end_time'=>576.34,'target_text'=>'>> What?','source_text'=>'>> Apa?','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>576.44,'end_time'=>577.7,'target_text'=>'Dude, why would you even buy those?','source_text'=>'Kenapa kau sanggup beli kasut mahal macam tu?','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>577.8,'end_time'=>578.54,'target_text'=>'>> Actually, it wasn\'t that much.','source_text'=>'>> Sebenarnya tak sampai sebanyak tu.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>578.64,'end_time'=>579.9,'target_text'=>'It was just under 200.','source_text'=>'Kurang sedikit daripada $200.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>580,'end_time'=>580.7,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s a lot.','source_text'=>'>> Banyak tu.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>580.8,'end_time'=>581.94,'target_text'=>'>> It was still a lot though.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi memang masih mahal juga.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>582.04,'end_time'=>584.3,'target_text'=>'But these shoes, these are like the most comfortable.','source_text'=>'Tapi kasut macam ini adalah antara yang paling selesa.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>584.4,'end_time'=>588.5,'target_text'=>'The running ones, especially these like 1080s, these are so comfy.','source_text'=>'Kasut larian terutamanya siri 1080 ini, memang sangat empuk dan selesa.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>588.6,'end_time'=>590.42,'target_text'=>'>> They look cuz look at all this foam.','source_text'=>'>> Nampak empuk sebab tengoklah lapisan kusyen busanya.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>590.52,'end_time'=>595.74,'target_text'=>'It looks like >> And they make an even bigger one, 1280, and that\'s super thick.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam >> Dan mereka ada buat yang lebih besar iaitu 1280, kusyennya sangat tebal.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>595.84,'end_time'=>596.24,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'>> Wah.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>596.32,'end_time'=>597.42,'target_text'=>'They\'re down there actually.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya kasut tu ada di bahagian bawah sana.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>597.52,'end_time'=>599.14,'target_text'=>'>> I can see why they would be comfortable.','source_text'=>'>> Patutlah ia sangat selesa dipakai.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>599.24,'end_time'=>601.62,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, the more so this is the thickest one you can get.','source_text'=>'>> Ini versi tapak paling tebal yang boleh anda dapat.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>601.72,'end_time'=>604.66,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, these things will make you like 2 in taller.','source_text'=>'>> Kasut ni boleh buat ketinggian kau naik 2 inci.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>604.76,'end_time'=>605.5,'target_text'=>'That\'s crazy.','source_text'=>'Luar biasa betul.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>605.6,'end_time'=>606,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>606.08,'end_time'=>609.1,'target_text'=>'>> I had a pair 2 years ago and they were crazy comfortable.','source_text'=>'>> Aku pernah ada sepasang 2 tahun lepas dan rasanya luar biasa selesa.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>609.2,'end_time'=>610.7,'target_text'=>'>> actually look really comfortable.','source_text'=>'>> Memang nampak sangat selesa.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>610.8,'end_time'=>613.5,'target_text'=>'>> If you look from like the top down, they\'re so big.','source_text'=>'>> Kalau tengok dari atas ke bawah, nampak besar sangat saiznya.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>613.6,'end_time'=>614,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>614.04,'end_time'=>615.78,'target_text'=>'>> So they were like really big shoes on me.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi bila aku pakai nampak macam kasut gergasi.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>615.88,'end_time'=>618.7,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, like I can see like looks super comfortable.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, aku boleh nampak ia memang nampak sangat selesa.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>618.8,'end_time'=>619.9,'target_text'=>'Wow, look at that.','source_text'=>'Wah, tengoklah tu.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>620,'end_time'=>620.58,'target_text'=>'>> And what are these for?','source_text'=>'>> Dan kasut ini untuk apa?','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>620.68,'end_time'=>621.34,'target_text'=>'Running?','source_text'=>'Untuk berlari ke?','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>621.44,'end_time'=>621.84,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>621.88,'end_time'=>622.7,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, let\'s bounce then.','source_text'=>'>> Jomlah kita gerak kalau macam tu.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>622.8,'end_time'=>625.1,'target_text'=>'I\'m not going to buy shoes today, especially running shoes.','source_text'=>'Saya tak jadi beli kasut hari ini, terutamanya kasut lari.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>625.2,'end_time'=>626.42,'target_text'=>'These really look like dad shoes.','source_text'=>'Kasut ini memang nampak macam kasut orang tua.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>626.52,'end_time'=>628.3,'target_text'=>'>> And these are like the super discounts on the back.','source_text'=>'>> Dan di rak belakang ini ada diskaun berganda.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>628.4,'end_time'=>630.46,'target_text'=>'So it tells you right here your your size.','source_text'=>'Ada ditunjukkan saiz kasut anda di sini.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>630.56,'end_time'=>631.54,'target_text'=>'>> Heavily discounted.','source_text'=>'>> Potongan harga yang sangat banyak.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>631.64,'end_time'=>632.22,'target_text'=>'>> Over here?','source_text'=>'>> Di sebelah sini ke?','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>632.32,'end_time'=>635.34,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m like 9 and 1/2, so I\'d be 275 in Korea.','source_text'=>'>> Saiz saya 9 setengah, jadi saiz Korea ialah 275.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>635.44,'end_time'=>638.92,'target_text'=>'>> UK 9, European 42.5.','source_text'=>'>> Saiz UK 9, Eropah 42.5.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>639.16,'end_time'=>639.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>639.96,'end_time'=>644.06,'target_text'=>'>> I kind of want to find the food court, so we\'re going to use this map to find it.','source_text'=>'>> Saya nak cari medan selera, jadi kita guna peta panduan ini untuk mencarinya.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>644.16,'end_time'=>645.14,'target_text'=>'How do we even start?','source_text'=>'Macam mana kita nak mula cari ni?','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>645.24,'end_time'=>647.44,'target_text'=>'Food and beverage.','source_text'=>'Makanan dan minuman (*Food and beverage*).','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>648.76,'end_time'=>650.54,'target_text'=>'Luxury Village Chinese Restaurant.','source_text'=>'Restoran Cina di Luxury Village.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>650.64,'end_time'=>652.38,'target_text'=>'Wonder if they have like an actual food court.','source_text'=>'Tertanya-tanya juga kalau mereka ada medan selera yang sebenar.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>652.48,'end_time'=>653.22,'target_text'=>'Let\'s head to that mall then.','source_text'=>'Jom kita pergi ke zon bangunan itu kalau begitu.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>653.32,'end_time'=>655.34,'target_text'=>'I think we can go through a passageway up here.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kita boleh lalu jejantas di tingkat atas ini.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>655.44,'end_time'=>660.14,'target_text'=>'So let\'s go up the escalators, cross the passageway, and then find the food court in Luxury Village.','source_text'=>'Jom kita naik eskalator, seberang jejantas, dan cari medan selera di Luxury Village.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>660.24,'end_time'=>660.82,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>660.92,'end_time'=>663.22,'target_text'=>'Down there, that\'s where the parking garage is.','source_text'=>'Di bawah sana ialah tempat letak kereta bertingkat.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>663.32,'end_time'=>666.74,'target_text'=>'Parking garage or parking lot or parking area.','source_text'=>'Garaj parkir, tempat letak kereta, atau kawasan parkir.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>666.84,'end_time'=>670.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s where our people park their vehicles, down there in the basement.','source_text'=>'Di situlah orang meletakkan kenderaan mereka, di tingkat bawah tanah.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>670.36,'end_time'=>673.18,'target_text'=>'We\'re uh going through this walkway to Luxury Village.','source_text'=>'Kami sedang melalui laluan pejalan kaki ini menuju ke Luxury Village.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>673.28,'end_time'=>674.38,'target_text'=>'And Luxury Village looks huge.','source_text'=>'Dan zon Luxury Village nampak tersangat besar.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>674.48,'end_time'=>675.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s like that whole building.','source_text'=>'Kawasan sebesar keseluruhan bangunan itu.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>675.76,'end_time'=>677.38,'target_text'=>'Sports Village is that building there.','source_text'=>'Sports Village pula ialah bangunan di sebelah sana.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>677.48,'end_time'=>679.7,'target_text'=>'First building we were at was the Youth Culture Village.','source_text'=>'Bangunan pertama yang kita pergi tadi ialah Youth Culture Village.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>679.8,'end_time'=>681.5,'target_text'=>'And we\'ve just finished [music] at Fashion Village.','source_text'=>'Dan kita baru saja selesai di Fashion Village.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>681.6,'end_time'=>684.42,'target_text'=>'So we\'ve completed two out of four buildings.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita sudah selesai melawat dua daripada empat buah bangunan.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>684.52,'end_time'=>686.42,'target_text'=>'Fashion Village also goes down over there.','source_text'=>'Fashion Village juga memanjang ke bahagian bawah sana.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>686.52,'end_time'=>687.22,'target_text'=>'Did we go there?','source_text'=>'Kita ada pergi sana ke tadi?','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>687.32,'end_time'=>689.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that\'s where they had the NEPA.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, di situlah ada kedai NEPA tadi.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>689.48,'end_time'=>689.94,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, NEPA.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, kedai NEPA.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>690.04,'end_time'=>690.44,'target_text'=>'Yeah, okay.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>690.52,'end_time'=>692.74,'target_text'=>'But I think the biggest one is luxury bill.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya rasa zon paling besar ialah Luxuryville.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>692.84,'end_time'=>694.3,'target_text'=>'People must love their luxury.','source_text'=>'Orang ramai memang gemar barangan mewah.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>694.4,'end_time'=>701.26,'target_text'=>'I see Mont Blanc, Coach, bunch of other ones, but the food court is over here apparently, so let\'s see if we can get it.','source_text'=>'Saya nampak Mont Blanc, Coach, dan banyak lagi, tapi medan selera rupanya di sebelah sini, jom kita cari.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>701.36,'end_time'=>705.06,'target_text'=>'There\'s literally a stream going through this shopping complex.','source_text'=>'Memang ada aliran sungai buatan yang merentasi kompleks beli-belah ini.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>705.16,'end_time'=>706.7,'target_text'=>'This outlet mall, it\'s so big.','source_text'=>'Pusat beli-belah ini sangat luas.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>706.8,'end_time'=>709.3,'target_text'=>'And there\'s a lot of apartments in the background there.','source_text'=>'Dan ada banyak pangsapuri di bahagian latar belakang sana.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>709.4,'end_time'=>711.42,'target_text'=>'And I have an announcement for you guys.','source_text'=>'Dan saya ada satu pengumuman untuk anda semua.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>711.52,'end_time'=>716.7,'target_text'=>'I\'ll be posting my shadowing stories on my second channel, Volka.','source_text'=>'Saya akan muat naik cerita shadowing saya di saluran kedua saya, Volka.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>716.8,'end_time'=>722.3,'target_text'=>'The link to my channel will be in the description, so make sure to subscribe and watch videos there.','source_text'=>'Pautan ke saluran saya ada di ruangan penerangan, jadi pastikan anda langgan dan tonton video di sana.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>722.4,'end_time'=>726.74,'target_text'=>'So we\'re in the food court right now, and that is a revolving sushi restaurant.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita berada di medan selera, dan itu ialah restoran sushi berputar.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>726.84,'end_time'=>727.7,'target_text'=>'We\'re not going to get that.','source_text'=>'Kita tak akan makan di situ.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>727.8,'end_time'=>732.86,'target_text'=>'We\'re in the food courts, and we\'re going to look at every restaurant to see what they have, and then decide what we want','source_text'=>'Kita berada di medan selera, dan kita akan lihat setiap gerai makanan untuk tengok menunya sebelum buat pilihan','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>732.96,'end_time'=>733.36,'target_text'=>'to eat.','source_text'=>'makanan.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>733.44,'end_time'=>736.46,'target_text'=>'Unless we see something good right off the bat, but let\'s keep on looking.','source_text'=>'Melainkan kalau kita nampak makanan yang sedap serta-merta, tapi jom kita teruskan mencari.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>736.56,'end_time'=>737.66,'target_text'=>'We have our food here.','source_text'=>'Makanan kita dah siap.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>737.76,'end_time'=>739.06,'target_text'=>'This is bulgogi.','source_text'=>'Ini bulgogi.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>739.16,'end_time'=>744.7,'target_text'=>'This is a big bowl of rice, and then you know, my sides kimchi, radish, salad, and then this like soup.','source_text'=>'Ini semangkuk besar nasi, dan hidangan sampingan saya seperti kimchi, lobak putih, salad, serta sup ini.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>744.8,'end_time'=>749.7,'target_text'=>'We\'re at the food court now, and we just ordered our food, and we had to go pick it up, and then we brought it back here,','source_text'=>'Kami berada di medan selera sekarang, kami baru memesan makanan, mengambilnya sendiri, dan membawanya ke meja ini,','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>749.8,'end_time'=>752.22,'target_text'=>'and now we\'re ready to eat lunch at the food court.','source_text'=>'dan sekarang kami sedia untuk menikmati makan tengah hari di medan selera.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>752.32,'end_time'=>753.46,'target_text'=>'The food court is pretty small.','source_text'=>'Medan selera ini agak kecil saiznya.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>753.56,'end_time'=>759.86,'target_text'=>'There wasn\'t a lot of options or variety, but this looked like this was something everyone was getting, so we decided to get','source_text'=>'Pilihan menunya tak banyak sangat, tapi nampaknya hidangan ini yang paling ramai orang pesan, jadi kami pun pesan','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>759.96,'end_time'=>760.5,'target_text'=>'this.','source_text'=>'menu ini.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>760.6,'end_time'=>763.9,'target_text'=>'Leon got the same thing, but you can see this is squid, right?','source_text'=>'Leon pesan hidangan yang sama, tapi anda boleh nampak ini sotong, kan?','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>764,'end_time'=>764.32,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>764.32,'end_time'=>766.9,'target_text'=>'So he got squid in his, and yeah, this is what we\'re going to eat.','source_text'=>'Jadi hidangannya ada sotong, dan ya, inilah yang kami akan makan.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>767,'end_time'=>772.1,'target_text'=>'And then after this, I think we\'ll go to the very final building, which is the sports bill.','source_text'=>'Dan selepas ini saya rasa kita akan pergi ke bangunan yang terakhir iaitu Sportsville.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>772.2,'end_time'=>773.22,'target_text'=>'So stick around, guys.','source_text'=>'Jadi jangan ke mana-mana semua.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>773.32,'end_time'=>776.24,'target_text'=>'We\'ll see you at the sports bill.','source_text'=>'Kita jumpa di Sportsville nanti.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>779.2,'end_time'=>785.46,'target_text'=>'So we just ate, but now we\'re walking on the very top floor of this building, and there are dinosaur statues here.','source_text'=>'Kami baru saja lepas makan, dan sekarang kami berjalan di tingkat paling atas bangunan ini dan ada patung dinosaur di sini.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>785.56,'end_time'=>786.14,'target_text'=>'Dinosaurs.','source_text'=>'Dinosaur.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>786.24,'end_time'=>786.9,'target_text'=>'Is that snow?','source_text'=>'Itu salji ke?','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>787,'end_time'=>788.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, and there\'s snow on the ground.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ada salji di atas tanah.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>788.68,'end_time'=>789.38,'target_text'=>'>> Oh my gosh.','source_text'=>'>> Ya ampun.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>789.48,'end_time'=>790.62,'target_text'=>'>> it\'s been snowing lately.','source_text'=>'>> Kebelakangan ini salji memang selalu turun.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>790.72,'end_time'=>794.26,'target_text'=>'But yeah, Tyrannosaurus Rex, the Tyrannosaurus Rex.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, Tyrannosaurus Rex, patung T-Rex.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>794.36,'end_time'=>794.98,'target_text'=>'Oh, and look at that one.','source_text'=>'Oh, dan tengok yang itu pula.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>795.08,'end_time'=>795.94,'target_text'=>'I didn\'t even see him.','source_text'=>'Saya tak perasan pun tadi.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>796.04,'end_time'=>798.38,'target_text'=>'Look at his huge, long neck.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah lehernya yang sangat panjang dan besar.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>798.48,'end_time'=>802.26,'target_text'=>'But uh let\'s go to Toys R Us, cuz didn\'t they go bankrupt in North America?','source_text'=>'Tapi jom kita tengok Toys R Us, sebab bukankah mereka dah muflis di Amerika Utara?','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>802.36,'end_time'=>803.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, in Canada.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, di Kanada.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>803.36,'end_time'=>805.06,'target_text'=>'Or actually no, in the US.','source_text'=>'Atau sebenarnya di Amerika Syarikat.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>805.16,'end_time'=>806.5,'target_text'=>'>> There\'s Toys R Us there.','source_text'=>'>> Ada kedai Toys R Us di sana.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>806.6,'end_time'=>813.1,'target_text'=>'>> A little the And I remember going to Toys \"R\" Us when I was younger, but now I think they\'re most of them are closed down','source_text'=>'>> Saya ingat lagi pergi ke Toys \"R\" Us masa zaman kanak-kanak, tapi sekarang rasanya kebanyakan cawangan dah ditutup','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>813.2,'end_time'=>816.54,'target_text'=>'now in Canada because the company went bankrupt.','source_text'=>'di Kanada sekarang sebab syarikat itu telah muflis.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>816.64,'end_time'=>823.14,'target_text'=>'Toys \"R\" Us went bankrupt, so they closed a lot of locations, but I haven\'t seen a Toys \"R\" Us in many, many, many, many years.','source_text'=>'Toys \"R\" Us muflis jadi banyak cawangan ditutup, dan saya sudah bertahun-tahun tak nampak kedai Toys \"R\" Us.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>823.24,'end_time'=>825.46,'target_text'=>'But I do want to walk into this Toys \"R\" Us.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya teringin juga nak masuk ke dalam Toys \"R\" Us ini.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>825.56,'end_time'=>828.46,'target_text'=>'Yeah, actually there\'s a sign that says no filming, so we\'re not going to go in there.','source_text'=>'Tapi ada papan tanda dilarang merakam video, jadi kita tak boleh masuk ke dalam.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>828.56,'end_time'=>830.06,'target_text'=>'We\'ll just go down instead.','source_text'=>'Kita turun ke bawah sajalah.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>830.16,'end_time'=>831.06,'target_text'=>'No filming.','source_text'=>'Dilarang merakam.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>831.16,'end_time'=>832.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they knew you were coming.','source_text'=>'>> Nampaknya mereka dah tahu kau nak datang.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>832.68,'end_time'=>833.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I guess so.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, mungkinlah.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>833.84,'end_time'=>835.14,'target_text'=>'We can see what they have here.','source_text'=>'Kita boleh tengok apa yang ada di luar sini.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>835.24,'end_time'=>836.58,'target_text'=>'Those kind of look like Legos.','source_text'=>'Barang itu nampak macam Lego.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>836.68,'end_time'=>837.98,'target_text'=>'>> I think they do have Legos, too.','source_text'=>'>> Aku rasa mereka ada jual Lego juga.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>838.08,'end_time'=>838.74,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, probably.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, mungkin juga.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>838.84,'end_time'=>840.58,'target_text'=>'And that\'s Nike Nike kids.','source_text'=>'Dan itu kedai Nike Kanak-kanak.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>840.68,'end_time'=>841.22,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go down.','source_text'=>'Jom kita turun.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>841.32,'end_time'=>846.54,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go to the very last part, which is over there, which is the Sport Hill.','source_text'=>'Jom kita pergi ke bahagian terakhir iaitu Sportsville di sebelah sana.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>846.64,'end_time'=>847.58,'target_text'=>'Let me see what they have there.','source_text'=>'Biar saya tengok apa yang ada di sana.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>847.68,'end_time'=>851.26,'target_text'=>'I I know there\'s a huge Nike store on the other side.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu ada kedai Nike yang sangat besar di seberang sana.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>851.36,'end_time'=>852.38,'target_text'=>'>> Are you a Nike boy?','source_text'=>'>> Kau peminat tegar Nike ke?','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>852.48,'end_time'=>854.14,'target_text'=>'>> Not really a big Nike fan, to be honest.','source_text'=>'>> Sejujurnya aku bukan peminat tegar Nike.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>854.24,'end_time'=>855.14,'target_text'=>'>> that Nike tech?','source_text'=>'>> Minat sut Nike Tech tu ke?','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>855.24,'end_time'=>856.62,'target_text'=>'>> I would wear the Nike tech.','source_text'=>'>> Aku suka juga pakai Nike Tech.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>856.72,'end_time'=>858.78,'target_text'=>'>> These guys make some really good clothes, too.','source_text'=>'>> Jenama ini buat pakaian yang sangat berkualiti juga.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>858.88,'end_time'=>863.86,'target_text'=>'But it\'s more like guys like suits and like >> But I\'m kind of looking for like those slip-on leather shoes.','source_text'=>'Tapi ini lebih kepada sut lelaki >> Tapi aku sebenarnya tengah cari kasut kulit jenis sarung (*slip-on*).','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>863.96,'end_time'=>869.5,'target_text'=>'>> Like these guys will sell These guys make like like hunting style outdoor gear, like >> Yeah, these stores are more like','source_text'=>'>> Kedai ini jual kelengkapan luar gaya memburu >> Ya, kedai ini lebih kepada','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>869.6,'end_time'=>872.58,'target_text'=>'formal fashion, which is not really my style.','source_text'=>'fesyen formal, yang bukan gaya saya sangat.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>872.68,'end_time'=>876.02,'target_text'=>'Although I would like Those look like the Margiela','source_text'=>'Walaupun saya suka reka bentuk yang nampak macam Margiela itu.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>876.12,'end_time'=>876.58,'target_text'=>'Gats.','source_text'=>'Model GATs.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>876.68,'end_time'=>878.38,'target_text'=>'>> This is the Margiela store.','source_text'=>'>> Ini kedai Margiela.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>878.48,'end_time'=>880.3,'target_text'=>'>> Sunglasses store.','source_text'=>'>> Kedai cermin mata hitam.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>880.4,'end_time'=>882.2,'target_text'=>'>> Africa.','source_text'=>'>> Kedai kaca mata.','order'=>376],
