            ['start_time'=>306.68,'end_time'=>311.94,'target_text'=>'So, here we have our soup, our pho, and these are chopsticks.','source_text'=>'Jadi di sini kita ada sup kita, iaitu pho, dan ini ialah penyepit (*chopsticks*).','order'=>76],
