            ['start_time'=>353.32,'end_time'=>354.86,'target_text'=>'Can you eat spicy food?','source_text'=>'Bolehkah anda makan makanan pedas?','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>354.96,'end_time'=>358.58,'target_text'=>'I love eating spicy food and I think I handle it well.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat suka makan makanan pedas dan saya rasa saya boleh tahan pedas dengan baik.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>358.68,'end_time'=>363.38,'target_text'=>'Some people may disagree, but in my opinion, I could eat anything spicy.','source_text'=>'Mungkin ada orang tak setuju, tapi pada pandangan saya, saya boleh makan apa saja yang pedas.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>363.48,'end_time'=>364.26,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>364.36,'end_time'=>367.14,'target_text'=>'There\'s a piece of lime as well.','source_text'=>'Ada sepotong limau nipis juga.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>367.24,'end_time'=>373.22,'target_text'=>'>> I think we can uh open up all the dishes, have them all here, and you guys can see all the dishes.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa kita boleh buka semua hidangan, letak di sini, dan anda semua boleh tengok semuanya.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>373.32,'end_time'=>377.78,'target_text'=>'I\'ll bring you guys a little bit closer so you can also enjoy the view.','source_text'=>'Saya akan bawa anda lebih dekat supaya anda pun boleh nikmati pemandangannya.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>377.88,'end_time'=>381.42,'target_text'=>'>> English open doors to jobs, friendships, travel, and more.','source_text'=>'>> Bahasa Inggeris membuka peluang pekerjaan, persahabatan, melancong, dan banyak lagi.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>381.52,'end_time'=>387.34,'target_text'=>'The only thing standing in your way is daily speaking practice, and most people don\'t have someone to practice with every','source_text'=>'Satu-satunya halangan ialah latihan bertutur harian, dan kebanyakan orang tiada teman berlatih setiap','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>387.44,'end_time'=>388.62,'target_text'=>'single day.','source_text'=>'hari.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>388.72,'end_time'=>390.42,'target_text'=>'That\'s where Easy Speak AI helps.','source_text'=>'Di situlah Easy Speak AI dapat membantu.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>390.52,'end_time'=>393.54,'target_text'=>'Real speaking practice anytime, anywhere.','source_text'=>'Latihan pertuturan sebenar pada bila-bila masa dan di mana jua.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>393.64,'end_time'=>399.18,'target_text'=>'With 12 plus AI tutors, you pick the vibe, friendly, professional, or casual.','source_text'=>'Dengan lebih 12 tutor AI, anda boleh pilih suasananya: mesra, profesional, atau santai.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>399.28,'end_time'=>400.82,'target_text'=>'Lessons are practical.','source_text'=>'Pelajaran yang sangat praktikal.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>400.92,'end_time'=>406.3,'target_text'=>'Real travel situations, everyday conversations, and phrases you\'ll actually use in your daily life.','source_text'=>'Situasi perjalanan sebenar, perbualan harian, dan frasa yang benar-benar anda gunakan dalam kehidupan harian.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>406.4,'end_time'=>407.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s for every level.','source_text'=>'Sesuai untuk semua tahap kemahiran.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>407.72,'end_time'=>411.9,'target_text'=>'Easy Speak assesses your level during conversations and recommends what to practice.','source_text'=>'Easy Speak menilai tahap anda semasa berbual dan mencadangkan perkara yang perlu dilatih.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>412,'end_time'=>417.46,'target_text'=>'Every topic has beginner, intermediate, and advanced versions with level-appropriate phrases.','source_text'=>'Setiap topik ada versi permulaan, pertengahan, dan lanjutan dengan frasa yang bersesuaian dengan tahap anda.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>417.56,'end_time'=>421.38,'target_text'=>'And now you can learn English and Spanish depending on your goals.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang anda boleh belajar bahasa Inggeris dan Sepanyol mengikut matlamat anda.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>421.48,'end_time'=>423.1,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s have a live demo.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita saksikan demonstrasi secara langsung.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>423.2,'end_time'=>426.66,'target_text'=>'Hey Ava, it just started raining and I\'m having trouble finding my taxi driver.','source_text'=>'Hai Ava, hujan baru saja turun dan saya sukar mencari pemandu teksi saya.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>426.76,'end_time'=>427.46,'target_text'=>'Could you help me?','source_text'=>'Boleh tolong saya?','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>427.56,'end_time'=>429.06,'target_text'=>'>> Hello, this is your driver.','source_text'=>'>> Halo, ini pemandu anda.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>429.16,'end_time'=>431.34,'target_text'=>'I\'m stuck behind a blue van near the corner.','source_text'=>'Saya tersekat di belakang sebuah van biru berhampiran selekoh.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>431.44,'end_time'=>432.02,'target_text'=>'Can you see me?','source_text'=>'Bolehkah anda nampak saya?','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>432.12,'end_time'=>435.18,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m standing right outside of the east entrance here.','source_text'=>'>> Saya sedang berdiri betul-betul di luar pintu masuk timur di sini.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>435.28,'end_time'=>437.78,'target_text'=>'>> Excellent job communicating your location.','source_text'=>'>> Bagus sekali cara anda memaklumkan lokasi anda.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>437.88,'end_time'=>440.82,'target_text'=>'Are you standing right next to the big glass doors at that entrance?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda berdiri betul-betul di sebelah pintu kaca besar di pintu masuk itu?','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>440.92,'end_time'=>444.02,'target_text'=>'>> No, actually I\'m standing right in front of the H&M logo.','source_text'=>'>> Tidak, sebenarnya saya berdiri betul-betul di hadapan logo H&M.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>444.12,'end_time'=>444.86,'target_text'=>'Do you see me?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda nampak saya?','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>444.96,'end_time'=>447.34,'target_text'=>'>> Great job being so specific.','source_text'=>'>> Bagus kerana memberikan maklumat yang sangat spesifik.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>447.44,'end_time'=>452.5,'target_text'=>'Instead of H&M logo, it sounds even more natural to say the H&M storefront.','source_text'=>'Daripada menyebut logo H&M, kedengaran lebih semula jadi jika menyebut \'H&M storefront\' (hadapan kedai H&M).','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>452.6,'end_time'=>455.62,'target_text'=>'Do you see my white Toyota with the hazard lights on right across the street?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda nampak kereta Toyota putih saya dengan lampu kecemasan bernyala betul-betul di seberang jalan?','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>455.72,'end_time'=>460.22,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m looking across the street, but I don\'t see a white Toyota with hazard lights on.','source_text'=>'>> Saya sedang melihat ke seberang jalan, tetapi saya tidak nampak Toyota putih dengan lampu kecemasan terpasang.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>460.32,'end_time'=>464.02,'target_text'=>'It is very busy today and there are a lot of vehicles on the road.','source_text'=>'Keadaan sangat sibuk hari ini dan terdapat banyak kenderaan di atas jalan raya.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>464.12,'end_time'=>466.1,'target_text'=>'>> That was a perfect description of the scene.','source_text'=>'>> Itu huraian keadaan yang sangat sempurna.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>466.2,'end_time'=>470.14,'target_text'=>'Instead of on the road, you could say stuck in traffic for more detail.','source_text'=>'Daripada menyebut \'on the road\', anda boleh sebut \'stuck in traffic\' untuk lebih terperinci.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>470.24,'end_time'=>472.1,'target_text'=>'Do you see a car pulling up near the bus stop now?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda nampak sebuah kereta sedang berhenti berhampiran perhentian bas sekarang?','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>472.2,'end_time'=>473.38,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, actually, yeah, I do.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ya, sebenarnya saya nampak.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>473.48,'end_time'=>474.1,'target_text'=>'Is that you?','source_text'=>'Adakah itu anda?','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>474.2,'end_time'=>479.3,'target_text'=>'The tutor responds naturally, corrects you fast, and helps you speak more smoothly.','source_text'=>'Tutor ini membalas secara semula jadi, membetulkan kesilapan dengan cepat, dan membantu anda bertutur dengan lebih lancar.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>479.4,'end_time'=>485.82,'target_text'=>'The review tab saves your phrases, vocabulary, mistakes, and shows your progress over time.','source_text'=>'Tab semakan menyimpan frasa, kosa kata, kesilapan anda, dan memaparkan kemajuan anda dari semasa ke semasa.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>485.92,'end_time'=>487.7,'target_text'=>'5 minutes a day adds up.','source_text'=>'5 minit sehari lama-lama akan terkumpul.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>487.8,'end_time'=>494.18,'target_text'=>'Over time, you can build your confidence, have smoother conversations, and hesitate less when it really matters.','source_text'=>'Lama-kelamaan, anda boleh membina keyakinan, berbual dengan lebih lancar, dan kurang teragak-agak bila diperlukan.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>494.28,'end_time'=>499.3,'target_text'=>'If you want to try it, download EasySpeak AI using the link in my description or pinned comment.','source_text'=>'Jika anda mahu mencubanya, muat turun EasySpeak AI menggunakan pautan di penerangan atau komen yang disematkan.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>499.4,'end_time'=>501.86,'target_text'=>'Thank you, EasySpeak, for sponsoring today\'s video.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih kepada EasySpeak kerana menaja video hari ini.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>501.96,'end_time'=>505.1,'target_text'=>'Okay, so, what other dishes do we have to prepare here?','source_text'=>'Baiklah, apakah hidangan lain yang perlu kita sediakan di sini?','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>505.2,'end_time'=>506.62,'target_text'=>'>> We have the bún chả.','source_text'=>'>> Kita ada bun cha.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>506.72,'end_time'=>511.14,'target_text'=>'>> Uh, so here, you can see this is a Styrofoam bowl.','source_text'=>'>> Di sini anda boleh nampak ini mangkuk polistirena (*Styrofoam*).','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>511.24,'end_time'=>513.34,'target_text'=>'The other bowl was a cardboard bowl.','source_text'=>'Mangkuk yang satu lagi tadi ialah mangkuk kadbod.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>513.44,'end_time'=>515.3,'target_text'=>'This is a Styrofoam bowl.','source_text'=>'Ini mangkuk polistirena.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>515.4,'end_time'=>521.34,'target_text'=>'One thing I would like to say is you can never put this in a microwave because it will catch on fire.','source_text'=>'Satu perkara penting: jangan sekali-kali masukkan mangkuk ini ke dalam ketuhar gelombang mikro kerana ia boleh terbakar.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>521.44,'end_time'=>525.26,'target_text'=>'And this is a very flimsy plastic lid.','source_text'=>'Dan ini penutup plastik yang sangat nipis dan lembik.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>525.36,'end_time'=>527.82,'target_text'=>'You can see it\'s very flimsy.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak ia sangat lembik.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>527.92,'end_time'=>530.22,'target_text'=>'See, very, very flimsy.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah, sangat-sangat lembik.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>530.32,'end_time'=>531.94,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, this is the fish sauce.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah, ini sos ikan.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>532.04,'end_time'=>533.42,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to pour it in.','source_text'=>'Mak nak tuangkan ke dalam.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>533.52,'end_time'=>534.46,'target_text'=>'Should we take out the spring roll?','source_text'=>'Patutkah kita keluarkan popia (*spring roll*) ini?','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>534.56,'end_time'=>536.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, you can put it to the side here.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, Mak boleh letak di tepi sini.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>536.48,'end_time'=>542.18,'target_text'=>'And now, pour that uh >> fish sauce >> in the bún chả cuz this is how the dish comes.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang tuangkan sos ikan ke dalam bun cha kerana begitulah cara hidangan ini dimakan.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>542.28,'end_time'=>544.22,'target_text'=>'This is one of my favorite dishes.','source_text'=>'Ini antara hidangan kegemaran saya.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>544.32,'end_time'=>546.3,'target_text'=>'I really love this dish.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat sukakan hidangan ini.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>546.4,'end_time'=>547.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s quite delicious.','source_text'=>'Ia sangat sedap.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>547.84,'end_time'=>548.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>548.76,'end_time'=>553.5,'target_text'=>'>> So, yeah, now we have the bún chả, the fork, and this is also part of the bún chả.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi ya, sekarang kita ada bun cha, garpu, dan ini juga sebahagian daripada bun cha.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>553.6,'end_time'=>555.78,'target_text'=>'I think you could put it on this plate.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa Mak boleh letak di atas pinggan ini.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>555.88,'end_time'=>559.18,'target_text'=>'This is just a small white plate.','source_text'=>'Ini cuma pinggan putih kecil.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>559.28,'end_time'=>560.34,'target_text'=>'Small white plate.','source_text'=>'Pinggan putih kecil.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>560.44,'end_time'=>562.7,'target_text'=>'Now, I\'m going to place it down on the table.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya akan letakkannya di atas meja.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>562.8,'end_time'=>565.02,'target_text'=>'>> Just going to tip out the >> the noodle.','source_text'=>'>> Mak nak tuangkan keluar mi ini.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>565.12,'end_time'=>566.06,'target_text'=>'>> noodle.','source_text'=>'>> mi.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>566.16,'end_time'=>567.06,'target_text'=>'>> You can pass that bag.','source_text'=>'>> Boleh hulurkan beg plastik itu.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>567.16,'end_time'=>569.94,'target_text'=>'I\'m putting all the garbage here, so.','source_text'=>'Mak letak semua sampah di sini.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>570.04,'end_time'=>574.62,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s one thing when you do get takeout, it does create a lot of garbage.','source_text'=>'>> Satu perkara bila bungkus makanan, ia memang menghasilkan banyak sampah.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>574.72,'end_time'=>578.58,'target_text'=>'>> And the bún chả also comes with these greens.','source_text'=>'>> Dan bun cha ini turut didatangkan dengan ulam-ulaman ini.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>578.68,'end_time'=>580.58,'target_text'=>'I\'ll put it in this bowl here.','source_text'=>'Mak letak dalam mangkuk ini.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>580.68,'end_time'=>583.74,'target_text'=>'Kind of fell on the table, but >> The table was clean.','source_text'=>'Ada yang jatuh ke meja, tapi >> Meja ini bersih.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>583.84,'end_time'=>584.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>584.6,'end_time'=>588.62,'target_text'=>'And then last, but certainly not least, we have the banh mi.','source_text'=>'Dan akhir sekali, sudah tentulah kita ada banh mi.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>588.72,'end_time'=>591.14,'target_text'=>'>> And we picked all Vietnamese dishes.','source_text'=>'>> Dan kita pilih semua makanan khas Vietnam.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>591.24,'end_time'=>594.18,'target_text'=>'>> So this is a Hanoi style banh mi.','source_text'=>'>> Ini banh mi gaya Hanoi.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>594.28,'end_time'=>597.18,'target_text'=>'Let me open it up and show you guys what\'s inside.','source_text'=>'Biar saya buka dan tunjukkan kepada anda apa yang ada di dalamnya.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>597.28,'end_time'=>598.9,'target_text'=>'Wow, this actually looks good.','source_text'=>'Wah, ini nampak sangat menyelerakan.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>599,'end_time'=>603.1,'target_text'=>'It looks like there\'s some egg, some sausage, and some greens.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam ada telur, sosej, dan sayur-sayuran.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>603.2,'end_time'=>605.3,'target_text'=>'So these are all our dishes.','source_text'=>'Inilah semua hidangan kita.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>605.4,'end_time'=>606.78,'target_text'=>'Uh what do you want to start with, Mom?','source_text'=>'Mak nak mula dengan yang mana dulu?','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>606.88,'end_time'=>608.98,'target_text'=>'>> Ooh, I think you should start with the pho.','source_text'=>'>> Mak rasa kamu patut mula dengan pho.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>609.08,'end_time'=>613.04,'target_text'=>'>> Let me try a piece of meat first.','source_text'=>'>> Biar saya rasa seketul daging dulu.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>616.12,'end_time'=>617.38,'target_text'=>'Mmm.','source_text'=>'Mmm.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>617.48,'end_time'=>619.18,'target_text'=>'Now let\'s try the pho.','source_text'=>'Sekarang jom kita cuba pho pula.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>619.28,'end_time'=>623.1,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try the pho and see how good the pho is.','source_text'=>'Jom rasa pho dan tengok betapa sedapnya pho ini.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>623.2,'end_time'=>624.34,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try some meat.','source_text'=>'Jom rasa sikit dagingnya.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>624.44,'end_time'=>626.18,'target_text'=>'Oh, this looks like a brisket.','source_text'=>'Oh, ini nampak macam bahagian brisket (daging tetel dada).','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>626.28,'end_time'=>627.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that\'s >> Beef brisket.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, itu daging brisket lembu.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>627.68,'end_time'=>629.14,'target_text'=>'Mmm.','source_text'=>'Mmm.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>629.24,'end_time'=>632.08,'target_text'=>'Now let me try some of the broth.','source_text'=>'Sekarang biar saya hirup kuahnya pula.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>633,'end_time'=>633.42,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s good.','source_text'=>'>> Sedap rasanya.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>633.52,'end_time'=>633.98,'target_text'=>'>> Try it.','source_text'=>'>> Cubalah rasa.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>634.08,'end_time'=>636.42,'target_text'=>'The meat is very tender.','source_text'=>'Dagingnya sangat lembut.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>636.52,'end_time'=>637.98,'target_text'=>'The beef is tender.','source_text'=>'Daging lembunya sangat empuk.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>638.08,'end_time'=>639.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s not very chewy.','source_text'=>'Ia tak liat.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>639.32,'end_time'=>641.7,'target_text'=>'You don\'t have to chew','source_text'=>'Anda tak perlu kunyah','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>641.8,'end_time'=>642.74,'target_text'=>'a lot.','source_text'=>'banyak kali.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>642.84,'end_time'=>647.3,'target_text'=>'Very tender, soft, and the broth is very clear and delicious.','source_text'=>'Sangat empuk, lembut, dan kuahnya jernih serta sangat sedap.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>647.4,'end_time'=>648.7,'target_text'=>'There\'s a lot of flavor.','source_text'=>'Rasanya sangat kaya dengan aroma rempah.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>648.8,'end_time'=>655.58,'target_text'=>'You could also take these, which are very hard pieces of bread, and dip it in there, and then eat it as well.','source_text'=>'Anda juga boleh ambil roti yang rangup keras ini, celup ke dalam kuah, dan nikmatinya bersama.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>655.68,'end_time'=>656.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>656.32,'end_time'=>659.1,'target_text'=>'And then lastly, we have the banh mi.','source_text'=>'Dan akhir sekali, kita ada banh mi.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>659.2,'end_time'=>660.58,'target_text'=>'>> The banh mi.','source_text'=>'>> Banh mi.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>660.68,'end_time'=>662.18,'target_text'=>'So here we have the banh mi.','source_text'=>'Di sini kita ada banh mi.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>662.28,'end_time'=>665.38,'target_text'=>'My mom cut it into three pieces.','source_text'=>'Emak saya potong kepada tiga bahagian.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>665.48,'end_time'=>667.06,'target_text'=>'So this is Hanoi style.','source_text'=>'Ini banh mi gaya Hanoi.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>667.16,'end_time'=>676.94,'target_text'=>'From looking into the inside of it, I can see sausage, egg, some other type of meat, >> lettuce, >> cucumbers, lettuce, tomatoes,','source_text'=>'Dari apa yang saya lihat di bahagian dalamnya, ada sosej, telur, daging, timun, salad, tomato,','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>677.04,'end_time'=>677.7,'target_text'=>'maybe onions.','source_text'=>'mungkin juga bawang.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>677.8,'end_time'=>678.58,'target_text'=>'I can\'t really tell.','source_text'=>'Saya tak dapat pastikan sangat.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>678.68,'end_time'=>681.46,'target_text'=>'>> I wonder if they put some of that liver spread on it, too.','source_text'=>'>> Mak tertanya-tanya kalau mereka ada sapukan pate hati juga.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>681.56,'end_time'=>686.02,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe, but the thing I love the most about banh mi is the bread.','source_text'=>'>> Mungkin, tapi benda yang paling saya suka tentang banh mi ialah rotinya.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>686.12,'end_time'=>687.42,'target_text'=>'The bread, I think, is delicious.','source_text'=>'Rotinya pada saya memang sangat sedap.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>687.52,'end_time'=>689.58,'target_text'=>'Here, you can try one as well.','source_text'=>'Nah, Mak boleh rasa sepotong juga.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>689.68,'end_time'=>689.92,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>689.92,'end_time'=>690.66,'target_text'=>'>> So let\'s try together.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita rasa bersama.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>690.76,'end_time'=>691.3,'target_text'=>'Cheers.','source_text'=>'Sorak (*cheers*).','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>691.4,'end_time'=>691.8,'target_text'=>'>> Cheers.','source_text'=>'>> Sorak.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>691.88,'end_time'=>694.08,'target_text'=>'Let\'s do it.','source_text'=>'Jom makan.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>696.52,'end_time'=>697.9,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>698,'end_time'=>699.82,'target_text'=>'It has the liver sausage, too.','source_text'=>'Ia ada sosej hati juga.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>699.92,'end_time'=>703.66,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so right now we are watching some TV after eating.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah, sekarang kita sedang menonton televisyen selepas makan.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>703.76,'end_time'=>706.5,'target_text'=>'And here you can see we have the other snacks.','source_text'=>'Dan di sini anda boleh nampak snek-snek kami yang lain.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>706.6,'end_time'=>708.5,'target_text'=>'So, can you tell me, Mom, >> Mhm.','source_text'=>'Boleh Mak beritahu saya, >> Mhm.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>708.6,'end_time'=>710.46,'target_text'=>'>> what snacks do we have here?','source_text'=>'>> snek apa yang kita ada di sini?','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>710.56,'end_time'=>714.62,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, we have some local snacks that we don\'t get in Canada.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, kita ada beberapa snek tempatan yang tiada di Kanada.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>714.72,'end_time'=>717.42,'target_text'=>'This is baked prawn with melted cheese.','source_text'=>'Ini udang bakar dengan keju cair.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>717.52,'end_time'=>719.26,'target_text'=>'That\'s one is going to be interesting.','source_text'=>'Yang itu nampak menarik.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>719.36,'end_time'=>723.1,'target_text'=>'And then nori seaweed Lays chips.','source_text'=>'Dan kerepek Lay\'s rumpai laut nori.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>723.2,'end_time'=>726.9,'target_text'=>'And then here coconut flavor peanut.','source_text'=>'Dan kacang tanah berperisa kelapa di sini.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>727,'end_time'=>733.34,'target_text'=>'Apparently, they get covered with this outer coconut flavor layer of something.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya kacang ini disalut dengan lapisan luar perisa kelapa.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>733.44,'end_time'=>733.84,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>733.92,'end_time'=>734.74,'target_text'=>'That looks interesting.','source_text'=>'Nampak menarik.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>734.84,'end_time'=>738.42,'target_text'=>'All three of these snacks look very good.','source_text'=>'Ketiga-tiga snek ini nampak sangat menyelerakan.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>738.52,'end_time'=>742.9,'target_text'=>'These two are chips and this is peanuts.','source_text'=>'Dua ini kerepek dan yang ini kacang tanah.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>743,'end_time'=>749.38,'target_text'=>'Can you give me three differences between these two bags of Lays chips?','source_text'=>'Bolehkah anda berikan tiga perbezaan antara dua pek kerepek Lay\'s ini?','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>749.48,'end_time'=>752.46,'target_text'=>'Write your answers in the comments.','source_text'=>'Tuliskan jawapan anda di ruangan komen.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>752.56,'end_time'=>756.5,'target_text'=>'So, first of all, the bags are different colors.','source_text'=>'Pertama sekali, bungkusannya berbeza warna.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>756.6,'end_time'=>759.22,'target_text'=>'They are also different flavors.','source_text'=>'Ia juga berbeza perisa.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>759.32,'end_time'=>762.1,'target_text'=>'And finally, they are different sizes.','source_text'=>'Dan akhir sekali, ia berbeza saiz.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>762.2,'end_time'=>766.9,'target_text'=>'You can see the bag of chips on the right is bigger','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak bungkusan kerepek di sebelah kanan lebih besar','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>767,'end_time'=>769.5,'target_text'=>'bigger than the bag on the left.','source_text'=>'daripada bungkusan di sebelah kiri.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>769.6,'end_time'=>774.42,'target_text'=>'Let me know if you guys had similar answers to me or different answers.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya jika jawapan anda sama macam saya atau berbeza.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>774.52,'end_time'=>777.54,'target_text'=>'You can see we also have some remotes here.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak kami ada beberapa alat kawalan jauh di sini.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>777.64,'end_time'=>782.78,'target_text'=>'Some are for the TV, some are for the AC, and others are for this light.','source_text'=>'Ada untuk TV, ada untuk penyaman udara, dan ada untuk lampu ini.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>782.88,'end_time'=>788.94,'target_text'=>'And on the left here, we have a bowl of watermelon that my mom sliced up for us.','source_text'=>'Dan di sebelah kiri ini, kita ada semangkuk tembikai yang emak saya hiris untuk kita.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>789.04,'end_time'=>792.38,'target_text'=>'And we also have a bowl of mango.','source_text'=>'Dan kita juga ada semangkuk mangga.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>792.48,'end_time'=>798.06,'target_text'=>'Now, what do you call this type of table that is usually near your sofa?','source_text'=>'Apakah nama meja jenis ini yang biasanya terletak berhampiran sofa?','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>798.16,'end_time'=>799.98,'target_text'=>'What is this type of table called?','source_text'=>'Apakah nama meja jenis ini?','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>800.08,'end_time'=>803,'target_text'=>'What is the name of it?','source_text'=>'Apakah namanya?','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>803.28,'end_time'=>805.74,'target_text'=>'This is a coffee table.','source_text'=>'Ini ialah meja kopi (*coffee table*).','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>805.84,'end_time'=>807.54,'target_text'=>'A coffee table.','source_text'=>'Meja kopi.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>807.64,'end_time'=>810.66,'target_text'=>'So, now let\'s try these snacks.','source_text'=>'Sekarang jom kita cuba snek-snek ini.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>810.76,'end_time'=>814.94,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster, get the workbook for this video on my website.','source_text'=>'Jika anda ingin belajar lebih pantas, dapatkan buku kerja video ini di laman web saya.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>815.04,'end_time'=>821.94,'target_text'=>'It includes deeper explanations and exercises to help you remember and master what you learned.','source_text'=>'Ia mengandungi penerangan mendalam dan latihan untuk membantu anda mengingati apa yang dipelajari.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>822.04,'end_time'=>824.46,'target_text'=>'What do you want to try first?','source_text'=>'Mak nak cuba yang mana dulu?','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>824.56,'end_time'=>827.1,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s try the two potato chips.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita cuba dua kerepek kentang ini dulu.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>827.2,'end_time'=>829.22,'target_text'=>'>> Which one?','source_text'=>'>> Yang mana satu?','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>829.32,'end_time'=>832.06,'target_text'=>'>> I think this bigger green bag.','source_text'=>'>> Mak rasa pek hijau yang lebih besar ini.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>832.16,'end_time'=>835.34,'target_text'=>'That nor Was it >> Nori seaweed.','source_text'=>'Yang rumpai laut nori itu.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>835.44,'end_time'=>839.42,'target_text'=>'The chips themselves kind of look like dill pickle chips.','source_text'=>'Kerepeknya nampak seakan-akan kerepek perisa jeruk dill.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>839.52,'end_time'=>840.06,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>840.16,'end_time'=>845.08,'target_text'=>'>> And I like dill pickle chips, but I know it\'s not going to taste like dill pickle.','source_text'=>'>> Dan saya suka kerepek jeruk dill, tapi saya tahu rasanya takkan sama macam jeruk dill.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>845.28,'end_time'=>846.38,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I forgot.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya terlupa.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>846.48,'end_time'=>848.54,'target_text'=>'Asian chips are different.','source_text'=>'Kerepek di Asia berbeza cara bungkusannya.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>848.64,'end_time'=>853.42,'target_text'=>'In North America, we open the chips like this, but in Asia >> Oh.','source_text'=>'Di Amerika Utara kita buka kerepek dari atas begini, tapi di Asia >> Oh.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>853.52,'end_time'=>856.1,'target_text'=>'>> you have to peel the bag like this.','source_text'=>'>> anda kena koyak begnya seperti ini.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>856.2,'end_time'=>859.5,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m learning something new today.','source_text'=>'>> Belajar benda baharu Mak hari ini.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>859.6,'end_time'=>861.94,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s really hard to open the chip.','source_text'=>'>> Agak susah nak buka bungkusan kerepek ini.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>862.04,'end_time'=>867.98,'target_text'=>'>> it\'s because our portion sizes are really big in America, in North America.','source_text'=>'>> Itu kerana saiz hidangan kami di Amerika Utara sangat besar.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>868.08,'end_time'=>871.66,'target_text'=>'So, we open it to the top and close it and keep it.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami buka dari atas dan boleh tutup simpan semula.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>871.76,'end_time'=>873.58,'target_text'=>'>> What about small chips though?','source_text'=>'>> Macam mana pula dengan pek kerepek kecil?','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>873.68,'end_time'=>874.38,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>874.48,'end_time'=>880.22,'target_text'=>'Because I didn\'t see here in the shop like super super size bags.','source_text'=>'Sebab Mak tak nampak di kedai sini bungkusan yang bersaiz gergasi.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>880.32,'end_time'=>884.22,'target_text'=>'>> So, here you can see this is what the inside of the chip bag looks like.','source_text'=>'>> Di sini anda boleh nampak bahagian dalam bungkusan kerepek.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>884.32,'end_time'=>890.94,'target_text'=>'The inside is this silver like chrome color and it reflects the chips.','source_text'=>'Bahagian dalamnya berwarna perak berkilat dan memantulkan imej kerepek.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>891.04,'end_time'=>893.78,'target_text'=>'And you can see this bag is about half full.','source_text'=>'Dan anda boleh nampak pek ini separuh penuh.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>893.88,'end_time'=>897.46,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s half filled with chips and the other half is air.','source_text'=>'Separuh diisi kerepek dan separuh lagi diisi angin.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>897.56,'end_time'=>901.26,'target_text'=>'This is essentially what most chips look like when you open the bag.','source_text'=>'Begitulah kebiasaannya keadaan kebanyakan kerepek bila dibuka.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>901.36,'end_time'=>903.38,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s try these.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita rasa kerepek ini.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>903.48,'end_time'=>904.98,'target_text'=>'Would you like to try them first?','source_text'=>'Mak nak rasa dulu?','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>905.08,'end_time'=>906.46,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s try them together.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita rasa bersama-sama.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>906.56,'end_time'=>907.26,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>907.36,'end_time'=>909.88,'target_text'=>'3 2 1.','source_text'=>'3 2 1.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>914.28,'end_time'=>915.7,'target_text'=>'Very seaweedy.','source_text'=>'Rasa rumpai laut yang sangat pekat.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>915.8,'end_time'=>917.34,'target_text'=>'Very.','source_text'=>'Sangat kuat.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>917.44,'end_time'=>918.58,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s kind of sweet.','source_text'=>'>> Ada rasa manis sedikit.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>918.68,'end_time'=>918.84,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>918.84,'end_time'=>919.24,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>919.32,'end_time'=>922.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s slightly sweet and has like a fishy seaweed taste to it.','source_text'=>'Ia sedikit manis dan ada rasa hanyir rumpai laut laut.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>922.56,'end_time'=>922.96,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>923,'end_time'=>923.78,'target_text'=>'>> Not my favorite.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan kegemaran saya.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>923.88,'end_time'=>924.62,'target_text'=>'Not my favorite.','source_text'=>'Bukan kegemaran saya.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>924.72,'end_time'=>926.42,'target_text'=>'My two favorite brands, I have two.','source_text'=>'Dua jenama kegemaran saya, saya ada dua.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>926.52,'end_time'=>927.06,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>927.16,'end_time'=>929.02,'target_text'=>'>> Can you guess one of them?','source_text'=>'>> Boleh Mak teka salah satu daripadanya?','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>929.12,'end_time'=>933.02,'target_text'=>'>> Uh brands, I\'m not sure, but I know what kind of >> What kind?','source_text'=>'>> Jenama Mak tak pasti, tapi Mak tahu perisa apa >> Perisa apa?','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>933.12,'end_time'=>933.82,'target_text'=>'>> flavor you like.','source_text'=>'>> perisa yang kamu suka.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>933.92,'end_time'=>934.9,'target_text'=>'You like ketchup.','source_text'=>'Kamu suka perisa sos tomato (*ketchup*).','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>935,'end_time'=>935.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>935.6,'end_time'=>936.42,'target_text'=>'>> And the other one?','source_text'=>'>> Dan satu lagi?','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>936.52,'end_time'=>942.46,'target_text'=>'>> I like a lot of different flavors, so I wouldn\'t really say I have like a favorite flavor, but I do love ketchup chips.','source_text'=>'>> Saya suka banyak perisa berbeza, tapi saya memang suka kerepek perisa sos tomato.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>942.56,'end_time'=>945.34,'target_text'=>'Let me know, have you ever tried ketchup chips?','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya, pernahkah anda cuba kerepek perisa sos tomato?','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>945.44,'end_time'=>947.54,'target_text'=>'And if you haven\'t, would you try them?','source_text'=>'Dan jika belum, adakah anda mahu mencubanya?','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>947.64,'end_time'=>950.58,'target_text'=>'And if you have tried them, did you like them or not?','source_text'=>'Dan jika sudah pernah, adakah anda sukakannya atau tidak?','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>950.68,'end_time'=>954.46,'target_text'=>'But I\'ll tell you now, my two favorite brands are Miss Vickie\'s.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya beritahu anda sekarang, dua jenama kegemaran saya ialah Miss Vickie\'s.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>954.56,'end_time'=>956.14,'target_text'=>'I\'m sure you could have guessed that one.','source_text'=>'Saya pasti Mak pun boleh teka yang itu.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>956.24,'end_time'=>960.26,'target_text'=>'>> so Yeah, because they\'re so [snorts] crispy and crunchy and >> They\'re so crunchy.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sebab kerepeknya sangat rangup dan rapuh >> Sangat rapuh.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>960.36,'end_time'=>961.1,'target_text'=>'They\'re really good.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat sedap.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>961.2,'end_time'=>964.26,'target_text'=>'My other favorite brand is uh Arriba.','source_text'=>'Satu lagi jenama kegemaran saya ialah Arriba.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>964.36,'end_time'=>964.98,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>965.08,'end_time'=>965.48,'target_text'=>'>> Ooh.','source_text'=>'>> Ooh.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>965.56,'end_time'=>968.7,'target_text'=>'Those chips, I\'ve never seen chips so coated with flavor.','source_text'=>'Kerepek itu disalut perisa yang sangat tebal.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>968.8,'end_time'=>969.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s just pure flavor.','source_text'=>'Memang penuh dengan perisa.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>969.96,'end_time'=>971.38,'target_text'=>'They\'re so so so good.','source_text'=>'Rasanya sangat-sangat sedap.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>971.48,'end_time'=>972.82,'target_text'=>'I think those are my favorite.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa itu nombor satu saya.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>972.92,'end_time'=>974.7,'target_text'=>'And then Miss Vickie\'s are my second favorite.','source_text'=>'Dan Miss Vickie\'s nombor dua kegemaran saya.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>974.8,'end_time'=>975.22,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>975.32,'end_time'=>977.9,'target_text'=>'I have to add, they are a taste bud killer.','source_text'=>'Tapi Mak kena kata, perisanya boleh buat deria rasa kebas.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>978,'end_time'=>979.54,'target_text'=>'They do kill your taste buds.','source_text'=>'Memang kuat sangat rasanya.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>979.64,'end_time'=>979.96,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, no.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, taklah.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>979.96,'end_time'=>982.94,'target_text'=>'>> They rejuvenate my taste buds and my soul.','source_text'=>'>> Ia menghidupkan semula deria rasa dan jiwa saya.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>983.04,'end_time'=>984.62,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so there you [snorts] go.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah, nampak tu.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>984.72,'end_time'=>987.9,'target_text'=>'That was a little bit sweet and seaweed-y like.','source_text'=>'Kerepek tadi agak manis dan berasa rumpai laut.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>988,'end_time'=>988.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>988.76,'end_time'=>990.1,'target_text'=>'We\'ll give that to Leon later.','source_text'=>'Kita bagi pada Leon nanti.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>990.2,'end_time'=>992.06,'target_text'=>'He\'ll finish them all, so don\'t worry.','source_text'=>'Dia akan habiskan semuanya, jangan risau.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>992.16,'end_time'=>993.1,'target_text'=>'We\'re not going to waste it.','source_text'=>'Kita takkan membazir.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>993.2,'end_time'=>995.74,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s open this other bag.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita buka satu lagi bungkusan.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>995.84,'end_time'=>999.58,'target_text'=>'>> This is a very Asian kind of chip because it is Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ini kerepek gaya Asia sebab rasanya unik.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>999.68,'end_time'=>1000.18,'target_text'=>'>> prawn?','source_text'=>'>> udang?','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>1000.28,'end_time'=>1000.7,'target_text'=>'>> Baked prawn.','source_text'=>'>> Udang bakar.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>1000.8,'end_time'=>1001.42,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>1001.52,'end_time'=>1004.54,'target_text'=>'The cheese on it is a little bit different.','source_text'=>'Rasa keju padanya agak berbeza sedikit.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>1004.64,'end_time'=>1005.74,'target_text'=>'>> This one is better.','source_text'=>'>> Yang ini lebih sedap.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>1005.84,'end_time'=>1006.5,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>1006.6,'end_time'=>1008.26,'target_text'=>'>> This one is a lot sweeter, though.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi yang ini jauh lebih manis.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>1008.36,'end_time'=>1009.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s way sweeter.','source_text'=>'Jauh lebih manis.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>1009.76,'end_time'=>1010.94,'target_text'=>'>> It tastes like prawns.','source_text'=>'>> Rasanya macam udang betul.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>1011.04,'end_time'=>1011.5,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>1011.6,'end_time'=>1016.62,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s completely different than North American dill pickle and barbecue and that kind of flavors.','source_text'=>'>> Ia berbeza langsung daripada perisa jeruk dill dan barbeku di Amerika Utara.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>1016.72,'end_time'=>1017.74,'target_text'=>'And all seasoned.','source_text'=>'Dan perisa campuran.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>1017.84,'end_time'=>1019.58,'target_text'=>'We have all season Oh, oh, sorry.','source_text'=>'Kami ada all season, oh maaf.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>1019.68,'end_time'=>1020.08,'target_text'=>'All dressed.','source_text'=>'All Dressed.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>1020.12,'end_time'=>1021.34,'target_text'=>'>> a That\'s Canadian thing, right?','source_text'=>'>> Itu perisa khas di Kanada, kan?','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>1021.44,'end_time'=>1024.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s only in Canada we have all dressed chips and they\'re really good.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, hanya di Kanada ada kerepek perisa \'All Dressed\' dan rasanya sangat sedap.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>1025,'end_time'=>1027.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, in Canada we have like unique chip flavors.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, di Kanada kami ada perisa kerepek yang unik.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>1028,'end_time'=>1030.34,'target_text'=>'For example, ketchup chips and all dressed chips.','source_text'=>'Contohnya, kerepek sos tomato dan kerepek All Dressed.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>1030.44,'end_time'=>1033.1,'target_text'=>'Those two flavors of chips are very very good.','source_text'=>'Kedua-dua perisa kerepek itu memang sangat sedap.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>1033.2,'end_time'=>1033.74,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>1033.84,'end_time'=>1035.38,'target_text'=>'I\'m sure we can get used to it.','source_text'=>'Mak pasti kita boleh sesuaikan diri dengan rasanya.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>1035.48,'end_time'=>1036.3,'target_text'=>'>> These ones were good.','source_text'=>'>> Yang ini sedap.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>1036.4,'end_time'=>1037.26,'target_text'=>'>> These ones?','source_text'=>'>> Yang ini?','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>1037.36,'end_time'=>1038.5,'target_text'=>'>> Those ones were not good.','source_text'=>'>> Yang tadi tu kurang sedap.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>1038.6,'end_time'=>1040.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s too bad that was the big bag.','source_text'=>'Sayang betul yang kurang sedap tu dalam pek besar.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>1040.28,'end_time'=>1043.22,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, they didn\'t have a big bag of those ones.','source_text'=>'>> Mereka tiada pek besar untuk yang ini.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>1043.32,'end_time'=>1044.82,'target_text'=>'But, it\'s very unique though.','source_text'=>'Tapi rasanya memang sangat unik.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>1044.92,'end_time'=>1045.94,'target_text'=>'Let\'s going to try it.','source_text'=>'Jom kita rasa.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>1046.04,'end_time'=>1049.54,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s a very unique Vietnamese chip flavor.','source_text'=>'>> Ini perisa kerepek Vietnam yang sangat unik.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>1049.64,'end_time'=>1052.86,'target_text'=>'Now, let me open up this other thing.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, biar saya buka bungkusan satu lagi ini.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>1052.96,'end_time'=>1058.7,'target_text'=>'And let me know, if you\'re Vietnamese or have been to Vietnam, what is your flavor of chips?','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya jika anda orang Vietnam atau pernah ke Vietnam, apa perisa kerepek kegemaran anda?','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>1058.8,'end_time'=>1060.22,'target_text'=>'And I will go and try them.','source_text'=>'Dan saya akan pergi cuba perisa itu.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>1060.32,'end_time'=>1062.26,'target_text'=>'Maybe I\'ll do a full chip review.','source_text'=>'Mungkin saya akan buat ulasan penuh kerepek.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>1062.36,'end_time'=>1062.76,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>1062.84,'end_time'=>1064.34,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe pour them in my hand.','source_text'=>'>> Tuangkan ke tapak tangan Mak.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>1064.44,'end_time'=>1065.66,'target_text'=>'Let\'s have a look at them.','source_text'=>'Jom kita tengok rupa bentuknya.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>1065.76,'end_time'=>1066.62,'target_text'=>'Okay.','source_text'=>'Baiklah.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>1066.72,'end_time'=>1067.66,'target_text'=>'Kind of feel light.','source_text'=>'Rasa ringan.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>1067.76,'end_time'=>1068.12,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>1068.12,'end_time'=>1071.74,'target_text'=>'>> So, they\'re like a circular shape and uh they\'re very hard.','source_text'=>'>> Bentuknya bulat dan agak keras.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>1071.84,'end_time'=>1073.34,'target_text'=>'So, I assume they\'re going to be quite crunchy.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa ia akan agak rangup.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>1073.44,'end_time'=>1074.38,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try them.','source_text'=>'Jom kita cuba.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>1074.48,'end_time'=>1077.62,'target_text'=>'>> They smell a little bit coconuty coconutty.','source_text'=>'>> Baunya ada sedikit aroma kelapa.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>1077.72,'end_time'=>1078.12,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>1078.16,'end_time'=>1080.72,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know if you can hear that, but','source_text'=>'>> Saya tak tahu kalau anda boleh dengar, tapi','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>1081.24,'end_time'=>1082.22,'target_text'=>'>> Super crunchy.','source_text'=>'>> Sangat rangup.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>1082.32,'end_time'=>1083.62,'target_text'=>'They\'re not sweet that I like.','source_text'=>'Ia tak terlalu manis, Mak suka.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>1083.72,'end_time'=>1085.86,'target_text'=>'A little bit, but mhm they\'re yummy.','source_text'=>'Manis sedikit saja, tapi mhm sedap.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>1085.96,'end_time'=>1087.46,'target_text'=>'I like the crunch on them.','source_text'=>'Mak suka kerangupannya.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>1087.56,'end_time'=>1090.54,'target_text'=>'>> So, we\'ve just tried the three packaged snacks.','source_text'=>'>> Kami baru saja selesai merasa ketiga-tiga snek bungkusan.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>1090.64,'end_time'=>1094.5,'target_text'=>'Out of all three of those, this bag of chips was my favorite.','source_text'=>'Daripada ketiga-tiganya, bungkusan kerepek ini kegemaran saya.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>1094.6,'end_time'=>1096.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, the baked prawn.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, perisa udang bakar.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>1096.16,'end_time'=>1097.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, those were the best.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, yang itu paling sedap.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>1097.32,'end_time'=>1098.18,'target_text'=>'What about you?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana dengan Mak pula?','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>1098.28,'end_time'=>1099.42,'target_text'=>'What was your favorite?','source_text'=>'Apa yang Mak paling suka?','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>1099.52,'end_time'=>1102.66,'target_text'=>'>> From the chips, I like the baked prawn the most.','source_text'=>'>> Daripada kerepek tadi, Mak paling suka udang bakar.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>1102.76,'end_time'=>1105.66,'target_text'=>'And I don\'t mind these peanuts.','source_text'=>'Dan Mak suka juga kacang tanah ini.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>1105.76,'end_time'=>1110.62,'target_text'=>'I like the crispy crackling kind of sound that they make when you chew.','source_text'=>'Mak suka bunyi kerangupan bila mengunyahnya.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>1110.72,'end_time'=>1112.98,'target_text'=>'>> But, chips make the same sound, do they not?','source_text'=>'>> Tapi kerepek pun ada bunyi rangup yang sama, kan?','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>1113.08,'end_time'=>1113.98,'target_text'=>'>> Not as extreme.','source_text'=>'>> Tak sekuat bunyi kacang ini.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>1114.08,'end_time'=>1115.88,'target_text'=>'Listen.','source_text'=>'Dengarlah.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>1117.08,'end_time'=>1118.86,'target_text'=>'>> No, they are very very crunchy.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ia memang sangat-sangat rangup.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>1118.96,'end_time'=>1119.62,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>1119.72,'end_time'=>1123.3,'target_text'=>'>> And here, of course, you know, we have the watermelon and mango.','source_text'=>'>> Dan di sini sudah tentulah kita ada tembikai dan mangga.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>1123.4,'end_time'=>1126.06,'target_text'=>'>> And from those two, which do you prefer?','source_text'=>'>> Antara kedua-duanya, yang mana kamu lebih suka?','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>1126.16,'end_time'=>1126.94,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, man.','source_text'=>'>> Susah nak pilih.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>1127.04,'end_time'=>1130.9,'target_text'=>'I love watermelon and I love mango, but I think I prefer mango.','source_text'=>'Saya suka tembikai dan saya suka mangga, tapi saya rasa saya lebih suka mangga.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>1131,'end_time'=>1131.98,'target_text'=>'I\'m not going to lie.','source_text'=>'Saya cakap jujur.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>1132.08,'end_time'=>1132.98,'target_text'=>'Something about it.','source_text'=>'Ada keistimewaan tersendiri padanya.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>1133.08,'end_time'=>1139.7,'target_text'=>'Can you guys give me three different ways to describe these two fruits?','source_text'=>'Bolehkah anda berikan tiga cara berbeza untuk menggambarkan kedua-dua buah ini?','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>1139.8,'end_time'=>1143.02,'target_text'=>'Both of these fruits are very sweet.','source_text'=>'Kedua-dua buah ini sangat manis.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>1143.12,'end_time'=>1146.98,'target_text'=>'Both of these fruits are also very juicy.','source_text'=>'Kedua-dua buah ini juga sangat berjus.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>1147.08,'end_time'=>1155.9,'target_text'=>'Also, both of these fruits can be quite messy, but I believe mangoes are messier if you try to eat them without peeling them.','source_text'=>'Kedua-dua buah ini juga boleh mengotorkan tangan, tapi saya rasa mangga lebih mengotorkan jika dimakan tanpa dikupas.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>1156,'end_time'=>1162.46,'target_text'=>'And both of these fruits are very healthy for you, but might make you go to the washroom fast.','source_text'=>'Dan kedua-dua buah ini sangat menyihatkan, tetapi mungkin membuatkan anda cepat ke tandas.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>1162.56,'end_time'=>1164.5,'target_text'=>'>> The mango, especially the mango.','source_text'=>'>> Terutamanya buah mangga.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>1164.6,'end_time'=>1165.5,'target_text'=>'>> watermelon.','source_text'=>'>> Tembikai juga.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>1165.6,'end_time'=>1168.43,'target_text'=>'>> Depends on the person, I guess.','source_text'=>'>> Bergantung pada setiap orang.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>1168.53,'end_time'=>1171.18,'target_text'=>'>> [laughter] >> But those are all the snacks we have tried.','source_text'=>'>> [ketawa] >> Tapi itulah semua snek yang telah kami cuba.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>1171.28,'end_time'=>1180.02,'target_text'=>'Now we are going to go out to a cafe and get some Vietnamese coffee and other drinks to try them and to also describe them','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami akan keluar ke kafe untuk minum kopi Vietnam dan minuman lain untuk mencubanya serta menghuraikannya','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>1180.12,'end_time'=>1180.94,'target_text'=>'to you as well.','source_text'=>'kepada anda juga.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>1181.04,'end_time'=>1182.78,'target_text'=>'So let\'s go now.','source_text'=>'Jom kita gerak sekarang.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>1182.88,'end_time'=>1185.74,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we\'re on our dessert of the day.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang kita berada di sesi pencuci mulut untuk hari ini.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>1185.84,'end_time'=>1191.9,'target_text'=>'We had a pretty big lunch and then some snacks while we were watching YouTube, but now we came to this like, I guess cafe','source_text'=>'Kami makan tengah hari agak banyak dan makan snek sambil tonton YouTube, tapi sekarang kami datang ke kafe ini','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1192,'end_time'=>1193.14,'target_text'=>'or >> It\'s a dessert.','source_text'=>'atau >> Kedai pencuci mulut.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1193.24,'end_time'=>1193.86,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it\'s a dessert.','source_text'=>'Ya, kedai pencuci mulut.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>1193.96,'end_time'=>1196.14,'target_text'=>'>> So we ordered food here, you can see right here.','source_text'=>'>> Kami dah pesan makanan di sini, anda boleh nampak di sini.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>1196.24,'end_time'=>1198.22,'target_text'=>'This right here is a QR code.','source_text'=>'Yang ini ialah kod QR.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>1198.32,'end_time'=>1202.46,'target_text'=>'You scan it with your camera and this is what the menu looks like.','source_text'=>'Anda imbas dengan kamera telefon dan inilah paparan menunya.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>1202.56,'end_time'=>1207.1,'target_text'=>'So we ordered three items, one for each of us and we\'ll try these.','source_text'=>'Kami pesan tiga hidangan, setiap seorang satu dan kami akan mencubanya.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>1207.2,'end_time'=>1213.66,'target_text'=>'We all ordered different items and um this is going to be my first time ever having it on my own, but my mom had it before','source_text'=>'Kami semua pesan menu berbeza dan ini kali pertama saya makan sendiri, tapi emak saya pernah makan sebelum ini','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>1213.76,'end_time'=>1215.46,'target_text'=>'and I tried hers and it was really good.','source_text'=>'dan saya pernah rasa kepunyaannya dan ia sangat sedap.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>1215.56,'end_time'=>1217.26,'target_text'=>'>> So your mom knows how to order.','source_text'=>'>> Mak kamu memang pandai buat pesanan.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>1217.36,'end_time'=>1218.94,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I guess so.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul juga.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1219.04,'end_time'=>1224.26,'target_text'=>'But right now we are all sitting down on these very small chairs.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang kami semua sedang duduk di atas kerusi yang sangat kecil ini.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>1224.36,'end_time'=>1227.62,'target_text'=>'These chairs are very small and also low to the ground.','source_text'=>'Kerusi ini sangat kecil dan amat rendah ke lantai.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>1227.72,'end_time'=>1230.78,'target_text'=>'This is also a very small metal table.','source_text'=>'Ini juga meja besi yang sangat kecil.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>1230.88,'end_time'=>1237.22,'target_text'=>'And you can see there are holes throughout the whole table, on the whole surface of the table.','source_text'=>'Dan anda boleh nampak ada lubang-lubang di seluruh permukaan meja ini.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>1237.32,'end_time'=>1244.7,'target_text'=>'>> This is very Vietnamese because I I don\'t know if you guys have ever seen such low chairs and tables in other countries.','source_text'=>'>> Ini suasana khas Vietnam sebab saya tak tahu kalau anda pernah nampak kerusi dan meja serendah ini di negara lain.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>1244.8,'end_time'=>1247.06,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe a little bit, but not like this much.','source_text'=>'>> Mungkin ada sikit, tapi taklah sebanyak ini.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>1247.16,'end_time'=>1248.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yes, everywhere.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, merata-rata tempat ada.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>1248.24,'end_time'=>1249.82,'target_text'=>'>> Here it\'s everywhere, everywhere.','source_text'=>'>> Di sini ada di mana-mana saja.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>1249.92,'end_time'=>1254.54,'target_text'=>'But uh yeah, so on the table there is also this basket with napkins.','source_text'=>'Di atas meja ada juga bakul berisi tisu makan ini.','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>1254.64,'end_time'=>1257.58,'target_text'=>'This is just a very small woven basket.','source_text'=>'Ini cuma bakul anyaman kecil.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>1257.68,'end_time'=>1258.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s just plastic.','source_text'=>'Diperbuat daripada plastik.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>1258.76,'end_time'=>1261.42,'target_text'=>'Over here you have a sign that says no pet.','source_text'=>'Di sebelah sini ada papan tanda larangan membawa haiwan peliharaan.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>1261.52,'end_time'=>1262.46,'target_text'=>'Should be no pets here.','source_text'=>'Sepatutnya tiada haiwan peliharaan di sini.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>1262.56,'end_time'=>1263.1,'target_text'=>'No pet.','source_text'=>'Dilarang membawa haiwan peliharaan.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>1263.2,'end_time'=>1266.78,'target_text'=>'And this right here is a red sign with a cross through it.','source_text'=>'Dan yang ini ialah tanda merah dengan palang melintang.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>1266.88,'end_time'=>1270.78,'target_text'=>'That\'s like a universal symbol for whatever the item is not allowed.','source_text'=>'Itu simbol sejagat yang menunjukkan barang tersebut tidak dibenarkan.','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>1270.88,'end_time'=>1273.9,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, we just ordered our food through the QR code.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya, kami baru memesan makanan melalui kod QR.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>1274,'end_time'=>1275.74,'target_text'=>'It brought us to the website and now we\'re just waiting.','source_text'=>'Ia membawa kami ke laman web dan sekarang kami sedang menunggu.','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>1275.84,'end_time'=>1280.7,'target_text'=>'So, I think over there in the kitchen they are preparing our dessert.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa di dapur sana mereka sedang menyediakan pencuci mulut kami.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>1280.8,'end_time'=>1283.42,'target_text'=>'But, yeah, you can show them around this store.','source_text'=>'Bolehlah tunjuk suasana sekeliling kedai ini.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>1283.52,'end_time'=>1284.02,'target_text'=>'Pretty empty.','source_text'=>'Agak lengang.','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>1284.12,'end_time'=>1286.94,'target_text'=>'There\'s just one other customer in here.','source_text'=>'Cuma ada seorang lagi pelanggan lain di sini.','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>1287.04,'end_time'=>1287.94,'target_text'=>'Overall empty.','source_text'=>'Secara keseluruhan agak kosong.','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>1288.04,'end_time'=>1292.06,'target_text'=>'I\'m excited to eat this dessert because when I tried my mom\'s it was really good.','source_text'=>'Saya teruja nak makan pencuci mulut ini sebab masa saya rasa kepunyaan emak saya hari tu ia memang sangat sedap.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>1292.16,'end_time'=>1292.94,'target_text'=>'So, yeah.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>1293.04,'end_time'=>1296.02,'target_text'=>'So, this right here is crushed ice.','source_text'=>'Yang ini ialah ais hancur (*crushed ice*).','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>1296.12,'end_time'=>1297.22,'target_text'=>'This is crushed ice.','source_text'=>'Ini ais hancur.','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>1297.32,'end_time'=>1300.06,'target_text'=>'So, now my mom\'s going to put the ice on the dessert.','source_text'=>'Sekarang emak saya akan meletakkan ais ke atas pencuci mulut.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1300.16,'end_time'=>1305.9,'target_text'=>'She just put a spoon for me, a spoon for herself, another spoon for herself, another spoon for Leon.','source_text'=>'Dia letak sudu untuk saya, sudu untuk dirinya, dan satu lagi sudu untuk Leon.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1306,'end_time'=>1307.18,'target_text'=>'We have three bowls.','source_text'=>'Kami ada tiga mangkuk.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1307.28,'end_time'=>1308.58,'target_text'=>'We each have our own.','source_text'=>'Masing-masing dapat satu bahagian.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1308.68,'end_time'=>1310.54,'target_text'=>'It looks pretty good.','source_text'=>'Nampak sangat sedap.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1310.64,'end_time'=>1315.7,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you\'re supposed to stir this or just like eat it like that, but I believe this is like some sort of caramel.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada kena gaul atau makan begitu saja, tapi saya rasa ini sejenis karamel.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1315.8,'end_time'=>1316.66,'target_text'=>'Flan is it good?','source_text'=>'Karamel flan, sedap tak?','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1316.76,'end_time'=>1317.16,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1317.2,'end_time'=>1320.1,'target_text'=>'The jelly The little jelly balls, they\'re very good.','source_text'=>'Bebola jeli kecil ini sangat sedap.','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1320.2,'end_time'=>1320.6,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1320.68,'end_time'=>1322.18,'target_text'=>'>> So, the flan is going to be good, too.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi flan pun pasti akan sedap juga.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1322.28,'end_time'=>1323.3,'target_text'=>'>> The flan is quite good.','source_text'=>'>> Flan ini memang agak sedap.','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>1323.4,'end_time'=>1326.4,'target_text'=>'Let me try these balls.','source_text'=>'Biar saya cuba bebola jeli ini.','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>1326.72,'end_time'=>1327.54,'target_text'=>'Like tapioca.','source_text'=>'Macam ubi tapioka (boba).','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>1327.64,'end_time'=>1328.38,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>1328.48,'end_time'=>1329.02,'target_text'=>'Pretty yummy.','source_text'=>'Agak sedap.','order'=>460],
            ['start_time'=>1329.12,'end_time'=>1330.42,'target_text'=>'>> Overall, it\'s pretty good.','source_text'=>'>> Secara keseluruhan memang agak sedap.','order'=>461],
            ['start_time'=>1330.52,'end_time'=>1332.82,'target_text'=>'I think the one you had before was better cuz it had the fruit.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa yang Mak makan sebelum ini lagi sedap sebab ada buah-buahan.','order'=>462],
            ['start_time'=>1332.92,'end_time'=>1333.82,'target_text'=>'>> I had mixed fruit, yes.','source_text'=>'>> Yang itu ada campuran buah, ya.','order'=>463],
            ['start_time'=>1333.92,'end_time'=>1335.02,'target_text'=>'This one is jackfruit.','source_text'=>'Yang ini ada buah nangka.','order'=>464],
            ['start_time'=>1335.12,'end_time'=>1338.98,'target_text'=>'>> Now we\'re walking down this pretty nice alley.','source_text'=>'>> Sekarang kami sedang berjalan di lorong yang agak menarik ini.','order'=>465],
            ['start_time'=>1339.08,'end_time'=>1346.42,'target_text'=>'You can see there are a lot of restaurants on the side here, but there aren\'t many people eating since it\'s almost 4:00 p.m.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak restoran di tepi lorong ini, tapi tak ramai orang makan sebab dah hampir pukul 4 petang.','order'=>466],
            ['start_time'=>1346.52,'end_time'=>1350.14,'target_text'=>'So, now we\'re thinking of going and buying one of these bags here.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami berhasrat nak beli salah satu beg di sini.','order'=>467],
