            ['start_time'=>1369.16,'end_time'=>1371.26,'target_text'=>'And these are more like fanny packs.','source_text'=>'Dan yang ini lebih kepada beg pinggang (*fanny packs*).','order'=>473],
            ['start_time'=>1371.36,'end_time'=>1377.98,'target_text'=>'You also have luggage straps here, luggage straps or luggage belts, and you can also call these messenger bags.','source_text'=>'Ada juga tali pengikat beg pakaian di sini, dan beg ini anda boleh panggil beg sandang (*messenger bags*).','order'=>474],
