            ['start_time'=>183.76,'end_time'=>185.34,'target_text'=>'Do I look like a real tour guide?','source_text'=>'Nampak macam pemandu pelancong sebenar tak?','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>185.44,'end_time'=>185.9,'target_text'=>'>> You look good.','source_text'=>'>> Nampak elok sangat tu.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>186,'end_time'=>186.4,'target_text'=>'>> Geez, bro.','source_text'=>'>> Alahai.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>186.44,'end_time'=>187.5,'target_text'=>'This looks like a woman\'s hat.','source_text'=>'Topi ni nampak macam topi perempuan je.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>187.6,'end_time'=>190.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, fun fact of that hat, I\'ve had it for more than 20 years.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, fakta menarik tentang topi tu, mak dah simpan lebih daripada 20 tahun.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>190.72,'end_time'=>192.26,'target_text'=>'Still looks really good.','source_text'=>'Masih nampak sangat elok.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>192.36,'end_time'=>193.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s because of the brand.','source_text'=>'Sebab jenamanya bagus.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>193.72,'end_time'=>194.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s a really good brand.','source_text'=>'Memang jenama yang berkualiti tinggi.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>194.72,'end_time'=>197.38,'target_text'=>'If you buy quality, it lasts you a lifetime.','source_text'=>'Kalau beli barang berkualiti, ia boleh tahan seumur hidup.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>197.48,'end_time'=>198.62,'target_text'=>'>> Is that still the case today?','source_text'=>'>> Sekarang ni masih macam tu ke keadaannya?','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>198.72,'end_time'=>200.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yes, because it\'s still here.','source_text'=>'>> Ya lah, tengok topi ni masih elok ada lagi.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>200.36,'end_time'=>202.06,'target_text'=>'>> No, like I mean like with stuff you buy today.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, maksud saya barang-barang yang dibeli zaman sekarang ni.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>202.16,'end_time'=>203.38,'target_text'=>'>> No, absolutely not.','source_text'=>'>> Oh kalau barang zaman sekarang, memang taklah.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>203.48,'end_time'=>204.54,'target_text'=>'>> Even if you buy quality.','source_text'=>'>> Walaupun kita beli yang berkualiti tinggi.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>204.64,'end_time'=>205.3,'target_text'=>'>> Well, yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tapi kalau sanggup bayar lebih...','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>205.4,'end_time'=>208.1,'target_text'=>'If you pay for it, it might last my lifetime.','source_text'=>'Kalau sanggup bayar harga mahal, mungkin boleh tahan seumur hidup.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>208.2,'end_time'=>209.22,'target_text'=>'>> course you pay for it.','source_text'=>'>> Mestilah kena bayar harganya.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>209.32,'end_time'=>211.38,'target_text'=>'Oh, dude, this is giving like Australia.','source_text'=>'Rupa topi ni macam gaya koboi Australia lah.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>211.48,'end_time'=>211.88,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita jalan.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>211.96,'end_time'=>213.14,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, well I guess we\'ll wear this.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah, kita pakai saja topi ni.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>213.24,'end_time'=>216.66,'target_text'=>'If it looks dumb, close your eyes and just listen to the audio.','source_text'=>'Kalau nampak kelakar pada mata anda, pejamkan mata dan dengar suaranya sahaja.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>216.76,'end_time'=>217.9,'target_text'=>'So me and this guy are matching.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya gaya saya dan lelaki di sebelah sana ni dah sedondon.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>218,'end_time'=>221.64,'target_text'=>'>> his inspiration from the locals.','source_text'=>'>> dapat ilham fesyen daripada penduduk tempatan.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>222.05,'end_time'=>226.06,'target_text'=>'>> [laughter] >> Okay, so we had to take our shoes off to get into this temple.','source_text'=>'>> [ketawa] >> Baiklah, kami kena buka kasut sebelum masuk ke dalam kuil ini.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>226.16,'end_time'=>228.54,'target_text'=>'Whoa, dude, this is massive.','source_text'=>'Wah, besarnya tempat ni.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>228.64,'end_time'=>229.62,'target_text'=>'Massive and golden.','source_text'=>'Sangat besar dan berwarna keemasan.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>229.72,'end_time'=>230.54,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s the one.','source_text'=>'>> Haa yang itulah dia.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>230.64,'end_time'=>233.5,'target_text'=>'>> Wow, dude, this is actually really beautiful.','source_text'=>'>> Wah, tempat ini sebenarnya memang sangat cantik.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>233.6,'end_time'=>236.26,'target_text'=>'Look at the detail and look at these pillars.','source_text'=>'Lihat ukiran terperinci ini dan lihat tiang-tiang ini.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>236.36,'end_time'=>240.18,'target_text'=>'Beautiful like wood and gold and these cranes right here.','source_text'=>'Kemasan kayu dan warna emas yang indah serta ukiran burung bangau di sini.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>240.28,'end_time'=>242.7,'target_text'=>'And these are some huge statues on the side here.','source_text'=>'Dan di bahagian tepi ini ada patung-patung yang sangat besar.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>242.8,'end_time'=>244.86,'target_text'=>'And then the big gold Buddha in the background.','source_text'=>'Dan patung Buddha emas yang besar tersergam di belakang.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>244.96,'end_time'=>245.9,'target_text'=>'>> I think it\'s bronze.','source_text'=>'>> Mak rasa itu gangsa.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>246,'end_time'=>247.82,'target_text'=>'They say this is bronze.','source_text'=>'Mereka kata patung ini diperbuat daripada gangsa.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>247.92,'end_time'=>249.46,'target_text'=>'>> But it\'s meant to look like gold.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi ia sengaja dibuat nampak seperti emas.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>249.56,'end_time'=>249.98,'target_text'=>'>> Bronze.','source_text'=>'>> Gangsa sebenarnya.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>250.08,'end_time'=>252.02,'target_text'=>'>> A huge fan here to keep us cool.','source_text'=>'>> Ada kipas gergasi di sini untuk menyejukkan suasana.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>252.12,'end_time'=>253.02,'target_text'=>'>> Oh.','source_text'=>'>> Oh.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>253.12,'end_time'=>256.44,'target_text'=>'>> And you can see a lot of these people here are praying.','source_text'=>'>> Dan anda boleh nampak ramai orang di sini sedang bersembahyang.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>257.72,'end_time'=>262.1,'target_text'=>'So here you can see a lot of photos and history of this pagoda.','source_text'=>'Di sini anda boleh lihat banyak gambar dan sejarah pagoda ini.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>262.2,'end_time'=>265.18,'target_text'=>'So I guess let\'s go around the temple.','source_text'=>'Mari kita berjalan mengelilingi kuil ini.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>265.28,'end_time'=>265.98,'target_text'=>'This way?','source_text'=>'Ikut jalan sini ke?','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>266.08,'end_time'=>267.66,'target_text'=>'Or should we go that way?','source_text'=>'Atau patut ikut sebelah sana?','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>267.76,'end_time'=>268.74,'target_text'=>'>> Or this way?','source_text'=>'>> Atau ikut arah sini?','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>268.84,'end_time'=>273.98,'target_text'=>'>> I guess probably that way cuz that\'s the hallway and it\'ll bring us all the way down to the pagoda cuz the pagoda is on','source_text'=>'>> Rasanya elok ikut sebelah sana sebab itu lorong utama yang akan bawa kita terus ke pagoda kerana pagoda terletak di','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>274.08,'end_time'=>275.14,'target_text'=>'this side anyway.','source_text'=>'sebelah sini juga.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>275.24,'end_time'=>280.46,'target_text'=>'And I guess this is just like a hall you can pray in or something or just socialize.','source_text'=>'Dan ini dewan luas tempat orang bersembahyang atau sekadar berinteraksi dan berehat.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>280.56,'end_time'=>286.22,'target_text'=>'If it was [music] raining, it wouldn\'t be the end of the world since you can just come and chill and relax in here.','source_text'=>'Kalau hari [muzik] hujan pun tiada masalah sebab boleh duduk berehat dengan tenang di dalam dewan ini.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>286.32,'end_time'=>288.74,'target_text'=>'>> I was just wanting to get away from the sun.','source_text'=>'>> Mak cuma nak berteduh daripada panas matahari je tadi.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>288.84,'end_time'=>291.42,'target_text'=>'>> I guess we\'re going to have to start climbing some stairs, man.','source_text'=>'>> Nampaknya kita kena mula mendaki anak tangga sekarang.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>291.52,'end_time'=>292.14,'target_text'=>'Ooh.','source_text'=>'Aduh.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>292.24,'end_time'=>294.78,'target_text'=>'Well, I guess we should have expected it low-key.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya memang dah agak pun kena panjat tangga.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>294.88,'end_time'=>295.42,'target_text'=>'Shh.','source_text'=>'Syy.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>295.52,'end_time'=>296.9,'target_text'=>'Bro, you drowning right now.','source_text'=>'Dah lencun berpeluh macam lemas dah kau ni.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>297,'end_time'=>297.42,'target_text'=>'You drowning.','source_text'=>'Lencun habis.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>297.52,'end_time'=>298.7,'target_text'=>'You need to start swimming.','source_text'=>'Kena pandai berenanglah kalau macam ni.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>298.8,'end_time'=>303.98,'target_text'=>'So Leona has taken custody of the hat and I no longer have it.','source_text'=>'Sekarang Leon dah ambil topi tu dan saya dah tak memakainya lagi.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>304.08,'end_time'=>308.14,'target_text'=>'We just climbed up all those stairs and now we can see the pagoda.','source_text'=>'Kami baru saja mendaki semua anak tangga tadi dan sekarang kami dapat melihat pagoda tersebut.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>308.24,'end_time'=>309.86,'target_text'=>'>> It says way to the stupa.','source_text'=>'>> Papan tanda tulis laluan ke stupa.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>309.96,'end_time'=>311.9,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s what they call it, the stupa.','source_text'=>'>> Haa itu yang mereka panggil stupa.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>312,'end_time'=>313.02,'target_text'=>'Are you a little tired?','source_text'=>'Mak penat sikit ke?','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>313.12,'end_time'=>314.66,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m quite tired today.','source_text'=>'>> Mak agak letih sikit hari ni.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>314.76,'end_time'=>315.98,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s the humidity.','source_text'=>'Rasanya sebab udara lembap sangat.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>316.08,'end_time'=>317.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s very humid.','source_text'=>'Cuacanya memang sangat lembap.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>317.4,'end_time'=>317.9,'target_text'=>'>> I think so, too.','source_text'=>'>> Saya pun rasa macam tu juga.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>318,'end_time'=>318.94,'target_text'=>'It\'s a little bit hot.','source_text'=>'Cuacanya agak panas.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>319.04,'end_time'=>321.34,'target_text'=>'But we made it to the main thing, the pagoda.','source_text'=>'Tapi akhirnya kita sampai ke tarikan utama iaitu pagoda.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>321.44,'end_time'=>324.22,'target_text'=>'I think the view will be a lot nicer once we go up the pagoda.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa pemandangannya akan jauh lebih cantik bila kita naik ke atas pagoda nanti.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>324.32,'end_time'=>325.18,'target_text'=>'Let\'s head up.','source_text'=>'Mari kita naik ke atas.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>325.28,'end_time'=>328.86,'target_text'=>'You can see Leon is walking in front of us.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh lihat Leon sedang berjalan di hadapan kami.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>328.96,'end_time'=>330.74,'target_text'=>'He\'s walking up the stairs.','source_text'=>'Dia sedang menaiki anak tangga.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>330.84,'end_time'=>335.58,'target_text'=>'He just walked up the stairs and he\'s walking towards the pagoda.','source_text'=>'Dia baru menaiki tangga dan berjalan menuju ke arah pagoda.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>335.68,'end_time'=>337.18,'target_text'=>'Now my mom is in front of me.','source_text'=>'Sekarang emak saya berjalan di hadapan saya.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>337.28,'end_time'=>338.78,'target_text'=>'I am behind.','source_text'=>'Saya berada di belakang.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>338.88,'end_time'=>340.14,'target_text'=>'I am behind.','source_text'=>'Saya di belakang.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>340.24,'end_time'=>344.34,'target_text'=>'And now I\'m walking up these stairs as well.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang saya pun turut menaiki anak tangga ini.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>344.44,'end_time'=>349.06,'target_text'=>'Now you can see the base of the pagoda, the base.','source_text'=>'Sekarang anda boleh melihat bahagian tapak asas pagoda ini, bahagian dasarnya.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>349.16,'end_time'=>352.98,'target_text'=>'It is a really beautiful, majestic pagoda.','source_text'=>'Ia sebuah pagoda yang sangat cantik dan tersergam megah.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>353.08,'end_time'=>356.14,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s such a prominent >> You can see it from so far.','source_text'=>'>> Sangat menonjol binaannya >> Boleh nampak dari jauh lagi.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>356.24,'end_time'=>358.62,'target_text'=>'>> Have you been to the Leaning Tower of Pisa?','source_text'=>'>> Mak pernah pergi ke Menara Condong Pisa?','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>358.72,'end_time'=>359.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yes, I have been.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, mak pernah pergi.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>359.64,'end_time'=>362.98,'target_text'=>'I have been to the Leaning Tower of Pisa in Italy.','source_text'=>'Mak pernah melawat Menara Condong Pisa di Itali dulu.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>363.08,'end_time'=>363.9,'target_text'=>'>> How does this compare?','source_text'=>'>> Macam mana kalau bandingkan dengan pagoda ni?','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>364,'end_time'=>364.9,'target_text'=>'This one is taller.','source_text'=>'Yang ini lebih tinggi.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>365,'end_time'=>367.06,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, dude, this one is way bigger.','source_text'=>'>> Yang ini jauh lebih besar mak.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>367.16,'end_time'=>369.1,'target_text'=>'The Leaning Tower of Pisa is really small.','source_text'=>'Menara Condong Pisa tu sebenarnya agak kecil.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>369.2,'end_time'=>370.18,'target_text'=>'Like it\'s it\'s not big.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya saiznya tak adalah besar sangat.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>370.28,'end_time'=>371.18,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you\'ve been or not.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti anda pernah pergi atau belum.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>371.28,'end_time'=>372.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s really not big.','source_text'=>'Ia memang tak besar mana pun.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>372.12,'end_time'=>374.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s just cool cuz it\'s leaning, I guess.','source_text'=>'Ia nampak unik cuma sebab kedudukannya condong.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>374.56,'end_time'=>376.26,'target_text'=>'But this is way bigger.','source_text'=>'Tapi pagoda ini jauh lebih besar dan megah.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>376.36,'end_time'=>377.34,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>377.44,'end_time'=>378.18,'target_text'=>'>> Way, way bigger.','source_text'=>'>> Jauh, jauh lebih besar.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>378.28,'end_time'=>379.7,'target_text'=>'>> That side we can get a view.','source_text'=>'>> Ikut sebelah sana kita boleh lihat pemandangan.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>379.8,'end_time'=>380.08,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ya betul.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>380.08,'end_time'=>382.62,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re at the base of the pagoda.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami berada di bahagian tapak asas pagoda.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>382.72,'end_time'=>386.26,'target_text'=>'There\'s a nice garden surrounding the pagoda.','source_text'=>'Ada taman yang indah mengelilingi pagoda ini.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>386.36,'end_time'=>388.14,'target_text'=>'Oh, these are lily pads.','source_text'=>'Oh, ini daun teratai.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>388.24,'end_time'=>388.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>388.76,'end_time'=>389.38,'target_text'=>'>> These are lily pads.','source_text'=>'>> Ini daun teratai di atas air.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>389.48,'end_time'=>392.38,'target_text'=>'Usually frogs hop on lily pads.','source_text'=>'Biasanya katak melompat atas daun teratai macam ni.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>392.48,'end_time'=>395.66,'target_text'=>'You can also see some algae in the water here.','source_text'=>'Anda juga boleh nampak lumut di dalam air di sini.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>395.76,'end_time'=>398.74,'target_text'=>'Right there, you can see a water tap.','source_text'=>'Di sebelah sana ada kepala paip air.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>398.84,'end_time'=>399.82,'target_text'=>'That is a pail.','source_text'=>'Itu sebuah baldi.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>399.92,'end_time'=>404.06,'target_text'=>'You can also see two rags on that cement.','source_text'=>'Anda juga boleh lihat dua helai kain buruk di atas lantai simen itu.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>404.16,'end_time'=>407.78,'target_text'=>'>> Do you see the way that they shape the trees to grow like that?','source_text'=>'>> Kamu perasan tak cara mereka bentuk pokok-pokok tu supaya tumbuh macam tu?','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>407.88,'end_time'=>409.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, the trees do look quite beautiful.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, pokok-pokok tu memang nampak sangat cantik.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>409.84,'end_time'=>412.98,'target_text'=>'I like the way they trim the trees and the leaves.','source_text'=>'Saya suka cara mereka memangkas dahan dan daun pokok.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>413.08,'end_time'=>413.86,'target_text'=>'It looks nice.','source_text'=>'Nampak kemas dan menarik.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>413.96,'end_time'=>415.02,'target_text'=>'>> a lily flower.','source_text'=>'>> bunga teratai.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>415.12,'end_time'=>415.48,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, cantiknya.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>415.48,'end_time'=>416.66,'target_text'=>'That\'s actually really good.','source_text'=>'Memang nampak sangat cantik.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>416.76,'end_time'=>417.58,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>417.68,'end_time'=>419.62,'target_text'=>'>> Look at the flower.','source_text'=>'>> Tengok bunganya yang mekar tu.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>419.72,'end_time'=>422.58,'target_text'=>'And I think we might have to buy tickets.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa kita mungkin kena beli tiket.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>422.68,'end_time'=>423.22,'target_text'=>'Do we?','source_text'=>'Kena ke?','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>423.32,'end_time'=>423.68,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'>> Mak pun tak pasti.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>423.68,'end_time'=>425.18,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try our ticket.','source_text'=>'Jom kita cuba guna tiket kita.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>425.28,'end_time'=>425.74,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try it.','source_text'=>'Cuba imbas dulu.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>425.84,'end_time'=>426.24,'target_text'=>'>> so, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi begitulah.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>426.24,'end_time'=>427.14,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go try.','source_text'=>'Jom kita cuba.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>427.24,'end_time'=>428.06,'target_text'=>'See if we can get in.','source_text'=>'Tengok sama ada kita boleh masuk atau tidak.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>428.16,'end_time'=>429.78,'target_text'=>'The tickets worked and now we\'re in.','source_text'=>'Tiket kami sah dan sekarang kami dah berjaya masuk ke dalam.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>429.88,'end_time'=>431.58,'target_text'=>'So, this is the bottom of the pagoda.','source_text'=>'Ini bahagian tingkat bawah pagoda.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>431.68,'end_time'=>435.66,'target_text'=>'There\'s a huge golden Buddha with a golden ceiling.','source_text'=>'Ada patung Buddha emas gergasi dengan siling kubah keemasan.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>435.76,'end_time'=>436.82,'target_text'=>'But let\'s go up.','source_text'=>'Mari kita naik ke tingkat atas.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>436.92,'end_time'=>439.74,'target_text'=>'There\'s a sign here that says keep silent.','source_text'=>'Ada papan tanda di sini meminta pengunjung bertenang dan diam.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>439.84,'end_time'=>441.98,'target_text'=>'So, I think we have to climb up the stairs.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya kita kena mendaki tangga.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>442.08,'end_time'=>445.06,'target_text'=>'If we have to climb up every single stair, dude, that\'d be crazy.','source_text'=>'Kalau kena panjat tangga sampai ke atas sekali, memang tercungap-cungap dibuatnya.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>445.16,'end_time'=>445.98,'target_text'=>'It\'s a lot of stairs.','source_text'=>'Banyak anak tangganya.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>446.08,'end_time'=>447.22,'target_text'=>'>> by step, I guess.','source_text'=>'>> Panjat satu per satu lah nampaknya.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>447.32,'end_time'=>450.26,'target_text'=>'>> I wonder how many flights this pagoda is.','source_text'=>'>> Agak-agak berapa tingkat tinggi pagoda ini.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>450.36,'end_time'=>451.46,'target_text'=>'We\'re about to find out.','source_text'=>'Sebentar lagi kita akan tahu.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>451.56,'end_time'=>455.22,'target_text'=>'Okay, now we\'re about to get into the elevator here after everyone gets out.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang kami akan masuk ke dalam lif selepas semua orang keluar.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>455.32,'end_time'=>457.68,'target_text'=>'We\'re in the elevator.','source_text'=>'Kami sudah berada di dalam lif.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>457.96,'end_time'=>459.06,'target_text'=>'Look at that view.','source_text'=>'Lihat pemandangan di luar itu.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>459.16,'end_time'=>461.06,'target_text'=>'That is a nice view.','source_text'=>'Pemandangan yang sangat memukau.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>461.16,'end_time'=>463.06,'target_text'=>'You can see like the whole complex.','source_text'=>'Boleh nampak seluruh kawasan kompleks dari atas.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>463.16,'end_time'=>464.14,'target_text'=>'Where do we start?','source_text'=>'Dari mana kita mula tadi?','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>464.24,'end_time'=>465.1,'target_text'=>'>> there to the left.','source_text'=>'>> sebelah kiri sana tu.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>465.2,'end_time'=>466.9,'target_text'=>'You see where the big gate is?','source_text'=>'Nampak tak pintu gerbang besar tu?','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>467,'end_time'=>467.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, nampak.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>467.56,'end_time'=>468.78,'target_text'=>'>> We entered there.','source_text'=>'>> Kita masuk dari situ tadi.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>468.88,'end_time'=>470.9,'target_text'=>'And then all of that looks like a wall.','source_text'=>'Dan sepanjang laluan tu nampak macam dinding.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>471,'end_time'=>472.46,'target_text'=>'That\'s all the walkway.','source_text'=>'Itulah keseluruhan laluan pejalan kaki.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>472.56,'end_time'=>473.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>473.6,'end_time'=>474.98,'target_text'=>'So we walked that whole place.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita dah berjalan merentasi seluruh kawasan tu.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>475.08,'end_time'=>475.48,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>475.48,'end_time'=>478.06,'target_text'=>'And then the Buddha was it was in that building there.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu patung Buddha tu dalam bangunan sana tu.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>478.16,'end_time'=>480.18,'target_text'=>'>> No, it was the Buddha was the one in front.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, patung Buddha tu yang dekat bahagian depan tadi.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>480.28,'end_time'=>481.62,'target_text'=>'>> No, the Buddha was here.','source_text'=>'>> Bukanlah, Buddha ada kat sini.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>481.72,'end_time'=>482.98,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I guess the Buddha was here.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, rasanya patung Buddha tu dekat sini.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>483.08,'end_time'=>486.1,'target_text'=>'You can see just the sheer size of this complex.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh bayangkan betapa luar biasanya keluasan kompleks ini.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>486.2,'end_time'=>487.94,'target_text'=>'That lady said 6 km.','source_text'=>'Wanita tadi kata jaraknya 6 kilometer.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>488.04,'end_time'=>489.38,'target_text'=>'This is like a kilometer.','source_text'=>'Yang ini nampak macam sekilometer saja.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>489.48,'end_time'=>493.58,'target_text'=>'>> But I think she meant if you go from one spot to the next maybe.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi mak rasa maksud dia kalau kita jalan dari satu sudut ke sudut lain.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>493.68,'end_time'=>498.7,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, maybe total walkable area 6 km, but not like lengthwise.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, mungkin jumlah keseluruhan laluan jalan kaki 6 km, bukannya jarak lurus.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>498.8,'end_time'=>500.5,'target_text'=>'Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'Wah, hebatnya.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>500.6,'end_time'=>502.84,'target_text'=>'That is crazy.','source_text'=>'Memang luar biasa.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>503.32,'end_time'=>506.14,'target_text'=>'And you can see they have a huge convention hall there.','source_text'=>'Dan anda boleh nampak mereka ada dewan konvensyen yang sangat besar di sana.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>506.24,'end_time'=>507.98,'target_text'=>'They call it the convention center.','source_text'=>'Mereka panggil pusat konvensyen.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>508.08,'end_time'=>512.46,'target_text'=>'>> I feel like we came from behind these mountains cuz we passed that bridge down there.','source_text'=>'>> Mak rasa kita datang dari arah belakang gunung-ganang ni sebab tadi kita lalu jambatan kat bawah tu.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>512.56,'end_time'=>514.86,'target_text'=>'So we came from the other side of these mountains.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita datang dari sebalik kawasan pergunungan ini.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>514.96,'end_time'=>517.06,'target_text'=>'>> Well, Ninh Binh is just right there.','source_text'=>'>> Bandar Ninh Binh terletak betul-betul di sebelah sana.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>517.16,'end_time'=>518.54,'target_text'=>'Just up ahead of us.','source_text'=>'Betul-betul di hadapan kita.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>518.64,'end_time'=>519.22,'target_text'=>'Is it not?','source_text'=>'Bukan ke?','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>519.32,'end_time'=>520.26,'target_text'=>'Actually, I\'m not sure.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya saya pun tak berapa pasti.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>520.36,'end_time'=>521.5,'target_text'=>'I\'m a little bit lost.','source_text'=>'Saya agak keliru sikit dengan arahnya.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>521.6,'end_time'=>527.5,'target_text'=>'>> When you stopped at the river, that\'s where we stopped because that bridge and barges were at that river there.','source_text'=>'>> Masa kamu berhenti dekat sungai tu, di situlah tempatnya sebab jambatan dan tongkang ada di sungai tu.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>527.6,'end_time'=>528.98,'target_text'=>'And then we came around.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu kita pusing masuk.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>529.08,'end_time'=>530.22,'target_text'=>'We entered in like that.','source_text'=>'Kita masuk ikut laluan macam tu tadi.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>530.32,'end_time'=>533.62,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m honestly surprised there\'s not busier up top here.','source_text'=>'>> Sejujurnya saya terkejut bahagian atas ini tidak berapa sesak.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>533.72,'end_time'=>535.74,'target_text'=>'We haven\'t really run into many people up here.','source_text'=>'Kami tak jumpa ramai orang pun di atas tingkat ini.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>535.84,'end_time'=>538.22,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe it\'s because we\'re going against the flow.','source_text'=>'>> Mungkin sebab laluan kita bertentangan dengan arah aliran pelawat lain.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>538.32,'end_time'=>540.26,'target_text'=>'The arrow was pointing that way.','source_text'=>'Tanda anak panah tadi menghala ke arah sana.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>540.36,'end_time'=>540.68,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, no.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, bukan.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>540.68,'end_time'=>541.78,'target_text'=>'It just says no climbing.','source_text'=>'Papan tanda tu cuma kata dilarang memanjat.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>541.88,'end_time'=>543.26,'target_text'=>'Oh, there is the parking lot.','source_text'=>'Oh, di sana tempat letak kenderaan.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>543.36,'end_time'=>544.94,'target_text'=>'That\'s the huge parking lot.','source_text'=>'Itulah kawasan parkir yang tersangat luas.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>545.04,'end_time'=>546.34,'target_text'=>'>> Oh my goodness.','source_text'=>'>> Ya ampun, luasnya.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>546.44,'end_time'=>549.82,'target_text'=>'>> There you can see that building is even bigger than the last one.','source_text'=>'>> Di sana anda boleh lihat bangunan itu jauh lebih besar daripada bangunan sebelumnya.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>549.92,'end_time'=>554.02,'target_text'=>'You can also see the big Buddha statue there with the big belly.','source_text'=>'Anda juga boleh nampak patung Buddha besar yang berperut buncit di sana.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>554.12,'end_time'=>557.26,'target_text'=>'And I think we can get the shuttle buses right down there to go back.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa kita boleh naik bas ulang-alik di bawah sana untuk pulang.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>557.36,'end_time'=>558.02,'target_text'=>'Like right down there.','source_text'=>'Betul-betul di bahagian bawah sana.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>558.12,'end_time'=>560.9,'target_text'=>'So we don\'t have to walk all the way back where we came from.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita tak perlulah berjalan kaki patah balik sepanjang jalan yang kita lalu tadi.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>561,'end_time'=>562.14,'target_text'=>'I guess we\'re at the end of it.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya kita dah sampai ke hujung lawatan.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>562.24,'end_time'=>562.98,'target_text'=>'We made it.','source_text'=>'Kita dah berjaya habiskan.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>563.08,'end_time'=>567.06,'target_text'=>'>> I think when she told us 5 km to get to the entrance gate, that\'s not true.','source_text'=>'>> Mak rasa masa perempuan tu cakap 5 km nak ke pintu gerbang utama tu, tak betul kot.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>567.16,'end_time'=>568.66,'target_text'=>'That\'s not 5 km.','source_text'=>'Jaraknya tak sampai 5 km pun.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>568.76,'end_time'=>570.74,'target_text'=>'>> It is still pretty far though.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi tetap agak jauh juga.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>570.84,'end_time'=>572.78,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it is far but >> quite far.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, memang jauh tapi... >> Cukup jauh juga.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>572.88,'end_time'=>573.78,'target_text'=>'This is a nice view.','source_text'=>'Pemandangan dari sini memang sangat indah.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>573.88,'end_time'=>575.78,'target_text'=>'This is like the highlight coming up here.','source_text'=>'Naik ke atas sini memang kemuncak pengalaman lawatan ini.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>575.88,'end_time'=>580.1,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster, get the workbook for this video on my website.','source_text'=>'Jika anda ingin belajar lebih cepat, dapatkan buku latihan untuk video ini di laman web saya.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>580.2,'end_time'=>586.94,'target_text'=>'It includes deeper explanations and exercises to help you remember and master what you learned.','source_text'=>'Ia mengandungi penerangan mendalam dan latihan praktikal untuk membantu anda mengingati dan menguasai apa yang dipelajari.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>587.04,'end_time'=>592.9,'target_text'=>'And if you get five or more workbooks, you\'ll get 30% off automatically at checkout.','source_text'=>'Dan jika anda beli lima atau lebih buku latihan, anda akan dapat diskaun 30% secara automatik semasa pembayaran.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>593,'end_time'=>597.32,'target_text'=>'So, go to the description or my website vulcaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Jadi layari pautan di ruangan penerangan atau laman web saya di vocaenglish.com.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>597.44,'end_time'=>600.78,'target_text'=>'We\'ve just finished exploring this whole complex.','source_text'=>'Kami baru sahaja selesai meneroka seluruh kawasan kompleks ini.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>600.88,'end_time'=>603.66,'target_text'=>'We went up the main pagoda and we saw everything.','source_text'=>'Kami naik ke atas pagoda utama dan melihat seluruh pemandangan.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>603.76,'end_time'=>604.74,'target_text'=>'We saw the whole complex.','source_text'=>'Kami dapat melihat segenap penjuru kompleks ini.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>604.84,'end_time'=>606.14,'target_text'=>'It was really beautiful.','source_text'=>'Suasananya memang sungguh mempesonakan.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>606.24,'end_time'=>611.74,'target_text'=>'And now we\'re heading to an ancient city, an ancient city here in Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang kami sedang menuju ke sebuah kota purba di Vietnam ini.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>611.84,'end_time'=>615.86,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to explore how they lived back in ancient times, I guess.','source_text'=>'Kami akan meneroka bagaimana corak kehidupan masyarakat pada zaman dahulu.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>615.96,'end_time'=>618.02,'target_text'=>'And maybe learn something about history, too.','source_text'=>'Dan mungkin dapat mempelajari sedikit sebanyak tentang sejarah silam.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>618.12,'end_time'=>621.86,'target_text'=>'And also see a lot of beautiful architecture and structures.','source_text'=>'Serta melihat keindahan seni bina dan binaan bersejarah.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>621.96,'end_time'=>624.58,'target_text'=>'>> But first, I think we should go for lunch.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi sebelum tu, mak rasa elok kita pergi makan tengah hari dulu.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>624.68,'end_time'=>625.62,'target_text'=>'>> Facts, I\'m hungry.','source_text'=>'>> Betul sangat tu, perut saya pun dah lapar.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>625.72,'end_time'=>626.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, and thirsty.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, dan tekak pun dah haus.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>626.72,'end_time'=>627.86,'target_text'=>'>> know Leon\'s hungry, so.','source_text'=>'>> Leon pun dah lapar, jadi...','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>627.96,'end_time'=>631.42,'target_text'=>'>> We don\'t want anybody, you know, getting hangry, so let\'s go eat.','source_text'=>'>> Kita tak nak sesiapa meradang sebab lapar (*hangry*), jadi jom kita pergi makan.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>631.52,'end_time'=>632.02,'target_text'=>'>> no, we don\'t.','source_text'=>'>> Betul, jangan sampai lapar marah.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>632.12,'end_time'=>635.54,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s go find some food and then go explore the ancient city.','source_text'=>'Jadi mari kita cari makanan dulu sebelum pergi meneroka kota purba.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>635.64,'end_time'=>638.42,'target_text'=>'We just got off the vehicle there.','source_text'=>'Kami baru sahaja turun daripada kenderaan di sana.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>638.52,'end_time'=>645.66,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re heading back to our bikes and then we are going to go into town and grab a bite to eat because we are hungry.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami kembali ke motosikal kami dan kemudian akan masuk ke pekan untuk makan alas perut sebab kami sangat lapar.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>645.76,'end_time'=>646.78,'target_text'=>'>> And thirsty.','source_text'=>'>> Dan dahaga.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>646.88,'end_time'=>648.7,'target_text'=>'>> And thirsty and dizzy.','source_text'=>'>> Dahaga dan agak pening kepala.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>648.8,'end_time'=>649.82,'target_text'=>'So, we need to food.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami perlukan makanan segera.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>649.92,'end_time'=>655.66,'target_text'=>'Okay, here we just stopped on the side of the road and you can see there are a bunch of goats here and a lot of baby goats,','source_text'=>'Baiklah, di sini kami berhenti sekejap di tepi jalan dan anda boleh nampak sekawan kambing bersama banyak anak kambing,','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>655.76,'end_time'=>656.22,'target_text'=>'too.','source_text'=>'juga.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>656.32,'end_time'=>660.5,'target_text'=>'Looks like they might have been born maybe a month ago, but they\'re also pretty small.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam baru lahir sebulan lepas, dan saiznya sangat comel dan kecil.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>660.6,'end_time'=>662.82,'target_text'=>'The grown adult ones are pretty small, too.','source_text'=>'Kambing dewasa pun saiznya agak kecil juga.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>662.92,'end_time'=>663.38,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>663.48,'end_time'=>664.78,'target_text'=>'>> But yeah, we stopped on the side here.','source_text'=>'>> Kami berhenti sekejap di tepi jalan ini.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>664.88,'end_time'=>667.86,'target_text'=>'I thought this might be the lunch we were looking for, but I guess not.','source_text'=>'Saya ingatkan ini menu makan tengah hari yang kami cari tadi, tapi nampaknya bukan.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>667.96,'end_time'=>669.66,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re going to go and find a restaurant.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami akan teruskan perjalanan mencari restoran.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>669.76,'end_time'=>671.42,'target_text'=>'>> The baby goats are called kids.','source_text'=>'>> Anak kambing dalam bahasa Inggeris dipanggil \'kids\'.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>671.52,'end_time'=>672.18,'target_text'=>'>> The kids.','source_text'=>'>> Anak kambing (*kids*).','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>672.28,'end_time'=>672.86,'target_text'=>'Okay, let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jom kita jalan.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>672.96,'end_time'=>680.98,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we just bought two large waters from this convenience store and now we\'re heading to the ancient capital.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, kami baru sahaja membeli dua botol besar air mineral dari kedai serbaneka ini dan sekarang kami menuju ke ibu kota purba.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>681.08,'end_time'=>681.74,'target_text'=>'You can hop on.','source_text'=>'Mak boleh naik.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>681.84,'end_time'=>688.26,'target_text'=>'And you can see my mom is hopping on the back and uh hopefully we don\'t fall, knock on wood, and let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Dan anda boleh nampak emak saya sedang membonceng di belakang, harapnya kami selamat tanpa apa-apa insiden, jom kita gerak.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>688.36,'end_time'=>689.46,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita gerak.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>689.56,'end_time'=>692.9,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, we\'ve just parked our bikes here in this parking lot.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah, kami baru sahaja meletakkan motosikal kami di kawasan parkir ini.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>693,'end_time'=>695.38,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re going to go explore the Forbidden City.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami akan meneroka Kota Larangan (*Forbidden City*).','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>695.48,'end_time'=>698.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s a huge complex here.','source_text'=>'Kawasannya kompleks yang sangat luas di sini.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>698.16,'end_time'=>700.94,'target_text'=>'You can see there are some people over there having a picnic.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak ada beberapa orang di sebelah sana sedang berkelah.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>701.04,'end_time'=>705.9,'target_text'=>'This is a nice pond here, and I believe this is like a someone\'s residence.','source_text'=>'Ini kolam yang indah di sini, dan saya percaya ini merupakan kediaman seseorang suatu masa dahulu.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>706,'end_time'=>707.14,'target_text'=>'Maybe this was the palace.','source_text'=>'Mungkin ini dahulunya sebuah istana.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>707.24,'end_time'=>709.62,'target_text'=>'I guess this is a the first courtyard here.','source_text'=>'Rasanya ini laman dalam (*courtyard*) yang pertama di sini.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>709.72,'end_time'=>710.74,'target_text'=>'What do you think of it, Mom?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat mak tentang tempat ni?','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>710.84,'end_time'=>711.78,'target_text'=>'>> I think it\'s really pretty.','source_text'=>'>> Mak rasa tempat ni memang sangat cantik.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>711.88,'end_time'=>713.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s shaded, so that\'s really nice.','source_text'=>'Kawasannya redup berteduh, jadi sangat selesa.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>713.88,'end_time'=>715.3,'target_text'=>'>> Does it feel ancient?','source_text'=>'>> Terasa aura kuno tak mak?','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>715.4,'end_time'=>716.06,'target_text'=>'Look at this.','source_text'=>'Tengok ukiran ni.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>716.16,'end_time'=>720.54,'target_text'=>'>> it feels more ancient than the um the pagoda we were just at.','source_text'=>'>> Suasananya rasa lebih kuno berbanding pagoda yang kita pergi tadi.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>720.64,'end_time'=>722.1,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, this is a national treasure.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ini khazanah warisan negara.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>722.2,'end_time'=>723.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s called the dragon bed.','source_text'=>'Ia dipanggil \'Katil Naga\'.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>723.28,'end_time'=>724.06,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, good.','source_text'=>'>> Baguslah kalau macam tu.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>724.16,'end_time'=>725.7,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, look at these ponds.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, lihat kolam-kolam ini.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>725.8,'end_time'=>727.38,'target_text'=>'That little girl\'s feeding the fish.','source_text'=>'Budak perempuan kecil tu sedang beri makan ikan.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>727.48,'end_time'=>730.46,'target_text'=>'That\'s why they are all in front of her.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah ikan-ikan semua berkerumun di hadapan dia.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>730.56,'end_time'=>732.86,'target_text'=>'And the fish are splashing cuz they\'re eating.','source_text'=>'Dan ikan-ikan tu berkocak dalam air sebab berebut makan.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>732.96,'end_time'=>736.02,'target_text'=>'This does look really really ancient, I\'m not going to lie.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya tempat ini memang nampak tersangatlah purba.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>736.12,'end_time'=>739.74,'target_text'=>'I wonder what that says cuz this is like a traditional characters, right?','source_text'=>'Tertanya-tanya juga apa maksud tulisan tu sebab ia guna tulisan aksara tradisional purba, kan?','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>739.84,'end_time'=>741.38,'target_text'=>'>> So, I wanted to talk about the flag.','source_text'=>'>> Mak nak cerita pasal bendera tu tadi.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>741.48,'end_time'=>743.14,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think we\'ve talked about the flag.','source_text'=>'Mak rasa kita belum pernah bincang pasal bendera tu lagi.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>743.24,'end_time'=>744.38,'target_text'=>'I was just reading up about it.','source_text'=>'Mak baru saja baca penerangan mengenainya.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>744.48,'end_time'=>752.58,'target_text'=>'This is the traditional Vietnamese five-color flag, and it\'s traditionally used during festivals, ceremonies, and at sacred','source_text'=>'Ini bendera tradisional lima warna Vietnam, dan mengikut adat ia dikibarkan semasa pesta, upacara rasmi, dan di tapak','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>752.68,'end_time'=>753.14,'target_text'=>'sites.','source_text'=>'keramat bersejarah.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>753.24,'end_time'=>759.54,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s why we see that flag all over historic sites and then at festivals.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah kita selalu nampak bendera ni di merata tempat bersejarah dan semasa pesta perayaan.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>759.64,'end_time'=>760.04,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>760.12,'end_time'=>761.62,'target_text'=>'The five-colored flag.','source_text'=>'Bendera lima warna.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>761.72,'end_time'=>762.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s nice.','source_text'=>'Cantik coraknya.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>762.8,'end_time'=>764.1,'target_text'=>'How many colors are on it?','source_text'=>'Ada berapa warna pada bendera tu?','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>764.2,'end_time'=>765.34,'target_text'=>'Probably five.','source_text'=>'Mestilah ada lima warna.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>765.44,'end_time'=>766.5,'target_text'=>'No, the spears.','source_text'=>'Bukan, tengok tombak tu pula.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>766.6,'end_time'=>767.3,'target_text'=>'Wait, what are they?','source_text'=>'Sekejap, senjata apa ni sebenarnya?','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>767.4,'end_time'=>769.34,'target_text'=>'Would you consider this a sword or a spear?','source_text'=>'Mak anggap ini sebilah pedang atau sebatang tombak?','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>769.44,'end_time'=>771.34,'target_text'=>'Or actually, I guess it\'s something completely different.','source_text'=>'Atau mungkin ia sejenis senjata lain yang berbeza sama sekali.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>771.44,'end_time'=>772.3,'target_text'=>'But like, humor me.','source_text'=>'Tapi cuba mak teka.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>772.4,'end_time'=>773.34,'target_text'=>'What would you call this?','source_text'=>'Mak panggil senjata ni apa?','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>773.44,'end_time'=>776.18,'target_text'=>'A sword or a spear if you had to choose between the two?','source_text'=>'Pedang atau tombak kalau mak kena pilih antara dua tu?','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>776.28,'end_time'=>777.98,'target_text'=>'>> I would say it\'s a spear sword.','source_text'=>'>> Mak rasa ini tombak pedang gabungan.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>778.08,'end_time'=>779.5,'target_text'=>'>> You have to choose between the two.','source_text'=>'>> Kena pilih salah satu antara dua tu je.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>779.6,'end_time'=>783.38,'target_text'=>'>> I think you jab, but you can\'t jab with this, so I\'ll call it a sword.','source_text'=>'>> Tombak untuk merejam tapi yang ni tak boleh rejam, jadi mak panggil pedanglah.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>783.48,'end_time'=>785.1,'target_text'=>'>> I think I\'ll call it a halberd.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa saya panggil senjata ni kapak tombak (*halberd*).','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>785.2,'end_time'=>788.42,'target_text'=>'We all agreed it\'s a it\'s a sword with a long handle.','source_text'=>'Kita semua sepakat ia sejenis pedang berhulu panjang.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>788.52,'end_time'=>789.86,'target_text'=>'Look at the design.','source_text'=>'Tengok ukirannya.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>789.96,'end_time'=>791.62,'target_text'=>'>> So, the detail on it, yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ukiran terperinci padanya.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>791.72,'end_time'=>792.5,'target_text'=>'Look at the detail.','source_text'=>'Tengok ketelitian buatannya.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>792.6,'end_time'=>793.26,'target_text'=>'>> Look at the eyes.','source_text'=>'>> Tengok bahagian matanya.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>793.36,'end_time'=>794.38,'target_text'=>'It\'s a marble.','source_text'=>'Ia daripada guli kaca.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>794.48,'end_time'=>795.62,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, it\'s a marble.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, itu biji guli rupanya.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>795.72,'end_time'=>798.74,'target_text'=>'>> But this is a really big, nice flower pot.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi ini pasu bunga yang sangat besar dan cantik.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>798.84,'end_time'=>799.7,'target_text'=>'There\'s a plant in it.','source_text'=>'Ada pokok ditanam di dalamnya.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>799.8,'end_time'=>800.12,'target_text'=>'It\'s cool.','source_text'=>'Nampak menarik.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>800.12,'end_time'=>801.1,'target_text'=>'I like the scales.','source_text'=>'Saya suka corak sisiknya.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>801.2,'end_time'=>802.18,'target_text'=>'Is this a phoenix?','source_text'=>'Ini burung phoenix ke?','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>802.28,'end_time'=>803.02,'target_text'=>'Looks like a bird.','source_text'=>'Rupa macam burung.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>803.12,'end_time'=>803.86,'target_text'=>'>> Looks like a peacock.','source_text'=>'>> Nampak macam burung merak.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>803.96,'end_time'=>804.82,'target_text'=>'>> No, it\'s a phoenix.','source_text'=>'>> Bukanlah, ini burung phoenix.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>804.92,'end_time'=>805.78,'target_text'=>'Look at its face.','source_text'=>'Tengok mukanya.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>805.88,'end_time'=>806.7,'target_text'=>'It has a beak.','source_text'=>'Ada paruh burung.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>806.8,'end_time'=>809.22,'target_text'=>'>> My goodness, I guess we all see something different.','source_text'=>'>> Ya ampun, nampaknya pandangan kita semua berbeza-beza.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>809.32,'end_time'=>810.22,'target_text'=>'>> This is a horse.','source_text'=>'>> Yang ini patung kuda.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>810.32,'end_time'=>812.82,'target_text'=>'Shout out year of the horse, 2026.','source_text'=>'Tahun zodiak kuda 2026.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>812.92,'end_time'=>813.62,'target_text'=>'That\'s me.','source_text'=>'Itulah tahun kelahiran saya.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>813.72,'end_time'=>818.56,'target_text'=>'The roof of this house looks really old, very weathered.','source_text'=>'Bumbung rumah ini nampak sangat tua dan dimamah usia.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>819.48,'end_time'=>825.98,'target_text'=>'This is a traditional temple courtyard with old stone gates, tall trees, and a wide brick walkway.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah laman kuil tradisional dengan pintu gerbang batu purba, pepohon rendang yang tinggi, dan laluan pejalan kaki berturap bata yang luas.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>826.08,'end_time'=>830.7,'target_text'=>'The ground is covered with large red tiles that look warm under the sunlight.','source_text'=>'Lantainya dilapisi jubin merah bersaiz besar yang kelihatan hangat disinari cahaya matahari.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>830.8,'end_time'=>838.58,'target_text'=>'Several people are walking through the entrance while wearing light clothes and hats because the weather looks hot and sunny.','source_text'=>'Kelihatan beberapa orang sedang berjalan melalui pintu masuk dengan berpakaian santai dan bertopi kerana cuaca kelihatan panas terik.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>838.68,'end_time'=>844.54,'target_text'=>'In the middle of the scene, there are two tall stone towers with detailed carvings and decorations.','source_text'=>'Di tengah-tengah pemandangan, berdiri megah dua menara batu tinggi dengan ukiran dan hiasan yang sangat terperinci.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>844.64,'end_time'=>848.38,'target_text'=>'The towers look old, historic, and carefully designed.','source_text'=>'Menara tersebut kelihatan klasik, penuh nilai sejarah, dan dibina dengan penuh ketelitian seni.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>848.48,'end_time'=>854.26,'target_text'=>'Near the entrance, colorful flags are standing beside the pathway and moving gently in the wind.','source_text'=>'Berhampiran pintu masuk, bendera berwarna-warni berkibar lembut ditiup angin di sepanjang laluan.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>854.36,'end_time'=>861.34,'target_text'=>'Behind the wall, there are green trees, tropical plants, and white flowers growing around the temple area.','source_text'=>'Di sebalik dinding kuil, kelihatan pepohon hijau rendang, tumbuhan tropika, dan bunga-bunga putih mekar menghiasi kawasan kuil.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>861.44,'end_time'=>864.42,'target_text'=>'The sky is bright blue with a few thin clouds.','source_text'=>'Langit membiru cerah dihiasi segumpal awan nipis yang memutih.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>864.52,'end_time'=>870.54,'target_text'=>'Shadows from the tall trees fall across the ground and create darker shapes on the tiles.','source_text'=>'Bayang-bayang daripada pepohon tinggi menutupi sebahagian tanah dan menghasilkan corak redup di atas permukaan jubin.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>870.64,'end_time'=>874.74,'target_text'=>'The whole place feels peaceful, cultural, and traditional.','source_text'=>'Seluruh kawasan ini terasa begitu damai, kaya dengan unsur kebudayaan dan nilai tradisi yang mendalam.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>874.84,'end_time'=>880.38,'target_text'=>'It looks like a place where people come to pray, visit, or learn about history.','source_text'=>'Ia bagaikan sebuah destinasi di mana orang ramai hadir untuk beribadat, berziarah, atau mendalami lembaran sejarah lampau.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>880.48,'end_time'=>884.62,'target_text'=>'Let me know in the comments if you guys like those shadowing lessons.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya di ruangan komen jika anda semua suka latihan meniru sebutan seperti ini.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>884.72,'end_time'=>885.78,'target_text'=>'Let\'s continue.','source_text'=>'Mari kita sambung perjalanan.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>885.88,'end_time'=>889.46,'target_text'=>'Okay, now we\'re going to walk through this small gate.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang kami akan berjalan melepasi pintu pagar kecil ini.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>889.56,'end_time'=>891.46,'target_text'=>'I would have hit my head there if I didn\'t bend down.','source_text'=>'Kepala saya mesti terhantuk tadi kalau saya tak tunduk.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>891.56,'end_time'=>893.1,'target_text'=>'What about you, Mom?','source_text'=>'Mak macam mana pula?','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>893.2,'end_time'=>893.86,'target_text'=>'How tall are you?','source_text'=>'Berapa tinggi mak?','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>893.96,'end_time'=>895.3,'target_text'=>'>> Not very likely.','source_text'=>'>> Mak takkan terhantuk punya.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>895.4,'end_time'=>900.02,'target_text'=>'I\'m shorter than you, so I seem to fit in everywhere here.','source_text'=>'Mak lebih rendah daripada kamu, jadi mak muat je jalan kat mana-mana pintu kat sini.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>900.12,'end_time'=>901.06,'target_text'=>'You could probably fit in there.','source_text'=>'Mak memang muat senang-senang je lalu kat situ.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>901.16,'end_time'=>902.62,'target_text'=>'Do you want to stand in that entrance?','source_text'=>'Mak nak cuba berdiri dekat pintu gerbang tu ke?','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>902.72,'end_time'=>903.34,'target_text'=>'I\'m sure.','source_text'=>'Mestilah lepas.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>903.44,'end_time'=>904.7,'target_text'=>'I\'m just making it.','source_text'=>'Saya ni muat-muat ngam je tingginya.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>904.8,'end_time'=>909.54,'target_text'=>'I think people here are shorter than I am, and I\'m probably >> Stand up straight.','source_text'=>'Rasanya orang di sini lebih rendah daripada saya, dan saya mungkin... >> Berdiri tegak tengok.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>909.64,'end_time'=>912.62,'target_text'=>'Oh, that\'s like >> that accommodation we had, too.','source_text'=>'Oh, sama macam... >> Macam tempat penginapan kita hari tu juga.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>912.72,'end_time'=>913.86,'target_text'=>'I just made it in there.','source_text'=>'Kepala saya muat-muat je lepas masuk situ.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>913.96,'end_time'=>915.78,'target_text'=>'>> Bro, let me try.','source_text'=>'>> Meh biar aku pula cuba.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>915.88,'end_time'=>918.04,'target_text'=>'>> Same size.','source_text'=>'>> Saiz yang sama je.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>918.64,'end_time'=>920.1,'target_text'=>'Careful with your glasses.','source_text'=>'Hati-hati dengan cermin mata kau tu.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>920.2,'end_time'=>922.18,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s okay.','source_text'=>'>> Tak apa, selamat.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>922.28,'end_time'=>926.1,'target_text'=>'These are some nice vines growing on this wall, but it looks dead.','source_text'=>'Pokok menjalar di dinding ni nampak cantik, tapi dah macam kering mati.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>926.2,'end_time'=>926.66,'target_text'=>'It might be dead.','source_text'=>'Mungkin dah mati kot.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>926.76,'end_time'=>928.42,'target_text'=>'I\'m not a botanist.','source_text'=>'Saya bukannya pakar tumbuhan.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>928.52,'end_time'=>931.18,'target_text'=>'>> What can you see in this place?','source_text'=>'>> Apa yang kamu nampak di tempat ini?','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>931.28,'end_time'=>935.58,'target_text'=>'>> I also want you guys to answer, what can you see in this place?','source_text'=>'>> Saya juga nak anda semua jawab di komen, apa yang anda nampak di kawasan ini?','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>935.68,'end_time'=>936.78,'target_text'=>'What can you see?','source_text'=>'Apa yang anda boleh lihat?','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>936.88,'end_time'=>942.18,'target_text'=>'>> Well, I can see there\'s three water buffalo on the edge of this square.','source_text'=>'>> Mak nampak ada tiga ekor kerbau di hujung dataran ini.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>942.28,'end_time'=>945.54,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so way over there at the very end, there are three water buffalo.','source_text'=>'>> Di sudut hujung sebelah sana ada tiga ekor kerbau.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>945.64,'end_time'=>947.34,'target_text'=>'What else can you see?','source_text'=>'Apa lagi yang mak nampak?','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>947.44,'end_time'=>949.5,'target_text'=>'>> I can see a small pagoda.','source_text'=>'>> Mak nampak ada pagoda kecil.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>949.6,'end_time'=>951.34,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, small pagoda.','source_text'=>'>> Pagoda kecil.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>951.44,'end_time'=>954.62,'target_text'=>'I see a row of flags.','source_text'=>'Saya nampak deretan bendera.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>954.72,'end_time'=>956.66,'target_text'=>'Both the What was that?','source_text'=>'Kedua-dua jenis... apa nama bendera tu tadi?','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>956.76,'end_time'=>958.26,'target_text'=>'Five-color traditional flag?','source_text'=>'Bendera tradisional lima warna?','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>958.36,'end_time'=>958.94,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>959.04,'end_time'=>960.38,'target_text'=>'>> And also the Vietnamese flag.','source_text'=>'>> Dan juga bendera kebangsaan Vietnam.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>960.48,'end_time'=>962.86,'target_text'=>'And here I see a big open square.','source_text'=>'Dan di sini saya nampak satu dataran terbuka yang luas.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>962.96,'end_time'=>966.94,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if there were buildings or something here before, but it\'s just wide opened.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada pernah ada bangunan di sini sebelum ini, tapi kawasannya lapang terbentang.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>967.04,'end_time'=>971.14,'target_text'=>'And I also see overgrown grass in between each square.','source_text'=>'Dan saya juga nampak rumput tumbuh meliar di antara setiap petak jubin dataran.','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>971.24,'end_time'=>973.58,'target_text'=>'So, that kind of is dividing each square.','source_text'=>'Jadi ia membahagikan setiap petak persegi.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>973.68,'end_time'=>975.54,'target_text'=>'And I can see mountains in the background.','source_text'=>'Dan saya dapat lihat banjaran gunung di latar belakang.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>975.64,'end_time'=>976.3,'target_text'=>'And also lights.','source_text'=>'Serta tiang lampu.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>976.4,'end_time'=>978.74,'target_text'=>'I guess they light this whole place up at night, right?','source_text'=>'Saya rasa waktu malam mereka akan terangkan seluruh kawasan ini dengan lampu, kan?','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>978.84,'end_time'=>979.24,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>979.32,'end_time'=>982.5,'target_text'=>'Must for functions and festivals and things like that.','source_text'=>'Mestilah untuk majlis keramaian dan festival.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>982.6,'end_time'=>983.22,'target_text'=>'>> Anything else?','source_text'=>'>> Ada apa-apa lagi?','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>983.32,'end_time'=>985.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, there\'s a river in the back there.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ada sebatang sungai di bahagian belakang sana.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>985.28,'end_time'=>986.02,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>986.12,'end_time'=>986.74,'target_text'=>'A river?','source_text'=>'Ada sungai?','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>986.84,'end_time'=>987.24,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ada.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>987.28,'end_time'=>988.5,'target_text'=>'>> What else do you see?','source_text'=>'>> Apa lagi yang mak nampak?','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>988.6,'end_time'=>989.14,'target_text'=>'>> Spotlights.','source_text'=>'>> Lampu limpah (*spotlights*).','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>989.24,'end_time'=>990.02,'target_text'=>'Did you do that one?','source_text'=>'Kamu dah sebut lampu tu tadi ke?','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>990.12,'end_time'=>990.2,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Dah.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>990.2,'end_time'=>990.78,'target_text'=>'>> Spotlights.','source_text'=>'>> Lampu limpah.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>990.88,'end_time'=>992.34,'target_text'=>'I said lights, but yeah, spotlights.','source_text'=>'Saya sebut lampu tadi, tapi ya lampu limpah lebih tepat.','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>992.44,'end_time'=>993.26,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>993.36,'end_time'=>1000.26,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so we just finished having a conversation with three young students here in the ancient capital.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah, kami baru sahaja selesai berbual dengan tiga orang pelajar muda di ibu kota purba ini.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1000.36,'end_time'=>1002.58,'target_text'=>'I think they\'re around like 11, 12 years old.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa umur mereka sekitar 11 atau 12 tahun.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1002.68,'end_time'=>1008.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yes, mine was 12 years old and they live close by, like 15 km away or so.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, yang berbual dengan mak tadi umur 12 tahun dan mereka tinggal berdekatan, dalam lingkungan 15 km dari sini.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1008.24,'end_time'=>1013.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I guess they were just like young students that wanted to practice speaking English >> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, mereka pelajar muda yang bersemangat mahu berlatih bertutur dalam bahasa Inggeris >> Mhm.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1013.2,'end_time'=>1015.1,'target_text'=>'>> because learning English is very important.','source_text'=>'>> kerana menguasai bahasa Inggeris sangat penting.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1015.2,'end_time'=>1017.42,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s a great way to practice speaking.','source_text'=>'Itulah cara terbaik untuk berlatih kemahiran bertutur.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1017.52,'end_time'=>1022.9,'target_text'=>'You just need to like go up to any foreigner that speaks English and [music] just ask if you could talk with them, and I\'m','source_text'=>'Anda cuma perlu mendekati mana-mana pelancong luar negara yang bertutur bahasa Inggeris dan [muzik] minta izin untuk bersembang,','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1023,'end_time'=>1024.78,'target_text'=>'sure they\'ll be glad to talk with you.','source_text'=>'dan saya pasti mereka akan berbesar hati untuk berbual dengan anda.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1024.88,'end_time'=>1032.66,'target_text'=>'If you want to speak English more clearly and naturally, then join my speaking and pronunciation course.','source_text'=>'Jika anda ingin bertutur dalam bahasa Inggeris dengan lebih jelas dan bersahaja, sertailah kursus pertuturan dan sebutan saya.','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1032.76,'end_time'=>1042.5,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to almost 100 video lessons with two new lessons every week, a clear step-by-step practice system,','source_text'=>'Anda mendapat akses serta-merta kepada hampir 100 video pembelajaran dengan dua pelajaran baharu setiap minggu, sistem latihan tersusun langkah demi langkah,','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1042.6,'end_time'=>1048.58,'target_text'=>'and an exclusive prompt to help you master the pronunciation of any word.','source_text'=>'dan panduan prompt eksklusif untuk membantu anda menguasai sebutan mana-mana perkataan.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1048.68,'end_time'=>1054.54,'target_text'=>'Inside, we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking.','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya, kami melatih aspek sebutan, aksen, ritma, dan pertuturan semula jadi.','order'=>456],
