            ['start_time'=>4.12,'end_time'=>10.86,'target_text'=>'Today\'s video is going to be a little bit different because I\'m going to be filming this like in my old style, like the style','source_text'=>'Video hari ini akan sedikit berbeza kerana saya akan merakamkannya mengikut gaya lama saya, iaitu gaya','order'=>2],
