            ['start_time'=>33.8,'end_time'=>43.26,'target_text'=>'Knuckles, fingers, mini spoons, wrinkly, contrast, lead the way, get into in the way, we have hair, fingernails, plain curtain','source_text'=>'Buku lima, jari, sudu kecil, berkedut, kontras, tunjuk jalan, menghalang laluan, rambut, kuku jari, langsir kosong,','order'=>8],
