            ['start_time'=>58.52,'end_time'=>68.34,'target_text'=>'Now they\'re not as wrinkly as they were earlier since it\'s been about 10 to 15 minutes since I got out of the shower.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kedutnya dah makin berkurang berbanding tadi sebab dah kira-kira 10 hingga 15 minit sejak saya keluar dari bilik air.','order'=>13],
