            ['start_time'=>136.6,'end_time'=>138.34,'target_text'=>'>> powdered cheese and it\'s crunchy.','source_text'=>'>> ada serbuk keju dan teksturnya rangup.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>138.44,'end_time'=>139.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a fritter.','source_text'=>'Macam kuih goreng rangup (*fritter*).','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>139.52,'end_time'=>140.14,'target_text'=>'So good.','source_text'=>'Sedap sangat.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>140.24,'end_time'=>140.98,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, this one looks good.','source_text'=>'>> Yang ini pun nampak sedap.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>141.08,'end_time'=>142.14,'target_text'=>'Banana crunch.','source_text'=>'Pisang rangup (*banana crunch*).','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>142.24,'end_time'=>145.38,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m sure it\'d be the same concept where it\'s filled with stuff.','source_text'=>'>> Konsepnya sama juga, bahagian dalam dipenuhi inti.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>145.48,'end_time'=>146.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>146.16,'end_time'=>148.38,'target_text'=>'>> And then powder but it\'s such a messy donut.','source_text'=>'>> Dan ada taburan serbuk, tapi makan donat ni memang comot sikit.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>148.48,'end_time'=>149.78,'target_text'=>'The powder goes everywhere.','source_text'=>'Serbuknya bersepah ke mana-mana.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>149.88,'end_time'=>151.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, this place is kind of cool.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kedai ni memang bergaya.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>151.64,'end_time'=>154.94,'target_text'=>'>> And then I also had the just original donut.','source_text'=>'>> Dan aku pernah cuba juga donat asli (*original*).','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>155.04,'end_time'=>156.86,'target_text'=>'>> Strawberry shortcake looks kind of good.','source_text'=>'>> Donat kek strawberi (*strawberry shortcake*) nampak menyelerakan.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>156.96,'end_time'=>158.58,'target_text'=>'The P','source_text'=>'Donat P...','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>158.68,'end_time'=>161.3,'target_text'=>'P star shield bread.','source_text'=>'Roti pistacio (*pistachio*).','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>161.4,'end_time'=>162.58,'target_text'=>'P star shield, dude.','source_text'=>'Sebutan dia pistacio.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>162.68,'end_time'=>164.62,'target_text'=>'You get You see what they\'re trying to say there?','source_text'=>'Kau faham kan apa yang mereka cuba tulis tu?','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>164.72,'end_time'=>166.46,'target_text'=>'>> I think it\'s','source_text'=>'>> Rasanya itu...','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>166.56,'end_time'=>167.34,'target_text'=>'>> P star.','source_text'=>'>> Pistacio.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>167.44,'end_time'=>169.02,'target_text'=>'But the interior is really nice.','source_text'=>'Tapi hiasan dalaman kedai ni memang cantik betul.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>169.12,'end_time'=>170.1,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, look at this mirror.','source_text'=>'>> Tengok cermin ni.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>170.2,'end_time'=>172.74,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, dude, that is tripping me out so hard.','source_text'=>'>> Pening kepala aku tengok pantulan cermin ni.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>172.84,'end_time'=>173.94,'target_text'=>'>> hurt looking at it.','source_text'=>'>> pening biji mata memandangnya.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>174.04,'end_time'=>179.42,'target_text'=>'>> Can I have a banana crunch, a vanilla cheese crunch, and strawberry shortcake.','source_text'=>'>> Boleh saya dapatkan satu banana crunch, satu vanilla cheese crunch, dan satu strawberry shortcake.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>179.52,'end_time'=>182.98,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we have three donuts from the butter baby.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, kami ada tiga biji donat daripada kedai Butter Baby.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>183.08,'end_time'=>187.78,'target_text'=>'This is like a really nice turquoise box and you open it by tearing this right here.','source_text'=>'Kotaknya warna firus (*turquoise*) yang sangat cantik dan dibuka dengan mengoyakkan bahagian ini.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>187.88,'end_time'=>190.28,'target_text'=>'Open me, baby.','source_text'=>'Buka aku, sayang.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>191.52,'end_time'=>192.54,'target_text'=>'Dude, I like that.','source_text'=>'Menarik sungguh rekaan kotak ni.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>192.64,'end_time'=>193.54,'target_text'=>'I like that a lot.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat sukakannya.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>193.64,'end_time'=>194.04,'target_text'=>'Let\'s open it.','source_text'=>'Mari kita buka.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>194.08,'end_time'=>196.04,'target_text'=>'Come here.','source_text'=>'Tengok sini.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>196.28,'end_time'=>199.5,'target_text'=>'Oh my gosh, dude, these things look actually so good.','source_text'=>'Wah, donat-donat ini nampak sangat menyelerakan.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>199.6,'end_time'=>200.98,'target_text'=>'And look at the butter baby, dude.','source_text'=>'Dan tengok lukisan watak bayi mentega tu.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>201.08,'end_time'=>202.38,'target_text'=>'That\'s actually so funny.','source_text'=>'Comel dan melucukan betul.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>202.48,'end_time'=>204.62,'target_text'=>'Wow, this is phone worthy.','source_text'=>'Memang sesuai sangat untuk diambil gambar guna telefon.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>204.72,'end_time'=>205.82,'target_text'=>'Which one should I start with?','source_text'=>'Yang mana satu patut saya rasa dulu?','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>205.92,'end_time'=>208.94,'target_text'=>'>> Uh you want to get messy or do you not want to get messy?','source_text'=>'>> Kau nak makan comot ke atau nak makan secara bersih dulu?','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>209.04,'end_time'=>210.46,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe least messy first.','source_text'=>'>> Yang paling kurang comot dulu kot.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>210.56,'end_time'=>211.9,'target_text'=>'Oh, they\'re kind of hard to grab.','source_text'=>'Agak susah sikit nak pegang donat ni.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>212,'end_time'=>213.26,'target_text'=>'Maybe not the ideal box.','source_text'=>'Mungkin kotak ni agak sempit sikit.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>213.36,'end_time'=>214.5,'target_text'=>'Dude, look at this.','source_text'=>'Tengok donat yang ini.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>214.6,'end_time'=>216.1,'target_text'=>'How would you describe this?','source_text'=>'Macam mana anda nak gambarkan donat ini?','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>216.2,'end_time'=>217.54,'target_text'=>'This right here is whipped cream.','source_text'=>'Bahagian ini ialah krim putar (*whipped cream*).','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>217.64,'end_time'=>220.22,'target_text'=>'It looks like there is some jelly right in the center.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam ada sedikit jeli di bahagian tengah.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>220.32,'end_time'=>224.62,'target_text'=>'There\'s like some probably strawberry icing on the side with uh crumbs.','source_text'=>'Di bahagian tepi ada aising strawberi dengan taburan serbuk biskut.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>224.72,'end_time'=>226.8,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try this.','source_text'=>'Mari kita cuba rasa.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>229.4,'end_time'=>230.5,'target_text'=>'The inside has a filling.','source_text'=>'Bahagian dalamnya berinti.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>230.6,'end_time'=>233.08,'target_text'=>'Let me take one more bite.','source_text'=>'Biar saya gigit sekali lagi.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>234.24,'end_time'=>237.78,'target_text'=>'Low-key, it\'s not like the greatest thing I\'ve ever had, but it\'s a really good donut.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya bukanlah donat paling luar biasa di dunia, tapi memang sangat sedap.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>237.88,'end_time'=>238.74,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try the next one.','source_text'=>'Mari kita cuba donat yang seterusnya.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>238.84,'end_time'=>240.86,'target_text'=>'So, how would you describe this one?','source_text'=>'Macam mana pula gambaran untuk yang ini?','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>240.96,'end_time'=>247.7,'target_text'=>'It looks like there\'s some white powder sprinkled over top of the whole donut, and underneath it\'s very crunchy and hard,','source_text'=>'Kelihatan ada taburan serbuk putih di atas seluruh permukaan donat, dan lapisan bawahnya sangat rangup dan padat,','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>247.8,'end_time'=>248.94,'target_text'=>'a hard donut.','source_text'=>'donat bertekstur padat.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>249.04,'end_time'=>251.1,'target_text'=>'But, I think when you bite into it, it\'ll be soft.','source_text'=>'Tapi rasanya bila gigit, bahagian dalamnya lembut.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>251.2,'end_time'=>253.16,'target_text'=>'Let me try.','source_text'=>'Biar saya rasa.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>257.52,'end_time'=>258.98,'target_text'=>'This is the banana one.','source_text'=>'Ini yang perisa pisang.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>259.08,'end_time'=>259.9,'target_text'=>'One more bite.','source_text'=>'Satu gigitan lagi.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>260,'end_time'=>262.36,'target_text'=>'It\'s really crunchy.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat rangup.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>264.08,'end_time'=>266.04,'target_text'=>'Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'Wah, sedapnya.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>267.48,'end_time'=>268.98,'target_text'=>'Is my face dirty?','source_text'=>'Muka saya comot ke?','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>269.08,'end_time'=>270.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, comot sikit.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>270.52,'end_time'=>271.78,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, let\'s try the last one.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah, jom kita cuba yang terakhir.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>271.88,'end_time'=>273.34,'target_text'=>'Oh, dude, this looks so good.','source_text'=>'Yang ini nampak sangat menyelerakan.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>273.44,'end_time'=>279.4,'target_text'=>'Last but not least, that\'s a very common saying in English, last but not least.','source_text'=>'\"Last but not least\", itu ungkapan bahasa Inggeris yang sangat popular bermaksud yang terakhir tetapi bukan yang terkecil.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>282.36,'end_time'=>283.66,'target_text'=>'Yeah, these ones are deep fried.','source_text'=>'Ya, donat-donat ini digoreng celur minyak (*deep fried*).','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>283.76,'end_time'=>284.9,'target_text'=>'You could definitely taste the oil.','source_text'=>'Memang dapat rasa minyaknya.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>285,'end_time'=>287.2,'target_text'=>'They\'re a lot heavier.','source_text'=>'Teksturnya jauh lebih berat dan padat.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>289.6,'end_time'=>292.66,'target_text'=>'Okay, so I just tried each of the Butter Baby donuts.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, saya baru selesai mencuba ketiga-tiga perisa donat Butter Baby.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>292.76,'end_time'=>296.86,'target_text'=>'The first one was really light, not very refreshing, but it was light and well-balanced.','source_text'=>'Yang pertama tadi teksturnya ringan, tidaklah terlalu menyegarkan tapi rasa manisnya seimbang.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>296.96,'end_time'=>301.66,'target_text'=>'The other two were deep fried, so they were very, very rich and intense.','source_text'=>'Dua lagi digoreng celur minyak, jadi rasanya sangat pekat, lemak, dan mengenyangkan.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>301.76,'end_time'=>303.9,'target_text'=>'So, I don\'t know if I could eat two full donuts like that.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada mampu habiskan dua biji donat berat macam tu sekali makan.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>304,'end_time'=>307.5,'target_text'=>'I think that would definitely be a lot, but I could definitely eat two of the first donut.','source_text'=>'Rasanya terlalu muak kalau makan dua biji yang itu, tapi kalau donat yang pertama tadi saya boleh makan dua biji.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>307.6,'end_time'=>308.38,'target_text'=>'Overall, not bad.','source_text'=>'Secara keseluruhannya, sedap juga.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>308.48,'end_time'=>313.18,'target_text'=>'If you\'re from Jakarta, or you ever come here, I would come and try these donuts, and I would get it again.','source_text'=>'Jika anda orang Jakarta atau berkunjung ke sini, anda patut cuba donat ini dan saya sendiri akan membelinya lagi.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>313.28,'end_time'=>315.06,'target_text'=>'We just had these donuts.','source_text'=>'Kami baru sahaja selesai makan donat ini.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>315.16,'end_time'=>321.38,'target_text'=>'Low-key though, this was not a good idea because we didn\'t eat anything salty today, and it\'s like 2:00 p.m., and usually','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya bukan idea yang baik sebab kami belum makan apa-apa makanan berlauk masin hari ini, sekarang dah pukul 2 petang, dan kebiasaannya','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>321.48,'end_time'=>324.14,'target_text'=>'it\'s not a good idea to just eat straight sugar.','source_text'=>'kurang elok makan makanan manis bergula semata-mata waktu perut kosong.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>324.24,'end_time'=>329.02,'target_text'=>'And all we had was flan and these donuts, so not a good idea cuz that spikes your blood sugar.','source_text'=>'Sebelum ni kami cuma makan puding karamel dan donat ini, jadi tak elok sebab ia menaikkan kadar gula dalam darah dengan mendadak.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>329.12,'end_time'=>330.18,'target_text'=>'>> What happened to your pants?','source_text'=>'>> Apa jadi dengan seluar kau?','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>330.28,'end_time'=>332.7,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, low-key my pants is dirty, but that\'s from the donuts.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, seluar aku kotor sikit, tapi sebab donat tu.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>332.8,'end_time'=>333.9,'target_text'=>'>> There was a lot of powder on them.','source_text'=>'>> Banyak betul serbuk gula atas donat tu.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>334,'end_time'=>336.98,'target_text'=>'>> That powder just fell all over me, but we\'re going to go eat right now.','source_text'=>'>> Serbuk tu habis jatuh kena seluar aku, tapi sekarang jom pergi makan.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>337.08,'end_time'=>338.5,'target_text'=>'We\'re just walking around.','source_text'=>'Kita tengah jalan-jalan pusing sini.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>338.6,'end_time'=>343.06,'target_text'=>'We were going to go to a Japanese restaurant, but they\'re closed, so we\'re going to go eat burgers instead.','source_text'=>'Tadi kita nak pergi restoran Jepun, tapi tutup pula, jadi kita pergi makan burger jelah.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>343.16,'end_time'=>347.74,'target_text'=>'And they looked really good when we walked by, so we\'re going to >> of burger are you going to get, A chicken or beef?','source_text'=>'Nampak sedap sangat masa kita lalu tadi, jadi kita nak >> jenis burger apa kau nak ambil, ayam ke daging?','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>347.84,'end_time'=>348.2,'target_text'=>'>> Beef.','source_text'=>'>> Daging.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>348.2,'end_time'=>349.14,'target_text'=>'I can\'t eat anything fried.','source_text'=>'Aku tak boleh makan benda goreng lagi.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>349.24,'end_time'=>350.78,'target_text'=>'This donut was already deep fried.','source_text'=>'Donat tadi pun dah memang bergoreng.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>350.88,'end_time'=>352.98,'target_text'=>'But yeah, we\'re on the outside of this this mall.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, sekarang kita kat luar pusat beli-belah ni.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>353.08,'end_time'=>353.94,'target_text'=>'What is this mall called?','source_text'=>'Apa nama pusat beli-belah ni?','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>354.04,'end_time'=>354.78,'target_text'=>'Oh, is this square?','source_text'=>'Oh, ini square ke?','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>354.88,'end_time'=>355.94,'target_text'=>'Is this M Block Square?','source_text'=>'Ni M Bloc Square ke?','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>356.04,'end_time'=>356.9,'target_text'=>'Or space, I mean?','source_text'=>'Maksud aku, atau M Bloc Space?','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>357,'end_time'=>358.62,'target_text'=>'>> Pretty sure it\'s M Block Space or Square.','source_text'=>'>> Rasa macam M Bloc Space atau Square.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>358.72,'end_time'=>359.34,'target_text'=>'>> There\'s space and square.','source_text'=>'>> Ada yang Space dan ada yang Square.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>359.44,'end_time'=>360.62,'target_text'=>'Square is the one we were at.','source_text'=>'Square tu tempat yang kita pergi tadi.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>360.72,'end_time'=>367.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, this is the space cuz all the restaurants inside are like niche like >> of Japanese, too, like >> Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ni yang Space sebab semua restoran kat dalam ni nampak unik dan niche macam >> banyak makanan Jepun juga, macam >> Oh, ya.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>367.12,'end_time'=>370.42,'target_text'=>'Like Indonesian people love Japanese and Korean food.','source_text'=>'Orang Indonesia memang suka sangat makanan Jepun dan Korea.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>370.52,'end_time'=>371.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>371.56,'end_time'=>372.82,'target_text'=>'I can tell, especially Japanese.','source_text'=>'Boleh nampak jelas, terutamanya makanan Jepun.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>372.92,'end_time'=>374.58,'target_text'=>'I\'ve seen a lot of Japanese.','source_text'=>'Aku tengok banyak gila kedai Jepun.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>374.68,'end_time'=>375.66,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, what happened?','source_text'=>'>> Okey, apa berlaku?','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>375.76,'end_time'=>379.74,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so we went to go get the burger, but as we were like ordering, the guy was like, \"Oh, we just sold out.\" So I was','source_text'=>'>> Okey, tadi kita pergi nak beli burger, tapi masa nak order tu, pekerja tu kata, \"Oh, baru je habis.\" Jadi aku rasa','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>379.84,'end_time'=>381.26,'target_text'=>'like','source_text'=>'macam','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>381.36,'end_time'=>381.78,'target_text'=>'that sucks.','source_text'=>'kecewa betul.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>381.88,'end_time'=>382.86,'target_text'=>'So they sold out.','source_text'=>'Jadi burger dah habis dijual.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>382.96,'end_time'=>384.26,'target_text'=>'So I think we\'re not going to eat anything then.','source_text'=>'Jadi rasanya kita tak makan apa-apa lagilah buat masa ni.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>384.36,'end_time'=>387.1,'target_text'=>'We\'re just going to head to a park.','source_text'=>'Kita pergi terus ke taman je.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>387.2,'end_time'=>388.3,'target_text'=>'There\'s a park nearby.','source_text'=>'Ada taman berdekatan sini.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>388.4,'end_time'=>390.78,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to go there and see what a park is like here.','source_text'=>'Kita nak pergi sana tengok suasana taman kat sini macam mana.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>390.88,'end_time'=>393.94,'target_text'=>'Unfortunately, we won\'t be eating any lunch so far.','source_text'=>'Sayangnya, setakat ni kita masih belum dapat makan tengah hari.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>394.04,'end_time'=>395.02,'target_text'=>'2:30 already.','source_text'=>'Dah pukul 2:30 petang.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>395.12,'end_time'=>395.9,'target_text'=>'I feel like I\'m drunk, dude.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam tengah mamai gila, weh.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>396,'end_time'=>397.06,'target_text'=>'I\'m just light-headed.','source_text'=>'Kepala aku rasa melayang dan pening.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>397.16,'end_time'=>398.3,'target_text'=>'I\'m like But you know what?','source_text'=>'Aku rasa... tapi tahu tak?','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>398.4,'end_time'=>399.7,'target_text'=>'We still ball.','source_text'=>'Kita tetap teruskan juga.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>399.8,'end_time'=>401.62,'target_text'=>'Something exciting inside.','source_text'=>'Ada sesuatu yang menarik kat dalam.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>401.72,'end_time'=>402.18,'target_text'=>'>> What?','source_text'=>'>> Apa dia?','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>402.28,'end_time'=>404.26,'target_text'=>'>> Look closer.','source_text'=>'>> Tengok dekat-dekat.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>404.36,'end_time'=>404.94,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Haah.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>405.04,'end_time'=>406.02,'target_text'=>'>> What do you call this?','source_text'=>'>> Apa nama benda ni?','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>406.12,'end_time'=>409.74,'target_text'=>'>> Don\'t put your mouth on >> Do they call this a glory hole or what?','source_text'=>'>> Jangan letak mulut kau kat >> Ni orang panggil glory hole ke apa?','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>409.84,'end_time'=>411.26,'target_text'=>'>> What kind of glory you looking for?','source_text'=>'>> Glory apa yang kau cari tu?','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>411.36,'end_time'=>413.9,'target_text'=>'>> Bro, it\'s just a It\'s just a reflection of yourself.','source_text'=>'>> Weh, ni cuma pantulan muka kau sendiri je.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>414,'end_time'=>414.5,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, let\'s see.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, jom tengok.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>414.6,'end_time'=>416.72,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s just a mirror.','source_text'=>'>> Cermin rupanya.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>417.4,'end_time'=>418.22,'target_text'=>'>> It is just a mirror.','source_text'=>'>> Memang cermin je.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>418.32,'end_time'=>418.94,'target_text'=>'>> Well, you know what?','source_text'=>'>> Tapi, tahu tak?','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>419.04,'end_time'=>421.1,'target_text'=>'Something exciting was inside.','source_text'=>'Ada benda menarik kat dalam tu.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>421.2,'end_time'=>423.26,'target_text'=>'>> And what What could that be?','source_text'=>'>> Dan apa... apa bendanya tu?','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>423.36,'end_time'=>426.68,'target_text'=>'>> You can hear that very loud bike?','source_text'=>'>> Dengar tak bunyi motor kuat gila tu?','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>427.08,'end_time'=>429.18,'target_text'=>'Very loud bike drove by us.','source_text'=>'Motorsikal bising gila baru lalu sebelah kita.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>429.28,'end_time'=>432.76,'target_text'=>'And now there\'s a car driving by us.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang ada kereta lalu sebelah kita.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>432.92,'end_time'=>437.98,'target_text'=>'But the car is a lot quieter compared to the bike or the scooter.','source_text'=>'Tapi kereta jauh lebih senyap berbanding motor atau skuter.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>438.08,'end_time'=>439.42,'target_text'=>'Car is a lot quieter.','source_text'=>'Kereta jauh lebih senyap.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>439.52,'end_time'=>441.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s not as loud, it\'s quieter.','source_text'=>'Tak bising sangat, lagi tenang.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>441.76,'end_time'=>445.34,'target_text'=>'Here we have a row of trees almost in a perfect row.','source_text'=>'Kat sini ada sebaris pokok yang tersusun elok dalam satu barisan.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>445.44,'end_time'=>447.26,'target_text'=>'However, the trees are not perfect.','source_text'=>'Walau bagaimanapun, pokok-pokok ni taklah sempurna seragam.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>447.36,'end_time'=>450.34,'target_text'=>'The trees all look unique and different.','source_text'=>'Semua pokok nampak unik dan berbeza.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>450.44,'end_time'=>452.38,'target_text'=>'But now we are in a park.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang kita dah sampai di taman.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>452.48,'end_time'=>454.94,'target_text'=>'The park Let me get you the name.','source_text'=>'Taman ni... biar aku tengok namanya.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>455.04,'end_time'=>458.42,'target_text'=>'The park is called GBK City Park.','source_text'=>'Taman ni nama Hutan Kota GBK.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>458.52,'end_time'=>460.38,'target_text'=>'GBK City Park.','source_text'=>'Taman Bandar GBK.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>460.48,'end_time'=>463.18,'target_text'=>'And that is the park we are at at the moment.','source_text'=>'Dan itulah taman tempat kita berada sekarang.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>463.28,'end_time'=>467.34,'target_text'=>'This right here, these tiles, can you guys tell me what they\'re used for?','source_text'=>'Jubin lantai kat sini ni, korang boleh beritahu tak untuk apa fungsinya?','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>467.44,'end_time'=>471.52,'target_text'=>'What is the purpose of these tiles?','source_text'=>'Apa tujuan jubin penunjuk arah ni?','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>472.32,'end_time'=>476.94,'target_text'=>'The purpose of these tiles is for people that can\'t see.','source_text'=>'Tujuan jubin ni adalah untuk orang yang ada masalah penglihatan.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>477.04,'end_time'=>479.3,'target_text'=>'What do you call a person that can\'t see?','source_text'=>'Apa kita panggil orang yang tak boleh melihat?','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>479.4,'end_time'=>482.78,'target_text'=>'Not because their eyes are closed, but because they literally cannot see.','source_text'=>'Bukan sebab pejam mata, tapi memang betul-betul tak dapat melihat.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>482.88,'end_time'=>484.5,'target_text'=>'What do you call a person like that?','source_text'=>'Apa panggilan untuk orang macam tu?','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>484.6,'end_time'=>485.62,'target_text'=>'>> A blind person.','source_text'=>'>> Orang buta.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>485.72,'end_time'=>486.46,'target_text'=>'>> A blind person.','source_text'=>'>> Orang buta (cacat penglihatan).','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>486.56,'end_time'=>488.02,'target_text'=>'You call that a blind person.','source_text'=>'Kita panggil orang buta atau OKU penglihatan.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>488.12,'end_time'=>495.42,'target_text'=>'So, most of the time a blind person has this stick that is compressed, but they can pull it out or it comes open and they','source_text'=>'Jadi, kebiasaannya orang buta ada tongkat boleh lipat, dan mereka boleh tarik panjang atau buka dan mereka','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>495.52,'end_time'=>500.14,'target_text'=>'go swiping side to side like this in this motion, side to side.','source_text'=>'hayun ke kiri dan kanan dengan gerakan macam ni, ke kiri dan kanan.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>500.24,'end_time'=>504.78,'target_text'=>'And when they walk, they can feel this feel this line and they know where to walk.','source_text'=>'Dan bila berjalan, mereka boleh rasa alur garisan ni dan tahu arah nak berjalan.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>504.88,'end_time'=>505.94,'target_text'=>'My eyes are bad though.','source_text'=>'Mata aku pun rabun juga sebenarnya.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>506.04,'end_time'=>507.62,'target_text'=>'I need to wear either contacts.','source_text'=>'Aku kena pakai sama ada kanta lekap.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>507.72,'end_time'=>509.62,'target_text'=>'I have contacts in my eyes right now.','source_text'=>'Sekarang ni pun aku tengah pakai kanta lekap kat mata.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>509.72,'end_time'=>515.66,'target_text'=>'Contacts are these very thin concave pieces of I don\'t even know what it\'s made out of.','source_text'=>'Kanta lekap ni bentuknya cekung nipis sangat, diperbuat daripada... aku pun tak pasti bahan apa.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>515.76,'end_time'=>516.7,'target_text'=>'>> Like a plastic.','source_text'=>'>> Macam sejenis plastik.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>516.8,'end_time'=>518.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'m not really sure what it\'s made out of.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, aku tak berapa pasti dibuat daripada apa.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>518.28,'end_time'=>523.42,'target_text'=>'This is what contacts are made out of, this material right here.','source_text'=>'Daripada bahan macam nilah kanta lekap dibuat, material jenis ni.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>523.52,'end_time'=>530.62,'target_text'=>'And uh yeah, they\'re very thin and you put them on your eye and it changes kind of like the way light enters your eye, so','source_text'=>'Dan ya, benda ni sangat nipis dan bila letak kat mata, ia ubah cara cahaya masuk ke mata, jadi','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>530.72,'end_time'=>531.9,'target_text'=>'then it corrects your vision.','source_text'=>'ia dapat membetulkan penglihatan korang.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>532,'end_time'=>533.7,'target_text'=>'And the same thing happens with glasses.','source_text'=>'Benda sama juga berlaku dengan cermin mata.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>533.8,'end_time'=>535.94,'target_text'=>'You put glasses on to help correct your vision.','source_text'=>'Korang pakai cermin mata untuk bantu betulkan penglihatan.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>536.04,'end_time'=>542.22,'target_text'=>'When I turn 25, so in 2 years, I will get uh Did you see that branch fall?','source_text'=>'Bila umur aku 25 nanti, dalam lagi 2 tahun, aku nak... Kau nampak tak dahan pokok tu jatuh?','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>542.32,'end_time'=>543.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, watch out.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, hati-hati.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>543.32,'end_time'=>544.38,'target_text'=>'Watch your head.','source_text'=>'Jaga kepala kau.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>544.48,'end_time'=>548.34,'target_text'=>'>> So, yeah, in about 2 years, I want to get LASIK eye surgery.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi ya, dalam lebih kurang 2 tahun lagi, aku nak buat pembedahan mata LASIK.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>548.44,'end_time'=>553.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s a type of eye surgery where they like correct your like eyesight.','source_text'=>'Ia sejenis pembedahan mata di mana doktor akan betulkan tahap penglihatan kita.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>553.56,'end_time'=>560.22,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ve had some friends that have done it and now they have perfect eyes, but uh ideally before you get it, you either want','source_text'=>'Ada kawan-kawan aku yang dah buat dan sekarang penglihatan diorang dah sempurna, tapi seeloknya sebelum buat pembedahan tu, korang kena','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>560.32,'end_time'=>566.06,'target_text'=>'to be at least 25 or if your eyes haven\'t changed in the past 3 years, then you can also get it.','source_text'=>'berumur sekurang-kurangnya 25 tahun atau kalau tahap rabun korang tak berubah dalam 3 tahun lepas, barulah boleh buat.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>566.16,'end_time'=>572.14,'target_text'=>'So, now I\'m going to just wait until I\'m older than 25 because I don\'t want to get it again cuz the thing about LASIK is you','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang aku tunggu sampai umur lebih 25 tahun sebab aku tak nak buat rawatan tu berulang kali, sebab tentang LASIK ni','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>572.24,'end_time'=>573.82,'target_text'=>'could only get it like a few times.','source_text'=>'korang cuma boleh buat beberapa kali je seumur hidup.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>573.92,'end_time'=>575.1,'target_text'=>'You can\'t always keep on getting it.','source_text'=>'Korang tak boleh nak buat berkali-kali sesuka hati.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>575.2,'end_time'=>577.9,'target_text'=>'I think you get it once, max, like twice.','source_text'=>'Rasa aku boleh buat sekali, paling banyak pun dua kali.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>578,'end_time'=>581.42,'target_text'=>'Because it\'ll damage your eyes and you can\'t really do it more than once.','source_text'=>'Sebab ia boleh rosakkan mata dan korang tak boleh buat lebih daripada sekali dua.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>581.52,'end_time'=>583.66,'target_text'=>'You could have like a corrective surgery, but yeah.','source_text'=>'Mungkin boleh buat pembedahan pembetulan susulan, tapi macam tulah.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>583.76,'end_time'=>588.62,'target_text'=>'I\'ve seen recently, I don\'t know if you\'ve seen it, but like other methods to fixing your eyes that are starting to come out.','source_text'=>'Kebelakangan ni aku tengok, tak tahu kalau kau pernah tengok, ada kaedah lain untuk rawat mata yang mula diperkenalkan.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>588.72,'end_time'=>592.86,'target_text'=>'One where they like literally change the shape of your eye with like pressure and I think like temperature.','source_text'=>'Ada satu kaedah di mana diorang ubah bentuk kornea mata menggunakan tekanan dan rasanya suhu tertentu.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>592.96,'end_time'=>594.66,'target_text'=>'They literally remold your eye.','source_text'=>'Diorang betul-betul bentuk semula mata korang.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>594.76,'end_time'=>599.82,'target_text'=>'Like I\'m not a optometrist, so I don\'t know name of every part of the eye, but they can change the shape of it.','source_text'=>'Aku bukanlah pakar optometris jadi aku tak tahu nama setiap bahagian mata, tapi diorang boleh ubah bentuknya.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>599.92,'end_time'=>605.06,'target_text'=>'>> Have you heard that trend where they say that you can force your eyes to get better by just not wearing glasses?','source_text'=>'>> Kau pernah dengar tak trend orang kata kita boleh pulihkan mata sendiri dengan cara tak pakai cermin mata langsung?','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>605.16,'end_time'=>608.54,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t really wear glasses like very, very often though.','source_text'=>'>> Aku sendiri pun bukannya kerap sangat pakai cermin mata.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>608.64,'end_time'=>609.74,'target_text'=>'I don\'t believe that\'s true.','source_text'=>'Aku tak percaya benda tu betul.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>609.84,'end_time'=>612.46,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think your eyes could just get better by not wearing glasses.','source_text'=>'Aku rasa tak masuk akal mata boleh sembuh sendiri semata-mata sebab tak pakai cermin mata.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>612.56,'end_time'=>616.46,'target_text'=>'My eyes were used to be 20/20, like 20/20 vision, and then they went bad.','source_text'=>'Dulu mata aku memang 20/20, penglihatan sempurna, lepas tu mula jadi rabun.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>616.56,'end_time'=>619.34,'target_text'=>'And then >> But was that before or after you started wearing glasses?','source_text'=>'Lepas tu >> Tapi tu sebelum atau selepas kau mula pakai cermin mata?','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>619.44,'end_time'=>621.18,'target_text'=>'>> I started wearing glasses because they got bad.','source_text'=>'>> Aku mula pakai cermin mata sebab mata aku dah makin rabun.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>621.28,'end_time'=>624.1,'target_text'=>'So, they went from good to bad and then I started wearing glasses.','source_text'=>'Jadi, dari elok jadi rabun, barulah aku mula pakai cermin mata.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>624.2,'end_time'=>625.22,'target_text'=>'And then they didn\'t really change at all.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu power mata aku takde ubah apa-apa sangat.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>625.32,'end_time'=>629.38,'target_text'=>'They changed like a little bit, like 0.25, but pretty much they\'re really similar.','source_text'=>'Ubah pun sikit je macam 0.25, tapi hampir sama je macam sebelum ni.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>629.48,'end_time'=>630.74,'target_text'=>'So, I don\'t know if I believe that.','source_text'=>'Jadi aku tak rasa aku percaya mitos tu.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>630.84,'end_time'=>632.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I don\'t know if I believe it, too.','source_text'=>'>> Haah, aku pun tak rasa aku percaya juga.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>632.2,'end_time'=>635.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s like that no shampoo TikTok thing.','source_text'=>'Benda tu macam trend no-shampoo kat TikTok tu.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>635.16,'end_time'=>640.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, where you don\'t don\'t wash your hair and then >> Well, you wash your hair, but you never use shampoo, just water.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, yang kau tak cuci rambut lepas tu >> Bukan, kau cuci rambut, tapi langsung tak guna syampu, guna air je.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>640.28,'end_time'=>640.68,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Haah.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>640.68,'end_time'=>642.22,'target_text'=>'But then your hair gets super greasy.','source_text'=>'Tapi lepas tu rambut jadi berminyak gila.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>642.32,'end_time'=>648.14,'target_text'=>'>> Well, they say for like a month or two, which is crazy long time, but then it goes back to normal.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi diorang kata dalam sebulan dua, yang mana lama gila, lepas tu rambut akan kembali normal.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>648.24,'end_time'=>650.58,'target_text'=>'>> But I think we can go that way.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi rasanya kita boleh ikut jalan arah sana.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>650.68,'end_time'=>652.86,'target_text'=>'And that\'s like more like the main park area.','source_text'=>'Dan kawasan sana lebih kepada kawasan utama taman.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>652.96,'end_time'=>653.38,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'>> Okey.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>653.48,'end_time'=>655.5,'target_text'=>'>> So, let\'s start heading that way.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi, jom kita mula tuju ke arah sana.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>655.6,'end_time'=>659.78,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster, get the workbook for this video on my website.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak belajar lebih cepat, dapatkan buku latihan untuk video ni di laman web saya.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>659.88,'end_time'=>666.62,'target_text'=>'It includes deeper explanations and exercises to help you remember and master what you learned.','source_text'=>'Ia merangkumi penerangan yang lebih mendalam serta latihan untuk bantu korang ingat dan kuasai apa yang dipelajari.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>666.72,'end_time'=>672.58,'target_text'=>'And if you get five or more workbooks, you\'ll get 30% off automatically at checkout.','source_text'=>'Dan kalau korang beli lima atau lebih buku latihan, korang akan dapat diskaun 30% secara automatik masa pembayaran.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>672.68,'end_time'=>676.78,'target_text'=>'So, go to the description or my website vulcaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Jadi, layari pautan di ruangan deskripsi atau laman web saya di vulcaenglish.com.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>676.88,'end_time'=>677.3,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys.','source_text'=>'Okey, semua.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>677.4,'end_time'=>685.38,'target_text'=>'So, in a previous video, I was in a park and we described a lot of things in the park with many different adjectives.','source_text'=>'Dalam video sebelum ni, saya ada pergi ke taman dan kita huraikan banyak benda di taman menggunakan pelbagai kata sifat berbeza.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>685.48,'end_time'=>690.22,'target_text'=>'I want you guys to think of some of those now, if you remember them, and describe this park.','source_text'=>'Saya nak korang fikirkan sebahagian daripadanya sekarang, kalau korang ingat, dan huraikan taman ini.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>690.32,'end_time'=>692.6,'target_text'=>'What do you see?','source_text'=>'Apa yang korang nampak?','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>693.4,'end_time'=>696.32,'target_text'=>'What colors do you see?','source_text'=>'Warna apa yang korang nampak?','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>696.64,'end_time'=>701.96,'target_text'=>'What objects, things, or people do you see?','source_text'=>'Objek, benda, atau orang apa yang korang nampak?','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>702.44,'end_time'=>705,'target_text'=>'How many do you see?','source_text'=>'Berapa banyak yang korang nampak?','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>706.16,'end_time'=>708.64,'target_text'=>'How does it make you feel?','source_text'=>'Apa perasaan korang bila melihatnya?','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>710.08,'end_time'=>714.2,'target_text'=>'Can you compare what you\'re seeing to something else?','source_text'=>'Boleh tak korang bandingkan apa yang korang nampak dengan benda lain?','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>715.28,'end_time'=>716.38,'target_text'=>'What do you hear?','source_text'=>'Apa yang korang dengar?','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>716.48,'end_time'=>718.8,'target_text'=>'Do you hear anything?','source_text'=>'Ada dengar apa-apa bunyi tak?','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>719.68,'end_time'=>722.26,'target_text'=>'And lastly, do you like parks?','source_text'=>'Dan yang terakhir, korang suka taman tak?','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>722.36,'end_time'=>723.62,'target_text'=>'Would you come to this park?','source_text'=>'Korang nak datang ke taman ni tak?','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>723.72,'end_time'=>728.78,'target_text'=>'Do you often visit parks, or do you never go to parks?','source_text'=>'Korang selalu pergi ke taman, atau langsung tak pernah pergi taman?','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>728.88,'end_time'=>730.9,'target_text'=>'Do you like nature?','source_text'=>'Korang suka alam semula jadi tak?','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>731,'end_time'=>733.48,'target_text'=>'Why do you like nature?','source_text'=>'Kenapa korang suka alam semula jadi?','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>733.76,'end_time'=>736.02,'target_text'=>'What is your favorite type of nature?','source_text'=>'Apakah suasana alam semula jadi kegemaran korang?','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>736.12,'end_time'=>742.58,'target_text'=>'Do you prefer mountains, forests, beaches, deserts, oceans?','source_text'=>'Korang lebih suka gunung, hutan, pantai, padang pasir, atau lautan?','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>742.68,'end_time'=>745.14,'target_text'=>'This really looks like a forest, doesn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Tempat ni betul-betul nampak macam hutan, kan?','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>745.24,'end_time'=>748.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s densely packed with trees.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, pokok-pokok kat sini tumbuh rapat dan padat.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>748.44,'end_time'=>751.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, and you can see a lot of dead leaves on the ground here.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, dan korang boleh nampak banyak daun kering gugur atas tanah kat sini.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>751.2,'end_time'=>754.02,'target_text'=>'Some of them are a lot greener than others.','source_text'=>'Ada sesetengah daun lebih hijau berbanding yang lain.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>754.12,'end_time'=>756.18,'target_text'=>'Some of them are almost black.','source_text'=>'Ada juga yang dah hampir warna hitam.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>756.28,'end_time'=>758.3,'target_text'=>'But look at the trunk of this tree.','source_text'=>'Tapi cuba tengok batang pokok ni.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>758.4,'end_time'=>759.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually quite nice, isn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya cantik dan menarik juga, kan?','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>759.88,'end_time'=>760.58,'target_text'=>'Look at this.','source_text'=>'Tengok ni.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>760.68,'end_time'=>761.9,'target_text'=>'That looks so cool, doesn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Nampak sangat unik dan menarik, kan?','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>762,'end_time'=>764.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I think that\'s a certain species of tree that grows like that.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, rasanya memang spesis pokok tertentu yang tumbuh macam tu.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>764.68,'end_time'=>767.38,'target_text'=>'>> Like the other ones are kind of like perfect like cylinders.','source_text'=>'>> Pokok-pokok lain bentuknya macam silinder lurus sempurna.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>767.48,'end_time'=>769.78,'target_text'=>'This one is like very thin.','source_text'=>'Pokok yang ni pula nampak sangat kurus.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>769.88,'end_time'=>770.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s cool.','source_text'=>'Menarik sungguh.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>770.52,'end_time'=>775.38,'target_text'=>'Obviously, the trunk is a cylinder, but the bottom part, it\'s like the roots start higher up.','source_text'=>'Batangnya memang silinder, tapi bahagian bawahnya nampak macam akarnya mula tumbuh dari paras lebih tinggi.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>775.48,'end_time'=>776.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s a cool type of tree.','source_text'=>'Spesis pokok yang sangat unik.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>776.84,'end_time'=>779.38,'target_text'=>'And you can look up and see the tree canopy.','source_text'=>'Dan korang boleh pandang ke atas tengok silara kanopi pokok.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>779.48,'end_time'=>781.54,'target_text'=>'It\'s blocking out most of the sun.','source_text'=>'Ia menghalang sebahagian besar cahaya matahari terik.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>781.64,'end_time'=>785.22,'target_text'=>'And if it rained, it would block out most of the rain as well.','source_text'=>'Dan kalau hujan, daun-daun ni boleh halang sebahagian besar air hujan juga.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>785.32,'end_time'=>789.94,'target_text'=>'You can see at the end of the tree branches, there are a lot of leaves.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak di hujung dahan-dahan pokok ada banyak sangat daun.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>790.04,'end_time'=>792.54,'target_text'=>'And these trees are actually quite tall, are they not?','source_text'=>'Dan pokok-pokok ni sebenarnya agak tinggi juga, kan?','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>792.64,'end_time'=>795.14,'target_text'=>'>> I think they have been here for a long time.','source_text'=>'>> Rasa aku pokok-pokok ni dah lama tumbuh kat sini.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>795.24,'end_time'=>798.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, these trees are very tall, but they are very thin.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, pokok-pokok ni memang tinggi sangat, tapi batangnya kurus runcing.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>798.44,'end_time'=>799.58,'target_text'=>'They\'re very thin.','source_text'=>'Pokoknya sangat kurus.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>799.68,'end_time'=>800.62,'target_text'=>'They\'re not very thick.','source_text'=>'Batangnya tak berapa tebal atau besar.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>800.72,'end_time'=>804.1,'target_text'=>'They\'re very thin, but tall and straight.','source_text'=>'Batangnya kurus, tapi tinggi dan tegak lurus.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>804.2,'end_time'=>805.78,'target_text'=>'This tree is very straight.','source_text'=>'Pokok yang ini sangat tegak lurus.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>805.88,'end_time'=>808.76,'target_text'=>'This tree is not very straight.','source_text'=>'Pokok yang satu ni pula tak berapa lurus.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>809.2,'end_time'=>811.34,'target_text'=>'That tree over there is also not very straight.','source_text'=>'Pokok kat sebelah sana tu pun tak berapa lurus juga.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>811.44,'end_time'=>816.3,'target_text'=>'You can see it separates into a Y shape, this tree right in front of me.','source_text'=>'Boleh nampak ia bercabang jadi bentuk huruf Y, pokok tepat di depan aku ni.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>816.4,'end_time'=>818.46,'target_text'=>'So, this is the name of the tree.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini nama pokok ni.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>818.56,'end_time'=>823.3,'target_text'=>'It is called a flame tree, and you could see there is an ant on the tree trunk.','source_text'=>'Ia dipanggil pokok semarak api (flame tree), dan korang boleh nampak ada semut kat batang pokok tu.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>823.4,'end_time'=>830.98,'target_text'=>'So, I want you guys to read the text on screen describing this area, and then I will read it after so you can practice your','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya nak korang baca teks atas skrin yang menerangkan kawasan ini, dan lepas tu saya akan bacakan supaya korang boleh latih','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>831.08,'end_time'=>835.68,'target_text'=>'pronunciation and compare yourself to me.','source_text'=>'sebutan korang dan bandingkan dengan sebutan saya.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>836,'end_time'=>839.74,'target_text'=>'This is a quiet path in a green park.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah laluan pejalan kaki yang tenang di sebuah taman yang menghijau.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>839.84,'end_time'=>846.22,'target_text'=>'There are many tall trees around it, and the path splits up ahead.','source_text'=>'Terdapat banyak pokok tinggi di sekelilingnya, dan laluan ini berpecah di hadapan.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>846.32,'end_time'=>851.1,'target_text'=>'The area looks calm, natural, and peaceful.','source_text'=>'Kawasan ini kelihatan tenang, semula jadi, dan damai.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>851.2,'end_time'=>852.46,'target_text'=>'Now, a longer version.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, versi yang lebih panjang pula.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>852.56,'end_time'=>858.84,'target_text'=>'I want you guys to read this text on screen, and then I will read it after.','source_text'=>'Saya nak korang baca teks ini di skrin, dan kemudian saya akan bacakan.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>859.28,'end_time'=>863.5,'target_text'=>'This part of the park looks very calm and natural.','source_text'=>'Bahagian taman ini kelihatan sangat tenang dan semula jadi.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>863.6,'end_time'=>870.9,'target_text'=>'The path is smooth and splits up ahead, which makes the scene feel soft and inviting.','source_text'=>'Laluannya rata dan berpecah di hadapan, menjadikan suasana terasa nyaman dan mendamaikan.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>871,'end_time'=>876.94,'target_text'=>'On both sides, there are many thin and tall trees with lots of green leaves.','source_text'=>'Di kedua-dua belah laluan, terdapat banyak pokok yang kurus dan tinggi dengan dedaunan hijau yang lebat.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>877.04,'end_time'=>886.14,'target_text'=>'The ground is covered with dry leaves, grass, and small plants, so the whole area feels earthy and quiet.','source_text'=>'Permukaan tanah dilitupi daun kering, rumput, dan tumbuhan kecil, menjadikan seluruh kawasan terasa dekat dengan alam dan sunyi.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>886.24,'end_time'=>894.14,'target_text'=>'There is also soft sunlight coming through the trees, which gives the place a gentle and relaxing atmosphere.','source_text'=>'Terdapat juga cahaya matahari lembut menembusi celah-celah pepohon, memberikan suasana yang damai dan menenangkan fikiran.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>894.24,'end_time'=>900.26,'target_text'=>'Tell me how you guys did, and make sure you try to sound the way I sounded when I read it.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya bagaimana bacaan korang tadi, dan pastikan korang cuba sebut dengan intonasi sama seperti saya.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>900.36,'end_time'=>903.46,'target_text'=>'This right in front of us, can you guys tell me what this is?','source_text'=>'Benda tepat di depan kita ni, korang boleh beritahu tak apa benda ni?','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>903.56,'end_time'=>904.34,'target_text'=>'What is it, Leon?','source_text'=>'Apa benda ni, Leon?','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>904.44,'end_time'=>905.46,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s a stadium.','source_text'=>'>> Ni stadium.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>905.56,'end_time'=>908.3,'target_text'=>'>> Correct, but this is a huge stadium.','source_text'=>'>> Betul, tapi ni stadium yang besar gila.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>908.4,'end_time'=>910.06,'target_text'=>'I wonder what sport they play in here.','source_text'=>'Aku tertanya-tanya sukan apa yang diorang main kat dalam ni.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>910.16,'end_time'=>913.62,'target_text'=>'If I had to guess, I would say soccer, or as they call it here, football.','source_text'=>'Kalau teka, aku rasa bola sepak, atau orang sini panggil football/sepak bola.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>913.72,'end_time'=>915.1,'target_text'=>'>> Looks like a soccer stadium.','source_text'=>'>> Nampak macam stadium bola sepak.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>915.2,'end_time'=>919.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, cuz they definitely don\'t play American football here, so it has to be a soccer stadium.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sebab diorang memang sah-sah tak main bola sepak Amerika kat sini, jadi mestilah stadium bola sepak biasa.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>919.92,'end_time'=>921.62,'target_text'=>'I know how big baseball is, either.','source_text'=>'Aku pun tak pasti sejauh mana sukan besbol popular kat sini.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>921.72,'end_time'=>924.02,'target_text'=>'So, look at the ditch on the side here.','source_text'=>'Tengok parit atau longkang kat tepi ni.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>924.12,'end_time'=>925.02,'target_text'=>'A ditch on the side.','source_text'=>'Longkang besar kat tepi.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>925.12,'end_time'=>927.9,'target_text'=>'It must rain a lot for the ditch to be this big, eh?','source_text'=>'Mesti hujan lebat sangat kat sini sampai longkang besar macam ni sekali, kan?','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>928,'end_time'=>929.54,'target_text'=>'That\'s a really deep ditch.','source_text'=>'Longkang ni dalam betul.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>929.64,'end_time'=>930.98,'target_text'=>'>> We\'re in the tropics.','source_text'=>'>> Kan kita kat kawasan tropika.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>931.08,'end_time'=>931.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>931.76,'end_time'=>933.9,'target_text'=>'And then here, these are parking spaces.','source_text'=>'Dan kat sebelah sini pula, ini adalah petak tempat letak kereta.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>934,'end_time'=>935.86,'target_text'=>'>> They should have moved the trees, though.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi diorang patutnya alihkan pokok-pokok tu.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>935.96,'end_time'=>937.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, low-key the trees are right in the way.','source_text'=>'>> Haah, pokok-pokok tu betul-betul menghalang laluan parking.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>937.76,'end_time'=>942.42,'target_text'=>'It kind of takes up a lot of room, but you can still see they put uh parking spaces here for people.','source_text'=>'Ia macam makan banyak ruang, tapi korang masih boleh nampak diorang sediakan petak tempat letak kereta untuk orang ramai.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>942.52,'end_time'=>944.22,'target_text'=>'And right there, that is a mosque.','source_text'=>'Dan kat situ tu, itulah masjid.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>944.32,'end_time'=>949.7,'target_text'=>'You could kind of hear them saying stuff over the speakers, but that\'s a mosque and I\'m walking on this path and they have','source_text'=>'Korang boleh dengar bunyi suara daripada pembesar suara, itu sebuah masjid dan aku tengah berjalan atas laluan ni dan ada','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>949.8,'end_time'=>953.06,'target_text'=>'the same type of tile meant for blind people.','source_text'=>'jubin penunjuk arah jenis sama khas untuk golongan cacat penglihatan.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>953.16,'end_time'=>957.5,'target_text'=>'>> Got to be rough being blind here, though, cuz once we get to the end, where are you going to go?','source_text'=>'>> Tapi mesti susah jadi orang buta kat sini, sebab bila sampai hujung jalan, nak pergi mana pula?','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>957.6,'end_time'=>960.5,'target_text'=>'>> And dude, imagine being blind and you can\'t even see this.','source_text'=>'>> Dan weh, bayangkan kalau buta dan kau langsung tak boleh nampak benda ni.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>960.6,'end_time'=>961.62,'target_text'=>'Imagine falling down there.','source_text'=>'Bayangkan kalau terjatuh ke dalam longkang tu.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>961.72,'end_time'=>963.5,'target_text'=>'Here, they have a trash bin, which is good.','source_text'=>'Kat sini diorang ada sediakan tong sampah, bagus betul.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>963.6,'end_time'=>967.3,'target_text'=>'I find there is a lot of trash bins in Indonesia, which I really like.','source_text'=>'Aku perasan ada banyak tong sampah di Indonesia, aku memang suka sangat benda tu.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>967.4,'end_time'=>969.42,'target_text'=>'>> Like this park, I barely saw any garbage.','source_text'=>'>> Macam taman ni, aku hampir tak nampak sampah sarap langsung.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>969.52,'end_time'=>970.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, no, it\'s definitely good.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul, memang sangat bagus.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>970.6,'end_time'=>975.46,'target_text'=>'A lot of times in countries I\'ve visited, they don\'t really have a lot of trash bins, which is annoying.','source_text'=>'Selalunya di negara-negara yang aku pernah lawat, tak banyak sangat tong sampah disediakan, memang menyusahkan.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>975.56,'end_time'=>978.46,'target_text'=>'Cuz then I have to carry around my trash and then throw it somewhere.','source_text'=>'Sebab lepas tu aku terpaksa usung sampah ke sana sini sampailah jumpa tempat nak buang.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>978.56,'end_time'=>986.26,'target_text'=>'If you want to speak English more clearly and naturally, then join my speaking and pronunciation course.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak bertutur dalam bahasa Inggeris dengan lebih jelas dan lancar, jom sertai kursus pertuturan dan sebutan saya.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>986.36,'end_time'=>996.02,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to almost 100 video lessons with two new lessons every week, a clear step-by-step practice system,','source_text'=>'Korang dapat akses terus kepada hampir 100 video pembelajaran dengan dua modul baharu setiap minggu, sistem latihan langkah demi langkah yang jelas,','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>996.12,'end_time'=>1002.14,'target_text'=>'and an exclusive prompt to help you master the pronunciation of any word.','source_text'=>'dan prompt eksklusif untuk bantu korang kuasai sebutan mana-mana perkataan.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>1002.24,'end_time'=>1008.1,'target_text'=>'Inside, we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking.','source_text'=>'Dalam kursus ini, kita akan fokus pada sebutan, slanga, ritma, dan cara bertutur secara santai dan semula jadi.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>1008.2,'end_time'=>1012.78,'target_text'=>'So, you can stop hesitating and speak with more confidence.','source_text'=>'Jadi, korang takkan ragu-ragu lagi dan boleh bercakap dengan penuh keyakinan.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>1012.88,'end_time'=>1015.86,'target_text'=>'>> Restaurants and bakeries that go viral on TikTok.','source_text'=>'>> Restoran dan bakeri yang tular viral di TikTok.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>1015.96,'end_time'=>1019.02,'target_text'=>'And they do a really good job of decorating the place.','source_text'=>'Dan diorang memang pandai hias tempat tu dengan sangat cantik.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>1019.12,'end_time'=>1022.06,'target_text'=>'They\'re a little more established than all these newer viral places.','source_text'=>'Kedai ni dah lebih lama bertapak berbanding tempat-tempat viral baharu yang lain.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>1022.16,'end_time'=>1024.1,'target_text'=>'But powder, but it\'s such a messy donut.','source_text'=>'Tapi serbuk tu... donat ni memang berselerak betul bila makan.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>1024.2,'end_time'=>1025.62,'target_text'=>'The powder goes everywhere.','source_text'=>'Serbuk gulanya bersepah ke merata tempat.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>1025.72,'end_time'=>1027.26,'target_text'=>'>> But the interior is really nice.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi reka bentuk dalamannya memang sangat cantik.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>1027.36,'end_time'=>1028.22,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, look at this mirror.','source_text'=>'>> Weh, tengok cermin ni.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>1028.32,'end_time'=>1030.5,'target_text'=>'>> A really nice turquoise box.','source_text'=>'>> Kotak berwarna biru firus (turquoise) yang sangat lawa.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>1030.6,'end_time'=>1034.3,'target_text'=>'And you open it by strawberry icing on the side with uh crumbs.','source_text'=>'Dan korang buka dengan aising strawberi di bahagian tepi bersama serdak biskut.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>1034.4,'end_time'=>1037.66,'target_text'=>'It looks like there\'s some white powder sprinkled over top of the whole donut.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam ada serbuk putih ditabur di seluruh bahagian atas donat.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>1037.76,'end_time'=>1040.7,'target_text'=>'Last but not least, it\'s a very common saying in English.','source_text'=>'Ungkapan \'Last but not least\', ia simpulan bahasa yang sangat lazim dalam bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>1040.8,'end_time'=>1041.66,'target_text'=>'>> I can\'t eat anything fried.','source_text'=>'>> Aku tak boleh makan makanan bergoreng.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>1041.76,'end_time'=>1043.5,'target_text'=>'This donut was already deep fried.','source_text'=>'Donat ni dah memang digoreng celup.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>1043.6,'end_time'=>1047.3,'target_text'=>'>> The purpose of these tiles >> by just not wearing glasses.','source_text'=>'>> Tujuan jubin penunjuk arah ni >> dengan semata-mata tak pakai cermin mata.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>1047.4,'end_time'=>1052.1,'target_text'=>'I don\'t really wear glasses like >> And you can look up and see the tree canopy.','source_text'=>'Aku jarang sangat pakai cermin mata macam >> Dan korang boleh pandang atas tengok kanopi pokok.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>1052.2,'end_time'=>1054.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s blocking out these are parking spaces.','source_text'=>'Ia menghalang terik matahari, ini tempat letak kereta.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>1054.68,'end_time'=>1055.86,'target_text'=>'>> They should have moved the trees.','source_text'=>'>> Diorang patutnya alihkan pokok-pokok tu.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>1055.96,'end_time'=>1057.7,'target_text'=>'>> Here they have a trash bin, which is good.','source_text'=>'>> Kat sini diorang ada tong sampah, bagus betul.','order'=>371],
