            ['start_time'=>1768.8,'end_time'=>1770.34,'target_text'=>'>> No, that\'s that\'s a friendly bear.','source_text'=>'>> Yang tu beruang yang mesra dan santai.','order'=>724],
            ['start_time'=>1770.44,'end_time'=>1772.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that was a friendly bear.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, beruang yang sangat santai.','order'=>725],
            ['start_time'=>1772.2,'end_time'=>1772.86,'target_text'=>'>> Friendly bear.','source_text'=>'>> Beruang peramah.','order'=>726],
            ['start_time'=>1772.96,'end_time'=>1773.94,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, what was yours?','source_text'=>'>> Pilihan awak pula apa?','order'=>727],
            ['start_time'=>1774.04,'end_time'=>1775.02,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, I love the giraffe.','source_text'=>'>> Weh, saya paling suka zirafah.','order'=>728],
            ['start_time'=>1775.12,'end_time'=>1776.38,'target_text'=>'The giraffe was so cool.','source_text'=>'Zirafah tu sangat gempak.','order'=>729],
            ['start_time'=>1776.48,'end_time'=>1779.98,'target_text'=>'Giraffe number one, hippo number two because hippos are just so cool.','source_text'=>'Nombor satu zirafah, nombor dua badak air sebab badak air memang unik sangat.','order'=>730],
            ['start_time'=>1780.08,'end_time'=>1781.58,'target_text'=>'Unfortunately, we didn\'t see a rhino.','source_text'=>'Sayangnya kita tak dapat tengok badak sumbu.','order'=>731],
            ['start_time'=>1781.68,'end_time'=>1782.78,'target_text'=>'So number three, the elephant.','source_text'=>'Jadi tempat ketiga, gajah.','order'=>732],
            ['start_time'=>1782.88,'end_time'=>1788.02,'target_text'=>'Elephants are just an amazing creature, but those were the top three, my top three, and Adam\'s top three.','source_text'=>'Gajah memang makhluk yang luar biasa hebat, itulah tiga haiwan teratas pilihan saya dan pilihan Adam.','order'=>733],
            ['start_time'=>1788.12,'end_time'=>1788.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>734],
