            ['start_time'=>1792.88,'end_time'=>1796.74,'target_text'=>'We\'ll just put a photo of them here so you guys can >> The polar bears were amazing, I agree.','source_text'=>'Kami akan letak gambar diorang kat sini supaya korang boleh tengok... >> Beruang kutub memang sangat menakjubkan, saya setuju.','order'=>736],
