            ['start_time'=>34.6,'end_time'=>42.06,'target_text'=>'have a pronunciation and accent training segment where you can really focus on talking like a native English speaker.','source_text'=>'ada segmen latihan sebutan dan aksen di mana korang boleh fokus untuk bertutur seperti penutur jati bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>6],
