            ['start_time'=>48.68,'end_time'=>51.58,'target_text'=>'Each bought [music] a ticket less polished brass in here.','source_text'=>'Masing-masing beli tiket [muzik] tembaga di sini.','order'=>10],
            ['start_time'=>51.68,'end_time'=>54.26,'target_text'=>'Drop to the Start the word count and let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Mulakan kiraan perkataan dan jom kita gerak.','order'=>11],
            ['start_time'=>54.36,'end_time'=>57.18,'target_text'=>'Where are we right now, Mom?','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita berada di mana, Mak?','order'=>12],
            ['start_time'=>57.28,'end_time'=>60.62,'target_text'=>'We are in the rice fields just outside Ninh Binh.','source_text'=>'Kita berada di kawasan sawah padi di luar pekan Ninh Binh.','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>60.72,'end_time'=>61.14,'target_text'=>'Correct.','source_text'=>'Betul.','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>61.24,'end_time'=>63.22,'target_text'=>'So we\'re in Ninh Binh right now.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang kita berada di Ninh Binh.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>63.32,'end_time'=>69.06,'target_text'=>'We arrived yesterday afternoon and we didn\'t really do much yesterday.','source_text'=>'Kami sampai petang semalam dan semalam kami tak buat banyak aktiviti sangat.','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>69.16,'end_time'=>73.74,'target_text'=>'We just walked around the town and celebrated reunification day.','source_text'=>'Kami cuma berjalan-jalan sekitar bandar dan menyambut Hari Penyatuan Semula (Reunification Day).','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>73.84,'end_time'=>76.7,'target_text'=>'But now we rented these bikes right here.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang kami dah sewa kenderaan kat sini.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>76.8,'end_time'=>78.82,'target_text'=>'Sorry, these aren\'t bikes, these are scooters.','source_text'=>'Maaf, ini bukan basikal, ini skuter.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>78.92,'end_time'=>80.86,'target_text'=>'We rented these scooters right here.','source_text'=>'Kami sewa skuter-skuter ini di sini.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>80.96,'end_time'=>84.86,'target_text'=>'You can see we each got a scooter and they are both white.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak kami ada dua skuter dan kedua-duanya warna putih.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>84.96,'end_time'=>87.62,'target_text'=>'What else can you tell me about these scooters, Mom?','source_text'=>'Apa lagi yang Mak boleh ceritakan pasal skuter ni?','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>87.72,'end_time'=>90.06,'target_text'=>'These scooters are electric.','source_text'=>'Skuter-skuter ni jenis elektrik.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>90.16,'end_time'=>90.74,'target_text'=>'>> Electric.','source_text'=>'>> Skuter elektrik.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>90.84,'end_time'=>92.62,'target_text'=>'These are electric scooters.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah skuter elektrik.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>92.72,'end_time'=>94.58,'target_text'=>'Do you guys know what that means?','source_text'=>'Korang tahu tak apa maksudnya?','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>94.68,'end_time'=>100.34,'target_text'=>'It means that these scooters do not run on fuel like gas, diesel, or anything.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya skuter ini langsung tak guna bahan api petrol, diesel, atau minyak.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>100.44,'end_time'=>103.5,'target_text'=>'These scooters run on batteries.','source_text'=>'Skuter ini berfungsi menggunakan bateri.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>103.6,'end_time'=>105.1,'target_text'=>'So there\'s a battery in the scooter.','source_text'=>'Jadi ada pek bateri di dalam skuter.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>105.2,'end_time'=>107.82,'target_text'=>'You can see the battery percentage here if you come this way.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak peratusan bateri kat sini kalau datang dekat sikit.','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>107.92,'end_time'=>111.14,'target_text'=>'It\'s a little dark, but this one is at 96% battery.','source_text'=>'Agak malap sikit, tapi bateri skuter ni ada 96%.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>111.24,'end_time'=>118.02,'target_text'=>'So this doesn\'t have a fuel gauge, but instead it has a battery and it shows you how much battery there is left.','source_text'=>'Jadi ia tiada tolok minyak, sebaliknya ada penunjuk bateri yang tunjukkan baki bateri yang tinggal.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>118.12,'end_time'=>125.14,'target_text'=>'So, 96% Mine is the exact same since we\'ve been following each other, and yeah, this is what our mode of transport will be','source_text'=>'Jadi 96%, skuter saya pun sama peratusannya sebab kami jalan beriringan, dan ya, inilah mod pengangkutan kami','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>125.24,'end_time'=>125.82,'target_text'=>'for today.','source_text'=>'untuk hari ini.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>125.92,'end_time'=>130.54,'target_text'=>'And we just left the town of Ninh Binh, and we\'re in this rice field.','source_text'=>'Dan kami baru saja tinggalkan bandar Ninh Binh, dan sekarang berada di sawah padi ini.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>130.64,'end_time'=>135.98,'target_text'=>'Why did we get electric scooters, and why do we only have two scooters, and we\'re three people?','source_text'=>'Kenapa kami sewa skuter elektrik, dan kenapa kami cuma ada dua skuter sedangkan kami bertiga?','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>136.08,'end_time'=>145.42,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we got electric scooters because even though Leon and I have our international license, and we have a bike license,','source_text'=>'Okey, kami sewa skuter elektrik sebab walaupun saya dan Leon ada lesen antarabangsa dan lesen motosikal,','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>145.52,'end_time'=>147.66,'target_text'=>'so we\'re allowed to drive these types of vehicles.','source_text'=>'yang membenarkan kami menunggang kenderaan jenis ini,','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>147.76,'end_time'=>154.46,'target_text'=>'We cannot drive them in Vietnam because of the like the international driving license agreement.','source_text'=>'kami tetap tak boleh menunggang motosikal biasa di Vietnam disebabkan perjanjian permit memandu antarabangsa.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>154.56,'end_time'=>159.74,'target_text'=>'There are two of them, and Canada, I guess, only signed the first one, and Vietnam signed the second one, and Vietnam only','source_text'=>'Ada dua jenis konvensyen perjanjian, Kanada tandatangan yang pertama manakala Vietnam tandatangan yang kedua, dan Vietnam hanya','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>159.84,'end_time'=>161.22,'target_text'=>'recognizes the second one.','source_text'=>'mengiktiraf perjanjian yang kedua itu sahaja.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>161.32,'end_time'=>167.66,'target_text'=>'So, that means like Canadians and Australians, we cannot use our international driver\'s license here even though we have an','source_text'=>'Jadi maknanya warganegara Kanada dan Australia tak boleh guna lesen antarabangsa di sini walaupun kami ada','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>167.76,'end_time'=>168.58,'target_text'=>'international driver\'s.','source_text'=>'lesen memandu antarabangsa yang sah.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>168.68,'end_time'=>176.18,'target_text'=>'So, instead, the solution is to rent electric scooters that are less powerful, around 50 cc if we were converting it to a','source_text'=>'Jadi jalan penyelesaiannya adalah dengan menyewa skuter elektrik berkuasa rendah, sekitar 50cc kalau dibandingkan dengan','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>176.28,'end_time'=>177.26,'target_text'=>'gas-powered scooter.','source_text'=>'skuter berenjin petrol.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>177.36,'end_time'=>180.66,'target_text'=>'We\'re allowed to drive these since they\'re less powered and they\'re electric.','source_text'=>'Kami dibenarkan tunggang kenderaan ini sebab kuasanya rendah dan ia guna elektrik.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>180.76,'end_time'=>184.58,'target_text'=>'And I guess no one in Vietnam needs a license to drive anything under 50 cc.','source_text'=>'Dan di Vietnam tiada siapa perlukan lesen untuk menunggang kenderaan bawah 50cc.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>184.68,'end_time'=>188.02,'target_text'=>'Hopefully, that\'s correct, or else I\'m like exposing myself.','source_text'=>'Harap-harap fakta tu betul, kalau tak kantoi pula saya.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>188.12,'end_time'=>191.3,'target_text'=>'Anyway, we\'re heading to Bai Dinh Pagoda.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, sekarang kami sedang menuju ke Pagoda Bai Dinh.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>191.4,'end_time'=>193.94,'target_text'=>'That\'s like a really like famous and popular pagoda.','source_text'=>'Ia sebuah pagoda kuil yang sangat terkenal dan popular.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>194.04,'end_time'=>197.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s about 19 km away or 40 minutes away.','source_text'=>'Jaraknya kira-kira 19 km atau 40 minit perjalanan dari sini.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>197.76,'end_time'=>200.62,'target_text'=>'But yeah, let\'s talk a little bit about this area around us.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom kita cerita serba sedikit tentang kawasan sekitar kita ni.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>200.72,'end_time'=>204.26,'target_text'=>'If you were to give it like a word, how would you describe it?','source_text'=>'Kalau Mak kena beri satu perkataan, macam mana Mak nak gambarkan tempat ni?','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>204.36,'end_time'=>204.72,'target_text'=>'Me?','source_text'=>'Mak?','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>204.72,'end_time'=>206.66,'target_text'=>'I would say it\'s very scenic.','source_text'=>'Mak akan kata pemandangannya sangat indah (scenic).','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>206.76,'end_time'=>207.94,'target_text'=>'Very scenic.','source_text'=>'Sangat indah pemandangannya.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>208.04,'end_time'=>211.42,'target_text'=>'I would describe it as picture perfect.','source_text'=>'Saya pula akan gambarkan ia ibarat gambar poskad yang sempurna (picture perfect).','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>211.52,'end_time'=>212.54,'target_text'=>'Picture perfect.','source_text'=>'Sempurna macam dalam lukisan.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>212.64,'end_time'=>218.62,'target_text'=>'So, my mom used the word scenic, I used the word picture perfect, and honestly, I feel like those are really two really good','source_text'=>'Jadi Mak saya guna perkataan \'scenic\' dan saya guna \'picture perfect\', dan sejujurnya saya rasa kedua-duanya perkataan yang sangat','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>218.72,'end_time'=>219.12,'target_text'=>'words.','source_text'=>'tepat.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>219.12,'end_time'=>224.9,'target_text'=>'Let me know in the comments what other words you guys would use to describe this area.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya di ruangan komen perkataan apa lagi yang korang akan gunakan untuk huraikan kawasan ini.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>225,'end_time'=>226.62,'target_text'=>'We also have a ditch right here.','source_text'=>'Kat sebelah sini juga ada parit saliran air.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>226.72,'end_time'=>233.46,'target_text'=>'You can see this ditch is filled with water, and this is just to flood the rice fields because I believe rice needs to be','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak parit ini dipenuhi air, tujuannya untuk mengairi sawah padi sebab padi perlukan','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>233.56,'end_time'=>234.66,'target_text'=>'flooded for it to grow.','source_text'=>'air bertakung untuk membesar dengan subur.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>234.76,'end_time'=>234.88,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya betul.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>234.88,'end_time'=>240.38,'target_text'=>'And And also I do believe there are a lot of rats in here because I saw one last night.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa ada banyak tikus kat dalam ni sebab semalam saya nampak seekor melintas.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>240.48,'end_time'=>243.06,'target_text'=>'Yeah, when it dries you really see it like all the rats and stuff.','source_text'=>'Ya, bila sawah ni kering nanti barulah nampak jelas tikus berkeliaran.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>243.16,'end_time'=>243.48,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>243.48,'end_time'=>245.74,'target_text'=>'So this is a irrigation ditch.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah parit tali air pertanian (irrigation ditch).','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>245.84,'end_time'=>252.02,'target_text'=>'They would irrigate it and flood the rice paddy field before they plant it.','source_text'=>'Petani akan alirkan air dan basahi petak sawah padi sebelum mula menanam.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>252.12,'end_time'=>253.34,'target_text'=>'Before or after?','source_text'=>'Sebelum atau selepas tanam?','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>253.44,'end_time'=>254.42,'target_text'=>'Before they plant it.','source_text'=>'Sebelum mula menanam.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>254.52,'end_time'=>257.38,'target_text'=>'Yeah, by the time it\'s dry the rice should be ready.','source_text'=>'Ya, bila tanah mulai mengering padi pun dah masak untuk dituai.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>257.48,'end_time'=>261.62,'target_text'=>'Yeah, and here you can see some beautiful white and yellow flowers.','source_text'=>'Ya, dan kat sini korang boleh nampak bunga-bunga kecil warna putih dan kuning yang cantik.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>261.72,'end_time'=>263.42,'target_text'=>'Let me pick a flower for you.','source_text'=>'Biar saya petikkan sekuntum bunga untuk Mak.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>263.52,'end_time'=>263.92,'target_text'=>'Daisies?','source_text'=>'Bunga daisi ke ni?','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>264,'end_time'=>265.18,'target_text'=>'I\'m not a flower expert.','source_text'=>'Saya bukanlah pakar bunga.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>265.28,'end_time'=>266.42,'target_text'=>'>> I think it\'s a weed.','source_text'=>'>> Mak rasa ni rumpai liar je.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>266.52,'end_time'=>267.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s still a flower though.','source_text'=>'Tapi ia tetap ada rupa bunga.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>267.52,'end_time'=>269.3,'target_text'=>'What\'s that game where you pull one and pull one?','source_text'=>'Apa nama permainan yang kita cabut kelopak bunga satu demi satu tu?','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>269.4,'end_time'=>271.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s like Oh, yes he loves me, no he doesn\'t.','source_text'=>'Permainan \'Dia cintakan aku, dia tak cintakan aku\'.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>271.88,'end_time'=>272.54,'target_text'=>'She loves me.','source_text'=>'Dia sayangkan saya.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>272.64,'end_time'=>281.74,'target_text'=>'Let\'s get back on these bikes and let\'s head to the Biden Pagoda and if we see anything along the way, well, you know, we\'ll','source_text'=>'Jom kita naik semula atas skuter dan teruskan perjalanan ke Pagoda Bai Dinh dan kalau nampak apa-apa yang menarik di jalan, kami','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>281.84,'end_time'=>283.58,'target_text'=>'also stop and talk about it.','source_text'=>'akan berhenti dan kongsikan dengan korang.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>283.68,'end_time'=>285.02,'target_text'=>'But yeah, this is our scooter.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, inilah skuter kami.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>285.12,'end_time'=>292.02,'target_text'=>'A lot of people struggle with English not because they\'re bad at learning languages but because the way they study feels nothing','source_text'=>'Ramai orang bergelut belajar bahasa Inggeris bukan sebab mereka lemah bahasa, tapi sebab kaedah pembelajaran mereka langsung tak macam','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>292.12,'end_time'=>293.82,'target_text'=>'like real life.','source_text'=>'kehidupan sebenar.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>293.92,'end_time'=>297.38,'target_text'=>'When I learn languages, real content is what keeps me going.','source_text'=>'Bila saya belajar bahasa asing, kandungan perbualan sebenar yang buat saya terus bersemangat.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>297.48,'end_time'=>301.14,'target_text'=>'Videos, conversations, and things I actually want to watch.','source_text'=>'Video, perbualan santai, dan bahan yang saya betul-betul teringin nak tonton.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>301.24,'end_time'=>304.1,'target_text'=>'Not endless drills that just feel like homework.','source_text'=>'Bukan latihan bertulis tak henti-henti yang rasa macam kerja sekolah membosankan.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>304.2,'end_time'=>307.82,'target_text'=>'That\'s why Magoosh is a good fit for anyone learning English.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah platform pembelajaran seperti ini sangat sesuai untuk sesiapa yang belajar bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>307.92,'end_time'=>314.14,'target_text'=>'It helps you turn real videos and real sentences into something you can actually learn from.','source_text'=>'Ia bantu korang tukar video sebenar dan ayat-ayat harian menjadi bahan pembelajaran praktikal.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>314.24,'end_time'=>322.58,'target_text'=>'If you\'re watching YouTube, Netflix, Disney Plus, or Viki and you see a word you don\'t know, you can click it, get an instant','source_text'=>'Kalau korang tonton YouTube, Netflix, Disney Plus, atau Viki dan jumpa perkataan yang korang tak tahu, korang boleh klik dan dapat','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>322.68,'end_time'=>327.9,'target_text'=>'explanation, hear the pronunciation, and see exactly how it\'s used in that scene.','source_text'=>'penerangan segera, dengar sebutannya, dan fahami cara penggunaannya dalam babak tersebut.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>328,'end_time'=>334.5,'target_text'=>'And if it\'s useful, you can save it as a flashcard with the audio, screenshot, and definition already there.','source_text'=>'Dan jika ia berguna, korang boleh simpan sebagai kad imbasan lengkap dengan audio, tangkap layar, dan maksudnya sekali.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>334.6,'end_time'=>337.58,'target_text'=>'So you\'re not wasting time building everything manually.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang tak bazir masa nak cipta nota secara manual.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>337.68,'end_time'=>344.34,'target_text'=>'And it uses spaced repetition, so the words come back right before you\'re about to forget them, which is a much better way','source_text'=>'Dan ia menggunakan teknik ulangan berjarak (spaced repetition) supaya perkataan diulang tepat sebelum korang terlupa, cara yang jauh lebih baik','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>344.44,'end_time'=>347.42,'target_text'=>'to actually remember the word long-term.','source_text'=>'untuk ingat perkataan dalam jangka masa panjang.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>347.52,'end_time'=>351.94,'target_text'=>'And when you\'re away from your computer, the app lets you keep learning on your phone, too.','source_text'=>'Dan bila jauh dari komputer, aplikasinya membolehkan korang sambung belajar di telefon pintar juga.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>352.04,'end_time'=>358.26,'target_text'=>'You can even use OCR to turn a book, menu, or sign into something you can study.','source_text'=>'Korang siap boleh guna OCR untuk imbas buku, menu, atau papan tanda menjadi nota belajar.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>358.36,'end_time'=>365.02,'target_text'=>'So, if you want to learn English through real content instead of boring study, use my link in the description to get 50% off','source_text'=>'Jadi jika korang nak belajar bahasa Inggeris melalui kandungan sebenar tanpa rasa bosan, gunakan pautan di deskripsi untuk dapat diskaun 50%','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>365.12,'end_time'=>371.18,'target_text'=>'the lifetime plan with Memrise or get one free month with their monthly or yearly plans.','source_text'=>'pelan seumur hidup bersama penaja atau dapatkan satu bulan percuma.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>371.28,'end_time'=>376.34,'target_text'=>'And you don\'t just get access to English, you get access to all the languages Memrise offers.','source_text'=>'Dan korang bukan sekadar dapat akses kepada bahasa Inggeris, bahkan semua bahasa yang ditawarkan.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>376.44,'end_time'=>378.54,'target_text'=>'Thank you, Memrise, for sponsoring today\'s video.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih kepada penaja kerana menaja video hari ini.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>378.64,'end_time'=>381.1,'target_text'=>'And I guess we forgot to mention why we only have two scooters.','source_text'=>'Dan rasanya kami terlupa nak jelaskan kenapa kami cuma ada dua skuter.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>381.2,'end_time'=>385.3,'target_text'=>'We only have two because my mom is riding on the back of mine.','source_text'=>'Kami cuma ada dua sebab mak saya membonceng di belakang skuter saya.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>385.4,'end_time'=>386.38,'target_text'=>'You\'re my driver.','source_text'=>'Kamu pemandu Mak.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>386.48,'end_time'=>387.9,'target_text'=>'Yeah, cuz why?','source_text'=>'Ya, sebab kenapa?','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>388,'end_time'=>389.9,'target_text'=>'You just don\'t [clears throat] have experience, so it\'s safer.','source_text'=>'Mak takde pengalaman tunggang skuter, jadi macam ni lebih selamat.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>390,'end_time'=>390.86,'target_text'=>'>> can ride the bike.','source_text'=>'>> Mak reti kayuh basikal.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>390.96,'end_time'=>391.94,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m sure you can, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Saya yakin Mak pandai kayuh basikal, ya.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>392.04,'end_time'=>396.18,'target_text'=>'>> But it\'s better if I do some filming at the back, seeing that I\'m part of the crew now.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi lebih baik Mak tolong rakam video dari belakang, memandangkan Mak dah jadi sebahagian krew penggambaran sekarang.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>396.28,'end_time'=>396.9,'target_text'=>'That\'s true.','source_text'=>'Betul juga tu.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>397,'end_time'=>397.4,'target_text'=>'That\'s true.','source_text'=>'Memang betul.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>397.4,'end_time'=>400.42,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ll be sitting right here, my mom will be sitting at the back.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya akan duduk di depan, mak saya duduk di tempat duduk belakang.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>400.52,'end_time'=>406.98,'target_text'=>'She\'ll be holding onto these handlebars here just to be safe, and I\'ll be holding onto the handlebar here and looking into','source_text'=>'Mak akan pegang pemegang belakang ini untuk keselamatan, dan saya pegang hendal depan sambil melihat','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>407.08,'end_time'=>413.58,'target_text'=>'the mirrors, pulling the throttle to go forward, and checking the gauges to make sure I\'m following the speed limit, and to','source_text'=>'cermin sisi, memulas pendikit minyak untuk bergerak, dan pantau meter kelajuan supaya patuh had laju serta','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>413.68,'end_time'=>415.46,'target_text'=>'make sure I don\'t run out of battery.','source_text'=>'pastikan bateri skuter tak kehabisan di tengah jalan.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>415.56,'end_time'=>420.98,'target_text'=>'But yeah, the sun is really hot, and also I know a lot of people always ask in the comments why you blink so much, what\'s','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, matahari memang terik sangat, dan saya tahu ramai orang selalu tanya di ruangan komen kenapa mata saya kerap berkelip,','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>421.08,'end_time'=>421.82,'target_text'=>'wrong with your eyes.','source_text'=>'kenapa dengan mata saya.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>421.92,'end_time'=>428.5,'target_text'=>'And one, it\'s cuz like I have sensitive eyes, and two, it\'s because I usually wear contact lenses, and the sun makes the contact','source_text'=>'Pertama, sebab mata saya jenis sensitif, dan kedua, sebab biasanya saya pakai kanta lekap, dan cahaya matahari buat kanta lekap','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>428.6,'end_time'=>432.46,'target_text'=>'lenses like really dry and like itchy, so I always blink, but I\'m not wearing any today.','source_text'=>'jadi sangat kering dan gatal sampai saya asyik berkelip, tapi hari ini saya langsung tak pakai kanta lekap.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>432.56,'end_time'=>433.74,'target_text'=>'So, today is just sunny.','source_text'=>'Jadi hari ini cuma silau cahaya matahari je.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>433.84,'end_time'=>435.02,'target_text'=>'Oh, are you kidding me?','source_text'=>'Biar betul kamu ni?','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>435.12,'end_time'=>437.46,'target_text'=>'You have no glasses on and you\'re the driver?','source_text'=>'Kamu tak pakai cermin mata dan kamu yang memandu skuter?','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>437.56,'end_time'=>439.02,'target_text'=>'No, no, I have actual glasses.','source_text'=>'Taklah, saya ada bawa cermin mata saya.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>439.12,'end_time'=>440.18,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, good, good, good.','source_text'=>'>> Okey, baguslah macam tu.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>440.28,'end_time'=>441.94,'target_text'=>'I have my actual glasses.','source_text'=>'Saya ada cermin mata rabun saya.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>442.04,'end_time'=>443.7,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ll wear these when we\'re driving.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya akan pakai cermin mata ni masa menunggang nanti.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>443.8,'end_time'=>448.3,'target_text'=>'Yes, I think it\'s just the light here is very bright, especially when it\'s overcast like this.','source_text'=>'Ya, Mak rasa pencahayaan kat sini memang silau sangat, terutamanya bila langit mendung putih macam ni.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>448.4,'end_time'=>454.1,'target_text'=>'Yeah, when there\'s no sun and it\'s just like a lot of clouds in the sky like this, overcast and just white, it\'s a lot brighter','source_text'=>'Ya, bila tiada matahari terik tapi awan mendung putih tebal di langit macam ni, keadaannya jauh lebih silau','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>454.2,'end_time'=>458.86,'target_text'=>'than when it\'s just like clear and blue because white is like just always really bright.','source_text'=>'berbanding bila langit biru cerah sebab pantulan warna putih memang sentiasa sangat terang dan silau.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>458.96,'end_time'=>462.3,'target_text'=>'But also, it\'s It\'s of like a natural like softbox.','source_text'=>'Tapi ia bertindak macam \'softbox\' pencahayaan semula jadi.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>462.4,'end_time'=>464.1,'target_text'=>'It makes it look better when you record.','source_text'=>'Ia buat rakaman video nampak lebih cantik.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>464.2,'end_time'=>469.44,'target_text'=>'Anyways, let\'s hop back on these scooters and let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, jom kita naik semula atas skuter dan teruskan perjalanan.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>470.08,'end_time'=>470.48,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys.','source_text'=>'Okey, semua.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>470.56,'end_time'=>476.34,'target_text'=>'So, we\'ve been driving for about 10-20 minutes and we just came up to this tunnel.','source_text'=>'Kami dah menunggang kira-kira 10 ke 20 minit dan sekarang kami baru tiba di terowong ini.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>476.44,'end_time'=>478.62,'target_text'=>'That right there in front of us, that is a tunnel.','source_text'=>'Kat depan kita tu, itu adalah terowong.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>478.72,'end_time'=>480.58,'target_text'=>'Let me just park my bike on the side here.','source_text'=>'Biar saya parkir motor saya kat tepi ni sekejap.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>480.68,'end_time'=>485.18,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s a tunnel in front of us and you can see the mountain above the tunnel.','source_text'=>'Jadi, itu terowong kat depan kita dan korang boleh nampak gunung kat atas terowong tu.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>485.28,'end_time'=>487.62,'target_text'=>'So, why do they make tunnels?','source_text'=>'Jadi, kenapa dorang buat terowong?','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>487.72,'end_time'=>491.54,'target_text'=>'Why do people make tunnels when they build a road?','source_text'=>'Kenapa orang bina terowong bila buat jalan?','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>491.64,'end_time'=>492.9,'target_text'=>'Because there are like two options.','source_text'=>'Sebab biasanya ada dua pilihan.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>493,'end_time'=>495.94,'target_text'=>'They can either go around or they can go through.','source_text'=>'Dorang boleh sama ada lalu ikut keliling atau tembus terus.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>496.04,'end_time'=>500.74,'target_text'=>'And a lot of the times going through is a lot faster than going around.','source_text'=>'Dan selalunya tembus terus jauh lebih cepat daripada pusing keliling.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>500.84,'end_time'=>502.18,'target_text'=>'And sometimes it\'s cheaper.','source_text'=>'Dan kadang-kadang ia lebih jimat kos.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>502.28,'end_time'=>508.62,'target_text'=>'In this case, I think it would be cheaper because the mountain isn\'t very like wide and deep cuz you can literally see the','source_text'=>'Dalam kes ni, saya rasa lebih jimat sebab gunung ni tak berapa lebar dan tebal, sebab korang memang boleh nampak terus','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>508.72,'end_time'=>514.02,'target_text'=>'other end and I think it would cost way more to go around the mountain and it would slow down traffic a lot.','source_text'=>'hujung sebelah sana, dan saya rasa kosnya jauh lebih tinggi kalau pusing keliling gunung serta melambatkan trafik.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>514.12,'end_time'=>518.34,'target_text'=>'Second question, let me know in the comments, do I look busted right now?','source_text'=>'Soalan kedua, beritahu saya kat ruangan komen, muka saya nampak serabai tak sekarang?','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>518.44,'end_time'=>519.62,'target_text'=>'Yes or no?','source_text'=>'Ya atau tidak?','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>519.72,'end_time'=>522.7,'target_text'=>'We\'re still about 20 minutes away from the pagoda.','source_text'=>'Perjalanan kita ke pagoda masih ada lebih kurang 20 minit lagi.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>522.8,'end_time'=>526.9,'target_text'=>'So, we\'ll get going, but you can see all the traffic zooming past us here.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jom kita gerak, tapi korang boleh nampak semua kenderaan menderu laju lalu sebelah kita ni.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>527,'end_time'=>528.74,'target_text'=>'And we just passed an area back there.','source_text'=>'Dan kami baru je lalu satu kawasan kat belakang tadi.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>528.84,'end_time'=>530.18,'target_text'=>'We took some videos on our phone.','source_text'=>'Kami ada rakam beberapa video guna telefon.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>530.28,'end_time'=>530.74,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>530.84,'end_time'=>532.9,'target_text'=>'That area was so congested.','source_text'=>'Kawasan tu sesak sangat.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>533,'end_time'=>537.58,'target_text'=>'There were so many like vehicles, people, scooters, >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Banyak sangat kenderaan, orang ramai, skuter, >> Ya.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>537.68,'end_time'=>540.54,'target_text'=>'and everything because I believe that\'s Mua Cave.','source_text'=>'dan macam-macam lagi sebab saya rasa itu Gua Mua.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>540.64,'end_time'=>541.04,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>541.12,'end_time'=>544.14,'target_text'=>'Or some some sort of like >> the boats come out.','source_text'=>'Atau tempat macam >> bot-bot keluar.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>544.24,'end_time'=>544.74,'target_text'=>'Boats?','source_text'=>'Bot?','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>544.84,'end_time'=>546.82,'target_text'=>'Yeah, there was boats to the right-hand side.','source_text'=>'Ya, ada bot kat sebelah kanan tadi.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>546.92,'end_time'=>547.54,'target_text'=>'>> round boats?','source_text'=>'>> bot bulat tu?','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>547.64,'end_time'=>548.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>548.24,'end_time'=>550.5,'target_text'=>'Okay, so that\'s where you go, I guess, get the round boats.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi kat situlah agaknya tempat orang naik bot bulat tu.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>550.6,'end_time'=>554.78,'target_text'=>'So, it was really busy and today is reunification weekend.','source_text'=>'Jadi memang sangat sibuk, lagipun hari ni hujung minggu cuti penyatuan semula.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>554.88,'end_time'=>557.5,'target_text'=>'So, it is just really busy and there are a lot of tourists.','source_text'=>'Jadi suasananya memang sangat sesak dan ramai pelancong.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>557.6,'end_time'=>558.58,'target_text'=>'Yeah, today\'s Friday.','source_text'=>'Ya, hari ni hari Jumaat.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>558.68,'end_time'=>561.64,'target_text'=>'But yeah, anyways, let\'s hit the road.','source_text'=>'Tapi apa-apa pun, jom kita teruskan perjalanan.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>562.56,'end_time'=>566.42,'target_text'=>'This is a quiet riverside area in the countryside.','source_text'=>'Ini kawasan tepi sungai yang tenang di luar bandar.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>566.52,'end_time'=>573.78,'target_text'=>'A wide river flows slowly through the middle of the scene and two long boats are moving across the water.','source_text'=>'Sungai yang luas mengalir tenang di tengah pemandangan dan dua buah bot panjang sedang bergerak melintasi air.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>573.88,'end_time'=>578.26,'target_text'=>'The boats are carrying large piles of sand or dirt.','source_text'=>'Bot-bot itu membawa timbunan besar pasir atau tanah.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>578.36,'end_time'=>584.62,'target_text'=>'On the right side, there is a tall green tree with many leaves hanging over the riverbank.','source_text'=>'Di sebelah kanan, ada sebatang pokok hijau tinggi dengan daun-daun yang merimbun di atas tebing sungai.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>584.72,'end_time'=>588.58,'target_text'=>'The grass near the water looks thick and slightly wild.','source_text'=>'Rumput dekat dengan air kelihatan tebal dan sedikit meliar.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>588.68,'end_time'=>592.46,'target_text'=>'In the distance, there is a long bridge stretching across the river.','source_text'=>'Di kejauhan, ada sebuah jambatan panjang yang merentasi sungai.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>592.56,'end_time'=>598.18,'target_text'=>'Behind the bridge, you can see dark rocky mountains rising into the cloudy sky.','source_text'=>'Di belakang jambatan, kelihatan gunung-ganang berbatu gelap menjulang ke langit yang mendung.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>598.28,'end_time'=>602.62,'target_text'=>'The clouds are heavy and gray, so it looks like it might rain soon.','source_text'=>'Awan tebal dan kelabu, nampaknya hari macam nak hujan tak lama lagi.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>602.72,'end_time'=>606.98,'target_text'=>'Small patches of green plants are floating floating on the surface of the water.','source_text'=>'Gumpalan kecil tumbuhan hijau terapung-apung di atas permukaan air.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>607.08,'end_time'=>611.06,'target_text'=>'The atmosphere feels calm, quiet, and natural.','source_text'=>'Suasananya terasa tenang, damai, dan semula jadi.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>611.16,'end_time'=>616.02,'target_text'=>'Everything looks still except for the slow movement of the boat on the water.','source_text'=>'Segala-galanya kelihatan kaku kecuali pergerakan perlahan bot di atas air.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>616.12,'end_time'=>622.14,'target_text'=>'The air feels humid and cool because of the clouds and the river breeze.','source_text'=>'Udaranya terasa lembap dan sejuk disebabkan cuaca mendung dan bayu sungai.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>622.24,'end_time'=>626.9,'target_text'=>'So, that guys is a accent and pronunciation practice segment.','source_text'=>'Jadi kawan-kawan, itu tadi segmen latihan sebutan dan loghat.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>627,'end_time'=>632.22,'target_text'=>'If you guys like that and you want to see more, let me know in the comments and I will keep on doing it.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang suka segmen macam tu dan nak tengok lagi, beritahu saya kat komen dan saya akan terus buat.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>632.32,'end_time'=>633.42,'target_text'=>'Let\'s continue.','source_text'=>'Jom kita sambung.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>633.52,'end_time'=>635.62,'target_text'=>'So, we just stopped on the side of the road again.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami berhenti kat tepi jalan lagi sekali.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>635.72,'end_time'=>638.86,'target_text'=>'And on this path, there are a lot of restaurants.','source_text'=>'Dan sepanjang laluan ni, ada banyak restoran.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>638.96,'end_time'=>641.62,'target_text'=>'I believe this is another restaurant, right?','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ini pun restoran juga, kan?','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>641.72,'end_time'=>642.12,'target_text'=>'Yes.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>642.2,'end_time'=>644.1,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I guess waffle.','source_text'=>'Ya, rasanya ada waffle.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>644.2,'end_time'=>646.82,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know what that is, but there are a lot of restaurants.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti makanan apa tu, tapi ada banyak restoran kat sini.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>646.92,'end_time'=>649.82,'target_text'=>'I think we should look for a coffee shop on our way.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa elok kita cari kedai kopi dalam perjalanan nanti.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>649.92,'end_time'=>656.02,'target_text'=>'As I was saying, there are a lot of restaurants along this path and now it\'s not as congested and there aren\'t as many people','source_text'=>'Macam yang saya kata tadi, ada banyak restoran sepanjang laluan ni dan sekarang tak berapa sesak serta tak ramai orang','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>656.12,'end_time'=>662.62,'target_text'=>'over here, so I think we\'ll just enjoy the rest of this ride and we\'ll see you guys when we get to the pagoda.','source_text'=>'kat sebelah sini, jadi kami nak nikmati baki tunggangan ni dan jumpa korang bila sampai kat pagoda nanti.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>662.72,'end_time'=>672.34,'target_text'=>'Get my 3,000 most common English words PDF and learn the words that will help you understand up to 95% of everyday English.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling kerap digunakan saya dan pelajari perkataan yang membantu anda faham sehingga 95% bahasa Inggeris harian.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>672.44,'end_time'=>674.82,'target_text'=>'Click the link in the description to get it.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruangan penerangan untuk dapatkannya.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>674.92,'end_time'=>678.58,'target_text'=>'arrived at Bai Dinh Pagoda.','source_text'=>'dah sampai kat Pagoda Bai Dinh.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>678.68,'end_time'=>680.58,'target_text'=>'Well, we haven\'t actually seen it yet.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya kami belum nampak binaannya lagi.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>680.68,'end_time'=>681.46,'target_text'=>'We just parked.','source_text'=>'Kami baru je parkir.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>681.56,'end_time'=>682.58,'target_text'=>'We just parked our scooters.','source_text'=>'Kami baru je parkir skuter kami.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>682.68,'end_time'=>683.58,'target_text'=>'But now we\'re going to [snorts] walk to it.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang kami nak [ketawa kecil] berjalan ke sana.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>683.68,'end_time'=>689.02,'target_text'=>'But if you look over there, it looks like those are rain clouds, so I really hope it doesn\'t rain, but we didn\'t bring any','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau tengok kat sana, nampak macam awan hujan, harapnya tak hujanlah, tapi kami tak bawa sebarang','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>689.12,'end_time'=>690.58,'target_text'=>'umbrellas or rain jacket.','source_text'=>'payung atau baju hujan.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>690.68,'end_time'=>692.3,'target_text'=>'can >> buy a garbage bag.','source_text'=>'boleh >> beli beg plastik sampah je.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>692.4,'end_time'=>693.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s all good.','source_text'=>'Semuanya okey.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>693.16,'end_time'=>695.34,'target_text'=>'Anyways, let\'s get going.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, jom kita gerak.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>695.44,'end_time'=>695.86,'target_text'=>'Yep.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>695.96,'end_time'=>698.78,'target_text'=>'You can see there are a lot of scooters parked here.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak banyak sangat skuter yang diparkir kat sini.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>698.88,'end_time'=>701.58,'target_text'=>'And that side, they are double parked.','source_text'=>'Dan kat bahagian sana, dorang parkir berlapis.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>701.68,'end_time'=>703.22,'target_text'=>'They are double parked over there.','source_text'=>'Dorang parkir berlapis kat sebelah sana.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>703.32,'end_time'=>707.66,'target_text'=>'Here you can see this person has a suitcase strapped to the back of their scooter.','source_text'=>'Kat sini korang boleh nampak orang ni ikat beg bagasi kat belakang skuter dia.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>707.76,'end_time'=>708.98,'target_text'=>'And this person has a backpack.','source_text'=>'Dan orang ni pula bawa beg galas.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>709.08,'end_time'=>710.46,'target_text'=>'Yo, did you see the suitcase, dude?','source_text'=>'Weh, kau nampak tak beg bagasi tu?','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>710.56,'end_time'=>711.7,'target_text'=>'Someone just strapped it.','source_text'=>'Ada orang ikat macam tu je.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>711.8,'end_time'=>712.94,'target_text'=>'>> we did on the Ha Giang loop.','source_text'=>'>> macam yang kami buat masa pusingan Ha Giang.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>713.04,'end_time'=>713.66,'target_text'=>'Did you?','source_text'=>'Kau buat macam tu ke?','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>713.76,'end_time'=>714.16,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>714.2,'end_time'=>715.06,'target_text'=>'Well, I didn\'t have my suitcase.','source_text'=>'Saya tak bawa beg bagasi saya.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>715.16,'end_time'=>715.94,'target_text'=>'I just had a backpack.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma bawa beg galas je.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>716.04,'end_time'=>719.7,'target_text'=>'Other people I was riding with, they had a suitcase and they just strapped it like that.','source_text'=>'Orang lain yang konvoi sekali dengan saya bawa bagasi dan dorang ikat macam tu je.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>719.8,'end_time'=>720.82,'target_text'=>'Dude, that\'s actually funny.','source_text'=>'Kelakar betullah bila tengok.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>720.92,'end_time'=>722.5,'target_text'=>'Actually, can you lean against it?','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya, boleh sandar kat beg tu ke?','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>722.6,'end_time'=>723.86,'target_text'=>'Could it be like a back support?','source_text'=>'Boleh jadi macam penyandar belakang ke?','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>723.96,'end_time'=>724.9,'target_text'=>'Or you might push it off.','source_text'=>'Atau kau mungkin tolak sampai terjatuh.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>725,'end_time'=>725.9,'target_text'=>'>> No, it\'ll fall off.','source_text'=>'>> Taklah, nanti terjatuh.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>726,'end_time'=>731.38,'target_text'=>'I was asking Wolka if I ever come back to do that, if they would have a bike with a back support.','source_text'=>'Saya ada tanya Wolka kalau saya datang lagi untuk buat aktiviti tu, ada tak motor yang ada penyandar belakang.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>731.48,'end_time'=>733.78,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I\'m sure you you could rent anything, man.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya pasti korang boleh sewa apa-apa jenis pun.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>733.88,'end_time'=>737.42,'target_text'=>'Anyway, let\'s head over there and buy our entrance ticket.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, jom kita pergi sana dan beli tiket masuk.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>737.52,'end_time'=>740.34,'target_text'=>'So, this is our first glimpse of the pagoda.','source_text'=>'Jadi, inilah pemandangan pertama kami melihat pagoda ni.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>740.44,'end_time'=>741.1,'target_text'=>'Beautiful.','source_text'=>'Cantik sangat.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>741.2,'end_time'=>741.82,'target_text'=>'Really nice.','source_text'=>'Memang menarik.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>741.92,'end_time'=>746.14,'target_text'=>'If you compare it to the One Pillar Pagoda, how many pillars are in this one?','source_text'=>'Kalau nak bandingkan dengan Pagoda Satu Tiang, pagoda ni ada berapa tiang pula?','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>746.24,'end_time'=>747.66,'target_text'=>'Aren\'t they all one pillar?','source_text'=>'Bukan semuanya ada satu tiang ke?','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>747.76,'end_time'=>749.74,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think anyone','source_text'=>'Saya rasa tak ada sesiapa','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>749.84,'end_time'=>750.98,'target_text'=>'That does not make sense.','source_text'=>'Itu langsung tak masuk akal.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>751.08,'end_time'=>754.1,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think anyone thought that, dude, except for you.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa tak ada siapa terfikir macam tu, kecuali kau sorang.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>754.2,'end_time'=>756.82,'target_text'=>'That\'s what I Well, I guess you weren\'t really thinking.','source_text'=>'Itu yang saya... nampaknya kau memang tak fikir betul-betul.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>756.92,'end_time'=>758.86,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we bought the tickets.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi kami dah beli tiket.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>758.96,'end_time'=>761.98,'target_text'=>'You can see we have three tickets there to get on the shuttle bus.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak kami ada tiga keping tiket untuk naik bas ulang-alik.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>762.08,'end_time'=>766.22,'target_text'=>'So, now we\'re going to get on the shuttle bus here, but there are a lot of people.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami nak naik bas ulang-alik kat sini, tapi orang ramai sangat.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>766.32,'end_time'=>770.38,'target_text'=>'But yeah, we\'re almost to the front and then we could get on the shuttle buses.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, kami dah hampir ke barisan depan dan boleh naik bas ulang-alik ni.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>770.48,'end_time'=>773.22,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we\'re getting on these shuttles here.','source_text'=>'Okey, sekarang kami sedang naik bas ulang-alik ni.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>773.32,'end_time'=>776.86,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if we could get on anyone or I think we just get on anyone.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti boleh naik mana-mana satu atau naik je yang mana ada.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>776.96,'end_time'=>778.1,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I guess get on the back here.','source_text'=>'Ya, rasanya kita naik kat bahagian belakang ni.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>778.2,'end_time'=>779.86,'target_text'=>'>> I was going to sit at the back.','source_text'=>'>> Saya ingatkan nak duduk kat belakang.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>779.96,'end_time'=>781.98,'target_text'=>'I kind of took that kid\'s spot, but >> Yeah, I know.','source_text'=>'Saya macam terambil tempat budak tu, tapi >> Ya, saya tahu.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>782.08,'end_time'=>786.3,'target_text'=>'>> [laughter] >> I was like I don\'t know if this is we\'re part of like a random tour group now.','source_text'=>'>> [ketawa] >> Saya tertanya-tanya adakah kita dah terserap dalam rombongan pelancong lain sekarang.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>786.4,'end_time'=>787.26,'target_text'=>'We\'re sitting at the back.','source_text'=>'Kami duduk kat bahagian belakang.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>787.36,'end_time'=>787.6,'target_text'=>'>> know.','source_text'=>'>> tahu.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>787.6,'end_time'=>789.3,'target_text'=>'We just got on there.','source_text'=>'Kami baru je naik tadi.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>789.4,'end_time'=>790.02,'target_text'=>'Well, we\'ll see.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah macam mana nanti.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>790.12,'end_time'=>793.3,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we are going.','source_text'=>'Okey, sekarang kami dah mula bertolak.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>793.4,'end_time'=>794.54,'target_text'=>'We\'re moving.','source_text'=>'Kami sedang bergerak.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>794.64,'end_time'=>795.78,'target_text'=>'We\'re all at the back here.','source_text'=>'Kami semua duduk kat belakang ni.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>795.88,'end_time'=>796.7,'target_text'=>'Back of the bus.','source_text'=>'Bahagian belakang bas.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>796.8,'end_time'=>798.18,'target_text'=>'And that\'s where we\'re heading to.','source_text'=>'Dan ke sanalah destinasi yang kami tuju.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>798.28,'end_time'=>799.86,'target_text'=>'We\'re heading to the pagoda over there.','source_text'=>'Kami sedang menuju ke pagoda kat sebelah sana tu.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>799.96,'end_time'=>804.22,'target_text'=>'Thank gosh we didn\'t have to walk cuz low-key I was not looking forward to walking.','source_text'=>'Nasib baiklah kami tak perlu jalan kaki, sebab jujurnya saya memang malas nak menapak.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>804.32,'end_time'=>809.74,'target_text'=>'No, I was not looking forward to walking there because she said like 5 km I thought.','source_text'=>'Memang saya tak sanggup nak jalan kaki ke sana sebab dia kata rasanya macam 5 km.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>809.84,'end_time'=>815.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I mean 6 km is the whole size of the like area I guess.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, rasanya 6 km tu keluasan keseluruhan kawasan ni.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>815.4,'end_time'=>816.98,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we\'ve just arrived.','source_text'=>'Okey, kami baru je sampai.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>817.08,'end_time'=>822.18,'target_text'=>'Our vehicle has dropped us off and now we\'re at the very top of this compound.','source_text'=>'Kenderaan dah turunkan kami dan sekarang kami berada di bahagian paling atas kawasan ni.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>822.28,'end_time'=>827.78,'target_text'=>'I don\'t really know what this area is because I thought it was just a pagoda, but this area is huge.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu sangat kawasan apa ni sebab ingatkan cuma kuil pagoda biasa, tapi tempat ni sangat luas.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>827.88,'end_time'=>829.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s a complex I guess.','source_text'=>'Rasanya macam satu kompleks yang besar.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>829.4,'end_time'=>833.94,'target_text'=>'Sightseeing map of Bai Dinh spiritual and cultural tourism complex.','source_text'=>'Peta lawatan kompleks pelancongan rohani dan kebudayaan Bai Dinh.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>834.04,'end_time'=>834.98,'target_text'=>'It\'s huge.','source_text'=>'Besar sungguh tempat ni.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>835.08,'end_time'=>839.66,'target_text'=>'Okay, so this is our first look at this cultural complex.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi inilah pandangan pertama kami terhadap kompleks kebudayaan ni.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>839.76,'end_time'=>840.94,'target_text'=>'What do you think of it so far?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat mak tentang tempat ni setakat ni?','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>841.04,'end_time'=>845.3,'target_text'=>'>> I think it\'s overwhelming because it\'s so big and that\'s a lot of steps.','source_text'=>'>> Mak rasa agak terkesima sebab ia terlalu besar dan tangganya banyak sangat.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>845.4,'end_time'=>850.38,'target_text'=>'Yeah, the lady when we were buying our tickets said this is 6 km long.','source_text'=>'Ya, wanita masa kita beli tiket tadi beritahu kawasan ni sejauh 6 km.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>850.48,'end_time'=>852.74,'target_text'=>'6 km this whole complex.','source_text'=>'6 km keluasan keseluruhan kompleks ni.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>852.84,'end_time'=>858.66,'target_text'=>'Here they have a little like a man-made lake [music] and they have some fish in there as well.','source_text'=>'Kat sini dorang ada tasik buatan manusia [muzik] dan ada ikan juga di dalamnya.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>858.76,'end_time'=>863.58,'target_text'=>'This area is nice, but I wonder is this like historic or is this just like they just made it?','source_text'=>'Kawasan ni cantik, tapi saya tertanya-tanya adakah ia bersejarah atau baru je dibina?','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>863.68,'end_time'=>866.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I think the pagoda is historical.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, mak rasa pagoda tu memang ada nilai sejarah.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>866.16,'end_time'=>869.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that is very well a possibility.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, perkara tu memang ada kemungkinannya.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>869.12,'end_time'=>871.66,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we\'re inside a temple.','source_text'=>'Okey, sekarang kami berada di dalam kuil.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>871.76,'end_time'=>874.38,'target_text'=>'Dude, those are some huge fans.','source_text'=>'Weh, besarnya kipas-kipas tu.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>874.48,'end_time'=>875.58,'target_text'=>'They\'re actually huge.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat besar.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>875.68,'end_time'=>879.46,'target_text'=>'I think this is the largest bronze statue in the complex.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ini patung gangsa yang paling besar dalam kompleks ni.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>879.56,'end_time'=>881.34,'target_text'=>'This statue is huge.','source_text'=>'Patung ni memang gergasi.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>881.44,'end_time'=>883.14,'target_text'=>'Buddhist bronze statue.','source_text'=>'Patung gangsa Buddha.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>883.24,'end_time'=>887.9,'target_text'=>'They have a really big like beautiful park behind this temple, you see?','source_text'=>'Dorang ada taman yang sangat luas dan cantik kat belakang kuil ni, nampak tak?','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>888,'end_time'=>893.82,'target_text'=>'This is like the inner courtyard of this complex and there are many inner courtyards, you know?','source_text'=>'Ini macam laman dalam kompleks ni, dan ada banyak lagi laman dalam yang lain, tahu tak?','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>893.92,'end_time'=>895.46,'target_text'=>'Yes, it looks like >> many many.','source_text'=>'Ya, nampaknya macam >> banyak sangat.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>895.56,'end_time'=>898.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s going to be I think you can make it a full day activity.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa korang boleh jadikan aktiviti seharian kat sini.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>899,'end_time'=>901.22,'target_text'=>'We\'re not going to, but No, you definitely can.','source_text'=>'Kami takkan buat macam tu, tapi memang korang boleh luangkan seharian.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>901.32,'end_time'=>902.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually so huge.','source_text'=>'Tempat ni memang sangat luas.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>902.84,'end_time'=>903.66,'target_text'=>'>> huge.','source_text'=>'>> sangat besar.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>903.76,'end_time'=>910.82,'target_text'=>'You can see the knees of these statues have been like polished because so many people have been touching them.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak bahagian lutut patung-patung ni macam berkilat sebab terlalu ramai orang sentuh.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>910.92,'end_time'=>914.14,'target_text'=>'So people constantly are touching this and this is metal or stone?','source_text'=>'Jadi orang sentiasa sentuh bahagian ni, dan ini logam atau batu ya?','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>914.24,'end_time'=>916.34,'target_text'=>'This is yeah, it looks like marble or stone.','source_text'=>'Ya, nampak macam batu marmar atau batu biasa.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>916.44,'end_time'=>923.34,'target_text'=>'And people touch it so much that they have begun to polish certain parts of these statues, mostly the knees.','source_text'=>'Dan orang kerap sangat sentuh sampai beberapa bahagian patung ni jadi licin berkilat, terutamanya bahagian lutut.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>923.44,'end_time'=>924.18,'target_text'=>'And the feet.','source_text'=>'Dan bahagian kaki.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>924.28,'end_time'=>928.76,'target_text'=>'Yeah, feet, the knees, the feet, and the hands.','source_text'=>'Ya, kaki, lutut, dan tangan.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>930.52,'end_time'=>939.06,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster and really understand the English from this video, get the workbook on my website, vocaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak belajar lebih cepat dan betul-betul faham bahasa Inggeris dari video ni, dapatkan buku latihan di laman web saya, vocaenglish.com.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>939.16,'end_time'=>943.7,'target_text'=>'And there really are like many, many statues, like dozens and dozens.','source_text'=>'Dan memang ada banyak sangat patung, berpuluh-puluh jumlahnya.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>943.8,'end_time'=>945.06,'target_text'=>'Look back at the corridor.','source_text'=>'Tengok balik lorong koridor tu.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>945.16,'end_time'=>948.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, we already walked a good way and there are just like so many more.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kita dah jalan agak jauh dan masih banyak lagi patung kat depan.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>948.76,'end_time'=>951.14,'target_text'=>'What do you think of the decoration and stuff like on top?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat mak tentang hiasan dan seni bina kat bahagian atas tu?','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>951.24,'end_time'=>952.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s really beautiful, isn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Cantik sangat, kan?','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>953,'end_time'=>954.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yes, I love the coloring.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, mak suka pilihan warnanya.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>954.48,'end_time'=>960.94,'target_text'=>'The red and yellow goes very well with the gold and And then the gold Buddhas like on the wall there.','source_text'=>'Warna merah dan kuning sangat sepadan dengan emas, dan patung emas kat dinding tu pun sama.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>961.04,'end_time'=>961.74,'target_text'=>'Beautiful.','source_text'=>'Sangat cantik.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>961.84,'end_time'=>963.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s really like a nice area.','source_text'=>'Kawasan ni memang sangat menarik.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>963.12,'end_time'=>966.74,'target_text'=>'I wonder how long it took to like build this whole place.','source_text'=>'Saya tertanya-tanya berapa lama masa diambil untuk bina keseluruhan tempat ni.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>966.84,'end_time'=>968.62,'target_text'=>'Probably a very long time.','source_text'=>'Mungkin ambil masa yang sangat lama.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>968.72,'end_time'=>969.78,'target_text'=>'Yes, I\'m sure.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya pasti.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>969.88,'end_time'=>971.78,'target_text'=>'Here is the bell tower.','source_text'=>'Kat sini menara loceng.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>971.88,'end_time'=>973.06,'target_text'=>'The bell tower.','source_text'=>'Menara loceng.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>973.16,'end_time'=>978.66,'target_text'=>'You can see the spiral staircase that people are climbing to get to the top of that tower.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak tangga berpusing yang orang ramai panjat untuk naik ke puncak menara tu.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>978.76,'end_time'=>979.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s really nice.','source_text'=>'Memang cantik.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>979.92,'end_time'=>981.74,'target_text'=>'Look at the size of this bell, dude.','source_text'=>'Tengok saiz loceng ni, besar gila.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>981.84,'end_time'=>983.66,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know what this structure below it is.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti struktur apa kat bahagian bawah loceng tu.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>983.76,'end_time'=>984.98,'target_text'=>'The bell is huge.','source_text'=>'Loceng ni memang gergasi.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>985.08,'end_time'=>987.34,'target_text'=>'Look at that, dude.','source_text'=>'Tengok tu.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>987.44,'end_time'=>988.9,'target_text'=>'This will kill a weaker man.','source_text'=>'Mendaki ni boleh buat orang tak kuat terus tumpas.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>989,'end_time'=>989.98,'target_text'=>'Good thing we\'re strong.','source_text'=>'Nasib baiklah kita berdua kuat.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>990.08,'end_time'=>991.98,'target_text'=>'I didn\'t even realize these were the shoes I wore.','source_text'=>'Saya tak perasan pun kasut mana yang saya pakai ni.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>992.08,'end_time'=>993.46,'target_text'=>'Thought I wore the Asics.','source_text'=>'Ingatkan saya pakai kasut Asics tadi.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>993.56,'end_time'=>994.74,'target_text'=>'I wore the wrong shoes.','source_text'=>'Saya tersalah pakai kasut.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>994.84,'end_time'=>997.78,'target_text'=>'I hiked mountains though before in this, so should be fine.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya pernah daki gunung pakai kasut ni sebelum ni, jadi patutnya tak ada masalah.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>997.88,'end_time'=>998.7,'target_text'=>'But look at this bell.','source_text'=>'Tapi tengoklah loceng ni.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>998.8,'end_time'=>1000.22,'target_text'=>'What do you think of that?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat mak tentang loceng tu?','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>1000.32,'end_time'=>1002.82,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s just absolutely spectacular.','source_text'=>'Mak rasa ia memang sangat mengagumkan.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>1002.92,'end_time'=>1003.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s huge, man.','source_text'=>'Besar sangat.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>1003.96,'end_time'=>1010.34,'target_text'=>'I wonder if they ring it, if all our eardrums will burst cuz that huge log there is used to ring this bell.','source_text'=>'Saya tertanya-tanya kalau dorang bunyikan, adakah gegendang telinga kita akan pecah sebab batang kayu balak besar tu digunakan untuk pukul loceng ni.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>1010.44,'end_time'=>1011.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s massive, man.','source_text'=>'Besar gila saiznya.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>1011.8,'end_time'=>1015.46,'target_text'=>'I\'m not really sure what it is, but it\'s just a huge piece of stone, I think.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sangat apa benda ni, tapi saya rasa cuma bongkah batu yang sangat besar.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>1015.56,'end_time'=>1016.06,'target_text'=>'Yep.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>1016.16,'end_time'=>1018.26,'target_text'=>'With carvings and symbols on it.','source_text'=>'Dengan ukiran dan simbol-simbol di atasnya.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>1018.36,'end_time'=>1021.02,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re on the middle floor and look at this view.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami berada di tingkat tengah dan tengoklah pemandangan ni.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>1021.12,'end_time'=>1024.98,'target_text'=>'Over there, you can see a pagoda in the distance and you can see another one there.','source_text'=>'Kat sana, korang boleh nampak kuil pagoda di kejauhan dan ada sebuah lagi kat sebelah sana.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>1025.08,'end_time'=>1028.18,'target_text'=>'I believe that is the main one, Bai Dinh Pagoda.','source_text'=>'Saya percaya itulah pagoda utama, Pagoda Bai Dinh.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>1028.28,'end_time'=>1028.7,'target_text'=>'Yes.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>1028.8,'end_time'=>1030.38,'target_text'=>'It looks like stone, doesn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Nampak macam diperbuat daripada batu, kan?','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>1030.48,'end_time'=>1031.18,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>1031.28,'end_time'=>1033.1,'target_text'=>'It looks actually massive.','source_text'=>'Ia memang kelihatan sangat besar.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>1033.2,'end_time'=>1034.38,'target_text'=>'I wonder if you can go up.','source_text'=>'Boleh naik ke atas ke agaknya.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>1034.48,'end_time'=>1036.42,'target_text'=>'>> I asked Leon, he says yes, but I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tanya Leon, dia kata boleh, tapi saya tak pasti.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>1036.52,'end_time'=>1037.82,'target_text'=>'I can\'t see >> people up there?','source_text'=>'Saya tak nampak >> ada orang kat atas tu ke?','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>1037.92,'end_time'=>1038.58,'target_text'=>'I can\'t.','source_text'=>'Saya tak nampak sesiapa.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>1038.68,'end_time'=>1042.54,'target_text'=>'Let\'s keep going cuz this complex is actually so massive.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan berjalan sebab kompleks ni memang teramat besar.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>1042.64,'end_time'=>1046.7,'target_text'=>'Like you can see in the distance there, there\'s just so many buildings and so much to explore.','source_text'=>'Macam korang nampak kat kejauhan sana, ada terlalu banyak bangunan dan banyak tempat untuk diterokai.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>1046.8,'end_time'=>1048.02,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s keep going.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jom kita teruskan.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>1048.12,'end_time'=>1051.54,'target_text'=>'And you can see this this is a tile roof.','source_text'=>'Dan korang boleh nampak bumbung ni bergenting.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>1051.64,'end_time'=>1052.7,'target_text'=>'No, not really.','source_text'=>'Eh, taklah juga.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>1052.8,'end_time'=>1056.14,'target_text'=>'But it looks like maybe maybe the shape, yeah.','source_text'=>'Tapi nampak macam bentuknya tu, ya.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>1056.24,'end_time'=>1057.1,'target_text'=>'Yeah, the shape of a bamboo.','source_text'=>'Ya, bentuk ruas buluh.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>1057.2,'end_time'=>1058.22,'target_text'=>'Those big bamboos.','source_text'=>'Batang buluh yang besar.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>1058.32,'end_time'=>1059.62,'target_text'=>'But it\'s ceramic tile.','source_text'=>'Tapi ia genting seramik.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>1059.72,'end_time'=>1061.7,'target_text'=>'Yeah, no, it looks actually quite nice.','source_text'=>'Ya, rekaannya nampak memang agak menarik.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>1061.8,'end_time'=>1062.86,'target_text'=>'Pretty nice roof.','source_text'=>'Bumbung yang agak cantik.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>1062.96,'end_time'=>1065.5,'target_text'=>'And you can see right there, those are LED lights.','source_text'=>'Dan korang boleh nampak kat situ, itu lampu LED.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>1065.6,'end_time'=>1067.1,'target_text'=>'Those are strong LED lights.','source_text'=>'Itu lampu LED berkuasa tinggi.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>1067.2,'end_time'=>1070.3,'target_text'=>'Here you can see the tile is broken, right?','source_text'=>'Kat sini korang boleh nampak gentingnya pecah, kan?','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>1070.4,'end_time'=>1070.76,'target_text'=>'Yes.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>1070.76,'end_time'=>1071.5,'target_text'=>'Am I blind?','source_text'=>'Mata saya silap tengok ke?','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>1071.6,'end_time'=>1073.94,'target_text'=>'Yeah, they\'re broken and some of them are cracked.','source_text'=>'Ya, genting tu pecah dan sebahagiannya retak.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>1074.04,'end_time'=>1074.82,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>1074.92,'end_time'=>1078.02,'target_text'=>'I\'m sure it looks nice in the evening if they light up the roof.','source_text'=>'Saya pasti pemandangannya cantik waktu malam kalau dorang nyalakan lampu kat bumbung.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>1078.12,'end_time'=>1081.34,'target_text'=>'This place is actually huge though, so let\'s keep going or else we won\'t finish.','source_text'=>'Tempat ni memang sangat luas, jadi jom teruskan berjalan kalau tak nanti tak habis pusing.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>1081.44,'end_time'=>1082.66,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m kind of tired already.','source_text'=>'>> Mak dah rasa agak penat dah.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>1082.76,'end_time'=>1083.18,'target_text'=>'Me, too.','source_text'=>'Saya pun sama.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>1083.28,'end_time'=>1091.1,'target_text'=>'If you\'re serious about becoming fluent in English, I\'ve built a full speaking and pronunciation course that shows you exactly','source_text'=>'Kalau korang serius nak fasih berbahasa Inggeris, saya dah bina kursus bertutur dan sebutan lengkap yang tunjukkan kepada korang secara tepat','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>1091.2,'end_time'=>1093.26,'target_text'=>'what to do step-by-step.','source_text'=>'apa yang perlu dibuat langkah demi langkah.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>1093.36,'end_time'=>1097.22,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to 80 plus video lessons right away.','source_text'=>'Korang akan dapat akses segera kepada lebih 80 video pembelajaran.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>1097.32,'end_time'=>1102.58,'target_text'=>'Inside we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking.','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya kita fokus pada sebutan, loghat, ritma, dan pertuturan semula jadi.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>1102.68,'end_time'=>1109.1,'target_text'=>'So, you can stop hesitating, sound more natural, and speak English with real confidence.','source_text'=>'Supaya korang tak lagi teragak-agak, bertutur lebih bersahaja, dan bercakap bahasa Inggeris dengan penuh yakin.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>1109.2,'end_time'=>1110.78,'target_text'=>'Join today in the description.','source_text'=>'Sertai hari ini menerusi pautan di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>1110.88,'end_time'=>1113.26,'target_text'=>'I\'m actually parched.','source_text'=>'Saya betul-betul dahaga sekarang.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>1113.36,'end_time'=>1118.22,'target_text'=>'I\'m parched and I\'m wearing my hair like this because I think my hair is really flat right now from wearing that helmet, you','source_text'=>'Saya dahaga dan saya buat rambut macam ni sebab saya rasa rambut saya kemek sangat lepas pakai topi keledar tu,','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>1118.32,'end_time'=>1118.82,'target_text'=>'know.','source_text'=>'faham-faham jelah.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>1118.92,'end_time'=>1120.1,'target_text'=>'My hair is flat?','source_text'=>'Rambut saya kemek ke?','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>1120.2,'end_time'=>1123.22,'target_text'=>'Your hair is naturally always flat.','source_text'=>'Rambut kau memang semula jadi lurus mendatar sentiasa.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>1123.32,'end_time'=>1125.18,'target_text'=>'Can I get a bottle of water?','source_text'=>'Boleh bagi sebotol air?','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>1125.28,'end_time'=>1126.02,'target_text'=>'Thank you.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>1126.12,'end_time'=>1129.14,'target_text'=>'So, we bought this water when we bought our tickets.','source_text'=>'Kami beli air ni masa beli tiket tadi.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>1129.24,'end_time'=>1130.1,'target_text'=>'Good thing we did.','source_text'=>'Nasib baiklah kita beli.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>1130.2,'end_time'=>1133.7,'target_text'=>'We have one more water bottle, but I\'ll share that cold one with you.','source_text'=>'Kami ada sebotol lagi air, tapi saya kongsi air sejuk tu dengan mak.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>1133.8,'end_time'=>1135.18,'target_text'=>'You don\'t mind sharing with me though.','source_text'=>'Mak tak kisah kan kongsi dengan saya.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>1135.28,'end_time'=>1136.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s not that cold anymore.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, air ni dah tak sejuk mana pun.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>1136.6,'end_time'=>1137.58,'target_text'=>'Oh, shoot.','source_text'=>'Alamak.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>1137.68,'end_time'=>1140.62,'target_text'=>'It was cold and we literally bought it like 20 minutes ago.','source_text'=>'Tadi sejuk, dan kita baru je beli lebih kurang 20 minit lepas.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>1140.72,'end_time'=>1142.06,'target_text'=>'Now it\'s not even cold.','source_text'=>'Sekarang langsung dah tak sejuk.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>1142.16,'end_time'=>1148.38,'target_text'=>'Okay, so this is the the bell tower we just went up, but we\'re going to end the video here because I don\'t want this to be','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi inilah menara loceng yang kami baru naik tadi, tapi kami nak tamatkan video kat sini sebab saya tak nak video ni berdurasi','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>1148.48,'end_time'=>1150.34,'target_text'=>'a 40 or 60 minute video.','source_text'=>'40 atau 60 minit panjangnya.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>1150.44,'end_time'=>1153.02,'target_text'=>'So, we\'ll have a part two right after this video.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita akan ada bahagian kedua sejurus selepas video ni.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>1153.12,'end_time'=>1154.34,'target_text'=>'So, just look out for that.','source_text'=>'Nantikan episod seterusnya.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>1154.44,'end_time'=>1157.7,'target_text'=>'And remember, guys, you will become fluent in English.','source_text'=>'Dan ingat semua, korang pasti boleh fasih berbahasa Inggeris.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>1157.8,'end_time'=>1163.78,'target_text'=>'Join the next video to see us exploring the rest of this and also other places here in Ninh Binh.','source_text'=>'Tonton video seterusnya untuk lihat kami meneroka baki kawasan ni dan juga tempat-tempat lain di Ninh Binh.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>1163.88,'end_time'=>1164.86,'target_text'=>'Bye, guys.','source_text'=>'Selamat tinggal semua.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>1164.96,'end_time'=>1166.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s going to be a highlight.','source_text'=>'Ini pasti akan jadi saat paling menarik.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>1166.72,'end_time'=>1170.66,'target_text'=>'Yesterday afternoon, [music] you can see we each got a scooter.','source_text'=>'Petang semalam, [muzik] korang boleh nampak kami masing-masing dapat sebuah skuter.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>1170.76,'end_time'=>1173.42,'target_text'=>'This is what our mode of transport will be for today.','source_text'=>'Inilah pengangkutan kami untuk hari ini.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>1173.52,'end_time'=>1181.14,'target_text'=>'Leon and I have our international license [music] electric scooters that are less powerful, around 50 cc.','source_text'=>'Leon dan saya ada lesen antarabangsa [muzik] skuter elektrik yang kurang kuasa, sekitar 50 cc.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>1181.24,'end_time'=>1183.1,'target_text'=>'>> I would say [music] it\'s very scenic.','source_text'=>'>> Saya boleh katakan [muzik] pemandangannya sangat indah.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>1183.2,'end_time'=>1183.94,'target_text'=>'Very scenic.','source_text'=>'Pemandangan sangat indah.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>1184.04,'end_time'=>1190.54,'target_text'=>'Also, I do believe there are a lot of rats in here because and just white it\'s a lot brighter than [music] when it\'s just','source_text'=>'Juga, saya rasa memang ada banyak tikus kat dalam ni sebab dan warna putih jauh lebih cerah daripada [muzik] masa keadaan cuaca','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>1190.64,'end_time'=>1191.66,'target_text'=>'like clear and blue.','source_text'=>'cerah dan langit biru.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>1191.76,'end_time'=>1193.94,'target_text'=>'That right there in front of us, that is a tunnel.','source_text'=>'Kat depan kita tu, itu adalah terowong.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>1194.04,'end_time'=>1195.54,'target_text'=>'Let me just park my bike on the side here.','source_text'=>'Biar saya parkir motor saya kat tepi ni sekejap.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>1195.64,'end_time'=>1199.34,'target_text'=>'This person [music] has a suitcase strapped to the back of their scooter.','source_text'=>'Orang ni [muzik] ikat beg bagasi kat bahagian belakang skuter dia.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>1199.44,'end_time'=>1201.46,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we bought the tickets.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi kami dah beli tiket.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>1201.56,'end_time'=>1202.94,'target_text'=>'You can see we have three tickets there.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak kami ada tiga keping tiket.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>1203.04,'end_time'=>1204.18,'target_text'=>'What do you [music] think of it so far?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat mak [muzik] tentang tempat ni setakat ni?','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>1204.28,'end_time'=>1210.94,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s overwhelming because it\'s so big and These statues have been like polished because so many people have been touching','source_text'=>'Mak rasa agak terkesima sebab ia terlalu besar dan patung-patung ni macam berkilat sebab terlalu ramai orang sentuh','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>1211.04,'end_time'=>1211.44,'target_text'=>'them.','source_text'=>'permukaannya.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>1211.44,'end_time'=>1212.22,'target_text'=>'Look at this bell.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah loceng ni.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1212.32,'end_time'=>1213.54,'target_text'=>'What do you think of that?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat mak tentang loceng tu?','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1213.64,'end_time'=>1214.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s not that cold anymore.','source_text'=>'Air ni dah tak sejuk mana pun.','order'=>409],
