            ['start_time'=>692.04,'end_time'=>699.18,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster and go deeper than the video, then get the workbook on my website, vulcaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak belajar lebih pantas dan mendalam berbanding video ni, dapatkan buku latihan di laman web saya, vocaenglish.com.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>699.28,'end_time'=>708.02,'target_text'=>'The workbook explains everything in greater detail and comes with exercises to help you learn new vocabulary, grammar, tenses,','source_text'=>'Buku latihan ni terangkan segalanya dengan terperinci beserta latihan untuk bantu korang kuasai kosa kata, tatabahasa, tenses,','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>708.12,'end_time'=>713.86,'target_text'=>'sentence patterns, comprehension, and real English you can actually use.','source_text'=>'pola ayat, pemahaman, dan bahasa Inggeris praktikal yang korang boleh gunakan.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>713.96,'end_time'=>720.3,'target_text'=>'I also have workbooks for past videos, so you can keep practicing and improving every lesson.','source_text'=>'Saya juga ada buku latihan untuk video-video sebelum ni supaya korang boleh terus berlatih.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>720.4,'end_time'=>723.58,'target_text'=>'Click the link in my description to get the workbooks.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruangan penerangan untuk dapatkan buku latihan tersebut.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>723.68,'end_time'=>726.54,'target_text'=>'We just tried to run to catch the bus, but we just missed the bus.','source_text'=>'Kami baru je lari nak kejar bas tadi, tapi terlepas juga.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>726.64,'end_time'=>727.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s up there.','source_text'=>'Bas tu ada kat atas sana.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>727.36,'end_time'=>731.34,'target_text'=>'But right now we\'re standing over a freeway, and there\'s also another freeway right here.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang kami sedang berdiri di atas jejantas lebuh raya, dan ada satu lagi lebuh raya kat bawah ni.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>731.44,'end_time'=>732.82,'target_text'=>'You can see many, many vehicles.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak banyak sangat kenderaan lalu-lalang.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>732.92,'end_time'=>737.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s about 4:40 p.m., so it\'s almost 5:00, so everyone is starting to head home.','source_text'=>'Sekarang dah pukul 4:40 petang, hampir pukul 5:00, jadi semua orang dah mula balik ke rumah.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>737.84,'end_time'=>740.26,'target_text'=>'They\'re starting to head home or go home.','source_text'=>'Dorang dah mula balik atau bergerak pulang.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>740.36,'end_time'=>746.46,'target_text'=>'So, traffic is going to start getting a lot more congested, but where we want to go is up there.','source_text'=>'Jadi jalan raya akan mula jadi jauh lebih sesak, tapi tempat yang kami nak tuju ada kat atas sana.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>746.56,'end_time'=>750.6,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure if you can see Seoul Tower up It\'s a little','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti kalau korang nampak Menara Seoul kat atas tu... cuaca agak','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>751.76,'end_time'=>757.54,'target_text'=>'bit overcast today, so it\'s overcast, and it\'s also like, you know, like foggy.','source_text'=>'mendung hari ini, cuaca redup dan macam berkabus.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>757.64,'end_time'=>758.94,'target_text'=>'Not foggy, smog.','source_text'=>'Bukan kabus, jerebu.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>759.04,'end_time'=>759.94,'target_text'=>'It\'s like smog.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam ada jerebu.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>760.04,'end_time'=>761.02,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think it\'s fog.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa bukan kabus semata-mata.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>761.12,'end_time'=>766.98,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s kind of we won\'t have the very best view, but you\'ll still be able to see the whole city from up there.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami tak dapat pemandangan terbaik, tapi masih boleh nampak seluruh bandar dari atas sana.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>767.08,'end_time'=>770.22,'target_text'=>'And we want to get up there sooner rather than than later.','source_text'=>'Dan kami nak sampai ke atas sana secepat yang mungkin.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>770.32,'end_time'=>774.12,'target_text'=>'But the sun is setting over there, as you can see.','source_text'=>'Tapi matahari dah mula terbenam kat sebelah sana, macam korang boleh nampak.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>775.48,'end_time'=>778.74,'target_text'=>'And yeah, now we have to wait 10 minutes for our bus right here.','source_text'=>'Dan ya, sekarang kami kena tunggu bas selama 10 minit kat sini.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>778.84,'end_time'=>782.7,'target_text'=>'That\'s our bus stop, so we have to wait 10 minutes, and then we can catch our bus.','source_text'=>'Itu perhentian bas kami, jadi kena tunggu 10 minit sebelum bas kami tiba.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>782.8,'end_time'=>785.82,'target_text'=>'But yeah, we\'re going to be going through rush hour in Seoul.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, kami akan meredah waktu puncak di Seoul.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>785.92,'end_time'=>788.12,'target_text'=>'Rush hour.','source_text'=>'Waktu puncak.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>791.72,'end_time'=>794.9,'target_text'=>'So, uh the bus driver just left the bus, as you can see.','source_text'=>'Pemandu bas baru je tinggalkan bas, macam korang boleh nampak.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>795,'end_time'=>799.34,'target_text'=>'Like so, now we have to walk 5 hours back home, but it\'s okay.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang kami kena berjalan kaki 5 jam balik ke rumah, tapi tak mengapalah.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>799.44,'end_time'=>800.18,'target_text'=>'I like walking.','source_text'=>'Saya suka berjalan kaki.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>800.28,'end_time'=>803.94,'target_text'=>'It\'s a good thing that he decided to leave the bus right at our bus stop.','source_text'=>'Mujurlah dia buat keputusan tinggalkan bas tepat kat perhentian kami.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>804.04,'end_time'=>806.1,'target_text'=>'Cuz he he literally just left the bus.','source_text'=>'Sebab dia memang tinggalkan bas begitu je tadi.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>806.2,'end_time'=>808.06,'target_text'=>'Oh, there\'s the bus driver.','source_text'=>'Oh, tu pemandu bas dah balik.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>808.16,'end_time'=>808.94,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, is that a washroom?','source_text'=>'>> Oh, itu tandas ke?','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>809.04,'end_time'=>809.78,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I\'m going to stop there.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya nak singgah situ.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>809.88,'end_time'=>810.28,'target_text'=>'There it is.','source_text'=>'Tu dia tandasnya.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>810.36,'end_time'=>811.5,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, he had to go to the washroom, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, dia terpaksa pergi ke tandas rupanya.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>811.6,'end_time'=>815.94,'target_text'=>'So, the bus driver had to go to the washroom real quick, so he left the bus, went to the washroom.','source_text'=>'Jadi pemandu bas tu kena pergi tandas sekejap, sebab tu dia keluar dari bas.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>816.04,'end_time'=>817.62,'target_text'=>'That was like That was like 30 seconds, dude.','source_text'=>'Cuma ambil masa 30 saat je tadi.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>817.72,'end_time'=>818.04,'target_text'=>'>> fast.','source_text'=>'>> cepat gila.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>818.04,'end_time'=>819.46,'target_text'=>'I think he didn\'t even wash his hands, though.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa dia tak basuh tangan pun agaknya.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>819.56,'end_time'=>823.86,'target_text'=>'>> I need to go to the washroom as well, so we\'re going to go to the washroom and then to the market.','source_text'=>'>> Saya pun kena pergi tandas juga, lepas tu baru kita ke pasar.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>823.96,'end_time'=>824.62,'target_text'=>'>> You are.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>824.72,'end_time'=>825.82,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s it looking like?','source_text'=>'>> Macam mana keadaannya kat sana?','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>825.92,'end_time'=>827.5,'target_text'=>'>> Looking kind of dead.','source_text'=>'>> Nampak agak lengang.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>827.6,'end_time'=>829.02,'target_text'=>'>> No, no, look at the camera.','source_text'=>'>> Eh tengok kamera ni.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>829.12,'end_time'=>829.66,'target_text'=>'>> Oh.','source_text'=>'>> Oh.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>829.76,'end_time'=>832.34,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, guys, so we\'re at Namdaemun Market.','source_text'=>'>> Okey semua, sekarang kami berada di Pasar Namdaemun.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>832.44,'end_time'=>833.34,'target_text'=>'We just arrived.','source_text'=>'Kami baru je sampai.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>833.44,'end_time'=>840.02,'target_text'=>'I know I said in the beginning we were going to go to the Namsan Tower, but as you can see, today is very smoggy.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu tadi saya kata nak pergi ke Menara Namsan, tapi macam korang nampak hari ni udara agak berjerebu.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>840.12,'end_time'=>840.86,'target_text'=>'Smoggy.','source_text'=>'Berjerebu.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>840.96,'end_time'=>845.14,'target_text'=>'That just means there\'s a lot of pollution, smoke in the air, so it\'s smoggy.','source_text'=>'Itu bermakna ada banyak pencemaran dan asap dalam udara, jadi ia berjerebu.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>845.24,'end_time'=>851.74,'target_text'=>'So, even if we went up, the view was not that nice and it was overcast, so there was no sunset, either, but we\'re going to','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau kami naik atas pun pemandangannya tak berapa elok dan cuaca mendung tanpa matahari terbenam, tapi kami','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>851.84,'end_time'=>854.1,'target_text'=>'just walk through Namdaemun Market real quick.','source_text'=>'nak jalan-jalan sekejap keliling Pasar Namdaemun ni.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>854.2,'end_time'=>855.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of like closing down.','source_text'=>'Pasar ni dah macam nak tutup.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>855.4,'end_time'=>860.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s almost 6:00 p.m., so there are some stalls open, but a lot of people are closing shop here.','source_text'=>'Dah hampir pukul 6:00 petang, ada beberapa gerai masih buka tapi ramai dah mula kemas kedai.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>860.52,'end_time'=>866.82,'target_text'=>'>> Well, Google Maps said it closes at 5:00, so >> Yeah, online it said like 5:00, 6:00, like 5:00, like I think 10:00 to','source_text'=>'>> Google Maps kata tutup pukul 5:00 petang >> Ya, dalam internet kata sekitar 5:00 atau 6:00 petang, dari pukul 10:00 pagi ke','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>866.92,'end_time'=>871.14,'target_text'=>'5:00 is the busiest time and then after that it\'s kind of like closing down, but there\'s still some stuff open.','source_text'=>'5:00 petang waktu paling sibuk dan lepas tu mula tutup, tapi masih ada gerai yang buka.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>871.24,'end_time'=>873.18,'target_text'=>'We can walk down this way and then come back up.','source_text'=>'Kita boleh jalan ke bawah ikut lorong ni dan patah balik nanti.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>873.28,'end_time'=>879.78,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, there\'s a jewelry shop here selling necklaces, rings, earrings, hair clips.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya, ada kedai aksesori kat sini jual rantai, cincin, anting-anting, dan klip rambut.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>879.88,'end_time'=>881.1,'target_text'=>'Here\'s a sweatshirt stall.','source_text'=>'Kat sini pula gerai baju sweatshirt.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>881.2,'end_time'=>882.22,'target_text'=>'>> the Supreme sweatshirt?','source_text'=>'>> baju sweatshirt jenama Supreme tu ke?','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>882.32,'end_time'=>883.22,'target_text'=>'>> The Stussy.','source_text'=>'>> Jenama Stussy.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>883.32,'end_time'=>884.14,'target_text'=>'I wonder if that\'s legit.','source_text'=>'Original ke pakaian tu agaknya.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>884.24,'end_time'=>884.74,'target_text'=>'Oh, what\'s this?','source_text'=>'Oh, apa ni?','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>884.84,'end_time'=>887.32,'target_text'=>'Don\'t touch me.','source_text'=>'Jangan sentuh saya.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>887.72,'end_time'=>888.66,'target_text'=>'Bart Simpson, bro.','source_text'=>'Watak Bart Simpson, bro.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>888.76,'end_time'=>889.3,'target_text'=>'That\'s hilarious.','source_text'=>'Kelakar betullah.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>889.4,'end_time'=>892.62,'target_text'=>'Oh, I want to buy a I heart Korea t-shirt, actually.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya saya teringin nak beli baju t-shirt I Heart Korea.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>892.72,'end_time'=>893.54,'target_text'=>'I heart Korea.','source_text'=>'I Heart Korea.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>893.64,'end_time'=>894.54,'target_text'=>'That\'s what I want.','source_text'=>'Itu yang saya cari.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>894.64,'end_time'=>897.7,'target_text'=>'If I see that, I\'m going to buy it cuz I do heart Korea.','source_text'=>'Kalau saya jumpa saya nak beli sebab saya memang suka Korea.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>897.8,'end_time'=>900.34,'target_text'=>'But actually, I might get a little bite to eat here.','source_text'=>'Tapi sebenarnya saya rasa nak cari makanan ringan sikit kat sini.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>900.44,'end_time'=>903.98,'target_text'=>'Oh, there\'s ginseng over there because I\'m feeling like super light-headed.','source_text'=>'Oh, ada ginseng kat sana, kepala saya rasa agak pening dan melayang ni.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>904.08,'end_time'=>908.1,'target_text'=>'Like I need I need some water and I need something to something to eat.','source_text'=>'Saya perlukan air minum dan sikit makanan untuk alas perut.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>908.2,'end_time'=>910.42,'target_text'=>'Oh, let\'s see let\'s see what she got cooking here.','source_text'=>'Jom tengok makcik tu tengah masak apa kat sini.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>910.52,'end_time'=>912.3,'target_text'=>'Hotteok, honey-filled Korean hotteok.','source_text'=>'Hotteok, pancake manis Korea berinti madu.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>912.4,'end_time'=>913.98,'target_text'=>'>> 2,000?','source_text'=>'>> 2,000 won?','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>914.08,'end_time'=>916.58,'target_text'=>'>> A B C D E F G >> Okay.','source_text'=>'>> Menu A B C D E F G >> Okey.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>916.68,'end_time'=>918.62,'target_text'=>'>> Uh >> I\'ll get an A.','source_text'=>'>> Saya nak menu A.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>918.72,'end_time'=>919.62,'target_text'=>'>> You want A?','source_text'=>'>> Kau nak menu A?','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>919.72,'end_time'=>920.08,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>920.08,'end_time'=>921.78,'target_text'=>'>> One A, please.','source_text'=>'>> Bagi menu A satu ya.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>921.88,'end_time'=>925.74,'target_text'=>'If you don\'t eat hot dog, you\'ll get caught in the hot dog method.','source_text'=>'Kalau tak makan hotteok, nanti terperangkap dengan rasa kempunan.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>925.84,'end_time'=>926.58,'target_text'=>'Okay, two.','source_text'=>'Okey, bagi dua.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>926.68,'end_time'=>929.06,'target_text'=>'One more, one more.','source_text'=>'Satu lagi, tambah satu lagi.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>929.16,'end_time'=>930.54,'target_text'=>'I don\'t even know what that means.','source_text'=>'Saya langsung tak faham apa maksud pepatah tu.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>930.64,'end_time'=>932.58,'target_text'=>'You\'ll get caught in the hot dog method.','source_text'=>'Nanti terperangkap dalam kaedah hotteok.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>932.68,'end_time'=>936.06,'target_text'=>'Yo, if you know what this means, let me know.','source_text'=>'Korang, kalau ada sesiapa tahu apa maksudnya, beritahu saya.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>936.16,'end_time'=>937.78,'target_text'=>'Anyways, we got the two here.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, kami dah dapat dua keping hotteok ni.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>937.88,'end_time'=>939.38,'target_text'=>'So, we got two A\'s.','source_text'=>'Kami beli dua menu A.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>939.48,'end_time'=>940.42,'target_text'=>'Leon got one.','source_text'=>'Leon dapat satu.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>940.52,'end_time'=>944.98,'target_text'=>'Well, I was just going to get one for both of us, but she said we\'re going to get caught in the hot dog way if we only have','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya saya ingatkan nak beli satu je untuk kongsi berdua, tapi makcik tu kata rugi besar kalau kami cuma ambil','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>945.08,'end_time'=>945.48,'target_text'=>'one.','source_text'=>'satu.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>945.52,'end_time'=>949.98,'target_text'=>'And that sounded like a threat, so we just got two.','source_text'=>'Bunyi macam ugutan pula, jadi kami beli jelah dua.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>950.08,'end_time'=>951.78,'target_text'=>'>> They\'re going to get you.','source_text'=>'>> Nanti dorang cari kau.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>951.88,'end_time'=>954.08,'target_text'=>'That looks good.','source_text'=>'Nampak sedap.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>954.48,'end_time'=>956.94,'target_text'=>'>> We have here top 10 loudest bikes.','source_text'=>'>> Kat sini kita ada 10 motosikal paling bising.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>957.04,'end_time'=>957.86,'target_text'=>'>> No, thanks, man.','source_text'=>'>> Tak naklah, terima kasih.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>957.96,'end_time'=>959.74,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s good.','source_text'=>'>> Sedap ni.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>959.84,'end_time'=>963.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s uh >> They didn\'t cut this one up like the last one, but >> I\'ve never seen them cut it up.','source_text'=>'Makcik ni tak potong macam kedai sebelum ni, tapi >> saya tak pernah tengok orang potong pun.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>963.56,'end_time'=>965.18,'target_text'=>'Just that last place they cut it up.','source_text'=>'Kedai sebelum ni je yang dorang tolong potongkan.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>965.28,'end_time'=>965.68,'target_text'=>'But, let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Tapi tak apa, jom kita rasa.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>965.68,'end_time'=>966.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s good.','source_text'=>'Memang sedap.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>966.68,'end_time'=>968.48,'target_text'=>'Mashiseoyo.','source_text'=>'Mashiseoyo (sedapnya).','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>968.72,'end_time'=>969.62,'target_text'=>'Kamsahamnida.','source_text'=>'Kamsahamnida (terima kasih).','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>969.72,'end_time'=>971.06,'target_text'=>'>> I think you butchered that one.','source_text'=>'>> Pelik bunyinya bila kau sebut tadi.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>971.16,'end_time'=>973.1,'target_text'=>'>> No, mashiseoyo is perfect Korean.','source_text'=>'>> Eh taklah, sebutan mashiseoyo saya tepat dalam bahasa Korea.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>973.2,'end_time'=>975.9,'target_text'=>'Let me know how good that was if you\'re Korean.','source_text'=>'Sesiapa orang Korea tolong komen betul ke tak sebutan saya tadi.','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>976,'end_time'=>977.82,'target_text'=>'Or no, the sausage and rice skewer.','source_text'=>'Atau bukan, cucuk sosej dan kek beras tu.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>977.92,'end_time'=>979.42,'target_text'=>'Let me just get one of those.','source_text'=>'Biar saya beli secucuk benda tu.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>979.52,'end_time'=>982.26,'target_text'=>'Uh one sausage and rice skewer.','source_text'=>'Bagi secucuk sosej dan kek beras tu ya.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>982.36,'end_time'=>983.02,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s this?','source_text'=>'>> Apa ni?','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>983.12,'end_time'=>983.9,'target_text'=>'>> The fish cake.','source_text'=>'>> Kek ikan.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>984,'end_time'=>985.82,'target_text'=>'This one.','source_text'=>'Yang ini.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>985.92,'end_time'=>987.1,'target_text'=>'>> What do they call it in Korean?','source_text'=>'>> Apa panggilannya dalam bahasa Korea?','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>987.2,'end_time'=>987.82,'target_text'=>'>> Not sure.','source_text'=>'>> Tak pasti.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>987.92,'end_time'=>989.38,'target_text'=>'Oh, odok.','source_text'=>'Oh, eomuk.','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>989.48,'end_time'=>991.02,'target_text'=>'Oh, odong.','source_text'=>'Oh, odeng.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>991.12,'end_time'=>991.9,'target_text'=>'Odong.','source_text'=>'Odeng.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>992,'end_time'=>993.66,'target_text'=>'Yeah, then she puts some sauce on it.','source_text'=>'Ya, lepas tu makcik tu letak sos kat atasnya.','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>993.76,'end_time'=>996,'target_text'=>'Some sweet sauce.','source_text'=>'Sos manis sedikit.','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>997.08,'end_time'=>998.7,'target_text'=>'Kamsahamnida.','source_text'=>'Kamsahamnida.','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>998.8,'end_time'=>1000.42,'target_text'=>'I\'ve been wanting to try this one for a while.','source_text'=>'Dah lama saya teringin nak cuba makanan ni.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>1000.52,'end_time'=>1003.98,'target_text'=>'I had it like two years ago when I was here, but I\'m kind of looking forward to it.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah makan dua tahun lepas masa kat sini, jadi saya teruja nak rasa balik.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>1004.08,'end_time'=>1006.92,'target_text'=>'>> You like wieners, don\'t you?','source_text'=>'>> Kau memang suka sosej kan?','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>1007.12,'end_time'=>1007.7,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'>> Wah.','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>1007.8,'end_time'=>1008.42,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'>> Wah.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1008.52,'end_time'=>1009.26,'target_text'=>'No reaction.','source_text'=>'Tiada reaksi.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1009.36,'end_time'=>1009.82,'target_text'=>'Light work.','source_text'=>'Benda senang je.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1009.92,'end_time'=>1010.94,'target_text'=>'>> No reaction.','source_text'=>'>> Langsung tak ada reaksi.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1011.04,'end_time'=>1012.5,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s super soft when they deep fry it.','source_text'=>'>> Teksturnya sangat lembut bila digoreng celur.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1012.6,'end_time'=>1013,'target_text'=>'>> it taste like?','source_text'=>'>> Apa rasanya?','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1013,'end_time'=>1015.34,'target_text'=>'Is it sweet, salty, bitter, spicy?','source_text'=>'Manis ke, masin, pahit, atau pedas?','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1015.44,'end_time'=>1016.42,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s just sweet, sweet.','source_text'=>'>> Rasanya cuma manis-manis.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1016.52,'end_time'=>1017.22,'target_text'=>'>> No spiciness?','source_text'=>'>> Tak ada rasa pedas langsung?','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1017.32,'end_time'=>1018.5,'target_text'=>'>> Uh-uh.','source_text'=>'>> Tak ada.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1018.6,'end_time'=>1020.06,'target_text'=>'But, it\'s good.','source_text'=>'Tapi sedap.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1020.16,'end_time'=>1020.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, look at those.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tengok makanan tu.','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>1020.96,'end_time'=>1021.7,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>1021.8,'end_time'=>1022.42,'target_text'=>'Mandu.','source_text'=>'Mandu (dumpling Korea).','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>1022.52,'end_time'=>1024.18,'target_text'=>'>> I guess these are kimchi and those are pork.','source_text'=>'>> Rasanya yang ini inti kimchi dan yang tu inti daging.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>1024.28,'end_time'=>1025.22,'target_text'=>'I\'m just going to get five.','source_text'=>'Saya nak beli lima ketul je.','order'=>460],
            ['start_time'=>1025.32,'end_time'=>1025.98,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s a lot, though.','source_text'=>'>> Banyak juga tu.','order'=>461],
            ['start_time'=>1026.08,'end_time'=>1026.54,'target_text'=>'They\'re big.','source_text'=>'Saiznya besar.','order'=>462],
            ['start_time'=>1026.64,'end_time'=>1027.62,'target_text'=>'>> Smallest option is five.','source_text'=>'>> Pilihan paling sikit memang lima ketul.','order'=>463],
            ['start_time'=>1027.72,'end_time'=>1029.78,'target_text'=>'>> Well, I guess I could sacrifice myself and eat them all.','source_text'=>'>> Nampaknya terpaksalah saya korbankan diri habiskan semua.','order'=>464],
            ['start_time'=>1029.88,'end_time'=>1031.5,'target_text'=>'>> They\'re a pork one and kimchi ones.','source_text'=>'>> Ada yang inti daging dan ada inti kimchi.','order'=>465],
            ['start_time'=>1031.6,'end_time'=>1033.14,'target_text'=>'I think the only option is five.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kuantiti minima memang kena ambil lima.','order'=>466],
            ['start_time'=>1033.24,'end_time'=>1034.58,'target_text'=>'People are getting boxes here.','source_text'=>'Orang lain beli sampai berkotak-kotak.','order'=>467],
            ['start_time'=>1034.68,'end_time'=>1036.82,'target_text'=>'>> Well, dude, all these trays were just filled.','source_text'=>'>> Talam-talam ni tadi penuh semuanya.','order'=>468],
            ['start_time'=>1036.92,'end_time'=>1038.02,'target_text'=>'>> Kamsahamnida.','source_text'=>'>> Kamsahamnida.','order'=>469],
            ['start_time'=>1038.12,'end_time'=>1039.14,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, this is so warm.','source_text'=>'>> Wah, panasnya mandu ni.','order'=>470],
            ['start_time'=>1039.24,'end_time'=>1040.74,'target_text'=>'Dude, people were literally buying boxes.','source_text'=>'Orang lain memang borong berkotak-kotak.','order'=>471],
            ['start_time'=>1040.84,'end_time'=>1044.62,'target_text'=>'And when I said five, I think they felt like offended, but five is all I wanted.','source_text'=>'Masa saya cakap nak lima ketul, dorang macam pelik je, tapi itu je yang saya mampu makan.','order'=>472],
            ['start_time'=>1044.72,'end_time'=>1047.58,'target_text'=>'Kind of don\'t want to dirty my hand, but this is what they look like.','source_text'=>'Saya tak nak kotorkan tangan, tapi macam nilah rupanya.','order'=>473],
            ['start_time'=>1047.68,'end_time'=>1048.34,'target_text'=>'Bro, look at that.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah tu, bro.','order'=>474],
            ['start_time'=>1048.44,'end_time'=>1049.66,'target_text'=>'Bro, that that is steaming.','source_text'=>'Masih berasap-asap lagi mandu ni.','order'=>475],
            ['start_time'=>1049.76,'end_time'=>1050.94,'target_text'=>'Look at that.','source_text'=>'Tengok tu.','order'=>476],
            ['start_time'=>1051.04,'end_time'=>1051.46,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>477],
            ['start_time'=>1051.56,'end_time'=>1052.9,'target_text'=>'>> Oh my god.','source_text'=>'>> Ya ampun.','order'=>478],
            ['start_time'=>1053,'end_time'=>1053.58,'target_text'=>'Not on it.','source_text'=>'Jangan sampai tumpah.','order'=>479],
            ['start_time'=>1053.68,'end_time'=>1055.34,'target_text'=>'I mean wow.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, hebatnya.','order'=>480],
            ['start_time'=>1055.44,'end_time'=>1056.46,'target_text'=>'>> Hopefully I don\'t burn my face.','source_text'=>'>> Harap-harap tak melecurlah muka saya.','order'=>481],
            ['start_time'=>1056.56,'end_time'=>1059.52,'target_text'=>'2 seconds ago these were still cooking.','source_text'=>'Dua saat lepas mandu ni baru je siap dimasak.','order'=>482],
            ['start_time'=>1063.44,'end_time'=>1064.82,'target_text'=>'>> One bite dumpling review.','source_text'=>'>> Ulasan dumpling satu suapan.','order'=>483],
            ['start_time'=>1064.92,'end_time'=>1065.82,'target_text'=>'>> Mandu review.','source_text'=>'>> Ulasan mandu.','order'=>484],
            ['start_time'=>1065.92,'end_time'=>1066.32,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s good.','source_text'=>'>> Sedap.','order'=>485],
            ['start_time'=>1066.32,'end_time'=>1067.9,'target_text'=>'It literally just tastes like mandu.','source_text'=>'Rasanya memang betul-betul macam mandu klasik.','order'=>486],
            ['start_time'=>1068,'end_time'=>1069.94,'target_text'=>'It tastes like the same thing we had at Gwangjang Market.','source_text'=>'Sama macam yang kami makan kat Pasar Gwangjang dulu.','order'=>487],
            ['start_time'=>1070.04,'end_time'=>1070.66,'target_text'=>'>> boiled, isn\'t it?','source_text'=>'>> Yang ni rebus kan?','order'=>488],
            ['start_time'=>1070.76,'end_time'=>1071.5,'target_text'=>'That\'s steamed, right?','source_text'=>'Itu dikukus, kan?','order'=>489],
            ['start_time'=>1071.6,'end_time'=>1072.38,'target_text'=>'>> same inside.','source_text'=>'>> Inti dalam sama.','order'=>490],
            ['start_time'=>1072.48,'end_time'=>1073.3,'target_text'=>'It tastes like the mandu.','source_text'=>'Rasanya macam mandu biasa.','order'=>491],
            ['start_time'=>1073.4,'end_time'=>1074.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s the same inside.','source_text'=>'Inti dalamnya tetap sama.','order'=>492],
            ['start_time'=>1074.4,'end_time'=>1075.14,'target_text'=>'>> opened the oven.','source_text'=>'>> Makcik tu buka pengukus.','order'=>493],
            ['start_time'=>1075.24,'end_time'=>1076.54,'target_text'=>'>> Oh my gosh, bro.','source_text'=>'>> Wah, banyaknya wap.','order'=>494],
            ['start_time'=>1076.64,'end_time'=>1077.38,'target_text'=>'Look.','source_text'=>'Tengok tu.','order'=>495],
            ['start_time'=>1077.48,'end_time'=>1079.02,'target_text'=>'Look at all that steam.','source_text'=>'Tengok kepulan asap wap air tu.','order'=>496],
            ['start_time'=>1079.12,'end_time'=>1080.82,'target_text'=>'It was good.','source_text'=>'Sedap sangat.','order'=>497],
            ['start_time'=>1080.92,'end_time'=>1084.22,'target_text'=>'Should I get an authentic Supreme t-shirt?','source_text'=>'Patut ke saya beli baju t-shirt Supreme original ni?','order'=>498],
            ['start_time'=>1084.32,'end_time'=>1084.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>499],
            ['start_time'=>1084.84,'end_time'=>1086.62,'target_text'=>'>> How much you think they\'ll let that go for?','source_text'=>'>> Berapa agak-agak harga dorang nak lepas?','order'=>500],
            ['start_time'=>1086.72,'end_time'=>1087.98,'target_text'=>'>> $10,000.','source_text'=>'>> 10,000 won.','order'=>501],
            ['start_time'=>1088.08,'end_time'=>1088.5,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s it?','source_text'=>'>> Itu je?','order'=>502],
            ['start_time'=>1088.6,'end_time'=>1089.22,'target_text'=>'That\'s kind of a good deal.','source_text'=>'Murah juga tawaran macam tu.','order'=>503],
            ['start_time'=>1089.32,'end_time'=>1091.26,'target_text'=>'What about the combo with the sweatpants?','source_text'=>'Kalau set kombo sekali dengan seluar sweatpants macam mana?','order'=>504],
            ['start_time'=>1091.36,'end_time'=>1092.58,'target_text'=>'>> $5,000 each.','source_text'=>'>> 5,000 won setiap satu.','order'=>505],
            ['start_time'=>1092.68,'end_time'=>1093.08,'target_text'=>'>> Each?','source_text'=>'>> Setiap satu?','order'=>506],
            ['start_time'=>1093.16,'end_time'=>1093.56,'target_text'=>'>> Yep.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>507],
            ['start_time'=>1093.56,'end_time'=>1094.94,'target_text'=>'>> Minimum, I\'d give them 20.','source_text'=>'>> Paling kurang saya sanggup bayar 20 ribu won.','order'=>508],
            ['start_time'=>1095.04,'end_time'=>1095.4,'target_text'=>'>> Me.','source_text'=>'>> Saya pun.','order'=>509],
            ['start_time'=>1095.4,'end_time'=>1097.14,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ll give them 20, they give me that.','source_text'=>'>> Saya bayar 20 ribu won, dorang bagi set baju tu.','order'=>510],
            ['start_time'=>1097.24,'end_time'=>1098.66,'target_text'=>'I think that\'s a good deal.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa itu harga yang berbaloi.','order'=>511],
            ['start_time'=>1098.76,'end_time'=>1098.92,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>512],
            ['start_time'=>1098.92,'end_time'=>1102.26,'target_text'=>'>> But yeah, now it\'s kind of like closing time at Namdaemun Market here.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi ya, sekarang waktu pasar mula tutup kat Pasar Namdaemun ni.','order'=>513],
            ['start_time'=>1102.36,'end_time'=>1104.38,'target_text'=>'Not every stall is open, and it\'s not as busy.','source_text'=>'Bukan semua gerai buka dan suasananya tak berapa sibuk.','order'=>514],
            ['start_time'=>1104.48,'end_time'=>1106.62,'target_text'=>'I\'m pretty sure during the day it was a lot busier.','source_text'=>'Saya pasti waktu siang tadi pasar ni jauh lebih sesak.','order'=>515],
            ['start_time'=>1106.72,'end_time'=>1108.66,'target_text'=>'>> The only stuff that\'s really open is the food stuff.','source_text'=>'>> Gerai yang masih berniaga cuma gerai-gerai makanan.','order'=>516],
            ['start_time'=>1108.76,'end_time'=>1114.98,'target_text'=>'>> I was reading on Reddit that someone said that this place wasn\'t busy anymore for like street food market.','source_text'=>'>> Saya ada baca kat Reddit orang kata tempat ni dah tak berapa rancak untuk pasar makanan jalanan.','order'=>517],
            ['start_time'=>1115.08,'end_time'=>1115.78,'target_text'=>'>> Yo.','source_text'=>'>> Weh.','order'=>518],
            ['start_time'=>1115.88,'end_time'=>1116.82,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, dude, twisted donuts.','source_text'=>'>> Ada donat pintal (kkwabaegi).','order'=>519],
            ['start_time'=>1116.92,'end_time'=>1121.02,'target_text'=>'>> No, when I was here 2 years ago, this place wasn\'t covered cuz I remember eating at this exact spot.','source_text'=>'>> Masa saya kat sini dua tahun lepas tempat ni tak berbumbung sebab saya ingat makan tepat kat tempat ni.','order'=>520],
            ['start_time'=>1121.12,'end_time'=>1122.38,'target_text'=>'>> No, this is new.','source_text'=>'>> Tempat ni dah diubah suai baru.','order'=>521],
            ['start_time'=>1122.48,'end_time'=>1122.68,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>522],
            ['start_time'=>1122.68,'end_time'=>1123.86,'target_text'=>'>> 2 years ago it wasn\'t here.','source_text'=>'>> Dua tahun lepas belum ada struktur macam ni.','order'=>523],
            ['start_time'=>1123.96,'end_time'=>1125.66,'target_text'=>'>> This actually all does kind of look new.','source_text'=>'>> Semua binaan ni memang nampak serba baru.','order'=>524],
            ['start_time'=>1125.76,'end_time'=>1127.22,'target_text'=>'They They\'re selling the same stuff.','source_text'=>'Dorang jual makanan yang sama je.','order'=>525],
            ['start_time'=>1127.32,'end_time'=>1129.06,'target_text'=>'Those like dumpling things, five for 5,000.','source_text'=>'Dumpling mandu tu, lima ketul harga 5,000 won.','order'=>526],
            ['start_time'=>1129.16,'end_time'=>1130.18,'target_text'=>'Dude, those were cheaper.','source_text'=>'Kedai ni lagi murah.','order'=>527],
            ['start_time'=>1130.28,'end_time'=>1131.54,'target_text'=>'Those were 1,000 won cheaper.','source_text'=>'1,000 won lebih murah daripada kedai tadi.','order'=>528],
            ['start_time'=>1131.64,'end_time'=>1132.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>529],
            ['start_time'=>1132.32,'end_time'=>1133.82,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I think they got you, dog.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya kau dah kena ketuk harga tadi bro.','order'=>530],
            ['start_time'=>1133.92,'end_time'=>1136.1,'target_text'=>'They steamed it and then they charged you 1,000 more.','source_text'=>'Dorang kukus mandu tu lepas tu caj kau 1,000 won lebih mahal.','order'=>531],
            ['start_time'=>1136.2,'end_time'=>1136.78,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, yeah, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Betul juga tu.','order'=>532],
            ['start_time'=>1136.88,'end_time'=>1137.86,'target_text'=>'It was the marketing, dude.','source_text'=>'Itu semua teknik pemasaran je.','order'=>533],
            ['start_time'=>1137.96,'end_time'=>1139.34,'target_text'=>'I just saw a huge line of people.','source_text'=>'Saya tengok orang beratur panjang tadi.','order'=>534],
            ['start_time'=>1139.44,'end_time'=>1140.34,'target_text'=>'I\'m like, I need to buy it.','source_text'=>'Saya pun rasa macam kena beli juga.','order'=>535],
            ['start_time'=>1140.44,'end_time'=>1141.1,'target_text'=>'I bought it.','source_text'=>'Saya pun pergilah beli.','order'=>536],
            ['start_time'=>1141.2,'end_time'=>1141.98,'target_text'=>'It was okay.','source_text'=>'Rasanya bolehlah tahan.','order'=>537],
            ['start_time'=>1142.08,'end_time'=>1143.86,'target_text'=>'>> I remember >> Oh, that\'s a jokbal, I think.','source_text'=>'>> Saya ingat >> Oh, itu jokbal (kaki khinzir rebus).','order'=>538],
            ['start_time'=>1143.96,'end_time'=>1144.46,'target_text'=>'Pig\'s feet.','source_text'=>'Kaki khinzir.','order'=>539],
            ['start_time'=>1144.56,'end_time'=>1145.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>540],
            ['start_time'=>1145.12,'end_time'=>1145.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they they got me.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, dorang memang dah ketuk harga saya.','order'=>541],
            ['start_time'=>1146,'end_time'=>1146.74,'target_text'=>'Oh, glasses store.','source_text'=>'Oh, kedai cermin mata.','order'=>542],
            ['start_time'=>1146.84,'end_time'=>1148.3,'target_text'=>'I do need to buy some glasses.','source_text'=>'Saya memang kena beli cermin mata baru.','order'=>543],
            ['start_time'=>1148.4,'end_time'=>1154.46,'target_text'=>'I kind of want to know how much it is to put uh lenses in glasses cuz I\'m going to need to put lenses in glasses once I buy','source_text'=>'Saya teringin nak tahu berapa kos pasang kanta cermin mata sebab saya kena masukkan kanta lepas beli','order'=>544],
            ['start_time'=>1154.56,'end_time'=>1155.66,'target_text'=>'the frames.','source_text'=>'bingkai ni nanti.','order'=>545],
            ['start_time'=>1155.76,'end_time'=>1156.86,'target_text'=>'You got a hat store here.','source_text'=>'Ada kedai topi kat sini.','order'=>546],
            ['start_time'=>1156.96,'end_time'=>1158.18,'target_text'=>'Oh, these are made in Korea.','source_text'=>'Oh, topi ni buatan Korea.','order'=>547],
            ['start_time'=>1158.28,'end_time'=>1160.02,'target_text'=>'You said you wanted to buy a hat, eh?','source_text'=>'Kau kata tadi nak beli topi, kan?','order'=>548],
            ['start_time'=>1160.12,'end_time'=>1162.34,'target_text'=>'>> No, I don\'t really wear hats anymore.','source_text'=>'>> Taklah, saya dah jarang pakai topi sekarang.','order'=>549],
            ['start_time'=>1162.44,'end_time'=>1164.7,'target_text'=>'>> What about the the Ajumma vest?','source_text'=>'>> Macam mana dengan jaket vest makcik Ajumma tu?','order'=>550],
            ['start_time'=>1164.8,'end_time'=>1166.7,'target_text'=>'>> Now, this is what Nandaemun is supposed to look like.','source_text'=>'>> Haa macam nilah rupa Pasar Namdaemun yang sepatutnya.','order'=>551],
            ['start_time'=>1166.8,'end_time'=>1168.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, there still are some people out.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, masih ada orang berjalan-jalan.','order'=>552],
            ['start_time'=>1168.6,'end_time'=>1172.02,'target_text'=>'I wonder how it\'s going to be in the winter if it\'s going to be busy, eh?','source_text'=>'Agak-agak macam mana keadaannya waktu musim sejuk nanti, masih sibuk ke?','order'=>553],
            ['start_time'=>1172.12,'end_time'=>1174.02,'target_text'=>'>> Uh >> Because it\'s going to get cold.','source_text'=>'>> Sebab cuaca akan jadi sangat sejuk.','order'=>554],
            ['start_time'=>1174.12,'end_time'=>1177.34,'target_text'=>'Actually, right here, this right here is where I bought my suitcase.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya kat sinilah tempat saya beli beg bagasi saya dulu.','order'=>555],
            ['start_time'=>1177.44,'end_time'=>1177.76,'target_text'=>'>> lady?','source_text'=>'>> Makcik tu ke?','order'=>556],
            ['start_time'=>1177.76,'end_time'=>1178.22,'target_text'=>'>> Right here.','source_text'=>'>> Tepat kat sini.','order'=>557],
            ['start_time'=>1178.32,'end_time'=>1180.42,'target_text'=>'No, it was a guy that was working there when I bought it.','source_text'=>'Bukan, masa saya beli dulu ada seorang lelaki yang jaga kedai ni.','order'=>558],
            ['start_time'=>1180.52,'end_time'=>1181.82,'target_text'=>'But, I\'m on my suitcase right there.','source_text'=>'Tapi beg bagasi saya ada kat situ.','order'=>559],
            ['start_time'=>1181.92,'end_time'=>1182.74,'target_text'=>'I think it was this guy.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa pakcik ni kot.','order'=>560],
            ['start_time'=>1182.84,'end_time'=>1183.24,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Oh ya.','order'=>561],
            ['start_time'=>1183.32,'end_time'=>1184.06,'target_text'=>'I remember that guy.','source_text'=>'Saya ingat orang tu.','order'=>562],
            ['start_time'=>1184.16,'end_time'=>1190.46,'target_text'=>'>> I definitely bought it there, but I don\'t have that suitcase anymore because I left it I left it in Ecuador.','source_text'=>'>> Memang sah saya beli kat situ, tapi saya dah tak ada beg tu sebab saya tertinggal kat Ecuador.','order'=>563],
            ['start_time'=>1190.56,'end_time'=>1191.94,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, dude, this is Myeongdong.','source_text'=>'>> Weh, ini kawasan Myeongdong.','order'=>564],
            ['start_time'=>1192.04,'end_time'=>1192.54,'target_text'=>'>> Is it?','source_text'=>'>> Betul ke?','order'=>565],
            ['start_time'=>1192.64,'end_time'=>1194.78,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, Myeongdong is just >> Is that Shinsegae?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, Myeongdong kat sebelah ni je >> Itu kompleks Shinsegae ke?','order'=>566],
            ['start_time'=>1194.88,'end_time'=>1196.66,'target_text'=>'>> Well, Myeongdong\'s like way over there.','source_text'=>'>> Myeongdong jauh sikit kat arah sana.','order'=>567],
            ['start_time'=>1196.76,'end_time'=>1199.62,'target_text'=>'>> I think this is uh Shinsegae Department Store.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa ini gedung membeli-belah Shinsegae.','order'=>568],
            ['start_time'=>1199.72,'end_time'=>1203.86,'target_text'=>'>> But, that road that goes that way up there is the main road that goes to that Lotte Department Store.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi jalan yang menuju ke atas tu jalan utama ke gedung membeli-belah Lotte.','order'=>569],
            ['start_time'=>1203.96,'end_time'=>1204.5,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, is it?','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ya ke?','order'=>570],
            ['start_time'=>1204.6,'end_time'=>1205.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it kind of curves like that.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, jalan tu macam melengkung sikit.','order'=>571],
            ['start_time'=>1205.84,'end_time'=>1207.22,'target_text'=>'I got a mental map.','source_text'=>'Saya dah ada peta dalam kepala.','order'=>572],
            ['start_time'=>1207.32,'end_time'=>1211.08,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah, Shinsegae Shinsegae building.','source_text'=>'>> Oh ya, bangunan Shinsegae.','order'=>573],
            ['start_time'=>1215.8,'end_time'=>1218.3,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re in Myeongdong walking street again.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami berada di jalan pejalan kaki Myeongdong lagi sekali.','order'=>574],
