            ['start_time'=>1326.6,'end_time'=>1334.46,'target_text'=>'The next day we started heading towards Kuala Lumpur, which is the capital of Malaysia, and it is a city I\'ve always wanted','source_text'=>'Keesokan harinya kami mula bertolak ke Kuala Lumpur, iaitu ibu negara Malaysia, dan bandar yang dah lama saya teringin','order'=>379],
