            ['start_time'=>1047.52,'end_time'=>1048.3,'target_text'=>'Very good.','source_text'=>'Sangat sedap.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>1048.4,'end_time'=>1055.58,'target_text'=>'So, overall, those spicy chips were too spicy that I had to get a Milo and the Milo was good.','source_text'=>'Jadi kesimpulannya, snek pedas tadi terlampau pedas sampai saya terpaksa beli Milo dan Milo tu sedap.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>1055.68,'end_time'=>1058.38,'target_text'=>'It just is like kind of tastes like cold hot chocolate, which is good.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia seakan-akan macam coklat panas versi sejuk, sedaplah juga.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>1058.48,'end_time'=>1059.38,'target_text'=>'I like hot chocolate.','source_text'=>'Saya suka coklat panas.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>1059.48,'end_time'=>1060.34,'target_text'=>'Milo was good.','source_text'=>'Milo tu memang sedap.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>1060.44,'end_time'=>1064.3,'target_text'=>'They were watching me when I was drinking it, so I had to say awesome.','source_text'=>'Mereka perhatikan saya masa saya tengah minum, jadi saya kenalah puji kata sedap gila.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1064.4,'end_time'=>1064.98,'target_text'=>'It\'s amazing.','source_text'=>'Ia memang hebat.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1065.08,'end_time'=>1067.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s the best drink I\'ve ever had in my entire life.','source_text'=>'Ia minuman terbaik pernah saya minum sepanjang hidup saya.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>1067.44,'end_time'=>1069.9,'target_text'=>'I had to give a good review, especially she made it.','source_text'=>'Saya kenalah bagi pujian yang baik, lebih-lebih lagi makcik tu yang buatkan.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>1070,'end_time'=>1071.18,'target_text'=>'She made it with love, I could tell.','source_text'=>'Makcik tu buat dengan penuh kasih sayang, saya dapat rasakan.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>1071.28,'end_time'=>1072.62,'target_text'=>'I had to give her give her a compliment.','source_text'=>'Saya kenalah puji dia.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>1072.72,'end_time'=>1074.22,'target_text'=>'>> give you that gringo price, though.','source_text'=>'>> tapi dia bagi kau harga pelancong asinglah.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>1074.32,'end_time'=>1075.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, 10K.','source_text'=>'>> Haah, 10 ribu rupiah.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>1075.24,'end_time'=>1076.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s like 80 cents.','source_text'=>'Lebih kurang 80 sen je.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>1076.16,'end_time'=>1077.94,'target_text'=>'But yeah, anyways, that was good.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, apa-apa pun, memang sedap.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>1078.04,'end_time'=>1080.62,'target_text'=>'That was my first time ever having Milo.','source_text'=>'Itulah kali pertama saya rasa Milo.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1080.72,'end_time'=>1081,'target_text'=>'Ever.','source_text'=>'Sepanjang hidup.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>1081,'end_time'=>1081.94,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never had Milo.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah minum Milo.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>1082.04,'end_time'=>1083.78,'target_text'=>'I had a Milo ice cream before.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah makan aiskrim Milo sebelum ni.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>1083.88,'end_time'=>1084.28,'target_text'=>'It was okay.','source_text'=>'Bolehlah tahan.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>1084.36,'end_time'=>1086.22,'target_text'=>'It was >> where Milo\'s from, though?','source_text'=>'Ia >> kau tahu ke Milo asal dari mana?','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>1086.32,'end_time'=>1086.74,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'>> Tak tahu.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>1086.84,'end_time'=>1088.02,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s from Australia.','source_text'=>'>> Dari Australia.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>1088.12,'end_time'=>1088.9,'target_text'=>'>> Australia?','source_text'=>'>> Australia?','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>1089,'end_time'=>1089.54,'target_text'=>'Really?','source_text'=>'Biar betul?','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>1089.64,'end_time'=>1092.02,'target_text'=>'Why is it so popular literally everywhere?','source_text'=>'Kenapa ia begitu popular di serata dunia?','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>1092.12,'end_time'=>1094.46,'target_text'=>'South America, Asia, everywhere.','source_text'=>'Amerika Selatan, Asia, di mana-mana saja.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>1094.56,'end_time'=>1097.5,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know what Australia\'s just over the other side of the water.','source_text'=>'>> Entahlah, mungkin sebab Australia cuma di seberang lautan sana je.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>1097.6,'end_time'=>1099.94,'target_text'=>'>> But in South America, it\'s super popular, too, though.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi kat Amerika Selatan pun ia sangat popular juga apa.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>1100.04,'end_time'=>1102.82,'target_text'=>'KFC had a Milo ice cream and that\'s the ice cream I had.','source_text'=>'KFC pernah ada aiskrim Milo dan itulah aiskrim yang saya makan.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>1102.92,'end_time'=>1104.58,'target_text'=>'That\'s why I\'m like, why is it so popular?','source_text'=>'Sebab tu saya tertanya-tanya, kenapa ia begitu popular?','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>1104.68,'end_time'=>1105.9,'target_text'=>'That was in Ecuador.','source_text'=>'Itu masa kat Ecuador dulu.','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>1106,'end_time'=>1110.98,'target_text'=>'Anyway, guys, let me know how long you want these comprehensible input vlogs.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, kawan-kawan, beritahu saya berapa panjang durasi vlog input mudah faham yang korang mahukan.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>1111.08,'end_time'=>1115.9,'target_text'=>'Do you want it around 12 to 15 minutes or 15 to 18 minutes?','source_text'=>'Korang nak sekitar 12 hingga 15 minit atau 15 hingga 18 minit?','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>1116,'end_time'=>1118.06,'target_text'=>'Those are the kind of the two times I\'m in between.','source_text'=>'Itu dua pilihan masa yang saya tengah pertimbangkan.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>1118.16,'end_time'=>1119.06,'target_text'=>'What do you prefer?','source_text'=>'Mana satu pilihan korang?','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>1119.16,'end_time'=>1125.58,'target_text'=>'Also, with these comprehensible input vlogs, do you want it to have a topic like how to speak politely in English or how to','source_text'=>'Selain itu, untuk vlog input mudah faham ini, adakah anda mahu topik khusus seperti cara bertutur secara sopan dalam bahasa Inggeris atau cara','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>1125.68,'end_time'=>1132.34,'target_text'=>'introduce yourself or how to talk in the past tense or present tense or future tense or do you want it to just be like a vlog','source_text'=>'memperkenalkan diri atau cara bercakap tentang masa lampau, kini, atau masa depan, atau adakah anda mahu ia sekadar vlog santai','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>1132.44,'end_time'=>1135.58,'target_text'=>'where I talk about everything I see with no specific topic?','source_text'=>'di mana saya ceritakan tentang apa saja yang saya nampak tanpa topik khusus?','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>1135.68,'end_time'=>1136.54,'target_text'=>'Let me know in the comments.','source_text'=>'Beri tahu saya di ruangan komen.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>1136.64,'end_time'=>1138.02,'target_text'=>'I\'ll see you guys next video.','source_text'=>'Kita jumpa lagi dalam video seterusnya.','order'=>442],
