            ['start_time'=>787.36,'end_time'=>795.94,'target_text'=>'You\'ll get an exclusive ChatGPT prompt that allows you to master the pronunciation of any word, plus a clear practice structure,','source_text'=>'Anda akan dapat prompt ChatGPT eksklusif yang membolehkan anda kuasai sebutan mana-mana perkataan, berserta struktur latihan yang jelas,','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>796.04,'end_time'=>802.18,'target_text'=>'so you always know exactly how to study, what to focus on, and how to make real progress.','source_text'=>'supaya anda sentiasa tahu cara belajar, apa yang perlu difokuskan, dan bagaimana mencapai kemajuan sebenar.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>802.28,'end_time'=>811.18,'target_text'=>'Inside, we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking, So, you can stop hesitating, sound more natural, and','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya, kita latih sebutan, aksen, ritma, dan pertuturan semula jadi, supaya anda tak lagi teragak-agak, bercakap lebih semula jadi, dan','order'=>180],
