            ['start_time'=>860.16,'end_time'=>863.22,'target_text'=>'Sounds like someone who\'s really addicted to playing video games.','source_text'=>'Kedengaran macam seseorang yang betul-betul ketagih main permainan video.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>863.32,'end_time'=>868.5,'target_text'=>'I remember at one point in my life when I was young, young, like 15, I used to be addicted to games.','source_text'=>'Saya teringat satu masa dalam hidup saya waktu saya masih muda remaja dulu, masa umur 15 tahun, saya pun pernah ketagih main game.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>868.6,'end_time'=>870.1,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I wouldn\'t really want to do anything else.','source_text'=>'Masa tu saya memang tak ada hati nak buat benda lain.','order'=>197],
