            ['start_time'=>60.36,'end_time'=>63.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so these are zip ties and they are used to like tighten things up.','source_text'=>'>> Haah, ini pengikat kabel dan ia digunakan untuk mengetatkan sesuatu.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>63.76,'end_time'=>70.26,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ve never been somewhere where they use zip ties to close the bags, but in this country, Indonesia, they do.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah pergi ke mana-mana tempat yang guna pengikat kabel untuk ikat beg plastik, tapi di negara Indonesia ni, mereka buat macam tu.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>70.36,'end_time'=>71.82,'target_text'=>'Or maybe it\'s just in Jakarta.','source_text'=>'Atau mungkin kat Jakarta je kot.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>71.92,'end_time'=>72.94,'target_text'=>'You guys can let me know.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh beritahu saya.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>73.04,'end_time'=>76.62,'target_text'=>'So, here, I think we should start with that, I guess.','source_text'=>'Jadi kat sini, saya rasa elok kita mulakan dengan yang tu dulu.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>76.72,'end_time'=>77.42,'target_text'=>'Most famous.','source_text'=>'Paling terkenal.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>77.52,'end_time'=>78.66,'target_text'=>'>> most well known.','source_text'=>'>> paling tersohor.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>78.76,'end_time'=>86.66,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s in a paper bag, but inside of this paper bag is a banana leaf and they wrap it up there just to keep it warm and','source_text'=>'Ia dibungkus dalam beg kertas, tapi dalam beg kertas ni ada daun pisang dan mereka balut kemas untuk kekalkan kepanasan serta','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>86.76,'end_time'=>87.16,'target_text'=>'nice.','source_text'=>'kesedapannya.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>87.24,'end_time'=>88.98,'target_text'=>'>> Ooh, look at that.','source_text'=>'>> Ooh, tengok tu.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>89.08,'end_time'=>89.98,'target_text'=>'>> There we go.','source_text'=>'>> Haa, cantiknya.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>90.08,'end_time'=>97.66,'target_text'=>'>> Get my 3,000 most common English words PDF and learn the words that will help you understand up to 95%','source_text'=>'>> Dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling kerap digunakan saya dan pelajari perkataan yang akan bantu anda faham hingga 95%','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>97.76,'end_time'=>99.7,'target_text'=>'of everyday English.','source_text'=>'bahasa Inggeris harian.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>99.8,'end_time'=>110.1,'target_text'=>'It includes real definitions, real example sentences for every meaning, and everything is organized by CEFR level and topic.','source_text'=>'Ia merangkumi definisi sebenar, contoh ayat untuk setiap makna, dan semuanya disusun mengikut tahap CEFR dan topik.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>110.2,'end_time'=>112.18,'target_text'=>'Click the link in the description to get it.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruang keterangan untuk dapatkannya.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>112.28,'end_time'=>112.94,'target_text'=>'Look at that.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah tu.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>113.04,'end_time'=>116.1,'target_text'=>'This >> is satay.','source_text'=>'Ini >> ialah sate.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>116.2,'end_time'=>117.1,'target_text'=>'>> Chicken satay.','source_text'=>'>> Sate ayam.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>117.2,'end_time'=>118.82,'target_text'=>'>> Chicken satay peanut sauce.','source_text'=>'>> Sate ayam bersama kuah kacang.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>118.92,'end_time'=>121.9,'target_text'=>'So, there is chicken here on this skewer.','source_text'=>'Ada daging ayam yang dicucuk pada lidi pencucuk ni.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>122,'end_time'=>127.54,'target_text'=>'This skewer is just a very thin piece of wood that is used to hold the meat.','source_text'=>'Lidi pencucuk ni hanyalah sebatang kayu nipis yang digunakan untuk mencucuk daging.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>127.64,'end_time'=>128.38,'target_text'=>'Skewer.','source_text'=>'Pencucuk sate.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>128.48,'end_time'=>131.46,'target_text'=>'Okay, so let\'s try the satay first.','source_text'=>'Okey, jom kita cuba sate ni dulu.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>131.56,'end_time'=>132.98,'target_text'=>'>> There\'s different proteins you can get.','source_text'=>'>> Ada pelbagai pilihan daging yang korang boleh pilih.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>133.08,'end_time'=>133.86,'target_text'=>'>> What?','source_text'=>'>> Apa dia?','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>133.96,'end_time'=>140.1,'target_text'=>'>> And the most popular one, which we have here, is chicken, but you could also get beef and goat.','source_text'=>'>> Dan yang paling popular, macam yang ada depan kita ni, ialah ayam, tapi korang juga boleh dapatkan daging lembu dan kambing.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>140.2,'end_time'=>142.18,'target_text'=>'Some places you could even get lamb.','source_text'=>'Sesetengah tempat ada juga sediakan daging kambing biri-biri.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>142.28,'end_time'=>146.98,'target_text'=>'So, you\'re not going to find pork in Indonesia or maybe in Bali.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang memang susah nak jumpa daging babi di Indonesia, kecuali mungkin di Bali.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>147.08,'end_time'=>154.9,'target_text'=>'They\'re actually Hindu in Bali, so they eat pork as well, but I prefer chicken and beef over pork anyway, so this is always','source_text'=>'Majoriti penduduk di Bali beragama Hindu, jadi mereka makan daging babi juga, tapi saya memang lebih suka ayam dan daging lembu, jadi sate ni memang sentiasa','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>155,'end_time'=>155.42,'target_text'=>'delicious.','source_text'=>'sedap.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>155.52,'end_time'=>162.42,'target_text'=>'The peanut sauce, you can get satay in other parts of the world, but the peanut sauce they have in Indonesia is the best one.','source_text'=>'Pasal kuah kacang pula, korang boleh jumpa sate di tempat lain di dunia, tapi kuah kacang di Indonesia memang yang paling padu.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>162.52,'end_time'=>166.74,'target_text'=>'>> You can see that the stick here is burned and it broke here.','source_text'=>'>> Korang boleh nampak lidi kat sini dah hangus dan patah kat bahagian ni.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>166.84,'end_time'=>170.26,'target_text'=>'So, when I was eating it, it broke.','source_text'=>'Masa saya tengah makan tadi, lidi tu patah.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>170.36,'end_time'=>172.22,'target_text'=>'>> Here we have the a rice cake.','source_text'=>'>> Kat sini kita ada lontong atau nasi impit.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>172.32,'end_time'=>174.1,'target_text'=>'They call this coconut rice cake.','source_text'=>'Mereka panggil ini lontong kelapa.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>174.2,'end_time'=>177.42,'target_text'=>'They basically put it into a bamboo tube.','source_text'=>'Pada asasnya mereka masukkan ke dalam kelongsong buluh.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>177.52,'end_time'=>178.58,'target_text'=>'They stuff it in there.','source_text'=>'Mereka padatkan beras kat dalam tu.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>178.68,'end_time'=>182.82,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if they blend the rice up first or not cuz it does look like it.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu sama ada mereka kisar beras tu dulu ke tak sebab rupa dia macam tu.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>182.92,'end_time'=>188.66,'target_text'=>'And then they cook it with a little bit of coconut milk and they serve it like that, like a tube of rice, but here they cut','source_text'=>'Lepas tu mereka masak dengan sedikit santan dan hidangkan macam tu, berbentuk silinder panjang, tapi kat sini mereka dah potong','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>188.76,'end_time'=>191.34,'target_text'=>'it into little pieces for us.','source_text'=>'kecil-kecil untuk kami.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>191.44,'end_time'=>193.42,'target_text'=>'I think they give us a cracker or two.','source_text'=>'Rasanya mereka bagi sekeping dua keropok sekali.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>193.52,'end_time'=>194.86,'target_text'=>'This is like a combo.','source_text'=>'Ini macam set kombo.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>194.96,'end_time'=>199.82,'target_text'=>'>> I thought the rice cake would be chewy since when you say rice cake, I think about the Korean rice cakes.','source_text'=>'>> Aku ingatkan lontong ni liat dan kenyal sebab bila sebut rice cake, aku teringat tteokbokki Korea.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>199.92,'end_time'=>204.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, but it\'s more just like the exact texture of like regular rice, but in a different form.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tapi tekstur dia sebenarnya sebiji macam nasi biasa cuma dalam bentuk yang berbeza.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>204.6,'end_time'=>207.86,'target_text'=>'>> Kind of just tastes like a potato, like the texture of a potato.','source_text'=>'>> Rasa dia macam kentang sikit, tekstur dia rasa macam ubi kentang.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>207.96,'end_time'=>208.9,'target_text'=>'>> Exactly.','source_text'=>'>> Tepat sekali.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>209,'end_time'=>212.62,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m going to break this in half.','source_text'=>'>> Saya nak patahkan ni jadi dua.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>212.72,'end_time'=>215.1,'target_text'=>'I just broke this in half.','source_text'=>'Saya baru je patahkan dua.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>215.2,'end_time'=>221.46,'target_text'=>'>> And the way they cook satay, which makes it so delicious, is they marinate it in like a sweeter marinade.','source_text'=>'>> Dan cara mereka masak sate ni yang buat ia begitu sedap ialah mereka perap dalam bahan perapan yang manis.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>221.56,'end_time'=>225.22,'target_text'=>'And then when they cook it, they cook it really hot and fast.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu masa bakar, mereka bakar atas api yang sangat panas dan cepat.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>225.32,'end_time'=>227.26,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s why they have the smaller pieces here.','source_text'=>'Sebab tu kepingan dagingnya dipotong kecil-kecil macam ni.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>227.36,'end_time'=>230.3,'target_text'=>'And by cooking it that way, it stays juicy inside.','source_text'=>'Dengan cara memasak macam tu, bahagian dalamnya kekal berjus.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>230.4,'end_time'=>231.74,'target_text'=>'It doesn\'t dry out at all.','source_text'=>'Dagingnya langsung tak kering.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>231.84,'end_time'=>232.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Betul.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>232.44,'end_time'=>233.98,'target_text'=>'So, now we have the sauce here.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita ada kuahnya kat sini.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>234.08,'end_time'=>242.14,'target_text'=>'I\'m taking my stick with my chicken on the end and I\'m just dipping it in the sauce and turning it to get it filled with sauce.','source_text'=>'Saya ambil lidi berserta ayam dan celupkannya ke dalam kuah sambil pusing-pusingkan supaya kuahnya menyaluti serata.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>242.24,'end_time'=>243.3,'target_text'=>'>> You\'re coating it, right?','source_text'=>'>> Kau tengah lumurkan kuah dia kan?','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>243.4,'end_time'=>248.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'m coating my chicken in the peanut sauce.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya tengah lumurkan ayam saya dengan kuah kacang.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>248.4,'end_time'=>254.02,'target_text'=>'Now my chicken is coated, so I\'m going to take a bite and I\'m going to try to get all the chicken in one bite.','source_text'=>'Sekarang ayam saya dah bersalut kuah, jadi saya nak gigit dan cuba makan semua isi ayam dalam satu suapan.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>254.12,'end_time'=>260.82,'target_text'=>'And you will see in a second here, I\'m going to bite and then turn the stick so that the chicken comes off easier.','source_text'=>'Dan korang akan nampak sekejap lagi, saya akan gigit dan pusingkan lidi tu supaya ayamnya mudah tertanggal.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>260.92,'end_time'=>263.12,'target_text'=>'Let\'s do that.','source_text'=>'Jom kita buat macam tu.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>263.8,'end_time'=>265.6,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>270.36,'end_time'=>272.9,'target_text'=>'>> There\'s a lot of satay restaurants online.','source_text'=>'>> Ada banyak kedai sate dalam talian.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>273,'end_time'=>274.74,'target_text'=>'So, you have to just pick whichever one.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang kena pilih je mana-mana satu.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>274.84,'end_time'=>276.98,'target_text'=>'Keep trying them until you find one you really like.','source_text'=>'Terus mencuba sampai korang jumpa satu yang korang betul-betul suka.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>277.08,'end_time'=>283.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I usually just choose whatever one has the highest rating and it always turns out good.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya biasanya cuma pilih kedai yang dapat penilaian tertinggi dan hasilnya memang sentiasa sedap.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>283.12,'end_time'=>286.9,'target_text'=>'This next dish is served in a plastic container.','source_text'=>'Hidangan seterusnya dihidangkan dalam bekas plastik.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>287,'end_time'=>289.46,'target_text'=>'The lid, you can see, is see-through.','source_text'=>'Penutupnya korang boleh nampak lut sinar.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>289.56,'end_time'=>293.58,'target_text'=>'You can see through the lid and it is also taped.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak tembus penutup tu dan ia juga dilekatkan dengan pita pelekat.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>293.68,'end_time'=>296.86,'target_text'=>'Here, you can see that there is tape holding down the lid.','source_text'=>'Kat sini korang boleh nampak ada pita pelekat yang memegang penutup tu.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>296.96,'end_time'=>301.1,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m going to take the tape off or peel the tape off.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya akan tanggalkan pita pelekat ni.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>301.2,'end_time'=>305.08,'target_text'=>'And now I\'m going to take off the lid.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang saya akan buka penutupnya.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>305.72,'end_time'=>309.9,'target_text'=>'So, as I said, guys, the lid is see-through and it\'s just a plastic lid.','source_text'=>'Macam yang saya kata tadi kawan-kawan, penutupnya lut sinar dan ia cuma penutup plastik biasa.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>310,'end_time'=>317.78,'target_text'=>'And inside here we have chili and they also have a lemon or a lime, sorry, that they cut in half, but this lime is very small.','source_text'=>'Dan kat dalam ni ada cili dan mereka juga sertakan limau nipis yang dibelah dua, tapi limau ni kecil sangat saiznya.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>317.88,'end_time'=>321.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I think it\'s called calamansi.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, aku rasa tu limau kasturi.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>321.4,'end_time'=>325.06,'target_text'=>'>> And it also came with rice rice, so we have rice here.','source_text'=>'>> Dan ia juga disertakan dengan nasi putih, jadi kita ada nasi kat sini.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>325.16,'end_time'=>326.06,'target_text'=>'What else?','source_text'=>'Apa lagi ada?','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>326.16,'end_time'=>328.42,'target_text'=>'These look to be like chips.','source_text'=>'Yang ni nampak macam kerepek.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>328.52,'end_time'=>329.7,'target_text'=>'Some sort of chips.','source_text'=>'Sejenis keropok atau emping.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>329.8,'end_time'=>332.14,'target_text'=>'And in here, I guess is the main dish.','source_text'=>'Dan dalam bekas ni, saya rasa hidangan utamanya.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>332.24,'end_time'=>337.7,'target_text'=>'The soup is inside a plastic bag, which is inside this black plastic container.','source_text'=>'Kuantiti sup berada di dalam beg plastik, yang dimasukkan ke dalam bekas plastik hitam ini.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>337.8,'end_time'=>346.34,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster and really understand the English from this video, get the workbook on my website, bookaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Jika anda ingin belajar lebih cepat dan benar-benar memahami bahasa Inggeris daripada video ini, dapatkan buku latihan di laman web saya, vocaenglish.com.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>346.44,'end_time'=>355.06,'target_text'=>'It goes into greater detail than the lesson and includes exercises to help you practice vocabulary, grammar, tenses, sentence','source_text'=>'Ia menerangkan lebih terperinci berbanding pelajaran video dan mengandungi latihan untuk bantu anda mengasah kosa kata, tatabahasa, bentuk masa,','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>355.16,'end_time'=>357.34,'target_text'=>'structure, and comprehension.','source_text'=>'struktur ayat, dan kefahaman.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>357.44,'end_time'=>363.3,'target_text'=>'I also have workbooks for past videos, so you can keep learning and reviewing anytime you want.','source_text'=>'Saya juga ada buku latihan untuk video lepas supaya anda boleh terus belajar dan mengulang kaji pada bila-bila masa.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>363.4,'end_time'=>365.26,'target_text'=>'Get the workbooks in my description.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku latihan di ruang keterangan saya.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>365.36,'end_time'=>366.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>366.2,'end_time'=>368.7,'target_text'=>'So, this one\'s called soto betawi.','source_text'=>'Jadi hidangan ni dipanggil Soto Betawi.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>368.8,'end_time'=>370.78,'target_text'=>'This soup is from Jakarta.','source_text'=>'Sup ini berasal dari Jakarta.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>370.88,'end_time'=>375.86,'target_text'=>'>> And here we have our cutlery inside this plastic bag.','source_text'=>'>> Dan kat sini kita ada sudu dan garpu di dalam beg plastik ni.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>375.96,'end_time'=>378.14,'target_text'=>'So, now I will tear it open.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya akan koyakkan bungkusannya.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>378.24,'end_time'=>380.1,'target_text'=>'And inside they have a spork.','source_text'=>'Dan kat dalam ni mereka bekalkan sudu-garpu (spork).','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>380.2,'end_time'=>388.34,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never seen so many sporks in a country before, but I guess sporks are very popular here >> Actually, >> the majority','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah tengok begitu banyak spork di sesebuah negara sebelum ni, tapi nampaknya spork sangat popular kat sini >> Sebenarnya, >> majoriti','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>388.44,'end_time'=>390.26,'target_text'=>'of people eat with their hands here.','source_text'=>'orang kat sini makan pakai tangan.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>390.36,'end_time'=>390.82,'target_text'=>'>> Really?','source_text'=>'>> Ya ke?','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>390.92,'end_time'=>397.1,'target_text'=>'>> Not for a soup, obviously, but um >> So, Leon is pouring the soup into the plastic bowl.','source_text'=>'>> Bukanlah untuk makan sup, tentulah tak, tapi >> Jadi, Leon tengah tuang sup ke dalam mangkuk plastik.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>397.2,'end_time'=>400.46,'target_text'=>'And it looks like there is meat in there with some vegetables.','source_text'=>'Dan nampaknya ada ketulan daging di dalamnya bersama sayur-sayuran.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>400.56,'end_time'=>401.18,'target_text'=>'Oh, beef?','source_text'=>'Oh, daging lembu ke?','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>401.28,'end_time'=>406.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s a beef soup with coconut milk, and it\'s super popular.','source_text'=>'>> Haah, ini sup daging lembu bersantan, dan ia sangat popular.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>406.2,'end_time'=>407.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s really rich.','source_text'=>'Kuah dia memang pekat berkrim.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>407.2,'end_time'=>410.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s almost like a coconut curry soup.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia hampir macam sup kari santan.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>410.44,'end_time'=>411.98,'target_text'=>'>> This is the soup.','source_text'=>'>> Ini supnya.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>412.08,'end_time'=>414.38,'target_text'=>'It\'s still warm, and it comes with the rice.','source_text'=>'Sup ni masih panas berasap, dan ia disertakan dengan nasi.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>414.48,'end_time'=>416.62,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s slightly yellow.','source_text'=>'Warna kuahnya kekuning-kuningan sikit.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>416.72,'end_time'=>418.5,'target_text'=>'It has a slight yellow color.','source_text'=>'Ia ada sedikit warna kuning.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>418.6,'end_time'=>420.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s not brown, but let\'s try it.','source_text'=>'Warna dia bukan coklat, tapi jom kita rasa.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>420.96,'end_time'=>424.94,'target_text'=>'I can see a layer of oil on top of the soup.','source_text'=>'Saya boleh nampak ada lapisan minyak di permukaan sup ni.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>425.04,'end_time'=>425.98,'target_text'=>'You said it was coconut?','source_text'=>'Kau kata tadi ada santan?','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>426.08,'end_time'=>426.86,'target_text'=>'>> Coconut milk, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Santan kelapa, ya.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>426.96,'end_time'=>427.32,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>427.32,'end_time'=>429.58,'target_text'=>'I can taste the coconut.','source_text'=>'Saya memang boleh rasa lemak santannya.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>429.68,'end_time'=>432.34,'target_text'=>'And one thing about me is I love rice.','source_text'=>'Dan satu perkara pasal diri saya, saya memang hantu nasi.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>432.44,'end_time'=>433.18,'target_text'=>'You see rice?','source_text'=>'Kau nampak nasi ni?','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>433.28,'end_time'=>435.78,'target_text'=>'I could eat just a bowl of rice.','source_text'=>'Saya boleh makan semangkuk nasi putih macam tu je.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>435.88,'end_time'=>436.38,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>436.48,'end_time'=>437.14,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Sedap.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>437.24,'end_time'=>437.86,'target_text'=>'>> Good rice?','source_text'=>'>> Nasi sedap?','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>437.96,'end_time'=>441.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I haven\'t had just plain rice in a long time.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, dah lama sangat saya tak makan nasi putih kosong macam ni.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>441.2,'end_time'=>448.66,'target_text'=>'>> I like the regular rice like that more than the rice cake because you can add more salt to that, or you they add more salt','source_text'=>'>> Aku lebih suka nasi putih biasa macam tu berbanding lontong sebab kita boleh tambah garam, atau mereka letak garam','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>448.76,'end_time'=>450.02,'target_text'=>'to that than they do with this.','source_text'=>'lebih sikit dalam nasi tu berbanding lontong ni.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>450.12,'end_time'=>455.34,'target_text'=>'So, this just tastes like saltless rice, which if you know, you need salt with your rice, right?','source_text'=>'Jadi lontong ni rasa macam nasi tawar tanpa garam, padahal macam kita tahu, nasi kena ada sikit rasa masin baru sedap, kan?','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>455.44,'end_time'=>458.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, and this meat looks like it has a lot of cartilage, eh?','source_text'=>'>> Haah, dan daging ni nampak macam ada banyak tulang rawan atau urat, kan?','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>458.24,'end_time'=>460.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so there\'s two different versions of this.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, jadi hidangan ni ada dua versi yang berbeza.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>460.52,'end_time'=>463.06,'target_text'=>'There\'s a mixed one, and there\'s an all beef one.','source_text'=>'Ada yang campur organ dalaman, dan ada yang daging lembu sepenuhnya.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>463.16,'end_time'=>469.26,'target_text'=>'I got the all beef one, but the mixed one comes with like organ meat and liver and lungs and stuff like that as well, but','source_text'=>'Aku pesan yang daging lembu sahaja, tapi yang versi campur tu ada organ dalaman macam hati, paru dan sebagainya sekali, tapi','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>469.36,'end_time'=>470.9,'target_text'=>'we\'ll try this one first.','source_text'=>'kita cuba yang ni dulu.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>471,'end_time'=>473.36,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, let\'s try it.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita rasa.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>473.88,'end_time'=>474.94,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>475.04,'end_time'=>478.78,'target_text'=>'This really reminds me of uh Thai green curry.','source_text'=>'Rasa ni betul-betul mengingatkan saya pada kari hijau Thai.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>478.88,'end_time'=>482.18,'target_text'=>'Except this one is just like more of like a soup than a curry.','source_text'=>'Cuma yang ni lebih kepada sup cair berbanding kari pekat.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>482.28,'end_time'=>482.82,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>482.92,'end_time'=>484.98,'target_text'=>'It\'s got some tomato in here as well.','source_text'=>'Ada hirisan tomato juga dalam sup ni.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>485.08,'end_time'=>486.22,'target_text'=>'>> But it\'s very similar.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi memang sangat serupa rasanya.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>486.32,'end_time'=>492.86,'target_text'=>'They both have like that strong coconut flavor as a base, and they\'re kind of like I guess like yellowish green the color.','source_text'=>'Dua-dua ada rasa lemak santan yang kuat sebagai asas, dan warna kuahnya agak kekuningan kehijauan.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>492.96,'end_time'=>494.78,'target_text'=>'They both have the same color.','source_text'=>'Warna kedua-duanya lebih kurang sama.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>494.88,'end_time'=>495.58,'target_text'=>'>> Wow, that\'s good.','source_text'=>'>> Wah, sedapnya.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>495.68,'end_time'=>497.66,'target_text'=>'Got a lot of flavor in it.','source_text'=>'Cukup rasa dan kaya dengan rempah.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>497.76,'end_time'=>498.04,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I know.','source_text'=>'>> Haah, aku tahu.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>498.04,'end_time'=>499.66,'target_text'=>'It actually is quite good.','source_text'=>'Memang sedap sebenarnya.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>499.76,'end_time'=>505.14,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try uh whatever these are inside this plastic bag.','source_text'=>'Jom kita cuba apa benda yang ada dalam beg plastik ni pula.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>505.24,'end_time'=>506.34,'target_text'=>'Okay, so you guys see that?','source_text'=>'Okey, korang nampak tak benda ni?','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>506.44,'end_time'=>508.98,'target_text'=>'It looks like a chip, but I\'m pretty sure this is not a potato.','source_text'=>'Rupa dia macam kerepek, tapi saya cukup yakin ini bukan kerepek kentang.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>509.08,'end_time'=>510.34,'target_text'=>'>> it\'s a prawn cracker.','source_text'=>'>> itu keropok udang.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>510.44,'end_time'=>512.02,'target_text'=>'>> It looks very good.','source_text'=>'>> Nampak sedap sangat.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>512.12,'end_time'=>514.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s uh not very colorful.','source_text'=>'Warnanya taklah begitu terang.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>514.52,'end_time'=>519.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a beige color, little bit like a slight yellow, slight orange.','source_text'=>'Warna dia macam kuning langsat krim, ada sikit warna kuning dan jingga lembut.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>519.8,'end_time'=>520.74,'target_text'=>'And you can hear it.','source_text'=>'Dan korang boleh dengar bunyinya.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>520.84,'end_time'=>521.54,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s try it.','source_text'=>'Sekarang jom kita cuba rasa.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>521.64,'end_time'=>525.52,'target_text'=>'I imagine it\'s going to crack when I bite it.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ia akan berkerupuk rangup bila saya gigit.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>530.48,'end_time'=>531.14,'target_text'=>'Try that.','source_text'=>'Rasa yang tu.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>531.24,'end_time'=>531.98,'target_text'=>'Try that.','source_text'=>'Cuba rasa.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>532.08,'end_time'=>532.94,'target_text'=>'>> Ooh.','source_text'=>'>> Ooh.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>533.04,'end_time'=>533.54,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>533.64,'end_time'=>534.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s water.','source_text'=>'Tawar macam air.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>534.84,'end_time'=>535.46,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>535.56,'end_time'=>537.62,'target_text'=>'The aftertaste is really weird.','source_text'=>'Rasa hujung dia pelik sangat.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>537.72,'end_time'=>538.74,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s fishy.','source_text'=>'>> Rasa hanyir ikan.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>538.84,'end_time'=>540.3,'target_text'=>'>> No, it\'s like bitter.','source_text'=>'>> Tak, rasa dia pahit.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>540.4,'end_time'=>541.94,'target_text'=>'It\'s like really bitter.','source_text'=>'Memang betul-betul pahit rasanya.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>542.04,'end_time'=>543.38,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s not a prawn cracker.','source_text'=>'>> Itu bukan keropok udanglah.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>543.48,'end_time'=>545.38,'target_text'=>'I\'m pretty sure it\'s rice-based.','source_text'=>'Aku yakin ia diperbuat daripada beras (atau melinjo/emping).','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>545.48,'end_time'=>546.82,'target_text'=>'Actually, it is getting kind of bitter now.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya makin lama dikunyah makin terasa pahit.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>546.92,'end_time'=>549.34,'target_text'=>'>> No, the the aftertaste is very bitter.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, rasa hujung dia memang sangat pahit.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>549.44,'end_time'=>550.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of like It\'s weird.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia macam Pelik sungguh.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>551,'end_time'=>552.46,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never had anything like that.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah rasa benda macam ni seumur hidup.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>552.56,'end_time'=>553.42,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think I like it.','source_text'=>'Rasanya saya tak berapa berkenan.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>553.52,'end_time'=>554.78,'target_text'=>'I like this though.','source_text'=>'Tapi yang sup ni saya suka.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>554.88,'end_time'=>555.58,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s a good soup.','source_text'=>'>> Sup ni memang sedap.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>555.68,'end_time'=>559.62,'target_text'=>'There\'s also another really popular soup that\'s eaten as a street food.','source_text'=>'Ada lagi satu sup yang sangat popular dimakan sebagai makanan jalanan.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>559.72,'end_time'=>563.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s called bakso, and it\'s basically like a meatball soup.','source_text'=>'Namanya bakso, dan pada dasarnya ia macam sup bebola daging.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>563.2,'end_time'=>566.3,'target_text'=>'So, there\'s noodle in it, and there\'s really delicious meatballs.','source_text'=>'Jadi ada mi di dalamnya dan ada bebola daging yang sangat sedap.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>566.4,'end_time'=>570.62,'target_text'=>'You can get large ones with filling inside of them, or small ones that are just meat.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh dapat bebola besar yang ada inti berlainan kat dalam, atau yang kecil isi daging semata-mata.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>570.72,'end_time'=>577.7,'target_text'=>'And they\'re mixed with a I think it\'s baking powder or baking soda that makes them really bouncy and chewy and addictive.','source_text'=>'Dan mereka campurkan dengan serbuk penaik yang buat bebola tu sangat kenyal, membal dan buat ketagih makan.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>577.8,'end_time'=>580.26,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s a really delicious soup as well.','source_text'=>'Jadi itu pun sup yang sangat sedap juga.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>580.36,'end_time'=>583.94,'target_text'=>'But, we tried this one instead because it\'s uniquely from Jakarta.','source_text'=>'Tapi kami pilih untuk cuba yang ni sebab ia hidangan unik istimewa dari Jakarta.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>584.04,'end_time'=>585.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yummy in my tummy.','source_text'=>'>> Sedap masuk ke perut.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>585.56,'end_time'=>587.06,'target_text'=>'That soup is busting.','source_text'=>'Sup tu memang sedap gila.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>587.16,'end_time'=>590.58,'target_text'=>'>> And I think they do like their soups a lot here in Indonesia.','source_text'=>'>> Dan saya rasa orang di Indonesia ni memang suka sangat makan hidangan berkuah sup.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>590.68,'end_time'=>593.9,'target_text'=>'I\'ve seen a lot of soup options as Indonesian food.','source_text'=>'Saya nampak banyak sangat pilihan menu sup dalam masakan Indonesia.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>594,'end_time'=>598.22,'target_text'=>'>> Now, let\'s try our last item of today, the dessert.','source_text'=>'>> Sekarang, jom kita cuba hidangan terakhir hari ini, iaitu pencuci mulut.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>598.32,'end_time'=>603.54,'target_text'=>'It is in a bright red bag, and you can see through the bag.','source_text'=>'Ia dibungkus dalam beg merah terang, dan korang boleh nampak bayang makanannya dari luar.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>603.64,'end_time'=>605.86,'target_text'=>'It has some weight to it.','source_text'=>'Boleh tahan berat juga bungkusannya.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>605.96,'end_time'=>606.7,'target_text'=>'It is heavy.','source_text'=>'Ia memang berat.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>606.8,'end_time'=>612.54,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to tear this bag open now because the zip tie is very tight, so','source_text'=>'Saya nak koyakkan beg plastik ni sekarang sebab pengikat kabelnya terlalu ketat, jadi','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>612.64,'end_time'=>614.5,'target_text'=>'it cannot slide off.','source_text'=>'ia tak boleh ditolak keluar.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>614.6,'end_time'=>618.52,'target_text'=>'>> So, the name of this dessert is called martabak.','source_text'=>'>> Nama pencuci mulut ni dipanggil martabak manis (terang bulan).','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>619.04,'end_time'=>619.94,'target_text'=>'>> Martabak.','source_text'=>'>> Martabak.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>620.04,'end_time'=>621.9,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s a it\'s an Arabic name.','source_text'=>'>> Ia berasal daripada perkataan Arab (mutabbaq).','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>622,'end_time'=>622.98,'target_text'=>'>> This is the dessert.','source_text'=>'>> Inilah pencuci mulutnya.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>623.08,'end_time'=>623.48,'target_text'=>'>> Ooh.','source_text'=>'>> Ooh.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>623.52,'end_time'=>627.22,'target_text'=>'>> You can get them sweet and savory, but we got a sweet one cuz this is our dessert.','source_text'=>'>> Korang boleh dapat versi manis atau savori berlauk, tapi kami beli yang manis sebab ini pencuci mulut kami.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>627.32,'end_time'=>628.34,'target_text'=>'>> This is huge, man.','source_text'=>'>> Besar gila benda ni bro.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>628.44,'end_time'=>629.98,'target_text'=>'Look Look at this.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah ni.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>630.08,'end_time'=>633.7,'target_text'=>'>> And I think this is one of the better desserts in Southeast Asia.','source_text'=>'>> Dan aku rasa ini antara pencuci mulut terbaik di Asia Tenggara.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>633.8,'end_time'=>634.82,'target_text'=>'>> This is massive.','source_text'=>'>> Saiz dia memang raksasa.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>634.92,'end_time'=>636.26,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s like >> What is this?','source_text'=>'>> Benda apa ni sebenarnya?','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>636.36,'end_time'=>642.74,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s called a pancake, but what they do is they cook it just from the bottom, so the top side doesn\'t get cooked.','source_text'=>'>> Orang panggil lempeng tebal (pancake), tapi cara mereka buat ialah masak dari bahagian bawah sahaja supaya bahagian atasnya kekal gebu dan lembut.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>642.84,'end_time'=>644.22,'target_text'=>'Then they put the filling on there.','source_text'=>'Kemudian mereka letakkan inti di atasnya.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>644.32,'end_time'=>650.46,'target_text'=>'In this case, we got peanut butter and chocolate, and they flip it over like half of pizza, and then they deliver it like','source_text'=>'Untuk yang ni, kami pilih inti kacang dan coklat, lepas tu mereka lipat dua macam separuh piza, dan mereka bungkus','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>650.56,'end_time'=>655.18,'target_text'=>'that, so the bottom and the top is a crust, and the inside\'s nice and moist.','source_text'=>'macam tu, jadi bahagian bawah dan atas ada kerak garing manakala bahagian dalamnya lembut dan lembap berjus.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>655.28,'end_time'=>655.7,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>655.8,'end_time'=>662.5,'target_text'=>'I\'ve already rolled up this sleeve, and I\'m going to roll up my right or sorry, my left sleeve as well, and I\'m going to grab','source_text'=>'Saya dah singsing lengan baju ni, dan saya akan singsing lengan sebelah kiri saya juga, lepas tu saya nak ambil','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>662.6,'end_time'=>663.9,'target_text'=>'Let me grab a middle piece.','source_text'=>'Biar saya ambil bahagian tengah.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>664,'end_time'=>665.34,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m going to grab a corner piece.','source_text'=>'>> Aku nak ambil bahagian bucu tepi.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>665.44,'end_time'=>668.06,'target_text'=>'Wow, so there\'s like a lot of sauce in there.','source_text'=>'Wah, ada banyak gila inti mencurah kat dalam tu.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>668.16,'end_time'=>669.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s wet, like >> Wow, yeah.','source_text'=>'Memang basah berminyak dan lekit >> Wah, betul.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>669.68,'end_time'=>673.46,'target_text'=>'My hands are going to be very sticky, but it looks looks amazing.','source_text'=>'Tangan saya mesti akan melekit nanti, tapi rupa dia nampak sedap gila.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>673.56,'end_time'=>674.02,'target_text'=>'>> so good.','source_text'=>'>> nampak menyelerakan.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>674.12,'end_time'=>676.2,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s try it.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita rasa.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>678.76,'end_time'=>680.9,'target_text'=>'>> Oh my god, that\'s so good.','source_text'=>'>> Ya ampun, sedap gila.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>681,'end_time'=>684.14,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a I don\'t think the dough is 100% flour.','source_text'=>'Adunan tepung dia saya rasa bukan tepung gandum semata-mata.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>684.24,'end_time'=>686.26,'target_text'=>'Like dough has some chew to it, so it\'s really good.','source_text'=>'Tepung dia ada rasa kenyal lembut bila dikunyah, memang sangat sedap.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>686.36,'end_time'=>690.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s super sweet, but I don\'t know I think this oil is just the oil they used to fry it.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia sangat manis, tapi minyak ni saya rasa minyak mentega atau marjerin yang digunakan masa menggoreng.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>690.36,'end_time'=>692.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s It\'s just a really oily dish.','source_text'=>'Hidangan ni memang agak berminyak.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>692.12,'end_time'=>693.9,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think it\'s a sauce they added on top.','source_text'=>'Bukan minyak sos tambahan yang diletak kat atas.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>694,'end_time'=>695.46,'target_text'=>'We can definitely taste the chocolate.','source_text'=>'Kita memang dapat rasa kemanisan coklatnya.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>695.56,'end_time'=>699.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s a really sweet from chocolate and little bit of peanuts.','source_text'=>'Manis daripada coklat berserta kerangupan kacang tanah.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>699.2,'end_time'=>701.62,'target_text'=>'I think they just use peanuts instead of peanut butter.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa mereka guna kacang tanah tumbuk, bukannya mentega kacang.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>701.72,'end_time'=>704.16,'target_text'=>'Oh, wow, this is good.','source_text'=>'Wah, sedap betul.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>705.28,'end_time'=>707.46,'target_text'=>'>> Is that the best pancake you\'ve ever had, right?','source_text'=>'>> Itu lempeng manis (martabak) paling sedap kau pernah rasa, kan?','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>707.56,'end_time'=>709.02,'target_text'=>'I\'m going non-verbal.','source_text'=>'Saya sampai tak terkata apa dah.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>709.12,'end_time'=>709.78,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s so good.','source_text'=>'>> Sedap sangat.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>709.88,'end_time'=>713.02,'target_text'=>'I think this is one of my favorite desserts in Southeast Asia.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ini antara pencuci mulut kegemaran saya di Asia Tenggara.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>713.12,'end_time'=>715.54,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think Southeast Asia does desserts that good.','source_text'=>'Pada saya biasanya pencuci mulut di Asia Tenggara biasa-biasa je.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>715.64,'end_time'=>720.46,'target_text'=>'They use a lot of fruit and milk and stuff, but this right here is definitely top-tier.','source_text'=>'Mereka banyak guna buah-buahan dan susu, tapi yang ni memang taraf kayangan (top-tier).','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>720.56,'end_time'=>722.3,'target_text'=>'Give me 10 more of these right now.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya 10 keping lagi sekarang juga.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>722.4,'end_time'=>726.1,'target_text'=>'And I\'m pretty sure Indonesia is one of the countries where this is the most popular.','source_text'=>'Dan saya yakin Indonesia ialah antara negara tempat makanan ni paling tersohor.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>726.2,'end_time'=>732.66,'target_text'=>'I\'m sure you can probably find it in other places, but if you want to try the original one, then you got to come to Indonesia','source_text'=>'Saya pasti korang boleh jumpa di tempat lain juga, tapi kalau nak rasa yang asli, korang kena datang ke Indonesia','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>732.76,'end_time'=>733.7,'target_text'=>'and have it here.','source_text'=>'dan nikmatinya di sini.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>733.8,'end_time'=>734.46,'target_text'=>'Take a look at that.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah tu.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>734.56,'end_time'=>735.94,'target_text'=>'Like this is a heavy bite.','source_text'=>'Satu suapan ni pun dah rasa berat dan padat.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>736.04,'end_time'=>740.94,'target_text'=>'This has got to be like 2-300 g in this in my hand right here.','source_text'=>'Sekeping kat tangan saya ni mesti ada dalam 200 hingga 300 gram beratnya.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>741.04,'end_time'=>742.54,'target_text'=>'Filled to the brim.','source_text'=>'Intinya melimpah-ruah sampai ke tepi.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>742.64,'end_time'=>746.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, shout-out to all Indonesians in the chat, bro.','source_text'=>'>> Salam buat semua penonton dari Indonesia di ruangan komen.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>746.36,'end_time'=>748.46,'target_text'=>'Let me know if you\'re from Indonesia in the comments.','source_text'=>'Beri tahu saya di ruangan komen kalau korang berasal dari Indonesia.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>748.56,'end_time'=>750.42,'target_text'=>'Let me know if you\'ve had this, bro.','source_text'=>'Beri tahu saya kalau korang pernah makan benda ni.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>750.52,'end_time'=>751.14,'target_text'=>'Ooh.','source_text'=>'Ooh.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>751.24,'end_time'=>752.46,'target_text'=>'Oh, my gosh.','source_text'=>'Ya ampun.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>752.56,'end_time'=>754.34,'target_text'=>'This is insanely good.','source_text'=>'Sedap gila benda ni.','order'=>257],
