            ['start_time'=>49.56,'end_time'=>55.42,'target_text'=>'Read, listen, shadow, and let\'s train your brain how to think in English naturally.','source_text'=>'Baca, dengar, buat shadowing, dan mari kita latih otak anda berfikir dalam bahasa Inggeris secara semula jadi.','order'=>9],
            ['start_time'=>55.52,'end_time'=>63.26,'target_text'=>'And if you want to get the 3,000 most common English words to help you understand up to 95% of spoken English, then get it','source_text'=>'Dan jika anda ingin mendapatkan 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling kerap digunakan untuk bantu faham hingga 95% perbualan harian, dapatkannya','order'=>10],
            ['start_time'=>63.36,'end_time'=>64.5,'target_text'=>'in the description.','source_text'=>'di ruang keterangan.','order'=>11],
            ['start_time'=>64.6,'end_time'=>65.58,'target_text'=>'Let\'s get started.','source_text'=>'Jom kita mulakan.','order'=>12],
            ['start_time'=>65.68,'end_time'=>71.06,'target_text'=>'Am I the a-hole for choosing my wife over my mom?','source_text'=>'Adakah aku yang bersalah sebab lebihkan isteri aku berbanding ibu aku?','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>71.16,'end_time'=>76.86,'target_text'=>'I, 32 male, have been married to my wife, 33 female, for 5 years.','source_text'=>'Saya, lelaki berumur 32 tahun, telah berkahwin dengan isteri saya, wanita berumur 33 tahun, selama 5 tahun.','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>76.96,'end_time'=>79.46,'target_text'=>'I lost my dad when I was 16.','source_text'=>'Ayah saya meninggal dunia semasa saya berumur 16 tahun.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>79.56,'end_time'=>80.9,'target_text'=>'I\'m an only child.','source_text'=>'Saya anak tunggal.','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>81,'end_time'=>87.14,'target_text'=>'Life was rough after he passed, but my mom is one of the strongest women I know.','source_text'=>'Hidup kami amat perit selepas pemergian ayah, tetapi ibu saya adalah antara wanita paling tabah yang pernah saya kenali.','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>87.24,'end_time'=>90.78,'target_text'=>'I was shattered and she held everything together.','source_text'=>'Jiwa saya hancur luluh dan ibulah yang menguatkan segalanya.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>90.88,'end_time'=>93.38,'target_text'=>'I love her more than anything.','source_text'=>'Saya menyayangi ibu lebih daripada segalanya.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>93.48,'end_time'=>103.18,'target_text'=>'Get my 3,000 most common English words PDF and learn the words that will help you understand up to 95% of everyday English.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling kerap digunakan saya dan pelajari perkataan yang akan bantu anda faham hingga 95% bahasa Inggeris harian.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>103.28,'end_time'=>113.54,'target_text'=>'It includes real definitions, real example sentences for every meaning, and everything is organized by CEFR level and topic.','source_text'=>'Ia mengandungi definisi sebenar, contoh ayat untuk setiap makna, dan semuanya disusun mengikut tahap CEFR dan topik.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>113.64,'end_time'=>115.74,'target_text'=>'Click the link in the description to get it.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruang keterangan untuk dapatkannya.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>115.84,'end_time'=>119.54,'target_text'=>'I met my wife in the first year of college.','source_text'=>'Saya bertemu isteri saya pada tahun pertama kolej.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>119.64,'end_time'=>121.82,'target_text'=>'We\'ve basically grown up together.','source_text'=>'Boleh dikatakan kami membesar bersama-sama.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>121.92,'end_time'=>123.86,'target_text'=>'She\'s my world.','source_text'=>'Dia adalah segala-galanya bagi saya.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>123.96,'end_time'=>127.98,'target_text'=>'Right now, the three of us live together in our apartment.','source_text'=>'Sekarang ini, kami bertiga tinggal bersama di pangsapuri kami.','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>128.08,'end_time'=>137.58,'target_text'=>'My mom is getting older and needs care, and I feel lucky that I have the two most important women in my life under one roof.','source_text'=>'Ibu saya semakin menua dan perlukan penjagaan, dan saya berasa bertuah kerana mempunyai dua wanita terpenting dalam hidup saya di bawah satu bumbung.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>137.68,'end_time'=>141.58,'target_text'=>'Both my wife and I have good careers.','source_text'=>'Saya dan isteri masing-masing mempunyai kerjaya yang baik.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>141.68,'end_time'=>146.1,'target_text'=>'We\'re ambitious and doing well, and yes, we don\'t have a child.','source_text'=>'Kami berwawasan tinggi, hidup selesa, dan ya, kami masih belum mempunyai anak.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>146.2,'end_time'=>148.3,'target_text'=>'That\'s a conscious decision.','source_text'=>'Itu adalah keputusan yang kami sepakati bersama.','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>148.4,'end_time'=>150.42,'target_text'=>'I\'m okay either way.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya, ada anak atau tidak, dua-dua saya okay.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>150.52,'end_time'=>157.98,'target_text'=>'I love kids and would love to have one someday, but my wife doesn\'t want one right now.','source_text'=>'Saya sukakan kanak-kanak dan teringin ada zuriat suatu hari nanti, tetapi isteri saya belum bersedia buat masa sekarang.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>158.08,'end_time'=>159.58,'target_text'=>'Maybe not ever.','source_text'=>'Mungkin tidak berminat langsung.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>159.68,'end_time'=>163.38,'target_text'=>'We\'ve had long conversations about it.','source_text'=>'Kami sudah berbincang panjang lebar mengenainya.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>163.48,'end_time'=>164.82,'target_text'=>'I have never forced her.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pernah memaksanya.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>164.92,'end_time'=>167.14,'target_text'=>'It\'s her body.','source_text'=>'Itu tubuh badannya.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>167.24,'end_time'=>170.38,'target_text'=>'She\'s at the peak of her career.','source_text'=>'Dia sedang berada di puncak kerjayanya.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>170.48,'end_time'=>176.9,'target_text'=>'She says she doesn\'t feel ready for motherhood and doesn\'t know if she ever will.','source_text'=>'Dia kata dia belum bersedia menjadi seorang ibu dan tidak tahu sama ada dia akan bersedia suatu hari nanti.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>177,'end_time'=>179.26,'target_text'=>'I respect that.','source_text'=>'Saya menghormati keputusannya.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>179.36,'end_time'=>183.98,'target_text'=>'The issue is my mom desperately wants a grandchild.','source_text'=>'Masalahnya, ibu saya teringin sangat menimang cucu.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>184.08,'end_time'=>188.3,'target_text'=>'For the past year, she\'s been emotionally pushing.','source_text'=>'Sepanjang setahun yang lalu, ibu sering memberi tekanan emosi.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>188.4,'end_time'=>189.66,'target_text'=>'Subtle comments.','source_text'=>'Sindiran halus.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>189.76,'end_time'=>192.3,'target_text'=>'\"You\'ll understand when you have your own.','source_text'=>'\'Nanti bila kau dah ada anak sendiri baru kau faham.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>192.4,'end_time'=>194.94,'target_text'=>'Don\'t wait too long.','source_text'=>'Jangan tunggu lama-lama sangat.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>195.04,'end_time'=>202.1,'target_text'=>'Women regret it later.\" I kept brushing it off hoping it would fade.','source_text'=>'Nanti wanita akan menyesal bila dah terlambat.\' Saya cuba buat tak endah dengan harapan ibu akan berhenti sendiri.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>202.2,'end_time'=>207.78,'target_text'=>'Two days ago, we had guests over who brought their kids.','source_text'=>'Dua hari lepas, ada tetamu datang ke rumah membawa anak-anak mereka.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>207.88,'end_time'=>215.42,'target_text'=>'After they left, my mom looked at my wife and said, \"You can\'t even give me one grandchild.','source_text'=>'Selepas tetamu pulang, ibu saya memandang isteri saya dan berkata, \'Sorang cucu pun kau tak mampu nak bagi aku.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>215.52,'end_time'=>218.42,'target_text'=>'Isn\'t that what women are meant to do?','source_text'=>'Bukankah itu tujuan seorang wanita diciptakan?','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>218.52,'end_time'=>229.34,'target_text'=>'Your biological clock is already expiring.\" My wife immediately said, \"Isn\'t it my decision whether I want to have a child?\"','source_text'=>'Waktu subur kau pun dah hampir tamat.\' Isteri saya terus membalas, \'Bukan ke itu hak saya untuk tentukan sama ada saya nak ada anak atau tak?\'','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>229.44,'end_time'=>232.42,'target_text'=>'It turned into a heated argument.','source_text'=>'Perbualan itu bertukar menjadi pertengkaran hangat.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>232.52,'end_time'=>236.22,'target_text'=>'I in and told my mom, \"Please stop forcing us.','source_text'=>'Saya masuk campur dan berkata kepada ibu saya, \'Tolonglah berhenti paksa kami.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>236.32,'end_time'=>238.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s her decision.','source_text'=>'Itu keputusan dia.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>238.12,'end_time'=>241.06,'target_text'=>'Whatever she decides is final.','source_text'=>'Apa sahaja keputusan dia adalah muktamad.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>241.16,'end_time'=>247.34,'target_text'=>'You don\'t get to talk to her like that.\" I won\'t lie, my tone was harsh.','source_text'=>'Ibu tak ada hak nak cakap macam tu pada dia.\' Saya akui, nada suara saya agak kasar.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>247.44,'end_time'=>251.9,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never raised my voice at my mom before.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah meninggikan suara pada ibu saya sebelum ini.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>252,'end_time'=>252.94,'target_text'=>'Ever.','source_text'=>'Langsung tak pernah.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>253.04,'end_time'=>257.18,'target_text'=>'I\'ve always been respectful, but this time I snapped.','source_text'=>'Saya sentiasa menghormati ibu, tetapi kali ini saya hilang sabar.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>257.28,'end_time'=>265.42,'target_text'=>'I\'ve been ignoring these comments for a year, and hearing her question my wife\'s worth as a woman just broke something inside','source_text'=>'Saya dah setahun pekakkan telinga dengan sindiran itu, dan mendengar ibu mempersoalkan maruah isteri saya sebagai seorang wanita benar-benar melukakan hati','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>265.52,'end_time'=>265.94,'target_text'=>'me.','source_text'=>'saya.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>266.04,'end_time'=>270.58,'target_text'=>'Now, my mom hasn\'t spoken to me in 2 days.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, ibu dah 2 hari tak bercakap dengan saya.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>270.68,'end_time'=>272.78,'target_text'=>'The house feels tense.','source_text'=>'Suasana rumah terasa sangat tegang.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>272.88,'end_time'=>279.58,'target_text'=>'I feel guilty for shouting at the woman who sacrificed everything for me.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa serba salah kerana menengking wanita yang telah mengorbankan segalanya untuk saya.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>279.68,'end_time'=>285.86,'target_text'=>'But, I also feel like if I hadn\'t stepped in, I would have failed my wife.','source_text'=>'Tetapi, saya juga rasa jika saya tidak masuk campur mempertahankan isteri, saya gagal sebagai seorang suami.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>285.96,'end_time'=>292.02,'target_text'=>'My mom hasn\'t been eating well, and mentioned she wants to move out.','source_text'=>'Ibu saya hilang selera makan, dan menyatakan hasrat untuk berpindah keluar.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>292.12,'end_time'=>297.94,'target_text'=>'Am I the a-hole for losing my temper and shouting at my old mom like this?','source_text'=>'Adakah aku yang bersalah kerana hilang sabar dan menengking ibu tua aku begini?','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>298.04,'end_time'=>299.14,'target_text'=>'Uh yes.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>299.24,'end_time'=>300.02,'target_text'=>'I would say yes.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ya.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>300.12,'end_time'=>306.06,'target_text'=>'I would say anything like shouting, being mean, raising your voice to your mom, it doesn\'t matter the situation, you\'re a','source_text'=>'Saya berpendapat apa-apa tindakan seperti menengking, bersikap biadab, meninggikan suara kepada ibu, walau apa pun situasinya, anda seorang','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>306.16,'end_time'=>309.74,'target_text'=>'grown-up, you shouldn\'t like let your emotions take over.','source_text'=>'dewasa, anda tidak sepatutnya membiarkan emosi menguasai diri.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>309.84,'end_time'=>315.14,'target_text'=>'You can be frustrated and upset, but you don\'t need to yell at someone else, especially your mom.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh rasa kecewa dan marah, tetapi tak perlulah menjerit pada orang lain, terutamanya ibu sendiri.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>315.24,'end_time'=>320.06,'target_text'=>'I would say for that you are in the wrong, but you\'re not in the wrong for defending your wife.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa dari segi itu anda memang silap, tetapi anda tidak salah dalam mempertahankan isteri anda.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>320.16,'end_time'=>326.02,'target_text'=>'body, her choice, so she can choose what she wants to do, but the part you are in the wrong for is shouting and losing your','source_text'=>'Tubuh badan dia, pilihan dia, jadi dia berhak memilih, tetapi bahagian yang anda silap ialah menengking dan hilang','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>326.12,'end_time'=>326.54,'target_text'=>'temper.','source_text'=>'kawalan emosi.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>326.64,'end_time'=>328.5,'target_text'=>'You are in the wrong for that.','source_text'=>'Anda memang salah dalam hal itu.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>328.6,'end_time'=>333.3,'target_text'=>'I want you guys to take out your phone and give me a summary of what you just read.','source_text'=>'Saya mahu anda semua keluarkan telefon dan berikan rumusan tentang apa yang baru dibaca.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>333.4,'end_time'=>340.18,'target_text'=>'Try to summarize it in one to two sentences, and record yourself so you can watch this video back in a couple months to see','source_text'=>'Cuba rumuskan dalam satu atau dua ayat, dan rakam diri anda supaya anda boleh tonton semula beberapa bulan lagi untuk lihat','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>340.28,'end_time'=>342.58,'target_text'=>'how much progress you have made.','source_text'=>'sejauh mana kemajuan yang telah anda capai.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>342.68,'end_time'=>344.06,'target_text'=>'Next story.','source_text'=>'Cerita seterusnya.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>344.16,'end_time'=>350.26,'target_text'=>'Am I the a-hole for not doing my fiance\'s laundry after he snapped at me.','source_text'=>'Adakah aku yang jahat sebab tak basuh baju tunang aku lepas dia tengking aku?','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>350.36,'end_time'=>358.18,'target_text'=>'I, 33 female, stopped doing my fiance\'s, 33 male, laundry after he snapped at me.','source_text'=>'Saya, wanita berumur 33 tahun, berhenti membasuh baju tunang saya, lelaki berumur 33 tahun, selepas dia menengking saya.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>358.28,'end_time'=>367.38,'target_text'=>'This was 3 years ago, but this morning he was grumbling about how he doesn\'t have any clean clothes, per usual, every week','source_text'=>'Peristiwa ini berlaku 3 tahun lepas, tetapi pagi tadi dia merungut seperti biasa setiap minggu tentang dia tak ada baju bersih','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>367.48,'end_time'=>373.22,'target_text'=>'and it starts to make me feel bad until I remember why I stopped doing it.','source_text'=>'dan ia mula membuatkan saya rasa bersalah sehinggalah saya teringat sebab mengapa saya berhenti basuh bajunya.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>373.32,'end_time'=>381.86,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster and really understand the English from this video, get the workbook on my website, vocaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Jika anda ingin belajar lebih cepat dan benar-benar memahami bahasa Inggeris daripada video ini, dapatkan buku latihan di laman web saya, vocaenglish.com.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>381.96,'end_time'=>390.54,'target_text'=>'It goes into greater detail than the lesson and includes exercises to help you practice vocabulary, grammar, tenses, sentence','source_text'=>'Ia menerangkan lebih terperinci berbanding video dan merangkumi latihan untuk bantu anda berlatih kosa kata, tatabahasa, bentuk masa,','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>390.64,'end_time'=>392.82,'target_text'=>'structure, and comprehension.','source_text'=>'struktur ayat, dan kefahaman.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>392.92,'end_time'=>398.78,'target_text'=>'I also have workbooks for past videos, so you can keep learning and reviewing anytime you want.','source_text'=>'Saya juga ada buku latihan untuk video lepas supaya anda boleh terus belajar dan mengulang kaji pada bila-bila masa.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>398.88,'end_time'=>400.74,'target_text'=>'Get the workbooks in my description.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku latihan di ruang keterangan saya.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>400.84,'end_time'=>405.5,'target_text'=>'To set the scene, 3 years ago I was heavily pregnant with our son.','source_text'=>'Untuk gambarkan keadaannya, 3 tahun lepas saya sarat mengandung anak lelaki kami.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>405.6,'end_time'=>411.78,'target_text'=>'I was put on light duty, not bed rest, due to his heart rate fluctuating.','source_text'=>'Doktor nasihatkan saya buat kerja ringan sahaja, bukan rehat terlentang, disebabkan degupan jantung bayi tidak stabil.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>411.88,'end_time'=>421.22,'target_text'=>'I was seeing a doctor weekly and even had a nurse coming to the house once a week to keep an eye on things.','source_text'=>'Saya buat pemeriksaan doktor setiap minggu dan ada jururawat datang ke rumah seminggu sekali untuk memantau keadaan.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>421.32,'end_time'=>431.98,'target_text'=>'When our son was born, his cord was wrapped around his neck twice, which the doctor quickly unwrapped and thankfully he has','source_text'=>'Semasa anak kami dilahirkan, tali pusatnya terbelit di leher dua kali, tetapi doktor berjaya membukanya dengan pantas dan bersyukur dia','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>432.08,'end_time'=>434.38,'target_text'=>'no issues because of it.','source_text'=>'tiada sebarang komplikasi kerananya.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>434.48,'end_time'=>442.58,'target_text'=>'The only problem after birth was the white of his eyes were completely bloodshot red from the cord being wrapped.','source_text'=>'Satu-satunya masalah selepas lahir ialah bahagian putih matanya kemerahan akibat terbelit tali pusat itu.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>442.68,'end_time'=>445.9,'target_text'=>'He is now perfect and healthy in every way.','source_text'=>'Kini dia membesar dengan sempurna dan sihat walafiat.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>446,'end_time'=>451.3,'target_text'=>'3 years ago we didn\'t know why this was happening, so I was put on light duty.','source_text'=>'3 tahun lepas kami tidak tahu mengapa masalah degupan jantung itu berlaku, jadi saya dinasihatkan membuat kerja-kerja ringan sahaja.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>451.4,'end_time'=>459.9,'target_text'=>'This particular day, same exact day every week, I collected my fiance\'s laundry because why can\'t he use the basket designated','source_text'=>'Pada hari kejadian, hari yang sama setiap minggu, saya kumpulkan pakaian kotor tunang saya sebab entah kenapa dia malas guna bakul khas','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>460,'end_time'=>466.78,'target_text'=>'for his dirty clothes and carried them to the stairs since our washer and dryer is in the basement.','source_text'=>'yang disediakan untuk baju kotornya dan membawanya ke tangga memandangkan mesin basuh dan pengering kami berada di ruang bawah tanah.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>466.88,'end_time'=>475.58,'target_text'=>'Two baskets of his dirty clothes sat for 3 days by the stairs as I reminded him multiple times a day to carry his laundry','source_text'=>'Dua bakul pakaian kotornya terbiar selama 3 hari di tepi tangga sedang saya berkali-kali mengingatkannya setiap hari supaya tolong bawa pakaian itu','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>475.68,'end_time'=>476.18,'target_text'=>'down.','source_text'=>'turun ke bawah.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>476.28,'end_time'=>482.7,'target_text'=>'Heavily pregnant, light duty, and stairs do not mix well.','source_text'=>'Sarat mengandung, nasihat kerja ringan, dan turun naik tangga memang langsung tidak serasi.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>482.8,'end_time'=>490.02,'target_text'=>'On the third day of his laundry sitting by the stairs, stairs are in my kitchen by the way and right by our back door which','source_text'=>'Pada hari ketiga pakaiannya terbiar di tepi tangga, untuk pengetahuan tangga itu berada di dapur betul-betul di sebelah pintu belakang yang','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>490.12,'end_time'=>492.5,'target_text'=>'we use often, so very much in the way.','source_text'=>'kerap kami gunakan, jadi ia memang sangat menghalang laluan.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>492.6,'end_time'=>500.74,'target_text'=>'I got a bit frustrated and in a more nagging tone complained about how he needs to carry his laundry downstairs so I can wash','source_text'=>'Saya rasa rimas dan mula berleter menyuruhnya bawa pakaian itu turun supaya saya boleh basuhkan','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>500.84,'end_time'=>501.86,'target_text'=>'it for him.','source_text'=>'untuk dia.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>501.96,'end_time'=>503.02,'target_text'=>'He snapped at me.','source_text'=>'Dia menengking saya.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>503.12,'end_time'=>505.58,'target_text'=>'He told me, \"It\'s my laundry.','source_text'=>'Dia kata, \'Itu baju aku.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>505.68,'end_time'=>511.94,'target_text'=>'I\'ll carry it down when I feel like it.\" with more expletives and I left for work.','source_text'=>'Bila aku rasa nak bawa turun barulah aku bawa!\' beserta kata-kata kesat sebelum dia pergi kerja.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>512.04,'end_time'=>515.38,'target_text'=>'So I carried his dirty clothes back to the room.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya angkat semula semua pakaian kotornya masuk ke bilik.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>515.48,'end_time'=>521.26,'target_text'=>'A few days later he asked me to wash some of his clothes because he had no clean clothes left.','source_text'=>'Beberapa hari kemudian dia meminta saya basuhkan pakaiannya kerana dia sudah kehabisan baju bersih.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>521.36,'end_time'=>524.62,'target_text'=>'I told him no because I\'ll do it when I feel like it.','source_text'=>'Saya jawab tak nak sebab \'bila aku rasa nak basuh barulah aku basuh\'.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>524.72,'end_time'=>532.74,'target_text'=>'To this day our dryer pieced out on us so I\'ve had to take the household clothes, two kids clothes, and my clothes to my mother\'s','source_text'=>'Sehingga ke hari ini mesin pengering kami rosak, jadi saya terpaksa membawa pakaian seisi rumah, baju dua orang anak, dan baju saya sendiri ke rumah ibu saya','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>532.84,'end_time'=>535.3,'target_text'=>'house until we can get a new dryer.','source_text'=>'sehinggalah kami dapat membeli mesin pengering yang baharu.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>535.4,'end_time'=>542.34,'target_text'=>'I told my fiance I\'ll take his shirts, socks, underwear to my mom\'s too, but he has to collect it.','source_text'=>'Saya beritahu tunang saya bahawa saya boleh bawakan baju, stoking, dan seluar dalamnya ke rumah ibu saya juga, tetapi dia kena kumpulkan sendiri.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>542.44,'end_time'=>546.66,'target_text'=>'Like I said, why doesn\'t he use his designated basket?','source_text'=>'Macam yang saya katakan, kenapa dia tak guna bakul khas dia sendiri?','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>546.76,'end_time'=>549.18,'target_text'=>'And I put it in my car the night before.','source_text'=>'Dan masukkan ke dalam kereta saya pada malam sebelumnya.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>549.28,'end_time'=>551.54,'target_text'=>'I only do laundry on Mondays.','source_text'=>'Saya hanya basuh baju pada hari Isnin.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>551.64,'end_time'=>552.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s been over a year.','source_text'=>'Dah lebih setahun berlalu.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>552.92,'end_time'=>553.9,'target_text'=>'He won\'t do it.','source_text'=>'Dia tetap enggan buat.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>554,'end_time'=>557.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s like Monday laundry day sneaks up on him or something.','source_text'=>'Seolah-olah hari membasuh baju hari Isnin itu datang secara mengejut setiap minggu.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>557.84,'end_time'=>563.54,'target_text'=>'Either way, I refuse to collect, carry, wash, dry, fold, return, put away everything.','source_text'=>'Walau apa pun, saya enggan kutip, angkat, basuh, keringkan, lipat, bawa balik, dan susun segalanya untuk dia.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>563.64,'end_time'=>568.86,'target_text'=>'If he can\'t even collect it and carry it to my car, then that\'s his problem.','source_text'=>'Kalau nak kumpul dan bawa masuk dalam kereta saya pun dia tak boleh buat, itu masalah dia.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>568.96,'end_time'=>574.86,'target_text'=>'So, am I the hole for not doing my fiance\'s laundry anymore after he snapped at me?','source_text'=>'Jadi, adakah saya yang jahat kerana tidak lagi membasuh pakaian tunang saya selepas dia menengking saya?','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>574.96,'end_time'=>577.94,'target_text'=>'Oh, I feel like uh feel like a year is a long time.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa setahun itu tempoh yang agak lama.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>578.04,'end_time'=>579.5,'target_text'=>'You have made it clear what you want.','source_text'=>'Awak dah nyatakan dengan jelas apa yang awak mahukan.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>579.6,'end_time'=>584.9,'target_text'=>'You want him to take his laundry, put it in a basket, and then put it in the back of your car, and then you\'ll wash it, and','source_text'=>'Awak cuma nak dia ambil pakaian kotornya, letak dalam bakul, dan letak di belakang kereta awak supaya awak boleh basuhkan, tetapi','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>585,'end_time'=>586.54,'target_text'=>'he can\'t seem to do that.','source_text'=>'dia langsung tak boleh nak buat benda semudah itu.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>586.64,'end_time'=>589.9,'target_text'=>'Maybe like he\'s super super busy and doesn\'t have time.','source_text'=>'Mungkin dia tersangatlah sibuk sampai tak ada masa langsung.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>590,'end_time'=>592.22,'target_text'=>'If that\'s the case, then yeah, I guess you\'re the a-hole.','source_text'=>'Kalau betul macam tu keadaannya, barulah awak yang bersalah.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>592.32,'end_time'=>598.26,'target_text'=>'But if that\'s not the case, and he has time to do it, but he just literally doesn\'t do it, then it\'s not your fault.','source_text'=>'Tetapi jika bukan itu keadaannya, dan dia sebenarnya ada masa tetapi sengaja malas nak buat, maka itu bukan salah awak.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>598.36,'end_time'=>602.46,'target_text'=>'You just want him to put it in the laundry basket, which is super super normal.','source_text'=>'Awak cuma minta dia letak pakaian dalam bakul baju kotor, suatu perkara yang sangat normal.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>602.56,'end_time'=>605.3,'target_text'=>'Like why would you throw your clothes around everywhere anyways?','source_text'=>'Lagipun buat apa nak campak baju merata-rata tempat?','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>605.4,'end_time'=>609.1,'target_text'=>'You just want him to put in the laundry basket and then bring it to your car the night before Monday.','source_text'=>'Awak cuma nak dia masukkan ke dalam bakul dan angkat ke kereta awak pada malam sebelum hari Isnin.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>609.2,'end_time'=>613.02,'target_text'=>'Like it\'s not a lot to ask for, so I don\'t think you\'re the a-hole in this situation.','source_text'=>'Permintaan itu bukan perkara yang membebankan pun, jadi saya rasa awak tak bersalah dalam situasi ini.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>613.12,'end_time'=>618.82,'target_text'=>'However, if your husband is super super busy, he works just constantly and doesn\'t have time, then yeah, you\'re the a-hole.','source_text'=>'Namun, sekiranya suami awak terlalu sibuk, bekerja tanpa henti dan tiada masa, barulah awak bersalah.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>618.92,'end_time'=>625.22,'target_text'=>'Also, if you\'re pregnant, then no, you\'re definitely not the a-hole, but you said this is a year after, so I assume you\'re','source_text'=>'Tambahan pula semasa mengandung dulu, awak memang sah tak bersalah, tetapi awak kata hal ni dah setahun berlalu jadi saya anggap awak','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>625.32,'end_time'=>626.82,'target_text'=>'not pregnant anymore.','source_text'=>'sudah tidak mengandung lagi.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>626.92,'end_time'=>627.62,'target_text'=>'Next story.','source_text'=>'Cerita seterusnya.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>627.72,'end_time'=>635.02,'target_text'=>'Am I overreacting for feeling jealous after my boyfriend called someone else the woman of my dreams.','source_text'=>'Adakah aku terlebih emosi sebab cemburu lepas teman lelaki aku panggil wanita lain sebagai \'wanita idaman kalbu\'?','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>635.12,'end_time'=>636.18,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to say no, bro.','source_text'=>'Bagi aku jawapannya taklah, bro.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>636.28,'end_time'=>637.18,'target_text'=>'That\'s crazy.','source_text'=>'Gila apa.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>637.28,'end_time'=>638.3,'target_text'=>'Why would he say that?','source_text'=>'Kenapa dia tergamak cakap macam tu?','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>638.4,'end_time'=>642.46,'target_text'=>'So, my boyfriend and I, 23, have been together for a year.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya dan teman lelaki saya, masing-masing 23 tahun, dah bercinta selama setahun.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>642.56,'end_time'=>643.94,'target_text'=>'Everything has been great.','source_text'=>'Semuanya berjalan dengan sangat lancar.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>644.04,'end_time'=>646.26,'target_text'=>'We barely have any arguments.','source_text'=>'Kami jarang sangat bertengkar.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>646.36,'end_time'=>650.1,'target_text'=>'We enjoy our time together, and I feel like he supports me.','source_text'=>'Kami gembira luangkan masa bersama, dan saya rasa dia sangat menyokong saya.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>650.2,'end_time'=>652.22,'target_text'=>'Everything was perfect.','source_text'=>'Segala-galanya sempurna.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>652.32,'end_time'=>659.5,'target_text'=>'But 2 days ago, we were walking, and a woman around the same age came to us screaming excited.','source_text'=>'Tapi 2 hari lepas, masa kami tengah berjalan-jalan, ada seorang perempuan sebaya kami datang menjerit teruja ke arah kami.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>659.6,'end_time'=>662.66,'target_text'=>'He looked at her and started screaming as well.','source_text'=>'Teman lelaki saya pandang dia dan turut menjerit teruja sama.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>662.76,'end_time'=>663.98,'target_text'=>'Red flag.','source_text'=>'Tanda bahaya (red flag).','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>664.08,'end_time'=>667.18,'target_text'=>'They hugged, jumped together.','source_text'=>'Mereka berpelukan dan melompat-lompat gembira bersama.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>667.28,'end_time'=>676.38,'target_text'=>'At that moment, I genuinely thought it was a great friend or maybe a family member that he had not seen in a long time, and','source_text'=>'Masa tu, saya betul-betul ingatkan perempuan tu kawan rapat lama atau saudara mara dia yang dah lama tak jumpa, dan','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>676.48,'end_time'=>678.26,'target_text'=>'I was happy for them.','source_text'=>'saya turut tumpang gembira untuk mereka.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>678.36,'end_time'=>682.42,'target_text'=>'They started chatting a little bit, and then he introduced me.','source_text'=>'Mereka mula berborak sekejap, lepas tu dia perkenalkan saya.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>682.52,'end_time'=>686.42,'target_text'=>'Not as his girlfriend, but by my name.','source_text'=>'Bukan sebagai teman wanita dia, tapi sekadar sebut nama saya je.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>686.52,'end_time'=>688.18,'target_text'=>'That\'s That\'s a little weird.','source_text'=>'Itu agak pelik.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>688.28,'end_time'=>689.22,'target_text'=>'Two red flags.','source_text'=>'Dua tanda amaran.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>689.32,'end_time'=>692.3,'target_text'=>'It was odd, but okay.','source_text'=>'Memang janggal, tapi saya biarkan dulu.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>692.4,'end_time'=>697.58,'target_text'=>'They continued catching up, really excited, and exchanged phone numbers.','source_text'=>'Mereka sambung berborak panjang dengan teruja, dan saling bertukar nombor telefon.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>697.68,'end_time'=>699.7,'target_text'=>'I was just there.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma berdiri kaku kat sebelah.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>699.8,'end_time'=>702.66,'target_text'=>'At that moment, it didn\'t feel wrong.','source_text'=>'Masa tu, saya tak rasa ada benda mencurigakan sangat.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>702.76,'end_time'=>706.14,'target_text'=>'I understood they were old friends, and that was it.','source_text'=>'Saya faham mereka kawan lama, dan setakat itu sahajalah.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>706.24,'end_time'=>711.78,'target_text'=>'But, after she left, he just kept looking at her until he couldn\'t anymore.','source_text'=>'Tapi, lepas perempuan tu beredar, dia terus pandang perempuan tu sampai bayang dia hilang dari pandangan.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>711.88,'end_time'=>720.26,'target_text'=>'Looked at me right in the eye and told me, \"You just met the one that was the woman of my dreams.\" I would break up immediately.','source_text'=>'Dia pandang tepat ke mata saya dan kata, \'Awak baru je jumpa wanita idaman kalbu saya.\' Kalau aku, aku terus minta putus on the spot.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>720.36,'end_time'=>722.34,'target_text'=>'Immediately if someone said this, bro.','source_text'=>'Serta-merta minta putus kalau ada orang cakap macam ni, bro.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>722.44,'end_time'=>723.1,'target_text'=>'We\'re done.','source_text'=>'Kita putus.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>723.2,'end_time'=>724.38,'target_text'=>'We\'re done.','source_text'=>'Tamat sampai sini.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>724.48,'end_time'=>726.3,'target_text'=>'Anyways, let\'s see what she does.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, jom kita tengok apa tindakan perempuan ni.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>726.4,'end_time'=>728.42,'target_text'=>'I was frozen.','source_text'=>'Saya kelu terpaku.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>728.52,'end_time'=>732.7,'target_text'=>'I didn\'t know what to say, so I just nodded.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu nak cakap apa, jadi saya cuma mampu mengangguk.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>732.8,'end_time'=>735.74,'target_text'=>'He didn\'t even realize I was shocked.','source_text'=>'Dia langsung tak perasan yang saya tengah terkejut beruk.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>735.84,'end_time'=>738.38,'target_text'=>'We kept going, and that was it.','source_text'=>'Kami teruskan perjalanan macam biasa, dan macam tu jelah.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>738.48,'end_time'=>743.98,'target_text'=>'But, I had been thinking about it these 2 days, and it\'s driving me crazy.','source_text'=>'Tapi, sepanjang 2 hari ni saya asyik fikirkan benda tu sampai rasa nak gila.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>744.08,'end_time'=>748.58,'target_text'=>'Especially because she looks nothing like me.','source_text'=>'Lebih-lebih lagi rupa paras perempuan tu langsung tak ada iras saya.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>748.68,'end_time'=>753.06,'target_text'=>'I don\'t feel ugly, and she is also pretty, but in a different way.','source_text'=>'Saya tak rasa diri saya hodoh, dan dia pun cantik juga, tapi gaya kecantikan kami berbeza.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>753.16,'end_time'=>755.86,'target_text'=>'My friends are sure I should dump him.','source_text'=>'Kawan-kawan saya bertegas suruh saya tinggalkan dia.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>755.96,'end_time'=>757.14,'target_text'=>'Me, too.','source_text'=>'Aku pun sama.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>757.24,'end_time'=>758.66,'target_text'=>'But, I\'m not sure.','source_text'=>'Tapi, saya berbelah bahagi.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>758.76,'end_time'=>764.02,'target_text'=>'I kind of want to have a conversation with him and try to continue the relationship.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa macam nak berbincang dengan dia dan cuba pertahankan hubungan ni.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>764.12,'end_time'=>764.7,'target_text'=>'Well, why?','source_text'=>'Kenapa pula?','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>764.8,'end_time'=>769.34,'target_text'=>'Feel like he just told you that that is the woman of his dreams, not you.','source_text'=>'Dah terang-terang dia cakap perempuan tu wanita idaman dia, bukan awak.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>769.44,'end_time'=>771.7,'target_text'=>'He literally told this to your face.','source_text'=>'Dia cakap terus depan muka awak.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>771.8,'end_time'=>772.86,'target_text'=>'That\'s just what happened.','source_text'=>'Itulah kenyataannya.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>772.96,'end_time'=>775.94,'target_text'=>'We both are 23 years old.','source_text'=>'Kami berdua berumur 23 tahun.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>776.04,'end_time'=>780.06,'target_text'=>'He told me they were together in a couple of classes in college.','source_text'=>'Dia beritahu saya yang mereka pernah sekelas untuk beberapa subjek di kolej dulu.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>780.16,'end_time'=>784.42,'target_text'=>'He quit college 2 years ago and hadn\'t seen her since then.','source_text'=>'Dia berhenti kolej 2 tahun lepas dan tak pernah jumpa perempuan tu sejak itu.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>784.52,'end_time'=>791.98,'target_text'=>'And the phone number exchange, we work in and the phone number exchange, we work in {slash} like arts, and it was more about','source_text'=>'Pasal pertukaran nombor telefon tu, bidang kerja kami berkait dengan seni, jadi ia lebih kepada urusan','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>792.08,'end_time'=>793.46,'target_text'=>'some projects.','source_text'=>'beberapa projek kerja.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>793.56,'end_time'=>801.42,'target_text'=>'She did mention she has a boyfriend and said we could all meet sometime, and he didn\'t seem upset about it.','source_text'=>'Perempuan tu ada beritahu yang dia dah ada teman lelaki dan ajak kami semua lepak sekali suatu hari nanti, dan teman lelaki saya nampak bersahaja mengenainya.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>801.52,'end_time'=>803.42,'target_text'=>'Now to the update.','source_text'=>'Kini mengenai perkembangan terbaharu.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>803.52,'end_time'=>805.98,'target_text'=>'I don\'t even know how to start.','source_text'=>'Saya sendiri tak tahu nak mula dari mana.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>806.08,'end_time'=>809.34,'target_text'=>'I went to his house yesterday around 11:00 a.m.','source_text'=>'Saya pergi ke rumah dia semalam sekitar pukul 11:00 pagi.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>809.44,'end_time'=>813.26,'target_text'=>'I prefer it that way so I don\'t have ghosts in my house.','source_text'=>'Saya lebih suka bincang di rumah dia supaya tak ada kenangan pahit menghantui rumah saya.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>813.36,'end_time'=>819.14,'target_text'=>'I went thinking there was a 50/50 chance to either break up or work on it.','source_text'=>'Saya pergi dengan anggapan ada peluang 50-50 sama ada kami akan putus atau baiki hubungan.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>819.24,'end_time'=>825.38,'target_text'=>'When I got there, he was with a male friend and the three of us were talking.','source_text'=>'Bila saya sampai, dia ada bersama seorang kawan lelaki dan kami bertiga berborak.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>825.48,'end_time'=>828.46,'target_text'=>'Then around an hour later, boyfriend got a call.','source_text'=>'Kira-kira sejam kemudian, teman lelaki saya dapat panggilan telefon.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>828.56,'end_time'=>829.66,'target_text'=>'It was her.','source_text'=>'Panggilan daripada perempuan tu.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>829.76,'end_time'=>834.3,'target_text'=>'She needed some pictures for her work and asked him if he was available.','source_text'=>'Dia perlukan beberapa keping gambar untuk kerja dan tanya sama ada teman lelaki saya ada kelapangan.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>834.4,'end_time'=>842.42,'target_text'=>'He said, \"I\'m with my girlfriend and a friend.\" Then he asked me if we could go, take the pictures, and come back.','source_text'=>'Dia jawab, \'Aku ada dengan teman wanita dan kawan aku.\' Lepas tu dia tanya saya kalau kami boleh pergi tolong ambil gambar dan balik semula.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>842.52,'end_time'=>849.82,'target_text'=>'I didn\'t tell him I needed to talk and I thought it was a good opportunity to see how they would behave now that it wasn\'t','source_text'=>'Saya tak beritahu dia yang saya nak berbincang dan saya fikir ini peluang baik untuk tengok macam mana tingkah laku mereka berdua memandangkan ini bukan lagi','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>849.92,'end_time'=>853.3,'target_text'=>'a surprise after 2 years of not seeing each other.','source_text'=>'pertemuan mengejut selepas 2 tahun tak berjumpa.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>853.4,'end_time'=>854.62,'target_text'=>'So, I said yes.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya setuju.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>854.72,'end_time'=>859.14,'target_text'=>'His friend said he had nothing else to do, so he also went.','source_text'=>'Kawannya kata dia tak ada apa-apa urusan lain, jadi dia pun ikut sekali.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>859.24,'end_time'=>863.06,'target_text'=>'We got there in an Uber, so I had no idea where it was.','source_text'=>'Kami pergi ke sana naik Uber, jadi saya langsung tak tahu lokasi tempat tu.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>863.16,'end_time'=>864.38,'target_text'=>'They were acting normal.','source_text'=>'Mereka berdua berkelakuan biasa.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>864.48,'end_time'=>870.58,'target_text'=>'She works in a private art school, gave us the tour, and mentioned they are looking for a new teacher.','source_text'=>'Perempuan tu bekerja di sebuah sekolah seni swasta, bawa kami melawat, dan sebut yang mereka sedang mencari cikgu baharu.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>870.68,'end_time'=>877.9,'target_text'=>'Boyfriend told her, \"I\'m in my last semester and they could hire me.\" She said she will mention it to the owner.','source_text'=>'Teman lelaki saya kata, \'Aku dalam semester akhir dan mereka boleh ambil aku kerja.\' Perempuan tu kata dia akan usulkan pada pemilik sekolah.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>878,'end_time'=>881.98,'target_text'=>'I had been struggling with getting a job, so I was glad about it.','source_text'=>'Dia memang tengah susah nak cari kerja, jadi saya tumpang gembira mendengarnya.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>882.08,'end_time'=>884.9,'target_text'=>'Everything went normal until the end.','source_text'=>'Semuanya berjalan lancar sehinggalah ke penghujungnya.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>885,'end_time'=>892.42,'target_text'=>'When we went outside the building, she asked him how much it was for the pictures and he said it was nothing.','source_text'=>'Bila kami keluar dari bangunan, perempuan tu tanya berapa bayaran untuk khidmat ambil gambar dan dia jawab percuma je.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>892.52,'end_time'=>897.26,'target_text'=>'Before at his house, he was talking about how he needed money.','source_text'=>'Padahal sebelum tu masa kat rumah, dia mengadu yang dia tengah terdesak perlukan duit.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>897.36,'end_time'=>901.58,'target_text'=>'She insisted and told him she wasn\'t paying, the school was.','source_text'=>'Perempuan tu berkeras nak bayar dan beritahu bukan duit dia tapi pihak sekolah yang bayar.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>901.68,'end_time'=>903.42,'target_text'=>'He still didn\'t accept.','source_text'=>'Dia tetap menolak pemberian duit tu.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>903.52,'end_time'=>909.02,'target_text'=>'His friend told him not to be stupid and at least ask for the money he used for the Uber.','source_text'=>'Kawannya tegur suruh jangan bodoh dan sekurang-kurangnya minta ganti duit tambang Uber.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>909.12,'end_time'=>916.66,'target_text'=>'She agreed, but he said, \"No, it\'s fine.\" They kept going a couple of times with the same thing until she went, \"Well then,','source_text'=>'Perempuan tu setuju, tapi dia tetap kata, \'Tak apa, tak payah.\' Mereka berbalas kata beberapa kali sampai perempuan tu kata, \'Kalau macam tu,','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>916.76,'end_time'=>922.06,'target_text'=>'let me at least invite you to dinner.\" Then he smiled and accepted.','source_text'=>'biar aku belanja kau makan malam.\' Terus dia tersenyum lebar dan bersetuju.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>922.16,'end_time'=>925.46,'target_text'=>'That was it, the sign I was looking for.','source_text'=>'Itulah dia, tanda jawapan yang selama ini saya cari.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>925.56,'end_time'=>931.58,'target_text'=>'Even his male friend looked at me and I could see in his face he was sorry for me.','source_text'=>'Malah kawan lelakinya pun memandang saya dan saya dapat lihat raut simpati di wajahnya untuk saya.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>931.68,'end_time'=>935.1,'target_text'=>'In the Uber, I went totally silent.','source_text'=>'Dalam perjalanan pulang naik Uber, saya mendiamkan diri seribu bahasa.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>935.2,'end_time'=>937.9,'target_text'=>'Thinking about how to end the relationship.','source_text'=>'Memikirkan bagaimana cara untuk menamatkan hubungan ini.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>938,'end_time'=>943.46,'target_text'=>'Then I saw a park that is not so far away from my place and asked the Uber to leave me there.','source_text'=>'Kemudian saya ternampak sebuah taman yang tak jauh dari rumah saya dan meminta pemandu Uber turunkan saya di situ.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>943.56,'end_time'=>946.02,'target_text'=>'He asked me what happened, but I didn\'t answer.','source_text'=>'Dia tanya saya kenapa, tapi saya tak jawab.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>946.12,'end_time'=>948.54,'target_text'=>'I just got out of the Uber and walked.','source_text'=>'Saya terus keluar dari Uber dan berjalan kaki.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>948.64,'end_time'=>954.78,'target_text'=>'The now ex followed me asking what was wrong and I couldn\'t ignore him anymore.','source_text'=>'Bekas kekasih saya mengekori dari belakang bertanyakan apa yang tak kena dan saya tak boleh nak buat tak peduli lagi.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>954.88,'end_time'=>956.82,'target_text'=>'I told him everything.','source_text'=>'Saya luahkan segalanya.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>956.92,'end_time'=>958.9,'target_text'=>'I\'m proud of how I told him.','source_text'=>'Saya bangga dengan cara saya bercakap dengan dia.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>959,'end_time'=>962.62,'target_text'=>'I wasn\'t yelling at him hysterically, but I was firm.','source_text'=>'Saya tak menjerit secara histeria, tapi nada saya sangat tegas.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>962.72,'end_time'=>965.62,'target_text'=>'He asked for a chance to explain himself.','source_text'=>'Dia merayu minta peluang untuk jelaskan keadaan.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>965.72,'end_time'=>973.02,'target_text'=>'I told him he would waste our time because my decision was made, but he begged, so I stayed.','source_text'=>'Saya beritahu dia cuma buang masa kerana keputusan saya dah muktamad, tapi dia merayu sungguh-sungguh jadi saya tunggu sekejap.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>973.12,'end_time'=>976.58,'target_text'=>'He said a lot of things, but here are the main points.','source_text'=>'Dia cakap macam-macam benda, tapi ini isi penting pengakuannya.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>976.68,'end_time'=>985.18,'target_text'=>'They were never a couple or something like that, but he did ask her out and she said she wasn\'t interested, so I don\'t have','source_text'=>'Mereka tak pernah bercinta pun sebelum ni, tapi dia mengaku pernah ajak perempuan tu keluar dan perempuan tu tolak, jadi saya tak perlu','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>985.28,'end_time'=>989.26,'target_text'=>'to worry about her because she doesn\'t like him.','source_text'=>'risau pasal perempuan tu sebab perempuan tu tak berminat pada dia.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>989.36,'end_time'=>997.46,'target_text'=>'He is entirely sure about it because he asked her out three times and she said no all three times.','source_text'=>'Dia betul-betul yakin sebab dia pernah ajak keluar tiga kali dan ketiga-tiga kali ditolak mentah-mentah.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>997.56,'end_time'=>1004.58,'target_text'=>'He is not looking for her anymore because she has a boyfriend, not because he loves me or because we have a future.','source_text'=>'Dia tak kejar perempuan tu lagi sebab perempuan tu dah ada kekasih, bukannya sebab dia cintakan saya atau nampak masa depan bersama.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>1004.68,'end_time'=>1008.1,'target_text'=>'He didn\'t say that, but that is what I thought in the moment.','source_text'=>'Dia tak sebut macam tu, tapi itulah yang terlintas di fikiran saya waktu tu.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>1008.2,'end_time'=>1014.78,'target_text'=>'If for any reason she changed her mind and looked for him in that way, he would say no because he is with me.','source_text'=>'Kalau atas apa-apa sebab perempuan tu ubah fikiran dan cari dia balik, dia akan tolak sebab dia ada dengan saya.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>1014.88,'end_time'=>1017.5,'target_text'=>'Again, not because he loves me.','source_text'=>'Sekali lagi, bukan sebab dia cintakan saya.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>1017.6,'end_time'=>1025.46,'target_text'=>'If you\'re serious about becoming fluent in English, I\'ve built a full speaking and pronunciation course that shows you exactly','source_text'=>'Jika anda serius ingin fasih berbahasa Inggeris, saya telah bina kursus pertuturan dan sebutan lengkap yang tunjukkan kepada anda secara tepat','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>1025.56,'end_time'=>1027.62,'target_text'=>'what to do step by step.','source_text'=>'apa yang perlu dilakukan langkah demi langkah.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>1027.72,'end_time'=>1035.66,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to 80 plus video lessons right away and I add three to five brand new lessons every week, so you can','source_text'=>'Anda dapat akses segera ke 80 lebih pelajaran video sekarang juga dan saya tambah 3 hingga 5 pelajaran baharu setiap minggu supaya anda boleh','order'=>239],
