            ['start_time'=>1038,'end_time'=>1041.42,'target_text'=>'And this is not just a course full of random videos.','source_text'=>'Dan ini bukan sekadar kursus yang dipenuhi video rambang.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>1041.52,'end_time'=>1050.1,'target_text'=>'You\'ll get an exclusive ChatGPT prompt that allows you to master the pronunciation of any word, plus a clear practice structure,','source_text'=>'Anda akan dapat prompt ChatGPT eksklusif yang membolehkan anda kuasai sebutan mana-mana perkataan, berserta struktur latihan yang jelas,','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>1050.2,'end_time'=>1056.34,'target_text'=>'so you always know exactly how to study, what to focus on, and how to make real progress.','source_text'=>'supaya anda sentiasa tahu cara belajar, apa yang perlu difokuskan, dan bagaimana mencapai kemajuan sebenar.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>1056.44,'end_time'=>1061.7,'target_text'=>'Inside, we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking.','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya, kita latih sebutan, aksen, ritma, dan pertuturan semula jadi.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>1061.8,'end_time'=>1068.22,'target_text'=>'So, you can stop hesitating, sound more natural, and speak English with real confidence.','source_text'=>'Supaya anda tidak lagi teragak-agak, bercakap lebih semula jadi, dan bertutur bahasa Inggeris dengan penuh yakin.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>1068.32,'end_time'=>1070.34,'target_text'=>'Join today in the description.','source_text'=>'Sertai hari ini menerusi pautan di ruang keterangan.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>1070.44,'end_time'=>1077.22,'target_text'=>'After he finished, I told him I wasn\'t going to be in a relationship with someone who flirts with others and asked him to','source_text'=>'Selepas dia habis bercakap, saya beritahu saya takkan jalin hubungan dengan orang yang suka menggatal dengan perempuan lain dan suruh dia','order'=>247],
