            ['start_time'=>62.84,'end_time'=>69.74,'target_text'=>'Okay, now we\'re going to follow four simple steps to describe things and scenery in nature.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang kita akan ikut empat langkah mudah untuk gambarkan suasana alam semula jadi.','order'=>13],
