            ['start_time'=>1206.6,'end_time'=>1211.18,'target_text'=>'The city is like [music] a concrete jungle, but this park is a green t-shirt.','source_text'=>'Bandar ibarat hutan batu, tetapi taman ini... berbaju-T hijau.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1211.28,'end_time'=>1217.7,'target_text'=>'Yes, there\'s someone over there relaxing [music] and rejuvenating to be sitting.','source_text'=>'Ya, ada seseorang di sebelah sana... berehat dan menyegarkan duduk bersantai.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1217.8,'end_time'=>1223.06,'target_text'=>'I also hear a leaf blower [music] cuz you did see >> man-made noises.','source_text'=>'Saya juga dengar penghembus daun... sebab anda nampak >> bunyi buatan manusia.','order'=>409],
