        foreach ([
            ['start_time'=>0,'end_time'=>6.86,'target_text'=>'Do you want to start thinking in English faster instead of translating everything in your head?','source_text'=>'Anda nak mula berfikir dalam bahasa Inggeris dengan lebih pantas tanpa perlu terjemah satu-satu dalam kepala?','order'=>1],
            ['start_time'=>6.96,'end_time'=>15.06,'target_text'=>'In this video, you are going to shadow a real story written the way native English speakers actually talk.','source_text'=>'Dalam video ini, anda akan tiru (shadow) sebuah kisah nyata yang ditulis mengikut cara penutur jati bercakap dalam kehidupan sebenar.','order'=>2],
            ['start_time'=>15.16,'end_time'=>25.26,'target_text'=>'This helps you connect English words directly to the meaning, so your brain starts processing English faster and more naturally.','source_text'=>'Kaedah ini bantu otak anda hubungkan perkataan bahasa Inggeris terus kepada maksudnya, supaya proses pemikiran jadi lebih pantas dan semula jadi.','order'=>3],
            ['start_time'=>25.36,'end_time'=>35.42,'target_text'=>'Shadowing also improves your pronunciation, rhythm, accent, listening, and speaking because you are copying real English in','source_text'=>'Teknik bayangan (shadowing) ini juga melatih sebutan, ritma, aksen, pendengaran dan pertuturan anda sebab anda meniru bahasa Inggeris asli secara','order'=>4],
            ['start_time'=>35.52,'end_time'=>36.86,'target_text'=>'real time.','source_text'=>'masa nyata.','order'=>5],
            ['start_time'=>36.96,'end_time'=>45.7,'target_text'=>'And since this is a story, you\'ll also learn new vocabulary, natural expressions, and sentence patterns that native English','source_text'=>'Dan memandangkan ini sebuah cerita, anda akan pelajari kosa kata baru, ungkapan bersahaja serta pola ayat yang penutur jati','order'=>6],
            ['start_time'=>45.8,'end_time'=>48.38,'target_text'=>'speakers actually use.','source_text'=>'benar-benar gunakan.','order'=>7],
            ['start_time'=>48.48,'end_time'=>51.7,'target_text'=>'So, don\'t just watch, read with me.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jangan tengok saja, jom baca bersama saya.','order'=>8],
            ['start_time'=>51.8,'end_time'=>57.9,'target_text'=>'Shadow out loud and train your brain to think in English from start to finish.','source_text'=>'Sebut kuat-kuat dan latih minda anda untuk berfikir dalam bahasa Inggeris dari awal sampai habis.','order'=>9],
            ['start_time'=>58,'end_time'=>58.7,'target_text'=>'Let\'s begin.','source_text'=>'Jom kita mulakan.','order'=>10],
            ['start_time'=>58.8,'end_time'=>67.18,'target_text'=>'I\'m I the A-hole for taking a job that conflicted with my best friend\'s wedding after he refused to compromise on unreasonable','source_text'=>'Adakah saya yang bersalah kerana terima tawaran kerja yang bertembung dengan majlis kahwin kawan baik saya selepas dia enggan bertolak ansur atas permintaan yang tak munasabah?','order'=>11],
            ['start_time'=>67.28,'end_time'=>68.1,'target_text'=>'demands.','source_text'=>'tuntutan-tuntutan tersebut.','order'=>12],
            ['start_time'=>68.2,'end_time'=>75.58,'target_text'=>'As you shadow me, I want you guys to remember what you\'re reading and what you\'re shadowing because at the end, I will ask','source_text'=>'Sambil anda tiru sebutan saya, saya nak anda ingat jalan cerita yang dibaca sebab di akhir nanti saya akan minta','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>75.68,'end_time'=>83.7,'target_text'=>'you to summarize what we just read and take a video of yourself giving the summary so you can watch it back at a later date.','source_text'=>'anda ringkaskan cerita ini dan rakam video diri anda merumuskannya supaya boleh ditonton semula kemudian hari.','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>83.8,'end_time'=>90.5,'target_text'=>'Throughout the video, you will also see words flash on screen that you should try to learn if you don\'t already know them.','source_text'=>'Sepanjang video ini juga, anda akan nampak perkataan terpapar di skrin yang patut anda pelajari jika belum tahu maksudnya.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>90.6,'end_time'=>100.42,'target_text'=>'These are part of my 3,000 most common English words series designed to help you understand up to 95% of spoken English.','source_text'=>'Perkataan ini adalah sebahagian daripada siri 3,000 perkataan lazim bahasa Inggeris saya untuk bantu anda faham sehingga 95% perbualan harian.','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>100.52,'end_time'=>107.98,'target_text'=>'If you want to get the PDF with all 3,000 words with definitions and real examples, then get it in the description.','source_text'=>'Kalau anda nak dapatkan PDF senarai 3,000 perkataan lengkap dengan maksud dan contoh sebenar, dapatkan di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>108.08,'end_time'=>108.86,'target_text'=>'Let\'s continue.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>108.96,'end_time'=>111.74,'target_text'=>'Using a throwaway, obviously.','source_text'=>'Tentulah saya guna akaun samaran Reddit (throwaway).','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>111.84,'end_time'=>116.7,'target_text'=>'So, my best friend got engaged about a year ago and asked me to be a groomsman.','source_text'=>'Kawan baik saya bertunang kira-kira setahun lalu dan minta saya jadi pengapit pengantin lelaki (groomsman).','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>116.8,'end_time'=>120.78,'target_text'=>'I said yes immediately because that\'s what you do.','source_text'=>'Saya terus setuju tanpa ragu-ragu sebab memang itu yang patut kawan baik buat.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>120.88,'end_time'=>126.26,'target_text'=>'We\'ve known each other since like middle school and I was genuinely excited.','source_text'=>'Kami dah berkawan sejak zaman sekolah menengah lagi dan saya memang sangat teruja untuk dia.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>126.36,'end_time'=>129.98,'target_text'=>'But then planning started and it got weird.','source_text'=>'Tapi bila proses merancang majlis bermula, suasana jadi agak pelik.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>130.08,'end_time'=>139.26,'target_text'=>'His fiance, who I\'ve never been super close with, started making all these demands about what the groomsmen needed to do.','source_text'=>'Tunangnya, yang saya tak berapa rapat sangat, mula buat macam-macam tuntutan tentang apa yang perlu dibuat oleh pengapit.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>139.36,'end_time'=>147.98,'target_text'=>'Custom shirts, specific haircuts, mandatory bachelor party at her chosen location, contributions to things I\'ve never agreed','source_text'=>'Baju tempah khas, gaya potongan rambut tertentu, wajib sertai parti bujang di lokasi pilihan tunangnya, dan paksa keluar duit untuk benda yang saya tak pernah setuju.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>148.08,'end_time'=>148.54,'target_text'=>'to.','source_text'=>'sebelum ini.','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>148.64,'end_time'=>152.46,'target_text'=>'It was getting expensive and honestly kind of controlling.','source_text'=>'Kosnya makin mahal dan sejujurnya terasa agak mengongkong.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>152.56,'end_time'=>156.5,'target_text'=>'I mentioned to my friend that some of this stuff seemed excessive.','source_text'=>'Saya ada beritahu kawan saya yang sebahagian daripada syarat-syarat ini nampak melampau.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>156.6,'end_time'=>164.42,'target_text'=>'Like I get wanting your wedding to look nice but requiring specific haircuts felt over the line.','source_text'=>'Saya fahamlah kalau nak majlis nampak cantik, tapi sampai wajibkan fesyen rambut tertentu rasa macam dah melampaui batas.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>164.52,'end_time'=>167.14,'target_text'=>'He just said, \"It\'s not that big a deal.','source_text'=>'Dia cuma balas, \"Alah bukan hal besar pun.','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>167.24,'end_time'=>170.98,'target_text'=>'Come on.\" and shut down the conversation.','source_text'=>'Bertenanglah,\" dan terus tamatkan perbualan begitu saja.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>171.08,'end_time'=>176.18,'target_text'=>'That\'s when I kind of started pulling back emotionally from the whole thing.','source_text'=>'Dari saat itulah saya mula rasa tawar hati dan tarik diri secara emosi daripada majlis tersebut.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>176.28,'end_time'=>184.34,'target_text'=>'Fast forward to about 3 months before the wedding and I got a new job offer that required me to relocate for like 2 weeks','source_text'=>'Masa berlalu hingga kira-kira 3 bulan sebelum majlis kahwin, saya dapat tawaran kerja baru yang memerlukan saya berpindah selama 2 minggu','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>184.44,'end_time'=>187.38,'target_text'=>'of training right before the wedding.','source_text'=>'untuk latihan kerja betul-betul sebelum tarikh perkahwinan itu.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>187.48,'end_time'=>193.02,'target_text'=>'I told him immediately and said I\'d try to reschedule it or work something out.','source_text'=>'Saya terus beritahu dia serta-merta dan kata saya akan cuba atur semula jadual atau cari jalan penyelesaian.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>193.12,'end_time'=>194.22,'target_text'=>'He lost it.','source_text'=>'Dia terus naik angin mengamuk.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>194.32,'end_time'=>200.42,'target_text'=>'Started saying I was abandoning him and that real friends would just turn down the job.','source_text'=>'Dia mula tuduh saya tinggalkan dia dan kata kawan sejati sanggup tolak tawaran kerja tu demi kawan.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>200.52,'end_time'=>207.9,'target_text'=>'I reminded him that I need to actually have a career and that I was still going to be there for the wedding.','source_text'=>'Saya ingatkan dia yang saya pun perlukan kerjaya untuk masa depan, dan saya tetap akan hadir pada hari perkahwinannya.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>208,'end_time'=>209.38,'target_text'=>'Here\'s the thing though.','source_text'=>'Tapi inilah hakikatnya.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>209.48,'end_time'=>212.1,'target_text'=>'I could have tried harder to reschedule.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya saya boleh saja berusaha lebih keras untuk ubah jadual latihan kerja tu.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>212.2,'end_time'=>220.22,'target_text'=>'I didn\'t really push back with my new employer because honestly, I was kind of over the whole wedding stress at that point.','source_text'=>'Saya tak beria-ia pun minta majikan baru tukar tarikh sebab sejujurnya saya dah muak dan rimas dengan tekanan majlis kahwin tu.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>220.32,'end_time'=>223.74,'target_text'=>'I think subconsciously, I wanted an out.','source_text'=>'Dalam hati secara bawah sedar, saya memang nak cari jalan keluar dari situasi tu.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>223.84,'end_time'=>230.58,'target_text'=>'His fiance apparently told him it was suspicious timing and that I was being selfish.','source_text'=>'Tunangnya pula hasut dia kata masanya sangat mencurigakan dan tuduh saya pentingkan diri sendiri.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>230.68,'end_time'=>236.54,'target_text'=>'My friend basically told me I was either fully committed or not committed at all.','source_text'=>'Kawan saya akhirnya beri kata dua: sama ada saya komited sepenuhnya, atau tak payah komited langsung.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>236.64,'end_time'=>243.66,'target_text'=>'I ended up keeping the job training and going, but I told him I\'d only make it back the day before the wedding.','source_text'=>'Akhirnya saya teruskan juga latihan kerja itu, tapi saya janji akan balik sehari sebelum hari perkahwinan.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>243.76,'end_time'=>248.34,'target_text'=>'That meant I couldn\'t go to the rehearsal dinner or the bachelor party.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya saya tak sempat hadir majlis raptai makan malam mahupun parti bujang.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>248.44,'end_time'=>256.54,'target_text'=>'He said that was unacceptable and that if I couldn\'t be there for everything, then I shouldn\'t be in the wedding at all.','source_text'=>'Dia kata itu tak boleh diterima sama sekali dan kalau tak boleh ada sepanjang masa, baik jangan jadi pengapit langsung.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>256.64,'end_time'=>260.5,'target_text'=>'So I got dropped as a groomsman like a week before the wedding.','source_text'=>'Jadi nama saya digugurkan daripada senarai pengapit seminggu sebelum majlis berlangsung.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>260.6,'end_time'=>263.78,'target_text'=>'I was upset but also kind of relieved.','source_text'=>'Saya sedih tapi pada masa sama rasa lega juga.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>263.88,'end_time'=>271.5,'target_text'=>'Get my 3,000 most common English words PDF and learn the words that will help you understand up to 95%','source_text'=>'Dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan lazim bahasa Inggeris saya dan kuasai kosa kata yang bantu anda faham sehingga 95%','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>271.6,'end_time'=>273.54,'target_text'=>'of everyday English.','source_text'=>'perbualan harian.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>273.64,'end_time'=>283.94,'target_text'=>'It includes real definitions, real example sentences for every meaning, and everything is organized by CEFR level and topic.','source_text'=>'Ia mengandungi maksud sebenar, contoh ayat untuk setiap maksud, dan disusun rapi mengikut tahap CEFR serta topik.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>284.04,'end_time'=>286.14,'target_text'=>'Click the link in the description to get it.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruangan penerangan untuk memilikinya.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>286.24,'end_time'=>290.62,'target_text'=>'Which tells me something about how I was feeling about the whole thing.','source_text'=>'Rasa lega itu membuktikan betapa tertekannya perasaan saya terhadap seluruh hal majlis tersebut.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>290.72,'end_time'=>293.98,'target_text'=>'Now a few months later, he\'s still mad at me.','source_text'=>'Kini beberapa bulan kemudian, dia masih marahkan saya.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>294.08,'end_time'=>297.98,'target_text'=>'He says I chose a job over my best friend.','source_text'=>'Dia kata saya lebih pilih kerja daripada kawan baik sendiri.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>298.08,'end_time'=>302.98,'target_text'=>'I say he chose his fiance\'s demands over our friendship.','source_text'=>'Saya pula kata dia lebih utamakan tuntutan mengarut tunangnya berbanding persahabatan kami.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>303.08,'end_time'=>305.26,'target_text'=>'My other friends are split.','source_text'=>'Kawan-kawan kami yang lain terbahagi kepada dua pihak.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>305.36,'end_time'=>308.42,'target_text'=>'Some say I should have just turned down the job.','source_text'=>'Ada yang kata saya patut tolak saja tawaran kerja tu.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>308.52,'end_time'=>314.58,'target_text'=>'Others say the wedding demands were unreasonable and he was being controlling about it.','source_text'=>'Ada yang kata tuntutan perkahwinan tu memang tak masuk akal dan kawan saya itu terlalu mengongkong.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>314.68,'end_time'=>317.58,'target_text'=>'The thing is, I could have handled this better.','source_text'=>'Masalahnya, saya akui saya boleh kendalikan perkara ini dengan lebih baik.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>317.68,'end_time'=>323.02,'target_text'=>'I could have been more honest about feeling uncomfortable instead of just pulling back.','source_text'=>'Sepatutnya saya berterus-terang yang saya rasa tak selesa, bukannya sekadar mendiamkan diri dan menjauhkan diri.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>323.12,'end_time'=>331.38,'target_text'=>'And yeah, I definitely could have tried harder with the job thing, but he also could have been more flexible and reasonable','source_text'=>'Dan ya, saya akui saya boleh cuba bincang jadual kerja tu, tapi dia pun patut lebih bertolak ansur dan bersikap rasional','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>331.48,'end_time'=>333.86,'target_text'=>'about what he was asking of me.','source_text'=>'tentang apa yang dia minta daripada saya.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>333.96,'end_time'=>335.54,'target_text'=>'Am I the a-hole?','source_text'=>'Adakah saya yang bersalah dalam hal ini?','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>335.64,'end_time'=>340.1,'target_text'=>'So before I give my opinion, we have an update, but I would like to say some things.','source_text'=>'Sebelum saya berikan pendapat peribadi saya, ada perkembangan terkini, tapi ada beberapa perkara saya nak ulas dulu.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>340.2,'end_time'=>348.94,'target_text'=>'If it was me and it was my wedding, I would not want my friends to turn down a job offer that would advance their career just','source_text'=>'Kalaulah saya dan itu majlis kahwin saya, saya takkan sesekali benarkan kawan saya tolak peluang kerjaya yang cerah semata-mata','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>349.04,'end_time'=>349.9,'target_text'=>'for my wedding.','source_text'=>'kerana majlis perkahwinan saya.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>350,'end_time'=>354.14,'target_text'=>'I understand a wedding is important, but we\'re talking about his entire life.','source_text'=>'Saya faham kahwin itu hari penting, tapi kerjaya melibatkan masa depan seluruh hidup kawan tu.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>354.24,'end_time'=>357.98,'target_text'=>'He\'s still going to be there on the wedding day, and that\'s more than enough.','source_text'=>'Dia tetap akan hadir pada hari kenduri nanti, dan itu sudah lebih daripada mencukupi.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>358.08,'end_time'=>362.74,'target_text'=>'I don\'t need him to ruin his life for one day because it\'s my wedding.','source_text'=>'Saya tak perlu dia gadaikan masa depannya demi satu hari keraian saya.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>362.84,'end_time'=>364.26,'target_text'=>'That is unreasonable.','source_text'=>'Itu memang permintaan yang tidak munasabah.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>364.36,'end_time'=>365.94,'target_text'=>'Major update.','source_text'=>'Perkembangan penting.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>366.04,'end_time'=>368.5,'target_text'=>'Things got worse, not better.','source_text'=>'Keadaan jadi semakin keruh, bukan makin baik.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>368.6,'end_time'=>372.98,'target_text'=>'I decided to actually call him instead of waiting for next week.','source_text'=>'Saya buat keputusan untuk terus telefon dia daripada tunggu minggu hadapan.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>373.08,'end_time'=>379.54,'target_text'=>'Figured I\'d strike while the iron was hot since I was feeling like maybe we could actually talk about this.','source_text'=>'Saya fikir elok bincang semasa emosi dah mula reda supaya kami dapat bersemuka dan selesaikan masalah.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>379.64,'end_time'=>382.74,'target_text'=>'He answered and seemed kind of cold right off the bat.','source_text'=>'Dia angkat panggilan dan layanannya sangat dingin sejak awal-awal lagi.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>382.84,'end_time'=>390.42,'target_text'=>'I started by apologizing for checking out and not being honest with him about how stressed the wedding stuff was making me.','source_text'=>'Saya mulakan dengan minta maaf sebab menjauhkan diri dan tak berterus-terang betapa tertekannya saya dengan persiapan majlis tu.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>390.52,'end_time'=>392.86,'target_text'=>'I thought that would open things up.','source_text'=>'Saya sangka tindakan itu akan menjernihkan keadaan.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>392.96,'end_time'=>400.74,'target_text'=>'Instead, he said, \"Yeah, well, you\'ve been posting about this on Reddit, haven\'t you?\" His wife apparently saw a thread that','source_text'=>'Sebaliknya dia terus sergah, \"Ha, kau ada buat hantaran pasal ni dekat Reddit kan?\" Isterinya rupa-rupanya terjumpa satu bebenang cerita yang','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>400.84,'end_time'=>404.02,'target_text'=>'sounded like it could be us and showed it to him.','source_text'=>'sebiji macam kisah kami dan tunjukkan kepadanya.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>404.12,'end_time'=>406.26,'target_text'=>'And now he\'s pissed.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang dia teramat marah.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>406.36,'end_time'=>414.26,'target_text'=>'He\'s saying I\'m airing dirty laundry online for strangers to judge him and his wife, that I\'m trying to make her look bad.','source_text'=>'Dia tuduh saya jaja aib peribadi di internet untuk dinilai orang luar, kononnya saya nak burukkan isteri dia.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>414.36,'end_time'=>417.58,'target_text'=>'I literally don\'t even know how she found it.','source_text'=>'Saya langsung tak tahu macam mana isterinya boleh jumpa hantaran tu.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>417.68,'end_time'=>421.06,'target_text'=>'It was only up for like an hour before I called him.','source_text'=>'Hantaran tu baru saja dimuat naik sejam sebelum saya telefon dia.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>421.16,'end_time'=>422.78,'target_text'=>'The post just went up.','source_text'=>'Pos itu baru sangat dinaikkan.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>422.88,'end_time'=>428.26,'target_text'=>'I\'m pretty sure I didn\'t leave any obvious details that would lead back to us.','source_text'=>'Saya yakin saya tak letak sebarang maklumat jelas yang boleh dikaitkan dengan identiti kami.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>428.36,'end_time'=>434.38,'target_text'=>'But either she recognized stuff or someone in our friend group figured it out and told them.','source_text'=>'Tapi sama ada dia cam jalan ceritanya, atau ada kawan dalam kumpulan kami yang perasan dan beritahu mereka.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>434.48,'end_time'=>437.34,'target_text'=>'Either way, it feels like a violation.','source_text'=>'Walau apa pun cara dia tahu, ia terasa sangat mengecewakan.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>437.44,'end_time'=>443.66,'target_text'=>'I tried to explain that I used a throwaway and kept things vague, but he wasn\'t hearing it.','source_text'=>'Saya cuba terangkan yang saya guna akaun samaran dan rahsiakan butiran, tapi dia enggan dengar penjelasan.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>443.76,'end_time'=>450.74,'target_text'=>'He said if I\'m willing to post about our friendship online, then clearly I don\'t actually value the friendship.','source_text'=>'Dia kata kalau saya sanggup cerita pasal persahabatan kami di internet, maknanya saya langsung tak hargai kawan.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>450.84,'end_time'=>455.7,'target_text'=>'He told me not to contact him again and blocked me on everything.','source_text'=>'Dia suruh saya jangan hubungi dia lagi dan terus sekat (block) saya di semua media sosial.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>455.8,'end_time'=>464.7,'target_text'=>'His wife apparently also texted some of the other groomsmen saying I\'m trash talking them online.\" Which obviously isn\'t great','source_text'=>'Isterinya pula mesej pengapit-pengapit lain tuduh kononnya saya mengumpat dan burukkan mereka di internet, yang sudah tentu','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>464.8,'end_time'=>467.9,'target_text'=>'for my reputation in the friend group.','source_text'=>'mencalarkan reputasi saya dalam kalangan kawan-kawan.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>468,'end_time'=>471.58,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, the opposite of reconciliation happened.','source_text'=>'Jadi, bukannya berdamai, hubungan kami bertambah hancur.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>471.68,'end_time'=>479.3,'target_text'=>'I\'m actually furious right now because I came to Reddit to process my feelings and now it\'s literally destroyed what was left','source_text'=>'Saya betul-betul bengang sekarang sebab saya cuma kongsi di Reddit untuk tenangkan fikiran, tapi sekarang ia musnahkan terus saki-baki','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>479.4,'end_time'=>480.42,'target_text'=>'of the friendship.','source_text'=>'ikatan persahabatan kami.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>480.52,'end_time'=>486.1,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if I should have told him or if I should have just kept it to myself.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu sama ada saya patut beritahu dia awal-awal atau simpan saja sendiri.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>486.2,'end_time'=>488.78,'target_text'=>'I genuinely don\'t know what to do now.','source_text'=>'Saya betul-betul buntu tak tahu nak buat apa lagi sekarang.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>488.88,'end_time'=>495.46,'target_text'=>'Yeah, that\'s kind of like a risk you\'ve always run by posting stuff like this online because even if you make it like anonymous','source_text'=>'Ya, memang itulah risiko bila berkongsi perkara sebegini di media sosial, sebab walaupun kita rahsiakan nama sebenar','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>495.56,'end_time'=>499.78,'target_text'=>'and don\'t put names or you put fake names or something, the details still are similar.','source_text'=>'atau guna nama samaran, perincian jalan ceritanya tetap sama dan boleh dicam.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>499.88,'end_time'=>505.46,'target_text'=>'So, someone could always be like, \"Oh, they\'re talking about me or this is me.\" But, the fact that they found out within an','source_text'=>'Jadi sesiapa saja yang terlibat boleh cam, \"Eh ini cerita pasal aku ni.\" Tapi hakikat mereka boleh jumpa dalam masa','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>505.56,'end_time'=>507.66,'target_text'=>'hour is kind of kind of crazy.','source_text'=>'satu jam memang agak gila dan luar biasa.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>507.76,'end_time'=>510.46,'target_text'=>'Maybe they were expecting it to be posted on Reddit.','source_text'=>'Mungkin mereka memang dah agak ada orang akan mengadu di Reddit.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>510.56,'end_time'=>511.06,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>511.16,'end_time'=>514.66,'target_text'=>'But, overall, I don\'t necessarily think you did anything wrong.','source_text'=>'Tapi secara keseluruhannya, saya tak rasa anda buat salah besar pun.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>514.76,'end_time'=>521.1,'target_text'=>'I think your friend is just upset because he probably read the comments and saw that him and his wife were in the wrong and','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kawan anda marah sebab dia mungkin terbaca komen-komen netizen yang menegaskan bahawa dia dan isterinya bersalah dan','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>521.2,'end_time'=>525.18,'target_text'=>'they were being very controlling and they seemed like the problem.','source_text'=>'terlalu mengongkong serta menjadi punca utama masalah.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>525.28,'end_time'=>527.54,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s probably why he was upset.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah dia bertambah berang.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>527.64,'end_time'=>534.26,'target_text'=>'Like I said in the beginning, I want you guys to take out your phone and record yourself giving a quick summary, maybe one','source_text'=>'Macam yang saya sebut di awal tadi, saya nak anda keluarkan telefon dan rakam diri anda memberi ringkasan pendek, mungkin dalam satu','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>534.36,'end_time'=>538.34,'target_text'=>'or two sentences of the story you just read.','source_text'=>'atau dua ayat tentang kisah yang baru kita baca ini.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>538.44,'end_time'=>539.38,'target_text'=>'On to the next.','source_text'=>'Jom beralih ke kisah seterusnya.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>539.48,'end_time'=>544.86,'target_text'=>'Am I the a-hole for telling a funny story at a wedding about the bride?','source_text'=>'Adakah saya bersalah kerana ceritakan kisah kelakar tentang pengantin perempuan semasa majlis kahwinnya?','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>544.96,'end_time'=>551.98,'target_text'=>'This happened a couple of weeks ago, but I am still reeling from it and want to know if I was being an a-hole.','source_text'=>'Perkara ini berlaku beberapa minggu lepas, tapi saya masih rasa terkesan dan nak tahu sama ada saya yang bersalah.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>552.08,'end_time'=>561.38,'target_text'=>'Me, 30 male, and my friend, 30 female, who I\'ll call Colleen, have known each other since we were kids.','source_text'=>'Saya, lelaki berumur 30 tahun, dan kawan saya, perempuan 30 tahun bernama Colleen (bukan nama sebenar), dah saling mengenali sejak kecil.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>561.48,'end_time'=>567.14,'target_text'=>'Her family is deeply Catholic, but she isn\'t nearly as religious.','source_text'=>'Keluarganya penganut Katolik yang sangat kuat, tapi dia sendiri tidaklah begitu alim.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>567.24,'end_time'=>568.86,'target_text'=>'Important later.','source_text'=>'Fakta ini penting untuk bahagian seterusnya.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>568.96,'end_time'=>570.78,'target_text'=>'Years ago, she met a guy.','source_text'=>'Beberapa tahun lalu, dia berkenalan dengan seorang lelaki.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>570.88,'end_time'=>574.98,'target_text'=>'I\'ll call him Mike and they became committed.','source_text'=>'Saya namakan dia Mike, dan mereka mula menjalinkan hubungan serius.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>575.08,'end_time'=>580.62,'target_text'=>'I met him and got along great with and the three of us hung out a lot.','source_text'=>'Saya berjumpa dengannya, kami serasi bersama dan kami bertiga kerap lepak beramai-ramai.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>580.72,'end_time'=>584.18,'target_text'=>'So, he proposed and they held a big wedding.','source_text'=>'Kemudian lelaki itu melamarnya dan mereka adakan majlis perkahwinan yang meriah.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>584.28,'end_time'=>590.82,'target_text'=>'The actual wedding came and went, and at the reception afterwards, some of us were giving speeches.','source_text'=>'Upacara pernikahan selesai, dan semasa majlis resepsi selepas itu, beberapa orang antara kami tampil berucap.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>590.92,'end_time'=>598.74,'target_text'=>'I went up and told them how happy I was for them and decided to tell the audience about some of our experiences in college','source_text'=>'Saya naik ke pentas dan ucapkan betapa gembiranya saya untuk mereka, serta ceritakan kepada para hadirin tentang pengalaman kami semasa di kolej','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>598.84,'end_time'=>599.46,'target_text'=>'together.','source_text'=>'bersama-sama dahulu.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>599.56,'end_time'=>601.34,'target_text'=>'Ooh, this could go really bad.','source_text'=>'Ooh, benda macam ni boleh jadi sangat memalukan.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>601.44,'end_time'=>609.38,'target_text'=>'I hope this guy isn\'t like clueless and doesn\'t like say any really personal stories that they would obviously not want other','source_text'=>'Saya harap lelaki ini tak lurus bendul sangat sampai terlepas cakap kisah-kisah peribadi yang orang lain tentu','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>609.48,'end_time'=>610.5,'target_text'=>'people to know.','source_text'=>'tak patut tahu.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>610.6,'end_time'=>613.74,'target_text'=>'But, by the sounds of it, he\'s probably going to do that.','source_text'=>'Tapi dari gaya penceritaannya, besar kemungkinan itulah yang dia bakal buat.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>613.84,'end_time'=>615.9,'target_text'=>'That\'s just my guess.','source_text'=>'Itu sekadar tekaan saya.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>616,'end_time'=>623.82,'target_text'=>'To summarize, my speech, it went something like, \"When me and Colleen went to college together, Colleen let loose and changed','source_text'=>'Secara ringkasnya ucapan saya berbunyi lebih kurang begini, \"Masa saya dan Colleen belajar di kolej dulu, Colleen mula berseronok bebas dan berubah','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>623.92,'end_time'=>627.1,'target_text'=>'completely from her days at Catholic school.','source_text'=>'sepenuhnya berbanding zaman dia bersekolah Katolik dulu.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>627.2,'end_time'=>630.54,'target_text'=>'But, then she met Mike and it seemed like he calmed her down.','source_text'=>'Tapi kemudian dia bertemu Mike dan Mike berjaya mententeramkan serta menenangkan dirinya.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>630.64,'end_time'=>635.18,'target_text'=>'I\'m happy for them and wish them much success.\" The thing is, it\'s probably true.','source_text'=>'Saya gembira untuk mereka dan doakan kejayaan buat mereka berdua.\" Masalahnya, perkara itu mungkin ada benarnya.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>635.28,'end_time'=>636.22,'target_text'=>'That\'s why he said it.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah dia sebut perkara tu.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>636.32,'end_time'=>638.98,'target_text'=>'He must know what he was doing by saying that.','source_text'=>'Dia mesti sedar apa maksud tersirat kata-katanya itu.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>639.08,'end_time'=>647.38,'target_text'=>'Because if their family is extremely Catholic, and then you say this at their wedding, that she let loose, then that just','source_text'=>'Sebab kalau keluarga mereka penganut Katolik tegar, dan anda sebut di majlis kahwin kononnya dia berpeleseran bebas di kolej, itu cuma','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>647.48,'end_time'=>648.7,'target_text'=>'implies one thing.','source_text'=>'membawa satu maksud negatif saja.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>648.8,'end_time'=>650.7,'target_text'=>'I feel like he definitely knew what he was doing.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa dia memang sengaja cari pasal.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>650.8,'end_time'=>653.94,'target_text'=>'The husband also has a right to know what she did.','source_text'=>'Si suami pun berhak tahu apa kisah silam isterinya.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>654.04,'end_time'=>658.86,'target_text'=>'But, the husband also has a right to know, you know, since it\'s going to be his wife.','source_text'=>'Tapi si suami pun ada hak untuk tahu, yalah, memandangkan perempuan itu bakal jadi isterinya.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>658.96,'end_time'=>664.22,'target_text'=>'The audience, for the most part, was laughing throughout my speech and seemed to enjoy it.','source_text'=>'Kebanyakan tetamu tertawa sepanjang ucapan saya dan nampak terhibur.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>664.32,'end_time'=>673.22,'target_text'=>'And given how me, Colleen, and Mike hung out a lot and how we all had a crude sense of humor, I thought they would appreciate','source_text'=>'Dan memandangkan saya, Colleen dan Mike selalu lepak bersama serta berkongsi jenaka selamba, saya sangka mereka akan hargai gurauan','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>673.32,'end_time'=>673.64,'target_text'=>'it.','source_text'=>'itu.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>673.64,'end_time'=>677.62,'target_text'=>'Okay, so by the sounds of it, it was he was saying it more in a joking manner.','source_text'=>'Okey, nampaknya dia sekadar berniat untuk berjenaka santai.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>677.72,'end_time'=>681.06,'target_text'=>'Oh, she let loose in university, but he calmed her down.','source_text'=>'Alah kononnya perempuan tu liar masa universiti, tapi suaminya yang jinakkan dia.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>681.16,'end_time'=>685.98,'target_text'=>'I didn\'t realize this was a big deal until later on in the wedding.','source_text'=>'Saya langsung tak sedar perkara itu jadi isu besar sehinggalah lewat majlis.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>686.08,'end_time'=>692.34,'target_text'=>'I went up to the table Colleen\'s parents were sitting at, but they shunned me away very quickly.','source_text'=>'Saya hampiri meja tempat duduk ibu bapa Colleen, tapi mereka terus palit muka dan halau saya pergi.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>692.44,'end_time'=>697.3,'target_text'=>'I went up to Colleen and Mike to ask them if her parents were okay.','source_text'=>'Saya pergi jumpa Colleen dan Mike untuk tanya sama ada ibu bapa Colleen okey ke tak.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>697.4,'end_time'=>705.42,'target_text'=>'They immediately told me, \"We need to talk.\" They took me into the back of the venue and asked me about the speech.','source_text'=>'Mereka terus tegaskan, \"Kita perlu bercakap.\" Mereka bawa saya ke belakang dewan dan persoalkan ucapan saya tadi.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>705.52,'end_time'=>712.62,'target_text'=>'I told them that most people enjoyed it and they should understand college is a time for going a little crazy and figuring','source_text'=>'Saya terangkan yang kebanyakan orang terhibur dan mereka patut faham zaman kolej memang masa untuk berseronok dan mengenali','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>712.72,'end_time'=>714.06,'target_text'=>'yourself out.','source_text'=>'jati diri.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>714.16,'end_time'=>718.58,'target_text'=>'Colleen yelled at me and said, I had no right.','source_text'=>'Colleen tengking saya dan kata saya langsung tak ada hak cerita pasal tu.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>718.68,'end_time'=>722.5,'target_text'=>'She was screaming so hard that Mike had to calm her down.','source_text'=>'Dia menjerit dengan begitu kuat sampai Mike terpaksa tenangkan dia.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>722.6,'end_time'=>730.7,'target_text'=>'She ended up leaving and Mike said, \"Look, it was a funny story, but try to keep it between us three next time.\" So, Mike','source_text'=>'Akhirnya Colleen beredar, dan Mike kata, \"Cerita tu memang kelakar, tapi lain kali simpan antara kita bertiga saja.\" Jadi Mike','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>730.8,'end_time'=>736.98,'target_text'=>'seems like a really chill guy and Colleen kind of seems like she just didn\'t want her personal business to be told to her','source_text'=>'nampak macam lelaki yang tenang, manakala Colleen pula cuma tak mahu rahsia peribadinya dibongkar depan','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>737.08,'end_time'=>742.22,'target_text'=>'entire extremely religious family, which honestly, I don\'t blame her.','source_text'=>'seluruh ahli keluarganya yang kuat beragama, yang mana sejujurnya saya tak salahkan dia pun.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>742.32,'end_time'=>747.54,'target_text'=>'Since then, I\'ve tried texting Colleen back, but she blocked me everywhere.','source_text'=>'Sejak hari itu, saya cuba hantar mesej kepada Colleen, tapi dia dah sekat saya di semua platform.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>747.64,'end_time'=>750.3,'target_text'=>'Mike hasn\'t been responding either.','source_text'=>'Mike pun dah tak balas mesej saya lagi.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>750.4,'end_time'=>757.34,'target_text'=>'Given that most people in the audience enjoyed it and probably forgot about it now, I don\'t know why this is a big deal.','source_text'=>'Memandangkan kebanyakan tetamu lain terhibur dan mungkin dah lupa pun pasal ucapan tu, saya pelik kenapa perkara ini diperbesarkan.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>757.44,'end_time'=>764.58,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s a big deal because yeah, maybe most people in the audience don\'t remember cuz they\'re not that close to Colleen','source_text'=>'Bagi saya ia isu besar sebab ya, mungkin tetamu biasa tak ambil pusing sebab tak rapat dengan Colleen','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>764.68,'end_time'=>772.26,'target_text'=>'or that close to Mike, but the people that do remember will be her parents and his parents, so they will remember and that\'s','source_text'=>'atau Mike, tetapi pihak yang akan ingat sampai bila-bila ialah ibu bapa mereka, dan mereka itulah','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>772.36,'end_time'=>776.34,'target_text'=>'the most important people that she probably didn\'t want them to know that.','source_text'=>'orang terpenting yang Colleen paling tak nak tahu tentang kisah itu.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>776.44,'end_time'=>778.3,'target_text'=>'That\'s why it\'s a big deal.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah ia jadi masalah besar.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>778.4,'end_time'=>786.06,'target_text'=>'Remember guys, give me a summary of the story and I want you to take a video because in a month or two, you can look back','source_text'=>'Ingat ya semua, buat ringkasan cerita ini dan rakam video diri anda sebab sebulan dua lagi anda boleh tonton semula','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>786.16,'end_time'=>793.46,'target_text'=>'at this video and see how much your pronunciation, your accent, your rhythm, and your confidence has improved.','source_text'=>'video tersebut dan lihat sejauh mana sebutan, aksen, ritma dan keyakinan pertuturan anda telah meningkat.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>793.56,'end_time'=>799.94,'target_text'=>'Am I the a-hole for refusing to give up my wedding dress the day after the wedding?','source_text'=>'Adakah saya bersalah kerana enggan serahkan gaun pengantin saya sehari selepas majlis perkahwinan?','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>800.04,'end_time'=>802.46,'target_text'=>'So, first, some context.','source_text'=>'Mula-mula, mari fahami latar belakang ceritanya.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>802.56,'end_time'=>810.14,'target_text'=>'I\'m getting married this Saturday and my fiance and I are paying the wedding ourselves, well, most of it.','source_text'=>'Saya akan berkahwin pada hari Sabtu ini dan saya serta tunang saya tanggung sendiri kos perkahwinan ini, sebahagian besarnya.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>810.24,'end_time'=>815.46,'target_text'=>'There\'s been some presents here and there, like the liquor from my parents, they insisted.','source_text'=>'Ada beberapa hadiah kecil daripada keluarga, macam minuman daripada ibu bapa saya sebab mereka berkeras nak belanja.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>815.56,'end_time'=>819.66,'target_text'=>'And in from my aunt, whom I have a bit of a tense relationship with.','source_text'=>'Dan daripada ibu saudara saya, yang mana hubungan saya dengannya agak tegang sedikit.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>819.76,'end_time'=>822.02,'target_text'=>'She gave me my wedding gown.','source_text'=>'Dia hadiahkan gaun pengantin kepada saya.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>822.12,'end_time'=>828.78,'target_text'=>'The thing about the wedding gown is it used to belong to my cousin, which is one of my bridesmaids.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya gaun itu asalnya kepunyaan sepupu saya, yang juga salah seorang pengapit saya.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>828.88,'end_time'=>834.1,'target_text'=>'She was about to get married, but they broke things off because he was cheating.','source_text'=>'Dulu dia hampir berkahwin, tapi perkahwinan itu dibatalkan sebab tunangnya curang.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>834.2,'end_time'=>836.42,'target_text'=>'But that\'s another story.','source_text'=>'Tapi itu cerita lain.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>836.52,'end_time'=>841.14,'target_text'=>'My aunt bought this wedding dress for her and it was brand new.','source_text'=>'Ibu saudara saya beli gaun pengantin itu khas untuknya dan ia masih baru belum dipakai.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>841.24,'end_time'=>847.34,'target_text'=>'It was never used and they had it sitting on their closet for about a year or two.','source_text'=>'Ia tak pernah digunakan dan sekadar tersimpan di dalam almari selama setahun dua.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>847.44,'end_time'=>855.7,'target_text'=>'When she found out I was getting married, she got as excited as if I was her daughter as well and told me about the dress','source_text'=>'Bila dia dapat tahu saya nak berkahwin, dia sangat teruja seolah-olah saya ini anak perempuannya sendiri dan tawarkan gaun itu','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>855.8,'end_time'=>858.1,'target_text'=>'asking me if I wanted it.','source_text'=>'sambil tanya sama ada saya sudi menerimanya.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>858.2,'end_time'=>864.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s not the dress I envisioned, but since we are paying the wedding ourselves and my fiance said that I was going to have','source_text'=>'Ia bukan gaun impian yang saya idamkan, tapi memandangkan kami tanggung sendiri kos kahwin dan tunang saya kata saya mungkin kena','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>864.8,'end_time'=>871.9,'target_text'=>'to rent a dress because we don\'t have the money to buy one and I was really sad about that because I wanted to own my own','source_text'=>'sewa gaun saja sebab kami tak ada bajet untuk beli, saya rasa sedih sebab saya teringin sangat nak miliki gaun pengantin sendiri.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>872,'end_time'=>872.94,'target_text'=>'dress.','source_text'=>'secara peribadi.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>873.04,'end_time'=>877.18,'target_text'=>'I said yes and once I tried it on, I fell in love with it.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya setuju terima, dan sebaik sahaja saya mencubanya, saya terus jatuh hati dengan gaun itu.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>877.28,'end_time'=>881.58,'target_text'=>'She gave me that dress as a gift and to alter as I saw fit.','source_text'=>'Dia hadiahkan gaun itu kepada saya untuk diubah suai mengikut keselesaan saya.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>881.68,'end_time'=>885.1,'target_text'=>'But like I said, I fell in love with it as it was.','source_text'=>'Tapi seperti yang saya katakan, saya dah suka bentuk asalnya begitu.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>885.2,'end_time'=>888.54,'target_text'=>'But I should have known that dress came with strings.','source_text'=>'Namun sepatutnya saya sedar awal-awal lagi bahawa hadiah itu ada udang di sebalik batu.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>888.64,'end_time'=>896.66,'target_text'=>'Yesterday I was coming back from a trip visiting my parents and when I got off the plane, I found a voicemail from my aunt.','source_text'=>'Semalam semasa dalam perjalanan pulang melawat ibu bapa dan turun dari kapal terbang, saya dengar pesanan suara daripada ibu saudara saya.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>896.76,'end_time'=>904.7,'target_text'=>'She told me that another of my cousins is getting married and she was asking if I could give her my dress the day after the','source_text'=>'Dia beritahu seorang lagi sepupu saya bakal berkahwin dan minta saya serahkan gaun itu sehari selepas','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>904.8,'end_time'=>913.5,'target_text'=>'wedding so she could tear it apart and take the lace off it and do with the dress as she wanted for her wedding and it broke','source_text'=>'majlis saya supaya sepupu itu boleh rombak semula, tanggalkan renda dan buat gaun ikut seleranya untuk majlisnya nanti, dan itu meremukkan hati','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>913.6,'end_time'=>914,'target_text'=>'me.','source_text'=>'saya.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>914.08,'end_time'=>921.54,'target_text'=>'This cousin in particular is the favorite of everyone, sometimes even of my own parents when we were younger.','source_text'=>'Sepupu yang ini memang anak emas kesayangan semua orang, malah ibu bapa saya pun lebihkan dia semasa kami kecil dulu.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>921.64,'end_time'=>928.5,'target_text'=>'Mostly because she is really charismatic and also she\'s white and blonde and I\'m a little on the darker side.','source_text'=>'Terutamanya sebab dia ada karisma, berkulit cerah dan berambut perang manakala kulit saya agak gelap sedikit.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>928.6,'end_time'=>929.7,'target_text'=>'You can imagine.','source_text'=>'Faham-faham sajalah layanannya.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>929.8,'end_time'=>932.06,'target_text'=>'I don\'t have any rivalry with her.','source_text'=>'Saya tiada sebarang rasa dengki atau persaingan dengannya.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>932.16,'end_time'=>939.1,'target_text'=>'I adore her and I knew she wouldn\'t want this wedding dress because I already talked to her about the style of the wedding','source_text'=>'Saya sayang dia dan saya tahu dia sendiri tak inginkan gaun ini pun sebab saya dah bincang dengannya tentang tema majlis','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>939.2,'end_time'=>943.78,'target_text'=>'that she wanted and how she wanted something more bohemian on the beach.','source_text'=>'yang dia impikan iaitu konsep bohemian santai di tepi pantai.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>943.88,'end_time'=>947.02,'target_text'=>'So, I know she wasn\'t the one to ask for this.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya tahu bukan sepupu itu yang minta gaun saya.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>947.12,'end_time'=>948.82,'target_text'=>'It was just my aunt.','source_text'=>'Ini semua idea ibu saudara saya saja.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>948.92,'end_time'=>956.86,'target_text'=>'Still, my wedding is this Saturday and I feel like it\'s the worst timing for my aunt to say this because I wouldn\'t be against','source_text'=>'Lagipun majlis saya hari Sabtu ini dan masa yang dipilih ibu saudara saya amat tidak kena, padahal saya bukannya tak sudi','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>956.96,'end_time'=>958.7,'target_text'=>'sharing my wedding dress.','source_text'=>'berkongsi gaun pengantin saya.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>958.8,'end_time'=>965.78,'target_text'=>'I was dreaming of maybe someday I can give it to one of my cousins or maybe to my goddaughter.','source_text'=>'Saya ada impian mungkin suatu hari nanti saya boleh wariskan gaun ini kepada sepupu lain atau kepada anak angkat saya.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>965.88,'end_time'=>972.18,'target_text'=>'Someone that like me wasn\'t able to buy their own wedding dress and they can have this one.','source_text'=>'Seseorang yang senasib macam saya tak mampu beli gaun sendiri supaya dia boleh gunakannya.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>972.28,'end_time'=>980.14,'target_text'=>'And to have that option taken away from me and to feel like I was given something just to be taken away even before I I could','source_text'=>'Dan bila hak itu diragut daripada saya, rasa macam saya diberi sesuatu semata-mata untuk dirampas balik sebelum sempat saya','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>980.24,'end_time'=>980.78,'target_text'=>'use it.','source_text'=>'pakai sepenuhnya.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>980.88,'end_time'=>985.94,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if I\'m being irrational here, but this has given me a lot of sadness.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu sama ada saya terlalu beremosi, tapi perkara ini buat saya berasa sangat sedih.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>986.04,'end_time'=>993.3,'target_text'=>'Now when I think about the wedding dress and when I think of my wedding and I\'m trying really hard to be happy and be excited.','source_text'=>'Sekarang bila fikir pasal gaun dan hari perkahwinan, saya cuba sedaya upaya untuk kekal ceria dan teruja.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>993.4,'end_time'=>995.82,'target_text'=>'This is my wedding week for God\'s sake.','source_text'=>'Inilah minggu perkahwinan saya demi tuhan.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>995.92,'end_time'=>1002.74,'target_text'=>'Oh, and on top of that my cousin lives in another country and will be leaving like 3 days after the wedding.','source_text'=>'Lagipun sepupu saya tinggal di luar negara dan akan berangkat pulang 3 hari selepas majlis saya.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>1002.84,'end_time'=>1010.46,'target_text'=>'So, my aunt wanted me to give it to her the day after I get married and I think that also affects me because I don\'t get to','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah ibu saudara saya desak supaya serahkan gaun itu sehari selepas saya bernikah, dan saya sedih sebab langsung tak sempat','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>1010.56,'end_time'=>1014.06,'target_text'=>'have my wedding dress the day after the wedding.','source_text'=>'simpan gaun kenangan saya sendiri selepas selesai majlis.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>1014.16,'end_time'=>1020.9,'target_text'=>'I just wanted to be able to take my wedding dress back to my home and have it in my closet and I know it\'s stupid, but I\'ve','source_text'=>'Saya cuma nak bawa gaun pengantin balik ke rumah dan simpan di dalam almari saya, mungkin nampak remeh tapi saya memang','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>1021,'end_time'=>1025.66,'target_text'=>'always wanted to have my wedding dress and be able to decide what to do with it.','source_text'=>'sentiasa idamkan untuk memiliki gaun pengantin sendiri dan ada hak tentukan nasib gaun itu.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>1025.76,'end_time'=>1027.58,'target_text'=>'So, what do y\'all think?','source_text'=>'Jadi, apa pandangan anda semua?','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>1027.68,'end_time'=>1035.54,'target_text'=>'If you\'re serious about becoming fluent in English, I\'ve built a full speaking and pronunciation course that shows you exactly','source_text'=>'Kalau anda serius nak fasih berbahasa Inggeris, saya dah bina kursus pertuturan dan sebutan lengkap yang tunjukkan','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>1035.64,'end_time'=>1037.74,'target_text'=>'what to do step by step.','source_text'=>'apa yang perlu dibuat langkah demi langkah.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>1037.84,'end_time'=>1045.78,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to 80 plus video lessons right away and I add three to five brand new lessons every week so you can','source_text'=>'Anda dapat akses segera ke 80 lebih video pelajaran dan saya tambah tiga hingga lima pelajaran baru setiap minggu supaya anda','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>1045.88,'end_time'=>1047.98,'target_text'=>'keep improving consistently.','source_text'=>'terus berkembang secara konsisten.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>1048.08,'end_time'=>1051.46,'target_text'=>'And this is not just a course full of random videos.','source_text'=>'Dan ini bukan sekadar kursus dengan video rawak.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>1051.56,'end_time'=>1060.14,'target_text'=>'You\'ll get an exclusive chat GPT prompt that allows you to master the pronunciation of any word plus a clear practice structure','source_text'=>'Anda akan dapat prompt khas ChatGPT untuk kuasai sebutan mana-mana perkataan serta struktur latihan yang jelas','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>1060.24,'end_time'=>1066.38,'target_text'=>'so you always know exactly how to study, what to focus on and how to make real progress.','source_text'=>'supaya anda sentiasa tahu cara belajar, apa nak difokuskan dan capai kemajuan yang nyata.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>1066.48,'end_time'=>1071.74,'target_text'=>'Inside we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm and natural speaking.','source_text'=>'Di dalam kursus ini kita asah sebutan, aksen, ritma dan gaya pertuturan semula jadi.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>1071.84,'end_time'=>1078.26,'target_text'=>'So you can stop hesitating, sound more natural and speak English with real confidence.','source_text'=>'Supaya anda tak teragak-agak lagi, bercakap lebih bersahaja dan yakin berbahasa Inggeris.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>1078.36,'end_time'=>1079.98,'target_text'=>'Join today in the description.','source_text'=>'Sertai hari ini melalui pautan di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>1080.08,'end_time'=>1085.02,'target_text'=>'So so far my thoughts are you can\'t give a gift to someone and then take it back.','source_text'=>'Pandangan saya setakat ini, kita tak boleh bagi hadiah kepada seseorang lepas tu minta balik.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>1085.12,'end_time'=>1087.3,'target_text'=>'Once you give it to someone, it\'s theirs.','source_text'=>'Bila dah beri sebagai hadiah, ia jadi hak milik orang itu sepenuhnya.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>1087.4,'end_time'=>1088.66,'target_text'=>'You can\'t ask for a gift back.','source_text'=>'Mana boleh minta balik hadiah yang dah diberi.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>1088.76,'end_time'=>1090.22,'target_text'=>'That\'s why it\'s a gift.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah namanya hadiah, bukan pinjaman.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>1090.32,'end_time'=>1091.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s not like a loan.','source_text'=>'Bukannya kita bagi pinjam barang.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>1091.32,'end_time'=>1093.22,'target_text'=>'You\'re not loaning them something.','source_text'=>'Anda bukan meminjamkan barang kepada mereka.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>1093.32,'end_time'=>1098.46,'target_text'=>'So the aunt is in the wrong here for asking something back just to give to someone else.','source_text'=>'Jadi tindakan ibu saudara itu memang salah sebab minta balik hadiah semata-mata nak beri kepada orang lain.','order'=>229],
