            ['start_time'=>212.8,'end_time'=>215.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s big but I think there are bigger parks in Korea.','source_text'=>'Ia memang besar, tapi saya rasa di Korea ada taman yang lebih luas.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>215.84,'end_time'=>217.98,'target_text'=>'Like I think Seoul Forest is bigger than this.','source_text'=>'Contohnya saya rasa Hutan Seoul (Seoul Forest) lagi besar daripada taman ini.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>218.08,'end_time'=>220.82,'target_text'=>'I think Korea has more green spaces than Bangkok does.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa Korea ada lebih banyak kawasan hijau berbanding Bangkok.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>220.92,'end_time'=>226.5,'target_text'=>'Yeah, cuz Korea has like mountains and stuff and a lot of the mountains are just like untouched because it\'s hard to build','source_text'=>'Ya, sebab di Korea banyak kawasan pergunungan dan kebanyakannya kekal terpelihara tanpa usikan sebab susah nak bina bangunan','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>226.6,'end_time'=>227.86,'target_text'=>'on the mountains.','source_text'=>'di cerun bukit.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>227.96,'end_time'=>228.54,'target_text'=>'So.','source_text'=>'Jadi begitulah.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>228.64,'end_time'=>233.26,'target_text'=>'Oh, there\'s a bunch of lizards that they have here that live naturally.','source_text'=>'Oh, ada banyak biawak yang hidup secara liar dan semula jadi di taman ini.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>233.36,'end_time'=>235.1,'target_text'=>'I remember seeing it online.','source_text'=>'Saya teringat pernah tengok videonya di internet.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>235.2,'end_time'=>235.98,'target_text'=>'That\'s a lizard?','source_text'=>'Itu biawak ke?','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>236.08,'end_time'=>237.78,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s a I don\'t think it\'s a Komodo dragon.','source_text'=>'Ya, rasanya bukan naga Komodo.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>237.88,'end_time'=>239.42,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s a monitor lizard.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa itu biawak air (monitor lizard).','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>239.52,'end_time'=>241.02,'target_text'=>'That thing is big, man.','source_text'=>'Besar gila saiz dia, kawan.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>241.12,'end_time'=>241.98,'target_text'=>'Holy.','source_text'=>'Biar betul.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>242.08,'end_time'=>243.94,'target_text'=>'It kind of looks like a snake when it swims like that.','source_text'=>'Bila dia berenang macam tu nampak macam ular.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>244.04,'end_time'=>245.46,'target_text'=>'>> There\'s a ton that roam around this park.','source_text'=>'Memang banyak sangat berkeliaran di seluruh taman ini.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>245.56,'end_time'=>247.14,'target_text'=>'>> And its tongue really looks like a snake.','source_text'=>'Lidahnya yang bercabang tu sebiji macam lidah ular.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>247.24,'end_time'=>249.22,'target_text'=>'And this type of animal is a reptile.','source_text'=>'Dan haiwan jenis ini ialah sejenis reptilia (reptile).','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>249.32,'end_time'=>250.34,'target_text'=>'This is a reptile.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah reptilia.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>250.44,'end_time'=>252.1,'target_text'=>'Dude, that really looks like a snake.','source_text'=>'Kawan, cara dia berenang betul-betul macam ular.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>252.2,'end_time'=>252.82,'target_text'=>'Let me double-check.','source_text'=>'Biar saya semak balik.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>252.92,'end_time'=>253.9,'target_text'=>'I think I saved it.','source_text'=>'Rasanya saya ada simpan maklumat pasal binatang ni.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>254,'end_time'=>255.5,'target_text'=>'You think this thing will attack you?','source_text'=>'Awak rasa binatang ni akan serang orang tak?','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>255.6,'end_time'=>256,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh, mestilah berisiko.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>256.04,'end_time'=>257.06,'target_text'=>'I wouldn\'t get too close to it.','source_text'=>'Saya takkan berani dekat terlalu rapat.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>257.16,'end_time'=>258.9,'target_text'=>'Actually, like they do get fed.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya binatang ni ada orang bagi makan.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>259,'end_time'=>259.74,'target_text'=>'Oh, by who?','source_text'=>'Oh, siapa yang bagi makan?','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>259.84,'end_time'=>260.42,'target_text'=>'By just people?','source_text'=>'Orang awam ke?','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>260.52,'end_time'=>262.74,'target_text'=>'>> staff, but yeah, it\'s called a monitor lizard.','source_text'=>'Petugas taman yang beri makan, tapi ya namanya biawak air (monitor lizard).','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>262.84,'end_time'=>264.06,'target_text'=>'A monitor lizard.','source_text'=>'Seekor biawak air.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>264.16,'end_time'=>265.34,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never seen one of those.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah tengok binatang macam ni secara dekat.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>265.44,'end_time'=>266.14,'target_text'=>'Crazy, right?','source_text'=>'Gila kan saiz dia?','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>266.24,'end_time'=>267.66,'target_text'=>'It doesn\'t seem scared, though.','source_text'=>'Tapi nampaknya ia langsung tak takut pada orang.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>267.76,'end_time'=>269.3,'target_text'=>'Wow, there\'s got to be more, though.','source_text'=>'Wah, mesti ada banyak lagi di sekitar sini.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>269.4,'end_time'=>271.78,'target_text'=>'Keep my eyes peeled for them.','source_text'=>'Kena pasang mata cari mereka.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>271.88,'end_time'=>272.62,'target_text'=>'For real.','source_text'=>'Betul sangat.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>272.72,'end_time'=>274.14,'target_text'=>'Those things look crazy, honestly.','source_text'=>'Binatang tu memang nampak luar biasa bentuknya.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>274.24,'end_time'=>277.14,'target_text'=>'>> of look like a Komodo dragon, but Komodo dragons are a lot bigger.','source_text'=>'Rupa macam naga Komodo, tapi naga Komodo jauh lebih besar saiznya.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>277.24,'end_time'=>279.14,'target_text'=>'And more dangerous, right?','source_text'=>'Dan jauh lebih berbahaya kan?','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>279.24,'end_time'=>279.9,'target_text'=>'>> vicious.','source_text'=>'Lebih ganas dan berbisa.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>280,'end_time'=>281.1,'target_text'=>'Damn, that was cool.','source_text'=>'Fuh, memang menarik tadi tu.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>281.2,'end_time'=>284.88,'target_text'=>'Too bad it wasn\'t like a giant snake that just like','source_text'=>'Cuma sayang ia bukan ular gergasi yang tiba-tiba melintas...','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>286,'end_time'=>287.86,'target_text'=>'Yo, there\'s another one right there, Leon.','source_text'=>'Eh, ada seekor lagi di sebelah sana, Leon.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>287.96,'end_time'=>288.7,'target_text'=>'Ooh, it\'s sleeping.','source_text'=>'Ooh, ia tengah tidur.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>288.8,'end_time'=>290.14,'target_text'=>'You think these two will fight?','source_text'=>'Awak rasa kedua-dua ekor ni akan bergaduh tak?','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>290.24,'end_time'=>292.46,'target_text'=>'Get them flicked up for the fight.','source_text'=>'Siap sedia rakam gambar kalau mereka bergaduh.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>292.56,'end_time'=>293.38,'target_text'=>'Damn.','source_text'=>'Fuh.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>293.48,'end_time'=>295.92,'target_text'=>'I\'m ready to run, though.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya dah sedia nak lari bila-bila masa.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>298.64,'end_time'=>301.74,'target_text'=>'So, right now we are in the heart of the park.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang kita berada di bahagian tengah-tengah taman.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>301.84,'end_time'=>304.14,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s have a little adjective lesson.','source_text'=>'Jom kita buat sesi pembelajaran kata sifat (adjective) sekejap.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>304.24,'end_time'=>305.82,'target_text'=>'Let\'s learn some adjectives here.','source_text'=>'Mari kita pelajari beberapa kata sifat di sini.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>305.92,'end_time'=>314.32,'target_text'=>'Look around me and think of some adjectives to describe my environment, to describe the people, to describe me.','source_text'=>'Pandang sekeliling saya dan fikirkan kata sifat yang sesuai untuk gambarkan suasana, orang ramai dan diri saya.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>314.88,'end_time'=>317.94,'target_text'=>'So, the first thing I notice is that it is calm here.','source_text'=>'Perkara pertama yang saya perasan ialah suasananya tenang di sini (calm).','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>318.04,'end_time'=>321.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s pretty calm and quiet and very peaceful.','source_text'=>'Sangat tenang, sunyi dan amat mendamaikan (peaceful).','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>321.8,'end_time'=>322.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s not busy.','source_text'=>'Tak sibuk.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>322.88,'end_time'=>325.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s not crowded, so it\'s nice.','source_text'=>'Tak sesak dengan orang ramai, jadi sangat selesa.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>325.12,'end_time'=>328.3,'target_text'=>'The sun is also setting, so that just adds to the calmness.','source_text'=>'Matahari pun dah mula terbenam, menambahkan lagi ketenangan waktu senja.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>328.4,'end_time'=>333.3,'target_text'=>'Also, maybe it\'s because it\'s currently dry season, but the park is not very green.','source_text'=>'Lagi satu, mungkin sebab sekarang musim kemarau, taman ini tak berapa menghijau sangat.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>333.4,'end_time'=>334.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s not very green.','source_text'=>'Tak berapa hijau.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>334.16,'end_time'=>335.94,'target_text'=>'You can see it\'s very dry.','source_text'=>'Boleh nampak tanahnya agak kering kontang.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>336.04,'end_time'=>338.62,'target_text'=>'There is not a lot of grass, and so it\'s not very green.','source_text'=>'Rumput tak berapa lebat, jadi suasananya kurang kehijauan.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>338.72,'end_time'=>340.02,'target_text'=>'More yellow, I think.','source_text'=>'Lebih kepada warna kekuningan rasanya.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>340.12,'end_time'=>344.26,'target_text'=>'The trees are green, or sorry, the leaves of the trees are green.','source_text'=>'Pokok-pokoknya hijau, eh maaf, dedaun pokoknya yang berwarna hijau.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>344.36,'end_time'=>345.5,'target_text'=>'The leaves are green.','source_text'=>'Dedaunnya berwarna hijau.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>345.6,'end_time'=>348.66,'target_text'=>'Right now, the area we\'re in is quite shady.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kawasan yang kita duduk ini agak redup (shady).','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>348.76,'end_time'=>350.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s shady and also it\'s cool.','source_text'=>'Ia redup dan juga terasa sejuk nyaman (cool).','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>350.8,'end_time'=>352.18,'target_text'=>'Like I\'m I\'m not hot at all.','source_text'=>'Saya langsung tak rasa panas.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>352.28,'end_time'=>354.7,'target_text'=>'Like this is a nice temperature to be at right now.','source_text'=>'Suhunya sangat selesa dan sedap dinikmati sekarang.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>354.8,'end_time'=>356.02,'target_text'=>'I am cool.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa sejuk (cool).','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>356.12,'end_time'=>356.7,'target_text'=>'I\'m cool.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa selesa.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>356.8,'end_time'=>359.38,'target_text'=>'So, cool also has, you know, different meanings.','source_text'=>'Perkataan \'cool\' ini ada beberapa maksud berbeza, tahu tak.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>359.48,'end_time'=>361.9,'target_text'=>'So, cool could just be like not hot, right?','source_text'=>'\'Cool\' boleh bermaksud tidak panas atau sejuk nyaman kan?','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>362,'end_time'=>362.58,'target_text'=>'So, the opposite.','source_text'=>'Lawan kepada perkataan panas.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>362.68,'end_time'=>363.22,'target_text'=>'So, cool.','source_text'=>'Itu maksud \'cool\'.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>363.32,'end_time'=>366.3,'target_text'=>'But, cool can also be like, \"Yo, what\'s up?\" That\'s cool.','source_text'=>'Tapi \'cool\' boleh juga bermaksud hebat atau bergaya macam, \"Yo, apa khabar?\"','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>366.4,'end_time'=>367.06,'target_text'=>'Like cool.','source_text'=>'Macam bergaya santai.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>367.16,'end_time'=>372.38,'target_text'=>'Like \"Oh, that guy, he\'s cool.\" He\'s not cool like like this, like cold.','source_text'=>'Macam ungkapan, \"Lelaki tu nampak \'cool\'.\" Bukannya dia sejuk menggigil.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>372.48,'end_time'=>373.86,'target_text'=>'He\'s not that cool.','source_text'=>'Bukan sejuk macam tu maksudnya.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>373.96,'end_time'=>379.22,'target_text'=>'He\'s cool as in like shades on, sitting back, maybe a drink in his hand.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya dia bergaya, pakai cermin mata gelap, duduk relaks sambil pegang minuman.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>379.32,'end_time'=>380.62,'target_text'=>'He\'s cool, you know?','source_text'=>'Dia bergaya sempoi, faham kan?','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>380.72,'end_time'=>383.3,'target_text'=>'So, this area is just pretty relaxing.','source_text'=>'Jadi kawasan ini memang sangat menenangkan (relaxing).','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>383.4,'end_time'=>390.02,'target_text'=>'So, those are just some simple adjectives you can use to describe this area, this environment, the people.','source_text'=>'Itulah antara kata sifat mudah yang boleh digunakan untuk gambarkan kawasan ini, persekitaran dan orang ramai.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>390.12,'end_time'=>392.42,'target_text'=>'Everyone does seem very relaxed here.','source_text'=>'Semua orang nampak sangat santai dan relaks di sini.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>392.52,'end_time'=>397.38,'target_text'=>'And you can just hear the birds chirping in the background, the crows','source_text'=>'Dan anda boleh dengar kicauan burung di latar belakang, bunyi burung gagak','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>397.48,'end_time'=>398.1,'target_text'=>'as well.','source_text'=>'juga.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>398.2,'end_time'=>402.38,'target_text'=>'And then you have those lizards, the monitor lizards just walking around.','source_text'=>'Dan kemudian ada biawak-biawak air yang merayap bebas di sekitar sini.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>402.48,'end_time'=>404.86,'target_text'=>'Like they were Some of them were quite well camouflaged.','source_text'=>'Sebahagian daripadanya sangat pandai menyamar (camouflaged).','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>404.96,'end_time'=>405.78,'target_text'=>'Like Leon got that.','source_text'=>'Macam yang Leon perasan tadi.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>405.88,'end_time'=>411.22,'target_text'=>'Or like I just saw its tail and I literally I literally thought it was part of the root from the tree cuz it was right beside','source_text'=>'Tadi saya cuma nampak ekornya dan saya betul-betul sangka itu akar pokok sebab ia duduk dekat pangkal','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>411.32,'end_time'=>411.6,'target_text'=>'the tree.','source_text'=>'pokok.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>411.6,'end_time'=>412.38,'target_text'=>'I thought it was the root.','source_text'=>'Saya ingat itu akar kayu.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>412.48,'end_time'=>413.54,'target_text'=>'And then I was looking, looking.','source_text'=>'Bila saya perhatikan betul-betul...','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>413.64,'end_time'=>417.82,'target_text'=>'I\'m like, So, I said to Leon, \"Yo, there\'s a lizard there.\" And then it was.','source_text'=>'Saya terus kata pada Leon, \"Eh ada biawak kat situ.\" Dan memang betul pun.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>417.92,'end_time'=>418.62,'target_text'=>'But, he was sleeping.','source_text'=>'Tapi biawak tu tengah tidur.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>418.72,'end_time'=>420.06,'target_text'=>'You could easily step on it.','source_text'=>'Silap-silap boleh terpijak kalau tak perasan.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>420.16,'end_time'=>424.38,'target_text'=>'Yeah, like that\'s why now I\'m like walking If you\'re on','source_text'=>'Ya, sebab itu sekarang bila saya melangkah... Kalau jalan atas','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>424.48,'end_time'=>427.98,'target_text'=>'If you\'re on the path there, obviously you can see a lizard because it\'s paved, right?','source_text'=>'Kalau di atas laluan berturap di sebelah sana, tentulah senang nampak biawak sebab jalannya rata kan?','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>428.08,'end_time'=>428.66,'target_text'=>'You can clearly see.','source_text'=>'Boleh nampak dengan jelas.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>428.76,'end_time'=>430.94,'target_text'=>'But, here they\'re like really camouflaged, right?','source_text'=>'Tapi di atas tanah sini warnanya memang betul-betul menyamar kan?','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>431.04,'end_time'=>432.22,'target_text'=>'They\'re camouflaged.','source_text'=>'Mereka menyamar mengikut warna alam.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>432.32,'end_time'=>433.26,'target_text'=>'So, you can\'t really see them.','source_text'=>'Jadi susah nak nampak kelibat mereka.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>433.36,'end_time'=>437.14,'target_text'=>'They blend in very well with the ground here and their surroundings.','source_text'=>'Warnanya sepadan dengan tanah dan persekitaran sekeliling.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>437.24,'end_time'=>439.74,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s kind of hard to see them and notice them.','source_text'=>'Agak susah nak kesan dan perasan kehadiran mereka.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>439.84,'end_time'=>441.06,'target_text'=>'And they love being by the water.','source_text'=>'Dan biawak ini memang suka berada dekat tepi air.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>441.16,'end_time'=>442.94,'target_text'=>'So, you just got to be careful about the water.','source_text'=>'Jadi kena lebih berhati-hati bila dekat dengan kawasan air.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>443.04,'end_time'=>446.86,'target_text'=>'Okay, so that noise we heard was someone breaking a chair.','source_text'=>'Okey, bunyi patah yang kita dengar tadi tu rupa-rupanya ada orang patahkan kerusi.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>446.96,'end_time'=>452.86,'target_text'=>'Okay, so someone Yeah, those two people back there, they sat on a chair and it just broke cuz I heard a sound and there were','source_text'=>'Ya, dua orang di belakang sana tu duduk atas sebuah kerusi dan kerusi tu terus patah sebab saya dengar bunyi patah dan ada','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>452.96,'end_time'=>454.46,'target_text'=>'four people there and they broke a chair.','source_text'=>'empat orang di situ yang patahkan kerusi plastik tu.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>454.56,'end_time'=>456.54,'target_text'=>'But, I can see he brought it to the back there.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya nampak dia dah bawa kerusi rosak tu ke belakang sana.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>456.64,'end_time'=>457.5,'target_text'=>'But, it\'s a plastic chair.','source_text'=>'Kerusi plastik memang biasa macam tu.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>457.6,'end_time'=>459.62,'target_text'=>'Plastic chairs break quite often, so.','source_text'=>'Kerusi plastik memang kerap patah.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>459.72,'end_time'=>461.1,'target_text'=>'That\'s true, especially in the heat.','source_text'=>'Betul, terutamanya bila terdedah pada panas matahari.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>461.2,'end_time'=>461.94,'target_text'=>'They get brittle.','source_text'=>'Ia jadi rapuh (brittle).','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>462.04,'end_time'=>466.62,'target_text'=>'Yeah, they get very brittle and very fragile and then sometimes they break when you sit on them.','source_text'=>'Ya, plastik jadi sangat rapuh dan mudah patah bila diduduki.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>466.72,'end_time'=>471.26,'target_text'=>'Also, sometimes people will play pranks on their friends and run up and kick the back of their legs while their friend is','source_text'=>'Kadang-kadang ada orang suka bergurau kenakan kawan, mereka tendang kaki kerusi dari belakang masa kawan tengah','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>471.36,'end_time'=>473.34,'target_text'=>'sitting on it and it breaks with them on it.','source_text'=>'duduk sampai kerusi tu roboh sekali dengan orangnya.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>473.44,'end_time'=>473.94,'target_text'=>'It\'s funny.','source_text'=>'Memang kelakar.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>474.04,'end_time'=>474.44,'target_text'=>'>> that before.','source_text'=>'Pernah tengok benda tu sebelum ni.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>474.52,'end_time'=>475.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s pretty hilarious.','source_text'=>'Memang melucukan.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>475.32,'end_time'=>476.06,'target_text'=>'>> a lot of videos like that.','source_text'=>'Banyak video macam tu dekat internet.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>476.16,'end_time'=>476.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s funny.','source_text'=>'Kelakar betul.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>476.92,'end_time'=>477.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s funny.','source_text'=>'Memang lucu.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>477.6,'end_time'=>481.62,'target_text'=>'As long as they don\'t like fall down a hill after or something or off a house.','source_text'=>'Asalkan mereka tak jatuh terguling masuk gaung atau jatuh dari bangunan sudahlah.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>481.72,'end_time'=>486.46,'target_text'=>'But I think we\'re going to keep on walking through this this really beautiful park cuz it\'s like a nice time of day to come.','source_text'=>'Tapi rasanya kami nak teruskan berjalan menikmati taman yang indah ini sebab waktu sekarang memang sangat sesuai.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>486.56,'end_time'=>488.02,'target_text'=>'Like the sun is starting to set.','source_text'=>'Matahari dah mula perlahan-lahan terbenam.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>488.12,'end_time'=>490.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s a it\'s 5 almost 5:30 p.m.','source_text'=>'Sekarang dah hampir pukul 5:30 petang.','order'=>203],
