            ['start_time'=>199.64,'end_time'=>202.66,'target_text'=>'I don\'t drink that much coffee, so one is enough for me.','source_text'=>'Saya tak minum banyak sangat kopi, jadi secawan dah cukup untuk saya.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>202.76,'end_time'=>203.54,'target_text'=>'You already had one.','source_text'=>'Awak dah minum secawan tadi.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>203.64,'end_time'=>204.58,'target_text'=>'I don\'t drink coffee.','source_text'=>'Saya tak minum kopi.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>204.68,'end_time'=>207.38,'target_text'=>'I just drink water, but uh let\'s keep going.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma minum air kosong, tapi jom kita teruskan jalan.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>207.48,'end_time'=>217.14,'target_text'=>'If you want to get my 3,000 most common English words PDF to help you understand up to 95% of spoken English with real, clear','source_text'=>'Jika anda ingin dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling lazim untuk bantu anda faham sehingga 95% bahasa Inggeris pertuturan berserta definisi','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>217.24,'end_time'=>224.38,'target_text'=>'definitions and examples, organized by CEFR level and topic, then check out the link in my description to get it.','source_text'=>'dan contoh yang jelas mengikut tahap CEFR dan topik, sila semak pautan di ruangan penerangan saya untuk mendapatkannya.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>224.48,'end_time'=>225.78,'target_text'=>'So, this is that mosque.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini masjid itu.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>225.88,'end_time'=>226.54,'target_text'=>'>> No, this is not a mosque.','source_text'=>'Bukan, ini bukan masjid.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>226.64,'end_time'=>227.04,'target_text'=>'>> a mosque.','source_text'=>'Bukan masjid.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>227.04,'end_time'=>229.54,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a palace would be the closest thing.','source_text'=>'Bangunan ini lebih mirip kepada sebuah istana.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>229.64,'end_time'=>232.02,'target_text'=>'So, kings used to live here, or royalty?','source_text'=>'Jadi raja-raja pernah tinggal di sini, atau kerabat diraja?','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>232.12,'end_time'=>233.14,'target_text'=>'>> I believe so.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa begitu.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>233.24,'end_time'=>238.06,'target_text'=>'Don\'t quote me on it, but it\'s across the main mosque, which we saw on the way over here.','source_text'=>'Jangan anggap kata-kata saya 100% tepat, tapi ia terletak bertentangan dengan masjid utama yang kita nampak semasa dalam perjalanan ke sini tadi.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>238.16,'end_time'=>238.56,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>238.56,'end_time'=>244.02,'target_text'=>'>> But right now, the royalty lives closer to where we\'re staying, on that mountain that we see.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang, kerabat diraja tinggal lebih dekat dengan tempat penginapan kita, di atas bukit yang kita nampak itu.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>244.12,'end_time'=>249.22,'target_text'=>'>> I actually was watching a YouTube video, and apparently there are like dozens of royal families in Malaysia.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya saya pernah tonton video YouTube, rupa-rupanya ada berbelas-belas keluarga diraja di Malaysia.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>249.32,'end_time'=>250.62,'target_text'=>'There\'s like one for every province.','source_text'=>'Ada satu untuk setiap negeri (provinsi).','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>250.72,'end_time'=>251.12,'target_text'=>'Or Exactly.','source_text'=>'Tepat sekali.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>251.16,'end_time'=>252.5,'target_text'=>'And then there\'s like a main king.','source_text'=>'Dan kemudian ada seorang Yang di-Pertuan Agong utama.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>252.6,'end_time'=>252.72,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>252.72,'end_time'=>256.9,'target_text'=>'And every like couple years, I don\'t know how it exactly works, but the main king changes.','source_text'=>'Dan setiap beberapa tahun, saya tak tahu persis bagaimana sistemnya berfungsi, tapi Agong utama akan bertukar.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>257,'end_time'=>258.58,'target_text'=>'Like it changes between each family.','source_text'=>'Bergilir-gilir antara setiap keluarga diraja.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>258.68,'end_time'=>259.04,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>259.04,'end_time'=>261.78,'target_text'=>'Like main position, which I think is like super interesting.','source_text'=>'Mengisi jawatan utama itu, yang saya rasa sangat menarik.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>261.88,'end_time'=>264.74,'target_text'=>'So there are like a lot of royals in Malaysia.','source_text'=>'Jadi memang ada ramai kerabat diraja di Malaysia.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>264.84,'end_time'=>268.38,'target_text'=>'But it\'s super beautiful, like the architecture, like the brick.','source_text'=>'Tapi tempat ini sangat cantik, daripada segi seni bina dan susunan batanya.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>268.48,'end_time'=>271.02,'target_text'=>'And I like how it\'s all like a lighter color.','source_text'=>'Dan saya suka warnanya yang kelihatan cerah.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>271.12,'end_time'=>273.62,'target_text'=>'But I think it looks too clean, don\'t you think?','source_text'=>'Tapi saya rasa ia nampak terlalu bersih, awak rasa tak?','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>273.72,'end_time'=>277.3,'target_text'=>'Like I believe this is an old building, but it doesn\'t feel like it.','source_text'=>'Saya percaya ini bangunan lama bersejarah, tapi ia tidak terasa seperti bangunan lama.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>277.4,'end_time'=>280.94,'target_text'=>'Everything\'s freshly painted, and the bricks are freshly washed.','source_text'=>'Semuanya baru dicat semula, dan bata-bata ini baru dicuci bersih.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>281.04,'end_time'=>281.44,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>281.44,'end_time'=>282.66,'target_text'=>'I I don\'t mind it, to be honest.','source_text'=>'Saya tak kisah pun sebenarnya.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>282.76,'end_time'=>285.3,'target_text'=>'The color is nice, and it just looks just clean.','source_text'=>'Warnanya cantik, dan ia cuma nampak bersih.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>285.4,'end_time'=>285.48,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>285.48,'end_time'=>288.54,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never seen bricks this light, if I\'m being honest.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya saya tak pernah tengok bata secerah ini.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>288.64,'end_time'=>290.54,'target_text'=>'It just looks really clean to me.','source_text'=>'Pada pandangan saya ia nampak sangat bersih.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>290.64,'end_time'=>292.02,'target_text'=>'Like it doesn\'t look fake.','source_text'=>'Dan ia tidak nampak palsu.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>292.12,'end_time'=>295.38,'target_text'=>'If the bricks were like those deep orange bricks, I would not like it.','source_text'=>'Kalau bata itu jenis jingga pekat, saya pasti tak suka.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>295.48,'end_time'=>297.06,'target_text'=>'But this color is quite nice, actually.','source_text'=>'Tapi warna ini agak menarik sebenarnya.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>297.16,'end_time'=>299.54,'target_text'=>'>> Like those ones over there?','source_text'=>'Macam yang di sebelah sana itu ke?','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>299.64,'end_time'=>299.88,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>299.88,'end_time'=>303.46,'target_text'=>'That that I don\'t like the color of those bricks, personally.','source_text'=>'Yang itu saya secara peribadi tak suka warna bata macam itu.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>303.56,'end_time'=>305.46,'target_text'=>'But this this is nice.','source_text'=>'Tapi yang ini sangat elok.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>305.56,'end_time'=>306.94,'target_text'=>'Look at this tower.','source_text'=>'Tengok menara ini.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>307.04,'end_time'=>308.82,'target_text'=>'It has a spiral staircase, right?','source_text'=>'Ia ada tangga berpusing (spiral staircase), kan?','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>308.92,'end_time'=>309.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>309.48,'end_time'=>311.26,'target_text'=>'That\'ll be cool to go up there, honestly.','source_text'=>'Menarik juga kalau dapat naik ke atas sana, sejujurnya.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>311.36,'end_time'=>315.7,'target_text'=>'So this is a simple, polite framework when speaking in English.','source_text'=>'Jadi ini adalah rangka kerja mudah untuk bercakap secara sopan dalam bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>315.8,'end_time'=>320.5,'target_text'=>'Attention, request, reason, thanks, and exit.','source_text'=>'Perhatian, permintaan, alasan, terima kasih, dan pengakhiran.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>320.6,'end_time'=>322.1,'target_text'=>'Only five steps.','source_text'=>'Hanya lima langkah sahaja.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>322.2,'end_time'=>325.42,'target_text'=>'So the first thing you want to do is get attention politely.','source_text'=>'Langkah pertama yang anda mahu buat ialah tarik perhatian secara sopan.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>325.52,'end_time'=>331.06,'target_text'=>'You can do this by saying phrases like, \"Excuse me, sorry, or hi.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh lakukan ini dengan menggunakan ungkapan seperti, \"Excuse me, sorry, atau hi.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>331.16,'end_time'=>335.22,'target_text'=>'Sorry to bother you.\" The second step is to make the request.','source_text'=>'Sorry to bother you.\" Langkah kedua ialah membuat permintaan.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>335.32,'end_time'=>341.18,'target_text'=>'Some common phrases are, \"Could you, would you, can you, and may I?','source_text'=>'Beberapa frasa lazim ialah, \"Could you, would you, can you, dan may I?','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>341.28,'end_time'=>342.58,'target_text'=>'Could you help me?','source_text'=>'Boleh tolong saya? (Could you help me?)','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>342.68,'end_time'=>344.42,'target_text'=>'Would you take a photo of me?','source_text'=>'Boleh tolong ambil gambar saya? (Would you take a photo of me?)','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>344.52,'end_time'=>346.5,'target_text'=>'Can you tell me where this is?','source_text'=>'Boleh beritahu saya di mana tempat ini? (Can you tell me where this is?)','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>346.6,'end_time'=>348.3,'target_text'=>'May I sit here?','source_text'=>'Boleh saya duduk di sini? (May I sit here?)','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>348.4,'end_time'=>350.5,'target_text'=>'Those are some example sentences.','source_text'=>'Itu adalah beberapa contoh ayat.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>350.6,'end_time'=>353.18,'target_text'=>'Step three is to add a reason.','source_text'=>'Langkah ketiga ialah menambah alasan.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>353.28,'end_time'=>355.42,'target_text'=>'This makes you sound softer.','source_text'=>'Ini membuatkan pertuturan anda kedengaran lebih lembut dan mesra.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>355.52,'end_time'=>359.14,'target_text'=>'Some example starter sentences are I\'m not sure.','source_text'=>'Beberapa contoh pemula ayat ialah \"I\'m not sure\" (saya tak pasti).','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>359.24,'end_time'=>361.9,'target_text'=>'I\'m trying to I\'m a bit lost.','source_text'=>'\"I\'m trying to\" (saya sedang cuba), \"I\'m a bit lost\" (saya sesat sedikit).','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>362,'end_time'=>364.58,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m not sure where to go.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya tak pasti nak pergi ke mana.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>364.68,'end_time'=>367.1,'target_text'=>'I\'m trying to find the entrance.','source_text'=>'Saya sedang cuba cari pintu masuk.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>367.2,'end_time'=>369.34,'target_text'=>'And then finally, I\'m a bit lost.','source_text'=>'Dan akhirnya, saya sesat sedikit.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>369.44,'end_time'=>373.62,'target_text'=>'Usually people want to help you if you show a little bit of vulnerability.','source_text'=>'Kebiasaannya orang ramai sedia membantu jika anda menunjukkan sedikit rasa merendah diri dan memerlukan pertolongan.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>373.72,'end_time'=>377.3,'target_text'=>'For example, by saying Excuse me, I don\'t know where to go.','source_text'=>'Contohnya dengan berkata Maafkan saya, saya tak tahu nak pergi ke mana.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>377.4,'end_time'=>378.5,'target_text'=>'I\'m a bit lost.','source_text'=>'Saya sesat sedikit.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>378.6,'end_time'=>379.78,'target_text'=>'Can you help me?','source_text'=>'Boleh tolong saya?','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>379.88,'end_time'=>381.54,'target_text'=>'That\'s a good example sentence.','source_text'=>'Itu contoh ayat yang sangat baik.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>381.64,'end_time'=>383.66,'target_text'=>'And step four is to say thanks.','source_text'=>'Dan langkah keempat ialah mengucapkan terima kasih.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>383.76,'end_time'=>388.02,'target_text'=>'After they\'ve helped you, it\'s important to say thank you and to be polite.','source_text'=>'Selepas mereka membantu anda, sangat penting untuk ucapkan terima kasih dan berbudi bahasa.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>388.12,'end_time'=>395.46,'target_text'=>'Some examples are thank you, thanks a lot, I appreciate it, and I really appreciate it.','source_text'=>'Beberapa contohnya ialah thank you, thanks a lot, I appreciate it, dan I really appreciate it.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>395.56,'end_time'=>398.54,'target_text'=>'My favorite is thank you, I appreciate it.','source_text'=>'Kegemaran saya ialah \"Thank you, I appreciate it\" (Terima kasih, saya sangat menghargainya).','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>398.64,'end_time'=>401.1,'target_text'=>'And the fifth step is to exit politely.','source_text'=>'Dan langkah kelima ialah mengundur diri secara sopan.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>401.2,'end_time'=>405.9,'target_text'=>'Whether they help you or not, it\'s important to still be polite when you leave.','source_text'=>'Sama ada mereka bantu anda atau tidak, amat penting untuk kekal bersopan semasa anda beredar.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>406,'end_time'=>412.78,'target_text'=>'So, if they don\'t want to help you, you can say no worries or no problem or that\'s okay or have a nice day.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jika mereka tidak dapat bantu anda, anda boleh sebut \"no worries\" atau \"no problem\" atau \"that\'s okay\" atau \"have a nice day\".','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>412.88,'end_time'=>416.34,'target_text'=>'So, an example sentence is no worries, have a nice day.','source_text'=>'Contoh ayatnya ialah \"No worries, have a nice day\" (Tak mengapa, semoga hari anda menyenangkan).','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>416.44,'end_time'=>418.7,'target_text'=>'Or that\'s okay, don\'t worry about it.','source_text'=>'Atau \"That\'s okay, don\'t worry about it\" (Tak apa, jangan risau mengenainya).','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>418.8,'end_time'=>421.78,'target_text'=>'And then you can just go ask another person for help.','source_text'=>'Dan kemudian anda boleh pergi tanya orang lain untuk meminta bantuan.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>421.88,'end_time'=>423.54,'target_text'=>'And hopefully they help you.','source_text'=>'Dan semoga mereka dapat bantu anda.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>423.64,'end_time'=>428.98,'target_text'=>'Now, if someone asks you to do something and you can\'t, you can refuse politely.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jika seseorang meminta anda lakukan sesuatu dan anda tidak boleh, anda boleh tolak secara sopan.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>429.08,'end_time'=>436.82,'target_text'=>'For example, you can say sorry, I can\'t, not right now, sorry, maybe later, or I\'d rather not, sorry.','source_text'=>'Contohnya, anda boleh sebut minta maaf, saya tak dapat bantu (sorry, I can\'t), bukan sekarang, maaf ya (not right now, sorry), mungkin kemudian (maybe later), atau saya rasa tidaklah, maaf (I\'d rather not, sorry).','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>436.92,'end_time'=>441.54,'target_text'=>'Those are four examples you can say to politely refuse someone\'s request.','source_text'=>'Itu empat contoh yang boleh anda sebut untuk menolak permintaan seseorang secara sopan.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>441.64,'end_time'=>446.66,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys, now we\'re going to go through three shadowing practice scenarios.','source_text'=>'Baiklah semua, sekarang kita akan lalui tiga senario latihan teknik shadowing.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>446.76,'end_time'=>454.26,'target_text'=>'The first one, me and my brother will speak and the second two, I will speak and you will read the yellow caption and speak','source_text'=>'Yang pertama, saya dan abang saya akan bercakap dan dua yang seterusnya, saya akan bercakap dan anda baca kapsyen kuning serta jawab','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>454.36,'end_time'=>456.96,'target_text'=>'back to me.','source_text'=>'kepada saya.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>457.52,'end_time'=>460.18,'target_text'=>'Excuse me, could you take a photo of me, please?','source_text'=>'Maafkan saya, boleh tolong ambilkan gambar saya?','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>460.28,'end_time'=>460.98,'target_text'=>'Sure.','source_text'=>'Boleh, sudah tentu.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>461.08,'end_time'=>461.58,'target_text'=>'Thank you.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>461.68,'end_time'=>463.62,'target_text'=>'I really appreciate it.','source_text'=>'Saya benar-benar menghargainya.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>463.72,'end_time'=>465.1,'target_text'=>'No worries.','source_text'=>'Sama-sama, tiada masalah.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>465.2,'end_time'=>466.74,'target_text'=>'The photos look really good.','source_text'=>'Gambar-gambar ini nampak sangat cantik.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>466.84,'end_time'=>467.5,'target_text'=>'Thank you.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>467.6,'end_time'=>468.54,'target_text'=>'I\'m glad.','source_text'=>'Baguslah kalau begitu.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>468.64,'end_time'=>471,'target_text'=>'Have a nice day.','source_text'=>'Semoga hari anda menyenangkan.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>471.4,'end_time'=>473.06,'target_text'=>'Hi, sorry to bother you.','source_text'=>'Hai, maaf mengganggu.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>473.16,'end_time'=>474.54,'target_text'=>'I\'m a bit lost.','source_text'=>'Saya sesat sedikit.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>474.64,'end_time'=>476.92,'target_text'=>'Could you help me?','source_text'=>'Boleh tolong saya?','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>478.08,'end_time'=>482.44,'target_text'=>'Could you tell me where the entrance is, please?','source_text'=>'Boleh tolong beritahu saya di mana pintu masuknya?','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>483.84,'end_time'=>484.62,'target_text'=>'Thank you very much.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih banyak-banyak.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>484.72,'end_time'=>486.52,'target_text'=>'Bye.','source_text'=>'Jumpa lagi.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>487.2,'end_time'=>490.2,'target_text'=>'Now you guys go first.','source_text'=>'Sekarang giliran anda pula mulakan dahulu.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>492.96,'end_time'=>495.8,'target_text'=>'Sorry, not right now.','source_text'=>'Maaf, bukan sekarang.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>497.6,'end_time'=>498.06,'target_text'=>'You too.','source_text'=>'Awak juga.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>498.16,'end_time'=>499.06,'target_text'=>'Bye.','source_text'=>'Jumpa lagi.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>499.16,'end_time'=>501.94,'target_text'=>'Now let\'s talk about some common mistakes.','source_text'=>'Sekarang mari kita bincangkan beberapa kesilapan lazim.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>502.04,'end_time'=>505.86,'target_text'=>'The first one, give me something blank.','source_text'=>'Yang pertama, \"give me [sesuatu]\" (beri saya).','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>505.96,'end_time'=>510.06,'target_text'=>'Give me can sound too direct with strangers.','source_text'=>'\"Give me\" boleh kedengaran terlalu mendesak dan kasar dengan orang yang tidak dikenali.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>510.16,'end_time'=>513.86,'target_text'=>'Use could you or can I instead.','source_text'=>'Gunakan \"could you\" atau \"can I\" sebagai gantinya.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>513.96,'end_time'=>516.5,'target_text'=>'For example, could you help me?','source_text'=>'Contohnya, boleh tolong saya? (could you help me?)','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>516.6,'end_time'=>519.06,'target_text'=>'Or can I have this, please?','source_text'=>'Atau boleh saya dapatkan ini? (can I have this, please?)','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>519.16,'end_time'=>521.62,'target_text'=>'The second, I want.','source_text'=>'Yang kedua, \"I want\" (saya mahu).','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>521.72,'end_time'=>528.26,'target_text'=>'I want is okay with friends, but in public with strangers it can sound very strong.','source_text'=>'\"I want\" tiada masalah bila bersama kawan-kawan, tetapi di tempat awam dengan orang asing ia boleh kedengaran terlalu mendesak.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>528.36,'end_time'=>531.78,'target_text'=>'Use I\'d like or could I have.','source_text'=>'Gunakan \"I\'d like\" atau \"could I have\".','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>531.88,'end_time'=>535.1,'target_text'=>'For example, I\'d like a coffee, please.','source_text'=>'Contohnya, saya nak secawan kopi (I\'d like a coffee, please).','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>535.2,'end_time'=>538.42,'target_text'=>'Or could I have a coffee, please?','source_text'=>'Atau boleh saya dapatkan secawan kopi? (could I have a coffee, please?)','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>538.52,'end_time'=>541.62,'target_text'=>'Or may I have a coffee, please?','source_text'=>'Atau bolehkah saya minta secawan kopi? (may I have a coffee, please?)','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>541.72,'end_time'=>547.54,'target_text'=>'Those are all a lot softer and more polite than simply saying, I want a coffee.','source_text'=>'Semua itu jauh lebih lembut dan sopan berbanding sekadar menyebut, \"I want a coffee\".','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>547.64,'end_time'=>550.82,'target_text'=>'Third common mistake, you must.','source_text'=>'Kesilapan lazim ketiga, \"you must\" (awak mesti).','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>550.92,'end_time'=>553.82,'target_text'=>'You must sounds like an order.','source_text'=>'\"You must\" kedengaran seperti satu arahan/perintah.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>553.92,'end_time'=>559.78,'target_text'=>'Use you should for advice or could you for a request.','source_text'=>'Gunakan \"you should\" untuk nasihat atau \"could you\" untuk permintaan.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>559.88,'end_time'=>563.74,'target_text'=>'For example, could you speak slowly, please?','source_text'=>'Contohnya, boleh tolong bercakap perlahan sedikit? (could you speak slowly, please?)','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>563.84,'end_time'=>566.7,'target_text'=>'Or you should try this place.','source_text'=>'Atau awak patut cuba tempat ini (you should try this place).','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>566.8,'end_time'=>573.06,'target_text'=>'However, there are circumstances where you must make sense and it\'s honestly better to use.','source_text'=>'Namun begitu, ada situasi di mana \"you must\" sesuai dan sebenarnya lebih bagus digunakan.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>573.16,'end_time'=>581.3,'target_text'=>'For example, if something is so good and you say to someone, \"You must try this restaurant because it\'s so good.\" In that','source_text'=>'Contohnya, jika sesuatu itu terlalu sedap dan anda cakap pada seseorang, \"Awak mesti cuba restoran ini sebab ia sangat sedap.\" Dalam situasi','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>581.4,'end_time'=>587.42,'target_text'=>'case, it\'s fine because you are just talking about how good the restaurant or that place is.','source_text'=>'itu, ia tidak mengapa kerana anda cuma menyatakan betapa hebatnya restoran atau tempat tersebut.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>587.52,'end_time'=>589.06,'target_text'=>'You must try it.','source_text'=>'Awak mesti cuba tempat itu.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>589.16,'end_time'=>591.98,'target_text'=>'But if it sounds like an order, \"You must try this.','source_text'=>'Tetapi jika bunyinya seperti arahan, \"Awak mesti cuba ini.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>592.08,'end_time'=>592.9,'target_text'=>'You must go there.','source_text'=>'Awak mesti pergi sana.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>593,'end_time'=>598.02,'target_text'=>'You must do this.\" Then that could come off as rude and it sounds like you\'re ordering them.','source_text'=>'Awak mesti buat ini.\" Maka itu boleh dianggap biadab dan kedengaran seperti anda mengarah mereka.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>598.12,'end_time'=>603.94,'target_text'=>'But if you\'re using it more to express how good something is, \"Oh, you must try this.\" Then it\'s okay.','source_text'=>'Tetapi jika anda gunakannya untuk menyatakan betapa bagusnya sesuatu, \"Oh, awak mesti cuba ini.\" Maka itu tiada masalah.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>604.04,'end_time'=>607.02,'target_text'=>'It just depends on how you say it.','source_text'=>'Ia bergantung kepada cara anda menyatakannya.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>607.12,'end_time'=>613.42,'target_text'=>'And one final tip you could add to make it sound even more polite is to add please at the end.','source_text'=>'Dan satu tip terakhir yang anda boleh tambah supaya kedengaran lebih sopan ialah meletakkan \"please\" di hujung ayat.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>613.52,'end_time'=>616.66,'target_text'=>'This makes it sound more polite and softer.','source_text'=>'Ini menjadikannya kedengaran lebih beradab dan lembut.','order'=>208],
