            ['start_time'=>115.72,'end_time'=>116.62,'target_text'=>'So Oh, there it is.','source_text'=>'Jadi Oh, itu dia kedainya.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>116.72,'end_time'=>118.06,'target_text'=>'You could see it from here.','source_text'=>'Awak boleh nampak dari sini.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>118.16,'end_time'=>120.94,'target_text'=>'But honestly, you can walk in any of these streets and find something to eat.','source_text'=>'Tapi sejujurnya, awak boleh jalan di mana-mana lorong ini dan jumpa macam-macam makanan.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>121.04,'end_time'=>122.18,'target_text'=>'Like there\'s so many options.','source_text'=>'Ada terlalu banyak pilihan.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>122.28,'end_time'=>124.38,'target_text'=>'>> Honestly, if I see like a good pad thai here, I\'ll just stop.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, kalau saya nampak kedai pad thai yang sedap di sini, saya akan terus singgah.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>124.48,'end_time'=>126.38,'target_text'=>'But I just saw this place on TikTok.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya baru nampak tempat ini di TikTok.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>126.48,'end_time'=>131.42,'target_text'=>'Someone local recommended saying most underrated pad thai place that they\'ve eaten at.','source_text'=>'Ada penduduk tempatan syorkan dan kata ini tempat pad thai paling underrated yang mereka pernah makan.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>131.52,'end_time'=>132.9,'target_text'=>'But I don\'t know, we\'ll see.','source_text'=>'Tapi entahlah, kita tengok nanti.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>133,'end_time'=>133.58,'target_text'=>'We\'ll see what they say.','source_text'=>'Kita tengok macam mana rupanya.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>133.68,'end_time'=>135.82,'target_text'=>'I don\'t really want western food like bagels.','source_text'=>'Saya tak berapa teringin makanan barat macam bagel sekarang.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>135.92,'end_time'=>137.34,'target_text'=>'I mean, it\'s not that expensive actually.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, harganya tidaklah mahal sebenarnya.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>137.44,'end_time'=>140.42,'target_text'=>'70 baht, but I want thai food in Thailand.','source_text'=>'70 baht, tapi saya nak makanan Thai bila berada di Thailand.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>140.52,'end_time'=>142.34,'target_text'=>'And pad thai is definitely one of my favorites.','source_text'=>'Dan pad thai sememangnya antara makanan kegemaran saya.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>142.44,'end_time'=>144.1,'target_text'=>'>> What kind of thai food have you tried already?','source_text'=>'Makanan Thai jenis apa yang awak dah pernah rasa sebelum ini?','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>144.2,'end_time'=>145.02,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know the name.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu namanya.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>145.12,'end_time'=>145.86,'target_text'=>'What was that?','source_text'=>'Apa benda itu?','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>145.96,'end_time'=>146.78,'target_text'=>'Pork thing yesterday?','source_text'=>'Daging babi semalam itu?','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>146.88,'end_time'=>147.58,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>147.68,'end_time'=>149.98,'target_text'=>'But it was like that basil like spicy sauce.','source_text'=>'Tapi rasanya macam sos pedas daun selasih (basil).','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>150.08,'end_time'=>150.62,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>150.72,'end_time'=>151.86,'target_text'=>'This one\'s not that big.','source_text'=>'Kedai yang ini tidak berapa besar.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>151.96,'end_time'=>154.74,'target_text'=>'It looks like there\'s one inside another mall that\'s huge.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya ada satu lagi di dalam sebuah pusat beli-belah yang saiznya sangat besar.','order'=>65],
