            ['start_time'=>185.28,'end_time'=>189.74,'target_text'=>'>> Here we were just browsing through the t-shirts, mainly the t-shirts and some button-up shirts.','source_text'=>'Tadi kita cuma melihat-lihat kemeja-T, terutamanya kemeja-T dan beberapa kemeja berkancing.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>189.84,'end_time'=>199.5,'target_text'=>'If you want to get my 3,000 most common English words PDF to help you understand up to 95% of spoken English with real clear','source_text'=>'Jika anda ingin dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling lazim untuk bantu anda faham sehingga 95% bahasa Inggeris pertuturan berserta definisi','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>199.6,'end_time'=>206.78,'target_text'=>'definitions and examples organized by CEFR level and topic, then check out the link in my description to get it.','source_text'=>'dan contoh yang jelas mengikut tahap CEFR dan topik, sila semak pautan di ruangan penerangan saya untuk mendapatkannya.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>206.88,'end_time'=>208.62,'target_text'=>'Is this like a Japanese area or what?','source_text'=>'Adakah kawasan ini macam kawasan Jepun ke?','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>208.72,'end_time'=>210.34,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, Thai people love Japanese stuff.','source_text'=>'Kawan, orang Thai memang suka barangan Jepun.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>210.44,'end_time'=>212.22,'target_text'=>'You see like with the restaurants and stuff?','source_text'=>'Awak perasan tak dengan restoran-restorannya?','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>212.32,'end_time'=>215.62,'target_text'=>'Yeah, there is like a huge amount of Japanese restaurants.','source_text'=>'Ya, ada terlalu banyak restoran Jepun di sini.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>215.72,'end_time'=>219.46,'target_text'=>'I haven\'t seen like a country with that many Japanese restaurants and it\'s not like in a Japanese area.','source_text'=>'Saya belum pernah tengok negara yang ada sebanyak ini restoran Jepun dan ia bukannya dalam zon perkampungan Jepun pun.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>219.56,'end_time'=>220.38,'target_text'=>'They\'re just everywhere.','source_text'=>'Mereka buka di merata-rata tempat.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>220.48,'end_time'=>221.58,'target_text'=>'But I love Japanese food.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya memang suka makanan Jepun.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>221.68,'end_time'=>224.14,'target_text'=>'Like Japanese curry is one of my favorite dishes.','source_text'=>'Kari Jepun adalah salah satu hidangan kegemaran saya.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>224.24,'end_time'=>225.3,'target_text'=>'Like top five probably.','source_text'=>'Mungkin dalam lima teratas hidangan kegemaran saya.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>225.4,'end_time'=>225.72,'target_text'=>'Honestly.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>225.72,'end_time'=>226.9,'target_text'=>'>> Coco Ichibanya?','source_text'=>'Coco Ichibanya ke?','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>227,'end_time'=>228.42,'target_text'=>'Coco Curry from Japan, dude.','source_text'=>'Kari Coco dari Jepun, kawan.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>228.52,'end_time'=>229.3,'target_text'=>'Oh my gosh.','source_text'=>'Ya ampun.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>229.4,'end_time'=>230.78,'target_text'=>'That is one of my favorite.','source_text'=>'Itu salah satu makanan kegemaran saya.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>230.88,'end_time'=>231.34,'target_text'=>'I love that.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat sukakannya.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>231.44,'end_time'=>237.42,'target_text'=>'The first time I ever tried that, I was with my mom in Japan and we were in Kyoto looking for somewhere to eat and we saw','source_text'=>'Kali pertama saya cuba, saya bersama ibu saya di Jepun dan kami berada di Kyoto mencari tempat makan dan ternampak','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>237.52,'end_time'=>238.38,'target_text'=>'that, so we went in.','source_text'=>'kedai itu, jadi kami pun masuk.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>238.48,'end_time'=>241.74,'target_text'=>'We had that for dinner that night, too, and for the next couple days.','source_text'=>'Kami makan itu untuk makan malam pada hari itu, dan untuk beberapa hari seterusnya.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>241.84,'end_time'=>244.22,'target_text'=>'Anyways, we\'re going to go eat now, so let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, kita nak pergi makan sekarang, jadi jom.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>244.32,'end_time'=>251.18,'target_text'=>'This area, Phrom Phong, is like really popular with expats, obviously, but specifically with Japanese people.','source_text'=>'Kawasan ini, Phrom Phong, sememangnya sangat popular dengan ekspatriat, terutamanya dengan komuniti Jepun.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>251.28,'end_time'=>256.18,'target_text'=>'That\'s why there are a lot of Japanese restaurants, um Japanese stores, Japanese like everything.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah ada banyak restoran Jepun, kedai-kedai Jepun, macam semua benda gaya Jepun.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>256.28,'end_time'=>259.74,'target_text'=>'And there\'s also a Don Don Don Quijote.','source_text'=>'Dan ada juga Don Don Don Quijote.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>259.84,'end_time'=>260.42,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>260.52,'end_time'=>260.92,'target_text'=>'Don Quijote.','source_text'=>'Don Quijote.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>260.92,'end_time'=>262.22,'target_text'=>'>> Which is like really popular in Japan.','source_text'=>'Yang mana sangat popular di Jepun.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>262.32,'end_time'=>262.98,'target_text'=>'Don Quijote.','source_text'=>'Don Quijote.','order'=>114],
