            ['start_time'=>265.36,'end_time'=>266.66,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re going to go to that, too, today.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita akan ke sana juga hari ini.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>266.76,'end_time'=>268.78,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to visit Don Quijote, probably buy some stuff.','source_text'=>'Kita akan melawat Don Quijote, mungkin beli beberapa barang.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>268.88,'end_time'=>270.54,'target_text'=>'Definitely buy some Japanese snacks.','source_text'=>'Pastinya beli snek Jepun.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>270.64,'end_time'=>270.96,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>270.96,'end_time'=>277.82,'target_text'=>'I\'m not really a Japanese snack expert, but this area is popular with specifically Japanese people, whether they\'re like traveling','source_text'=>'Saya bukannya pakar snek Jepun, tapi kawasan ini sangat popular terutamanya dengan orang Jepun, sama ada melancong','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>277.92,'end_time'=>281.06,'target_text'=>'as tourists or living here as expats.','source_text'=>'sebagai pelancong atau menetap di sini sebagai ekspatriat.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>281.16,'end_time'=>283.14,'target_text'=>'Okay, so this is where we\'re going to stop for lunch.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jadi di sinilah kita akan singgah untuk makan tengah hari.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>283.24,'end_time'=>290.62,'target_text'=>'It was recommended on TikTok by someone and it actually has a user\'s choice by LINE MAN and a Grab thumbs up.','source_text'=>'Ia dicadangkan di TikTok oleh seseorang dan sebenarnya ia ada lencana User\'s Choice oleh LINE MAN dan pengiktirafan Grab.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>290.72,'end_time'=>291.66,'target_text'=>'Oh, it\'s closed.','source_text'=>'Oh, kedainya tutup.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>291.76,'end_time'=>292.5,'target_text'=>'Just coffee.','source_text'=>'Cuma bahagian kopi sahaja.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>292.6,'end_time'=>294.98,'target_text'=>'I think I saw this What did the sign out here say?','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya nampak Apa yang ditulis pada papan tanda di luar ini?','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>295.08,'end_time'=>296.66,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh, ya.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>296.76,'end_time'=>297.66,'target_text'=>'We apologize Okay.','source_text'=>'Kami memohon maaf Baiklah.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>297.76,'end_time'=>300.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s a pad thai place and a coffee shop, so that\'s why they\'re closed.','source_text'=>'Ini kedai pad thai dan kedai kopi, sebab itulah mereka tutup.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>300.96,'end_time'=>303.26,'target_text'=>'So, unfortunately,','source_text'=>'Jadi, malangnya,','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>303.36,'end_time'=>308.78,'target_text'=>'that pad thai restaurant was closed, but at least we were able to cut our key and now we\'re just walking beside this busy','source_text'=>'restoran pad thai itu ditutup, tapi sekurang-kurangnya kita sempat buat kunci pendua dan sekarang kita cuma berjalan di tepi jalan','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>308.88,'end_time'=>310.94,'target_text'=>'road down towards Thong Lor.','source_text'=>'yang sibuk ini menghala ke Thong Lor.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>311.04,'end_time'=>313.5,'target_text'=>'And this area is a lot quieter than I thought it would be.','source_text'=>'Dan kawasan ini jauh lebih tenang daripada apa yang saya bayangkan.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>313.6,'end_time'=>319.22,'target_text'=>'So, the stop back there, Phrom Phong Phong or whatever, that place was [music] busy, but in between these two stops it\'s not','source_text'=>'Stesen di belakang tadi, Phrom Phong atau apa namanya, tempat itu sangat sibuk, tapi di antara dua stesen ini suasananya tidak','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>319.32,'end_time'=>319.74,'target_text'=>'that busy.','source_text'=>'begitu sesak.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>319.84,'end_time'=>320.78,'target_text'=>'And everything is closed.','source_text'=>'Dan kebanyakan kedai tutup.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>320.88,'end_time'=>322.18,'target_text'=>'Like, look at all these stores.','source_text'=>'Tengok semua kedai-kedai ini.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>322.28,'end_time'=>323.62,'target_text'=>'Yeah, well, what day is it today?','source_text'=>'Ya, hari ini hari apa sebenarnya?','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>323.72,'end_time'=>328.42,'target_text'=>'>> Today is January 2nd, so everyone\'s probably on break for taking a holiday.','source_text'=>'Hari ini 2 Januari, jadi semua orang mungkin sedang bercuti sempena tahun baharu.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>328.52,'end_time'=>333.46,'target_text'=>'>> until the 4th, so Okay, holiday until the 4th, so all these stores and stuff are closed.','source_text'=>'sehingga 4 hari bulan, jadi Okey, cuti sampai 4 Januari, sebab itulah semua kedai ini tutup.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>333.56,'end_time'=>336.86,'target_text'=>'Pretty much like malls and like maybe big chains are open.','source_text'=>'Kebanyakannya cuma pusat beli-belah dan mungkin rangkaian kedai besar sahaja yang buka.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>336.96,'end_time'=>343.1,'target_text'=>'There\'s this cafe I want to go to called uh Come Coffee, so hopefully that\'s open cuz at least we could go and get a coffee','source_text'=>'Ada satu kafe yang saya nak pergi namanya Come Coffee, jadi harap-harap ia buka sebab sekurang-kurangnya kita boleh dapatkan kopi','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>343.2,'end_time'=>343.62,'target_text'=>'there.','source_text'=>'di sana.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>343.72,'end_time'=>349.54,'target_text'=>'We walked like 20 minutes, couldn\'t really hard to It was mostly just Japanese food and obviously I want to eat Thai food','source_text'=>'Kami dah berjalan sekitar 20 minit, agak susah Kebanyakannya cuma ada makanan Jepun dan saya tentunya nak makan makanan Thai','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>349.64,'end_time'=>351.06,'target_text'=>'so we\'re in 7-Eleven now.','source_text'=>'jadi sekarang kita berada di 7-Eleven.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>351.16,'end_time'=>352.06,'target_text'=>'Let me get the Hawaiian pizza.','source_text'=>'Biar saya ambil piza Hawaii ini.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>352.16,'end_time'=>353.26,'target_text'=>'I love Hawaiian pizza.','source_text'=>'Saya suka piza Hawaii.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>353.36,'end_time'=>354.1,'target_text'=>'Let me get this one.','source_text'=>'Biar saya ambil yang ini.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>354.2,'end_time'=>355.66,'target_text'=>'This and a water.','source_text'=>'Yang ini dan sebotol air.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>355.76,'end_time'=>357.18,'target_text'=>'This is going to be our lunch for today.','source_text'=>'Ini akan jadi makan tengah hari kita untuk hari ini.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>357.28,'end_time'=>359.3,'target_text'=>'I never had this toasty flavor before.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah cuba perisa sandwic bakar (toasty) ini sebelum ini.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>359.4,'end_time'=>362.26,'target_text'=>'You can let me know if you guys had it but it\'s like Oh, you can see a pineapple right there.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh beritahu saya kalau anda pernah rasa tapi ia macam Oh, anda boleh nampak nanas betul-betul di situ.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>362.36,'end_time'=>364.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s uh it\'s Hawaiian flavor.','source_text'=>'Ia adalah perisa Hawaii.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>364.16,'end_time'=>366.02,'target_text'=>'Ooh, it\'s hot.','source_text'=>'Ooh, panasnya.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>366.12,'end_time'=>368.58,'target_text'=>'It actually just tastes like Hawaiian pizza.','source_text'=>'Rasanya memang betul-betul macam piza Hawaii.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>368.68,'end_time'=>369.3,'target_text'=>'Like I\'m not going to lie.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tipu.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>369.4,'end_time'=>372.5,'target_text'=>'I mean >> I guess it literally is the same.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya Saya rasa bahannya memang sama.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>372.6,'end_time'=>374.42,'target_text'=>'I guess it literally is the same thing.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ia memang benda yang sama.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>374.52,'end_time'=>378.5,'target_text'=>'It could use a little more pizza sauce but it just dough, ham, cheese, and pizza sauce.','source_text'=>'Boleh tambah sedikit lagi sos piza tapi cuma ada doh, daging ham, keju, dan sos piza.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>378.6,'end_time'=>380.14,'target_text'=>'But overall, it\'s pretty good.','source_text'=>'Tapi secara keseluruhannya, ia agak sedap.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>380.24,'end_time'=>381.42,'target_text'=>'Maybe I would get it again.','source_text'=>'Mungkin saya akan beli lagi lain kali.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>381.52,'end_time'=>382.3,'target_text'=>'This is what it looks like.','source_text'=>'Macam inilah rupanya.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>382.4,'end_time'=>387.58,'target_text'=>'I do think the original one or not the original one but the triple cheese one, that one\'s fire so I\'ll probably just stick','source_text'=>'Saya rasa yang perisa asli atau bukan yang asli tapi yang triple cheese itu, yang itu memang padu jadi saya mungkin kekal','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>387.68,'end_time'=>388.18,'target_text'=>'with that one.','source_text'=>'dengan yang itu.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>388.28,'end_time'=>394.26,'target_text'=>'>> Honestly, I like the original like just without the triple cheese the best cuz that one gets the crispiest on the outside.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, saya paling suka yang biasa tanpa triple cheese sebab yang itu bahagian luarnya paling garing.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>394.36,'end_time'=>395.26,'target_text'=>'I like the triple cheese.','source_text'=>'Saya suka yang triple cheese.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>395.36,'end_time'=>397.78,'target_text'=>'Overall, I wouldn\'t say this is busting.','source_text'=>'Secara keseluruhan, saya takkan kata ini luar biasa lazat.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>397.88,'end_time'=>398.86,'target_text'=>'I would say it\'s fire.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya boleh kata ia memang padu.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>398.96,'end_time'=>399.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s fire.','source_text'=>'Memang sedap.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>399.56,'end_time'=>400.18,'target_text'=>'I would have it again.','source_text'=>'Saya sudi makan lagi.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>400.28,'end_time'=>405.64,'target_text'=>'Three young guys pointed at the sign and started laughing and then I read it.','source_text'=>'Tiga orang lelaki muda tadi tunjuk papan tanda itu dan mula ketawa dan kemudian saya membacanya.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>406.08,'end_time'=>407.46,'target_text'=>'But yeah, that\'s Say that word.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, itulah Sebut perkataan itu.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>407.56,'end_time'=>407.98,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom kita pergi.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>408.08,'end_time'=>409.54,'target_text'=>'What\'s that restaurant called?','source_text'=>'Apa nama restoran itu?','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>409.64,'end_time'=>413.02,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we\'re at Come Specialty Coffee.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang kita berada di Come Specialty Coffee.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>413.12,'end_time'=>415.54,'target_text'=>'If it\'s all dudes working there, I\'m going to be a little suspicious.','source_text'=>'Kalau semuanya pekerja lelaki di dalam itu, saya akan rasa agak curiga.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>415.64,'end_time'=>417.54,'target_text'=>'>> Hopefully they don\'t put anything too special inside my coffee.','source_text'=>'Harap-harap mereka tak letak apa-apa yang terlalu istimewa dalam kopi saya.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>417.64,'end_time'=>419.3,'target_text'=>'Dude, these are some nice vehicles here.','source_text'=>'Kawan, kereta-kereta di sini semuanya hebat.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>419.4,'end_time'=>419.94,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>420.04,'end_time'=>421.98,'target_text'=>'I guess everyone that comes here is just balling.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa semua orang yang datang ke sini memang berduit (kaya raya).','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>422.08,'end_time'=>422.86,'target_text'=>'For real, where is it?','source_text'=>'Betul-betul kaya raya, di manakah ia?','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>422.96,'end_time'=>423.86,'target_text'=>'Balling like that.','source_text'=>'Sangat berduit macam itu.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>423.96,'end_time'=>426.74,'target_text'=>'I think this whole thing is the coffee.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa keseluruhan bangunan ini kedai kopi.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>426.84,'end_time'=>428.58,'target_text'=>'I got their signature coffee.','source_text'=>'Saya pesan kopi istimewa mereka.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>428.68,'end_time'=>433.9,'target_text'=>'You guys will see and Leon just got a regular latte but I would like to sit inside but we can\'t film in there so we have to','source_text'=>'Anda semua akan nampak nanti dan Leon cuma pesan latte biasa tapi saya nak duduk di dalam cuma tak boleh merakam di sana jadi kita kena','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>434,'end_time'=>434.4,'target_text'=>'sit outside.','source_text'=>'duduk di luar.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>434.44,'end_time'=>435.22,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>435.32,'end_time'=>437.7,'target_text'=>'Now it\'s ringing so I\'m going to go grab it.','source_text'=>'Sekarang alat penggera dah berbunyi jadi saya akan pergi ambil kopi.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>437.8,'end_time'=>439.06,'target_text'=>'I\'ll be back.','source_text'=>'Saya akan kembali sekejap lagi.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>439.16,'end_time'=>441.02,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we got the coffees here.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, kita dah dapat kopi di sini.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>441.12,'end_time'=>443.5,'target_text'=>'This one is like the biscuit coffee.','source_text'=>'Yang ini macam kopi biskut.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>443.6,'end_time'=>444.86,'target_text'=>'This is uh Biscoff.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah Biscoff.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>444.96,'end_time'=>445.46,'target_text'=>'>> Biscoff, yeah.','source_text'=>'Biscoff, ya.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>445.56,'end_time'=>447.7,'target_text'=>'Well, they they call it the biscuit coffee but it\'s Biscoff.','source_text'=>'Mereka panggil kopi biskut tapi sebenarnya Biscoff.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>447.8,'end_time'=>450.26,'target_text'=>'But these actually look good and this is the name, Come.','source_text'=>'Tapi nampak sangat menyelerakan dan ini namanya, Come.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>450.36,'end_time'=>454.74,'target_text'=>'And these are just some paper coasters because you don\'t want to like stain the wood.','source_text'=>'Dan ini cuma alas cawan kertas sebab anda tak mahu tinggalkan kesan kotoran pada kayu.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>454.84,'end_time'=>457.42,'target_text'=>'I think this is whipped cream on mine.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa yang di atas kopi saya ini krim putar (whipped cream).','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>457.52,'end_time'=>460.2,'target_text'=>'Honestly, I thought it was ice cream.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, saya ingatkan ia aiskrim tadi.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>460.48,'end_time'=>462.06,'target_text'=>'I just realized I don\'t even like coffee.','source_text'=>'Saya baru tersedar saya langsung tak gemar kopi sebenarnya.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>462.16,'end_time'=>463.34,'target_text'=>'That\'s not going to taste like coffee.','source_text'=>'Yang itu takkan rasa macam kopi langsung.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>463.44,'end_time'=>464.22,'target_text'=>'I\'ll tell you that right now.','source_text'=>'Saya boleh beritahu awak sekarang.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>464.32,'end_time'=>465.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s going to be sweet.','source_text'=>'Ia pasti manis.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>465.28,'end_time'=>466.26,'target_text'=>'I have a straw here.','source_text'=>'Saya ada penyedut minuman di sini.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>466.36,'end_time'=>467.06,'target_text'=>'Let me open it.','source_text'=>'Biar saya buka bungkusannya.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>467.16,'end_time'=>470.9,'target_text'=>'Yeah, honestly, I think I would just prefer a Thai milk tea, but I don\'t think they had that on the menu.','source_text'=>'Ya, sejujurnya, saya rasa saya lebih suka teh susu Thai (Thai milk tea), tapi saya rasa tiada dalam menu mereka.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>471,'end_time'=>472.62,'target_text'=>'But this is like a co-working area.','source_text'=>'Tapi ini macam kawasan ruang kerja bersama (co-working space).','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>472.72,'end_time'=>474.94,'target_text'=>'I assume the Wi-Fi is probably pretty good here.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa sambungan Wi-Fi di sini agak laju.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>475.04,'end_time'=>476.58,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to actually do a Wi-Fi test.','source_text'=>'Saya sebenarnya nak buat ujian kelajuan Wi-Fi.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>476.68,'end_time'=>479.46,'target_text'=>'But this is a nice area, but it\'s kind of like far from where I am.','source_text'=>'Tapi kawasan ini memang menarik, cuma agak jauh dari tempat tinggal saya.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>479.56,'end_time'=>481.96,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try this now.','source_text'=>'Jom kita rasa sekarang.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>483.04,'end_time'=>484.46,'target_text'=>'Okay, that is very sweet.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, rasanya sangat manis.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>484.56,'end_time'=>486.66,'target_text'=>'I\'m not the biggest fan of coffee, but it\'s good.','source_text'=>'Saya bukannya peminat tegar kopi, tapi rasanya sedap.','order'=>212],
