            ['start_time'=>488.64,'end_time'=>490.82,'target_text'=>'Think you come here more for the vibes than the coffee.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam orang datang sini lebih kerana suasananya (vibes) berbanding kopinya.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>490.92,'end_time'=>491.82,'target_text'=>'All the vibes are good.','source_text'=>'Suasananya memang menarik.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>491.92,'end_time'=>493.62,'target_text'=>'Like this is a nice area.','source_text'=>'Tempat ini kawasan yang cantik.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>493.72,'end_time'=>498.22,'target_text'=>'But yeah, we\'re going to finish these coffees and then go to Don Quijote, which is literally like the next building over.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, kita akan habiskan kopi ini dan kemudian pergi ke Don Quijote, yang terletak betul-betul di bangunan sebelah.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>498.32,'end_time'=>499.34,'target_text'=>'So it\'s right beside us.','source_text'=>'Jadi ia bersebelahan sahaja dengan kita.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>499.44,'end_time'=>500.94,'target_text'=>'And if you\'re Japanese, you know what it is.','source_text'=>'Dan kalau anda orang Jepun, anda pasti tahu kedai apa ini.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>501.04,'end_time'=>503.94,'target_text'=>'And if you\'re not Japanese, watch the video and you\'ll find out what it is.','source_text'=>'Dan kalau anda bukan orang Jepun, tonton video ini dan anda akan tahu apa itu Don Quijote.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>504.04,'end_time'=>505.26,'target_text'=>'Don Quijote.','source_text'=>'Don Quijote.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>505.36,'end_time'=>506.9,'target_text'=>'And I\'m sure you guys know their song.','source_text'=>'Dan saya pasti anda semua tahu lagu tema mereka.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>507,'end_time'=>509.3,'target_text'=>'Don don don Don Quijote.','source_text'=>'Don don don Don Quijote.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>509.4,'end_time'=>509.94,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Ya, entahlah.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>510.04,'end_time'=>512.02,'target_text'=>'I don\'t really have a good beat, but anyways, let\'s go in here.','source_text'=>'Rentak nyanyian saya tak berapa kena, tapi apa-apa pun, jom kita masuk.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>512.12,'end_time'=>514.3,'target_text'=>'They actually have indoor sports as well.','source_text'=>'Mereka sebenarnya ada sukan dalam bangunan juga.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>514.4,'end_time'=>519.38,'target_text'=>'They have like this drum thing, soccer, rock climbing, baseball, cool, and basketball.','source_text'=>'Ada permainan dram, bola sepak, memanjat tembok batu, besbol, menarik, dan bola keranjang.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>519.48,'end_time'=>520.14,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go in.','source_text'=>'Jom kita masuk ke dalam.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>520.24,'end_time'=>521.66,'target_text'=>'Dude, this looks good.','source_text'=>'Kawan, ini nampak sedap.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>521.76,'end_time'=>522.58,'target_text'=>'That does look good.','source_text'=>'Memang nampak sangat sedap.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>522.68,'end_time'=>525.26,'target_text'=>'>> like a rice crispies, but this flavor.','source_text'=>'Macam rice crispies, tapi perisa ini.','order'=>231],
