            ['start_time'=>574,'end_time'=>574.54,'target_text'=>'Nah.','source_text'=>'Tak naklah.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>574.64,'end_time'=>575.34,'target_text'=>'I like grape.','source_text'=>'Saya suka anggur.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>575.44,'end_time'=>581.22,'target_text'=>'Genuinely, I\'m not really sure what\'s like popular to get, but I do think people spend a lot >> Don\'t you love matcha?','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, saya tak berapa pasti barang apa yang popular di sini, tapi saya rasa orang berbelanja banyak Awak tak suka matcha ke?','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>581.32,'end_time'=>582.66,'target_text'=>'I don\'t.','source_text'=>'Tak suka.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>582.76,'end_time'=>583.94,'target_text'=>'I do not like matcha.','source_text'=>'Saya memang tak suka matcha.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>584.04,'end_time'=>585.1,'target_text'=>'Do I need anything?','source_text'=>'Ada apa-apa barang yang saya perlukan ke?','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>585.2,'end_time'=>585.86,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think so.','source_text'=>'Rasanya tak ada.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>585.96,'end_time'=>587.42,'target_text'=>'Maybe some figurine.','source_text'=>'Mungkin patung figura.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>587.52,'end_time'=>591.74,'target_text'=>'I\'m not really a good consumer unless it\'s Apple products.','source_text'=>'Saya bukanlah pembeli tegar barangan melainkan produk Apple.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>591.84,'end_time'=>593.14,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we got these gummies.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jadi kita dah beli gula-gula getah (gummies) ini.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>593.24,'end_time'=>597.1,'target_text'=>'I\'ve had these before in Korea, but I didn\'t really see anything else I wanted in there.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah makan ini sebelum ini di Korea, tapi saya tak nampak benda lain yang saya nak di dalam tadi.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>597.2,'end_time'=>603.86,'target_text'=>'We just walked around I\'m sure if you like shopping, that store is really good, but I\'m not really a huge shopper, but this','source_text'=>'Kami cuma berjalan-jalan Saya pasti kalau anda suka membeli-belah, kedai itu memang sangat bagus, cuma saya bukan jenis suka bershopping, tapi macam','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>603.96,'end_time'=>604.82,'target_text'=>'is what they look like.','source_text'=>'inilah rupanya.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>604.92,'end_time'=>608.04,'target_text'=>'They kind of do actually look like grapes.','source_text'=>'Bentuknya memang betul-betul macam buah anggur.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>609.28,'end_time'=>611.5,'target_text'=>'And you can like peel the skin back.','source_text'=>'Dan anda boleh kupas kulit luarnya.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>611.6,'end_time'=>612.5,'target_text'=>'Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'Oh, wah.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>612.6,'end_time'=>613.74,'target_text'=>'Very soft.','source_text'=>'Sangat lembut.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>613.84,'end_time'=>617.7,'target_text'=>'They are like similar to grape and they are very, very sweet.','source_text'=>'Rasanya mirip buah anggur dan ia sangat, sangat manis.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>617.8,'end_time'=>618.46,'target_text'=>'Ooh.','source_text'=>'Ooh.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>618.56,'end_time'=>619.58,'target_text'=>'They\'re overall pretty good though.','source_text'=>'Secara keseluruhannya ia agak sedap.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>619.68,'end_time'=>624.06,'target_text'=>'There are like a lot of flavors though, but I always just get the grape one.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak perisa sebenarnya, tapi saya selalu beli perisa anggur sahaja.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>624.16,'end_time'=>628.38,'target_text'=>'That right there, or those buildings right there, those are all high-rise buildings.','source_text'=>'Yang di sebelah sana itu, atau bangunan-bangunan itu, semuanya adalah bangunan tinggi (high-rise).','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>628.48,'end_time'=>632.06,'target_text'=>'And I believe they are connected, but those are high-rise apartments.','source_text'=>'Dan saya percaya ia bersambung, itu adalah pangsapuri bertingkat tinggi.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>632.16,'end_time'=>636.02,'target_text'=>'Okay, so right now we\'re walking on the sidewalk beside the road.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi sekarang kita sedang berjalan di laluan pejalan kaki di tepi jalan raya.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>636.12,'end_time'=>640.5,'target_text'=>'There is a mall just across the road, as you can see.','source_text'=>'Ada pusat beli-belah di seberang jalan, seperti yang anda boleh lihat.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>640.6,'end_time'=>642.46,'target_text'=>'There\'s a mall across the road.','source_text'=>'Ada sebuah pusat beli-belah di seberang jalan.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>642.56,'end_time'=>646.34,'target_text'=>'And question guys, what do you do when you want to go from this side to that side?','source_text'=>'Dan soalan untuk kawan-kawan semua, apa yang anda buat bila anda mahu pergi dari sebelah sini ke sebelah sana?','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>646.44,'end_time'=>650.94,'target_text'=>'Cross the road, go across the road, or go through the road?','source_text'=>'Cross the road, go across the road, atau go through the road?','order'=>285],
