            ['start_time'=>1.68,'end_time'=>8.6,'target_text'=>'Today, we\'re going to be learning easy English using comprehensible input.','source_text'=>'Hari ini, kita akan belajar bahasa Inggeris mudah menggunakan input yang mudah difahami (comprehensible input).','order'=>2],
            ['start_time'=>13.1,'end_time'=>14.9,'target_text'=>'>> [music]','source_text'=>'[muzik]','order'=>3],
            ['start_time'=>17.84,'end_time'=>20.9,'target_text'=>'>> Start the workout, and let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Mulakan latihan perkataan, dan jom kita pergi.','order'=>4],
            ['start_time'=>21,'end_time'=>27.94,'target_text'=>'So, this is a big water bottle, and it comes with a handle because it\'s very heavy.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini adalah botol air yang besar, dan ia dilengkapi pemegang kerana ia sangat berat.','order'=>5],
            ['start_time'=>28.04,'end_time'=>30.78,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s easier to carry it with the handle.','source_text'=>'Jadi, lebih mudah untuk membawanya menggunakan pemegang itu.','order'=>6],
            ['start_time'=>30.88,'end_time'=>33.54,'target_text'=>'And up here, that is a bug catcher.','source_text'=>'Dan di atas sini, itu adalah perangkap serangga.','order'=>7],
            ['start_time'=>33.64,'end_time'=>38.3,'target_text'=>'It attracts the bugs with the light, and then you can see they stick onto the black part there.','source_text'=>'Ia menarik perhatian serangga dengan cahaya, dan kemudian anda boleh lihat mereka melekat pada bahagian hitam di situ.','order'=>8],
            ['start_time'=>38.4,'end_time'=>40.42,'target_text'=>'A bug catcher.','source_text'=>'Perangkap serangga.','order'=>9],
            ['start_time'=>40.52,'end_time'=>42.22,'target_text'=>'Over here, we have a freezer.','source_text'=>'Di sebelah sini pula, kita ada peti beku.','order'=>10],
            ['start_time'=>42.32,'end_time'=>44.78,'target_text'=>'There is ice inside the freezer.','source_text'=>'Ada ais di dalam peti beku ini.','order'=>11],
            ['start_time'=>44.88,'end_time'=>46.78,'target_text'=>'But, we are not looking for ice.','source_text'=>'Tapi, kita bukan mencari ais.','order'=>12],
            ['start_time'=>46.88,'end_time'=>49.14,'target_text'=>'We are looking to eat real food.','source_text'=>'Kita nak cari makanan sebenar.','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>49.24,'end_time'=>54.38,'target_text'=>'Although, I don\'t know how real the food is if it\'s from 7-Eleven.','source_text'=>'Walaupun begitu, saya tak pasti sejauh mana makanan ini \'sebenar\' kalau ia dari 7-Eleven.','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>54.48,'end_time'=>55.18,'target_text'=>'Oh, we\'ll see.','source_text'=>'Kita tengok nanti.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>55.28,'end_time'=>56.62,'target_text'=>'You\'ll be surprised.','source_text'=>'Awak pasti akan terkejut.','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>56.72,'end_time'=>60.14,'target_text'=>'So, what drink are you looking to get?','source_text'=>'Jadi, minuman apa yang awak cari?','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>60.24,'end_time'=>63.6,'target_text'=>'This has just caught my eye.','source_text'=>'Yang ini baru sahaja menarik perhatian saya.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>64.24,'end_time'=>66.7,'target_text'=>'What isn\'t this a lychee or litchi?','source_text'=>'Bukankah ini laici?','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>66.8,'end_time'=>68.74,'target_text'=>'>> Lychee, I think that is the right pronunciation.','source_text'=>'Lychee, saya rasa itu sebutan yang betul.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>68.84,'end_time'=>69.82,'target_text'=>'>> People pronounce it differently.','source_text'=>'Orang sebut dengan cara berbeza.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>69.92,'end_time'=>70.98,'target_text'=>'I\'ve heard litchi.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah dengar litchi.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>71.08,'end_time'=>71.94,'target_text'=>'I\'ve heard lychee.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah dengar lychee.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>72.04,'end_time'=>75.5,'target_text'=>'Me, personally, I say lychee, but this is a type of fruit.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya secara peribadi, saya sebut laici (lychee), tapi ini sejenis buah.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>75.6,'end_time'=>76.74,'target_text'=>'I think I want to try this.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya nak cuba yang ini.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>76.84,'end_time'=>77.9,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never seen it before.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah nampak sebelum ini.','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>78,'end_time'=>79.54,'target_text'=>'Actually, let me try the smaller one.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya, biar saya cuba yang saiz lebih kecil.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>79.64,'end_time'=>81.54,'target_text'=>'What\'s that green one on the end?','source_text'=>'Apa yang warna hijau di bahagian hujung itu?','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>81.64,'end_time'=>84.5,'target_text'=>'This one is banana','source_text'=>'Yang ini perisa pisang','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>84.6,'end_time'=>85.42,'target_text'=>'pineapple.','source_text'=>'nanas.','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>85.52,'end_time'=>86.38,'target_text'=>'No way.','source_text'=>'Biar betul.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>86.48,'end_time'=>88.3,'target_text'=>'Banana, orange, and pineapple.','source_text'=>'Pisang, oren, dan nanas.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>88.4,'end_time'=>88.98,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>89.08,'end_time'=>90.7,'target_text'=>'But, I\'m just going to try the lychee.','source_text'=>'Tapi, saya cuma nak cuba perisa laici.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>90.8,'end_time'=>98.42,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never had this flavor, and I like lychee, so I\'m going to buy this and try it, and I will let you guys know how good','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah rasa perisa ini, dan saya suka laici, jadi saya akan beli dan cuba, dan saya akan beritahu anda semua betapa sedapnya','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>98.52,'end_time'=>98.88,'target_text'=>'it is.','source_text'=>'air ini.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>98.88,'end_time'=>100.22,'target_text'=>'What drink do you want?','source_text'=>'Awak nak minuman apa?','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>100.32,'end_time'=>105.98,'target_text'=>'Do you want a soda, or do you want a tea, or a juice, or water, or milk?','source_text'=>'Awak nak air bikarbonat, atau awak nak teh, jus, air mineral, atau susu?','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>106.08,'end_time'=>110.34,'target_text'=>'I think I want something not carbonated, so I\'m going to go with OJ.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya nak sesuatu yang tidak berkarbonat, jadi saya mungkin pilih jus oren (OJ).','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>110.44,'end_time'=>111.34,'target_text'=>'That\'s alcoholic.','source_text'=>'Itu minuman beralkohol.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>111.44,'end_time'=>112.66,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to get a tea.','source_text'=>'Saya nak ambil teh.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>112.76,'end_time'=>116.18,'target_text'=>'If you see a lemon tea, that\'d be good.','source_text'=>'Kalau awak nampak teh lemon, itu bagus juga.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>116.28,'end_time'=>117.5,'target_text'=>'A lemon tea?','source_text'=>'Teh lemon?','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>117.6,'end_time'=>118.14,'target_text'=>'Yep.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>118.24,'end_time'=>118.78,'target_text'=>'Right there.','source_text'=>'Betul-betul di situ.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>118.88,'end_time'=>121.14,'target_text'=>'Oh, no, that\'s green tea honey lemon.','source_text'=>'Oh, tidak, itu teh hijau madu lemon.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>121.24,'end_time'=>124.68,'target_text'=>'Honey lemon up there, second row.','source_text'=>'Madu lemon di atas sana, baris kedua.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>124.84,'end_time'=>125.54,'target_text'=>'Honey lemon.','source_text'=>'Madu lemon.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>125.64,'end_time'=>126.38,'target_text'=>'This looks good.','source_text'=>'Ini nampak sedap.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>126.48,'end_time'=>128.42,'target_text'=>'Maybe I should get this, but I want to try this flavor.','source_text'=>'Mungkin saya patut ambil yang ini, tapi saya nak cuba perisa tadi.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>128.52,'end_time'=>131.22,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never seen this flavor, so I will just get this one.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah nampak perisa ini, jadi saya ambil yang ini sajalah.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>131.32,'end_time'=>132.58,'target_text'=>'So, we got the bevs.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita dah dapat minuman.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>132.68,'end_time'=>134.26,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s get a snack.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom cari snek makanan ringan pula.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>134.36,'end_time'=>135.34,'target_text'=>'Oh, dude, look at this.','source_text'=>'Oh, kawan, tengok ini.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>135.44,'end_time'=>136.66,'target_text'=>'This is seaweed.','source_text'=>'Ini rumpai laut.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>136.76,'end_time'=>138.14,'target_text'=>'Seaweed or fish strips?','source_text'=>'Rumpai laut atau jalur jejari ikan?','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>138.24,'end_time'=>139.82,'target_text'=>'>> This is fish strips.','source_text'=>'Ini jalur jejari ikan.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>139.92,'end_time'=>140.74,'target_text'=>'Usually it\'s squid.','source_text'=>'Biasanya ia sotong.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>140.84,'end_time'=>141.82,'target_text'=>'Like here, these are squid.','source_text'=>'Macam di sini, ini sotong.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>141.92,'end_time'=>143.06,'target_text'=>'>> These are squid, yeah.','source_text'=>'Ini sotong, ya.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>143.16,'end_time'=>143.58,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>143.68,'end_time'=>145.42,'target_text'=>'But anyways, what chips do you want?','source_text'=>'Tapi apa-apa pun, kerepek apa yang awak nak?','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>145.52,'end_time'=>146.5,'target_text'=>'You said these are popular.','source_text'=>'Awak kata yang ini popular.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>146.6,'end_time'=>147.54,'target_text'=>'Have you had these before?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah makan ini sebelum ini?','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>147.64,'end_time'=>150.74,'target_text'=>'I\'ve had the shrimp ones and they\'re good.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah makan yang perisa udang dan rasanya sedap.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>150.84,'end_time'=>151.38,'target_text'=>'These ones?','source_text'=>'Yang ini ke?','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>151.48,'end_time'=>151.9,'target_text'=>'Yes.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>152,'end_time'=>153.66,'target_text'=>'They kind of look like onion rings.','source_text'=>'Rupa bentuknya macam gegelang bawang (onion rings).','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>153.76,'end_time'=>155.02,'target_text'=>'They look like onion rings.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam gegelang bawang.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>155.12,'end_time'=>156.66,'target_text'=>'This looks cool.','source_text'=>'Ini nampak menarik.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>156.76,'end_time'=>160.22,'target_text'=>'But the one I would like to try These look good.','source_text'=>'Tapi yang saya nak cuba Yang ini nampak sedap.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>160.32,'end_time'=>161.22,'target_text'=>'Those look delicious.','source_text'=>'Nampak sangat lazat.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>161.32,'end_time'=>162.02,'target_text'=>'I would try those.','source_text'=>'Saya nak cuba yang itu.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>162.12,'end_time'=>162.78,'target_text'=>'What about these ones?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana dengan yang ini pula?','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>162.88,'end_time'=>164.58,'target_text'=>'They look like little These Cheetos look good.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam kecil Cheetos ini nampak sedap.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>164.68,'end_time'=>166.06,'target_text'=>'Cheesy Cheetos.','source_text'=>'Cheetos berperisa keju.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>166.16,'end_time'=>168.38,'target_text'=>'Corn, [clears throat] butter roasted corn flavor.','source_text'=>'Jagung, perisa jagung bakar mentega.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>168.48,'end_time'=>169.46,'target_text'=>'What is this flavor?','source_text'=>'Perisa apa ini?','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>169.56,'end_time'=>170.22,'target_text'=>'Just cheese.','source_text'=>'Keju sahaja.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>170.32,'end_time'=>175.18,'target_text'=>'I haven\'t had Cheetos in a very, very long time, so I think I\'ll go with this Cheeto flavor.','source_text'=>'Dah sangat, sangat lama saya tak makan Cheetos, jadi saya rasa saya akan pilih perisa Cheetos ini.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>175.28,'end_time'=>177.18,'target_text'=>'What flavor of chips do you want?','source_text'=>'Kerepek perisa apa yang awak nak?','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>177.28,'end_time'=>178.74,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>178.84,'end_time'=>180.82,'target_text'=>'Maybe I\'ll try these chicken skins here.','source_text'=>'Mungkin saya akan cuba kulit ayam goreng di sini.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>180.92,'end_time'=>181.46,'target_text'=>'Chicken skins?','source_text'=>'Kulit ayam?','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>181.56,'end_time'=>182.86,'target_text'=>'>> Those are almost chips.','source_text'=>'Yang itu hampir macam kerepek.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>182.96,'end_time'=>185.26,'target_text'=>'I have never seen chicken skin.','source_text'=>'Saya belum pernah tengok kerepek kulit ayam.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>185.36,'end_time'=>186.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s actual chicken skin.','source_text'=>'Ini betul-betul kulit ayam sebenar.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>186.52,'end_time'=>186.98,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>187.08,'end_time'=>187.48,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>187.56,'end_time'=>188.74,'target_text'=>'Well, we\'re getting chicken skin.','source_text'=>'Kalau begitu, kita ambil kulit ayam ini.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>188.84,'end_time'=>192.42,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s get the main course, an actual like entree.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita cari hidangan utama, hidangan berat yang sebenar.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>192.52,'end_time'=>192.92,'target_text'=>'Right here.','source_text'=>'Betul-betul di sini.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>192.92,'end_time'=>193.86,'target_text'=>'There\'s our entree.','source_text'=>'Ada hidangan utama kita.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>193.96,'end_time'=>195.02,'target_text'=>'Protein snack.','source_text'=>'Makanan ringan berprotein.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>195.12,'end_time'=>195.62,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>195.72,'end_time'=>199.5,'target_text'=>'Okay, so these are all the entrees you can have.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jadi ini semua hidangan utama yang anda boleh pilih.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>199.6,'end_time'=>200.86,'target_text'=>'So, this will be our lunch.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini akan jadi makan tengah hari kita.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>200.96,'end_time'=>202.26,'target_text'=>'So, we have all these options.','source_text'=>'Kita ada pelbagai pilihan ini.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>202.36,'end_time'=>208.1,'target_text'=>'These are lunches you can warm up and these you can probably eat cold, but I think they taste better warmed up and these are','source_text'=>'Ini adalah set makan tengah hari yang boleh anda panaskan dan yang ini mungkin boleh dimakan sejuk, tapi saya rasa lebih sedap dipanaskan dahulu dan ini adalah','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>208.2,'end_time'=>209.78,'target_text'=>'toasties, like sandwiches.','source_text'=>'sandwic bakar (toasties).','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>209.88,'end_time'=>211.14,'target_text'=>'What do you want?','source_text'=>'Awak nak yang mana satu?','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>211.24,'end_time'=>213.26,'target_text'=>'I think I\'ll have one of these lunches here.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya nak ambil salah satu set makan tengah hari di sini.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>213.36,'end_time'=>216.26,'target_text'=>'>> I had them last time I was in Thailand and they were actually really good.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah makan ini kali terakhir saya ke Thailand dan rasanya memang sangat sedap.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>216.36,'end_time'=>218.86,'target_text'=>'They do a good job at making them taste good.','source_text'=>'Mereka memang pandai buat rasa makanan ini sedap.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>218.96,'end_time'=>221.62,'target_text'=>'They taste just like the real thing or no?','source_text'=>'Rasanya sama macam makanan yang baru dimasak ke?','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>221.72,'end_time'=>222.9,'target_text'=>'I think really close.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa sangat mirip.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>223,'end_time'=>225.58,'target_text'=>'I had one of these noodle ones and they were delicious.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah makan yang jenis mi ini dan rasanya sangat lazat.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>225.68,'end_time'=>226.66,'target_text'=>'Maybe this one here.','source_text'=>'Mungkin yang ini di sebelah sini.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>226.76,'end_time'=>227.5,'target_text'=>'Ooh.','source_text'=>'Ooh.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>227.6,'end_time'=>229.78,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I had one of these noodles and they were quite good.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya pernah makan mi jenis ini dan rasanya agak sedap.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>229.88,'end_time'=>231.18,'target_text'=>'There are a lot of choices.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak pilihan.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>231.28,'end_time'=>233.14,'target_text'=>'This looks like seafood.','source_text'=>'Ini nampak seperti makanan laut.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>233.24,'end_time'=>234.7,'target_text'=>'It does say in English there.','source_text'=>'Ada tertulis dalam bahasa Inggeris di situ.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>234.8,'end_time'=>240.3,'target_text'=>'Well, I\'ve always liked curries, so these ones Oh, and if you\'re missing your Korean food, here you go.','source_text'=>'Saya memang selalu suka kari, jadi yang ini Oh, dan kalau anda rindu makanan Korea, ini dia.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>240.4,'end_time'=>244.02,'target_text'=>'So, we have our drink, our meal, and a snack.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita dah dapat minuman, makanan utama, dan makanan ringan.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>244.12,'end_time'=>246.46,'target_text'=>'And the only thing we\'re missing is dessert.','source_text'=>'Dan satu-satunya perkara yang tinggal ialah pencuci mulut.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>246.56,'end_time'=>248.62,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re going to choose a dessert here.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita akan pilih pencuci mulut di sini.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>248.72,'end_time'=>255.7,'target_text'=>'There are many choices, so I\'m not sure what I want, but I\'ll choose one and you guys will see me eat it, try it, and rate','source_text'=>'Ada banyak pilihan, jadi saya tak pasti apa yang saya nak, tapi saya akan pilih satu dan anda semua akan lihat saya makan, cuba, dan beri','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>255.8,'end_time'=>256.2,'target_text'=>'it.','source_text'=>'penilaian padanya.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>256.28,'end_time'=>259.48,'target_text'=>'We have our stuff, so we\'re about to check out.','source_text'=>'Kita dah dapat barang-barang kita, jadi kita nak pergi bayar sekarang.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>260.44,'end_time'=>261.58,'target_text'=>'We got all our food.','source_text'=>'Kita dah dapat semua makanan kita.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>261.68,'end_time'=>268.14,'target_text'=>'Let\'s head back to our apartment and we\'ll try this and describe it to you with as many adjectives as we can think of.','source_text'=>'Jom kita balik ke apartmen dan kita akan rasa makanan ini serta terangkannya kepada anda dengan seberapa banyak kata sifat yang kita boleh fikirkan.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>268.24,'end_time'=>271.46,'target_text'=>'English opens doors to work, friendships, and travel.','source_text'=>'Bahasa Inggeris membuka pintu kepada peluang kerja, persahabatan, dan pelancongan.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>271.56,'end_time'=>278.82,'target_text'=>'The only thing standing in the way is daily practice, and most people don\'t have someone to practice with every single day.','source_text'=>'Satu-satunya halangan ialah latihan harian, dan kebanyakan orang tiada teman untuk berlatih setiap hari.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>278.92,'end_time'=>281.02,'target_text'=>'That\'s where Easy Speak AI helps.','source_text'=>'Di situlah Easy Speak AI dapat membantu.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>281.12,'end_time'=>287.9,'target_text'=>'Real speaking practice anytime, anywhere with amazing tutors featuring different personalities and accents.','source_text'=>'Latihan bertutur sebenar pada bila-bila masa, di mana-mana sahaja bersama tutor hebat yang mempunyai pelbagai personaliti dan aksen.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>288,'end_time'=>290.42,'target_text'=>'There\'s always someone you\'ll connect with.','source_text'=>'Sentiasa ada tutor yang serasi dengan anda.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>290.52,'end_time'=>294.78,'target_text'=>'Recently, they\'ve even introduced an angel tutor, and I especially love her.','source_text'=>'Baru-baru ini, mereka juga memperkenalkan tutor \'angel\', dan saya sangat sukakannya.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>294.88,'end_time'=>302.9,'target_text'=>'Lessons are practical, real travel situations, everyday conversations, and problem-solving phrases you can actually use.','source_text'=>'Pelajarannya sangat praktikal, situasi melancong sebenar, perbualan harian, dan ungkapan penyelesaian masalah yang anda betul-betul boleh gunakan.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>303,'end_time'=>304.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s for every level.','source_text'=>'Ia sesuai untuk setiap peringkat kemahiran.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>304.16,'end_time'=>308.74,'target_text'=>'Easy Speak assesses your English level and gives you recommendations on what to practice.','source_text'=>'Easy Speak akan menilai tahap bahasa Inggeris anda dan memberikan cadangan topik untuk anda latih.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>308.84,'end_time'=>315.38,'target_text'=>'Each topic has beginner, intermediate, and advanced versions, and you can now learn English and Spanish depending on your','source_text'=>'Setiap topik mempunyai versi pemula, pertengahan, dan lanjutan, dan kini anda boleh belajar bahasa Inggeris serta bahasa Sepanyol mengikut','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>315.48,'end_time'=>315.98,'target_text'=>'goals.','source_text'=>'matlamat anda.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>316.08,'end_time'=>317.02,'target_text'=>'Ava speaking.','source_text'=>'Ava bercakap di sini.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>317.12,'end_time'=>317.82,'target_text'=>'How may I help you?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana saya boleh bantu anda?','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>317.92,'end_time'=>318.58,'target_text'=>'Volka?','source_text'=>'Volkan?','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>318.68,'end_time'=>319.34,'target_text'=>'Good evening, Ava.','source_text'=>'Selamat petang, Ava.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>319.44,'end_time'=>322.26,'target_text'=>'This is Volka in room 1503.','source_text'=>'Ini Volkan dari bilik 1503.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>322.36,'end_time'=>327.62,'target_text'=>'I\'m calling because the air conditioning isn\'t working at all, and the room is uncomfortably hot.','source_text'=>'Saya menelefon kerana penyaman udara langsung tidak berfungsi, dan bilik ini terasa sangat panas dan tidak selesa.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>327.72,'end_time'=>329.9,'target_text'=>'I\'m very sorry to hear that, Volka.','source_text'=>'Saya amat kesal mendengar perkara itu, Volkan.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>330,'end_time'=>335.26,'target_text'=>'To help me assist you better, could you describe what happens when you try to adjust the thermostat?','source_text'=>'Untuk bantu saya memahami masalah ini dengan lebih baik, boleh anda terangkan apa yang berlaku apabila anda cuba laraskan termostat?','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>335.36,'end_time'=>336.1,'target_text'=>'Yes, of course.','source_text'=>'Ya, sudah tentu.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>336.2,'end_time'=>338.9,'target_text'=>'When I try to adjust the thermostat, nothing happens.','source_text'=>'Apabila saya cuba laraskan termostat, tiada apa-apa berlaku.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>339,'end_time'=>344.02,'target_text'=>'Since the thermostat isn\'t responding, I can send a technician up or offer you a room move.','source_text'=>'Memandangkan termostat tidak bertindak balas, saya boleh hantar juruteknik naik atau tawarkan pertukaran bilik baharu untuk anda.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>344.12,'end_time'=>345.42,'target_text'=>'How would you like to proceed?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana anda ingin teruskan?','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>345.52,'end_time'=>347.38,'target_text'=>'I think I would prefer to just move rooms.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya lebih suka untuk tukar bilik sahaja.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>347.48,'end_time'=>347.98,'target_text'=>'Thank you.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>348.08,'end_time'=>351.66,'target_text'=>'Would you like a bellhop to help with your luggage or can you manage?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda perlukan \'bellhop\' (pelayan hotel) untuk bantu angkat bagasi anda atau anda boleh uruskan sendiri?','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>351.76,'end_time'=>353.3,'target_text'=>'Yes, can you please send a bellhop?','source_text'=>'Ya, boleh tolong hantarkan seorang pelayan hotel?','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>353.4,'end_time'=>357.94,'target_text'=>'I do have a lot of bags and I will need help to move them to the new room.','source_text'=>'Saya ada banyak beg dan saya perlukan bantuan untuk memindahkannya ke bilik baharu.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>358.04,'end_time'=>358.66,'target_text'=>'Thank you.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>358.76,'end_time'=>361.3,'target_text'=>'I\'ve dispatched a bellhop to room 1503.','source_text'=>'Saya telah menghantar seorang pelayan hotel ke bilik 1503.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>361.4,'end_time'=>364.74,'target_text'=>'They will arrive in 5 minutes to assist you with your move.','source_text'=>'Mereka akan tiba dalam masa 5 minit untuk membantu perpindahan anda.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>364.84,'end_time'=>365.7,'target_text'=>'That sounds perfect.','source_text'=>'Itu sangat bagus.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>365.8,'end_time'=>367.02,'target_text'=>'Thank you very much, Ava.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih banyak-banyak, Ava.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>367.12,'end_time'=>368.34,'target_text'=>'I appreciate the help.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat hargai bantuan anda.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>368.44,'end_time'=>370.58,'target_text'=>'I\'m glad I could help resolve this for you quickly.','source_text'=>'Saya gembira dapat bantu selesaikan masalah ini untuk anda dengan cepat.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>370.68,'end_time'=>375.58,'target_text'=>'The tutor responds naturally, corrects you fast, and helps you speak more smoothly.','source_text'=>'Tutor ini memberi maklum balas secara semula jadi, membetulkan kesilapan anda dengan pantas, dan membantu anda bercakap dengan lebih lancar.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>375.68,'end_time'=>379.82,'target_text'=>'The review tab saves your phrases, highlights mistakes, and shows your progress.','source_text'=>'Tab semakan menyimpan ungkapan anda, mengetengahkan kesilapan, dan menunjukkan kemajuan anda.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>379.92,'end_time'=>381.78,'target_text'=>'Just 5 minutes a day adds up.','source_text'=>'Hanya 5 minit sehari memberi impak yang besar.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>381.88,'end_time'=>388.38,'target_text'=>'Over time, you can build confidence, have smoother conversations, and hesitate less when it really matters.','source_text'=>'Lama-kelamaan, anda boleh bina keyakinan, berbual dengan lebih lancar, dan kurang teragak-agak apabila tiba waktu penting.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>388.48,'end_time'=>393.54,'target_text'=>'If you want to try today, download Easy Speak AI using the link in my description or pinned comment.','source_text'=>'Jika anda ingin mencuba hari ini, muat turun Easy Speak AI menggunakan pautan dalam penerangan saya atau komen yang disematkan.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>393.64,'end_time'=>396.18,'target_text'=>'Thank you, Easy Speak AI, for sponsoring today\'s video.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih kepada Easy Speak AI kerana menaja video hari ini.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>396.28,'end_time'=>399.78,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys, we just got back from the convenience store.','source_text'=>'Baiklah semua, kita baru sahaja kembali dari kedai serbaneka.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>399.88,'end_time'=>401.8,'target_text'=>'The drinks.','source_text'=>'Minuman-minuman ini.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>403.84,'end_time'=>413.62,'target_text'=>'We have Leon\'s chips, chicken skins, and then we have Leon\'s dessert, my dessert, [snorts] my chips,','source_text'=>'Kita ada kerepek Leon, kulit ayam, dan kemudian kita ada pencuci mulut Leon, pencuci mulut saya, kerepek saya,','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>413.72,'end_time'=>416.22,'target_text'=>'and then Ooh, it\'s still warm.','source_text'=>'dan kemudian Ooh, masih panas lagi.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>416.32,'end_time'=>417.86,'target_text'=>'Ooh, my Oh, that\'s really warm.','source_text'=>'Ooh, roti Oh, ini sangat panas.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>417.96,'end_time'=>424.74,'target_text'=>'My bun, and then Leon\'s I already tried this, but I\'m going to try it again to give you guys the reaction.','source_text'=>'Roti saya, dan kemudian kepunyaan Leon Saya dah rasa ini sebelum ini, tapi saya nak cuba lagi untuk tunjukkan reaksi kepada anda semua.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>424.84,'end_time'=>427.34,'target_text'=>'You can try your stuff, too.','source_text'=>'Awak boleh rasa makanan awak juga.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>427.44,'end_time'=>429.98,'target_text'=>'We got the bev, honey lemon oolong tea.','source_text'=>'Kita dapat minuman, teh oolong madu lemon.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>430.08,'end_time'=>432.5,'target_text'=>'This is basically iced tea.','source_text'=>'Ini pada asasnya ialah teh ais.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>432.6,'end_time'=>434.56,'target_text'=>'Okay, this.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, yang ini.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>434.76,'end_time'=>436.82,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you guys have had honeycomb before.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kalau anda semua pernah makan sarang lebah (honeycomb) sebelum ini.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>436.92,'end_time'=>437.78,'target_text'=>'Honeycomb.','source_text'=>'Sarang lebah.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>437.88,'end_time'=>438.78,'target_text'=>'This is what it looks like.','source_text'=>'Macam inilah rupanya.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>438.88,'end_time'=>443.62,'target_text'=>'But this, like I swear, this tastes exactly like honeycomb.','source_text'=>'Tapi ini, saya bersumpah rasanya betul-betul sama macam sarang lebah.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>443.72,'end_time'=>445.94,'target_text'=>'If honeycomb was a liquid, this would be it.','source_text'=>'Kalau sarang lebah dijadikan cecair, inilah rasanya.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>446.04,'end_time'=>447.98,'target_text'=>'Like It doesn\'t taste a little bit.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya Ia bukan rasa sedikit-sedikit sahaja.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>448.08,'end_time'=>451.22,'target_text'=>'It tastes exactly exactly like honeycomb.','source_text'=>'Rasanya memang tepat-tepat sama seperti sarang lebah.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>451.32,'end_time'=>453.64,'target_text'=>'Like really.','source_text'=>'Betul-betul sama.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>455.32,'end_time'=>456.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s insane.','source_text'=>'Memang gila.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>456.16,'end_time'=>458.34,'target_text'=>'Okay, so what should we have first?','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jadi apa yang patut kita makan dulu?','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>458.44,'end_time'=>462.1,'target_text'=>'The snack, dessert, or the main course?','source_text'=>'Makanan ringan, pencuci mulut, atau hidangan utama?','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>462.2,'end_time'=>464.38,'target_text'=>'Like let\'s start with the main course first.','source_text'=>'Jom kita mulakan dengan hidangan utama dahulu.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>464.48,'end_time'=>470.38,'target_text'=>'Yeah, this is like a coconut curry, so there\'s a lot of coconut oil in it and that spilled out a bit.','source_text'=>'Ya, ini seperti kari santan, jadi ada banyak minyak kelapa di dalamnya dan ia tertumpah sedikit tadi.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>470.48,'end_time'=>473.62,'target_text'=>'Okay, so this is my bao bun.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jadi ini pau saya.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>473.72,'end_time'=>477.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s a jumbo big bao barbecued pork.','source_text'=>'Ini pau saiz besar berinti daging babi barbeku.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>477.2,'end_time'=>480,'target_text'=>'So, now I\'m going to open the packaging.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang saya akan buka bungkusannya.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>480.28,'end_time'=>483.58,'target_text'=>'Oh, there was moisture that spilled out.','source_text'=>'Oh, ada wap air yang terpercik keluar.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>483.68,'end_time'=>484.86,'target_text'=>'But, this is what it looks like.','source_text'=>'Tapi macam inilah rupanya.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>484.96,'end_time'=>486.14,'target_text'=>'It does look quite good.','source_text'=>'Memang nampak sangat sedap.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>486.24,'end_time'=>488.9,'target_text'=>'I really do like bao buns, so I decided to go with this.','source_text'=>'Saya memang sangat sukakan pau, jadi saya buat keputusan untuk ambil yang ini.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>489,'end_time'=>495.58,'target_text'=>'It was only 30 baht, which is about a dollar 30 Canadian.','source_text'=>'Harganya cuma 30 baht, iaitu sekitar satu dolar tiga puluh sen Kanada.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>495.68,'end_time'=>498.68,'target_text'=>'But, let\'s try the bao bun.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom kita rasa pau ini.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>500.84,'end_time'=>503.08,'target_text'=>'Sounds good.','source_text'=>'Kedengaran menyelerakan.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>503.96,'end_time'=>505.98,'target_text'=>'Here we got the curry.','source_text'=>'Di sini kita ada kari.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>506.08,'end_time'=>510.86,'target_text'=>'So, this is a Thai green curry, super popular curry in Thailand.','source_text'=>'Jadi ini kari hijau Thai, kari yang sangat popular di Thailand.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>510.96,'end_time'=>513.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s got a little egg in there and some purple rice.','source_text'=>'Ada sedikit telur di dalamnya dan ada nasi beras ungu.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>513.92,'end_time'=>519.48,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if the flavors changed from regular rice, but we\'ll see right now.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada rasanya berbeza dengan nasi putih biasa, tapi kita akan tahu sekarang.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>520,'end_time'=>522.6,'target_text'=>'So, we\'ll try some of that chicken.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita akan rasa sedikit ayam itu.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>523.48,'end_time'=>524.66,'target_text'=>'Mhm, flavor\'s good.','source_text'=>'Mhm, rasanya sedap.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>524.76,'end_time'=>526.58,'target_text'=>'I can definitely taste the coconut milk.','source_text'=>'Saya memang boleh rasa santannya dengan jelas.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>526.68,'end_time'=>529.1,'target_text'=>'A little salty and there\'s a little bit of spice in there.','source_text'=>'Sedikit masin dan ada sedikit rasa pedas di dalamnya.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>529.2,'end_time'=>531.8,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try the rice by itself.','source_text'=>'Jom rasa nasinya begitu sahaja tanpa lauk.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>533.64,'end_time'=>536.22,'target_text'=>'Mhm, so that just tastes like regular rice.','source_text'=>'Mhm, rasanya macam nasi biasa sahaja.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>536.32,'end_time'=>542.62,'target_text'=>'The color does not affect the flavor at all, but it\'s got a little bit of different texture and makes it a little bit more','source_text'=>'Warnanya langsung tidak menjejaskan rasa, tapi ia ada sedikit kelainan tekstur dan menjadikannya lebih','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>542.72,'end_time'=>543.38,'target_text'=>'crunchy.','source_text'=>'rangup sedikit.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>543.48,'end_time'=>544.86,'target_text'=>'So, we\'ll get a nice bite here.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita ambil satu suapan yang besar di sini.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>544.96,'end_time'=>548.06,'target_text'=>'Okay, this is genuinely such a weird drink.','source_text'=>'Okey, minuman ini secara jujurnya rasa sangat pelik.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>548.16,'end_time'=>549.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s really throwing me off.','source_text'=>'Ia betul-betul membuatkan saya keliru.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>549.4,'end_time'=>554.3,'target_text'=>'Like, I don\'t remember lychee tasting like this, but honeycomb it\'s really I don\'t know if I like it or not.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, saya tak ingat rasa laici macam ini, tapi sarang lebah ini saya tak pasti sama ada saya suka atau tidak.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>554.4,'end_time'=>556.54,'target_text'=>'It\'s really, really weird and different.','source_text'=>'Ia sangat, sangat pelik dan berbeza.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>556.64,'end_time'=>558.94,'target_text'=>'Well, let\'s finish my pork bao bao bun.','source_text'=>'Jom habiskan pau saya ini.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>559.04,'end_time'=>561.3,'target_text'=>'I have to say this is really delicious.','source_text'=>'Saya kena katakan yang ini memang sangat lazat.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>561.4,'end_time'=>563.92,'target_text'=>'This is bussing.','source_text'=>'Ini memang padu.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>565,'end_time'=>566.8,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>567.28,'end_time'=>567.98,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know what this is.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu apa benda ini.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>568.08,'end_time'=>569.62,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s like an eggplant or something.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ia macam terung atau sesuatu.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>569.72,'end_time'=>570.7,'target_text'=>'Or maybe >> It\'s an egg.','source_text'=>'Atau mungkin Ini telur.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>570.8,'end_time'=>571.86,'target_text'=>'No, I think it\'s eggplant.','source_text'=>'Tak, saya rasa ini terung.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>571.96,'end_time'=>572.62,'target_text'=>'Is it egg?','source_text'=>'Telur ke?','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>572.72,'end_time'=>574.68,'target_text'=>'That\'s crazy.','source_text'=>'Mengarutlah.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>576.12,'end_time'=>576.98,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>577.08,'end_time'=>578.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s a vegetable.','source_text'=>'Ini sejenis sayuran.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>578.32,'end_time'=>579.5,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s a fig.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ini buah ara (fig).','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>579.6,'end_time'=>580.42,'target_text'=>'Ooh.','source_text'=>'Ooh.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>580.52,'end_time'=>581.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s got some heat to it.','source_text'=>'Ada rasa pedas padanya.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>581.84,'end_time'=>583.66,'target_text'=>'I mean, the sauce does, the curry.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya pada kuahnya, kuah kari itu.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>583.76,'end_time'=>585.18,'target_text'=>'The almond is quite good.','source_text'=>'Rasanya agak sedap.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>585.28,'end_time'=>588.7,'target_text'=>'The only thing I would say is that it is very sweet.','source_text'=>'Cuma satu perkara yang saya nak komen ialah ia sangat manis.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>588.8,'end_time'=>590.1,'target_text'=>'It is very, very sweet.','source_text'=>'Ia sangat, sangat manis.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>590.2,'end_time'=>592.26,'target_text'=>'That\'s like my one thing about it.','source_text'=>'Itu sajalah satu teguran saya mengenainya.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>592.36,'end_time'=>596.58,'target_text'=>'I think they could tone down on the sweetness, and then that would make it a lot better.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa mereka patut kurangkan sedikit rasa manisnya, dan itu akan menjadikannya jauh lebih sedap.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>596.68,'end_time'=>601.2,'target_text'=>'But right now, it\'s just It is too sweet for me, in my opinion.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang ini ia terlalu manis untuk tekak saya, pada pandangan saya.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>601.96,'end_time'=>603.26,'target_text'=>'This is also too sweet.','source_text'=>'Yang ini pun terlalu manis juga.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>603.36,'end_time'=>605.98,'target_text'=>'It\'s just sweet, sweet, sweet.','source_text'=>'Asyik manis, manis, manis sahaja.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>606.08,'end_time'=>609.6,'target_text'=>'I need a cleanse my palate','source_text'=>'Saya kena neutralkan semula deria rasa tekak saya','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>609.88,'end_time'=>611.62,'target_text'=>'with Cheetos.','source_text'=>'dengan Cheetos.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>611.72,'end_time'=>613.7,'target_text'=>'Shouldn\'t you try the dessert first?','source_text'=>'Bukankah awak patut rasa pencuci mulut dulu?','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>613.8,'end_time'=>615.74,'target_text'=>'That\'ll be sweet.','source_text'=>'Itu pasti manis juga.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>615.84,'end_time'=>616.7,'target_text'=>'Too much sweetness?','source_text'=>'Terlalu banyak manis ke?','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>616.8,'end_time'=>617.22,'target_text'=>'Yeah, dude.','source_text'=>'Ya, kawan.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>617.32,'end_time'=>621.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s really like I\'m going to have a sugar crash later today.','source_text'=>'Nanti badan saya mesti hilang tenaga sebab terlebih gula (sugar crash) petang nanti.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>621.2,'end_time'=>622.82,'target_text'=>'Also, review on this iced tea.','source_text'=>'Juga, ulasan untuk teh ais ini.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>622.92,'end_time'=>628.98,'target_text'=>'Honestly, I find carbonated drinks to be really refreshing, but this is honestly on par with being as refreshing.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, saya rasa minuman berkarbonat sangat menyegarkan, tapi air ini pun sama setanding tahap kesegarannya.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>629.08,'end_time'=>631.24,'target_text'=>'Want to try it?','source_text'=>'Awak nak rasa?','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>631.68,'end_time'=>633.72,'target_text'=>'Pretty good.','source_text'=>'Agak sedap.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>634.16,'end_time'=>638.5,'target_text'=>'Okay, so I thought there would be a lot more flavor on these, but these don\'t really have that much flavor.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, saya ingatkan kerepek ini ada banyak rasa, tapi sebenarnya ia tak berapa berasa sangat.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>638.6,'end_time'=>640.96,'target_text'=>'They\'re kind of like plain.','source_text'=>'Rasanya agak tawar dan biasa.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>643.08,'end_time'=>643.78,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>643.88,'end_time'=>648.44,'target_text'=>'Nothing to write home about, but I guess it\'s a good snack.','source_text'=>'Tiada apa yang istimewa sangat, tapi saya rasa ia snek yang okey.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>648.68,'end_time'=>650.46,'target_text'=>'Honestly, this is a really good meal.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, ini hidangan yang sangat elok.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>650.56,'end_time'=>656.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s surprising that they can like mass produce this, and then send it out to thousands of 7-Elevens around Thailand.','source_text'=>'Mengagumkan bagaimana mereka boleh hasilkan makanan ini secara besar-besaran, dan edarkan ke beribu-ribu cawangan 7-Eleven di seluruh Thailand.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>656.68,'end_time'=>657.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually crazy.','source_text'=>'Memang luar biasa.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>657.68,'end_time'=>659.74,'target_text'=>'This is like I would eat this again, for sure.','source_text'=>'Hidangan ini memang saya akan makan lagi, pasti.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>659.84,'end_time'=>661.02,'target_text'=>'Thai green curry.','source_text'=>'Kari hijau Thai.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>661.12,'end_time'=>662.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s got good flavor.','source_text'=>'Ia ada rasa yang sedap.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>662.36,'end_time'=>667.22,'target_text'=>'And I think even for Thai people, eating at 7-Eleven\'s popular for lunch or something.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa untuk orang Thai pun, makan di 7-Eleven popular untuk makan tengah hari atau apa-apa.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>667.32,'end_time'=>670.7,'target_text'=>'If you\'re busy or working lots, it\'s a really convenient, and it\'s still really good.','source_text'=>'Kalau anda sibuk atau banyak kerja, ia sangat mudah, dan rasanya masih sangat sedap.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>670.8,'end_time'=>671.78,'target_text'=>'And the price is crazy.','source_text'=>'Dan harganya sangat murah.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>671.88,'end_time'=>675,'target_text'=>'This is not that expensive at all.','source_text'=>'Ini langsung tidak mahal.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>675.64,'end_time'=>678.18,'target_text'=>'Bro, this is pure sugar.','source_text'=>'Bro, ini gula tulen.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>678.28,'end_time'=>679.7,'target_text'=>'Iced tea.','source_text'=>'Teh ais.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>679.8,'end_time'=>680.78,'target_text'=>'He said it was refreshing.','source_text'=>'Dia kata air ini menyegarkan.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>680.88,'end_time'=>682.02,'target_text'=>'That is not refreshing.','source_text'=>'Yang ini langsung tak menyegarkan.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>682.12,'end_time'=>685.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s just really sweet.','source_text'=>'Cuma rasa sangat manis.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>685.16,'end_time'=>689.78,'target_text'=>'But uh we stopped at that lady and bought some chicken, so let me take a bite of this chicken.','source_text'=>'Tapi kita tadi singgah dekat makcik itu dan beli sedikit ayam, jadi biar saya rasa sedikit ayam ini.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>689.88,'end_time'=>691.34,'target_text'=>'Hopefully, it\'s cooked all the way.','source_text'=>'Harap-harap ia masak sepenuhnya.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>691.44,'end_time'=>693.5,'target_text'=>'Oh, it smells good though.','source_text'=>'Oh, baunya memang wangi.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>693.6,'end_time'=>703.26,'target_text'=>'If you want to get my 3,000 most common English words PDF to help you understand up to 95% of spoken English with real clear','source_text'=>'Jika anda ingin dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling lazim untuk bantu anda faham sehingga 95% bahasa Inggeris pertuturan berserta definisi','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>703.36,'end_time'=>710.54,'target_text'=>'definitions and examples organized by CEFR level and topic, then check out the link in my description to get it.','source_text'=>'dan contoh yang jelas mengikut tahap CEFR dan topik, sila semak pautan di ruangan penerangan saya untuk mendapatkannya.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>710.64,'end_time'=>711.66,'target_text'=>'>> looks good.','source_text'=>'Nampak menyelerakan.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>711.76,'end_time'=>712.86,'target_text'=>'I think you got the fire right.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa mereka bakar dengan api yang betul.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>712.96,'end_time'=>715.02,'target_text'=>'They cut it open and then they split it open.','source_text'=>'Mereka hiris dan belah ayam itu.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>715.12,'end_time'=>718.66,'target_text'=>'So, you got to be careful with chicken because you might get salmonella poisoning.','source_text'=>'Jadi awak kena berhati-hati dengan ayam sebab awak boleh kena keracunan bakteria salmonella.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>718.76,'end_time'=>719.7,'target_text'=>'Could that kill you?','source_text'=>'Boleh membawa maut ke?','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>719.8,'end_time'=>720.3,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, sudah tentu.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>720.4,'end_time'=>720.82,'target_text'=>'It can kill you.','source_text'=>'Ia boleh membunuh awak.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>720.92,'end_time'=>721.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s bacteria.','source_text'=>'Ia adalah bakteria.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>721.92,'end_time'=>725.9,'target_text'=>'But, it\'s crazy cuz in some places, like Japan, you can actually eat raw chicken there.','source_text'=>'Tapi luar biasanya di sesetengah tempat macam Jepun, awak sebenarnya boleh makan ayam mentah di sana.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>726,'end_time'=>731.18,'target_text'=>'So, what they do is they cook the outside really quickly and then the inside still raw.','source_text'=>'Apa yang mereka buat ialah mereka bakar bahagian luar dengan sangat pantas dan bahagian dalam masih mentah.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>731.28,'end_time'=>736.74,'target_text'=>'So, apparently that kills any salmonella that could be on the outside and the inside still like completely clean.','source_text'=>'Jadi katanya itu membunuh semua bakteria salmonella di luar manakala bahagian dalam kekal bersih sepenuhnya.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>736.84,'end_time'=>739.62,'target_text'=>'But, if you\'re willing to risk it, you can go to Japan and you can try it.','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau awak sanggup tanggung risiko, awak boleh pergi ke Jepun dan cubanya.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>739.72,'end_time'=>742.14,'target_text'=>'Or, you can try it at home, but I don\'t know if you\'ll survive it.','source_text'=>'Atau awak boleh cuba di rumah, tapi saya tak tahu kalau awak boleh selamat.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>742.24,'end_time'=>744.42,'target_text'=>'>> whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.','source_text'=>'Hei, jangan.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>744.52,'end_time'=>745.66,'target_text'=>'Do not try that at home.','source_text'=>'Jangan cuba buat macam itu di rumah.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>745.76,'end_time'=>746.94,'target_text'=>'Please, do not.','source_text'=>'Tolong jangan.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>747.04,'end_time'=>747.82,'target_text'=>'Do not try that.','source_text'=>'Jangan cuba begitu.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>747.92,'end_time'=>748.16,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I know.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya tahu.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>748.16,'end_time'=>749.42,'target_text'=>'You can\'t mess around with food.','source_text'=>'Awak tak boleh main-main dengan makanan.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>749.52,'end_time'=>751.62,'target_text'=>'Food is uh very dangerous.','source_text'=>'Makanan boleh jadi sangat berbahaya.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>751.72,'end_time'=>752.78,'target_text'=>'You have to be careful.','source_text'=>'Awak kena sentiasa berhati-hati.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>752.88,'end_time'=>759.42,'target_text'=>'You have to respect food and you have to make sure everything is cooked and all bacteria and stuff is dead before you eat','source_text'=>'Awak kena hargai makanan dan pastikan semuanya dimasak elok dan semua bakteria mati sebelum awak makan','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>759.52,'end_time'=>760.22,'target_text'=>'it.','source_text'=>'makanan tersebut.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>760.32,'end_time'=>763.06,'target_text'=>'That\'s why we boil water or cook food.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah kita masak air atau masak makanan.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>763.16,'end_time'=>765.94,'target_text'=>'That kills the bacteria.','source_text'=>'Itu membunuh bakteria.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>766.04,'end_time'=>766.94,'target_text'=>'Chicken skin.','source_text'=>'Kulit ayam goreng.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>767.04,'end_time'=>767.54,'target_text'=>'This is crazy.','source_text'=>'Ini menarik.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>767.64,'end_time'=>770.74,'target_text'=>'I just saw it at the corner of my eye and I want to try it.','source_text'=>'Saya baru ternampak di hujung mata tadi dan saya nak cuba.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>770.84,'end_time'=>771.66,'target_text'=>'It looks good, actually.','source_text'=>'Nampak sedap sebenarnya.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>771.76,'end_time'=>775.06,'target_text'=>'It looks like chicharrones, but for chicken.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam chicharrones tapi dibuat daripada ayam.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>775.16,'end_time'=>775.56,'target_text'=>'You mean pork?','source_text'=>'Maksud awak babi?','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>775.6,'end_time'=>777.42,'target_text'=>'Ooh, that smells spicy.','source_text'=>'Ooh, baunya pedas.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>777.52,'end_time'=>778.54,'target_text'=>'That smells strong.','source_text'=>'Baunya kuat.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>778.64,'end_time'=>779.94,'target_text'=>'I think we got the spicy one.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kita ambil yang perisa pedas.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>780.04,'end_time'=>781.34,'target_text'=>'I just picked whatever.','source_text'=>'Saya tadi main ambil sahaja.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>781.44,'end_time'=>784.5,'target_text'=>'There\'s a fire right here, so I think it might have a little kick to it.','source_text'=>'Ada gambar api di sini, jadi saya rasa mungkin ada sedikit rasa pedas padanya.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>784.6,'end_time'=>786.96,'target_text'=>'That\'s what it looks like.','source_text'=>'Macam inilah rupanya.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>791.04,'end_time'=>792.94,'target_text'=>'Nice crunch, but it\'s not spicy.','source_text'=>'Kerangupan yang elok, tapi tak pedas pun.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>793.04,'end_time'=>794.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s just sweet.','source_text'=>'Cuma rasa manis.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>794.16,'end_time'=>798.14,'target_text'=>'I think there\'s a lot of sugar in the food we\'ve had today cuz Try one.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ada banyak gula dalam makanan yang kita makan hari ini sebab Cuba rasa satu.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>798.24,'end_time'=>802.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a Oh, these are like the Those remind me of this Chinese food I had in Shanghai.','source_text'=>'Ia macam Oh, ini macam Ini mengingatkan saya pada makanan Cina yang saya makan di Shanghai dulu.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>802.72,'end_time'=>803.9,'target_text'=>'Those kebab things.','source_text'=>'Makanan lidi kebab itu.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>804,'end_time'=>804.46,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh, ya.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>804.56,'end_time'=>806.86,'target_text'=>'Maybe that\'s the flavor, like a It\'s not spicy though.','source_text'=>'Mungkin itu perisanya, macam Tapi tak pedas pun.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>806.96,'end_time'=>808.62,'target_text'=>'it\'s just sweet and savory.','source_text'=>'cuma manis dan berperisa lemak masin (savory).','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>808.72,'end_time'=>809.42,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>809.52,'end_time'=>812.18,'target_text'=>'To me it just tastes really fatty and greasy and oily.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya ia cuma rasa sangat berlemak dan berminyak.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>812.28,'end_time'=>812.82,'target_text'=>'>> greasy.','source_text'=>'Berminyak.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>812.92,'end_time'=>813.9,'target_text'=>'Cuz it\'s skin, right?','source_text'=>'Sebab ia kulit, kan?','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>814,'end_time'=>814.98,'target_text'=>'Cuz it\'s good, but it\'s not a lot.','source_text'=>'Rasanya sedap, tapi jumlahnya tak banyak.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>815.08,'end_time'=>817.06,'target_text'=>'We only had a couple of pieces then.','source_text'=>'Kita baru makan beberapa keping tadi.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>817.16,'end_time'=>817.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s almost empty.','source_text'=>'Dah hampir habis.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>817.8,'end_time'=>819.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, almost empty.','source_text'=>'Ya, hampir kosong.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>819.12,'end_time'=>822.94,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we finished our main course and some of our snack.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jadi kita dah habiskan hidangan utama dan sebahagian snek kita.','order'=>326],
