            ['start_time'=>824.96,'end_time'=>827.54,'target_text'=>'I got young coconut lava mochi.','source_text'=>'Saya beli mochi lava kelapa muda.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>827.64,'end_time'=>829.18,'target_text'=>'It looks really good.','source_text'=>'Nampak sangat menarik.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>829.28,'end_time'=>831.74,'target_text'=>'And I got these little puff pastries.','source_text'=>'Dan saya dapat pastri lapis kecil ini.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>831.84,'end_time'=>833.98,'target_text'=>'They\'re like little What do you call these?','source_text'=>'Bentuknya macam Apa panggil kuih ini?','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>834.08,'end_time'=>834.9,'target_text'=>'Uh strudels?','source_text'=>'Strudel ke?','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>835,'end_time'=>836.1,'target_text'=>'Tiny little strudels.','source_text'=>'Strudel kecil yang comel.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>836.2,'end_time'=>836.6,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>836.68,'end_time'=>837.22,'target_text'=>'You got grape.','source_text'=>'Awak dapat perisa anggur.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>837.32,'end_time'=>838.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, grape jelly flavor.','source_text'=>'Ya, perisa jeli anggur.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>838.6,'end_time'=>839.38,'target_text'=>'>> know how good grape would be.','source_text'=>'Tak tahu sejauh mana sedapnya perisa anggur ini.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>839.48,'end_time'=>841.42,'target_text'=>'I feel like some sort of berry would have been nicer.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kalau perisa buah beri mungkin lebih sedap.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>841.52,'end_time'=>843.98,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I thought this was blueberry actually when I picked it up.','source_text'=>'Ya, sebenarnya saya ingatkan ini beri biru (blueberry) masa saya ambil tadi.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>844.08,'end_time'=>844.98,'target_text'=>'I have my mochi.','source_text'=>'Ini mochi saya.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>845.08,'end_time'=>846.42,'target_text'=>'Very sticky.','source_text'=>'Sangat melekit.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>846.52,'end_time'=>848.68,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try this.','source_text'=>'Jom kita cuba ini.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>852.96,'end_time'=>853.74,'target_text'=>'Woah.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>853.84,'end_time'=>855.74,'target_text'=>'Look at how stretchy this mochi is.','source_text'=>'Tengok betapa kenyalnya mochi ini boleh ditarik.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>855.84,'end_time'=>856.82,'target_text'=>'Looks like cheese, man.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam keju, kawan.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>856.92,'end_time'=>859.58,'target_text'=>'It literally looks like melted mozzarella cheese.','source_text'=>'Memang betul-betul nampak macam keju mozzarella cair.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>859.68,'end_time'=>863.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s supposed to be coconut flavor, but I don\'t really taste any coconut.','source_text'=>'Ia sepatutnya perisa kelapa, tapi saya tak berapa rasa kelapa pun.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>863.44,'end_time'=>864.26,'target_text'=>'I just taste sweet, man.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma rasa manis sahaja.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>864.36,'end_time'=>866.76,'target_text'=>'Everything is just sweet.','source_text'=>'Semuanya serba manis.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>869.28,'end_time'=>871.14,'target_text'=>'This looks kind of good actually.','source_text'=>'Ini nampak agak sedap sebenarnya.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>871.24,'end_time'=>873.68,'target_text'=>'Look how crispy that looks.','source_text'=>'Tengok betapa rangupnya ia kelihatan.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>876.12,'end_time'=>877.46,'target_text'=>'That smells strong.','source_text'=>'Baunya sangat kuat.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>877.56,'end_time'=>878.58,'target_text'=>'Ooh, let me try one.','source_text'=>'Ooh, biar saya cuba satu.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>878.68,'end_time'=>880.62,'target_text'=>'That\'s sweet, but got a nice crunch.','source_text'=>'Memang manis, tapi ada kerangupan yang sedap.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>880.72,'end_time'=>881.58,'target_text'=>'That one looks burnt.','source_text'=>'Yang satu itu nampak macam hangus.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>881.68,'end_time'=>884.42,'target_text'=>'These smell super strong as soon as he took it out.','source_text'=>'Benda ini berbau sangat kuat sebaik sahaja dia keluarkannya.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>884.52,'end_time'=>886.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s just that strong grape flavor.','source_text'=>'Bau perisa anggur yang sangat kuat.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>886.92,'end_time'=>889.04,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try it.','source_text'=>'Jom kita rasa.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>892.6,'end_time'=>893.62,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it\'s like a strudel.','source_text'=>'Ya, rasanya macam strudel.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>893.72,'end_time'=>894.08,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>894.08,'end_time'=>894.98,'target_text'=>'Really similar to a strudel.','source_text'=>'Sangat mirip dengan strudel.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>895.08,'end_time'=>895.62,'target_text'=>'>> strudel.','source_text'=>'Strudel.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>895.72,'end_time'=>898.58,'target_text'=>'The top it looks like they put sugar on when they were baking it.','source_text'=>'Bahagian atasnya nampak macam mereka tabur gula masa membakarnya.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>898.68,'end_time'=>899.38,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>899.48,'end_time'=>901.94,'target_text'=>'So it kind of has that crunch.','source_text'=>'Jadi ia ada kerangupan seperti itu.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>902.04,'end_time'=>904.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s got a lot of layers too.','source_text'=>'Ia ada banyak lapisan juga.','order'=>366],
