            ['start_time'=>907,'end_time'=>909.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s got some sesame seeds on the top.','source_text'=>'Ada sedikit biji bijan di bahagian atasnya.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>909.4,'end_time'=>910.1,'target_text'=>'They\'re all the same.','source_text'=>'Semuanya sama sahaja.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>910.2,'end_time'=>911.22,'target_text'=>'Smells like sesame.','source_text'=>'Baunya macam bijan.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>911.32,'end_time'=>913.6,'target_text'=>'Let\'s see how it tastes.','source_text'=>'Jom tengok macam mana rasanya.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>917.04,'end_time'=>917.86,'target_text'=>'Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'Oh, wah.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>917.96,'end_time'=>919.58,'target_text'=>'I think there\'s a filling inside this one.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ada inti di dalam yang ini.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>919.68,'end_time'=>920.7,'target_text'=>'Yeah, the The one too.','source_text'=>'Ya, yang satu lagi pun ada juga.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>920.8,'end_time'=>921.38,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>921.48,'end_time'=>923.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a Supposed to be coconut.','source_text'=>'Ia macam Sepatutnya perisa kelapa.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>923.16,'end_time'=>925.78,'target_text'=>'>> I think it tastes a little bit like coconut, but young coconut.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ada sedikit rasa macam kelapa, tapi kelapa muda.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>925.88,'end_time'=>926.66,'target_text'=>'Oh, okay.','source_text'=>'Oh, okey.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>926.76,'end_time'=>929.7,'target_text'=>'Young coconut lava mochi.','source_text'=>'Mochi lava kelapa muda.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>929.8,'end_time'=>930.58,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>930.68,'end_time'=>931.74,'target_text'=>'Super sweet, but it\'s good.','source_text'=>'Sangat manis, tapi sedap.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>931.84,'end_time'=>933.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s got a little bit of coconut flavor.','source_text'=>'Ada sedikit rasa kelapa padanya.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>933.8,'end_time'=>934.7,'target_text'=>'That filling is nice, though.','source_text'=>'Inti di dalamnya memang sedap.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>934.8,'end_time'=>937.9,'target_text'=>'I\'m not a big fan of mochi, but this is a cool treat.','source_text'=>'Saya bukannya peminat tegar mochi, tapi ini hidangan yang menarik.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>938,'end_time'=>940.06,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I was about to say I thought you hated mochi.','source_text'=>'Ya, baru saya nak cakap tadi saya ingatkan awak benci mochi.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>940.16,'end_time'=>943.58,'target_text'=>'I don\'t like mochi that much, but this is like maybe 20% mochi.','source_text'=>'Saya tak berapa suka mochi, tapi yang ini mungkin cuma ada 20% mochi.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>943.68,'end_time'=>946.24,'target_text'=>'The rest is just like a filling.','source_text'=>'Selebihnya hanyalah inti semata-mata.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>946.48,'end_time'=>948.1,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>948.2,'end_time'=>949.22,'target_text'=>'Maybe I do love mochi.','source_text'=>'Mungkin saya sebenarnya suka mochi.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>949.32,'end_time'=>951.34,'target_text'=>'Have you ever had mochi?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah makan mochi sebelum ini?','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>951.44,'end_time'=>954.22,'target_text'=>'Every mochi is only like 10 to 20% mochi.','source_text'=>'Setiap mochi memang cuma ada 10 hingga 20% bahagian mochi.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>954.32,'end_time'=>956.86,'target_text'=>'Mochi is always wrapped around a fruit or something.','source_text'=>'Mochi selalunya dibalut pada buah atau sesuatu.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>956.96,'end_time'=>958.74,'target_text'=>'>> No, traditional mochi doesn\'t have anything.','source_text'=>'Tak, mochi tradisional tiada apa-apa inti.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>958.84,'end_time'=>960.98,'target_text'=>'It\'s just straight beaten rice.','source_text'=>'Ia cuma beras pulut yang ditumbuk semata-mata.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>961.08,'end_time'=>964.54,'target_text'=>'I have never seen I\'ve never seen just someone selling straight mochi.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah nampak orang jual mochi kosong semata-mata.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>964.64,'end_time'=>966.3,'target_text'=>'The straight mochi is the original.','source_text'=>'Mochi kosong itulah yang asli (original).','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>966.4,'end_time'=>972.34,'target_text'=>'Everything else is like I\'m not Japanese, so I don\'t know, but I went to Japan and all the mochi I ever saw was always wrapped.','source_text'=>'Yang lain-lain itu Saya bukan orang Jepun, jadi saya tak tahu, tapi masa saya ke Jepun semua mochi yang saya jumpa sentiasa berbalut.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>972.44,'end_time'=>973.54,'target_text'=>'The mochi was always wrapped.','source_text'=>'Mochinya sentiasa membalut inti.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>973.64,'end_time'=>978.9,'target_text'=>'Well, I don\'t know if that\'s the correct way to describe that mochi, but there was always fruit and then that mochi wrapped','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kalau itu cara tepat untuk gambarkan mochi itu, tapi sentiasa ada buah dan mochi itu membalut','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>979,'end_time'=>979.66,'target_text'=>'wrapped the fruit.','source_text'=>'buah tersebut.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>979.76,'end_time'=>983.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'ve seen that with strawberries, but I\'m pretty sure that\'s a newer way to eat it.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya pernah nampak yang berbalut strawberi, tapi saya agak pasti itu cara makan versi baharu.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>983.48,'end_time'=>984.5,'target_text'=>'That\'s not like traditional.','source_text'=>'Itu bukan cara tradisional.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>984.6,'end_time'=>985.26,'target_text'=>'Uh I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>985.36,'end_time'=>988.42,'target_text'=>'Cuz the one mochi >> never seen this a ball of mochi that you just eat.','source_text'=>'Sebab mochi yang satu lagi itu Tak pernah nampak bebola mochi kosong yang terus dimakan begitu sahaja.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>988.52,'end_time'=>995.14,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never seen >> mochi I had, it was in uh Nara or Kyoto, and they beat it with a big mallet, and then they give you a piece','source_text'=>'Saya belum pernah tengok Mochi yang saya makan dulu di Nara atau Kyoto, mereka tumbuk dengan tukul kayu besar, dan kemudian beri seketul','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>995.24,'end_time'=>1001.18,'target_text'=>'of that, just the mochi, and they wrap it in or they throw it in a like a brown powder that\'s like uh I think it\'s some sort','source_text'=>'mochi kosong itu, dan mereka gaulkan dalam serbuk perang yang saya rasa ia sejenis','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1001.28,'end_time'=>1005.54,'target_text'=>'of fermented powder that they make, and then you eat it like that, just straight mochi.','source_text'=>'serbuk tapai (kinako) yang mereka buat, dan awak makan macam itu saja, mochi kosong semata-mata.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1005.64,'end_time'=>1006.82,'target_text'=>'That\'s like traditionally way.','source_text'=>'Macam itulah cara tradisional.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>1006.92,'end_time'=>1010.22,'target_text'=>'You\'re talking about like warabi mochi or something something like that.','source_text'=>'Maksud awak macam warabi mochi atau lebih kurang macam itu.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>1010.32,'end_time'=>1015.34,'target_text'=>'You put this uh brown syrupy sauce on it, and it\'s a million times better.','source_text'=>'Awak tuang sos sirap perang itu ke atasnya, dan rasanya sejuta kali lebih sedap.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>1015.44,'end_time'=>1015.84,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>1015.84,'end_time'=>1018.06,'target_text'=>'Bro, yeah, you were >> This is the one I had, and the green one.','source_text'=>'Betul kawan, macam itu Ini yang saya makan tadi, dan yang warna hijau.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>1018.16,'end_time'=>1019.58,'target_text'=>'Okay, no, I didn\'t have the green one.','source_text'=>'Okey, tak, saya tak makan yang hijau.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>1019.68,'end_time'=>1024.1,'target_text'=>'I had I had the white >> But I can\'t remember if they put the sauce on it, but I do remember the powder.','source_text'=>'Saya makan yang putih Tapi saya tak ingat sama ada mereka tuang sos padanya, tapi saya memang ingat serbuk itu.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>1024.2,'end_time'=>1026.14,'target_text'=>'Well, you have to put the powder, or else it\'ll be too sticky.','source_text'=>'Awak memang kena letak serbuk itu, kalau tidak ia akan jadi terlalu melekit.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>1026.24,'end_time'=>1026.98,'target_text'=>'Yeah, exactly.','source_text'=>'Ya, tepat sekali.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1027.08,'end_time'=>1028.5,'target_text'=>'Cuz that one that one there is sticky.','source_text'=>'Sebab yang itu melekit.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>1028.6,'end_time'=>1029.94,'target_text'=>'Yeah, cuz they didn\'t put a powder on here.','source_text'=>'Ya, sebab mereka tak letak serbuk di sini.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>1030.04,'end_time'=>1031.54,'target_text'=>'So, what\'s the final verdict?','source_text'=>'Jadi, apa keputusan muktamadnya?','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>1031.64,'end_time'=>1033.46,'target_text'=>'>> [snorts] >> We finished pretty much all the food.','source_text'=>'Kita dah habiskan hampir kesemua makanan.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>1033.56,'end_time'=>1037.7,'target_text'=>'There\'s some mochi, some chips, some chicken left, but for the most part, we have the food.','source_text'=>'Tinggal sedikit mochi, kerepek, dan sedikit ayam, tapi sebahagian besarnya kita dah makan.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>1037.8,'end_time'=>1038.78,'target_text'=>'This is just pure sugar.','source_text'=>'Air ini memang gula tulen.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>1038.88,'end_time'=>1040.22,'target_text'=>'I I don\'t think I would get this again.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya takkan beli lagi air ini.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>1040.32,'end_time'=>1042.94,'target_text'=>'I would just get like water or something, but it was all right.','source_text'=>'Saya lebih rela beli air mineral atau apa-apa, tapi bolehlah.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>1043.04,'end_time'=>1046.1,'target_text'=>'I think out of all the things here, my favorite','source_text'=>'Saya rasa antara semua barang di sini, kegemaran saya','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>1046.2,'end_time'=>1048.82,'target_text'=>'My favorite thing we got from 7-Eleven, what was your favorite?','source_text'=>'Makanan kegemaran yang kita beli dari 7-Eleven, apa makanan kegemaran awak?','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>1048.92,'end_time'=>1049.24,'target_text'=>'Let me think.','source_text'=>'Biar saya fikir sekejap.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>1049.24,'end_time'=>1050.46,'target_text'=>'Definitely this curry here.','source_text'=>'Pastinya kari ini.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>1050.56,'end_time'=>1052.14,'target_text'=>'Like it actually tasted really good.','source_text'=>'Rasanya memang sangat sedap.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>1052.24,'end_time'=>1054.82,'target_text'=>'Like this tasted like a meal that you could maybe eat at a restaurant.','source_text'=>'Rasanya seperti hidangan yang mungkin awak makan di restoran.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>1054.92,'end_time'=>1060.82,'target_text'=>'Obviously the portion\'s a little small because you\'re all buying it from convenience store, but the flavor was there.','source_text'=>'Tentunya saiz hidangannya agak kecil sebab awak beli di kedai serbaneka, tapi rasanya memang cukup.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>1060.92,'end_time'=>1067.02,'target_text'=>'The egg obviously you can\'t have a runny egg in a microwave meal like that, but the curry was good, the rice was good, and','source_text'=>'Telurnya sudah tentu awak tak boleh dapat telur cair dalam makanan ketuhar gelombang mikro begini, tapi karinya sedap, nasinya sedap, dan','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>1067.12,'end_time'=>1068.1,'target_text'=>'it all worked well together.','source_text'=>'semuanya sangat serasi bersama.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>1068.2,'end_time'=>1069.22,'target_text'=>'So I did enjoy that.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya memang sukakan yang itu.','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>1069.32,'end_time'=>1071.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, for me, I\'m not a big fan of Cheetos.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya pula, saya bukan peminat tegar Cheetos.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>1071.36,'end_time'=>1072.78,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know why I even got those.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kenapa saya beli benda itu tadi.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>1072.88,'end_time'=>1074.74,'target_text'=>'The mochi was just really sweet.','source_text'=>'Mochinya pula cuma terlalu manis.','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>1074.84,'end_time'=>1077.42,'target_text'=>'And I guess the best would be the bao bun.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa yang paling sedap ialah pau itu.','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>1077.52,'end_time'=>1081.26,'target_text'=>'If they put a little less sugar in it, I think it would be so much better.','source_text'=>'Kalau mereka kurangkan sedikit gula di dalamnya, saya rasa ia akan jadi jauh lebih sedap.','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>1081.36,'end_time'=>1082.82,'target_text'=>'But the way it was, it was good.','source_text'=>'Tapi dengan keadaannya tadi, rasanya dah sedap.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>1082.92,'end_time'=>1086.46,'target_text'=>'At least the the bun part of it, the white part, it wasn\'t that sweet.','source_text'=>'Sekurang-kurangnya bahagian roti pau itu, bahagian putihnya, tidaklah begitu manis.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>1086.56,'end_time'=>1088.1,'target_text'=>'So that made it easier to eat.','source_text'=>'Jadi itu menjadikannya lebih mudah dimakan.','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>1088.2,'end_time'=>1089.3,'target_text'=>'So it kind of balanced it out.','source_text'=>'Jadi ia mengimbangi rasa manis intinya.','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>1089.4,'end_time'=>1090.94,'target_text'=>'But overall, wasn\'t too bad.','source_text'=>'Tapi secara keseluruhannya, tidaklah terlalu teruk.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1091.04,'end_time'=>1097.22,'target_text'=>'I think if you\'re in a rush or something or if you have a short break or short lunch, this is a good option cuz there\'s so','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kalau anda tergesa-gesa atau ada waktu rehat pendek untuk makan tengah hari, ini pilihan yang baik sebab ada terlalu','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1097.32,'end_time'=>1098.06,'target_text'=>'much selection there.','source_text'=>'banyak pilihan di sana.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1098.16,'end_time'=>1104.18,'target_text'=>'Like you see when we were there, like there\'s a whole wall of just different foods you can grab for lunch and microwave meals.','source_text'=>'Macam anda lihat masa kami di sana tadi, ada satu dinding penuh dengan pelbagai makanan tengah hari dan hidangan gelombang mikro.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1104.28,'end_time'=>1107.9,'target_text'=>'So honestly, if you go there often, you probably know what\'s best.','source_text'=>'Jadi sejujurnya, kalau anda selalu ke sana, anda pasti tahu apa yang paling sedap.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1108,'end_time'=>1109.26,'target_text'=>'So True.','source_text'=>'Betul itu.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1109.36,'end_time'=>1112.82,'target_text'=>'And I\'ve been to Japan and Japan\'s convenience stores are even better.','source_text'=>'Dan saya pernah ke Jepun dan kedai serbaneka Jepun jauh lebih hebat.','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1112.92,'end_time'=>1115.58,'target_text'=>'The selection Yeah, the selection\'s >> the same chain.','source_text'=>'Pilihannya Ya, pilihannya rangkaian kedai yang sama.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1115.68,'end_time'=>1116.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s amazing.','source_text'=>'Memang mengagumkan.','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1116.52,'end_time'=>1120.22,'target_text'=>'You could have like warm foods, like freshly baked pastries.','source_text'=>'Awak boleh dapatkan makanan panas, macam pastri yang baru dibakar.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1120.32,'end_time'=>1122.1,'target_text'=>'No, Yeah, you >> like freshly baked things.','source_text'=>'macam makanan yang baru dibakar segar.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1122.2,'end_time'=>1123.62,'target_text'=>'>> You can have fresh baked stuff, yeah.','source_text'=>'Awak boleh dapat makanan yang baru dibakar segar, ya.','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>1123.72,'end_time'=>1124.5,'target_text'=>'I\'ve been there.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah ke sana.','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>1124.6,'end_time'=>1130.38,'target_text'=>'It\'s been like 2 years since I\'ve last been to Japan, so my memory might be a little bit wrong, but yeah, I\'m pretty sure','source_text'=>'Dah kira-kira 2 tahun sejak kali terakhir saya ke Jepun, jadi memori saya mungkin sedikit kabur, tapi ya, saya agak pasti','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>1130.48,'end_time'=>1132.46,'target_text'=>'they had like fresh warm pastries and stuff.','source_text'=>'mereka ada pastri panas yang baru dibakar dan sebagainya.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>1132.56,'end_time'=>1137.54,'target_text'=>'Yeah, but I definitely think Thailand is maybe top five, maybe top three countries 7-Elevens.','source_text'=>'Ya, tapi saya rasa 7-Eleven Thailand mungkin berada dalam lima teratas, mungkin tiga teratas di dunia.','order'=>460],
            ['start_time'=>1137.64,'end_time'=>1143.62,'target_text'=>'They have like a lot of options, like The toasties are elite 7-Eleven food.','source_text'=>'Mereka ada banyak pilihan, macam Sandwic bakar (toasties) adalah makanan terbaik di 7-Eleven.','order'=>461],
            ['start_time'=>1143.72,'end_time'=>1147.7,'target_text'=>'If you never had one, when you come to Thailand, you need to go and buy [music] a toasty.','source_text'=>'Kalau anda belum pernah rasa, bila datang ke Thailand, anda wajib beli [muzik] toasty.','order'=>462],
            ['start_time'=>1147.8,'end_time'=>1150.38,'target_text'=>'Those are so really really good.','source_text'=>'Yang itu memang sangat-sangat sedap.','order'=>463],
            ['start_time'=>1150.48,'end_time'=>1151.26,'target_text'=>'Those are really good.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat sedap.','order'=>464],
            ['start_time'=>1151.36,'end_time'=>1158.58,'target_text'=>'If you\'re serious about becoming fluent in English, I\'ve built a full speaking, shadowing, and pronunciation course you can','source_text'=>'Jika anda serius ingin fasih berbahasa Inggeris, saya telah membina kursus pertuturan, teknik shadowing, dan sebutan yang lengkap yang anda boleh','order'=>465],
            ['start_time'=>1158.68,'end_time'=>1160.54,'target_text'=>'follow step-by-step.','source_text'=>'ikuti langkah demi langkah.','order'=>466],
            ['start_time'=>1160.64,'end_time'=>1169.5,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to over 60 video lessons right away, and I add three to five brand new lessons every week to keep the','source_text'=>'Anda mendapat akses serta-merta kepada lebih 60 pelajaran video, dan saya menambah tiga hingga lima pelajaran baharu setiap minggu untuk memastikan','order'=>467],
            ['start_time'=>1169.6,'end_time'=>1171.18,'target_text'=>'content fresh.','source_text'=>'kandungannya sentiasa segar.','order'=>468],
            ['start_time'=>1171.28,'end_time'=>1180.1,'target_text'=>'And you\'re not just getting videos, you also get an exclusive chat GPT prompt to help you master the pronunciation of any','source_text'=>'Dan anda bukan sekadar dapat video, anda juga mendapat prom ChatGPT eksklusif untuk bantu anda kuasai sebutan mana-mana','order'=>469],
            ['start_time'=>1180.2,'end_time'=>1180.6,'target_text'=>'word.','source_text'=>'perkataan.','order'=>470],
            ['start_time'=>1180.68,'end_time'=>1188.26,'target_text'=>'Plus, a step-by-step structure to follow, so you know exactly how to practice and get the most out of every lesson.','source_text'=>'Ditambah struktur langkah demi langkah untuk diikuti, jadi anda tahu persis bagaimana untuk berlatih dan memanfaatkan setiap pelajaran sebaiknya.','order'=>471],
            ['start_time'=>1188.36,'end_time'=>1190.86,'target_text'=>'Inside, we train pronunciation,','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya, kita melatih sebutan,','order'=>472],
            ['start_time'=>1190.96,'end_time'=>1194.34,'target_text'=>'accent, rhythm, and natural speaking.','source_text'=>'aksen, ritma, dan pertuturan semula jadi.','order'=>473],
            ['start_time'=>1194.44,'end_time'=>1199.18,'target_text'=>'So, you stop hesitating and start speaking with real confidence.','source_text'=>'Supaya anda berhenti teragak-agak dan mula bertutur dengan penuh keyakinan sebenar.','order'=>474],
            ['start_time'=>1199.28,'end_time'=>1202.74,'target_text'=>'Now, here\'s a sneak peek at what you get the moment you join.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, ini sedikit intipan tentang apa yang anda dapat sebaik sahaja anda menyertainya.','order'=>475],
            ['start_time'=>1202.84,'end_time'=>1206.7,'target_text'=>'So, I wouldn\'t take a legal I\'m down to He\'s [music] already so cranky.','source_text'=>'Jadi jangan risau tentang masalah teknikal semuanya disediakan.','order'=>476],
            ['start_time'=>1206.8,'end_time'=>1210.42,'target_text'=>'>> the jeans and one hoodie, which Click the link in my description to join.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan dalam penerangan saya untuk menyertainya.','order'=>477],
            ['start_time'=>1210.52,'end_time'=>1211.34,'target_text'=>'bug catcher.','source_text'=>'Perangkap serangga.','order'=>478],
            ['start_time'=>1211.44,'end_time'=>1215.42,'target_text'=>'It attracts the bugs with the light, and then you can see here we have a freezer.','source_text'=>'Ia menarik serangga dengan cahaya, dan kemudian di sini kita ada peti beku.','order'=>479],
            ['start_time'=>1215.52,'end_time'=>1217.18,'target_text'=>'There\'s ice inside the freezer.','source_text'=>'Ada ais di dalam peti beku.','order'=>480],
            ['start_time'=>1217.28,'end_time'=>1219.02,'target_text'=>'pronunciation >> People pronounce it differently.','source_text'=>'Sebutan Orang sebut dengan cara berbeza.','order'=>481],
            ['start_time'=>1219.12,'end_time'=>1221.1,'target_text'=>'I\'ve heard lychee, [music] I\'ve heard litchi.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah dengar lychee, [muzik] saya pernah dengar litchi.','order'=>482],
            ['start_time'=>1221.2,'end_time'=>1222.1,'target_text'=>'>> to get a tea.','source_text'=>'Nak beli teh.','order'=>483],
            ['start_time'=>1222.2,'end_time'=>1224.76,'target_text'=>'If you see a lemon Here, these are squid.','source_text'=>'Kalau awak nampak lemon Di sini, ini adalah sotong.','order'=>484],
            ['start_time'=>1224.86,'end_time'=>1226.34,'target_text'=>'[music] >> These are squid, yeah.','source_text'=>'Ini sotong, ya.','order'=>485],
            ['start_time'=>1226.44,'end_time'=>1226.86,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>486],
            ['start_time'=>1226.96,'end_time'=>1230.62,'target_text'=>'But, any main course, an actual like entree food right here.','source_text'=>'Tapi apa-apa pun hidangan utama, makanan utama yang sebenar di sini.','order'=>487],
            ['start_time'=>1230.72,'end_time'=>1232.02,'target_text'=>'There are a lot of choices.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak pilihan.','order'=>488],
            ['start_time'=>1232.12,'end_time'=>1233.74,'target_text'=>'This looks like seafood.','source_text'=>'Ini nampak seperti makanan laut.','order'=>489],
            ['start_time'=>1233.84,'end_time'=>1238.98,'target_text'=>'Head back to our apartment and we\'ll try this and I don\'t know if you guys have had honeycomb before.','source_text'=>'Balik ke apartmen dan kita akan rasa ini dan saya tak tahu kalau anda pernah makan sarang lebah sebelum ini.','order'=>490],
            ['start_time'=>1239.08,'end_time'=>1239.9,'target_text'=>'Honeycomb.','source_text'=>'Sarang lebah.','order'=>491],
            ['start_time'=>1240,'end_time'=>1240.86,'target_text'=>'This is what it looks like.','source_text'=>'Macam inilah rupanya.','order'=>492],
