            ['start_time'=>235.84,'end_time'=>238.94,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a really long long mall.','source_text'=>'Bentuk dia macam pusat beli-belah yang sangat panjang membujur.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>239.04,'end_time'=>240.26,'target_text'=>'Honestly, it actually goes really far.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, ia memang memanjang jauh sangat ke hadapan.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>240.36,'end_time'=>244.5,'target_text'=>'I can\'t even see the end, but it\'s a clothing market, Pyeonghwa Clothing Market.','source_text'=>'Saya sampai tak nampak hujung dia, tapi ni pasar pakaian, Pasar Pakaian Pyeonghwa.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>244.6,'end_time'=>245,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom kita pergi.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>245.04,'end_time'=>245.78,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go check it out.','source_text'=>'Jom kita masuk tengok.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>245.88,'end_time'=>247.18,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never been in this market.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah masuk pasar ni sebelum ni.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>247.28,'end_time'=>248.14,'target_text'=>'I want to try to get in.','source_text'=>'Saya nak cuba masuk ke dalam.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>248.24,'end_time'=>251.42,'target_text'=>'It kind of looks not too busy on the outside, but I want to get inside to see.','source_text'=>'Dari luar nampak tak berapa sibuk, tapi saya nak masuk dalam untuk tengok sendiri.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>251.52,'end_time'=>253.98,'target_text'=>'I imagine it\'s just a huge clothing market.','source_text'=>'Saya bayangkan ia pasar pakaian yang teramat besar.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>254.08,'end_time'=>255.34,'target_text'=>'>> Look how far it goes, man.','source_text'=>'>> Tengok betapa panjangnya bangunan ni, kawan.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>255.44,'end_time'=>256.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s it\'s huge, man.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, memang sangat besar gila.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>256.68,'end_time'=>257.54,'target_text'=>'>> You can\'t even see the end.','source_text'=>'>> Tak nampak pun kat mana penghujungnya.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>257.64,'end_time'=>258.46,'target_text'=>'It bends with the road.','source_text'=>'Bentuk dia melengkung ikut jalan raya ni.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>258.56,'end_time'=>259.26,'target_text'=>'That\'s how big it is.','source_text'=>'Begitulah betapa besarnya tempat ni.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>259.36,'end_time'=>261.98,'target_text'=>'And you can see this building right here is under construction.','source_text'=>'Dan korang boleh nampak bangunan sebelah sini sedang dalam pembinaan.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>262.08,'end_time'=>263.78,'target_text'=>'You can actually kind of hear someone working.','source_text'=>'Korang sebenarnya boleh dengar bunyi orang bertukang.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>263.88,'end_time'=>265.78,'target_text'=>'They\'re constructing a new building there.','source_text'=>'Dorang tengah bina bangunan baharu kat situ.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>265.88,'end_time'=>268.38,'target_text'=>'Probably apartments, like this one.','source_text'=>'Mungkin bangunan apartmen, macam yang satu ni.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>268.48,'end_time'=>270.7,'target_text'=>'Actually, no, that looks like more like an office.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya tak, yang tu nampak macam bangunan pejabat.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>270.8,'end_time'=>271.34,'target_text'=>'Kind of getting cold.','source_text'=>'Udara mula rasa makin sejuk.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>271.44,'end_time'=>273.62,'target_text'=>'I think I need to buy that jacket like soon.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya kena beli jaket tu secepat mungkin.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>273.72,'end_time'=>275.46,'target_text'=>'But after this, we can go to Gwangjang Market.','source_text'=>'Tapi lepas ni, kita boleh terus pergi ke Pasar Gwangjang.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>275.56,'end_time'=>276.34,'target_text'=>'It\'ll be warm there.','source_text'=>'Kat sana terlindung dan lebih suam.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>276.44,'end_time'=>278.26,'target_text'=>'We could eat something cuz it\'s like lunchtime.','source_text'=>'Kita boleh cari makan sikit sebab sekarang dah waktu makan tengah hari.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>278.36,'end_time'=>283.22,'target_text'=>'And then we could go to a department store, probably at Myeongdong, since they have the biggest ones there.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu kita boleh pergi ke gedung membeli-belah, mungkin dekat Myeongdong sebab yang paling besar ada kat sana.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>283.32,'end_time'=>285.34,'target_text'=>'Oh, did you got a bunch of hats in here?','source_text'=>'Oh, tengok banyak topi kat dalam ni?','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>285.44,'end_time'=>287.5,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it\'s going to be the same all inside, though.','source_text'=>'Ya, tapi bahagian dalam pun lebih kurang sama je semuanya.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>287.6,'end_time'=>288.5,'target_text'=>'Yeah, let\'s go inside.','source_text'=>'Ya, jom kita masuk dalam.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>288.6,'end_time'=>289.94,'target_text'=>'I would get that hat, honestly.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya saya tertarik nak beli topi tu.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>290.04,'end_time'=>290.74,'target_text'=>'Look at that, huh?','source_text'=>'Cuba tengok tu, lawa kan?','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>290.84,'end_time'=>291.78,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it\'s probably warm.','source_text'=>'Ya, topi tu mesti tebal dan hangat.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>291.88,'end_time'=>293.98,'target_text'=>'Ooh, they got so many hats in there.','source_text'=>'Uish, banyak betul pilihan topi dorang ada kat dalam tu.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>294.08,'end_time'=>294.9,'target_text'=>'We just got in.','source_text'=>'Kita baru je melangkah masuk.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>295,'end_time'=>297.14,'target_text'=>'Like the entrance is literally right there.','source_text'=>'Pintu masuk dia ada betul-betul kat sebelah situ.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>297.24,'end_time'=>298.26,'target_text'=>'And this is the first stall.','source_text'=>'Dan ini gerai yang paling pertama.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>298.36,'end_time'=>302.54,'target_text'=>'It kind of looks like, you know, pajamas and, you know, clothes that you wear to bed.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam baju tidur dan pakaian santai untuk tidur malam.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>302.64,'end_time'=>303.78,'target_text'=>'Well, let\'s check this out.','source_text'=>'Apa pun, jom kita tinjau-tinjau.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>303.88,'end_time'=>305.14,'target_text'=>'Like I don\'t even know where to start.','source_text'=>'Sampai saya tak tahu nak mula tengok dari mana.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>305.24,'end_time'=>307.66,'target_text'=>'Honestly, I could probably buy a scarf here for a pretty good deal.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, saya rasa boleh dapat mafla leher kat sini dengan tawaran harga yang berpatutan.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>307.76,'end_time'=>310.38,'target_text'=>'There\'s mostly like older Korean ladies here.','source_text'=>'Kebanyakan yang ada kat sini mak cik-mak cik warga emas Korea.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>310.48,'end_time'=>312.42,'target_text'=>'I would assume they only take cash here.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kedai-kedai kat sini cuma terima bayaran tunai saja.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>312.52,'end_time'=>312.72,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Saya pun tak pasti sangat.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>312.72,'end_time'=>316.02,'target_text'=>'If this was in somewhere in South America, I would be sketched out.','source_text'=>'Kalau tempat macam ni kat suatu tempat di Amerika Selatan, saya dah rasa cuak dah.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>316.12,'end_time'=>316.82,'target_text'=>'I\'d get robbed.','source_text'=>'Dah kena rompak rasanya.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>316.92,'end_time'=>321.34,'target_text'=>'Cuz usually in places like this in South America where they sell like cheaper stuff is more dangerous.','source_text'=>'Sebab biasanya tempat jual barang murah macam ni kat Amerika Selatan lebih berisiko bahaya.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>321.44,'end_time'=>322.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s more dangerous.','source_text'=>'Memang jauh lebih bahaya.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>322.44,'end_time'=>324.66,'target_text'=>'I think this is all stuff that\'s made in Korea, though.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya rasa barang-barang kat sini semuanya buatan Korea.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>324.76,'end_time'=>325.16,'target_text'=>'Probably.','source_text'=>'Mungkin juga.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>325.24,'end_time'=>328.26,'target_text'=>'Everyone that buys stuff at Hongdae buys their stuff here.','source_text'=>'Semua peniaga yang jual barang kat Hongdae ambil stok dorang dari sini.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>328.36,'end_time'=>333.62,'target_text'=>'Okay, so I got these AirPods that can live translate Korean into English.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi saya ada fon telinga AirPods ni yang boleh terjemah bahasa Korea ke bahasa Inggeris secara langsung.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>333.72,'end_time'=>337.46,'target_text'=>'So I\'m going to start live translation and And why do you want to do that?','source_text'=>'Jadi saya akan aktifkan terjemahan langsung dan... kenapa awak nak buat macam tu?','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>337.56,'end_time'=>339.54,'target_text'=>'Uh just to eavesdrop.','source_text'=>'Saja nak pasang telinga dengar perbualan dorang.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>339.64,'end_time'=>341.72,'target_text'=>'Now it\'s translating.','source_text'=>'Sekarang ia dah mula menterjemah.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>343.28,'end_time'=>346.54,'target_text'=>'There\'s a lot of people speaking, so it\'s hard to catch someone\'s voice.','source_text'=>'Ramai sangat orang tengah bercakap, jadi susah nak tangkap suara seseorang secara jelas.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>346.64,'end_time'=>348.66,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we\'re going up to the last floor.','source_text'=>'Okey, sekarang kita naik ke tingkat paling atas.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>348.76,'end_time'=>351.9,'target_text'=>'Actually looks closed, but let\'s go up.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam dah tutup, tapi jom kita naik juga tengok.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>352,'end_time'=>354.58,'target_text'=>'Okay, so yeah, you can see actually there\'s a couple more floors.','source_text'=>'Okey, ya, korang boleh tengok sebenarnya ada beberapa tingkat lagi.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>354.68,'end_time'=>356.38,'target_text'=>'Yeah, so these floors are closed.','source_text'=>'Ya, tingkat-tingkat ni dah ditutup.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>356.48,'end_time'=>361.94,'target_text'=>'So we\'ll go back down and walk back down because top floors are closed, so no point in going up there.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita turun balik berjalan ke bawah sebab tingkat atas tutup, tak ada gunanya naik ke sana.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>362.04,'end_time'=>365.66,'target_text'=>'But I always wanted to go inside this huge long mall.','source_text'=>'Tapi dari dulu lagi saya memang teringin nak masuk dalam pusat beli-belah panjang ni.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>365.76,'end_time'=>370.54,'target_text'=>'I always wanted to go inside, so now I finally can say that I have done it.','source_text'=>'Saya selalu berhajat nak masuk, jadi sekarang akhirnya saya boleh cakap saya dah jejakkan kaki ke sini.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>370.64,'end_time'=>373.1,'target_text'=>'Dude, imagine walking down the whole length of this.','source_text'=>'Fuh, bayangkan berjalan kaki sepanjang bangunan ni dari hujung ke hujung.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>373.2,'end_time'=>374.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s so long.','source_text'=>'Memang terlampau panjang.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>374.12,'end_time'=>377.14,'target_text'=>'Like you saw in the out side, like it\'s really really long.','source_text'=>'Macam yang korang tengok kat luar tadi, ia memang betul-betul panjang.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>377.24,'end_time'=>380.54,'target_text'=>'But yeah, now we\'re walking down the stairs trying to find a way out.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, sekarang kita menuruni tangga cuba cari jalan keluar.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>380.64,'end_time'=>381.94,'target_text'=>'I think this is where we came in from.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa dari sini tempat kita masuk tadi.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>382.04,'end_time'=>384.06,'target_text'=>'We came in from there, so let\'s walk to the end here.','source_text'=>'Kita masuk ikut arah sana, jadi jom kita jalan terus sampai ke hujung lorong ni.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>384.16,'end_time'=>389.02,'target_text'=>'Walk to the end cuz we need to go to the end anyways, and and here it\'s warm, and then we\'ll leave through that end.','source_text'=>'Jalan ke hujung sebab kita memang nak menuju ke hujung sana pun, lagipun kat sini suam, lepas tu baru kita keluar ikut pintu hujung tu.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>389.12,'end_time'=>390.02,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom gerak.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>390.12,'end_time'=>392.58,'target_text'=>'Right now we\'re in an underground shopping center.','source_text'=>'Sekarang ni kita berada di pusat beli-belah bawah tanah.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>392.68,'end_time'=>398.62,'target_text'=>'We had to walk down, and the only reason we\'re in here is just to cross the road, so there\'s no crosswalk, so we have to go','source_text'=>'Kita kena turun ke bawah, dan satu-satunya sebab kita masuk sini adalah semata-mata nak lintas jalan, sebab tak ada lintasan pejalan kaki atas jalan raya','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>398.72,'end_time'=>402.34,'target_text'=>'underground, cross through here, and now we can go back out up and out.','source_text'=>'jadi kita kena lalu bawah tanah, menyeberang kat sini, dan sekarang kita boleh naik semula ke atas dan keluar.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>402.44,'end_time'=>403.66,'target_text'=>'So I believe yeah, right here.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya yakin ya, betul-betul kat sini.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>403.76,'end_time'=>405.86,'target_text'=>'Here\'s the exit, so Yeah, we\'re underground.','source_text'=>'Ini pintu keluarnya, jadi ya, kita berada di laluan bawah tanah.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>405.96,'end_time'=>408.58,'target_text'=>'We came down from that end, and now we\'re just exiting here.','source_text'=>'Kita turun dari hujung sebelah sana, dan sekarang kita keluar ikut sini.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>408.68,'end_time'=>413.3,'target_text'=>'And this isn\'t a subway station, this is just an underground shopping mall.','source_text'=>'Dan tempat ni bukan stesen kereta api bawah tanah, ini sekadar pusat beli-belah bawah tanah biasa.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>413.4,'end_time'=>418.86,'target_text'=>'In these past years, it\'s become more like a tourist trap, but still everything is so cool to see, and it\'s a really good','source_text'=>'Sejak beberapa tahun kebelakangan ni, tempat ni dah makin jadi tumpuan perangkap pelancong, tapi tetap sangat menarik untuk dilihat dan tempat yang sangat bagus','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>418.96,'end_time'=>421.62,'target_text'=>'place to come if you\'re ever in Korea.','source_text'=>'untuk dikunjungi kalau korang berpeluang datang ke Korea.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>421.72,'end_time'=>426.82,'target_text'=>'It like grinds all those beans into a paste, and then they make these pancakes right here out of it.','source_text'=>'Mesin tu kisar semua kacang jadi pes lumat, lepas tu dorang buat lempeng daripada bancuhan tu kat sini.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>426.92,'end_time'=>432.94,'target_text'=>'If you guys are serious about learning English and you want to get access to over 30 exclusive videos, then check out my Patreon','source_text'=>'Kalau korang serius nak belajar bahasa Inggeris dan nak akses lebih 30 video eksklusif, layari laman Patreon saya','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>433.04,'end_time'=>439.82,'target_text'=>'in the description to practice your pronunciation, your accent, and your confidence in speaking English.','source_text'=>'di bahagian penerangan untuk latih sebutan, loghat, serta keyakinan bercakap dalam bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>439.92,'end_time'=>443.14,'target_text'=>'Here\'s a sneak peek at what you\'ll get the moment you join.','source_text'=>'Ini sedutan apa yang korang akan dapat serta-merta bila mendaftar.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>443.24,'end_time'=>445.26,'target_text'=>'In this lesson, I want you to shadow me.','source_text'=>'Dalam sesi kali ni, saya nak korang \'shadow\' (tiru sebutan) saya.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>445.36,'end_time'=>446.06,'target_text'=>'What does that mean?','source_text'=>'Apa maksudnya?','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>446.16,'end_time'=>449.82,'target_text'=>'It means I have issue with my weight, [music] at least outwardly.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya saya ada masalah dengan berat badan saya, sekurang-kurangnya dari pandangan luaran.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>449.92,'end_time'=>451.26,'target_text'=>'And I\'m good at my job.','source_text'=>'Dan saya cekap buat kerja saya.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>451.36,'end_time'=>453.3,'target_text'=>'John proposed a few months later.','source_text'=>'John melamar beberapa bulan kemudian.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>453.4,'end_time'=>454.7,'target_text'=>'She stood up for herself.','source_text'=>'Dia berani mempertahankan dirinya sendiri.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>454.8,'end_time'=>455.54,'target_text'=>'She\'s 41.','source_text'=>'Umur dia 41 tahun.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>455.64,'end_time'=>457.5,'target_text'=>'I mean, she\'s a grown woman.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, dia dah wanita dewasa matang.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>457.6,'end_time'=>463.18,'target_text'=>'So if you guys want to get access to all that and more and three new videos every single week.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau korang nak dapatkan akses ke semua itu dan banyak lagi serta tiga video baharu setiap minggu.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>463.28,'end_time'=>464.14,'target_text'=>'Sign up today.','source_text'=>'Daftarlah hari ini.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>464.24,'end_time'=>466.9,'target_text'=>'All of these stalls are super super famous.','source_text'=>'Semua gerai kat sini teramat sangat terkenal.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>467,'end_time'=>468.34,'target_text'=>'Like everyone has pictures.','source_text'=>'Boleh kata setiap gerai ada gambar digantung.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>468.44,'end_time'=>470.06,'target_text'=>'Some of them have pictures with famous people.','source_text'=>'Ada yang tampal gambar bersama selebriti terkenal.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>470.16,'end_time'=>472.44,'target_text'=>'Yeah, like this one.','source_text'=>'Ya, macam yang satu ni.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>473.6,'end_time'=>476.94,'target_text'=>'The smells, the vibes, like it\'s a lot busier than I thought it would be.','source_text'=>'Bau aroma makanan, suasana meriah, tempat ni jauh lebih sesak daripada yang saya jangkakan.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>477.04,'end_time'=>479.54,'target_text'=>'Every time I\'ve come in here it\'s been like 7:00 p.m.','source_text'=>'Setiap kali saya datang sini biasanya waktu sekitar pukul 7 petang.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>479.64,'end_time'=>482.14,'target_text'=>'But I didn\'t know it was this busy this time of day.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya tak sangka ia sesibuk ini pada waktu siang macam ni.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>482.24,'end_time'=>483.22,'target_text'=>'You know is this food?','source_text'=>'Awak tahu tak ini makanan apa?','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>483.32,'end_time'=>483.74,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Tak tahu.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>483.84,'end_time'=>487.62,'target_text'=>'But over here is where those like super viral twisted donuts are.','source_text'=>'Tapi sebelah sini tempat ada donat pintal yang sangat viral tu.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>487.72,'end_time'=>488.38,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh, ya.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>488.48,'end_time'=>489.78,'target_text'=>'That\'s what I had when I was here.','source_text'=>'Itu yang saya makan masa datang sini dulu.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>489.88,'end_time'=>492.08,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go get those.','source_text'=>'Jom kita pergi beli donat tu.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>492.44,'end_time'=>494.5,'target_text'=>'So the line is so long and they have to let people pass.','source_text'=>'Jadi barisan beratur panjang sangat dan dorang kena beri laluan untuk orang lalu-lalang.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>494.6,'end_time'=>496.66,'target_text'=>'So we have to stand here for the line.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita kena berdiri kat sini dalam barisan.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>496.76,'end_time'=>498.62,'target_text'=>'But that\'s where you go to the second line.','source_text'=>'Tapi kat sana baru korang sambung ke barisan kedua.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>498.72,'end_time'=>500.98,'target_text'=>'So there\'s a double line just to get these donuts.','source_text'=>'Sampai ada dua barisan berasingan semata-mata nak beli donat ni.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>501.08,'end_time'=>503.3,'target_text'=>'So they are like super viral and famous.','source_text'=>'Memang donat ni teramat viral dan popular.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>503.4,'end_time'=>509.86,'target_text'=>'These specific donuts because they\'re like these twisted donuts that are just like super fresh, moist, doughy, like they\'re','source_text'=>'Khusus donat jenis ni sebab bentuk pintal dia sangat segar panas, lembut gebu, bertekstur liat sedap','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>509.96,'end_time'=>512.02,'target_text'=>'amazing and just covered in sugar.','source_text'=>'sangat luar biasa enak dan disalut gula pasir.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>512.12,'end_time'=>514.1,'target_text'=>'Bro, look at the people with the cut open masks.','source_text'=>'Bro, tengok orang yang pakai pelitup muka berlubang tu.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>514.2,'end_time'=>515.9,'target_text'=>'Dude, COVID era was crazy.','source_text'=>'Fuh, zaman COVID dulu memang pelik-pelik.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>516,'end_time'=>516.66,'target_text'=>'You see that?','source_text'=>'Korang nampak tu?','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>516.76,'end_time'=>517.34,'target_text'=>'That\'s the menu there.','source_text'=>'Itu senarai menu kat sana.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>517.44,'end_time'=>517.98,'target_text'=>'What do they have?','source_text'=>'Dorang jual apa je?','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>518.08,'end_time'=>520.02,'target_text'=>'Sweet rice twist, red bean donut.','source_text'=>'Donat pintal pulut manis, donat kacang merah.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>520.12,'end_time'=>520.52,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>520.52,'end_time'=>521.74,'target_text'=>'You like red bean, don\'t you?','source_text'=>'Awak suka kacang merah, kan?','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>521.84,'end_time'=>524.26,'target_text'=>'>> the original one or like the super popular one.','source_text'=>'>> jenis asli atau yang paling laris popular tu.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>524.36,'end_time'=>527.58,'target_text'=>'Then red bean and then a black rice glutinous and then sweet potato.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu kacang merah, pulut beras hitam, dan ubi keledek manis.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>527.68,'end_time'=>528.58,'target_text'=>'We\'ll get one of each.','source_text'=>'Kita ambil satu untuk setiap jenis.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>528.68,'end_time'=>531.28,'target_text'=>'I\'m just going to get the original.','source_text'=>'Saya nak ambil perisa asli je.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>533.48,'end_time'=>535.34,'target_text'=>'I wonder what she\'s sprinkling on there.','source_text'=>'Saya tertanya-tanya apa serbuk yang mak cik tu tabur kat atas tu.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>535.44,'end_time'=>537.82,'target_text'=>'Looks like corn flour or something or a type of flour.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam tepung jagung atau sejenis tepung lain.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>537.92,'end_time'=>539.38,'target_text'=>'It does look like corn flour, yeah.','source_text'=>'Memang nampak macam tepung jagung, ya.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>539.48,'end_time'=>541.1,'target_text'=>'Then she just like slices it up.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu dia potong doh tu laju-laju.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>541.2,'end_time'=>546.54,'target_text'=>'No measurements and then they twist it, put it back in that tray, deep fry it for a couple seconds.','source_text'=>'Tak payah sukat, dorang pintal, letak balik dalam talam, lepas tu goreng celur sekejap beberapa saat.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>546.64,'end_time'=>547.74,'target_text'=>'Hello.','source_text'=>'Helo.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>547.84,'end_time'=>548.98,'target_text'=>'Uh one of each, please.','source_text'=>'Boleh saya dapatkan satu untuk setiap jenis?','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>549.08,'end_time'=>550.02,'target_text'=>'One each.','source_text'=>'Satu setiap satu.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>550.12,'end_time'=>552.86,'target_text'=>'So we got one of each, of course.','source_text'=>'Jadi mestilah kita beli satu untuk setiap jenis perisa.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>552.96,'end_time'=>556.86,'target_text'=>'So I think we\'ll start with I\'ll pick a random one.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa kita mula dengan... saya ambil satu secara rawak.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>556.96,'end_time'=>558.38,'target_text'=>'Ooh, this one\'s heavy.','source_text'=>'Ooh, yang ni rasa berat.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>558.48,'end_time'=>559.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s like something in there.','source_text'=>'Macam ada inti padat kat dalam dia.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>559.4,'end_time'=>559.94,'target_text'=>'It\'s the red bean one.','source_text'=>'Ini donat inti kacang merah.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>560.04,'end_time'=>562.54,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, I hope I really don\'t like red bean.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, saya harap bukan... saya betul-betul tak gemar kacang merah.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>562.64,'end_time'=>565.32,'target_text'=>'Red bean is my least favorite.','source_text'=>'Kacang merah ni paling saya tak gemar sekali.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>566.04,'end_time'=>568.06,'target_text'=>'The wait time for this was like 5 seconds, dude.','source_text'=>'Masa menunggu nak dapat donat ni macam 5 saat je, kawan.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>568.16,'end_time'=>571.18,'target_text'=>'She just took your order, took your money, and then sent you off.','source_text'=>'Mak cik tu terus ambil pesanan, ambil duit, lepas tu serahkan plastik makanan.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>571.28,'end_time'=>572.3,'target_text'=>'Then she\'s like, get out of here.','source_text'=>'Macam dia kata, okey jalan cepat.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>572.4,'end_time'=>575.66,'target_text'=>'Which I mean I respect cuz I like to get my food quick.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya suka macam tu sebab saya gemar dapat makanan pantas.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>575.76,'end_time'=>577.56,'target_text'=>'Well,','source_text'=>'Apa pun,','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>577.84,'end_time'=>579.78,'target_text'=>'red bean, not a fan to be honest.','source_text'=>'kacang merah ni, sejujurnya saya kurang minat.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>579.88,'end_time'=>580.34,'target_text'=>'Not a fan.','source_text'=>'Kurang gemar.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>580.44,'end_time'=>580.94,'target_text'=>'Next.','source_text'=>'Yang seterusnya.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>581.04,'end_time'=>583.34,'target_text'=>'So, there was glutinous rice and glutinous black rice.','source_text'=>'Jadi, tadi ada jenis beras pulut biasa dan pulut hitam.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>583.44,'end_time'=>586.2,'target_text'=>'This one is just a normal one.','source_text'=>'Yang ini jenis biasa saja.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>586.52,'end_time'=>586.88,'target_text'=>'Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'Oh, wah.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>586.88,'end_time'=>588.78,'target_text'=>'>> sweet potato one.','source_text'=>'>> inti ubi keledek manis.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>588.88,'end_time'=>590.22,'target_text'=>'So, this one was a sweet potato.','source_text'=>'Jadi, yang ini inti ubi keledek.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>590.32,'end_time'=>592.34,'target_text'=>'It was better, but not really my thing to be honest.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia lebih sedap, tapi sejujurnya bukan selera saya sangat.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>592.44,'end_time'=>595.06,'target_text'=>'Like people love that, but this is the black black rice.','source_text'=>'Ramai orang suka, tapi yang ini pula pulut beras hitam.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>595.16,'end_time'=>595.74,'target_text'=>'Glutinous rice.','source_text'=>'Beras pulut.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>595.84,'end_time'=>598.28,'target_text'=>'Black glutinous rice.','source_text'=>'Pulut hitam.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>599.44,'end_time'=>600.22,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know what\'s in there.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu apa inti kat dalam ni.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>600.32,'end_time'=>601.46,'target_text'=>'Think it was red bean, too.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam inti kacang merah juga.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>601.56,'end_time'=>602.82,'target_text'=>'I really don\'t like red bean.','source_text'=>'Saya memang betul-betul tak suka kacang merah.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>602.92,'end_time'=>604.66,'target_text'=>'Out of those three, this one was actually cold.','source_text'=>'Daripada tiga jenis tu, yang satu ni sebenarnya dah sejuk.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>604.76,'end_time'=>607.66,'target_text'=>'Maybe cuz no one wants that one, but this is the most popular one.','source_text'=>'Mungkin sebab tak ramai orang beli yang tu, tapi yang ini paling popular sekali.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>607.76,'end_time'=>610.26,'target_text'=>'Captain Marvel herself came here just to have this.','source_text'=>'Pelakon Captain Marvel sendiri pernah datang sini semata-mata nak rasa donat ni.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>610.36,'end_time'=>611.54,'target_text'=>'Like there\'s a picture there somewhere.','source_text'=>'Ada gambar dia digantung kat satu sudut.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>611.64,'end_time'=>615.7,'target_text'=>'And it\'s only 1,000 won, which is like 70 cents USD.','source_text'=>'Dan harga dia cuma 1,000 won, dalam sekitar 70 sen dolar AS.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>615.8,'end_time'=>617.92,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try it.','source_text'=>'Jom kita rasa.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>618.64,'end_time'=>624.22,'target_text'=>'Okay, so this lady right here, her noodles were on Netflix on this show right here.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi mak cik sebelah sini, mi dia pernah masuk Netflix dalam rancangan yang ditayangkan ni.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>624.32,'end_time'=>625.7,'target_text'=>'She was on this Netflix series.','source_text'=>'Dia pernah muncul dalam siri dokumentari Netflix.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>625.8,'end_time'=>626.5,'target_text'=>'It was cleared out.','source_text'=>'Masa tu kawasan ni dikosongkan.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>626.6,'end_time'=>628.1,'target_text'=>'I wonder what time of day they did this.','source_text'=>'Saya tertanya-tanya waktu bila dorang buat penggambaran tu.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>628.2,'end_time'=>629.74,'target_text'=>'But this was in 2019.','source_text'=>'Tapi ini penggambaran tahun 2019 dulu.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>629.84,'end_time'=>630.42,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>630.52,'end_time'=>631.34,'target_text'=>'This is the menu.','source_text'=>'Ini menu makanannya.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>631.44,'end_time'=>634.02,'target_text'=>'I think we\'re going to go with the I think this is a good one.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kita patut pilih... saya rasa menu ni pilihan menarik.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>634.12,'end_time'=>636.02,'target_text'=>'The mandu kalguksu.','source_text'=>'Menu mandu kalguksu (mi sup bersama ladu).','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>636.12,'end_time'=>638.26,'target_text'=>'That\'s just Mandu is the dumplings.','source_text'=>'Mandu tu adalah sejenis ladu (dumpling).','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>638.36,'end_time'=>639.62,'target_text'=>'And which one do you want?','source_text'=>'Dan awak pula nak pilih yang mana?','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>639.72,'end_time'=>642.46,'target_text'=>'Probably get the best one cuz it does say it\'s the best one they have, so.','source_text'=>'Mungkin ambil yang paling istimewa sebab menu tulis itu yang terbaik dorang ada.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>642.56,'end_time'=>645.1,'target_text'=>'This one is like the off-cut of noodles, so it\'s thicker pieces.','source_text'=>'Yang ni macam hirisan lebihan mi, jadi kepingan dia lebih tebal.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>645.2,'end_time'=>646.3,'target_text'=>'What\'s this one?','source_text'=>'Yang ini apa pula?','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>646.4,'end_time'=>648.02,'target_text'=>'This is the same as this, but with mandu.','source_text'=>'Yang ni sama macam tadi, cuma ditambah ladu mandu.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>648.12,'end_time'=>648.78,'target_text'=>'What about this one?','source_text'=>'Kalau yang ini macam mana pula?','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>648.88,'end_time'=>649.9,'target_text'=>'No noodles.','source_text'=>'Tak ada mi langsung.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>650,'end_time'=>651.34,'target_text'=>'I\'ll probably have this one.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya akan ambil yang ni.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>651.44,'end_time'=>652.34,'target_text'=>'So, you want this one?','source_text'=>'Jadi, awak nak yang ni?','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>652.44,'end_time'=>653.86,'target_text'=>'Yeah, go try two different ones.','source_text'=>'Ya, jom kita cuba dua jenis yang berbeza.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>653.96,'end_time'=>658.8,'target_text'=>'>> these two cuz I know I\'ll like this, but also this is original, so we should try these two.','source_text'=>'>> dua mangkuk ni sebab saya tahu saya akan suka yang ni, dan satu lagi perisa asli, jadi patut rasa dua-dua.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>666.68,'end_time'=>667.08,'target_text'=>'Mandu.','source_text'=>'Mandu.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>667.08,'end_time'=>670.94,'target_text'=>'So, they give you one kimchi and one pork mandu and then all the noodles.','source_text'=>'Jadi dorang bagi satu mandu kimchi dan satu mandu daging serta semangkuk penuh mi.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>671.04,'end_time'=>672.46,'target_text'=>'On the side, kimchi.','source_text'=>'Sebagai hidangan sampingan, ada kimchi.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>672.56,'end_time'=>675.36,'target_text'=>'Oh, dude, I\'m going to burn my face.','source_text'=>'Alamak kawan, panas berasap ni boleh terbakar muka saya.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>677.6,'end_time'=>679.02,'target_text'=>'I just burned my face.','source_text'=>'Muka saya dah rasa kena haba panas.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>679.12,'end_time'=>680.38,'target_text'=>'Like literally.','source_text'=>'Serius panas betul.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>680.48,'end_time'=>685.56,'target_text'=>'It has like that really like subtle seaweed taste that is just really good.','source_text'=>'Kuah dia ada rasa rumpai laut yang lembut dan memang sangat sedap.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>686.16,'end_time'=>687.82,'target_text'=>'And you can see they\'re just hand-cut noodles.','source_text'=>'Dan korang boleh tengok mi ni jenis diuli dan dihiris dengan tangan.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>687.92,'end_time'=>690.3,'target_text'=>'I could literally eat an entire bowl of these noodles.','source_text'=>'Saya boleh habiskan semangkuk penuh mi ni seorang diri.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>690.4,'end_time'=>691.54,'target_text'=>'Like two bowls.','source_text'=>'Malah dua mangkuk pun boleh habis.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>691.64,'end_time'=>692.34,'target_text'=>'Double it.','source_text'=>'Gandakan dua kali.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>692.44,'end_time'=>694.76,'target_text'=>'Give it to the next person.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu bagi kat orang sebelah.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>700.52,'end_time'=>704.24,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try the pork dumpling first, mandu.','source_text'=>'Jom kita rasa ladu daging mandu dulu.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>706.48,'end_time'=>708.9,'target_text'=>'Now let\'s try the kimchi.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita cuba rasa yang kimchi pula.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>709,'end_time'=>711.4,'target_text'=>'Maybe I should use a spoon.','source_text'=>'Mungkin lebih elok saya guna sudu.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>713.36,'end_time'=>714.14,'target_text'=>'Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'Oh, wow.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>714.24,'end_time'=>715.18,'target_text'=>'That looks good.','source_text'=>'Nampak menyelerakan sangat.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>715.28,'end_time'=>716.94,'target_text'=>'Kimchi one I like a lot better.','source_text'=>'Yang perisa kimchi ni saya jauh lebih suka.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>717.04,'end_time'=>718.18,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wow.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>718.28,'end_time'=>719.34,'target_text'=>'Is it spicy?','source_text'=>'Ada rasa pedas ke?','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>719.44,'end_time'=>719.94,'target_text'=>'Nope.','source_text'=>'Tak ada.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>720.04,'end_time'=>721.3,'target_text'=>'Just tastes like kimchi?','source_text'=>'Rasa kimchi semata-mata?','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>721.4,'end_time'=>722.26,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>722.36,'end_time'=>723.38,'target_text'=>'Let me say hello.','source_text'=>'Biar saya tegur mereka dulu.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>723.48,'end_time'=>723.94,'target_text'=>'Hello.','source_text'=>'Helo.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>724.04,'end_time'=>724.98,'target_text'=>'Yes, these are the flavors.','source_text'=>'Ya, ini pilihan perisanya.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>725.08,'end_time'=>726.86,'target_text'=>'Can I have two, please?','source_text'=>'Boleh saya pesan dua batang?','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>726.96,'end_time'=>727.38,'target_text'=>'>> Number two?','source_text'=>'>> Nombor dua?','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>727.48,'end_time'=>728.7,'target_text'=>'Yes, please.','source_text'=>'Ya, tolong sediakan.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>728.8,'end_time'=>730.78,'target_text'=>'Yes, so these are the different ones.','source_text'=>'Ya, jadi ini variasi berlainan yang dorang ada.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>730.88,'end_time'=>734.74,'target_text'=>'One is just original corn dog, and then half cheese, half hot dog.','source_text'=>'Satu cuma sosej \'corn dog\' asli, lepas tu ada separuh keju separuh sosej.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>734.84,'end_time'=>735.86,'target_text'=>'This one is cheddar.','source_text'=>'Yang ni pula keju cheddar.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>735.96,'end_time'=>736.94,'target_text'=>'This one\'s pure cheese.','source_text'=>'Yang ni seratus peratus inti keju penuh.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>737.04,'end_time'=>738.86,'target_text'=>'And the last one is just potato dog.','source_text'=>'Dan yang terakhir disalut ketulan kentang.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>738.96,'end_time'=>739.78,'target_text'=>'But I got this one.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya pilih yang ini.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>739.88,'end_time'=>742.3,'target_text'=>'This is the normal size of a corn dog in Korea.','source_text'=>'Ini saiz biasa untuk \'corn dog\' di Korea.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>742.4,'end_time'=>743.3,'target_text'=>'And I ordered one of these.','source_text'=>'Dan saya pesan satu yang macam ni.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>743.4,'end_time'=>745.1,'target_text'=>'It was only $3 USD.','source_text'=>'Harga dia cuma 3 dolar AS saja.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>745.2,'end_time'=>747.1,'target_text'=>'So I think um What are What is there?','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa... sos apa yang ada kat sini?','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>747.2,'end_time'=>749.26,'target_text'=>'Sweet chili, honey mustard, mayonnaise.','source_text'=>'Cili manis, \'honey mustard\', dan mayonis.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>749.36,'end_time'=>750.34,'target_text'=>'What\'s this one?','source_text'=>'Yang ni sos apa?','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>750.44,'end_time'=>751.82,'target_text'=>'This probably like gochujang or something.','source_text'=>'Ini rasanya macam gochujang pedas manis.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>751.92,'end_time'=>753.26,'target_text'=>'I think I\'m just going to go ketchup.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya cuma nak letak sos tomato biasa.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>753.36,'end_time'=>754.42,'target_text'=>'And they put sugar on it.','source_text'=>'Dan dorang tabur gula kat atasnya.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>754.52,'end_time'=>755.98,'target_text'=>'Well, that\'s Korean style sweet.','source_text'=>'Begitulah citarasa manis ala Korea.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>756.08,'end_time'=>759.56,'target_text'=>'You\'re supposed to make it look like this corn dog.','source_text'=>'Patutnya rupa bentuk dia jadi menarik macam \'corn dog\' ni.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>760.28,'end_time'=>763.9,'target_text'=>'You can\'t come to Korea without having a Korean corn dog.','source_text'=>'Tak sah datang Korea kalau tak nikmati \'corn dog\' Korea.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>764,'end_time'=>765.62,'target_text'=>'And they sprinkle sugar on this.','source_text'=>'Dan dorang taburkan gula halus atas ni.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>765.72,'end_time'=>767.22,'target_text'=>'You','source_text'=>'Awak','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>767.32,'end_time'=>768.9,'target_text'=>'the guy she told you not to worry about.','source_text'=>'lelaki yang dia suruh jangan risaukan tu.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>769,'end_time'=>771.2,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try this.','source_text'=>'Jom kita rasa ni.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>772.96,'end_time'=>773.9,'target_text'=>'That\'s got to be hot.','source_text'=>'Mesti panas menggelegak ni.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>774,'end_time'=>775.02,'target_text'=>'Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'Oh, wow.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>775.12,'end_time'=>775.9,'target_text'=>'Look at that cheese pull.','source_text'=>'Tengok keju dia meregang panjang!','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>776,'end_time'=>776.86,'target_text'=>'Look at that.','source_text'=>'Cuba tengok tu.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>776.96,'end_time'=>777.62,'target_text'=>'That looks good.','source_text'=>'Nampak sangat memikat selera.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>777.72,'end_time'=>778.08,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'>> Tak.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>778.08,'end_time'=>778.98,'target_text'=>'What does the cheese taste like?','source_text'=>'Macam mana rasa keju tu?','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>779.08,'end_time'=>781.08,'target_text'=>'>> Listen to this.','source_text'=>'>> Dengar bunyi kerangupan ni.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>781.8,'end_time'=>783.02,'target_text'=>'I think they use corn flakes.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa dorang salut guna kepingan emping jagung.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>783.12,'end_time'=>783.4,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>783.4,'end_time'=>783.6,'target_text'=>'What?','source_text'=>'Apa dia?','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>783.6,'end_time'=>784.26,'target_text'=>'Like the frosted one?','source_text'=>'Macam kepingan emping jagung bergula tu?','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>784.36,'end_time'=>785.1,'target_text'=>'Frosted corn flakes?','source_text'=>'Emping jagung bersalut gula?','order'=>349],
