            ['start_time'=>792.6,'end_time'=>795.98,'target_text'=>'And the crunch from those corn flakes and deep fried, that\'s golden, bro.','source_text'=>'Kerangupan emping jagung goreng celur tu, memang garing keemasan sempurna, kawan.','order'=>353],
