            ['start_time'=>821.48,'end_time'=>824.94,'target_text'=>'And you can hold on to this for support, and they\'re spread out throughout the bus.','source_text'=>'Dan korang boleh pegang pemegang ni untuk imbangkan badan, dorang sediakan sepanjang dalam bas.','order'=>367],
