            ['start_time'=>829.32,'end_time'=>835.82,'target_text'=>'Hey guys, we\'re at the Lotte Department Store in Myeongdong, and we\'re going to go in here right now to buy a winter jacket.','source_text'=>'Hai kawan-kawan, kita dah sampai di Gedung Membeli-belah Lotte di Myeongdong, dan kita nak masuk sekarang untuk beli jaket musim sejuk.','order'=>370],
