            ['start_time'=>847.76,'end_time'=>853.02,'target_text'=>'Genuinely the best coat deal and coat we saw was in Sinchon.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya tawaran harga dan kot paling cantik yang kita jumpa tadi adalah di Sinchon.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>853.12,'end_time'=>854.94,'target_text'=>'So, I think I\'m going to just go back there.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa saya nak patah balik ke sana je.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>855.04,'end_time'=>860.3,'target_text'=>'Hopefully they have my jacket still there that I saw, but it was the best deal, and it fit the best, and looked the best.','source_text'=>'Harapnya jaket yang saya berkenan tadi masih ada, sebab harga dia paling berbaloi, padan elok pada badan, dan nampak paling kemas.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>860.4,'end_time'=>864.78,'target_text'=>'Here we looked through all of the stores here, and I didn\'t even find like one I really like.','source_text'=>'Dekat sini kita dah tengok semua kedai, tapi saya langsung tak jumpa satu pun yang saya betul-betul minat.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>864.88,'end_time'=>867.5,'target_text'=>'It\'ll make me look like so fat, like the Michelin Man.','source_text'=>'Jaket-jaket ni buat badan saya nampak gemuk kembang, macam maskot Michelin Man.','order'=>379],
