            ['start_time'=>214.96,'end_time'=>220.86,'target_text'=>'And usually the proper etiquette when you\'re at a train station is to always stand to the side.','source_text'=>'Dan biasanya etika yang betul semasa di stesen kereta api adalah sentiasa berdiri di bahagian tepi.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>220.96,'end_time'=>226.94,'target_text'=>'You stand to the side so that you can let the people that are coming out of the train walk right here.','source_text'=>'Korang berdiri di tepi supaya beri laluan kepada orang yang keluar dari tren lalu di tengah sini.','order'=>77],
