            ['start_time'=>244.72,'end_time'=>248.06,'target_text'=>'The MRT station feels very empty.','source_text'=>'Suasana stesen MRT ini terasa sangat lengang.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>248.16,'end_time'=>252.54,'target_text'=>'So those are three simple sentences you can use to describe almost anything.','source_text'=>'Jadi itu tiga ayat mudah yang korang boleh gunakan untuk gambarkan hampir apa sahaja.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>252.64,'end_time'=>254.86,'target_text'=>'What it is, what it looks like.','source_text'=>'Apa benda itu, bagaimana rupanya.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>254.96,'end_time'=>257.58,'target_text'=>'So describe it and then how it feels.','source_text'=>'Jadi terangkan rupanya dan bagaimana perasaannya.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>257.68,'end_time'=>259.66,'target_text'=>'So this is an MRT station.','source_text'=>'Contohnya, ini adalah sebuah stesen MRT.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>259.76,'end_time'=>264.22,'target_text'=>'It looks clean and modern and it feels very empty.','source_text'=>'Rupanya nampak bersih dan moden, dan suasananya terasa amat lengang.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>264.32,'end_time'=>271.5,'target_text'=>'Three sentences, very simple, and that will make you sound a lot more fluent in English with those three sentences.','source_text'=>'Tiga ayat yang sangat ringkas, dan ia akan buat korang bertutur jauh lebih fasih dalam bahasa Inggeris dengan tiga ayat tu.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>271.6,'end_time'=>275.58,'target_text'=>'So, look around your room right now and give me three sentences.','source_text'=>'Jadi, pandang sekeliling bilik korang sekarang dan berikan saya tiga ayat.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>275.68,'end_time'=>278.78,'target_text'=>'You can just say it to yourself or you can write them in the comments.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh sebut sendiri perlahan-lahan atau tuliskan di ruang komen.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>278.88,'end_time'=>281.98,'target_text'=>'How would you describe your surroundings right now?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana korang akan gambarkan keadaan sekeliling korang ketika ini?','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>282.08,'end_time'=>286.3,'target_text'=>'So, our train has just arrived and we are now going to board the train.','source_text'=>'Jadi, tren kita baru sahaja tiba dan sekarang kita akan naik ke dalam tren.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>286.4,'end_time'=>293.18,'target_text'=>'Since there is almost no one coming out of the train, we\'ll stand right in front of the door and get on once these two doors','source_text'=>'Oleh sebab hampir tak ada orang keluar dari tren, kita akan berdiri di depan pintu dan terus masuk bila kedua-dua daun pintu','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>293.28,'end_time'=>294.78,'target_text'=>'open.','source_text'=>'terbuka.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>294.88,'end_time'=>298.94,'target_text'=>'So, this is an underground subway station.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini adalah stesen kereta api bawah tanah.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>299.04,'end_time'=>305.72,'target_text'=>'It is very deep underground and there are many escalators as you can see clearly.','source_text'=>'Ia terletak amat dalam di bawah tanah dan ada banyak eskalator macam yang korang boleh nampak dengan jelas.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>307.04,'end_time'=>310.22,'target_text'=>'And the feeling this gives me is vertigo.','source_text'=>'Dan rasa yang saya alami bila tengok ke bawah ni adalah gayat (vertigo).','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>310.32,'end_time'=>315.02,'target_text'=>'I also feel like this is just really cool, modern, and clean.','source_text'=>'Saya juga rasa tempat ni memang sangat hebat, serba moden, dan bersih.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>315.12,'end_time'=>320.14,'target_text'=>'And it honestly feels like I\'m in a super advanced country, which I am.','source_text'=>'Dan sejujurnya terasa macam berada di negara yang sangat maju, dan memang pun hakikatnya.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>320.24,'end_time'=>327.26,'target_text'=>'Just seeing how far these escalators come down into the ground just to have public transit for people, which is very cool.','source_text'=>'Bila tengok betapa dalamnya eskalator ni turun ke bawah tanah semata-mata untuk kemudahan transit awam rakyat, memang mengagumkan.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>327.36,'end_time'=>331.74,'target_text'=>'But outside of this station, nearby are the Petronis Twin Towers.','source_text'=>'Tapi di luar stesen ni, berdekatan dengannya ada Menara Berkembar Petronas.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>331.84,'end_time'=>334.7,'target_text'=>'So, how would you describe this subway station?','source_text'=>'Jadi, bagaimana korang akan gambarkan stesen bawah tanah ni?','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>334.8,'end_time'=>340.62,'target_text'=>'>> Two words to describe this station would be massive cuz it feels like there\'s multiple levels.','source_text'=>'>> Dua perkataan untuk gambarkan stesen ni adalah tersangat besar sebab ia terasa macam ada banyak aras bertingkat.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>340.72,'end_time'=>343.26,'target_text'=>'I can see one, two, and three.','source_text'=>'Saya boleh nampak tingkat satu, dua, dan tiga.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>343.36,'end_time'=>347.9,'target_text'=>'But I say three levels, but look at how far they go down and how far it goes up.','source_text'=>'Saya sebut tiga tingkat, tapi tengoklah betapa jauhnya ia menjunam ke bawah dan setinggi mana ia mendaki ke atas.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>348,'end_time'=>349.34,'target_text'=>'So it feels massive.','source_text'=>'Jadi suasananya terasa begitu luas dan gah.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>349.44,'end_time'=>353.1,'target_text'=>'And I feel like during peak time it\'ll be busy.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa pada waktu puncak ia mesti sangat sibuk sesak.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>353.2,'end_time'=>354.94,'target_text'=>'But right now it\'s quiet.','source_text'=>'Tapi waktu sekarang ni amat tenang sunyi.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>355.04,'end_time'=>355.44,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>355.44,'end_time'=>357.34,'target_text'=>'During rush hour it will be busy.','source_text'=>'Waktu orang berulang-alik kerja memang akan padat.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>357.44,'end_time'=>360.94,'target_text'=>'But now let\'s head up all these escalators and go outside.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang jom kita naik semua eskalator ni dan keluar ke kawasan luar.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>361.04,'end_time'=>361.82,'target_text'=>'>> All right.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>361.92,'end_time'=>362.32,'target_text'=>'Okay.','source_text'=>'Okey.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>362.32,'end_time'=>365.74,'target_text'=>'Look at like look at how far this escalator goes.','source_text'=>'Cuba tengok betapa tingginya eskalator ni menjangkau ke atas.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>365.84,'end_time'=>366.94,'target_text'=>'This is like high.','source_text'=>'Tempat ni memang gayat tinggi.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>367.04,'end_time'=>370.46,'target_text'=>'And this one on my left hand side is broken by the looks of it.','source_text'=>'Dan yang sebelah kiri saya ni nampak gayanya macam rosak.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>370.56,'end_time'=>372.14,'target_text'=>'And they\'re repairing it right now.','source_text'=>'Dan dorang sedang membaikinya sekarang.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>372.24,'end_time'=>374.78,'target_text'=>'And this is our third escalator.','source_text'=>'Dan ini eskalator yang ketiga kita naik.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>374.88,'end_time'=>380.14,'target_text'=>'>> So if you were at the bottom, how many escalators do you have to take to get up to the top >> from the very bottom?','source_text'=>'>> Jadi kalau dari aras paling bawah, berapa banyak eskalator kena naik sampai ke atas >> dari lantai paling bawah?','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>380.24,'end_time'=>380.64,'target_text'=>'Four.','source_text'=>'Empat.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>380.72,'end_time'=>381.58,'target_text'=>'>> Four escalators.','source_text'=>'>> Empat buah eskalator.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>381.68,'end_time'=>382.94,'target_text'=>'>> And these escalators are long.','source_text'=>'>> Dan setiap eskalator ni memang panjang-panjang.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>383.04,'end_time'=>384.86,'target_text'=>'>> Two of them are like really long, right?','source_text'=>'>> Dua daripadanya memang terlampau panjang, kan?','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>384.96,'end_time'=>385.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>385.6,'end_time'=>385.84,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>385.84,'end_time'=>386.54,'target_text'=>'They\'re very long.','source_text'=>'Memang panjang sangat.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>386.64,'end_time'=>389.18,'target_text'=>'So you\'re deep underground for sure.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang memang sah berada jauh di dasar bawah tanah.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>389.28,'end_time'=>394.46,'target_text'=>'So to my right, you can see the Patronus Twin Towers.','source_text'=>'Jadi di sebelah kanan saya, korang boleh nampak Menara Berkembar Petronas.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>394.56,'end_time'=>397.34,'target_text'=>'They are very tall and uh shiny.','source_text'=>'Menara tu amat tinggi dan berkilau keperakan.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>397.44,'end_time'=>398.54,'target_text'=>'Very tall and shiny.','source_text'=>'Teramat tinggi dan berkilauan.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>398.64,'end_time'=>404.7,'target_text'=>'Unfortunately, it\'s kind of hard to see the twin towers, but once we get closer, we\'ll be able to see them both like side','source_text'=>'Malangnya agak sukar nampak menara kembar tu secara penuh sekarang, tapi bila makin dekat nanti kita boleh nampak kedua-duanya bersebelahan','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>404.8,'end_time'=>408.06,'target_text'=>'by side, but right now it looks like one building, right?','source_text'=>'tapi buat masa ni dari sudut sini nampak macam satu bangunan je, kan?','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>408.16,'end_time'=>410.78,'target_text'=>'Kind of does >> cuz we\'re like parallel to them, right?','source_text'=>'Memang nampak macam tu >> sebab kedudukan kita selari lurus dengan menara tu, kan?','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>410.88,'end_time'=>411.28,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>411.28,'end_time'=>411.68,'target_text'=>'Almost.','source_text'=>'Hampir selari.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>411.76,'end_time'=>412.22,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>412.32,'end_time'=>415.9,'target_text'=>'And uh it just feels like so cool.','source_text'=>'Dan rasa dia memang sangat menakjubkan.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>416,'end_time'=>418.06,'target_text'=>'Like I don\'t know how else I would describe it.','source_text'=>'Saya pun tak tahu macam mana lagi nak gambarkan.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>418.16,'end_time'=>422.22,'target_text'=>'Just feels cool and surreal to see like huge towering buildings.','source_text'=>'Cuma terasa hebat dan luar biasa bila tengok bangunan pencakar langit yang tersergam indah macam ni.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>422.32,'end_time'=>426.7,'target_text'=>'>> Like you can\'t really tell the scale on video, but >> these buildings are huge buildings.','source_text'=>'>> Melalui video mungkin tak nampak saiz sebenar, tapi >> bangunan-bangunan ni memang teramat gergasi.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>426.8,'end_time'=>427.12,'target_text'=>'>> I know.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tahu.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>427.12,'end_time'=>431.58,'target_text'=>'I always find it really cool being in the city center being surrounded by all the skyscrapers.','source_text'=>'Saya sentiasa rasa seronok bila berada di pusat bandar raya sambil dikelilingi bangunan pencakar langit.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>431.68,'end_time'=>435.02,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s like surreal that people like built this crazy.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ia sesuatu yang mengagumkan bila fikirkan manusia mampu membina struktur sehebat ini.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>435.12,'end_time'=>435.9,'target_text'=>'Let\'s get closer.','source_text'=>'Jom kita pergi lebih dekat.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>436,'end_time'=>437.26,'target_text'=>'Get a better view.','source_text'=>'Dapat pemandangan yang lebih memukau.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>437.36,'end_time'=>443.58,'target_text'=>'This is a a self-s served convenience store and you have to like scan your face to enter the shop.','source_text'=>'Ini kedai serbaneka layan diri automatik dan korang kena imbas muka untuk masuk ke dalam kedai.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>443.68,'end_time'=>446.94,'target_text'=>'So, I guess if you steal anything, they\'ll charge you.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa kalau ada sesiapa mencuri, dorang akan caj terus akaun orang tu.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>447.04,'end_time'=>447.58,'target_text'=>'Ooh, dude.','source_text'=>'Fuh, kawan.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>447.68,'end_time'=>449.58,'target_text'=>'Honestly, these look super good.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya aiskrim-aiskrim ni nampak sangat menggiurkan.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>449.68,'end_time'=>451.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that looks handmade, you know.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, nampak macam buatan tangan segar, kan.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>451.28,'end_time'=>451.6,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>451.6,'end_time'=>452.3,'target_text'=>'Tutti frutti.','source_text'=>'Perisa Tutti frutti.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>452.4,'end_time'=>453.74,'target_text'=>'That one\'s tutti frutti.','source_text'=>'Yang tu perisa tutti frutti.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>453.84,'end_time'=>455.1,'target_text'=>'That\'s strawberry.','source_text'=>'Yang tu strawberi.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>455.2,'end_time'=>457.18,'target_text'=>'This one is red velvet cheese, dude.','source_text'=>'Yang ni perisa keju baldu merah (red velvet cheese), bro.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>457.28,'end_time'=>458.3,'target_text'=>'Oh my gosh, dude.','source_text'=>'Alahai kawan, sedapnya.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>458.4,'end_time'=>459.18,'target_text'=>'They\'re tempting me.','source_text'=>'Tergugat betul nafsu saya tengok ni.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>459.28,'end_time'=>460.46,'target_text'=>'Oh, have you seen these?','source_text'=>'Oh, awak pernah tengok yang ini tak?','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>460.56,'end_time'=>462.38,'target_text'=>'That\'s the chicken drumstick.','source_text'=>'Yang ni bentuk paha ayam goreng.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>462.48,'end_time'=>463.18,'target_text'=>'Fried chicken.','source_text'=>'Ayam goreng rangup.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>463.28,'end_time'=>465.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, I want that.','source_text'=>'>> Fuh, saya teringin nak yang tu.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>465.12,'end_time'=>465.9,'target_text'=>'>> You should get that.','source_text'=>'>> Awak patut beli rasa satu.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>466,'end_time'=>468.06,'target_text'=>'First thing you eat today is just ice cream.','source_text'=>'Makanan pertama awak makan hari ni cuma aiskrim je.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>468.16,'end_time'=>469.5,'target_text'=>'>> A chicken drumstick ice cream.','source_text'=>'>> Aiskrim bentuk paha ayam.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>469.6,'end_time'=>473.02,'target_text'=>'I see that all the time on TikTok and I always think I want to try that so bad.','source_text'=>'Saya selalu sangat nampak orang post kat TikTok dan dari dulu teringin gila nak rasa.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>473.12,'end_time'=>475.26,'target_text'=>'Is that just like a cob of corn?','source_text'=>'Yang tu pula bentuk tongkol jagung ke?','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>475.36,'end_time'=>476.3,'target_text'=>'>> I think you\'re right.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa betul tekaan awak.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>476.4,'end_time'=>477.98,'target_text'=>'Sweet corn.','source_text'=>'Jagung manis.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>478.08,'end_time'=>478.86,'target_text'=>'>> Grilled corn.','source_text'=>'>> Jagung bakar.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>478.96,'end_time'=>481.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, I want to try this chocolate moist.','source_text'=>'>> Bro, saya nak rasa coklat lembap (chocolate moist) ni.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>481.84,'end_time'=>483.58,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, some of this stuff looks like homemade.','source_text'=>'>> Kawan, sesetengah makanan kat sini nampak macam dibuat sendiri kat rumah.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>483.68,'end_time'=>485.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of >> really cool.','source_text'=>'Suasana kedai ni >> memang sangat menarik.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>485.2,'end_time'=>486.62,'target_text'=>'>> But what I do want is a water.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi apa yang saya betul-betul perlukan sekarang adalah sebotol air kosong.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>486.72,'end_time'=>489.26,'target_text'=>'So yeah, this is a self-s served convenience store.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya, ini adalah kedai serbaneka layan diri automatik sepenuhnya.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>489.36,'end_time'=>497.42,'target_text'=>'It is automated and selfs served and it feels futuristic >> and it\'s more convenient than a regular convenience store.','source_text'=>'Semuanya berautomatik dan layan diri, dan suasananya terasa futuristik >> dan ia lebih mudah pantas daripada kedai serbaneka biasa.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>497.52,'end_time'=>498.14,'target_text'=>'>> Facts, though.','source_text'=>'>> Memang fakta betul tu.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>498.24,'end_time'=>503.5,'target_text'=>'I think I don\'t know if we\'re going to come back here, but I really want to try one of these, but I haven\'t eaten anything','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada kita akan datang sini lagi ke tak, tapi saya teringin sangat rasa salah satu makanan ni, cuma perut belum alas apa-apa lagi','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>503.6,'end_time'=>506.78,'target_text'=>'today and I don\'t want to have something sweet right off the bat.','source_text'=>'hari ini dan saya tak nak makan benda manis-manis sebagai makanan pertama.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>506.88,'end_time'=>509.5,'target_text'=>'Now I\'m going to pay by tapping.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya akan bayar secara imbas kad tanpa sentuh (tap).','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>509.6,'end_time'=>518.3,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we were walking and I was walking on this side and I did not notice that there is razor wire like right here and','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi tadi masa kita tengah berjalan dan saya lalu di sebelah sini, saya tak perasan ada kawat duri tajam betul-betul kat sini dan','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>518.4,'end_time'=>522.62,'target_text'=>'I was thinking if you\'re walking like if you look right here that\'s literally in the path.','source_text'=>'saya terfikir kalau orang berjalan macam ni dan tengok betul-betul, kawat tu betul-betul terjulur di laluan pejalan kaki.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>522.72,'end_time'=>527.1,'target_text'=>'So you could just be walking and then slice your arm open and probably get infected.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang boleh je tersiat lengan masa berjalan lalu luka terbelah dan berkemungkinan terkena jangkitan kuman.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>527.2,'end_time'=>531.66,'target_text'=>'I feel like that\'s not really the safest thing I\'ve seen, but >> No, definitely not.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa benda ni bukanlah sesuatu yang paling selamat dipasang, tapi >> Memang langsung tak selamat.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>531.76,'end_time'=>535.58,'target_text'=>'I mean because of the rust it\'s not that sharp anymore, but still that\'s >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya sebab dah berkarat mungkin tak berapa tajam sangat, tapi tetap... >> Ya, betul.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>535.68,'end_time'=>537.34,'target_text'=>'So this is razor wire.','source_text'=>'Jadi ini dawai kawat duri.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>537.44,'end_time'=>543.18,'target_text'=>'It looks rusty and old and it feels unsafe to have right along the sidewalk.','source_text'=>'Rupanya nampak berkarat dan usang, serta terasa berbahaya bila diletakkan rapat di laluan pejalan kaki.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>543.28,'end_time'=>545.58,'target_text'=>'Feels unsafe, but I don\'t make the rules.','source_text'=>'Terasa tak selamat, tapi bukanlah saya yang tetapkan peraturan tempat ni.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>545.68,'end_time'=>548.14,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s just uh stay away from that.','source_text'=>'Jadi jom kita elak dan jalan jauh sikit dari kawat tu.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>548.24,'end_time'=>550.62,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we\'ve been walking for a few minutes now.','source_text'=>'Okey, sekarang kita dah berjalan kaki selama beberapa minit.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>550.72,'end_time'=>555.34,'target_text'=>'We\'re surrounded by these skyscrapers and high-rise apartments.','source_text'=>'Kita dikelilingi oleh pencakar langit dan bangunan apartmen tinggi lampai ni.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>555.44,'end_time'=>559.02,'target_text'=>'And here it looks like they\'re clearing out this old building.','source_text'=>'Dan kat sebelah sini nampak macam dorang sedang merobohkan dan mengosongkan bangunan lama ni.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>559.12,'end_time'=>560.94,'target_text'=>'I believe it was a hotel before.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa tempat ni sebuah hotel sebelum ni.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>561.04,'end_time'=>565.26,'target_text'=>'You can see all of this scrap metal inside these big metal containers.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak longgokan besi buruk dalam tong kontena besi yang besar ni.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>565.36,'end_time'=>566.62,'target_text'=>'And these people are working.','source_text'=>'Dan pekerja-pekerja ni sedang sibuk bertukang.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>566.72,'end_time'=>572.3,'target_text'=>'Once these are full, a truck will come and take this away and dump it in the landfill.','source_text'=>'Bila tong ni dah penuh, lori akan datang angkut dan buang ke tapak pelupusan sampah.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>572.4,'end_time'=>576.78,'target_text'=>'The landfill, that\'s just where you dump all the garbage from a city.','source_text'=>'Tapak pelupusan sampah tu adalah tempat di mana semua sisa buangan bandar dibuang.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>576.88,'end_time'=>578.38,'target_text'=>'But, uh, let\'s keep going.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom kita teruskan perjalanan.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>578.48,'end_time'=>581.26,'target_text'=>'I could just see the tip of the Petronis Tower.','source_text'=>'Saya dah mula nampak puncak Menara Petronas.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>581.36,'end_time'=>582.06,'target_text'=>'We\'re almost there.','source_text'=>'Kita dah hampir sampai.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>582.16,'end_time'=>583.9,'target_text'=>'And we almost have a good view of it.','source_text'=>'Dan kita dah hampir dapat sudut pandang yang cantik.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>584,'end_time'=>587.02,'target_text'=>'So, just a little bit more and we\'ll be able to see it.','source_text'=>'Jadi jalan sikit lagi dan kita akan dapat lihat dengan jelas.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>587.12,'end_time'=>594.38,'target_text'=>'If you\'re serious about becoming fluent in English, I\'ve built a full speaking, shadowing, and pronunciation course you can','source_text'=>'Kalau korang betul-betul serius nak fasih berbahasa Inggeris, saya dah bina kursus lengkap pertuturan, teknik shadowing, dan sebutan yang korang boleh','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>594.48,'end_time'=>596.22,'target_text'=>'follow step by step.','source_text'=>'ikuti langkah demi langkah.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>596.32,'end_time'=>601.18,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to over 60 video lessons right away.','source_text'=>'Korang akan dapat akses serta-merta ke lebih 60 video pembelajaran sekarang juga.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>601.28,'end_time'=>606.94,'target_text'=>'And I add three to five brand new lessons every week to keep the content fresh.','source_text'=>'Dan saya tambah tiga hingga lima pelajaran baharu setiap minggu untuk pastikan kandungan sentiasa terkini.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>607.04,'end_time'=>609.34,'target_text'=>'And you\'re not just getting videos.','source_text'=>'Dan korang bukan sekadar dapat video pembelajaran saja.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>609.44,'end_time'=>616.38,'target_text'=>'You also get an exclusive chat prompt to help you master the pronunciation of any word.','source_text'=>'Korang juga dapat \'prompt\' perbualan eksklusif untuk bantu kuasai sebutan mana-mana perkataan,','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>616.48,'end_time'=>624.06,'target_text'=>'plus a step-by-step structure to follow so you know exactly how to practice and get the most out of every lesson.','source_text'=>'ditambah panduan berperingkat supaya korang tahu cara berlatih yang paling mantap untuk setiap sesi.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>624.16,'end_time'=>634.86,'target_text'=>'Inside we train pronunciation, accent, rhythm and natural speaking so you stop hesitating and start speaking with real confidence.','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya kita asah sebutan, loghat, ritma, dan gaya bercakap bersahaja supaya korang tak lagi teragak-agak dan berani bertutur penuh yakin.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>634.96,'end_time'=>638.46,'target_text'=>'Now here\'s a sneak peek at what you get the moment you join.','source_text'=>'Sekarang ini sedutan apa yang korang akan dapat sebaik sahaja menyertai.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>638.56,'end_time'=>645.5,'target_text'=>'So I wouldn\'t take [music] legal came down to heat already so cranky jeans and one hoodie which click the link in my description','source_text'=>'Jadi saya takkan ambil [muzik] kepanasan dan cepat merungut seluar jeans dan baju \'hoodie\'... klik pautan di penerangan saya','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>645.6,'end_time'=>646.14,'target_text'=>'to join.','source_text'=>'untuk sertai sekarang.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>646.24,'end_time'=>646.48,'target_text'=>'Okay.','source_text'=>'Okey.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>646.48,'end_time'=>651.58,'target_text'=>'So we decided to make a quick pit stop at this mall to try these Chinese burgers.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita buat keputusan singgah sekejap di pusat beli-belah ni untuk rasa burger Cina ni.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>651.68,'end_time'=>652.94,'target_text'=>'>> Chinese beef roti.','source_text'=>'>> Roti daging Cina (Chinese beef roti).','order'=>217],
