            ['start_time'=>72.72,'end_time'=>78.38,'target_text'=>'But in Malaysia, they use letters from the alphabet just like in English, which is something I never knew.','source_text'=>'Tapi di Malaysia, dorang guna huruf abjad rumi sama macam bahasa Inggeris, sesuatu yang saya tak pernah tahu sebelum ni.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>78.48,'end_time'=>80.3,'target_text'=>'I thought they had their own writing system.','source_text'=>'Saya ingatkan dorang ada sistem tulisan tersendiri.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>80.4,'end_time'=>85.74,'target_text'=>'>> Is it the Roman alphabet or the Our alphabet has a name, but I can\'t remember what the name was.','source_text'=>'>> Adakah abjad Rumi atau... abjad kita ni ada nama khas, tapi saya tak ingat apa namanya.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>85.84,'end_time'=>87.1,'target_text'=>'Let me search it.','source_text'=>'Biar saya buat carian.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>87.2,'end_time'=>91.58,'target_text'=>'What is the official name of the English alphabet?','source_text'=>'Apakah nama rasmi untuk abjad bahasa Inggeris?','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>91.68,'end_time'=>99.66,'target_text'=>'So, officially the alphabet we use in English is called the Latin alphabet or the Roman alphabet.','source_text'=>'Jadi, secara rasminya abjad yang kita guna dalam bahasa Inggeris dipanggil abjad Latin atau abjad Rumi.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>99.76,'end_time'=>104.94,'target_text'=>'But come around here and you can check out what the floating mosque looks like.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom pusing sini dan korang boleh tengok rupa bentuk masjid terapung ni.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>105.04,'end_time'=>107.82,'target_text'=>'Have you ever been to this mosque before?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah datang ke masjid ni sebelum ni?','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>107.92,'end_time'=>114.86,'target_text'=>'>> I have been here before, but when I was here, the water was all the way to the beach.','source_text'=>'>> Saya pernah datang sebelum ni, tapi masa saya datang dulu air laut pasang penuh sampai ke tepi pantai.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>114.96,'end_time'=>118.38,'target_text'=>'So right now it\'s currently low tide.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang ni air laut tengah surut.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>118.48,'end_time'=>124.62,'target_text'=>'So you can see the sand and the rocks and you can see underneath the mosque.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang boleh nampak pasir pantai, batu-batu, dan bahagian bawah tiang masjid ni.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>124.72,'end_time'=>128.3,'target_text'=>'But when it\'s high tide, what happens when it\'s high tide?','source_text'=>'Tapi bila air pasang, apa yang berlaku bila air laut pasang?','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>128.4,'end_time'=>133.74,'target_text'=>'When it\'s high tide, the water comes back to its highest point.','source_text'=>'Bila air pasang, paras air laut akan naik kembali ke paras paling tinggi.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>133.84,'end_time'=>136.46,'target_text'=>'>> So the water rises.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi paras air akan meningkat naik.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>136.56,'end_time'=>141.5,'target_text'=>'And over there in the distance, you can see some boats on the water.','source_text'=>'Dan nun jauh di sana, korang boleh nampak beberapa buah bot terapung di atas air.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>141.6,'end_time'=>145.1,'target_text'=>'And you can also see some boats in the sand there.','source_text'=>'Dan korang juga boleh nampak bot-bot tersadai atas pasir di situ.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>145.2,'end_time'=>150.46,'target_text'=>'And right now you can say that they are stuck there because they cannot move.','source_text'=>'Dan waktu sekarang korang boleh kata bot-bot tu terperangkap di situ sebab tak boleh bergerak.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>150.56,'end_time'=>154.38,'target_text'=>'They are beached just like a whale can be beached.','source_text'=>'Bot-bot tu terdampar kandas atas pantai, sama macam ikan paus yang terdampar.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>154.48,'end_time'=>162.14,'target_text'=>'That\'s just when a whale goes on land and then it can\'t swim because a whale can only swim and move in water.','source_text'=>'Keadaan tu bila ikan paus naik ke daratan dan tak boleh berenang sebab paus cuma boleh berenang dan bergerak dalam air.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>162.24,'end_time'=>165.98,'target_text'=>'It cannot swim when it\'s on the land.','source_text'=>'Paus tak boleh berenang bila berada di atas tanah daratan.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>166.08,'end_time'=>169.42,'target_text'=>'And often times that can kill a whale.','source_text'=>'Dan kebiasaannya keadaan itu boleh menyebabkan ikan paus mati.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>169.52,'end_time'=>172.86,'target_text'=>'But uh those boats are in the sand there.','source_text'=>'Tapi bot-bot tu cuma tersadai atas pasir di sana.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>172.96,'end_time'=>179.82,'target_text'=>'But when the high tide comes back and the water level rises, then the boats will be able to move once again.','source_text'=>'Tapi bila air pasang kembali dan paras air laut naik semula, barulah bot-bot tu boleh bergerak semula.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>179.92,'end_time'=>182.62,'target_text'=>'And those do look like fishing boats to me.','source_text'=>'Dan pada pandangan saya bot-bot tu nampak macam bot nelayan.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>182.72,'end_time'=>184.06,'target_text'=>'What do they look like to you?','source_text'=>'Pada pandangan korang bot tu nampak macam apa?','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>184.16,'end_time'=>186.38,'target_text'=>'To you guys and to Leon.','source_text'=>'Untuk korang semua dan untuk Leon.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>186.48,'end_time'=>187.66,'target_text'=>'>> I think you\'re right.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa awak betul.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>187.76,'end_time'=>190.14,'target_text'=>'They do look like fishing boats.','source_text'=>'Memang nampak macam bot nelayan.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>190.24,'end_time'=>193.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they don\'t really look like tourist boats.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tak nampak macam bot persiaran pelancong.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>193.2,'end_time'=>199.02,'target_text'=>'Every time I ask a question, I want you guys to pause the video, answer the question, and then continue.','source_text'=>'Setiap kali saya tanya soalan, saya nak korang jeda video ni, jawab soalan tu, kemudian baru sambung tonton.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>199.12,'end_time'=>201.74,'target_text'=>'because Leon will also answer the question.','source_text'=>'sebab Leon pun akan turut jawab soalan tu.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>201.84,'end_time'=>204.7,'target_text'=>'So you can compare your answer to Leon.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang boleh bandingkan jawapan korang dengan jawapan Leon.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>204.8,'end_time'=>209.26,'target_text'=>'So what do you guys see very far in the distance over there?','source_text'=>'Jadi apa yang korang nampak nun jauh di seberang sana?','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>209.36,'end_time'=>211.74,'target_text'=>'What do you see over there?','source_text'=>'Apa yang korang nampak kat situ?','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>211.84,'end_time'=>212.94,'target_text'=>'Pause.','source_text'=>'Jeda sebentar.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>213.04,'end_time'=>214.94,'target_text'=>'What do you see over there?','source_text'=>'Apa yang awak nampak kat sana?','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>215.04,'end_time'=>219.98,'target_text'=>'>> Over there on the horizon, I see mountains.','source_text'=>'>> Di kaki langit sana, saya nampak banjaran bukit dan gunung.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>220.08,'end_time'=>222.86,'target_text'=>'>> And are the mountains very clear?','source_text'=>'>> Dan adakah gunung-ganang tu nampak jelas?','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>222.96,'end_time'=>225.34,'target_text'=>'>> The mountains are not clear.','source_text'=>'>> Gunung-ganang tu tak berapa jelas.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>225.44,'end_time'=>229.34,'target_text'=>'I can only see the silhouette of the mountains.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma boleh nampak bayang bentuk siluet gunung saja.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>229.44,'end_time'=>231.1,'target_text'=>'>> And why is that?','source_text'=>'>> Dan kenapa jadi macam tu?','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>231.2,'end_time'=>235.26,'target_text'=>'Why can\'t you see the mountains clearly?','source_text'=>'Kenapa awak tak dapat nampak gunung tu dengan jelas?','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>235.36,'end_time'=>241.9,'target_text'=>'>> I can\'t see them clearly because there is mist and they\'re also far away.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tak dapat nampak jelas sebab ada kabus tebal dan kedudukannya pun sangat jauh.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>242,'end_time'=>244.54,'target_text'=>'>> So that is why we can\'t see them clearly.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi itulah sebabnya kita tak dapat nampak dengan jelas.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>244.64,'end_time'=>247.42,'target_text'=>'The visibility isn\'t the best.','source_text'=>'Tahap penglihatan jarak jauh bukanlah yang terbaik.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>247.52,'end_time'=>255.58,'target_text'=>'Although the visibility today is very good, but the mountains are just so far in the distance that you could only see the','source_text'=>'Walaupun cuaca hari ini agak cerah, tapi bukit bukau tu terlalu jauh sehingga kita cuma dapat melihat','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>255.68,'end_time'=>257.26,'target_text'=>'silhouette of the mountain.','source_text'=>'garis bentuk siluet gunung tu saja.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>257.36,'end_time'=>261.26,'target_text'=>'And that right there is the main land, right?','source_text'=>'Dan seberang sana tu adalah bahagian tanah besar, kan?','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>261.36,'end_time'=>262.54,'target_text'=>'>> That is correct.','source_text'=>'>> Tepat sekali.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>262.64,'end_time'=>270.06,'target_text'=>'That is the main land of Malaysia >> cuz we are currently on an island.','source_text'=>'Itu tanah besar Semenanjung Malaysia >> sebab kita sekarang ni berada di sebuah pulau.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>270.16,'end_time'=>273.1,'target_text'=>'This right here, what is this?','source_text'=>'Yang ini pula, benda apa ni?','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>273.2,'end_time'=>275.02,'target_text'=>'>> That is a wall.','source_text'=>'>> Itu sebuah dinding tembok.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>275.12,'end_time'=>275.98,'target_text'=>'>> This is a wall.','source_text'=>'>> Ini sebuah tembok.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>276.08,'end_time'=>276.7,'target_text'=>'Correct.','source_text'=>'Tepat.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>276.8,'end_time'=>279.88,'target_text'=>'What am I doing right now?','source_text'=>'Apa yang saya sedang buat sekarang?','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>280.16,'end_time'=>282.3,'target_text'=>'>> You are sitting down.','source_text'=>'>> Awak sedang duduk.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>282.4,'end_time'=>284.78,'target_text'=>'>> What is this right here?','source_text'=>'>> Apa benda ni pula?','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>284.88,'end_time'=>287.34,'target_text'=>'>> That is a water hose.','source_text'=>'>> Itu hos getah paip air.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>287.44,'end_time'=>287.9,'target_text'=>'>> Correct.','source_text'=>'>> Betul.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>288,'end_time'=>289.66,'target_text'=>'This is a water hose.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah hos getah air.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>289.76,'end_time'=>293.74,'target_text'=>'And what color is the water hose?','source_text'=>'Dan apa warna hos getah ni?','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>293.84,'end_time'=>297.42,'target_text'=>'>> The water hose is dark green.','source_text'=>'>> Hos air tu berwarna hijau pekat.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>297.52,'end_time'=>302.54,'target_text'=>'>> And what do you use the water hose for?','source_text'=>'>> Dan untuk apa hos air ni digunakan?','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>302.64,'end_time'=>308.28,'target_text'=>'This water hose is used to water these plants.','source_text'=>'Hos air ni digunakan untuk menyiram pokok-pokok tumbuhan ni.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>309.04,'end_time'=>311.82,'target_text'=>'So these plants need water to survive.','source_text'=>'Pokok-pokok ni perlukan air untuk terus hidup.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>311.92,'end_time'=>319.42,'target_text'=>'That\'s why there is a water hose here to give water to all these plants in this parking lot.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah ada hos air kat sini untuk siram semua tanaman dalam kawasan tempat letak kereta ni.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>319.52,'end_time'=>322.62,'target_text'=>'We are currently in a parking lot.','source_text'=>'Sekarang ni kita berada di kawasan tempat letak kereta.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>322.72,'end_time'=>327.9,'target_text'=>'If you look to that side, you can see a lot of apartment buildings.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang pandang ke arah sana, korang boleh nampak banyak deretan bangunan apartmen.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>328,'end_time'=>330.3,'target_text'=>'Now a question for you guys.','source_text'=>'Sekarang satu soalan untuk korang semua.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>330.4,'end_time'=>339.18,'target_text'=>'What do you call the part where you walk out and you can stand on the floor, but you can see out and you\'re outside of your','source_text'=>'Apa korang panggil bahagian tempat korang melangkah keluar dan berdiri atas lantainya, boleh tengok pemandangan luar di luar dinding','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>339.28,'end_time'=>343.1,'target_text'=>'apartment building and there is a railing to keep you from falling over.','source_text'=>'bangunan apartmen korang dan ada pagar penghadang untuk elak daripada jatuh.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>343.2,'end_time'=>346.22,'target_text'=>'What do you call that part?','source_text'=>'Apa nama bahagian tu?','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>346.32,'end_time'=>349.34,'target_text'=>'>> That part is called a balcony.','source_text'=>'>> Bahagian tu dipanggil balkoni.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>349.44,'end_time'=>351.74,'target_text'=>'>> That is called the balcony.','source_text'=>'>> Itu dipanggil balkoni.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>351.84,'end_time'=>362.22,'target_text'=>'Not every apartment has a balcony, but if I ever had to live in an apartment, I would love to live very high up and also have','source_text'=>'Bukan semua apartmen ada balkoni, tapi kalau saya terpaksa tinggal di apartmen, saya teringin tinggal di tingkat paling tinggi dan ada','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>362.32,'end_time'=>371.26,'target_text'=>'a balcony just because I think sitting out there in the morning or at night to watch the sunset would be very beautiful with','source_text'=>'balkoni semata-mata sebab saya rasa duduk bersantai di luar pada waktu pagi atau petang sambil melihat matahari terbenam sangat menenangkan dengan','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>371.36,'end_time'=>372.54,'target_text'=>'a balcony.','source_text'=>'adanya balkoni.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>372.64,'end_time'=>375.66,'target_text'=>'What do you think she is doing?','source_text'=>'Pada pandangan awak, apa yang wanita tu sedang buat?','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>375.76,'end_time'=>379.02,'target_text'=>'>> She has a bucket and a small rake.','source_text'=>'>> Dia pegang baldi dan sebilah pencakar kecil.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>379.12,'end_time'=>385.42,'target_text'=>'So maybe she is looking for some sort of shellfish or digging for something.','source_text'=>'Jadi mungkin dia tengah cari hidupan kerang-kerangan atau menggali sesuatu.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>385.52,'end_time'=>386.06,'target_text'=>'>> I agree.','source_text'=>'>> Saya setuju.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>386.16,'end_time'=>390.94,'target_text'=>'I think she\'s either looking for garbage or she is looking for some sort of animal.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa sama ada dia tengah cari sampah atau mencari sejenis haiwan laut.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>391.04,'end_time'=>395.42,'target_text'=>'Maybe she is harvesting something or searching for something.','source_text'=>'Mungkin dia mengutip hasil laut atau mencari sesuatu.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>395.52,'end_time'=>397.1,'target_text'=>'Now I have a question for you guys.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya ada soalan untuk korang semua.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>397.2,'end_time'=>398.62,'target_text'=>'How do you think we got here?','source_text'=>'Agak-agak korang macam mana cara kami sampai ke sini?','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>398.72,'end_time'=>400.78,'target_text'=>'Did we take public transport?','source_text'=>'Adakah kami naik pengangkutan awam?','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>400.88,'end_time'=>402.78,'target_text'=>'Did we drive a car?','source_text'=>'Adakah kami pandu kereta?','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>402.88,'end_time'=>406.28,'target_text'=>'Or did we take scooters?','source_text'=>'Atau kami naik motosikal skuter?','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>407.04,'end_time'=>408.46,'target_text'=>'We took these scooters.','source_text'=>'Kami naik skuter-skuter ni.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>408.56,'end_time'=>409.98,'target_text'=>'Come over here, guys.','source_text'=>'Mari sini, kawan-kawan.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>410.08,'end_time'=>413.26,'target_text'=>'So, you can see these are the scooters we rented.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang boleh tengok ini skuter yang kami sewa.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>413.36,'end_time'=>416.06,'target_text'=>'Which one is your scooter, Leon?','source_text'=>'Yang mana satu skuter awak, Leon?','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>416.16,'end_time'=>419.9,'target_text'=>'>> My scooter is the one that is white and green.','source_text'=>'>> Skuter saya yang warna putih dan hijau tu.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>420,'end_time'=>422.62,'target_text'=>'White, black, and green.','source_text'=>'Putih, hitam, dan hijau.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>422.72,'end_time'=>423.04,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>423.04,'end_time'=>425.5,'target_text'=>'So, this is Leon\'s scooter.','source_text'=>'Jadi ini skuter Leon.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>425.6,'end_time'=>427.58,'target_text'=>'And this is Leon\'s helmet.','source_text'=>'Dan ini topi keledar Leon.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>427.68,'end_time'=>430.46,'target_text'=>'This right here is my scooter.','source_text'=>'Yang ini pula skuter saya.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>430.56,'end_time'=>432.06,'target_text'=>'You can come around here.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh datang dekat sebelah sini.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>432.16,'end_time'=>433.5,'target_text'=>'How would you describe this?','source_text'=>'Macam mana korang akan gambarkan keadaan','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>433.6,'end_time'=>435.02,'target_text'=>'my scooter is.','source_text'=>'skuter saya ni.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>435.12,'end_time'=>438.38,'target_text'=>'Give me three words to describe this scooter.','source_text'=>'Berikan saya tiga perkataan untuk gambarkan skuter ni.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>438.48,'end_time'=>441.8,'target_text'=>'You can come closer and take a look.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh datang lebih dekat dan tengok sendiri.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>444.72,'end_time'=>448.06,'target_text'=>'Your scooter is white.','source_text'=>'Skuter awak warna putih.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>448.16,'end_time'=>450.78,'target_text'=>'>> White, small.','source_text'=>'>> Warna putih, bersaiz kecil.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>450.88,'end_time'=>453.9,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s small and old.','source_text'=>'>> Kecil dan nampak berumur.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>454,'end_time'=>454.7,'target_text'=>'>> And old.','source_text'=>'>> Dan lama.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>454.8,'end_time'=>456.94,'target_text'=>'It\'s white, small, and old.','source_text'=>'Warna putih, kecil, dan lama.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>457.04,'end_time'=>459.1,'target_text'=>'And all three of those are correct.','source_text'=>'Dan ketiga-tiga gambaran tu tepat sekali.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>459.2,'end_time'=>465.34,'target_text'=>'You can see a lot of small cracks and scratches on the body of the scooter.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak banyak rekahan halus dan kesan calar pada badan skuter ni.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>465.44,'end_time'=>469.02,'target_text'=>'It is old, but it still runs like new.','source_text'=>'Walaupun nampak lama, tapi enjin dia masih berfungsi lancar macam baru.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>469.12,'end_time'=>475.82,'target_text'=>'Anyways, we\'re going to head now to a national park to go see monkeys at a beach.','source_text'=>'Apa pun, sekarang kita akan bertolak ke taman negara untuk tengok monyet di tepi pantai.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>475.92,'end_time'=>478.94,'target_text'=>'The beach is called Monkey Beach.','source_text'=>'Pantai tu dinamakan Pantai Monyet (Monkey Beach).','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>479.04,'end_time'=>479.9,'target_text'=>'Who would have guessed?','source_text'=>'Siapa sangka, kan?','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>480,'end_time'=>486.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s a beautiful white and blue color with birds perched on the roof of the mosque.','source_text'=>'Warna putih dan biru masjid terapung ni sangat indah dengan burung-burung hinggap di atas bumbung.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>486.32,'end_time'=>487.5,'target_text'=>'Very beautiful.','source_text'=>'Sungguh mempesonakan.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>487.6,'end_time'=>488.86,'target_text'=>'Let\'s get going, guys.','source_text'=>'Jom kita gerak, semua.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>488.96,'end_time'=>492.62,'target_text'=>'I just landed in Malaysia and I need my phone working immediately.','source_text'=>'Saya baru je mendarat di Malaysia dan saya perlukan telefon saya berfungsi serta-merta.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>492.72,'end_time'=>494.86,'target_text'=>'Grab maps and messages.','source_text'=>'Buka aplikasi peta dan hantar mesej.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>494.96,'end_time'=>499.74,'target_text'=>'I hate hunting for Wi-Fi and I hate waiting in line for a SIM at the airport.','source_text'=>'Saya malas nak cari Wi-Fi percuma dan leceh beratur panjang beli kad SIM di lapangan terbang.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>499.84,'end_time'=>502.46,'target_text'=>'I want data working the second I arrive.','source_text'=>'Saya nak data internet terus aktif saat saya menjejakkan kaki.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>502.56,'end_time'=>503.5,'target_text'=>'So, here\'s what I use.','source_text'=>'Jadi inilah apa yang saya gunakan.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>503.6,'end_time'=>508.38,'target_text'=>'I use SY, an eim app brought to you by the creators of NordVPN.','source_text'=>'Saya gunakan Saily, aplikasi eSIM yang dibawakan oleh pencipta NordVPN.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>508.48,'end_time'=>511.1,'target_text'=>'It only takes a few moments and then you\'ve got data.','source_text'=>'Cuma ambil masa beberapa saat sahaja dan korang terus dapat internet.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>511.2,'end_time'=>512.3,'target_text'=>'No messing around.','source_text'=>'Tanpa sebarang kerumitan.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>512.4,'end_time'=>513.98,'target_text'=>'Just connect and go.','source_text'=>'Sambung dan terus boleh guna.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>514.08,'end_time'=>515.58,'target_text'=>'And here\'s a useful tip.','source_text'=>'Dan ini satu tip yang sangat berguna.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>515.68,'end_time'=>522.38,'target_text'=>'If you want it to be even more convenient and have zero problems when you land, activate your sale data before you get on','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak lebih mudah dan tiada sebarang masalah masa mendarat, aktifkan data eSIM korang sebelum naik','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>522.48,'end_time'=>523.02,'target_text'=>'the plane.','source_text'=>'pesawat terbang.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>523.12,'end_time'=>526.94,'target_text'=>'That way, you don\'t need Wi-Fi to activate it when you\'re already abroad.','source_text'=>'Dengan cara tu, korang tak perlukan sambungan Wi-Fi untuk aktifkannya bila dah sampai luar negara nanti.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>527.04,'end_time'=>535.74,'target_text'=>'Also, SLY has an ad block feature that helps you save up to 26% of your data because ads also consume your mobile data.','source_text'=>'Selain itu, Saily ada ciri penyekat iklan yang jimatkan sehingga 26% kuota internet sebab paparan iklan turut guna data telefon korang.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>535.84,'end_time'=>539.82,'target_text'=>'Get 15% off sale eim data plans with my code Vulca.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan potongan diskaun 15% untuk pelan data eSIM dengan guna kod promo Vulca saya.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>539.92,'end_time'=>544.7,'target_text'=>'Just download the SY app, enter Vulca at checkout, and the discount applies automatically.','source_text'=>'Muat turun aplikasi Saily, masukkan kod Vulca semasa pembayaran, dan diskaun akan ditolak secara automatik.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>544.8,'end_time'=>549.42,'target_text'=>'You can scan the QR code on screen or use my link in the description and pinned comment.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh imbas kod QR di skrin atau guna pautan saya di penerangan dan komen yang disematkan.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>549.52,'end_time'=>551.42,'target_text'=>'Thank you SE for sponsoring this video.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih kepada Saily kerana menaja video ini.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>551.52,'end_time'=>555.34,'target_text'=>'We have just arrived at Paneang National Park.','source_text'=>'Kami baru sahaja tiba di Taman Negara Pulau Pinang.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>555.44,'end_time'=>564.3,'target_text'=>'This right here is the ocean and you can see behind me there is a pier and that is just a very long platform structure that','source_text'=>'Di depan ni adalah laut dan di belakang saya ada sebuah jeti iaitu struktur pelantar yang sangat panjang','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>564.4,'end_time'=>569.02,'target_text'=>'goes deep into the ocean and is supported by pillars.','source_text'=>'menghala jauh ke tengah laut dan disokong oleh tiang-tiang konkrit.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>569.12,'end_time'=>571.66,'target_text'=>'But anyways, it\'s still low tide.','source_text'=>'Tapi apa pun, air laut sekarang masih surut.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>571.76,'end_time'=>580.14,'target_text'=>'So that\'s why you can see right here it\'s very wet because the water was all the way up here before but uh now it\'s not.','source_text'=>'Sebab tu korang boleh nampak kawasan ni basah lencun sebab air pernah pasang sampai ke paras ni tapi sekarang dah surut.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>580.24,'end_time'=>588.62,'target_text'=>'And you can see when the water recedes it leaves behind all this garbage, wood, and other debris on the beach.','source_text'=>'Dan korang boleh nampak bila air laut surut, ia tinggalkan sisa sampah, kayu hanyut, dan serpihan lain atas pantai.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>588.72,'end_time'=>598.3,'target_text'=>'But uh right now we\'re going to walk to Monkey Beach, which is a very popular beach to visit here because there are monkeys.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang kita akan berjalan kaki menuju ke Pantai Monyet yang sangat popular dikunjungi di sini sebab ada banyak monyet.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>598.4,'end_time'=>603.02,'target_text'=>'How long will it take for us to walk to Monkey Beach?','source_text'=>'Berapa lama masa yang kita perlukan untuk jalan kaki ke Pantai Monyet?','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>603.12,'end_time'=>606.86,'target_text'=>'>> To walk to Monkey Beach, it\'ll take about an hour.','source_text'=>'>> Untuk berjalan kaki ke Pantai Monyet, ia akan ambil masa sekitar satu jam.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>606.96,'end_time'=>613.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, on the sign there it said from where we are an hour and 15 minutes, but I think we walk kind of fast.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, papan tanda tadi tulis dari sini ambil masa satu jam 15 minit, tapi saya rasa langkah kita agak laju.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>613.68,'end_time'=>616.3,'target_text'=>'So, maybe just an hour, which is kind of far.','source_text'=>'Jadi mungkin satu jam saja, yang mana jaraknya agak jauh juga.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>616.4,'end_time'=>618.78,'target_text'=>'And especially today, it is quite warm.','source_text'=>'Lebih-lebih lagi cuaca hari ini agak panas terik.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>618.88,'end_time'=>623.9,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to open up the weather app on my phone and I\'m going to check the temperature.','source_text'=>'Saya akan buka aplikasi cuaca di telefon saya dan semak suhu semasa.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>624,'end_time'=>627.02,'target_text'=>'>> 28, clear, high of 30.','source_text'=>'>> 28 darjah, cerah, suhu tertinggi boleh cecah 30 darjah.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>627.12,'end_time'=>629.02,'target_text'=>'That is uh kind of nice.','source_text'=>'Kira okey juga cuaca macam tu.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>629.12,'end_time'=>632.46,'target_text'=>'And the sun will set today at 7:30 p.m.','source_text'=>'Dan matahari akan terbenam hari ini pada pukul 7:30 petang.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>632.56,'end_time'=>635.5,'target_text'=>'and it is currently 11:06 a.m.','source_text'=>'dan sekarang waktu menunjukkan pukul 11:06 pagi.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>635.6,'end_time'=>637.98,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to go walk to Monkey Beach.','source_text'=>'Kita akan berjalan menuju ke Pantai Monyet.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>638.08,'end_time'=>639.42,'target_text'=>'Hopefully, we don\'t get lost.','source_text'=>'Harapnya kita tak sesat jalan.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>639.52,'end_time'=>641.5,'target_text'=>'Paneang National Park.','source_text'=>'Taman Negara Pulau Pinang.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>641.6,'end_time'=>643.18,'target_text'=>'This is the entrance.','source_text'=>'Ini pintu masuk utamanya.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>643.28,'end_time'=>645.02,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s the name in Malay?','source_text'=>'>> Apa nama dia dalam bahasa Melayu?','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>645.12,'end_time'=>650.78,'target_text'=>'>> I do not speak Malay, but this is a very nice entrance to the park.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tak tahu cakap Melayu, tapi pintu gerbang masuk ke taman negara ni memang sangat cantik.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>650.88,'end_time'=>655.9,'target_text'=>'There is a nice path here that they made with rocks.','source_text'=>'Ada laluan pejalan kaki yang elok dibuat daripada susunan batu kat sini.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>656,'end_time'=>660.62,'target_text'=>'No smoking and no vaping or you will be fined.','source_text'=>'Dilarang merokok dan menghisap vape atau korang akan didenda.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>660.72,'end_time'=>662.46,'target_text'=>'5,000 ringlet.','source_text'=>'Denda 5,000 Ringgit.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>662.56,'end_time'=>664.38,'target_text'=>'This is actually a nice path.','source_text'=>'Laluan ni sebenarnya memang kemas dan selesa.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>664.48,'end_time'=>665.26,'target_text'=>'Like look at this.','source_text'=>'Cuba tengok ni.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>665.36,'end_time'=>668.54,'target_text'=>'It\'s like very smooth and very well done.','source_text'=>'Permukaan dia sangat rata dan dibina dengan elok.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>668.64,'end_time'=>670.22,'target_text'=>'To me, this isn\'t really hiking.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya, ini bukanlah mendaki yang mencabar sangat.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>670.32,'end_time'=>671.74,'target_text'=>'This is like walking.','source_text'=>'Ini lebih kepada berjalan santai.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>671.84,'end_time'=>677.02,'target_text'=>'But they call this a hike, a national park hike, which is fine to me.','source_text'=>'Tapi dorang panggil aktiviti mendaki taman negara, okeylah bagi saya.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>677.12,'end_time'=>681.66,'target_text'=>'But we\'ll see how much water I drink because it\'s about right here.','source_text'=>'Tapi kita tengok berapa banyak air saya minum nanti sebab paras air botol saya tinggal kat sini.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>681.76,'end_time'=>683.82,'target_text'=>'And uh we\'re going to start this hike.','source_text'=>'Dan kita akan mulakan perjalanan mendaki ni.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>683.92,'end_time'=>684.94,'target_text'=>'Did you bring water?','source_text'=>'Awak bawa air ke?','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>685.04,'end_time'=>687.98,'target_text'=>'Uh, why did you tell me earlier that you didn\'t bring water?','source_text'=>'Kenapa tadi awak kata awak tak bawa air?','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>688.08,'end_time'=>689.34,'target_text'=>'>> I drank it all.','source_text'=>'>> Saya dah minum habis semuanya.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>689.44,'end_time'=>690.54,'target_text'=>'>> You drank it all?','source_text'=>'>> Awak dah habiskan semua?','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>690.64,'end_time'=>691.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I told you.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kan saya dah beritahu.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>691.36,'end_time'=>693.1,'target_text'=>'I\'m like a camel >> already.','source_text'=>'Saya ni macam unta tahan haus >> sekarang ni.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>693.2,'end_time'=>696.14,'target_text'=>'We haven\'t even been doing any walking so far.','source_text'=>'Kita belum mula berjalan pun lagi setakat ni.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>696.24,'end_time'=>696.78,'target_text'=>'>> But I\'ll be fine.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi saya tak ada masalah.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>696.88,'end_time'=>698.3,'target_text'=>'I drank a lot this morning.','source_text'=>'Pagi tadi saya dah minum banyak gila.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>698.4,'end_time'=>704.46,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so Leon can drink ocean water because if I let him drink my water, he\'ll drink it all.','source_text'=>'>> Okey, jadi biar Leon minum air laut sebab kalau saya bagi dia air saya, dia akan teguk sampai habis.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>704.56,'end_time'=>710.38,'target_text'=>'But you can see that they paved it before with like ashvault, but it kind of is like doesn\'t look very good.','source_text'=>'Tapi korang boleh nampak dulu dorang pernah turap laluan ni guna asfalt tar, tapi sekarang nampak tak berapa elok.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>710.48,'end_time'=>713.82,'target_text'=>'And then they redid the road with rock.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu dorang buat semula jalan ni dengan susunan batu.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>713.92,'end_time'=>715.34,'target_text'=>'kind of smells, doesn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Nampak macam ada bau sesuatu kan?','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>715.44,'end_time'=>720.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it smells like uh decaying ocean matter.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, bau dia macam sisa organik laut yang membusuk.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>720.16,'end_time'=>722.22,'target_text'=>'>> Smells like something is decomposing.','source_text'=>'>> Bau macam ada sesuatu tengah mereput.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>722.32,'end_time'=>724.86,'target_text'=>'>> Ocean plants decomposing cuz it has like that oceany smell.','source_text'=>'>> Tumbuhan laut mereput sebab ia ada bau hanyir laut yang kuat.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>724.96,'end_time'=>725.42,'target_text'=>'>> Do you think?','source_text'=>'>> Awak rasa macam tu ke?','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>725.52,'end_time'=>727.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, >> ocean plants.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, >> tumbuhan rumpai laut.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>727.2,'end_time'=>729.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, like seaweed or um >> decomposing?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, macam rumpai laut atau... mereput busuk?','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>729.92,'end_time'=>730.32,'target_text'=>'Really?','source_text'=>'Betul ke?','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>730.32,'end_time'=>733.18,'target_text'=>'>> Well, they wash up on the beach right here.','source_text'=>'>> Tumbuhan tu terdampar dihanyutkan ombak ke pantai ni.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>733.28,'end_time'=>735.42,'target_text'=>'>> And then they start decomposing.','source_text'=>'>> Lepas tu ia mula mereput dan berbau.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>735.52,'end_time'=>737.42,'target_text'=>'>> They wash up on the beach.','source_text'=>'>> Terdampar di tepi pantai.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>737.52,'end_time'=>740.38,'target_text'=>'That\'s when like stuff from the ocean ends up on the beach.','source_text'=>'Itulah bila barang atau sisa dari laut dibawa ombak ke tepi pantai.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>740.48,'end_time'=>743.26,'target_text'=>'You can say it washes up on the beach.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh gunakan frasa \'washes up on the beach\' (hanyut terdampar ke pantai).','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>743.36,'end_time'=>748.7,'target_text'=>'And yeah, this path is a little it\'s a little narrow for the cameraman Leon to be right beside me.','source_text'=>'Dan ya, laluan ni agak sempit untuk jurukamera Leon berjalan di sebelah saya.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>748.8,'end_time'=>750.22,'target_text'=>'So, he\'s kind of like falling over.','source_text'=>'Jadi dia asyik tersandung nak jatuh.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>750.32,'end_time'=>754.3,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you\'re noticing that in the video, but he\'s kind of like falling over a bit.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti kalau korang perasan dalam video, tapi dia asyik terhuyung-hayang sikit.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>754.4,'end_time'=>758.86,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s like not perfectly like there\'s like chunks taken out of it for some reason.','source_text'=>'>> Laluan ni tak berapa rata, ada bahagian berlubang-lubang macam terkikis entah kenapa.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>758.96,'end_time'=>759.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>759.6,'end_time'=>760.94,'target_text'=>'But look at this forest, dude.','source_text'=>'Tapi tengoklah pemandangan hutan ni, kawan.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>761.04,'end_time'=>761.98,'target_text'=>'It\'s like beautiful.','source_text'=>'Memang tersangat cantik.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>762.08,'end_time'=>763.18,'target_text'=>'And I love this vibe.','source_text'=>'Dan saya suka sangat suasana macam ni.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>763.28,'end_time'=>765.42,'target_text'=>'Like the ocean is just right there.','source_text'=>'Laut terbentang betul-betul di sebelah sana.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>765.52,'end_time'=>768.54,'target_text'=>'And then you have like literally a jungle right here.','source_text'=>'Dan betul-betul kat sebelah sini pula hutan rimba tebal.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>768.64,'end_time'=>769.42,'target_text'=>'That\'s a vibe.','source_text'=>'Memang suasana yang menakjubkan.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>769.52,'end_time'=>772.54,'target_text'=>'Do you think you\'re going to go swimming at Monkey Beach?','source_text'=>'Awak rasa awak nak mandi manda ke kat Pantai Monyet nanti?','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>772.64,'end_time'=>773.58,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think so.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa tak kot.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>773.68,'end_time'=>775.34,'target_text'=>'>> With the monkeys, are you allowed?','source_text'=>'>> Sekali dengan monyet-monyet tu, dibenarkan ke berenang?','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>775.44,'end_time'=>780.54,'target_text'=>'>> I think you\'re allowed to, but if you leave your stuff unattended, the monkeys will rob you.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa dibenarkan, tapi kalau korang tinggalkan barang tanpa dijaga, monyet akan rampas rompak barang korang.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>780.64,'end_time'=>782.7,'target_text'=>'So, >> really >> 100%.','source_text'=>'Jadi, >> betul ke >> seratus peratus pasti.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>782.8,'end_time'=>790.86,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, I\'ve seen videos on Instagram usually of people getting their stuff literally stolen out of their hands by monkeys.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, saya biasa tengok video kat Instagram orang kena ragut barang terus dari tangan dorang oleh monyet.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>790.96,'end_time'=>791.42,'target_text'=>'Where is that?','source_text'=>'Kat mana tu?','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>791.52,'end_time'=>792.78,'target_text'=>'That\'s usually in Bali.','source_text'=>'Selalunya di Bali.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>792.88,'end_time'=>794.54,'target_text'=>'No, >> that\'s at a temple in Bali.','source_text'=>'Bukan, >> itu dekat kuil di Bali.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>794.64,'end_time'=>797.82,'target_text'=>'I went to that temple >> and it\'s famous for their monkeys, right?','source_text'=>'Saya pernah pergi kuil tu >> dan tempat tu terkenal dengan monyet-monyet dorang, kan?','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>797.92,'end_time'=>800.22,'target_text'=>'>> I saw monkeys stealing people\'s stuff.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tengok sendiri monyet curi barang pengunjung.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>800.32,'end_time'=>800.72,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>800.8,'end_time'=>803.42,'target_text'=>'Are these monkeys the same species?','source_text'=>'Monyet-monyet kat sini spesis yang sama ke?','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>803.52,'end_time'=>804.14,'target_text'=>'>> I think they are.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa spesis yang sama.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>804.24,'end_time'=>806.3,'target_text'=>'They\'re the most common species.','source_text'=>'Dorang spesis monyet yang paling biasa dijumpai.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>806.4,'end_time'=>807.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they\'re not too big.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saiz dorang tak berapa besar sangat.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>807.6,'end_time'=>811.74,'target_text'=>'They\'re [clears throat] kind of uh like small and they just got like I don\'t know a monkey face.','source_text'=>'Dorang bersaiz agak kecil dan ada muka comel monyet biasa.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>811.84,'end_time'=>813.02,'target_text'=>'>> But look at this tree.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi cuba tengok pokok ni.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>813.12,'end_time'=>814.86,'target_text'=>'Crazy spiky, right?','source_text'=>'Batang dia berduri tajam, kan?','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>814.96,'end_time'=>816.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, you almost ran into it.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tadi awak hampir terlanggar pokok tu.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>816.72,'end_time'=>818.14,'target_text'=>'Or did you run into it?','source_text'=>'Atau awak dah terlanggar tadi?','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>818.24,'end_time'=>821.34,'target_text'=>'>> No, I noticed it, but I didn\'t notice that it was spiky.','source_text'=>'>> Tak, saya perasan pokok tu tapi tak perasan ia berduri tajam.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>821.44,'end_time'=>823.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I saw you like go like this.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya nampak awak mengelak macam ni tadi.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>823.52,'end_time'=>830.46,'target_text'=>'It kind of is risky going to see monkeys, especially if they\'re the like naughty ones, the ones that just want to steal your','source_text'=>'Agak berisiko juga pergi tengok monyet, terutamanya kalau monyet jenis nakal yang suka mencuri','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>830.56,'end_time'=>836.78,'target_text'=>'stuff because we have a camera and if they try to steal it, I don\'t know, just >> you have to fight the monkeys.','source_text'=>'barang orang sebab kita bawa kamera dan kalau dorang cuba rampas, tak tahu la... >> kena berlawan dengan monyet la.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>836.88,'end_time'=>839.82,'target_text'=>'>> Pretty sure you cannot even touch the monkeys.','source_text'=>'>> Saya pasti kita langsung tak boleh sentuh monyet-monyet tu.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>839.92,'end_time'=>843.26,'target_text'=>'One, because they might give you an infection and they might be dirty.','source_text'=>'Pertama, sebab dorang mungkin bawa jangkitan kuman dan kotor.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>843.36,'end_time'=>848.94,'target_text'=>'And two, they\'re probably protected since it\'s a national park, so if you hurt a monkey, even though they steal your stuff,','source_text'=>'Dan kedua, monyet tu haiwan dilindungi sebab dalam taman negara, jadi kalau korang cederakan monyet walaupun dia curi barang,','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>849.04,'end_time'=>851.98,'target_text'=>'it\'s like you\'ll get fined probably or put in jail.','source_text'=>'berkemungkinan korang akan didenda atau dipenjarakan.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>852.08,'end_time'=>853.26,'target_text'=>'I don\'t want to hit a monkey.','source_text'=>'Saya tak nak pukul monyet.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>853.36,'end_time'=>856.54,'target_text'=>'Obviously, it\'s just a monkey, but I do want to keep my stuff to myself.','source_text'=>'Memanglah ia sekadar seekor monyet, tapi saya nak pastikan barang-barang saya selamat.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>856.64,'end_time'=>860.38,'target_text'=>'So, I think I\'ll put all my valuables inside my cross body bag.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya rasa saya akan masukkan semua barang berharga dalam beg silang saya.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>860.48,'end_time'=>863.02,'target_text'=>'And uh then I\'ll hold the zipper shut.','source_text'=>'Dan saya akan pegang kepala zip supaya sentiasa tertutup rapat.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>863.12,'end_time'=>864.46,'target_text'=>'And there is only one zipper.','source_text'=>'Dan beg ni cuma ada satu zip saja.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>864.56,'end_time'=>866.3,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ll hold it shut like this.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya akan genggam rapat zip macam ni.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>866.4,'end_time'=>867.34,'target_text'=>'There\'s a monkey there.','source_text'=>'Ada seekor monyet kat sana.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>867.44,'end_time'=>868.78,'target_text'=>'We\'ll walk closer.','source_text'=>'Jom kita jalan lebih dekat.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>868.88,'end_time'=>877.1,'target_text'=>'>> Well, there\'s a monkey on your >> Leon on the other hand, he has a full big backpack with like eight zippers.','source_text'=>'>> Ada monyet kat atas... Leon pula bawa beg galas besar dengan lapan kepala zip.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>877.2,'end_time'=>878.94,'target_text'=>'So, >> I can lock the main one.','source_text'=>'Jadi, >> saya boleh kunci zip utama.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>879.04,'end_time'=>881.42,'target_text'=>'So, >> maybe I\'ll walk behind him to make sure.','source_text'=>'Jadi, >> mungkin saya akan jalan di belakang dia untuk perhatikan.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>881.52,'end_time'=>881.76,'target_text'=>'Sure.','source_text'=>'Boleh.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>881.76,'end_time'=>884.78,'target_text'=>'No monkeys steal anything cuz that would suck.','source_text'=>'Pastikan tak ada monyet curi barang sebab susah kalau hilang.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>884.88,'end_time'=>886.46,'target_text'=>'But oh, there\'s the monkey.','source_text'=>'Tapi haa, tu dia monyet tu.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>886.56,'end_time'=>886.96,'target_text'=>'Look at it.','source_text'=>'Tengok dia tu.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>887.04,'end_time'=>888.22,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, it got something already.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, dia dah dapat curi sesuatu dah.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>888.32,'end_time'=>889.66,'target_text'=>'>> Got a plastic bottle.','source_text'=>'>> Dia pegang botol plastik.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>889.76,'end_time'=>891.74,'target_text'=>'Dude, it just looks so naughty.','source_text'=>'Kawan, muka dia nampak nakal sungguh.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>891.84,'end_time'=>893.74,'target_text'=>'Like, it just looks mischievous.','source_text'=>'Muka dia nampak licik dan nakal.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>893.84,'end_time'=>895.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they will rob you blind.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, monyet-monyet ni memang perompak licik.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>895.28,'end_time'=>895.52,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>895.52,'end_time'=>896.38,'target_text'=>'Don\'t look at it too long.','source_text'=>'Jangan tenung dia lama sangat.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>896.48,'end_time'=>897.9,'target_text'=>'It might get an idea.','source_text'=>'Nanti dia dapat ilham nak buat hal.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>898,'end_time'=>900.14,'target_text'=>'That is another word that people pronounce differently.','source_text'=>'Itu satu lagi perkataan yang orang sebut dengan cara berbeza.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>900.24,'end_time'=>905.34,'target_text'=>'Depending on where you\'re from and depending on who you ask, people pronounce this word differently.','source_text'=>'Bergantung pada dari mana korang berasal dan siapa yang korang tanya, orang sebut perkataan ni secara berlainan.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>905.44,'end_time'=>909.26,'target_text'=>'How would you pronounce this word right here?','source_text'=>'Macam mana korang sebut perkataan yang tertulis kat sini?','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>909.36,'end_time'=>915.18,'target_text'=>'This word is technically officially pronounced mischievous.','source_text'=>'Perkataan ini secara rasmi disebut sebagai \'mischievous\'.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>915.28,'end_time'=>916.3,'target_text'=>'Mischievous.','source_text'=>'\'Mischievous\' (nakal).','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>916.4,'end_time'=>928.06,'target_text'=>'But I and a lot of people I know and everyone most people I see online on YouTube, on the news, on TV shows, they say mischievous.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya dan ramai orang yang saya kenal, serta kebanyakan orang di YouTube, berita, dan TV sering sebut \'mischievous\'.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>928.16,'end_time'=>929.26,'target_text'=>'Mischievous.','source_text'=>'Sebutan yang biasa didengar: \'mischievous\'.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>929.36,'end_time'=>932.22,'target_text'=>'But the correct way to say it is mischievous.','source_text'=>'Tapi cara sebutan yang betul dari segi tatabahasa adalah \'mischievous\'.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>932.32,'end_time'=>933.98,'target_text'=>'And we just got on this bridge.','source_text'=>'Dan kita baru je melangkah atas jambatan ni.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>934.08,'end_time'=>935.26,'target_text'=>'So now we\'re on this bridge.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang kita berada di atas jambatan gantung ni.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>935.36,'end_time'=>936.94,'target_text'=>'And it\'s kind of like a little bouncy.','source_text'=>'Dan ia rasa macam bergoyang anjal sikit.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>937.04,'end_time'=>938.84,'target_text'=>'Okay.','source_text'=>'Okey.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>938.96,'end_time'=>940.54,'target_text'=>'Little bit of a bouncy bridge.','source_text'=>'Jambatan ni rasa macam melantun sikit bila dipijak.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>940.64,'end_time'=>941.58,'target_text'=>'I like this.','source_text'=>'Saya suka jambatan macam ni.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>941.68,'end_time'=>942.62,'target_text'=>'I like this.','source_text'=>'Menarik rasa dia.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>942.72,'end_time'=>949.18,'target_text'=>'Oh, I guess there is a bridge because when the tide rises, this whole area probably gets flooded, right?','source_text'=>'Oh, saya rasa jambatan ni dibina sebab bila air pasang, seluruh kawasan ni ditenggelami air laut, kan?','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>949.28,'end_time'=>951.42,'target_text'=>'Cuz I can see a little bit of water here.','source_text'=>'Sebab saya boleh nampak lopak air kat sini.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>951.52,'end_time'=>954.78,'target_text'=>'And it kind of looks like later in the day, this is all going to flood.','source_text'=>'Dan nampak gayanya lewat petang nanti seluruh kawasan ni akan ditenggelami air.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>954.88,'end_time'=>956.22,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s why they need this bridge.','source_text'=>'Sebab tu dorang perlukan jambatan ni.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>956.32,'end_time'=>957.98,'target_text'=>'It\'s an interesting bridge to make.','source_text'=>'Pembinaan jambatan yang sangat menarik dan praktikal.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>958.08,'end_time'=>959.9,'target_text'=>'But this place is picture perfect.','source_text'=>'Tapi pemandangan tempat ni memang sangat cantik untuk bergambar.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>960,'end_time'=>961.5,'target_text'=>'Like, let me let me take a picture.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya ambil gambar sekejap.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>961.6,'end_time'=>962.7,'target_text'=>'This is so nice.','source_text'=>'Cantik sangat tempat ni.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>962.8,'end_time'=>968.94,'target_text'=>'If you guys want to ever see these pictures, make sure to check out my Slow English podcast because that is where I show you','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak tengok gambar-gambar ni, pastikan korang ikuti podcast Slow English saya sebab di situlah saya tunjukkan','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>969.04,'end_time'=>972.86,'target_text'=>'all these videos and then talk about them and describe them.','source_text'=>'semua video ni sambil bercerita dan menerangkan persekitarannya.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>972.96,'end_time'=>974.38,'target_text'=>'Let\'s continue.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan perjalanan.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>974.48,'end_time'=>979.42,'target_text'=>'So, we got to go to the right towards Monkey Beach and also the lighthouse.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita kena ikut simpang kanan menghala ke Pantai Monyet dan juga rumah api.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>979.52,'end_time'=>980.22,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom gerak.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>980.32,'end_time'=>985.5,'target_text'=>'And there are a lot of roots, so watch out and make sure you don\'t trip or roll your ankle.','source_text'=>'Dan ada banyak akar kayu berselirat, jadi berhati-hati jangan sampai tersandung atau terseliuh buku lali.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>985.6,'end_time'=>987.18,'target_text'=>'Have you ever rolled your ankle?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah terseliuh buku lali tak?','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>987.28,'end_time'=>991.82,'target_text'=>'>> Not so much that I would do damage to myself, but I have rolled it before.','source_text'=>'>> Tak sampai tahap kecederaan teruk, tapi pernah juga terseliuh sebelum ni.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>991.92,'end_time'=>992.54,'target_text'=>'M.','source_text'=>'Hmm.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>992.64,'end_time'=>993.9,'target_text'=>'Oh, watch out.','source_text'=>'Oh, hati-hati.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>994,'end_time'=>995.9,'target_text'=>'That is not sturdy.','source_text'=>'Pijakan tu tak kukuh.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>996,'end_time'=>1004.62,'target_text'=>'I have rolled my ankle so bad that I was limping for a few days and I probably tore a couple ligaments and I didn\'t roll my','source_text'=>'Saya pernah terseliuh buku lali teruk sangat sampai terhincut-hincut beberapa hari dan ligamen mungkin terkoyak, dan bukan terseliuh','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>1004.72,'end_time'=>1006.94,'target_text'=>'ankle from uh from just walking.','source_text'=>'masa sekadar berjalan kaki biasa.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>1007.04,'end_time'=>1008.06,'target_text'=>'This is actually what happened.','source_text'=>'Ini apa yang sebenarnya berlaku dulu.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>1008.16,'end_time'=>1015.5,'target_text'=>'I was jumping on my trampoline when I was younger and when I came down from jumping, I landed bad and I landed like this and','source_text'=>'Masa saya kecil dulu saya lompat atas trampolin dan bila mendarat, kaki saya mendarat senget macam ni dan','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>1015.6,'end_time'=>1019.1,'target_text'=>'I completely rolled my ankle with all my body weight landing on it.','source_text'=>'seluruh berat badan saya menghempap atas buku lali yang terlipat tu.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>1019.2,'end_time'=>1019.6,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'>> Fuh, sakitnya.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>1019.68,'end_time'=>1022.06,'target_text'=>'I don\'t remember that one, but that does sound brutal.','source_text'=>'Saya tak ingat kejadian tu, tapi bunyinya memang ngeri.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>1022.16,'end_time'=>1024.7,'target_text'=>'>> No, I think I was alone when I did that.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya rasa masa tu saya main seorang diri.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>1024.8,'end_time'=>1025.98,'target_text'=>'How\'s the hike so far?','source_text'=>'Macam mana perjalanan mendaki setakat ni?','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>1026.08,'end_time'=>1026.62,'target_text'=>'>> Pretty good.','source_text'=>'>> Agak seronok dan baik.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>1026.72,'end_time'=>1027.34,'target_text'=>'>> Not too bad.','source_text'=>'>> Boleh tahan seronok.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>1027.44,'end_time'=>1029.58,'target_text'=>'You\'re not sweating little bit, but I\'m good.','source_text'=>'Awak tak berpeluh... ada sikit peluh, tapi saya okey je.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>1029.68,'end_time'=>1030.54,'target_text'=>'My back\'s sweaty.','source_text'=>'Belakang baju saya dah basah peluh.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>1030.64,'end_time'=>1031.98,'target_text'=>'But >> are you thirsty?','source_text'=>'Tapi >> awak haus tak?','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>1032.08,'end_time'=>1032.54,'target_text'=>'>> No, I\'m good.','source_text'=>'>> Tak, saya masih okey.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>1032.64,'end_time'=>1035.58,'target_text'=>'If I drank water now, I just have to go to the toilet.','source_text'=>'Kalau saya minum air sekarang, nanti saya terpaksa cari tandas pula.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>1035.68,'end_time'=>1041.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'m starting to sweat more now, >> but I think it\'s already been 15, if not 20 minutes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya dah mula berpeluh lebat sekarang, >> tapi rasanya dah 15 ke 20 minit kita berjalan.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>1041.84,'end_time'=>1044.3,'target_text'=>'So, >> yeah, about 15 20 minutes.','source_text'=>'Jadi, >> ya, dalam 15 ke 20 minit.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>1044.4,'end_time'=>1045.98,'target_text'=>'Here is a rest spot.','source_text'=>'Kat sini ada tempat berehat (pondok rehat).','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>1046.08,'end_time'=>1047.34,'target_text'=>'You can rest here.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh berehat kat sini.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>1047.44,'end_time'=>1053.5,'target_text'=>'There is a bench that goes all the way around this platform that you can sit and rest on.','source_text'=>'Ada bangku kayu mengelilingi pelantar ni untuk korang duduk lepaskan lelah.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>1053.6,'end_time'=>1055.82,'target_text'=>'And this is another bridge.','source_text'=>'Dan ini ada satu lagi jambatan.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>1055.92,'end_time'=>1057.82,'target_text'=>'This is a pretty nice place, eh?','source_text'=>'Tempat ni memang cukup mendamaikan, kan?','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>1057.92,'end_time'=>1059.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s super pretty.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, cantik sangat pemandangannya.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>1059.44,'end_time'=>1061.66,'target_text'=>'>> You like taking photos, don\'t you?','source_text'=>'>> Awak memang suka ambil gambar kan?','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>1061.76,'end_time'=>1062.3,'target_text'=>'>> I do.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya memang suka.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>1062.4,'end_time'=>1063.1,'target_text'=>'>> Look at that.','source_text'=>'>> Cuba tengok pemandangan tu.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>1063.2,'end_time'=>1067.74,'target_text'=>'This kind of feels like there should be a monster lurking very close.','source_text'=>'Suasana kat sini rasa macam ada raksasa misteri mengintai dekat-dekat.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>1067.84,'end_time'=>1070.06,'target_text'=>'>> Well, there are a lot of leopards here.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi kat hutan ni memang ada harimau kumbang tau.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>1070.16,'end_time'=>1070.62,'target_text'=>'>> Are there?','source_text'=>'>> Biar betul ada?','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>1070.72,'end_time'=>1071.98,'target_text'=>'Oh, >> and lizards.','source_text'=>'Oh, >> dan biawak juga.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>1072.08,'end_time'=>1072.7,'target_text'=>'>> You hear that?','source_text'=>'>> Awak dengar bunyi tu tak?','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>1072.8,'end_time'=>1077.9,'target_text'=>'Might be a >> Your boy is gonna go fight whatever made that sound.','source_text'=>'Mungkin bunyi... >> member korang ni nak pergi berlawan dengan apa saja yang buat bunyi tu.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>1078,'end_time'=>1079.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s a big lizard.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, itu biawak besar.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>1079.44,'end_time'=>1080.3,'target_text'=>'>> A big lizard.','source_text'=>'>> Seekor biawak besar.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>1080.4,'end_time'=>1084.14,'target_text'=>'>> I can\'t really see what kind it is though, but it\'s definitely a lizard.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tak nampak jelas spesis apa, tapi memang sah itu biawak.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>1084.24,'end_time'=>1085.58,'target_text'=>'>> You see a lizard there?','source_text'=>'>> Awak nampak biawak kat situ ke?','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>1085.68,'end_time'=>1086.08,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya nampak.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>1086.08,'end_time'=>1086.94,'target_text'=>'We can go look at it.','source_text'=>'Kita boleh pergi tengok dia.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>1087.04,'end_time'=>1089.5,'target_text'=>'Listen to where it\'s walking and then you\'ll see it.','source_text'=>'Dengar arah mana dia merayap lepas tu baru korang nampak.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>1089.6,'end_time'=>1090.78,'target_text'=>'>> Here lizard.','source_text'=>'>> Meh sini biawak.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>1090.88,'end_time'=>1091.58,'target_text'=>'Where are you?','source_text'=>'Mana kau menyorok?','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>1091.68,'end_time'=>1092.08,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>1092.16,'end_time'=>1093.26,'target_text'=>'Oh, there it is.','source_text'=>'Haa tu dia.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>1093.36,'end_time'=>1094.78,'target_text'=>'Oh, it\'s just a small thing.','source_text'=>'Oh, rupa-rupanya biawak kecil je.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>1094.88,'end_time'=>1096.54,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you guys can see that lizard.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kalau korang boleh nampak biawak tu dalam kamera.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>1096.64,'end_time'=>1098.22,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it was just a small guy.','source_text'=>'Ya, cuma anak biawak kecil saja.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>1098.32,'end_time'=>1099.9,'target_text'=>'Nothing to write home about.','source_text'=>'Tak ada apa yang mengejutkan sangat pun.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>1100,'end_time'=>1102.7,'target_text'=>'I think it could be poisonous though.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya rasa ia mungkin beracun juga.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>1102.8,'end_time'=>1107.98,'target_text'=>'>> Oh yeah, don\'t even mess with any animals and then you won\'t have to worry if it\'s poisonous or not.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, jangan kacau apa-apa haiwan dan korang tak perlu risau sama ada beracun atau tak.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>1108.08,'end_time'=>1109.82,'target_text'=>'>> What about plants?','source_text'=>'>> Bagaimana pula dengan tumbuh-tumbuhan?','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>1109.92,'end_time'=>1110.78,'target_text'=>'>> Same thing.','source_text'=>'>> Sama juga, jangan sentuh.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>1110.88,'end_time'=>1112.86,'target_text'=>'But yeah, you could see Leon\'s backpack now.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, korang boleh tengok beg galas Leon sekarang.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>1112.96,'end_time'=>1119.18,'target_text'=>'Look at all these zippers that the monkeys are just going to grab and open up and then steal all his stuff.','source_text'=>'Tengok semua kepala zip ni yang monyet boleh rentap buka dan curi barang-barang dia.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>1119.28,'end_time'=>1120.86,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ll wear it on my front.','source_text'=>'>> Saya akan galas beg ni kat bahagian depan dada.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>1120.96,'end_time'=>1123.5,'target_text'=>'>> And we\'ve already seen one monkey.','source_text'=>'>> Dan kita dah nampak seekor monyet tadi.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>1123.6,'end_time'=>1126.22,'target_text'=>'>> Well, we saw more than that on the drive up.','source_text'=>'>> Tadi masa kita tunggang skuter ke sini kita nampak lebih banyak lagi.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>1126.32,'end_time'=>1128.38,'target_text'=>'We saw maybe 30 monkeys.','source_text'=>'Kita nampak dalam 30 ekor monyet.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>1128.48,'end_time'=>1129.5,'target_text'=>'It was a lot.','source_text'=>'Banyak sangat jumlahnya.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>1129.6,'end_time'=>1134.62,'target_text'=>'20 maybe 30 monkeys drive on the drive up here along the main road.','source_text'=>'Ada dalam 20 ke 30 ekor monyet sepanjang jalan utama masa naik ke sini tadi.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>1134.72,'end_time'=>1135.04,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>1135.04,'end_time'=>1140.54,'target_text'=>'When we were driving the scooters, we passed by a big group of monkeys just monkeying around.','source_text'=>'Masa kita tunggang skuter tadi, kita berselisih dengan sekumpulan besar monyet yang tengah lepak main-main.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>1140.64,'end_time'=>1146.22,'target_text'=>'But yeah, this path is really getting like a lot more like off-road.','source_text'=>'Tapi laluan ni sekarang dah makin mencabar macam laluan hutan tanah merah.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>1146.32,'end_time'=>1148.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, you better be careful.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, lebih baik awak berhati-hati.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>1148.16,'end_time'=>1153.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, there might be a a big snake or a lizard just on this dirt path that might want to like eat us.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, entah-entah ada ular besar atau biawak atas lorong tanah ni yang nak terkam kita.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>1153.84,'end_time'=>1155.26,'target_text'=>'But look at how narrow this is.','source_text'=>'Tapi tengoklah betapa sempitnya laluan ni.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>1155.36,'end_time'=>1156.22,'target_text'=>'Very narrow.','source_text'=>'Sempit sangat.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>1156.32,'end_time'=>1157.66,'target_text'=>'Definitely got to be careful here.','source_text'=>'Memang kena ekstra berhati-hati melangkah kat sini.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>1157.76,'end_time'=>1160.22,'target_text'=>'And I haven\'t even seen that many people.','source_text'=>'Dan saya langsung tak nampak ramai orang lalu-lalang.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>1160.32,'end_time'=>1162.86,'target_text'=>'I\'ve seen like three other people hiking this route.','source_text'=>'Cuma nampak tiga orang pendaki lain je sepanjang laluan ni tadi.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>1162.96,'end_time'=>1164.86,'target_text'=>'>> There\'s not a lot of tourists here.','source_text'=>'>> Tak ramai pelancong datang sini.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>1164.96,'end_time'=>1167.18,'target_text'=>'>> Tourists, >> which is why I like it so much.','source_text'=>'>> Pelancong tak ramai >> dan sebab itulah saya suka sangat tempat ni.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>1167.28,'end_time'=>1172.94,'target_text'=>'If this was in Thailand, like in the south somewhere, this trail would be full of people.','source_text'=>'Kalau tempat macam ni di Thailand, macam di bahagian selatan, trek ni dah penuh sesak dengan orang.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>1173.04,'end_time'=>1174.22,'target_text'=>'>> Aren\'t you a tourist?','source_text'=>'>> Awak sendiri bukan pelancong ke?','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>1174.32,'end_time'=>1174.94,'target_text'=>'>> I am.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya pelancong.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>1175.04,'end_time'=>1177.1,'target_text'=>'>> So you don\'t like your own people.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi awak tak suka geng awak sendiri la ni.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>1177.2,'end_time'=>1177.98,'target_text'=>'>> Exactly.','source_text'=>'>> Tepat sekali.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>1178.08,'end_time'=>1179.66,'target_text'=>'>> So you don\'t like yourself?','source_text'=>'>> Jadi awak tak suka diri sendiri ke?','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>1179.76,'end_time'=>1181.56,'target_text'=>'>> Exactly.','source_text'=>'>> Tepat sekali jawapan tu.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>1181.84,'end_time'=>1183.58,'target_text'=>'>> So you hate yourself?','source_text'=>'>> Jadi awak benci diri sendiri?','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>1183.68,'end_time'=>1184.38,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe.','source_text'=>'>> Mungkin juga.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>1184.48,'end_time'=>1185.34,'target_text'=>'>> Exactly.','source_text'=>'>> Tepat tekaan tu.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>1185.44,'end_time'=>1185.98,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys.','source_text'=>'Okey, kawan-kawan.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>1186.08,'end_time'=>1188.54,'target_text'=>'So, we have made it to a beach.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita dah berjaya sampai ke pantai.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>1188.64,'end_time'=>1191.74,'target_text'=>'Not the monkey beach, but a beach.','source_text'=>'Bukan Pantai Monyet yang dituju lagi, tapi pantai persinggahan.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>1191.84,'end_time'=>1193.34,'target_text'=>'And there are monkeys here.','source_text'=>'Dan ada monyet juga kat sini.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>1193.44,'end_time'=>1195.98,'target_text'=>'Oh, are they fighting?','source_text'=>'Oh, dorang tengah bergaduh ke tu?','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>1196.08,'end_time'=>1197.02,'target_text'=>'I >> think so.','source_text'=>'Saya >> rasa macam tu.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>1197.12,'end_time'=>1198.46,'target_text'=>'>> I think he\'s cleaning him.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa dia tengah tolong carikan kutu.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>1198.56,'end_time'=>1199.02,'target_text'=>'Never mind.','source_text'=>'Tak apa la.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>1199.12,'end_time'=>1200.14,'target_text'=>'He He\'s not cleaning.','source_text'=>'Dia... dia bukan tengah cari kutu tu.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>1200.24,'end_time'=>1200.86,'target_text'=>'Never mind.','source_text'=>'Lupakanlah.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>1200.96,'end_time'=>1202.94,'target_text'=>'Anyways, we\'re on a beach right now.','source_text'=>'Apa pun, sekarang ni kita berada di tepi pantai.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>1203.04,'end_time'=>1204.46,'target_text'=>'This is super nice.','source_text'=>'Suasana kat sini sangat tenang dan indah.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>1204.56,'end_time'=>1208.94,'target_text'=>'There\'s a lot of rocks, big rocks, big boulders on the beach.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak batu besar dan bongkah batu granit tersadai di persisiran pantai ni.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>1209.04,'end_time'=>1212.7,'target_text'=>'And uh yeah, >> this is a university location.','source_text'=>'Dan ya, >> ini sebenarnya stesen penyelidikan universiti.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>1212.8,'end_time'=>1215.26,'target_text'=>'Well, it might be like a >> marine biology.','source_text'=>'Tempat ni berkaitan dengan >> biologi marin la kot.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>1215.36,'end_time'=>1215.6,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1215.6,'end_time'=>1219.1,'target_text'=>'You know, some universities have a farm that\'s separate from the campus.','source_text'=>'Sesetengah universiti ada ladang pertanian yang terpisah daripada kampus utama.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1219.2,'end_time'=>1224.22,'target_text'=>'Well, this is a secondary campus that probably just does ocean related marine stuff.','source_text'=>'Dan tempat ni pula kampus kedua yang khusus buat kajian hidupan laut dan marin.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>1224.32,'end_time'=>1229.58,'target_text'=>'>> Do you think they have to hike this every day or they have a like a road that leads them here?','source_text'=>'>> Awak rasa pelajar atau staf kena mendaki macam ni hari-hari ke, atau ada jalan raya yang boleh tembus ke sini?','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>1229.68,'end_time'=>1230.08,'target_text'=>'>> Neither.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan dua-dua tu.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>1230.16,'end_time'=>1231.58,'target_text'=>'They take a boat every day.','source_text'=>'Dorang naik bot hari-hari.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>1231.68,'end_time'=>1233.58,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, that makes the most sense.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, masuk akal sangat jawapan tu.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>1233.68,'end_time'=>1239.26,'target_text'=>'So, I guess that\'s the boat that they used to come to their classes here and they get to have classes with monkeys.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa bot tu yang dorang guna untuk datang menghadiri kelas kat sini, belajar ditemani monyet liar.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>1239.36,'end_time'=>1240.06,'target_text'=>'That\'s actually cool.','source_text'=>'Seronok juga rasa belajar macam tu.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>1240.16,'end_time'=>1242.7,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never seen a campus like this remote.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah tengok kampus universiti yang begitu terpencil macam ni.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>1242.8,'end_time'=>1246.38,'target_text'=>'Let\'s keep going and make our way to Monkey Beach.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan perjalanan menuju ke Pantai Monyet.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1246.48,'end_time'=>1253.02,'target_text'=>'We\'re about to walk down this straight cliff, but there is cord and rope on the side that we could grab onto.','source_text'=>'Kita kena menuruni tebing curam ni, tapi nasib baik ada tali keselamatan di tepi untuk kita berpaut.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>1253.12,'end_time'=>1255.02,'target_text'=>'But, uh, who should go first?','source_text'=>'Tapi siapa patut turun dulu?','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>1255.12,'end_time'=>1255.74,'target_text'=>'>> You should go first.','source_text'=>'>> Awak patut turun dulu.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>1255.84,'end_time'=>1257.66,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, let me let me go past you there.','source_text'=>'>> Okey, biar saya lalu melepasi awak dulu.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>1257.76,'end_time'=>1258.54,'target_text'=>'All right, guys.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, semua.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>1258.64,'end_time'=>1263.34,'target_text'=>'I got my water bottle in one hand and the other hand on the rope.','source_text'=>'Sebelah tangan pegang botol air dan sebelah tangan lagi berpaut pada tali.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>1263.44,'end_time'=>1266.62,'target_text'=>'Good thing I got the hiking shoes on.','source_text'=>'Mujur saya pakai kasut mendaki yang sesuai.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>1266.72,'end_time'=>1271.9,'target_text'=>'Ooh, if there wasn\'t any rope, I feel like a lot of people would get hurt and fall here.','source_text'=>'Kalau tak ada tali ni, saya rasa ramai orang dah tergelincir jatuh cedera kat tebing ni.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>1272,'end_time'=>1275.4,'target_text'=>'And a lot of people probably would turn around,','source_text'=>'Dan ramai pendaki mungkin akan patah balik ke belakang,','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>1276.08,'end_time'=>1279.02,'target_text'=>'but uh yeah, now I\'m just climbing down.','source_text'=>'tapi sekarang saya sedang perlahan-lahan turun ke bawah.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>1279.12,'end_time'=>1283.1,'target_text'=>'Right here though, the dirt is pretty loose.','source_text'=>'Kat bahagian ni tanah dia agak peroi longgar.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>1283.2,'end_time'=>1285.74,'target_text'=>'Pretty loose, so you can fall easily here.','source_text'=>'Tanah berpasir peroi, jadi korang mudah tergelincir jatuh kat sini.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>1285.84,'end_time'=>1289.18,'target_text'=>'But up there, it\'s very compact, so you won\'t fall.','source_text'=>'Tapi kat bahagian atas tadi tanah dia padat keras, jadi tak mudah jatuh.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>1289.28,'end_time'=>1290.62,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys.','source_text'=>'Okey, semua.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>1290.72,'end_time'=>1295.02,'target_text'=>'After a long and hard hike, we have finally made it to Monkey Beach.','source_text'=>'Selepas perjalanan mendaki yang panjang dan meletihkan, akhirnya kita berjaya sampai ke Pantai Monyet.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>1295.12,'end_time'=>1297.58,'target_text'=>'Honestly, I think it took longer than an hour, >> I think.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya saya rasa masa yang diambil lebih daripada satu jam, >> saya rasa.','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>1297.68,'end_time'=>1299.5,'target_text'=>'So, >> I think it was like an hour and a half.','source_text'=>'Jadi, >> saya rasa hampir satu jam setengah.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>1299.6,'end_time'=>1300.38,'target_text'=>'>> More than that.','source_text'=>'>> Lebih daripada tu lagi.','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>1300.48,'end_time'=>1301.66,'target_text'=>'The trail is like terrible.','source_text'=>'Keadaan trek laluan dia agak teruk.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>1301.76,'end_time'=>1303.34,'target_text'=>'There\'s like there\'s stuff all over the trail.','source_text'=>'Banyak halangan rintangan kayu tumbang sepanjang laluan.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>1303.44,'end_time'=>1305.66,'target_text'=>'You have to do like gymnastics to get over.','source_text'=>'Kena buat aksi gimnastik nak melompat melepasi halangan tu.','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>1305.76,'end_time'=>1308.22,'target_text'=>'>> For 50 ring it, I feel like it should be better.','source_text'=>'>> Dengan bayaran tiket 50 Ringgit, patutnya trek ni diselenggara lebih elok.','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>1308.32,'end_time'=>1312.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they should definitely take care of the trail more, but >> and pick up all that garbage, too.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, pihak pengurusan patut selenggara trek lebih kerap, >> dan kutip semua sisa sampah juga.','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>1312.72,'end_time'=>1313.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, lowkey a lot.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, banyak juga sampah berselerak.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>1313.92,'end_time'=>1315.42,'target_text'=>'But it\'s a big national park.','source_text'=>'Tapi ini sebuah taman negara yang sangat luas.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>1315.52,'end_time'=>1317.82,'target_text'=>'Probably most of the people take boats anyways.','source_text'=>'Kebanyakan pengunjung lain pun pilih naik bot terus ke pantai ni.','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>1317.92,'end_time'=>1323.66,'target_text'=>'But anyways, we\'re here at Monkey Beach, and I don\'t see any monkeys.','source_text'=>'Tapi apa pun, kita dah sampai di Pantai Monyet, cuma saya tak nampak kelibat seekor pun monyet.','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>1323.76,'end_time'=>1327.34,'target_text'=>'Maybe they\'re further down, but uh yeah, this is Monkey Beach.','source_text'=>'Mungkin dorang ada kat bahagian hujung sana, tapi inilah dia Pantai Monyet.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1327.44,'end_time'=>1329.42,'target_text'=>'It is getting a lot hotter now.','source_text'=>'Cuaca sekarang makin bertambah terik panas.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1329.52,'end_time'=>1331.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s about uh 12:30.','source_text'=>'Sekarang dah sekitar pukul 12:30 tengah hari.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1331.12,'end_time'=>1333.82,'target_text'=>'So >> yeah, >> the sun is like at its highest point.','source_text'=>'Jadi >> ya, >> matahari betul-betul tegak di atas kepala.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1333.92,'end_time'=>1336.22,'target_text'=>'So right now it\'s the hottest time of the day.','source_text'=>'Sekarang waktu paling panas terik dalam sehari.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1336.32,'end_time'=>1339.66,'target_text'=>'Even though we\'re by the ocean, the breeze does not feel refreshing.','source_text'=>'Walaupun kita berada di tepi laut, angin sepoi-sepoi langsung tak rasa menyegarkan.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1339.76,'end_time'=>1341.26,'target_text'=>'It still feels pretty warm.','source_text'=>'Udara tetap terasa panas bahang.','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1341.36,'end_time'=>1342.46,'target_text'=>'But we could swim here.','source_text'=>'Tapi kita boleh mandi laut kat sini kalau nak.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1342.56,'end_time'=>1348.3,'target_text'=>'The only thing is we\'re going to be wet hiking back for like an hour, which is going to kind of suck.','source_text'=>'Cuma masalahnya nanti badan basah kuyup nak mendaki balik selama sejam, memang tak selesa langsung.','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1348.4,'end_time'=>1349.58,'target_text'=>'We have to think about that.','source_text'=>'Kita kena fikir masak-masak pasal tu.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1349.68,'end_time'=>1351.42,'target_text'=>'But I haven\'t really drank that much water.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya belum minum banyak air sangat pun.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1351.52,'end_time'=>1353.74,'target_text'=>'It was like right here when we started.','source_text'=>'Paras air masa mula bertolak tadi kat paras ni.','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>1353.84,'end_time'=>1355.42,'target_text'=>'I got to keep some for the way back.','source_text'=>'Saya kena simpan baki air ni untuk perjalanan balik nanti.','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>1355.52,'end_time'=>1358.6,'target_text'=>'But let\'s walk along the beach now.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom kita jalan menyusuri pantai sekarang.','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>1361.92,'end_time'=>1363.74,'target_text'=>'There are two monkeys there.','source_text'=>'Ada dua ekor monyet kat sana.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>1363.84,'end_time'=>1365.82,'target_text'=>'Two monkeys and they\'re coming towards us.','source_text'=>'Dua ekor monyet dan dorang tengah berjalan menuju ke arah kita.','order'=>460],
            ['start_time'=>1365.92,'end_time'=>1367.42,'target_text'=>'These monkeys look kind of chill though.','source_text'=>'Tapi monyet-monyet ni nampak macam tenang santai je.','order'=>461],
            ['start_time'=>1367.52,'end_time'=>1369.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I think they\'re too hot to do anything.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya rasa dorang pun kepanasan sampai malas nak buat hal.','order'=>462],
            ['start_time'=>1369.44,'end_time'=>1372.86,'target_text'=>'>> Doesn\'t look like they want to really uh harass us.','source_text'=>'>> Tak nampak macam dorang nak kacau atau serang kita.','order'=>463],
            ['start_time'=>1372.96,'end_time'=>1373.98,'target_text'=>'>> We\'ll see.','source_text'=>'>> Kita tengok la nanti macam mana.','order'=>464],
            ['start_time'=>1374.08,'end_time'=>1379.66,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe if you mess with them, they\'ll mess with you, but if you just leave them alone, then they\'ll leave you alone.','source_text'=>'>> Mungkin kalau kita usik dorang baru dorang balas, tapi kalau kita tak kacau, dorang pun takkan kacau kita.','order'=>465],
            ['start_time'=>1379.76,'end_time'=>1385.74,'target_text'=>'So, if you guys want to become more confident in English and become truly fluent, check out my Patreon in the description','source_text'=>'Jadi, kalau korang nak lebih berkeyakinan dalam bahasa Inggeris dan benar-benar fasih, lawati Patreon saya di ruang penerangan','order'=>466],
            ['start_time'=>1385.84,'end_time'=>1394.14,'target_text'=>'where I give you guys three new videos every week to practice your pronunciation, your accent, and most importantly, your','source_text'=>'di mana saya sediakan tiga video baharu setiap minggu untuk korang latih sebutan, loghat, dan yang paling penting, tahap','order'=>467],
            ['start_time'=>1394.24,'end_time'=>1395.02,'target_text'=>'confidence.','source_text'=>'keyakinan diri.','order'=>468],
            ['start_time'=>1395.12,'end_time'=>1396.38,'target_text'=>'I\'ll see you guys there.','source_text'=>'Kita jumpa di sana nanti.','order'=>469],
            ['start_time'=>1396.48,'end_time'=>1397.02,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys.','source_text'=>'Okey, semua.','order'=>470],
            ['start_time'=>1397.12,'end_time'=>1400.78,'target_text'=>'I did not notice this before, but do you see that right there?','source_text'=>'Tadi saya tak perasan, tapi korang nampak tak benda kat situ tu?','order'=>471],
            ['start_time'=>1400.88,'end_time'=>1403.66,'target_text'=>'That is a dead snake.','source_text'=>'Itu bangkai seekor ular mati.','order'=>472],
            ['start_time'=>1403.76,'end_time'=>1405.82,'target_text'=>'That is a dead snake.','source_text'=>'Itu bangkai ular.','order'=>473],
            ['start_time'=>1405.92,'end_time'=>1408.78,'target_text'=>'And right now, it is decomposing.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang ni ia sedang mereput.','order'=>474],
            ['start_time'=>1408.88,'end_time'=>1416.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s decomposing and there are a lot of very small flies on the snake.','source_text'=>'Bangkai tu makin mereput dan ada banyak lalat kecil menghurungi ular tu.','order'=>475],
            ['start_time'=>1416.16,'end_time'=>1420.46,'target_text'=>'There is a rope here attached to the tree going into the ocean.','source_text'=>'Ada tali yang diikat pada pokok ni dan menghala terus ke laut.','order'=>476],
            ['start_time'=>1420.56,'end_time'=>1425.26,'target_text'=>'I believe that is for boats so boats can anchor there.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa tali tu untuk bot tambat sauh kat situ.','order'=>477],
            ['start_time'=>1425.36,'end_time'=>1428.46,'target_text'=>'And this is the whole monkey beach.','source_text'=>'Dan inilah keseluruhan pemandangan Pantai Monyet.','order'=>478],
            ['start_time'=>1428.56,'end_time'=>1433.18,'target_text'=>'There were a lot of monkeys back there but uh they kind of ran back into the bush.','source_text'=>'Tadi ada banyak monyet kat belakang sana tapi dorang dah lari masuk balik ke dalam semak.','order'=>479],
            ['start_time'=>1433.28,'end_time'=>1435.58,'target_text'=>'But this beach is very very beautiful.','source_text'=>'Tapi pantai ni memang sangat cantik mempesonakan.','order'=>480],
            ['start_time'=>1435.68,'end_time'=>1439.02,'target_text'=>'And this water is not like a bright turquoise.','source_text'=>'Dan air laut ni bukan warna firus (turquoise) terang.','order'=>481],
            ['start_time'=>1439.12,'end_time'=>1441.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of a little faded.','source_text'=>'Warna dia agak pudar sikit.','order'=>482],
            ['start_time'=>1441.12,'end_time'=>1443.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s more of a light turquoise.','source_text'=>'Lebih kepada warna firus lembut.','order'=>483],
            ['start_time'=>1443.12,'end_time'=>1444.38,'target_text'=>'Not too bad of a beach.','source_text'=>'Memang pantai yang tidak mengecewakan.','order'=>484],
            ['start_time'=>1444.48,'end_time'=>1447.18,'target_text'=>'Tell me, what do you guys think of this beach?','source_text'=>'Cuba beritahu, apa pendapat korang tentang pantai ni?','order'=>485],
            ['start_time'=>1447.28,'end_time'=>1451.18,'target_text'=>'How would you describe this beach in three words?','source_text'=>'Macam mana korang akan gambarkan pantai ni dalam tiga perkataan?','order'=>486],
            ['start_time'=>1451.28,'end_time'=>1456.62,'target_text'=>'Let me know in the comments the three words you would use to describe this beach.','source_text'=>'Kongsikan di ruangan komen tiga perkataan yang korang pilih untuk gambarkan pantai ni.','order'=>487],
            ['start_time'=>1456.72,'end_time'=>1459.34,'target_text'=>'And then let me know, would you come to this beach?','source_text'=>'Dan beritahu juga, adakah korang teringin nak datang ke pantai ni?','order'=>488],
            ['start_time'=>1459.44,'end_time'=>1462.54,'target_text'=>'But you do have to hike about an hour and a half to get here.','source_text'=>'Tapi korang kena mendaki sekitar satu jam setengah nak sampai ke sini.','order'=>489],
            ['start_time'=>1462.64,'end_time'=>1465.34,'target_text'=>'So take that into consideration.','source_text'=>'Jadi fikirkanlah cabaran tu dulu.','order'=>490],
            ['start_time'=>1465.44,'end_time'=>1467.66,'target_text'=>'A lot of these buildings are abandoned.','source_text'=>'Banyak binaan bangunan kat sini terbiar usang.','order'=>491],
            ['start_time'=>1467.76,'end_time'=>1473.9,'target_text'=>'E, those look like they used to be rooms you can rent, like your own A-frame, but now they just look abandoned.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam bilik chalet bentuk A-frame yang pernah disewakan dulu, tapi sekarang terbiar sepi.','order'=>492],
            ['start_time'=>1474,'end_time'=>1475.26,'target_text'=>'And this looks abandoned, too.','source_text'=>'Dan yang ini pun nampak terbiar juga.','order'=>493],
