            ['start_time'=>144.12,'end_time'=>145.34,'target_text'=>'Really smart guy, honestly.','source_text'=>'Memang budak yang sangat bijak, sejujurnya.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>145.44,'end_time'=>146.34,'target_text'=>'Super, super smart.','source_text'=>'Teramat cerdik.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>146.44,'end_time'=>147.3,'target_text'=>'Super smart.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat pandai.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>147.4,'end_time'=>149.42,'target_text'=>'And very mature, dude.','source_text'=>'Dan sangat matang pemikiran dia.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>149.52,'end_time'=>150.42,'target_text'=>'Like crazy.','source_text'=>'Hebat betul.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>150.52,'end_time'=>156.3,'target_text'=>'When I was an exchange student, I stayed here at SK Global House, which also like is another dormitory.','source_text'=>'Masa saya jadi pelajar pertukaran dulu, saya tinggal kat SK Global House yang merupakan salah sebuah bangunan asrama.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>156.4,'end_time'=>161.06,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you watch K-dramas or not, but isn\'t that area like really, really famous for K-dramas?','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu korang suka tengok drama Korea ke tak, tapi kawasan tu kan terkenal sangat dalam penggambaran K-drama?','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>161.16,'end_time'=>168.78,'target_text'=>'>> They filmed that K-drama, the It was about the the students who are in charge of all the festivals and and the dancing','source_text'=>'>> Dorang ada buat penggambaran drama Korea pasal sekumpulan pelajar yang uruskan festival dan pasukan tarian','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>168.88,'end_time'=>169.55,'target_text'=>'team.','source_text'=>'sorak kat situ.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>169.65,'end_time'=>171.45,'target_text'=>'>> [screaming]','source_text'=>'>> [jeritan sorakan]','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>172.48,'end_time'=>174.66,'target_text'=>'>> So, this is actually called Hagye-ro.','source_text'=>'>> Jalan laluan pejalan kaki ni sebenarnya dipanggil Baekyang-ro (Hagye-ro).','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>174.76,'end_time'=>176.22,'target_text'=>'It used to be like a car road.','source_text'=>'Dulu jalan ni laluan kereta berturap.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>176.32,'end_time'=>178.06,'target_text'=>'Cuz it is like really, really wide.','source_text'=>'Sebab jalan dia memang sangat lebar membentang.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>178.16,'end_time'=>181.26,'target_text'=>'Like it\'s one of the nicest pathways I\'ve ever seen in a university.','source_text'=>'Antara laluan pejalan kaki paling cantik pernah saya lihat di dalam universiti.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>181.36,'end_time'=>183.5,'target_text'=>'Have you ever been to Japan for cherry blossoms?','source_text'=>'Kau pernah pergi Jepun tengok bunga sakura tak?','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>183.6,'end_time'=>186.94,'target_text'=>'I\'ve been to Japan once, but not for cherry blossoms.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah pergi Jepun sekali, tapi bukan untuk musim bunga sakura.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>187.04,'end_time'=>189.02,'target_text'=>'I went during like fall, I think.','source_text'=>'Saya pergi masa musim luruh rasanya.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>189.12,'end_time'=>189.4,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>189.4,'end_time'=>189.86,'target_text'=>'Oh, okay.','source_text'=>'Oh, okey.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>189.96,'end_time'=>191.66,'target_text'=>'I\'ve been to Japan with Yumin.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah pergi Jepun dengan Yumin.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>191.76,'end_time'=>192.34,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh, ya.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>192.44,'end_time'=>193.86,'target_text'=>'Uh Yumin is one of our friends at YU.','source_text'=>'Yumin tu kawan kami di Universiti Yonsei.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>193.96,'end_time'=>194.74,'target_text'=>'Shout out Yumin.','source_text'=>'Salam hormat buat Yumin.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>194.84,'end_time'=>195.78,'target_text'=>'>> used to also be a board member, no?','source_text'=>'>> dia pun dulu ahli jawatankuasa kelab juga kan?','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>195.88,'end_time'=>198.86,'target_text'=>'He used to Yeah, he used to also be in the same club we were as a board member.','source_text'=>'Ya, dia pun pernah berada dalam kelab yang sama dengan kami sebagai jawatankuasa.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>198.96,'end_time'=>199.78,'target_text'=>'Yumin was fire.','source_text'=>'Yumin memang orang yang hebat.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>199.88,'end_time'=>203.62,'target_text'=>'Oh, if you look at that uh the statue the Oh, yeah, that\'s the eagle thing.','source_text'=>'Cuba tengok tugu arca tu... haa yang tugu burung helang tu.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>203.72,'end_time'=>205.42,'target_text'=>'>> or like the bean thing.','source_text'=>'>> atau macam bentuk kacang tu.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>205.52,'end_time'=>206.46,'target_text'=>'What is this sign?','source_text'=>'Papan tanda ni tulis apa?','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>206.56,'end_time'=>207.1,'target_text'=>'Oh, this sign?','source_text'=>'Oh, papan tanda ni?','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>207.2,'end_time'=>207.7,'target_text'=>'Yeah, this sign.','source_text'=>'Ya, papan tanda ni.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>207.8,'end_time'=>208.42,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>208.52,'end_time'=>209.3,'target_text'=>'No dogs allowed.','source_text'=>'Anjing tidak dibenarkan masuk.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>209.4,'end_time'=>210.5,'target_text'=>'No motorcycles.','source_text'=>'Motosikal dilarang masuk.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>210.6,'end_time'=>213.14,'target_text'=>'Bicycle, motorcycle, scooter, not allowed.','source_text'=>'Basikal, motosikal, dan skuter tidak dibenarkan.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>213.24,'end_time'=>216.7,'target_text'=>'But I sometimes see people just just go coming here with the scooter.','source_text'=>'Tapi kadang-kadang saya nampak orang selamba je tunggang skuter masuk sini.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>216.8,'end_time'=>217.38,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, dude, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Oh ya, memang pun.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>217.48,'end_time'=>223.02,'target_text'=>'And I see like the like those motorcycle delivery guys just whipping [laughter] here, man.','source_text'=>'Dan saya nampak mat runner penghantar makanan merempit laju [ketawa] redah jalan ni, kawan.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>223.12,'end_time'=>224.22,'target_text'=>'Is there a sign in the gate?','source_text'=>'Ada papan tanda larangan kat pintu pagar ke?','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>224.32,'end_time'=>225.62,'target_text'=>'Cuz like I don\'t think they see it.','source_text'=>'Sebab saya rasa macam dorang tak nampak je.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>225.72,'end_time'=>229.12,'target_text'=>'They should put a proper >> definitely know, dude.','source_text'=>'Dorang patut letak tanda lebih jelas >> dorang tahu sebenarnya, saja buat tak nampak.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>229.6,'end_time'=>231.96,'target_text'=>'Cherry blossoms.','source_text'=>'Bunga sakura.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>233.96,'end_time'=>236.86,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah, during the summer time that becomes like a fountain.','source_text'=>'Oh ya, masa musim panas kawasan tu jadi pancuran air.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>236.96,'end_time'=>238.34,'target_text'=>'Water shoots up, yeah.','source_text'=>'Air memancut naik ke atas, ya.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>238.44,'end_time'=>239.94,'target_text'=>'So, they don\'t have a hockey arena here, eh?','source_text'=>'Jadi dorang tak ada gelanggang hoki ais kat sini, kan?','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>240.04,'end_time'=>240.54,'target_text'=>'They don\'t.','source_text'=>'Memang tak ada.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>240.64,'end_time'=>241.14,'target_text'=>'They don\'t.','source_text'=>'Tak ada gelanggang.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>241.24,'end_time'=>241.64,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>241.68,'end_time'=>242.9,'target_text'=>'They do have a hockey team.','source_text'=>'Tapi universiti ada pasukan hoki.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>243,'end_time'=>243.46,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Ya betul.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>243.56,'end_time'=>245.26,'target_text'=>'Called Yonsei Titans.','source_text'=>'Nama pasukan tu Yonsei Titans.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>245.36,'end_time'=>248.62,'target_text'=>'And it\'s also so cool like there\'s stuff all under underneath us, right?','source_text'=>'Dan menarik sangat sebab ada banyak fasiliti di bahagian bawah tanah kita ni, kan?','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>248.72,'end_time'=>251.62,'target_text'=>'Like cuz you can see right here there\'s like entrances underground.','source_text'=>'Macam yang korang nampak kat sini ada pintu masuk ke aras bawah tanah.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>251.72,'end_time'=>254.38,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s like parking mostly, but also student Co-op.','source_text'=>'Kebanyakannya tempat letak kereta, tapi ada juga kedai Koperasi Pelajar (Co-op).','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>254.48,'end_time'=>256.9,'target_text'=>'There\'s a Yonsei co-op where you can buy these hats, you know?','source_text'=>'Ada kedai koperasi Yonsei tempat korang boleh beli topi-topi ni, tahu tak?','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>257,'end_time'=>259.06,'target_text'=>'And buy like the Yonsei jerseys.','source_text'=>'Dan beli jersi rasmi Yonsei.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>259.16,'end_time'=>265.7,'target_text'=>'I know in like North America, like Canada and United States, like no one wears those varsity jackets, like literally no one.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu kat Amerika Utara, macam di Kanada dan Amerika Syarikat, tak ada siapa pakai jaket kolej varsity macam tu, serius tak ada.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>265.8,'end_time'=>266.16,'target_text'=>'No one.','source_text'=>'Langsung tak ada.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>266.16,'end_time'=>268.3,'target_text'=>'Only like football teams and football players.','source_text'=>'Cuma pasukan ragbi dan pemain sukan je yang pakai.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>268.4,'end_time'=>268.98,'target_text'=>'Here, dude.','source_text'=>'Tapi kat sini, kawan.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>269.08,'end_time'=>270.46,'target_text'=>'Everybody I don\'t really see anyone.','source_text'=>'Semua orang... hari ni tak nampak ramai sangat orang pakai.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>270.56,'end_time'=>271.42,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s too cold.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa sebab cuaca terlalu sejuk kot.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>271.52,'end_time'=>272.06,'target_text'=>'Oh yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh ya.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>272.16,'end_time'=>279.02,'target_text'=>'Everyone here has one and also wears it, especially during like Yonsei games or something or like the They have the pride,','source_text'=>'Hampir semua pelajar kat sini ada sehelai dan selalu pakai, lebih-lebih lagi masa perlawanan sukan antara universiti, dorang ada rasa bangga','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>279.12,'end_time'=>280.38,'target_text'=>'you know, they have the Yonsei pride.','source_text'=>'dorang ada rasa bangga sebagai warga Yonsei.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>280.48,'end_time'=>281.5,'target_text'=>'That\'s one thing.','source_text'=>'Itu satu perbezaan ketara.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>281.6,'end_time'=>286.22,'target_text'=>'In Korea, they have university pride, like super strong pride.','source_text'=>'Di Korea, dorang ada semangat patriotik kebanggaan universiti yang teramat menebal.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>286.32,'end_time'=>288.54,'target_text'=>'Like how prestigious is Yonsei University?','source_text'=>'Sejauh mana hebatnya reputasi Universiti Yonsei ni?','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>288.64,'end_time'=>293.26,'target_text'=>'Oh, so basically like Yonsei is um there is SKY universities.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya Yonsei ni tergolong dalam universiti SKY.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>293.36,'end_time'=>297.98,'target_text'=>'They they call it SKY, which is Seoul, Korea, and Yonsei University.','source_text'=>'Dorang panggil singkatan SKY, iaitu Universiti Kebangsaan Seoul (SNU), Universiti Korea (KU), dan Universiti Yonsei (YU).','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>298.08,'end_time'=>300.42,'target_text'=>'And those three are the top three universities in Korea.','source_text'=>'Dan ketiga-tiga institusi ni adalah tiga universiti terbaik dan paling berprestij di Korea.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>300.52,'end_time'=>302.26,'target_text'=>'Oh yeah, so this is the eagle statue.','source_text'=>'Haa ya, jadi inilah dia tugu burung helang tu.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>302.36,'end_time'=>305.78,'target_text'=>'>> Is this like the mascot of uh That\'s yeah, that\'s the mascot of Yonsei.','source_text'=>'>> Ini maskot rasmi... ya betul, helang adalah maskot Universiti Yonsei.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>305.88,'end_time'=>309.06,'target_text'=>'This was the first place I met Johnny now that now that I\'m thinking of it.','source_text'=>'Bila saya teringat balik, kat tugu nilah tempat pertama saya mula-mula kenal Johnny dulu.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>309.16,'end_time'=>311.38,'target_text'=>'Cuz I remember we had like the orientation.','source_text'=>'Sebab saya ingat masa tu kita ada sesi orientasi pelajar baharu.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>311.48,'end_time'=>312.62,'target_text'=>'Orientation, yeah.','source_text'=>'Sesi orientasi, betul.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>312.72,'end_time'=>313.12,'target_text'=>'Yeah, dude.','source_text'=>'Ya, kawan.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>313.12,'end_time'=>313.66,'target_text'=>'That was crazy.','source_text'=>'Memang kenangan menggamit memori.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>313.76,'end_time'=>315.22,'target_text'=>'And I remember I was with Bartek.','source_text'=>'Dan saya ingat masa tu saya bersama Bartek.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>315.32,'end_time'=>315.72,'target_text'=>'Bartek.','source_text'=>'Bartek.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>315.76,'end_time'=>316.04,'target_text'=>'>> Bartek.','source_text'=>'>> Bartek.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>316.04,'end_time'=>316.54,'target_text'=>'Bartek.','source_text'=>'Bartek.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>316.64,'end_time'=>317.46,'target_text'=>'He\'s from Poland, right?','source_text'=>'Dia dari Poland kan?','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>317.56,'end_time'=>319.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, this Polish Polish American guy.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kawan berdarah kacukan Poland-Amerika tu.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>319.84,'end_time'=>321.78,'target_text'=>'And then then we met Johnny there.','source_text'=>'Dan lepas tu kami berkenalan dengan Johnny kat situ.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>321.88,'end_time'=>322.28,'target_text'=>'Oh yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh ya.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>322.32,'end_time'=>325.18,'target_text'=>'And then Johnny was like 19.','source_text'=>'Dan masa tu Johnny baru umur 19 tahun.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>325.28,'end_time'=>325.86,'target_text'=>'Crazy, dude.','source_text'=>'Hebat betul, kawan.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>325.96,'end_time'=>328.54,'target_text'=>'Behind this statue is our central library.','source_text'=>'Di belakang tugu helang ni adalah perpustakaan utama kami.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>328.64,'end_time'=>332.42,'target_text'=>'You know, students used to just like sleep on the sofas in there.','source_text'=>'Tahu tak, dulu pelajar-pelajar selamba je tidur atas sofa kat dalam tu.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>332.52,'end_time'=>333.34,'target_text'=>'Did you?','source_text'=>'Kau pun pernah buat ke?','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>333.44,'end_time'=>334.14,'target_text'=>'Yeah, yeah.','source_text'=>'Pernah, pernah.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>334.24,'end_time'=>335.38,'target_text'=>'I used to do that.','source_text'=>'Saya pun selalu tidur kat situ dulu.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>335.48,'end_time'=>337.46,'target_text'=>'Students, aka me.','source_text'=>'Pelajar lain tidur, termasuklah saya sendiri.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>337.56,'end_time'=>341.22,'target_text'=>'Oh, this is actually the the square where nothing really happens in the square.','source_text'=>'Tempat ni sebenarnya dataran lapang yang jarang ada apa-apa aktiviti berlaku.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>341.32,'end_time'=>344.66,'target_text'=>'People used to be able to use this these like quadrants, I guess.','source_text'=>'Dulu orang dibenarkan guna petak-petak rumput ni rasanya.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>344.76,'end_time'=>345.16,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>345.24,'end_time'=>351.86,'target_text'=>'For like, I don\'t know, picnics and stuff, but I heard from one of our like school administrators that people started drinking','source_text'=>'Untuk berkelah ke apa, tapi saya dengar dari salah seorang pentadbir universiti yang ada orang mula minum arak','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>351.96,'end_time'=>356.5,'target_text'=>'and vomiting, so they prohibited people from like, you know >> Oh yeah, cuz I What does that sign say?','source_text'=>'dan muntah merata-rata, jadi pihak pentadbiran larang orang duduk kat situ >> Papan tanda tu tulis apa?','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>356.6,'end_time'=>359.62,'target_text'=>'It says, \"Don\'t step on it.\" Yeah.','source_text'=>'Papan tanda tu tulis, \"Dilarang memijak rumput.\" Ya.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>359.72,'end_time'=>363.5,'target_text'=>'Oh, and there\'s like a bulletin board with like What What activities are happening?','source_text'=>'Oh, dan ada papan kenyataan tunjuk aktiviti apa yang sedang berlangsung kat kampus?','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>363.6,'end_time'=>366.42,'target_text'=>'Is it They do post a lot of, you know, posters in here.','source_text'=>'Dorang memang banyak tampal poster hebahan kat sini.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>366.52,'end_time'=>370.1,'target_text'=>'There\'s a lot of bulletin boards like across campus.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak papan kenyataan di merata tempat dalam kampus.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>370.2,'end_time'=>370.98,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>371.08,'end_time'=>372.86,'target_text'=>'They promote a lot of things.','source_text'=>'Dorang promosikan pelbagai aktiviti.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>372.96,'end_time'=>375.48,'target_text'=>'This one looks like video game.','source_text'=>'Yang satu ni nampak macam poster pertandingan permainan video.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>376.16,'end_time'=>379.46,'target_text'=>'Oh, this is the 24-hour lounge where all the students study.','source_text'=>'Oh, ini ruang santai belajar 24 jam tempat semua pelajar mengulang kaji pelajaran.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>379.56,'end_time'=>380.1,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>380.2,'end_time'=>383.02,'target_text'=>'And right now it\'s exam period, so there\'s a bunch of these kids.','source_text'=>'Sekarang musim peperiksaan, jadi ramai pelajar berkumpul kat dalam tu.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>383.12,'end_time'=>384.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s really hard to reserve a spot here.','source_text'=>'Susah sangat nak tempah tempat duduk kat sini waktu sekarang.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>384.92,'end_time'=>385.34,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>385.44,'end_time'=>385.94,'target_text'=>'Why?','source_text'=>'Kenapa?','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>386.04,'end_time'=>389.3,'target_text'=>'Cuz everybody\'s like, you know, they\'re very studious, so yeah.','source_text'=>'Sebab semua pelajar sangat rajin dan kuat belajar, jadi begitulah.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>389.4,'end_time'=>390.02,'target_text'=>'Everybody goes there.','source_text'=>'Semua orang serbu masuk ke situ.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>390.12,'end_time'=>396.46,'target_text'=>'But it\'s like it\'s like wouldn\'t an individual\'s study room be better than like a big open room with everyone?','source_text'=>'Tapi bukankah bilik belajar persendirian lebih elok berbanding bilik terbuka yang penuh dengan orang ramai?','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>396.56,'end_time'=>401.34,'target_text'=>'I can study by myself pretty good, but definitely if I\'m studying with people that are like super Yeah.','source_text'=>'Saya boleh belajar sendiri dengan baik, tapi kalau belajar dengan orang yang teramat tekun... ya.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>401.44,'end_time'=>403.9,'target_text'=>'>> dedicated like I don\'t even want to look at my phone.','source_text'=>'>> terlalu fokus sampai saya sendiri rasa segan nak tengok telefon.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>404,'end_time'=>404.42,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>404.52,'end_time'=>404.92,'target_text'=>'>> bad about myself.','source_text'=>'>> rasa bersalah pada diri sendiri kalau leka.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>404.96,'end_time'=>405.42,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I know.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya faham sangat perasaan tu.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>405.52,'end_time'=>406.38,'target_text'=>'I have to say.','source_text'=>'Kena akui hal tu.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>406.48,'end_time'=>407.34,'target_text'=>'But this is the library.','source_text'=>'Tapi inilah bangunan perpustakaannya.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>407.44,'end_time'=>411.06,'target_text'=>'I\'ll insert pictures of the inside of the library just so you guys can see what it looks like.','source_text'=>'Saya akan selitkan gambar bahagian dalam perpustakaan supaya korang boleh tengok sendiri suasananya.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>411.16,'end_time'=>412.26,'target_text'=>'>> This one here.','source_text'=>'>> Yang bahagian sebelah sini.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>412.36,'end_time'=>419.14,'target_text'=>'There used to be like long couches and long sofas, but then like because people used to started like sleeping on them.','source_text'=>'Dulu ada deretan sofa panjang kat sini, tapi sebab ramai pelajar mula tidur atas sofa tu...','order'=>185],
