            ['start_time'=>420.92,'end_time'=>423.22,'target_text'=>'Yeah, but like it it looks more civilized, I think.','source_text'=>'Ya, tapi nampak lebih kemas dan sopan bila guna kerusi macam ni.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>423.32,'end_time'=>426.74,'target_text'=>'And when you go inside, there\'s like this little Y lounge or something.','source_text'=>'Dan bila masuk ke dalam, ada ruang rehat Y Lounge.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>426.84,'end_time'=>429.54,'target_text'=>'It\'s like this big open space where you can just study.','source_text'=>'Ruang terbuka yang luas untuk pelajar mengulang kaji pelajaran.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>429.64,'end_time'=>436.34,'target_text'=>'And If you\'re learning English and you want to kick back and relax, watching native English TV shows is one of the best ways','source_text'=>'Dan kalau korang sedang belajar bahasa Inggeris dan nak santai-santai, menonton rancangan TV bahasa Inggeris penutur jati adalah cara terbaik','order'=>190],
