            ['start_time'=>437.32,'end_time'=>443.06,'target_text'=>'The only problem is your streaming library can look completely different depending on what country you\'re in.','source_text'=>'Cuma masalahnya senarai rancangan penstriman korang berbeza-beza mengikut negara tempat korang berada.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>443.16,'end_time'=>445.22,'target_text'=>'That is where NordVPN comes in.','source_text'=>'Di situlah fungsi NordVPN membantu.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>445.32,'end_time'=>450.3,'target_text'=>'It helps me stay secure on travel Wi-Fi and keep using the services I already pay for.','source_text'=>'Ia lindungi keselamatan saya semasa guna Wi-Fi awam dan membolehkan saya akses langganan yang saya bayar.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>450.4,'end_time'=>457.06,'target_text'=>'I\'m learning Spanish right now and I use NordVPN to keep my Spanish listening habit consistent while I travel.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya sedang belajar bahasa Sepanyol dan saya guna NordVPN untuk teruskan tabiat mendengar perbualan bahasa Sepanyol semasa melancong.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>457.16,'end_time'=>465.34,'target_text'=>'So I keep getting real native Spanish in my free every On top of that, NordVPN includes threat protection pro, which helps','source_text'=>'Jadi saya dapat dengar pertuturan asli Sepanyol setiap masa. Selain itu, NordVPN ada perlindungan ancaman Pro yang membantu','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>465.44,'end_time'=>470.74,'target_text'=>'block malicious websites and reduces the risk of clicking sketchy links while you\'re online.','source_text'=>'sekat laman web berniat jahat dan kurangkan risiko tertekan pautan mencurigakan semasa melayari internet.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>470.84,'end_time'=>473.84,'target_text'=>'If you want to try it, go to nordvpn.com/volkaenglish','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak cuba, layari nordvpn.com/volkaenglish','order'=>198],
