            ['start_time'=>528.72,'end_time'=>532.22,'target_text'=>'I mean, compared to foreign standards, I think I don\'t think it\'s that expensive.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya kalau banding piawaian luar negara, saya rasa taklah terlalu mahal sangat.','order'=>218],
