            ['start_time'=>999.6,'end_time'=>1000.06,'target_text'=>'I was wrong.','source_text'=>'Saya salah tadi.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1000.16,'end_time'=>1003.02,'target_text'=>'Now it says over 360,000 students.','source_text'=>'Sekarang tertulis lebih 360,000 pelajar.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1003.12,'end_time'=>1006.42,'target_text'=>'So this is insane because when you look on the map it\'s like it is a city.','source_text'=>'Memang tak masuk akal sebab bila tengok atas peta ia macam sebuah bandar.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1006.52,'end_time'=>1008.42,'target_text'=>'First of all, Mexico City is huge.','source_text'=>'Pertama sekali, Mexico City memang dah cukup besar.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1008.52,'end_time'=>1008.92,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1008.92,'end_time'=>1012.02,'target_text'=>'But when you look at the map on this thing it\'s like a city inside the city.','source_text'=>'Tapi bila tengok peta tempat ni, ia macam bandar di dalam bandar.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1012.12,'end_time'=>1013.66,'target_text'=>'Should we get uh something to eat?','source_text'=>'Patut ke kita cari sesuatu untuk makan?','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1013.76,'end_time'=>1014.22,'target_text'=>'Sure, man.','source_text'=>'Boleh juga, kawan.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1014.32,'end_time'=>1014.94,'target_text'=>'You hungry?','source_text'=>'Awak lapar ke?','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1015.04,'end_time'=>1015.98,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1016.08,'end_time'=>1017.62,'target_text'=>'You still eat like eight times a day?','source_text'=>'Awak masih makan lapan kali sehari ke?','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1017.72,'end_time'=>1018.46,'target_text'=>'I\'m I\'m trying to cut.','source_text'=>'Saya tengah cuba kurangkan makan (cut).','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>1018.56,'end_time'=>1019.38,'target_text'=>'I\'m trying to cut.','source_text'=>'Saya tengah cuba kurangkan pengambilan kalori.','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>1019.48,'end_time'=>1021.62,'target_text'=>'Trying to cut for the army, you know?','source_text'=>'Cuba \'cut\' badan untuk masuk tentera, faham-fahamlah kan?','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>1021.72,'end_time'=>1023.58,'target_text'=>'So we\'re in the cafeteria right now.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang kita ada dalam kafeteria.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>1023.68,'end_time'=>1026.14,'target_text'=>'This is like the main uh cafeteria, right?','source_text'=>'Ini kafeteria utama, kan?','order'=>460],
            ['start_time'=>1026.24,'end_time'=>1026.94,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>461],
            ['start_time'=>1027.04,'end_time'=>1029.46,'target_text'=>'Uh there\'s no Actually these are all the options?','source_text'=>'Tak ada— Sebenarnya ini je ke semua pilihan yang ada?','order'=>462],
            ['start_time'=>1029.56,'end_time'=>1030.34,'target_text'=>'Yeah, they\'re all options.','source_text'=>'Ya, ini semua pilihannya.','order'=>463],
            ['start_time'=>1030.44,'end_time'=>1032.46,'target_text'=>'They don\'t really have Oh, there it is.','source_text'=>'Mereka tak berapa ada Oh, tu dia.','order'=>464],
            ['start_time'=>1032.56,'end_time'=>1033.26,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh, ya.','order'=>465],
            ['start_time'=>1033.36,'end_time'=>1034.38,'target_text'=>'There\'s one like right there, right?','source_text'=>'Ada satu kat sebelah sana tu, kan?','order'=>466],
            ['start_time'=>1034.48,'end_time'=>1034.88,'target_text'=>'Yeah, yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul.','order'=>467],
            ['start_time'=>1034.96,'end_time'=>1036.18,'target_text'=>'You know Jimmy, what\'s his name?','source_text'=>'Awak kenal Jimmy, apa nama penuh dia tu?','order'=>468],
            ['start_time'=>1036.28,'end_time'=>1040.42,'target_text'=>'He\'s like this Korean YouTuber that like he speaks English in his videos, but he did a video here.','source_text'=>'Dia YouTuber Korea yang cakap Inggeris dalam video dia, tapi dia pernah buat video kat sini.','order'=>469],
            ['start_time'=>1040.52,'end_time'=>1040.84,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>470],
            ['start_time'=>1040.84,'end_time'=>1042.3,'target_text'=>'>> He\'s pretty well He\'s like a chef?','source_text'=>'>> Dia agak ter— Dia macam tukang masak ke?','order'=>471],
            ['start_time'=>1042.4,'end_time'=>1044.02,'target_text'=>'No, that\'s Uncle Roger.','source_text'=>'Bukan, yang tu Uncle Roger.','order'=>472],
            ['start_time'=>1044.12,'end_time'=>1044.4,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh, ya.','order'=>473],
            ['start_time'=>1044.4,'end_time'=>1046.34,'target_text'=>'So, this is like more Western oriented.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini lebih kepada hidangan gaya Barat.','order'=>474],
            ['start_time'=>1046.44,'end_time'=>1047.18,'target_text'=>'>> Spaghetti, I see.','source_text'=>'>> Spageti, saya nampak.','order'=>475],
            ['start_time'=>1047.28,'end_time'=>1049.62,'target_text'=>'Oh, but they have a spicy pork rice bowl.','source_text'=>'Oh, tapi mereka ada semangkuk nasi daging babi pedas.','order'=>476],
            ['start_time'=>1049.72,'end_time'=>1050.98,'target_text'=>'Yeah, they do.','source_text'=>'Ya, memang ada.','order'=>477],
            ['start_time'=>1051.08,'end_time'=>1052.54,'target_text'=>'So, now we\'re just waiting for our food.','source_text'=>'Jadi, sekarang kita tengah tunggu makanan kita.','order'=>478],
            ['start_time'=>1052.64,'end_time'=>1053.62,'target_text'=>'It probably shouldn\'t take long.','source_text'=>'Mestinya tak ambil masa lama.','order'=>479],
            ['start_time'=>1053.72,'end_time'=>1054.62,'target_text'=>'I assume it\'s quick.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa cepat je.','order'=>480],
            ['start_time'=>1054.72,'end_time'=>1056.22,'target_text'=>'Sometimes it takes a long time.','source_text'=>'Kadang-kadang lama juga.','order'=>481],
            ['start_time'=>1056.32,'end_time'=>1059.05,'target_text'=>'>> guess maybe during lunch time, and it is.','source_text'=>'>> Rasa-rasanya waktu makan tengah hari memang lama, dan sekarang memang waktu makan.','order'=>482],
            ['start_time'=>1059.15,'end_time'=>1060.95,'target_text'=>'>> [music]','source_text'=>'>> [muzik]','order'=>483],
            ['start_time'=>1065.08,'end_time'=>1067.42,'target_text'=>'>> They they serve Yeah, we got our food, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Mereka hidang— Ya, makanan kita dah sampai, bro.','order'=>484],
            ['start_time'=>1067.52,'end_time'=>1067.92,'target_text'=>'Look at that.','source_text'=>'Tengok tu.','order'=>485],
            ['start_time'=>1067.96,'end_time'=>1069.78,'target_text'=>'>> Look at this insane amount.','source_text'=>'>> Tengoklah porsi dia punya la banyak.','order'=>486],
            ['start_time'=>1069.88,'end_time'=>1073.18,'target_text'=>'Like It\'s like compared to our face, dude.','source_text'=>'Bila banding dengan muka kita, besar betul bro.','order'=>487],
            ['start_time'=>1073.28,'end_time'=>1074.74,'target_text'=>'>> have a big face, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> muka awak memang besar, ya.','order'=>488],
            ['start_time'=>1074.84,'end_time'=>1077.54,'target_text'=>'Have you been to like the that really cheap tonkatsu place?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah pergi tempat tonkatsu yang sangat murah tu tak?','order'=>489],
            ['start_time'=>1077.64,'end_time'=>1079.1,'target_text'=>'Yeah, yeah, yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, pernah, pernah.','order'=>490],
            ['start_time'=>1079.2,'end_time'=>1080.38,'target_text'=>'That place, too.','source_text'=>'Tempat tu pun sama.','order'=>491],
            ['start_time'=>1080.48,'end_time'=>1081.66,'target_text'=>'And that\'s like the only I\'m trying to cut.','source_text'=>'Dan itu saja— Saya tengah cuba cut berat badan ni.','order'=>492],
            ['start_time'=>1081.76,'end_time'=>1089.06,'target_text'=>'I\'m >> [laughter] >> This is the One thing Yonsei needs to fix are these cups, man.','source_text'=>'Saya— >> [ketawa] >> Satu benda yang Yonsei kena baiki ialah cawan ni, kawan.','order'=>493],
            ['start_time'=>1089.16,'end_time'=>1090.54,'target_text'=>'What?','source_text'=>'Kenapa?','order'=>494],
            ['start_time'=>1090.64,'end_time'=>1093.54,'target_text'=>'I\'ve used these cups before, but I guess you just got to drink it, dude.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah guna cawan ni sebelum ni, tapi rasanya awak kena minum laju-laju, bro.','order'=>495],
            ['start_time'=>1093.64,'end_time'=>1096.24,'target_text'=>'If you don\'t drink it, it\'s all just','source_text'=>'Kalau awak tak terus minum, semuanya akan','order'=>496],
            ['start_time'=>1097.4,'end_time'=>1098.66,'target_text'=>'This is like a game show cup.','source_text'=>'Ni macam cawan dalam rancangan sukaneka.','order'=>497],
            ['start_time'=>1098.76,'end_time'=>1102.5,'target_text'=>'Like, this is So, >> [snorts] >> like you could see they\'re just they\'re just leaking.','source_text'=>'Macam, ini— Jadi, >> [mendengus] >> macam awak boleh tengok cawan ni bocor je.','order'=>498],
            ['start_time'=>1102.6,'end_time'=>1103.1,'target_text'=>'>> Come on, man.','source_text'=>'>> Alahai, bro.','order'=>499],
            ['start_time'=>1103.2,'end_time'=>1104.26,'target_text'=>'Like, we want some water.','source_text'=>'Kita cuma nak minum air sikit.','order'=>500],
            ['start_time'=>1104.36,'end_time'=>1106.22,'target_text'=>'What is Who can drink from this?','source_text'=>'Apa benda ni? Siapa je boleh minum pakai cawan macam ni?','order'=>501],
            ['start_time'=>1106.32,'end_time'=>1109.18,'target_text'=>'>> Like, now there\'s water all over the table and all over the floor.','source_text'=>'>> Sekarang air dah tumpah atas meja dengan atas lantai.','order'=>502],
            ['start_time'=>1109.28,'end_time'=>1111.08,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>503],
            ['start_time'=>1112.4,'end_time'=>1113.62,'target_text'=>'Okay, we got the ice cream.','source_text'=>'Okey, kita dah dapat aiskrim.','order'=>504],
            ['start_time'=>1113.72,'end_time'=>1118.64,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go outside and Yonsei Yonsei Yonsei','source_text'=>'Jom keluar dan Yonsei Yonsei Yonsei','order'=>505],
            ['start_time'=>1119.08,'end_time'=>1120.7,'target_text'=>'So, Yonsei sundae.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini sundae Yonsei.','order'=>506],
            ['start_time'=>1120.8,'end_time'=>1123.78,'target_text'=>'The best thing to eat after some spicy food is Is a Yonsei, man.','source_text'=>'Benda paling best makan lepas makanan pedas ialah aiskrim Yonsei, kawan.','order'=>507],
            ['start_time'=>1123.88,'end_time'=>1127.18,'target_text'=>'Yonsei >> [laughter] >> Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'Yonsei >> [ketawa] >> Oh, wah.','order'=>508],
            ['start_time'=>1127.28,'end_time'=>1128.66,'target_text'=>'That actually tastes amazing.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya rasa dia memang sangat sedap.','order'=>509],
            ['start_time'=>1128.76,'end_time'=>1130.06,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it tastes pretty strong.','source_text'=>'Ya, rasa dia agak pekat.','order'=>510],
            ['start_time'=>1130.16,'end_time'=>1131.26,'target_text'=>'The the milk taste is really strong.','source_text'=>'Rasa susunya sangat pekat dan berkrim.','order'=>511],
            ['start_time'=>1131.36,'end_time'=>1133.46,'target_text'=>'I really like it.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka.','order'=>512],
            ['start_time'=>1133.56,'end_time'=>1134.3,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>513],
            ['start_time'=>1134.4,'end_time'=>1136.5,'target_text'=>'So, what what is this area called?','source_text'=>'Jadi, apa nama kawasan ni?','order'=>514],
            ['start_time'=>1136.6,'end_time'=>1138.62,'target_text'=>'Oh, it\'s Underwood Courtyard.','source_text'=>'Oh, ini Dataran Underwood (Underwood Courtyard).','order'=>515],
            ['start_time'=>1138.72,'end_time'=>1139.12,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>516],
            ['start_time'=>1139.16,'end_time'=>1146.1,'target_text'=>'Okay, so this is like if you ever see like people doing like vlogs of their student life in Korea or at Yonsei or like K-dramas','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi kalau korang pernah tengok vlog kehidupan pelajar kat Korea atau di Yonsei atau dalam K-drama','order'=>517],
            ['start_time'=>1146.2,'end_time'=>1148.38,'target_text'=>'like these K-dramas, this is where they are.','source_text'=>'macam K-drama tu, kat sinilah lokasinya.','order'=>518],
            ['start_time'=>1148.48,'end_time'=>1153.7,'target_text'=>'Unfortunately, it\'s not like super green and like luscious, but you kind of get the idea.','source_text'=>'Sayangnya sekarang taklah menghijau dan subur sangat, tapi korang boleh bayangkanlah.','order'=>519],
            ['start_time'=>1153.8,'end_time'=>1159.1,'target_text'=>'Uh during spring it was really green and all that, but Oh, they also trimmed these trees.','source_text'=>'Masa musim bunga dulu memang sangat hijau, tapi Oh, pokok-pokok ni dorang dah pangkas juga.','order'=>520],
            ['start_time'=>1159.2,'end_time'=>1160.54,'target_text'=>'>> They Yeah, they trimmed them all.','source_text'=>'>> Dorang— Ya, dorang dah pangkas semuanya.','order'=>521],
            ['start_time'=>1160.64,'end_time'=>1161.34,'target_text'=>'Oh, why?','source_text'=>'Oh, kenapa?','order'=>522],
            ['start_time'=>1161.44,'end_time'=>1162.14,'target_text'=>'Sad.','source_text'=>'Sedihnya.','order'=>523],
            ['start_time'=>1162.24,'end_time'=>1163.1,'target_text'=>'Yeah, they\'re beautiful.','source_text'=>'Ya, pokok-pokok tu cantik kot.','order'=>524],
            ['start_time'=>1163.2,'end_time'=>1163.9,'target_text'=>'>> wintertime.','source_text'=>'>> sebab musim sejuk.','order'=>525],
            ['start_time'=>1164,'end_time'=>1170.62,'target_text'=>'And like these three buildings have like vines all over them in the summer, but now there\'s You can see the kind of like the','source_text'=>'Dan tiga bangunan ni penuh pokok menjalar waktu musim panas, tapi sekarang Awak boleh nampak macam','order'=>526],
            ['start_time'=>1170.72,'end_time'=>1174.66,'target_text'=>'branches of the vines, yeah, but there are no leaves.','source_text'=>'ranting-ranting pokok menjalar tu, ya, tapi daun dah tak ada.','order'=>527],
            ['start_time'=>1174.76,'end_time'=>1177.82,'target_text'=>'This right here is Horace Underwood.','source_text'=>'Yang ini patung Horace Underwood.','order'=>528],
            ['start_time'=>1177.92,'end_time'=>1180.22,'target_text'=>'This is the person that founded the university.','source_text'=>'Inilah individu yang mengasaskan universiti ini.','order'=>529],
            ['start_time'=>1180.32,'end_time'=>1184.26,'target_text'=>'He was the president of the Chosun Christian College.','source_text'=>'Beliau merupakan presiden Maktab Kristian Chosun.','order'=>530],
            ['start_time'=>1184.36,'end_time'=>1187.66,'target_text'=>'In my opinion, this is the nicest spot on campus.','source_text'=>'Pada pendapat saya, ini tempat paling cantik dalam kampus.','order'=>531],
            ['start_time'=>1187.76,'end_time'=>1188.16,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>532],
            ['start_time'=>1188.16,'end_time'=>1189.54,'target_text'=>'Like it\'s just so nice.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat tenang dan cantik.','order'=>533],
            ['start_time'=>1189.64,'end_time'=>1191.5,'target_text'=>'You\'re not supposed to climb on top of the statue.','source_text'=>'Tak dibenarkan panjat ke atas patung tu.','order'=>534],
            ['start_time'=>1191.6,'end_time'=>1192.14,'target_text'=>'>> climb up.','source_text'=>'>> panjat naik.','order'=>535],
            ['start_time'=>1192.24,'end_time'=>1193.82,'target_text'=>'We never climbed up, but we never did.','source_text'=>'Kami tak pernah panjat, kami tak pernah buat pun.','order'=>536],
            ['start_time'=>1193.92,'end_time'=>1196.62,'target_text'=>'We climbed up to like right like right here maybe.','source_text'=>'Kami panjat setakat sampai kat sini je kot.','order'=>537],
            ['start_time'=>1196.72,'end_time'=>1197.66,'target_text'=>'Like this is the max.','source_text'=>'Setakat ni je paling maksimum.','order'=>538],
            ['start_time'=>1197.76,'end_time'=>1198.16,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>539],
            ['start_time'=>1198.24,'end_time'=>1198.52,'target_text'=>'What the hell?','source_text'=>'Biar betul?','order'=>540],
            ['start_time'=>1198.52,'end_time'=>1200.02,'target_text'=>'You can\'t put your arms around Mr.','source_text'=>'Awak tak boleh peluk bahu Encik','order'=>541],
            ['start_time'=>1200.12,'end_time'=>1201.02,'target_text'=>'Underwood, you know?','source_text'=>'Underwood macam tu, kan?','order'=>542],
            ['start_time'=>1201.12,'end_time'=>1201.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>543],
            ['start_time'=>1201.72,'end_time'=>1204.18,'target_text'=>'I\'m pretty sure you get in trouble and kicked out of school if you did.','source_text'=>'Saya pasti awak akan kena tindakan dan kena buang kolej kalau buat macam tu.','order'=>544],
            ['start_time'=>1204.28,'end_time'=>1204.74,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>545],
            ['start_time'=>1204.84,'end_time'=>1206.58,'target_text'=>'What is your favorite place on campus?','source_text'=>'Apa tempat kegemaran awak dalam kampus?','order'=>546],
            ['start_time'=>1206.68,'end_time'=>1212.14,'target_text'=>'I I\'d say I want to say my major building, but it\'s not as pretty as here.','source_text'=>'Saya nak kata bangunan fakulti jurusan saya, tapi tak secantik tempat ni.','order'=>547],
            ['start_time'=>1212.24,'end_time'=>1214.66,'target_text'=>'The first time I came here I was like, \"Oh my god, is this Hogwarts?','source_text'=>'Masa kali pertama saya datang sini, saya macam, \"Ya ampun, ini Hogwarts ke?','order'=>548],
            ['start_time'=>1214.76,'end_time'=>1219.42,'target_text'=>'Like this is This is not something from Korea.\" I\'d say that my favorite place is here.','source_text'=>'Macam ini— Ini langsung tak nampak macam kat Korea.\" Saya boleh kata tempat kegemaran saya kat sinilah.','order'=>549],
            ['start_time'=>1219.52,'end_time'=>1224.5,'target_text'=>'A lot of couples who like start dating, they come here at night.','source_text'=>'Banyak pasangan yang baru mula bercinta datang sini waktu malam.','order'=>550],
            ['start_time'=>1224.6,'end_time'=>1225.18,'target_text'=>'Oh, really?','source_text'=>'Oh, ya ke?','order'=>551],
            ['start_time'=>1225.28,'end_time'=>1226.07,'target_text'=>'Hell yeah.','source_text'=>'Mestilah.','order'=>552],
            ['start_time'=>1226.17,'end_time'=>1232.78,'target_text'=>'>> [laughter] >> But I remember when I was studying here, sometimes I met Johnny over there on those benches during classes','source_text'=>'>> [ketawa] >> Tapi saya ingat masa saya belajar sini dulu, kadang-kadang saya jumpa Johnny kat bangku sana tu waktu kelas','order'=>553],
            ['start_time'=>1232.88,'end_time'=>1234.18,'target_text'=>'and then we would just like sit there.','source_text'=>'dan lepas tu kami cuma lepak duduk kat situ.','order'=>554],
            ['start_time'=>1234.28,'end_time'=>1236.86,'target_text'=>'Cuz my I studied right there at the business school.','source_text'=>'Sebab saya— saya belajar betul-betul kat sekolah perniagaan tu.','order'=>555],
            ['start_time'=>1236.96,'end_time'=>1237.78,'target_text'=>'>> yeah.','source_text'=>'>> ya.','order'=>556],
            ['start_time'=>1237.88,'end_time'=>1240.18,'target_text'=>'Yeah, that that building is the business building.','source_text'=>'Ya, bangunan tu fakulti perniagaan.','order'=>557],
            ['start_time'=>1240.28,'end_time'=>1242.94,'target_text'=>'That\'s where I studied, so I would just come out here, sit here.','source_text'=>'Kat situlah tempat saya belajar, jadi saya selalu keluar lepak duduk sini.','order'=>558],
            ['start_time'=>1243.04,'end_time'=>1245.02,'target_text'=>'Korean summers are so nice.','source_text'=>'Musim panas kat Korea sangat best.','order'=>559],
            ['start_time'=>1245.12,'end_time'=>1248.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s like nice, warm, sunny, so I would just sit outside and enjoy the sun.','source_text'=>'Cuacanya nyaman, hangat, redup cerah, jadi saya duduk je kat luar nikmati cahaya matahari.','order'=>560],
            ['start_time'=>1248.84,'end_time'=>1250.3,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re going to go through the forest.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita akan lalu kawasan hutan ni.','order'=>561],
            ['start_time'=>1250.4,'end_time'=>1252.58,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to make our way to the forest.','source_text'=>'Kita akan berjalan menuju ke arah hutan.','order'=>562],
            ['start_time'=>1252.68,'end_time'=>1255.7,'target_text'=>'Does that forest have a name or I don\'t think so.','source_text'=>'Hutan tu ada nama ke atau Saya rasa tak ada.','order'=>563],
            ['start_time'=>1255.8,'end_time'=>1258.22,'target_text'=>'Yeah, we\'re just going to walk through the forest.','source_text'=>'Ya, kita cuma akan jalan meredah hutan ni.','order'=>564],
            ['start_time'=>1258.32,'end_time'=>1260.42,'target_text'=>'And that is the theater.','source_text'=>'Dan yang itu teater.','order'=>565],
            ['start_time'=>1260.52,'end_time'=>1261.3,'target_text'=>'Or the amphitheater.','source_text'=>'Atau amfiteater terbuka.','order'=>566],
            ['start_time'=>1261.4,'end_time'=>1261.94,'target_text'=>'>> Amphitheater.','source_text'=>'>> Amfiteater.','order'=>567],
            ['start_time'=>1262.04,'end_time'=>1262.82,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>568],
            ['start_time'=>1262.92,'end_time'=>1264.98,'target_text'=>'Well, we will go check that out, too, if it\'s open.','source_text'=>'Nanti kita pergi tengok juga kalau ia buka.','order'=>569],
            ['start_time'=>1265.08,'end_time'=>1265.78,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>570],
            ['start_time'=>1265.88,'end_time'=>1271.06,'target_text'=>'But I this is the walk I did every day from the business building up through the forest to the dorms.','source_text'=>'Tapi inilah laluan yang saya jalan kaki setiap hari dari bangunan perniagaan naik ikut hutan ke asrama.','order'=>571],
            ['start_time'=>1271.16,'end_time'=>1272.78,'target_text'=>'It was like a 15-minute walk, man.','source_text'=>'Lebih kurang 15 minit jalan kaki, kawan.','order'=>572],
            ['start_time'=>1272.88,'end_time'=>1273.74,'target_text'=>'It was kind of far.','source_text'=>'Agak jauh juga.','order'=>573],
