            ['start_time'=>1288.64,'end_time'=>1294.3,'target_text'=>'>> I mean, every year Yonsei has this representative uh festival called Akaraka.','source_text'=>'>> Maksud saya, setiap tahun Yonsei adakan festival mercu tanda yang dipanggil Akaraka.','order'=>585],
