            ['start_time'=>1316.88,'end_time'=>1323.22,'target_text'=>'And me and Valko used to be like I\'ll I\'ll definitely include videos, but imagine this whole area just filled with people','source_text'=>'Dan saya dengan Valko dulu selalu— nanti saya selitkan video, tapi bayangkan seluruh kawasan ni penuh dengan orang','order'=>595],
