            ['start_time'=>1327.64,'end_time'=>1333.98,'target_text'=>'This is my Like imagine an entire theater filled with students in red and blue.','source_text'=>'Bayangkan seluruh teater dipenuhi pelajar berbaju merah dan biru.','order'=>598],
            ['start_time'=>1334.08,'end_time'=>1340.3,'target_text'=>'Well, Akaraka is just blue but with the cheer event red and blue and everyone\'s just the vibes are immaculate.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya Akaraka cuma biru, tapi untuk acara sorakan ada merah dan biru dan suasananya memang luar biasa mantap.','order'=>599],
