            ['start_time'=>1363.44,'end_time'=>1365.38,'target_text'=>'>> This is where I studied Korean here.','source_text'=>'>> Kat sinilah tempat saya belajar bahasa Korea dulu.','order'=>610],
            ['start_time'=>1365.48,'end_time'=>1368.86,'target_text'=>'This is the KLI building and I studied here for well, one semester.','source_text'=>'Ini bangunan KLI dan saya belajar kat sini selama satu semester.','order'=>611],
            ['start_time'=>1368.96,'end_time'=>1370.1,'target_text'=>'>> I speak some Korean now.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tahu sikit-sikit cakap Korea sekarang.','order'=>612],
            ['start_time'=>1370.2,'end_time'=>1371.3,'target_text'=>'Go ahead, Valko.','source_text'=>'Cubalah cakap, Valko.','order'=>613],
            ['start_time'=>1371.4,'end_time'=>1372.02,'target_text'=>'Annyeonghaseyo.','source_text'=>'Annyeonghaseyo.','order'=>614],
            ['start_time'=>1372.12,'end_time'=>1372.8,'target_text'=>'>> Woah.','source_text'=>'>> Wah.','order'=>615],
            ['start_time'=>1372.9,'end_time'=>1374.18,'target_text'=>'[laughter] You know what that is?','source_text'=>'[ketawa] Awak tahu apa maksud tu?','order'=>616],
            ['start_time'=>1374.28,'end_time'=>1375.42,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh, ya.','order'=>617],
            ['start_time'=>1375.52,'end_time'=>1376.78,'target_text'=>'You say I love you.','source_text'=>'Awak cakap saya cintakan awak.','order'=>618],
            ['start_time'=>1376.88,'end_time'=>1378.22,'target_text'=>'Saranghae.','source_text'=>'Saranghae.','order'=>619],
            ['start_time'=>1378.32,'end_time'=>1382.74,'target_text'=>'Okay, so this is SK Global, which is the student dorm I stayed at.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi ini SK Global, asrama pelajar tempat saya menginap dulu.','order'=>620],
            ['start_time'=>1382.84,'end_time'=>1386.3,'target_text'=>'There are like two main student dorms, International House and SK Global.','source_text'=>'Ada dua asrama utama pelajar, International House dan SK Global.','order'=>621],
            ['start_time'=>1386.4,'end_time'=>1388.98,'target_text'=>'90% of the people that come on exchange are women.','source_text'=>'90% orang yang datang untuk program pertukaran pelajar ialah wanita.','order'=>622],
            ['start_time'=>1389.08,'end_time'=>1390.34,'target_text'=>'Oh, I didn\'t know that.','source_text'=>'Oh, saya tak tahu pula.','order'=>623],
            ['start_time'=>1390.44,'end_time'=>1391.42,'target_text'=>'K-pop, K-dramas.','source_text'=>'Sebab K-pop dan drama Korea.','order'=>624],
            ['start_time'=>1391.52,'end_time'=>1392.3,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>625],
            ['start_time'=>1392.4,'end_time'=>1394.58,'target_text'=>'>> And then 10% is like men and like me.','source_text'=>'>> Dan 10% lagi lelaki macam saya.','order'=>626],
            ['start_time'=>1394.68,'end_time'=>1398.9,'target_text'=>'And then of those 10% probably like 90% of them are into K-pop, K-drama.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu daripada 10% tu, mungkin 90% daripadanya minat K-pop dengan drama Korea.','order'=>627],
            ['start_time'=>1399,'end_time'=>1402.18,'target_text'=>'And then there\'s me that just came to Korea.','source_text'=>'Dan lepas tu ada saya yang cuma datang ke Korea.','order'=>628],
            ['start_time'=>1402.28,'end_time'=>1404.1,'target_text'=>'To learn the actual culture.','source_text'=>'Untuk belajar budaya sebenar.','order'=>629],
            ['start_time'=>1404.2,'end_time'=>1404.52,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>630],
            ['start_time'=>1404.52,'end_time'=>1405.42,'target_text'=>'It was It was a good dorm.','source_text'=>'Asrama tu memang best.','order'=>631],
            ['start_time'=>1405.52,'end_time'=>1408.62,'target_text'=>'I had a roommate here, this Swedish guy.','source_text'=>'Saya ada teman sebilik kat sini, seorang lelaki warga Sweden.','order'=>632],
            ['start_time'=>1408.72,'end_time'=>1409.42,'target_text'=>'Vegan.','source_text'=>'Dia seorang vegan.','order'=>633],
            ['start_time'=>1409.52,'end_time'=>1411.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s really hard to find vegan and vegetarian restaurants.','source_text'=>'Sangat susah nak cari restoran vegan dan vegetarian.','order'=>634],
            ['start_time'=>1412,'end_time'=>1412.4,'target_text'=>'It is.','source_text'=>'Memang betul.','order'=>635],
            ['start_time'=>1412.4,'end_time'=>1412.76,'target_text'=>'It is.','source_text'=>'Memang susah.','order'=>636],
            ['start_time'=>1412.76,'end_time'=>1414.38,'target_text'=>'Cuz everything contains some sort of meat product.','source_text'=>'Sebab hampir semua makanan ada ramuan daging.','order'=>637],
            ['start_time'=>1414.48,'end_time'=>1419.94,'target_text'=>'So, all he ate was like rice and like some oats and grains every night in a bowl.','source_text'=>'Jadi dia cuma makan nasi dan bijirin oat setiap malam dalam mangkuk.','order'=>638],
            ['start_time'=>1420.04,'end_time'=>1427.1,'target_text'=>'But like most of the vegan or vegetarian places, they\'re pretty expensive, you know, compared to, you know, non-vegan or or','source_text'=>'Tapi kebanyakan tempat vegan atau vegetarian agak mahal kalau banding dengan makanan biasa atau','order'=>639],
            ['start_time'=>1427.2,'end_time'=>1427.98,'target_text'=>'just normal, yeah.','source_text'=>'makanan biasa, ya.','order'=>640],
            ['start_time'=>1428.08,'end_time'=>1435.86,'target_text'=>'The most important part of learning a language and the reason why everyone learns a language is to be able to speak the language.','source_text'=>'Bahagian paling penting dalam belajar bahasa dan sebab semua orang belajar bahasa adalah untuk boleh bercakap bahasa tersebut.','order'=>641],
            ['start_time'=>1435.96,'end_time'=>1440.86,'target_text'=>'These videos help you with your listening, but how can you practice your speaking even more?','source_text'=>'Video-video ini bantu pendengaran anda, tapi macam mana nak latih pertuturan dengan lebih mantap?','order'=>642],
            ['start_time'=>1440.96,'end_time'=>1443.22,'target_text'=>'You need to practice by shadowing.','source_text'=>'Anda perlu berlatih melalui kaedah shadowing (meniru sebutan).','order'=>643],
            ['start_time'=>1443.32,'end_time'=>1450.54,'target_text'=>'Shadowing is just repeating after a native English speaker to practice your pronunciation, your accent, and your confidence.','source_text'=>'Shadowing adalah mengulang sebutan mengikut penutur jati bahasa Inggeris untuk melatih sebutan, slanga, dan keyakinan anda.','order'=>644],
            ['start_time'=>1450.64,'end_time'=>1455.94,'target_text'=>'And I\'ve started making videos specifically just to practice those three things.','source_text'=>'Dan saya dah mula buat video khas semata-mata untuk melatih tiga perkara tersebut.','order'=>645],
            ['start_time'=>1456.04,'end_time'=>1462.02,'target_text'=>'So, if you guys want to become more confident in English and become truly fluent, check out my Patreon in the description','source_text'=>'Jadi, kalau korang nak lebih yakin berbahasa Inggeris dan benar-benar fasih, lihat Patreon saya di ruangan deskripsi','order'=>646],
            ['start_time'=>1462.12,'end_time'=>1467.34,'target_text'=>'where I give you guys three new videos every week to practice your pronunciation,','source_text'=>'di mana saya sediakan tiga video baharu setiap minggu untuk melatih sebutan anda,','order'=>647],
            ['start_time'=>1467.44,'end_time'=>1471.22,'target_text'=>'your accent, and most importantly, your confidence.','source_text'=>'slanga anda, dan paling penting sekali, keyakinan diri anda.','order'=>648],
            ['start_time'=>1471.32,'end_time'=>1472.42,'target_text'=>'I\'ll see you guys there.','source_text'=>'Kita jumpa kat sana.','order'=>649],
            ['start_time'=>1472.52,'end_time'=>1480.1,'target_text'=>'We are going to be learning [music] English as I clean up my pronunciation, your accent, [music] your rhythm, and your confidence.','source_text'=>'Kita akan belajar [muzik] bahasa Inggeris sambil memantapkan sebutan, slanga, [muzik] rentak percakapan, dan keyakinan anda.','order'=>650],
            ['start_time'=>1480.2,'end_time'=>1484.9,'target_text'=>'Or it was just a roundabout way of her politely trying to spare my feelings.','source_text'=>'Atau itu sekadar cara berlapik dia nak jaga perasaan saya dengan sopan.','order'=>651],
            ['start_time'=>1485,'end_time'=>1491.54,'target_text'=>'The a-hole for giving [music] all of my coworkers a different reason for why I have missing fingers so I wouldn\'t [music]','source_text'=>'Si celaka tu sebab beritahu [muzik] rakan sekerja saya pelbagai alasan berbeza pasal jari saya yang hilang supaya saya tak [muzik]','order'=>652],
            ['start_time'=>1491.64,'end_time'=>1492.46,'target_text'=>'take legal action.','source_text'=>'ambil tindakan undang-undang.','order'=>653],
            ['start_time'=>1492.56,'end_time'=>1495.94,'target_text'=>'I\'m down to hear company-wide training on all of his behavior.','source_text'=>'Saya sedia dengar latihan peringkat syarikat mengenai segala kelakuannya.','order'=>654],
            ['start_time'=>1496.04,'end_time'=>1500.04,'target_text'=>'>> [music] >> He chooses not to, but I was already so cranky.','source_text'=>'>> [muzik] >> Dia pilih untuk tak buat, tapi saya masa tu dah cukup meragam.','order'=>655],
            ['start_time'=>1500.44,'end_time'=>1504.26,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we\'re in I did so much shopping in Muju Shima.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi kita kat— Saya berbelanja sakan kat Muju Shima.','order'=>656],
            ['start_time'=>1504.36,'end_time'=>1511.26,'target_text'=>'The jeans and one hoodie which Yeah, this is kind of like the food court area for students cuz around here there are a few','source_text'=>'Seluar jean dan sehelai hoodie yang— Ya, ini macam medan selera untuk pelajar sebab kawasan sekitar ni ada beberapa','order'=>657],
            ['start_time'=>1511.36,'end_time'=>1515.26,'target_text'=>'dormitories like the one I went to and then another one over there and a couple more.','source_text'=>'asrama macam yang saya tinggal dulu lepas tu ada satu lagi kat sebelah sana dan beberapa lagi.','order'=>658],
            ['start_time'=>1515.36,'end_time'=>1519.1,'target_text'=>'This is where I used to study like this is my the building that I studied in.','source_text'=>'Kat sinilah tempat saya belajar dulu, inilah bangunan fakulti tempat saya belajar.','order'=>659],
            ['start_time'=>1519.2,'end_time'=>1520.1,'target_text'=>'This is your building, eh?','source_text'=>'Ini bangunan fakulti awak ya?','order'=>660],
            ['start_time'=>1520.2,'end_time'=>1521.94,'target_text'=>'Yeah, this is where I used to study.','source_text'=>'Ya, kat sinilah saya belajar dulu.','order'=>661],
            ['start_time'=>1522.04,'end_time'=>1524.74,'target_text'=>'The first floor is really nice cuz they renovated only the first floor.','source_text'=>'Tingkat satu memang sangat cantik sebab mereka ubah suai tingkat satu saja.','order'=>662],
            ['start_time'=>1524.84,'end_time'=>1530.46,'target_text'=>'Not going to lie, this is kind of gloomy but these are the classrooms but It\'s empty and it smells like paint.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, suasana kat sini agak suram tapi ini bilik-bilik kelas, sekarang kosong dan bau cat.','order'=>663],
            ['start_time'=>1530.56,'end_time'=>1531.82,'target_text'=>'I think they did like a paint job.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa mereka baru lepas mengecat.','order'=>664],
            ['start_time'=>1531.92,'end_time'=>1533.38,'target_text'=>'>> painted this recently, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> baru je cat tempat ni, ya.','order'=>665],
            ['start_time'=>1533.48,'end_time'=>1535.62,'target_text'=>'Oh yeah, so they renovated this whole place.','source_text'=>'Oh ya, jadi mereka ubah suai seluruh tempat ni.','order'=>666],
            ['start_time'=>1535.72,'end_time'=>1536.9,'target_text'=>'It looks much better, right?','source_text'=>'Nampak jauh lebih elok, kan?','order'=>667],
            ['start_time'=>1537,'end_time'=>1542.64,'target_text'=>'Is he a native English speaker or did he learn English and his accent?','source_text'=>'Adakah dia penutur jati bahasa Inggeris atau dia belajar bahasa Inggeris dan slanganya?','order'=>668],
            ['start_time'=>1544.48,'end_time'=>1545.02,'target_text'=>'What are you, Johnny?','source_text'=>'Awak yang mana satu, Johnny?','order'=>669],
            ['start_time'=>1545.12,'end_time'=>1547.38,'target_text'=>'Are you a native English speaker or did you learn English?','source_text'=>'Awak penutur jati bahasa Inggeris atau awak belajar bahasa Inggeris?','order'=>670],
            ['start_time'=>1547.48,'end_time'=>1548.38,'target_text'=>'I learned English.','source_text'=>'Saya belajar bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>671],
            ['start_time'=>1548.48,'end_time'=>1548.98,'target_text'=>'You learned English.','source_text'=>'Awak belajar bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>672],
            ['start_time'=>1549.08,'end_time'=>1550.14,'target_text'=>'What\'s your first language?','source_text'=>'Apa bahasa ibunda awak?','order'=>673],
            ['start_time'=>1550.24,'end_time'=>1551.46,'target_text'=>'My first language is Korean.','source_text'=>'Bahasa ibunda saya ialah bahasa Korea.','order'=>674],
            ['start_time'=>1551.56,'end_time'=>1551.96,'target_text'=>'Korean.','source_text'=>'Bahasa Korea.','order'=>675],
            ['start_time'=>1551.96,'end_time'=>1552.04,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>676],
            ['start_time'=>1552.04,'end_time'=>1552.78,'target_text'=>'Where were you born?','source_text'=>'Awak lahir di mana?','order'=>677],
            ['start_time'=>1552.88,'end_time'=>1557.34,'target_text'=>'I was born in Korea and uh I did have some experience abroad.','source_text'=>'Saya lahir di Korea dan saya ada pengalaman duduk luar negara.','order'=>678],
            ['start_time'=>1557.44,'end_time'=>1562.26,'target_text'=>'I was in Singapore during my high school years but I did mostly learn English beforehand.','source_text'=>'Saya tinggal di Singapura masa sekolah menengah, tapi kebanyakan bahasa Inggeris saya dah pelajari sebelum tu lagi.','order'=>679],
            ['start_time'=>1562.36,'end_time'=>1563.22,'target_text'=>'Yeah, like how?','source_text'=>'Ya, macam mana tu?','order'=>680],
            ['start_time'=>1563.32,'end_time'=>1563.78,'target_text'=>'How did you learn it?','source_text'=>'Macam mana awak belajar?','order'=>681],
            ['start_time'=>1563.88,'end_time'=>1566.06,'target_text'=>'>> like you, man, like YouTubers, you know?','source_text'=>'>> macam video awak kawan, melalui YouTuber, tahu tak?','order'=>682],
            ['start_time'=>1566.16,'end_time'=>1566.56,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>683],
            ['start_time'=>1566.56,'end_time'=>1569.38,'target_text'=>'I watched a lot of Ryan Higa, Smosh, Oh yeah, yeah.','source_text'=>'Saya banyak tengok Ryan Higa, Smosh, Oh ya, ya.','order'=>684],
            ['start_time'=>1569.48,'end_time'=>1570.61,'target_text'=>'PewDiePie, Oh yeah.','source_text'=>'PewDiePie, Oh ya.','order'=>685],
            ['start_time'=>1570.71,'end_time'=>1572.9,'target_text'=>'[laughter] I listened to a lot of, you know, songs.','source_text'=>'[ketawa] Saya banyak dengar lagu-lagu Inggeris.','order'=>686],
            ['start_time'=>1573,'end_time'=>1573.94,'target_text'=>'I used to love Eminem.','source_text'=>'Dulu saya sangat minat Eminem.','order'=>687],
            ['start_time'=>1574.04,'end_time'=>1578.34,'target_text'=>'I I was in elementary school, I used to try to memorize Eminem lyrics.','source_text'=>'Masa saya sekolah rendah, saya cuba hafal lirik-lirik lagu Eminem.','order'=>688],
            ['start_time'=>1578.44,'end_time'=>1579.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s pretty [laughter] Yeah.','source_text'=>'Memang kelakar [ketawa] Ya.','order'=>689],
            ['start_time'=>1579.96,'end_time'=>1585.66,'target_text'=>'You\'re pretty much everyone\'s goal when learning a language like where you are like you sound like a native like when I heard','source_text'=>'Tahap awak ni matlamat semua orang bila belajar bahasa, awak bercakap saling tak tumpah macam penutur jati bila saya dengar','order'=>690],
