            ['start_time'=>155.68,'end_time'=>157.66,'target_text'=>'And that\'s just a number on the floor.','source_text'=>'Tertulis 72 pertukaran pantas (fast transfer).','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>157.76,'end_time'=>161.42,'target_text'=>'>> So, we have to walk all the way down to door 72 for fast transfer.','source_text'=>'Dan itu cuma nombor pada lantai.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>161.52,'end_time'=>161.76,'target_text'=>'Okay.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi, kita kena jalan terus sampai ke pintu 72 untuk pertukaran pantas.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>161.76,'end_time'=>165.5,'target_text'=>'So, I just searched and it\'s called a moving walkway or auto walk.','source_text'=>'Okey.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>165.6,'end_time'=>168.38,'target_text'=>'That\'s the technical term for that platform that just moves as you walk.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya baru cari tadi dan namanya laluan pejalan kaki bergerak (moving walkway atau auto walk).','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>168.48,'end_time'=>170.14,'target_text'=>'Kind of like an escalator, but a flat one.','source_text'=>'Itulah istilah teknikal untuk platform yang bergerak bila kita jalan.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>170.24,'end_time'=>171.26,'target_text'=>'72 is that one.','source_text'=>'Macam eskalator, tapi jenis rata.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>171.36,'end_time'=>172.3,'target_text'=>'So, we\'ll just stay here.','source_text'=>'72 yang sebelah sana tu.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>172.4,'end_time'=>173.18,'target_text'=>'This is close enough.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita tunggu kat sini je.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>173.28,'end_time'=>177.82,'target_text'=>'These doors are closed so that no one could go onto the railway and get hit by the train.','source_text'=>'Kat sini dah cukup dekat.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>177.92,'end_time'=>180.7,'target_text'=>'And these open up automatically when the metro arrives.','source_text'=>'Pintu-pintu ni ditutup supaya tak ada orang boleh masuk ke landasan dan dilanggar tren.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>180.8,'end_time'=>182.94,'target_text'=>'So, and up here you can see the directions.','source_text'=>'Dan pintu ni terbuka secara automatik bila metro sampai.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>183.04,'end_time'=>185.34,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re heading that direction towards Cinchon.','source_text'=>'Dan kat atas ni awak boleh nampak arah panduan.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>185.44,'end_time'=>188.22,'target_text'=>'And yeah, these are the stations, the different stations.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita menuju ke arah sana ke Sinchon.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>188.32,'end_time'=>189.74,'target_text'=>'I just got out of the subway.','source_text'=>'Dan ya, ini stesen-stesennya, pelbagai stesen berbeza.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>189.84,'end_time'=>190.78,'target_text'=>'Now, we have to transfer.','source_text'=>'Saya baru je keluar dari subway.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>190.88,'end_time'=>193.34,'target_text'=>'So, we have to go to line five, a purple line.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, kita kena tukar tren.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>193.44,'end_time'=>195.26,'target_text'=>'So, we have to go up the escalators to transfer.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita kena naik eskalator untuk bertukar tren.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>195.36,'end_time'=>198.62,'target_text'=>'I think we\'re only have to take the next train for like two or three stops.','source_text'=>'Rasanya kita cuma perlu naik tren seterusnya dalam dua atau tiga stesen je.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>198.72,'end_time'=>199.66,'target_text'=>'>> I think we should just walk.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa baik kita jalan kaki je.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>199.76,'end_time'=>201.02,'target_text'=>'>> No, from here we\'re still far.','source_text'=>'>> Tak, dari sini kita masih jauh.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>201.12,'end_time'=>202.54,'target_text'=>'>> Are we like in Mandong, though?','source_text'=>'>> Tapi kita dah ada kat Myeongdong ke?','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>202.64,'end_time'=>203.9,'target_text'=>'>> Look, that\'s how far we are.','source_text'=>'>> Tengoklah, sejauh tu jarak kita.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>204,'end_time'=>205.98,'target_text'=>'And when we where it drops us off, we\'ll walk up.','source_text'=>'Dan bila tren turunkan kita nanti, kita akan jalan kaki naik ke atas.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>206.08,'end_time'=>207.1,'target_text'=>'Line five transfer.','source_text'=>'Pertukaran laluan lima.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>207.2,'end_time'=>209.02,'target_text'=>'There\'s an arrow pointing this way.','source_text'=>'Ada tanda anak panah menunjuk ke arah sini.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>209.12,'end_time'=>209.9,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s go this way.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jom kita ikut jalan ni.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>210,'end_time'=>211.66,'target_text'=>'We have to navigate through the subway.','source_text'=>'Kita kena cari jalan dalam subway ni.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>211.76,'end_time'=>212.7,'target_text'=>'But it\'s really easy.','source_text'=>'Tapi sebenarnya sangat senang.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>212.8,'end_time'=>218.94,'target_text'=>'Honestly, people I\'ve never used public transportation until I got to Korea, but Korea is super easy to use, honestly.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, saya tak pernah guna pengangkutan awam sampailah saya sampai ke Korea, tapi kat Korea ni memang sangat mudah nak guna.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>219.04,'end_time'=>219.2,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>219.2,'end_time'=>220.86,'target_text'=>'As long as you don\'t use Google Maps, you\'re good.','source_text'=>'Asalkan awak tak guna Google Maps, semuanya okey.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>220.96,'end_time'=>221.12,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>221.12,'end_time'=>221.82,'target_text'=>'Don\'t use Google Maps.','source_text'=>'Jangan guna Google Maps.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>221.92,'end_time'=>222.94,'target_text'=>'I use neighbor.','source_text'=>'Saya guna Naver.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>223.04,'end_time'=>223.66,'target_text'=>'So easy.','source_text'=>'Sangat mudah.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>223.76,'end_time'=>224.16,'target_text'=>'Next train.','source_text'=>'Tren seterusnya.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>224.24,'end_time'=>225.58,'target_text'=>'It tells you when the next train is coming.','source_text'=>'Paparan ni beritahu bila tren seterusnya akan sampai.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>225.68,'end_time'=>227.66,'target_text'=>'Next train is coming in 7 minutes.','source_text'=>'Tren seterusnya akan sampai dalam masa 7 minit.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>227.76,'end_time'=>230.62,'target_text'=>'And we\'re heading to Chong Chun.','source_text'=>'Dan kita menuju ke Jongno.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>230.72,'end_time'=>232.3,'target_text'=>'No Chun.','source_text'=>'Gwanghwamun.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>232.4,'end_time'=>237.58,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if I\'m saying that right, but anyways, we\'re walking through this like passageway down even deeper underground','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sebutan saya betul ke tak, tapi apa pun kita tengah jalan lalu lorong ni turun lebih jauh ke bawah tanah','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>237.68,'end_time'=>238.94,'target_text'=>'to the next train.','source_text'=>'untuk ke tren seterusnya.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>239.04,'end_time'=>240.3,'target_text'=>'So, we\'ll see you guys there.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jumpa korang kat sana nanti.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>240.4,'end_time'=>242.14,'target_text'=>'We just got here, exit 2.','source_text'=>'Kita baru je sampai sini, pintu keluar 2.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>242.24,'end_time'=>245.34,'target_text'=>'We\'re about to leave the subway station and climb up these stairs.','source_text'=>'Kita dah nak keluar dari stesen subway dan panjat tangga ni.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>245.44,'end_time'=>248.14,'target_text'=>'And then I think we might be able to see the palace from there.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu rasanya kita mungkin boleh nampak istana dari situ.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>248.24,'end_time'=>249.66,'target_text'=>'Oo, >> that\'s cold.','source_text'=>'Uish, >> sejuknya.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>249.76,'end_time'=>250.7,'target_text'=>'>> You feel that wind?','source_text'=>'>> Awak rasa angin tu?','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>250.8,'end_time'=>251.58,'target_text'=>'You see my hair is moving.','source_text'=>'Awak nampak rambut saya bergerak-gerak.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>251.68,'end_time'=>252.78,'target_text'=>'I told you the wind, man.','source_text'=>'Kan saya dah kata angin kuat gila, kawan.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>252.88,'end_time'=>254.7,'target_text'=>'>> And do you know what these things on the side are for?','source_text'=>'>> Dan awak tahu tak benda kat bahagian tepi ni untuk apa?','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>254.8,'end_time'=>255.42,'target_text'=>'>> Bicycles.','source_text'=>'>> Basikal.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>255.52,'end_time'=>255.84,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>255.84,'end_time'=>260.54,'target_text'=>'These are for bikes or bicycles for climbing these stairs to the outside.','source_text'=>'Ini landasan basikal untuk tolak naik tangga ke luar.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>260.64,'end_time'=>261.82,'target_text'=>'Look at that view.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah pemandangan tu.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>261.92,'end_time'=>262.7,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'>> Wah.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>262.8,'end_time'=>264.06,'target_text'=>'>> K-pop Demon Hunters, bro.','source_text'=>'>> K-pop Demon Hunters, bro.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>264.16,'end_time'=>265.1,'target_text'=>'At Paris Baguette.','source_text'=>'Dekat kedai Paris Baguette.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>265.2,'end_time'=>267.5,'target_text'=>'K-pop Demon Hunters is like super popular.','source_text'=>'K-pop Demon Hunters sangat popular.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>267.6,'end_time'=>270.3,'target_text'=>'I think one of the more popular recent movies on Netflix.','source_text'=>'Rasanya antara filem terkini paling popular kat Netflix.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>270.4,'end_time'=>271.58,'target_text'=>'K-pop Demon Hunters.','source_text'=>'K-pop Demon Hunters.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>271.68,'end_time'=>272.7,'target_text'=>'And Paris Baguette.','source_text'=>'Dan Paris Baguette.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>272.8,'end_time'=>273.66,'target_text'=>'That\'s this bakery.','source_text'=>'Itulah kedai roti ni.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>273.76,'end_time'=>277.5,'target_text'=>'Paris Baguette is like a a huge chain of bakeries in Korea.','source_text'=>'Paris Baguette ni rangkaian kedai roti gergasi di Korea.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>277.6,'end_time'=>278.22,'target_text'=>'Not in Paris.','source_text'=>'Bukan di Paris.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>278.32,'end_time'=>279.02,'target_text'=>'No, it\'s not French.','source_text'=>'Bukan dari Perancis pun.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>279.12,'end_time'=>279.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s Korean.','source_text'=>'Ia jenama Korea.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>279.76,'end_time'=>280.86,'target_text'=>'Paris Baguette.','source_text'=>'Paris Baguette.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>280.96,'end_time'=>283.1,'target_text'=>'But I think that\'s some government buildings over there, eh?','source_text'=>'Tapi rasanya bangunan kat sebelah sana tu bangunan kerajaan, kan?','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>283.2,'end_time'=>284.22,'target_text'=>'>> No, that\'s a museum.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, itu muzium.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>284.32,'end_time'=>285.02,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, museum.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, muzium.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>285.12,'end_time'=>285.52,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>285.52,'end_time'=>289.42,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, let\'s let\'s go to that big statue of uh one of the past kings.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita pergi ke patung besar salah seorang raja terdahulu.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>289.52,'end_time'=>291.58,'target_text'=>'He made Hungul like the Korean alphabet.','source_text'=>'Dialah yang cipta Hangeul, abjad bahasa Korea.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>291.68,'end_time'=>292.08,'target_text'=>'Hungu.','source_text'=>'Hangeul.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>292.16,'end_time'=>293.82,'target_text'=>'He\'s the person that invented it.','source_text'=>'Dialah orang yang menciptanya.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>293.92,'end_time'=>295.58,'target_text'=>'We\'re crossing the crosswalk.','source_text'=>'Kita tengah melintas lintasan pejalan kaki.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>295.68,'end_time'=>299.26,'target_text'=>'Okay, we are right now in Guang Wong Moon Square.','source_text'=>'Okey, sekarang kita berada di Dataran Gwanghwamun.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>299.36,'end_time'=>300.46,'target_text'=>'Guang Wong Square.','source_text'=>'Dataran Gwanghwamun.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>300.56,'end_time'=>301.74,'target_text'=>'We\'re in a square right now.','source_text'=>'Kita berada di sebuah dataran sekarang.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>301.84,'end_time'=>304.06,'target_text'=>'That right there is a very big statue.','source_text'=>'Kat depan tu patung yang sangat besar.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>304.16,'end_time'=>304.4,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>304.4,'end_time'=>305.18,'target_text'=>'Let me take a flick of that.','source_text'=>'Biar saya tangkap gambar benda tu.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>305.28,'end_time'=>306.38,'target_text'=>'>> What does let me take a flick mean?','source_text'=>'>> Apa maksud \"let me take a flick\"?','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>306.48,'end_time'=>308.3,'target_text'=>'>> Let me take a flick means just let me take a pick.','source_text'=>'>> \"Let me take a flick\" maksudnya biar saya ambil gambar (take a pic).','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>308.4,'end_time'=>309.58,'target_text'=>'Let me take a picture.','source_text'=>'Biar saya ambil gambar.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>309.68,'end_time'=>311.48,'target_text'=>'flick.','source_text'=>'flick (gambar).','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>312.16,'end_time'=>315.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it but it\'s only got popular in like recent years.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tapi perkataan tu baru popular beberapa tahun kebelakangan ni.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>315.2,'end_time'=>315.52,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Taklah.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>315.52,'end_time'=>315.76,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>315.76,'end_time'=>317.34,'target_text'=>'Today is actually a really nice day though.','source_text'=>'Hari ini sebenarnya hari yang sangat cantik.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>317.44,'end_time'=>318.62,'target_text'=>'Like the sky is super clear.','source_text'=>'Langit sangat membiru dan cerah.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>318.72,'end_time'=>319.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s not cloudy at all.','source_text'=>'Langsung tak ada awan mendung.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>319.68,'end_time'=>320.3,'target_text'=>'And you can see everything.','source_text'=>'Dan awak boleh nampak segalanya.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>320.4,'end_time'=>322.38,'target_text'=>'Like if you see that\'s the blue house all the way up there.','source_text'=>'Kalau awak tengok, itulah Blue House (Rumah Biru) nun jauh kat atas sana.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>322.48,'end_time'=>323.66,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you can see that from here.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada korang boleh nampak dari sini.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>323.76,'end_time'=>326.38,'target_text'=>'Shout out Koreans if you\'re watching this video trying to learn English.','source_text'=>'Salam hormat kepada penonton Korea yang sedang tonton video ni untuk belajar bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>326.48,'end_time'=>328.3,'target_text'=>'Tune in for the Korea series.','source_text'=>'Nantikan siri video jelajah Korea ni.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>328.4,'end_time'=>329.98,'target_text'=>'There\'s a lot of police vans here too.','source_text'=>'Banyak van polis kat sini juga.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>330.08,'end_time'=>331.34,'target_text'=>'>> I think that\'s a police station.','source_text'=>'>> Rasanya itu balai polis.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>331.44,'end_time'=>332.46,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s the US embassy.','source_text'=>'>> Itu kedutaan Amerika Syarikat.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>332.56,'end_time'=>336.86,'target_text'=>'If you guys don\'t know, the US and Korea have a really good relationship because of the Korean War.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang tak tahu, AS dan Korea ada hubungan sangat akrab berpunca daripada Perang Korea.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>336.96,'end_time'=>339.82,'target_text'=>'Well, they also got like military bases and all that stuff here.','source_text'=>'Mereka juga ada pengkalan tentera dan sebagainya kat sini.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>339.92,'end_time'=>344.86,'target_text'=>'Well, I don\'t know about how the relationship is now because like I don\'t know if you guys like heard this on the news, but','source_text'=>'Tapi saya tak tahu bagaimana hubungan mereka sekarang sebab saya tak pasti korang pernah dengar dalam berita ke tak,','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>344.96,'end_time'=>349.98,'target_text'=>'recently, I think in the past month or so, maybe two months, there was actually a Hyundai factory that was being built in','source_text'=>'baru-baru ni dalam sebulan dua lepas, sebenarnya ada kilang Hyundai sedang dibina di','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>350.08,'end_time'=>351.42,'target_text'=>'like somewhere in the south, I think.','source_text'=>'kawasan selatan Amerika rasanya.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>351.52,'end_time'=>354.38,'target_text'=>'And then all those Koreans that were working there got deported.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu semua pekerja Korea yang kerja kat situ telah diusir keluar (deported).','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>354.48,'end_time'=>359.5,'target_text'=>'You know, even though they were allowed to be there, they had visas, working visas and stuff, but they all got deported by','source_text'=>'Walaupun dorang dibenarkan berada kat situ, ada visa kerja dan segalanya, tapi dorang semua diusir oleh','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>359.6,'end_time'=>360.38,'target_text'=>'the US government.','source_text'=>'kerajaan Amerika Syarikat.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>360.48,'end_time'=>364.54,'target_text'=>'So now, I don\'t know if you\'re Korean, you could let me know what you think of that, but I feel like a lot of Koreans are','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang, kalau korang orang Korea, boleh beritahu pandangan korang tapi saya rasa ramai orang Korea','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>364.64,'end_time'=>365.42,'target_text'=>'mad about that.','source_text'=>'marah pasal isu tu.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>365.52,'end_time'=>369.82,'target_text'=>'They\'re building a factory from what I understand for Hyundai and also teaching Americans.','source_text'=>'Mereka bina kilang setahu saya untuk Hyundai dan latih orang Amerika juga.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>369.92,'end_time'=>371.5,'target_text'=>'Now, I\'m not really caught up on the news.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya taklah ikuti rapat sangat perkembangan berita tu.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>371.6,'end_time'=>372.78,'target_text'=>'Maybe it\'s all resolved.','source_text'=>'Mungkin semuanya dah selesai.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>372.88,'end_time'=>375.26,'target_text'=>'Maybe it\'s not resolved, but that\'s just what I know of it.','source_text'=>'Mungkin belum selesai lagi, tapi setakat itulah yang saya tahu.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>375.36,'end_time'=>378.46,'target_text'=>'So, you know, take my word is the one and only truth.','source_text'=>'Jadi, janganlah ambil kata-kata saya sebagai satu-satunya kebenaran mutlak.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>378.56,'end_time'=>379.18,'target_text'=>'Search up yourself.','source_text'=>'Buat carian sendiri untuk kepastian.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>379.28,'end_time'=>379.9,'target_text'=>'Oh, dude, look.','source_text'=>'Oh, kawan, tengok tu.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>380,'end_time'=>381.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of like big Lego blocks.','source_text'=>'Ia macam blok Lego yang besar.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>381.68,'end_time'=>382.46,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s what they are.','source_text'=>'>> Memang blok Lego pun.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>382.56,'end_time'=>383.42,'target_text'=>'>> Big Lego blocks.','source_text'=>'>> Blok Lego besar.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>383.52,'end_time'=>386.3,'target_text'=>'But we can\'t go there cuz there\'s this temporary fence blocking us.','source_text'=>'Tapi kita tak boleh pergi situ sebab ada pagar sementara ni halang kita.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>386.4,'end_time'=>387.98,'target_text'=>'Ooh, but dude, my ears are cold.','source_text'=>'Uish, tapi kawan, telinga saya dah kebas sejuk.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>388.08,'end_time'=>389.9,'target_text'=>'That wind is piercing me, bro.','source_text'=>'Angin tu menusuk sampai ke tulang, bro.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>390,'end_time'=>391.42,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, I\'ve been to that museum.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, saya pernah pergi ke muzium tu.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>391.52,'end_time'=>393.5,'target_text'=>'>> Contemporary >> contemporary history.','source_text'=>'>> Muzium sejarah >> sejarah kontemporari.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>393.6,'end_time'=>397.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s really nice and it\'s got a really nice view of the palace from uh up in the top floors.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat menarik dan ada pemandangan istana yang sangat cantik dari tingkat atas.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>398,'end_time'=>399.42,'target_text'=>'>> The palace is closed today.','source_text'=>'>> Istana tutup hari ini.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>399.52,'end_time'=>403.02,'target_text'=>'I did not know that the palace was closed today, but we\'ll we\'ll walk up to it.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu pula istana tutup hari ini, tapi kita tetap akan jalan pergi tengok dekat-dekat.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>403.12,'end_time'=>404.7,'target_text'=>'We\'ll come back another day, so don\'t worry.','source_text'=>'Kita akan datang balik hari lain, jadi jangan risau.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>404.8,'end_time'=>406.78,'target_text'=>'We\'ll come in when it\'s warmer, maybe this weekend.','source_text'=>'Kita masuk bila cuaca lebih panas, mungkin hujung minggu ni.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>406.88,'end_time'=>412.14,'target_text'=>'And we\'re also going to be eating Jokal, which is my second favorite Korean food at a very good restaurant.','source_text'=>'Dan kita juga akan makan Jokbal, iaitu makanan Korea kedua kegemaran saya di sebuah restoran yang sangat sedap.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>412.24,'end_time'=>414.7,'target_text'=>'We still have a lot of stuff planned today, so stick around.','source_text'=>'Banyak lagi rancangan kita hari ini, jadi teruskan menonton.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>414.8,'end_time'=>417.18,'target_text'=>'Yongbukong Palace right here.','source_text'=>'Istana Gyeongbokgung kat depan ni.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>417.28,'end_time'=>421.9,'target_text'=>'Today it\'s closed as we were saying, but you can see the entrance to the palace is right in front of us.','source_text'=>'Hari ini ia tutup macam yang kita cakap tadi, tapi korang boleh nampak pintu masuk istana betul-betul di depan kita.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>422,'end_time'=>425.66,'target_text'=>'And there\'s a wall that goes all around the palace.','source_text'=>'Dan ada tembok yang mengelilingi seluruh kawasan istana.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>425.76,'end_time'=>426.46,'target_text'=>'We can\'t go inside.','source_text'=>'Kita tak boleh masuk ke dalam.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>426.56,'end_time'=>429.26,'target_text'=>'The courtyard, but uh we can just see the palace.','source_text'=>'Ke laman dalam, tapi kita boleh tengok istana dari luar.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>429.36,'end_time'=>431.82,'target_text'=>'And you can see there are three red gates.','source_text'=>'Dan awak boleh nampak ada tiga pintu gerbang merah.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>431.92,'end_time'=>435.74,'target_text'=>'The middle one is a little bit bigger than the other two, but there are three main gates there.','source_text'=>'Pintu yang tengah lebih besar sedikit berbanding dua yang lain, tapi ada tiga pintu gerbang utama kat situ.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>435.84,'end_time'=>437.5,'target_text'=>'I don\'t really see any watchtowers.','source_text'=>'Saya tak berapa nampak menara kawalan.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>437.6,'end_time'=>438.78,'target_text'=>'Maybe this is a watchtower.','source_text'=>'Mungkin yang ini menara kawalan.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>438.88,'end_time'=>439.98,'target_text'=>'I think you could go up there.','source_text'=>'Rasanya orang boleh panjat naik atas tu.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>440.08,'end_time'=>443.42,'target_text'=>'Might have been a watchtowwer back in the day in ancient times.','source_text'=>'Mungkin dulu ia menara kawalan pada zaman purba.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>443.52,'end_time'=>444.62,'target_text'=>'But now we have to wait.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang kita kena tunggu.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>444.72,'end_time'=>452.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually kind of interesting how there\'s like so much like modernization, big buildings, highrises all around here and','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya agak menarik tengok kemodenan yang begitu pesat, bangunan-bangunan besar pencakar langit di sekeliling sini dan','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>452.4,'end_time'=>456.3,'target_text'=>'then there\'s traffic literally right right up to the doorstep of the palace.','source_text'=>'lepas tu ada kesesakan lalu lintas betul-betul depan muka pintu masuk istana.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>456.4,'end_time'=>460.94,'target_text'=>'There\'s traffic and then there\'s like ancient history palace that\'s been standing for I don\'t know how many years.','source_text'=>'Ada kenderaan lalu-lalang dan ada istana bersejarah purba yang berdiri teguh entah berapa ratus tahun.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>461.04,'end_time'=>468.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s just really interesting to see the contrast between ancient times, a beautiful palace and then modernization and the','source_text'=>'Memang sangat menarik tengok kontras antara zaman purba, istana yang indah dengan pemodenan dan','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>468.32,'end_time'=>471.02,'target_text'=>'current way the world looks right at the doorstep.','source_text'=>'keadaan dunia masa kini betul-betul di depan pintu.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>471.12,'end_time'=>471.66,'target_text'=>'Very interesting.','source_text'=>'Sangat menarik.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>471.76,'end_time'=>474.06,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to go to Buchchan Hanok Village first.','source_text'=>'Kita akan pergi ke Perkampungan Hanok Bukchon dulu.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>474.16,'end_time'=>478.06,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to go up this way to a traditional market then to Buchchan Hanuk Village.','source_text'=>'Kita akan ikut jalan ni ke pasar tradisional lepas tu ke Perkampungan Hanok Bukchon.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>478.16,'end_time'=>485.9,'target_text'=>'The most important part of learning a language and the reason why everyone learns a language is to be able to speak the language.','source_text'=>'Bahagian paling penting belajar bahasa dan sebab semua orang belajar bahasa adalah untuk boleh bercakap bahasa tersebut.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>486,'end_time'=>488.14,'target_text'=>'These videos help you with your listening.','source_text'=>'Video-video ini bantu pendengaran anda.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>488.24,'end_time'=>490.94,'target_text'=>'But how can you practice your speaking even more?','source_text'=>'Tapi macam mana anda nak latih pertuturan dengan lebih mantap?','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>491.04,'end_time'=>493.42,'target_text'=>'You need to practice by shadowing.','source_text'=>'Anda perlu berlatih melalui kaedah shadowing (meniru sebutan).','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>493.52,'end_time'=>500.62,'target_text'=>'Shadowing is just repeating after a native English speaker to practice your pronunciation, your accent, and your confidence.','source_text'=>'Shadowing adalah mengulang sebutan penutur jati bahasa Inggeris untuk melatih sebutan, slanga, dan keyakinan anda.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>500.72,'end_time'=>505.98,'target_text'=>'And I\'ve started making videos specifically just to practice those three things.','source_text'=>'Dan saya dah mula buat video khas untuk melatih tiga perkara tersebut.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>506.08,'end_time'=>511.98,'target_text'=>'So, if you guys want to become more confident in English and become truly fluent, check out my Patreon in the description','source_text'=>'Jadi, kalau korang nak lebih yakin berbahasa Inggeris dan benar-benar fasih, lihat Patreon saya di ruang deskripsi','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>512.08,'end_time'=>520.38,'target_text'=>'where I give you guys three new videos every week to practice your pronunciation, your accent, and most importantly, your','source_text'=>'di mana saya sediakan tiga video baharu setiap minggu untuk latih sebutan, slanga, dan paling utama,','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>520.48,'end_time'=>521.26,'target_text'=>'confidence.','source_text'=>'keyakinan anda.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>521.36,'end_time'=>522.46,'target_text'=>'I\'ll see you guys there.','source_text'=>'Kita jumpa di sana.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>522.56,'end_time'=>530.46,'target_text'=>'We are going to be learning English as I clean up my pronunciation, your accent, [music] your rhythm, and your confidence.','source_text'=>'Kita akan belajar bahasa Inggeris sambil memantapkan sebutan, slanga, [muzik] rentak percakapan, dan keyakinan anda.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>530.56,'end_time'=>535.02,'target_text'=>'It was just a roundabout way of her politely trying to spare my feelings.','source_text'=>'Itu cuma cara berlapik dia cuba jaga perasaan saya secara sopan.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>535.12,'end_time'=>542.46,'target_text'=>'The a-hole for giving all [music] of my co-workers a different reason for why I have missing fingers so I wouldn\'t take legal','source_text'=>'Si celaka tu sebab beritahu semua [muzik] rakan sekerja pelbagai alasan jari saya hilang supaya saya tak ambil tindakan undang-undang','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>542.56,'end_time'=>546.06,'target_text'=>'came down to he companywide [music] training on his behavior.','source_text'=>'sampai kena buat latihan seluruh syarikat [muzik] mengenai kelakuannya.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>546.16,'end_time'=>547.1,'target_text'=>'He chooses not.','source_text'=>'Dia pilih untuk tak ikut.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>547.2,'end_time'=>550.2,'target_text'=>'But I was already so cranky.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya masa tu dah cukup meragam.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>550.56,'end_time'=>554.3,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we\'re in I did so much shopping in Mushima.','source_text'=>'Okey, kita kat— Saya beli-belah banyak barang di Muji.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>554.4,'end_time'=>559.02,'target_text'=>'The jeans and one hoodie, which we kind of just walked in through the side entrance here.','source_text'=>'Seluar jean dan satu baju hoodie, dan kita baru je masuk ikut pintu tepi kat sini.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>559.12,'end_time'=>561.82,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure if it\'s open or not, but there\'s no guards.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada ia buka atau tidak, tapi tak ada pengawal keselamatan.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>561.92,'end_time'=>562.86,'target_text'=>'There\'s no one here.','source_text'=>'Tak ada sesiapa kat sini.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>562.96,'end_time'=>563.98,'target_text'=>'The gates are just open.','source_text'=>'Pintu pagar terbuka macam tu je.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>564.08,'end_time'=>566.94,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re going to walk in and try to see if we could see the palace.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita akan masuk dan cuba tengok sama ada kita boleh nampak istana.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>567.04,'end_time'=>568.06,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure if we can.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada kita boleh.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>568.16,'end_time'=>573.5,'target_text'=>'Like, we can see the palace, but I\'m not sure if we can enter the main courtyard, but uh maybe we can.','source_text'=>'Kita boleh nampak istana, tapi saya tak pasti boleh masuk ke laman utama atau tidak, tapi mungkin boleh.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>573.6,'end_time'=>578.22,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re going to walk around here and see if we could show you guys what this palace looks like.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita akan jalan pusing-pusing kat sini dan tunjukkan pada korang macam mana rupa istana ni.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>578.32,'end_time'=>579.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s really beautiful.','source_text'=>'Ia sangat indah.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>579.28,'end_time'=>584.14,'target_text'=>'There\'s also a house in the middle of a pond here that I would like to show you guys as well.','source_text'=>'Ada juga sebuah pavilion di tengah kolam kat sini yang saya nak tunjukkan pada korang juga.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>584.24,'end_time'=>586.62,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s go see if we could uh find that.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jom kita tengok kalau-kalau kita boleh jumpa tempat tu.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>586.72,'end_time'=>589.1,'target_text'=>'Okay, so this looks like the max we can go.','source_text'=>'Okey, nampaknya setakat ni je paling jauh kita boleh pergi.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>589.2,'end_time'=>590.62,'target_text'=>'We can\'t go any further in.','source_text'=>'Kita tak boleh masuk lebih dalam lagi.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>590.72,'end_time'=>596.7,'target_text'=>'You can see the side gates here are all closed off, so we can\'t actually go in there, but we can just see the entrances on','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak pintu tepi kat sini semuanya ditutup, jadi kita tak boleh masuk tapi kita boleh tengok pintu masuk kat','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>596.8,'end_time'=>597.42,'target_text'=>'the side here.','source_text'=>'sebelah tepi ni.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>597.52,'end_time'=>598.14,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a wall.','source_text'=>'Ia macam sebuah tembok.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>598.24,'end_time'=>599.58,'target_text'=>'Right now, we\'re in a courtyard.','source_text'=>'Sekarang ni, kita berada di sebuah laman luar.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>599.68,'end_time'=>605.02,'target_text'=>'We passed one wall and we\'re in an inner courtyard, but then there\'s another courtyard, more inside.','source_text'=>'Kita dah lepas satu tembok dan sekarang berada di laman dalam, tapi ada satu lagi laman lebih ke dalam.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>605.12,'end_time'=>608.94,'target_text'=>'I\'m not really sure how many courtyards there are inside here, but this palace is very big.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti berapa banyak laman yang ada kat dalam ni, tapi istana ni memang sangat besar.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>609.04,'end_time'=>610.46,'target_text'=>'I do see people in there, though.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya ada nampak orang kat dalam tu.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>610.56,'end_time'=>613.18,'target_text'=>'I do see people in there, but I don\'t think it\'s for us.','source_text'=>'Saya memang nampak orang kat dalam tu, tapi rasanya bukan untuk orang awam.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>613.28,'end_time'=>614.78,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s for other people.','source_text'=>'Rasanya untuk tetamu khas lain.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>614.88,'end_time'=>618.14,'target_text'=>'Maybe someone reserved it or maybe something\'s going on, but we can\'t go in there.','source_text'=>'Mungkin ada orang tempah khas atau ada majlis sedang berlangsung, tapi kita tak boleh masuk.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>618.24,'end_time'=>619.42,'target_text'=>'We\'ll come back another day.','source_text'=>'Kita akan datang balik hari lain.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>619.52,'end_time'=>620.06,'target_text'=>'Let\'s continue.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan perjalanan.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>620.16,'end_time'=>620.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s cold.','source_text'=>'Sejuknya.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>620.88,'end_time'=>624.3,'target_text'=>'I\'m about to cross this zebra crosswalk.','source_text'=>'Saya nak melintas lintasan belang (zebra crossing) ni.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>624.4,'end_time'=>627.82,'target_text'=>'You can see the light is red and there\'s no vehicles, so I\'m just going to cross.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak lampu merah dan tak ada kenderaan, jadi saya terus lintas je.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>627.92,'end_time'=>630.06,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re crossing the zebra crosswalk now.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita tengah melintas lintasan belang sekarang.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>630.16,'end_time'=>632.86,'target_text'=>'I did not cross it on the red lights if you were wondering.','source_text'=>'Saya tak lintas masa lampu merah kalau korang tertanya-tanya.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>632.96,'end_time'=>633.82,'target_text'=>'And there\'s no vehicles.','source_text'=>'Dan tak ada kenderaan.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>633.92,'end_time'=>635.58,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m just going to cross.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya lintas terus.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>635.68,'end_time'=>637.58,'target_text'=>'And now we\'ve lost the sun.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang matahari dah terlindung.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>637.68,'end_time'=>640.62,'target_text'=>'So, now we\'re we\'re in the shade, so it\'s going to get colder.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang kita berada di tempat teduh, rasa makin sejuk.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>640.72,'end_time'=>642.38,'target_text'=>'And I put these these mits on.','source_text'=>'Dan saya pakai sarung tangan mitten ni.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>642.48,'end_time'=>643.74,'target_text'=>'This is what mits look like.','source_text'=>'Macam nilah rupa sarung tangan mitten.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>643.84,'end_time'=>646.22,'target_text'=>'Gloves have individual fingers.','source_text'=>'Sarung tangan biasa ada jari yang berasingan.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>646.32,'end_time'=>649.9,'target_text'=>'And this right here, this is a glove because the fingers are individual.','source_text'=>'Dan yang ini, ini sarung tangan glove sebab jari-jarinya berasingan.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>650,'end_time'=>651.5,'target_text'=>'So, you can transform these.','source_text'=>'Jadi, awak boleh ubah bentuk sarung tangan ni.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>651.6,'end_time'=>656.38,'target_text'=>'These ones specifically are mittens and gloves, but normally you either have mittens or you have gloves.','source_text'=>'Yang ini khususnya jenis gabungan mitten dan glove, tapi biasanya orang ada sama ada mitten atau glove.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>656.48,'end_time'=>660.62,'target_text'=>'Gloves are a lot easier to use if you want to use like individual fingers like on your phone.','source_text'=>'Glove jauh lebih mudah diguna kalau nak guna jari secara berasingan macam tekan skrin telefon.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>660.72,'end_time'=>664.94,'target_text'=>'But mittens are a lot warmer because it keeps your fingers wrapped tight together.','source_text'=>'Tapi mitten jauh lebih hangat sebab jari-jemari dirapatkan sekali.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>665.04,'end_time'=>667.58,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re heading to the market, right?','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita menuju ke pasar, kan?','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>667.68,'end_time'=>668.08,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>668.16,'end_time'=>668.86,'target_text'=>'Traditional market.','source_text'=>'Pasar tradisional.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>668.96,'end_time'=>669.42,'target_text'=>'>> Traditional market.','source_text'=>'>> Pasar tradisional.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>669.52,'end_time'=>670.3,'target_text'=>'Is it open?','source_text'=>'Buka ke?','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>670.4,'end_time'=>671.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s open.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, buka.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>671.2,'end_time'=>672.14,'target_text'=>'>> Are you sure?','source_text'=>'>> Awak pasti ke?','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>672.24,'end_time'=>673.66,'target_text'=>'>> Uh 50/50.','source_text'=>'>> Lebih kurang 50/50.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>673.76,'end_time'=>674,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'>> Okey.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>674,'end_time'=>676.14,'target_text'=>'Well, we\'re about to find out if this market\'s open.','source_text'=>'Kita bakal tahu sama ada pasar ni buka ke tak sekejap lagi.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>676.24,'end_time'=>677.66,'target_text'=>'And it\'s kind of like freezing.','source_text'=>'Dan cuaca memang tersangat sejuk beku.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>677.76,'end_time'=>681.02,'target_text'=>'This right here is a bookstore, but it\'s not just any bookstore.','source_text'=>'Yang ini kedai buku, tapi bukan sebarangan kedai buku.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>681.12,'end_time'=>685.1,'target_text'=>'Apparently, this is the oldest standing bookstore in Korea.','source_text'=>'Rupa-rupanya, ini kedai buku tertua yang masih wujud di Korea.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>685.2,'end_time'=>688.3,'target_text'=>'Unfortunately, I\'m not actually into books.','source_text'=>'Malangnya, saya bukanlah jenis minat membaca buku.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>688.4,'end_time'=>690.06,'target_text'=>'It says, \"This is a cafe now.','source_text'=>'Notis tu kata, \"Sekarang tempat ini adalah kafe.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>690.16,'end_time'=>691.82,'target_text'=>'We don\'t sell books anymore.','source_text'=>'Kami tidak lagi menjual buku.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>691.92,'end_time'=>693.74,'target_text'=>'Please order a drink to come in.','source_text'=>'Sila pesan minuman untuk masuk.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>693.84,'end_time'=>697.02,'target_text'=>'Thank you.\" I don\'t drink coffee, but this is the oldest bookstore in Korea.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih.\" Saya tak minum kopi, tapi inilah kedai buku tertua di Korea.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>697.12,'end_time'=>699.5,'target_text'=>'I\'ll put up some pictures of what it looks like, but we\'re here.','source_text'=>'Nanti saya tunjukkan beberapa keping gambar macam mana rupanya, tapi kita dah sampai.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>699.6,'end_time'=>702.54,'target_text'=>'Have you ever had those fish things like the with the beans inside?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah makan kuih ikan yang ada inti kacang merah kat dalam tu tak?','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>702.64,'end_time'=>705.02,'target_text'=>'>> Actually, I\'ve had one with chocolate in it, and it was pretty good.','source_text'=>'>> Sebenarnya saya pernah makan yang berinti coklat, dan rasanya agak sedap.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>705.12,'end_time'=>705.36,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>705.36,'end_time'=>707.9,'target_text'=>'I don\'t like the one with beans, but this right here is like some street food.','source_text'=>'Saya tak suka yang inti kacang, tapi kat sini ada jual pelbagai makanan jalanan (street food).','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>708,'end_time'=>709.34,'target_text'=>'This is like popular street food.','source_text'=>'Ini antara makanan jalanan yang popular.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>709.44,'end_time'=>710.3,'target_text'=>'>> Well, this is the market.','source_text'=>'>> Inilah pasarnya.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>710.4,'end_time'=>712.22,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, found the market, guys.','source_text'=>'>> Dah jumpa pasarnya semua.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>712.32,'end_time'=>714.62,'target_text'=>'I guess it\'s kind of like a refrigerator being outside.','source_text'=>'Rasanya suasana luar ni macam dalam peti ais.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>714.72,'end_time'=>716.14,'target_text'=>'So, they don\'t even need to refrigerate it.','source_text'=>'Jadi dorang tak payah simpan dalam peti sejuk pun.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>716.24,'end_time'=>717.34,'target_text'=>'>> Well, you see this tarp here?','source_text'=>'>> Awak nampak kanvas plastik ni?','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>717.44,'end_time'=>718.78,'target_text'=>'Everything behind there is cooler.','source_text'=>'Semua benda kat belakang tu lebih sejuk.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>718.88,'end_time'=>720.7,'target_text'=>'>> I think everything behind there is warmer now.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa semua benda kat belakang tu lebih hangat sekarang.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>720.8,'end_time'=>723.1,'target_text'=>'Maybe in the winter it\'s cooler, but now it\'s probably warm.','source_text'=>'Mungkin waktu musim sejuk ia lebih sejuk, tapi sekarang rasanya hangat.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>723.2,'end_time'=>723.44,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>723.44,'end_time'=>724.94,'target_text'=>'>> Or maybe in the summer it\'s cooler.','source_text'=>'>> Atau mungkin waktu musim panas ia lebih sejuk.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>725.04,'end_time'=>726.54,'target_text'=>'But the market is pretty quiet.','source_text'=>'Tapi pasar ni agak sunyi.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>726.64,'end_time'=>729.66,'target_text'=>'You would say in English popular way to say is the market is dead.','source_text'=>'Kalau dalam bahasa Inggeris, ungkapan popularnya adalah pasarnya sangat lengang (the market is dead).','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>729.76,'end_time'=>731.18,'target_text'=>'Man, maybe I should get some street food.','source_text'=>'Mungkin saya patut beli makanan jalanan sikit.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>731.28,'end_time'=>734.84,'target_text'=>'Actually, right from the market.','source_text'=>'Terus daripada pasar ni.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>736.23,'end_time'=>740.06,'target_text'=>'[laughter] >> So, you say it in Spanish now.','source_text'=>'[ketawa] >> Jadi awak sebut dalam bahasa Sepanyol pula sekarang.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>740.16,'end_time'=>741.42,'target_text'=>'Deliciosa.','source_text'=>'Deliciosa (Sedap).','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>741.52,'end_time'=>742.46,'target_text'=>'>> I see how it is.','source_text'=>'>> Macam tu rupanya.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>742.56,'end_time'=>742.96,'target_text'=>'>> Try it.','source_text'=>'>> Cubalah rasa.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>742.96,'end_time'=>744.86,'target_text'=>'No, I\'m good.','source_text'=>'Tak mengapalah, saya okey je.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>744.96,'end_time'=>748.22,'target_text'=>'And she gave us some uh broth.','source_text'=>'Dan mak cik tu bagi kita sup panas sikit.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>748.32,'end_time'=>749.82,'target_text'=>'What a vibe this market is.','source_text'=>'Memang syahdu betul suasana pasar ni.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>749.92,'end_time'=>752.86,'target_text'=>'Usually they give you like this broth in this cup.','source_text'=>'Biasanya mereka bagi sup panas dalam cawan macam ni.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>752.96,'end_time'=>756.22,'target_text'=>'Like that fish fish broth, especially when it\'s cold.','source_text'=>'Macam sup rebusan ikan tu, terutamanya bila cuaca sejuk.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>756.32,'end_time'=>758.22,'target_text'=>'So, this is really warming up my hands right now.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini sangat menghangatkan tangan saya sekarang.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>758.32,'end_time'=>760.62,'target_text'=>'Toboki is kind of like you have to get it.','source_text'=>'Tteokbokki ni macam makanan wajib beli.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>760.72,'end_time'=>764.78,'target_text'=>'And if you order it at a restaurant, they give you like a massive bowl and I cannot eat that.','source_text'=>'Dan kalau pesan kat restoran, mereka hidang dalam mangkuk besar gila sampai saya tak larat habiskan.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>764.88,'end_time'=>766.62,'target_text'=>'But you can see the rest of the market down here.','source_text'=>'Tapi korang boleh tengok bahagian pasar yang lain kat bawah sana.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>766.72,'end_time'=>769.26,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to walk down there and uh see that.','source_text'=>'Kita akan jalan ke bawah sana dan tengok kawasan tu.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>769.36,'end_time'=>774.52,'target_text'=>'Walking down the the alleyway where all the where all the shops are.','source_text'=>'Berjalan menyusuri lorong di mana terletaknya kedai-kedai.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>775.28,'end_time'=>778.3,'target_text'=>'This dish right here, I believe this one is a kimchi jig.','source_text'=>'Hidangan yang ini, rasanya kimchi jjigae.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>778.4,'end_time'=>779.18,'target_text'=>'Oh my gosh.','source_text'=>'Ya ampun.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>779.28,'end_time'=>779.98,'target_text'=>'So good.','source_text'=>'Sedap sangat.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>780.08,'end_time'=>780.94,'target_text'=>'This is a butcher shop.','source_text'=>'Ini kedai daging.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>781.04,'end_time'=>783.34,'target_text'=>'I think they\'re having dinner right now, but that was a butcher shop.','source_text'=>'Rasanya dorang tengah makan malam sekarang, tapi tadi tu kedai daging.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>783.44,'end_time'=>784.38,'target_text'=>'Oh, dude.','source_text'=>'Oh, kawan.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>784.48,'end_time'=>785.98,'target_text'=>'15k for the labubu.','source_text'=>'15 ribu won untuk Labubu.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>786.08,'end_time'=>786.86,'target_text'=>'That\'s a deal.','source_text'=>'Murah tu, harga berbaloi.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>786.96,'end_time'=>787.36,'target_text'=>'>> 15.','source_text'=>'>> 15 ribu.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>787.36,'end_time'=>789.34,'target_text'=>'No, get the libu head right here.','source_text'=>'Bukan, ambil kepala Labubu yang kat sini.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>789.44,'end_time'=>790.38,'target_text'=>'>> Just a labu head.','source_text'=>'>> Kepala Labubu je.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>790.48,'end_time'=>792.22,'target_text'=>'That means you\'re only be half cursed.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya awak cuma kena separuh sumpahan je.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>792.32,'end_time'=>794.86,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re going to the Bukchan Hanok village, right?','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita menuju ke Perkampungan Hanok Bukchon, kan?','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>794.96,'end_time'=>795.2,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>795.2,'end_time'=>797.24,'target_text'=>'Blue house.','source_text'=>'Blue House (Rumah Biru).','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>802.24,'end_time'=>807.26,'target_text'=>'That is the blue house which is equivalent to like the white house in the United States.','source_text'=>'Itulah Rumah Biru yang setaraf macam Rumah Putih (White House) di Amerika Syarikat.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>807.36,'end_time'=>811.5,'target_text'=>'So the blue house is where their president lives here in Korea.','source_text'=>'Rumah Biru ialah tempat kediaman rasmi presiden di Korea.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>811.6,'end_time'=>814.54,'target_text'=>'Although I don\'t think the previous president lived there.','source_text'=>'Walaupun rasanya presiden sebelum ni tak tinggal kat situ.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>814.64,'end_time'=>816.3,'target_text'=>'I think he moved somewhere else.','source_text'=>'Rasanya dia pindah ke tempat lain.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>816.4,'end_time'=>819.1,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure if the current president lives here as well.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada presiden sekarang tinggal kat sini juga.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>819.2,'end_time'=>820.78,'target_text'=>'Maybe you guys can let me know in the comments.','source_text'=>'Mungkin korang boleh beritahu saya di ruangan komen.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>820.88,'end_time'=>822.86,'target_text'=>'But I know that that is the blue house.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya tahu yang itu memang Rumah Biru.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>822.96,'end_time'=>826.22,'target_text'=>'We are currently in Bon Hanog Village.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita berada di Perkampungan Hanok Bukchon.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>826.32,'end_time'=>828.14,'target_text'=>'This is the first traditional house we\'ve seen.','source_text'=>'Ini rumah tradisional pertama yang kita nampak.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>828.24,'end_time'=>831.1,'target_text'=>'But now we\'re going to go find that very popular and famous street.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang kita nak pergi cari jalan yang sangat popular dan terkenal tu.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>831.2,'end_time'=>834.22,'target_text'=>'I have no idea where it is, but I know it\'s in this area.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kat mana tempatnya, tapi saya tahu ia dalam kawasan ni.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>834.32,'end_time'=>835.9,'target_text'=>'So, watch your step.','source_text'=>'Jadi, hati-hati melangkah.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>836,'end_time'=>838.38,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, is that is that how you say watch your step in Korean?','source_text'=>'>> Kawan, macam tu ke cara sebut hati-hati melangkah dalam bahasa Korea?','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>838.48,'end_time'=>840.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s like 50 pages.','source_text'=>'Ayat dia panjang macam 50 muka surat.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>840.96,'end_time'=>843.56,'target_text'=>'>> No, it\'s the yellow.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, itu yang warna kuning.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>843.68,'end_time'=>848.46,'target_text'=>'Although we couldn\'t uh see the palace, at least we can see the inside of one of these houses kind of.','source_text'=>'Walaupun kita tak dapat tengok istana, sekurang-kurangnya kita dapat tengok bahagian dalam salah satu rumah ni.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>848.56,'end_time'=>852.62,'target_text'=>'I think this is what a traditional house of maybe an upper class family looked like.','source_text'=>'Rasanya macam nilah rupa rumah tradisional golongan bangsawan kelas atasan dulu-dulu.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>852.72,'end_time'=>857.66,'target_text'=>'This is probably the house of some someone that had either money or influence.','source_text'=>'Ini kemungkinan rumah seseorang yang ada banyak harta atau pengaruh.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>857.76,'end_time'=>859.1,'target_text'=>'Oh, dude, that looks so nice.','source_text'=>'Wah kawan, nampak sangat cantik.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>859.2,'end_time'=>860.38,'target_text'=>'Actually, that is a vibe.','source_text'=>'Suasana dia memang sangat menenangkan.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>860.48,'end_time'=>863.1,'target_text'=>'Let me use my new iPhone 18 Pro Max to take a picture.','source_text'=>'Biar saya guna iPhone 18 Pro Max baharu saya untuk tangkap gambar.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>863.2,'end_time'=>865.74,'target_text'=>'These almost look like maple leaves, but I don\'t think they are.','source_text'=>'Daun-daun ni hampir nampak macam daun maple, tapi rasanya bukan.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>865.84,'end_time'=>869.74,'target_text'=>'>> Bro, maple leaves come from the maple tree that produces maple syrup.','source_text'=>'>> Bro, daun maple datang daripada pokok maple yang hasilkan sirap maple.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>869.84,'end_time'=>872.14,'target_text'=>'This is like a big big compound.','source_text'=>'Kawasan perkarangan ni memang sangat luas.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>872.24,'end_time'=>872.94,'target_text'=>'What is this?','source_text'=>'Apa benda ni?','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>873.04,'end_time'=>874.46,'target_text'=>'Detached quarters.','source_text'=>'Kediaman berasingan (detached quarters).','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>874.56,'end_time'=>876.46,'target_text'=>'>> That was probably for the servants.','source_text'=>'>> Yang tu mungkin untuk orang gaji.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>876.56,'end_time'=>877.66,'target_text'=>'>> No, it\'s for the master.','source_text'=>'>> Tak, itu untuk tuan rumah.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>877.76,'end_time'=>880.06,'target_text'=>'A relaxation place for the master.','source_text'=>'Tempat berehat santai untuk tuan rumah.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>880.16,'end_time'=>881.82,'target_text'=>'Look, this was the kitchen where they cooked.','source_text'=>'Tengok ni, ini dapur tempat dorang memasak.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>881.92,'end_time'=>883.18,'target_text'=>'And maybe that\'s where they ate.','source_text'=>'Dan mungkin kat situlah dorang makan.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>883.28,'end_time'=>885.66,'target_text'=>'Yeah, you\'d have to be small to get in there, though.','source_text'=>'Ya, tapi badan kena kecil untuk masuk situ.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>885.76,'end_time'=>887.74,'target_text'=>'This is a nice courtyard here.','source_text'=>'Laman dalam kat sini sangat cantik.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>887.84,'end_time'=>889.58,'target_text'=>'You think that\'s from back in the day?','source_text'=>'Awak rasa benda tu dari zaman purba dulu ke?','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>889.68,'end_time'=>890.78,'target_text'=>'Or is this new?','source_text'=>'Atau ini binaan baru?','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>890.88,'end_time'=>891.9,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s back in the day.','source_text'=>'>> Itu dari zaman dulu.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>892,'end_time'=>897.34,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, they have such like intense security cameras, but all you need is a blink and that shoots in like 4K.','source_text'=>'>> Kawan, kamera litar tertutup (CCTV) dorang canggih betul, tapi awak cuma perlukan kamera Blink je yang boleh rakam 4K.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>897.44,'end_time'=>901.58,'target_text'=>'Okay, well, we just saw the whole house, so let\'s see if we could find the the road.','source_text'=>'Okey, kita dah tengok seluruh rumah ni, jadi jom cari jalan keluar.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>901.68,'end_time'=>903.5,'target_text'=>'That was a little side quest.','source_text'=>'Itu tadi macam misi sampingan (side quest) kecil.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>903.6,'end_time'=>904.78,'target_text'=>'Side quest.','source_text'=>'Misi sampingan.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>904.88,'end_time'=>908.76,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know where we are.','source_text'=>'Saya dah tak tahu kita kat mana sekarang.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>908.96,'end_time'=>910.86,'target_text'=>'Yeah, this is someone\'s house.','source_text'=>'Ya, ini rumah orang.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>910.96,'end_time'=>912.14,'target_text'=>'That was not the right way.','source_text'=>'Itu bukan jalan yang betul.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>912.24,'end_time'=>913.42,'target_text'=>'That was a dead end.','source_text'=>'Itu jalan mati.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>913.52,'end_time'=>915.82,'target_text'=>'A dead end just means you can\'t go any further.','source_text'=>'Jalan mati maksudnya jalan yang terputus dan tak boleh pergi lebih jauh lagi.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>915.92,'end_time'=>917.5,'target_text'=>'>> And why did why did we go there?','source_text'=>'>> Dan kenapa kita pergi ikut jalan tu tadi?','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>917.6,'end_time'=>920.78,'target_text'=>'cuz hopes and prayers >> cuz I wasn\'t directing.','source_text'=>'sebab main redah je >> sebab bukan saya yang tunjuk arah.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>920.88,'end_time'=>922.7,'target_text'=>'So, we went the wrong way.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita dah tersalah jalan.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>922.8,'end_time'=>923.98,'target_text'=>'>> Uh, that\'s not true.','source_text'=>'>> Tak betul tu.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>924.08,'end_time'=>925.42,'target_text'=>'Anyways, that was a dead end.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, itu memang jalan mati.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>925.52,'end_time'=>927.82,'target_text'=>'So, you guys learned a new word, so we couldn\'t go that way.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang dah belajar perkataan baru, dan kita tak boleh lalu jalan tu.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>927.92,'end_time'=>932.76,'target_text'=>'So, now we have to go around hopefully finding another way.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang kita kena pusing balik harapnya jumpa jalan lain.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>932.96,'end_time'=>935.18,'target_text'=>'You can only visit here from 10:00 to 5:00 p.m.','source_text'=>'Korang cuma boleh melawat kat sini dari pukul 10:00 pagi hingga 5:00 petang.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>935.28,'end_time'=>936.86,'target_text'=>'And it\'s closed on Sundays.','source_text'=>'Dan tutup pada hari Ahad.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>936.96,'end_time'=>944.04,'target_text'=>'It\'s a residential area, and if you come outside of visiting hours, you can get fined 100,000 one.','source_text'=>'Ini kawasan perumahan, dan kalau datang luar waktu melawat, boleh kena denda 100,000 won.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>946.4,'end_time'=>952.86,'target_text'=>'Okay, so right behind me is the most popular view of Buchanan Hanok Village, like this road right here.','source_text'=>'Okey, di belakang saya ni pemandangan paling popular di Perkampungan Hanok Bukchon, lorong jalan ni.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>952.96,'end_time'=>956.94,'target_text'=>'And people actually live in all these houses, so you have to be careful like not to make noise.','source_text'=>'Dan orang memang tinggal dalam semua rumah ni, jadi kena berhati-hati jangan buat bising.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>957.04,'end_time'=>959.5,'target_text'=>'Like there are signs everywhere saying you\'ll be fined.','source_text'=>'Ada papan tanda di merata-rata amaran kena denda.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>959.6,'end_time'=>961.66,'target_text'=>'And this person right here is the sheriff.','source_text'=>'Dan orang kat sini ialah pegawai penguat kuasa.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>961.76,'end_time'=>963.42,'target_text'=>'If you make too much noise, he\'ll give you a fine.','source_text'=>'Kalau buat bising sangat, dia akan kenakan denda.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>963.52,'end_time'=>965.74,'target_text'=>'So you got to be quiet cuz people actually live here.','source_text'=>'Jadi kena senyap sebab orang betul-betul tinggal kat sini.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>965.84,'end_time'=>966.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s interesting.','source_text'=>'Menarik sungguh.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>966.56,'end_time'=>967.74,'target_text'=>'I think now we\'re pretty hungry.','source_text'=>'Rasanya sekarang kita dah lapar sangat.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>967.84,'end_time'=>970.14,'target_text'=>'So we\'re going to go get Jokbal pig\'s feet.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita nak pergi makan jokbal, kaki babi.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>970.24,'end_time'=>973.26,'target_text'=>'On that side of the street is a Buddhist temple.','source_text'=>'Di seberang jalan sebelah sana tu ada kuil Buddha.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>973.36,'end_time'=>977.02,'target_text'=>'So, I believe that the second biggest religion in Korea is Buddhism.','source_text'=>'Setahu saya agama kedua terbesar di Korea ialah agama Buddha.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>977.12,'end_time'=>981.02,'target_text'=>'The first is Christianity, but uh this right here is a big Buddhist temple.','source_text'=>'Yang pertama ialah Kristian, tapi yang kat sini kuil Buddha yang besar.','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>981.12,'end_time'=>983.18,'target_text'=>'There are Buddhist temples spread throughout the city.','source_text'=>'Kuil Buddha banyak bertaburan di serata bandar.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>983.28,'end_time'=>984.3,'target_text'=>'But we\'ll cross the street now.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom kita seberang jalan sekarang.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>984.4,'end_time'=>985.42,'target_text'=>'The light just turned red.','source_text'=>'Lampu isyarat baru bertukar merah.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>985.52,'end_time'=>985.98,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom jalan.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>986.08,'end_time'=>987.58,'target_text'=>'That green man means go.','source_text'=>'Simbol orang hijau tu maksudnya boleh jalan.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>987.68,'end_time'=>990.86,'target_text'=>'Dude, these colors are so vibrant.','source_text'=>'Kawan, warna-warni kat sini sangat ceria dan terang.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>990.96,'end_time'=>992.86,'target_text'=>'Wow, look at that design and detail.','source_text'=>'Wah, tengok reka bentuk dan ketelitian ukiran tu.','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>992.96,'end_time'=>995.82,'target_text'=>'I would like to know if this has been restored or if this is original.','source_text'=>'Saya teringin nak tahu sama ada binaan ni pernah dipulihkan atau masih yang asal.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>995.92,'end_time'=>1000.06,'target_text'=>'I feel like it\'s probably been restored since it looks really vibrant, but it looks cool.','source_text'=>'Rasa-rasanya macam dah dipulihkan semula sebab nampak sangat terang warnanya, tapi memang lawa.','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>1000.16,'end_time'=>1001.18,'target_text'=>'This bridge is cool.','source_text'=>'Jambatan ni cantik.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>1001.28,'end_time'=>1003.66,'target_text'=>'There\'s a heart around the bridge.','source_text'=>'Ada bentuk hati di sekeliling jambatan.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>1003.76,'end_time'=>1004.94,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if this means anything.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu ada maksud tersirat ke tak.','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>1005.04,'end_time'=>1008.68,'target_text'=>'Maybe it means I\'m gonna find love or something.','source_text'=>'Mungkin petanda saya akan jumpa jodoh ke apa.','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>1010.16,'end_time'=>1013.1,'target_text'=>'It looks like there\'s currently people praying inside there.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya ada penganut sedang beribadat kat dalam tu sekarang.','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>1013.2,'end_time'=>1014.22,'target_text'=>'I\'m not a Buddhist.','source_text'=>'Saya bukan penganut Buddha.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>1014.32,'end_time'=>1017.18,'target_text'=>'I won\'t be praying today, but there are people praying in there.','source_text'=>'Saya takkan bersembahyang hari ini, tapi ada orang tengah bersembahyang kat dalam.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>1017.28,'end_time'=>1020.3,'target_text'=>'This whole thing used to be the restaurant and now I just think it\'s upstairs.','source_text'=>'Dulu seluruh bangunan ni restoran, sekarang rasanya cuma tingkat atas.','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>1020.4,'end_time'=>1020.94,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, really?','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ya ke?','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>1021.04,'end_time'=>1023.82,'target_text'=>'>> This whole thing was not KBBQ.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan semua ni kedai K-BBQ.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1023.92,'end_time'=>1024.7,'target_text'=>'This is the restaurant.','source_text'=>'Inilah restorannya.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1024.8,'end_time'=>1026.3,'target_text'=>'You can see this is what we\'re going to get.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh tengok inilah hidangan yang kita nak pesan.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1026.4,'end_time'=>1027.98,'target_text'=>'This one, Job Bal.','source_text'=>'Yang ini, Jokbal.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1028.08,'end_time'=>1031.02,'target_text'=>'In English, it\'s called pig\'s feet or pig trotters.','source_text'=>'Dalam bahasa Inggeris dipanggil pig\'s feet atau pig trotters.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1031.12,'end_time'=>1034.06,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go in and see if they\'re open.','source_text'=>'Jom masuk dan tengok sama ada buka ke tak.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1034.16,'end_time'=>1035.66,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we got this.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi kita dah dapat pesanan ni.','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1035.76,'end_time'=>1036.94,'target_text'=>'That\'s what we got.','source_text'=>'Itulah yang kita dapat.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1037.04,'end_time'=>1039.1,'target_text'=>'Chbbo pigs feet for two to three people.','source_text'=>'Jokbal untuk dua hingga tiga orang makan.','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1039.2,'end_time'=>1039.9,'target_text'=>'That\'s the portion size.','source_text'=>'Itu saiz hidangannya.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1040,'end_time'=>1041.5,'target_text'=>'We got 39,0001.','source_text'=>'Harga dia 39,000 won.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1041.6,'end_time'=>1043.42,'target_text'=>'This is our hunchan hunchan.','source_text'=>'Ini banchan (hidangan sampingan) kita.','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>1043.52,'end_time'=>1044.46,'target_text'=>'We have some sides here.','source_text'=>'Kita ada hidangan sampingan kat sini.','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>1044.56,'end_time'=>1045.82,'target_text'=>'This is very salty.','source_text'=>'Yang ini sangat masin.','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>1045.92,'end_time'=>1047.58,'target_text'=>'These are like mini shrimp.','source_text'=>'Ini macam udang geragau kecil.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>1047.68,'end_time'=>1048.86,'target_text'=>'This is like a side sauce.','source_text'=>'Ini macam sos cicah pencicah.','order'=>460],
            ['start_time'=>1048.96,'end_time'=>1051.66,'target_text'=>'And then this is like just garlic, peppers.','source_text'=>'Dan lepas tu ini bawang putih dan cili.','order'=>461],
            ['start_time'=>1051.76,'end_time'=>1053.82,'target_text'=>'Okay guys, so I have my bowl here.','source_text'=>'Okey kawan-kawan, saya ada mangkuk saya kat sini.','order'=>462],
            ['start_time'=>1053.92,'end_time'=>1055.42,'target_text'=>'We have the jokal here.','source_text'=>'Kita ada jokbal kat sini.','order'=>463],
            ['start_time'=>1055.52,'end_time'=>1059.74,'target_text'=>'We have the sides, a salad, and the lettuce here.','source_text'=>'Kita ada hidangan sampingan, salad, dan daun salad segar kat sini.','order'=>464],
            ['start_time'=>1059.84,'end_time'=>1063.42,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to use this ladle to dish up some of this soup.','source_text'=>'Saya akan guna senduk ni untuk cedok sup ni.','order'=>465],
            ['start_time'=>1063.52,'end_time'=>1068.54,'target_text'=>'This soup comes with it for free, but if you want to get it refilled, it cost 15,0001.','source_text'=>'Sup ni dapat percuma sekali hidangan, tapi kalau nak tambah kena bayar 15,000 won.','order'=>466],
            ['start_time'=>1068.64,'end_time'=>1069.82,'target_text'=>'But this soup is very good.','source_text'=>'Tapi sup ni memang sangat sedap.','order'=>467],
            ['start_time'=>1069.92,'end_time'=>1071.82,'target_text'=>'And it is freezing outside.','source_text'=>'Dan cuaca kat luar tersangat sejuk beku.','order'=>468],
            ['start_time'=>1071.92,'end_time'=>1074.38,'target_text'=>'It is very cold outside, so it\'s nice to have this soup.','source_text'=>'Cuaca luar memang sangat sejuk, jadi dapat hirup sup panas ni memang nikmat.','order'=>469],
            ['start_time'=>1074.48,'end_time'=>1076.86,'target_text'=>'And on the side here, we have spoons.','source_text'=>'Dan kat sebelah tepi ni ada sudu.','order'=>470],
            ['start_time'=>1076.96,'end_time'=>1078.38,'target_text'=>'And here we have cups.','source_text'=>'Dan kat sini ada cawan.','order'=>471],
            ['start_time'=>1078.48,'end_time'=>1079.34,'target_text'=>'This is a cup.','source_text'=>'Ini cawan.','order'=>472],
            ['start_time'=>1079.44,'end_time'=>1080.46,'target_text'=>'This is a glass.','source_text'=>'Ini gelas.','order'=>473],
            ['start_time'=>1080.56,'end_time'=>1084.14,'target_text'=>'A glass here is made out of glass.','source_text'=>'Gelas kat sini diperbuat daripada kaca.','order'=>474],
            ['start_time'=>1084.24,'end_time'=>1086.7,'target_text'=>'And a cup is made out of a different material.','source_text'=>'Dan cawan dibuat daripada bahan berbeza.','order'=>475],
            ['start_time'=>1086.8,'end_time'=>1087.82,'target_text'=>'This one is plastic.','source_text'=>'Yang ini diperbuat daripada plastik.','order'=>476],
            ['start_time'=>1087.92,'end_time'=>1090.22,'target_text'=>'And here these are shot glasses.','source_text'=>'Dan yang ini pula gelas syot (shot glasses).','order'=>477],
            ['start_time'=>1090.32,'end_time'=>1091.9,'target_text'=>'Let me try the soup.','source_text'=>'Biar saya rasa sup ni dulu.','order'=>478],
            ['start_time'=>1092,'end_time'=>1092.86,'target_text'=>'Misoy.','source_text'=>'Macam sup miso.','order'=>479],
            ['start_time'=>1092.96,'end_time'=>1095.58,'target_text'=>'Now the star of the show, Jopal.','source_text'=>'Sekarang bintang utama hidangan hari ini, Jokbal.','order'=>480],
            ['start_time'=>1095.68,'end_time'=>1099.1,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to get my chopsticks and let\'s try this.','source_text'=>'Saya ambil penyepit dan jom kita cuba rasa.','order'=>481],
            ['start_time'=>1099.2,'end_time'=>1100.78,'target_text'=>'This is my personal rule.','source_text'=>'Ini prinsip peribadi saya.','order'=>482],
            ['start_time'=>1100.88,'end_time'=>1104.6,'target_text'=>'The first bite is just always straight','source_text'=>'Suapan pertama sentiasa makan kosong macam tu je','order'=>483],
            ['start_time'=>1105.44,'end_time'=>1108.12,'target_text'=>'with a little bit of pigkin.','source_text'=>'dengan sedikit kulit babi.','order'=>484],
            ['start_time'=>1108.4,'end_time'=>1108.86,'target_text'=>'Very good.','source_text'=>'Sangat sedap.','order'=>485],
            ['start_time'=>1108.96,'end_time'=>1113.34,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to finish eating this and uh we\'ll show you guys when we finish.','source_text'=>'Kami nak habiskan makanan ni dan kami tunjukkan bila dah selesai nanti.','order'=>486],
            ['start_time'=>1113.44,'end_time'=>1113.98,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys.','source_text'=>'Okey kawan-kawan.','order'=>487],
            ['start_time'=>1114.08,'end_time'=>1115.82,'target_text'=>'This is the aftermath.','source_text'=>'Inilah hasil licinnya.','order'=>488],
            ['start_time'=>1115.92,'end_time'=>1117.5,'target_text'=>'We ate everything off the bone.','source_text'=>'Kami makan licin sampai tinggal tulang je.','order'=>489],
            ['start_time'=>1117.6,'end_time'=>1118.46,'target_text'=>'You can see the bone there.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak tulang kat situ.','order'=>490],
            ['start_time'=>1118.56,'end_time'=>1119.42,'target_text'=>'>> What did you think of it?','source_text'=>'>> Apa pendapat awak pasal makanan tadi?','order'=>491],
            ['start_time'=>1119.52,'end_time'=>1120.06,'target_text'=>'>> It was good.','source_text'=>'>> Sedap gila.','order'=>492],
            ['start_time'=>1120.16,'end_time'=>1120.94,'target_text'=>'I like chop.','source_text'=>'Saya suka jokbal.','order'=>493],
            ['start_time'=>1121.04,'end_time'=>1123.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s one of my favorite Korean foods.','source_text'=>'Antara makanan Korea kegemaran saya.','order'=>494],
            ['start_time'=>1123.12,'end_time'=>1125.74,'target_text'=>'And it sounds weird, like pig\'s feet, but it is really good.','source_text'=>'Bunyi macam pelik, kaki babi kan, tapi memang sangat sedap.','order'=>495],
            ['start_time'=>1125.84,'end_time'=>1128.06,'target_text'=>'You should definitely try it if you ever visit Korea.','source_text'=>'Korang wajib cuba kalau ada peluang melancong ke Korea.','order'=>496],
            ['start_time'=>1128.16,'end_time'=>1130.54,'target_text'=>'But now we\'re going to head back outside into the freezing cold.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang kita kena keluar balik meredah cuaca sejuk beku.','order'=>497],
            ['start_time'=>1130.64,'end_time'=>1136.78,'target_text'=>'So, okay, we just had uh dinner, guys, and I can\'t I can\'t stop moving or I\'m going to freeze to death.','source_text'=>'Okey, kami baru lepas makan malam kawan-kawan, dan saya tak boleh berhenti bergerak kalau tak saya mati kesejukan.','order'=>498],
            ['start_time'=>1136.88,'end_time'=>1141.5,'target_text'=>'Anyways, this is a river that stretches for like miles and miles.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, ini sungai yang mengalir berbatu-batu jauhnya.','order'=>499],
            ['start_time'=>1141.6,'end_time'=>1144.78,'target_text'=>'This river right here stretches uh for a very long time.','source_text'=>'Sungai kat sini memang sangat panjang jajarannya.','order'=>500],
            ['start_time'=>1144.88,'end_time'=>1145.82,'target_text'=>'>> Is that the Han River?','source_text'=>'>> Itu Sungai Han ke?','order'=>501],
            ['start_time'=>1145.92,'end_time'=>1147.18,'target_text'=>'>> No, this is not the Han River.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, ini bukan Sungai Han.','order'=>502],
            ['start_time'=>1147.28,'end_time'=>1149.9,'target_text'=>'This is I don\'t know what it\'s called, but it stretches like really far.','source_text'=>'Ini— saya tak tahu apa nama sungai ni (Cheonggyecheon), tapi mengalir sangat jauh.','order'=>503],
            ['start_time'=>1150,'end_time'=>1153.1,'target_text'=>'You could walk along the whole thing and it\'ll take you like over an hour for sure.','source_text'=>'Awak boleh jalan kaki sepanjang tebing sungai ni dan memang ambil masa lebih sejam.','order'=>504],
            ['start_time'=>1153.2,'end_time'=>1155.26,'target_text'=>'But it\'s a really nice place to come walking at night.','source_text'=>'Tapi ini tempat yang sangat menarik untuk jalan-jalan waktu malam.','order'=>505],
            ['start_time'=>1155.36,'end_time'=>1159.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s a little cold now, so I got to keep moving to keep my blood pumping so I don\'t get cold.','source_text'=>'Sekarang agak sejuk, jadi saya kena terus berjalan supaya darah mengalir lancar dan tak kesejukan.','order'=>506],
            ['start_time'=>1159.84,'end_time'=>1163.58,'target_text'=>'So, this is one of the bigger L department stores here.','source_text'=>'Ini salah satu gedung membeli-belah Lotte yang lebih besar di sini.','order'=>507],
            ['start_time'=>1163.68,'end_time'=>1165.18,'target_text'=>'Like, it\'s actually huge.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat besar.','order'=>508],
            ['start_time'=>1165.28,'end_time'=>1167.9,'target_text'=>'Yeah, this whole building I think is L department store.','source_text'=>'Ya, seluruh bangunan ni rasanya gedung membeli-belah Lotte.','order'=>509],
            ['start_time'=>1168,'end_time'=>1170.86,'target_text'=>'This is the main main like street food street.','source_text'=>'Ini jalan utama tumpuan makanan jalanan.','order'=>510],
            ['start_time'=>1170.96,'end_time'=>1172.86,'target_text'=>'Like you can see street food all on the side there.','source_text'=>'Awak boleh nampak gerai-gerai makanan jalanan di sepanjang laluan tu.','order'=>511],
            ['start_time'=>1172.96,'end_time'=>1174.54,'target_text'=>'The guy has eggs for days, man.','source_text'=>'Banyak gila telur mamat tu ada, bertimbun-timbun kawan.','order'=>512],
            ['start_time'=>1174.64,'end_time'=>1178.06,'target_text'=>'Like this whole street is just the all filled with street food.','source_text'=>'Seluruh jalan ni memang dipenuhi dengan makanan jalanan.','order'=>513],
            ['start_time'=>1178.16,'end_time'=>1180.62,'target_text'=>'Obviously, it\'s very touristic and very overpriced.','source_text'=>'Sudah tentu kawasan ni sangat tumpuan pelancong dan harga agak melampau.','order'=>514],
            ['start_time'=>1180.72,'end_time'=>1182.46,'target_text'=>'This is like a really touristic area.','source_text'=>'Ini memang kawasan tumpuan pelancong.','order'=>515],
            ['start_time'=>1182.56,'end_time'=>1185.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s nice to see, but uh all the food here is overpriced.','source_text'=>'Seronok tengok suasananya, tapi makanan kat sini agak mahal melampau.','order'=>516],
            ['start_time'=>1185.44,'end_time'=>1187.66,'target_text'=>'So, if you want other food, it\'s cheaper to buy somewhere else.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kalau nak cari makanan lain, lebih murah beli kat tempat lain.','order'=>517],
            ['start_time'=>1187.76,'end_time'=>1190.46,'target_text'=>'But, we just ate, so I\'m not really looking for anything to eat.','source_text'=>'Tapi kami baru lepas makan, jadi saya takdelah cari apa-apa makanan.','order'=>518],
            ['start_time'=>1190.56,'end_time'=>1193.08,'target_text'=>'Like, I\'m kind of full.','source_text'=>'Perut pun dah agak kenyang.','order'=>519],
            ['start_time'=>1195.2,'end_time'=>1197.5,'target_text'=>'>> This is like a super popular store apparently.','source_text'=>'>> Kedai ni rupa-rupanya sangat popular.','order'=>520],
            ['start_time'=>1197.6,'end_time'=>1198.3,'target_text'=>'Blue Elephant.','source_text'=>'Blue Elephant.','order'=>521],
            ['start_time'=>1198.4,'end_time'=>1199.74,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re going to go in there and check it out.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita nak masuk dan tengok-tengok kat dalam.','order'=>522],
            ['start_time'=>1199.84,'end_time'=>1202.14,'target_text'=>'Glasses don\'t really look good on me, but go try them out.','source_text'=>'Cermin mata tak berapa sesuai dengan muka saya, tapi pergilah cuba pakai.','order'=>523],
            ['start_time'=>1202.24,'end_time'=>1205.74,'target_text'=>'Dude, these look like the Meta Ray bands, and I do not like the way those look.','source_text'=>'Kawan, rekaan ni nampak macam cermin mata Meta Ray-Ban, dan saya tak suka rupa dia.','order'=>524],
            ['start_time'=>1205.84,'end_time'=>1207.02,'target_text'=>'>> Sorry to break it to you, bud.','source_text'=>'>> Maaf cakaplah kawan.','order'=>525],
            ['start_time'=>1207.12,'end_time'=>1207.66,'target_text'=>'>> Chopped.','source_text'=>'>> Buruk betul rupanya.','order'=>526],
            ['start_time'=>1207.76,'end_time'=>1209.56,'target_text'=>'>> Chopped.','source_text'=>'>> Memang tak kena langsung.','order'=>527],
            ['start_time'=>1212.16,'end_time'=>1214.78,'target_text'=>'>> Bro, the Korean snack from Squid Games.','source_text'=>'>> Bro, snek Korea macam dalam siri Squid Game.','order'=>528],
            ['start_time'=>1214.88,'end_time'=>1215.98,'target_text'=>'We have to get it.','source_text'=>'Kita kena beli ni.','order'=>529],
            ['start_time'=>1216.08,'end_time'=>1216.86,'target_text'=>'>> What about hot dog?','source_text'=>'>> Macam mana dengan hotteok?','order'=>530],
            ['start_time'=>1216.96,'end_time'=>1218.62,'target_text'=>'>> Hot dog is That is good.','source_text'=>'>> Hotteok tu sedap.','order'=>531],
            ['start_time'=>1218.72,'end_time'=>1222.78,'target_text'=>'Can I have a >> We just ate, so I\'m not really looking for anything to eat.','source_text'=>'Boleh saya dapatkan— >> Kita baru lepas makan, jadi saya takdelah nak makan sangat.','order'=>532],
            ['start_time'=>1222.88,'end_time'=>1224.14,'target_text'=>'>> Brown sugar hot dog.','source_text'=>'>> Hotteok gula perang.','order'=>533],
            ['start_time'=>1224.24,'end_time'=>1224.94,'target_text'=>'Just one, >> dude.','source_text'=>'Satu je, >> bro.','order'=>534],
            ['start_time'=>1225.04,'end_time'=>1226.3,'target_text'=>'That\'s all that\'s inside.','source_text'=>'Itu je inti kat dalam.','order'=>535],
            ['start_time'=>1226.4,'end_time'=>1227.38,'target_text'=>'Oh, all of this.','source_text'=>'Oh, semua benda ni.','order'=>536],
            ['start_time'=>1227.48,'end_time'=>1229.1,'target_text'=>'[laughter] Oh, >> be very careful.','source_text'=>'[ketawa] Oh, >> hati-hati betul-betul.','order'=>537],
            ['start_time'=>1229.2,'end_time'=>1229.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s hot.','source_text'=>'Panas ni.','order'=>538],
            ['start_time'=>1229.92,'end_time'=>1231.26,'target_text'=>'>> Have you burnt your mouth on that?','source_text'=>'>> Mulut awak pernah melecur makan benda tu?','order'=>539],
            ['start_time'=>1231.36,'end_time'=>1231.98,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I have.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, pernah.','order'=>540],
            ['start_time'=>1232.08,'end_time'=>1233.42,'target_text'=>'Cuz it\'s it\'s sugar.','source_text'=>'Sebab inti dia gula cair panas.','order'=>541],
            ['start_time'=>1233.52,'end_time'=>1234.46,'target_text'=>'You can see that\'s how they put it.','source_text'=>'Awak boleh tengok macam tu cara dia letak.','order'=>542],
            ['start_time'=>1234.56,'end_time'=>1236.06,'target_text'=>'He puts it in the oil.','source_text'=>'Dia masukkan ke dalam minyak panas.','order'=>543],
            ['start_time'=>1236.16,'end_time'=>1237.96,'target_text'=>'>> Oh,','source_text'=>'>> Oh,','order'=>544],
            ['start_time'=>1239.36,'end_time'=>1239.68,'target_text'=>'yeah.','source_text'=>'ya.','order'=>545],
            ['start_time'=>1239.68,'end_time'=>1241.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s not It\'s not boiling hot.','source_text'=>'Tak adalah panas menggelegak sangat.','order'=>546],
            ['start_time'=>1241.44,'end_time'=>1242.86,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s good.','source_text'=>'>> Eloklah macam tu.','order'=>547],
            ['start_time'=>1242.96,'end_time'=>1247.34,'target_text'=>'>> This is like a one of the most popular and a traditional Korean snack.','source_text'=>'>> Ini salah satu snek tradisional Korea yang paling popular.','order'=>548],
            ['start_time'=>1247.44,'end_time'=>1252.78,'target_text'=>'There\'s like brown sugar, cinnamon, peanuts, and sunflower seeds all inside here.','source_text'=>'Ada gula perang, serbuk kayu manis, kacang tanah, dan kuaci bunga matahari dalam inti ni.','order'=>549],
            ['start_time'=>1252.88,'end_time'=>1255.26,'target_text'=>'Okay, we just finished at Maongdong Market.','source_text'=>'Okey, kita baru je selesai di Pasar Myeongdong.','order'=>550],
            ['start_time'=>1255.36,'end_time'=>1256.86,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re going to head back home.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita nak balik ke penginapan.','order'=>551],
            ['start_time'=>1256.96,'end_time'=>1257.66,'target_text'=>'We\'ll head back now.','source_text'=>'Kita gerak balik sekarang.','order'=>552],
            ['start_time'=>1257.76,'end_time'=>1258.46,'target_text'=>'Let\'s take the subway.','source_text'=>'Jom naik subway.','order'=>553],
            ['start_time'=>1258.56,'end_time'=>1263.34,'target_text'=>'We got to walk a little bit down this way, but uh it shouldn\'t be that long cuz the green line will take us all the way to','source_text'=>'Kita kena jalan kaki sikit ke arah ni, tapi tak lama pun sebab laluan hijau akan bawa kita terus ke','order'=>554],
            ['start_time'=>1263.44,'end_time'=>1263.9,'target_text'=>'Hung Day.','source_text'=>'Hongdae.','order'=>555],
            ['start_time'=>1264,'end_time'=>1266.92,'target_text'=>'And that\'s the green line up there.','source_text'=>'Dan itu laluan hijau kat atas sana.','order'=>556],
            ['start_time'=>1269.12,'end_time'=>1270.94,'target_text'=>'>> In this lesson, I want you to shadow.','source_text'=>'>> Dalam pelajaran ini, saya nak anda buat teknik shadowing.','order'=>557],
            ['start_time'=>1271.04,'end_time'=>1274.22,'target_text'=>'Heading to up here down the escalators map.','source_text'=>'Menuju ke atas sini turun eskalator peta.','order'=>558],
            ['start_time'=>1274.32,'end_time'=>1275.26,'target_text'=>'Let me open up the map.','source_text'=>'Biar saya buka peta.','order'=>559],
            ['start_time'=>1275.36,'end_time'=>1276.3,'target_text'=>'Vending machines.','source_text'=>'Mesin layan diri.','order'=>560],
            ['start_time'=>1276.4,'end_time'=>1276.8,'target_text'=>'>> Serious.','source_text'=>'>> Serius.','order'=>561],
            ['start_time'=>1276.88,'end_time'=>1277.42,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m serious.','source_text'=>'>> Saya serius.','order'=>562],
            ['start_time'=>1277.52,'end_time'=>1278.46,'target_text'=>'A moving walkway.','source_text'=>'Laluan pejalan kaki bergerak.','order'=>563],
            ['start_time'=>1278.56,'end_time'=>1279.02,'target_text'=>'So popular.','source_text'=>'Sangat popular.','order'=>564],
            ['start_time'=>1279.12,'end_time'=>1279.74,'target_text'=>'>> Take a flick of that.','source_text'=>'>> Ambil gambar benda tu.','order'=>565],
