            ['start_time'=>212.88,'end_time'=>217.74,'target_text'=>'So, we stopped at the 7-Eleven, but all we got was just some drinks.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami singgah di 7-Eleven, tapi apa yang kami beli cuma minuman.','order'=>45],
