            ['start_time'=>256.08,'end_time'=>262.46,'target_text'=>'But you can see here Leon changed into shorts because I imagine he was probably very hot.','source_text'=>'Tapi korang boleh nampak Leon tukar pakai seluar pendek sebab saya rasa dia mesti rasa panas gila.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>262.56,'end_time'=>263.5,'target_text'=>'Same as I was.','source_text'=>'Sama macam saya juga.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>263.6,'end_time'=>266.7,'target_text'=>'So, and this is also an interesting question.','source_text'=>'Dan ini juga satu soalan yang menarik.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>266.8,'end_time'=>270.78,'target_text'=>'Do you prefer warm weather or cold weather?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda lebih gemar cuaca panas atau cuaca sejuk?','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>270.88,'end_time'=>272.54,'target_text'=>'Warm weather or cold weather?','source_text'=>'Cuaca panas atau cuaca sejuk?','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>272.64,'end_time'=>276.54,'target_text'=>'And to answer this question, I want you guys to write it in the comments.','source_text'=>'Dan untuk jawab soalan ini, saya nak korang tuliskan jawapan di ruangan komen.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>276.64,'end_time'=>278.14,'target_text'=>'What do you prefer?','source_text'=>'Yang mana satu pilihan anda?','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>278.24,'end_time'=>280.62,'target_text'=>'Warm weather or cold weather?','source_text'=>'Cuaca panas atau sejuk?','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>280.72,'end_time'=>282.86,'target_text'=>'And then tell me where do you live?','source_text'=>'Dan lepas tu beritahu saya di mana anda tinggal?','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>282.96,'end_time'=>288.78,'target_text'=>'Do you live somewhere that has cold weather or is it just warm all year round?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda tinggal di tempat yang beriklim sejuk atau cuacanya panas sepanjang tahun?','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>288.88,'end_time'=>294.62,'target_text'=>'Me personally, I prefer warm weather just because it\'s more comfortable.','source_text'=>'Secara peribadi, saya lebih gemar cuaca panas sebab rasa lebih selesa.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>294.72,'end_time'=>300.86,'target_text'=>'When it\'s cold, I have to put on so many layers just to stay warm and even then it\'s cold.','source_text'=>'Bila cuaca sejuk, saya terpaksa pakai baju berlapis-lapis untuk kekal hangat dan itu pun masih rasa sejuk.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>300.96,'end_time'=>310.06,'target_text'=>'And the thing about that is is that even if you put on so many layers of clothes and then you finally get warm, what do you','source_text'=>'Dan masalahnya adalah walaupun dah pakai pakaian tebal berlapis-lapis dan akhirnya rasa hangat, apa yang anda','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>310.16,'end_time'=>312.06,'target_text'=>'do when you enter a building?','source_text'=>'buat bila masuk ke dalam bangunan?','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>312.16,'end_time'=>316.3,'target_text'=>'You have to take off all your clothes and then you just have to carry that around.','source_text'=>'Anda terpaksa tanggalkan semua baju tebal tu dan kena usung ke sana ke mari.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>316.4,'end_time'=>321.34,'target_text'=>'So it\'s very inconvenient in my opinion to live somewhere that\'s cold.','source_text'=>'Jadi pada pandangan saya sangat leceh tinggal di tempat yang beriklim sejuk.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>321.44,'end_time'=>323.42,'target_text'=>'That\'s my experience living in Canada.','source_text'=>'Itulah pengalaman saya tinggal di Kanada.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>323.52,'end_time'=>326.06,'target_text'=>'That\'s one of the reasons I prefer warmer weather.','source_text'=>'Itu salah satu sebab kenapa saya lebih suka cuaca yang lebih panas.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>326.16,'end_time'=>329.42,'target_text'=>'Another reason is just I like to be warm.','source_text'=>'Sebab lain ialah saya memang suka rasa hangat.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>329.52,'end_time'=>330.62,'target_text'=>'I don\'t like to be cold.','source_text'=>'Saya tak suka rasa kesejukan.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>330.72,'end_time'=>331.66,'target_text'=>'Simple as that.','source_text'=>'Mudah macam tu je.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>331.76,'end_time'=>337.1,'target_text'=>'I would rather sweat and be warm outside than be freezing cold outside.','source_text'=>'Saya lebih rela berpeluh dan rasa hangat di luar daripada menggigil kesejukan di luar.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>337.2,'end_time'=>338.38,'target_text'=>'That\'s just my opinion.','source_text'=>'Itu cuma pandangan peribadi saya.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>338.48,'end_time'=>343.18,'target_text'=>'We ended up eating dinner at a restaurant very close to our hotel.','source_text'=>'Kami akhirnya makan malam di restoran yang sangat dekat dengan hotel kami.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>343.28,'end_time'=>347.26,'target_text'=>'I believe it was uh pig\'s feet or something similar to this.','source_text'=>'Rasanya hidangan kaki babi atau sesuatu yang serupa macam tu.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>347.36,'end_time'=>348.54,'target_text'=>'But it was it was very good.','source_text'=>'Tapi rasanya sangat sedap.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>348.64,'end_time'=>350.7,'target_text'=>'I really I really enjoyed that meal.','source_text'=>'Saya betul-betul menikmati hidangan tu.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>350.8,'end_time'=>352.78,'target_text'=>'It was like very like sweet.','source_text'=>'Rasanya ada sedikit manis.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>352.88,'end_time'=>354.14,'target_text'=>'I like sweet foods.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka makanan yang ada rasa manis.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>354.24,'end_time'=>356.62,'target_text'=>'For my first meal in Thailand, it was very good.','source_text'=>'Sebagai hidangan pertama saya di Thailand, memang sangat memuaskan.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>356.72,'end_time'=>359.74,'target_text'=>'So, our second day in Thailand, I went to a mall.','source_text'=>'Jadi, pada hari kedua kami di Thailand, saya pergi ke pusat beli-belah.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>359.84,'end_time'=>364.3,'target_text'=>'I believe it was called Emporium or something like that.','source_text'=>'Rasanya nama pusat beli-belah tu Emporium atau seumpamanya.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>364.4,'end_time'=>365.66,'target_text'=>'Emporium.','source_text'=>'Emporium.','order'=>90],
