            ['start_time'=>367.12,'end_time'=>371.66,'target_text'=>'So, if you\'ve been to Thailand or you\'re from Thailand, you know which mall I\'m talking about.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau anda pernah ke Thailand atau berasal dari Thailand, anda mesti tahu pusat beli-belah mana yang saya maksudkan.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>371.76,'end_time'=>380.38,'target_text'=>'And uh yeah, I found it pretty cool and interesting that despite the super warm weather, they still had a Christmas tree.','source_text'=>'Dan ya, saya rasa sangat menarik kerana walaupun cuaca sangat panas, mereka tetap ada pokok Krismas.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>380.48,'end_time'=>385.1,'target_text'=>'And they even made it look like there was snow on the Christmas tree, which I found interesting.','source_text'=>'Malah mereka buat pokok Krismas tu nampak macam diselaputi salji, sesuatu yang agak unik bagi saya.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>385.2,'end_time'=>387.66,'target_text'=>'And then they also had ornaments on the Christmas tree.','source_text'=>'Dan mereka juga gantung hiasan perhiasan pada pokok Krismas tu.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>387.76,'end_time'=>391.18,'target_text'=>'Like I can see some butterflies there and dragonflies.','source_text'=>'Macam saya boleh nampak ada rama-rama dan pepatung kat situ.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>391.28,'end_time'=>395.34,'target_text'=>'And at the top there is a heart, a red heart.','source_text'=>'Dan di bahagian puncak paling atas ada bentuk hati berwarna merah.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>395.44,'end_time'=>397.42,'target_text'=>'So I I thought that was pretty cool.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa benda tu agak menarik.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>397.52,'end_time'=>398.78,'target_text'=>'So I took a video of it.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya pun rakamlah video pokok tu.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>398.88,'end_time'=>403.42,'target_text'=>'And believe it or not, I have never ridden on the back of a motorcycle.','source_text'=>'Dan percaya atau tidak, saya tak pernah membonceng di belakang motosikal seumur hidup saya.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>403.52,'end_time'=>410.46,'target_text'=>'I have ridden a motorcycle as the driver, but I\'ve never ridden on the back of a motorcycle as a passenger.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah menunggang motosikal sebagai penunggang, tapi tak pernah duduk di belakang sebagai pembonceng.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>410.56,'end_time'=>412.06,'target_text'=>'This was my first time.','source_text'=>'Ini kali pertama saya.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>412.16,'end_time'=>414.54,'target_text'=>'It was, you know, a little bit sketchy.','source_text'=>'Ia agak mengerikan dan mendebarkan juga.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>414.64,'end_time'=>421.58,'target_text'=>'So, I had both hands at the back here, but obviously when I was taking this video, I had one only one hand on the back.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya pegang pemegang belakang dengan kedua-dua belah tangan, tapi masa rakam video ni saya cuma guna sebelah tangan pegang belakang.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>421.68,'end_time'=>423.26,'target_text'=>'The other one was filming.','source_text'=>'Sebelah tangan lagi tengah pegang telefon merakam.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>423.36,'end_time'=>426.22,'target_text'=>'And yeah, you could see Leon there on his scooter.','source_text'=>'Dan ya, korang boleh nampak Leon kat sana naik skuter dia.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>426.32,'end_time'=>432.54,'target_text'=>'And when I was holding out my phone to record and film, I was afraid I was going to drop my phone cuz my phone is kind of','source_text'=>'Dan masa saya hulurkan telefon untuk rakam video, saya takut sangat telefon saya terlepas jatuh sebab telefon saya agak','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>432.64,'end_time'=>436.06,'target_text'=>'big, so it\'s kind of hard to get a good grip on it.','source_text'=>'besar, jadi agak sukar nak genggam dengan kemas.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>436.16,'end_time'=>438.46,'target_text'=>'So, uh, I really had to hold it tight.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya terpaksa pegang sekuat hati.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>438.56,'end_time'=>441.82,'target_text'=>'But, I actually bought something today to help with that.','source_text'=>'Tapi sebenarnya saya ada beli sesuatu hari ini untuk selesaikan masalah tu.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>441.92,'end_time'=>443.66,'target_text'=>'Let me show you guys.','source_text'=>'Biar saya tunjukkan pada korang.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>443.76,'end_time'=>451.58,'target_text'=>'The most important part of learning a language and the reason why everyone learns a language is to be able to speak the language.','source_text'=>'Bahagian paling penting belajar bahasa dan sebab semua orang belajar bahasa adalah untuk boleh bercakap bahasa tersebut.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>451.68,'end_time'=>453.82,'target_text'=>'These videos help you with your listening.','source_text'=>'Video-video ini bantu pendengaran anda.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>453.92,'end_time'=>456.62,'target_text'=>'But how can you practice your speaking even more?','source_text'=>'Tapi macam mana anda nak latih pertuturan dengan lebih mantap?','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>456.72,'end_time'=>459.1,'target_text'=>'You need to practice by shadowing.','source_text'=>'Anda perlu berlatih melalui kaedah shadowing (meniru sebutan).','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>459.2,'end_time'=>466.22,'target_text'=>'Shadowing is just repeating after a native English speaker to practice your pronunciation, your accent, and your confidence.','source_text'=>'Shadowing adalah mengulang sebutan penutur jati bahasa Inggeris untuk melatih sebutan, slanga, dan keyakinan anda.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>466.32,'end_time'=>471.66,'target_text'=>'and I\'ve started making videos specifically just to practice those three things.','source_text'=>'dan saya dah mula buat video khas semata-mata untuk melatih tiga perkara tersebut.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>471.76,'end_time'=>477.66,'target_text'=>'So, if you guys want to become more confident in English and become truly fluent, check out my Patreon in the description','source_text'=>'Jadi, kalau korang nak lebih yakin berbahasa Inggeris dan benar-benar fasih, lihat Patreon saya di ruang deskripsi','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>477.76,'end_time'=>486.06,'target_text'=>'where I give you guys three new videos every week to practice your pronunciation, your accent, and most importantly, your','source_text'=>'di mana saya sediakan tiga video baharu setiap minggu untuk latih sebutan, slanga, dan paling penting,','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>486.16,'end_time'=>486.86,'target_text'=>'confidence.','source_text'=>'keyakinan anda.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>486.96,'end_time'=>488.14,'target_text'=>'I\'ll see you guys there.','source_text'=>'Kita jumpa di sana.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>488.24,'end_time'=>496.06,'target_text'=>'We are going to be learning English as I clean up my pronunciation, your accent, your rhythm, and your confidence.','source_text'=>'Kita akan belajar bahasa Inggeris sambil memantapkan sebutan, slanga, rentak percakapan, dan keyakinan anda.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>496.16,'end_time'=>500.78,'target_text'=>'It was just a roundabout way of her politely trying to spare my feelings.','source_text'=>'Itu cuma cara berlapik dia cuba jaga perasaan saya secara sopan.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>500.88,'end_time'=>508.38,'target_text'=>'The a-hole for giving all of my co-workers a different reason for why I have missing fingers so I wouldn\'t take legal came','source_text'=>'Si celaka tu sebab beritahu semua rakan sekerja pelbagai alasan kenapa jari saya hilang supaya saya tak ambil tindakan undang-undang','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>508.48,'end_time'=>511.74,'target_text'=>'down to he companywide training on his behavior.','source_text'=>'sampai kena buat latihan seluruh syarikat mengenai kelakuannya.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>511.84,'end_time'=>512.7,'target_text'=>'He chooses not.','source_text'=>'Dia pilih untuk tak ikut.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>512.8,'end_time'=>515.39,'target_text'=>'But I was already so cranky.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya masa tu dah cukup meragam.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>515.49,'end_time'=>519.98,'target_text'=>'>> [music] >> Okay, so we\'re in I did so much shopping in Mushima.','source_text'=>'>> [muzik] >> Okey, kita kat— Saya banyak membeli-belah di Muji.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>520.08,'end_time'=>527.5,'target_text'=>'The jeans and one hoodie, which so this morning I went to Chatak Market and I bought this.','source_text'=>'Seluar jean dan satu baju hoodie, dan pagi tadi saya pergi ke Pasar Chatuchak dan saya beli benda ni.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>527.6,'end_time'=>535.42,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure if you guys can see this, but this is a wrist strap so I can put it on my wrist like this.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti korang nampak ke tak, tapi ini tali pergelangan tangan (wrist strap) supaya saya boleh sarung kat pergelangan macam ni.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>535.52,'end_time'=>543.74,'target_text'=>'And then this part right here, it just looks like a clear piece of plastic, but this you actually put inside your phone case','source_text'=>'Dan bahagian yang ini pula nampak macam kepingan plastik jernih biasa, tapi sebenarnya korang selit masuk dalam sarung telefon','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>543.84,'end_time'=>545.1,'target_text'=>'behind here.','source_text'=>'di bahagian belakang ni.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>545.2,'end_time'=>549.66,'target_text'=>'And uh this part comes through the charging port here.','source_text'=>'Dan bahagian penyangkuk ni terkeluar ikut lubang pengecas telefon.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>549.76,'end_time'=>556.06,'target_text'=>'So you put this inside your phone case and then it it acts as like a hand grip.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang letak ni dalam sarung telefon dan ia berfungsi sebagai pemegang keselamatan.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>556.16,'end_time'=>559.66,'target_text'=>'So even if you drop your phone, it\'ll still be on.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau telefon terlepas daripada tangan pun, ia masih tergantung elok.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>559.76,'end_time'=>565.82,'target_text'=>'So now I can record myself on the scooters without having to worry about dropping my phone.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang saya boleh rakam diri saya atas skuter tanpa perlu risau telefon terjatuh.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>565.92,'end_time'=>569.1,'target_text'=>'Let\'s just hope this thin piece of plastic holds.','source_text'=>'Harap-haraplah plastik nipis ni kuat bertahan.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>569.2,'end_time'=>571.24,'target_text'=>'If not,','source_text'=>'Kalau tak tahan,','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>572.16,'end_time'=>573.26,'target_text'=>'then that sucks.','source_text'=>'habislah rosak telefon.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>573.36,'end_time'=>576.46,'target_text'=>'But actually, I really do like riding on the back of scooters.','source_text'=>'Tapi sebenarnya saya memang suka membonceng di belakang skuter.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>576.56,'end_time'=>579.98,'target_text'=>'First of all, it\'s a lot cheaper than getting a taxi.','source_text'=>'Pertama sekali, ia jauh lebih murah berbanding naik teksi.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>580.08,'end_time'=>582.7,'target_text'=>'And second of all, it\'s just like a vibe.','source_text'=>'Dan keduanya, suasananya memang sangat santai dan best.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>582.8,'end_time'=>585.66,'target_text'=>'like you\'re just outside like the wind is blowing on your face.','source_text'=>'macam korang berada di luar dengan angin sepoi-sepoi menampar muka.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>585.76,'end_time'=>589.66,'target_text'=>'Your hair is like moving and you\'re just cruising through the streets.','source_text'=>'Rambut korang berterbangan ditiup angin sambil santai menelusuri jalan raya.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>589.76,'end_time'=>593.02,'target_text'=>'You don\'t have to worry about driving because the driver is driving.','source_text'=>'Korang tak perlu risau fikir pasal memandu sebab penunggang yang pandu.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>593.12,'end_time'=>596.06,'target_text'=>'So, you could just look around, enjoy everything.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang boleh pandang sekeliling dan nikmati segala pemandangan.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>596.16,'end_time'=>597.74,'target_text'=>'The sounds of the city.','source_text'=>'Bunyi keriuhan kota.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>597.84,'end_time'=>600.54,'target_text'=>'It\'s warm outside, but the cool air is hitting you.','source_text'=>'Cuaca luar panas, tapi angin nyaman menyapa tubuh.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>600.64,'end_time'=>603.42,'target_text'=>'So, if you ever go to Thailand, I definitely recommend that experience.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau korang ada pergi Thailand, saya memang cadangkan rasa pengalaman membonceng ni.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>603.52,'end_time'=>607.58,'target_text'=>'It might be a little bit sketchy, but you just have to put your hands on the back there.','source_text'=>'Mungkin nampak agak menakutkan sikit, tapi korang cuma perlu pegang pemegang belakang kat situ.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>607.68,'end_time'=>609.18,'target_text'=>'There are hand grips.','source_text'=>'Ada pemegang tangan disediakan.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>609.28,'end_time'=>613.74,'target_text'=>'And then for lunch, we decided to stop at this restaurant that was selling chicken.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu untuk makan tengah hari, kami singgah di sebuah kedai yang jual nasi ayam.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>613.84,'end_time'=>619.5,'target_text'=>'So, it was just like completely white chicken over white rice, but the chicken just has so much flavor.','source_text'=>'Jadi hidangannya cuma ayam putih rebus di atas nasi putih, tapi isi ayam tu sangat sedap dan beraroma.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>619.6,'end_time'=>624.22,'target_text'=>'And they also gave us this like spicy red sauce that we put over top of our chicken.','source_text'=>'Dan dorang ada bagi sos merah pedas untuk kita tuang atas isi ayam.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>624.32,'end_time'=>626.14,'target_text'=>'And it was like it was amazing.','source_text'=>'Dan rasanya memang sangat luar biasa sedap.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>626.24,'end_time'=>627.9,'target_text'=>'Truly, it was it was really good.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya memang sangat menyelerakan.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>628,'end_time'=>631.82,'target_text'=>'I ate I ate all of that in like 2 seconds.','source_text'=>'Saya telan licin semua makanan tu dalam masa sekejap je.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>631.92,'end_time'=>632.24,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>632.24,'end_time'=>633.18,'target_text'=>'Here you can see our plate.','source_text'=>'Kat sini korang boleh nampak pinggan kami.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>633.28,'end_time'=>634.62,'target_text'=>'It is very like white.','source_text'=>'Nampak serba putih.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>634.72,'end_time'=>642.14,'target_text'=>'It doesn\'t look like there is a lot of flavor, but that sauce in that small little bowl on the side has a lot of flavor and','source_text'=>'Nampak macam tak banyak perisa, tapi sos dalam mangkuk kecil di sebelah tu sangat kaya dengan rasa dan','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>642.24,'end_time'=>644.54,'target_text'=>'it\'s spicy, but I like the spice.','source_text'=>'pedas, tapi saya memang suka rasa pedas tu.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>644.64,'end_time'=>648.14,'target_text'=>'And then they also gave us a few cucumbers on the side.','source_text'=>'Dan dorang juga sertakan beberapa hiris timun sebagai ulam sampingan.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>648.24,'end_time'=>652.86,'target_text'=>'After that, we just headed back to our hotel and rested until the nighttime.','source_text'=>'Selepas tu kami terus balik ke hotel dan berehat sampailah waktu malam.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>652.96,'end_time'=>657.58,'target_text'=>'And as you can see here, we went out to a market to have dinner.','source_text'=>'Dan macam korang nampak kat sini, kami keluar ke pasar malam untuk makan malam.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>657.68,'end_time'=>659.66,'target_text'=>'So, here they had skewers.','source_text'=>'Kat sini ada pelbagai jenis sate/cucuk (skewers).','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>659.76,'end_time'=>666.14,'target_text'=>'I believe they had beef skewers, pork skewers, chicken skewers, uh fish balls as well.','source_text'=>'Rasanya ada cucuk daging lembu, babi, ayam, dan juga bebola ikan.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>666.24,'end_time'=>669.1,'target_text'=>'I just went with the chicken and beef skewers.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma pilih cucuk ayam dan daging lembu.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>669.2,'end_time'=>671.82,'target_text'=>'And I kind of messed up here, let me tell you.','source_text'=>'Dan kat sini saya buat silap sikit, biar saya ceritakan.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>671.92,'end_time'=>676.86,'target_text'=>'Right here in this moment, you can see she\'s putting a sauce in the bag with my skewers.','source_text'=>'Tepat pada saat ini, korang boleh nampak mak cik tu letak sos dalam beg plastik sate cucuk saya.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>676.96,'end_time'=>684.3,'target_text'=>'And she asked me, she\'s like, \"Do you want sauce?\" She said, \"Very, very, very spicy.\" And I\'m like, \"Okay, little bit.\" As','source_text'=>'Dan dia tanya saya, \"Nak sos ke? Sangat, sangat, sangat pedas.\" Dan saya kata, \"Okey, letak sikit je.\" Macam','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>684.4,'end_time'=>691.98,'target_text'=>'you can see from the video, it looks like she put a little bit, but this was the spiciest thing I\'ve eaten so far in Thailand.','source_text'=>'yang korang nampak dalam video, nampak macam dia letak sikit, tapi inilah makanan paling pedas saya pernah makan sepanjang kat Thailand.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>692.08,'end_time'=>694.06,'target_text'=>'And I\'ve been here for about 10 days now.','source_text'=>'Dan saya dah berada kat sini kira-kira 10 hari setakat ini.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>694.16,'end_time'=>697.26,'target_text'=>'But this was so spicy.','source_text'=>'Tapi sos ni punya la pedas gila.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>697.36,'end_time'=>705.1,'target_text'=>'And uh I think the skewers were already spicy, but then with this sauce on top of it, it was it was almost unbearable.','source_text'=>'Dan rasanya sate cucuk tu sendiri dah pedas, ditambah pula dengan sos ni, sampai hampir tak tertahan pedasnya.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>705.2,'end_time'=>709.18,'target_text'=>'I almost could not eat it, but I paid for it already, so I had to eat it.','source_text'=>'Hampir-hampir saya tak boleh habiskan, tapi dah bayar, jadi saya paksa diri makan juga.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>709.28,'end_time'=>711.1,'target_text'=>'But man,','source_text'=>'Tapi aduhai,','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>711.2,'end_time'=>712.3,'target_text'=>'my eyes were watering.','source_text'=>'mata saya berair.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>712.4,'end_time'=>713.26,'target_text'=>'My nose was running.','source_text'=>'Hidung saya berhingus.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>713.36,'end_time'=>716.7,'target_text'=>'I was using like so many napkins to blow my nose.','source_text'=>'Banyak gila tisu saya guna untuk hembus hingus.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>716.8,'end_time'=>717.98,'target_text'=>'It was bad.','source_text'=>'Memang teruk pedas dia.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>718.08,'end_time'=>719.26,'target_text'=>'But they were good.','source_text'=>'Tapi sate tu sedap.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>719.36,'end_time'=>723.82,'target_text'=>'And luckily, we got this curry soup that wasn\'t as spicy.','source_text'=>'Dan nasib baik kami ada sup kari ni yang tak berapa pedas.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>723.92,'end_time'=>729.5,'target_text'=>'So, I was eating my skewers with the curry soup, so it kind of like mellowed it out.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya makan sate cucuk tu sekali dengan sup kari, dapatlah redakan rasa pedas sikit.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>729.6,'end_time'=>731.9,'target_text'=>'So, it wasn\'t as potent.','source_text'=>'Jadi taklah menyengat sangat.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>732,'end_time'=>734.78,'target_text'=>'And that\'s all we did for our third day in Thailand.','source_text'=>'Dan itulah saja aktiviti kami pada hari ketiga di Thailand.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>734.88,'end_time'=>738.78,'target_text'=>'So, the next day was December 31st.','source_text'=>'Hari berikutnya ialah 31 Disember.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>738.88,'end_time'=>741.02,'target_text'=>'So, that was New Year\'s Eve.','source_text'=>'Iaitu malam ambang Tahun Baharu.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>741.12,'end_time'=>747.42,'target_text'=>'And as you can see here, this right here is New Year\'s Eve at the Icon CM.','source_text'=>'Dan macam korang nampak kat sini, inilah suasana malam Tahun Baharu di ICONSIAM.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>747.52,'end_time'=>749.98,'target_text'=>'Yeah, this mall is called Icon CM.','source_text'=>'Ya, pusat beli-belah ni bernama ICONSIAM.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>750.08,'end_time'=>756.7,'target_text'=>'They were having a New Year\'s Eve celebration at this mall and they also had fireworks at midnight.','source_text'=>'Mereka adakan sambutan ambang Tahun Baharu di pusat beli-belah ini dan ada pertunjukan bunga api tepat tengah malam.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>756.8,'end_time'=>759.34,'target_text'=>'But you can just see the amount of people in this mall.','source_text'=>'Tapi korang tengoklah lautan manusia dalam mall ni.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>759.44,'end_time'=>762.06,'target_text'=>'It was absolutely insane.','source_text'=>'Memang luar biasa ramainya.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>762.16,'end_time'=>764.3,'target_text'=>'It was so busy, so crowded.','source_text'=>'Sangat sesak dan padat.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>764.4,'end_time'=>767.18,'target_text'=>'Just to get to this mall was insane.','source_text'=>'Nak sampai ke mall ni saja dah satu cabaran gila.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>767.28,'end_time'=>776.46,'target_text'=>'We had to get off at a subway stop and then we we decided to walk across the bridge so we can see a view of the river.','source_text'=>'Kami terpaksa turun di stesen subway lepas tu kami buat keputusan jalan kaki rentas jambatan supaya dapat tengok pemandangan sungai.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>776.56,'end_time'=>778.54,'target_text'=>'And it was it was crazy busy.','source_text'=>'Dan laluannya memang tersangat sesak.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>778.64,'end_time'=>780.38,'target_text'=>'That bridge was packed.','source_text'=>'Jambatan tu penuh sesak dengan orang.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>780.48,'end_time'=>785.66,'target_text'=>'So it was very hard to walk across the bridge cuz the path was very narrow, right?','source_text'=>'Jadi sangat sukar nak jalan seberang jambatan sebab laluan pejalan kaki agak sempit.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>785.76,'end_time'=>791.82,'target_text'=>'There was a lot of congestion, but eventually we got through and we made it to Icon CM.','source_text'=>'Berlaku kesesakan teruk, tapi akhirnya kami berjaya lepas dan sampai ke ICONSIAM.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>791.92,'end_time'=>795.98,'target_text'=>'But when I tell you the amount of people here, it was it was crazy.','source_text'=>'Bila saya kata ramai orang kat sini, memang betul-betul gila ramainya.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>796.08,'end_time'=>797.18,'target_text'=>'It was crazy.','source_text'=>'Gila ramainya.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>797.28,'end_time'=>799.66,'target_text'=>'And this was pretty far from where we were staying.','source_text'=>'Dan tempat ni agak jauh dari tempat penginapan kami.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>799.76,'end_time'=>804.14,'target_text'=>'So, we actually decided not to watch the fireworks from there.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami buat keputusan untuk tak tengok bunga api dari situ.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>804.24,'end_time'=>810.78,'target_text'=>'And instead, we went to Central World, which is another huge, huge mall that also had a fireworks show.','source_text'=>'Sebaliknya kami pergi ke CentralWorld, sebuah lagi pusat beli-belah gergasi yang turut adakan pertunjukan bunga api.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>810.88,'end_time'=>813.74,'target_text'=>'And you can see in this video, the road has been blocked off.','source_text'=>'Dan korang boleh nampak dalam video ni, jalan raya telah ditutup.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>813.84,'end_time'=>816.3,'target_text'=>'And it is just filled with people.','source_text'=>'Dan jalan tu dipenuhi lautan manusia.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>816.4,'end_time'=>821.1,'target_text'=>'There are probably thousands, probably millions of people out in the street.','source_text'=>'Mungkin beribu-ribu, atau berjuta-juta orang berada di atas jalan raya.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>821.2,'end_time'=>822.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s It was insane.','source_text'=>'Memang gila suasananya.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>822.96,'end_time'=>833.34,'target_text'=>'And personally, I don\'t really like being in a big city during holidays like this, like like Halloween,','source_text'=>'Secara peribadi, saya tak berapa gemar berada di bandar besar waktu cuti perayaan macam ni, macam Halloween,','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>833.44,'end_time'=>841.66,'target_text'=>'Christmas, New Year\'s, like these really popular holidays where people usually go out because it\'s just so crowded and so','source_text'=>'Krismas, Tahun Baharu, iaitu cuti umum popular di mana orang ramai keluar beramai-ramai sebab terlalu sesak dan','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>841.76,'end_time'=>842.08,'target_text'=>'busy.','source_text'=>'sibuk.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>842.08,'end_time'=>847.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of hard to enjoy the night or the day with the amount of people there are.','source_text'=>'Agak sukar nak nikmati suasana siang atau malam dengan kehadiran orang yang terlampau ramai.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>847.36,'end_time'=>855.42,'target_text'=>'So, I would prefer to just stay inside, but I wanted to show you guys what New Year\'s Eve was like in uh Bangkok.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya lebih suka duduk kat dalam bilik je, tapi saya nak tunjukkan pada korang macam mana suasana malam Tahun Baharu di Bangkok.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>855.52,'end_time'=>857.42,'target_text'=>'So, we went out','source_text'=>'Jadi kami pun keluar','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>857.52,'end_time'=>859.42,'target_text'=>'for like 8 hours.','source_text'=>'selama lebih kurang 8 jam.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>859.52,'end_time'=>861.98,'target_text'=>'And here you could just see the beautiful fireworks.','source_text'=>'Dan kat sini korang boleh saksikan bunga api yang sangat indah.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>862.08,'end_time'=>865.1,'target_text'=>'It was a really nice fireworks show.','source_text'=>'Pertunjukan bunga api yang sungguh memukau.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>865.2,'end_time'=>875.34,'target_text'=>'I was uh scrolling on Tik Tok and I saw a video of someone eating this like stuffed mochi they call it or soft mochi, but','source_text'=>'Masa saya layan TikTok, saya nampak video orang makan mochi berinti atau mochi lembut,','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>875.44,'end_time'=>882.14,'target_text'=>'it was essentially a big piece of mochi with fruit, cream cheese,','source_text'=>'yang sebenarnya seketul mochi besar berisi buah-buahan, keju krim,','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>882.24,'end_time'=>884.54,'target_text'=>'cookies, brownies, whatever you want inside.','source_text'=>'biskut, brownie, apa saja inti yang korang nak kat dalam.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>884.64,'end_time'=>886.14,'target_text'=>'And then they wrap it up.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu dorang bungkus kemas.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>886.24,'end_time'=>890.94,'target_text'=>'They close the top and then they put it in like whatever kind of uh topping you want.','source_text'=>'Dorang tutup bahagian atas dan salut dengan apa jua topping yang korang suka.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>891.04,'end_time'=>897.98,'target_text'=>'You could put it in like powder or in corn flakes or whatever you wanted, but I couldn\'t find it anywhere, so I ordered it','source_text'=>'Boleh salut dengan serbuk atau kepingan jagung (cornflakes), tapi saya tak jumpa kat mana-mana kedai jadi saya pesan','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>898.08,'end_time'=>898.48,'target_text'=>'online.','source_text'=>'secara dalam talian (online).','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>898.48,'end_time'=>900.22,'target_text'=>'So, here you can see me eating it.','source_text'=>'Jadi kat sini korang boleh nampak saya tengah makan mochi tu.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>900.32,'end_time'=>905.34,'target_text'=>'It was good, but I just wish the cream cheese had more of like that like cream cheese flavor.','source_text'=>'Sedap juga, cuma saya harap rasa keju krim tu lebih pekat rasa kejunya.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>905.44,'end_time'=>911.58,'target_text'=>'It kind of just tasted like whipped cream, more like whipped cream than cream cheese, if you know what I mean.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia lebih kepada krim putar (whipped cream) berbanding keju krim, kalau korang faham maksud saya.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>911.68,'end_time'=>915.26,'target_text'=>'The next day, we decided to go to a popular thrift shop.','source_text'=>'Keesokan harinya, kami pergi ke sebuah kedai jualan pakaian terpakai (thrift shop) yang popular.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>915.36,'end_time'=>922.06,'target_text'=>'I found all the items in the thrift shop to be quite expensive because I guess they are more like higher quality items and','source_text'=>'Saya dapati semua barang dalam kedai bundle tu agak mahal sebab rasanya kualitinya lebih tinggi dan','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>922.16,'end_time'=>929.74,'target_text'=>'also they handpick every item so that it\'s not just a random collection of t-shirts, jeans and and whatever.','source_text'=>'dorang pilih sendiri setiap helai baju dengan teliti, bukan sekadar longgokan t-shirt atau seluar jean secara rawak.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>929.84,'end_time'=>935.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s you know a curated collection of specific items that they want to sell.','source_text'=>'Ia koleksi terpilih barang-barang vintaj tertentu yang dorang nak jual.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>936,'end_time'=>938.3,'target_text'=>'So I didn\'t end up buying anything here.','source_text'=>'Jadi akhirnya saya tak beli apa-apa pun kat sini.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>938.4,'end_time'=>944.46,'target_text'=>'Then we went to the biggest park in or one of the biggest parks in Bangkok, Lumpini.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu kami pergi ke taman terbesar atau antara taman terbesar di Bangkok, iaitu Lumphini.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>944.56,'end_time'=>945.98,'target_text'=>'Lumpini Park.','source_text'=>'Taman Lumphini.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>946.08,'end_time'=>950.94,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure if I\'m pronouncing the park name correctly, but we saw these lizards.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sebutan nama taman tu betul ke tak, tapi kami nampak biawak-biawak ni.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>951.04,'end_time'=>953.42,'target_text'=>'And at first, I honestly thought it was a snake.','source_text'=>'Dan pada mulanya, sejujurnya saya ingat itu ular.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>953.52,'end_time'=>956.94,'target_text'=>'And finally, for dinner, we had this like barbecue meal.','source_text'=>'Dan akhirnya untuk makan malam, kami makan hidangan stimbot/barbeku (mookata).','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>957.04,'end_time'=>959.58,'target_text'=>'On the top, we were grilling our meat.','source_text'=>'Di bahagian atas kuali, kami panggang daging.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>959.68,'end_time'=>961.18,'target_text'=>'But on the side, there was a soup base.','source_text'=>'Tapi di bahagian tepi kelilingnya ada kuah sup.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>961.28,'end_time'=>967.74,'target_text'=>'So, we were able to put vegetables, noodles, and even the meat after it was cooked on the side there, and then we were eating','source_text'=>'Jadi kami boleh masukkan sayur-sayuran, mi, dan daging yang dah masak ke dalam sup tepi tu, lepas tu kami makan','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>967.84,'end_time'=>968.46,'target_text'=>'it all.','source_text'=>'semuanya.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>968.56,'end_time'=>973.34,'target_text'=>'I didn\'t find this meal had like a lot of flavor, but it was still delicious.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya rasa hidangan ni taklah terlalu berperisa, tapi tetap sedap.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>973.44,'end_time'=>974.94,'target_text'=>'and I would eat it again.','source_text'=>'dan saya sudi makan lagi.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>975.04,'end_time'=>978.06,'target_text'=>'The only thing is the meat does take a long time to cook.','source_text'=>'Cuma satu hal, daging tu ambil masa agak lama untuk masak.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>978.16,'end_time'=>985.34,'target_text'=>'So this is us again at Chhatu Chuck Market and you can see the amount of stalls and people at this market.','source_text'=>'Ini kami sekali lagi di Pasar Chatuchak dan korang boleh nampak betapa banyaknya gerai dan pengunjung di pasar ni.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>985.44,'end_time'=>987.34,'target_text'=>'It is only a weekend market.','source_text'=>'Ia cuma pasar hujung minggu.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>987.44,'end_time'=>990.94,'target_text'=>'That means it\'s only on Saturday, Sunday, the weekend.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya ia cuma buka hari Sabtu dan Ahad, hujung minggu.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>991.04,'end_time'=>994.38,'target_text'=>'So this is a weekend market, an outdoor market.','source_text'=>'Jadi ini pasar hujung minggu terbuka.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>994.48,'end_time'=>997.98,'target_text'=>'And you can just see the amount of stalls here.','source_text'=>'Dan korang boleh nampak betapa banyaknya gerai kat sini.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>998.08,'end_time'=>1000.3,'target_text'=>'There are so many vendors and stalls here.','source_text'=>'Terlalu banyak peniaga dan gerai jualan kat sini.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>1000.4,'end_time'=>1001.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s it\'s insane.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat luar biasa banyaknya.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>1002,'end_time'=>1006.22,'target_text'=>'I think to try to go through this whole market would take','source_text'=>'Saya rasa nak ronda habis seluruh pasar ni akan ambil masa','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>1006.32,'end_time'=>1007.9,'target_text'=>'more than one weekend for sure.','source_text'=>'lebih daripada satu hujung minggu pastinya.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>1008,'end_time'=>1009.82,'target_text'=>'Like more than one weekend.','source_text'=>'Memang lebih daripada satu hujung minggu.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>1009.92,'end_time'=>1013.34,'target_text'=>'And that\'s if you\'re spending the whole day at this market.','source_text'=>'Itu pun kalau luangkan masa sepanjang hari kat pasar ni.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>1013.44,'end_time'=>1020.7,'target_text'=>'And when I was in Bangkok 3 years ago, me and my friend went to this market and had the best pet thai ever.','source_text'=>'Dan masa saya di Bangkok 3 tahun lepas, saya dan kawan saya pergi ke pasar ni dan makan pad thai paling sedap pernah saya rasa.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>1020.8,'end_time'=>1022.06,'target_text'=>'That was what I remembered.','source_text'=>'Itulah apa yang saya ingat.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>1022.16,'end_time'=>1023.98,'target_text'=>'And I also remember it being very cheap.','source_text'=>'Dan saya juga ingat harganya sangat murah.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>1024.08,'end_time'=>1027.66,'target_text'=>'I think it was like 50 bot, which was a really good price.','source_text'=>'Rasanya dalam 50 baht, harga yang sangat berpatutan.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>1027.76,'end_time'=>1029.18,'target_text'=>'Like that was very cheap.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat murah.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>1029.28,'end_time'=>1036.22,'target_text'=>'So, we went to the same spot and I thought, you know, maybe prices increased a little bit, but the prices tripled, the prices','source_text'=>'Jadi kami pergi ke tempat yang sama dan saya ingat harga naik sikit je, tapi rupa-rupanya harga naik tiga kali ganda,','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>1036.32,'end_time'=>1036.86,'target_text'=>'tripled.','source_text'=>'tiga kali ganda.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>1036.96,'end_time'=>1043.1,'target_text'=>'When it\'s just two times, the prices doubled, the prices tripled, the prices quadrupled.','source_text'=>'Bila dua kali ganda harga digandakan (doubled), tiga kali ganda (tripled), empat kali ganda (quadrupled).','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>1043.2,'end_time'=>1051.18,'target_text'=>'But in this case, the prices just tripled and it was 150 bot, which was insanely expensive in my opinion for Pat Thai.','source_text'=>'Tapi dalam kes ni, harganya naik tiga kali ganda jadi 150 baht, yang mana pada pendapat saya tersangatlah mahal untuk sepinggan Pad Thai.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>1051.28,'end_time'=>1057.9,'target_text'=>'But I guess it\'s just gotten a lot more touristy, so a lot more people go there, so now they can charge those prices.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya rasa kawasan tu dah jadi terlalu tumpuan pelancong, semakin ramai orang pergi, jadi dorang boleh caj harga setinggi tu.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>1058,'end_time'=>1064.46,'target_text'=>'And honestly, I\'m not going to sit here and lie to you guys and say it was the best pai I ever had again because three years','source_text'=>'Dan sejujurnya, saya takkan duduk sini dan tipu korang dengan kata ia pad thai paling sedap lagi sekali sebab tiga tahun','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>1064.56,'end_time'=>1065.66,'target_text'=>'ago it was.','source_text'=>'lepas memang betul sedap.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>1065.76,'end_time'=>1070.3,'target_text'=>'Three years ago, it was the best pie I ever had in my life.','source_text'=>'Tiga tahun lepas, itulah pad thai paling sedap yang pernah saya makan seumur hidup.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>1070.4,'end_time'=>1073.5,'target_text'=>'But this time when we went, it was it was okay.','source_text'=>'Tapi kali ini bila kami pergi, rasa dia biasa-biasa je.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>1073.6,'end_time'=>1076.7,'target_text'=>'Like it wasn\'t anything special.','source_text'=>'Macam tak ada yang istimewa pun.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>1076.8,'end_time'=>1078.86,'target_text'=>'It was just like an average pai.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia macam pad thai biasa je.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>1078.96,'end_time'=>1082.54,'target_text'=>'And for the price, it should have been a lot more food and a lot better.','source_text'=>'Dan dengan harga semahal tu, porsi sepatutnya jauh lebih banyak dan rasa lebih sedap.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>1082.64,'end_time'=>1084.46,'target_text'=>'The portion was pretty small.','source_text'=>'Porsi hidangan agak sikit.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>1084.56,'end_time'=>1085.82,'target_text'=>'There wasn\'t a lot of chicken.','source_text'=>'Isi ayam pun tak banyak.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>1085.92,'end_time'=>1090.06,'target_text'=>'The flavor was okay, but it really was a let down.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia sekadar okey, tapi sejujurnya ia agak mengecewakan.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>1090.16,'end_time'=>1093.34,'target_text'=>'A let down, which I hate to say because it was my favorite.','source_text'=>'Mengecewakan, berat hati saya nak cakap sebab dulu ia kegemaran saya.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>1093.44,'end_time'=>1097.26,'target_text'=>'So, I definitely won\'t be going back there ever again.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya pasti takkan jejak kaki ke situ lagi dah.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>1097.36,'end_time'=>1100.31,'target_text'=>'And I have had better pat thai since we went there.','source_text'=>'Dan saya dah jumpa pad thai yang jauh lebih sedap sejak kami ke sana.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>1100.41,'end_time'=>1104.62,'target_text'=>'[snorts] Recently, we went to a night market very close to where we\'re staying.','source_text'=>'[mendengus] Baru-baru ini kami pergi ke pasar malam yang sangat dekat dengan tempat penginapan kami.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>1104.72,'end_time'=>1109.5,'target_text'=>'And I got a pat thai for I think a chicken pie for 70 bot.','source_text'=>'Dan saya beli pad thai ayam dengan harga 70 baht.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>1109.6,'end_time'=>1112.54,'target_text'=>'And that one that one was excellent.','source_text'=>'Dan yang itu memang tersangat sedap.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>1112.64,'end_time'=>1116.62,'target_text'=>'That was an excellent patai for half the price.','source_text'=>'Pad thai yang luar biasa sedap dengan separuh daripada harga tadi.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>1116.72,'end_time'=>1119.82,'target_text'=>'So, I will definitely be getting that patai again.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya pasti akan beli pad thai tu lagi.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>1119.92,'end_time'=>1121.1,'target_text'=>'I\'ll try to steer clear now.','source_text'=>'Saya akan cuba elak pergi sana sekarang.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>1121.2,'end_time'=>1125.5,'target_text'=>'I\'ll try to check market and that area because it is getting more touristy.','source_text'=>'Saya akan cuba elak Pasar Chatuchak dan kawasan tu sebab ia dah makin terlalu komersial untuk pelancong.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>1125.6,'end_time'=>1126,'target_text'=>'I see.','source_text'=>'Faham-fahamlah kan.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>1126,'end_time'=>1131.5,'target_text'=>'I mean, it was always touristy and busy, but now it\'s just gotten like the prices have just shot up.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, dulu pun memang tumpuan pelancong dan sibuk, tapi sekarang harganya melambung naik mendadak.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>1131.6,'end_time'=>1134.62,'target_text'=>'Oh, and I also tried mango sticky rice.','source_text'=>'Oh, dan saya juga cuba pulut mangga (mango sticky rice).','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>1134.72,'end_time'=>1136.3,'target_text'=>'Mango sticky rice.','source_text'=>'Pulut mangga.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>1136.4,'end_time'=>1141.02,'target_text'=>'I think my first ever mango sticky rice, I don\'t know where I had it.','source_text'=>'Kali pertama saya makan pulut mangga dulu, saya tak ingat kat mana.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>1141.12,'end_time'=>1146.46,'target_text'=>'I think it was somewhere in the south, maybe like Phuket, like that area.','source_text'=>'Rasanya di bahagian selatan, mungkin sekitar Phuket atau kawasan tu.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>1146.56,'end_time'=>1148.38,'target_text'=>'I had mango sticky rice there.','source_text'=>'Saya makan pulut mangga kat sana.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>1148.48,'end_time'=>1152.22,'target_text'=>'And I remember it being very good and like very sweet.','source_text'=>'Dan saya ingat rasanya sangat sedap dan manis berkrim.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>1152.32,'end_time'=>1154.06,'target_text'=>'But this one was a little bit different.','source_text'=>'Tapi yang kali ini rasanya agak berbeza sikit.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>1154.16,'end_time'=>1160.3,'target_text'=>'I think this is more of the authentic mango sticky rice because when I had it, it was salty.','source_text'=>'Rasanya ini lebih kepada pulut mangga asli tradisional sebab masa saya makan, ia masin.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>1160.4,'end_time'=>1164.54,'target_text'=>'I asked a lady and she said that white liquid was coconut.','source_text'=>'Saya tanya mak cik tu dan dia kata cecair putih tu santan kelapa.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>1164.64,'end_time'=>1168.3,'target_text'=>'It was coconut, but uh it was very salty.','source_text'=>'Ia memang santan, tapi rasanya sangat masin.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>1168.4,'end_time'=>1173.5,'target_text'=>'It was really, really salty, which kind of threw me off because I was eating the mango sticky rice.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat masin sampai buat saya rasa pelik sebab saya tengah makan pulut mangga.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>1173.6,'end_time'=>1181.26,'target_text'=>'And I was expecting it to be sweet, like condensed milk with mango sweet, but it was like coconut with salt.','source_text'=>'Dan saya sangka rasanya manis berlemak macam susu pekat dengan mangga manis, tapi rupanya santan bergaram.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>1181.36,'end_time'=>1182.22,'target_text'=>'It was very salty.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia sangat masin.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>1182.32,'end_time'=>1184.78,'target_text'=>'So, me personally, not really my favorite.','source_text'=>'Jadi secara peribadi, bukanlah kegemaran saya.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>1184.88,'end_time'=>1188.62,'target_text'=>'If it was a sweeter, like condensed milk, it would be really, really good.','source_text'=>'Kalau rasanya lebih manis macam susu pekat, mesti sangat-sangat sedap.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>1188.72,'end_time'=>1191.1,'target_text'=>'But that salt definitely threw me off.','source_text'=>'Tapi rasa masin tu memang potong selera saya.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>1191.2,'end_time'=>1195.02,'target_text'=>'And like for dessert, I\'m not really trying to have something salty.','source_text'=>'Dan untuk pencuci mulut, saya takdelah cari benda yang masin.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>1195.12,'end_time'=>1198.14,'target_text'=>'So, it wasn\'t really my favorite.','source_text'=>'Jadi ia bukan pencuci mulut kegemaran saya.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>1198.24,'end_time'=>1203.1,'target_text'=>'But another dessert I tried was a cheesecake from Labs.','source_text'=>'Tapi satu lagi pencuci mulut yang saya cuba ialah kek keju daripada kedai Labs.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>1203.2,'end_time'=>1210.94,'target_text'=>'I\'ve seen cheesecakes like these online and I\'ve always wanted to try them because they\'re just like they\'re so fluffy and','source_text'=>'Saya pernah nampak kek keju gebu macam ni dalam internet dan dah lama teringin nak cuba sebab nampak sangat gebu dan','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>1211.04,'end_time'=>1215.66,'target_text'=>'jiggly that like how could I not try it, right?','source_text'=>'bergoyang-goyang (jiggly) lembut sampai rugi kalau tak cuba, kan?','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>1215.76,'end_time'=>1221.02,'target_text'=>'So, this is my first time trying one and I I literally just bit right into it.','source_text'=>'Jadi ini kali pertama saya cuba dan saya terus gigit macam tu je.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>1221.12,'end_time'=>1229.02,'target_text'=>'I know they did give me utensils, so I could have used a spoon, but you know, when in Rome, I was feeling like I needed to','source_text'=>'Saya tahu dorang ada sediakan sudu dan saya boleh guna sudu, tapi saya rasa macam lebih best kalau','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>1229.12,'end_time'=>1229.82,'target_text'=>'bite into it.','source_text'=>'terus gigit.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>1229.92,'end_time'=>1236.54,'target_text'=>'So, I just It tasted how I expected it to taste, just like kind of like a fluffy cake because that\'s what it looks like.','source_text'=>'Jadi rasanya macam yang saya agak, tekstur kek span yang sangat gebu macam rupa bentuknya.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>1236.64,'end_time'=>1239.5,'target_text'=>'It didn\'t taste anything anything like cheesecake.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia langsung tak macam kek keju.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>1239.6,'end_time'=>1247.9,'target_text'=>'It did not taste anything like cheesecake at all because I mean, it\'s more like cake than it is cheesecake, if you know what','source_text'=>'Langsung tak ada rasa kek keju sebab ia lebih kepada kek span biasa berbanding kek keju, kalau korang faham','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>1248,'end_time'=>1248.62,'target_text'=>'I\'m saying.','source_text'=>'maksud saya.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>1248.72,'end_time'=>1255.02,'target_text'=>'And one thing actually that also really surprised me was the raisins on the bottom.','source_text'=>'Dan satu lagi benda yang betul-betul buat saya terkejut ialah ada kismis di bahagian dasar bawah kek.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>1255.12,'end_time'=>1265.26,'target_text'=>'That really surprised me because nowhere on the packaging, nowhere on their signs said that there were raisins on the bottom','source_text'=>'Itu betul-betul buat saya terkejut sebab langsung tak tertulis pada bungkusan atau papan tanda bahawa ada kismis di bahagian bawah','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>1265.36,'end_time'=>1266.7,'target_text'=>'of the cheesecake.','source_text'=>'kek keju tersebut.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>1266.8,'end_time'=>1273.02,'target_text'=>'So, one thing about me is I like raisins, but alone and like very dry.','source_text'=>'Satu benda pasal saya ialah saya suka kismis, tapi jenis kismis kering makan begitu saja.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>1273.12,'end_time'=>1276.38,'target_text'=>'So, I like eating them just like that, nothing else.','source_text'=>'Saya suka makan kismis kering macam tu je tanpa campur benda lain.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>1276.48,'end_time'=>1279.18,'target_text'=>'However, when you cook raisins,','source_text'=>'Namun, bila kismis dimasak,','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>1279.28,'end_time'=>1279.98,'target_text'=>'I don\'t like them.','source_text'=>'saya tak suka.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>1280.08,'end_time'=>1286.94,'target_text'=>'I don\'t like raisins cooked because then they\'re just like warm and mushy, and I I personally don\'t like my raisins warm and','source_text'=>'Saya tak suka kismis yang dimasak sebab ia jadi suam dan lembik berair, dan saya secara peribadi tak suka kismis jadi lembik dan','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>1287.04,'end_time'=>1287.82,'target_text'=>'mushy.','source_text'=>'suam.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>1287.92,'end_time'=>1289.82,'target_text'=>'And these were warm and mushy.','source_text'=>'Dan kismis kat bawah kek ni memang suam dan lembik.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>1289.92,'end_time'=>1293.26,'target_text'=>'So, I didn\'t really like these raisins with the cheesecake.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya tak berapa suka ada kismis dalam kek keju ni.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>1293.36,'end_time'=>1299.34,'target_text'=>'So, if I had to give this a rating from 1 to 10, I would give it like a like a four.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau saya kena bagi penilaian dari 1 hingga 10, saya bagi markah dalam 4 je.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>1299.44,'end_time'=>1300.14,'target_text'=>'Like a four.','source_text'=>'Dalam 4 per 10.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>1300.24,'end_time'=>1300.7,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>1300.8,'end_time'=>1302.7,'target_text'=>'I I would not get this again ever.','source_text'=>'Saya memang takkan beli benda ni lagi dah.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>1302.8,'end_time'=>1304.38,'target_text'=>'I would never get this again.','source_text'=>'Saya takkan beli lagi.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>1304.48,'end_time'=>1305.9,'target_text'=>'It really wasn\'t that good.','source_text'=>'Memang tak sedap sangat pun.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>1306,'end_time'=>1308.14,'target_text'=>'I really love love love cheesecake.','source_text'=>'Saya sebenarnya sangat sukakan kek keju.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>1308.24,'end_time'=>1314.06,'target_text'=>'I really am not sure why they even call it cheesecake, but I guess that\'s a question for another time.','source_text'=>'Saya tak faham kenapa dorang panggil benda ni kek keju, tapi itu cerita lain kali lah.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>1314.16,'end_time'=>1317.82,'target_text'=>'If you guys actually know why they call this cheesecake, let me know.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang tahu kenapa dorang panggil benda ni kek keju, beritahu saya ya.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>1317.92,'end_time'=>1323.42,'target_text'=>'Oh yeah, and then at another night market, we found the like stuffed soft mochi again.','source_text'=>'Oh ya, lepas tu kat satu lagi pasar malam, kami jumpa lagi mochi lembut berinti tu.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>1323.52,'end_time'=>1330.46,'target_text'=>'And I will say this stuffed mochi was better than the last one because this one, the cream cheese filling on the inside had','source_text'=>'Dan saya boleh kata mochi berinti kali ini lebih sedap berbanding yang sebelum ni sebab inti keju krim kat dalam dia','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>1330.56,'end_time'=>1332.54,'target_text'=>'more of that like cream cheese flavor.','source_text'=>'lebih kuat rasa keju krimnya.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>1332.64,'end_time'=>1333.9,'target_text'=>'It was like a stronger flavor.','source_text'=>'Rasa kejunya lebih ketara dan pekat.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>1334,'end_time'=>1337.66,'target_text'=>'It didn\'t really taste as much as whipped cream as the past one I had.','source_text'=>'Tak adalah rasa macam krim putar kosong macam yang saya makan sebelum ni.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>1337.76,'end_time'=>1339.98,'target_text'=>'So, this one was better.','source_text'=>'Jadi yang ini jauh lebih sedap.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>1340.08,'end_time'=>1342.86,'target_text'=>'Now, I want to find one that\'s amazing.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya teringin nak cari yang betul-betul luar biasa sedap.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>1342.96,'end_time'=>1348.06,'target_text'=>'And I\'m sure you guys have kind of come to the realization by now, but Pai is one of my favorite Thai foods.','source_text'=>'Dan saya pasti korang dah mula sedar setakat ini bahawa Pad Thai ialah antara makanan Thailand kegemaran saya.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>1348.16,'end_time'=>1350.86,'target_text'=>'And I know it\'s not really that adventurous.','source_text'=>'Dan saya tahu pilihan ni tak berapa mencabar selera.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>1350.96,'end_time'=>1355.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of boring, kind of like normal, but I like it and I enjoy it.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam biasa dan membosankan, tapi saya memang suka dan berselera makan.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>1355.52,'end_time'=>1359.58,'target_text'=>'Although, now I\'m starting to eat more and more Thai food, so that might change.','source_text'=>'Walaupun sekarang saya dah mula makan pelbagai makanan Thai lain, jadi mungkin citarasa saya akan berubah.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>1359.68,'end_time'=>1362.54,'target_text'=>'But for now, Pai is still my number one.','source_text'=>'Tapi buat masa ini, Pad Thai masih nombor satu bagi saya.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>1362.64,'end_time'=>1364.86,'target_text'=>'And this was the pai I was talking about.','source_text'=>'Dan inilah pad thai yang saya maksudkan tadi.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>1364.96,'end_time'=>1368.38,'target_text'=>'This pie was 70 bot and it was very good.','source_text'=>'Pad thai ini berharga 70 baht dan rasanya sangat sedap.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>1368.48,'end_time'=>1371.98,'target_text'=>'So this right now is my current favorite pie.','source_text'=>'Jadi setakat ini inilah pad thai kegemaran saya sekarang.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>1372.08,'end_time'=>1375.26,'target_text'=>'And finally to end the night, we had a cookie.','source_text'=>'Dan akhir sekali untuk menutup malam kami, kami makan biskut kuki.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>1375.36,'end_time'=>1378.22,'target_text'=>'The cookie I picked was a s\'more cookie.','source_text'=>'Kuki yang saya pilih ialah s\'more cookie.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>1378.32,'end_time'=>1381.58,'target_text'=>'So you can see there\'s a graham cracker on the bottom of the cookie.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak ada biskut kraker graham di bahagian dasar bawah kuki tu.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>1381.68,'end_time'=>1386.22,'target_text'=>'And then you know the the middle part of it was chocolate chip, a chocolate chip cookie.','source_text'=>'Dan bahagian tengahnya kuki cip coklat.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>1386.32,'end_time'=>1389.98,'target_text'=>'And on top there were two melted marshmallows.','source_text'=>'Dan di bahagian atas ada dua biji marshmallow cair.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>1390.08,'end_time'=>1391.66,'target_text'=>'So it was quite good.','source_text'=>'Jadi rasanya agak sedap.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>1391.76,'end_time'=>1393.9,'target_text'=>'It wasn\'t that sweet though, in my opinion.','source_text'=>'Tapi taklah manis sangat pada pendapat saya.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>1394,'end_time'=>1396.22,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think they put really much sugar at all.','source_text'=>'Rasanya dorang tak letak banyak gula pun.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>1396.32,'end_time'=>1397.98,'target_text'=>'It wasn\'t sweet at all.','source_text'=>'Langsung tak rasa manis.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>1398.08,'end_time'=>1401.74,'target_text'=>'It just tasted like a a cookie but with no sugar.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia macam kuki biasa tapi tanpa gula.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>1401.84,'end_time'=>1406.46,'target_text'=>'It was a little bit weird, but at least the marshmallow gave it some sweetness.','source_text'=>'Agak pelik sikit, tapi sekurang-kurangnya marshmallow tu bagi sedikit rasa manis.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>1406.56,'end_time'=>1409.42,'target_text'=>'And we finally went to go watch Avatar.','source_text'=>'Dan akhirnya kami pergi tonton filem Avatar.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>1409.52,'end_time'=>1415.9,'target_text'=>'I wanted to watch it while I was in Soul, South Korea, but we just never had the chance.','source_text'=>'Saya dah lama nak tonton masa kat Seoul, Korea Selatan lagi, tapi kami tak berkesempatan.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>1416,'end_time'=>1419.02,'target_text'=>'We never had the opportunity to go and watch it.','source_text'=>'Kami tak ada peluang langsung nak pergi tengok masa tu.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>1419.12,'end_time'=>1420.54,'target_text'=>'But here in Thailand, we did.','source_text'=>'Tapi kat Thailand ni, kami dapat pergi tengok.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>1420.64,'end_time'=>1423.66,'target_text'=>'So, we went to go watch it and uh it was good.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami pergi tonton dan ceritanya memang menarik.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>1423.76,'end_time'=>1426.22,'target_text'=>'Like I really like the Avatar series.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka siri filem Avatar.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>1426.32,'end_time'=>1434.46,'target_text'=>'I remember watching the first Avatar when it came out I think in when was it 2008 or 2009 like somewhere around there.','source_text'=>'Saya ingat lagi masa tonton Avatar yang pertama masa tayangan perdana sekitar tahun 2008 atau 2009 macam tu.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>1434.56,'end_time'=>1437.34,'target_text'=>'Uh it was very very good.','source_text'=>'Filem tu memang sangat hebat.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>1437.44,'end_time'=>1439.26,'target_text'=>'The movie was just so different.','source_text'=>'Filem tu sangat lain daripada yang lain.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>1439.36,'end_time'=>1445.18,'target_text'=>'The blue people looked really cool and it was just a very well-made movie with great CGI.','source_text'=>'Makhluk biru Na\'vi tu nampak gempak dan filem tu dihasilkan dengan teliti serta kesan CGI yang mantap.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>1445.28,'end_time'=>1449.34,'target_text'=>'And this one I found it was exactly the same.','source_text'=>'Dan filem yang terbaru ni pun sama hebat bagi saya.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>1449.44,'end_time'=>1451.9,'target_text'=>'Like high quality CGI.','source_text'=>'Kualiti CGI bertaraf tinggi.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>1452,'end_time'=>1453.58,'target_text'=>'The acting was decent.','source_text'=>'Lakonan para pelakon agak mantap.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>1453.68,'end_time'=>1455.02,'target_text'=>'The story was there.','source_text'=>'Jalan ceritanya tersusun elok.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>1455.12,'end_time'=>1459.1,'target_text'=>'But the thing is is that I don\'t know if it\'s because I\'m older now or what.','source_text'=>'Tapi masalahnya saya tak pasti sama ada faktor usia saya makin meningkat atau apa.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>1459.2,'end_time'=>1462.38,'target_text'=>'But I find all these movies to be quite predictable.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya rasa filem-filem macam ni jalan ceritanya mudah dijangka (predictable).','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>1462.48,'end_time'=>1467.82,'target_text'=>'Like it\'s really easy to predict what\'s going to happen when there\'s like a moment of tension where like oh is are they going','source_text'=>'Sangat senang nak teka apa yang bakal berlaku bila ada babak cemas sama ada dorang','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>1467.92,'end_time'=>1469.26,'target_text'=>'to make it?','source_text'=>'sempat selamat atau tidak?','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>1469.36,'end_time'=>1470.62,'target_text'=>'Yeah, obviously they\'re going to make it.','source_text'=>'Mestilah dorang selamat.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>1470.72,'end_time'=>1473.74,'target_text'=>'They\'re the main character or they\'re like someone important.','source_text'=>'Dorang kan watak utama atau watak penting.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>1473.84,'end_time'=>1476.3,'target_text'=>'I just find all these movies so predictable.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma rasa filem-filem sekarang terlalu mudah dijangka kesudahannya.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>1476.4,'end_time'=>1478.3,'target_text'=>'That\'s why I don\'t really watch movies anymore.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah saya dah jarang tengok filem sekarang.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>1478.4,'end_time'=>1487.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of hard to make a very good, compelling, interesting, engaging story in a two to three hour time frame.','source_text'=>'Agak sukar nak bina jalan cerita yang mendalam, menarik, dan memikat dalam tempoh masa dua hingga tiga jam saja.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>1487.36,'end_time'=>1494.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s hard to capture people\'s attention and like get them invested in characters and then have like a good payoff at the end','source_text'=>'Sukar nak tarik perhatian penonton dan buat dorang betul-betul menjiwai watak dengan pengakhiran yang memuaskan','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>1494.88,'end_time'=>1499.18,'target_text'=>'when you only have 2 to three hours to do that in a movie.','source_text'=>'bila hanya ada masa dua hingga tiga jam dalam sebuah filem.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>1499.28,'end_time'=>1501.82,'target_text'=>'That\'s why I prefer watching TV shows.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah saya lebih gemar tonton siri drama TV.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>1501.92,'end_time'=>1508.38,'target_text'=>'I feel like TV shows, you can really immerse yourself in the universe of that TV show.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa dalam siri TV, kita betul-betul boleh menyelami dunia dan jalan cerita siri tersebut.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>1508.48,'end_time'=>1510.7,'target_text'=>'So, you get more attached to the characters.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita lebih rasa terikat dan sayangkan watak-wataknya.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>1510.8,'end_time'=>1513.74,'target_text'=>'So, when something happens, it matters more to you.','source_text'=>'Jadi bila sesuatu terjadi pada watak tu, kita rasa lebih terkesan.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>1513.84,'end_time'=>1515.74,'target_text'=>'And that\'s also why I like watching anime.','source_text'=>'Dan sebab itu juga saya suka tonton anime.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>1515.84,'end_time'=>1524.38,'target_text'=>'I think anime stories and characters and character development are a lot better than movies.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa jalan cerita, watak, dan perkembangan watak dalam anime jauh lebih mantap daripada filem biasa.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>1524.48,'end_time'=>1533.34,'target_text'=>'But lately, I would say in the past two to three years, I haven\'t really been watching any movies, any TV shows.','source_text'=>'Tapi sejak kebelakangan ini dalam dua tiga tahun lepas, saya dah jarang tonton filem atau siri TV.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>1533.44,'end_time'=>1537.98,'target_text'=>'And I really only watched anime a lot, like religiously','source_text'=>'Dan saya cuma tonton banyak anime secara konsisten setiap hari','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>1538.08,'end_time'=>1540.14,'target_text'=>'during uh 2020.','source_text'=>'pada tahun 2020 dulu.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>1540.24,'end_time'=>1542.54,'target_text'=>'So that\'s when the whole world was shut down.','source_text'=>'Waktu tu seluruh dunia dikenakan perintah berkurung (lockdown).','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>1542.64,'end_time'=>1545.1,'target_text'=>'That\'s when I really watched a lot.','source_text'=>'Waktu itulah saya betul-betul banyak tonton anime.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>1545.2,'end_time'=>1547.58,'target_text'=>'It was like a year and a half where I watched so many.','source_text'=>'Hampir setahun setengah saya layan macam-macam anime.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>1547.68,'end_time'=>1550.62,'target_text'=>'I think I\'ve watched over 200 anime.','source_text'=>'Rasanya saya dah tonton lebih 200 tajuk anime.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>1550.72,'end_time'=>1556.14,'target_text'=>'So, if you name one in the comments, I could tell you if I watched it, yes or no, and if I liked it, yes or no.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau korang sebut satu tajuk di ruangan komen, saya boleh beritahu sama ada saya pernah tonton dan sama ada saya suka atau tidak.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>1556.24,'end_time'=>1562.7,'target_text'=>'So, so if you watch anime and uh you want to tell me what you watched or what\'s your favorite anime, let me know.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau korang peminat anime dan nak kongsikan apa yang korang tonton atau anime kegemaran korang, beritahu saya.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>1562.8,'end_time'=>1564.62,'target_text'=>'I could give you my top three.','source_text'=>'Saya boleh kongsikan tiga anime terbaik pilihan saya.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>1564.72,'end_time'=>1567.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of hard to make a top three.','source_text'=>'Agak susah nak senaraikan tiga teratas.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>1567.2,'end_time'=>1571.34,'target_text'=>'So, this isn\'t this isn\'t going to be a specific top three order.','source_text'=>'Jadi ini bukan mengikut urutan kedudukan tertentu.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>1571.44,'end_time'=>1576.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s just going to be three that I like equally that I would consider my favorites.','source_text'=>'Cuma tiga judul yang saya suka sama rata dan saya anggap sebagai kegemaran saya.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>1576.32,'end_time'=>1577.9,'target_text'=>'Attack on Titan for sure.','source_text'=>'Attack on Titan sudah tentu.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1578,'end_time'=>1584.3,'target_text'=>'I remember watching Attack on Titan with no spoilers and the plot twists were so insane.','source_text'=>'Saya ingat lagi masa tonton Attack on Titan tanpa sebarang spoiler dan plot twist dia memang gila tak sangka.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1584.4,'end_time'=>1586.78,'target_text'=>'That show was unpredictable.','source_text'=>'Siri anime tu langsung tak boleh dijangka.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>1586.88,'end_time'=>1588.22,'target_text'=>'Unpredictable.','source_text'=>'Penuh kejutan.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>1588.32,'end_time'=>1589.5,'target_text'=>'HunterX Hunter.','source_text'=>'Hunter x Hunter.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>1589.6,'end_time'=>1590.62,'target_text'=>'I really like that show.','source_text'=>'Saya memang sangat suka siri tu.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>1590.72,'end_time'=>1595.34,'target_text'=>'The power scaling, the powers, like everything was really cool.','source_text'=>'Tahap kuasa sistem Nen dan aksinya memang sangat hebat.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>1595.44,'end_time'=>1598.92,'target_text'=>'And uh third, thirdly,','source_text'=>'Dan pilihan ketiga,','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>1599.92,'end_time'=>1602.06,'target_text'=>'I would say Rezero.','source_text'=>'saya pilih Re:Zero.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>1602.16,'end_time'=>1606.14,'target_text'=>'That one was really interesting because it was different than any other anime I\'ve seen.','source_text'=>'Yang tu memang sangat menarik sebab konsepnya lain daripada mana-mana anime yang pernah saya tonton.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>1606.24,'end_time'=>1611.5,'target_text'=>'There are a lot of animes like that follow the same kind of path, but that one was very different.','source_text'=>'Banyak anime lain ikut formula jalan cerita yang sama, tapi Re:Zero sangat unik.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1611.6,'end_time'=>1615.02,'target_text'=>'So, I did like that one a lot just because it was so different.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya memang sangat suka siri tu sebab keunikannya.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>1615.12,'end_time'=>1618.7,'target_text'=>'Anyways, let me know your top three in the comments.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, kongsikan tiga anime kegemaran korang di ruangan komen.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>1618.8,'end_time'=>1621.66,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, that\'s been uh our trip in Thailand so far.','source_text'=>'Jadi itulah serba sedikit perjalanan kami di Thailand setakat ini.','order'=>420],
