            ['start_time'=>166.4,'end_time'=>168.54,'target_text'=>'I\'m pretty sure this is Canadian Mars bar.','source_text'=>'Saya yakin ini Mars Bar versi Kanada.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>168.64,'end_time'=>169.74,'target_text'=>'I haven\'t had these in so long.','source_text'=>'Dah lama sangat saya tak makan ni.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>169.84,'end_time'=>172.62,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if it\'ll be the same, but I\'m trying to lose weight, so I won\'t get it.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada rasanya masih sama, tapi saya tengah nak turunkan berat badan, jadi saya tak beli.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>172.72,'end_time'=>173.42,'target_text'=>'This looks fire.','source_text'=>'Yang ini nampak padu gila.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>173.52,'end_time'=>174.06,'target_text'=>'Butterscotch.','source_text'=>'Butterscotch.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>174.16,'end_time'=>177.26,'target_text'=>'I like Hershey\'s cookies and cream, but uh this is all we\'re going to get.','source_text'=>'Saya suka Hershey\'s cookies and cream, tapi ini je yang kita akan beli.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>177.36,'end_time'=>179.42,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to go to the counter, check out, and I\'ll see you guys.','source_text'=>'Kita akan pergi ke kaunter, buat bayaran, dan jumpa korang kat luar.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>179.52,'end_time'=>180.46,'target_text'=>'>> They do have peanut butter.','source_text'=>'Dorang memang ada mentega kacang.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>180.56,'end_time'=>181.26,'target_text'=>'Reese\'s.','source_text'=>'Reese\'s.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>181.36,'end_time'=>181.98,'target_text'=>'What?','source_text'=>'Apa?','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>182.08,'end_time'=>184.06,'target_text'=>'Oh, >> I did not see those last time I was here.','source_text'=>'Oh, saya tak perasan langsung masa datang sini kali lepas.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>184.16,'end_time'=>184.7,'target_text'=>'>> Reese\'s.','source_text'=>'Reese\'s.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>184.8,'end_time'=>185.34,'target_text'=>'This is fire.','source_text'=>'Ini memang padu.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>185.44,'end_time'=>185.9,'target_text'=>'This is fire.','source_text'=>'Terbaik gila.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>186,'end_time'=>187.02,'target_text'=>'I still want to try the Mr.','source_text'=>'Saya masih teringin nak cuba coklat Mr.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>187.12,'end_time'=>189.98,'target_text'=>'Beast uh peanut butter cup, but this is a step up.','source_text'=>'Beast cawan mentega kacang, tapi yang ini pun dah cukup hebat.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>190.08,'end_time'=>190.62,'target_text'=>'We\'re almost there.','source_text'=>'Kita dah nak sampai ke kaunter.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>190.72,'end_time'=>193.1,'target_text'=>'But I\'m going to check out and I\'ll see you guys outside.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya bayar dulu dan jumpa korang kat luar.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>193.2,'end_time'=>195.74,'target_text'=>'Okay, so I\'ve never had this uh Thai Red Bull before.','source_text'=>'Okey, saya tak pernah minum Red Bull Thai ni sebelum ni.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>195.84,'end_time'=>198.84,'target_text'=>'I assume I\'m not going to like it.','source_text'=>'Saya agak saya takkan suka rasanya.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>198.96,'end_time'=>199.36,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>199.44,'end_time'=>200.54,'target_text'=>'It\'s just a hunch.','source_text'=>'Cuma firasat saya je.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>200.64,'end_time'=>201.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s just a hunch.','source_text'=>'Sekadar rasa hati.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>202,'end_time'=>203.9,'target_text'=>'But I usually like carbonated things.','source_text'=>'Tapi biasanya saya suka minuman berkarbonat (bergas).','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>204,'end_time'=>206.46,'target_text'=>'And it kind of looks like a medicine like bottle, doesn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Dan rupa botol dia macam botol ubat kan?','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>206.56,'end_time'=>208.76,'target_text'=>'>> Tastes like it.','source_text'=>'Rasa pun macam ubat.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>214.32,'end_time'=>215.9,'target_text'=>'>> That actually tastes pretty good.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya rasa dia agak sedap juga.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>216,'end_time'=>218.46,'target_text'=>'That tastes like a like a melted freezy.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia macam aiskrim batang (freezie) yang dah cair.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>218.56,'end_time'=>219.66,'target_text'=>'>> You know what I\'m talking about?','source_text'=>'Korang tahu tak apa yang saya maksudkan?','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>219.76,'end_time'=>222.86,'target_text'=>'>> That literally tastes exactly I don\'t know what flavor, but I\'m sure you guys have had it.','source_text'=>'Memang sejibik rasa dia, saya tak pasti perisa apa, tapi saya yakin korang pernah rasa.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>222.96,'end_time'=>228.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a long plastic tube and inside it\'s like a a liquid but you freeze it and then you suck on it once it\'s frozen.','source_text'=>'Ia macam tiub plastik panjang dan kat dalam ada cecair, kita bekukan lepas tu kita hisap bila dah beku.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>228.8,'end_time'=>230.94,'target_text'=>'So it\'s like uh cools you down in the summer.','source_text'=>'Ia menyejukkan tekak waktu musim panas.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>231.04,'end_time'=>231.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a summer drink.','source_text'=>'Macam minuman musim panas.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>231.92,'end_time'=>233.18,'target_text'=>'But this tastes like a melted one.','source_text'=>'Tapi yang ni rasa macam aiskrim tu yang dah cair sepenuhnya.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>233.28,'end_time'=>235.5,'target_text'=>'So one that\'s completely melted and you\'re just drinking the liquid.','source_text'=>'Yang cair sepenuhnya dan kita cuma minum air manis tu je.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>235.6,'end_time'=>236.46,'target_text'=>'That\'s what that tastes like.','source_text'=>'Macam tulah rasanya.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>236.56,'end_time'=>238.3,'target_text'=>'>> You\'ve never had one before.','source_text'=>'Awak tak pernah minum sebelum ni.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>238.4,'end_time'=>239.66,'target_text'=>'>> This I\'ve never had.','source_text'=>'Yang ini saya tak pernah minum langsung.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>239.76,'end_time'=>242.54,'target_text'=>'>> Non-carbonated version is what I see all the bike drivers.','source_text'=>'Versi tak bergas nilah yang saya nampak penunggang motor selalu minum.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>242.64,'end_time'=>243.34,'target_text'=>'>> Barely carbonated.','source_text'=>'Gas dia sikit sangat.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>243.44,'end_time'=>245.18,'target_text'=>'This is like very very subtle.','source_text'=>'Rasa gas dia tersangat halus.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>245.28,'end_time'=>246.22,'target_text'=>'They say sparkly.','source_text'=>'Dorang kata berkarbonat lembut.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>246.32,'end_time'=>247.02,'target_text'=>'Barely.','source_text'=>'Hampir tak rasa langsung.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>247.12,'end_time'=>247.98,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>248.08,'end_time'=>249.58,'target_text'=>'>> Anyways, let\'s go find something to eat.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, jom kita cari makanan.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>249.68,'end_time'=>251.34,'target_text'=>'This is Leon\'s drink, so I\'ll hand it to him.','source_text'=>'Ini air minuman Leon, jadi saya serahkan pada dia.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>251.44,'end_time'=>252.62,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go find something to eat.','source_text'=>'Jom kita pergi cari makanan.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>252.72,'end_time'=>255.58,'target_text'=>'Then we\'ll head down to Icon CM to see the New Year\'s.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu kita gerak ke ICONSIAM untuk tengok sambutan Tahun Baharu.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>255.68,'end_time'=>256.14,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s get it.','source_text'=>'Jom gerak.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>256.24,'end_time'=>256.64,'target_text'=>'No way.','source_text'=>'Biar betul.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>256.64,'end_time'=>258.06,'target_text'=>'The trike scooter, dog.','source_text'=>'Skuter roda tiga, kawan.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>258.16,'end_time'=>259.02,'target_text'=>'>> This is a tricycle.','source_text'=>'Ini kenderaan roda tiga (tricycle).','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>259.12,'end_time'=>261.82,'target_text'=>'You call it a tricycle because there are three wheels.','source_text'=>'Orang panggil tricycle sebab ada tiga roda.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>261.92,'end_time'=>262.54,'target_text'=>'One, two, three.','source_text'=>'Satu, dua, tiga.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>262.64,'end_time'=>264.46,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s a tricycle scooter.','source_text'=>'Jadi ia skuter roda tiga.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>264.56,'end_time'=>265.18,'target_text'=>'That is valid.','source_text'=>'Memang padu rekaannya.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>265.28,'end_time'=>266.46,'target_text'=>'But now we just have our water.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang kita cuma ada air mineral kita.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>266.56,'end_time'=>269.18,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go find somewhere to eat.','source_text'=>'Jom cari kedai makan.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>269.28,'end_time'=>270.3,'target_text'=>'>> I can go for a pet thai.','source_text'=>'Saya teringin nak makan pad thai.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>270.4,'end_time'=>270.86,'target_text'=>'What about you?','source_text'=>'Awak macam mana?','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>270.96,'end_time'=>272.14,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, we had pet thai already.','source_text'=>'Kita kan dah makan pad thai sebelum ni.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>272.24,'end_time'=>274.22,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s our >> Yeah, but I I could have it again.','source_text'=>'Jadi itu— >> Ya, tapi saya boleh je makan lagi.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>274.32,'end_time'=>276.22,'target_text'=>'Or maybe something else that\'s like similar.','source_text'=>'Atau hidangan lain yang seakan-akan sama.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>276.32,'end_time'=>279.02,'target_text'=>'Maybe some noodles or that like pork chart we had.','source_text'=>'Mungkin mi sup atau hidangan daging babi yang kita makan haritu.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>279.12,'end_time'=>279.66,'target_text'=>'That was amazing.','source_text'=>'Itu memang sangat sedap.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>279.76,'end_time'=>280.62,'target_text'=>'I would have that again.','source_text'=>'Saya nak makan benda tu lagi.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>280.72,'end_time'=>280.96,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>280.96,'end_time'=>283.66,'target_text'=>'But isn\'t the goal not to eat anything twice?','source_text'=>'Tapi bukankah matlamat kita jangan makan benda yang sama dua kali?','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>283.76,'end_time'=>284.94,'target_text'=>'>> Whose goal is that?','source_text'=>'Matlamat siapa tu?','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>285.04,'end_time'=>285.74,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s your goal.','source_text'=>'Matlamat awaklah.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>285.84,'end_time'=>286.78,'target_text'=>'>> I never said that.','source_text'=>'Bila masa saya cakap macam tu.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>286.88,'end_time'=>288.3,'target_text'=>'>> You got to try new things.','source_text'=>'Awak kena cuba makanan baharu.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>288.4,'end_time'=>290.46,'target_text'=>'>> I I swear I\'ve never said that.','source_text'=>'Saya bersumpah saya tak pernah kata macam tu.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>290.56,'end_time'=>291.98,'target_text'=>'I >> think you\'re a little too picky.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa awak ni memilih sangat makan.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>292.08,'end_time'=>293.42,'target_text'=>'So, it\'d be good to try new things.','source_text'=>'Jadi eloklah cuba benda-benda baharu.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>293.52,'end_time'=>296.46,'target_text'=>'>> No, I like trying new things, but why fix what isn\'t broken?','source_text'=>'Taklah, saya suka cuba benda baru, tapi kenapa nak ubah benda yang dah elok sedap?','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>296.56,'end_time'=>297.98,'target_text'=>'And right now, it\'s golden hour.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang ni waktu senja keemasan (golden hour).','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>298.08,'end_time'=>299.34,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s what picky people say.','source_text'=>'Ayat biasa orang yang memilih makan.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>299.44,'end_time'=>301.34,'target_text'=>'>> The sun is just like at a nice height.','source_text'=>'Kedudukan matahari betul-betul cantik parasnya.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>301.44,'end_time'=>303.1,'target_text'=>'So, everything is going to look golden.','source_text'=>'Jadi pemandangan sekeliling nampak keemasan.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>303.2,'end_time'=>303.98,'target_text'=>'Golden hour.','source_text'=>'Waktu keemasan.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>304.08,'end_time'=>305.5,'target_text'=>'But it\'s almost 5:00 p.m.','source_text'=>'Tapi dah hampir pukul 5:00 petang.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>305.6,'end_time'=>309.98,'target_text'=>'And uh today is the 31st of December, which means it\'s New Year\'s Eve.','source_text'=>'Dan hari ini 31 Disember, bermakna malam ambang Tahun Baharu.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>310.08,'end_time'=>312.78,'target_text'=>'So, at midnight tonight, it\'s going to be 2026.','source_text'=>'Jadi tepat tengah malam nanti, tahun akan bertukar ke 2026.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>312.88,'end_time'=>313.82,'target_text'=>'Happy New Year, guys.','source_text'=>'Selamat Tahun Baharu, semua.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>313.92,'end_time'=>314.7,'target_text'=>'Very soon.','source_text'=>'Tak lama lagi.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>314.8,'end_time'=>315.42,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom kita gerak.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>315.52,'end_time'=>323.26,'target_text'=>'The most important part of learning a language and the reason why everyone learns a language is to be able to speak the language.','source_text'=>'Bahagian paling penting belajar bahasa dan sebab semua orang belajar bahasa adalah untuk boleh bercakap bahasa tersebut.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>323.36,'end_time'=>325.5,'target_text'=>'These videos help you with your listening.','source_text'=>'Video-video ini bantu pendengaran anda.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>325.6,'end_time'=>328.38,'target_text'=>'But how can you practice your speaking even more?','source_text'=>'Tapi macam mana anda nak latih pertuturan dengan lebih mantap?','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>328.48,'end_time'=>330.78,'target_text'=>'You need to practice by shadowing.','source_text'=>'Anda perlu berlatih melalui kaedah shadowing (meniru sebutan).','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>330.88,'end_time'=>337.98,'target_text'=>'Shadowing is just repeating after a native English speaker to practice your pronunciation, your accent, and your confidence.','source_text'=>'Shadowing adalah mengulang sebutan penutur jati bahasa Inggeris untuk melatih sebutan, slanga, dan keyakinan anda.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>338.08,'end_time'=>343.34,'target_text'=>'and I\'ve started making videos specifically just to practice those three things.','source_text'=>'dan saya dah mula buat video khas semata-mata untuk melatih tiga perkara tersebut.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>343.44,'end_time'=>349.42,'target_text'=>'So, if you guys want to become more confident in English and become truly fluent, check out my Patreon in the description','source_text'=>'Jadi, kalau korang nak lebih yakin berbahasa Inggeris dan benar-benar fasih, lihat Patreon saya di ruang deskripsi','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>349.52,'end_time'=>357.82,'target_text'=>'where I give you guys three new videos every week to practice your pronunciation, your accent, and most importantly, your','source_text'=>'di mana saya sediakan tiga video baharu setiap minggu untuk latih sebutan, slanga, dan paling utama,','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>357.92,'end_time'=>358.62,'target_text'=>'confidence.','source_text'=>'keyakinan anda.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>358.72,'end_time'=>359.82,'target_text'=>'I\'ll see you guys there.','source_text'=>'Kita jumpa di sana.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>359.92,'end_time'=>367.82,'target_text'=>'We are going to be learning English as I clean up my pronunciation, your accent, your rhythm, and your confidence.','source_text'=>'Kita akan belajar bahasa Inggeris sambil memantapkan sebutan, slanga, rentak pertuturan, dan keyakinan anda.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>367.92,'end_time'=>372.46,'target_text'=>'It was just a roundabout way of her politely trying to spare my feelings.','source_text'=>'Itu cuma cara berlapik dia cuba jaga perasaan saya secara sopan.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>372.56,'end_time'=>380.06,'target_text'=>'The a-hole for giving all of my co-workers a different reason for why I have missing fingers so I wouldn\'t take legal came','source_text'=>'Si celaka tu sebab beritahu semua rakan sekerja pelbagai alasan kenapa jari saya hilang supaya saya tak ambil tindakan undang-undang','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>380.16,'end_time'=>383.42,'target_text'=>'down to he companywide training on his behavior.','source_text'=>'sampai kena buat latihan seluruh syarikat mengenai kelakuannya.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>383.52,'end_time'=>384.46,'target_text'=>'He chooses not.','source_text'=>'Dia pilih untuk tak ikut.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>384.56,'end_time'=>387.56,'target_text'=>'But I was already so cranky.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya masa tu dah cukup meragam.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>387.92,'end_time'=>391.66,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we\'re in I did so much shopping in Mushima.','source_text'=>'Okey, kita kat— Saya banyak membeli-belah di Muji.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>391.76,'end_time'=>394.54,'target_text'=>'The jeans and one hoodie, which this is a castle.','source_text'=>'Seluar jean dan satu hoodie, dan ini nampak macam sebuah istana.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>394.64,'end_time'=>395.82,'target_text'=>'Do you think anyone lives here?','source_text'=>'Awak rasa ada orang tinggal kat sini ke?','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>395.92,'end_time'=>396.86,'target_text'=>'>> Lord Farquad.','source_text'=>'Lord Farquaad.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>396.96,'end_time'=>399.26,'target_text'=>'>> You look like Lord Farquad for a moment there.','source_text'=>'Awak nampak macam Lord Farquaad sekejap tadi.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>399.36,'end_time'=>400.22,'target_text'=>'No, but >> critical.','source_text'=>'Bukan, tapi Critical.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>400.32,'end_time'=>400.86,'target_text'=>'What\'s his name?','source_text'=>'Siapa nama dia tu?','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>400.96,'end_time'=>401.28,'target_text'=>'>> What?','source_text'=>'Siapa?','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>401.28,'end_time'=>403.18,'target_text'=>'>> That rapper that looks like Lord Farquad.','source_text'=>'Penyanyi rap yang muka macam Lord Farquaad tu.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>403.28,'end_time'=>404.54,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s like critical something.','source_text'=>'Rasanya macam Critical apa entah.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>404.64,'end_time'=>404.8,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>404.8,'end_time'=>406.7,'target_text'=>'He\'s like, I just got my hair done.','source_text'=>'Dia macam, rambut saya baru lepas buat.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>406.8,'end_time'=>412.22,'target_text'=>'Anyway, we\'re at this market and uh we\'re going to try to grab a bite to eat before we head to Icon CM.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, kami berada di pasar ni dan kami nak cari makanan alas perut sebelum bertolak ke ICONSIAM.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>412.32,'end_time'=>414.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s probably going to be crazy busy cuz it\'s like an hour away.','source_text'=>'Mestinya kat sana sesak gila sebab perjalanan ambil masa dalam sejam.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>414.72,'end_time'=>418.06,'target_text'=>'So, by the time we get there, it\'s going to be dark or almost dark and it\'s going to be insane.','source_text'=>'Jadi bila kami sampai nanti, hari dah gelap atau hampir malam dan suasananya mesti sangat sesak.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>418.16,'end_time'=>419.82,'target_text'=>'Also, I noticed this cap doesn\'t come off.','source_text'=>'Lagi satu, saya perasan penutup botol ni tak tertanggal.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>419.92,'end_time'=>422.14,'target_text'=>'That\'s like really popular in uh in Europe.','source_text'=>'Reka bentuk macam ni sangat popular di Eropah.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>422.24,'end_time'=>423.9,'target_text'=>'Like, none of the caps come off in Europe.','source_text'=>'Kat Eropah semua penutup botol melekat macam ni.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>424,'end_time'=>424.16,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>424.16,'end_time'=>426.14,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know how much I like that >> to avoid like littering.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada saya suka ke tak >> tujuannya untuk elak buang sampah merata-rata.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>426.24,'end_time'=>427.02,'target_text'=>'I don\'t mind it, honestly.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya saya tak kisah pun.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>427.12,'end_time'=>427.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s not that bad.','source_text'=>'Okey je sebenarnya.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>427.84,'end_time'=>428.08,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>428.08,'end_time'=>428.78,'target_text'=>'Where should we start?','source_text'=>'Kat mana kita patut mula?','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>428.88,'end_time'=>430.46,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, this is this was the candy.','source_text'=>'Oh, ini manisan gula-gula tu.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>430.56,'end_time'=>431.5,'target_text'=>'Tong hulu.','source_text'=>'Tanghulu.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>431.6,'end_time'=>432.22,'target_text'=>'Tong hulu.','source_text'=>'Tanghulu.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>432.32,'end_time'=>434.06,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, that\'s what I was trying to remember.','source_text'=>'Oh, itu nama yang saya cuba ingat tadi.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>434.16,'end_time'=>434.78,'target_text'=>'>> Tangulu.','source_text'=>'Tanghulu.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>434.88,'end_time'=>435.74,'target_text'=>'Yeah, that\'s what it was.','source_text'=>'Ya, itulah namanya.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>435.84,'end_time'=>438.7,'target_text'=>'Shout out to our editor cuz he put he put it up there.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih kepada penyunting video kami sebab dia paparkan teks tu.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>438.8,'end_time'=>439.5,'target_text'=>'The name of it.','source_text'=>'Nama manisan tu.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>439.6,'end_time'=>443.26,'target_text'=>'>> Uh tao or >> Yes, something like that.','source_text'=>'Tang atau >> Ya, seumpama macam tu.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>443.36,'end_time'=>444.06,'target_text'=>'Like I\'m not sure.','source_text'=>'Saya tak berapa pasti.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>444.16,'end_time'=>445.74,'target_text'=>'Pong Hulu cuz we didn\'t know the name.','source_text'=>'Tanghulu sebab kami tak tahu nama dia.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>445.84,'end_time'=>448.2,'target_text'=>'>> No, I didn\'t know.','source_text'=>'Memang saya tak tahu.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>449.6,'end_time'=>450.46,'target_text'=>'>> I just want a patai.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma nak makan pad thai.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>450.56,'end_time'=>453.18,'target_text'=>'There are a lot of stalls open and it\'s not crazy busy, dude.','source_text'=>'Banyak gerai buka dan suasananya taklah sesak sangat, kawan.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>453.28,'end_time'=>453.98,'target_text'=>'The sushi, I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Sushi kat sini, entahlah.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>454.08,'end_time'=>455.1,'target_text'=>'I would never trust this sushi.','source_text'=>'Saya takkan berani percaya makan sushi tepi jalan ni.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>455.2,'end_time'=>456.22,'target_text'=>'>> Do you know this dish right here?','source_text'=>'Awak tahu hidangan yang kat sini?','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>456.32,'end_time'=>456.86,'target_text'=>'Ka soy?','source_text'=>'Khao Soi?','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>456.96,'end_time'=>459.1,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, that\'s like really popular in Mai, isn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Oh, hidangan tu sangat popular di Chiang Mai, kan?','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>459.2,'end_time'=>460.14,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s like from Mai.','source_text'=>'Asal dari Chiang Mai.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>460.24,'end_time'=>462.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s a northern curry noodle.','source_text'=>'Ya, ia mi kari utara Thailand.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>462.64,'end_time'=>464.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I think it\'s a little strong for me.','source_text'=>'Rasa rempah dia agak kuat sikit untuk tekak saya.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>464.48,'end_time'=>465.58,'target_text'=>'Like the flavors.','source_text'=>'Rasa kuahnya.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>465.68,'end_time'=>466.08,'target_text'=>'>> Really?','source_text'=>'Ya ke?','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>466.16,'end_time'=>466.48,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>466.48,'end_time'=>466.88,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>466.88,'end_time'=>468.22,'target_text'=>'I did not know you were so picky.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu pula awak ni cerewet sangat bab makan.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>468.32,'end_time'=>469.1,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s just so oily.','source_text'=>'Kuah dia berminyak sangat.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>469.2,'end_time'=>470.86,'target_text'=>'There\'s like a layer of oil on it.','source_text'=>'Ada lapisan minyak kat atas kuah.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>470.96,'end_time'=>471.66,'target_text'=>'Like that\'s what I\'m saying.','source_text'=>'Itu maksud saya tadi.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>471.76,'end_time'=>472.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s pretty strong.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia agak kuat.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>472.56,'end_time'=>474.62,'target_text'=>'They use a lot of coconut oil to make it.','source_text'=>'Dorang guna banyak minyak santan kelapa untuk masak kuah tu.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>474.72,'end_time'=>475.98,'target_text'=>'>> Honestly, I would have a rodi after.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, saya nak makan roti canai manis (roti) lepas ni.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>476.08,'end_time'=>480.6,'target_text'=>'I think I\'ll have a rodi after, but I\'m just going to look for that pai for now.','source_text'=>'Rasanya saya nak makan roti manis lepas ni, tapi buat masa ni saya nak cari pad thai dulu.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>482.56,'end_time'=>483.5,'target_text'=>'>> What is mala?','source_text'=>'Apa itu mala?','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>483.6,'end_time'=>484.7,'target_text'=>'Isn\'t mala spicy?','source_text'=>'Bukan ke mala tu pedas?','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>484.8,'end_time'=>486.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s like a hot pot flavor.','source_text'=>'Ya, perisa rempah stimbot (hotpot) Sichuan.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>486.64,'end_time'=>487.42,'target_text'=>'Oh, those ones.','source_text'=>'Oh, yang itu.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>487.52,'end_time'=>489.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a sweet uh fish sauce pork.','source_text'=>'Daging babi sos ikan manis.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>489.92,'end_time'=>490.38,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ve had that.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah makan tu.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>490.48,'end_time'=>491.18,'target_text'=>'>> They\'re really good.','source_text'=>'Sedap gila.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>491.28,'end_time'=>492.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'ve had that.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya pernah rasa.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>492.32,'end_time'=>493.1,'target_text'=>'That one is good.','source_text'=>'Yang tu memang sedap.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>493.2,'end_time'=>494.46,'target_text'=>'>> What about the mango sticky rice?','source_text'=>'Macam mana pula dengan pulut mangga?','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>494.56,'end_time'=>495.1,'target_text'=>'Have you had that?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah makan tak?','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>495.2,'end_time'=>496.54,'target_text'=>'>> Mango sticky rice is really good.','source_text'=>'Pulut mangga memang sangat sedap.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>496.64,'end_time'=>497.98,'target_text'=>'There is a lot of good desserts.','source_text'=>'Banyak pencuci mulut yang sedap kat sini.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>498.08,'end_time'=>499.18,'target_text'=>'>> You got some bugs, too.','source_text'=>'Ada serangga goreng juga.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>499.28,'end_time'=>500.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, bugs, dude.','source_text'=>'Ya, serangga kawan.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>500.24,'end_time'=>501.1,'target_text'=>'Those are huge, man.','source_text'=>'Besar gila saiz serangga tu, kawan.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>501.2,'end_time'=>502.14,'target_text'=>'Oh my gosh, dude.','source_text'=>'Ya ampun, bro.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>502.24,'end_time'=>503.42,'target_text'=>'I tried them like one time.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah cuba makan sekali dulu.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>503.52,'end_time'=>504.38,'target_text'=>'I did it like this.','source_text'=>'Saya buat macam ni.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>504.48,'end_time'=>505.34,'target_text'=>'Actually, I have a video.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya saya ada video rakaman.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>505.44,'end_time'=>506.3,'target_text'=>'I\'ll put it in if I see it.','source_text'=>'Nanti saya selitkan kalau saya jumpa fail video tu.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>506.4,'end_time'=>510.14,'target_text'=>'But I did it like this and I shook it all in my mouth and ate it and like it\'s not worth it.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya buat macam ni dan masukkan semua dalam mulut dan kunyah, memang tak berbaloi langsung.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>510.24,'end_time'=>512.3,'target_text'=>'Honestly, it cost a lot and I I didn\'t eat it all.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya harga agak mahal dan saya tak habiskan pun.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>512.4,'end_time'=>513.42,'target_text'=>'I\'m not into bugs.','source_text'=>'Saya bukan penggemar makanan serangga.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>513.52,'end_time'=>513.76,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>513.76,'end_time'=>515.82,'target_text'=>'The only one I\'ve had is this scorpion.','source_text'=>'Satu-satunya yang pernah saya rasa ialah kala jengking.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>515.92,'end_time'=>518.78,'target_text'=>'I never had any other bug and uh it was not that good.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah rasa serangga lain dan rasanya tak berapa sedap pun.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>518.88,'end_time'=>520.94,'target_text'=>'>> That probably doesn\'t even taste like anything though.','source_text'=>'Benda tu rasanya langsung tak ada perisa apa-apa.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>521.04,'end_time'=>522.3,'target_text'=>'>> No, just a sauce they put on.','source_text'=>'Memang tak ada, rasa sos yang dorang sapu tu je.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>522.4,'end_time'=>524.38,'target_text'=>'It was like a sweet teriyaki sauce they had.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam sos teriyaki manis yang dorang letak.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>524.48,'end_time'=>525.42,'target_text'=>'That\'s all it tasted like.','source_text'=>'Itu je rasa yang ada.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>525.52,'end_time'=>528.46,'target_text'=>'Maybe at one of these restaurants along the edges we\'ll find a pep.','source_text'=>'Mungkin kat salah satu kedai di sepanjang deretan ni ada jual pad thai.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>528.56,'end_time'=>529.5,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, definitely.','source_text'=>'Mesti ada punya.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>529.6,'end_time'=>532.06,'target_text'=>'Uh, >> or what about Fruity Cuties?','source_text'=>'Atau >> macam mana pula dengan kedai Fruity Cuties tu?','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>532.16,'end_time'=>533.74,'target_text'=>'Isn\'t that what they called you in high school?','source_text'=>'Bukan ke itu gelaran dorang panggil awak masa sekolah menengah dulu?','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>533.84,'end_time'=>535.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>535.28,'end_time'=>537.42,'target_text'=>'>> I definitely want to get a roi 100%.','source_text'=>'Saya memang betul-betul nak beli roti canai manis 100%.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>537.52,'end_time'=>541.58,'target_text'=>'That\'s fire, but I need to eat something like salty before then and then I could go do that.','source_text'=>'Itu memang padu, tapi saya kena makan makanan masin dulu sebelum makan yang manis tu.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>541.68,'end_time'=>542.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that\'s a good plan.','source_text'=>'Ya, rancangan yang bagus.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>542.56,'end_time'=>543.9,'target_text'=>'Th >> This one looks good though.','source_text'=>'Tapi yang ini nampak sedap.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>544,'end_time'=>544.46,'target_text'=>'Look at that.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah tu.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>544.56,'end_time'=>546.46,'target_text'=>'>> You can get it now and then keep it for dinner.','source_text'=>'Awak boleh beli sekarang lepas tu simpan untuk makan malam.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>546.56,'end_time'=>546.96,'target_text'=>'>> I won\'t.','source_text'=>'Saya takkan buat macam tu.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>546.96,'end_time'=>547.9,'target_text'=>'I would eat it right away.','source_text'=>'Saya mesti terus makan on the spot.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>548,'end_time'=>548.78,'target_text'=>'I know myself.','source_text'=>'Saya kenal diri saya.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>548.88,'end_time'=>549.66,'target_text'=>'>> You don\'t have self-control.','source_text'=>'Awak tak ada kawalan diri.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>549.76,'end_time'=>552.62,'target_text'=>'>> If it\'s right in front of me and it\'s warm, I\'m just going to eat it.','source_text'=>'Kalau benda tu depan mata dan masih panas berasap, saya terus ngap je.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>552.72,'end_time'=>554.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that\'s relatable.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya faham sangat perasaan tu.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>554.24,'end_time'=>556.3,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s go through the middle of this one and see it.','source_text'=>'Jom kita lalu celah laluan tengah ni dan tengok.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>556.4,'end_time'=>556.64,'target_text'=>'>> All right.','source_text'=>'Baiklah.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>556.64,'end_time'=>557.82,'target_text'=>'What\'s this market called?','source_text'=>'Apa nama pasar ni?','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>557.92,'end_time'=>560.46,'target_text'=>'I\'m not even going to try to pronounce it, but this is what it\'s called.','source_text'=>'Saya malas nak cuba sebut nama dia, tapi inilah namanya.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>560.56,'end_time'=>562.14,'target_text'=>'>> Leah Duban.','source_text'=>'Liab Duan.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>562.24,'end_time'=>562.94,'target_text'=>'Is that the right one?','source_text'=>'Betul ke pasar ni?','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>563.04,'end_time'=>564.14,'target_text'=>'That\'s only got 300 reviews.','source_text'=>'Tempat ni cuma ada 300 ulasan je.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>564.24,'end_time'=>566.78,'target_text'=>'I\'m pretty sure it had more reviews than that.','source_text'=>'Saya yakin ulasan dia sepatutnya lebih banyak daripada tu.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>566.88,'end_time'=>568.14,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s the photos are this one.','source_text'=>'Gambar-gambar kat sini memang padan dengan tempat ni.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>568.24,'end_time'=>569.82,'target_text'=>'So, I would say yeah, this is it.','source_text'=>'Jadi rasanya memang inilah tempatnya.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>569.92,'end_time'=>570.62,'target_text'=>'>> Hey, what\'s the move?','source_text'=>'Apa rancangan kita sekarang?','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>570.72,'end_time'=>573.42,'target_text'=>'>> The move is we couldn\'t find the patai, so we\'re just going to get a roadie.','source_text'=>'Rancangan dia kita tak jumpa pad thai, jadi kita beli roti canai manis (roti) je.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>573.52,'end_time'=>574.54,'target_text'=>'But, let\'s see what they got here.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom tengok apa menu yang ada kat sini.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>574.64,'end_time'=>575.82,'target_text'=>'>> I think you should get durian.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa awak patut cuba roti durian.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>575.92,'end_time'=>576.7,'target_text'=>'>> Roi durian.','source_text'=>'Roti durian.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>576.8,'end_time'=>577.5,'target_text'=>'Crazy word.','source_text'=>'Pilihan yang gila.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>577.6,'end_time'=>579.9,'target_text'=>'I think banana Nutella is simply the best.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya pisang Nutella adalah yang terbaik.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>580,'end_time'=>582.14,'target_text'=>'Honestly, I think I\'m going to go with banana Nutella.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, saya rasa saya akan pilih pisang Nutella.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>582.24,'end_time'=>583.1,'target_text'=>'That\'s like my favorite one.','source_text'=>'Itu perisa kegemaran saya.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>583.2,'end_time'=>585.18,'target_text'=>'I haven\'t had it in a while, so let me get that one.','source_text'=>'Dah lama saya tak makan, jadi biar saya pesan yang tu.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>585.28,'end_time'=>588.54,'target_text'=>'Banana Nutella, I think, is their most popular one, >> I think, globally.','source_text'=>'Pisang Nutella rasanya yang paling popular, secara global pun orang suka.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>588.64,'end_time'=>593.26,'target_text'=>'But that flavor combo in like creps or pancakes, that\'s >> Yeah, banana or even toast.','source_text'=>'Gabungan perisa tu dalam krep atau lempeng memang mantap >> Ya, dengan roti bakar pun sedap.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>593.36,'end_time'=>594.86,'target_text'=>'I put banana Nutella on toast.','source_text'=>'Saya selalu letak pisang dengan Nutella atas roti bakar.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>594.96,'end_time'=>596.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s also the diabetes combo.','source_text'=>'Itu juga kombo pakej kencing manis.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>596.4,'end_time'=>600.3,'target_text'=>'I think we\'re the first to order cuz that thing is clean and shiny.','source_text'=>'Rasanya kita pelanggan pertama pesan sebab kuali leper tu nampak bersih berkilat.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>600.4,'end_time'=>600.64,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>600.64,'end_time'=>605.34,'target_text'=>'So, she\'s just like pressing that dough against the counter there, flat.','source_text'=>'Jadi mak cik tu tengah canai doh atas meja kaunter sampai leper.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>605.44,'end_time'=>608.14,'target_text'=>'I think she makes it as thin as possible and then fries it.','source_text'=>'Dia buat senipis yang mungkin lepas tu goreng atas kuali.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>608.24,'end_time'=>611.34,'target_text'=>'Now, she\'s slapping it to like make it uh like to stretch it out.','source_text'=>'Sekarang dia tebar dan kibas doh tu untuk regangkan bagi lebar.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>611.44,'end_time'=>611.76,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh, ya.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>611.76,'end_time'=>612.38,'target_text'=>'That\'s how they do it.','source_text'=>'Macam tu cara dorang tebar.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>612.48,'end_time'=>613.34,'target_text'=>'That\'s how they make it that thin.','source_text'=>'Macam tu dorang bagi doh tu jadi nipis.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>613.44,'end_time'=>616.22,'target_text'=>'I wonder what uh inside the dough makes it crispy.','source_text'=>'Saya tertanya-tanya bahan apa dalam doh yang buat ia rangup.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>616.32,'end_time'=>618.22,'target_text'=>'Got to be like butter or something.','source_text'=>'Mesti sebab letak marjerin atau mentega.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>618.32,'end_time'=>619.74,'target_text'=>'>> That thing looks like it has a lot of butter.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam letak banyak mentega tu.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>619.84,'end_time'=>620.38,'target_text'=>'No doubt.','source_text'=>'Memang tak syak lagi.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>620.48,'end_time'=>621.66,'target_text'=>'Yeah, there you go.','source_text'=>'Haa, tengok tu.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>621.76,'end_time'=>623.66,'target_text'=>'Yeah, that thing cooks in like seconds.','source_text'=>'Roti tu masak dalam masa beberapa saat je.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>623.76,'end_time'=>625.5,'target_text'=>'Banana.','source_text'=>'Pisang.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>625.6,'end_time'=>626.7,'target_text'=>'>> Oh yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh ya.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>626.8,'end_time'=>627.9,'target_text'=>'>> Just flipping it now.','source_text'=>'Tengah terbalikkan roti tu sekarang.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>628,'end_time'=>631.58,'target_text'=>'>> And then you wrap it up the ai way.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu lipat kemas gaya khas Thai.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>631.68,'end_time'=>633.42,'target_text'=>'>> When I came here, >> have you been here?','source_text'=>'Masa saya datang sini dulu, >> awak pernah sampai sini ke?','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>633.52,'end_time'=>634.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, this exact one.','source_text'=>'Ya, kedai yang sama ni.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>634.4,'end_time'=>634.8,'target_text'=>'A year ago.','source_text'=>'Setahun yang lepas.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>634.88,'end_time'=>635.34,'target_text'=>'>> Like at night?','source_text'=>'Waktu malam ke?','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>635.44,'end_time'=>636.46,'target_text'=>'I mean like what time of day?','source_text'=>'Maksud saya waktu bila siang ke malam?','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>636.56,'end_time'=>639.26,'target_text'=>'>> At night, but it was during the week, so it was kind of dead still.','source_text'=>'Waktu malam, tapi masa tu hari biasa bekerja, jadi pasar agak lengang.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>639.36,'end_time'=>642.7,'target_text'=>'>> Well, today is like Wednesday, >> but this is the busiest day probably of the year.','source_text'=>'Hari ini hari Rabu, >> tapi ini hari paling sibuk sepanjang tahun.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>642.8,'end_time'=>643.12,'target_text'=>'New York.','source_text'=>'Malam Tahun Baharu.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>643.12,'end_time'=>645.58,'target_text'=>'>> But were a lot of stalls open at least or >> No, it wasn\'t.','source_text'=>'Tapi banyak gerai buka ke masa tu? >> Tak banyak buka pun.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>645.68,'end_time'=>647.42,'target_text'=>'So, I didn\'t really find that much good food.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya tak jumpa banyak makanan sedap masa tu.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>647.52,'end_time'=>649.02,'target_text'=>'>> I think all the stalls are open.','source_text'=>'Rasanya malam ni semua gerai buka.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>649.12,'end_time'=>649.52,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>649.6,'end_time'=>650.86,'target_text'=>'Go to Iconium.','source_text'=>'Pergi ke ICONSIAM.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>650.96,'end_time'=>651.98,'target_text'=>'Oh, it\'s going to be crazy.','source_text'=>'Mesti gila sesak kat sana.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>652.08,'end_time'=>652.54,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to get there.','source_text'=>'Kita akan sampai sana.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>652.64,'end_time'=>653.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s going to be dark.','source_text'=>'Hari dah nak gelap.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>653.44,'end_time'=>657.74,'target_text'=>'Actually, we could take we could take the green line all the way down and then transfer to the other one and just take one','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya kita boleh naik laluan hijau terus ke bawah lepas tu bertukar ke satu lagi tren dan naik satu','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>657.84,'end_time'=>658.38,'target_text'=>'grab.','source_text'=>'Grab.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>658.48,'end_time'=>661.1,'target_text'=>'>> But at Central, the line is going to be crazy busy.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi kat Central, barisan tren mesti sesak gila.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>661.2,'end_time'=>661.6,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>661.6,'end_time'=>662.54,'target_text'=>'But the line for what?','source_text'=>'Tapi beratur untuk apa?','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>662.64,'end_time'=>665.66,'target_text'=>'I don\'t even want to go in there though cuz once you go in, you\'re not getting out.','source_text'=>'Saya tak nak masuk langsung pun kat dalam tu sebab sekali awak masuk, awak takkan boleh keluar balik.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>665.76,'end_time'=>666.38,'target_text'=>'>> You saw the videos.','source_text'=>'>> Awak dah tengok video-video tu.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>666.48,'end_time'=>667.98,'target_text'=>'They\'re like gridlocked, right?','source_text'=>'Dorang tersekat tak boleh gerak langsung kan?','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>668.08,'end_time'=>668.32,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>668.32,'end_time'=>670.76,'target_text'=>'Now she\'s cutting it.','source_text'=>'Sekarang mak cik tu tengah potong roti tu.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>672.88,'end_time'=>674.86,'target_text'=>'We\'re at a market in Bangkok, Thailand.','source_text'=>'Kami berada di sebuah pasar di Bangkok, Thailand.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>674.96,'end_time'=>680.78,'target_text'=>'We just ordered the roadie, which is probably one of the most famous desserts here beside like besides mango sticky rice.','source_text'=>'Kami baru pesan roti canai manis (roti), yang merupakan antara pencuci mulut paling terkenal kat sini selain pulut mangga.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>680.88,'end_time'=>681.66,'target_text'=>'But let\'s try it.','source_text'=>'Jom kita rasa.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>681.76,'end_time'=>682.78,'target_text'=>'>> She just made it, right?','source_text'=>'>> Dia baru siap masak panas-panas kan?','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>682.88,'end_time'=>683.04,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>683.04,'end_time'=>683.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s like the perfect dessert.','source_text'=>'Ia macam pencuci mulut yang sempurna.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>684,'end_time'=>688.04,'target_text'=>'Like crispy on the outside, soft and gooey on the inside.','source_text'=>'Rangup di luar, lembut dan berlemak manis di dalam.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>688.24,'end_time'=>689.1,'target_text'=>'>> Oh my.','source_text'=>'>> Ya tuhan.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>689.2,'end_time'=>692.06,'target_text'=>'>> On a scale 1 to 10, how sweet is it?','source_text'=>'>> Skala 1 hingga 10, berapa manis rasa dia?','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>692.16,'end_time'=>692.86,'target_text'=>'>> How sweet is it?','source_text'=>'>> Berapa manis?','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>692.96,'end_time'=>693.2,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>693.2,'end_time'=>694.54,'target_text'=>'On a scale of 1 to 10.','source_text'=>'Pada skala 1 hingga 10.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>694.64,'end_time'=>697.18,'target_text'=>'>> Well, it was sweet and then she put condensed milk over top.','source_text'=>'>> Memang dah manis lepas tu dia tuang susu pekat manis lagi kat atas.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>697.28,'end_time'=>698.22,'target_text'=>'Diabetes combo.','source_text'=>'Kombo kencing manis.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>698.32,'end_time'=>699.66,'target_text'=>'Honestly, this is like This is my favorite.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, ini memang kegemaran saya.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>699.76,'end_time'=>702.14,'target_text'=>'I like this more than mango sticky rice.','source_text'=>'Saya lebih suka roti ni berbanding pulut mangga.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>702.24,'end_time'=>703.9,'target_text'=>'Diabetes combo in my opinion.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya ini kombo manis potong kaki.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>704,'end_time'=>705.1,'target_text'=>'You have to eat it quick though.','source_text'=>'Tapi kena makan laju-laju waktu panas.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>705.2,'end_time'=>707.82,'target_text'=>'But that crispiness and then the banana Nutella on top.','source_text'=>'Kerangupan dia ditambah dengan pisang Nutella di atas.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>707.92,'end_time'=>709.02,'target_text'=>'You really can\'t beat that.','source_text'=>'Memang tak boleh tandingi kesedapan dia.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>709.12,'end_time'=>712.62,'target_text'=>'And then the further inside you go, the more banana you get.','source_text'=>'Dan makin ke dalam gigitan, makin banyak pisang yang awak rasa.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>712.72,'end_time'=>714.76,'target_text'=>'It\'s fire','source_text'=>'Memang padu gila','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>715.2,'end_time'=>716.3,'target_text'=>'diabetes combo.','source_text'=>'kombo manis terangkat.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>716.4,'end_time'=>717.5,'target_text'=>'Is this pai or?','source_text'=>'Ini pad thai ke atau?','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>717.6,'end_time'=>718.06,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Bukan.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>718.16,'end_time'=>720.86,'target_text'=>'Oh, it\'s a fish ball pai.','source_text'=>'Oh, ini pad thai bebola ikan.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>720.96,'end_time'=>721.9,'target_text'=>'You want one?','source_text'=>'Awak nak satu ke?','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>722,'end_time'=>723.98,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'ll get the >> this one.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya nak yang >> yang ni.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>724.08,'end_time'=>724.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>724.64,'end_time'=>726.14,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, they got intestines, too.','source_text'=>'>> Dorang ada pedal/usus juga.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>726.24,'end_time'=>726.94,'target_text'=>'Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'Oh, wah.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>727.04,'end_time'=>727.66,'target_text'=>'Is this like heart?','source_text'=>'Ini hati ke?','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>727.76,'end_time'=>730.06,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to get Yeah, I\'m going to get that one.','source_text'=>'Saya nak ambil— ya, saya nak yang tu.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>730.16,'end_time'=>730.56,'target_text'=>'>> What is that?','source_text'=>'>> Apa benda tu?','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>730.56,'end_time'=>732.06,'target_text'=>'Is that >> That\'s chicken butt.','source_text'=>'Itu— >> Itu tongkeng ayam.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>732.16,'end_time'=>733.1,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ll I\'ll get one of those, too.','source_text'=>'>> Saya nak ambil satu yang tu juga.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>733.2,'end_time'=>733.6,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s this?','source_text'=>'>> Yang ni apa pula?','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>733.68,'end_time'=>734.94,'target_text'=>'>> Well, you can you can ask her.','source_text'=>'>> Awak boleh tanya mak cik tu.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>735.04,'end_time'=>736.3,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, and here you got sauces.','source_text'=>'>> Kat sini ada pelbagai jenis sos.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>736.4,'end_time'=>737.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, there\'s more over there.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kat sebelah sana ada lagi.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>737.84,'end_time'=>738.54,'target_text'=>'Barbecue.','source_text'=>'Barbeku.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>738.64,'end_time'=>739.74,'target_text'=>'>> Is that actually chicken butt?','source_text'=>'>> Itu betul-betul tongkeng ayam ke?','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>739.84,'end_time'=>740.16,'target_text'=>'>> Yep.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>740.16,'end_time'=>741.1,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to get one of those.','source_text'=>'Saya nak ambil satu cucuk yang tu.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>741.2,'end_time'=>742.54,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I\'ll get two of those.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya dua cucuk yang tu.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>742.64,'end_time'=>744.92,'target_text'=>'And one of those.','source_text'=>'Dan satu yang tu.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>746.24,'end_time'=>748.46,'target_text'=>'>> We managed to get the patai.','source_text'=>'>> Kami berjaya dapatkan pad thai.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>748.56,'end_time'=>751.1,'target_text'=>'And also, we got a bunch of skewers.','source_text'=>'Dan kami juga dapat beberapa cucuk sate.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>751.2,'end_time'=>753.66,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure which was which, but here are the skewers.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti yang mana satu jenis apa, tapi inilah cucuk-cucuk sate tu.','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>753.76,'end_time'=>755.5,'target_text'=>'We got a bunch of different flavors, I guess.','source_text'=>'Kami dapat pelbagai perisa berbeza rasanya.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>755.6,'end_time'=>756.38,'target_text'=>'Let me try one of these.','source_text'=>'Biar saya rasa salah satu cucuk ni.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>756.48,'end_time'=>757.66,'target_text'=>'I got teriyak.','source_text'=>'Saya dapat perisa teriyaki.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>757.76,'end_time'=>759.5,'target_text'=>'I think this is the most like popular one.','source_text'=>'Rasanya ini yang paling popular.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>759.6,'end_time'=>761.26,'target_text'=>'This is like meat that they mush up, right?','source_text'=>'Ini daging kisar lumat yang dibentuk kan?','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>761.36,'end_time'=>762.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s not like a solid piece.','source_text'=>'Bukan ketulan daging pejal.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>762.32,'end_time'=>763.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s like ground.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, macam daging cincang.','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>763.52,'end_time'=>765.74,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s like mushed meat, but I see this everywhere.','source_text'=>'>> Macam daging kisar, tapi saya nampak benda ni merata-rata.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>765.84,'end_time'=>769.42,'target_text'=>'I think this is the most like popular famous one.','source_text'=>'Rasanya ini jenis yang paling popular dan terkenal.','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>769.52,'end_time'=>769.92,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>770,'end_time'=>772.06,'target_text'=>'Fire busting or goo fire.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia memang mantap padu.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>772.16,'end_time'=>772.56,'target_text'=>'Okay.','source_text'=>'Okey.','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>772.56,'end_time'=>774.22,'target_text'=>'So, I got one of these.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya ambil satu yang ni.','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>774.32,'end_time'=>776.14,'target_text'=>'Pretty sure this was my one.','source_text'=>'Saya yakin ini yang saya punya.','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>776.24,'end_time'=>776.78,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>776.88,'end_time'=>779.34,'target_text'=>'Or no, I think that\'s the chicken butt.','source_text'=>'Atau bukan, rasanya itu tongkeng ayam.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>779.44,'end_time'=>780.06,'target_text'=>'>> This was my one.','source_text'=>'>> Ini yang saya punya.','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>780.16,'end_time'=>781.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that\'s the chicken skewer.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, itu cucuk isi ayam.','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>781.52,'end_time'=>783.5,'target_text'=>'>> Let me try the chicken butt, though.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi biar saya cuba tongkeng ayam ni dulu.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>783.6,'end_time'=>784.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s pretty fatty though.','source_text'=>'Banyak lemak betul.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>784.56,'end_time'=>785.42,'target_text'=>'No, >> super fatty.','source_text'=>'Bukan sekadar banyak, >> tersangat berlemak.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>785.52,'end_time'=>787.02,'target_text'=>'And there\'s a little bit of cartilage in it.','source_text'=>'Dan ada sedikit tulang rawan kat dalam dia.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>787.12,'end_time'=>790.54,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s why I didn\'t really want to get it because it\'s like, will I like it if it\'s pure fat?','source_text'=>'>> Sebab itulah saya tak berapa nak beli tadi sebab saya terfikir, boleh telan ke kalau lemak semata-mata?','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>790.64,'end_time'=>792.94,'target_text'=>'Cuz I know what chicken butt is, but this one\'s huge.','source_text'=>'Sebab saya tahu tongkeng ayam tu apa, tapi saiz yang ni besar sangat.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>793.04,'end_time'=>795.56,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe turkey butts.','source_text'=>'>> Entah-entah tongkeng ayam belanda.','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>797.28,'end_time'=>798.94,'target_text'=>'>> There\'s a bone in there.','source_text'=>'>> Ada tulang kat dalam tu.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>799.04,'end_time'=>802.3,'target_text'=>'I\'m going be honest, not a fan of the butt.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, saya bukan peminat tongkeng ayam.','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>802.4,'end_time'=>805.34,'target_text'=>'If it didn\'t have any bone and I could just easily eat it, it would have been better.','source_text'=>'Kalau tak ada tulang dan senang dikunyah telan, mesti lebih sedap.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>805.44,'end_time'=>806.86,'target_text'=>'But there was a pretty big bone in there.','source_text'=>'Tapi ada ketulan tulang yang agak besar kat dalam tu.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>806.96,'end_time'=>808.54,'target_text'=>'So, but anyways, this is our peta we got.','source_text'=>'Tapi apa-apa pun, inilah pad thai yang kami beli.','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>808.64,'end_time'=>811.1,'target_text'=>'This was 20 bot and each of these were also 20 bot.','source_text'=>'Yang ini 20 baht dan setiap cucuk ni pun 20 baht.','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>811.2,'end_time'=>812.14,'target_text'=>'So, 60 bot total.','source_text'=>'Jadi jumlahnya 60 baht.','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>812.24,'end_time'=>813.82,'target_text'=>'But I would say that\'s a decent amount of meat.','source_text'=>'Tapi bagi saya isi daging dia agak banyak juga.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>813.92,'end_time'=>815.1,'target_text'=>'But these noodles look nice.','source_text'=>'Dan mi ni nampak sangat menyelerakan.','order'=>460],
            ['start_time'=>815.2,'end_time'=>816.54,'target_text'=>'Put a little chili on the side.','source_text'=>'Letak serbuk cili sikit kat tepi.','order'=>461],
            ['start_time'=>816.64,'end_time'=>818.46,'target_text'=>'And it comes with like fish balls.','source_text'=>'Dan hidangan ni disertakan dengan bebola ikan.','order'=>462],
            ['start_time'=>818.56,'end_time'=>820.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they\'re just different textures.','source_text'=>'Ya, teksturnya cuma berbeza sikit.','order'=>463],
            ['start_time'=>820.16,'end_time'=>821.74,'target_text'=>'So, they\'re basically the same meat, though.','source_text'=>'Tapi pada dasarnya ramuan daging yang sama.','order'=>464],
            ['start_time'=>821.84,'end_time'=>827.18,'target_text'=>'>> If that chicken butt was like really warm, it would be better, but it\'s like cold, so it just kind of tastes like fat.','source_text'=>'Kalau tongkeng ayam tu panas berasap mesti sedap lagi, tapi yang ni dah sejuk, jadi rasa lemak beku je.','order'=>465],
            ['start_time'=>827.28,'end_time'=>828.46,'target_text'=>'You know, cold fat.','source_text'=>'Faham-fahamlah kan, lemak sejuk.','order'=>466],
            ['start_time'=>828.56,'end_time'=>830.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, maybe I won\'t like it as much.','source_text'=>'Ya, mungkin saya tak berapa suka kalau macam tu.','order'=>467],
            ['start_time'=>830.56,'end_time'=>831.18,'target_text'=>'>> Very fishy.','source_text'=>'Bau hanyir ikan kuat sikit.','order'=>468],
            ['start_time'=>831.28,'end_time'=>833.1,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try the balls.','source_text'=>'Jom rasa bebola ikan ni.','order'=>469],
            ['start_time'=>833.2,'end_time'=>833.98,'target_text'=>'Balls are good.','source_text'=>'Bebola ni sedap.','order'=>470],
            ['start_time'=>834.08,'end_time'=>837.26,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to finish eating this and then head to the icon.','source_text'=>'Kami nak habiskan makanan ni lepas tu terus gerak ke ICONSIAM.','order'=>471],
            ['start_time'=>837.36,'end_time'=>840.7,'target_text'=>'We just ate and now we\'re going to go catch the crane that\'s over there.','source_text'=>'Kami baru lepas makan dan sekarang nak pergi naik tren yang kat sebelah sana tu.','order'=>472],
            ['start_time'=>840.8,'end_time'=>844.78,'target_text'=>'I feel like they could have put some trees to make it a little bit nicer, but the hedges they made are pretty nice.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa elok kalau dorang tanam pokok untuk nampak lebih redup, tapi pokok renek berpagar ni pun dah cukup kemas.','order'=>473],
            ['start_time'=>844.88,'end_time'=>848.94,'target_text'=>'But we\'re about to hop on this line and head down towards uh Icon CM.','source_text'=>'Tapi kami dah nak naik laluan tren ni menuju ke ICONSIAM.','order'=>474],
            ['start_time'=>849.04,'end_time'=>849.98,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom gerak.','order'=>475],
            ['start_time'=>850.08,'end_time'=>852.06,'target_text'=>'Okay, so in Korea they have the T- Money.','source_text'=>'Okey, kat Korea dorang ada kad T-Money.','order'=>476],
            ['start_time'=>852.16,'end_time'=>854.22,'target_text'=>'In Bangkok, they have the rabbit card.','source_text'=>'Di Bangkok pula, dorang guna kad Rabbit (Rabbit Card).','order'=>477],
            ['start_time'=>854.32,'end_time'=>857.98,'target_text'=>'Although the rabbit card can only be used on the BTS lines.','source_text'=>'Walaupun kad Rabbit ni cuma boleh guna untuk laluan BTS SkyTrain je.','order'=>478],
            ['start_time'=>858.08,'end_time'=>858.86,'target_text'=>'Everything is private.','source_text'=>'Semuanya milik syarikat swasta.','order'=>479],
            ['start_time'=>858.96,'end_time'=>861.9,'target_text'=>'So there are a bunch of different private like subway providers.','source_text'=>'Jadi ada beberapa pengendali tren bawah tanah dan transit yang berasingan.','order'=>480],
            ['start_time'=>862,'end_time'=>864.54,'target_text'=>'So this card I could only use here and one other place.','source_text'=>'Jadi kad ni saya cuma boleh guna kat sini dengan satu tempat lagi.','order'=>481],
            ['start_time'=>864.64,'end_time'=>866.94,'target_text'=>'So it\'s kind of annoying if I\'m being honest.','source_text'=>'Agak leceh juga kalau nak jujur.','order'=>482],
            ['start_time'=>867.04,'end_time'=>871.18,'target_text'=>'But, uh, I would like to just have one card for everything, but it\'s kind of like that in Japan, too.','source_text'=>'Saya lebih suka kalau ada satu kad universal untuk semua transit, tapi kat Jepun pun macam ni juga.','order'=>483],
            ['start_time'=>871.28,'end_time'=>872.54,'target_text'=>'Different cities have their own cards.','source_text'=>'Bandar berbeza ada kad transit masing-masing.','order'=>484],
            ['start_time'=>872.64,'end_time'=>874.94,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m going to tap my card','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya sentuh (tap) kad saya','order'=>485],
            ['start_time'=>875.04,'end_time'=>875.98,'target_text'=>'and go in.','source_text'=>'dan masuk ke dalam.','order'=>486],
            ['start_time'=>876.08,'end_time'=>877.98,'target_text'=>'Those are some nice high-rise apartments.','source_text'=>'Pangsapuri tinggi kat sana tu nampak sangat cantik.','order'=>487],
            ['start_time'=>878.08,'end_time'=>878.54,'target_text'=>'I like those.','source_text'=>'Saya suka rekaan dia.','order'=>488],
            ['start_time'=>878.64,'end_time'=>881.26,'target_text'=>'And they\'re really close to the BTS station.','source_text'=>'Dan lokasinya sangat dekat dengan stesen BTS.','order'=>489],
            ['start_time'=>881.36,'end_time'=>884.38,'target_text'=>'This is what a like a subway station looks like in Bangkok.','source_text'=>'Macam nilah rupa stesen tren transit di Bangkok.','order'=>490],
            ['start_time'=>884.48,'end_time'=>890.46,'target_text'=>'This is an open air one, and it\'s above ground, but there are underground subway stations as well, like similar to Korea.','source_text'=>'Ini jenis stesen terbuka di atas jejambat, tapi ada juga stesen bawah tanah sama macam di Korea.','order'=>491],
            ['start_time'=>890.56,'end_time'=>891.02,'target_text'=>'Really similar.','source_text'=>'Sangat serupa.','order'=>492],
            ['start_time'=>891.12,'end_time'=>896.86,'target_text'=>'Most of the BTS ones are above ground >> cuz they\'re called sky trains and the underground ones are the MRT ones.','source_text'=>'Kebanyakan stesen BTS berada di atas bertingkat >> sebab dorang panggil SkyTrain, dan yang bawah tanah tu MRT.','order'=>493],
            ['start_time'=>896.96,'end_time'=>897.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, sky train.','source_text'=>'Ya, SkyTrain.','order'=>494],
            ['start_time'=>897.76,'end_time'=>898.22,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, there it is.','source_text'=>'Tu dia dah sampai.','order'=>495],
            ['start_time'=>898.32,'end_time'=>899.74,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, I see it >> to the last stop.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya nampak >> sampai stesen terakhir.','order'=>496],
            ['start_time'=>899.84,'end_time'=>903.82,'target_text'=>'>> Hopefully the train isn\'t packed because I think everyone\'s going to start going that way.','source_text'=>'Harap-harap tren tak sesak padat sebab rasanya semua orang dah mula gerak ke arah sana.','order'=>497],
            ['start_time'=>903.92,'end_time'=>904.78,'target_text'=>'We\'ll see how busy it is.','source_text'=>'Kita tengok betapa sesaknya nanti.','order'=>498],
            ['start_time'=>904.88,'end_time'=>906.46,'target_text'=>'Let\'s line up.','source_text'=>'Jom kita beratur.','order'=>499],
            ['start_time'=>906.56,'end_time'=>911.1,'target_text'=>'So, the train has just arrived and it doesn\'t look too too busy.','source_text'=>'Jadi, tren baru je sampai dan nampaknya tak terlalu sesak.','order'=>500],
            ['start_time'=>911.2,'end_time'=>912.54,'target_text'=>'It\'s not crazy busy in there.','source_text'=>'Tak adalah terlalu padat kat dalam tu.','order'=>501],
            ['start_time'=>912.64,'end_time'=>914.06,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, we\'ll definitely get a spot.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita mesti dapat ruang berdiri.','order'=>502],
            ['start_time'=>914.16,'end_time'=>918.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s not crazy crowded, but as we go further down, it\'s probably going to be a lot busier, but the doors are about to open','source_text'=>'Tak sesak sangat, tapi bila tren makin menghampiri pusat bandar mesti makin padat, dan pintu dah nak terbuka','order'=>503],
            ['start_time'=>918.88,'end_time'=>920.46,'target_text'=>'and then we could uh go in.','source_text'=>'untuk kita masuk.','order'=>504],
            ['start_time'=>920.56,'end_time'=>921.5,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom kita masuk.','order'=>505],
            ['start_time'=>921.6,'end_time'=>922.62,'target_text'=>'You got the sugar cane.','source_text'=>'Ada air tebu.','order'=>506],
            ['start_time'=>922.72,'end_time'=>923.98,'target_text'=>'I could use a baxi.','source_text'=>'Boleh tahan juga kalau dapat.','order'=>507],
            ['start_time'=>924.08,'end_time'=>925.82,'target_text'=>'>> I wonder what that is.','source_text'=>'Tertanya-tanya juga apa benda tu.','order'=>508],
            ['start_time'=>925.92,'end_time'=>927.72,'target_text'=>'>> Fishbowl.','source_text'=>'Bebola ikan.','order'=>509],
            ['start_time'=>928.08,'end_time'=>929.82,'target_text'=>'>> You didn\'t really like those other fishbowls, did you?','source_text'=>'Awak tak berapa suka bebola ikan yang tadi kan?','order'=>510],
            ['start_time'=>929.92,'end_time'=>930.16,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>511],
            ['start_time'=>930.16,'end_time'=>932.46,'target_text'=>'I\'m not really a huge uh fish ball fan, so I didn\'t get it.','source_text'=>'Saya bukan penggemar tegar bebola ikan, jadi saya tak beli.','order'=>512],
            ['start_time'=>932.56,'end_time'=>935.26,'target_text'=>'But >> yeah, >> I think we might have to take a boat across.','source_text'=>'Tapi >> ya, >> rasanya kita kena naik bot seberang sungai.','order'=>513],
            ['start_time'=>935.36,'end_time'=>935.68,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti.','order'=>514],
            ['start_time'=>935.68,'end_time'=>939.66,'target_text'=>'I thought I saw a walking path like you can walk like on Google Maps.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa macam nampak laluan pejalan kaki dalam Google Maps.','order'=>515],
            ['start_time'=>939.76,'end_time'=>942.46,'target_text'=>'>> I think the road that we saw is up there, but I don\'t know if you can walk.','source_text'=>'Rasanya jalan raya yang kita nampak kat atas tu, tapi tak tahu boleh jalan kaki ke tak.','order'=>516],
            ['start_time'=>942.56,'end_time'=>943.74,'target_text'=>'>> Google maps kind of cooked.','source_text'=>'Google Maps macam pening sikit.','order'=>517],
            ['start_time'=>943.84,'end_time'=>945.34,'target_text'=>'>> Can we walk up there?','source_text'=>'Boleh jalan kaki naik atas tu ke?','order'=>518],
            ['start_time'=>945.44,'end_time'=>947.74,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so now we\'re about across the bridge here.','source_text'=>'Okey, sekarang kita dah nak seberang jambatan kat sini.','order'=>519],
            ['start_time'=>947.84,'end_time'=>950.46,'target_text'=>'Yeah, we could walk across the whole bridge, but it\'s probably crowded.','source_text'=>'Ya, kita boleh jalan kaki seberang sepanjang jambatan, tapi mungkin sesak.','order'=>520],
            ['start_time'=>950.56,'end_time'=>952.86,'target_text'=>'>> You think everyone here is going to wait like 6 hours?','source_text'=>'Awak rasa semua orang kat sini sanggup tunggu sampai 6 jam?','order'=>521],
            ['start_time'=>952.96,'end_time'=>953.36,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>522],
            ['start_time'=>953.36,'end_time'=>953.76,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>523],
            ['start_time'=>953.84,'end_time'=>955.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s >> busy.','source_text'=>'Ya, memang >> sesak.','order'=>524],
            ['start_time'=>955.52,'end_time'=>956.62,'target_text'=>'That\'s the mall right there.','source_text'=>'Itulah pusat beli-belah kat seberang sana.','order'=>525],
            ['start_time'=>956.72,'end_time'=>959.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, the boat is bringing them directly there.','source_text'=>'Ya, bot bawa penumpang terus ke pintu mall tu.','order'=>526],
            ['start_time'=>959.12,'end_time'=>964.22,'target_text'=>'>> So, we\'re now like walking through this really dark, sketchy, dangerous alleyway.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami tengah jalan lalu lorong gelap, sunyi dan agak mencurigakan ni.','order'=>527],
            ['start_time'=>964.32,'end_time'=>965.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I can barely see.','source_text'=>'Ya, hampir tak nampak apa-apa.','order'=>528],
            ['start_time'=>965.44,'end_time'=>967.42,'target_text'=>'>> We still have over 5 hours to wait.','source_text'=>'Masih ada lebih 5 jam lagi kena tunggu.','order'=>529],
            ['start_time'=>967.52,'end_time'=>971.82,'target_text'=>'Honestly, we probably should have went out later, but we\'re already here, so let\'s find some things to do.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya kami patut keluar lewat sikit, tapi dah alang-alang sampai, jom cari aktiviti.','order'=>530],
            ['start_time'=>971.92,'end_time'=>972.54,'target_text'=>'>> Vibes.','source_text'=>'Layan suasana.','order'=>531],
            ['start_time'=>972.64,'end_time'=>973.34,'target_text'=>'These are the vibes.','source_text'=>'Inilah suasananya.','order'=>532],
            ['start_time'=>973.44,'end_time'=>979.02,'target_text'=>'Yeah, we\'re walking there and there are a lot of tuk tuks there bringing people probably overcharging you like a lot.','source_text'=>'Ya, kami tengah jalan dan banyak tuk-tuk bawa penumpang, mesti dorang cekik darah caj mahal gila.','order'=>533],
            ['start_time'=>979.12,'end_time'=>979.74,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, easy.','source_text'=>'Memang sah.','order'=>534],
            ['start_time'=>979.84,'end_time'=>981.58,'target_text'=>'>> But if you know the price then it\'s fine.','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau awak tahu harga pasaran biasa tak ada masalah.','order'=>535],
            ['start_time'=>981.68,'end_time'=>983.82,'target_text'=>'But yeah, that\'s like an actual just like a vehicle.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, itu memang kenderaan pengangkutan unik.','order'=>536],
            ['start_time'=>983.92,'end_time'=>986.94,'target_text'=>'>> Me and Kyle took one and it had like bulking stereo system in it.','source_text'=>'Saya dengan Kyle pernah naik satu tuk-tuk yang ada sistem pembesar suara gempak gila.','order'=>537],
            ['start_time'=>987.04,'end_time'=>987.44,'target_text'=>'It was sick.','source_text'=>'Memang padu gila.','order'=>538],
            ['start_time'=>987.52,'end_time'=>987.84,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh, ya.','order'=>539],
            ['start_time'=>987.84,'end_time'=>995.18,'target_text'=>'They usually the ones uh on that uh green line always have like a really crazy LEDs and like stereo systems, >> you know.','source_text'=>'Tuk-tuk kat kawasan laluan hijau tu memang selalu pasang lampu LED meriah dengan sistem audio gempak.','order'=>540],
            ['start_time'=>995.28,'end_time'=>997.1,'target_text'=>'This is the biggest mall in Thailand.','source_text'=>'Ini pusat beli-belah terbesar di Thailand.','order'=>541],
            ['start_time'=>997.2,'end_time'=>997.6,'target_text'=>'>> Is it?','source_text'=>'Ya ke?','order'=>542],
            ['start_time'=>997.6,'end_time'=>997.92,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>543],
            ['start_time'=>997.92,'end_time'=>999.26,'target_text'=>'>> So, we\'re in Icon Sam now.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang kami berada di ICONSIAM.','order'=>544],
            ['start_time'=>999.36,'end_time'=>1000.46,'target_text'=>'I can see the first sign there.','source_text'=>'Saya dah nampak papan tanda pertama kat situ.','order'=>545],
            ['start_time'=>1000.56,'end_time'=>1001.5,'target_text'=>'So, this is the mall.','source_text'=>'Jadi inilah mall tu.','order'=>546],
            ['start_time'=>1001.6,'end_time'=>1002.54,'target_text'=>'Can you even go in?','source_text'=>'Boleh masuk ke ni?','order'=>547],
            ['start_time'=>1002.64,'end_time'=>1003.58,'target_text'=>'Oh yeah, I guess.','source_text'=>'Boleh rasanya.','order'=>548],
            ['start_time'=>1003.68,'end_time'=>1005.02,'target_text'=>'>> Why don\'t we just go inside?','source_text'=>'Jomlah kita masuk dalam.','order'=>549],
            ['start_time'=>1005.12,'end_time'=>1005.66,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s busy here.','source_text'=>'Sesak betul kat sini.','order'=>550],
            ['start_time'=>1005.76,'end_time'=>1006.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s crowded.','source_text'=>'Padat dengan orang.','order'=>551],
            ['start_time'=>1006.4,'end_time'=>1009.18,'target_text'=>'Wait, why is the biggest mall on the other side of the river?','source_text'=>'Kejap, kenapa mall paling besar terletak di seberang sungai?','order'=>552],
            ['start_time'=>1009.28,'end_time'=>1011.66,'target_text'=>'>> They had to buy like 20 locks to be able to build it.','source_text'=>'Dorang terpaksa beli dalam 20 lot tanah untuk bina mall ni.','order'=>553],
            ['start_time'=>1011.76,'end_time'=>1012.54,'target_text'=>'This is the cheapest.','source_text'=>'Kawasan ni tanah paling murah.','order'=>554],
            ['start_time'=>1012.64,'end_time'=>1015.5,'target_text'=>'>> Everything that\'s like bumping is on the right side of the river.','source_text'=>'Semua kawasan yang meriah dan sibuk ada di sebelah kanan sungai.','order'=>555],
            ['start_time'=>1015.6,'end_time'=>1016,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>556],
            ['start_time'=>1016.08,'end_time'=>1017.9,'target_text'=>'>> Or on the on the east side.','source_text'=>'Atau di sebelah timur.','order'=>557],
            ['start_time'=>1018,'end_time'=>1018.16,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>558],
            ['start_time'=>1018.16,'end_time'=>1019.74,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s it was a space issue though.','source_text'=>'Rasanya isu keluasan tanah yang terhad.','order'=>559],
            ['start_time'=>1019.84,'end_time'=>1021.18,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, let\'s go in, I guess.','source_text'=>'Okey, jomlah kita masuk ke dalam.','order'=>560],
            ['start_time'=>1021.28,'end_time'=>1022.86,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so we just got in.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi kami baru je berjaya masuk.','order'=>561],
            ['start_time'=>1022.96,'end_time'=>1023.74,'target_text'=>'No problems.','source_text'=>'Tak ada masalah apa-apa.','order'=>562],
            ['start_time'=>1023.84,'end_time'=>1027.02,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to go up a couple floors cuz this area is kind of like really crowded.','source_text'=>'Kita naik beberapa tingkat ke atas sebab kawasan aras bawah ni terlalu sesak.','order'=>563],
            ['start_time'=>1027.12,'end_time'=>1028.14,'target_text'=>'>> That is so busy.','source_text'=>'Sesak gila kat bawah tu.','order'=>564],
            ['start_time'=>1028.24,'end_time'=>1028.86,'target_text'=>'How big is it?','source_text'=>'Besar mana mall ni?','order'=>565],
            ['start_time'=>1028.96,'end_time'=>1029.42,'target_text'=>'>> Very big, dude.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat besar, kawan.','order'=>566],
            ['start_time'=>1029.52,'end_time'=>1031.66,'target_text'=>'There\'s like probably seven or eight floors, right?','source_text'=>'Ada dalam tujuh atau lapan tingkat kan?','order'=>567],
            ['start_time'=>1031.76,'end_time'=>1035.26,'target_text'=>'At least do >> they have the general monster, but it\'s like mushrooms.','source_text'=>'Sekurang-kurangnya >> ada Gentle Monster, tapi rekaan bertema cendawan.','order'=>568],
            ['start_time'=>1035.36,'end_time'=>1035.82,'target_text'=>'That\'s funny.','source_text'=>'Kelakar juga.','order'=>569],
            ['start_time'=>1035.92,'end_time'=>1036.46,'target_text'=>'Why?','source_text'=>'Kenapa?','order'=>570],
            ['start_time'=>1036.56,'end_time'=>1037.82,'target_text'=>'>> Why do you think they got the mushrooms?','source_text'=>'Kenapa awak rasa dorang guna tema cendawan?','order'=>571],
            ['start_time'=>1037.92,'end_time'=>1038.86,'target_text'=>'>> We go check it out.','source_text'=>'Jom kita pergi tengok dekat-dekat.','order'=>572],
            ['start_time'=>1038.96,'end_time'=>1040.7,'target_text'=>'>> So, this is uh General Monster.','source_text'=>'Jadi ini kedai Gentle Monster.','order'=>573],
            ['start_time'=>1040.8,'end_time'=>1042.46,'target_text'=>'We went to like a bunch of them in Soul.','source_text'=>'Kami pernah pergi ke beberapa cawangan masa kat Seoul.','order'=>574],
            ['start_time'=>1042.56,'end_time'=>1044.3,'target_text'=>'>> Well, they\'re Korean, so >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Jenama ni dari Korea, jadi >> Ya.','order'=>575],
            ['start_time'=>1044.4,'end_time'=>1045.26,'target_text'=>'I mean, yeah.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, ya betul.','order'=>576],
            ['start_time'=>1045.36,'end_time'=>1046.78,'target_text'=>'>> Someone actually just noticed me in Thailand.','source_text'=>'Ada orang baru je cam saya kat Thailand ni.','order'=>577],
            ['start_time'=>1046.88,'end_time'=>1049.18,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s the first person that noticed me, but he was nice.','source_text'=>'Itu orang pertama yang tegur dan kenal saya, dia sangat peramah.','order'=>578],
            ['start_time'=>1049.28,'end_time'=>1050.3,'target_text'=>'We just took a photo.','source_text'=>'Kami sempat bergambar bersama.','order'=>579],
            ['start_time'=>1050.4,'end_time'=>1051.34,'target_text'=>'Happy New Year, everyone.','source_text'=>'Selamat Tahun Baharu semua.','order'=>580],
            ['start_time'=>1051.44,'end_time'=>1051.9,'target_text'=>'What\'s this?','source_text'=>'Apa benda ni?','order'=>581],
            ['start_time'=>1052,'end_time'=>1052.24,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'Okey.','order'=>582],
            ['start_time'=>1052.24,'end_time'=>1052.48,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>583],
            ['start_time'=>1052.48,'end_time'=>1052.94,'target_text'=>'This is cool.','source_text'=>'Ini menarik.','order'=>584],
            ['start_time'=>1053.04,'end_time'=>1053.9,'target_text'=>'I\'ve seen this online.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah nampak seni robot ni dalam internet.','order'=>585],
            ['start_time'=>1054,'end_time'=>1055.9,'target_text'=>'I feel like they have something similar in soul, though.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam ada rekaan serupa kat Seoul juga.','order'=>586],
            ['start_time'=>1056,'end_time'=>1056.24,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Taklah.','order'=>587],
            ['start_time'=>1056.24,'end_time'=>1057.74,'target_text'=>'And that one moves, doesn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Dan robot tu bergerak-gerak kan?','order'=>588],
            ['start_time'=>1057.84,'end_time'=>1058.16,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>589],
            ['start_time'=>1058.16,'end_time'=>1058.48,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>590],
            ['start_time'=>1058.48,'end_time'=>1059.18,'target_text'=>'Look at that dog.','source_text'=>'Tengok anjing tu.','order'=>591],
            ['start_time'=>1059.28,'end_time'=>1059.98,'target_text'=>'What\'s that dog called?','source_text'=>'Apa baka anjing tu?','order'=>592],
            ['start_time'=>1060.08,'end_time'=>1060.7,'target_text'=>'The wiener dog.','source_text'=>'Anjing sosej (Dachshund) ke?','order'=>593],
            ['start_time'=>1060.8,'end_time'=>1061.04,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Bukan.','order'=>594],
            ['start_time'=>1061.04,'end_time'=>1063.1,'target_text'=>'No, that\'s a It looks like a Doberman.','source_text'=>'Bukan, nampak macam anjing Doberman.','order'=>595],
            ['start_time'=>1063.2,'end_time'=>1063.44,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'Bukan.','order'=>596],
            ['start_time'=>1063.44,'end_time'=>1063.84,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Bukan.','order'=>597],
            ['start_time'=>1063.84,'end_time'=>1064.24,'target_text'=>'>> Like a C.','source_text'=>'Macam corgi.','order'=>598],
            ['start_time'=>1064.32,'end_time'=>1066.62,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s It\'s like those those small dogs that are white.','source_text'=>'Ia macam anjing kecil yang berbulu putih tu.','order'=>599],
            ['start_time'=>1066.72,'end_time'=>1067.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, those are wiener dogs.','source_text'=>'Ya, itu anjing sosej.','order'=>600],
            ['start_time'=>1067.6,'end_time'=>1067.84,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'Bukan.','order'=>601],
            ['start_time'=>1067.84,'end_time'=>1068.08,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Bukanlah.','order'=>602],
            ['start_time'=>1068.08,'end_time'=>1069.74,'target_text'=>'Like it has a specific name.','source_text'=>'Ada nama khusus baka dia.','order'=>603],
            ['start_time'=>1069.84,'end_time'=>1070.78,'target_text'=>'I forget what it\'s called.','source_text'=>'Saya terlupa nama baka tu.','order'=>604],
            ['start_time'=>1070.88,'end_time'=>1071.04,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Bukan.','order'=>605],
            ['start_time'=>1071.04,'end_time'=>1071.2,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Bukan.','order'=>606],
            ['start_time'=>1071.2,'end_time'=>1072.7,'target_text'=>'That one\'s like >> the long ones.','source_text'=>'Yang tu jenis >> badan panjang.','order'=>607],
            ['start_time'=>1072.8,'end_time'=>1073.2,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>608],
            ['start_time'=>1073.2,'end_time'=>1073.74,'target_text'=>'Wiener dogs.','source_text'=>'Anjing Dachshund.','order'=>609],
            ['start_time'=>1073.84,'end_time'=>1074,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'Bukan.','order'=>610],
            ['start_time'=>1074,'end_time'=>1076.94,'target_text'=>'I wanted to get a dog like this, but it has >> Oh, it\'s moving.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah nak bela anjing macam ni, tapi ada >> Oh, robot tu bergerak.','order'=>611],
            ['start_time'=>1077.04,'end_time'=>1079.34,'target_text'=>'>> This is the dog we saw in Ecuador at that park.','source_text'=>'Ini macam anjing yang kita nampak kat Ecuador dalam taman hari tu.','order'=>612],
            ['start_time'=>1079.44,'end_time'=>1081.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, but the color is like a Doberman.','source_text'=>'Ya, tapi warna bulunya macam Doberman.','order'=>613],
            ['start_time'=>1081.44,'end_time'=>1081.84,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>614],
            ['start_time'=>1081.92,'end_time'=>1082.08,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Betul.','order'=>615],
            ['start_time'=>1082.08,'end_time'=>1083.1,'target_text'=>'I forget what it\'s called.','source_text'=>'Saya lupa apa nama baka dia.','order'=>616],
            ['start_time'=>1083.2,'end_time'=>1084.22,'target_text'=>'>> Should we start moving up?','source_text'=>'Patutkah kita mula naik ke atas?','order'=>617],
            ['start_time'=>1084.32,'end_time'=>1084.56,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>618],
            ['start_time'=>1084.56,'end_time'=>1085.26,'target_text'=>'Let\'s keep going.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan jalan.','order'=>619],
            ['start_time'=>1085.36,'end_time'=>1090.62,'target_text'=>'So, we\'ve just gone up like two floors, but you can see down there just how big this mall is.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kami baru naik dalam dua tingkat, tapi korang boleh tengok ke bawah betapa besarnya mall ni.','order'=>620],
            ['start_time'=>1090.72,'end_time'=>1093.58,'target_text'=>'And you were saying it\'s the biggest mall in Thailand, right?','source_text'=>'Dan awak kata ini pusat beli-belah terbesar di Thailand kan?','order'=>621],
            ['start_time'=>1093.68,'end_time'=>1093.92,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>622],
            ['start_time'=>1093.92,'end_time'=>1094.78,'target_text'=>'Is that actually a fact?','source_text'=>'Betul ke fakta tu?','order'=>623],
            ['start_time'=>1094.88,'end_time'=>1095.34,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s a fact.','source_text'=>'Memang fakta tepat.','order'=>624],
            ['start_time'=>1095.44,'end_time'=>1099.98,'target_text'=>'>> And today is especially crowded because of the like New Year celebration here.','source_text'=>'Dan hari ini sangat sesak terutamanya sebab sambutan ambang Tahun Baharu kat sini.','order'=>625],
            ['start_time'=>1100.08,'end_time'=>1103.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s like the biggest area to have like the New Year celebration in Icon CM.','source_text'=>'Di sinilah kawasan sambutan Tahun Baharu terbesar di ICONSIAM.','order'=>626],
            ['start_time'=>1103.52,'end_time'=>1108.3,'target_text'=>'But let\'s keep going up cuz maybe there\'s a nice view of that area cuz there is like a big open area outside.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom teruskan naik sebab mungkin ada pemandangan cantik kawasan luar memandangkan ada dataran terbuka yang luas di luar.','order'=>627],
            ['start_time'=>1108.4,'end_time'=>1110.7,'target_text'=>'No, that\'s where everyone would be cuz I\'ve seen videos of it.','source_text'=>'Kat situlah semua orang akan berkumpul sebab saya pernah tengok video-video sebelum ni.','order'=>628],
            ['start_time'=>1110.8,'end_time'=>1111.98,'target_text'=>'Dude, I do not want to be in that.','source_text'=>'Kawan, saya memang tak nak bersesak-sesak dalam lautan orang macam tu.','order'=>629],
            ['start_time'=>1112.08,'end_time'=>1112.86,'target_text'=>'Like I\'m going to be honest.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya saya cakap.','order'=>630],
            ['start_time'=>1112.96,'end_time'=>1113.98,'target_text'=>'>> Here\'s a terrace.','source_text'=>'Kat sini ada balkoni teres luar.','order'=>631],
            ['start_time'=>1114.08,'end_time'=>1115.74,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, they have some activities here.','source_text'=>'Oh, ada aktiviti kat sini.','order'=>632],
            ['start_time'=>1115.84,'end_time'=>1116.24,'target_text'=>'Oh, no.','source_text'=>'Oh, taklah.','order'=>633],
            ['start_time'=>1116.24,'end_time'=>1116.78,'target_text'=>'They\'re not lined up.','source_text'=>'Dorang bukan tengah beratur.','order'=>634],
            ['start_time'=>1116.88,'end_time'=>1117.82,'target_text'=>'They\'re just watching.','source_text'=>'Dorang cuma berdiri menonton.','order'=>635],
            ['start_time'=>1117.92,'end_time'=>1119.74,'target_text'=>'>> We can go out, it looks like.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya kita boleh keluar ke balkoni.','order'=>636],
            ['start_time'=>1119.84,'end_time'=>1122.7,'target_text'=>'And then outside in that terrace, you can see the river.','source_text'=>'Dan dari luar teres tu awak boleh nampak pemandangan sungai.','order'=>637],
            ['start_time'=>1122.8,'end_time'=>1124.6,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>638],
            ['start_time'=>1124.96,'end_time'=>1126.76,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>639],
            ['start_time'=>1130.08,'end_time'=>1131.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that took a while.','source_text'=>'Ya, ambil masa agak lama juga.','order'=>640],
            ['start_time'=>1131.28,'end_time'=>1131.6,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>641],
            ['start_time'=>1131.6,'end_time'=>1132.94,'target_text'=>'>> So, I was faster than you.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya lebih cepat sampai daripada awak.','order'=>642],
            ['start_time'=>1133.04,'end_time'=>1134.3,'target_text'=>'>> How much was yours?','source_text'=>'Berapa harga tambang awak tadi?','order'=>643],
            ['start_time'=>1134.4,'end_time'=>1135.02,'target_text'=>'>> 75.','source_text'=>'75 baht.','order'=>644],
            ['start_time'=>1135.12,'end_time'=>1135.52,'target_text'=>'>> Same.','source_text'=>'Saya pun sama.','order'=>645],
            ['start_time'=>1135.52,'end_time'=>1136.86,'target_text'=>'>> How far is it?','source_text'=>'Berapa jauh dari sini?','order'=>646],
            ['start_time'=>1136.96,'end_time'=>1137.5,'target_text'=>'>> Uh, I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti.','order'=>647],
            ['start_time'=>1137.6,'end_time'=>1139.26,'target_text'=>'You have to check Check his phone.','source_text'=>'Kena periksa— periksa telefon dia.','order'=>648],
            ['start_time'=>1139.36,'end_time'=>1141.64,'target_text'=>'Check your phone.','source_text'=>'Tengok telefon awak.','order'=>649],
            ['start_time'=>1141.84,'end_time'=>1142.7,'target_text'=>'>> 17 minutes.','source_text'=>'17 minit.','order'=>650],
            ['start_time'=>1142.8,'end_time'=>1143.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>651],
            ['start_time'=>1143.36,'end_time'=>1145.58,'target_text'=>'>> Hop at Are you going to fall if you do that?','source_text'=>'Naik— awak tak takut jatuh ke buat macam tu?','order'=>652],
            ['start_time'=>1145.68,'end_time'=>1146.22,'target_text'=>'>> No, dude.','source_text'=>'Taklah kawan.','order'=>653],
            ['start_time'=>1146.32,'end_time'=>1148.38,'target_text'=>'Once you get used to it, you don\'t need hands or anything.','source_text'=>'Bila dah biasa, tak payah pegang pemegang tangan langsung pun boleh.','order'=>654],
            ['start_time'=>1148.48,'end_time'=>1148.8,'target_text'=>'>> I know.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu.','order'=>655],
            ['start_time'=>1148.8,'end_time'=>1151.58,'target_text'=>'I see people like that, but I\'m like uh feel like I would fall.','source_text'=>'Saya nampak orang lain buat macam tu, tapi saya rasa macam saya boleh jatuh.','order'=>656],
            ['start_time'=>1151.68,'end_time'=>1153.66,'target_text'=>'>> Like you you squeeze with your legs.','source_text'=>'Kena kepit peha kemas-kemas pada tempat duduk.','order'=>657],
            ['start_time'=>1153.76,'end_time'=>1155.26,'target_text'=>'>> You have to walk around that barricade.','source_text'=>'Awak kena pusing keliling penghadang jalan tu.','order'=>658],
            ['start_time'=>1155.36,'end_time'=>1155.76,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'Tak.','order'=>659],
            ['start_time'=>1155.84,'end_time'=>1158.62,'target_text'=>'Yeah, but I couldn\'t see them cuz the map wasn\'t working.','source_text'=>'Ya, tapi saya tak nampak dorang tadi sebab peta tak berfungsi.','order'=>660],
            ['start_time'=>1158.72,'end_time'=>1159.26,'target_text'=>'But >> Yeah, I know.','source_text'=>'Tapi >> Ya, saya tahu.','order'=>661],
            ['start_time'=>1159.36,'end_time'=>1161.66,'target_text'=>'For me, I I walked too far and then I had to walk back.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya, saya terlajak jalan jauh sangat lepas tu kena patah balik.','order'=>662],
            ['start_time'=>1161.76,'end_time'=>1163.5,'target_text'=>'But he sent me a selfie, so I was able to see.','source_text'=>'Tapi dia ada hantar gambar swafoto, jadi saya boleh cam dia.','order'=>663],
            ['start_time'=>1163.6,'end_time'=>1164.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I sent him a selfie.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya hantar swafoto kat dia.','order'=>664],
            ['start_time'=>1164.96,'end_time'=>1167.34,'target_text'=>'>> I was able to see who it was because there were so many.','source_text'=>'Saya dapat cam siapa penunggangnya sebab terlalu ramai orang kat situ.','order'=>665],
            ['start_time'=>1167.44,'end_time'=>1169.1,'target_text'=>'I was checking every license plate.','source_text'=>'Saya terpaksa periksa satu-satu nombor plat pendaftaran.','order'=>666],
            ['start_time'=>1169.2,'end_time'=>1169.98,'target_text'=>'But yeah, for real.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, memang betul.','order'=>667],
            ['start_time'=>1170.08,'end_time'=>1170.62,'target_text'=>'Let\'s rip.','source_text'=>'Jom kita pecut gerak.','order'=>668],
            ['start_time'=>1170.72,'end_time'=>1172.6,'target_text'=>'>> All right.','source_text'=>'Baiklah.','order'=>669],
            ['start_time'=>1178.72,'end_time'=>1180.62,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we\'re in Central World.','source_text'=>'Okey, sekarang kami berada di CentralWorld.','order'=>670],
            ['start_time'=>1180.72,'end_time'=>1185.58,'target_text'=>'We were at uh Icon Sam, but now we\'re in Central World, a new area.','source_text'=>'Tadi kami kat ICONSIAM, tapi sekarang kami berada di CentralWorld, kawasan baharu.','order'=>671],
            ['start_time'=>1185.68,'end_time'=>1187.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I like this area more.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya lebih suka kawasan ni.','order'=>672],
            ['start_time'=>1187.12,'end_time'=>1190.94,'target_text'=>'There\'s a lot more space to walk and you don\'t have to be like in the mall, but we\'ll walk towards the mall.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak ruang untuk berjalan kaki dan tak perlu terperap dalam mall, tapi kami jalan ke arah mall.','order'=>673],
            ['start_time'=>1191.04,'end_time'=>1192.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s still super early.','source_text'=>'Masih terlalu awal.','order'=>674],
            ['start_time'=>1192.32,'end_time'=>1192.56,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>675],
            ['start_time'=>1192.56,'end_time'=>1192.88,'target_text'=>'8.','source_text'=>'Pukul 8:00 malam.','order'=>676],
            ['start_time'=>1192.88,'end_time'=>1193.12,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>677],
            ['start_time'=>1193.12,'end_time'=>1193.28,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Betul.','order'=>678],
            ['start_time'=>1193.28,'end_time'=>1194.46,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go walk that way.','source_text'=>'Jom kita jalan ikut arah sana.','order'=>679],
            ['start_time'=>1194.56,'end_time'=>1195.98,'target_text'=>'Are you mid Kirk vacation?','source_text'=>'Awak tengah pening kepala ke?','order'=>680],
            ['start_time'=>1196.08,'end_time'=>1197.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'m kind of tweaking.','source_text'=>'Ya, mata saya rasa pedih dan mengantuk gila.','order'=>681],
            ['start_time'=>1197.12,'end_time'=>1199.66,'target_text'=>'I need those eye drops, but I don\'t have them.','source_text'=>'Saya perlukan ubat titis mata, tapi saya tak bawa.','order'=>682],
            ['start_time'=>1199.76,'end_time'=>1205.9,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we got into Central World and they still have their Christmas tree up and Hong Kong Disneyland.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi kami dah masuk ke CentralWorld dan dorang masih pasang pokok Krismas bertema Hong Kong Disneyland.','order'=>683],
            ['start_time'=>1206,'end_time'=>1207.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, >> we are not in Hong Kong.','source_text'=>'Ya, >> padahal kita bukan kat Hong Kong pun.','order'=>684],
            ['start_time'=>1207.76,'end_time'=>1210.38,'target_text'=>'>> So, there\'s a bar up there that you can get into that\'s really popular.','source_text'=>'Ada sebuah bar kat tingkat atas yang sangat popular kalau nak lepak.','order'=>685],
            ['start_time'=>1210.48,'end_time'=>1211.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s in the gay gay store.','source_text'=>'Terletak kat bahagian bangunan sana.','order'=>686],
            ['start_time'=>1212,'end_time'=>1217.26,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s still about tminus 3 and 1/2 hours until midnight.','source_text'=>'Masih ada baki 3 jam setengah sebelum detik tengah malam.','order'=>687],
            ['start_time'=>1217.36,'end_time'=>1218.46,'target_text'=>'So, I don\'t know if we\'ll wait here.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya tak pasti sama ada kami akan tunggu kat sini.','order'=>688],
            ['start_time'=>1218.56,'end_time'=>1223.42,'target_text'=>'If we go out, it would kind of suck to have to come back in and stuff, but we\'ll walk around and see what they got here.','source_text'=>'Kalau kami keluar, leceh pula nak beratur masuk balik, tapi kami pusing-pusing tengok apa yang ada kat sini.','order'=>689],
            ['start_time'=>1223.52,'end_time'=>1224.38,'target_text'=>'Maybe they have food.','source_text'=>'Mungkin ada makanan.','order'=>690],
            ['start_time'=>1224.48,'end_time'=>1227.64,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m trying to lose weight, so I won\'t get it.','source_text'=>'Saya tengah nak turunkan berat badan, jadi saya tak beli.','order'=>691],
            ['start_time'=>1236.88,'end_time'=>1240.78,'target_text'=>'Okay, so they have the Merry Christmas bag still, but it\'s New Year\'s.','source_text'=>'Okey, beg kertas masih bertulis Selamat Hari Krismas walaupun dah malam Tahun Baharu.','order'=>692],
            ['start_time'=>1240.88,'end_time'=>1243.42,'target_text'=>'I got a toasty, a triple cheese ham.','source_text'=>'Saya beli sandwic bakar (toastie) tiga lapis keju bersama daging ham.','order'=>693],
            ['start_time'=>1243.52,'end_time'=>1243.98,'target_text'=>'Look at that.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah tu.','order'=>694],
            ['start_time'=>1244.08,'end_time'=>1246.06,'target_text'=>'This is like super popular to get.','source_text'=>'Ini snek yang tersangat popular kat 7-Eleven.','order'=>695],
            ['start_time'=>1246.16,'end_time'=>1250.78,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re in Thailand trying the most famous sandwich in Thailand, the toasty.','source_text'=>'Kami berada di Thailand mencuba sandwic paling terkenal di Thailand, iaitu toastie.','order'=>696],
            ['start_time'=>1250.88,'end_time'=>1253.26,'target_text'=>'And uh yeah, it\'s still about 3 hours till New Year\'s.','source_text'=>'Dan ya, masih ada kira-kira 3 jam sebelum masuk tahun baharu.','order'=>697],
            ['start_time'=>1253.36,'end_time'=>1254.3,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m ready to go home.','source_text'=>'Badan saya sebenarnya dah bersedia nak balik tidur.','order'=>698],
            ['start_time'=>1254.4,'end_time'=>1256.92,'target_text'=>'We got to wait it out.','source_text'=>'Tapi kami kena bertahan tunggu sampai habis.','order'=>699],
            ['start_time'=>1257.2,'end_time'=>1259.5,'target_text'=>'Hopefully this helps.','source_text'=>'Harap-harap roti ni dapat bantu bagi tenaga.','order'=>700],
            ['start_time'=>1259.6,'end_time'=>1262.06,'target_text'=>'Hey guys, we\'re at McDonald\'s now.','source_text'=>'Hai semua, sekarang kami berada di McDonald\'s.','order'=>701],
            ['start_time'=>1262.16,'end_time'=>1265.98,'target_text'=>'It\'s still 9:30, so we have two and a half hours to go.','source_text'=>'Baru pukul 9:30 malam, jadi ada dua jam setengah lagi kena tunggu.','order'=>702],
            ['start_time'=>1266.08,'end_time'=>1269.74,'target_text'=>'So, we decided to stop at McDonald\'s and get a drink fries.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami buat keputusan singgah di McDonald\'s beli minuman dan kentang goreng.','order'=>703],
            ['start_time'=>1269.84,'end_time'=>1270.54,'target_text'=>'This is something new.','source_text'=>'Ini menu baharu.','order'=>704],
            ['start_time'=>1270.64,'end_time'=>1271.18,'target_text'=>'Oh, this is new.','source_text'=>'Oh, ini menu baharu.','order'=>705],
            ['start_time'=>1271.28,'end_time'=>1272.46,'target_text'=>'This is coffee banana.','source_text'=>'Ini pai kopi pisang (coffee banana pie).','order'=>706],
            ['start_time'=>1272.56,'end_time'=>1273.26,'target_text'=>'>> Coffee banana.','source_text'=>'Kopi pisang.','order'=>707],
            ['start_time'=>1273.36,'end_time'=>1275.34,'target_text'=>'>> They also had corn and pineapple, but I\'m like, no.','source_text'=>'Dorang ada pai jagung dan nanas juga, tapi saya tolak.','order'=>708],
            ['start_time'=>1275.44,'end_time'=>1276.62,'target_text'=>'And then a Mc Chicken.','source_text'=>'Dan burger McChicken.','order'=>709],
            ['start_time'=>1276.72,'end_time'=>1279.58,'target_text'=>'This is the one thing I want to try cuz I have never had it.','source_text'=>'Inilah satu benda yang saya nak rasa sebab saya tak pernah makan sebelum ni.','order'=>710],
            ['start_time'=>1279.68,'end_time'=>1282.04,'target_text'=>'But coffee banana.','source_text'=>'Pai kopi pisang.','order'=>711],
            ['start_time'=>1284.16,'end_time'=>1285.82,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, tastes like a roi.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam roti canai pisang.','order'=>712],
            ['start_time'=>1285.92,'end_time'=>1286.86,'target_text'=>'Like a coffee roi.','source_text'=>'Macam roti kopi.','order'=>713],
            ['start_time'=>1286.96,'end_time'=>1288.62,'target_text'=>'Like it\'s like the same type of crunch.','source_text'=>'Kerangupan kulit dia seakan-akan sama.','order'=>714],
            ['start_time'=>1288.72,'end_time'=>1291.8,'target_text'=>'>> It looks like it >> with ice cream.','source_text'=>'Rupa bentuk dia serupa >> bila cicah aiskrim.','order'=>715],
            ['start_time'=>1294,'end_time'=>1294.4,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'Okey.','order'=>716],
            ['start_time'=>1294.4,'end_time'=>1295.82,'target_text'=>'Yeah, that\'s actually fire.','source_text'=>'Ya, yang ni memang sedap padu.','order'=>717],
            ['start_time'=>1295.92,'end_time'=>1297.34,'target_text'=>'>> Give it a rating.','source_text'=>'Bagi markah penilaian.','order'=>718],
            ['start_time'=>1297.44,'end_time'=>1298.7,'target_text'=>'Give it your rating.','source_text'=>'Bagi penilaian awak.','order'=>719],
            ['start_time'=>1298.8,'end_time'=>1299.5,'target_text'=>'Good.','source_text'=>'Sedap.','order'=>720],
            ['start_time'=>1299.6,'end_time'=>1300.62,'target_text'=>'Fire or butter?','source_text'=>'Padu atau biasa-biasa?','order'=>721],
            ['start_time'=>1300.72,'end_time'=>1303.58,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s fire cuz that crunch and then it goes really good with the ice cream.','source_text'=>'Memang padu sebab kerangupan kulit dia sangat serasi bila makan dengan aiskrim.','order'=>722],
            ['start_time'=>1303.68,'end_time'=>1305.9,'target_text'=>'If it was just this, it would just be it would be good.','source_text'=>'Kalau makan pai ni saja sedap juga.','order'=>723],
            ['start_time'=>1306,'end_time'=>1307.34,'target_text'=>'But with the ice cream, fire.','source_text'=>'Tapi bila gabung dengan aiskrim, memang luar biasa mantap.','order'=>724],
            ['start_time'=>1307.44,'end_time'=>1308.14,'target_text'=>'No, I like that.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka kombinasi ni.','order'=>725],
            ['start_time'=>1308.24,'end_time'=>1309.5,'target_text'=>'We still got to wait 2 and 1/2 hours.','source_text'=>'Kami masih kena tunggu 2 jam setengah lagi.','order'=>726],
            ['start_time'=>1309.6,'end_time'=>1312.14,'target_text'=>'We\'re probably going to try to kill some time here until then.','source_text'=>'Kami mungkin akan luangkan masa lepak kat sini sementara tunggu waktu tu.','order'=>727],
            ['start_time'=>1312.24,'end_time'=>1314.3,'target_text'=>'Maybe an hour or two cuz I don\'t know what else to do.','source_text'=>'Mungkin sejam dua sebab tak tahu nak buat apa lagi dah.','order'=>728],
            ['start_time'=>1314.4,'end_time'=>1315.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s so crowded.','source_text'=>'Terlalu sesak kat luar.','order'=>729],
            ['start_time'=>1315.28,'end_time'=>1316.22,'target_text'=>'Can\'t even walk anywhere.','source_text'=>'Langsung tak boleh nak berjalan ke mana-mana.','order'=>730],
            ['start_time'=>1316.32,'end_time'=>1317.34,'target_text'=>'>> What >> time is it?','source_text'=>'Pukul >> berapa sekarang?','order'=>731],
            ['start_time'=>1317.44,'end_time'=>1319.56,'target_text'=>'It\'s >> 10:52.','source_text'=>'Sekarang >> 10:52 malam.','order'=>732],
            ['start_time'=>1320.16,'end_time'=>1321.26,'target_text'=>'How do you feel right now?','source_text'=>'Macam mana perasaan awak sekarang?','order'=>733],
            ['start_time'=>1321.36,'end_time'=>1321.98,'target_text'=>'>> 10:52.','source_text'=>'10:52 malam.','order'=>734],
            ['start_time'=>1322.08,'end_time'=>1322.94,'target_text'=>'Dude, I\'m so tired.','source_text'=>'Kawan, saya dah tersangat mengantuk dan letih.','order'=>735],
            ['start_time'=>1323.04,'end_time'=>1323.9,'target_text'=>'>> 7-Eleven\'s that way.','source_text'=>'7-Eleven ikut arah sana.','order'=>736],
            ['start_time'=>1324,'end_time'=>1324.7,'target_text'=>'Did you want something?','source_text'=>'Awak nak beli apa-apa ke?','order'=>737],
            ['start_time'=>1324.8,'end_time'=>1325.2,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'Tak payahlah.','order'=>738],
            ['start_time'=>1325.28,'end_time'=>1325.52,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Tak payah.','order'=>739],
            ['start_time'=>1325.52,'end_time'=>1327.9,'target_text'=>'Cuz it\'s only an hour and then I got to go to bed.','source_text'=>'Sebab tinggal sejam lagi lepas tu saya nak terus tidur.','order'=>740],
            ['start_time'=>1328,'end_time'=>1329.42,'target_text'=>'So 10:52.','source_text'=>'Pukul 10:52 malam.','order'=>741],
            ['start_time'=>1329.52,'end_time'=>1331.82,'target_text'=>'Like an hour till uh till New Year\'s.','source_text'=>'Tinggal lebih kurang sejam sebelum ambang Tahun Baharu.','order'=>742],
            ['start_time'=>1331.92,'end_time'=>1332.38,'target_text'=>'>> Oh my gosh.','source_text'=>'Ya ampun.','order'=>743],
            ['start_time'=>1332.48,'end_time'=>1332.88,'target_text'=>'Look at this.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah ni.','order'=>744],
            ['start_time'=>1332.96,'end_time'=>1335.1,'target_text'=>'People are lining up all over the sides already.','source_text'=>'Orang ramai dah mula berbaris di sepanjang tepi jalan.','order'=>745],
            ['start_time'=>1335.2,'end_time'=>1336.38,'target_text'=>'>> Lowkey kked right now.','source_text'=>'Suasana dah mula sesak sekarang.','order'=>746],
            ['start_time'=>1336.48,'end_time'=>1338.22,'target_text'=>'But honestly, you can see it all from here.','source_text'=>'Tapi sejujurnya, awak boleh nampak semuanya dari sini.','order'=>747],
            ['start_time'=>1338.32,'end_time'=>1340.38,'target_text'=>'So I don\'t We don\'t even need to go that far down.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita tak perlu pun nak jalan jauh ke depan sana.','order'=>748],
            ['start_time'=>1340.48,'end_time'=>1344.84,'target_text'=>'>> No, but let\'s find somewhere we can like take a seat at least.','source_text'=>'Tak, tapi jom cari tempat yang sekurang-kurangnya kita boleh duduk.','order'=>749],
            ['start_time'=>1345.28,'end_time'=>1348.38,'target_text'=>'Should we see if there\'s room at our spot we saw or just walk down?','source_text'=>'Patutkah kita tengok tempat yang kita nampak tadi ada kosong atau terus jalan ke bawah?','order'=>750],
            ['start_time'=>1348.48,'end_time'=>1349.66,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t even want to walk down.','source_text'=>'Saya malas dah nak jalan ke bawah.','order'=>751],
            ['start_time'=>1349.76,'end_time'=>1350.22,'target_text'=>'>> Oh my god.','source_text'=>'Ya tuhan.','order'=>752],
