            ['start_time'=>41.08,'end_time'=>47.34,'target_text'=>'If someone is trying to get with your husband, I think you have all the right to call them out, especially if it got to the','source_text'=>'Kalau ada orang cuba nak mengurat suami awak, saya rasa awak memang berhak tegur dia, lebih-lebih lagi kalau sampai ke tahap','order'=>11],
