            ['start_time'=>49.6,'end_time'=>55.54,'target_text'=>'Although we\'re not sure yet if her boyfriend left her because she was always trying to get with OP\'s husband.','source_text'=>'Walaupun kita belum pasti lagi sama ada teman lelaki dia tinggalkan dia sebab dia asyik nak mengurat suami OP tu.','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>55.64,'end_time'=>60.26,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re not exactly sure about that yet, but we\'ll read it, and then we\'ll see.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita belum tahu hal sebenar lagi, tapi jom kita baca dan tengok nanti.','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>60.36,'end_time'=>67.82,'target_text'=>'I, 27 female, have been friends with Kira, 27 female, since we were little.','source_text'=>'Aku, perempuan umur 27 tahun, dah berkawan dengan Kira, perempuan 27 tahun, sejak kami kecil lagi.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>67.92,'end_time'=>71.18,'target_text'=>'We were neighbors, went to the same school, college, etc.','source_text'=>'Kami dulu berjiran, sekolah sama, kolej sama, dan sebagainya.','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>71.28,'end_time'=>77.58,'target_text'=>'She was my maid of honor when I married Rowan, 28 male, who we went to college with.','source_text'=>'Dia jadi pengapit masa aku kahwin dengan Rowan, lelaki 28 tahun, kawan sekolej kami dulu.','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>77.68,'end_time'=>83.14,'target_text'=>'At first, Kira had a big crush on him, but he started liking me.','source_text'=>'Mula-mula, Kira memang minat gila kat dia, tapi Rowan mula sukakan aku.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>83.24,'end_time'=>86.86,'target_text'=>'We slowly got closer, and I started liking him, too.','source_text'=>'Lama-kelamaan kami makin rapat, dan aku pun mula sukakan dia juga.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>86.96,'end_time'=>95.38,'target_text'=>'This was after Kira had told me she\'d gotten over it and was dating another guy, but I still felt really guilty and didn\'t','source_text'=>'Masa tu Kira dah beritahu yang dia dah move on dan tengah bercinta dengan lelaki lain, tapi aku tetap rasa bersalah dan tak','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>95.48,'end_time'=>98.38,'target_text'=>'want to date him if it would hurt Kira.','source_text'=>'nak keluar dengan dia kalau itu buat Kira terasa hati.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>98.48,'end_time'=>103.3,'target_text'=>'I asked her multiple times if she was okay with it, and she said she was.','source_text'=>'Aku tanya dia berkali-kali sama ada dia okey ke tak, dan dia kata dia okey.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>103.4,'end_time'=>105.02,'target_text'=>'So, I thought it was fine.','source_text'=>'Jadi, aku ingat semuanya tak ada masalah.','order'=>23],
