            ['start_time'=>110.16,'end_time'=>115.38,'target_text'=>'However, over the last few months, she\'s been acting strange around Rowan.','source_text'=>'Tapi sejak beberapa bulan lepas, perangai dia jadi pelik bila ada Rowan.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>115.48,'end_time'=>123.42,'target_text'=>'Whenever we\'d be hanging out with the three of us or even with Adam there, she\'d always find some way to sit next to Rowan,','source_text'=>'Bila kami lepak bertiga atau sekali dengan Adam, dia mesti cari jalan nak duduk sebelah Rowan,','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>123.52,'end_time'=>126.1,'target_text'=>'laugh at everything he said, etc.','source_text'=>'gelak terlebih-lebih dengan apa saja yang Rowan cakap, dan sebagainya.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>126.2,'end_time'=>134.18,'target_text'=>'I didn\'t think anything of it initially because I knew that\'s kind of her personality and she and Rowan are friends.','source_text'=>'Mula-mula aku tak fikir bukan-bukan sebab aku tahu memang macam tu perangai dia dan dia dengan Rowan memang kawan.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>134.28,'end_time'=>142.46,'target_text'=>'But then she started always asking me if Rowan was there before she came over and if I said no, she\'d often suddenly say she','source_text'=>'Tapi lepas tu dia mula asyik tanya sama ada Rowan ada kat rumah sebelum dia datang, dan kalau aku kata tak ada, tiba-tiba dia','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>142.56,'end_time'=>143.42,'target_text'=>'couldn\'t come.','source_text'=>'akan kata tak jadi datang.','order'=>30],
