            ['start_time'=>161.52,'end_time'=>168.26,'target_text'=>'Yeah, so by the sounds of it, it does seem like her friend wants her','source_text'=>'Ya, jadi bila dengar cerita ni, nampak macam kawan dia memang nakkan teman lelaki dia.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>168.36,'end_time'=>168.76,'target_text'=>'boyfriend.','source_text'=>'teman lelaki dia.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>168.84,'end_time'=>171.14,'target_text'=>'I think it I don\'t think they\'re married yet.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya rasa mereka belum berkahwin lagi.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>171.24,'end_time'=>172.74,'target_text'=>'Her friend wants her boyfriend.','source_text'=>'Kawan dia nakkan teman lelaki dia.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>172.84,'end_time'=>173.94,'target_text'=>'By the By the sounds of it.','source_text'=>'Berdasarkan daripada apa yang kita dengar.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>174.04,'end_time'=>177.74,'target_text'=>'Just the way she\'s explaining it and telling the story.','source_text'=>'Tengok pada cara dia jelaskan dan ceritakan perkara tu.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>177.84,'end_time'=>183.14,'target_text'=>'And especially from the very beginning, initially, she liked Rowan.','source_text'=>'Dan lebih-lebih lagi dari awal lagi, asalnya dia memang suka kat Rowan.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>183.24,'end_time'=>185.22,'target_text'=>'But then Rowan did not like her back.','source_text'=>'Tapi Rowan tak balas perasaan dia.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>185.32,'end_time'=>187.06,'target_text'=>'Rowan liked OP.','source_text'=>'Rowan sukakan si penulis ni.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>187.16,'end_time'=>188.9,'target_text'=>'So Rowan and OP got together.','source_text'=>'Jadi Rowan dengan penulis ni pun bersama.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>189,'end_time'=>193.14,'target_text'=>'However, the friend must still have some feelings for Rowan.','source_text'=>'Tapi kawan dia tu mesti masih ada perasaan lagi kat Rowan.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>193.24,'end_time'=>194.06,'target_text'=>'Let\'s continue.','source_text'=>'Jom kita sambung.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>194.16,'end_time'=>195.7,'target_text'=>'The odd behavior continued.','source_text'=>'Perangai pelik tu berterusan.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>195.8,'end_time'=>203.62,'target_text'=>'The most important part of learning a language and the reason why everyone learns a language is to be able to speak the language.','source_text'=>'Bahagian paling penting dalam belajar bahasa dan sebab kenapa semua orang belajar bahasa adalah untuk boleh bertutur bahasa tersebut.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>203.72,'end_time'=>208.58,'target_text'=>'These videos help you with your listening, but how can you practice your speaking even more?','source_text'=>'Video-video ni bantu korang dalam kemahiran mendengar, tapi macam mana nak latih kemahiran bertutur dengan lebih giat?','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>208.68,'end_time'=>210.94,'target_text'=>'You need to practice by shadowing.','source_text'=>'Korang kena berlatih melalui teknik shadowing.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>211.04,'end_time'=>218.3,'target_text'=>'Shadowing is just repeating after a native English speaker to practice your pronunciation, your accent, and your confidence.','source_text'=>'Shadowing ni cuma mengulang semula percakapan penutur jati bahasa Inggeris untuk melatih sebutan, slanga, dan keyakinan korang.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>218.4,'end_time'=>223.7,'target_text'=>'And I\'ve started making videos specifically just to practice those three things.','source_text'=>'Dan saya dah mula buat video khas semata-mata untuk latih ketiga-tiga perkara tu.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>223.8,'end_time'=>229.94,'target_text'=>'So if you guys want to become more confident in English and become truly fluent, check out my Patreon in the description where','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau korang nak jadi lebih yakin berbahasa Inggeris dan betul-betul fasih, lawati Patreon saya di ruang penerangan di mana','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>230.04,'end_time'=>235.1,'target_text'=>'I give you guys three new videos every week to practice your pronunciation,','source_text'=>'saya sediakan tiga video baru setiap minggu untuk korang latih sebutan,','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>235.2,'end_time'=>238.98,'target_text'=>'your accent, and most importantly, your confidence.','source_text'=>'slanga korang, dan yang paling penting sekali, keyakinan diri korang.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>239.08,'end_time'=>240.18,'target_text'=>'I\'ll see you guys there.','source_text'=>'Jumpa korang di sana.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>240.28,'end_time'=>247.82,'target_text'=>'We are going to be learning English [music] as I clean up my pronunciation, your accent, your rhythm, and your confidence.','source_text'=>'Kita akan belajar bahasa Inggeris sambil memantapkan sebutan, slanga, intonasi, dan keyakinan korang.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>247.92,'end_time'=>252.66,'target_text'=>'Here it was [music] just a roundabout way of her politely trying to spare my feelings.','source_text'=>'Rupa-rupanya itu cuma cara berlapik dia nak jaga perasaan aku secara sopan.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>252.76,'end_time'=>258.63,'target_text'=>'The A-hole for giving all [music] of my co-workers a different reason for why I have missing fingers.','source_text'=>'Adakah aku bersalah sebab bagi alasan berbeza-beza kat semua rakan sekerja pasal kenapa jari aku tak cukup.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>258.73,'end_time'=>263.74,'target_text'=>'[music] So, I wouldn\'t take legal action down to hear company-wide training on his behavior.','source_text'=>'Supaya aku tak ambil tindakan undang-undang sehinggalah dengar sesi latihan syarikat tentang kelakuannya.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>263.84,'end_time'=>267.8,'target_text'=>'He chooses not, but I was already so cranky.','source_text'=>'Dia pilih untuk tidak, tapi masa tu aku dah cukup rimas.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>268.24,'end_time'=>271.98,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we\'re in I did so much shopping in Hiroshima.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi kita kat saya banyak sangat membeli-belah di Hiroshima.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>272.08,'end_time'=>274.78,'target_text'=>'The jeans and one hoodie, which Let\'s continue.','source_text'=>'Seluar jeans dan sehelai hoodie, yang mana jom kita teruskan.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>274.88,'end_time'=>284.7,'target_text'=>'The odd behavior continued, but TBH, which just stands for to be honest, is very common when you\'re texting to write TBH,','source_text'=>'Perangai pelik tu berterusan, tapi TBH, iaitu singkatan bagi to be honest (sejujurnya), sangat biasa digunakan bila korang berbalas mesej untuk tulis TBH,','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>284.8,'end_time'=>285.58,'target_text'=>'to be honest.','source_text'=>'iaitu sejujurnya.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>285.68,'end_time'=>293.18,'target_text'=>'So, but to be honest, the pregnancy had been keeping me too exhausted to give it a lot more thought.','source_text'=>'Jadi, tapi sejujurnya, keadaan mengandung buat aku terlalu penat untuk fikirkan benda tu lebih-lebih.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>293.28,'end_time'=>296.98,'target_text'=>'And Rowan seemed as friendly with Kira as always.','source_text'=>'Dan Rowan pun nampak mesra macam biasa dengan Kira.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>297.08,'end_time'=>300.9,'target_text'=>'But 2 days ago, our mutual friend Shay threw a dinner party.','source_text'=>'Tapi 2 hari lepas, kawan kami bersama iaitu Shay buat satu majlis makan malam.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>301,'end_time'=>303.7,'target_text'=>'Me and Rowan went, as did Kira and Adam.','source_text'=>'Aku dengan Rowan pergi, begitu juga Kira dengan Adam.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>303.8,'end_time'=>308.1,'target_text'=>'Kira got a bit tipsy, and she kept trying to sit with Rowan and touch him.','source_text'=>'Kira jadi agak khayal, dan dia asyik cuba nak duduk sebelah Rowan dan raba-raba dia.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>308.2,'end_time'=>311.7,'target_text'=>'He excused himself a few times, but she kept finding him.','source_text'=>'Rowan dah minta diri beberapa kali, tapi dia asyik cari Rowan juga.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>311.8,'end_time'=>317.9,'target_text'=>'I tried to get her off a few times, and I was getting mad because this was a new line she was crossing.','source_text'=>'Aku cuba halang dia beberapa kali, dan aku mula naik angin sebab dia dah melampaui batas kali ni.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>318,'end_time'=>324.94,'target_text'=>'Yeah, especially if like if someone is trying to touch your boyfriend and you\'re there, and even if you\'re not there, that\'s','source_text'=>'Ya, lagi-lagi kalau ada orang cuba sentuh teman lelaki awak depan mata awak, malah kalau awak tak ada pun, itu','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>325.04,'end_time'=>328.9,'target_text'=>'that is crossing multiple boundaries and lines.','source_text'=>'itu memang dah terang-terang melampaui batas.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>329,'end_time'=>336.3,'target_text'=>'And you know what they say, a very popular and common saying in in English is, \"Drunk words are sober thoughts.\" So, although','source_text'=>'Dan korang tahu kan apa pepatah popular dalam bahasa Inggeris, \"Kata-kata orang mabuk adalah isi hati sebenar.\" Jadi walaupun','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>336.4,'end_time'=>338.66,'target_text'=>'she\'s not saying anything, I feel like it still applies.','source_text'=>'dia tak cakap apa-apa, saya rasa perkara tu tetap terpakai.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>338.76,'end_time'=>346.02,'target_text'=>'Like, \"Drunk actions are sober desires.\" She was slurring about how I stole Rowan from her.','source_text'=>'Macam, \"Tindakan masa mabuk adalah keinginan hati yang sebenar.\" Dia meracau cakap yang aku rampas Rowan daripada dia.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>346.12,'end_time'=>353.34,'target_text'=>'Thankfully, Adam was too busy talking to Shay\'s husband to hear this, but he definitely saw Kira\'s actions.','source_text'=>'Nasib baiklah Adam sibuk bersembang dengan suami Shay sampai tak dengar, tapi dia memang nampak perbuatan Kira tu.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>353.44,'end_time'=>357.82,'target_text'=>'The next afternoon, I was at Shay\'s again with some friends when Kira showed up.','source_text'=>'Petang esoknya, aku lepak lagi kat rumah Shay dengan beberapa orang kawan bila tiba-tiba Kira muncul.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>357.92,'end_time'=>363.94,'target_text'=>'She was crying about how Adam had broken up with her that day, saying he didn\'t think they were going to work out.','source_text'=>'Dia menangis-nangis beritahu yang Adam dah putuskan hubungan dengan dia hari tu, katanya Adam rasa hubungan mereka tak ada masa depan.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>364.04,'end_time'=>367.46,'target_text'=>'Everyone was consoling her, but I was just kind of sitting there.','source_text'=>'Semua orang pujuk dia, tapi aku cuma duduk diam kat situ.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>367.56,'end_time'=>370.86,'target_text'=>'I couldn\'t help but feel like she brought this upon herself.','source_text'=>'Aku tak dapat nafikan rasa yang semua ni berpunca daripada diri dia sendiri.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>370.96,'end_time'=>376.66,'target_text'=>'She asked me, \"Aren\'t you going to say something?\" So, I said, \"Maybe Adam wouldn\'t have left you if you weren\'t trying to','source_text'=>'Dia tanya aku, \"Kau tak nak cakap apa-apa ke?\" Jadi aku jawab, \"Mungkin Adam takkan tinggalkan kau kalau kau tak asyik cuba','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>376.76,'end_time'=>383.38,'target_text'=>'get with Rowan all the time.\" Some of our other friends were shocked to hear this and got mad at Kira.','source_text'=>'mengurat Rowan sepanjang masa.\" Sebahagian kawan-kawan kami terkejut dengar benda tu dan mula marahkan Kira.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>383.48,'end_time'=>389.98,'target_text'=>'Some got angry with me, saying Kira was just really friendly with everyone, and that was a horrible accusation to make.','source_text'=>'Ada juga yang marahkan aku, kata Kira cuma jenis peramah dengan semua orang, dan itu tuduhan yang melampau.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>390.08,'end_time'=>396.5,'target_text'=>'Kira was upset, saying she couldn\'t believe I thought that of her, and maybe we really weren\'t that close.','source_text'=>'Kira merajuk, kata dia tak sangka aku boleh sangka buruk macam tu kat dia, dan mungkin kami sebenarnya tak serapat mana.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>396.6,'end_time'=>399.14,'target_text'=>'She left in tears, and I left soon after, too.','source_text'=>'Dia keluar sambil menangis, dan aku pun balik tak lama lepas tu.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>399.24,'end_time'=>400.14,'target_text'=>'Now, I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, aku dah buntu.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>400.24,'end_time'=>401.58,'target_text'=>'Maybe I was wrong.','source_text'=>'Mungkin aku yang salah.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>401.68,'end_time'=>406.26,'target_text'=>'Kira had been drinking at the dinner party and might not have meant what she said.','source_text'=>'Kira minum alkohol masa jamuan makan malam tu dan mungkin dia tak berniat macam apa yang dia cakapkan.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>406.36,'end_time'=>408.86,'target_text'=>'And the other stuff could have been nothing.','source_text'=>'Dan hal-hal lain sebelum ni mungkin tak ada apa-apa pun.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>408.96,'end_time'=>416.38,'target_text'=>'Maybe this was too harsh to say to her after a breakup, and we could have talked privately, not in front of our friends.','source_text'=>'Mungkin kata-kata aku tu terlalu kejam untuk dia yang baru putus cinta, dan kami sepatutnya berbincang secara peribadi, bukan depan kawan-kawan.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>416.48,'end_time'=>418.86,'target_text'=>'So, am I the a-hole?','source_text'=>'Jadi, adakah aku yang bersalah?','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>418.96,'end_time'=>421.5,'target_text'=>'Okay, personally,','source_text'=>'Okey, secara peribadi,','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>421.6,'end_time'=>425.42,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think you\'re the a-hole >> [music] >> because you kind of just said it as is.','source_text'=>'saya rasa awak tak bersalah langsung sebab awak cuma cakap perkara yang betul.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>425.52,'end_time'=>433.42,'target_text'=>'Like, she has been bothering you a lot, and you have kind of like had the feeling that she was trying to get with your husband','source_text'=>'Maksudnya, dia dah kerap ganggu awak, dan awak memang dah rasa yang dia cuba nak mengurat suami awak','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>433.52,'end_time'=>436.98,'target_text'=>'just through her actions and, you know, what she was saying.','source_text'=>'hanya melalui perbuatan dan, faham-fahamlah kan, apa yang dia cakapkan.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>437.08,'end_time'=>443.02,'target_text'=>'So, I think this was just kind of like a a culmination of all that built up maybe frustration with her.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa benda ni macam kemuncak kepada segala rasa geram yang terbuku terhadap dia.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>443.12,'end_time'=>446.54,'target_text'=>'And then you ended up saying that, which could be true, could not be true.','source_text'=>'Dan akhirnya awak terluahkan perkara tu, yang mungkin betul atau mungkin tak betul.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>446.64,'end_time'=>453.54,'target_text'=>'It was probably better to talk to her privately, I would say, and even before she broke up with Adam, I believe his name was.','source_text'=>'Mungkin lebih baik kalau bincang secara berdua saja, pada pandangan saya, malah sebelum dia putus dengan Adam lagi.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>453.64,'end_time'=>459.9,'target_text'=>'Even though even before Adam broke up with her, you could have talked to her and been like, like, \"What\'s your deal?','source_text'=>'Malah sebelum Adam putus dengan dia pun, awak boleh saja bincang dengan dia dan tanya, \"Apa masalah kau sebenarnya?','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>460,'end_time'=>461.34,'target_text'=>'Like, am I seeing this right?','source_text'=>'Macam, betul ke apa yang aku nampak ni?','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>461.44,'end_time'=>462.78,'target_text'=>'Are you trying to get with Rowan?','source_text'=>'Kau cuba nak mengurat Rowan ke?','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>462.88,'end_time'=>468.18,'target_text'=>'You always bring him up, you mention him, you talk about him, you\'re trying to touch him all the time.','source_text'=>'Kau asyik sebut pasal dia, cakap pasal dia, dan kau asyik cuba nak sentuh dia sepanjang masa.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>468.28,'end_time'=>471.42,'target_text'=>'Like, is there some underlying feelings?','source_text'=>'Maksudnya, kau masih ada perasaan terpendam ke?','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>471.52,'end_time'=>473.1,'target_text'=>'And then just see how she reacts.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu tengoklah apa reaksi dia.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>473.2,'end_time'=>479.02,'target_text'=>'I know that\'s probably a very difficult conversation to have, especially with a long-time friend, but I think that could have','source_text'=>'Saya tahu perbualan macam tu memang sangat susah nak dimulakan, lebih-lebih lagi dengan kawan lama, tapi saya rasa itu boleh','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>479.12,'end_time'=>482.18,'target_text'=>'really helped kind of understand the situation.','source_text'=>'sangat membantu untuk memahami keadaan sebenar.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>482.28,'end_time'=>485.26,'target_text'=>'And understand where she was coming from and how she felt.','source_text'=>'Dan faham apa yang dia rasa serta sudut pandang dia.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>485.36,'end_time'=>492.38,'target_text'=>'And saying this was kind of like a little petty on your part, but then again, I don\'t think you\'re the a-hole for saying it.','source_text'=>'Dan mengungkit benda tu nampak macam kebudak-budakan sikit dari pihak awak, tapi apapun, saya tak rasa awak salah bila cakap macam tu.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>492.48,'end_time'=>494.94,'target_text'=>'Rowan is your boyfriend after all.','source_text'=>'Lagipun Rowan tu teman lelaki awak.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>495.04,'end_time'=>495.66,'target_text'=>'Not hers.','source_text'=>'Bukan teman lelaki dia.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>495.76,'end_time'=>497.06,'target_text'=>'Next story.','source_text'=>'Cerita seterusnya.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>497.16,'end_time'=>501.3,'target_text'=>'Am I the a-hole for telling my friends to get effed?','source_text'=>'Adakah aku yang bersalah sebab suruh kawan-kawan aku pergi mampus?','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>501.4,'end_time'=>504.34,'target_text'=>'I, 29 female, love to cook.','source_text'=>'Aku, perempuan berumur 29 tahun, memang suka sangat memasak.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>504.44,'end_time'=>506.38,'target_text'=>'I cook all kinds of stuff.','source_text'=>'Aku masak macam-macam jenis hidangan.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>506.48,'end_time'=>511.62,'target_text'=>'Tofu, chicken, soup, sausage, Asian, Mexican, Italian, etc.','source_text'=>'Taufu, ayam, sup, sosej, masakan Asia, Mexico, Itali, dan macam-macam lagi.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>511.72,'end_time'=>513.62,'target_text'=>'I love to make things from scratch.','source_text'=>'Aku suka buat semua benda daripada bahan mentah asas.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>513.72,'end_time'=>514.82,'target_text'=>'Two examples.','source_text'=>'Dua contohnya.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>514.92,'end_time'=>519.34,'target_text'=>'Was in a tofu kick, so I made my own from raw soybeans.','source_text'=>'Masa tengah gian nak makan taufu, aku buat taufu sendiri guna kacang soya mentah.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>519.44,'end_time'=>523.18,'target_text'=>'Was on a chalupa kick, but they\'re $7 each.','source_text'=>'Bila teringin nak makan chalupa, tapi harganya sampai $7 sebiji.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>523.28,'end_time'=>524.62,'target_text'=>'WTF Taco Bell.','source_text'=>'Mengadanya Taco Bell.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>524.72,'end_time'=>528.34,'target_text'=>'So, I made my own fry bread and toppings, etc.','source_text'=>'Jadi, aku buat roti goreng sendiri, inti dia, dan sebagainya.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>528.44,'end_time'=>532.02,'target_text'=>'I love to bake Christmas cookies and make little treats.','source_text'=>'Aku suka bakar biskut Krismas dan buat kudapan manis.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>532.12,'end_time'=>538.5,'target_text'=>'Anyways, all this to explain that I take a lot of pride in making food and I love to feed people.','source_text'=>'Apapun, semua ni sekadar nak jelaskan yang aku berbangga dengan masakan aku dan aku suka bagi orang makan.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>538.6,'end_time'=>546.86,'target_text'=>'My two closest friends, 21 female and 25 female, on me every time I make something that isn\'t chicken tenders, basically.','source_text'=>'Dua kawan rapat aku, perempuan 21 dan 25 tahun, asyik perli aku setiap kali aku masak benda selain nuget ayam.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>546.96,'end_time'=>552.9,'target_text'=>'I make a chicken gnocchi soup and one tells me it looks like it has bugs in it.','source_text'=>'Aku buat sup gnocchi ayam dan sorang tu kata nampak macam ada serangga dalam tu.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>553,'end_time'=>557.74,'target_text'=>'I make a tofu stir-fry and the other tells me it looks like poop from a butt.','source_text'=>'Aku buat taufu goreng campur dan sorang lagi kata nampak macam tahi.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>557.84,'end_time'=>561.02,'target_text'=>'They know it bothers me and still continue to do it.','source_text'=>'Diorang tahu aku sakit hati tapi tetap teruskan juga buat macam tu.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>561.12,'end_time'=>563.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s not like I forced them to eat the food.','source_text'=>'Bukannya aku paksa diorang makan makanan tu pun.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>563.44,'end_time'=>571.82,'target_text'=>'I did make 21 female try tofu one time, not even the dish posted above, which I\'ll admit didn\'t look how I wanted it to, even','source_text'=>'Aku cuma pernah suruh kawan umur 21 tahun tu rasa taufu sekali, itu pun bukan lauk yang disebut kat atas, yang aku akui rupa dia tak seperti yang aku harapkan, walaupun','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>571.92,'end_time'=>573.34,'target_text'=>'if it was delicious.','source_text'=>'rasanya sedap.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>573.44,'end_time'=>581.54,'target_text'=>'Today, I woke up to a Facebook post of them publicly mocking me about how my food is only meant for starving orphans.','source_text'=>'Hari ini, aku bangun tidur dan nampak hantaran Facebook diorang yang secara terbuka kutuk aku kononnya makanan aku cuma layak untuk anak yatim yang kelaparan.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>581.64,'end_time'=>584.9,'target_text'=>'Whoa, that is that is very harsh.','source_text'=>'Wah, itu memang sangat melampau.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>585,'end_time'=>588.7,'target_text'=>'So, I told them both to get effed and now I\'m the dramatic one.','source_text'=>'Jadi, aku suruh diorang berdua pergi mampus dan sekarang diorang tuduh aku pula yang terlebih beremosi.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>588.8,'end_time'=>590.14,'target_text'=>'So, am I the a-hole?','source_text'=>'Jadi, adakah aku yang bersalah?','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>590.24,'end_time'=>590.66,'target_text'=>'Whoa.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>590.76,'end_time'=>595.7,'target_text'=>'Okay, that really took like a 180° turn like that.','source_text'=>'Okey, itu betul-betul berubah 180 darjah macam tu saja.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>595.8,'end_time'=>596.38,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>596.48,'end_time'=>602.54,'target_text'=>'So, they made a public Facebook post mocking your food saying it\'s only meant for starving orphans.','source_text'=>'Jadi, mereka buat hantaran Facebook awam yang mempersendakan masakan awak dan kata ia cuma layak untuk anak yatim yang kebuluran.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>602.64,'end_time'=>606.14,'target_text'=>'First of all, that is very rude to the OP that wrote this.','source_text'=>'Pertama sekali, itu sangat biadab terhadap penulis yang meluahkan cerita ni.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>606.24,'end_time'=>609.74,'target_text'=>'Second of all, who says that about orphans?','source_text'=>'Keduanya, siapa sanggup cakap macam tu pasal anak yatim?','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>609.84,'end_time'=>611.9,'target_text'=>'That is just That\'s really in bad taste.','source_text'=>'Itu memang itu memang sangat biadab dan tak bertamadun.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>612,'end_time'=>613.54,'target_text'=>'That\'s Wow.','source_text'=>'Itu memang... wah.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>613.64,'end_time'=>614.06,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I know.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya faham.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>614.16,'end_time'=>615.7,'target_text'=>'These These are not good friends.','source_text'=>'Ini ini bukanlah kawan yang baik.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>615.8,'end_time'=>623.3,'target_text'=>'If I had a friend that made a public post saying not even my food but some random food is only meant for starving orphans.','source_text'=>'Kalau saya ada kawan yang buat hantaran terbuka cakap bukan makanan saya saja tapi mana-mana makanan cuma layak untuk anak yatim kebuluran.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>623.4,'end_time'=>624.02,'target_text'=>'Whoa.','source_text'=>'Fuh.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>624.12,'end_time'=>629.34,'target_text'=>'Just cuz they\'re orphans and starving doesn\'t mean they deserve like bad food.','source_text'=>'Hanya sebab mereka anak yatim dan kelaparan tak bermakna mereka layak dapat makanan yang tak elok.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>629.44,'end_time'=>629.86,'target_text'=>'What?','source_text'=>'Apa benda ni?','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>629.96,'end_time'=>630.66,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>630.76,'end_time'=>632.38,'target_text'=>'Okay, you are definitely not the a-hole.','source_text'=>'Okey, awak memang seratus peratus tak bersalah.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>632.48,'end_time'=>633.82,'target_text'=>'Your friends are kind of crazy.','source_text'=>'Kawan-kawan awak tu memang agak gila.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>633.92,'end_time'=>638.1,'target_text'=>'I would I would literally stop being friends with these people if this ever happened to me.','source_text'=>'Saya saya memang akan putus kawan terus dengan orang macam ni kalau perkara ni berlaku pada saya.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>638.2,'end_time'=>638.66,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>638.76,'end_time'=>639.5,'target_text'=>'Shocking.','source_text'=>'Mengejutkan betul.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>639.6,'end_time'=>640.66,'target_text'=>'Okay, next story.','source_text'=>'Okey, cerita seterusnya.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>640.76,'end_time'=>647.1,'target_text'=>'Am I the a-hole for telling my friend I don\'t want to end up like her after she told me to lower my standards.','source_text'=>'Adakah aku yang bersalah sebab cakap kat kawan aku yang aku tak nak jadi macam dia lepas dia suruh aku rendahkan standard aku.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>647.2,'end_time'=>654.1,'target_text'=>'I, 22 female, met Rachel, 23 female, 3 years ago in university and we became friends.','source_text'=>'Aku, perempuan 22 tahun, kenal Rachel, perempuan 23 tahun, 3 tahun lepas masa di universiti dan kami jadi kawan rapat.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>654.2,'end_time'=>657.9,'target_text'=>'For context, I have never dated before and I am okay with that.','source_text'=>'Untuk makluman, aku tak pernah bercinta sebelum ni dan aku okey saja dengan hal tu.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>658,'end_time'=>663.26,'target_text'=>'I don\'t purposefully seek out relationships and I am comfortable being by myself.','source_text'=>'Aku tak terhegeh-hegeh cari pasangan dan aku rasa selesa hidup sendirian.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>663.36,'end_time'=>666.22,'target_text'=>'I have a few close friends and this is enough for me.','source_text'=>'Aku ada beberapa orang kawan rapat dan ini dah cukup memadai buat aku.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>666.32,'end_time'=>672.62,'target_text'=>'In contrast, Rachel has had a lot of boyfriends and doesn\'t like to be single, her words.','source_text'=>'Sebaliknya, Rachel dah ada ramai teman lelaki dan dia tak suka hidup membujang, mengikut kata-kata dia sendiri.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>672.72,'end_time'=>678.66,'target_text'=>'She met her husband, Max, 2 years ago in one of the uni classes and they quickly began dating.','source_text'=>'Dia kenal suaminya, Max, 2 tahun lepas dalam salah satu kelas universiti dan diorang cepat saja bercinta.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>678.76,'end_time'=>682.74,'target_text'=>'He isn\'t the most pleasant guy to be around in my opinion.','source_text'=>'Dia bukanlah seorang lelaki yang menyenangkan bila kita bersama dia, pada pendapat aku.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>682.84,'end_time'=>686.7,'target_text'=>'IMO just stands for in my opinion.','source_text'=>'IMO cuma singkatan kepada in my opinion (pada pendapat saya).','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>686.8,'end_time'=>693.22,'target_text'=>'Once again, if you\'re writing like a proper paper or an email, you\'re to have to write in my opinion, the full word, but she\'s','source_text'=>'Sekali lagi, kalau korang tulis tugasan rasmi atau e-mel, korang kena tulis perkataan penuh in my opinion, tapi dia','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>693.32,'end_time'=>696.34,'target_text'=>'just like, this is like texting spelling text.','source_text'=>'cuma tulis singkatan gaya teks mesej.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>696.44,'end_time'=>698.86,'target_text'=>'When you want to text quick, in my opinion.','source_text'=>'Bila korang nak taip mesej laju-laju, iaitu pada pendapat saya.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>698.96,'end_time'=>703.06,'target_text'=>'And they had quite a few big arguments during the relationship.','source_text'=>'Dan mereka kerap bergaduh besar sepanjang perhubungan mereka.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>703.16,'end_time'=>710.22,'target_text'=>'He even tried to flirt with me, and I told Rachel about it, but she dismissed it saying he was probably just trying to butter','source_text'=>'Dia siap pernah cuba mengurat aku, dan bila aku beritahu Rachel pasal tu, Rachel buat tak endah saja dan kata Max cuma nak bodek','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>710.32,'end_time'=>712.78,'target_text'=>'me up, so I helped him with homework.','source_text'=>'aku supaya aku tolong siapkan kerja rumah dia.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>712.88,'end_time'=>715.62,'target_text'=>'He has told me sexist jokes in the past, too.','source_text'=>'Dia pun pernah buat jenaka seksis kat aku sebelum ni.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>715.72,'end_time'=>720.38,'target_text'=>'Whenever they fought, I always told Rachel she deserves better and to break up with him.','source_text'=>'Setiap kali diorang bergaduh, aku selalu nasihatkan Rachel yang dia layak dapat lelaki lebih baik dan patut putus saja dengan Max.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>720.48,'end_time'=>722.82,'target_text'=>'But in the end, they always made up.','source_text'=>'Tapi akhirnya, diorang tetap berbaik semula.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>722.92,'end_time'=>729.3,'target_text'=>'This could be annoying, especially if you\'re friends with her, and you see that the person your friend is in a relationship','source_text'=>'Benda ni memang boleh buat kita rimas, terutamanya bila awak berkawan dengan dia, dan awak nampak pasangan kawan awak tu','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>729.4,'end_time'=>735.58,'target_text'=>'with is not a good person, but your friend can\'t see it, and you try to like, you know, tell her tell her your opinion, but','source_text'=>'bukanlah orang yang baik, tapi kawan awak tak nampak hakikat tu, dan awak cuba untuk berikan pandangan awak, tapi','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>735.68,'end_time'=>741.9,'target_text'=>'you also don\'t want to like get into their business and into their relationship, because that might affect your friendship','source_text'=>'dalam masa yang sama awak tak nak campur tangan terlalu dalam urusan peribadi diorang, sebab takut jejaskan persahabatan','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>742,'end_time'=>742.5,'target_text'=>'with your friend.','source_text'=>'dengan kawan awak sendiri.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>742.6,'end_time'=>745.66,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s definitely a sticky situation to be in.','source_text'=>'Jadi, memang situasi yang serba salah bila berada di kedudukan macam tu.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>745.76,'end_time'=>750.26,'target_text'=>'He proposed to her after 1 year, and they got married 4 months ago.','source_text'=>'Dia lamar Rachel lepas 1 tahun bercinta, dan diorang dah kahwin 4 bulan lepas.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>750.36,'end_time'=>750.86,'target_text'=>'Oof.','source_text'=>'Aduh.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>750.96,'end_time'=>751.5,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>751.6,'end_time'=>755.34,'target_text'=>'I think proposing after 1 year is extremely','source_text'=>'Bagi saya, melamar lepas 1 tahun tu tersangatlah','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>755.44,'end_time'=>756.3,'target_text'=>'fast.','source_text'=>'cepat.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>756.4,'end_time'=>757.18,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>757.28,'end_time'=>757.94,'target_text'=>'1 year.','source_text'=>'1 tahun.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>758.04,'end_time'=>765.14,'target_text'=>'However, after they moved in together in the flat that Rachel\'s parents pay the rent for, Max became even worse.','source_text'=>'Tapi lepas diorang tinggal bersama di rumah sewa yang dibayar oleh ibu bapa Rachel, perangai Max jadi makin teruk.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>765.24,'end_time'=>771.42,'target_text'=>'He never helps out with the cleaning or cooking, doesn\'t really take Rachel out on dates anymore, and whenever she tried to','source_text'=>'Dia langsung tak pernah tolong kemas rumah atau memasak, dah tak bawa Rachel keluar berjanji temu, dan setiap kali Rachel cuba','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>771.52,'end_time'=>776.34,'target_text'=>'talk to him about it, Max tells her to stop complaining about wife duties.','source_text'=>'berbincang pasal tu, Max suruh dia jangan nak bising pasal tanggungjawab seorang isteri.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>776.44,'end_time'=>779.06,'target_text'=>'So, he is misogynistic.','source_text'=>'Jadi dia memang jenis lelaki yang anti-wanita dan patriarki melampau.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>779.16,'end_time'=>779.62,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>779.72,'end_time'=>786.54,'target_text'=>'So, a few days ago, Rachel asked me if I would like to go on a date with one of her friends from high school who is single','source_text'=>'Jadi beberapa hari lepas, Rachel tanya aku kalau aku nak keluar berjanji temu dengan salah seorang kawan sekolah menengahnya yang masih bujang','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>786.64,'end_time'=>788.5,'target_text'=>'and is looking for a relationship.','source_text'=>'dan tengah cari pasangan.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>788.6,'end_time'=>792.42,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never been on a date before, so I agreed out of curiosity.','source_text'=>'Aku tak pernah keluar janji temu sebelum ni, jadi aku setuju sekadar nak cuba.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>792.52,'end_time'=>794.06,'target_text'=>'We went to a nice restaurant.','source_text'=>'Kami pergi ke restoran yang agak mewah.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>794.16,'end_time'=>801.02,'target_text'=>'The guy never asked me a single question about myself back, and after I got tired of coming up with questions about him, we','source_text'=>'Lelaki tu langsung tak tanya sepatah pun soalan pasal diri aku, dan lepas aku penat asyik fikir soalan nak tanya pasal dia, kami','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>801.12,'end_time'=>803.78,'target_text'=>'just sat the rest of the meal in awkward silence.','source_text'=>'cuma duduk terdiam kaku sepanjang baki waktu makan tu dalam keadaan yang janggal.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>803.88,'end_time'=>808.5,'target_text'=>'We split the bill, and after he walked me to the subway station, he tried to kiss me.','source_text'=>'Kami bayar bil masing-masing, dan lepas dia teman aku ke stesen kereta api bawah tanah, dia cuba nak cium aku.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>808.6,'end_time'=>811.62,'target_text'=>'I declined as politely as I could and went home.','source_text'=>'Aku tolak sebaik dan sesopan mungkin lepas tu terus balik rumah.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>811.72,'end_time'=>813.7,'target_text'=>'The next day I met up with Rachel.','source_text'=>'Keesokan harinya aku jumpa Rachel.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>813.8,'end_time'=>817.62,'target_text'=>'Apparently, she\'s already heard about how the date went from her friend.','source_text'=>'Rupa-rupanya dia dah tahu cerita pasal janji temu tu daripada kawan dia.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>817.72,'end_time'=>819.58,'target_text'=>'She asked me why I rejected him.','source_text'=>'Dia tanya aku kenapa aku tolak lelaki tu.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>819.68,'end_time'=>823.58,'target_text'=>'I told her the reason I mentioned before and that I didn\'t really like the guy.','source_text'=>'Aku jelaskan sebab yang aku beritahu tadi dan aku memang tak berkenan dengan lelaki tu.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>823.68,'end_time'=>829.22,'target_text'=>'Then she rolled her eyes and said that I need to lower my standards because I\'m honestly not that attractive.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu dia julingkan mata dan kata aku kena rendahkan standard aku sebab sejujurnya rupa aku bukannya lawa mana.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>829.32,'end_time'=>834.82,'target_text'=>'That I blew maybe my only chance to date and if I continue like that, I\'ll end up forever alone.','source_text'=>'Katanya aku dah sia-siakan mungkin satu-satunya peluang untuk bercinta dan kalau aku berterusan macam tu, aku akan membujang sampai bila-bila.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>834.92,'end_time'=>837.58,'target_text'=>'Even though she knows I\'m fine without a relationship.','source_text'=>'Walaupun dia tahu aku tak ada masalah pun kalau tak bercinta.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>837.68,'end_time'=>840.82,'target_text'=>'Also, I\'m not insecure about my appearance.','source_text'=>'Lagipun aku tak pernah rasa rendah diri pasal rupa paras aku.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>840.92,'end_time'=>843.74,'target_text'=>'But hearing my friend say that about me hurt.','source_text'=>'Tapi bila dengar kawan sendiri cakap macam tu pasal diri aku, memang rasa sakit hati sangat.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>843.84,'end_time'=>851.54,'target_text'=>'I got angry and said, \"Better to be forever alone than end up like you with a husband that doesn\'t respect me.\" Facts.','source_text'=>'Aku jadi marah dan balas, \"Lebih baik aku membujang selamanya daripada jadi macam kau yang dapat suami tak hormat bini langsung.\" Fakta.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>851.64,'end_time'=>857.54,'target_text'=>'She started crying and said that I\'m being rude when she\'s just trying to look out for me and then left.','source_text'=>'Dia mula menangis dan cakap aku biadab padahal dia cuma nak ambil berat pasal aku, lepas tu dia terus pergi.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>857.64,'end_time'=>860.22,'target_text'=>'We haven\'t texted or spoken since.','source_text'=>'Sejak dari tu kami langsung tak berhubung atau bercakap.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>860.32,'end_time'=>868.02,'target_text'=>'Honestly, I\'m not sure if I want to salvage this friendship after finding out this is how Rachel felt about me all this time.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, aku tak pasti sama ada aku nak selamatkan persahabatan ni lagi lepas tahu rupa-rupanya macam tu pandangan Rachel kat aku selama ni.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>868.12,'end_time'=>875.74,'target_text'=>'However, I feel guilty for saying this to her when I knew it was a sore spot and also for kind of blaming her for the fact','source_text'=>'Walau bagaimanapun, aku rasa bersalah sebab cakap macam tu sedangkan aku tahu itu titik kelemahan dia, dan macam salahkan dia atas nasib malang','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>875.84,'end_time'=>877.54,'target_text'=>'that her husband is awful.','source_text'=>'dapat suami yang tak guna.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>877.64,'end_time'=>880.14,'target_text'=>'So, am I the in this situation?','source_text'=>'Jadi, adakah aku yang bersalah dalam situasi ni?','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>880.24,'end_time'=>884.66,'target_text'=>'I think you are the but not for saying that to her.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa awak ada salahnya tapi bukan sebab awak cakap macam tu pada dia.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>884.76,'end_time'=>889.94,'target_text'=>'I think she definitely needs to face the fact that her husband\'s not really a good person.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa dia memang kena hadapi kenyataan yang suaminya bukanlah seorang yang baik.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>890.04,'end_time'=>895.02,'target_text'=>'But I feel like you should have tried harder earlier on in the relationship.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya rasa awak patutnya berusaha lebih awal masa mereka mula bercinta dulu.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>895.12,'end_time'=>902.22,'target_text'=>'That\'s why I think you were the You could have tried to open up her eyes to how the rest of her life with this person was','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah saya rasa awak ada salahnya. Awak patutnya cuba buka mata dia tentang bagaimana sisa hidupnya dengan lelaki tu nanti','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>902.32,'end_time'=>909.06,'target_text'=>'going to be but instead you just blamed her after your feelings got hurt which I kind of think is an move to just snap back','source_text'=>'akan jadi, tapi sebaliknya awak cuma salahkan dia lepas hati awak disakiti, yang mana saya rasa macam tindakan melulu bila terus balas balik','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>909.16,'end_time'=>910.74,'target_text'=>'after someone insulted you.','source_text'=>'lepas orang hina awak.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>910.84,'end_time'=>912.34,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it\'s definitely fair game.','source_text'=>'Ya, memang patutlah balas kalau ikutkan.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>912.44,'end_time'=>914.18,'target_text'=>'They insulted you so you insult them.','source_text'=>'Dia hina awak, jadi awak hina dia balik.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>914.28,'end_time'=>914.82,'target_text'=>'Fair enough.','source_text'=>'Adillah macam tu.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>914.92,'end_time'=>922.26,'target_text'=>'But if it was your friend, you should have tried harder earlier on to kind of like open up her eyes to how her current husband','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau dia kawan awak, awak patutnya cuba lebih gigih dari awal untuk sedarkan dia tentang perangai sebenar suaminya sekarang','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>922.36,'end_time'=>924.1,'target_text'=>'is before she married him.','source_text'=>'sebelum dia berkahwin dengan lelaki tu.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>924.2,'end_time'=>928.58,'target_text'=>'So, you\'re not the a-hole for saying that, but you are the a-hole for not helping out your friend.','source_text'=>'Jadi, awak tak salah sebab cakap macam tu, tapi awak ada salahnya sebab tak tolong kawan awak dari awal.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>928.68,'end_time'=>929.5,'target_text'=>'In my opinion.','source_text'=>'Pada pendapat saya.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>929.6,'end_time'=>930,'target_text'=>'In my opinion.','source_text'=>'Pada pendapat saya.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>930.08,'end_time'=>937.7,'target_text'=>'If I had a friend and I was in a relationship like this, I would want them to do their best to help me, you know, realize','source_text'=>'Kalau saya ada kawan dan saya terperangkap dalam hubungan toksik macam ni, saya nak mereka cuba sedaya upaya untuk tolong saya sedar','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>937.8,'end_time'=>941.9,'target_text'=>'how they really are before I marry them, before I marry them.','source_text'=>'perangai sebenar pasangan saya sebelum saya kahwin dengan dia, sebelum saya kahwin dengan dia.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>942,'end_time'=>943.66,'target_text'=>'But, uh yeah, that\'s just my opinion.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, itu cuma pandangan peribadi saya.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>943.76,'end_time'=>950.14,'target_text'=>'As always, guys, I want you to take out your phone, open up your camera, and record yourself talking about what you learned','source_text'=>'Macam biasa, kawan-kawan, saya nak korang keluarkan telefon, buka kamera, dan rakam diri korang bercakap tentang apa yang korang belajar','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>950.24,'end_time'=>954.82,'target_text'=>'today, any new words you learned, and also summarize this whole video.','source_text'=>'hari ini, apa-apa perkataan baru yang dipelajari, dan juga ringkaskan keseluruhan video ini.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>954.92,'end_time'=>959.5,'target_text'=>'If you need to, watch the video again, shadow it again, and then take a video.','source_text'=>'Kalau perlu, tonton video ni sekali lagi, buat shadowing semula, dan kemudian rakam video korang.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>959.6,'end_time'=>962.26,'target_text'=>'This will really help you track your progress.','source_text'=>'Ini akan sangat membantu korang memantau perkembangan diri.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>962.36,'end_time'=>966.5,'target_text'=>'If you guys want more videos like this one, make sure to let me know in the comments.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak lebih banyak video macam ni, pastikan korang beritahu saya di ruangan komen.','order'=>238],
