            ['start_time'=>294.88,'end_time'=>301.26,'target_text'=>'>> While I was editing this video, I noticed how much cleaner my pacing [music] has gotten compared to my older videos.','source_text'=>'Masa tengah sunting video ni, saya perasan tempo suntingan saya jadi jauh lebih kemas berbanding video-video lama.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>301.36,'end_time'=>307.82,'target_text'=>'I\'ve been using Skillshare again, and this time I took the in-depth Cap Cut video editing [music] master class.','source_text'=>'Saya guna semula Skillshare, dan kali ini saya ikuti kelas mendalam suntingan video CapCut.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>307.92,'end_time'=>316.14,'target_text'=>'One thing I learned was how to tighten every cut to the beat instead of leaving small pauses, and [music] it instantly made','source_text'=>'Antara benda yang saya belajar ialah cara merapatkan setiap potongan babak mengikut rentak muzik dan elak jeda kosong, dan ia serta-merta','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>316.24,'end_time'=>318.14,'target_text'=>'my edits feel smoother.','source_text'=>'buat hasil suntingan saya terasa lebih lancar.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>318.24,'end_time'=>326.3,'target_text'=>'What I like about Skillshare is that the classes are taught by real working creatives like filmmakers, designers, and photographers','source_text'=>'Apa yang saya suka pasal Skillshare ialah kelas diajar oleh karyawan kreatif profesional seperti pembikin filem, pereka bentuk, dan jurugambar','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>326.4,'end_time'=>329.18,'target_text'=>'who actually use these techniques every [music] day.','source_text'=>'yang betul-betul guna teknik ni dalam kerja harian mereka.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>329.28,'end_time'=>335.26,'target_text'=>'I usually watch a short lesson, then apply it right away, and you can already see the difference in this video.','source_text'=>'Biasanya saya tonton pelajaran pendek, lepas tu terus praktikkan, dan korang dah boleh nampak perbezaannya dalam video ni.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>335.36,'end_time'=>342.7,'target_text'=>'They have classes on [music] everything, including English, from pronunciation practice to advanced communication.','source_text'=>'Mereka ada kelas untuk macam-macam topik termasuk bahasa Inggeris, daripada latihan sebutan sehinggalah komunikasi tahap lanjutan.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>342.8,'end_time'=>346.78,'target_text'=>'So, you can improve your speaking while building creative skills.','source_text'=>'Jadi, korang boleh tingkatkan kemahiran bertutur sambil asah kemahiran kreatif.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>346.88,'end_time'=>355.42,'target_text'=>'The first 500 people to use my link in the description or [music] scan my QR code will receive a one month free trial of Skillshare.','source_text'=>'500 orang terawal yang guna pautan saya di ruang penerangan atau imbas kod QR saya akan dapat percubaan percuma sebulan di Skillshare.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>355.52,'end_time'=>356.7,'target_text'=>'So, get started today.','source_text'=>'Jadi, mulakan langkah korang hari ini.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>356.8,'end_time'=>358.86,'target_text'=>'Thank you Skillshare for sponsoring today\'s video.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih kepada Skillshare kerana menaja video hari ini.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>358.96,'end_time'=>360.7,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s get back into the video.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita kembali ke video kita.','order'=>175],
