            ['start_time'=>432.96,'end_time'=>433.66,'target_text'=>'Is this drip?','source_text'=>'Nampak bergaya tak?','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>433.76,'end_time'=>439.34,'target_text'=>'And I do actually I do like buying secondhand clothes because when you buy brand new clothes, it always shrinks.','source_text'=>'Dan sebenarnya saya memang suka beli pakaian terpakai sebab bila beli baju serba baru, ia selalu mengecut bila dibasuh.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>439.44,'end_time'=>442.94,'target_text'=>'Not always, depending on what kind of quality you get, but usually the clothes shrink.','source_text'=>'Tak semestinya selalu, bergantung pada kualiti fabrik, tapi biasanya pakaian baru akan mengecut.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>443.04,'end_time'=>447.1,'target_text'=>'When you buy secondhand clothes, it\'s already been washed many, many times, so it doesn\'t shrink.','source_text'=>'Bila korang beli pakaian terpakai, ia dah dicuci berkali-kali, jadi ia takkan mengecut lagi dah.','order'=>219],
