            ['start_time'=>492.4,'end_time'=>493.26,'target_text'=>'Maybe he just bought it.','source_text'=>'Mungkin dia baru saja beli kerusi tu.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>493.36,'end_time'=>494.86,'target_text'=>'Let\'s see what she\'s selling here.','source_text'=>'Jom tengok apa yang makcik ni jual kat sini.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>494.96,'end_time'=>504.54,'target_text'=>'Some wallets, some gloves, oh, some toques, belts, watches, oh, a magnifying glass, electric toothbrushes, some bike helmets','source_text'=>'Ada dompet, sarung tangan, topi kupluk, tali pinggang, jam tangan, kanta pembesar, berus gigi elektrik, topi keledar basikal','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>504.64,'end_time'=>508.7,'target_text'=>'back there, phone cases, and then a bunch of other random stuff, I think.','source_text'=>'kat belakang tu, sarung telefon, dan bermacam-macam barang lain lagi rasanya.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>508.8,'end_time'=>510.46,'target_text'=>'Yeah, some charging bricks.','source_text'=>'Ya, ada kepala pengecas.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>510.56,'end_time'=>511.1,'target_text'=>'>> Holy.','source_text'=>'Mak aih.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>511.2,'end_time'=>513.18,'target_text'=>'>> Some portable power banks.','source_text'=>'Ada bank kuasa mudah alih.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>513.28,'end_time'=>515.58,'target_text'=>'Okay, so these right here are fleece.','source_text'=>'Okey, yang kat sini semuanya fabrik fleece.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>515.68,'end_time'=>516.78,'target_text'=>'These are all fleece.','source_text'=>'Semua ni fabrik fleece.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>516.88,'end_time'=>519.1,'target_text'=>'That\'s just the material and the type of jacket.','source_text'=>'Itu cuma nama jenis fabrik dan jenis jaket.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>519.2,'end_time'=>520.22,'target_text'=>'This is fleece.','source_text'=>'Ini fabrik fleece.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>520.32,'end_time'=>521.82,'target_text'=>'These are all fleece jackets.','source_text'=>'Semua ni jaket fabrik fleece.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>521.92,'end_time'=>525.18,'target_text'=>'So, we just found a whole bunch of trench coats.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita baru saja jumpa banyak sangat baju trench coat.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>525.28,'end_time'=>527.18,'target_text'=>'Like, all of these are trench coats.','source_text'=>'Tengok ni, semua ni baju trench coat.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>527.28,'end_time'=>530.14,'target_text'=>'The belt, the material, all of these are trench coats.','source_text'=>'Ada tali pinggang, material dia, semua ni memang trench coat.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>530.24,'end_time'=>536.14,'target_text'=>'Green trench coats, black trench coats, beige trench coats, gray trench coats, leather trench coats.','source_text'=>'Trench coat warna hijau, hitam, krim, kelabu, dan trench coat kulit.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>536.24,'end_time'=>537.9,'target_text'=>'This is the trench coat corner.','source_text'=>'Ini sudut khas untuk baju trench coat.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>538,'end_time'=>539.1,'target_text'=>'All of these are trench coats.','source_text'=>'Semua ni baju trench coat.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>539.2,'end_time'=>542.3,'target_text'=>'But we still have not found the overalls.','source_text'=>'Tapi kita masih belum jumpa seluar overall lagi.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>542.4,'end_time'=>543.42,'target_text'=>'Those are going to be really hard.','source_text'=>'Yang tu memang susah nak cari.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>543.52,'end_time'=>544.94,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if we can do that.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu sama ada kita boleh jumpa atau tak.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>545.04,'end_time'=>548.38,'target_text'=>'So, they do have these, but these are coveralls.','source_text'=>'Jadi mereka memang ada baju jenis ni, tapi ini dipanggil coverall.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>548.48,'end_time'=>551.02,'target_text'=>'Coveralls because your whole body is covered.','source_text'=>'Coverall sebab seluruh badan awak ditutupi pakaian ni.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>551.12,'end_time'=>551.66,'target_text'=>'coveralls.','source_text'=>'Baju coverall.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>551.76,'end_time'=>555.18,'target_text'=>'We\'re looking for overalls very similar to this, but it\'s not the same.','source_text'=>'Kita tengah cari seluar overall yang sangat serupa macam ni, tapi bukan benda yang sama.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>555.28,'end_time'=>557.26,'target_text'=>'And here there are a bunch of leather jackets.','source_text'=>'Dan kat sini ada banyak jaket kulit.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>557.36,'end_time'=>558.38,'target_text'=>'80,0001.','source_text'=>'80,000 won.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>558.48,'end_time'=>559.34,'target_text'=>'How much is this one?','source_text'=>'Berapa harga yang ni?','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>559.44,'end_time'=>560.38,'target_text'=>'100,0001.','source_text'=>'100,000 won.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>560.48,'end_time'=>562.7,'target_text'=>'We have found the overalls right here.','source_text'=>'Kita dah jumpa seluar overall kat sini.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>562.8,'end_time'=>566.86,'target_text'=>'Well, this is like a skirt overall, but these I believe are the normal overalls.','source_text'=>'Yang ni macam skirt overall, tapi yang sebelah ni saya rasa overall biasa.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>566.96,'end_time'=>567.36,'target_text'=>'Yep.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>567.36,'end_time'=>574.06,'target_text'=>'So, they were similar to those coveralls, but it\'s pretty much pants, but then it has shoulder straps that come up and you','source_text'=>'Jadi ia mirip macam coverall tadi, tapi bentuknya seluar biasa yang ada tali bahu bersambung ke atas dan korang','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>574.16,'end_time'=>574.86,'target_text'=>'wear it like that.','source_text'=>'pakai macam tu.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>574.96,'end_time'=>575.58,'target_text'=>'Overalls.','source_text'=>'Seluar overall.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>575.68,'end_time'=>577.18,'target_text'=>'And we found a bunch of overalls.','source_text'=>'Dan kita dah jumpa banyak seluar overall.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>577.28,'end_time'=>578.3,'target_text'=>'Here\'s another pair.','source_text'=>'Ini sepasang lagi.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>578.4,'end_time'=>579.26,'target_text'=>'Here\'s another pair.','source_text'=>'Ini sepasang lagi.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>579.36,'end_time'=>581.1,'target_text'=>'These are like overall skirts.','source_text'=>'Yang ni jenis skirt overall.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>581.2,'end_time'=>581.66,'target_text'=>'What we found?','source_text'=>'Apa yang kita dah jumpa?','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>581.76,'end_time'=>583.5,'target_text'=>'We found all five items.','source_text'=>'Kita dah jumpa kesemua lima-lima barang tadi.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>583.6,'end_time'=>584.3,'target_text'=>'You know what that means?','source_text'=>'Korang tahu apa maksudnya?','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>584.4,'end_time'=>586.46,'target_text'=>'That means we can go and eat lunch.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya kita dah boleh pergi makan tengah hari.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>586.56,'end_time'=>588.06,'target_text'=>'So, come with us to eat lunch.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jom ikut kami makan tengah hari.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>588.16,'end_time'=>589.9,'target_text'=>'We\'re gonna have a very special meal.','source_text'=>'Kita akan nikmati hidangan yang sangat istimewa.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>590,'end_time'=>591.98,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s go there after we\'re done looking around.','source_text'=>'Jom kita ke sana lepas selesai tengok-tengok sekeliling.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>592.08,'end_time'=>594.7,'target_text'=>'I still am looking for a hoodie or a sweater.','source_text'=>'Saya masih lagi tengah cari baju hoodie atau baju panas.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>594.8,'end_time'=>595.26,'target_text'=>'Either one.','source_text'=>'Mana-mana satu pun boleh.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>595.36,'end_time'=>596.86,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s keep on looking for that.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jom kita teruskan mencari.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>596.96,'end_time'=>597.74,'target_text'=>'Those are silks.','source_text'=>'Itu kain sutera.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>597.84,'end_time'=>599.42,'target_text'=>'And I think that\'s pig skin.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa itu kulit babi.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>599.52,'end_time'=>601.42,'target_text'=>'>> Uh hana','source_text'=>'Hana,','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>601.52,'end_time'=>602.54,'target_text'=>'kimchi.','source_text'=>'kimchi.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>602.64,'end_time'=>604.38,'target_text'=>'Kimchi.','source_text'=>'Kimchi.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>604.48,'end_time'=>606.38,'target_text'=>'>> She said uh kimchi because that\'s like cheese.','source_text'=>'Makcik tu sebut kimchi sebab itu macam sebut perkataan cheese.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>606.48,'end_time'=>610.78,'target_text'=>'That\'s how you say cheese in uh >> Oh, is it >> like when you know how people say cheese for the camera?','source_text'=>'Macam tulah cara orang Korea sebut cheese masa bergambar.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>610.88,'end_time'=>612.7,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, >> they say kimchi here.','source_text'=>'Ya, orang kat sini sebut kimchi.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>612.8,'end_time'=>615.9,'target_text'=>'They also have pig skin over there and then the rice drink, but it tastes good.','source_text'=>'Mereka ada jual kulit babi kat sebelah sana dan juga minuman beras, tapi rasa minuman tu sedap.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>616,'end_time'=>618.92,'target_text'=>'It\'s super like soft and delicate.','source_text'=>'Teksturnya sangat lembut dan halus.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>619.44,'end_time'=>621.66,'target_text'=>'>> We\'re going to go eat some Korean beef soup.','source_text'=>'Kita akan pergi makan sup daging lembu Korea.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>621.76,'end_time'=>624.38,'target_text'=>'That rib soup is also good, but I\'m going to have the Korean beef soup.','source_text'=>'Sup tulang rusuk tu pun sedap juga, tapi saya nak makan sup daging lembu Korea.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>624.48,'end_time'=>624.94,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go in here.','source_text'=>'Jom kita masuk sini.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>625.04,'end_time'=>625.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I want a soup.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya memang nak makan sup panas.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>625.92,'end_time'=>628.92,'target_text'=>'So, this is the place to be.','source_text'=>'Jadi, inilah tempat yang paling sesuai.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>631.36,'end_time'=>633.58,'target_text'=>'>> We just uh decided to come for lunch here.','source_text'=>'Kami baru saja buat keputusan nak makan tengah hari kat sini.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>633.68,'end_time'=>637.74,'target_text'=>'This restaurant is really popular, really famous for their their meat and their beef.','source_text'=>'Restoran ni memang sangat popular dan terkenal dengan hidangan daging lembu mereka.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>637.84,'end_time'=>640.38,'target_text'=>'So, we\'ve decided to get two Korean beef soups.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kami pesan dua mangkuk sup daging lembu Korea.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>640.48,'end_time'=>641.58,'target_text'=>'Beef soup or beef stew?','source_text'=>'Sup daging atau stew daging?','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>641.68,'end_time'=>642.08,'target_text'=>'What was it?','source_text'=>'Yang mana satu tadi?','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>642.16,'end_time'=>642.86,'target_text'=>'I think soup.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa sup.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>642.96,'end_time'=>643.58,'target_text'=>'>> Beef soup.','source_text'=>'Sup daging lembu.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>643.68,'end_time'=>644.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>644.24,'end_time'=>645.98,'target_text'=>'10,0001 uh each.','source_text'=>'Harga 10,000 won setiap satu mangkuk.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>646.08,'end_time'=>651.34,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s about a little bit less than 10 Canadian dollars and probably about like 6 to 7 USD.','source_text'=>'Jadi itu kurang sikit daripada 10 dolar Kanada dan sekitar 6 hingga 7 dolar Amerika.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>651.44,'end_time'=>652.86,'target_text'=>'But yeah, we\'re going to have that for lunch.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, kami akan makan hidangan tu untuk makan tengah hari.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>652.96,'end_time'=>653.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s about 1:00 p.m.','source_text'=>'Sekarang lebih kurang pukul 1:00 petang.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>654,'end_time'=>654.46,'target_text'=>'right now.','source_text'=>'waktu sekarang.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>654.56,'end_time'=>655.1,'target_text'=>'1:00 p.m.','source_text'=>'Pukul 1:00 petang.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>655.2,'end_time'=>657.1,'target_text'=>'or 1:00 in the afternoon, you could say.','source_text'=>'atau korang boleh sebut jam 1:00 tengah hari.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>657.2,'end_time'=>659.98,'target_text'=>'And I just poured myself and Leon some water.','source_text'=>'Dan saya baru saja tuang air masak untuk saya dan Leon.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>660.08,'end_time'=>660.86,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s his cup.','source_text'=>'Jadi itu cawan dia.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>660.96,'end_time'=>662.78,'target_text'=>'And I really like the cups in Korea, honestly.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya saya suka sangat cawan kat Korea ni.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>662.88,'end_time'=>664.22,'target_text'=>'They\'re like these metal cups.','source_text'=>'Cawan jenis logam macam ni.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>664.32,'end_time'=>665.18,'target_text'=>'They are pretty small.','source_text'=>'Saiznya agak comel dan kecil.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>665.28,'end_time'=>665.52,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>665.52,'end_time'=>669.58,'target_text'=>'But they also give you this jug of water, this container of water.','source_text'=>'Tapi mereka bagi jag air yang besar ni sekali.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>669.68,'end_time'=>673.72,'target_text'=>'So you can easily just refill your cup.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang boleh terus tambah air dalam cawan sendiri dengan mudah.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>676.4,'end_time'=>678.46,'target_text'=>'Very, very, very refreshing.','source_text'=>'Sangat-sangat menyegarkan tekak.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>678.56,'end_time'=>680.06,'target_text'=>'But this restaurant is super busy.','source_text'=>'Tapi restoran ni memang sangat sibuk.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>680.16,'end_time'=>681.74,'target_text'=>'There are a lot of people.','source_text'=>'Ada ramai sangat pelanggan.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>681.84,'end_time'=>684.7,'target_text'=>'We didn\'t end up actually buying anything from Dongo Market.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya kami tak beli apa-apa pun dari Pasar Dongmyo tadi.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>684.8,'end_time'=>687.82,'target_text'=>'We just uh we just walked around and we found those five items.','source_text'=>'Kami cuma pusing-pusing jalan dan jumpa lima barang tadi.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>687.92,'end_time'=>689.1,'target_text'=>'So, can you guys remember it?','source_text'=>'Jadi, korang masih ingat lagi tak barang-barang tu?','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>689.2,'end_time'=>690.78,'target_text'=>'What is this item?','source_text'=>'Barang apa yang ini?','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>690.88,'end_time'=>692.94,'target_text'=>'What is this item?','source_text'=>'Barang apa yang ini?','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>693.04,'end_time'=>695.1,'target_text'=>'What is this item?','source_text'=>'Barang apa yang ini?','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>695.2,'end_time'=>696.86,'target_text'=>'What is this item?','source_text'=>'Barang apa yang ini?','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>696.96,'end_time'=>699.66,'target_text'=>'And what is this item?','source_text'=>'Dan barang apa pula yang ini?','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>699.76,'end_time'=>701.02,'target_text'=>'Did you guys get them all right?','source_text'=>'Semua jawapan korang betul tak?','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>701.12,'end_time'=>701.58,'target_text'=>'Let me know.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya ya.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>701.68,'end_time'=>704.94,'target_text'=>'Turtleneck, cardigan, bomber jacket, trench coat.','source_text'=>'Baju turtleneck, kardigan, jaket bomber, baju trench coat.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>705.04,'end_time'=>709.27,'target_text'=>'Those are all the items that we found and that you learned specifically.','source_text'=>'Itulah semua barang yang kita jumpa dan korang pelajari secara khusus tadi.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>709.37,'end_time'=>710.78,'target_text'=>'[snorts]','source_text'=>'[ketawa kecil]','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>710.88,'end_time'=>714.46,'target_text'=>'But now we\'ll wait for our food and uh we\'ll show you guys what we\'re eating.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang kita tunggu makanan sampai dan kita akan tunjuk kat korang apa yang kita makan.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>714.56,'end_time'=>716.14,'target_text'=>'Okay guys, so we just got our food.','source_text'=>'Okey kawan-kawan, makanan kami baru saja sampai.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>716.24,'end_time'=>719.42,'target_text'=>'It was boiling earlier, but it\'s not boiling anymore.','source_text'=>'Tadi kuahnya menggelegak panas, tapi sekarang dah reda sikit.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>719.52,'end_time'=>720.46,'target_text'=>'But it was boiling.','source_text'=>'Tapi tadi memang betul-betul menggelegak.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>720.56,'end_time'=>725.74,'target_text'=>'like it was really really hot because this bowl is made of stone and it\'s super hot and that\'s why they give it to you in','source_text'=>'kuahnya memang panas membara sebab mangkuk ni diperbuat daripada batu dan sangat panas, sebab itulah mereka letak mangkuk ni atas','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>725.84,'end_time'=>727.58,'target_text'=>'this plate so that you don\'t burn yourself.','source_text'=>'pinggan pelapik ni supaya tangan korang tak melecur.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>727.68,'end_time'=>729.26,'target_text'=>'We got a bowl of rice there.','source_text'=>'Kita dapat semangkuk nasi putih kat situ.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>729.36,'end_time'=>733.34,'target_text'=>'Here we have the sides, kimchi, radish kimchi and uh a salad.','source_text'=>'Kat sini kita ada hidangan sampingan iaitu kimchi, kimchi lobak putih, dan juga salad.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>733.44,'end_time'=>736.22,'target_text'=>'And then here is the star of the show.','source_text'=>'Dan inilah dia sajian utama kita.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>736.32,'end_time'=>738.7,'target_text'=>'Here is the Korean beef soup.','source_text'=>'Inilah sup daging lembu Korea.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>738.8,'end_time'=>739.66,'target_text'=>'Looks super good.','source_text'=>'Nampak menyelerakan sangat.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>739.76,'end_time'=>740.54,'target_text'=>'Korean beef soup.','source_text'=>'Sup daging lembu Korea.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>740.64,'end_time'=>741.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s just steaming.','source_text'=>'Asap panas masih berkepul-kepul keluar.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>741.36,'end_time'=>742.14,'target_text'=>'It\'s so hot.','source_text'=>'Panas betul sup ni.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>742.24,'end_time'=>743.66,'target_text'=>'Let\'s uh give this a try.','source_text'=>'Jom kita rasa.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>743.76,'end_time'=>744.7,'target_text'=>'Let\'s dig in.','source_text'=>'Jom kita makan.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>744.8,'end_time'=>750.28,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m going to get some soup, my spoon, and I\'m going to blow it cuz it\'s very, very hot.','source_text'=>'Saya ambil sikit kuah sup guna sudu dan tiup dulu sebab kuah ni sangat-sangat panas.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>753.28,'end_time'=>753.82,'target_text'=>'Ooh.','source_text'=>'Ooh.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>753.92,'end_time'=>754.32,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>754.32,'end_time'=>754.86,'target_text'=>'Very good.','source_text'=>'Sedap sangat.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>754.96,'end_time'=>759.9,'target_text'=>'I really like soup and right now it\'s like the best time to eat soups because it\'s so cold outside.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka makan sup dan sekarang waktu paling sesuai nak hirup sup sebab cuaca kat luar sejuk sangat.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>760,'end_time'=>761.1,'target_text'=>'Like we were freezing, eh?','source_text'=>'Kita menggigil kesejukan tadi kan?','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>761.2,'end_time'=>762.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it was chilly.','source_text'=>'Ya, cuaca memang dingin.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>762.16,'end_time'=>763.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, especially that wind, man.','source_text'=>'Ya, lagi-lagi angin sejuk tu.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>763.52,'end_time'=>764.94,'target_text'=>'That wind just like it just cuts you.','source_text'=>'Angin tu rasa macam mencucuk-cucuk sampai ke tulang.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>765.04,'end_time'=>766.7,'target_text'=>'Like my ears get frozen.','source_text'=>'Telinga saya sampai rasa kebas membeku.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>766.8,'end_time'=>768.7,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know about you, but my ears get frozen.','source_text'=>'Tak tahulah kalau korang, tapi telinga saya memang kebas membeku.','order'=>369],
