            ['start_time'=>184.44,'end_time'=>192.06,'target_text'=>'We are going [music] to be learning English as I clean up my pronunciation, your accent, your [music] rhythm and your confidence.','source_text'=>'Kita akan belajar bahasa Inggeris sambil memantapkan sebutan saya, slanga, intonasi dan keyakinan diri korang.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>192.16,'end_time'=>196.82,'target_text'=>'It was just a roundabout way of her politely trying to spare my feelings.','source_text'=>'Itu cuma cara berlapik dia nak jaga hati saya secara sopan.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>196.92,'end_time'=>204.14,'target_text'=>'Be a hole for giving all of my co-workers a different reason for why I have missing fingers so [music] I wouldn\'t take legal','source_text'=>'Adakah bersalah beri alasan berbeza kat rakan sekerja pasal jari saya yang hilang supaya tak ambil tindakan undang-undang','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>204.24,'end_time'=>207.94,'target_text'=>'time down to heat company wide training on his behavior.','source_text'=>'sehinggalah sesi latihan syarikat tentang kelakuannya diadakan.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>208.04,'end_time'=>212,'target_text'=>'He chooses not but [music] I was already so cranky.','source_text'=>'Dia pilih untuk tidak tapi saya masa tu dah cukup rimas.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>212.36,'end_time'=>216.14,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we\'re in the I did so much shopping in Mushima.','source_text'=>'Okey jadi kita berada di saya banyak sangat membeli-belah di Hiroshima.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>216.24,'end_time'=>218.82,'target_text'=>'The jeans and one hoodie which I How old are you?','source_text'=>'Seluar jeans dan sehelai hoodie yang mana umur awak berapa sekarang?','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>218.92,'end_time'=>222.94,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m 25 and my skin age is 30.','source_text'=>'Umur saya 25 tahun tapi umur kulit saya 30 tahun.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>223.04,'end_time'=>225.44,'target_text'=>'Five year difference.','source_text'=>'Beza lima tahun lebih tua.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>225.64,'end_time'=>228.98,'target_text'=>'It says Leon\'s skin age is 30 and he is 25.','source_text'=>'Keputusan menunjukkan umur kulit Leon 30 tahun padahal umur sebenarnya baru 25 tahun.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>229.08,'end_time'=>231.78,'target_text'=>'So, his skin is five years older than he is.','source_text'=>'Jadi kulit dia lima tahun lebih tua daripada usia sebenar dia.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>231.88,'end_time'=>236.06,'target_text'=>'And then I\'m 23 and my skin age is 23.','source_text'=>'Dan saya pula umur 23 tahun dan umur kulit saya pun 23 tahun.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>236.16,'end_time'=>237.5,'target_text'=>'And honestly this is actually super cool.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya pengalaman ni memang sangat menarik.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>237.6,'end_time'=>242.06,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never done like a skin test or anything before but pretty cool.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah buat ujian analisis kulit macam ni sebelum ni tapi memang sangat hebat.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>242.16,'end_time'=>243.18,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it\'s cool stuff.','source_text'=>'Ya, memang menarik sangat.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>243.28,'end_time'=>243.48,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>243.48,'end_time'=>249.42,'target_text'=>'And I think the reason my skin age is like my age is because I use tretinoin and that like really helps like keep your skin','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa punca kenapa umur kulit saya sama macam umur saya adalah sebab saya pakai tretinoin yang sangat membantu jaga kulit','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>249.52,'end_time'=>251.58,'target_text'=>'like tight and like younger.','source_text'=>'supaya kekal tegang dan nampak muda.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>251.68,'end_time'=>254.42,'target_text'=>'And I kind of like put you on that like five years ago but you\'ve never used it.','source_text'=>'Dan saya dah kenalkan produk tu kat awak sejak lima tahun lepas tapi awak tak pernah nak pakai.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>254.52,'end_time'=>256.22,'target_text'=>'But I don\'t really use it that much anymore.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang saya dah tak kerap pakai sangat dah.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>256.32,'end_time'=>258.66,'target_text'=>'I mainly just use it on my nose and my forehead.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma sapu kat bahagian hidung dan dahi saja.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>258.76,'end_time'=>262.06,'target_text'=>'Not really on my like cheeks or anything but it\'s actually super interesting.','source_text'=>'Tak sapu sangat kat pipi atau tempat lain, tapi analisis ni memang sangat menarik.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>262.16,'end_time'=>267.54,'target_text'=>'And I thought my skin would be like super dry but whatever they used to wash my face like moisturized it a lot.','source_text'=>'Dan saya ingatkan kulit saya akan jadi sangat kering tapi produk pencuci yang mereka guna tadi sangat melembapkan kulit.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>267.64,'end_time'=>268.54,'target_text'=>'>> feels tight right now.','source_text'=>'terasa tegang sekarang ni.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>268.64,'end_time'=>271.5,'target_text'=>'Yeah, my skin feels tight too but it feels like moisturized as well.','source_text'=>'Ya, kulit saya pun rasa tegang tapi dalam masa yang sama rasa sangat lembap.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>271.6,'end_time'=>277.18,'target_text'=>'So, over there there are two consultation rooms and then over there is the reception.','source_text'=>'Jadi kat sebelah sana ada dua bilik rundingan dan kat sana pula kaunter penyambut tetamu.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>277.28,'end_time'=>280.1,'target_text'=>'And then here is the lobby or the waiting area.','source_text'=>'Dan bahagian sini pula adalah lobi atau ruang menunggu.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>280.2,'end_time'=>282.38,'target_text'=>'And it\'s really close to Gangnam Station.','source_text'=>'Dan tempat ni sangat dekat dengan Stesen Gangnam.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>282.48,'end_time'=>284.22,'target_text'=>'So, it is really easy to get here.','source_text'=>'Jadi sangat mudah nak sampai ke sini.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>284.32,'end_time'=>289.54,'target_text'=>'We just came from Hongdae all the way to Gangnam Station and we just walked here.','source_text'=>'Kami baru saja datang dari Hongdae terus ke Stesen Gangnam dan jalan kaki saja ke sini.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>289.64,'end_time'=>290.74,'target_text'=>'So, it was really close.','source_text'=>'Jadi jaraknya memang sangat dekat.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>290.84,'end_time'=>295.94,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it\'s pretty convenient and it\'s my first like dermatologist thing I\'ve ever done in my life.','source_text'=>'Ya, memang sangat mudah dan ini kali pertama seumur hidup saya pergi jumpa pakar kulit dermatologi.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>296.04,'end_time'=>297.62,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s pretty cool and interesting.','source_text'=>'Jadi memang pengalaman yang sangat seronok dan menarik.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>297.72,'end_time'=>300.1,'target_text'=>'And definitely Korea has like good skin care advice.','source_text'=>'Dan sememangnya Korea ada nasihat penjagaan kulit yang sangat bagus.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>300.2,'end_time'=>303.98,'target_text'=>'So, Yeah, I think a lot of people come here just for skin care and stuff.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya rasa ramai orang datang ke sini semata-mata untuk rawatan kulit dan sebagainya.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>304.08,'end_time'=>304.66,'target_text'=>'>> And like health.','source_text'=>'Dan juga untuk kesihatan.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>304.76,'end_time'=>307.54,'target_text'=>'We\'ll see what they say about my skin at the consultation.','source_text'=>'Kita tengok apa yang doktor akan cakap pasal kulit saya masa sesi rundingan nanti.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>307.64,'end_time'=>308.46,'target_text'=>'How old are you, old dude?','source_text'=>'Berapa umur awak sekarang, orang tua?','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>308.56,'end_time'=>309.26,'target_text'=>'You\'re cooked.','source_text'=>'Habislah awak.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>309.36,'end_time'=>311.3,'target_text'=>'By the time you\'re like 40 you\'re going to look 50.','source_text'=>'Bila umur awak 40 tahun nanti mesti muka awak nampak macam 50 tahun.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>311.4,'end_time'=>314.44,'target_text'=>'>> But that\'s just the nature being a man.','source_text'=>'Tapi memang lumrah orang lelaki macam tu.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>320.72,'end_time'=>322.34,'target_text'=>'So, what\'s the verdict?','source_text'=>'Jadi, apa keputusannya?','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>322.44,'end_time'=>326.02,'target_text'=>'So, the verdict is we\'re cooked.','source_text'=>'Jadi keputusannya ialah kita dua-dua dah habis.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>326.12,'end_time'=>328.98,'target_text'=>'No, the verdict is we both have like super oily skin.','source_text'=>'Bukanlah, keputusannya kulit kami dua-dua jenis yang sangat berminyak.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>329.08,'end_time'=>330.86,'target_text'=>'They suggested some treatments that we\'re going to go with.','source_text'=>'Mereka cadangkan beberapa rawatan yang kami setuju untuk buat.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>330.96,'end_time'=>335.34,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to do like micro needling over my whole face to lower pores and oiliness.','source_text'=>'Saya akan buat rawatan jarum mikro pada seluruh muka untuk kecilkan liang pori dan kurangkan minyak.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>335.44,'end_time'=>337.66,'target_text'=>'And Leon\'s going to do something similar as well.','source_text'=>'Dan Leon pun akan buat rawatan yang lebih kurang sama juga.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>337.76,'end_time'=>340.16,'target_text'=>'And we\'re about to do that.','source_text'=>'Dan kami dah sedia nak buat rawatan tu sekarang.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>350.56,'end_time'=>352.72,'target_text'=>'We just finished.','source_text'=>'Kami baru saja selesai rawatan.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>353.96,'end_time'=>357.66,'target_text'=>'But the most painful one for me was the one in the beginning, the fat thing.','source_text'=>'Tapi rawatan paling sakit untuk saya ialah bahagian awal tadi, yang pasal lemak tu.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>357.76,'end_time'=>358.42,'target_text'=>'Oh, I didn\'t get that.','source_text'=>'Oh, saya tak kena rawatan tu.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>358.52,'end_time'=>359.38,'target_text'=>'>> That one.','source_text'=>'Yang itu.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>359.48,'end_time'=>361.98,'target_text'=>'It was It was 37 degrees that hot [music] thing.','source_text'=>'Suhu alat panas tu sampai 37 darjah Celsius.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>362.08,'end_time'=>364.34,'target_text'=>'And then the outside of it was 5 degrees so.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu bahagian luarnya 5 darjah Celsius.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>364.44,'end_time'=>365.98,'target_text'=>'And they like were putting a lot of pressure.','source_text'=>'Dan mereka tekan kuat sangat kat muka.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>366.08,'end_time'=>366.9,'target_text'=>'That one hurt.','source_text'=>'Yang tu memang rasa sakit.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>367,'end_time'=>368.86,'target_text'=>'The rest the micro needles just felt like really weird.','source_text'=>'Yang selebihnya rawatan jarum mikro tu rasa agak pelik saja.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>368.96,'end_time'=>370.06,'target_text'=>'I mostly didn\'t feel it.','source_text'=>'Kebanyakannya saya tak rasa sangat pun.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>370.16,'end_time'=>373.26,'target_text'=>'And then sometimes I\'d feel really like thin needles like hair.','source_text'=>'Dan ada ketikanya rasa macam jarum halus sehalus rambut.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>373.36,'end_time'=>374.42,'target_text'=>'The needles weren\'t bad.','source_text'=>'Jarum tu taklah sakit sangat.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>374.52,'end_time'=>376.7,'target_text'=>'And the the laser one wasn\'t bad either.','source_text'=>'Dan rawatan laser tu pun taklah teruk sangat.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>376.8,'end_time'=>377.5,'target_text'=>'Did you do that one?','source_text'=>'Awak buat yang tu juga ke?','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>377.6,'end_time'=>378.62,'target_text'=>'Uh with laser.','source_text'=>'Guna laser.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>378.72,'end_time'=>380.38,'target_text'=>'Like it was like','source_text'=>'Rasa dia macam','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>380.48,'end_time'=>381.86,'target_text'=>'What?','source_text'=>'Apa dia?','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>381.96,'end_time'=>382.5,'target_text'=>'Like a laser.','source_text'=>'Macam sinaran laser.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>382.6,'end_time'=>383.14,'target_text'=>'>> The first one.','source_text'=>'Yang rawatan pertama tadi.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>383.24,'end_time'=>384.34,'target_text'=>'Oh, I thought that was needles.','source_text'=>'Oh, saya ingatkan yang tu guna jarum.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>384.44,'end_time'=>387.98,'target_text'=>'So, we just finished our skin care treatment at Repic Clinic.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami baru saja selesai jalani rawatan kulit di Klinik Repic.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>388.08,'end_time'=>389.5,'target_text'=>'First of all, thank you to them.','source_text'=>'Pertama sekali, terima kasih banyak-banyak kepada mereka.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>389.6,'end_time'=>390.74,'target_text'=>'It was a great experience.','source_text'=>'Ia satu pengalaman yang sangat menakjubkan.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>390.84,'end_time'=>392.7,'target_text'=>'They stayed later just for us.','source_text'=>'Kakitangan mereka sanggup tunggu lebih masa semata-mata untuk kami.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>392.8,'end_time'=>393.98,'target_text'=>'So, really grateful for that.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami sangat-sangat berterima kasih atas layanan mereka.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>394.08,'end_time'=>395.78,'target_text'=>'But this is where we were, Repic Clinic.','source_text'=>'Tapi inilah tempat kami tadi, iaitu Klinik Repic.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>395.88,'end_time'=>396.78,'target_text'=>'I would recommend this place.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat sarankan korang datang ke tempat ni.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>396.88,'end_time'=>402.54,'target_text'=>'They did a whole scan of us, gave us our diagnosis, told us what we needed and then they did it.','source_text'=>'Mereka imbas keseluruhan kulit kami, beri diagnosis lengkap, beritahu rawatan yang diperlukan dan terus buat rawatan.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>402.64,'end_time'=>405.1,'target_text'=>'Everyone there was really nice and they speak good English.','source_text'=>'Semua staf kat situ sangat ramah dan mereka fasih berbahasa Inggeris.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>405.2,'end_time'=>407.62,'target_text'=>'Thank you to the doctor and all the staff that work there.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih kepada doktor dan semua staf yang bertugas di sana.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>407.72,'end_time'=>408.7,'target_text'=>'And Merry Christmas.','source_text'=>'Dan Selamat Hari Krismas.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>408.8,'end_time'=>409.54,'target_text'=>'Happy New Year.','source_text'=>'Selamat Tahun Baru.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>409.64,'end_time'=>410.46,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go get something to eat.','source_text'=>'Jom kita pergi cari makanan.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>410.56,'end_time'=>412.66,'target_text'=>'This truck is backing up into this building.','source_text'=>'Lori ni tengah mengundur masuk ke dalam bangunan ni.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>412.76,'end_time'=>414.78,'target_text'=>'So, this building right here is under construction.','source_text'=>'Bangunan yang ada kat sini masih dalam proses pembinaan.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>414.88,'end_time'=>417.62,'target_text'=>'So, we have to let this guy back up first before we can go in.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita kena bagi lori ni mengundur dulu sebelum kita boleh melintas masuk.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>417.72,'end_time'=>419.26,'target_text'=>'The guy on the road stopped traffic.','source_text'=>'Petugas jalan raya tu dah tahan lalulintas.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>419.36,'end_time'=>420.94,'target_text'=>'Now we can go.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita dah boleh jalan.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>421.04,'end_time'=>428.86,'target_text'=>'This is like a Hyundai pop-up and I guess this is the electrical component of a vehicle, the E&D architecture of a Hyundai','source_text'=>'Ini macam kedai pameran sementara Hyundai dan saya rasa ini komponen elektrikal kenderaan, iaitu seni bina E&D untuk kenderaan Hyundai.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>428.96,'end_time'=>429.38,'target_text'=>'vehicle.','source_text'=>'kenderaan.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>429.48,'end_time'=>430.54,'target_text'=>'That\'s actually kind of cool.','source_text'=>'Nampak sangat menarik sebenarnya.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>430.64,'end_time'=>434.34,'target_text'=>'I saw this on the way there and I thought to myself I kind of want to come in see this.','source_text'=>'Saya nampak tempat ni masa lalu tadi dan terdetik dalam hati nak masuk tengok.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>434.44,'end_time'=>434.86,'target_text'=>'It looked cool.','source_text'=>'Nampak sangat gempak.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>434.96,'end_time'=>436.78,'target_text'=>'But I guess these are all the electronics.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya rasa semua ni komponen elektronik dia.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>436.88,'end_time'=>438.22,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s just all the cables.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ini susunan semua kabel pendawaian.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>438.32,'end_time'=>440.98,'target_text'=>'And like the modules and also the speakers.','source_text'=>'Termasuk modul dan juga pembesar suara.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>441.08,'end_time'=>444.42,'target_text'=>'I think pretty much everything that\'s connected to electronics is here right now.','source_text'=>'Boleh dikatakan semua benda yang bersambung dengan sistem elektronik ada kat sini sekarang.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>444.52,'end_time'=>444.92,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>444.92,'end_time'=>445.86,'target_text'=>'>> The touch screen as well.','source_text'=>'Termasuk skrin sesentuh juga.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>445.96,'end_time'=>449.66,'target_text'=>'But you would call this like all the cables that are together a harness, correct?','source_text'=>'Tapi himpunan semua kabel yang dicantumkan sekali ni dipanggil kekas wayar (harness), betul tak?','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>449.76,'end_time'=>450.16,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>450.2,'end_time'=>452.98,'target_text'=>'So, the harness of Dude, they got ethernet on this thing.','source_text'=>'Kekas wayar untuk Wah, ada sambungan kabel ethernet kat benda ni.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>453.08,'end_time'=>453.54,'target_text'=>'Really?','source_text'=>'Biar betul?','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>453.64,'end_time'=>454.7,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, it\'s for wireless something.','source_text'=>'Oh, itu untuk sambungan tanpa wayar.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>454.8,'end_time'=>456.42,'target_text'=>'I guess it connects to the internet.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ia bersambung ke rangkaian internet.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>456.52,'end_time'=>457.22,'target_text'=>'>> This is really cool.','source_text'=>'Ini memang sangat hebat.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>457.32,'end_time'=>459.22,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never seen a vehicle\'s electronics.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah tengok sistem elektronik kenderaan secara terbuka macam ni.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>459.32,'end_time'=>461.1,'target_text'=>'Honestly, it\'s not as much as I thought.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya taklah sebanyak macam yang saya sangkakan.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>461.2,'end_time'=>462.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, but this is Is that a battery?','source_text'=>'Ya, tapi yang ini Adakah itu bateri?','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>462.84,'end_time'=>464.26,'target_text'=>'Yeah, that\'s the battery in the bottom.','source_text'=>'Ya, itu bateri yang terletak di bahagian bawah.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>464.36,'end_time'=>465.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s an electric vehicle.','source_text'=>'Ini kenderaan elektrik.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>465.92,'end_time'=>466.7,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>466.8,'end_time'=>467.9,'target_text'=>'Oh, look at that.','source_text'=>'Wah, tengok bahagian tu.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>468,'end_time'=>471.1,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure if you can tell but that bottom part is a big battery.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada korang perasan tapi bahagian bawah tu ialah bateri bersaiz besar.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>471.2,'end_time'=>473.18,'target_text'=>'So, I guess this is an electric vehicle.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa ini memang kenderaan elektrik.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>473.28,'end_time'=>474.94,'target_text'=>'And then I guess this is the vehicle.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa inilah rupa keretanya.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>475.04,'end_time'=>475.62,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>475.72,'end_time'=>477.06,'target_text'=>'So, STV test bed.','source_text'=>'Jadi ini tapak ujian kenderaan STV.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>477.16,'end_time'=>478.38,'target_text'=>'So, this is the vehicle.','source_text'=>'Jadi inilah dia keretanya.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>478.48,'end_time'=>479.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually kind of nice.','source_text'=>'Nampak agak kemas dan bergaya.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>479.36,'end_time'=>481.5,'target_text'=>'Dude, there are no side mirrors.','source_text'=>'Kawan, kereta ni langsung tak ada cermin sisi.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>481.6,'end_time'=>482.3,'target_text'=>'>> Just cameras?','source_text'=>'Pakai kamera saja ke?','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>482.4,'end_time'=>482.9,'target_text'=>'>> a camera.','source_text'=>'Hanya guna kamera.','order'=>181],
