            ['start_time'=>620.68,'end_time'=>621.34,'target_text'=>'Fungus treatment.','source_text'=>'Ubat rawatan kulat.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>621.44,'end_time'=>622.1,'target_text'=>'Oh, that\'s really good.','source_text'=>'Wah, bagus betul produk tu.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>622.2,'end_time'=>623.02,'target_text'=>'That\'s cool.','source_text'=>'Hebat sangat.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>623.12,'end_time'=>624.06,'target_text'=>'That\'s really cool.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat bagus.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>624.16,'end_time'=>626.02,'target_text'=>'I know you come to Korea.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu awak datang ke Korea.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>626.12,'end_time'=>626.44,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>626.44,'end_time'=>628.9,'target_text'=>'So, I watching your video.','source_text'=>'Sebab saya memang tonton video awak.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>629,'end_time'=>630.82,'target_text'=>'You came to Korea.','source_text'=>'Awak datang bercuti ke Korea.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>630.92,'end_time'=>631.16,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>631.16,'end_time'=>634.78,'target_text'=>'So, when you came to Hongdae, I want to go there.','source_text'=>'Jadi bila tahu awak pergi ke Hongdae, saya rasa teringin nak ke sana.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>634.88,'end_time'=>635.3,'target_text'=>'Oh, okay.','source_text'=>'Oh, faham-faham.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>635.4,'end_time'=>639.22,'target_text'=>'Uh, so, I want to looking for you, but I don\'t know where you are.','source_text'=>'Saya nak cari awak kat sana tapi tak tahu awak kat mana.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>639.32,'end_time'=>639.74,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>639.84,'end_time'=>642.34,'target_text'=>'Uh, so, I\'m walking and you go.','source_text'=>'Masa saya tengah berjalan-jalan tiba-tiba awak lalu.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>642.44,'end_time'=>647.78,'target_text'=>'I said, \"Look at me.\" And I was like, \"Maybe he recognizes me.\" You\'re going to be the first person that spoke on a video.','source_text'=>'Saya perasan dan fikir, \"Mungkin dia cam saya.\" Awak adalah penonton pertama yang bercakap dalam video saya.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>647.88,'end_time'=>648.66,'target_text'=>'Big honor.','source_text'=>'Satu penghormatan besar.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>648.76,'end_time'=>649.34,'target_text'=>'Thank you.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih banyak-banyak.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>649.44,'end_time'=>649.86,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>649.96,'end_time'=>652.78,'target_text'=>'Some people, I think they maybe recognize me, but they never say anything.','source_text'=>'Sesetengah orang tu saya rasa mungkin mereka cam saya, tapi mereka segan nak tegur.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>652.88,'end_time'=>653.86,'target_text'=>'Maybe they\'re shy.','source_text'=>'Mungkin mereka pemalu.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>653.96,'end_time'=>658.46,'target_text'=>'But, if you ever do see me, be like, \"Dong-hyeon.\" And come and speak to me because I love speaking.','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau sesiapa nampak saya, panggil saja nama saya dan datang berbual sebab saya memang suka bersembang.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>658.56,'end_time'=>658.84,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>658.84,'end_time'=>661.34,'target_text'=>'And if you wanted to speak and speak, I could speak with you.','source_text'=>'Dan kalau awak nak bercakap banyak lagi, saya boleh saja berbual dengan awak.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>661.44,'end_time'=>662.66,'target_text'=>'I hope you continue studying.','source_text'=>'Saya harap awak teruskan usaha belajar bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>662.76,'end_time'=>664.46,'target_text'=>'Cuz what is your goal for English?','source_text'=>'Sebab apa matlamat utama awak belajar bahasa Inggeris?','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>664.56,'end_time'=>667.46,'target_text'=>'Like, what is just like travel?','source_text'=>'Adakah untuk melancong ke luar negara?','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>667.56,'end_time'=>668.54,'target_text'=>'Or to speak with people?','source_text'=>'Atau untuk bersembang dengan orang lain?','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>668.64,'end_time'=>669.38,'target_text'=>'Or for business?','source_text'=>'Atau untuk urusan perniagaan?','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>669.48,'end_time'=>671.22,'target_text'=>'I really love traveling.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka sangat melancong.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>671.32,'end_time'=>675.82,'target_text'=>'So, I want to make, uh, foreign, uh, a foreign, uh, friend.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya nak cari kawan dari luar negara.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>675.92,'end_time'=>676.32,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>676.36,'end_time'=>680.58,'target_text'=>'So, want to, uh, communicate what I want to say.','source_text'=>'Supaya saya boleh sampaikan apa yang saya nak katakan.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>680.68,'end_time'=>681.38,'target_text'=>'To meet people.','source_text'=>'Untuk berjumpa dengan orang luar.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>681.48,'end_time'=>683.22,'target_text'=>'So, you like connections, talking to people.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya awak suka jalin persahabatan dan berborak dengan orang ramai.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>683.32,'end_time'=>684.18,'target_text'=>'Where do you want to travel?','source_text'=>'Awak teringin nak melancong ke mana?','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>684.28,'end_time'=>686.94,'target_text'=>'Like, you have a country that you really want to go to?','source_text'=>'Ada mana-mana negara yang awak teringin sangat nak pergi?','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>687.04,'end_time'=>690.94,'target_text'=>'I want really want to go America and Canada.','source_text'=>'Saya teringin sangat nak pergi ke Amerika dan Kanada.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>691.04,'end_time'=>691.7,'target_text'=>'And Canada?','source_text'=>'Dan Kanada?','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>691.8,'end_time'=>692.7,'target_text'=>'Canada\'s very nice.','source_text'=>'Kanada sebuah negara yang sangat indah.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>692.8,'end_time'=>693.34,'target_text'=>'Canada.','source_text'=>'Negara Kanada.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>693.44,'end_time'=>693.98,'target_text'=>'Where in Canada?','source_text'=>'Bahagian mana di Kanada?','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>694.08,'end_time'=>694.9,'target_text'=>'Where in Canada?','source_text'=>'Kat bahagian mana di Kanada?','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>695,'end_time'=>695.46,'target_text'=>'Toronto.','source_text'=>'Bandar Toronto.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>695.56,'end_time'=>700.66,'target_text'=>'Toronto is very popular, but also I recommend going to British Columbia, Vancouver.','source_text'=>'Toronto memang sangat terkenal, tapi saya juga cadangkan pergi ke British Columbia di Vancouver.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>700.76,'end_time'=>702.86,'target_text'=>'I\'m sure you\'ve heard Vancouver, the mountains.','source_text'=>'Mesti awak pernah dengar tentang Vancouver dan keindahan banjaran gunungnya.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>702.96,'end_time'=>704.42,'target_text'=>'That is most beautiful part of Canada.','source_text'=>'Itulah bahagian yang paling cantik sekali di Kanada.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>704.52,'end_time'=>707.14,'target_text'=>'Toronto, I\'ve only been once, but Toronto is very nice, too.','source_text'=>'Toronto saya cuma pernah pergi sekali, tapi Toronto pun sangat menarik juga.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>707.24,'end_time'=>711.22,'target_text'=>'They have like, uh, a lot to do, but Vancouver, I think the weather is better.','source_text'=>'Banyak aktiviti boleh buat kat sana, tapi di Vancouver saya rasa cuacanya lebih menyenangkan.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>711.32,'end_time'=>713.5,'target_text'=>'And, uh, like, the mountains are so beautiful.','source_text'=>'Dan pemandangan gunung-ganang di sana sangat memukau.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>713.6,'end_time'=>715.1,'target_text'=>'Like, it\'s it\'s so beautiful.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat-sangat indah.','order'=>322],
