            ['start_time'=>750.64,'end_time'=>752.38,'target_text'=>'So, you will freeze.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh membeku kesejukan.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>752.48,'end_time'=>753.22,'target_text'=>'You\'ll freeze to death.','source_text'=>'Boleh mati kesejukan kalau berkhemah masa tu.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>753.32,'end_time'=>755.06,'target_text'=>'But, have you traveled outside of Korea?','source_text'=>'Tapi awak pernah melancong ke luar negara sebelum ni?','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>755.16,'end_time'=>755.56,'target_text'=>'Uh, yes.','source_text'=>'Ya, pernah.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>755.64,'end_time'=>759.14,'target_text'=>'This year, I travel Japan eight time.','source_text'=>'Tahun ini saja saya dah pergi Jepun lapan kali.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>759.24,'end_time'=>759.64,'target_text'=>'Eight times?','source_text'=>'Lapan kali?','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>759.72,'end_time'=>760.12,'target_text'=>'>> Eight times.','source_text'=>'Ya, lapan kali.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>760.16,'end_time'=>762.42,'target_text'=>'And, uh, Vietnam uh, two time.','source_text'=>'Dan ke Vietnam dua kali.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>762.52,'end_time'=>765.82,'target_text'=>'And, China, uh, five time for a business.','source_text'=>'Dan ke China lima kali untuk urusan perniagaan.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>765.92,'end_time'=>770.14,'target_text'=>'Is it difficult to make like foreigner friends in Korea to speak English with?','source_text'=>'Susah ke nak cari kawan orang luar kat Korea ni untuk berlatih cakap bahasa Inggeris?','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>770.24,'end_time'=>772.46,'target_text'=>'Are you part of any like speaking clubs for English?','source_text'=>'Awak ada sertai mana-mana kelab pertuturan bahasa Inggeris ke?','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>772.56,'end_time'=>774.42,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know this information.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu maklumat pasal kelab macam tu.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>774.52,'end_time'=>776.34,'target_text'=>'And I don\'t speak well.','source_text'=>'Dan saya pun tak pandai bertutur sangat.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>776.44,'end_time'=>778.38,'target_text'=>'So, I don\'t have a a competition.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya tak ada peluang nak bercakap.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>778.48,'end_time'=>779.1,'target_text'=>'You speak well.','source_text'=>'Awak bercakap dengan baguslah.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>779.2,'end_time'=>780.26,'target_text'=>'You speak well.','source_text'=>'Pertuturan awak sangat elok.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>780.36,'end_time'=>782.06,'target_text'=>'Confidence, no confidence.','source_text'=>'Keyakinan diri, saya kurang yakin.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>782.16,'end_time'=>784.34,'target_text'=>'Uh, I didn\'t trying that.','source_text'=>'Saya belum pernah cuba sertai lagi.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>784.44,'end_time'=>786.14,'target_text'=>'>> Confidence is the most important.','source_text'=>'Keyakinan diri adalah perkara paling penting.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>786.24,'end_time'=>787.42,'target_text'=>'I was learning Spanish.','source_text'=>'Masa saya belajar bahasa Sepanyol dulu.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>787.52,'end_time'=>790.26,'target_text'=>'It was really, really, really hard for me to speak it.','source_text'=>'Ia memang tersangatlah sukar untuk saya bertutur pada mulanya.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>790.36,'end_time'=>794.26,'target_text'=>'But, once I started speaking it, I started learning like like this, like exponentially.','source_text'=>'Tapi sebaik saja saya mula berani bercakap, perkembangan pembelajaran saya meningkat secara mendadak.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>794.36,'end_time'=>799.38,'target_text'=>'Once you start speaking, like hopefully after this, you have more more confidence and just go speak to more like foreigners,','source_text'=>'Bila awak dah mula bercakap, harapnya lepas ni awak makin berkeyakinan dan terus berani bercakap dengan orang luar,','order'=>366],
