            ['start_time'=>801.6,'end_time'=>803.82,'target_text'=>'Cuz I was an exchange student in Korea three years ago.','source_text'=>'Sebab saya sendiri pernah jadi pelajar pertukaran di Korea tiga tahun lepas.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>803.92,'end_time'=>806.3,'target_text'=>'And I wanted to make friends with Koreans.','source_text'=>'Dan masa tu saya teringin sangat nak berkawan dengan orang tempatan Korea.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>806.4,'end_time'=>807.5,'target_text'=>'And it was very hard.','source_text'=>'Tapi ia agak sukar.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>807.6,'end_time'=>812.98,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m sure if you go with maybe like Sinchon or Hongdae area, like cuz I went to Yonsei, so it was like around there.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya pasti kalau awak pergi ke kawasan Sinchon atau Hongdae, sebab dulu saya belajar di Universiti Yonsei di area situ.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>813.08,'end_time'=>817.74,'target_text'=>'If you go there and you speak to some foreigners, it\'s really, really easy to make friends cuz they want to be friends with','source_text'=>'Kalau awak pergi ke sana dan bertegur sapa dengan warga asing, memang sangat senang nak berkawan sebab mereka pun nak berkawan dengan','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>817.84,'end_time'=>818.12,'target_text'=>'you.','source_text'=>'awak.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>818.12,'end_time'=>819.5,'target_text'=>'I was I was in their shoes.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah berada di tempat mereka dulu.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>819.6,'end_time'=>820.46,'target_text'=>'They want to be friends with you.','source_text'=>'Mereka memang nak berkawan dengan awak.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>820.56,'end_time'=>822.3,'target_text'=>'So, if you do that, you can make a lot of friends.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau awak buat macam tu, awak boleh dapat ramai kawan.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>822.4,'end_time'=>826.38,'target_text'=>'And even if it\'s just speaking maybe for 10 minutes, that\'s still good practice.','source_text'=>'Dan walaupun cuma bersembang selama 10 minit, itu tetap satu latihan yang sangat berharga.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>826.48,'end_time'=>827.7,'target_text'=>'But, then they want to be your friend.','source_text'=>'Malah lepas tu mereka nak jadi kawan awak terus.','order'=>378],
