            ['start_time'=>832.44,'end_time'=>837.98,'target_text'=>'Like, but really, foreigners want to speak and want to meet with like Koreans because maybe you can give them recommendations','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya orang luar memang teringin nak bersembang dan berkenalan dengan orang Korea sebab awak boleh cadangkan','order'=>383],
