            ['start_time'=>17.84,'end_time'=>21.42,'target_text'=>'This will help you practice your pronunciation,','source_text'=>'Ini akan bantu korang melatih sebutan,','order'=>4],
            ['start_time'=>21.52,'end_time'=>28.06,'target_text'=>'your accent, and your confidence when speaking English.','source_text'=>'slanga, dan keyakinan diri korang bila bertutur dalam bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>5],
            ['start_time'=>28.16,'end_time'=>34.46,'target_text'=>'I will speak slowly and clearly during the whole video.','source_text'=>'Saya akan bercakap secara perlahan dan jelas sepanjang video ini.','order'=>6],
            ['start_time'=>34.56,'end_time'=>37.74,'target_text'=>'I have never seen it before.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah tengok benda tu sebelum ni.','order'=>7],
            ['start_time'=>37.84,'end_time'=>41.1,'target_text'=>'And we arrived in Bangkok at 400 p.m.','source_text'=>'Dan kami tiba di Bangkok pada jam 4:00 petang.','order'=>8],
            ['start_time'=>41.2,'end_time'=>44.3,'target_text'=>'It only snowed once.','source_text'=>'Salji cuma turun sekali sahaja.','order'=>9],
            ['start_time'=>44.4,'end_time'=>46.14,'target_text'=>'Do you know them all?','source_text'=>'Korang tahu semua sekali ke?','order'=>10],
            ['start_time'=>46.24,'end_time'=>47.82,'target_text'=>'Let\'s get started.','source_text'=>'Jom kita mulakan.','order'=>11],
            ['start_time'=>47.92,'end_time'=>56.86,'target_text'=>'So, recently I went to South Korea with my older brother.','source_text'=>'Baru-baru ini saya pergi ke Korea Selatan bersama abang saya.','order'=>12],
            ['start_time'=>56.96,'end_time'=>60.84,'target_text'=>'South Korea is what?','source_text'=>'Korea Selatan itu apa?','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>61.04,'end_time'=>65.1,'target_text'=>'South Korea is a country.','source_text'=>'Korea Selatan ialah sebuah negara.','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>65.2,'end_time'=>69.9,'target_text'=>'And the capital of South Korea is Soul.','source_text'=>'Dan ibu negara Korea Selatan ialah Seoul.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>70,'end_time'=>70.46,'target_text'=>'Soul.','source_text'=>'Seoul.','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>70.56,'end_time'=>73.26,'target_text'=>'What is Soul?','source_text'=>'Apa itu Seoul?','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>73.36,'end_time'=>76.86,'target_text'=>'Soul is a city.','source_text'=>'Seoul ialah sebuah bandar raya.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>76.96,'end_time'=>78.78,'target_text'=>'Soul is a city.','source_text'=>'Seoul ialah sebuah bandar raya.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>78.88,'end_time'=>84.14,'target_text'=>'Now, this isn\'t my first trip to South Korea.','source_text'=>'Ini bukanlah perjalanan pertama saya ke Korea Selatan.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>84.24,'end_time'=>88.7,'target_text'=>'I have been to South Korea before.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah pergi ke Korea Selatan sebelum ini.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>88.8,'end_time'=>96.86,'target_text'=>'Around three years ago, I was an exchange student in South Korea.','source_text'=>'Kira-kira tiga tahun lepas, saya pernah jadi pelajar pertukaran di Korea Selatan.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>96.96,'end_time'=>106.14,'target_text'=>'An exchange student is a student that studies in a different university, usually in a different country for one semester or','source_text'=>'Pelajar pertukaran ialah pelajar yang menyambung pelajaran di universiti lain, biasanya di negara berbeza selama satu semester atau','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>106.24,'end_time'=>110.54,'target_text'=>'even two, like in my case.','source_text'=>'malah dua semester, macam dalam situasi saya.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>110.64,'end_time'=>116.94,'target_text'=>'So I studied in Soul, South Korea for two semesters.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya belajar di Seoul, Korea Selatan selama dua semester.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>117.04,'end_time'=>122.94,'target_text'=>'The university I studied at was Jon University.','source_text'=>'Universiti tempat saya belajar dulu ialah Universiti Yonsei.','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>123.04,'end_time'=>125.58,'target_text'=>'That was 3 years ago.','source_text'=>'Itu tiga tahun yang lalu.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>125.68,'end_time'=>132.94,'target_text'=>'My first time in South Korea, I had no idea how public transit worked.','source_text'=>'Kali pertama saya sampai di Korea Selatan dulu, saya langsung tak tahu macam mana sistem pengangkutan awam berfungsi.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>133.04,'end_time'=>148.54,'target_text'=>'So, it was very very difficult for me to navigate and get around South Korea, but I figured it out and now I am a professional.','source_text'=>'Jadi memang sangat-sangat susah untuk saya bergerak ke sana ke mari di Korea Selatan, tapi akhirnya saya berjaya faham dan sekarang saya dah pakar.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>148.64,'end_time'=>154.7,'target_text'=>'I like using neighbor maps because you can\'t use Google Maps.','source_text'=>'Saya suka guna aplikasi Naver Maps sebab korang tak boleh guna Google Maps.','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>154.8,'end_time'=>158.7,'target_text'=>'Google Maps doesn\'t work in South Korea.','source_text'=>'Google Maps tak berfungsi di Korea Selatan.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>158.8,'end_time'=>162.14,'target_text'=>'So, you have two options.','source_text'=>'Jadi, korang ada dua pilihan.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>162.24,'end_time'=>165.9,'target_text'=>'Neighbor maps or cacao maps?','source_text'=>'Naver Maps atau Kakao Maps?','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>166,'end_time'=>168.94,'target_text'=>'I prefer neighbor maps.','source_text'=>'Saya lebih gemar guna Naver Maps.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>169.04,'end_time'=>170.54,'target_text'=>'What do you prefer?','source_text'=>'Korang pula lebih suka yang mana satu?','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>170.64,'end_time'=>178.44,'target_text'=>'So, me and my brother arrived in South Korea on the 28th','source_text'=>'Saya dan abang saya tiba di Korea Selatan pada 28','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>178.64,'end_time'=>181.02,'target_text'=>'of November.','source_text'=>'hari bulan November.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>181.12,'end_time'=>187.58,'target_text'=>'November is a month and we stayed for exactly one month.','source_text'=>'November ialah nama bulan dan kami tinggal di sana tepat selama satu bulan.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>187.68,'end_time'=>192.62,'target_text'=>'So, we left on the 28th of December.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kami berlepas pulang pada 28 Disember.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>192.72,'end_time'=>198.22,'target_text'=>'And I remember that was on a Sunday.','source_text'=>'Dan saya masih ingat hari itu ialah hari Ahad.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>198.32,'end_time'=>199.58,'target_text'=>'A Sunday.','source_text'=>'Hari Ahad.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>199.68,'end_time'=>204.06,'target_text'=>'Sunday is a day of the week.','source_text'=>'Ahad ialah salah satu hari dalam seminggu.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>204.16,'end_time'=>205.1,'target_text'=>'Sunday.','source_text'=>'Ahad.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>205.2,'end_time'=>207.66,'target_text'=>'Do you know them all?','source_text'=>'Korang tahu semua nama hari dalam seminggu?','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>207.76,'end_time'=>209.5,'target_text'=>'Monday,','source_text'=>'Isnin,','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>209.6,'end_time'=>211.26,'target_text'=>'Tuesday,','source_text'=>'Selasa,','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>211.36,'end_time'=>212.94,'target_text'=>'Wednesday,','source_text'=>'Rabu,','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>213.04,'end_time'=>214.54,'target_text'=>'Thursday,','source_text'=>'Khamis,','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>214.64,'end_time'=>216.44,'target_text'=>'Friday,','source_text'=>'Jumaat,','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>216.56,'end_time'=>218.36,'target_text'=>'Saturday,','source_text'=>'Sabtu,','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>218.56,'end_time'=>219.5,'target_text'=>'Sunday.','source_text'=>'Ahad.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>219.6,'end_time'=>220.3,'target_text'=>'Good job.','source_text'=>'Syabas dan terbaik.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>220.4,'end_time'=>225.74,'target_text'=>'The area my brother and I stayed in was called Hung.','source_text'=>'Kawasan tempat saya dan abang saya tinggal dipanggil Hongdae.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>225.84,'end_time'=>229.66,'target_text'=>'Hung is a neighborhood in Seoul.','source_text'=>'Hongdae ialah sebuah kawasan kejiranan di Seoul.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>229.76,'end_time'=>240.86,'target_text'=>'It is a very popular and trendy neighborhood especially for younger people because there are many universities','source_text'=>'Ia kawasan yang sangat popular dan menjadi tumpuan terutamanya golongan muda kerana terdapat banyak universiti','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>240.96,'end_time'=>252.86,'target_text'=>'surrounding Hungai for example Yoni University Iwa women\'s university soong university Hongik University and there might be','source_text'=>'di sekitar Hongdae contohnya Universiti Yonsei, Universiti Wanita Ewha, Universiti Sogang, Universiti Hongik dan mungkin ada','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>252.96,'end_time'=>255.42,'target_text'=>'more but I don\'t know them all.','source_text'=>'lagi yang lain tapi saya tak tahu semuanya.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>255.52,'end_time'=>258.7,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know them all.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kesemuanya.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>258.8,'end_time'=>262.38,'target_text'=>'I only know those four universities.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma tahu empat universiti tu saja.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>262.48,'end_time'=>270.62,'target_text'=>'During our trip to Korea, we enjoyed a lot of very delicious Korean food.','source_text'=>'Sepanjang percutian kami di Korea, kami dapat menikmati banyak makanan Korea yang sangat lazat.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>270.72,'end_time'=>275.66,'target_text'=>'Some of my favorite Korean food include takali,','source_text'=>'Antara makanan kegemaran Korea saya termasuk dakgalbi,','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>275.76,'end_time'=>280.46,'target_text'=>'jokal, jimduck, kimchi, jig,','source_text'=>'jokbal, jjimdak, sup kimchi jjigae,','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>280.56,'end_time'=>283.98,'target_text'=>'and Korean barbecue.','source_text'=>'dan barbeku daging Korea.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>284.08,'end_time'=>288.94,'target_text'=>'Those are my five favorite Korean foods.','source_text'=>'Itulah lima makanan kegemaran Korea saya.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>289.04,'end_time'=>292.7,'target_text'=>'What are your favorite foods?','source_text'=>'Apa makanan kegemaran korang pula?','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>292.8,'end_time'=>295.26,'target_text'=>'Let me know in the comments.','source_text'=>'Kongsikan dengan saya di ruangan komen.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>295.36,'end_time'=>297.66,'target_text'=>'Make a sentence','source_text'=>'Bina satu ayat','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>297.76,'end_time'=>299.18,'target_text'=>'in the comments.','source_text'=>'di ruangan komen.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>299.28,'end_time'=>308.06,'target_text'=>'My favorite food is my favorite foods are during our trip in Korea.','source_text'=>'Makanan kegemaran saya ialah... makanan kegemaran saya sepanjang percutian di Korea.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>308.16,'end_time'=>314.94,'target_text'=>'It only snowed once and only for about 30 minutes.','source_text'=>'Salji cuma turun sekali sahaja dan hanya selama kira-kira 30 minit.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>315.04,'end_time'=>321.58,'target_text'=>'It didn\'t snow for very long, but it snowed a lot.','source_text'=>'Salji tak turun lama sangat, tapi lebat betul saljinya.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>321.68,'end_time'=>323.18,'target_text'=>'It snowed a lot.','source_text'=>'Salji turun dengan sangat lebat.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>323.28,'end_time'=>326.14,'target_text'=>'We even made a snowman.','source_text'=>'Kami siap buat orang salji lagi.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>326.24,'end_time'=>332.38,'target_text'=>'And I know Korea is cold, but I didn\'t expect it to be so cold.','source_text'=>'Dan saya tahu Korea memang sejuk, tapi saya tak sangka ia akan jadi sesejuk itu.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>332.48,'end_time'=>335.74,'target_text'=>'When I got there, I was freezing.','source_text'=>'Bila saya sampai kat sana, saya menggigil kesejukan.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>335.84,'end_time'=>340.94,'target_text'=>'I wanted to buy a big puffy winter jacket.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa nak beli jaket tebal musim sejuk yang besar.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>341.04,'end_time'=>348.46,'target_text'=>'A big puffy winter jacket to cover my whole body from head to toe.','source_text'=>'Jaket tebal musim sejuk yang besar untuk tutup seluruh badan saya dari hujung rambut sampai ke hujung kaki.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>348.56,'end_time'=>361.66,'target_text'=>'But I decided not to because I would then have to carry that winter jacket with me all throughout Asia because I am going','source_text'=>'Tapi saya batalkan niat tu sebab nanti saya kena usung jaket musim sejuk tu ke merata tempat di seluruh Asia memandangkan saya akan','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>361.76,'end_time'=>366.86,'target_text'=>'to be visiting many countries in Asia.','source_text'=>'melawat banyak negara di benua Asia.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>366.96,'end_time'=>370.22,'target_text'=>'I have already been to South Korea.','source_text'=>'Saya dah pun melawat Korea Selatan.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>370.32,'end_time'=>373.02,'target_text'=>'I won\'t be going north.','source_text'=>'Saya takkan pergi ke bahagian utara lagi.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>373.12,'end_time'=>377.5,'target_text'=>'And right now I\'m currently in Thailand.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang ini saya berada di Thailand.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>377.6,'end_time'=>379.74,'target_text'=>'I am in Thailand.','source_text'=>'Saya berada di Thailand.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>379.84,'end_time'=>383.9,'target_text'=>'After Thailand, I will be going to Malaysia,','source_text'=>'Selepas Thailand, saya akan pergi ke Malaysia,','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>384,'end_time'=>386.3,'target_text'=>'then Vietnam,','source_text'=>'kemudian Vietnam,','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>386.4,'end_time'=>395.02,'target_text'=>'then China, then India, then Japan, and after that I haven\'t decided where I want to go.','source_text'=>'kemudian China, seterusnya India, Jepun, dan selepas itu saya belum buat keputusan lagi nak pergi mana.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>395.12,'end_time'=>401.98,'target_text'=>'Maybe Taiwan, maybe the Philippines, maybe Indonesia, maybe Hong Kong.','source_text'=>'Mungkin Taiwan, mungkin Filipina, mungkin Indonesia, atau mungkin Hong Kong.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>402.08,'end_time'=>406.06,'target_text'=>'There are many places I would like to visit.','source_text'=>'Banyak tempat yang saya teringin sangat nak lawati.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>406.16,'end_time'=>410.62,'target_text'=>'Now tell me, do you guys enjoy traveling?','source_text'=>'Sekarang beritahu saya, korang suka melancong tak?','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>410.72,'end_time'=>413.42,'target_text'=>'Do you like to travel?','source_text'=>'Korang suka berjalan ke tempat orang?','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>413.52,'end_time'=>425.02,'target_text'=>'I personally love traveling, but I like staying in one place for at least two weeks.','source_text'=>'Secara peribadi saya memang suka melancong, tapi saya gemar tinggal di satu-satu tempat sekurang-kurangnya selama dua minggu.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>425.12,'end_time'=>431.1,'target_text'=>'I don\'t like to travel every day or every week.','source_text'=>'Saya tak suka berpindah-randah setiap hari atau setiap minggu.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>431.2,'end_time'=>442.7,'target_text'=>'I like to stay in one place for at least two weeks and if I like it then I\'ll stay for one month.','source_text'=>'Saya suka menetap di satu tempat sekurang-kurangnya dua minggu dan kalau saya suka tempat tu, saya akan tinggal selama sebulan.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>442.8,'end_time'=>450.94,'target_text'=>'That is why I stayed in Korea for one month because I knew I would love it.','source_text'=>'Itulah sebabnya saya tinggal di Korea selama sebulan sebab saya tahu saya pasti akan sukakannya.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>451.04,'end_time'=>459.34,'target_text'=>'While I was in Korea, I also met up with one of my Korean friends, Johnny, for dinner.','source_text'=>'Masa di Korea, saya juga berjumpa dengan salah seorang kawan Korea saya, Johnny, untuk makan malam bersama.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>459.44,'end_time'=>466.7,'target_text'=>'We had this raw fish that we wrapped in leaves and put other toppings on before we ate it.','source_text'=>'Kami makan hidangan ikan mentah yang dibalut dengan daun bersama inti lain sebelum dimakan.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>466.8,'end_time'=>479.98,'target_text'=>'I personally am not a huge fan of raw fish, but it is very traditional in Korea to eat that raw fish at the start of winter.','source_text'=>'Saya secara peribadi bukanlah peminat tegar ikan mentah, tapi ia adalah tradisi di Korea untuk makan ikan mentah tersebut pada awal musim sejuk.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>480.08,'end_time'=>483.1,'target_text'=>'So, we went to go and eat it.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kami pun pergi makan hidangan tu bersama-sama.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>483.2,'end_time'=>490.7,'target_text'=>'One of my favorite things to do while I\'m in Korea is to visit Gyongbokung Palace.','source_text'=>'Antara aktiviti kegemaran saya semasa di Korea ialah melawat Istana Gyeongbokgung.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>490.8,'end_time'=>497.42,'target_text'=>'That is the really big and famous palace in Korea.','source_text'=>'Itulah istana yang sangat besar dan paling terkenal di Korea.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>497.52,'end_time'=>504.86,'target_text'=>'The palace was so beautiful and it was such a beautiful and sunny day the day I went.','source_text'=>'Istana tu sangat cantik dan cuaca pada hari saya pergi pun sangat cerah dan indah.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>504.96,'end_time'=>509.5,'target_text'=>'We also were able to see the changing of the guard.','source_text'=>'Kami juga berpeluang menyaksikan upacara pertukaran pengawal istana.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>509.6,'end_time'=>516.54,'target_text'=>'That was a very special thing to see because I have never seen it before.','source_text'=>'Ia satu pemandangan yang sangat istimewa kerana saya tak pernah melihatnya sebelum ini.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>516.64,'end_time'=>521.18,'target_text'=>'I have never seen the changing of the guard before.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah tengok upacara pertukaran pengawal sebelum ini.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>521.28,'end_time'=>528.06,'target_text'=>'And before we left Korea, we got to experience what Christmas was like in Korea.','source_text'=>'Dan sebelum meninggalkan Korea, kami sempat merasai suasana sambutan Hari Krismas di sana.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>528.16,'end_time'=>533.02,'target_text'=>'I have never spent Christmas in Korea.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah menyambut Krismas di Korea sebelum ini.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>533.12,'end_time'=>538.46,'target_text'=>'This was my first Christmas in Korea and it was very beautiful.','source_text'=>'Ini Krismas pertama saya di Korea dan suasananya sangat mempesonakan.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>538.56,'end_time'=>540.06,'target_text'=>'We went ice skating.','source_text'=>'Kami pergi meluncur ais.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>540.16,'end_time'=>543.82,'target_text'=>'Then we went to the stream with many lanterns.','source_text'=>'Kemudian kami pergi ke anak sungai yang dihiasi dengan banyak tanglung.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>543.92,'end_time'=>548.78,'target_text'=>'And at the end, we went to a Christmas market.','source_text'=>'Dan akhirnya, kami pergi ke pasar Krismas.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>548.88,'end_time'=>551.1,'target_text'=>'That was a highlight.','source_text'=>'Itu detik yang paling mengujakan.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>551.2,'end_time'=>555.9,'target_text'=>'While I was in Korea, I also did some shopping.','source_text'=>'Masa di Korea, saya juga ada membeli-belah sedikit.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>556,'end_time'=>560.54,'target_text'=>'Not a lot, but I did buy some things.','source_text'=>'Tak banyak sangat, tapi ada juga beberapa barang yang saya beli.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>560.64,'end_time'=>562.7,'target_text'=>'I bought a pair of shoes.','source_text'=>'Saya beli sepasang kasut.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>562.8,'end_time'=>569.58,'target_text'=>'I couldn\'t decide which pair of shoes to buy, the one on the right or the one on the left.','source_text'=>'Saya serba salah nak pilih kasut yang mana, sama ada yang di sebelah kanan atau sebelah kiri.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>569.68,'end_time'=>576.46,'target_text'=>'I ended up buying the one on the left since I thought it looked more unique.','source_text'=>'Akhirnya saya beli kasut di sebelah kiri sebab nampak lebih unik pada pandangan saya.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>576.56,'end_time'=>584.14,'target_text'=>'I also bought two new pairs of jeans, one blue pair and one black pair.','source_text'=>'Saya juga beli dua helai seluar jeans baru, sehelai warna biru dan sehelai warna hitam.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>584.24,'end_time'=>587.66,'target_text'=>'And I bought one pair of sweatpants.','source_text'=>'Dan saya beli sehelai seluar sukan kasual (sweatpants).','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>587.76,'end_time'=>591.66,'target_text'=>'Overall, my trip to Korea was amazing.','source_text'=>'Secara keseluruhannya, perjalanan saya ke Korea memang sangat luar biasa.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>591.76,'end_time'=>593.02,'target_text'=>'I love Korea.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat sukakan Korea.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>593.12,'end_time'=>599.98,'target_text'=>'After our month in Korea, we took a flight from Seoul to Bangkok.','source_text'=>'Selepas sebulan di Korea, kami menaiki penerbangan dari Seoul ke Bangkok.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>600.08,'end_time'=>602.54,'target_text'=>'Our flight was at 12:00 p.m.','source_text'=>'Penerbangan kami dijadualkan pada jam 12:00 tengah hari.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>602.64,'end_time'=>606.06,'target_text'=>'and we arrived in Bangkok at 400 p.m.','source_text'=>'dan kami tiba di Bangkok pada jam 4:00 petang.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>606.16,'end_time'=>611.42,'target_text'=>'It was a 6-hour flight, but with the time change, it was only 400 p.m.','source_text'=>'Penerbangan mengambil masa selama 6 jam, tapi disebabkan perbezaan zon masa, ia baru jam 4:00 petang','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>611.52,'end_time'=>612.94,'target_text'=>'in Bangkok.','source_text'=>'di Bangkok.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>613.04,'end_time'=>615.58,'target_text'=>'We have been here for a few days now.','source_text'=>'Kami dah berada di sini selama beberapa hari.','order'=>126],
