            ['start_time'=>152.16,'end_time'=>153.5,'target_text'=>'We got to run across.','source_text'=>'Kita kena lintas lari ke seberang sana.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>153.6,'end_time'=>154.7,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s walk to this crosswalk.','source_text'=>'Jom kita jalan sampai ke lintasan pejalan kaki tu.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>154.8,'end_time'=>155.34,'target_text'=>'Probably be fast.','source_text'=>'Mungkin lagi cepat macam tu.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>155.44,'end_time'=>157.74,'target_text'=>'That right up there is a a crosswalk.','source_text'=>'Yang kat depan sana tu ialah lintasan pejalan kaki (lintasan belang).','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>157.84,'end_time'=>159.5,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re walking to the crosswalk.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami tengah berjalan menuju ke lintasan pejalan kaki.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>159.6,'end_time'=>163.58,'target_text'=>'And then this right here, that\'s an electric scooter, an electric bike.','source_text'=>'Dan yang kat tepi ni pula skuter elektrik, iaitu basikal elektrik.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>163.68,'end_time'=>163.84,'target_text'=>'Okay.','source_text'=>'Okey.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>163.84,'end_time'=>170.38,'target_text'=>'Okay, we\'re going to go try some of the viral stuff you can buy at a Korean convenience store here in Soul, South Korea.','source_text'=>'Okey, kami nak pergi cuba beberapa makanan viral yang boleh dibeli di kedai serbaneka Korea di Seoul, Korea Selatan.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>170.48,'end_time'=>173.24,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jom kita masuk.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>173.58,'end_time'=>175.82,'target_text'=>'[bell] Ooh, they got tables here.','source_text'=>'Wah, mereka sediakan meja kat dalam ni.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>175.92,'end_time'=>177.82,'target_text'=>'Nice chip section.','source_text'=>'Bahagian snek kerepek yang menarik.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>177.92,'end_time'=>178.78,'target_text'=>'Bagel chips.','source_text'=>'Kerepek bagel.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>178.88,'end_time'=>181.98,'target_text'=>'>> What about those uh Flynn crisps you saw yesterday?','source_text'=>'Macam mana pula dengan kerepek Flynn yang awak nampak semalam?','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>182.08,'end_time'=>182.94,'target_text'=>'>> Do you see them again?','source_text'=>'Awak nampak lagi ke kerepek tu?','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>183.04,'end_time'=>184.54,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe, but they were like a sweet one.','source_text'=>'Mungkin ada, tapi rasanya jenis yang manis.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>184.64,'end_time'=>187.02,'target_text'=>'>> Chicken nugget freaking chips.','source_text'=>'Kerepek perisa nuget ayam.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>187.12,'end_time'=>188.06,'target_text'=>'Oh my gosh, dude.','source_text'=>'Biar betul, kawan.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>188.16,'end_time'=>188.86,'target_text'=>'That\'s hilarious.','source_text'=>'Kelakar betul perisa macam tu.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>188.96,'end_time'=>190.3,'target_text'=>'These ones are really good.','source_text'=>'Yang ni memang sedap sangat.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>190.4,'end_time'=>191.02,'target_text'=>'I like these.','source_text'=>'Saya suka jenis ni.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>191.12,'end_time'=>192.3,'target_text'=>'They\'re like wafer chips.','source_text'=>'Rupa dia macam kerepek wafer.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>192.4,'end_time'=>194.22,'target_text'=>'And this one\'s like chocolate churo flavor.','source_text'=>'Dan yang ni pula perisa churros coklat.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>194.32,'end_time'=>194.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s really good.','source_text'=>'Rasanya sangat sedap.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>194.96,'end_time'=>196.62,'target_text'=>'Oh, right here.','source_text'=>'Oh, kat sini.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>196.72,'end_time'=>197.9,'target_text'=>'Creme brulee flavor.','source_text'=>'Perisa creme brulee.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>198,'end_time'=>198.62,'target_text'=>'Flavor.','source_text'=>'Perisa.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>198.72,'end_time'=>199.82,'target_text'=>'That\'s just what it tastes like.','source_text'=>'Itu merujuk kepada rasa makanan tersebut.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>199.92,'end_time'=>200.62,'target_text'=>'The flavor.','source_text'=>'Perisanya.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>200.72,'end_time'=>203.42,'target_text'=>'The sound that makes everything enjoyable.','source_text'=>'Bunyi kunyahan yang buat semuanya rasa nikmat.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>203.52,'end_time'=>204.94,'target_text'=>'They really upped their flavor game.','source_text'=>'Mereka betul-betul tingkatkan kepelbagaian perisa makanan mereka.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>205.04,'end_time'=>206.62,'target_text'=>'Like look at look at this, bro.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah yang ni, kawan.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>206.72,'end_time'=>208.78,'target_text'=>'Chocolate cocoa powder croissant dog.','source_text'=>'Roti sosej croissant serbuk koko coklat.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>208.88,'end_time'=>209.58,'target_text'=>'Butter caramel.','source_text'=>'Karamel mentega.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>209.68,'end_time'=>211.18,'target_text'=>'Sweet and spicy Korean fried chicken.','source_text'=>'Ayam goreng Korea pedas manis.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>211.28,'end_time'=>212.46,'target_text'=>'Bro, there are so many choices.','source_text'=>'Kawan, banyak gila pilihan yang ada.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>212.56,'end_time'=>213.98,'target_text'=>'I don\'t even know what I want.','source_text'=>'Saya sampai tak tahu nak pilih yang mana satu.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>214.08,'end_time'=>216.38,'target_text'=>'But I feel like I don\'t want something pure sweet like this.','source_text'=>'Tapi rasanya saya tak nak makanan yang manis semata-mata macam ni.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>216.48,'end_time'=>218.78,'target_text'=>'I want like >> Yeah, >> something more savory.','source_text'=>'Saya teringin nak makan >> Ya, >> makanan yang lebih berperisa masin berlemak.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>218.88,'end_time'=>221.58,'target_text'=>'>> When they do sugar here, they make it super sweet, right?','source_text'=>'Bila orang kat sini buat makanan manis, mereka buat manis gila kan?','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>221.68,'end_time'=>223.02,'target_text'=>'Even when it\'s not sugar.','source_text'=>'Malah bila makanan tu sepatutnya bukan jenis manis pun.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>223.12,'end_time'=>228.7,'target_text'=>'>> When I was here in Korea, I had Doritos and I tried them and they\'re the most sugary chips.','source_text'=>'Masa saya kat Korea dulu, saya beli Doritos dan bila saya makan, kerepek tu manis gila rasanya.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>228.8,'end_time'=>229.66,'target_text'=>'I almost crashed them.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa macam nak buang saja.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>229.76,'end_time'=>230.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I know.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya faham sangat.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>230.32,'end_time'=>234.94,'target_text'=>'There are like a bunch of grocery stores in E1 that just sell like foreign snacks and there\'s like an American one.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak kedai runcit di Itaewon yang khas jual snek import dari luar negara termasuk dari Amerika.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>235.04,'end_time'=>236.86,'target_text'=>'You could just buy American flavors.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh beli snek dengan perisa asli Amerika kat sana.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>236.96,'end_time'=>238.7,'target_text'=>'So, dude, this thing is low-key expensive.','source_text'=>'Tapi kawan, roti ni boleh tahan mahal harganya.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>238.8,'end_time'=>239.34,'target_text'=>'3,300.','source_text'=>'3,300 won.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>239.44,'end_time'=>241.26,'target_text'=>'But Yon cream milk bread.','source_text'=>'Tapi roti krim susu Yonsei ni.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>241.36,'end_time'=>241.9,'target_text'=>'This is fire.','source_text'=>'Memang sedap gila.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>242,'end_time'=>242.7,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to get this.','source_text'=>'Saya nak ambil yang ni.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>242.8,'end_time'=>245.66,'target_text'=>'Dude, they got red velvet too now with custard.','source_text'=>'Kawan, sekarang ada perisa red velvet inti kastard juga.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>245.76,'end_time'=>246.54,'target_text'=>'That\'s a new flavor.','source_text'=>'Itu perisa baru.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>246.64,'end_time'=>247.26,'target_text'=>'All these are new flavors.','source_text'=>'Semua ni perisa-perisa terbaru.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>247.36,'end_time'=>249.26,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, they got their Jon stuff there too, right?','source_text'=>'Oh, ada produk keluaran Yonsei kat situ juga kan?','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>249.36,'end_time'=>251.02,'target_text'=>'>> This is the OG original.','source_text'=>'Ini versi asli yang paling pertama.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>251.12,'end_time'=>255.1,'target_text'=>'And then let me get this is a mixed I think mixed tuna and chicken.','source_text'=>'Dan biar saya ambil yang ni, rasanya campuran tuna dan ayam.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>255.2,'end_time'=>256.3,'target_text'=>'So I\'ll get this.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya akan beli yang ni.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>256.4,'end_time'=>257.74,'target_text'=>'>> Have you ever tried any of those?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah rasa mana-mana makanan tu tak?','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>257.84,'end_time'=>258.94,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s like hot pockets.','source_text'=>'Rupa dia macam roti poket panas.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>259.04,'end_time'=>259.44,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'Tak pernah.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>259.52,'end_time'=>260.54,'target_text'=>'>> The pizza buns.','source_text'=>'Roti bun piza.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>260.64,'end_time'=>262.62,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ve never had that.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah makan benda tu.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>262.72,'end_time'=>263.82,'target_text'=>'>> Are you going to get anything?','source_text'=>'Awak nak beli apa-apa ke?','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>263.92,'end_time'=>264.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, nak.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>264.56,'end_time'=>265.42,'target_text'=>'>> What are you getting?','source_text'=>'Awak nak beli apa?','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>265.52,'end_time'=>268.54,'target_text'=>'We\'re trying the red velvet one that Leon bought.','source_text'=>'Kami nak rasa roti red velvet yang Leon beli tadi.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>268.64,'end_time'=>269.74,'target_text'=>'I just see whipped cream in here.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma nampak krim putar saja dalam ni.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>269.84,'end_time'=>272.86,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know where the cream cheese is at, but let\'s try it.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kat mana inti keju krimnya berada, tapi jom kita rasa.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>272.96,'end_time'=>274.86,'target_text'=>'>> So it\'s like a little bit of cream cheese flavor.','source_text'=>'Ada rasa keju krim sikit-sikit.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>274.96,'end_time'=>279.66,'target_text'=>'It tastes pretty much just like this one, but it\'s red and it has some cream cheese on the bottom, but it\'s pretty similar.','source_text'=>'Rasanya hampir sama macam roti yang satu lagi tadi, cuma warnanya merah dan ada sedikit keju krim di bahagian bawah, tapi lebih kurang sama.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>279.76,'end_time'=>281.96,'target_text'=>'Besides that,','source_text'=>'Selain daripada itu,','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>282.16,'end_time'=>282.86,'target_text'=>'right there.','source_text'=>'kat sebelah sana tu.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>282.96,'end_time'=>284.46,'target_text'=>'Big big university.','source_text'=>'Sebuah universiti yang sangat besar.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>284.56,'end_time'=>286.38,'target_text'=>'That is Hongik University.','source_text'=>'Itulah Universiti Hongik.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>286.48,'end_time'=>287.9,'target_text'=>'Hongik University.','source_text'=>'Universiti Hongik.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>288,'end_time'=>290.06,'target_text'=>'And right now we are in Hong.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang kami berada di kawasan Hongdae.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>290.16,'end_time'=>291.58,'target_text'=>'This is like a wall right here.','source_text'=>'Ini macam sebuah dinding pemisah kat sini.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>291.68,'end_time'=>293.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s like not a complete solid wall.','source_text'=>'Bukan dinding konkrit pejal sepenuhnya.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>293.92,'end_time'=>296.14,'target_text'=>'You can see through it because there are many small holes.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak tembus ke seberang sebab ada banyak lubang-lubang kecil.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>296.24,'end_time'=>297.26,'target_text'=>'But that\'s a pink wall.','source_text'=>'Tapi itu dinding berwarna merah jambu.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>297.36,'end_time'=>303.58,'target_text'=>'And this area up here is like my favorite area to go or was my favorite area to go, but it looks like they\'ve completely blocked','source_text'=>'Dan kawasan atas ni dulu tempat paling saya gemar kunjungi, tapi nampaknya mereka dah tutup kawasan ni sepenuhnya','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>303.68,'end_time'=>304.08,'target_text'=>'it off.','source_text'=>'dengan penghadang.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>304.08,'end_time'=>307.02,'target_text'=>'There\'s like a construction barrier here, so you can\'t go on the other side.','source_text'=>'Ada penghadang tapak pembinaan kat sini, jadi korang tak boleh masuk ke seberang.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>307.12,'end_time'=>308.62,'target_text'=>'But that right there was a park.','source_text'=>'Tapi tempat tu dulu sebenarnya sebuah taman.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>308.72,'end_time'=>309.66,'target_text'=>'It was just a small park.','source_text'=>'Taman kecil saja.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>309.76,'end_time'=>314.78,'target_text'=>'Although there was no like grass, it was just a like a cement pad, like a really small park.','source_text'=>'Walaupun tak ada rumput menghijau, kawasannya cuma tapak simen rata, macam dataran taman yang kecil.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>314.88,'end_time'=>316.86,'target_text'=>'It was called Hunguk Cultural Park.','source_text'=>'Tempat tu dipanggil Taman Budaya Hongik.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>316.96,'end_time'=>320.46,'target_text'=>'But that was my favorite place to go at night cuz people used to sing there and stuff.','source_text'=>'Tapi itulah tempat kegemaran saya waktu malam dulu sebab ramai orang buat persembahan nyanyian kat situ.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>320.56,'end_time'=>322.38,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s that symbol that that thing is holding?','source_text'=>'Simbol apa yang patung tu tengah pegang?','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>322.48,'end_time'=>323.26,'target_text'=>'>> This with the hand?','source_text'=>'Tangan yang buat bentuk ni ke?','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>323.36,'end_time'=>325.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, >> that\'s uh like a heart.','source_text'=>'Ya, >> itu simbol mini love (hati).','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>325.36,'end_time'=>328.22,'target_text'=>'But dude, this architecture on this building is actually really nice.','source_text'=>'Tapi kawan, seni bina bangunan ni sebenarnya sangat cantik.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>328.32,'end_time'=>331.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I think that\'s called brutalist cuz it\'s >> this isn\'t brutalist.','source_text'=>'Ya, rasanya rekaan macam ni dipanggil brutalis sebab >> yang ni bukan brutalis.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>331.68,'end_time'=>334.14,'target_text'=>'Like maybe the material is brutalist, but not the design.','source_text'=>'Mungkin bahan binaannya nampak macam brutalis, tapi bukan reka bentuknya.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>334.24,'end_time'=>335.02,'target_text'=>'>> That design is brutalist.','source_text'=>'Reka bentuk tu memang brutalis.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>335.12,'end_time'=>337.5,'target_text'=>'>> The brutalist design is just like square and stuff.','source_text'=>'Reka bentuk brutalis biasanya berbentuk petak-petak kaku.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>337.6,'end_time'=>339.82,'target_text'=>'There\'s no like no there\'s no curvy shape to it.','source_text'=>'Tak ada unsur lekuk-lekuk lembut langsung.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>339.92,'end_time'=>340.32,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>340.32,'end_time'=>343.74,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think that\'s brutalist cuz that building doesn\'t make you depressed.','source_text'=>'Saya tak rasa itu brutalis sebab bangunan tu tak buat kita rasa murung.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>343.84,'end_time'=>345.5,'target_text'=>'Brutalist buildings make you depressed.','source_text'=>'Bangunan berkonsep brutalis biasanya buat orang rasa murung dan tertekan.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>345.6,'end_time'=>349.82,'target_text'=>'English opens doors to work, friendships, and travel.','source_text'=>'Bahasa Inggeris membuka peluang pekerjaan, persahabatan, dan pelancongan.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>349.92,'end_time'=>352.29,'target_text'=>'The only thing standing in the way is daily practice.','source_text'=>'Satu-satunya cabaran ialah latihan harian yang konsisten.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>352.39,'end_time'=>356.7,'target_text'=>'[music] And most people don\'t have someone to practice with every single day.','source_text'=>'Dan kebanyakan orang tak ada kawan untuk berlatih bersama setiap hari.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>356.8,'end_time'=>358.7,'target_text'=>'That\'s where Easy Speak AI helps.','source_text'=>'Di sinilah Easy Speak AI dapat membantu.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>358.8,'end_time'=>361.9,'target_text'=>'Real speaking practice [music] anytime, anywhere.','source_text'=>'Latihan pertuturan sebenar pada bila-bila masa dan di mana jua.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>362,'end_time'=>364.14,'target_text'=>'Perfect for a New Year\'s resolution.','source_text'=>'Sangat sesuai untuk azam Tahun Baru korang.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>364.24,'end_time'=>369.98,'target_text'=>'With 12 plus AI tutors, you picked the vibe, friendly, professional, or [music] casual.','source_text'=>'Dengan lebih 12 tutor AI, korang boleh pilih gaya perbualan: mesra, profesional, atau santai.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>370.08,'end_time'=>374.46,'target_text'=>'And now with Easy Speak AI, you can practice both your English and Spanish.','source_text'=>'Dan kini melalui Easy Speak AI, korang boleh latih kedua-dua bahasa Inggeris dan Sepanyol.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>374.56,'end_time'=>382.54,'target_text'=>'There are tons of lessons across various topics, finding your way around town, airport, hotel, ordering at a cafe, and many','source_text'=>'Terdapat banyak pelajaran merangkumi pelbagai topik: mencari arah di bandar, lapangan terbang, hotel, memesan makanan di kafe, dan banyak','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>382.64,'end_time'=>383.1,'target_text'=>'more.','source_text'=>'lagi.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>383.2,'end_time'=>384.38,'target_text'=>'It\'s for every level.','source_text'=>'Ia sesuai untuk setiap tahap kemahiran.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>384.48,'end_time'=>388.7,'target_text'=>'Easy Speak assesses your English during conversation and recommends what to practice.','source_text'=>'Easy Speak akan menilai tahap bahasa Inggeris korang semasa perbualan dan mencadangkan aspek yang perlu dilatih.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>388.8,'end_time'=>394.7,'target_text'=>'Each topic has beginner, intermediate, [music] and advanced lessons with level appropriate phrases.','source_text'=>'Setiap topik ada tahap asas, pertengahan, dan lanjutan berserta frasa yang bersesuaian.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>394.8,'end_time'=>397.98,'target_text'=>'Hey Ava, could you help me write a New Year\'s resolution?','source_text'=>'Hai Ava, boleh awak bantu saya tulis azam Tahun Baru?','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>398.08,'end_time'=>398.54,'target_text'=>'>> Absolutely.','source_text'=>'Sudah tentu boleh.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>398.64,'end_time'=>402.14,'target_text'=>'What kind of areas are you thinking about improving or focusing on in the new year?','source_text'=>'Bidang apa yang awak ingin perbaiki atau beri tumpuan pada tahun baru nanti?','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>402.24,'end_time'=>405.82,'target_text'=>'>> In the new year, I really want to improve my English level.','source_text'=>'Pada tahun baru, saya teringin sangat nak tingkatkan tahap bahasa Inggeris saya.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>405.92,'end_time'=>409.74,'target_text'=>'>> What specific aspects of pronunciation do you find most challenging right now?','source_text'=>'Aspek sebutan khusus apa yang paling mencabar untuk awak sekarang?','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>409.84,'end_time'=>413.82,'target_text'=>'>> The thing I find most challenging is pronouncing the th sound.','source_text'=>'Benda yang paling mencabar bagi saya ialah menyebut bunyi \'th\'.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>413.92,'end_time'=>416.94,'target_text'=>'>> Would you like to try practicing some words with th sounds right now?','source_text'=>'Awak nak cuba berlatih beberapa perkataan dengan bunyi \'th\' sekarang?','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>417.04,'end_time'=>418.38,'target_text'=>'Yeah, let\'s go ahead and do that.','source_text'=>'Ya, jom kita cuba sekarang.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>418.48,'end_time'=>420.7,'target_text'=>'>> Can you try saying this and think for me?','source_text'=>'Boleh awak cuba sebut perkataan \'this\' dan \'think\' untuk saya?','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>420.8,'end_time'=>421.82,'target_text'=>'>> This think.','source_text'=>'This, think.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>421.92,'end_time'=>422.46,'target_text'=>'>> Great job.','source_text'=>'Bagus sekali.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>422.56,'end_time'=>424.06,'target_text'=>'You hit both sounds perfectly.','source_text'=>'Sebutan kedua-dua perkataan tu sangat sempurna.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>424.16,'end_time'=>427.74,'target_text'=>'>> I now have my New Year\'s resolution and I feel like it\'s more concrete.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya dah ada azam Tahun Baru dan ia terasa lebih jelas serta kukuh.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>427.84,'end_time'=>429.58,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s the first step you\'re going to take to achieve it?','source_text'=>'Apakah langkah pertama yang akan awak ambil untuk mencapainya?','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>429.68,'end_time'=>432.86,'target_text'=>'>> The first step I\'m going to take is continue practicing with you.','source_text'=>'Langkah pertama saya ialah terus berlatih bersama awak.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>432.96,'end_time'=>434.46,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s a fantastic first step.','source_text'=>'Itu langkah permulaan yang sangat hebat.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>434.56,'end_time'=>436.3,'target_text'=>'I\'m absolutely here for that.','source_text'=>'Saya sentiasa ada di sini untuk membantu awak.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>436.4,'end_time'=>437.66,'target_text'=>'>> Everything is personalized.','source_text'=>'Semuanya disesuaikan mengikut keperluan peribadi korang.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>437.76,'end_time'=>444.38,'target_text'=>'You set goals and interests and the app adapts it for you and the review section shows exactly how you\'re improving.','source_text'=>'Korang tetapkan matlamat dan minat, aplikasi akan menyesuaikannya, dan bahagian semakan menunjukkan kemajuan korang dengan tepat.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>444.48,'end_time'=>446.46,'target_text'=>'Over time, you can feel more confident.','source_text'=>'Lama-kelamaan, korang akan berasa lebih yakin.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>446.56,'end_time'=>450.78,'target_text'=>'have smoother conversations and hesitate less when it really matters.','source_text'=>'perbualan jadi lebih lancar dan kurang teragak-agak bila bercakap dalam situasi sebenar.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>450.88,'end_time'=>455.58,'target_text'=>'Easy Speak AI is giving away 10 free one-month trials to viewers of this video.','source_text'=>'Easy Speak AI memberikan 10 percubaan percuma selama sebulan kepada penonton video ini.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>455.68,'end_time'=>459.02,'target_text'=>'Make sure you sign up for Easy Speak AI using my link in the description.','source_text'=>'Pastikan korang mendaftar di Easy Speak AI menggunakan pautan saya di ruang penerangan.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>459.12,'end_time'=>464.14,'target_text'=>'Then DM me on Instagram saying you signed up for Easy Speak AI and I\'ll pick 10 lucky winners next week.','source_text'=>'Kemudian hantarkan mesej DM di Instagram saya menyatakan korang dah mendaftar dan saya akan pilih 10 pemenang bertuah minggu depan.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>464.24,'end_time'=>466.7,'target_text'=>'Thank you Easy Speak AI for sponsoring today\'s video.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih kepada Easy Speak AI kerana menaja video hari ini.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>466.8,'end_time'=>471.66,'target_text'=>'From this part of Hungai, from like here, literally right here you see Lab Bomba Latin Pub.','source_text'=>'Dari bahagian Hongdae yang ini, betul-betul dari tempat korang nampak La Bomba Latin Pub ni.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>471.76,'end_time'=>474.7,'target_text'=>'From here down is just probably hundreds of nightclubs.','source_text'=>'Dari sini ke bawah rasanya ada beratus-ratus buah kelab malam.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>474.8,'end_time'=>475.9,'target_text'=>'A lot of nightclubs.','source_text'=>'Banyak gila kelab malam.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>476,'end_time'=>479.74,'target_text'=>'Hung day has a huge night life including Hung daywan and Kangnam.','source_text'=>'Hongdae mempunyai kehidupan malam yang sangat meriah bersama-sama Itaewon dan Gangnam.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>479.84,'end_time'=>480.38,'target_text'=>'Those three areas.','source_text'=>'Tiga kawasan tersebut.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>480.48,'end_time'=>481.02,'target_text'=>'Huge night life.','source_text'=>'Kehidupan malam yang sangat aktif.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>481.12,'end_time'=>482.22,'target_text'=>'Hung day is my favorite though.','source_text'=>'Tapi Hongdae tetap tempat kegemaran saya.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>482.32,'end_time'=>484.22,'target_text'=>'But from here just a bunch of clubs.','source_text'=>'Tapi dari sini ke depan semuanya deretan kelab hiburan.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>484.32,'end_time'=>485.58,'target_text'=>'Dude, that would be cool if that was a club.','source_text'=>'Kawan, gempak juga kalau tempat tu jadi kelab malam.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>485.68,'end_time'=>486.94,'target_text'=>'And then you can just see right in it.','source_text'=>'Dan korang boleh nampak terus ke dalam.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>487.04,'end_time'=>488.38,'target_text'=>'This is Yeah, Monster Pizza.','source_text'=>'Ini ya, Monster Pizza.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>488.48,'end_time'=>490.94,'target_text'=>'This is a pizza place I always come to late at night.','source_text'=>'Ini kedai piza yang saya selalu pergi bila lewat malam.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>491.04,'end_time'=>492.14,'target_text'=>'Monster pizza.','source_text'=>'Monster Pizza.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>492.24,'end_time'=>493.42,'target_text'=>'This street right down here.','source_text'=>'Lorong jalan yang kat bawah ni.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>493.52,'end_time'=>495.66,'target_text'=>'And then next street over is just a bunch of clubs.','source_text'=>'Dan jalan di sebelah sana pula penuh dengan deretan kelab.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>495.76,'end_time'=>496.3,'target_text'=>'Like Yeah.','source_text'=>'Macam ya.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>496.4,'end_time'=>497.42,'target_text'=>'Look down there.','source_text'=>'Tengok ke arah bawah sana tu.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>497.52,'end_time'=>499.18,'target_text'=>'This whole street is just clubs.','source_text'=>'Sepanjang jalan ni semuanya kelab malam.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>499.28,'end_time'=>503.82,'target_text'=>'This street right here is I think the most popular like club street in Korea.','source_text'=>'Jalan yang ini saya rasa jalan kelab malam paling popular di Korea.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>503.92,'end_time'=>505.02,'target_text'=>'huge amount of clubs.','source_text'=>'Banyak sangat kelab malam kat sini.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>505.12,'end_time'=>507.5,'target_text'=>'Like this whole area is just clubs and poachas.','source_text'=>'Seluruh kawasan ni dipenuhi kelab malam dan pocha (gerai minum Korea).','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>507.6,'end_time'=>516.38,'target_text'=>'>> And here, you know, B1 >> B1 is like pretty infamous for being like the dirtiest like most crazy insane club.','source_text'=>'Dan kat sini, korang tahu kan kelab B1 terkenal sebagai kelab paling kotor dan paling liar sekali.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>516.48,'end_time'=>517.02,'target_text'=>'B1.','source_text'=>'Kelab B1.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>517.12,'end_time'=>517.28,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>517.28,'end_time'=>518.46,'target_text'=>'I don\'t I don\'t really like it.','source_text'=>'Saya tak berapa gemar sangat tempat tu.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>518.56,'end_time'=>520.46,'target_text'=>'People are always shirtless.','source_text'=>'Ramai orang tak pakai baju kat dalam tu.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>520.56,'end_time'=>521.74,'target_text'=>'They\'re dancing on the tables.','source_text'=>'Mereka menari atas meja.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>521.84,'end_time'=>523.66,'target_text'=>'They\'re Oh, it it\'s crazy.','source_text'=>'Memang liar gila suasananya.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>523.76,'end_time'=>527.9,'target_text'=>'>> Last time I was there, I was inside for 5 minutes and my clothes smelled like cigarettes.','source_text'=>'Kali terakhir saya pergi dulu, baru 5 minit kat dalam baju saya dah berbau asap rokok teruk.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>528,'end_time'=>529.42,'target_text'=>'>> It smells so bad in there.','source_text'=>'Bau kat dalam tu memang busuk sangat.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>529.52,'end_time'=>531.1,'target_text'=>'Like in the clubs here, you can smoke.','source_text'=>'Sebab dalam kelab kat sini orang dibenarkan merokok.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>531.2,'end_time'=>532.06,'target_text'=>'That\'s why it gets so dirty.','source_text'=>'Sebab tulah tempat tu jadi sangat kotor.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>532.16,'end_time'=>534.14,'target_text'=>'But yeah, there\'s another pizza place right here.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, ada satu lagi kedai piza kat sini.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>534.24,'end_time'=>535.34,'target_text'=>'You can have pizza.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh makan piza.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>535.44,'end_time'=>537.58,'target_text'=>'But yeah, this street is just filled with clubs, poachas.','source_text'=>'Tapi jalan ni memang padat dengan kelab malam dan kedai makan pocha.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>537.68,'end_time'=>539.5,'target_text'=>'Here\'s some chicken out dark chicken.','source_text'=>'Kat sini ada kedai ayam goreng Outdark.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>539.6,'end_time'=>540.62,'target_text'=>'That is a restaurant.','source_text'=>'Itu sebuah restoran.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>540.72,'end_time'=>545.66,'target_text'=>'So if you ever come to Korea, Hungai is just the craziest place to party.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau korang datang ke Korea, Hongdae memang tempat paling meriah dan gila untuk berhibur.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>545.76,'end_time'=>550.22,'target_text'=>'When you think of like the main walking street in Hungai, the one that you always see in the videos and stuff, it\'s this street','source_text'=>'Bila korang terbayangkan laluan pejalan kaki utama di Hongdae yang selalu muncul dalam video, inilah jalannya','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>550.32,'end_time'=>550.86,'target_text'=>'right up here.','source_text'=>'yang ada kat depan ni.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>550.96,'end_time'=>553.66,'target_text'=>'That street is the main Hungai walking street.','source_text'=>'Jalan itulah laluan pejalan kaki utama di Hongdae.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>553.76,'end_time'=>559.18,'target_text'=>'It starts from like way back there, but the main part is up here, and you can just walk like the whole way all the way to','source_text'=>'Ia bermula dari jauh di belakang sana, tapi bahagian utamanya di sebelah depan ni, dan korang boleh jalan kaki terus sampai ke','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>559.28,'end_time'=>560.46,'target_text'=>'like the end of Hung Day.','source_text'=>'hujung kawasan Hongdae.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>560.56,'end_time'=>563.26,'target_text'=>'This is like the main the main like Hungai street.','source_text'=>'Inilah jalan paling utama di Hongdae.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>563.36,'end_time'=>564.54,'target_text'=>'It gets like super busy here.','source_text'=>'Kawasan ni memang akan jadi sangat sesak dan meriah.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>564.64,'end_time'=>569.8,'target_text'=>'All along here there are fortune tellers and stuff like all along here.','source_text'=>'Di sepanjang laluan ni ada banyak gerai tilik nasib dan macam-macam lagi.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>575.36,'end_time'=>576.62,'target_text'=>'>> This restaurant is fire.','source_text'=>'Restoran ni memang padu gila.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>576.72,'end_time'=>579.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s even recommended by Gordon Ramsay.','source_text'=>'Malah Gordon Ramsay pun pernah sarankan kedai ni.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>579.52,'end_time'=>580.86,'target_text'=>'But this is the type of chicken they have.','source_text'=>'Tapi inilah jenis masakan ayam yang mereka sediakan.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>580.96,'end_time'=>581.98,'target_text'=>'It\'s like oven baked.','source_text'=>'Ayam yang dibakar dalam ketuhar.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>582.08,'end_time'=>584.94,'target_text'=>'And usually I get like one of these ones like a bulgogi one.','source_text'=>'Dan biasanya saya pesan yang macam ni, iaitu perisa bulgogi.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>585.04,'end_time'=>586.46,'target_text'=>'Boneless, of course.','source_text'=>'Tanpa tulang, semestinya.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>586.56,'end_time'=>587.1,'target_text'=>'Boneless.','source_text'=>'Tanpa tulang.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>587.2,'end_time'=>588.54,'target_text'=>'That means without the bone.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya daging ayam tanpa tulang.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>588.64,'end_time'=>589.66,'target_text'=>'This one is with the bone.','source_text'=>'Yang satu lagi ni ada tulang.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>589.76,'end_time'=>590.46,'target_text'=>'But it\'s fire.','source_text'=>'Tapi memang sangat sedap.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>590.56,'end_time'=>594.14,'target_text'=>'The portions are pretty small, so you could just like eat so much of it.','source_text'=>'Porsinya agak kecil, jadi korang boleh makan banyak tanpa rasa muak.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>594.24,'end_time'=>595.1,'target_text'=>'That\'s like the only thing.','source_text'=>'Itu sajalah ciri dia.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>595.2,'end_time'=>596.14,'target_text'=>'But it\'s pretty fire.','source_text'=>'Tapi rasanya memang padu.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>596.24,'end_time'=>598.22,'target_text'=>'Like I brought my friends here and they really liked it.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah bawa kawan-kawan saya makan kat sini dan mereka suka sangat.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>598.32,'end_time'=>599.82,'target_text'=>'This looks like traditional Korean food.','source_text'=>'Yang ni nampak macam makanan tradisional Korea.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>599.92,'end_time'=>600.38,'target_text'=>'>> This one too.','source_text'=>'Yang ni pun sama.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>600.48,'end_time'=>601.18,'target_text'=>'>> Like street food.','source_text'=>'Macam makanan jalanan.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>601.28,'end_time'=>601.68,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>601.68,'end_time'=>602.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>602.4,'end_time'=>603.1,'target_text'=>'That looks good.','source_text'=>'Nampak menyelerakan.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>603.2,'end_time'=>606.14,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s like the deep fried deep fried pancake stuff.','source_text'=>'Macam lempeng goreng tepung rangup tu.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>606.24,'end_time'=>606.7,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>606.8,'end_time'=>609.42,'target_text'=>'Like I\'m not hungry, but maybe we\'ll have that eventually.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya belum lapar lagi, tapi nanti mungkin kita boleh rasa.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>609.52,'end_time'=>610.14,'target_text'=>'I\'m still full.','source_text'=>'Saya masih kenyang lagi.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>610.24,'end_time'=>611.66,'target_text'=>'Loki ate a lot.','source_text'=>'Tadi makan banyak juga.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>611.76,'end_time'=>614.54,'target_text'=>'>> And I\'m lowkey only trying to eat like once a day to be honest.','source_text'=>'Dan sejujurnya saya sebenarnya tengah cuba makan sekali sehari saja.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>614.64,'end_time'=>614.88,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>614.88,'end_time'=>615.28,'target_text'=>'Low key.','source_text'=>'Secara santai.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>615.36,'end_time'=>618.06,'target_text'=>'>> And then maybe like a small snack like street food type.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu mungkin makan snek ringan macam makanan jalanan sikit.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>618.16,'end_time'=>618.4,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>618.4,'end_time'=>618.86,'target_text'=>'Loki.','source_text'=>'Diam-diam saja.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>618.96,'end_time'=>621.18,'target_text'=>'What about this low-key place?','source_text'=>'Macam mana dengan kedai santai yang ini?','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>621.28,'end_time'=>623.98,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I think we should definitely get BBQ chicken one of these days.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya rasa kita memang kena pergi makan ayam BBQ suatu hari nanti.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>624.08,'end_time'=>624.7,'target_text'=>'What do you think?','source_text'=>'Apa pandangan awak?','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>624.8,'end_time'=>626.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, let\'s get it tonight.','source_text'=>'Ya, jom kita makan malam ni saja.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>626.32,'end_time'=>628.38,'target_text'=>'>> We should definitely hit up that BBQ chicken.','source_text'=>'Kita memang wajib singgah kedai ayam BBQ tu.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>628.48,'end_time'=>629.18,'target_text'=>'>> That place?','source_text'=>'Kedai yang tu ke?','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>629.28,'end_time'=>629.52,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>629.52,'end_time'=>630.06,'target_text'=>'What do you think?','source_text'=>'Macam mana, okey tak?','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>630.16,'end_time'=>630.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, let\'s do it.','source_text'=>'Okey, jom kita pergi.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>630.96,'end_time'=>633.34,'target_text'=>'>> I haven\'t had Korean fried chicken in a year, literally.','source_text'=>'Dah genap setahun saya tak makan ayam goreng Korea.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>633.44,'end_time'=>634.62,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ve kind of been craving it.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya memang tengah teringin sangat sekarang ni.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>634.72,'end_time'=>636.3,'target_text'=>'So, but I don\'t think I don\'t know tonight.','source_text'=>'Tapi entahlah, saya tak pasti malam ni ke.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>636.4,'end_time'=>637.9,'target_text'=>'Maybe tonight at like 8:00 p.m.','source_text'=>'Mungkin malam ni dalam pukul 8:00 malam.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>638,'end_time'=>640.22,'target_text'=>'If we\'re really full still, we could go to that other one.','source_text'=>'Kalau masa tu kita masih kenyang sangat, kita boleh pergi ke kedai yang satu lagi tu.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>640.32,'end_time'=>640.56,'target_text'=>'>> Good.','source_text'=>'Eloklah.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>640.56,'end_time'=>641.34,'target_text'=>'Cold, too, isn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Cuaca pun sejuk kan sekarang ni?','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>641.44,'end_time'=>641.6,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>641.6,'end_time'=>645.9,'target_text'=>'But if we\'re full, we could go to the other one that Gordon and Ramsey went to.','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau kita kenyang, kita boleh pergi ke kedai yang pernah Gordon Ramsay kunjungi tu.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>646,'end_time'=>648.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, because then we would be kind of full anyways.','source_text'=>'Ya, sebab porsi kat situ tak besar sangat kalau kita dah kenyang.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>648.24,'end_time'=>648.86,'target_text'=>'from that one.','source_text'=>'dari kedai tu.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>648.96,'end_time'=>650.22,'target_text'=>'They don\'t give you as much.','source_text'=>'Mereka bagi porsi yang tak berapa banyak.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>650.32,'end_time'=>651.74,'target_text'=>'>> Are you feeling the Christmas spirit?','source_text'=>'Awak dah mula rasa suasana Hari Krismas ke?','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>651.84,'end_time'=>654.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'m going to get copyrighted for that.','source_text'=>'Ya, mesti video saya kena tuntutan hak cipta sebab lagu tu.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>654.48,'end_time'=>657.42,'target_text'=>'>> Apparently, she makes 500 million every Christmas season.','source_text'=>'Rupa-rupanya penyanyi tu dapat 500 juta setiap musim Krismas.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>657.52,'end_time'=>657.92,'target_text'=>'>> Why?','source_text'=>'Kenapa?','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>657.92,'end_time'=>658.7,'target_text'=>'From this song?','source_text'=>'Daripada lagu ni saja ke?','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>658.8,'end_time'=>660.62,'target_text'=>'>> No, she has a bunch of Christmas music.','source_text'=>'Taklah, dia ada banyak koleksi lagu-lagu Krismas.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>660.72,'end_time'=>661.66,'target_text'=>'>> Half a billion.','source_text'=>'Setengah bilion.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>661.76,'end_time'=>662.7,'target_text'=>'>> Half a billion.','source_text'=>'Ya, setengah bilion.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>662.8,'end_time'=>664.22,'target_text'=>'>> Bro, I I do not believe that.','source_text'=>'Kawan, saya susah nak percaya benda tu.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>664.32,'end_time'=>665.98,'target_text'=>'Someone else is singing there.','source_text'=>'Ada orang lain tengah menyanyi kat sana.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>666.08,'end_time'=>667.1,'target_text'=>'She is singing.','source_text'=>'Wanita tu tengah menyanyi.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>667.2,'end_time'=>669.1,'target_text'=>'So, she\'s singing into a microphone.','source_text'=>'Dia menyanyi menggunakan mikrofon.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>669.2,'end_time'=>669.98,'target_text'=>'A microphone.','source_text'=>'Sebuah mikrofon.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>670.08,'end_time'=>672.3,'target_text'=>'And there\'s a speaker that amplifies her voice.','source_text'=>'Dan ada pembesar suara yang menguatkan bunyi suaranya.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>672.4,'end_time'=>673.66,'target_text'=>'So, that makes her voice louder.','source_text'=>'Jadi ia buat suara nyanyiannya kedengaran lebih lantang.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>673.76,'end_time'=>677.98,'target_text'=>'So when she sings into the microphone, the speaker amplifies her voice so we can all hear it.','source_text'=>'Jadi bila dia menyanyi ke dalam mikrofon, pembesar suara kuatkan suaranya supaya kita semua boleh dengar.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>678.08,'end_time'=>679.34,'target_text'=>'That\'s busking.','source_text'=>'Itulah persembahan jalanan (busking).','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>679.44,'end_time'=>679.6,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>679.6,'end_time'=>683.26,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to have to fact check that cuz dude, she does not make half a billion dollars.','source_text'=>'Saya kena semak fakta tu semula sebab takkanlah dia boleh dapat setengah bilion dolar.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>683.36,'end_time'=>684.46,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s what she\'s saying, >> bro.','source_text'=>'Macam tulah dakwaan orang, kawan.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>684.56,'end_time'=>688.46,'target_text'=>'That means every year you make just like 500 million just during Christmas.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya setiap tahun awak dapat 500 juta masa musim Krismas saja.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>688.56,'end_time'=>689.26,'target_text'=>'Nah, dude.','source_text'=>'Tak logik langsung, kawan.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>689.36,'end_time'=>692.22,'target_text'=>'Not not even like the biggest company during Black Friday.','source_text'=>'Syarikat paling besar masa jualan Black Friday pun','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>692.32,'end_time'=>693.58,'target_text'=>'They won\'t even make that much.','source_text'=>'mereka takkan dapat keuntungan sebanyak tu.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>693.68,'end_time'=>694.38,'target_text'=>'>> What about Apple?','source_text'=>'Macam mana pula dengan syarikat Apple?','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>694.48,'end_time'=>694.8,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah, saya tak tahu.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>694.8,'end_time'=>696.06,'target_text'=>'I guess that\'ll be Amazon.','source_text'=>'Rasanya syarikat Amazon saja yang mampu macam tu.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>696.16,'end_time'=>698.06,'target_text'=>'They probably don\'t even Actually, no, they probably do.','source_text'=>'Mungkin mereka pun tak sampai sebenarnya mungkin mereka sampai juga angka tu.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>698.16,'end_time'=>698.56,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh, ya.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>698.64,'end_time'=>700.94,'target_text'=>'These were the restaurants we saw yesterday and now they\'re opened up.','source_text'=>'Inilah restoran yang kita nampak semalam dan sekarang semuanya dah dibuka.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>701.04,'end_time'=>701.9,'target_text'=>'So look at that.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah tu.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>702,'end_time'=>703.42,'target_text'=>'There was Kdrama\'s film there.','source_text'=>'Pernah ada drama Korea buat penggambaran kat situ.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>703.52,'end_time'=>704.94,'target_text'=>'Oh yeah, this I want to try this.','source_text'=>'Oh ya, yang ni saya nak cuba rasa.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>705.04,'end_time'=>706.62,'target_text'=>'That\'s like the intestines.','source_text'=>'Itu macam hidangan usus lembu (gopchang).','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>706.72,'end_time'=>708.7,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never tried that, but apparently it\'s really good.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah cuba lagi, tapi dengar ceritanya memang sedap sangat.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>708.8,'end_time'=>710.06,'target_text'=>'And this is the pig skin.','source_text'=>'Dan yang ini pula kulit babi.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>710.16,'end_time'=>711.02,'target_text'=>'I\'ve had that before.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah makan hidangan tu sebelum ni.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>711.12,'end_time'=>713.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, we can go to all you can eat and hit that up.','source_text'=>'Ya, kita boleh pergi ke restoran bufet makan sepuasnya dan cuba menu tu.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>713.52,'end_time'=>714.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>714.24,'end_time'=>715.82,'target_text'=>'Oysters with kimchi, bro.','source_text'=>'Tiram dimakan dengan kimchi, kawan.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>715.92,'end_time'=>716.46,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah, macam pelik saja.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>716.56,'end_time'=>720.78,'target_text'=>'>> Have you had oysters with >> I\'ve never had an oyster, but I feel like I would not like it with kimchi.','source_text'=>'Awak pernah makan tiram dengan >> Saya tak pernah makan tiram pun, tapi saya rasa saya takkan suka kalau makan dengan kimchi.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>720.88,'end_time'=>721.74,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never had an oyster.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah makan tiram seumur hidup.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>721.84,'end_time'=>722.24,'target_text'=>'Have you?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah makan ke?','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>722.24,'end_time'=>722.78,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they\'re all right.','source_text'=>'Pernah, rasanya okey saja.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>722.88,'end_time'=>724.94,'target_text'=>'They just It\'s like salty uh water.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia cuma macam air masin.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>725.04,'end_time'=>725.66,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s what it tastes like.','source_text'=>'Macam tulah rasanya.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>725.76,'end_time'=>728.14,'target_text'=>'But you\'re not even supposed to chew it, so how would you know what it tastes like?','source_text'=>'Tapi orang kata tiram tak patut dikunyah pun, jadi macam mana awak tahu apa rasanya?','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>728.24,'end_time'=>728.94,'target_text'=>'>> No, you can chew them.','source_text'=>'Boleh saja kunyah sebenarnya.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>729.04,'end_time'=>730.7,'target_text'=>'But I\'ve had um deep fried oyos.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya pernah makan tiram goreng celup tepung.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>730.8,'end_time'=>731.66,'target_text'=>'Those are really good.','source_text'=>'Yang tu memang sangat sedap.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>731.76,'end_time'=>736.78,'target_text'=>'>> Really, if you guys are serious about learning English and you want to practice your speaking, check out my Patreon in','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya kalau korang betul-betul serius nak belajar bahasa Inggeris dan nak latih pertuturan korang, lawati Patreon saya di','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>736.88,'end_time'=>738.86,'target_text'=>'the description where you get three new videos a week.','source_text'=>'ruang penerangan di mana korang akan dapat tiga video baru setiap minggu.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>738.96,'end_time'=>744.38,'target_text'=>'There you can practice your pronunciation, your accent, and your confidence when you speak English.','source_text'=>'Di situ korang boleh latih sebutan, slanga, dan keyakinan diri bila bercakap dalam bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>744.48,'end_time'=>748.7,'target_text'=>'So, if you want to level up your speaking, check out my Patreon and I\'ll see you guys there.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau korang nak tingkatkan mutu pertuturan, lawati Patreon saya dan jumpa korang kat sana.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>748.8,'end_time'=>749.42,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>749.52,'end_time'=>751.58,'target_text'=>'In this lesson, I want [music] you to shadow me.','source_text'=>'Dalam pelajaran kali ini, saya nak korang buat teknik shadowing bersama saya.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>751.68,'end_time'=>752.3,'target_text'=>'What does that mean?','source_text'=>'Apa maksudnya?','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>752.4,'end_time'=>756.06,'target_text'=>'It means I have issue with my weight, at least outwardly.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya saya ada masalah dengan berat badan saya, sekurang-kurangnya dari pandangan luaran.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>756.16,'end_time'=>757.58,'target_text'=>'And I\'m good at my job.','source_text'=>'Dan saya cekap melakukan tugas saya.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>757.68,'end_time'=>759.58,'target_text'=>'John proposed a few months later.','source_text'=>'John melamar beberapa bulan kemudian.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>759.68,'end_time'=>760.94,'target_text'=>'She stood up for herself.','source_text'=>'Dia mempertahankan maruah dirinya.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>761.04,'end_time'=>762.94,'target_text'=>'She\'s 41.','source_text'=>'Umurnya 41 tahun.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>763.04,'end_time'=>763.66,'target_text'=>'She\'s a grown.','source_text'=>'Dia seorang wanita dewasa.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>763.76,'end_time'=>764.16,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, guys.','source_text'=>'Okey, kawan-kawan.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>764.24,'end_time'=>765.66,'target_text'=>'So, you guys know the drill.','source_text'=>'Jadi, korang dah tahu rutin kita kan.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>765.76,'end_time'=>766.7,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to go eat dinner.','source_text'=>'Kita nak pergi makan malam sekarang.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>766.8,'end_time'=>770.78,'target_text'=>'I think we\'re going to eat like that barbecue chicken place, the one that Gordon Ramsay went to.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kita patut makan kat kedai ayam BBQ yang pernah dikunjungi Gordon Ramsay tu.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>770.88,'end_time'=>771.5,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s head there.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jom kita menuju ke sana.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>771.6,'end_time'=>772.7,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s really close.','source_text'=>'Rasanya dah dekat sangat dah.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>772.8,'end_time'=>774.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s like just right here.','source_text'=>'Betul-betul kat sebelah sini saja.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>774.16,'end_time'=>776.3,'target_text'=>'Oh, the boy is busing.','source_text'=>'Oh, budak lelaki tu tengah buat persembahan jalanan.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>776.4,'end_time'=>777.18,'target_text'=>'>> Sing like that.','source_text'=>'Menyanyi macam tu.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>777.28,'end_time'=>779.34,'target_text'=>'>> He\'s singing like really calmly.','source_text'=>'Dia menyanyi dengan sangat tenang.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>779.44,'end_time'=>780.46,'target_text'=>'It might be a sad song.','source_text'=>'Mungkin lagu sedih agaknya.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>780.56,'end_time'=>782.54,'target_text'=>'There are a lot of people sitting here chilling.','source_text'=>'Ada ramai orang tengah duduk lepak santai kat sini.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>782.64,'end_time'=>784.38,'target_text'=>'Probably listening to the music.','source_text'=>'Mungkin tengah dengar alunan muzik tu.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>784.48,'end_time'=>785.5,'target_text'=>'Actually, I do need to cut my hair.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya saya memang kena gunting rambut saya.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>785.6,'end_time'=>789.34,'target_text'=>'I think I\'m going to go to the kitchen and see if >> kitchen >> see if there\'s some scissors there.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya nak pergi dapur tengok kalau ada gunting kat sana.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>789.44,'end_time'=>791.74,'target_text'=>'Last time I was in I was in Korea, I needed to cut my hair.','source_text'=>'Masa saya kat Korea kali lepas pun saya kena potong rambut juga.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>791.84,'end_time'=>794.3,'target_text'=>'So, I I just went to go get uh scissors from the kitchen.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya cuma pergi ambil gunting dari dapur saja.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>794.4,'end_time'=>795.66,'target_text'=>'It was like an easy cut, but yeah.','source_text'=>'Potong sikit-sikit gaya mudah saja.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>795.76,'end_time'=>796,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>796,'end_time'=>796.94,'target_text'=>'What\'s that pink building?','source_text'=>'Bangunan merah jambu apa kat sana tu?','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>797.04,'end_time'=>797.66,'target_text'=>'>> I have no idea.','source_text'=>'Entahlah, saya langsung tak tahu.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>797.76,'end_time'=>799.1,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never seen that building before.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah nampak bangunan tu sebelum ni.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>799.2,'end_time'=>803.34,'target_text'=>'Oh, that\'s where that that bus stops that we saw the other day that we saw yesterday.','source_text'=>'Oh, kat situlah tempat bas yang kita nampak semalam berhenti.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>803.44,'end_time'=>804.22,'target_text'=>'>> The tour bus.','source_text'=>'Bas pelancongan.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>804.32,'end_time'=>805.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, >> the tourist bus.','source_text'=>'Ya, >> bas lawatan pelancong.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>805.28,'end_time'=>805.9,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s where it stops.','source_text'=>'Kat situlah tempat bas tu berhenti.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>806,'end_time'=>807.58,'target_text'=>'I think fried chicken is better.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ayam goreng lagi sedap.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>807.68,'end_time'=>808,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>808,'end_time'=>809.02,'target_text'=>'>> Or no, no, baked chicken.','source_text'=>'Atau eh bukan, ayam bakar.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>809.12,'end_time'=>811.82,'target_text'=>'Baked chicken because you\'re not like that hungry, are you?','source_text'=>'Ayam bakar sebab awak taklah lapar sangat kan sekarang?','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>811.92,'end_time'=>812.7,'target_text'=>'>> No, not really.','source_text'=>'Tak lapar sangat pun sebenarnya.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>812.8,'end_time'=>813.9,'target_text'=>'>> So, then let\'s get the baked chicken.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau macam tu jom kita makan ayam bakar.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>814,'end_time'=>815.82,'target_text'=>'When when we\'re hungry, we go get the fried chicken.','source_text'=>'Bila kita betul-betul lapar nanti baru kita makan ayam goreng.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>815.92,'end_time'=>818.3,'target_text'=>'It It is like the same price, I assume.','source_text'=>'Harganya lebih kurang sama saja rasanya.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>818.4,'end_time'=>818.8,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>818.88,'end_time'=>819.98,'target_text'=>'No, this one\'s cheaper.','source_text'=>'Eh tak, yang ni lebih murah.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>820.08,'end_time'=>820.54,'target_text'=>'I checked.','source_text'=>'Saya dah periksa harganya.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>820.64,'end_time'=>821.58,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, this is cheaper.','source_text'=>'Oh, yang ni lagi murah.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>821.68,'end_time'=>821.92,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>821.92,'end_time'=>823.1,'target_text'=>'And you get a whole chicken.','source_text'=>'Dan dapat seekor ayam penuh.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>823.2,'end_time'=>824.14,'target_text'=>'>> But boneless we\'re getting.','source_text'=>'Tapi kita nak ambil yang tanpa tulang.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>824.24,'end_time'=>825.42,'target_text'=>'I\'m not getting that bone in.','source_text'=>'Saya tak nak yang ada tulang.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>825.52,'end_time'=>825.92,'target_text'=>'>> No, dude.','source_text'=>'Tak naklah, kawan.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>825.92,'end_time'=>827.18,'target_text'=>'That\'s just straight white meat.','source_text'=>'Yang tu semuanya bahagian isi dada ayam.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>827.28,'end_time'=>830.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, it we\'re getting boneless, dog.','source_text'=>'Kita pesan yang tanpa tulang saja, kawan.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>830.16,'end_time'=>830.78,'target_text'=>'But we could eat here.','source_text'=>'Tapi kita boleh makan kat dalam ni.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>830.88,'end_time'=>832.06,'target_text'=>'There there are some seats here.','source_text'=>'Ada tempat duduk kat sebelah sini.','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>832.16,'end_time'=>833.42,'target_text'=>'>> Or what about that?','source_text'=>'Atau macam mana dengan gerai yang tu?','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>833.52,'end_time'=>834.54,'target_text'=>'>> I have no idea.','source_text'=>'Entahlah, saya tak tahu.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>834.64,'end_time'=>835.9,'target_text'=>'Oh, that\'s busousan food.','source_text'=>'Oh, itu makanan khas dari Busan.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>836,'end_time'=>841.9,'target_text'=>'They have like this type of like soup stuff that\'s like like this white broth with rice and then they have this meat on the','source_text'=>'Mereka ada sup jenis kuah putih macam sup sup daging beras dan ada daging rebus','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>842,'end_time'=>843.1,'target_text'=>'side that\'s just boiled.','source_text'=>'yang disajikan sekali di tepi.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>843.2,'end_time'=>846.22,'target_text'=>'This is like the most traditional looking stall like ever.','source_text'=>'Gerai ni nampak paling tradisional sekali gayanya.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>846.32,'end_time'=>847.9,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, that\'s all traditional stuff, isn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Memang semuanya makanan tradisional kan?','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>848,'end_time'=>848.24,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'Okey.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>848.24,'end_time'=>849.74,'target_text'=>'Gordon Ramsey did it here.','source_text'=>'Gordon Ramsay pernah makan kat sini.','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>849.84,'end_time'=>854.62,'target_text'=>'No, but usually I go with bulgogi boneless with fries, but it\'s not like that much.','source_text'=>'Taklah, tapi biasanya saya pilih ayam tanpa tulang perisa bulgogi dengan kentang goreng, cuma kuantitinya taklah banyak sangat.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>854.72,'end_time'=>855.74,'target_text'=>'>> Is did it look like that?','source_text'=>'Rupa hidangannya macam tu ke?','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>855.84,'end_time'=>856.62,'target_text'=>'>> They cut it like that.','source_text'=>'Mereka potong macam tu.','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>856.72,'end_time'=>858.22,'target_text'=>'>> But does it like look like that portion?','source_text'=>'Tapi porsinya memang banyak macam tu ke?','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>858.32,'end_time'=>860.06,'target_text'=>'>> Usually you get like a half and half one.','source_text'=>'Biasanya korang boleh pilih gabungan dua perisa berbeza (separuh-separuh).','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>860.16,'end_time'=>862.22,'target_text'=>'You get two flavors, but that\'s like any place.','source_text'=>'Boleh dapat dua perisa, tapi kebanyakan kedai lain pun macam tu juga.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>862.32,'end_time'=>865.74,'target_text'=>'>> Wait, so the boneless chicken edge barbecue, is that like nuggets?','source_text'=>'Sekejap, ayam BBQ tanpa tulang tu rupa dia macam nuget ke?','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>865.84,'end_time'=>868.46,'target_text'=>'Like all the same meat or like they\'re like dark meat and white meat?','source_text'=>'Semua guna bahagian isi sama atau campur bahagian peha dan dada?','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>868.56,'end_time'=>869.98,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s like It\'s like chicken thighs.','source_text'=>'Mereka guna bahagian isi peha ayam.','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>870.08,'end_time'=>872.62,'target_text'=>'>> Should we walk down a bit and then work up on our appetite?','source_text'=>'Patut ke kita jalan-jalan dulu bagi rasa lapar sikit?','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>872.72,'end_time'=>875.98,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I guess there\'s so there\'s so much like better food in Korea.','source_text'=>'Ya, rasanya banyak lagi pilihan makanan yang lagi sedap di Korea ni.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>876.08,'end_time'=>877.58,'target_text'=>'Like better areas for food.','source_text'=>'Banyak kawasan yang lagi terkenal dengan makanan sedap.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>877.68,'end_time'=>880.7,'target_text'=>'Like Ewan, I know, is like one of the most popular places for food.','source_text'=>'Macam kawasan Itaewon antara tempat paling popular untuk syurga makanan.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>880.8,'end_time'=>881.74,'target_text'=>'They don\'t just have Korean food.','source_text'=>'Bukan sekadar makanan tempatan Korea saja.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>881.84,'end_time'=>883.26,'target_text'=>'They have like all types of food.','source_text'=>'Pelbagai jenis masakan antarabangsa ada kat sana.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>883.36,'end_time'=>884.62,'target_text'=>'>> What about tacos?','source_text'=>'Macam mana pula dengan makanan taco?','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>884.72,'end_time'=>886.62,'target_text'=>'>> Uh, they look good, honestly.','source_text'=>'Nampak menyelerakan juga sejujurnya.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>886.72,'end_time'=>888.06,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, should we get fake food?','source_text'=>'Patut ke kita beli makanan segera?','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>888.16,'end_time'=>890.38,'target_text'=>'>> No, I know good restaurants for that stuff.','source_text'=>'Tak payah, saya tahu restoran yang sedap untuk makanan macam tu.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>890.48,'end_time'=>891.02,'target_text'=>'So, we can go.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita boleh pergi sana nanti.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>891.12,'end_time'=>891.58,'target_text'=>'>> Really?','source_text'=>'Ya ke?','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>891.68,'end_time'=>892,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>892,'end_time'=>894.54,'target_text'=>'>> Well, I guess if you\'re going to eat here, you might as well eat just at a chain.','source_text'=>'Kalau nak makan kat sini, lebih baik makan kat restoran rangkaian berjenama saja.','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>894.64,'end_time'=>894.96,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>894.96,'end_time'=>896.62,'target_text'=>'If I eat it home, it\'ll be at a chain.','source_text'=>'Kalau saya makan kat sini, saya pilih restoran rangkaian.','order'=>460],
