            ['start_time'=>900.24,'end_time'=>905.5,'target_text'=>'So, usually you\'re going to explain it better than me, but in Korea, a lot of the food is for like at least two people, right?','source_text'=>'Biasanya awak lagi pandai jelaskan dari saya, tapi di Korea kebanyakan makanan disyaratkan untuk sekurang-kurangnya dua orang kan?','order'=>464],
