            ['start_time'=>905.84,'end_time'=>909.18,'target_text'=>'Like a lot of like places won\'t let you go eat unless you order for two people.','source_text'=>'Banyak kedai tak bagi masuk makan melainkan awak pesan untuk porsi dua orang.','order'=>466],
            ['start_time'=>909.28,'end_time'=>914.14,'target_text'=>'So, if you go to KBBQ, then you have to order for two people or sometimes they just like won\'t even take you in.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau pergi ke kedai barbeku Korea, awak wajib pesan untuk dua orang atau kadang-kadang mereka langsung tak terima pelanggan solo.','order'=>467],
            ['start_time'=>914.24,'end_time'=>917.26,'target_text'=>'So, >> that was a KBBQ spot for >> just one person.','source_text'=>'Jadi kedai tu khas untuk makan barbeku Korea bagi seorang saja.','order'=>468],
