            ['start_time'=>111.2,'end_time'=>119.26,'target_text'=>'Lepas setiap pusingan atau latihan hoki, Zamboni akan datang bersihkan ais dan basahkan ais dengan air','source_text'=>'After every period or after every hockey practice, the Zamboni comes and clears and cleans the ice and wets the ice with water','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>119.36,'end_time'=>123.5,'target_text'=>'lepas tu biarkan kering seminit dua, dan ais akan jadi licin elok.','source_text'=>'and then you let it dry for like a minute or two and then it\'s like perfectly smooth.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>123.6,'end_time'=>128.14,'target_text'=>'Segala rekahan dan lekuk pada ais tadi semua jadi licin rata.','source_text'=>'All like the imperfections and the grooves in the ice are smoothed out.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>128.24,'end_time'=>132.6,'target_text'=>'Dan dia pakai but kulit, bro, dengan cermin mata Gucci.','source_text'=>'And he got the leather boots, bro, with the Gucci shades.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>133.2,'end_time'=>134.38,'target_text'=>'Tengok Santa tu, bro.','source_text'=>'>> Look at Santa, bro.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>134.48,'end_time'=>135.58,'target_text'=>'Selamat Hari Krismas.','source_text'=>'Merry Christmas.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>135.68,'end_time'=>137.74,'target_text'=>'Dia tengah kumpul hadiah sekarang.','source_text'=>'So, he\'s collecting gifts right now.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>137.84,'end_time'=>139.34,'target_text'=>'Pertama sekali, selamat Hari Krismas untuk semua.','source_text'=>'Merry Christmas, first of all, everyone.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>139.44,'end_time'=>140.46,'target_text'=>'Selamat Hari Krismas.','source_text'=>'Merry Christmas.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>140.56,'end_time'=>143.02,'target_text'=>'Kita sekarang ada kat Cheonggyecheon.','source_text'=>'We\'re at Chiong Hi Gchon.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>143.12,'end_time'=>144.14,'target_text'=>'Aku tak pasti sebutan aku betul ke tak.','source_text'=>'I don\'t know if I said that right.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>144.24,'end_time'=>145.82,'target_text'=>'Mungkin sebutan aku salah teruk kot.','source_text'=>'I probably said that really wrong.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>145.92,'end_time'=>149.9,'target_text'=>'Tapi ni kawasan pasar Krismas dan tapak sambutan Krismas.','source_text'=>'But this is a Christmas market and a Christmas area.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>150,'end_time'=>155.5,'target_text'=>'Jadi kita luangkan masa kat sini sekejap, lepas tu pergi pasar Krismas dan harapnya dapat makan makanan','source_text'=>'So, we\'re going to spend some time here and then we\'re going to go to the Christmas market and hopefully get some Christmas','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>155.6,'end_time'=>156.7,'target_text'=>'bertemakan Krismas.','source_text'=>'themed food.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>156.8,'end_time'=>161.18,'target_text'=>'Tapi satu benda yang aku rasa lawak kat sini, ButtFit Ground.','source_text'=>'But one thing I found funny is this right here, ButtFit Ground.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>161.28,'end_time'=>162.54,'target_text'=>'ButtFit Ground.','source_text'=>'Butt fit Ground.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>162.64,'end_time'=>166.54,'target_text'=>'Nama sesetengah kedai kat sini aku rasa agak kelakar.','source_text'=>'Some of the names of stores and businesses here I find quite funny.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>166.64,'end_time'=>168.86,'target_text'=>'Tapi jom kita tengok kawasan anak sungai ni.','source_text'=>'But let\'s go check out this uh this stream.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>168.96,'end_time'=>173.58,'target_text'=>'Anak sungai ni memang popular gila dan ada sambutan acara Krismas kat sini.','source_text'=>'really popular stream and they have like holiday Christmas events going on here.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>173.68,'end_time'=>178.22,'target_text'=>'Jadi kita jalan kat sini dulu, lepas tu baru pergi pasar Krismas untuk makan.','source_text'=>'So, we\'re going to go here first and then we\'ll go to the Christmas market to eat.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>178.32,'end_time'=>179.26,'target_text'=>'Jom gerak.','source_text'=>'So, let\'s go.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>179.36,'end_time'=>181.9,'target_text'=>'Dalam bahasa Inggeris kita biasanya ucap merry Christmas.','source_text'=>'So, in English we say usually merry Christmas.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>182,'end_time'=>187.42,'target_text'=>'Kalau tak pasti jumpa orang tu waktu tahun baru nanti, kita ucap merry Christmas and a happy new year.','source_text'=>'If you\'re not sure you\'re going to see the person during New Year\'s, you say merry Christmas and a happy new year.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>187.52,'end_time'=>190.7,'target_text'=>'Tapi kalau kau akan jumpa diorang macam keluarga kau, cakap merry Christmas je.','source_text'=>'But if you are going to see them like your family, just merry Christmas.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>190.8,'end_time'=>196.86,'target_text'=>'Tapi kat sini ada pokok Krismas bercahaya yang cantik siap ada tulisan Merry Christmas.','source_text'=>'But here we have a nice, beautiful lit up Christmas tree that says Merry Christmas on there.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>196.96,'end_time'=>201.98,'target_text'=>'Ya, kat bahagian paling bawah ada orang kerdil elf dan atas dia pula ada Santa Claus.','source_text'=>'Yeah, you can see at the very bottom there\'s an elf and then above him is Santa Claus.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>202.08,'end_time'=>204.22,'target_text'=>'Dan atas sekali ada biskut gingerbread man.','source_text'=>'And then even higher is a gingerbread man.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>204.32,'end_time'=>207.02,'target_text'=>'Oh, tu pun benda yang memang popular sangat.','source_text'=>'Oh, that\'s also something that\'s really popular.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>207.12,'end_time'=>212.22,'target_text'=>'Aku tak tahu kita jumpa ke tak, tapi buat rumah roti halia memang popular gila kat Kanada.','source_text'=>'I don\'t know if we can find one, but making a gingerbread house that\'s super popular in Canada.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>212.32,'end_time'=>213.74,'target_text'=>'Kat sini aku tak pasti.','source_text'=>'Here, I\'m not sure.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>213.84,'end_time'=>217.66,'target_text'=>'Tapi aku yakin mungkin boleh jumpa rumah roti halia kat sini.','source_text'=>'I\'m pretty sure you could maybe find a gingerbread house.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>217.76,'end_time'=>223.58,'target_text'=>'Ya, ni salah satu aktiviti paling popular waktu Krismas kat Korea, pesta tanglung.','source_text'=>'But yeah, this is one of the most popular things to do during Christmas in Korea, the lantern festival.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>223.68,'end_time'=>227.58,'target_text'=>'Dan anak sungai ni dipenuhi dengan ratusan tanglung yang memang lawa gila.','source_text'=>'And this stream is just filled with hundreds of lanterns and they\'re really cool.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>227.68,'end_time'=>230.14,'target_text'=>'Macam... Aku rasa kat bawah tu macam ada tema Pokemon.','source_text'=>'Like >> I think there\'s like a Pokemon theme or something down there.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>230.24,'end_time'=>231.66,'target_text'=>'Ya, betul-betul ada bot kat situ.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, there\'s literally a boat there.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>231.76,'end_time'=>234.3,'target_text'=>'Jauh sikit ke depan ada Patung Liberty.','source_text'=>'More further down Statue of Liberty.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>234.4,'end_time'=>237.58,'target_text'=>'Kat sini ada beberapa tanglung bertema sejarah.','source_text'=>'Here you have some historical lanterns.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>237.68,'end_time'=>237.92,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'Yeah.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>237.92,'end_time'=>239.82,'target_text'=>'Jadi jom kita turun pergi sana.','source_text'=>'So, let\'s go down over there.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>239.92,'end_time'=>240.16,'target_text'=>'Okey.','source_text'=>'Okay.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>240.16,'end_time'=>242.22,'target_text'=>'Sekarang kita turun ke kawasan anak sungai.','source_text'=>'Now, we\'re going down into the stream.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>242.32,'end_time'=>245.42,'target_text'=>'Aku tertanya-tanya juga sepanjang mana laluan ni.','source_text'=>'I think I I actually wonder how long this is.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>245.52,'end_time'=>250.38,'target_text'=>'Yang aku tahu memang ada beratus-ratus >> dan kita belum nampak ratusan lagi pun.','source_text'=>'All I know is that there are hundreds >> and we have we have not seen hundreds yet.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>250.48,'end_time'=>251.66,'target_text'=>'>> Bayangkan kalau terjatuh dalam air.','source_text'=>'>> Imagine falling in the water.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>251.76,'end_time'=>252.7,'target_text'=>'Mesti sejuk gila tu.','source_text'=>'That\'d be so cool.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>252.8,'end_time'=>254.62,'target_text'=>'Kau boleh kena... kau boleh kena hipotermia terus.','source_text'=>'You would get like you would get hypothermia.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>254.72,'end_time'=>255.42,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, 100% betul.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, 100%.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>255.52,'end_time'=>256.46,'target_text'=>'>> Kau boleh kena hipotermia.','source_text'=>'>> You would get hypothermia.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>256.56,'end_time'=>259.58,'target_text'=>'>> Dan aku boleh jamin benda tu mesti dah pernah jadi sekurang-kurangnya sekali.','source_text'=>'>> And I can I can guarantee that\'s happened already once.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>259.68,'end_time'=>261.98,'target_text'=>'>> Bahagian paling penting dalam belajar bahasa.','source_text'=>'>> The most important part of learning a language.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>262.08,'end_time'=>267.34,'target_text'=>'Dan sebab kenapa semua orang belajar bahasa adalah supaya boleh bercakap bahasa tu.','source_text'=>'And the reason why everyone learns a language is to be able to speak the language.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>267.44,'end_time'=>269.58,'target_text'=>'Video-video macam ni bantu pendengaran korang.','source_text'=>'These videos help you with your listening.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>269.68,'end_time'=>272.46,'target_text'=>'Tapi macam mana nak latih kemahiran bercakap korang lagi mantap?','source_text'=>'But how can you practice your speaking even more?','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>272.56,'end_time'=>274.86,'target_text'=>'Korang kena berlatih guna teknik shadowing.','source_text'=>'You need to practice by shadowing.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>274.96,'end_time'=>282.06,'target_text'=>'Shadowing ni maksudnya mengulang sebut lepas penutur asli untuk latih sebutan, loghat, dan keyakinan korang.','source_text'=>'Shadowing is just repeating after a native English speaker to practice your pronunciation, your accent, and your confidence.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>282.16,'end_time'=>287.42,'target_text'=>'dan aku dah mula buat video khas untuk latih ketiga-tiga aspek ni.','source_text'=>'and I\'ve started making videos specifically just to practice those three things.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>287.52,'end_time'=>293.5,'target_text'=>'Jadi, kalau korang nak lebih yakin berbahasa Inggeris dan betul-betul fasih, jenguk Patreon aku kat ruangan penerangan','source_text'=>'So, if you guys want to become more confident in English and become truly fluent, check out my Patreon in the description','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>293.6,'end_time'=>301.9,'target_text'=>'kat mana aku sediakan tiga video baharu setiap minggu untuk korang asah sebutan, loghat, dan paling penting,','source_text'=>'where I give you guys three new videos every week to practice your pronunciation, your accent, and most importantly, your','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>302,'end_time'=>302.7,'target_text'=>'keyakinan diri.','source_text'=>'confidence.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>302.8,'end_time'=>303.9,'target_text'=>'Jumpa korang kat sana nanti.','source_text'=>'I\'ll see you guys there.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>304,'end_time'=>311.9,'target_text'=>'Kita akan belajar bahasa Inggeris sambil aku perkemaskan sebutan, loghat, rentak, dan keyakinan korang.','source_text'=>'We are going to be learning English as I clean up my pronunciation, your accent, your rhythm, and your confidence.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>312,'end_time'=>316.54,'target_text'=>'Itu cuma cara berlapik dia nak jaga perasaan aku secara sopan.','source_text'=>'It was just a roundabout way of her politely trying to spare my feelings.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>316.64,'end_time'=>324.14,'target_text'=>'Si jahat tu bagi macam-macam alasan berbeza kat rakan sekerja pasal jari aku yang hilang sampai ada tindakan undang-undang','source_text'=>'The a-hole for giving all of my co-workers a different reason for why I have missing fingers so I wouldn\'t take legal a came','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>324.24,'end_time'=>327.5,'target_text'=>'dan akhirnya dia kena lalui latihan tatatertib syarikat atas kelakuannya.','source_text'=>'down to he companywide training on his behavior.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>327.6,'end_time'=>328.54,'target_text'=>'Dia pilih untuk tak nak.','source_text'=>'He chooses not.','order'=>108],
