            ['start_time'=>429.68,'end_time'=>434.7,'target_text'=>'Aku tak nampak hujung dia lagi, tapi kita kena jalan sampai habis dan patah balik semula.','source_text'=>'I don\'t see an end to this, but you know, we\'re going to have to walk all the way down and then walk all the way back.','order'=>158],
