            ['start_time'=>663.84,'end_time'=>670.38,'target_text'=>'Tapi itulah, kat pasar Krismas yang kita beratur panjang tadi tu, aku harap sangat ada jual coklat panas.','source_text'=>'But the thing is at that Christmas at that market, the one we waited in line for, I really wish they had hot chocolate.','order'=>259],
