            ['start_time'=>738.24,'end_time'=>738.7,'target_text'=>'Wah.','source_text'=>'Wow.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>738.8,'end_time'=>739.26,'target_text'=>'Pergh.','source_text'=>'>> Damn.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>739.36,'end_time'=>742.6,'target_text'=>'Aku nampak karusel kat sini.','source_text'=>'I see a merrygoround here.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>742.96,'end_time'=>745.82,'target_text'=>'Teringin nak naik, tapi barisan dia gila panjang.','source_text'=>'>> I would like to ride that, but the lines here are insane.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>745.92,'end_time'=>747.26,'target_text'=>'Rasanya macam ada had berat badan nak naik benda tu.','source_text'=>'>> I I think there\'s a weight limit on that.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>747.36,'end_time'=>748.7,'target_text'=>'atau mungkin had ketinggian.','source_text'=>'or maybe a height limit.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>748.8,'end_time'=>751.1,'target_text'=>'Aku nampak lelaki dewasa pun naik benda tu.','source_text'=>'>> I I see grown men on that thing.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>751.2,'end_time'=>752.06,'target_text'=>'Oh ya, betul cakap kau.','source_text'=>'>> Oh yeah, you\'re right.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>752.16,'end_time'=>755.1,'target_text'=>'Tengoklah ramai orang tengah berpusing tu.','source_text'=>'>> Like look at all those people moving.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>755.2,'end_time'=>756.78,'target_text'=>'Tapi itulah pasar yang kita pergi tadi.','source_text'=>'>> But that was the market we were at.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>756.88,'end_time'=>758.06,'target_text'=>'Pokok Krismas besar.','source_text'=>'Big Christmas tree.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>758.16,'end_time'=>758.86,'target_text'=>'Karusel.','source_text'=>'Merry go around.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>758.96,'end_time'=>763.58,'target_text'=>'Kita dah jalan sampai hujung dan tengok pertunjukan lampu kat dinding Gyeongbokgung.','source_text'=>'We walked all the way to the end and saw the light show on the Gyomoku wall.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>763.68,'end_time'=>767.5,'target_text'=>'Seronok tengok ramai orang keluar walau keadaan sejuk membeku.','source_text'=>'It\'s good to see a lot of people coming out even though it\'s freezing cold.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>767.6,'end_time'=>767.84,'target_text'=>'Okey.','source_text'=>'Okay.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>767.84,'end_time'=>770.7,'target_text'=>'Satu benda aku suka pasal Korea ni, semua benda ada kat laci tepi meja.','source_text'=>'One thing I love about Korea is that everything\'s on the side.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>770.8,'end_time'=>772.54,'target_text'=>'Penyepit makanan (chopstick)','source_text'=>'The chopsticks','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>772.64,'end_time'=>775.66,'target_text'=>'dan sudu, malah tisu pun ada.','source_text'=>'and the spoon and even the napkin.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>775.76,'end_time'=>779.66,'target_text'=>'Jadi kalau tak nampak sudu atas meja, tengok je kat laci tepi meja.','source_text'=>'So if you never see your stuff on the table, just check the side.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>779.76,'end_time'=>781.56,'target_text'=>'Ah,','source_text'=>'Ah,','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>782.48,'end_time'=>785.02,'target_text'=>'makanan ni dipanggil Jjimdak.','source_text'=>'this is called Jim Duck.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>785.12,'end_time'=>787.98,'target_text'=>'Korang boleh tengok kat atas ni, ada keju yang diorang bakar garing.','source_text'=>'You can see on the top here, they have cheese that they crisped up.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>788.08,'end_time'=>790.06,'target_text'=>'Tengok warna keemasan yang cantik tu.','source_text'=>'Look at that beautiful golden brown.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>790.16,'end_time'=>794.54,'target_text'=>'Jjimdak maksudnya dalam bahasa Inggeris ayam masak kicap pekat renek.','source_text'=>'Jimduck means in English, brazed soya sauce chicken.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>794.64,'end_time'=>799.34,'target_text'=>'Dan diorang sediakan semangkuk nasi pulut lembut yang gebu.','source_text'=>'And they give you this like beautiful bowl of like fluffy sticky rice.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>799.44,'end_time'=>800.86,'target_text'=>'Jom kita rasa ayam ni sekarang.','source_text'=>'But let\'s try this chicken now.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>800.96,'end_time'=>801.98,'target_text'=>'Detik yang kita tunggu-tunggu.','source_text'=>'The moment we\'ve been waiting for.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>802.08,'end_time'=>803.5,'target_text'=>'Jom ambil sikit keju sekali.','source_text'=>'Let\'s get a little bit of cheese on here, too.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>803.6,'end_time'=>804.86,'target_text'=>'Tengok tarikan keju tu meregang, bro.','source_text'=>'Look at that cheese bowl, bro.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>804.96,'end_time'=>807.18,'target_text'=>'Jom rasa.','source_text'=>'Let\'s try this.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>807.28,'end_time'=>813.5,'target_text'=>'Aku selalu tengok orang asyik cari BBQ Korea atau ayam goreng, tapi diorang terlepas jjimdak yang sedap ni.','source_text'=>'I always see people getting KBBQ or fried chicken, but they\'re sleeping on this gym duck.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>813.6,'end_time'=>817.5,'target_text'=>'Aku tak tipu kalau aku kata aku boleh makan lauk ni tiap-tiap hari.','source_text'=>'I\'m not joking when I tell you I can eat this every single day.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>817.6,'end_time'=>822.94,'target_text'=>'Masa aku jadi pelajar pertukaran 3 tahun lepas kat Korea, aku makan ni setiap minggu, paling kurang seminggu sekali.','source_text'=>'When I was an exchange student 3 years ago in Korea, I had this every week, at least once a week.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>823.04,'end_time'=>826.04,'target_text'=>'Jom rasa mi suhun kenyal dia pula.','source_text'=>'Let\'s try the beautiful noodles.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>826.72,'end_time'=>830.54,'target_text'=>'Ni antara hidangan wajib korang cuba bila datang ke Korea.','source_text'=>'This is one of the dishes that you need to try when you come to Korea.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>830.64,'end_time'=>832.94,'target_text'=>'Memang makanan Korea paling kegemaran aku.','source_text'=>'It\'s absolutely my favorite Korean food.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>833.04,'end_time'=>834.7,'target_text'=>'Dan aku pernah duduk sini selama setahun.','source_text'=>'And I lived here for a year.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>834.8,'end_time'=>840.14,'target_text'=>'Jadi kalau cuma boleh cadangkan satu makanan je kat Korea, aku memang rekomen kedai ni.','source_text'=>'So, if I could only recommend one thing to come and eat in Korea, I would recommend this place.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>840.24,'end_time'=>841.98,'target_text'=>'Itu dia kedai kat belakang aku.','source_text'=>'So, that\'s the restaurant behind me.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>842.08,'end_time'=>843.9,'target_text'=>'Aku cadangkan 10,000% padu.','source_text'=>'I recommend that 10,000%.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>844,'end_time'=>845.58,'target_text'=>'Kawan-kawan aku pun mesti jatuh cinta dengan makanan ni.','source_text'=>'It\'s always my friend\'s favorite.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>845.68,'end_time'=>849.42,'target_text'=>'Setiap kali aku cadangkan kedai ni, terus jadi makanan Korea kegemaran diorang.','source_text'=>'Every time I recommend it, it becomes their favorite Korean food.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>849.52,'end_time'=>856.94,'target_text'=>'Keesokan harinya, kita tuju ke gelanggang luncur ais Seoul Plaza sekali lagi nak tengok buka ke tak kali ni.','source_text'=>'It\'s the next day and we\'re heading to the Soul Plaza skating rink again to see if they\'re open this time.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>857.04,'end_time'=>860.94,'target_text'=>'Maksud aku, semalam buka, cuma nak tengok ada slot kosong ke tak untuk kita.','source_text'=>'I mean, they were open last time, but to see if they have any spots available for us.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>861.04,'end_time'=>863.1,'target_text'=>'Harap-harap adalah slot.','source_text'=>'So, fingers crossed they do.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>863.2,'end_time'=>864.14,'target_text'=>'Jom gerak.','source_text'=>'Let\'s go.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>864.24,'end_time'=>870.06,'target_text'=>'Okey, nampak lengang sikit hari ni, tapi aku rasa tiket pukul 1:00 petang dah habis.','source_text'=>'Okay, it looks a lot quieter today, but I think I think they\'re sold out for 1:00 p.m.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>870.16,'end_time'=>871.26,'target_text'=>'macam yang aku nampak kat situ.','source_text'=>'like I can see there.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>871.36,'end_time'=>873.18,'target_text'=>'Atau mungkin tu untuk hari lain kot.','source_text'=>'Or maybe that\'s a different day.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>873.28,'end_time'=>874.94,'target_text'=>'Tapi tadi aku nampak orang beli tiket.','source_text'=>'>> But I did see them just buy some tickets.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>875.04,'end_time'=>875.66,'target_text'=>'Jadi kita tengoklah macam mana.','source_text'=>'So, we\'ll see.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>875.76,'end_time'=>877.02,'target_text'=>'Kita tengok apa kata diorang.','source_text'=>'We\'ll see what they say.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>877.12,'end_time'=>878.46,'target_text'=>'Keadaan agak lengang sikit.','source_text'=>'It\'s kind of like pretty empty.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>878.56,'end_time'=>879.1,'target_text'=>'Sejujurnya lah.','source_text'=>'I\'m going to be honest.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>879.2,'end_time'=>883.08,'target_text'=>'Tak macam semalam, korang boleh tengok semalam padat gila.','source_text'=>'Like yesterday, you can see yesterday it was packed.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>883.84,'end_time'=>884.7,'target_text'=>'Mantap, kejayaan besar!','source_text'=>'>> So, double use.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>884.8,'end_time'=>889.02,'target_text'=>'Aku nak semua tulis huruf W dalam ruangan chat sebab kita berjaya dapat pas masuk!','source_text'=>'I want everyone write a W in the chat cuz we got the pass.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>889.12,'end_time'=>892.3,'target_text'=>'Dan sekarang kita pergi sini nak ambil kasut luncur kita.','source_text'=>'And I think now we\'re going to go over here to get our skates.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>892.4,'end_time'=>894.06,'target_text'=>'Tapi tengok gelanggang ni.','source_text'=>'But look at this ring.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>894.16,'end_time'=>896.14,'target_text'=>'Kosong langsung tak ada orang.','source_text'=>'Completely empty.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>896.24,'end_time'=>898.22,'target_text'=>'Jadi ini lah yang aku cakap tadi.','source_text'=>'So this is kind of what I was talking about.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>898.32,'end_time'=>900.38,'target_text'=>'Tapi kat sini diorang cuma ratakan ais secara manual je.','source_text'=>'But here they\'re just doing it by hand.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>900.48,'end_time'=>905.1,'target_text'=>'Diorang tuang air atas rekahan ais yang besar tu bagi rata licin.','source_text'=>'They put like water over the big crevices in the ice to make it smooth.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>905.2,'end_time'=>910.06,'target_text'=>'Tapi kalau gelanggang hoki sebenar ada mesin besar dipanggil Zamboni yang akan bersihkan semua ni.','source_text'=>'But a real hockey rink just has that big machine called a Zamboni that clear this.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>910.16,'end_time'=>910.94,'target_text'=>'Apa yang kita tengah ambil sekarang ni?','source_text'=>'>> What are we getting right now?','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>911.04,'end_time'=>911.98,'target_text'=>'Kasut luncur ais.','source_text'=>'The skates.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>912.08,'end_time'=>914.46,'target_text'=>'Ya, ni tempat sewa kasut luncur ais.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, this is the skate rental area.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>914.56,'end_time'=>918.06,'target_text'=>'Dan abang tu tengah ambilkan kasut dan topi keledar untuk kita sebelum masuk.','source_text'=>'And uh he\'s getting us our skates and helmet and then we can go.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>918.16,'end_time'=>919.66,'target_text'=>'Aku rasa waktu kita sampai ni memang masa yang tepat sangat.','source_text'=>'I think we got here at the perfect time.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>919.76,'end_time'=>922.86,'target_text'=>'Ya, sebab kita sempat masuk dan boleh meluncur.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, >> cuz we still got in and we can skate.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>922.96,'end_time'=>925.74,'target_text'=>'Tunjuk sikit kasut luncur tu.','source_text'=>'Show me the skates.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>925.84,'end_time'=>929.66,'target_text'=>'Okey, sekarang aku nak sarung kasut luncur aku.','source_text'=>'Okay, so I\'m going to put my skates on now.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>929.76,'end_time'=>937.9,'target_text'=>'Kasut ni jenis kelakar sikit sebab guna klip tali gesper, tapi kasut biasa ada tali macam kasut biasa.','source_text'=>'These are funny skates cuz they\'re like these buckle things, but normal skates have laces just like shoes do.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>938,'end_time'=>940.6,'target_text'=>'Jom kita pakai ni.','source_text'=>'But let\'s put these on.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>942,'end_time'=>944.62,'target_text'=>'Bro, dah lama gila aku tak meluncur ais...','source_text'=>'Dude, I haven\'t skated in like','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>944.72,'end_time'=>945.66,'target_text'=>'macam dah 3 tahun kot.','source_text'=>'like 3 years.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>945.76,'end_time'=>950.46,'target_text'=>'Yang kelakarnya aku suka kasut aku ketat gila, jadi tak pasti boleh tahan ke tak. Aku pakai stoking dua lapis.','source_text'=>'>> The funny thing is I like my skates super tight, so I don\'t know how I\'m going to be >> I\'m wearing double lace.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>950.56,'end_time'=>955.98,'target_text'=>'Maksud aku, aku pakai stoking dua lapis, jadi rasa macam longgar sikit, tapi patutnya okey kot.','source_text'=>'I mean, I\'m wearing double layer socks, so the these are like still a little bit loose, so I think they\'ll be fine.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>956.08,'end_time'=>956.48,'target_text'=>'Oh, boleh ketatkan.','source_text'=>'Oh, no.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>956.56,'end_time'=>957.82,'target_text'=>'Kau boleh ketatkan elok-elok.','source_text'=>'You can tighten them good.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>957.92,'end_time'=>958.24,'target_text'=>'Okey.','source_text'=>'>> Okay.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>958.24,'end_time'=>960.78,'target_text'=>'Haa, ni dah ketat elok.','source_text'=>'>> No, these are super tight.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>960.88,'end_time'=>969.1,'target_text'=>'Aku suka bahagian buku lali ketat sangat, tapi kat depan ni sederhana je supaya tak penyekkan jari kaki.','source_text'=>'I like mine really tight around the ankle and then here moderately tight cuz it might crush my toe sometimes.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>969.2,'end_time'=>971.18,'target_text'=>'Loker ni.','source_text'=>'This locker.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>971.28,'end_time'=>973.9,'target_text'=>'Ni loker simpan barang dan kita simpan kasut kita dalam ni.','source_text'=>'So, this is a locker and we\'re just putting our shoes in.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>974,'end_time'=>975.02,'target_text'=>'Boleh guna loker kat sini.','source_text'=>'>> You can get one right here.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>975.12,'end_time'=>976.46,'target_text'=>'Oh, terbaik.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, fire.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>976.56,'end_time'=>979.9,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku cuma perlu tukar duit 1,000 won.','source_text'=>'So, I\'m just going to exchange a 1,000.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>980,'end_time'=>982.12,'target_text'=>'Masukkan duit.','source_text'=>'Put it in.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>984,'end_time'=>984.94,'target_text'=>'Dan kita dapat duit syiling.','source_text'=>'And we got the coins.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>985.04,'end_time'=>985.44,'target_text'=>'Bagus.','source_text'=>'All right.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>985.44,'end_time'=>986.94,'target_text'=>'Sekarang masa untuk pakai topi keledar pula.','source_text'=>'So, now it\'s time to put the helmet on.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>987.04,'end_time'=>991.58,'target_text'=>'Aku rasa topi ni macam helmet basikal je.','source_text'=>'Pretty sure these are like bicycle helmets or something.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>991.68,'end_time'=>993.26,'target_text'=>'Rupa aku kelakar gila kot dalam ni.','source_text'=>'And I am looking busted in here.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>993.36,'end_time'=>993.98,'target_text'=>'Mesti lawak.','source_text'=>'I bet.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>994.08,'end_time'=>994.94,'target_text'=>'Skala satu hingga sepuluh.','source_text'=>'Went to 10.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>995.04,'end_time'=>996.94,'target_text'=>'Bro, rupa kau takkan seburuk rupa aku.','source_text'=>'>> Dude, that cannot look as bad as me.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>997.04,'end_time'=>998.22,'target_text'=>'Nilai sikit penampilan kita.','source_text'=>'>> Rate the fit.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>998.32,'end_time'=>1001.74,'target_text'=>'Oh, helmet merah ni saiz betul ke?','source_text'=>'Oh, >> is red the right size?','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>1001.84,'end_time'=>1002.94,'target_text'=>'Ada saiz berbeza-beza ke?','source_text'=>'Are there different sizes?','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>1003.04,'end_time'=>1004.78,'target_text'=>'Ya, hijau tu saiz sederhana (M).','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, green\'s medium.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>1004.88,'end_time'=>1006.46,'target_text'=>'Ada tulis kat bahagian dalam helmet.','source_text'=>'It says inside the helmet.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>1006.56,'end_time'=>1009.58,'target_text'=>'Ada tanda S kat dalam ni.','source_text'=>'There\'s a S inside here.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>1009.68,'end_time'=>1011.1,'target_text'=>'Nampak kecik sangat ke?','source_text'=>'>> Does it look small?','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>1011.2,'end_time'=>1012.3,'target_text'=>'Rasa ketat kecik ke?','source_text'=>'>> Well, does it feel small?','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>1012.4,'end_time'=>1014.38,'target_text'=>'Kalau muat kepala kau elok, kira okeylah tu.','source_text'=>'>> Well, if it fits your head, then you\'re fine.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>1014.48,'end_time'=>1016.44,'target_text'=>'Rupa aku macam...','source_text'=>'>> I look','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>1020,'end_time'=>1022.3,'target_text'=>'Okey, kita dah masuk gelanggang.','source_text'=>'>> All right, we out here.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1022.4,'end_time'=>1024.86,'target_text'=>'Bro, tajam gila mata kasut ni.','source_text'=>'Dude, these skates are so sharp.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1024.96,'end_time'=>1029.18,'target_text'=>'Aku tak pasti sama ada tajam sangat atau tumpul sangat, tapi bila nak berhenti rasa macam nak tersembam muka.','source_text'=>'>> I don\'t know if they\'re so sharp or so dull, but when you go to stop, you just want to face.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>1029.28,'end_time'=>1030.7,'target_text'=>'Kasut ni tak cukup ketatlah, bro.','source_text'=>'They\'re not tight enough, >> dude.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>1030.8,'end_time'=>1033.82,'target_text'=>'Dah dekat 3 tahun aku tak meluncur ais.','source_text'=>'I have not skated in like 3 years.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>1033.92,'end_time'=>1035.34,'target_text'=>'Kau pula macam mana, bro?','source_text'=>'What about you, >> bro?','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>1035.44,'end_time'=>1037.26,'target_text'=>'Aku rasa dah dekat 5 tahun juga kot.','source_text'=>'It\'s probably been like 5 years.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>1037.36,'end_time'=>1040.2,'target_text'=>'Aku gerak dulu.','source_text'=>'>> I I\'m off.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>1047.2,'end_time'=>1048.06,'target_text'=>'Kasut ni memang tajam.','source_text'=>'These are sharp.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>1048.16,'end_time'=>1050.78,'target_text'=>'Jadi dinding tepi ni dipanggil papan penghadang (boards).','source_text'=>'So, these right here, these are called boards.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>1050.88,'end_time'=>1052.14,'target_text'=>'Papan penghadang gelanggang.','source_text'=>'Boards of a rink.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1052.24,'end_time'=>1057.18,'target_text'=>'Papan ni macam dinding yang dibuat daripada plastik keras sangat.','source_text'=>'The boards like a wall made out of this very hard plastic.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>1057.28,'end_time'=>1063.9,'target_text'=>'Dan ya, biasanya papan kat arena hoki mula-mula warna putih, tapi lepas beberapa tahun jadi hitam legam','source_text'=>'And yeah, usually boards on hockey arenas are completely they\'re white originally, but they\'re completely black after a couple','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>1064,'end_time'=>1067.18,'target_text'=>'sebab selalu kena hentakan puck hoki pada papan tu.','source_text'=>'years because of all the hockey pucks hitting the boards.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>1067.28,'end_time'=>1069.5,'target_text'=>'Tapi apa pendapat korang pasal satu pusingan yang aku buat tadi?','source_text'=>'But what do you guys think of that lap I did?','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>1069.6,'end_time'=>1070.38,'target_text'=>'Pusingan keliling gelanggang tadi.','source_text'=>'That lap around.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>1070.48,'end_time'=>1072.06,'target_text'=>'Aku rasa kau boleh meluncur lagi laju.','source_text'=>'I >> think you can go faster.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>1072.16,'end_time'=>1073.66,'target_text'=>'Ada yang pakai kasut luncur berirama (figure skates).','source_text'=>'>> Some of them have figure skates.','order'=>424],
