            ['start_time'=>75.52,'end_time'=>76.3,'target_text'=>'Macam mana dengan yang ni?','source_text'=>'>> What about this one?','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>76.4,'end_time'=>77.9,'target_text'=>'Itu perisa creme brulee.','source_text'=>'That\'s creme brulee flavor.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>78,'end_time'=>78.86,'target_text'=>'Fuh, sedapnya bro.','source_text'=>'>> Oh my gosh, dude.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>78.96,'end_time'=>79.66,'target_text'=>'Aku nak cuba rasa yang tu.','source_text'=>'I want to try that.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>79.76,'end_time'=>83.42,'target_text'=>'Itu mesti... Macam keropok jagung kot rasa dia.','source_text'=>'>> That would be >> It\'s like a I think it\'s like a corn puff.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>83.52,'end_time'=>86.38,'target_text'=>'Bro, orang Korea ada banyak gila pilihan perisa snek keripik.','source_text'=>'Dude, Koreans have so many flavors of chips.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>86.48,'end_time'=>90.14,'target_text'=>'Bagi aku secara peribadi, pilihan coklat bar diorang tak adalah banyak sangat.','source_text'=>'Like me personally, I don\'t think their chocolate bar selection is that good.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>90.24,'end_time'=>93.5,'target_text'=>'Macam ini jelah pilihan coklat bar yang ada kat situ.','source_text'=>'Like this is all they have for chocolate bars right there.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>93.6,'end_time'=>97.26,'target_text'=>'Aku sendiri rasa macam tak banyak sangat pilihan, tapi pilihan snek keripik diorang memang meriah.','source_text'=>'>> I personally feel like they lack a lot, but their chip selection is very good.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>97.36,'end_time'=>100.3,'target_text'=>'Aku suka macam coklat mentega kacang, tapi tak nampak banyak sangat kat sini.','source_text'=>'>> I like like peanut butter chocolates and I don\'t see much here.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>100.4,'end_time'=>101.34,'target_text'=>'Ya, aku nak... aku teringin nak beli tu.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, I want to I want to get that.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>101.44,'end_time'=>102.3,'target_text'=>'Aku teringin nak rasa coklat Mr.','source_text'=>'I want to try that Mr.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>102.4,'end_time'=>103.5,'target_text'=>'Beast peanut butter cup tu.','source_text'=>'Beast peanut butter cup.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>103.6,'end_time'=>104.46,'target_text'=>'Nampak sedap.','source_text'=>'It looks good.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>104.56,'end_time'=>107.9,'target_text'=>'Kawan-kawan aku selalu beli sosej murah tu, bro.','source_text'=>'My boys would always get the freaking gizzies, bro.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>108,'end_time'=>109.42,'target_text'=>'Daging betul ke tu?','source_text'=>'>> Is that even real meat?','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>109.52,'end_time'=>109.92,'target_text'=>'Entahlah.','source_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>110,'end_time'=>111.02,'target_text'=>'Yang ni sah-sah bukan.','source_text'=>'This is definitely not.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>111.12,'end_time'=>112.62,'target_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, yang ni baru barang sedap.','source_text'=>'Anyways, this is the good stuff right here.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>112.72,'end_time'=>114.46,'target_text'=>'Oh ya, aku ada makan satu semalam.','source_text'=>'Oh yeah, I had one of these yesterday.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>114.56,'end_time'=>120.78,'target_text'=>'Kau boleh beli yang besar, tapi biasanya aku rasa yang kecil lagi sedap sebab yang besar kadang-kadang kering.','source_text'=>'>> You could get the big ones, but usually I find the small ones taste better because the big ones are sometimes dry.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>120.88,'end_time'=>121.66,'target_text'=>'Kau nak satu tak?','source_text'=>'Do you want one of these?','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>121.76,'end_time'=>122.38,'target_text'=>'Tuna mayo.','source_text'=>'Tuna mayo.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>122.48,'end_time'=>124.78,'target_text'=>'Rasa macam aku nak ambil satu kimbap segitiga ni.','source_text'=>'>> I think I\'ll get one of these uh Timups.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>124.88,'end_time'=>126.3,'target_text'=>'Perisa apa yang ada kat sini?','source_text'=>'What flavors do they have here?','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>126.4,'end_time'=>128.06,'target_text'=>'Atau itu gulungan spam?','source_text'=>'Or is that a spam roll?','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>128.16,'end_time'=>128.56,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>128.64,'end_time'=>132.06,'target_text'=>'Okey, mungkin aku ambil tu sebab nampak macam ada spam dengan nasi kan?','source_text'=>'>> Okay, maybe I\'ll get that cuz it looks like spam and then rice, right?','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>132.16,'end_time'=>132.62,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>132.72,'end_time'=>133.42,'target_text'=>'Ya, aku ambil yang tu.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'ll get that.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>133.52,'end_time'=>135.18,'target_text'=>'Dan... kau nak minum apa?','source_text'=>'And uh what are you going to get to drink?','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>135.28,'end_time'=>136.62,'target_text'=>'Aku dah bawa air masak.','source_text'=>'>> I got I brought water.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>136.72,'end_time'=>137.04,'target_text'=>'Okey.','source_text'=>'>> Okay.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>137.04,'end_time'=>138.62,'target_text'=>'Kalau macam tu, aku beli air mineral lah.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, >> I\'m going to buy water then.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>138.72,'end_time'=>140.22,'target_text'=>'Atau sebenarnya, elok aku beli kopi.','source_text'=>'Or actually, maybe I should get a coffee.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>140.32,'end_time'=>141.9,'target_text'=>'Atau kau boleh bancuh campuran susu pisang tu.','source_text'=>'Or you can make that banana milk mixture.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>142,'end_time'=>145.98,'target_text'=>'Kau beli paket kopi kat bahagian belah sana tu.','source_text'=>'You buy you buy one of the coffee pouches like somewhere over there.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>146.08,'end_time'=>147.34,'target_text'=>'Takpelah, aku okey je.','source_text'=>'>> No, I\'m good.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>147.44,'end_time'=>148.46,'target_text'=>'Jom ikut jalan ni.','source_text'=>'Let\'s go this way.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>148.56,'end_time'=>150.54,'target_text'=>'Ada apa-apa lagi kita nak beli kat sini?','source_text'=>'Do we need to get anything else here?','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>150.64,'end_time'=>151.42,'target_text'=>'Tak ada, rasanya tu je.','source_text'=>'>> No, I think that\'s it.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>151.52,'end_time'=>153.1,'target_text'=>'Tapi yang ni paling aku suka kat sini.','source_text'=>'But these are my favorite right here.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>153.2,'end_time'=>154.86,'target_text'=>'Roti Jjon-buns.','source_text'=>'The Jon buns.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>154.96,'end_time'=>155.74,'target_text'=>'Yang ni memang kegemaran aku.','source_text'=>'This one\'s my favorite.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>155.84,'end_time'=>157.66,'target_text'=>'Bukan, bukan untuk... Yon ke yang buat roti tu? Brand diorang ke?','source_text'=>'No, not for >> Does Yon make them?','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>157.76,'end_time'=>158.62,'target_text'=>'Macam jenama diorang ke?','source_text'=>'Like that\'s their brand?','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>158.72,'end_time'=>160.3,'target_text'=>'Jjon ni memang ada produk makanan jenama sendiri. Pelik juga.','source_text'=>'>> Jon just has like branded food.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>160.4,'end_time'=>160.94,'target_text'=>'Pelik sikit.','source_text'=>'It\'s weird.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>161.04,'end_time'=>162.86,'target_text'=>'Rasa macam aku nak ambil salah satu sandwic ni pulalah.','source_text'=>'>> I think I\'m going to get one of these sandwiches instead.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>162.96,'end_time'=>163.74,'target_text'=>'Apa pendapat kau pasal tu?','source_text'=>'What do you think of that?','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>163.84,'end_time'=>165.34,'target_text'=>'Ya, aku tetap nak makan kimbap ni.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'m going to stay with the Kimpop.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>165.44,'end_time'=>167.02,'target_text'=>'Tapi kalau kau nak sandwic, beli jelah.','source_text'=>'But you can get a sandwich if you want.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>167.12,'end_time'=>169.02,'target_text'=>'Bukankah benda tu dipanggil Onigiri?','source_text'=>'>> Isn\'t that called Oniiri?','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>169.12,'end_time'=>170.14,'target_text'=>'Onigiri tu bahasa Jepun.','source_text'=>'Oniiri is Japanese.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>170.24,'end_time'=>170.86,'target_text'=>'Kimbap tu bahasa Korea.','source_text'=>'Kimpab is Korean.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>170.96,'end_time'=>172.7,'target_text'=>'Tapi dua-dua tu lebih kurang sama kan?','source_text'=>'[music] >> But they\'re similar, right?','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>172.8,'end_time'=>173.2,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>173.2,'end_time'=>175.42,'target_text'=>'Nasi bersalut rumpai laut dengan inti kat dalam.','source_text'=>'Seaweed wrapped rice with something inside.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>175.52,'end_time'=>176.06,'target_text'=>'Haa, betul.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>176.16,'end_time'=>177.98,'target_text'=>'Rasanya aku duduk belah sini lah.','source_text'=>'>> I\'ll sit on this side, I guess.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>178.08,'end_time'=>178.54,'target_text'=>'Okey, kawan-kawan.','source_text'=>'>> Okay, guys.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>178.64,'end_time'=>180.06,'target_text'=>'Jadi, ini lah makanan yang kita beli.','source_text'=>'So, this is what we got.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>180.16,'end_time'=>182.06,'target_text'=>'Leon ambil sandwic telur.','source_text'=>'Leon got an egg sandwich.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>182.16,'end_time'=>186.46,'target_text'=>'Aku pula ambil kimbap ramen ni dengan kimbap tuna mayo.','source_text'=>'I got this like ramen kimpop and a tuna mayo.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>186.56,'end_time'=>187.66,'target_text'=>'Aku cukup yakin yang ni tuna mayo.','source_text'=>'I\'m pretty sure it\'s tuna mayo.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>187.76,'end_time'=>190.94,'target_text'=>'Jap, ramen tu guna daging jenis apa kat dalam dia?','source_text'=>'>> Wait, is it What kind of meat does that ramen have in it?','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>191.04,'end_time'=>192.3,'target_text'=>'Entahlah.','source_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>192.4,'end_time'=>193.26,'target_text'=>'Aku rasa daging lembu.','source_text'=>'I think beef.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>193.36,'end_time'=>195.9,'target_text'=>'Dan Leon ambil kimbap daging babi dan sekeping sandwic.','source_text'=>'And Leon got a pork one and a sandwich.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>196,'end_time'=>197.66,'target_text'=>'Jadi, aku dah tahu rasa tuna mayo macam mana.','source_text'=>'So, I know what the tuna may one taste like.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>197.76,'end_time'=>205.42,'target_text'=>'Tuna mayo memang sedap, tapi nak buka dia, kau kena tarik jalur tengah ni ke bawah lepas tu pusing keliling.','source_text'=>'The tuna mayo one is good, but to open it, you have to pull down on that and then pull it all the way around.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>205.52,'end_time'=>206.54,'target_text'=>'Kenapa diorang buat bungkusan macam tu?','source_text'=>'>> Why do they make it like that?','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>206.64,'end_time'=>207.74,'target_text'=>'Supaya senang nak buka.','source_text'=>'>> Just cuz it\'s easy to open it.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>207.84,'end_time'=>210.14,'target_text'=>'Ramai orang selalu silap buka bahagian ni.','source_text'=>'A lot of people mess this part up.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>210.24,'end_time'=>211.42,'target_text'=>'Kau cuma perlu tarik kedua-dua hujung tepi.','source_text'=>'You just have to pull each end.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>211.52,'end_time'=>214.54,'target_text'=>'Sebenarnya, kau nak tahu tak sebab sebenar diorang bungkus macam tu?','source_text'=>'>> Actually, you want to know the real reason why they package it like that?','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>214.64,'end_time'=>218.54,'target_text'=>'Sebab nak asingkan rumpai laut daripada nasi supaya tak lembik berair.','source_text'=>'Because it\'s to keep the seaweed separate from the rice so it doesn\'t get soggy.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>218.64,'end_time'=>219.1,'target_text'=>'Tapi nampak tak?','source_text'=>'>> But you see that?','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>219.2,'end_time'=>221.58,'target_text'=>'Plastik tu terlungsur keluar dengan sangat mudah.','source_text'=>'It just slides out very easily.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>221.68,'end_time'=>222.46,'target_text'=>'Dan tengok tu.','source_text'=>'And look at that.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>222.56,'end_time'=>226.78,'target_text'=>'Ni lapisan rumpai laut dan dalam dia ada nasi.','source_text'=>'This is the seaweed and inside is the rice.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>226.88,'end_time'=>229.48,'target_text'=>'Aku belum pernah rasa perisa yang ni.','source_text'=>'I\'ve never had this flavor.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>229.91,'end_time'=>231.71,'target_text'=>'[Muzik]','source_text'=>'[music]','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>236.96,'end_time'=>237.98,'target_text'=>'Pedas ke?','source_text'=>'>> Spicy.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>238.08,'end_time'=>239.02,'target_text'=>'Tak.','source_text'=>'>> Nope.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>239.12,'end_time'=>241.4,'target_text'=>'Sebenarnya sedap juga.','source_text'=>'It\'s actually good.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>242,'end_time'=>244.86,'target_text'=>'Sejujurnya aku tak pernah tahu pun pasal fungsi asingkan rumpai laut tu.','source_text'=>'I never knew that about the seaweed to be honest.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>244.96,'end_time'=>246.14,'target_text'=>'Tapi masuk akal kan?','source_text'=>'>> But it makes sense, right?','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>246.24,'end_time'=>248.94,'target_text'=>'Ya, memang masuk akal sebab kalau tak nanti rumpai laut jadi lembik.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, it does make sense cuz it would be soggy.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>249.04,'end_time'=>253.66,'target_text'=>'Dan benda yang orang paling suka pasal ni ialah bunyi keropok krup bila gigit.','source_text'=>'And what people love about this is that crunch when you bite it.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>253.76,'end_time'=>256.12,'target_text'=>'Ada rasa rangup bila gigit.','source_text'=>'There\'s like a crunch.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>260,'end_time'=>262.62,'target_text'=>'Restoran kat depan tu, korang mesti boleh tolong carikan untuk aku.','source_text'=>'That restaurant right there, you guys could find it for me.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>262.72,'end_time'=>264.86,'target_text'=>'Kawan aku kata restoran ni pernah masuk dalam drama Korea (K-drama).','source_text'=>'But this was in a Kdrama, my friend said.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>264.96,'end_time'=>266.22,'target_text'=>'Atau tak, kedai yang kat sudut sana tu.','source_text'=>'Or no, that one on the corner there.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>266.32,'end_time'=>268.06,'target_text'=>'Salah satu daripada dua kedai ni.','source_text'=>'One of these two.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>268.16,'end_time'=>269.58,'target_text'=>'Apa benda tu?','source_text'=>'What is that?','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>269.68,'end_time'=>271.26,'target_text'=>'Apa benda...','source_text'=>'>> What\'s','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>271.36,'end_time'=>273.1,'target_text'=>'macam bas sekolah budak-budak ke?','source_text'=>'>> like a kid school bus?','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>273.2,'end_time'=>275.42,'target_text'=>'Okey, kita dah jumpa dari drama Korea mana kedai ni datang.','source_text'=>'Okay, so we found which Kdrama it\'s from.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>275.52,'end_time'=>276.22,'target_text'=>'Daripada drama yang ni.','source_text'=>'It\'s from this one.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>276.32,'end_time'=>278.94,'target_text'=>'Aku tak pernah... Sebenarnya aku tak tengok K-drama sangat, jadi aku tak tahu.','source_text'=>'I\'ve never Well, actually, I don\'t watch K drama, so I don\'t know.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>279.04,'end_time'=>280.84,'target_text'=>'Tapi...','source_text'=>'But','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>282.88,'end_time'=>284.94,'target_text'=>'jadi kalau korang pernah tengok drama tu, bagitahu lah aku.','source_text'=>'>> so if you guys have watched that, let me know.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>285.04,'end_time'=>286.54,'target_text'=>'Aku sendiri tak pernah tengok.','source_text'=>'I\'ve never watched it.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>286.64,'end_time'=>288.94,'target_text'=>'Ini Jalan Hongdae.','source_text'=>'This is Hung Day Street.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>289.04,'end_time'=>292.94,'target_text'=>'Masa kali terakhir aku datang sini dulu, restoran kat depan tu dengan kedai sushi tu belum ada lagi.','source_text'=>'Last time I was here, that restaurant right there and the sushi one was not there.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>293.04,'end_time'=>296.38,'target_text'=>'Kedai burger paling sedap pada pandangan aku ialah Burgery.','source_text'=>'The best burger place I found in my opinion is Burgery.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>296.48,'end_time'=>298.3,'target_text'=>'Nanti bila-bila ada masa kita pergi makan kat Burgery.','source_text'=>'So one of these days we\'ll go to Burgery.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>298.4,'end_time'=>302.78,'target_text'=>'Rasa macam ada satu cawangan kat Hongdae dan satu lagi kat Sinchon, tapi Burgery memang paling terbaik sejujurnya.','source_text'=>'I think there\'s one at Hung Day and there\'s one in Cchan, but Burgery is like the best honest.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>302.88,'end_time'=>305.02,'target_text'=>'Oh, nama dia macam tiru jenama Burberry ke?','source_text'=>'>> Oh, is it like a play on words of Burberry?','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>305.12,'end_time'=>305.66,'target_text'=>'Aku tak pasti.','source_text'=>'>> I\'m not I\'m not sure.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>305.76,'end_time'=>306.7,'target_text'=>'Kau tahu kan jenama Burberry?','source_text'=>'>> You know the Burberry brand?','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>306.8,'end_time'=>307.12,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>307.12,'end_time'=>309.74,'target_text'=>'Kawan-kawan aku yang cadangkan kat aku, diorang kata, \"Pergilah Burger tu.\"','source_text'=>'And my friends recommended to me and they said, \"Oh, go to Burger.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>309.84,'end_time'=>315.34,'target_text'=>'\"Tu paling padu.\" Padahal aku rasa burger dengan makanan segera kat Korea biasa-biasa je, tapi ya ampun bro.','source_text'=>'It\'s like the best.\" And I\'m like, I find the burgers and fast food in Korea like not my favorite, but oh my gosh, bro.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>315.44,'end_time'=>319.02,'target_text'=>'Aku makan kat situ 3 hari berturut-turut, sarapan, makan tengah hari, dengan makan malam.','source_text'=>'I went there for like 3 days straight, like breakfast, lunch, and dinner.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>319.12,'end_time'=>320.06,'target_text'=>'Sedap gila kot.','source_text'=>'It was so good.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>320.16,'end_time'=>323.26,'target_text'=>'Maksud aku, makan tengah hari dengan makan malam je, sarapan taklah, tapi memang sedap sangat.','source_text'=>'I mean, just lunch and dinner, not breakfast, but it it was really good.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>323.36,'end_time'=>324.14,'target_text'=>'Aku suka sangat.','source_text'=>'I liked it.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>324.24,'end_time'=>326.78,'target_text'=>'Apa lagi benda kau nak cuba alang-alang dah balik sini?','source_text'=>'>> What else do you want to try now that you\'re back?','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>326.88,'end_time'=>331.58,'target_text'=>'Untuk makan malam nanti kita nak makan Jjimdak sebab tu memang kegemaran aku kat Sinchon.','source_text'=>'>> Well, for dinner, uh, we\'re going to have Jim Duck cuz that\'s like my favorite inch.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>331.68,'end_time'=>334.06,'target_text'=>'Aku nak rasa ayam goreng Korea dulu.','source_text'=>'>> I want to try the Korean fried chicken first.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>334.16,'end_time'=>335.98,'target_text'=>'Jadi, kau rasa kedai mana patut kita pergi?','source_text'=>'So, where do you think we should go for that?','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>336.08,'end_time'=>341.02,'target_text'=>'Kalau kita bercakap pasal rangkaian ayam goreng Korea yang terkenal, bukan kedai biasa-biasa, tapi kedai francais.','source_text'=>'If we\'re talking about Korean fried chicken chains, like not like individual restaurants, but chains.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>341.12,'end_time'=>343.42,'target_text'=>'Ramai orang kata ayam goreng BBQ Chicken tu paling sedap.','source_text'=>'A lot of people say BBQ chicken\'s like the best.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>343.52,'end_time'=>346.86,'target_text'=>'Tapi apa... itu macam kedai kecantikan Korea.','source_text'=>'But what is going That\'s like some Korean beauty stuff.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>346.96,'end_time'=>348.06,'target_text'=>'Bukan ke semua kedai macam tu?','source_text'=>'>> Isn\'t that all of them?','order'=>163],
