            ['start_time'=>612,'end_time'=>613.18,'target_text'=>'Ya, saiz tu sama macam saiz yang aku ada.','source_text'=>'Yeah, that\'s with the size I have.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>613.28,'end_time'=>614.14,'target_text'=>'Jadi... okey.','source_text'=>'So, >> okay.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>614.24,'end_time'=>620.12,'target_text'=>'Sebenarnya aku dah belajar cara sebut perkataan Korea dan ni memang disebut \"babal\".','source_text'=>'Actually, I learned how to like pronounce Korean and this is literally pronounced basal.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>624.16,'end_time'=>625.58,'target_text'=>'Tadi kau kata kau nak selipar kan?','source_text'=>'>> Did you say you wanted slippers?','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>625.68,'end_time'=>627.5,'target_text'=>'Ya, elok juga kalau aku beli sepasang.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, I probably should get one.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>627.6,'end_time'=>629.02,'target_text'=>'Selipar ni nampak elok juga.','source_text'=>'These ones look good though.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>629.12,'end_time'=>634.7,'target_text'=>'Tapak dia tebal bertingkat, tapi aku lebih suka jenis yang tertutup kat bawah supaya air tak terpercik masuk.','source_text'=>'They\'re like platformed up, but I prefer ones that would be closed at the bottom so that water doesn\'t come up.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>634.8,'end_time'=>635.26,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>635.36,'end_time'=>636.54,'target_text'=>'Oh, tapi yang ni saiz kecil.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, these are small though.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>636.64,'end_time'=>637.98,'target_text'=>'Kecik sangat yang ni.','source_text'=>'These are super small.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>638.08,'end_time'=>639.98,'target_text'=>'Aku rasa kaki aku tak muat ni.','source_text'=>'I don\'t think my feet would fit in these.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>640.08,'end_time'=>643.5,'target_text'=>'Okey, aku nak cuba sarung dulu nak pastikan muat dengan kaki aku.','source_text'=>'Okay, I\'m going to try these on to make sure they fit my feet.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>643.6,'end_time'=>644.22,'target_text'=>'Oh ya.','source_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>644.32,'end_time'=>645.1,'target_text'=>'Muat elok sangat.','source_text'=>'Perfect fit.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>645.2,'end_time'=>647.66,'target_text'=>'Saiz dia besar dan tapak tebal.','source_text'=>'And they\'re big and platformed.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>647.76,'end_time'=>653.02,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku boleh guna dalam bilik air atau guna masa masuk tandas tanpa stoking aku basah.','source_text'=>'So, I can use these in the shower or I can use these in the washroom and my socks won\'t get wet.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>653.12,'end_time'=>654.62,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku ambil yang ni.','source_text'=>'So, I\'ll take those.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>654.72,'end_time'=>657.48,'target_text'=>'Selipar tu.','source_text'=>'Those slippers.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>659.28,'end_time'=>660.7,'target_text'=>'Aku baru je bayar semua barang ni.','source_text'=>'I just paid for all this stuff.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>660.8,'end_time'=>663.66,'target_text'=>'Kalau kira banyak mana barang kita beli tadi, berapa kau bayar?','source_text'=>'Considering the amount we bought, >> how much did you pay?','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>663.76,'end_time'=>664.94,'target_text'=>'Tak mahal sangat pun.','source_text'=>'>> It wasn\'t that much.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>665.04,'end_time'=>671.34,'target_text'=>'Aku bayar 26 dolar Kanada atau 26,000 won.','source_text'=>'I paid 26 Canadian or 26,0001.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>671.44,'end_time'=>673.5,'target_text'=>'Jadi sejujurnya tak banyak mana.','source_text'=>'So, honestly, not that much.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>673.6,'end_time'=>676.54,'target_text'=>'Dapat satu beg penuh, beg besar isi macam-macam barang.','source_text'=>'Like, it\'s actually a whole bag, a large bag of stuff.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>676.64,'end_time'=>679.98,'target_text'=>'Kita belum beli tisu tandas dengan sabun buku aku.','source_text'=>'We didn\'t get toilet paper and my bar of soap.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>680.08,'end_time'=>682.14,'target_text'=>'Jadi dua benda tu aku masih perlukan.','source_text'=>'So, those are two things I still need.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>682.24,'end_time'=>683.42,'target_text'=>'Tapi selain daripada tu, semua dah dapat.','source_text'=>'But besides that, we got everything.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>683.52,'end_time'=>685.34,'target_text'=>'Patut ke kita pergi daftar pelan telefon sekarang?','source_text'=>'Should we go to get the phone plan now?','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>685.44,'end_time'=>689.74,'target_text'=>'Ya, jom kita pergi kedai harimau tu dulu lepas tu baru pergi daftar pelan telefon, rasanya.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, >> let\'s go to the tiger place first and then we\'ll go get the phone plan, I think.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>689.84,'end_time'=>690.08,'target_text'=>'Okey.','source_text'=>'Okay.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>690.08,'end_time'=>692.14,'target_text'=>'Jadi kita nak pergi tengok kasut tu.','source_text'=>'So, we\'re going to go check out those shoes.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>692.24,'end_time'=>693.58,'target_text'=>'Macam mana sebut nama tu ek?','source_text'=>'How do you How do you say that name?','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>693.68,'end_time'=>694.46,'target_text'=>'Oni.','source_text'=>'Un.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>694.56,'end_time'=>697.9,'target_text'=>'Dan dari dulu lagi aku teringin nak beli sepasang kasut ni.','source_text'=>'And I\'ve always wanted to buy a pair of these shoes.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>698,'end_time'=>699.66,'target_text'=>'Onitsuka Tiger.','source_text'=>'Giri Tiger.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>699.76,'end_time'=>700.16,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'Yeah.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>700.16,'end_time'=>700.86,'target_text'=>'Entahlah.','source_text'=>'I don\'t know.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>700.96,'end_time'=>704.3,'target_text'=>'Rasa macam salah sebut je, jadi aku tak sebut lagilah nama tu.','source_text'=>'Feel like I\'m offending someone, so I won\'t say that name anymore.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>704.4,'end_time'=>705.5,'target_text'=>'Ni jenis yang Kill Bill pakai tu.','source_text'=>'These are the Kill Bill ones.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>705.6,'end_time'=>706.78,'target_text'=>'Tak, aku tertanya-tanya berapa harga dia.','source_text'=>'No, I wonder how much they are.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>706.88,'end_time'=>707.42,'target_text'=>'Tak tipulah.','source_text'=>'Not going to lie.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>707.52,'end_time'=>709.34,'target_text'=>'Lepas tu yang lain aku tak berapa minat sangat.','source_text'=>'And then I don\'t like them too much.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>709.44,'end_time'=>711.02,'target_text'=>'Aku suka rekaan yang aku baru sentuh tadi.','source_text'=>'I like that design I just touched.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>711.12,'end_time'=>714.2,'target_text'=>'Rekaan yang ni, biasa-biasa je.','source_text'=>'These designs, not so much.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>714.48,'end_time'=>717.18,'target_text'=>'Itu krim pelindung matahari (sunscreen) yang aku beli untuk mak aku.','source_text'=>'That\'s the sunscreen I bought for mom.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>717.28,'end_time'=>719.34,'target_text'=>'Urutan badan.','source_text'=>'>> Boy massage.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>719.44,'end_time'=>722.04,'target_text'=>'Oh, kat situ tulis perkataan badan (body).','source_text'=>'Oh, >> there it says body.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>724,'end_time'=>727.1,'target_text'=>'Tempat duduk ni dikhaskan untuk wanita kan?','source_text'=>'This position is reserved for ladies, is it not?','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>727.2,'end_time'=>728.78,'target_text'=>'Perisa keju dan jagung.','source_text'=>'>> Cheese and corn flavor.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>728.88,'end_time'=>729.74,'target_text'=>'Sedap gila tu bro.','source_text'=>'>> That\'d be fire, dude.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>729.84,'end_time'=>731.26,'target_text'=>'Keju parmesan.','source_text'=>'It\'s parmesan cheese.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>731.36,'end_time'=>733.18,'target_text'=>'Tak, itu daripada jenama BBQ Chicken.','source_text'=>'>> No, that\'s from barbecue chicken.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>733.28,'end_time'=>735.18,'target_text'=>'Kat sini, diorang panggil persembahan jalanan (busking).','source_text'=>'Uh right here, they call it busking.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>735.28,'end_time'=>737.1,'target_text'=>'Dan diorang buat persembahan kat merata tempat.','source_text'=>'And they perform like here and there.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>737.2,'end_time'=>740.86,'target_text'=>'Sepanjang jalan ni, Jalan Hongdae, memang ada aktiviti busking.','source_text'=>'All along this this street, Hungai Street, there\'s there\'s busking.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>740.96,'end_time'=>744.3,'target_text'=>'Waktu malam diorang buat persembahan macam menyanyi atau menari.','source_text'=>'That\'s when they just perform at night like sing or dance.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>744.4,'end_time'=>745.82,'target_text'=>'Diorang main alat muzik.','source_text'=>'They play instruments.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>745.92,'end_time'=>748.54,'target_text'=>'Kadang-kadang secara berkumpulan, kadang-kadang solo seorang diri.','source_text'=>'Sometimes it\'s a group of people, sometimes it\'s just one person.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>748.64,'end_time'=>754.46,'target_text'=>'Sekarang kita nak naik ke Chingu Mobile nak ambil pelan telefon supaya ada kuota internet masa kat Korea.','source_text'=>'So, we\'re going to go up right now to Chingu Mobile and get a phone plan so we can have data while we\'re in Korea.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>754.56,'end_time'=>758.44,'target_text'=>'Kita nak ambil SIM prabayar untuk tempoh sebulan kot.','source_text'=>'We\'re going to get the prepaid SIM probably for a month.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>759.68,'end_time'=>763.74,'target_text'=>'Kita baru je beli pelan telefon, atau pelan data internet.','source_text'=>'We just bought our phone plan, a data plan or a phone plan you can call it.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>763.84,'end_time'=>768.78,'target_text'=>'Bila kita langgan pelan data, ada panggilan dan ada mesej teks sekali.','source_text'=>'That\'s just when you get like either data or data and calling or data calling and text messages.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>768.88,'end_time'=>770.14,'target_text'=>'Jadi itulah pelan yang kita baru beli.','source_text'=>'So, that\'s what we just bought.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>770.24,'end_time'=>773.66,'target_text'=>'Harga dia 30,000 won untuk 30 hari.','source_text'=>'It was 30,0001 for 30 days.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>773.76,'end_time'=>775.66,'target_text'=>'Kira-kira dalam 20 USD.','source_text'=>'So, that\'s around 20 USD.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>775.76,'end_time'=>781.58,'target_text'=>'Kita sekarang ada kat Hongdae macam korang nampak, tapi kita nak balik tempat penginapan nak letak semua barang ni.','source_text'=>'We\'re in home day right now as you can see, but we\'re gonna head back to our accommodation to drop off all our stuff.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>781.68,'end_time'=>783.02,'target_text'=>'Makanan ni mesti buat aku gemuk nanti.','source_text'=>'This is gonna make me fat.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>783.12,'end_time'=>785.34,'target_text'=>'Ya, aku macam... Bro, 6,500 won.','source_text'=>'Yeah, I kind Dude, 6,500.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>785.44,'end_time'=>786.14,'target_text'=>'Aku tak tahu pun.','source_text'=>'I don\'t even know.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>786.24,'end_time'=>788.54,'target_text'=>'Siapa-siapa tolong bagitahu kat ruangan komen apa maksud tulisan ni.','source_text'=>'Someone let me know what this says in the comments.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>788.64,'end_time'=>791.74,'target_text'=>'Sekarang kita tengah beli tisu tandas.','source_text'=>'So, we\'re buying uh toilet paper right now.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>791.84,'end_time'=>799.34,'target_text'=>'Ada banyak pek gulungan tisu tandas, dan aku nak ambil pek isi enam gulung ni sebab kita perlukan kat bilik.','source_text'=>'So, there are a bunch of packets of roll toilet paper, and I\'m going to get this six-pack of toilet paper because we need','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>799.44,'end_time'=>800.78,'target_text'=>'untuk tempat penginapan kita.','source_text'=>'it for our accommodation.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>800.88,'end_time'=>802.7,'target_text'=>'Lagipun kita cuma tinggal kat sini selama sebulan.','source_text'=>'And we\'re only going to be staying there for one month.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>802.8,'end_time'=>808.14,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku rasa tiga gulung seorang dah lebih daripada cukup sebab takkanlah guna segulung seminggu.','source_text'=>'So, I think three each is more than enough because I don\'t think we\'ll be using one roll a week.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>808.24,'end_time'=>811.1,'target_text'=>'Kat sini ada sebuah peti sejuk besar.','source_text'=>'This is right here a big refrigerator.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>811.2,'end_time'=>813.34,'target_text'=>'Peti ni berfungsi untuk sejukkan semua makanan ni.','source_text'=>'So, this just keeps all this food cool.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>813.44,'end_time'=>814.38,'target_text'=>'Bukan peti beku (freezer).','source_text'=>'It\'s not a freezer.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>814.48,'end_time'=>817.1,'target_text'=>'Dia tak bekukan makanan, cuma kekalkan suhu sejuk je.','source_text'=>'It doesn\'t freeze it, but it just keeps it cool.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>817.2,'end_time'=>821.5,'target_text'=>'Jom kita pergi ke kaunter pembayaran dan bayar... Oh, herba Ginseng.','source_text'=>'Let\'s go to the checkout counter and check out Oh, Jinseng.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>821.6,'end_time'=>823.1,'target_text'=>'Apa fungsi benda tu?','source_text'=>'>> What does that do?','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>823.2,'end_time'=>823.66,'target_text'=>'Tak ada apa-apa.','source_text'=>'>> Nothing.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>823.76,'end_time'=>825.88,'target_text'=>'Aku rasa...','source_text'=>'I think','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>826.88,'end_time'=>831.34,'target_text'=>'kita nak masuk kedai Olive Young empat tingkat ni: satu, dua, tiga, empat tingkat.','source_text'=>'we\'re going to go in this one, two, three, four, fourtory Olive Young.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>831.44,'end_time'=>834.7,'target_text'=>'Padahal aku cuma perlukan sebuku sabun je, macam melampau pula masuk kedai besar macam ni semata-mata nak beli sabun.','source_text'=>'And I just need a bar of soap, but that feels like overkill for what I need.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>834.8,'end_time'=>837.32,'target_text'=>'Tapi jomlah kita masuk.','source_text'=>'But let\'s go in.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>838,'end_time'=>844.06,'target_text'=>'Kalau korang serius nak belajar bahasa Inggeris dan nak latih pertuturan, jenguk Patreon aku kat ruangan penerangan.','source_text'=>'If you guys are serious about learning English and you want to practice your speaking, then check out my Patreon in the description.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>844.16,'end_time'=>850.1,'target_text'=>'Aku muat naik tiga video baharu setiap minggu untuk bantu korang asah sebutan, loghat, dan paling penting, keyakinan diri','source_text'=>'I post three new videos a week that help you practice your pronunciation, your accent, and most importantly, your confidence','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>850.2,'end_time'=>851.42,'target_text'=>'semasa bertutur dalam bahasa Inggeris.','source_text'=>'[music] when speaking English.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>851.52,'end_time'=>855.02,'target_text'=>'Jadi, kalau korang nak mantapkan bahasa Inggeris korang, layari Patreon aku kat penerangan.','source_text'=>'So, if you guys want to improve your English, check out my Patreon in the description.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>855.12,'end_time'=>855.82,'target_text'=>'Jumpa korang kat sana nanti.','source_text'=>'I\'ll see you guys there.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>855.92,'end_time'=>858.06,'target_text'=>'Kita baru je balik lepas habiskan satu pagi membeli-belah.','source_text'=>'We just got back from the whole morning of shopping.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>858.16,'end_time'=>859.5,'target_text'=>'Ini semua barang yang kita beli tadi.','source_text'=>'This is all our shopping right here.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>859.6,'end_time'=>865.5,'target_text'=>'Mula-mula kita singgah Daiso, lepas tu beli pelan telefon, lepas tu beli tisu tandas, dan akhir sekali pergi Olive Young.','source_text'=>'We first stopped at Daiso and then got our phone plan and then got toilet paper and then we went to Olive Young.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>865.6,'end_time'=>867.4,'target_text'=>'Jadi,','source_text'=>'So,','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>868.4,'end_time'=>877.58,'target_text'=>'tisu tandas ni, selipar aku, dan selebihnya tuala, plastik sampah, dan barang-barang keperluan lain.','source_text'=>'this toilet paper, my slippers, and then the rest is just towels, garbage bags, and just other miscellaneous items.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>877.68,'end_time'=>880.92,'target_text'=>'Dan ini resit pembelian dia.','source_text'=>'And this is the receipt.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>882.64,'end_time'=>886.78,'target_text'=>'Aku tak pernah makan coklat bar Feastables sebelum ni, dan aku tahu ni jenama MrBeast.','source_text'=>'So, I\'ve never had a Fastable Chocolate Bar before, and I know this is Mr.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>886.88,'end_time'=>887.66,'target_text'=>'jenama MrBeast.','source_text'=>'Beast\'s brand.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>887.76,'end_time'=>889.5,'target_text'=>'Aku yakin korang semua kenal siapa dia.','source_text'=>'I\'m sure you guys all know who that is.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>889.6,'end_time'=>891.18,'target_text'=>'Diorang cuma ada perisa mentega kacang je.','source_text'=>'They only had the peanut butter flavor.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>891.28,'end_time'=>892.78,'target_text'=>'Aku tak berapa minat sangat mentega kacang.','source_text'=>'I\'m not a huge fan of peanut butter.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>892.88,'end_time'=>898.06,'target_text'=>'Aku lebih suka jenis peanut butter cups, tapi aku nak cuba rasa yang ni dan beritahu korang macam mana rasa dia.','source_text'=>'I would prefer the peanut butter cups, but I\'m going to try this one and tell you guys how it is.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>898.16,'end_time'=>903.32,'target_text'=>'Aku akan terangkan rasa dia sebaik mungkin.','source_text'=>'I\'ll describe the flavor to the best of my abilities.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>905.44,'end_time'=>910.2,'target_text'=>'Rasa macam coklat ni dah patah dua masa aku jalan tadi.','source_text'=>'I think I broke it in half accidentally on the way there walking.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>910.48,'end_time'=>913.74,'target_text'=>'Okey, jom kita patahkan.','source_text'=>'Okay, let\'s break it.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>913.84,'end_time'=>915.26,'target_text'=>'Bila pegang rasa licin lembut sangat kat tangan.','source_text'=>'It feels very smooth in my hands.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>915.36,'end_time'=>916.94,'target_text'=>'Macam tengah mencair je.','source_text'=>'Like it\'s just melting.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>917.04,'end_time'=>918.7,'target_text'=>'Tapi... jom kita rasa.','source_text'=>'But uh let\'s try it.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>918.8,'end_time'=>922.68,'target_text'=>'Bau dia memang sebiji bau mentega kacang semata-mata.','source_text'=>'It smells like just straight up peanut butter.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>923.76,'end_time'=>929.18,'target_text'=>'Harga asal coklat ni 6,500 won, tapi kita dapat bayar 1,500 won je.','source_text'=>'Original price of this 6,500 one, but we paid 1,500.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>929.28,'end_time'=>931.42,'target_text'=>'Kira tawaran yang jimat sangatlah tu.','source_text'=>'So that was a good deal.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>931.52,'end_time'=>933.34,'target_text'=>'Dan... rasa dia boleh tahan sedap.','source_text'=>'And uh it\'s pretty good.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>933.44,'end_time'=>936.14,'target_text'=>'Rasa mentega kacang dia tak adalah kuat sangat.','source_text'=>'Like there\'s not really a strong peanut butter flavor.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>936.24,'end_time'=>939.42,'target_text'=>'Tak terlalu kuat, tapi masih terasa mentega kacang tu.','source_text'=>'It\'s not very strong, but you can taste the peanut butter.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>939.52,'end_time'=>940.54,'target_text'=>'Rasa coklat pun terasa juga.','source_text'=>'You can taste the chocolate.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>940.64,'end_time'=>941.5,'target_text'=>'Jadi kira okeylah rasa dia.','source_text'=>'So, it\'s pretty good.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>941.6,'end_time'=>944.38,'target_text'=>'Tak adalah hebat luar biasa sangat, tapi tak ada lah teruk pun.','source_text'=>'Like, it\'s not like amazing, but it\'s not terrible.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>944.48,'end_time'=>946.7,'target_text'=>'Rasa macam coklat bar biasa je.','source_text'=>'It\'s just tastes like a normal chocolate bar.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>946.8,'end_time'=>947.82,'target_text'=>'Aku nak makan lagi tak lepas ni?','source_text'=>'Would I eat this again?','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>947.92,'end_time'=>948.62,'target_text'=>'Rasa macam nak juga kot.','source_text'=>'Yeah, I probably would.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>948.72,'end_time'=>952.54,'target_text'=>'Tapi aku nak cuba perisa lain pula, sebab aku dengar orang kata perisa karamel sedap.','source_text'=>'I want to try the other flavors though, cuz I heard people like the caramel flavor.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>952.64,'end_time'=>956.3,'target_text'=>'Ada orang sebut \"karemel\", ada orang sebut \"karamel\".','source_text'=>'They say, by the way, some people say caramel, some people say caramel.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>956.4,'end_time'=>961.1,'target_text'=>'Suka hati koranglah nak sebut macam mana, tapi kebanyakan orang aku tengok sebut karamel.','source_text'=>'You can say it how you want, but I found majority of people say caramel.','order'=>414],
