            ['start_time'=>288.88,'end_time'=>291.9,'target_text'=>'Yang ni baju lengan panjang.','source_text'=>'This right here, this is a long sleeve.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>292,'end_time'=>293.5,'target_text'=>'Baju lengan panjang.','source_text'=>'A long sleeve.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>293.6,'end_time'=>296.46,'target_text'=>'Yang ni pula baju lengan pendek.','source_text'=>'This right here is a short sleeve.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>296.56,'end_time'=>297.98,'target_text'=>'Baju lengan pendek.','source_text'=>'A short sleeve.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>298.08,'end_time'=>300.54,'target_text'=>'Dan yang ni baju-T (t-shirt).','source_text'=>'And this is a t-shirt.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>300.64,'end_time'=>310.06,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku kena tapis dan pilih baju-baju aku ni, mana yang nak bawa dan mana yang nak tinggal sebab takkanlah nak bawa semua','source_text'=>'So, I do have to sort through my clothes here to see what I want to take and what I want to leave because I can\'t bring everything','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>310.16,'end_time'=>311.98,'target_text'=>'pergi ke Korea.','source_text'=>'with me to Korea.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>312.08,'end_time'=>320.7,'target_text'=>'Dan aku kena beringat juga yang cuaca kat Korea nanti sejuk masa aku pergi, sebab aku pergi hujung bulan November dan masa tu','source_text'=>'And I also have to remember it\'s going to be cold in Korea when I go because I\'ll be going at the end of November and it will','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>320.8,'end_time'=>322.86,'target_text'=>'cuaca kat sana memang sejuk.','source_text'=>'be cold there when I go.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>322.96,'end_time'=>325.02,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku kena ambil kira hal tu juga.','source_text'=>'So, I also have to keep that in mind.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>325.12,'end_time'=>331.58,'target_text'=>'Tapi aku akan pergi ke negara Asia lain juga macam Vietnam, Thailand, dan kat sana cuaca jauh lebih panas.','source_text'=>'But also, I\'ll be going to other Asian countries like Vietnam, Thailand, and there it\'s a lot warmer.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>331.68,'end_time'=>336.06,'target_text'=>'Aku kena ambil kira perkara tu masa tengah kemas beg ni.','source_text'=>'I need to take that into account when I\'m packing my bags.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>336.16,'end_time'=>340.94,'target_text'=>'Kena ambil kira kedua-dua cuaca panas dan cuaca sejuk.','source_text'=>'I have to take into account the warm weather and the cold weather.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>341.04,'end_time'=>345.24,'target_text'=>'Benda ni pula kawan-kawan, korang boleh teka tak apa dia?','source_text'=>'This right here, you guys, can you guess what this is?','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>348.96,'end_time'=>351.58,'target_text'=>'Ni tuala mikrofiber (microfiber towel).','source_text'=>'This is a microfiber towel.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>351.68,'end_time'=>357.48,'target_text'=>'Tuala ni memang elok sangat untuk melancong sebab boleh lipat sampai jadi saiz kecil gila.','source_text'=>'So, this is great for traveling because it folds into a very small shape.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>357.84,'end_time'=>359.66,'target_text'=>'Korang nampak kan?','source_text'=>'You see?','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>359.76,'end_time'=>364.46,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku dapat tuala saiz penuh dalam bentuk padat yang sangat kecil.','source_text'=>'So, I get a full towel in a very small compact shape.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>364.56,'end_time'=>366.38,'target_text'=>'Ni baju tanpa lengan (muscle shirt / singlet).','source_text'=>'This is a muscle shirt.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>366.48,'end_time'=>367.74,'target_text'=>'Baju singlet tanpa lengan.','source_text'=>'A muscle shirt.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>367.84,'end_time'=>370.46,'target_text'=>'Aku beli baju ni masa kat Thailand dulu.','source_text'=>'I got this from Thailand.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>370.56,'end_time'=>372.86,'target_text'=>'Dan kat sini ada beberapa pasang stoking.','source_text'=>'And then here we have some socks.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>372.96,'end_time'=>376.94,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku cuma bawa beberapa pasang stoking sekali.','source_text'=>'So, I\'m just going to bring a couple pairs of socks with me as well.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>377.04,'end_time'=>380.14,'target_text'=>'Okey, rasanya kebanyakan barang dari almari dah ambil dah.','source_text'=>'Okay, I think we got most of the stuff from the closet.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>380.24,'end_time'=>380.64,'target_text'=>'pun.','source_text'=>'though.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>380.64,'end_time'=>384.68,'target_text'=>'Sekarang aku nak bawa barang-barang ni ke sana dekat beg pakaian aku.','source_text'=>'Now I\'m going to bring it over there to my suitcases.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>384.96,'end_time'=>388.14,'target_text'=>'Okey, jadi aku letak baju-baju aku kat sini dulu.','source_text'=>'Okay, so I\'ll put my clothes down right here.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>388.24,'end_time'=>391.26,'target_text'=>'Dan sekarang jom kita mula masukkan barang dalam beg.','source_text'=>'And now let\'s start packing my bag.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>391.36,'end_time'=>393.42,'target_text'=>'Beg pakaian besar aku ada kat sini.','source_text'=>'I have my large suitcase right here.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>393.52,'end_time'=>396.3,'target_text'=>'Aku kena daftarkan beg pakaian ni memandangkan aku baru je beli.','source_text'=>'I need to register my suitcase since I just bought it.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>396.4,'end_time'=>398.06,'target_text'=>'Ni kad jaminan waranti dia.','source_text'=>'So this is a warranty card.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>398.16,'end_time'=>403.66,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku kena daftar, kalau apa-apa jadi kat beg ni nanti, bagasi aku ada waranti jaminan.','source_text'=>'So I need to register it and if anything ever happens, then I have a warranty on my luggage.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>403.76,'end_time'=>405.82,'target_text'=>'Bagasi aku ada kat sini.','source_text'=>'I have my luggage here.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>405.92,'end_time'=>407.66,'target_text'=>'Elok juga kalau aku letak AirTag dalam beg ni.','source_text'=>'I should probably put an Air Tag in here.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>407.76,'end_time'=>408.62,'target_text'=>'Nantilah aku buat benda tu.','source_text'=>'I\'ll do that later.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>408.72,'end_time'=>410.7,'target_text'=>'Aku baru je selesai daftar produk beg ni.','source_text'=>'I just registered my product.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>410.8,'end_time'=>414.22,'target_text'=>'Ni kali pertama aku tengok beg pakaian yang kedua-dua belah bahagian ada zip.','source_text'=>'This first time I\'ve seen a suitcase with each side having a zipper.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>414.32,'end_time'=>418.94,'target_text'=>'Dan sekarang aku kena basuh semua baju ni dulu','source_text'=>'And now I have to wash all this clothes first','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>419.04,'end_time'=>421.58,'target_text'=>'sebab baju yang aku nak masukkan dalam beg ni kotor.','source_text'=>'because the clothes I need to pack in here are dirty.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>421.68,'end_time'=>423.42,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku kena cuci dulu.','source_text'=>'So I need to wash this.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>423.52,'end_time'=>425.26,'target_text'=>'Tapi aku boleh mula kemas barang ni buat masa sekarang.','source_text'=>'But I can start packing this for now.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>425.36,'end_time'=>429.66,'target_text'=>'Yang ni sehelai seluar pendek.','source_text'=>'So this right here is a pair of shorts.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>429.76,'end_time'=>431.42,'target_text'=>'Ni seluar pendek.','source_text'=>'This is a pair of shorts.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>431.52,'end_time'=>434.06,'target_text'=>'Aku tak ada banyak sangat seluar pendek.','source_text'=>'I don\'t really have a lot of shorts.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>434.16,'end_time'=>438.46,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku sebenarnya cuma ada macam dua helai je seluar pendek, tak banyak mana pun.','source_text'=>'So, I really only have like two pairs of shorts, which is not a lot.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>438.56,'end_time'=>440.54,'target_text'=>'Ni baju-T pertama aku.','source_text'=>'This is my first t-shirt.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>440.64,'end_time'=>447.18,'target_text'=>'Sejujurnya dengan korang, aku tak berapa pasti apa lagi nak kemas sebab maklumlah, ada had berat penerbangan dan sekatan berat','source_text'=>'To be honest with you guys, I\'m not really sure what I\'m going to be packing cuz, you know, there\'s weight limits and weight','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>447.28,'end_time'=>448.14,'target_text'=>'bagasi.','source_text'=>'restrictions.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>448.24,'end_time'=>453.32,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku tak berapa pasti barang apa yang nak dimasukkan dalam ni.','source_text'=>'So, I\'m not too sure what I\'m going to be packing in here.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>453.44,'end_time'=>459.9,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku rasa sekarang aku nak pergi campak baju kotor ni dalam mesin basuh supaya bersih bila aku kemas masuk','source_text'=>'So, I think right now I\'m going to go throw this clothes in the washer so I could have it clean when I pack it away inside','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>460,'end_time'=>460.86,'target_text'=>'ke dalam beg pakaian aku.','source_text'=>'my suitcase.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>460.96,'end_time'=>462.7,'target_text'=>'Jom kita pergi basuh baju ni dulu.','source_text'=>'So, let\'s go wash this.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>462.8,'end_time'=>465.5,'target_text'=>'Selamat datang kawan-kawan ke bilik dobi mencuci aku.','source_text'=>'Welcome guys to my laundry room.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>465.6,'end_time'=>469.1,'target_text'=>'Kat sini ada bakul kain kotor aku.','source_text'=>'I have my dirty laundry basket here or my hamper.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>469.2,'end_time'=>472.86,'target_text'=>'Dan sekarang aku nak basuh baju.','source_text'=>'And now I\'m going to wash some laundry.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>472.96,'end_time'=>476.3,'target_text'=>'Yang ni mesin basuh aku.','source_text'=>'This right here, this is my washer.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>476.4,'end_time'=>477.98,'target_text'=>'Ini semua punat kawalan dia.','source_text'=>'These are all the controls.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>478.08,'end_time'=>479.82,'target_text'=>'Kat situ tempat aku boleh kawal tetapan basuhan.','source_text'=>'That\'s where I can control the settings.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>479.92,'end_time'=>485.32,'target_text'=>'Aku buka pintu mesin dan masukkan baju-baju ke dalam tu.','source_text'=>'I\'m going to open it up and throw my clothes in there.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>488.72,'end_time'=>491.34,'target_text'=>'Dan yang ni sabun pencuci baju aku.','source_text'=>'And now this is my laundry detergent.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>491.44,'end_time'=>493.42,'target_text'=>'Ini sabun jenis cecair.','source_text'=>'This is a liquid detergent.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>493.52,'end_time'=>498.7,'target_text'=>'Bukan jenis kapsul pod tu, tapi jenis cecair biasa.','source_text'=>'So, it\'s not those pods, just a liquid form instead of in the pod form.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>498.8,'end_time'=>502.44,'target_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak cecair tu mengalir keluar.','source_text'=>'So, you can see it coming out.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>503.2,'end_time'=>504.14,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku agak-agak je sukatan dia guna mata kasar (eyeball it).','source_text'=>'So, I\'m eyeballing it.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>504.24,'end_time'=>505.9,'target_text'=>'Aku pernah cerita pasal istilah tu dalam video yang ni.','source_text'=>'I talked about that in this video here.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>506,'end_time'=>509.5,'target_text'=>'Maksudnya kita cuma agak-agak tanpa guna sukatan cawan atau ukuran rasmi.','source_text'=>'It just means I\'m kind of guessing like I\'m not measuring it out.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>509.6,'end_time'=>513.02,'target_text'=>'Banyak ni dah kira cukup sangat untuk apa yang aku perlukan.','source_text'=>'Uh, that\'s probably about as much as I need.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>513.12,'end_time'=>514.7,'target_text'=>'Jadi istilah tu bukan untuk masak je.','source_text'=>'So, it\'s not just for cooking.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>514.8,'end_time'=>520.36,'target_text'=>'Boleh guna untuk apa-apa situasi bila kau agak-agak atau anggarkan kuantiti.','source_text'=>'It\'s for anything where you guess or you estimate the amount.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>525.28,'end_time'=>526.94,'target_text'=>'Sekarang jom kita mulakan basuhan.','source_text'=>'Now, let\'s start it.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>527.04,'end_time'=>528.7,'target_text'=>'Korang nampak mesin ni kat mod biasa (regular).','source_text'=>'So, you see it\'s on regular.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>528.8,'end_time'=>530.38,'target_text'=>'Basuhan akan ambil masa 53 minit.','source_text'=>'It will take 53 minutes.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>530.48,'end_time'=>532.86,'target_text'=>'Dan sekarang aku nak tekan mula.','source_text'=>'And now, I\'m going to start it.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>532.96,'end_time'=>535.5,'target_text'=>'Jom kita pergi sambung kemas beg sementara tunggu basuhan siap.','source_text'=>'So, let\'s go finish packing while we wait for this.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>535.6,'end_time'=>538.3,'target_text'=>'Korang boleh tengok Leon dah siap kemas beg dia dah.','source_text'=>'You can see Leon has packed his bags already.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>538.4,'end_time'=>540.62,'target_text'=>'Ni beg pakaian besar dia.','source_text'=>'This is his large suitcase.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>540.72,'end_time'=>542.7,'target_text'=>'Yang tu pula beg pakaian kecil dia.','source_text'=>'That is his small suitcase.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>542.8,'end_time'=>544.14,'target_text'=>'Dan yang tu beg galas belakang dia.','source_text'=>'And that is his backpack.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>544.24,'end_time'=>547.42,'target_text'=>'Tapi korang boleh nampak kat luar ni salji turun dari semalam.','source_text'=>'But you can see outside here the snow from yesterday.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>547.52,'end_time'=>549.42,'target_text'=>'Nampak dah mula cair sikit dah.','source_text'=>'So, it\'s kind of started to melt already.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>549.52,'end_time'=>550.54,'target_text'=>'Tapi tengoklah tu.','source_text'=>'But look at that.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>550.64,'end_time'=>554.46,'target_text'=>'Macam selimut salji tebal dan ada ais kat anjung luar.','source_text'=>'It\'s like a blanket of snow and there\'s ice on the patio.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>554.56,'end_time'=>556.14,'target_text'=>'Macam tulah keadaan kat Kanada, kawan-kawan.','source_text'=>'But that\'s what Canada\'s like, you guys.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>556.24,'end_time'=>558.94,'target_text'=>'Kalau korang ada rancang nak datang Kanada, datanglah waktu musim panas.','source_text'=>'If you\'re ever planning on coming to Canada, come in the summer.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>559.04,'end_time'=>564.22,'target_text'=>'Musim panas memang sangat cantik dan hangat, tapi kalau musim sejuk, musim sejuk memang beku gila.','source_text'=>'The summer is very beautiful, very warm, but the winter, the winter is cold.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>564.32,'end_time'=>567.82,'target_text'=>'Tapi aktiviti luncur papan salji dan sukan musim sejuk memang seronok sangat.','source_text'=>'But snowboarding and winter sports are very fun.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>567.92,'end_time'=>569.58,'target_text'=>'Jadi itu satu kelebihan.','source_text'=>'So that is a plus.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>569.68,'end_time'=>570.94,'target_text'=>'Itu satu bonus tambahan.','source_text'=>'That is a bonus.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>571.04,'end_time'=>573.98,'target_text'=>'Itu manfaat bila datang waktu musim sejuk.','source_text'=>'That is a benefit of coming in the winter.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>574.08,'end_time'=>577.02,'target_text'=>'Ada sukan hoki, luncur papan salji, menunggang motosikal salji (snowmobile).','source_text'=>'You have hockey, snowboarding, snowmmoiling.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>577.12,'end_time'=>578.3,'target_text'=>'Memang sangat seronok.','source_text'=>'That\'s just amazing.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>578.4,'end_time'=>579.58,'target_text'=>'dan mengujakan gila.','source_text'=>'and a lot of fun.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>579.68,'end_time'=>583.9,'target_text'=>'Sekarang semua barang kita dah dibentangkan.','source_text'=>'So, all of our stuff is now all laid out.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>584,'end_time'=>586.22,'target_text'=>'Dah disusun terbentang atas lantai.','source_text'=>'It\'s laid out across the floor.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>586.32,'end_time'=>592.54,'target_text'=>'Ni lantai dan semua barang, baju, bagasi, beg, dan barang asas kita semua dah disusun terbentang.','source_text'=>'This is the floor and all of our items, clothes, luggage, bags, all our essentials are all laid out.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>592.64,'end_time'=>595.42,'target_text'=>'Jadi ini semua barangan keperluan melancong kita.','source_text'=>'So, these are all our travel essentials.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>595.52,'end_time'=>598.46,'target_text'=>'Semua barang atas lantai ni benda yang kita perlukan untuk melancong.','source_text'=>'All of the things on the floor are things we need to travel.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>598.56,'end_time'=>600.06,'target_text'=>'Ada banyak barang.','source_text'=>'We have a lot of things.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>600.16,'end_time'=>602.14,'target_text'=>'Dalam bilik aku pun sebenarnya ada banyak lagi barang.','source_text'=>'Like, I still have a lot of stuff in my room.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>602.24,'end_time'=>603.9,'target_text'=>'Leon pun banyak barang dalam bilik dia.','source_text'=>'Leot has a lot of stuff in his room.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>604,'end_time'=>605.74,'target_text'=>'Ini barang keperluan asas kita.','source_text'=>'These are our essentials.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>605.84,'end_time'=>613.66,'target_text'=>'Benda-benda yang kita memang perlu dan tak boleh hidup tanpa benda ni macam baju, barang mandian, alat elektronik, dan beg pakaian.','source_text'=>'These are things that we need and that we can\'t live without like clothes, toiletries, electronics, and our suitcases.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>613.76,'end_time'=>619.1,'target_text'=>'Jadi barang asas, dan semua barang ni membolehkan kita hidup bergantung pada beg pakaian kita je.','source_text'=>'So, essentials >> and all this stuff basically lets us live out of our suitcases.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>619.2,'end_time'=>622.94,'target_text'=>'Kita ada semua kelengkapan untuk mengembara pusing dunia.','source_text'=>'So, we have everything we need to travel the world.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>623.04,'end_time'=>625.34,'target_text'=>'Kita cuma perlukan barang-barang asas ni je.','source_text'=>'>> We just need these essentials and that\'s it.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>625.44,'end_time'=>630.46,'target_text'=>'Jadi kita cuba kemas secara ringkas seringkas mungkin barang keperluan yang wajib je.','source_text'=>'So, we try to pack uh minimally only our essentials that we need.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>630.56,'end_time'=>632.38,'target_text'=>'Kita elak bawa barang berlebihan (overpack).','source_text'=>'We don\'t try to overpack.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>632.48,'end_time'=>638.22,'target_text'=>'Kalau boleh, kita nak bawa kurang barang (underpack) supaya ada ruang nak beli cenderamata kat mana-mana negara kita pergi.','source_text'=>'If anything, we want to underpack so that we could buy souvenirs or something in whatever country we\'re at.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>638.32,'end_time'=>642.54,'target_text'=>'Jadi lebih baik bawa kurang daripada bawa terlebih barang.','source_text'=>'So, it\'s better to underpack than to overpack.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>642.64,'end_time'=>648.94,'target_text'=>'Tapi kita akan keluar melancong beberapa bulan, jadi tetap kena bawa jumlah barang yang mencukupi.','source_text'=>'But, we will be gone for a couple months, so we need to still pack a decent amount of stuff.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>649.04,'end_time'=>650.14,'target_text'=>'Jom kita mula kemas.','source_text'=>'Let\'s start packing.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>650.24,'end_time'=>651.82,'target_text'=>'Macam mana gaya kau kemas barang?','source_text'=>'How do you like to pack?','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>651.92,'end_time'=>654.22,'target_text'=>'Aku suka kemas dengan tersusun rapi.','source_text'=>'>> Me, I like being quite organized.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>654.32,'end_time'=>656.38,'target_text'=>'Aku rasa aku ada sindrom OCD sikit kot.','source_text'=>'I think I have a level of OCD.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>656.48,'end_time'=>659.74,'target_text'=>'Dia masih ada beberapa helai baju dalam mesin pengering yang belum dikeluarkan.','source_text'=>'He still has some clothes in the dryer that have to come out.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>659.84,'end_time'=>664.86,'target_text'=>'Dan korang boleh nampak banyak beg kecil macam ni dan kiub pembungkusan (packing cubes).','source_text'=>'And yeah, you can see like a lot of small bags like this and small packing cubes.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>664.96,'end_time'=>666.78,'target_text'=>'Itu semua kepunyaan Leon.','source_text'=>'Those are all Leons.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>666.88,'end_time'=>673.5,'target_text'=>'Barang-barang aku pula, korang boleh tengok bersepah bebas macam ni je sebab aku tak suka guna beg packing cubes sangat,','source_text'=>'All my stuff, you can see my stuff is just loose like this clothes because I don\'t uh I don\'t like using packing cubes only','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>673.6,'end_time'=>679.26,'target_text'=>'hanya untuk benda tertentu je macam gajet elektronik atau barang mandian atau seluar dalam.','source_text'=>'for certain things like for electronics or for toiletries or for my boxers or something.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>679.36,'end_time'=>683.18,'target_text'=>'Untuk benda-benda tu aku suka guna packing cubes, tapi untuk baju-baju lain, tak payahlah.','source_text'=>'For that, I like using uh packing cubes, but for everything else, no.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>683.28,'end_time'=>686.46,'target_text'=>'Aku nak mula susun baju-baju aku dalam beg pakaian.','source_text'=>'I will start organizing my clothes in my suitcase.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>686.56,'end_time'=>687.98,'target_text'=>'Jadi ini beg pakaian aku.','source_text'=>'>> So, this is my suitcase.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>688.08,'end_time'=>689.34,'target_text'=>'Lain sikit daripada beg Vulca.','source_text'=>'It\'s different than Voca\'s.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>689.44,'end_time'=>692.2,'target_text'=>'Beg dia jenis kerangka keras (hard shell).','source_text'=>'His is a hard shell.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>692.48,'end_time'=>693.9,'target_text'=>'Boleh dengar bunyi ketukan tu.','source_text'=>'You can hear that.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>694,'end_time'=>695.34,'target_text'=>'Dan beg aku jenis kain lembut (soft shell).','source_text'=>'And mine\'s a soft shell.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>695.44,'end_time'=>700.94,'target_text'=>'Beg dia besar sikit sebab dia kena bawa banyak barang kamera, tapi beg aku kecil sikit.','source_text'=>'His is a little larger because he has more camera stuff to carry, but mine\'s a little smaller.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>701.04,'end_time'=>703.58,'target_text'=>'Benda ni pula tali pengikat bagasi (luggage belt).','source_text'=>'This right here is a luggage belt.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>703.68,'end_time'=>707.9,'target_text'=>'Tali ni lilit keliling bahagian luar beg dan berfungsi sebagai lapisan keselamatan tambahan.','source_text'=>'It goes around the outside of the luggage and it just is another level of security.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>708,'end_time'=>712.7,'target_text'=>'Kalau zip beg rosak atau pecah, tali pengikat ni masih boleh pegang beg pakaian korang supaya tak terbuka.','source_text'=>'If your zippers fail, you still have this luggage belt to hold your suitcase together.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>712.8,'end_time'=>716.86,'target_text'=>'Tali bagasi ni juga berguna untuk kenal pasti beg korang.','source_text'=>'A luggage belt is also useful for identifying your luggage.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>716.96,'end_time'=>722.62,'target_text'=>'Bila tengah melancong, orang lain mungkin guna beg pakaian yang sebiji sama macam kau, tapi peluang untuk diorang guna','source_text'=>'So when you\'re traveling, someone might have the exact same suitcase as you, but the chances are low that they\'ll have the','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>722.72,'end_time'=>724.46,'target_text'=>'tali bagasi yang sama adalah sangat rendah.','source_text'=>'same luggage belt as well.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>724.56,'end_time'=>727.74,'target_text'=>'Jadi tu satu lagi cara nak cam beg pakaian korang.','source_text'=>'So that\'s another way to identify your luggage.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>727.84,'end_time'=>733.26,'target_text'=>'Lagipun kat bahagian belakang setiap beg, ada ruang khas untuk letak kad maklumat perhubungan.','source_text'=>'Also, at the back, every single piece of luggage, there\'s an area where you can put a contact card.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>733.36,'end_time'=>734.3,'target_text'=>'Beg aku tak ada benda tu.','source_text'=>'Mine doesn\'t have one.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>734.4,'end_time'=>736.86,'target_text'=>'Aku rasa tu cuma ada pada beg jenis kulit lembut je.','source_text'=>'I think that\'s only for soft shell suitcases.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>736.96,'end_time'=>738.86,'target_text'=>'Yelah, cuma ada pada beg jenis kulit lembut.','source_text'=>'>> Well, it\'s just for soft shell suitcases.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>738.96,'end_time'=>745.02,'target_text'=>'Kau boleh tulis nama, alamat, dan negara asal kau kot-kot kalau beg kau hilang nanti.','source_text'=>'Then you can put your name, your address, and the country you\'re from in case you ever lose your bag.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>745.12,'end_time'=>749.66,'target_text'=>'Tapi zaman sekarang, hampir semua orang letak peranti pengesan dalam beg bagasi diorang.','source_text'=>'But nowadays, almost everyone puts a tracking device inside of their luggage.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>749.76,'end_time'=>755.26,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku dengan Vulca dua-dua letak peranti pengesan supaya senang nak cari beg pakaian kami.','source_text'=>'So, me and Voca both have tracking devices to be able to easily find our luggage.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>755.36,'end_time'=>755.82,'target_text'=>'Ya betul.','source_text'=>'>> Yep.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>755.92,'end_time'=>757.1,'target_text'=>'Malah lebih daripada satu sebenarnya.','source_text'=>'Multiple, actually.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>757.2,'end_time'=>757.52,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'Yeah.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>757.52,'end_time'=>759.42,'target_text'=>'Sekarang ni aku tengah lipat baju-baju aku.','source_text'=>'Right now, I\'m just folding my clothes.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>759.52,'end_time'=>760.14,'target_text'=>'Aku gulung baju tu.','source_text'=>'I roll it.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>760.24,'end_time'=>763.26,'target_text'=>'Aku tak lipat leper, tapi aku gulung bulat.','source_text'=>'I don\'t fold it flat, but rather I roll it.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>763.36,'end_time'=>767.56,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku nak tunjuk kat korang macam mana aku susun barang dalam beg ni.','source_text'=>'>> So, I\'ll show you guys how I pack this thing in.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>767.76,'end_time'=>770.14,'target_text'=>'Mula-mula aku mulakan dengan barang paling besar yang aku ada.','source_text'=>'So, I start with the biggest items I have.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>770.24,'end_time'=>774.54,'target_text'=>'Iaitu seluar panjang, seluar jean, seluar trek, dan seluar pendek.','source_text'=>'That is going to be my pants, jeans, sweatpants, shorts.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>774.64,'end_time'=>776.3,'target_text'=>'Semua tu letak kat bahagian paling bawah sekali.','source_text'=>'So that goes at the very bottom.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>776.4,'end_time'=>778.7,'target_text'=>'Dan beg kiub ni pula simpan semua jaket aku kat dalam.','source_text'=>'And this has all my jackets inside of it.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>778.8,'end_time'=>781.5,'target_text'=>'Ada baju baju panas (sweater), hoodie bertopi, dan jaket kalis hujan.','source_text'=>'So my sweater, my hoodie, rain jacket.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>781.6,'end_time'=>783.26,'target_text'=>'Jadi ini beg kiub kedua paling besar aku.','source_text'=>'So this is my second largest one.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>783.36,'end_time'=>789.34,'target_text'=>'Yang seronoknya pasal beg kiub ni, rasa macam main permainan Jenga setiap kali kau susun masuk beg bagasi','source_text'=>'Now, the fun thing about packing cubes is it\'s almost like playing a game of Jenga every time you put your luggage inside','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>789.44,'end_time'=>794.46,'target_text'=>'sebab kau nak pastikan susunan tu muat elok ngam-ngam, kalau tak nanti tak boleh muat semua benda.','source_text'=>'cuz you want to have it fitting exactly perfect or else you won\'t be able to get everything in.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>794.56,'end_time'=>796.22,'target_text'=>'Korang boleh tengok dia guna beg kiub pembungkusan.','source_text'=>'So you can see he has packing cubes.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>796.32,'end_time'=>798.78,'target_text'=>'Jadi dia tak selit baju celah-celah pakaian lain.','source_text'=>'So he doesn\'t put any clothes between like his clothes.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>798.88,'end_time'=>800.62,'target_text'=>'Boleh je kalau nak, tapi kebanyakannya dalam kiub beg.','source_text'=>'He can, but it\'s mostly in packing cubes.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>800.72,'end_time'=>802.22,'target_text'=>'Jadi semua kena muat dengan elok.','source_text'=>'So it all has to fit good.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>802.32,'end_time'=>805.42,'target_text'=>'Bagi aku pula, aku terus masukkan semua baju aku terus dalam tu.','source_text'=>'As for me, I just put all my clothes in there directly.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>805.52,'end_time'=>807.5,'target_text'=>'Jadi beg ni ibarat satu beg kiub besar je.','source_text'=>'So, this is just like one big packing cube.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>807.6,'end_time'=>811.66,'target_text'=>'Secara teknikalnya, aku boleh selit baju kat setiap ceruk dan celah yang aku nak.','source_text'=>'Technically, I could fit clothes in every nook and cranny that I want.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>811.76,'end_time'=>813.18,'target_text'=>'Jadi tu dua cara berbeza untuk kemas beg.','source_text'=>'So, that\'s two different ways to pack.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>813.28,'end_time'=>818.06,'target_text'=>'Sama ada guna beg kiub pembungkusan ataupun lipat dan susun terus ke dalam beg pakaian korang.','source_text'=>'Either with packing cubes or you can just fold your clothes directly into your suitcase.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>818.16,'end_time'=>821.34,'target_text'=>'Beg yang aku pegang ni beg uncang kasut aku.','source_text'=>'So, this bag I have right here is my shoe pouch.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>821.44,'end_time'=>823.5,'target_text'=>'Tempat aku simpan kasut mendaki aku.','source_text'=>'It\'s where I keep my hiking shoes.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>823.6,'end_time'=>826.86,'target_text'=>'Dan dua barang terakhir ni vitamin aku.','source_text'=>'And the last two are my vitamins.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>826.96,'end_time'=>832.94,'target_text'=>'Dan beg terakhir ni kanta lekap ganti, losen badan, dan krim pencukur.','source_text'=>'And the last bag, spare contacts, my lotion, and some shaving cream.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>833.04,'end_time'=>838.46,'target_text'=>'Dan langkah terakhir ialah guna tali pengikat ni untuk ketatkan dan mampatkan semua barang kemas-kemas.','source_text'=>'And the last thing to do is use these straps to cinch everything down tight.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>838.56,'end_time'=>840.46,'target_text'=>'Aku guna satu aplikasi sebagai senarai semak barang (packing list).','source_text'=>'I have an app I use as a packing list.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>840.56,'end_time'=>843.02,'target_text'=>'Dan semua barang aku kat sini dibahagikan mengikut jenis beg.','source_text'=>'And I have all my items here divided by luggage.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>843.12,'end_time'=>850.38,'target_text'=>'Ada beg galas, beg sandang silang, beg daftar masuk, dan beg kabin semua tersenarai dalam tu.','source_text'=>'So, I have my backpack, my sling bag, check bag, and carry-on suitcase all inside there.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>850.48,'end_time'=>856.22,'target_text'=>'Kalau korang serius nak belajar bahasa Inggeris dan nak sokong aku, layari Patreon aku kat penerangan.','source_text'=>'If you\'re serious about learning English and you want to support me, then check out my Patreon in the description.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>856.32,'end_time'=>859.5,'target_text'=>'Korang akan dapat tiga video baharu setiap minggu daripada aku.','source_text'=>'You\'ll get three new videos every week from me.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>859.6,'end_time'=>863.82,'target_text'=>'Itu bermakna 12 video input mudah faham bertaraf sinematik setiap bulan.','source_text'=>'That\'s 12 cinematic, comprehensible input videos a month.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>863.92,'end_time'=>868.54,'target_text'=>'Ini buat aku terus bersemangat mencipta video dan bantu korang fasih dengan lebih cepat.','source_text'=>'It keeps me creating and it helps you become fluent even faster.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>868.64,'end_time'=>872.14,'target_text'=>'Ni sedutan ringkas apa yang korang akan dapat sebaik sahaja sertai.','source_text'=>'Here\'s a sneak peek at what you\'ll get the moment you join.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>872.24,'end_time'=>876.06,'target_text'=>'Ni hari pertama penuh kita kat Quito, Ecuador, kawasan ni.','source_text'=>'Is our first full day in Keto, Ecuador, the area.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>876.16,'end_time'=>878.38,'target_text'=>'Dan sekarang rasanya kita nak pergi jalan-jalan tengok tempat lain pula.','source_text'=>'And now I think we\'re going to go just see some more.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>878.48,'end_time'=>880.78,'target_text'=>'Sebenarnya sekarang ni kita nak pergi makan malam.','source_text'=>'Well, actually, right now we\'re going to go have dinner.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>880.88,'end_time'=>885.98,'target_text'=>'Paella, iaitu hidangan makanan Sepanyol, tapi ada restoran Sepanyol kat tempat kita tinggal ni.','source_text'=>'Pella, which is like Spanish food, but there\'s a Spanish restaurant here where we live.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>886.08,'end_time'=>887.74,'target_text'=>'Kita ada sepinggan hidangan kat sini.','source_text'=>'So, we have a plate here.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>887.84,'end_time'=>889.1,'target_text'=>'Sebenarnya kita ada tiga pinggan.','source_text'=>'We actually have three plates.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>889.2,'end_time'=>889.6,'target_text'=>'Okey, kawan-kawan.','source_text'=>'Okay, guys.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>889.68,'end_time'=>892.06,'target_text'=>'Leon baru je terangkan cara dia kemas barang dia tadi.','source_text'=>'So, Leon just explained how he\'s packing his stuff.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>892.16,'end_time'=>895.58,'target_text'=>'Sekarang aku nak tunjuk ringkas apa yang aku tengah kemas kat sini pula.','source_text'=>'And now, I\'m just going to quickly show you what I got working here.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>895.68,'end_time'=>897.74,'target_text'=>'Ini semua baju-baju aku kat sini.','source_text'=>'So, this is all my clothes here.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>897.84,'end_time'=>900.94,'target_text'=>'Korang boleh tengok aku guna beberapa beg kiub untuk stoking dan seluar dalam aku.','source_text'=>'You can see I have some packing cubes for my socks and boxers.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>901.04,'end_time'=>905.02,'target_text'=>'Dan baju-baju lain aku cuma susun terus dalam beg pakaian kat kedua-dua bahagian.','source_text'=>'And then I have the rest of my clothes just in my suitcase on both sides.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>905.12,'end_time'=>907.58,'target_text'=>'Aku belum kemas beg pakaian kecil aku lagi.','source_text'=>'I haven\'t packed my small suitcase yet.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>907.68,'end_time'=>909.18,'target_text'=>'Macam yang korang nampak, beg tu masih kosong lagi.','source_text'=>'As you can see, it\'s still empty.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>909.28,'end_time'=>911.18,'target_text'=>'Dan sejujurnya, hampir semua barang aku dah siap kemas dah.','source_text'=>'And honestly, I\'ve pretty much packed everything.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>911.28,'end_time'=>913.42,'target_text'=>'Tinggal barang mandian aku kat sini je.','source_text'=>'I just have my toiletries right here.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>913.52,'end_time'=>914.54,'target_text'=>'Masih perlu dimasukkan.','source_text'=>'I still need to pack.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>914.64,'end_time'=>916.7,'target_text'=>'Yang ni beberapa keping kanta lekap.','source_text'=>'These are some contact lenses.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>916.8,'end_time'=>919.9,'target_text'=>'Dan dalam beg galas aku, aku letak barang lebih kurang sama macam Leon.','source_text'=>'And in my backpack, I\'m just putting stuff pretty similar to Leon.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>920,'end_time'=>923.66,'target_text'=>'Cuma gajet elektronik macam komputer riba dan pengecas.','source_text'=>'Just my electronics like my laptop and uh chargers.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>923.76,'end_time'=>925.9,'target_text'=>'Jadi beg pakaian aku hampir siap sepenuhnya.','source_text'=>'So, my suitcase is pretty much done.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>926,'end_time'=>928.54,'target_text'=>'Aku belum letak apa-apa lagi dalam beg bawa kabin aku.','source_text'=>'I haven\'t even put anything in my carry-on yet.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>928.64,'end_time'=>930.22,'target_text'=>'Nanti aku cuma letak beberapa barang keperluan asas yang perlu je.','source_text'=>'I\'ll just put some essentials I need.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>930.32,'end_time'=>931.82,'target_text'=>'Mungkin sepasang baju persalinan.','source_text'=>'Maybe one change of clothes.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>931.92,'end_time'=>933.1,'target_text'=>'Ya, bantal leher aku.','source_text'=>'Yeah, my neck pillow.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>933.2,'end_time'=>934.94,'target_text'=>'Yang tu sebenarnya aku gantung kat beg galas aku je.','source_text'=>'That one actually I\'ll keep on my bag.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>935.04,'end_time'=>936.54,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku ada dua pilihan.','source_text'=>'So, I have two options.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>936.64,'end_time'=>939.9,'target_text'=>'Aku tak ada jaket musim sejuk kat sini sebab aku tak pakai jaket musim sejuk sangat.','source_text'=>'I don\'t really have a winter jacket here cuz I don\'t wear winter jackets.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>940,'end_time'=>941.18,'target_text'=>'Aku cuma pakai hoodie je.','source_text'=>'I just wear hoodies.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>941.28,'end_time'=>947.66,'target_text'=>'Tapi sama ada aku bawa salah satu jaket labuh yang aku ada kat sini, atau aku beli jaket puffer tebal yang labuh','source_text'=>'But uh I either I\'m going to bring one of these long jackets I have here or I\'m going to buy one of those big long puffer','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>947.76,'end_time'=>950.22,'target_text'=>'kat Korea nanti macam yang orang Korea selalu pakai tu.','source_text'=>'jackets in Korea that all the Koreans wear.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>950.32,'end_time'=>953.42,'target_text'=>'Pilihan yang bijak sebab jaket tu memang hangat gila.','source_text'=>'They\'re very smart because that\'s a warm jacket.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>953.52,'end_time'=>959.34,'target_text'=>'Seterusnya, aku nak masukkan satu barang penting wajib bila melancong, iaitu peti pertolongan cemas (first aid kit).','source_text'=>'Next, I\'m going to be putting in an essential that you need when you travel, a first aid kit.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>959.44,'end_time'=>967.34,'target_text'=>'Vulca patut ada satu peti macam ni juga, sebab masa trip kita kat Ecuador dulu, hari pertama lagi daripada dua minggu perjalanan,','source_text'=>'Voca should have one of these, too, because last time we did a trip in Ecuador, the first day of our two week long trip, he','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>967.44,'end_time'=>971.58,'target_text'=>'jari dia terhiris luka teruk dan kita langsung tak ada ubat pertolongan cemas masa tu.','source_text'=>'cut his finger completely open and we had no first aid supplies on us.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>971.68,'end_time'=>974.46,'target_text'=>'Jari aku terhiris kena pisau pencukur manual keselamatan aku.','source_text'=>'>> I cut my finger with my safety razor shaver.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>974.56,'end_time'=>982.78,'target_text'=>'Masa aku seluk tangan dalam beg barang mandian, tiba-tiba rasa pedih menyengat lepas tu tengok jari berdarah membuak-buak','source_text'=>'I put my hand in my bag in my toiletries bag and I just felt like a burning pain and then I just saw my finger like bleeding','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>982.88,'end_time'=>984.46,'target_text'=>'sampai terkoyak isi.','source_text'=>'so much and it was just like dangling.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>984.56,'end_time'=>988.14,'target_text'=>'Masa tu dah pukul 10 atau 11 malam, jadi waktu tu memang dah lewat sangat.','source_text'=>'And that was like at 10 or 11:00 at night, so it was pretty late already.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>988.24,'end_time'=>989.58,'target_text'=>'Macam mana entah dia boleh kena macam tu.','source_text'=>'Somehow he managed that.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>989.68,'end_time'=>994.06,'target_text'=>'Kalau korang nak dapatkan senarai 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling kerap digunakan, tengok ruangan penerangan.','source_text'=>'>> If you guys want to get the 3,000 most common English words, check the description.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>994.16,'end_time'=>999.58,'target_text'=>'Ni komen kegemaran aku dari video lepas, dan ni tiga negara teratas penonton dari video lepas.','source_text'=>'This was my favorite comment from last video, and these were the top three countries you were from last video.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>999.68,'end_time'=>1005.34,'target_text'=>'Jangan lupa tinggalkan komen dari mana korang berasal, apa yang korang belajar, dan video apa korang nak tengok pada masa depan.','source_text'=>'And make sure to leave a comment where you\'re from, what you learned, and what videos you want to see in the future.','order'=>304],
