            ['start_time'=>0.08,'end_time'=>1.82,'target_text'=>'Selamat kembali ke video seterusnya, kawan-kawan.','source_text'=>'Welcome back to another video, guys.','order'=>1],
            ['start_time'=>1.92,'end_time'=>8.38,'target_text'=>'Hari ni, kita akan belajar bahasa Inggeris harian di sekitar rumah aku dan sambil aku tunggang motosikal lasak (dirt bike).','source_text'=>'Today, we\'re going to be learning daily life English around my house and as I ride my dirt bike.','order'=>2],
            ['start_time'=>8.48,'end_time'=>9.34,'target_text'=>'Penapis udara.','source_text'=>'The air filter.','order'=>3],
            ['start_time'=>9.44,'end_time'=>11.02,'target_text'=>'Benda ni pula kawan-kawan, adalah pendikit minyak (throttle).','source_text'=>'So, this right here, guys, is the throttle.','order'=>4],
            ['start_time'=>11.12,'end_time'=>12.38,'target_text'=>'Dan korang pulas benda ni ke belakang.','source_text'=>'And you pull this back.','order'=>5],
            ['start_time'=>12.48,'end_time'=>15.82,'target_text'=>'Ni pelapik tempat duduk motosikal lasak tempat korang boleh masukkan kod laluan.','source_text'=>'This is the dirt bike seat pad where you could put a passcode in.','order'=>6],
            ['start_time'=>15.92,'end_time'=>17.26,'target_text'=>'Korang perlukan lesen.','source_text'=>'You need a license.','order'=>7],
            ['start_time'=>17.36,'end_time'=>19.66,'target_text'=>'Kasut ni dah haus sangat.','source_text'=>'These shoes are very worn.','order'=>8],
            ['start_time'=>19.76,'end_time'=>21.42,'target_text'=>'Ini telur burung unta.','source_text'=>'This is an ostrich egg.','order'=>9],
            ['start_time'=>21.52,'end_time'=>22.94,'target_text'=>'Aku nak nyahbekukan.','source_text'=>'I want to defrost.','order'=>10],
            ['start_time'=>23.04,'end_time'=>25.1,'target_text'=>'Mula kiraan perkataan dan jom gerak.','source_text'=>'So, start the word count and let\'s go.','order'=>11],
            ['start_time'=>25.2,'end_time'=>32.94,'target_text'=>'Perkara pertama kita kena buat ialah hidupkan enjin dulu supaya enjin dan minyak hitam panas sebelum kita tukar minyak','source_text'=>'So, the first thing we need to do is start it so we could warm up the engine and warm up the oil before we change the oil','order'=>12],
            ['start_time'=>33.04,'end_time'=>37.26,'target_text'=>'sebab sebelum aku tunggang motor ni, aku kena tukar minyak hitam dengan penapis udara dulu.','source_text'=>'because before I ride it, I need to change the oil and the air filter.','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>37.36,'end_time'=>39.42,'target_text'=>'Jom kita buat benda tu dulu.','source_text'=>'So, let\'s do that first.','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>39.52,'end_time'=>42.22,'target_text'=>'Cuaca agak sejuk, jadi aku tak pasti boleh hidupkan enjin ke tak.','source_text'=>'So, it\'s pretty cold, so I\'m not sure if I\'m going to be able to start it.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>42.32,'end_time'=>46.54,'target_text'=>'Tapi benda ni pemijak penghidup (kickstarter), dan aku kena tendang ke bawah nak hidupkan enjin.','source_text'=>'But, this right here is a kickstarter, and I have to kick it to be able to start it.','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>46.64,'end_time'=>48.44,'target_text'=>'Jadi...','source_text'=>'So,','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>55.04,'end_time'=>57.34,'target_text'=>'Okey, kita dah hidupkan enjin motor lasak ni.','source_text'=>'Okay, so we started the dirt bike.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>57.44,'end_time'=>59.34,'target_text'=>'Benda ni mata soket (socket).','source_text'=>'This right here is a socket.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>59.44,'end_time'=>62.46,'target_text'=>'Ni mata soket saiz 11 mm.','source_text'=>'This is a 11 mm socket.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>62.56,'end_time'=>67.1,'target_text'=>'Jadi ni mata soket dan yang ni pula sepana cemat (ratchet).','source_text'=>'So this is a socket and this right here is a ratchet.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>67.2,'end_time'=>67.98,'target_text'=>'Ini sepana ratchet.','source_text'=>'This is a ratchet.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>68.08,'end_time'=>70.2,'target_text'=>'Ini semua peralatan bertukang.','source_text'=>'These are tools.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>70.48,'end_time'=>75.18,'target_text'=>'Sekarang Leon tengah pasang penapis udara.','source_text'=>'So now Leon is installing the air filter.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>75.28,'end_time'=>78.06,'target_text'=>'Dia tengah pasang penapis udara tu.','source_text'=>'He\'s installing the air filter.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>78.16,'end_time'=>81.26,'target_text'=>'Dan yang ni kawan-kawan, ini bolt (bolt).','source_text'=>'And this right here, guys, this is a bolt.','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>81.36,'end_time'=>83.34,'target_text'=>'Ini sebatang bolt.','source_text'=>'This is a bolt.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>83.44,'end_time'=>85.42,'target_text'=>'Dan yang ini pula','source_text'=>'And these','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>85.52,'end_time'=>86.94,'target_text'=>'semuanya bolt.','source_text'=>'are bolts.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>87.04,'end_time'=>89.34,'target_text'=>'Dan aku ada set ratchet aku kat sini.','source_text'=>'And I have my ratchet set here.','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>89.44,'end_time'=>93.58,'target_text'=>'Aku pakai sarung tangan sebab benda ni kotor bergris.','source_text'=>'And I have gloves on because it\'s dirty.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>93.68,'end_time'=>97.56,'target_text'=>'Sekarang aku nak pasang tempat duduk pula.','source_text'=>'So now I\'m going to install the seat.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>97.68,'end_time'=>97.92,'target_text'=>'Okey.','source_text'=>'Okay.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>97.92,'end_time'=>100.14,'target_text'=>'Aku baru je pasang tempat duduk tadi.','source_text'=>'So I just installed the seat.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>100.24,'end_time'=>101.26,'target_text'=>'Sekarang dah terpasang kemas elok.','source_text'=>'Now it\'s on there good.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>101.36,'end_time'=>103.74,'target_text'=>'Dan sekarang aku kena tukar minyak hitam pula.','source_text'=>'And now I have to change the oil.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>103.84,'end_time'=>104.16,'target_text'=>'Okey.','source_text'=>'Okay.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>104.16,'end_time'=>107.98,'target_text'=>'Sekarang minyak enjin dah suam panas','source_text'=>'So now the engine oil is warm','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>108.08,'end_time'=>110.3,'target_text'=>'jadi lagi senang nak mengalir keluar.','source_text'=>'so it\'ll be easier to flow out.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>110.4,'end_time'=>113.42,'target_text'=>'Sekarang minyak tengah keluar mengalir kat sini.','source_text'=>'So now the oil is draining out here.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>113.52,'end_time'=>116.06,'target_text'=>'Minyak mengalir masuk ke dalam takung tadahan minyak.','source_text'=>'It\'s draining out into the oil drain pan.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>116.16,'end_time'=>120.06,'target_text'=>'Dan sekarang aku buat benda sama kat bahagian sebelah lagi untuk minyak enjin.','source_text'=>'And now I\'m doing the same thing on the other side with the engine oil.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>120.16,'end_time'=>125.82,'target_text'=>'Okey kawan-kawan, kita dah tukar minyak enjin, minyak transmisi, dan penapis udara motor ni.','source_text'=>'Okay guys, so we changed the oil and the transmission fluid and the air filter on the bike.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>125.92,'end_time'=>129.18,'target_text'=>'Sekarang kita boleh hidupkan enjin dan pergi pusing-pusing sekejap.','source_text'=>'So now we can start it and go for a little rip.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>129.28,'end_time'=>134.06,'target_text'=>'Yang ni kawan-kawan, benda ni brek tangan.','source_text'=>'This right here, you guys, this right here, this is the handbrake.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>134.16,'end_time'=>135.66,'target_text'=>'Ini brek tangan.','source_text'=>'This is the handbrake.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>135.76,'end_time'=>140.22,'target_text'=>'Dan brek yang kat bawah ni pula, ini satu lagi brek.','source_text'=>'And this brake right here, this is also another brake.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>140.32,'end_time'=>143.18,'target_text'=>'Ini mengawal brek belakang.','source_text'=>'This controls the back brake.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>143.28,'end_time'=>146.46,'target_text'=>'Jadi ada brek depan dan ada brek belakang.','source_text'=>'So, the front brake and the back brake.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>146.56,'end_time'=>149.98,'target_text'=>'Brek ni aku kena guna tangan aku.','source_text'=>'This brake I have to use my hand, my hand.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>150.08,'end_time'=>153.42,'target_text'=>'Dan brek ni pula, aku kena guna kaki aku.','source_text'=>'And this brake, I have to use my foot, my foot.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>153.52,'end_time'=>155.1,'target_text'=>'Benda ni pula kawan-kawan, ini pendikit minyak (throttle).','source_text'=>'So, this right here, guys, is the throttle.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>155.2,'end_time'=>157.9,'target_text'=>'Dan korang pulas benda ni ke belakang untuk bergerak ke depan.','source_text'=>'And you pull this back to move forward.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>158,'end_time'=>161.5,'target_text'=>'Sama macam pedal minyak pada kenderaan kereta.','source_text'=>'So this is like similar to a gas pedal on a vehicle.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>161.6,'end_time'=>163.72,'target_text'=>'Pendikit minyak','source_text'=>'The throttle','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>163.92,'end_time'=>167.5,'target_text'=>'kat belah sebelah lagi ni, ini klac (clutch).','source_text'=>'on the other side here, this is the clutch.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>167.6,'end_time'=>168.06,'target_text'=>'Klac.','source_text'=>'The clutch.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>168.16,'end_time'=>172.3,'target_text'=>'Korang tarik klac ni ke dalam lepas tu tukar gear.','source_text'=>'So you pull this in and then you shift gears.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>172.4,'end_time'=>174.46,'target_text'=>'Dan yang kat bawah ni tuil penukar gear aku.','source_text'=>'So this right here is my gear shifter.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>174.56,'end_time'=>177.82,'target_text'=>'Kena tarik klac ke dalam dulu lepas tu baru boleh tukar gear kat sini.','source_text'=>'You have to pull the clutch in and then I can shift gears right here.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>177.92,'end_time'=>179.74,'target_text'=>'Corak susunan gear macam mana?','source_text'=>'>> And what\'s the shift pattern?','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>179.84,'end_time'=>183.9,'target_text'=>'Corak tukaran gear ialah satu ke bawah, empat ke atas.','source_text'=>'>> So the shift pattern is one down, four up.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>184,'end_time'=>187.74,'target_text'=>'Motor ni ada lima kelajuan gear.','source_text'=>'So, there are five gears on this bike.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>187.84,'end_time'=>189.9,'target_text'=>'Sekarang aku tengah duduk atas tempat duduk.','source_text'=>'And right now, I\'m sitting on the seat.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>190,'end_time'=>192.06,'target_text'=>'Ini tempat duduk motor lasak (seat).','source_text'=>'This is the dirt bike seat.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>192.16,'end_time'=>193.5,'target_text'=>'Ini bukan kerusi (chair).','source_text'=>'This is not a chair.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>193.6,'end_time'=>194.54,'target_text'=>'Bukan kerusi.','source_text'=>'It\'s not a chair.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>194.64,'end_time'=>197.98,'target_text'=>'Yang kat sana tu, korang boleh panggil kerusi, kerusi pejabat.','source_text'=>'That right there, you can call that a chair, an office chair.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>198.08,'end_time'=>199.1,'target_text'=>'Tapi yang ni dipanggil tempat duduk (seat).','source_text'=>'But this is a seat.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>199.2,'end_time'=>200.14,'target_text'=>'Korang panggil benda ni pelana atau tempat duduk.','source_text'=>'You call this a seat.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>200.24,'end_time'=>201.82,'target_text'=>'Selesa tak rasa duduk atas tu?','source_text'=>'>> And how comfortable is it?','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>201.92,'end_time'=>204.14,'target_text'=>'Tak berapa selesa sangat sebab tempat duduk ni tirus dan sempit.','source_text'=>'>> It\'s not very comfortable cuz it\'s very narrow.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>204.24,'end_time'=>205.42,'target_text'=>'Tempat duduk ni tirus sempit.','source_text'=>'The seat is very narrow.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>205.52,'end_time'=>206.38,'target_text'=>'Dan... keras.','source_text'=>'So, >> and hard.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>206.48,'end_time'=>207.98,'target_text'=>'Sempit tirus dan keras.','source_text'=>'>> It\'s very narrow and hard.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>208.08,'end_time'=>208.48,'target_text'=>'Keras.','source_text'=>'It\'s hard.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>208.56,'end_time'=>209.5,'target_text'=>'Bukan jenis span empuk lembut.','source_text'=>'It\'s not soft.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>209.6,'end_time'=>210.38,'target_text'=>'Langsung tak lembut.','source_text'=>'Like, it\'s not soft.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>210.48,'end_time'=>212.06,'target_text'=>'Keras sangat.','source_text'=>'It\'s very hard.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>212.16,'end_time'=>214.78,'target_text'=>'Memang tak selesa, tapi motor macam ni bukan direka untuk keselesaan pun.','source_text'=>'So, it\'s not comfortable, but it\'s not made for comfort.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>214.88,'end_time'=>218.54,'target_text'=>'Benda ni pula hendal motosikal aku (handlebar).','source_text'=>'This right here, this is my handlebar.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>218.64,'end_time'=>220.62,'target_text'=>'Hendal aku.','source_text'=>'My handlebar.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>220.72,'end_time'=>222.86,'target_text'=>'Dan aku pegang pada hendal ni.','source_text'=>'And uh I hold on to my handlebar.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>222.96,'end_time'=>225.1,'target_text'=>'Sekarang kita dah faham serba sedikit macam mana motor ni berfungsi.','source_text'=>'Now, we kind of have an idea of how this bike works.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>225.2,'end_time'=>226.54,'target_text'=>'Jom kita hidupkan enjin.','source_text'=>'So, let\'s start it.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>226.64,'end_time'=>229.02,'target_text'=>'Yang ni pemijak penghidup (kickstarter).','source_text'=>'This right here is a kickstarter.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>229.12,'end_time'=>230.22,'target_text'=>'Pemijak penghidup enjin.','source_text'=>'A kickstarter.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>230.32,'end_time'=>232.46,'target_text'=>'Untuk hidupkan motor, aku kena tendang pemijak ni ke belakang.','source_text'=>'And to start the bike, I have to kick it back.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>232.56,'end_time'=>235.88,'target_text'=>'Jom kita hidupkan.','source_text'=>'So, let\'s start.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>236.4,'end_time'=>238.2,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>240.4,'end_time'=>241.98,'target_text'=>'Motor ni tengah buat apa sekarang?','source_text'=>'So, what\'s the bike doing right now?','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>242.08,'end_time'=>243.42,'target_text'=>'Lepas je kau hidupkan enjin.','source_text'=>'Right after you start it.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>243.52,'end_time'=>245.74,'target_text'=>'Motor ni tengah melahu (idling).','source_text'=>'>> So, right now, the bike is idling.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>245.84,'end_time'=>247.26,'target_text'=>'Aku biarkan motor ni melahu tanpa jalan.','source_text'=>'I\'m letting the bike idle.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>247.36,'end_time'=>251.18,'target_text'=>'Maksudnya enjin tengah hidup tapi tak bergerak ke mana-mana.','source_text'=>'That just means it\'s just running and it\'s not going anywhere.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>251.28,'end_time'=>252.3,'target_text'=>'Aku tak bawa motor ni.','source_text'=>'I\'m not driving.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>252.4,'end_time'=>253.5,'target_text'=>'Aku tak brek pun.','source_text'=>'I\'m not uh braking.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>253.6,'end_time'=>254.94,'target_text'=>'Aku cuma biarkan enjin berputar melahu je.','source_text'=>'I\'m just letting it idle.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>255.04,'end_time'=>258.06,'target_text'=>'Enjin dah hidup dan cuma berjalan setempat.','source_text'=>'So, it\'s the engine is started and it\'s just going.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>258.16,'end_time'=>259.98,'target_text'=>'Enjin tengah hidup, tapi aku tak tunggang.','source_text'=>'The engine is going, but I\'m not driving it.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>260.08,'end_time'=>261.74,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku biarkan melahu setempat.','source_text'=>'So, I\'m just letting it idle.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>261.84,'end_time'=>263.66,'target_text'=>'Motosikal tengah melahu.','source_text'=>'The bike is idling.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>263.76,'end_time'=>265.82,'target_text'=>'Dan kau memang kena buat macam ni untuk panaskan enjin motor dulu.','source_text'=>'And you have to do this to let the bike warm up.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>265.92,'end_time'=>269.66,'target_text'=>'Lebih-lebih lagi sekarang ni, macam korang boleh tengok luar ni agak sejuk.','source_text'=>'Especially right now, you can see it\'s pretty cold out.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>269.76,'end_time'=>272.78,'target_text'=>'Sejuk sangat... berapa suhu sekarang?','source_text'=>'It\'s uh like what how how cold is it?','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>272.88,'end_time'=>274.7,'target_text'=>'Macam berapa darjah suhu dia?','source_text'=>'It\'s like what\'s the temperature?','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>274.8,'end_time'=>277.02,'target_text'=>'Rasanya hari ni 5 darjah.','source_text'=>'>> I think it\'s 5° today.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>277.12,'end_time'=>279.42,'target_text'=>'5 darjah Celsius.','source_text'=>'>> 5° Celsius.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>279.52,'end_time'=>281.98,'target_text'=>'Itulah suhu hari ni.','source_text'=>'That is the temperature today.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>282.08,'end_time'=>284.62,'target_text'=>'Yang ni beberapa maklumat pasal motosikal lasak ni.','source_text'=>'So, this is just some information on the dirt bike.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>284.72,'end_time'=>287.58,'target_text'=>'Ada bagitahu model dan juga tahun buatan.','source_text'=>'It tells you the model and also the year.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>287.68,'end_time'=>289.18,'target_text'=>'Buatan mana motor ni?','source_text'=>'>> Where was it made?','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>289.28,'end_time'=>291.1,'target_text'=>'Dibuat kat Jepun.','source_text'=>'>> It was made in Japan.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>291.2,'end_time'=>292.94,'target_text'=>'Salam penghargaan untuk semua penonton aku dari Jepun.','source_text'=>'Shout out to all my Japanese viewers.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>293.04,'end_time'=>294.94,'target_text'=>'Bagitahu aku kalau korang ada kat Jepun.','source_text'=>'Let me know if you\'re in Japan.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>295.04,'end_time'=>300.04,'target_text'=>'Okey, sekarang aku nak buat satu pusingan kecil dan gerak keluar.','source_text'=>'Okay, so now I\'m just going to do a little loop and head out.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>302.16,'end_time'=>303.96,'target_text'=>'Jadi...','source_text'=>'So','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>305.36,'end_time'=>308.38,'target_text'=>'kemahiran mendengar sangat penting untuk korang fasih berbahasa Inggeris.','source_text'=>'listening is super important for becoming fluent in English.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>308.48,'end_time'=>311.18,'target_text'=>'Tapi ada satu perkara yang orang selalu terlepas pandang.','source_text'=>'But there\'s one thing people always overlook.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>311.28,'end_time'=>311.68,'target_text'=>'Pertuturan.','source_text'=>'Speaking.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>311.76,'end_time'=>314.54,'target_text'=>'Malah ada yang kata bertutur ni lagi penting.','source_text'=>'Some even say speaking is more important.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>314.64,'end_time'=>319.58,'target_text'=>'Tapi macam mana korang nak berlatih cakap kalau tak ada kawan nak berbual secara berdepan?','source_text'=>'But how can you practice speaking when you don\'t have anyone to talk to in real life?','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>319.68,'end_time'=>324.38,'target_text'=>'Sebab itulah aku ambil keputusan untuk mula buat siri video eksklusif.','source_text'=>'That\'s why I decided to start making a whole series of exclusive videos.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>324.48,'end_time'=>331.5,'target_text'=>'Video yang direka khas untuk asah pertuturan, sebutan, rentak gaya, dan paling utama, keyakinan diri korang','source_text'=>'videos designed to help practice your speaking, your pronunciation, your rhythm, and most importantly, your confidence in','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>331.6,'end_time'=>332,'target_text'=>'berbahasa Inggeris.','source_text'=>'English.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>332.08,'end_time'=>341.18,'target_text'=>'Kat dalam tu, korang dapat 30 pelajaran eksklusif serta-merta, dan aku muat naik 3 hingga 5 video baharu setiap minggu supaya korang boleh berlatih secara konsisten','source_text'=>'Inside, you\'ll get 30 exclusive lessons immediately, and I upload three to five new videos every week, so you can train consistently','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>341.28,'end_time'=>343.18,'target_text'=>'dan betul-betul nampak peningkatan.','source_text'=>'and actually improve.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>343.28,'end_time'=>346.54,'target_text'=>'Ni sedutan ringkas apa yang korang akan dapat sebaik sahaja sertai.','source_text'=>'Now, here\'s a sneak peek at what you\'ll get the moment you join.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>346.64,'end_time'=>350.7,'target_text'=>'Selamat kembali kawan-kawan ke sesi latihan shadowing yang seterusnya.','source_text'=>'Welcome back, guys, to another shadowing lesson.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>350.8,'end_time'=>352.86,'target_text'=>'Dalam sesi ni, aku nak korang shadow ikut sebutan aku.','source_text'=>'In this lesson, I want you to shadow me.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>352.96,'end_time'=>353.58,'target_text'=>'Apa maksud shadowing?','source_text'=>'What does that mean?','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>353.68,'end_time'=>357.82,'target_text'=>'Maksudnya lepas aku sebut satu ayat, korang jeda video.','source_text'=>'It means after I say a sentence, paused the video.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>357.92,'end_time'=>359.34,'target_text'=>'Aku terkejut gila.','source_text'=>'I was floored.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>359.44,'end_time'=>362.86,'target_text'=>'Tak pernah ada pelanggan yang pertikaikan pasal berat badan aku.','source_text'=>'I\'ve never had a client have an issue with my weight.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>362.96,'end_time'=>367.82,'target_text'=>'Aku desak dan tanya dia kalau-kalau ada aduan lain.','source_text'=>'I pushed and asked him if there had been any complaints instead.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>367.92,'end_time'=>370.86,'target_text'=>'Bila aku dapat tahu, aku rasa terkilan, tapi aku cuba lepaskan dan lupakan.','source_text'=>'When I found out I was hurt, but I tried to let it go.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>370.96,'end_time'=>375.02,'target_text'=>'Masukkan nama Logan dalam emel jemputan sesi lepak minggu depan.','source_text'=>'Add Logan to the email invite for the next week\'s hangout.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>375.12,'end_time'=>377.98,'target_text'=>'Dia perasan yang dia tak dapat jemputan dan mula bertanya.','source_text'=>'He noticed he never got an invite and began to ask.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>378.08,'end_time'=>379.82,'target_text'=>'Ada dua cawan.','source_text'=>'There are two cups.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>379.92,'end_time'=>382.22,'target_text'=>'Aku dengar ramai orang kena rompak kat sini.','source_text'=>'I\'ve heard a lot of people get robbed here.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>382.32,'end_time'=>383.74,'target_text'=>'atau bas persiaran.','source_text'=>'or a coach bus.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>383.84,'end_time'=>391.02,'target_text'=>'Bila matahari terbenam, kita akan belajar bahasa Inggeris sambil aku kemas bilik aku.','source_text'=>'When the sun sets, when the sun goes down, we are going to be learning English as I clean up my room to our area.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>391.12,'end_time'=>393.9,'target_text'=>'Beberapa tahun lepas, dia minta tolong aku carikan dia kerja.','source_text'=>'A few years ago, she asked me to get her a job.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>394,'end_time'=>396.28,'target_text'=>'Jadi jom sertai hari ini.','source_text'=>'So, join today.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>420.8,'end_time'=>422.22,'target_text'=>'Sekarang aku nak matikan enjin motor ni.','source_text'=>'So now I\'m going to turn the bike off.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>422.32,'end_time'=>429.4,'target_text'=>'Aku boleh cakap aku nak matikan motor atau aku nak henti motor atau aku nak padamkan enjin.','source_text'=>'So I can say I\'m going to turn the bike off or I\'m going to shut the bike off or I\'m going to kill the engine.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>430.8,'end_time'=>432.38,'target_text'=>'Haa selesai.','source_text'=>'So there we go.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>432.48,'end_time'=>438.06,'target_text'=>'Enjin dah mati dan aku nak sandarkan motor ni pada tiang bendera ni.','source_text'=>'Bike is off and I\'m going to lean it up against this flag pole.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>438.16,'end_time'=>441.58,'target_text'=>'Aku baru je sandarkan motor lasak ni pada tiang bendera.','source_text'=>'I just leaned the dirt bike against the flag pole.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>441.68,'end_time'=>443.34,'target_text'=>'Benda ni tiang bendera (flag pole).','source_text'=>'This right here is a flag pole.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>443.44,'end_time'=>447.66,'target_text'=>'Aku, abang aku, dengan ayah aku baru je pasang bendera ni hari tu.','source_text'=>'So, me, my brother, and my dad, we hung this flag the other day.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>447.76,'end_time'=>450.78,'target_text'=>'Dan kita orang ada buat banyak lagi kerja-kerja lain keliling rumah.','source_text'=>'And we also, you know, we did a lot of other things around the house.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>450.88,'end_time'=>454.38,'target_text'=>'Macam korang boleh nampak, sekarang ni musim luruh.','source_text'=>'It\'s uh as you can tell, it\'s fall right now.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>454.48,'end_time'=>456.14,'target_text'=>'Korang boleh tengok pokok yang satu ni.','source_text'=>'You can see this tree right here.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>456.24,'end_time'=>458.14,'target_text'=>'Semua daun dah luruh berguguran.','source_text'=>'All the leaves have fallen off.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>458.24,'end_time'=>461.9,'target_text'=>'Semua daun dah bertaburan atas tanah sekarang.','source_text'=>'So, all the leaves are on the ground right now.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>462,'end_time'=>463.98,'target_text'=>'Semua daun dah luruh daripada pokok.','source_text'=>'They have all fallen off the tree.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>464.08,'end_time'=>465.82,'target_text'=>'Kat sini ada sebatang lagi pokok.','source_text'=>'Right here is another tree.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>465.92,'end_time'=>468.62,'target_text'=>'Dan korang boleh nampak hampir semua daun masih lekat elok kat dahan.','source_text'=>'And you can see all the leaves are pretty much still on.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>468.72,'end_time'=>476.62,'target_text'=>'Mestilah ada beberapa helai daun yang luruh, tapi kebanyakannya pokok ni masih ada daun.','source_text'=>'There\'s of course some leaves that have fallen off, but for the most part, it\'s this tree still has all its leaves.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>476.72,'end_time'=>480.3,'target_text'=>'Bangunan ni pula dipanggil bengkel (shop / workshop).','source_text'=>'This building right here is called a shop.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>480.4,'end_time'=>483.18,'target_text'=>'Jom kita masuk dalam bengkel ni.','source_text'=>'So, let\'s go into the shop.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>483.28,'end_time'=>484.86,'target_text'=>'Ni cuma pintu sisi tepi.','source_text'=>'So, this is just a side door.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>484.96,'end_time'=>486.94,'target_text'=>'Benda ni pad kekunci nombor (keypad).','source_text'=>'This right here is a keypad.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>487.04,'end_time'=>489.58,'target_text'=>'Pad kekunci tempat korang boleh masukkan kod laluan keselamatan.','source_text'=>'A keypad where you could put a passcode in.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>489.68,'end_time'=>491.58,'target_text'=>'Kod laluan (passcode).','source_text'=>'A passcode.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>491.68,'end_time'=>495.74,'target_text'=>'Kod laluan ni macam kata laluan (password), tapi cuma guna nombor sahaja.','source_text'=>'A passcode is just like a password, but there\'s only numbers.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>495.84,'end_time'=>496.46,'target_text'=>'Kod laluan.','source_text'=>'A passcode.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>496.56,'end_time'=>502.78,'target_text'=>'Kata laluan lebih kurang sama, tapi kata laluan boleh guna huruf dan simbol-simbol lain sekali.','source_text'=>'A password is similar, but a password you could have letters and other symbols as well.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>502.88,'end_time'=>505.18,'target_text'=>'Aku takkan tutup pintu bengkel ni rapat habis.','source_text'=>'I\'m not going to close the shop door all the way.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>505.28,'end_time'=>508.22,'target_text'=>'Aku tutup separuh je kot.','source_text'=>'I\'ll close it maybe maybe half.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>508.32,'end_time'=>511.02,'target_text'=>'Ni pintu bengkel.','source_text'=>'So, this right here is the shop door.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>511.12,'end_time'=>514.54,'target_text'=>'Pintu dia memang besar gila.','source_text'=>'It\'s a very big big door.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>514.64,'end_time'=>516.92,'target_text'=>'Rasa macam...','source_text'=>'I think right','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>517.84,'end_time'=>519.1,'target_text'=>'Aku rasa setakat ni dah elok dah.','source_text'=>'I think that\'s good.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>519.2,'end_time'=>522.86,'target_text'=>'Benda ni kawan-kawan, kita panggil lori treler semi (semi-truck).','source_text'=>'So this right here, you guys, we call this a semi-truck.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>522.96,'end_time'=>524.46,'target_text'=>'Ini lori semi-treler.','source_text'=>'This is a semi-truck.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>524.56,'end_time'=>526.62,'target_text'=>'Lori ni sangat besar.','source_text'=>'And it\'s a very big truck.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>526.72,'end_time'=>530.3,'target_text'=>'Yang kat sana tu pun korang boleh panggil lori, tapi itu trak pikap (pickup truck).','source_text'=>'That right there, you can also call a truck, but that is a pickup truck.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>530.4,'end_time'=>532.22,'target_text'=>'Dan yang ni pula lori semi-treler.','source_text'=>'And this is a semi-truck.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>532.32,'end_time'=>535.34,'target_text'=>'Dan korang boleh nampak ada dua buah lori semi-treler kat dalam ni.','source_text'=>'And you can see there are two semi-truckss in here.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>535.44,'end_time'=>537.82,'target_text'=>'Satu warna putih dan satu lagi warna hitam.','source_text'=>'A white one and a black one.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>537.92,'end_time'=>540.38,'target_text'=>'Dan ini bampar lori semi-treler.','source_text'=>'And this is the semitruck bumper.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>540.48,'end_time'=>542.06,'target_text'=>'Besar gila saiz dia.','source_text'=>'It is huge.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>542.16,'end_time'=>543.02,'target_text'=>'Besar sangat.','source_text'=>'It is huge.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>543.12,'end_time'=>549.02,'target_text'=>'Ni rasanya antara bampar paling besar yang korang pernah nampak pada kenderaan.','source_text'=>'Like this is probably one of the biggest bumpers you\'ll see on a vehicle.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>549.12,'end_time'=>551.96,'target_text'=>'Kau boleh pandu lori semi-treler ni ke?','source_text'=>'>> So, can you drive a semi-truck?','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>552.08,'end_time'=>554.38,'target_text'=>'Boleh ke aku pandu lori semi-treler?','source_text'=>'>> Can I drive a semitr?','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>554.48,'end_time'=>554.88,'target_text'=>'Tak boleh.','source_text'=>'No.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>554.96,'end_time'=>559.02,'target_text'=>'Sebabnya ialah kau perlukan lesen khas.','source_text'=>'And the reason is is because you need a license.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>559.12,'end_time'=>566.3,'target_text'=>'Dompet aku tak ada kat tangan sekarang, tapi kau perlukan lesen yang menyatakan jenis kenderaan yang kau boleh pandu.','source_text'=>'So, I don\'t have my wallet on me now, but you need a license, which is just something that says what vehicles you can drive.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>566.4,'end_time'=>567.98,'target_text'=>'Dan aku tak ada lesen untuk pandu lori ni.','source_text'=>'And I don\'t have a license to drive this.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>568.08,'end_time'=>575.1,'target_text'=>'Aku cuma ada lesen untuk pandu kenderaan macam ni, macam trak pikap, kereta sedan, hatchback, atau SUV.','source_text'=>'I just have a license to drive something like this, like a truck or a pickup truck or a car or a hatchback or SUV.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>575.2,'end_time'=>578.3,'target_text'=>'Kelas lesen apa untuk kenderaan biasa?','source_text'=>'>> And what class of license is a regular vehicle?','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>578.4,'end_time'=>585.02,'target_text'=>'Aku tak pasti sama ada seluruh dunia sama, tapi aku ada lesen Kelas 5 dan lesen tu membolehkan kau pandu kenderaan macam','source_text'=>'>> I\'m not sure if it\'s similar throughout the whole world, but I have a class 5 and uh that lets you drive vehicles like','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>585.12,'end_time'=>585.52,'target_text'=>'ni.','source_text'=>'this.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>585.6,'end_time'=>591.18,'target_text'=>'Dan baru-baru ni aku baru dapat lesen Kelas 6, iaitu untuk motosikal.','source_text'=>'And recently, I got my class 6 license, which is motorcycles.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>591.28,'end_time'=>593.58,'target_text'=>'Jadi sekarang aku dah boleh tunggang motosikal secara sah di sisi undang-undang.','source_text'=>'So now I could drive motorcycles legally.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>593.68,'end_time'=>600.3,'target_text'=>'Sebab aku teringin nak pergi ke Vietnam dan pusing laluan gelung apa nama tu kat utara Vietnam atas Hanoi.','source_text'=>'And that is because I want to go to Vietnam and do the what\'s that loop called in northern Vietnam north of Hanoi.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>600.4,'end_time'=>601.34,'target_text'=>'Ha...','source_text'=>'Ha.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>601.44,'end_time'=>602.7,'target_text'=>'Oh, gelung Ha Giang (Ha Giang loop).','source_text'=>'>> Oh, the Hagyan loop.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>602.8,'end_time'=>603.42,'target_text'=>'Ha Giang.','source_text'=>'>> Hagyang.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>603.52,'end_time'=>605.1,'target_text'=>'Aku tak pasti sebutan aku betul ke tak.','source_text'=>'I don\'t know if I\'m saying that right.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>605.2,'end_time'=>610.86,'target_text'=>'Aku teringin nak pergi gelung Ha Giang tu... berapa lama ambil masa nak habiskan pusingan tu?','source_text'=>'I want I want to go on the Hagyang loop, which is like a How long How many days is the Hagan loop?','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>610.96,'end_time'=>615.9,'target_text'=>'Masa aku buat dulu ambil masa 3 hari, tapi boleh buat lagi pendek atau lagi lama.','source_text'=>'>> Well, I did it and it was 3 days for me, but you can do shorter or longer.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>616,'end_time'=>618.38,'target_text'=>'Okey, dalam 3 hingga 5 hari kot.','source_text'=>'>> Okay, so like 3 to 5 days, I would say.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>618.48,'end_time'=>620.7,'target_text'=>'Aku teringin nak pergi tunggang motor pusing laluan gelung Ha Giang tu.','source_text'=>'I want to go and bike around the Hagyang Loop.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>620.8,'end_time'=>622.22,'target_text'=>'Dengar cerita memang best gila.','source_text'=>'Apparently, it\'s very good.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>622.32,'end_time'=>624.38,'target_text'=>'Benda tu jadi kenangan paling manis untuk semua orang kan?','source_text'=>'But it\'s like everyone\'s highlight, right?','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>624.48,'end_time'=>625.42,'target_text'=>'Itu kenangan paling best kau ke?','source_text'=>'Was it your highlight?','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>625.52,'end_time'=>626.54,'target_text'=>'Ya, seronok gila masa tu.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, it was really fun.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>626.64,'end_time'=>628.62,'target_text'=>'Itu detik paling bermakna (highlight) dalam trip kau ke?','source_text'=>'>> Was it the highlight of your trip?','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>628.72,'end_time'=>630.94,'target_text'=>'Memang kenangan paling terbaik masa trip aku kat Vietnam.','source_text'=>'>> Definitely the highlight of my trip to Vietnam.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>631.04,'end_time'=>634.38,'target_text'=>'\"Highlight\" ni maksudnya detik atau bahagian paling best sekali dalam sesuatu perjalanan.','source_text'=>'>> Highlight is like the one like the best part of the trip.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>634.48,'end_time'=>640.86,'target_text'=>'Banyak benda menarik masa melawat sesebuah negara, tapi highlight ni macam apa yang paling kau suka sekali?','source_text'=>'Like there\'s a lot of like good things about visiting a country, but the highlight is like what was what was your favorite?','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>640.96,'end_time'=>641.82,'target_text'=>'Apa kenangan kemuncak kau?','source_text'=>'What was your highlight?','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>641.92,'end_time'=>644.54,'target_text'=>'Dan semua orang bagitahu aku pasal benda tu.','source_text'=>'And everyone has told me that.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>644.64,'end_time'=>647.02,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku teringin nak buat sebab aku pernah pergi Vietnam sebulan,','source_text'=>'So I want to do it cuz I went to Vietnam.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>647.12,'end_time'=>651.42,'target_text'=>'tapi aku tak pernah buat pusingan motor tu.','source_text'=>'I spent one month in Vietnam, but I never did the bike loop.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>651.52,'end_time'=>651.92,'target_text'=>'Rugi gila rasa.','source_text'=>'Sucks.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>651.92,'end_time'=>658.78,'target_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, bro bro, boleh tolong aku tolak Jeep ni masuk kat sini?','source_text'=>'Anyways, >> yo >> yo, >> can you can you give me a hand pushing this Jeep in >> just right here?','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>658.88,'end_time'=>660.54,'target_text'=>'Rasa macam kita boleh muatkan kat depan van tu.','source_text'=>'>> I think we can get it in front of the van.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>660.64,'end_time'=>661.98,'target_text'=>'Bukan.','source_text'=>'No.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>662.08,'end_time'=>663.18,'target_text'=>'Ya, rasa macam boleh muat kat sini.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, I think it could fit here.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>663.28,'end_time'=>665.96,'target_text'=>'Biar aku alihkan barang ni kejap.','source_text'=>'I I\'ll just move this.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>666.32,'end_time'=>669.74,'target_text'=>'Aku dah cuba hidupkan tadi, tapi sejuk sangat enjin tak nak hidup.','source_text'=>'>> I tried starting it, but it\'s a little too cold to start it.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>669.84,'end_time'=>670.24,'target_text'=>'Okey.','source_text'=>'>> Okay.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>670.24,'end_time'=>671.18,'target_text'=>'Kau rasa kita boleh tolak berdua ke?','source_text'=>'You think we could push it?','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>671.28,'end_time'=>672.22,'target_text'=>'Cuma kita berdua je?','source_text'=>'Just the two of us?','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>672.32,'end_time'=>674.06,'target_text'=>'Boleh, roda dia berpusing senang je.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s rolls pretty easily.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>674.16,'end_time'=>675.1,'target_text'=>'Tak berat sangat pun.','source_text'=>'It\'s not too heavy.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>675.2,'end_time'=>675.82,'target_text'=>'Okey.','source_text'=>'>> Okay.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>675.92,'end_time'=>676.16,'target_text'=>'Okey.','source_text'=>'Okay.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>676.16,'end_time'=>680.36,'target_text'=>'Jom kita tolak kereta Jeep ni masuk ke dalam bengkel.','source_text'=>'So, let\'s push the Jeep in inside the shop then.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>682.08,'end_time'=>684.3,'target_text'=>'Benda kat sini ni kawan-kawan,','source_text'=>'This right here, you guys,','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>684.4,'end_time'=>687.26,'target_text'=>'ini tong jerigen (jerry can).','source_text'=>'this this is a jerry can.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>687.36,'end_time'=>688.54,'target_text'=>'Ini tong jerigen.','source_text'=>'This is a jerry can.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>688.64,'end_time'=>692.38,'target_text'=>'Korang tahu tak apa kegunaan tong jerigen ni?','source_text'=>'Do you guys know what you use a jerry can for?','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>692.48,'end_time'=>695.18,'target_text'=>'Digunakan untuk isi atau simpan bahan api minyak.','source_text'=>'It\'s used to hold fuel or to store fuel.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>695.28,'end_time'=>699.42,'target_text'=>'Korang masukkan minyak dalam tong jerigen ni lepas tu boleh bawa ke sana sini.','source_text'=>'So, you put fuel inside the jerry can and then you can carry it around.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>699.52,'end_time'=>703.82,'target_text'=>'Jadi cara yang sangat mudah dan senang alih untuk bawa bekalan minyak korang.','source_text'=>'So, it\'s a very easy and portable way to carry your fuel around.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>703.92,'end_time'=>704.32,'target_text'=>'Oh ya.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>704.4,'end_time'=>705.66,'target_text'=>'Senang je tolak ni.','source_text'=>'That\'s easy.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>705.76,'end_time'=>710.38,'target_text'=>'Jangan hilang momentum laju tolak tu, sebab aku cuma pakai selipar selesa je ni.','source_text'=>'Don\'t lose momentum, though, cuz I\'m kind of I\'m kind of in the chunkless.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>710.48,'end_time'=>712.94,'target_text'=>'Macam mana keadaan belah sana tu?','source_text'=>'How\'s it looking on that side?','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>713.04,'end_time'=>713.28,'target_text'=>'Elok.','source_text'=>'>> Good.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>713.28,'end_time'=>714.54,'target_text'=>'Ada banyak ruang lagi.','source_text'=>'You have lots of room.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>714.64,'end_time'=>715.5,'target_text'=>'Tolak kuat sikit bro!','source_text'=>'>> Oh, push hard, man.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>715.6,'end_time'=>718.12,'target_text'=>'Kena lepas tebing bonggol ni.','source_text'=>'We got to get over this hump.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>718.4,'end_time'=>721.5,'target_text'=>'Itu jek kereta (car jack).','source_text'=>'>> So, that is a car jack.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>721.6,'end_time'=>727.18,'target_text'=>'Dan digunakan dalam situasi macam ni bila kau kena angkat kenderaan naik ke atas.','source_text'=>'And it is used in situations like this where you need to lift up a vehicle.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>727.28,'end_time'=>734.78,'target_text'=>'Jadi kita kena buat kerja secara bijak bukan guna tenaga semata-mata, tarik bahagian belakang Jeep rapat ke dinding guna jek.','source_text'=>'>> So, we\'re going to work smarter, not harder, and pull the back end of the Jeep closer to the wall with the jack.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>734.88,'end_time'=>741.02,'target_text'=>'Satu benda pasal kenderaan Jeep ni, dia tak berapa boleh diharap sangat.','source_text'=>'One thing about this vehicle, this Jeep, is that it\'s not very reliable.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>741.12,'end_time'=>742.7,'target_text'=>'Tak berapa boleh diharap (reliable).','source_text'=>'It\'s not very reliable.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>742.8,'end_time'=>749.74,'target_text'=>'Maksudnya kau tak boleh nak sandarkan harapan atau percayakan kenderaan ni sepenuhnya, sebab macam korang nampak tadi kita terpaksa tolak','source_text'=>'That just means you can\'t count on it or you can\'t uh trust the vehicle because, as you saw, we had to push it in because','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>749.84,'end_time'=>751.58,'target_text'=>'sebab enjin tak boleh hidup.','source_text'=>'it wouldn\'t start.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>751.68,'end_time'=>753.66,'target_text'=>'Enjin tak nak hidup.','source_text'=>'It wouldn\'t start.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>753.76,'end_time'=>755.18,'target_text'=>'Jadi...','source_text'=>'So,','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>755.28,'end_time'=>756.38,'target_text'=>'kenderaan ni tak boleh diharap.','source_text'=>'it\'s not reliable.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>756.48,'end_time'=>762.46,'target_text'=>'Kenderaan yang boleh diharap akan hidup setiap kali kau cuba, tapi kenderaan ni bukan jenis macam tu.','source_text'=>'A reliable vehicle will start every time, but this is not a reliable vehicle.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>762.56,'end_time'=>763.34,'target_text'=>'Kita dah selesai kat dalam ni.','source_text'=>'We\'re done in here.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>763.44,'end_time'=>765.34,'target_text'=>'Kita dah simpan Jeep dengan motosikal lasak ke dalam bengkel.','source_text'=>'We packed away the Jeep and the dirt bike.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>765.44,'end_time'=>769.58,'target_text'=>'Sekarang jom kita masuk dalam rumah dan ajar korang beberapa perkataan lagi.','source_text'=>'Now, let\'s go inside the house and teach you guys some more words.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>769.68,'end_time'=>776.22,'target_text'=>'Masa aku tengah sunting video ni, aku sedar aku masih nak perkemaskan jalan cerita dan visual video aku.','source_text'=>'So, while I was editing this video, I realized I still want to improve how my stories flow and look on screen.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>776.32,'end_time'=>782.3,'target_text'=>'Aku mula tonton kelas kat Skillshare bertajuk kelas suntingan video CapCut mendalam.','source_text'=>'I started watching a Skillshare class called in-depth Cap Cut video editing master class.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>782.4,'end_time'=>789.26,'target_text'=>'Ia bantu aku potong klip dengan lebih laju, guna transisi yang lebih kemas, dan buat setiap babak nampak lebih sinematik dan mudah difahami.','source_text'=>'It has helped me cut faster, use better transitions, and make each scene feel more cinematic and easier to follow.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>789.36,'end_time'=>795.18,'target_text'=>'Apa yang paling aku suka pasal Skillshare ialah kelas diajar oleh pengkarya profesional sebenar.','source_text'=>'What I like most about Skillshare is that the classes are taught by real working creatives.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>795.28,'end_time'=>802.06,'target_text'=>'Diorang ni pembikin filem, pereka grafik, dan jurugambar yang kongsi teknik sama yang diorang guna setiap hari.','source_text'=>'These are filmmakers, designers, and photographers sharing the same techniques they use every single day.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>802.16,'end_time'=>804.7,'target_text'=>'Jadi korang belajar terus daripada orang yang korang kagumi.','source_text'=>'So, you learn directly from people you admire.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>804.8,'end_time'=>807.9,'target_text'=>'Korang boleh ikuti kelas pada bila-bila masa mengikut rentak kelajuan korang sendiri.','source_text'=>'You can take classes whenever you want and learn at your own pace.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>808,'end_time'=>814.22,'target_text'=>'Aku tonton video ringkas, terus praktikkan teknik tu, dan nampak perbezaan ketara serta-merta pada hasil suntingan aku.','source_text'=>'I watch a short lesson, apply the technique right away, and notice an instant difference in my edits.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>814.32,'end_time'=>822.14,'target_text'=>'Kalau korang nak belajar menyunting, mereka bentuk, fotografi, atau bahasa Inggeris, platform ni mudahkan korang bina tabiat kreatif','source_text'=>'If you want to learn editing, design, photography, or even English, this platform makes it easy to build a creative habit','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>822.24,'end_time'=>824.86,'target_text'=>'dan siapkan projek yang korang boleh banggakan.','source_text'=>'and actually finish projects you are proud of.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>824.96,'end_time'=>833.18,'target_text'=>'Diorang juga ada kelas bahasa Inggeris dari latihan sebutan sampai komunikasi lanjutan supaya korang kedengaran lebih natural','source_text'=>'They also have English classes that range from pronunciation practice to advanced communication so you can sound more natural','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>833.28,'end_time'=>834.22,'target_text'=>'bila bercakap.','source_text'=>'when you speak.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>834.32,'end_time'=>842.54,'target_text'=>'500 orang terawal yang guna pautan aku kat penerangan atau kod QR akan dapat percubaan percuma Skillshare selama sebulan.','source_text'=>'The first 500 people to use my link in the description or my QR code will receive a one month free trial of Skillshare.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>842.64,'end_time'=>843.9,'target_text'=>'Jadi mulakan hari ini.','source_text'=>'So get started today.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>844,'end_time'=>846.22,'target_text'=>'Terima kasih Skillshare kerana menaja video ini.','source_text'=>'Thank you Skillshare for sponsoring this video.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>846.32,'end_time'=>850.86,'target_text'=>'Dan sekarang korang akan nampak hasil daripada apa yang aku belajar dalam kelas tadi sepanjang video ni.','source_text'=>'And now you will see the results of what I learned in my class in the rest of this video.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>850.96,'end_time'=>853.98,'target_text'=>'Jadi teruskan menonton dan bagitahu aku kalau korang perasan perbezaannya.','source_text'=>'So keep watching and tell me if you notice the difference.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>854.08,'end_time'=>857.26,'target_text'=>'Kasut ni dah sangat lusuh dan haus.','source_text'=>'So these shoes are very worn.','order'=>281],
