            ['start_time'=>891.68,'end_time'=>892.94,'target_text'=>'Aku kena bersihkan dapur ni.','source_text'=>'I need to clean the kitchen.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>893.04,'end_time'=>894.54,'target_text'=>'Kotor sikit keadaan dia.','source_text'=>'It\'s a little dirty.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>894.64,'end_time'=>901.9,'target_text'=>'Tapi aku nak keringkan tangan aku guna tuala tangan ni atau tuala dapur ni.','source_text'=>'Uh, but I\'m going to dry my hands with this hand towel or this kitchen towel.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>902,'end_time'=>905,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku cuma lap keringkan tangan aku kat sini.','source_text'=>'So, I\'m just drying my hands here.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>905.28,'end_time'=>907.66,'target_text'=>'Dan yang ni pula mesin pembasuh pinggan (dishwasher).','source_text'=>'And this right here is the dishwasher.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>907.76,'end_time'=>912.22,'target_text'=>'Sekarang ni separuh penuh dengan pinggan mangkuk kotor.','source_text'=>'And right now, it is half filled with dirty dishes.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>912.32,'end_time'=>913.1,'target_text'=>'Pinggan mangkuk kotor.','source_text'=>'Dirty dishes.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>913.2,'end_time'=>915.82,'target_text'=>'Bahagian ni dipanggil rak (racks).','source_text'=>'So, so these are called racks.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>915.92,'end_time'=>919.66,'target_text'=>'Rak atas dan rak bawah.','source_text'=>'The upper rack or the top rack and the bottom rack.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>919.76,'end_time'=>923.1,'target_text'=>'Itu rak tempat korang susun pinggan mangkuk korang.','source_text'=>'So, those are racks where you put your dishes.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>923.2,'end_time'=>925.1,'target_text'=>'Aku kena bersihkan dapur ni.','source_text'=>'So, I need to clean the kitchen.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>925.2,'end_time'=>929.1,'target_text'=>'Ada beberapa periuk dan kuali dalam sinki.','source_text'=>'There are a couple pots and pans in the sink.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>929.2,'end_time'=>933.1,'target_text'=>'Ada kuali leper atas dapur gas yang aku kena basuh juga.','source_text'=>'There are pans on the stove that I also need to clean.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>933.2,'end_time'=>935.42,'target_text'=>'Dan ada beberapa biji gelas atas kaunter meja.','source_text'=>'And there are some glasses on the counter.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>935.52,'end_time'=>939.48,'target_text'=>'Benda ni pula tuala kertas tisu dapur (paper towel).','source_text'=>'This right here is paper towel.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>939.92,'end_time'=>941.18,'target_text'=>'Ini tisu gulung dapur.','source_text'=>'This is paper towel.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>941.28,'end_time'=>945.24,'target_text'=>'Boleh korang gambarkan tisu dapur ni untuk aku?','source_text'=>'Can you describe this paper towel for me?','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>945.44,'end_time'=>947.5,'target_text'=>'Tisu dapur ni warna putih.','source_text'=>'This paper towel is white.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>947.6,'end_time'=>950.04,'target_text'=>'Dah pernah digunakan.','source_text'=>'It has been used.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>950.48,'end_time'=>951.66,'target_text'=>'Rasa dia pun lembut sangat.','source_text'=>'It\'s also very soft.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>951.76,'end_time'=>957.9,'target_text'=>'Tisu dapur ni lembut dan salah satu sifatnya ialah menyerap cecair dengan sangat baik.','source_text'=>'The paper towel is soft and one of its properties is that it absorbs liquids very well.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>958,'end_time'=>966.3,'target_text'=>'Satu benda aku nak tunjuk kat korang benda yang aku suka gila, sesuatu yang ibarat kemewahan kecil.','source_text'=>'One thing I want to show you guys something that I really really like, something that uh it\'s just like a small luxury.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>966.4,'end_time'=>973.26,'target_text'=>'Benda yang tak wajib pun, tapi seronok kalau ada, dan ia berkaitan dengan benda ni.','source_text'=>'It\'s like a something that\'s not necessary, but it it is really nice to have, and it\'s to do with this.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>973.36,'end_time'=>976.94,'target_text'=>'Boleh korang teka apa aku nak buat dengan botol ni?','source_text'=>'Can you guys guess what I\'m going to do with this bottle?','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>977.04,'end_time'=>981.02,'target_text'=>'Sekarang ni aku tengah isikan botol ni dengan air daripada jag ni.','source_text'=>'So, right now, I\'m filling up this bottle with this jug of water.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>981.12,'end_time'=>985.42,'target_text'=>'Kalau korang datang tengok sini, aku akan tunjuk benda ni kat korang.','source_text'=>'If you guys come around here, I will show you this right here.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>985.52,'end_time'=>987.58,'target_text'=>'Mesin ni macam buat silap mata.','source_text'=>'This machine does magic.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>987.68,'end_time'=>989.66,'target_text'=>'Mesin ni buat helah silap mata.','source_text'=>'It performs magic tricks.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>989.76,'end_time'=>992.28,'target_text'=>'Ibarat ahli silap mata.','source_text'=>'So, this is a magician.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>992.56,'end_time'=>994.78,'target_text'=>'Inilah keajaiban yang dia buat.','source_text'=>'So, this is the magic it performs.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>994.88,'end_time'=>997.72,'target_text'=>'Dia tukarkan air kosong biasa','source_text'=>'It turns regular','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>998.16,'end_time'=>1003.16,'target_text'=>'air mati yang bosan, tapi inilah yang dia tambah.','source_text'=>'boring still water, but this is what it adds.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>1003.76,'end_time'=>1006.04,'target_text'=>'Dengar bunyi tu.','source_text'=>'Listen to that.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>1006.24,'end_time'=>1010.3,'target_text'=>'Dia tambahkan pengkarbonan, atau senang kata tambah buih gas.','source_text'=>'It adds carbonation or you can just say it adds bubbles.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>1010.4,'end_time'=>1013.18,'target_text'=>'Perkataan \"buih gas\" lagi senang nak ingat.','source_text'=>'That\'s probably a way easier word to remember.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>1013.28,'end_time'=>1015.02,'target_text'=>'Dia tambahkan buih gas berkarbonat dalam air korang.','source_text'=>'It adds bubbles to your water.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>1015.12,'end_time'=>1021.66,'target_text'=>'Kalau pesan benda ni kat restoran, korang boleh minta air berkarbonat atau air bergas (sparkling water).','source_text'=>'If you order this at the restaurant, you can ask for sparkling water or carbonated water.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>1021.76,'end_time'=>1023.66,'target_text'=>'Tapi biasanya orang minta sparkling water.','source_text'=>'But normally people ask for sparkling water.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>1023.76,'end_time'=>1025.42,'target_text'=>'Air bergas atau air biasa?','source_text'=>'Sparkling or still?','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>1025.52,'end_time'=>1026.22,'target_text'=>'Air biasa (still).','source_text'=>'Still.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>1026.32,'end_time'=>1029.02,'target_text'=>'Semua air soda dan minuman ringan ada gas karbonat.','source_text'=>'All sodas and pops are are carbonated.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>1029.12,'end_time'=>1036.6,'target_text'=>'Sebab itulah aku suka minum soda atau minuman ringan sebab rasa gas karbonat dia.','source_text'=>'So that\'s why I like drinking sodas or pops or something like that for its carbonation.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>1036.88,'end_time'=>1038.94,'target_text'=>'Tapi korang boleh datang tengok belah sini.','source_text'=>'But uh you guys can come around here.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>1039.04,'end_time'=>1040.3,'target_text'=>'Selimut-selimut ni tengah dikeringkan.','source_text'=>'So, these blankets are drying.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>1040.4,'end_time'=>1044.14,'target_text'=>'Kita basuh selimut dalam mesin basuh, lepas tu kita jemur keringkan secara angin atas sofa.','source_text'=>'So, we wash the blankets in the washer, but then we air dry them on the sofa.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>1044.24,'end_time'=>1047.58,'target_text'=>'Kadar selimut dan cadar ni tengah kering.','source_text'=>'So, blanket sheets, these are drying.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>1047.68,'end_time'=>1054.7,'target_text'=>'Dan kat dalam ni, sejujurnya aku tak pernah masuk sangat, tapi ada set cawan teh kat dalam ni.','source_text'=>'And right in here, I\'ve honestly never really been in here, but there\'s a tea set in here.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>1054.8,'end_time'=>1057.26,'target_text'=>'Rasanya set ni dari Afrika Selatan.','source_text'=>'I believe that is from uh South Africa.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>1057.36,'end_time'=>1059.9,'target_text'=>'Rasanya dulu kepunyaan nenek aku.','source_text'=>'I believe it was my grandma\'s originally.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>1060,'end_time'=>1061.5,'target_text'=>'Mak aku ada bagitahu aku pasal benda tu hari tu.','source_text'=>'My mom told me that the other day.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>1061.6,'end_time'=>1063.5,'target_text'=>'Oh, tapi benda ni kawan-kawan.','source_text'=>'Oh, but this this you guys.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>1063.6,'end_time'=>1065.82,'target_text'=>'Okey, benda kat sini ni,','source_text'=>'Okay, this right here,','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>1065.92,'end_time'=>1070.62,'target_text'=>'ini telur burung unta dari Afrika Selatan.','source_text'=>'this is an ostrich egg from South Africa.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>1070.72,'end_time'=>1072.38,'target_text'=>'Ini telur burung unta.','source_text'=>'This is an ostrich egg.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>1072.48,'end_time'=>1078.6,'target_text'=>'Burung unta ialah spesies burung paling besar dalam dunia.','source_text'=>'An ostrich is like the biggest bird species in the world.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>1078.8,'end_time'=>1080.7,'target_text'=>'Tadi kau ada makan apa-apa kat bandar?','source_text'=>'Did you have anything in the city?','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>1080.8,'end_time'=>1082.38,'target_text'=>'Ya, aku ada sarapan pagi tadi.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, I had some breakfast.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>1082.48,'end_time'=>1083.74,'target_text'=>'Makan kat Tim Hortons.','source_text'=>'Had some Tim Hortons.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>1083.84,'end_time'=>1085.82,'target_text'=>'Kau beli apa kat Tim Hortons?','source_text'=>'>> What did you get at Tim Hortons?','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>1085.92,'end_time'=>1087.42,'target_text'=>'Kopi double double.','source_text'=>'>> A double double.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>1087.52,'end_time'=>1088.62,'target_text'=>'Kopi double double.','source_text'=>'>> A double double.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>1088.72,'end_time'=>1091.42,'target_text'=>'Ada sesiapa kat luar Kanada yang tahu apa maksud benda tu?','source_text'=>'>> Does anyone that\'s not in Canada know what that means?','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>1091.52,'end_time'=>1091.76,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>1091.76,'end_time'=>1094.78,'target_text'=>'\"Double double\" ni rasanya cuma wujud kat Kanada je.','source_text'=>'A double double is something that\'s like I think only Canadian.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>1094.88,'end_time'=>1096.38,'target_text'=>'Memang ungkapan tradisi orang Kanada.','source_text'=>'It\'s very very Canadian to say.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>1096.48,'end_time'=>1102.54,'target_text'=>'Jadi kalau korang datang Kanada dan nak berbunyi macam orang tempatan bila pesan kopi kat mana-mana,','source_text'=>'So if you guys are ever coming to Canada and you want to sound Canadian, say if you\'re getting coffee somewhere, anywhere','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>1102.64,'end_time'=>1110.7,'target_text'=>'mana-mana kedai kopi kalau nak dua sudu gula dan dua sudu krim, sebut je nak \"double double\".','source_text'=>'really, any coffee shop or any place that sells coffee and you want two sugars and two creams, you just ask for a double double.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>1110.8,'end_time'=>1112.46,'target_text'=>'\"Double\" ni maksudnya macam dua.','source_text'=>'Double just means like two.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>1112.56,'end_time'=>1117.58,'target_text'=>'Jadi kalau kau cakap, \"Boleh bagi saya satu double double?\", maksudnya dua sudu gula dan dua sudu krim.','source_text'=>'So you say, \"Oh, can I get a double double?\" That means two sugars and two creams.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>1117.68,'end_time'=>1120.14,'target_text'=>'Jadi ini span basuh pinggan.','source_text'=>'So So this is a sponge.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>1120.24,'end_time'=>1122.94,'target_text'=>'Sekarang aku nak basuh kuali ni.','source_text'=>'And now I\'m going to wash this pan.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>1123.04,'end_time'=>1126.86,'target_text'=>'Aku letak sikit sabun pencuci pinggan atas span aku.','source_text'=>'I\'m going to put some dish soap on my sponge.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>1126.96,'end_time'=>1131.26,'target_text'=>'Dan sekarang aku renyuk berbuihkan span aku.','source_text'=>'And now I\'m going to lather up my sponge.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>1131.36,'end_time'=>1133.5,'target_text'=>'Lepas tu aku sental kuali ni.','source_text'=>'And now I\'m going to scrub this.','order'=>367],
