            ['start_time'=>108.56,'end_time'=>111.42,'target_text'=>'Ambil ayam panggang, tapi hidangan siap masak ni pun...','source_text'=>'>> Get a roasted chicken, but also this pre-cooked meals.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>111.52,'end_time'=>111.92,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>111.92,'end_time'=>112.38,'target_text'=>'Nampak sedap juga.','source_text'=>'>> Kind of looks good.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>112.48,'end_time'=>114.86,'target_text'=>'Diorang ada daging lembu halia dan daging babi masam manis.','source_text'=>'They got ginger beef and sweet and sour pork.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>114.96,'end_time'=>117.18,'target_text'=>'Dan ada kepak ayam madu bawang putih.','source_text'=>'And there\'s some honey garlic wings.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>117.28,'end_time'=>120.14,'target_text'=>'Tengoklah apa yang korang teringin nak makan kat situ.','source_text'=>'Have a look what you guys want there.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>120.24,'end_time'=>122.62,'target_text'=>'Lauk-pauk ni semua hidangan yang dah siap dimasak.','source_text'=>'>> So, these meals are all precooked meals.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>122.72,'end_time'=>125.26,'target_text'=>'Korang cuma perlu panaskan semula lepas tu dah boleh terus makan.','source_text'=>'You just have to warm them up and then you can eat them.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>125.36,'end_time'=>127.02,'target_text'=>'Kat sini ada lasagna.','source_text'=>'There\'s lasagna here.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>127.12,'end_time'=>132.06,'target_text'=>'Ada daging babi masam manis, stik salisbury, daging lembu halia, kepak ayam madu bawang putih.','source_text'=>'There\'s a sweet and sour pork, salbury steak, ginger beef, honey garlic wings.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>132.16,'end_time'=>134.14,'target_text'=>'Okey, kita baru je ambil kepak ayam madu bawang putih.','source_text'=>'Okay, so we just picked up some honey garlic wings.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>134.24,'end_time'=>137.26,'target_text'=>'Dan aku dah masukkan ke dalam troli beli-belah aku.','source_text'=>'And I\'ve put it down into my shopping cart.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>137.36,'end_time'=>138.7,'target_text'=>'Sekarang ni bahagian bakeri roti.','source_text'=>'Now, this is the bakery.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>138.8,'end_time'=>141.5,'target_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak kat belakang tu ada ketuhar tengah bakar roti.','source_text'=>'You see behind there, they have ovens baking bread.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>141.6,'end_time'=>145.42,'target_text'=>'Dan pekerja-pekerja kat belakang tu yang buat roti segar.','source_text'=>'And all those workers, all those employees behind there bake bread.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>145.52,'end_time'=>147.34,'target_text'=>'Dan ini bahagian bakeri roti.','source_text'=>'And uh this is just the bakery section.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>147.44,'end_time'=>151.1,'target_text'=>'Korang boleh dapat roti segar yang dibuat panas-panas setiap hari kat sini.','source_text'=>'You get fresh bread here that they make fresh every single day.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>151.2,'end_time'=>152.7,'target_text'=>'Roti jenis bulat kecil ni dipanggil bun (buns).','source_text'=>'This type of bread is called buns.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>152.8,'end_time'=>153.82,'target_text'=>'Ini roti bun.','source_text'=>'These are buns.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>153.92,'end_time'=>155.98,'target_text'=>'Ini pula bahagian daging berbungkus siap.','source_text'=>'So this is the packaged meat section.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>156.08,'end_time'=>157.74,'target_text'=>'Semua daging kat sini dibungkus elok.','source_text'=>'All these meats are packaged.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>157.84,'end_time'=>158.86,'target_text'=>'Nampak ni?','source_text'=>'See this?','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>158.96,'end_time'=>159.9,'target_text'=>'Ini satu bungkusan.','source_text'=>'This is a package.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>160,'end_time'=>161.18,'target_text'=>'Dan daging-daging ni siap dibungkus rapi.','source_text'=>'And these meats are packaged.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>161.28,'end_time'=>163.1,'target_text'=>'Disedut udara kedap vakum (vacuum sealed).','source_text'=>'And they\'re vacuum sealed.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>163.2,'end_time'=>164.14,'target_text'=>'Kedap udara vakum.','source_text'=>'Vacuum sealed.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>164.24,'end_time'=>166.54,'target_text'=>'Ini semua daging bungkusan kedap udara vakum.','source_text'=>'These are all vacuum sealed packaged meats.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>166.64,'end_time'=>170.46,'target_text'=>'Dan yang ni pula bukan kedap vakum sebab masih ada udara kat dalam.','source_text'=>'And this this is not vacuum sealed cuz there\'s still air inside.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>170.56,'end_time'=>173.9,'target_text'=>'Yang ni kedap vakum sebab langsung tak ada udara.','source_text'=>'This is vacuum sealed because there\'s no air.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>174,'end_time'=>175.26,'target_text'=>'Ini bahagian ekor lembu (beef oxtail).','source_text'=>'>> This is beef oxtail.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>175.36,'end_time'=>175.9,'target_text'=>'Tiga ketul.','source_text'=>'Three pieces.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>176,'end_time'=>178.46,'target_text'=>'Porsi ni muat untuk kau seorang je.','source_text'=>'This is a portion just for you.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>178.56,'end_time'=>179.66,'target_text'=>'Mana cukup, aku nak lebih lagi.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, I need more than that.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>179.76,'end_time'=>180.46,'target_text'=>'Harga $15.','source_text'=>'$15.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>180.56,'end_time'=>180.8,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>180.8,'end_time'=>181.82,'target_text'=>'Tak berbaloilah beli kat sini.','source_text'=>'No, I wouldn\'t buy it here.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>181.92,'end_time'=>182.32,'target_text'=>'Aku tahu tempat lagi murah.','source_text'=>'I get it.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>182.32,'end_time'=>182.78,'target_text'=>'Ekor lembu.','source_text'=>'>> Oxtail.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>182.88,'end_time'=>184.38,'target_text'=>'Selalu aku dapat sebatang ekor harga $12 je.','source_text'=>'>> I get a tail for 12.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>184.48,'end_time'=>184.72,'target_text'=>'Ya betul.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>184.72,'end_time'=>187.42,'target_text'=>'Dan kat sini ada bahagian ayam itik (poultry).','source_text'=>'And here you have you have the poultry sections.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>187.52,'end_time'=>193.42,'target_text'=>'Kemahiran bertutur sama pentingnya dengan mendengar kalau korang nak fasih bahasa Inggeris.','source_text'=>'Speaking is just as important as listening when you want to become fluent in English.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>193.52,'end_time'=>197.26,'target_text'=>'Tapi macam mana nak berlatih bertutur kalau tak ada kawan nak diajak berbual?','source_text'=>'But how can you practice your speaking when you have no one to speak with?','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>197.36,'end_time'=>202.86,'target_text'=>'Kalau korang nak asah kemahiran bertutur dan tak ada teman bercakap, jenguk Patreon aku kat ruangan penerangan.','source_text'=>'If you guys want to practice your speaking and you don\'t have anyone to speak with, check out my Patreon in the description.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>202.96,'end_time'=>210.38,'target_text'=>'Kat sana korang dapat 3 hingga 5 video baharu setiap minggu khas untuk latih korang bertutur dalam bahasa Inggeris,','source_text'=>'There you get three to five new videos every single week specifically made to practice your speaking in English where you','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>210.48,'end_time'=>215.42,'target_text'=>'tempat korang boleh asah loghat, sebutan, dan keyakinan diri berbahasa Inggeris.','source_text'=>'can practice your accent, your pronunciation, and your confidence in English.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>215.52,'end_time'=>218.54,'target_text'=>'Jenguk Patreon aku kat penerangan untuk mula berlatih.','source_text'=>'Check out my Patreon in the description to get started.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>218.64,'end_time'=>220.3,'target_text'=>'Kat sini ada ayam bulat seekor.','source_text'=>'You have a whole chicken here.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>220.4,'end_time'=>221.66,'target_text'=>'Kat sini ada bahagian dada ayam.','source_text'=>'You have chicken breast here.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>221.76,'end_time'=>222.62,'target_text'=>'Dada ayam sahaja.','source_text'=>'Just chicken breast.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>222.72,'end_time'=>224.78,'target_text'=>'Kat sini ada bahagian paha atas ayam (chicken thighs).','source_text'=>'You have chicken thighs here, chicken thigh.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>224.88,'end_time'=>226.54,'target_text'=>'Yang ni pula dipanggil betis ayam atau paha bawah (chicken drumsticks).','source_text'=>'These are called chicken drumsticks.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>226.64,'end_time'=>231,'target_text'=>'kepak ayam dan paha ayam, daging babi,','source_text'=>'chicken wings and then the chicken legs, pork,','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>231.92,'end_time'=>234.06,'target_text'=>'dan kat sebelah sini pula daging lembu.','source_text'=>'and then over here you have beef.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>234.16,'end_time'=>237.66,'target_text'=>'Warna daging lembu jauh lebih merah pekat berbanding daging babi.','source_text'=>'Beef is a lot more red in color than pork.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>237.76,'end_time'=>239.5,'target_text'=>'Korang nampak tak tanda kat atas tu?','source_text'=>'>> So you see this right up there?','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>239.6,'end_time'=>240.54,'target_text'=>'Itu dipanggil lorong rak (aisle).','source_text'=>'It\'s called an aisle.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>240.64,'end_time'=>241.98,'target_text'=>'Jadi ini lorong nombor dua.','source_text'=>'So this is aisle number two.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>242.08,'end_time'=>244.14,'target_text'=>'Ini dipanggil lorong laluan barang.','source_text'=>'This is called an aisle.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>244.24,'end_time'=>246.62,'target_text'=>'Dan ada satu lagi lorong kat sebelah dia dan lorong seterusnya.','source_text'=>'And there\'s another aisle beside it and another aisle.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>246.72,'end_time'=>248.78,'target_text'=>'Korang tengok tu lorong tiga, empat, lima.','source_text'=>'You see that\'s aisle three, four, five.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>248.88,'end_time'=>250.77,'target_text'=>'Dan bahagian ni ada banyak barangan makanan dalam tin.','source_text'=>'And this section there\'s a lot of canned goods.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>250.87,'end_time'=>253.98,'target_text'=>'Ada tomato dalam tin, kacang dalam tin kat bahagian bawah tu.','source_text'=>'[music] There\'s canned tomatoes, canned beans down there.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>254.08,'end_time'=>255.35,'target_text'=>'Dan ada banyak lagi makanan dalam tin kat sini.','source_text'=>'And there\'s more canned foods here.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>255.45,'end_time'=>258.86,'target_text'=>'Kacang dalam tin, ravioli dalam tin, cili dalam tin.','source_text'=>'[music] Canned beans, canned ravioli, canned chili.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>258.96,'end_time'=>260.86,'target_text'=>'Semua makanan ni di dalam tin.','source_text'=>'These foods are canned.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>260.96,'end_time'=>263.9,'target_text'=>'Semua ni dibuat kat Calgary, Alberta.','source_text'=>'>> So this is all made in Calgary, Alberta.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>264,'end_time'=>267.98,'target_text'=>'Bukan import luar, tapi produk tempatan negeri.','source_text'=>'So not imported local provincial produce.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>268.08,'end_time'=>270.3,'target_text'=>'Dan ini telur jeruk herba dill.','source_text'=>'And these are dill pickled eggs.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>270.4,'end_time'=>270.72,'target_text'=>'Menarik.','source_text'=>'>> Nice.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>270.72,'end_time'=>272.3,'target_text'=>'Walaupun aku tak suka sangat telur jeruk dill ni.','source_text'=>'Although I don\'t like dill pickled eggs.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>272.4,'end_time'=>275.26,'target_text'=>'Aku tetap hargai produk bangga buatan Alberta.','source_text'=>'I respect >> proudly Alberta made.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>275.36,'end_time'=>276.62,'target_text'=>'Oh, yang ni pun dari Alberta juga.','source_text'=>'Oh, this is from Alberta, too.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>276.72,'end_time'=>278.38,'target_text'=>'Kat sini pula, ini bahagian keju.','source_text'=>'This right here, this is the cheese area.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>278.48,'end_time'=>279.74,'target_text'=>'Ada banyak lagi pilihan keju kat sini.','source_text'=>'There\'s also more cheese here.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>279.84,'end_time'=>281.02,'target_text'=>'Dan kebanyakan ni sos cicah (dips).','source_text'=>'And a lot of these are dips.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>281.12,'end_time'=>286.06,'target_text'=>'Sos cicah ni korang boleh cicah dengan apa-apa je, tapi paling biasa dicicah dengan keropok kerepek.','source_text'=>'Dips are just, you dip, you could really dip anything, but most common is dipping with chips.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>286.16,'end_time'=>289.58,'target_text'=>'Korang ambil keropok dan cicah dalam sos untuk tambah perisa sedap.','source_text'=>'So you have a chip and you dip it and it just adds flavor.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>289.68,'end_time'=>292.3,'target_text'=>'Kau ada nampak sos cicah bayam (spinach dip) kat mana-mana tak?','source_text'=>'>> Did you see a spinach dip anywhere?','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>292.4,'end_time'=>294.94,'target_text'=>'Yang kat sana tu pula bahagian jus buah-buahan.','source_text'=>'>> So that right there is the fruit juice section.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>295.04,'end_time'=>296.86,'target_text'=>'Ada bermacam-macam jenis jus buah.','source_text'=>'There\'s different types of fruit juices.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>296.96,'end_time'=>299.1,'target_text'=>'Jus buah apa yang paling korang gemar?','source_text'=>'What\'s your favorite type of fruit juice?','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>299.2,'end_time'=>300.86,'target_text'=>'Ha\'ah, ni bahagian yogurt.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, this is the yogurt section.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>300.96,'end_time'=>303.26,'target_text'=>'Semua ni ada pelbagai jenis perisa yogurt.','source_text'=>'So [music] all of these are different flavors of yogurt.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>303.36,'end_time'=>306.94,'target_text'=>'Yogurt strawberi, yogurt vanila, yogurt beri campuran.','source_text'=>'Strawberry yogurt, vanilla yogurt, mixed berry yogurt.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>307.04,'end_time'=>310.14,'target_text'=>'Ini pula bahagian makanan sejuk beku.','source_text'=>'So this is the frozen section, the frozen foods.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>310.24,'end_time'=>313.02,'target_text'=>'Ada aiskrim dan pelbagai makanan beku lain kat bawah tu.','source_text'=>'There\'s ice cream and other frozen foods down there.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>313.12,'end_time'=>314.54,'target_text'=>'Satu benda yang menarik perhatian mata aku.','source_text'=>'Something that caught my eye.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>314.64,'end_time'=>315.74,'target_text'=>'Menarik perhatian aku (caught my eye).','source_text'=>'Something that caught my eye.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>315.84,'end_time'=>318.06,'target_text'=>'Maksudnya benda yang buat aku tertarik nak tengok.','source_text'=>'That just means something that caught my attention.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>318.16,'end_time'=>320.2,'target_text'=>'Iaitu aiskrim ni...','source_text'=>'Is this','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>321.04,'end_time'=>322.14,'target_text'=>'Melona?','source_text'=>'Malona?','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>322.24,'end_time'=>324.94,'target_text'=>'Kalau korang orang Korea, korang mesti tahu aiskrim apa ni.','source_text'=>'If you\'re Korean, then you know [music] you know what this is.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>325.04,'end_time'=>325.5,'target_text'=>'Aiskrim Melona.','source_text'=>'Malona.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>325.6,'end_time'=>327.58,'target_text'=>'Ini aiskrim paling kegemaran aku.','source_text'=>'This is my favorite ice cream.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>327.68,'end_time'=>329.82,'target_text'=>'Pelik juga tak ada tulis latte ke apa kat situ.','source_text'=>'Surprised it doesn\'t say like latte there or something.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>329.92,'end_time'=>331.82,'target_text'=>'Tapi aiskrim Melona ni...','source_text'=>'But Malona,','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>331.92,'end_time'=>334.54,'target_text'=>'Sebenarnya aku rasa ada tulis kat bahagian tertentu.','source_text'=>'>> actually I do think it says somewhere on it.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>334.64,'end_time'=>337.26,'target_text'=>'Oh, yang ni ada tulis perkataan latte.','source_text'=>'Oh, this one says latte on it.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>337.36,'end_time'=>338.06,'target_text'=>'Yang tu.','source_text'=>'That one.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>338.16,'end_time'=>338.48,'target_text'=>'Oh ya betul.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>338.48,'end_time'=>339.5,'target_text'=>'Yukimi.','source_text'=>'>> Yukimi.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>339.6,'end_time'=>341.42,'target_text'=>'Dan ini semua makanan sejuk beku.','source_text'=>'>> And these are just frozen foods.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>341.52,'end_time'=>346.38,'target_text'=>'Korang boleh beli satu lepas tu panaskan dalam ketuhar gelombang mikro (microwave) dan terus makan.','source_text'=>'So, you can buy one of these and just warm it up in a microwave and then eat it.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>346.48,'end_time'=>349.02,'target_text'=>'Ini semua makanan sejuk beku.','source_text'=>'These are all frozen foods.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>349.12,'end_time'=>354.62,'target_text'=>'Dan aku ingat lagi masa zaman budak-budak dulu, aku selalu makan biskut Pop-Tarts untuk makan tengah hari.','source_text'=>'And I remember when I was a kid, I used to eat Pop-Tarts all the time for lunch.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>354.72,'end_time'=>355.9,'target_text'=>'Memang kerap sangat makan.','source_text'=>'All the time.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>356,'end_time'=>361.46,'target_text'=>'Buku-buku roti ni lebih banyak bahan proses berbanding roti segar yang kita nampak tadi sebab tahan lebih lama.','source_text'=>'These loaves of bread [music] are a lot more processed than the ones we saw over there cuz these last longer.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>361.56,'end_time'=>363.58,'target_text'=>'Roti ni bukan dibuat segar setiap hari.','source_text'=>'[music] These are not freshly made every day.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>363.68,'end_time'=>365.02,'target_text'=>'Roti ni tak sesegar yang kat bakeri tadi.','source_text'=>'These are these are not as fresh.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>365.12,'end_time'=>366.46,'target_text'=>'Lebih banyak bahan proses pengawet.','source_text'=>'They\'re more processed.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>366.56,'end_time'=>367.5,'target_text'=>'Kau nak mentega kacang ke?','source_text'=>'You want a peanut butter?','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>367.6,'end_time'=>367.84,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>367.84,'end_time'=>368.7,'target_text'=>'Jenis rangup berkacang (crunchy).','source_text'=>'It\'s crunchy.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>368.8,'end_time'=>370.06,'target_text'=>'Mentega kacang rangup.','source_text'=>'>> Crunchy peanut butter.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>370.16,'end_time'=>372.46,'target_text'=>'Aku nak letak benda ni dalam troli.','source_text'=>'I\'m going to place that down in the cart.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>372.56,'end_time'=>377.42,'target_text'=>'Dan kalau aku tak jadi nak beli, lepas ambil tapi tak nak, aku boleh letak balik.','source_text'=>'And if I didn\'t want this, if I took it and I didn\'t want it, I could put it back.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>377.52,'end_time'=>381.58,'target_text'=>'Jadi aku letak balik mentega kacang ni sebab aku tak nak.','source_text'=>'So, I\'m going to put back the peanut butter because I don\'t want it.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>381.68,'end_time'=>384.3,'target_text'=>'Dan aku nak ambil yang ni sebagai ganti.','source_text'=>'And I\'m going to take this one instead.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>384.4,'end_time'=>385.26,'target_text'=>'Sebagai ganti (instead).','source_text'=>'Instead.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>385.36,'end_time'=>388.62,'target_text'=>'Maksudnya aku tak nak yang tu, tapi aku nak yang ni sebagai ganti.','source_text'=>'So, I don\'t want that one, but I want this one instead.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>388.72,'end_time'=>392.3,'target_text'=>'Sekarang ada banyak papan tanda buatan Kanada untuk sokong barangan tempatan Kanada.','source_text'=>'Now, there\'s a lot more made in Canada signs to promote Canadian products.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>392.4,'end_time'=>397.26,'target_text'=>'Label buatan Kanada ni jadi sangat popular sebab orang ramai mula utamakan beli barangan tempatan.','source_text'=>'Made in Canada became very popular because people started just buying Canadian products.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>397.36,'end_time'=>398.86,'target_text'=>'Kita beli madu sikit.','source_text'=>'>> We\'ll buy some honey.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>398.96,'end_time'=>401.1,'target_text'=>'Seluruh bahagian kat sini ialah bijirin sarapan (cereal).','source_text'=>'All this section right here is cereal.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>401.2,'end_time'=>403.56,'target_text'=>'Ini semua bijirin sarapan pagi.','source_text'=>'These are all cereals.','order'=>165],
