            ['start_time'=>37.44,'end_time'=>39.5,'target_text'=>'\"One-way\" maksudnya kenderaan cuma boleh lalu hala ke sana sahaja.','source_text'=>'One way means it just goes that way.','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>39.6,'end_time'=>40.94,'target_text'=>'Cuma menghala ke arah sana.','source_text'=>'Just goes that way.','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>41.04,'end_time'=>46.3,'target_text'=>'Itu jalan sehala untuk kenderaan kereta dan juga motosikal.','source_text'=>'That is a one-way street for the vehicles and also for motorcycles and stuff.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>46.4,'end_time'=>48.78,'target_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak aliran jalan memang menuju ke satu arah tu je.','source_text'=>'But yeah, you can see it just goes that way.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>48.88,'end_time'=>49.82,'target_text'=>'Ini hospital.','source_text'=>'>> This is the hospital.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>49.92,'end_time'=>50.62,'target_text'=>'Jalan sehala.','source_text'=>'>> One way.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>50.72,'end_time'=>54.06,'target_text'=>'Dan ini hospital yang dengar ceritanya memang sentiasa sibuk sepanjang masa.','source_text'=>'And this is the hospital that apparently is very busy all the time.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>54.16,'end_time'=>59.34,'target_text'=>'Ya, pertambahan penduduk kat sini naik terlalu mendadak sampai pihak hospital tak menang tangan.','source_text'=>'Yeah, the population has grown very fast and furious and they can\'t cope.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>59.44,'end_time'=>64.3,'target_text'=>'Tapi rasa macam ramai orang pindah ke kawasan tanah besar kan?','source_text'=>'>> But I feel like a lot of people move to the like mainland, right?','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>64.4,'end_time'=>64.8,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'>> Yes.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>64.8,'end_time'=>67.26,'target_text'=>'Aku yakin kos tempat tinggal kat pulau ni jauh lebih mahal.','source_text'=>'I\'m sure accommodation is more expensive here.','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>67.36,'end_time'=>70.3,'target_text'=>'Oh, kedai aiskrim ada kat sini.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, the ice cream is right here.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>70.4,'end_time'=>71.82,'target_text'=>'Alah, tutup pula.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, it\'s closed.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>71.92,'end_time'=>74.22,'target_text'=>'Tadi kita ingat nak makan aiskrim kat sini, tapi kedai tutup.','source_text'=>'>> We were going to eat ice cream right here, but they\'re closed.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>74.32,'end_time'=>76.3,'target_text'=>'Hari tu kita ada makan kat sini.','source_text'=>'We had it earlier.','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>76.4,'end_time'=>77.58,'target_text'=>'Awal minggu hari tu.','source_text'=>'>> Earlier in the week.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>77.68,'end_time'=>78.78,'target_text'=>'Ya, awal minggu hari tu.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, earlier in the week.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>78.88,'end_time'=>84.7,'target_text'=>'Diorang kata ada satu lagi cawangan jauh kat hujung sana, tapi kita memang kena pergi sana pun nak pulangkan beg ni.','source_text'=>'So, they said there was another one way down there, but we have to go down there anyways to drop off this bag.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>84.8,'end_time'=>86.94,'target_text'=>'Dalam ni ada pakaian selam (wetsuits).','source_text'=>'This right here, these are wet suits.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>87.04,'end_time'=>88.78,'target_text'=>'Beg ni ada pakaian selam kat dalam.','source_text'=>'This bag has wet suits inside.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>88.88,'end_time'=>92.62,'target_text'=>'Aku rasa ada aktiviti sekolah tengah berjalan kat sebelah sana tu.','source_text'=>'I think that\'s like some school activity or something going on over there.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>92.72,'end_time'=>93.12,'target_text'=>'Ya betul.','source_text'=>'>> Yep.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>93.2,'end_time'=>94.22,'target_text'=>'Kan?','source_text'=>'>> Right.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>94.32,'end_time'=>95.66,'target_text'=>'Nampak macam aktiviti sekolah.','source_text'=>'>> It looks like it.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>95.76,'end_time'=>97.58,'target_text'=>'Aku nak tengok kalau-kalau nampak apa diorang buat.','source_text'=>'I will have a look if I can see.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>97.68,'end_time'=>100.62,'target_text'=>'Rasa macam diorang dah mula kemas barang dah.','source_text'=>'>> I think they\'re taking taking it down, though.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>100.72,'end_time'=>101.34,'target_text'=>'Takpelah.','source_text'=>'It\'s fine.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>101.44,'end_time'=>102.94,'target_text'=>'Nampak tak berapa menarik sangat pun.','source_text'=>'Doesn\'t look that interesting.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>103.04,'end_time'=>106.06,'target_text'=>'Diorang tengah... diorang tengah buka pasang... Ya.','source_text'=>'And they\'re >> they\'re dismantling the >> Yeah.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>106.16,'end_time'=>107.02,'target_text'=>'barang-barang tu.','source_text'=>'>> the things.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>107.12,'end_time'=>109.5,'target_text'=>'Tempat ni sekurang-kurangnya bagi kita sikit teduhan.','source_text'=>'This is just providing us a little bit of shade.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>109.6,'end_time'=>110.86,'target_text'=>'Dan ini jeti pelabuhan (pier).','source_text'=>'And this is the pier.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>110.96,'end_time'=>116.7,'target_text'=>'Kat sinilah bot-bot datang dan korang boleh naik atau turun dari bot kat sini.','source_text'=>'And this is where like boats come and you can get on like disembark or embark from here.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>116.8,'end_time'=>125.26,'target_text'=>'Jeti ni, kat sini juga tempat korang naik teksi bot nak pergi ke Playa de los Alemanes kat seberang sana.','source_text'=>'So the pier, >> this is also where you get the taxi to go to uh play de las salmanes over there.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>125.36,'end_time'=>133.9,'target_text'=>'Jadi kat sinilah tempat korang naik teksi bot nak pergi ke pulau-pulau lain atau lokasi berbeza sekitar pulau ni,','source_text'=>'>> So this is like this is where you get the boat taxis to different different islands or different locations on this island,','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>134,'end_time'=>135.66,'target_text'=>'korang naik dari jeti ni.','source_text'=>'>> but you get it from here from this pier.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>135.76,'end_time'=>136.62,'target_text'=>'Ada dua jenis bot.','source_text'=>'So there\'s there\'s two.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>136.72,'end_time'=>138.86,'target_text'=>'Ada teksi bot dan ada feri.','source_text'=>'There\'s a boat taxi and then there\'s a ferry.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>138.96,'end_time'=>141.26,'target_text'=>'Nanti aku tunjukkan kalau nampak mana-mana bot feri.','source_text'=>'We can point out if I see one.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>141.36,'end_time'=>143.34,'target_text'=>'Semua teksi bot tu siap bernombor.','source_text'=>'>> Those are all tax all numbered.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>143.44,'end_time'=>145.26,'target_text'=>'Nombor satu, tiga.','source_text'=>'One, three.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>145.36,'end_time'=>146.86,'target_text'=>'Kat sebelah sana tu tempat dok pangkalan bot.','source_text'=>'That over there is a dock.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>146.96,'end_time'=>148.54,'target_text'=>'Tapi air laut kat sini biru jernih gila.','source_text'=>'But this water is so blue.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>148.64,'end_time'=>149.58,'target_text'=>'Memang sangat cantik.','source_text'=>'It\'s like really nice.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>149.68,'end_time'=>152.86,'target_text'=>'Air ni ingatkan aku pada suasana air laut... tengok tu.','source_text'=>'This reminds me of water in a >> bam.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>152.96,'end_time'=>155.74,'target_text'=>'Tengok singa laut (sea lions) ni.','source_text'=>'Look at these sea lines.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>155.84,'end_time'=>158.7,'target_text'=>'Korang betul-betul boleh duduk atas bangku betul-betul sebelah singa laut.','source_text'=>'You could literally sit on a bench right beside a seaine.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>158.8,'end_time'=>160.94,'target_text'=>'Tengoklah kawan-kawan tu.','source_text'=>'Look at those guys.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>161.04,'end_time'=>163.24,'target_text'=>'Diorang tidur santai je.','source_text'=>'They\'re just sleeping.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>165.44,'end_time'=>167.34,'target_text'=>'betul-betul kat bawah bangku ni.','source_text'=>'right under this bench.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>167.44,'end_time'=>172.22,'target_text'=>'Kalau tak berhati-hati, silap hari bulan boleh terpijak singa laut kat sini.','source_text'=>'>> So, I mean, I guess if you\'re not careful, you might accidentally step on a sea lion here.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>172.32,'end_time'=>177.66,'target_text'=>'Tapi aku tak cadangkan korang buat macam tu sebab diorang mungkin gigit korang sebab suka bermain.','source_text'=>'Although, I would not recommend that because I think they might bite you because they\'re playful.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>177.76,'end_time'=>183.98,'target_text'=>'Masa aku tengah snorkeling hari tu, diorang datang berenang keliling kita lepas tu gigit-gigit manja sikit,','source_text'=>'And when I was doing snorkeling, they would come and play around you and maybe give you a little nibble, a little small soft','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>184.08,'end_time'=>184.48,'target_text'=>'gigitan lembut yang tak sakit.','source_text'=>'bite.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>184.56,'end_time'=>188.86,'target_text'=>'gigitan kecil.','source_text'=>'All of these boats here, all of these boats are all anchored.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>188.96,'end_time'=>191.18,'target_text'=>'Semua bot kat sini, semua bot ni berlabuh sauh.','source_text'=>'All these boats are anchored in the water here.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>191.28,'end_time'=>193.26,'target_text'=>'Semua bot ni berlabuh campak sauh dalam air kat sini.','source_text'=>'>> There\'s the That\'s a ferry.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>193.36,'end_time'=>195.42,'target_text'=>'Haa tu feri.','source_text'=>'So you see the seats inside there.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>195.52,'end_time'=>198.06,'target_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak kerusi-kerusi penumpang kat dalam tu.','source_text'=>'So they go from island to island between islands.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>198.16,'end_time'=>198.4,'target_text'=>'Feri ni bawa penumpang dari satu pulau ke pulau lain.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>198.4,'end_time'=>199.34,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'So that\'s a ferry.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>199.44,'end_time'=>203.66,'target_text'=>'Itulah bot feri.','source_text'=>'>> It doesn\'t look like a traditional big ferry, but that\'s >> these these fairies are just small.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>203.76,'end_time'=>206.14,'target_text'=>'Rupa dia tak macam feri besar biasa, tapi feri kat sini saiz dia memang kecil-kecil.','source_text'=>'And back there you have the yachts.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>206.24,'end_time'=>207.18,'target_text'=>'Dan kat bahagian belakang sana ada kapal layar mewah.','source_text'=>'So that\'s a yacht.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>207.28,'end_time'=>209.18,'target_text'=>'Itu sebuah kapal layar mewah (yacht).','source_text'=>'That bigger ship is a yacht.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>209.28,'end_time'=>215.1,'target_text'=>'Dan kat sini pun ada beberapa buah kapal persiaran yang boleh muatkan macam... 100 orang.','source_text'=>'And there are also some cruise ships around here that could fit like >> 100 people.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>215.2,'end_time'=>216.86,'target_text'=>'Rasanya 100 orang had maksimum yang dibenarkan kat sini.','source_text'=>'I think 100 is the max you can have here.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>216.96,'end_time'=>219.74,'target_text'=>'Cuma boleh ada... kapal persiaran muatan 100 orang je.','source_text'=>'You can only have >> a 100 person cruise ship.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>219.84,'end_time'=>220.08,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'Yeah.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>220.08,'end_time'=>220.86,'target_text'=>'Minta maaf pasal janggut aku ni.','source_text'=>'And sorry about my beard.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>220.96,'end_time'=>221.66,'target_text'=>'Aku kena bercukur.','source_text'=>'I need a shave.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>221.76,'end_time'=>223.18,'target_text'=>'Dah lama aku tak bercukur.','source_text'=>'I haven\'t shaved in a while.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>223.28,'end_time'=>226.53,'target_text'=>'Nanti malam ni ke, petang ni ke, atau pagi esok aku cukur.','source_text'=>'I\'ll do that tonight or today or tomorrow morning.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>226.63,'end_time'=>227.42,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'[snorts] Yeah.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>227.52,'end_time'=>229.26,'target_text'=>'Sekarang kita tengah duduk berehat kat jeti ni.','source_text'=>'Right now we are just sitting on this pier.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>229.36,'end_time'=>231.42,'target_text'=>'Oh, orang-orang tu tengah menaiki bot.','source_text'=>'Oh, these people are embarking.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>231.52,'end_time'=>234.14,'target_text'=>'Diorang tengah naik teksi bot tu.','source_text'=>'They are embarking on that taxi.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>234.24,'end_time'=>236.78,'target_text'=>'Yang kat depan tu teksi bot (boat taxi).','source_text'=>'So, that right there is a boat taxi.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>236.88,'end_time'=>239.34,'target_text'=>'Diorang tengah naik bot nak pergi ke suatu tempat.','source_text'=>'So, they are going to embark and go somewhere.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>239.44,'end_time'=>240.62,'target_text'=>'Aku tak berapa pasti ke mana.','source_text'=>'I\'m not really sure where.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>240.72,'end_time'=>244.62,'target_text'=>'Orang panggil teksi air juga, ha\'ah, diorang tengah jalan menuruni platform tu.','source_text'=>'>> They also call it a water taxi, >> but yeah, they\'re walking down that platform.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>244.72,'end_time'=>247.82,'target_text'=>'Diorang jalan turun masuk ke dalam teksi bot.','source_text'=>'They\'re walking down it into the boat taxi.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>247.92,'end_time'=>250.38,'target_text'=>'Kat sini korang boleh nampak kawasan pesisir pantai.','source_text'=>'So, here you can see the shoreline.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>250.48,'end_time'=>251.74,'target_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak garis pesisiran pantai.','source_text'=>'You can see the shoreline.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>251.84,'end_time'=>253.5,'target_text'=>'Dan pesisir pantai ni berbatu-batu.','source_text'=>'And this shoreline is very rocky.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>253.6,'end_time'=>255.82,'target_text'=>'Tak ada pantai pasir sangat pun.','source_text'=>'There\'s not really a beach or anything.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>255.92,'end_time'=>257.34,'target_text'=>'Pesisiran pantai yang sangat berbatu.','source_text'=>'Very rocky shoreline.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>257.44,'end_time'=>259.98,'target_text'=>'Tapi rasanya ada pantai yang kita boleh pergi kan?','source_text'=>'But I think there is a beach we can go to, right?','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>260.08,'end_time'=>261.5,'target_text'=>'Pantai pasir putih tu.','source_text'=>'That white white sand beach.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>261.6,'end_time'=>265.42,'target_text'=>'Ya, kita pergi esok kot bila cuaca elok sikit.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, we\'re going to do that probably tomorrow when the weather is a little bit better.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>265.52,'end_time'=>267.26,'target_text'=>'Besar gila singa laut ni.','source_text'=>'>> This guy is huge.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>267.36,'end_time'=>267.68,'target_text'=>'Kat sini.','source_text'=>'>> Here.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>267.68,'end_time'=>269.74,'target_text'=>'Ada banyak lagi singa laut.','source_text'=>'There are some more sea lions.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>269.84,'end_time'=>271.42,'target_text'=>'Seekor je rupanya, badan dia besar sangat sampai nampak macam dua ekor.','source_text'=>'>> It\'s only one cuz he\'s so big.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>271.52,'end_time'=>273.1,'target_text'=>'Nampak macam dua ekor tadi.','source_text'=>'It looked like two.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>273.2,'end_time'=>274.54,'target_text'=>'Besar gila singa laut ni.','source_text'=>'>> That is a big boy.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>274.64,'end_time'=>274.8,'target_text'=>'Ya.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>274.8,'end_time'=>275.66,'target_text'=>'Aku ingatkan dua ekor tadi.','source_text'=>'I thought it was two.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>275.76,'end_time'=>278.3,'target_text'=>'Dua ekor, rupanya cuma seekor je yang besar gila.','source_text'=>'Two, but he\'s it\'s only one big >> big boy.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>278.4,'end_time'=>283.5,'target_text'=>'Dan satu benda pasal singa laut kat sini, singa laut ni langsung tak takut dengan manusia.','source_text'=>'And the thing about these sea lions is that these sea lions are not scared of people.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>283.6,'end_time'=>284.94,'target_text'=>'Macam langsung tak hairan dan tak takut.','source_text'=>'Like they\'re not scared.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>285.04,'end_time'=>287.5,'target_text'=>'Kebanyakan haiwan kat Galapagos memang tak takut.','source_text'=>'>> Actually, most of the animals are not on the gap.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>287.6,'end_time'=>291.42,'target_text'=>'Kau boleh duduk rapat macam ni, sedekat ni pun diorang buat tak tahu je.','source_text'=>'>> You could just be like this close to it, even this close, and they won\'t even do anything.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>291.52,'end_time'=>292.62,'target_text'=>'Tengok tu, ada kuku.','source_text'=>'>> Look, it\'s got nails.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>292.72,'end_time'=>293.66,'target_text'=>'Nampak tak?','source_text'=>'You see?','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>293.76,'end_time'=>295.66,'target_text'=>'Nampak kuku kat sirip kaki dia tu?','source_text'=>'You see the nails on his flipper?','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>295.76,'end_time'=>297.1,'target_text'=>'Memang besar gila singa laut ni.','source_text'=>'>> But yeah, this is a big boy.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>297.2,'end_time'=>298.86,'target_text'=>'Dan tahi dia berak sebiji macam anjing.','source_text'=>'>> And they actually poop like a dog.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>298.96,'end_time'=>304.46,'target_text'=>'Hampir semua haiwan kat Galapagos ni langsung tak takut dengan manusia.','source_text'=>'>> Pretty much all the all the animals in the Gopos are not scared of humans.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>304.56,'end_time'=>307.4,'target_text'=>'Diorang langsung tak takut dengan orang.','source_text'=>'They are not scared of humans.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>308.32,'end_time'=>309.98,'target_text'=>'Panas gila cuaca ni.','source_text'=>'This is very hot.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>310.08,'end_time'=>312.54,'target_text'=>'Sekarang aku nak sapu sikit krim pelindung matahari (sunscreen).','source_text'=>'So now I\'m going to apply some sunscreen.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>312.64,'end_time'=>313.82,'target_text'=>'Sunscreen buatan Korea.','source_text'=>'>> It\'s Korean.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>313.92,'end_time'=>316.54,'target_text'=>'Ya, pelindung matahari Korea.','source_text'=>'>> Yeah, Korean sunscreen.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>316.64,'end_time'=>317.82,'target_text'=>'Muka aku boleh terbakar rentung nanti.','source_text'=>'My face is going to burn.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>317.92,'end_time'=>322.86,'target_text'=>'Dan aku... korang boleh perasan kot kat kamera, kulit aku dah gelap terbakar matahari sekarang ni.','source_text'=>'And I\'m You could tell, I don\'t know if you can tell on camera, but I am very tanned right now.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>322.96,'end_time'=>324.54,'target_text'=>'Sekurang-kurangnya muka aku dah gelap kena matahari.','source_text'=>'My face at least is very tanned.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>324.64,'end_time'=>327.98,'target_text'=>'Aku nak sapukan krim pelindung matahari Korea ni.','source_text'=>'I\'m going to apply this Korean sunscreen.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>328.08,'end_time'=>329.82,'target_text'=>'Kau dapat dari mana krim tu?','source_text'=>'Where did you get it from?','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>329.92,'end_time'=>333.02,'target_text'=>'Daripada anak lelaki kegemaran mak, anak yang suka gila negara Korea tu.','source_text'=>'>> From my favorite son, the one that loves Korea.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>333.12,'end_time'=>334.54,'target_text'=>'Korea Selatan, mestilah.','source_text'=>'South Korea, obviously.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>334.64,'end_time'=>335.5,'target_text'=>'Siapa anak bertuah tu?','source_text'=>'>> And who is that?','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>335.6,'end_time'=>338.62,'target_text'=>'Anak yang baru-baru ni pergi bercuti dengan mak.','source_text'=>'It\'s the one that recently vacationed with me.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>338.72,'end_time'=>340.86,'target_text'=>'Baru-baru ni ke atau tengah bercuti sekarang?','source_text'=>'>> Recently or current?','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>340.96,'end_time'=>345.9,'target_text'=>'Yelah, anak yang tengah bercuti dengan mak sekarang ni lah.','source_text'=>'>> Well, it\'s currently It\'s the one that is currently on vacation with me.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>346,'end_time'=>348.7,'target_text'=>'Krim ni bagus sebab tak rasa melekit berminyak kat muka.','source_text'=>'>> It\'s good sunscreen cuz it doesn\'t feel like oily or whatever.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>348.8,'end_time'=>350.14,'target_text'=>'Memang elok sangat. Nanti bila kau balik rumah bawakan lagi untuk mak.','source_text'=>'>> No, it\'s really really good.','order'=>142],
