            ['start_time'=>486.08,'end_time'=>491.42,'target_text'=>'Cara pantas tambah maklumat tanpa rosakkan mood santai video.','source_text'=>'It\'s a quick way to add info [music] without killing the travel vibe.','order'=>185],
